window.TEAMS_FULL = {"6040":{"team":"McGill","id":"6040","section":"Undergrad","country":"Canada","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/mcgill/","projectTitle":"LanTurn","projectTitle_zh":"LanTurn","tagline":"Lanmodulin displayed on yeast, harvested by light-triggered flocculation, deployed on-site as a tolling service for mine tailings","tagline_zh":"將 lanmodulin 展示於酵母表面，以光觸發絮凝收集菌體，並以現場代工服務的形式部署於礦場尾礦","summary":"McGill engineered Saccharomyces cerevisiae EBY100 to display lanmodulin variants on its surface via the Aga1-Aga2 system for selective rare-earth binding, and to flocculate on command through a blue-light VP16-EL222 / C120 optogenetic circuit driving a truncated 678FLO1 flocculin, so that REE-loaded cells can be separated by gravity settling instead of centrifugation. Light-induced flocculation reached 66-75 percent against 24-25 percent in dark controls, and LanM surface display was confirmed by flow cytometry and confocal microscopy. The commercial case is a full industrial techno-economic analysis rather than a canvas: gate-to-gate CAPEX and OPEX, a unit cost of $11.83-20.58 USD per kg REO, a full-scale NPV case study on the Ashram tailings in Nunavik, Quebec, and seven separate sensitivity analyses. They were nominated for Best Entrepreneurship (Undergrad) and Best Biomanufacturing.","summary_zh":"McGill 改造 Saccharomyces cerevisiae EBY100，透過 Aga1-Aga2 系統將 lanmodulin 變異體展示於細胞表面以選擇性結合稀土元素，並以藍光 VP16-EL222 / C120 光遺傳學迴路驅動截短的 678FLO1 絮凝素，使細胞可依指令絮凝，讓吸附稀土的細胞以重力沉降取代離心分離。光誘導絮凝達 66-75%，暗處對照組為 24-25%；LanM 表面展示則以流式細胞術與共軛焦顯微術確認。其商業論證是完整的工業級技術經濟分析，而不是一張商業模式圖：涵蓋 gate-to-gate 的資本支出與營運支出、每公斤 REO 11.83-20.58 美元的單位成本、以魁北克 Nunavik 的 Ashram 尾礦為對象的全規模 NPV 個案研究，以及七項獨立的敏感度分析。他們入圍 Best Entrepreneurship（大學部）與 Best Biomanufacturing。","awards":["Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Biomanufacturing Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Technology Readiness Levels (NASA nine-level scale, chosen specifically because Canadian cleantech and mining funding programmes gate on TRL) as the backbone of a four-phase staged development plan, each phase carrying goals, named partners, a funding figure and source, and a risk-and-mitigation table. Plus techno-economic analysis in three parts (gate-to-gate, full-scale case study, sensitivity), competitor tiering into direct, substitute and future, a four-option exit plan, a skill-gap analysis mapped against the advisory board, an IP and freedom-to-operate review, and a one-year incorporation plan with a one-pager.","frameworks_zh":"以技術成熟度等級（TRL，NASA 的九級量表；之所以選用，是因為加拿大的清潔科技與礦業補助計畫都以 TRL 作為門檻）作為四階段分期開發計畫的骨幹，每一階段都列出目標、具名合作夥伴、資金金額與來源，以及風險與緩解對策表。此外還有分成三部分的技術經濟分析（gate-to-gate、全規模個案研究、敏感度分析）、把競爭者分為直接、替代與未來三層的分析、四種選項的退場計畫、對照顧問團成員盤點的技能缺口分析、智慧財產權與 freedom-to-operate 檢視，以及附一頁式簡介的一年期公司設立計畫。","dataviz":"A tabbed entrepreneurship page with a Sankey flowchart of critical-materials flows, a rare-earth demand-and-project-gap chart, a TEA workflow flowsheet, CAPEX/OPEX tables for both gate-to-gate and full-scale cases, a financial-analysis panel, and seven sensitivity charts (adsorption capacity, desorption efficiency, product purity discount, feedstock grade, yeast dosing concentration, PLS pH, discount rate), plus a tolling-model process diagram and an advisory-board gallery.","dataviz_zh":"以分頁呈現的創業頁面，包含關鍵原料流向的 Sankey 流程圖、稀土需求與專案缺口圖、技術經濟分析的工作流程圖、gate-to-gate 與全規模兩種情境的資本支出與營運支出表、財務分析面板，以及七張敏感度圖表（吸附容量、脫附效率、產品純度折價、原料品位、酵母投加濃度、PLS pH 值、折現率），另有代工模式的製程示意圖與顧問團名錄。","datascience":"Genuinely industrial-grade analysis. Mass balances built in Excel at a PLS flowthrough of 1,200,000 cubic metres per year, 1 g/L REE and 80 percent target recovery; unit-cost benchmarking per kg TREO against solvent extraction, column-immobilised lanmodulin and a Caulobacter-based bioadsorbent; NPV of USD 51M over 15 years in the high-uptake case versus USD -0.2M in the low-uptake case, with payback of 2.6-5.9 years. The sensitivity work generates actual engineering targets: breakeven at about 23 mg/g adsorption capacity, rising to about 35 mg/g once a 20-30 percent impurity discount on mixed REO is applied; every 5 percent loss of desorption efficiency costs roughly USD 10M of project value; profitability is governed almost entirely by initial PLS pH rather than the bioadsorbent's operating pH; and the low-uptake case goes negative above a 15 percent discount rate. Separately, the TORCH dry-lab project runs GROMACS molecular dynamics with QM/MM to engineer the LanM binding site, including a real debugging story about periodic boundary conditions inflating RMSD tenfold.","datascience_zh":"真正達到工業水準的分析。以 Excel 建立質量平衡，條件為 PLS 年處理量 1,200,000 立方公尺、稀土濃度 1 g/L、目標回收率 80%；並以每公斤 TREO 的單位成本，對照溶劑萃取、管柱固定化 lanmodulin 與以 Caulobacter 為基礎的生物吸附劑做基準比較；高採用情境下 15 年 NPV 為 5,100 萬美元，低採用情境為 -20 萬美元，回收期 2.6-5.9 年。敏感度分析產出的是真正可用的工程目標：吸附容量約 23 mg/g 為損益平衡點，若計入混合 REO 的 20-30% 雜質折價，門檻升到約 35 mg/g；脫附效率每下降 5%，專案價值約減少 1,000 萬美元；獲利能力幾乎完全取決於 PLS 的初始 pH 值，而不是生物吸附劑的操作 pH 值；折現率高於 15% 時，低採用情境就轉為負值。另外，乾實驗室的 TORCH 專案以 GROMACS 分子動力學搭配 QM/MM 改造 LanM 的結合位點，其中還包括一段真實的除錯經歷：週期性邊界條件讓 RMSD 被放大十倍。","software":"TORCH, a QM/MM and molecular-dynamics pipeline for optimising the lanmodulin binding site, with custom scripts for RMSD, clustering, radial distribution functions and explicit oxygen-distance coordination counting.","software_zh":"TORCH，一套用於最佳化 lanmodulin 結合位點的 QM/MM 與分子動力學流程，並自行撰寫程式計算 RMSD、分群、徑向分布函數，以及依氧原子距離明確計算配位數。","stack":["GROMACS","VMD","Python","Excel mass-balance and TEA models","S. cerevisiae EBY100 / pYD1 Aga1-Aga2 display","VP16-EL222 / C120 optogenetics","flow cytometry","confocal microscopy","ICP-MS","Xylenol Orange colorimetry"],"techniques":["yeast surface display with FLAG-tag detection","blue-light-inducible flocculation and Helm's flocculation assay","REE adsorption and desorption from flocs","restriction-enzyme cloning with LiOAc/SDS yeast colony PCR","sulfuric acid leaching of real tailings samples","sensitivity and NPV analysis"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"They host their own annual synthetic-biology conference, On the Verge, themed in 2026 as 'On the Verge of Running Out: Building the Bioeconomy', deliberately assembling corporate industry leaders, startup founders, policy experts, researchers and students around resource extraction. They also ran school and summer-camp workshops (microbial painting, acid-base chemistry) and are responding to a teacher's request for more advanced genetic-engineering workshops by exploring chromoproteins for new colours.","publicEngagement_zh":"團隊自辦年度合成生物學會議 On the Verge，2026 年主題為 On the Verge of Running Out: Building the Bioeconomy，刻意圍繞資源開採議題，聚集企業界領袖、新創創辦人、政策專家、研究者與學生。他們也在學校與夏令營舉辦工作坊（微生物繪畫、酸鹼化學），並回應一位老師希望有更進階基因工程工作坊的請求，正嘗試以色素蛋白提供新的顏色選擇。","ihp":"Over 100 stakeholders engaged, with a consultation map that traces who informed what and who they were referred to next, explicitly arguing that no consultation stands alone. The consequential ones are documented as reversals. They abandoned ultra-purification of REEs entirely after Dr. Michael Free and others showed the separation factor cannot support the claim and that the economics would hinge on only the last 0.9 percent of purity, repositioning instead on selective pre-solvent-extraction concentration. Feedstock choice came from Dr. Jayme Fehyl-Buska and Dr. Kevin Moran of CVW Sustainable Royalties; Ms. Julia Vilela Carvalho of UNEP steered them to fresh rather than legacy tailings for liability and environmental-regulation reasons; Peter van Alphen, Bastien Fresia and Gilles Roy of Nuvau Minerals Corp. confirmed mines have space and are used to disposing of new materials, which is why the process was designed around equipment mines already run, and recommended the tolling model. Protocol-level consultations repeatedly rescued failing experiments: Dr. Denzel Ignacia raised the flocculation induction OD to 3-5, Mira Loock supplied a surface-display-specific protocol at OD 0.8-1.2 that finally produced positive metal-binding results, Michael Bellucci spotted restriction sites less than 30 bp apart as the reason digests failed. Jan Morrill of Earthworks pushed back on their sustainability framing by insisting re-mining can inflict the same harm as direct mining and taught them a Free, Prior and Informed Consent framework. Dr. Yvette Baninla widened the analysis to the geopolitics of offshore REE processing and Indigenous consultation.","ihp_zh":"接觸超過 100 位利害關係人，並以一張諮詢地圖標示誰影響了哪一項決定、又被轉介給誰，明確主張沒有任何一次諮詢能獨立成立。真正造成影響的諮詢，都以推翻原案的形式記錄下來。在 Dr. Michael Free 等人指出分離因子無法支撐其主張、而且經濟性其實只取決於純度最後的 0.9% 之後，團隊徹底放棄稀土超高純度精煉，改將定位轉向溶劑萃取前的選擇性濃縮。原料選擇來自 CVW Sustainable Royalties 的 Dr. Jayme Fehyl-Buska 與 Dr. Kevin Moran；UNEP 的 Ms. Julia Vilela Carvalho 以責任歸屬與環境法規為理由，引導他們選擇新產生的尾礦而非舊有尾礦；Nuvau Minerals Corp. 的 Peter van Alphen、Bastien Fresia 與 Gilles Roy 確認礦場有足夠空間、也習慣處置新產生的物料，這正是製程被設計成圍繞礦場既有設備的原因，他們並建議採用代工模式。實驗流程層面的諮詢一再救回失敗的實驗：Dr. Denzel Ignacia 建議把絮凝誘導的 OD 提高到 3-5；Mira Loock 提供專為表面展示設計、在 OD 0.8-1.2 進行的實驗流程，終於做出金屬結合的陽性結果；Michael Bellucci 看出限制酶切位相距不到 30 bp 正是切割失敗的原因。Earthworks 的 Jan Morrill 反駁他們的永續論述，強調再開採可能造成與直接開採同等的傷害，並教他們自由、事先與知情同意（FPIC）的框架。Dr. Yvette Baninla 把分析擴及稀土境外加工的地緣政治與原住民族諮詢議題。","realWorld":"Among the strongest commercialisation cases in iGEM 2026, and the only one in this group with real third-party commitments on paper. The business model is a B2B on-site tolling service: the mine keeps ownership and legal liability for its tailings, LanTurn operates a small modular plant on site and returns a concentrated mixed rare earth oxide, which avoids transport cost and keeps tailings-management liability off LanTurn's books. That model was recommended by Nuvau Minerals Corp. and then re-validated at the REM3 Executive Summit with potential offtakers and feedstock providers. Unit economics are properly built rather than asserted: $11.83-20.58 USD per kg REO gate-to-gate, with about 92 percent of CAPEX in desorption columns and resins and 54-68 percent of OPEX in fermentation, compared against solvent extraction (at worst 12 percent more expensive, at best 370-720 percent cheaper on impure low-grade feedstock), column-immobilised lanmodulin (16-100 percent cheaper) and a lanthanide-binding-tag bioadsorbent. The design choices are individually cost-justified, which is rare: surface display versus purified LanM in agarose resin, flocculation versus continuous centrifugation (though they honestly note this saves only $0.21 per kg TREO and is 'not hugely significant'), and light induction versus copper, ethanol or galactose. The Ashram case study is a real deposit with 51 Mt of flotation tailings at about 0.4 percent TREO, giving a USD 51M NPV over 15 years with a 2.6-year payback in the optimistic case and a marginally negative NPV with a 5.9-year payback in the pessimistic case, and they say so rather than quoting only the good number. The headline $560 billion of locked value in tailings is derived, not borrowed: tailings tonnage times REE concentration times market prices, with a 70 percent discount applied for mixed rather than pure REEs, and they immediately contextualise it against a global REE market of only about USD 4.5 billion. Institutional traction is concrete: entry into the Dobson Lean Startup Accelerator at McGill's Dobson Centre for Entrepreneurship in September 2026, ongoing mentorship from Felicity Meyer, a cleantech investment manager at BoxOne Ventures, guidance from Chris Corkery on McGill's research-commercialisation and tech-transfer route, an eleven-person advisory board spanning hydrometallurgy, mining, VC, biomanufacturing and regulatory affairs, published letters of support from Bastien Fresia of Nuvau Minerals Corp. and Dr. Boyd Davis of Kingston Process Metallurgy, real tailings samples already secured from a large Canadian mining company that plans to continue research with them, and named scale-up facilities (Concordia Bioprocessing Facility at 1000 L, KPM's 10,000 sq ft Kingston pilot plant and its biomining division launching 2027, a Sudbury bioleaching facility). The funding plan is staged and specific: about $28,800 across four quarters for the laboratory phase from university funds and non-dilutive grants (NSERC, NRC IRAP, NFRF), then angel and cleantech VC after incorporation, with later phases pointing at NRCan's CMRDD programme (typically $4M+ for TRL 6-8) and MICA Canada (up to $2.5M for TRL 7-9), benchmarked against actual biomining raises (Allonnia USD 20M Series A, pH7 USD 32M Series B). The IP work is the real thing rather than a slogan: they checked that the foundational yeast surface-display patents US6699658B1 and US7465787B2 have expired, identified live LanM patents (CA3170828A1, CA3223988A1, US20240183787A1) and a pending Princeton application WO2025240129A2 that explicitly claims EL222/C120 optogenetics in S. cerevisiae, and concluded they must differentiate technically, disclose to McGill's Tech Transfer Office before publishing anything patentable, and run a formal freedom-to-operate analysis. Blunt caveats: there is no incorporated company yet, only a one-year incorporation plan; no revenue, no signed tolling contract and no term sheet; and they state outright that many TEA parameters are literature estimates rather than their own measurements, which is exactly why the sensitivity analysis exists as a de-risking to-do list for the wet and dry labs. Their ethical self-assessment is unusually unflattering, admitting LanTurn neither remediates tailings nor meaningfully reduces their volume, that re-mining can reintroduce mining harms to communities that have not seen a project for decades, and that the rare earths will mostly end up in consumer goods and defence rather than the clean-energy story, with a stated commitment not to market it otherwise.","realWorld_zh":"是 iGEM 2026 中商業化論證最紮實的隊伍之一，也是本組唯一有第三方書面承諾的隊伍。商業模式是 B2B 的現場代工服務：尾礦的所有權與法律責任留在礦場，LanTurn 在現場營運一座小型模組化廠房，交回濃縮的混合稀土氧化物，既省去運輸成本，也讓尾礦管理責任不落在 LanTurn 帳上。這個模式由 Nuvau Minerals Corp. 建議，之後又在 REM3 Executive Summit 上與潛在買方和原料供應者再次驗證。單位經濟是算出來的，不是喊出來的：gate-to-gate 每公斤 REO 11.83-20.58 美元，其中約 92% 的資本支出在脫附管柱與樹脂，54-68% 的營運支出在發酵；並與溶劑萃取（最差情況貴 12%，最好情況在不純的低品位原料上便宜 370-720%）、管柱固定化 lanmodulin（便宜 16-100%）以及鑭系結合標籤生物吸附劑比較。設計選擇逐項都有成本依據，這相當少見：表面展示對比固定於 agarose 樹脂的純化 LanM、絮凝對比連續離心（不過他們老實指出這只省下每公斤 TREO 0.21 美元，並不特別顯著），以及光誘導對比銅、乙醇或半乳糖誘導。Ashram 個案研究用的是真實礦床，有 51 Mt 浮選尾礦、TREO 品位約 0.4%；樂觀情境下 15 年 NPV 為 5,100 萬美元、回收期 2.6 年，悲觀情境下 NPV 略為負值、回收期 5.9 年，而他們把兩者都講出來，不只引用好看的數字。尾礦中鎖住 5,600 億美元價值這個標題數字是自己推導的，不是引用來的：尾礦噸數乘以稀土濃度乘以市場價格，並因為是混合稀土而非純稀土而打了 70% 折扣，接著立刻把它與全球稀土市場僅約 45 億美元的規模並列對照。機構層面的進展也很具體：2026 年 9 月進入 McGill Dobson Centre for Entrepreneurship 的 Dobson Lean Startup Accelerator；BoxOne Ventures 清潔科技投資經理 Felicity Meyer 持續提供指導；Chris Corkery 就 McGill 的研究商業化與技術移轉路徑提供建議；十一人顧問團涵蓋濕法冶金、礦業、創投、生物製造與法規事務；公開 Nuvau Minerals Corp. 的 Bastien Fresia 與 Kingston Process Metallurgy 的 Dr. Boyd Davis 的支持信；已從一家大型加拿大礦業公司取得真實尾礦樣品，對方並打算與他們繼續合作研究；放大生產設施也都指名（Concordia Bioprocessing Facility 的 1000 L 規模、KPM 位於 Kingston 的 10,000 平方英尺試量產廠及其 2027 年成立的生物採礦部門、Sudbury 的生物浸出設施）。募資計畫分階段而且寫得很細：實驗室階段四個季度約需 28,800 美元，來自校內經費與不稀釋股權的補助（NSERC、NRC IRAP、NFRF）；公司設立後再找天使與清潔科技創投；後續階段則指向 NRCan 的 CMRDD 計畫（TRL 6-8 通常為 400 萬美元以上）與 MICA Canada（TRL 7-9 最高 250 萬美元），並以實際的生物採礦募資案做對照（Allonnia 的 2,000 萬美元 A 輪、pH7 的 3,200 萬美元 B 輪）。智慧財產權的工作是真做而不是口號：他們查證酵母表面展示的基礎專利 US6699658B1 與 US7465787B2 已到期，找出仍有效的 LanM 專利（CA3170828A1、CA3223988A1、US20240183787A1），以及 Princeton 一件尚在審查的申請案 WO2025240129A2，該案明確主張在 S. cerevisiae 中使用 EL222/C120 光遺傳學，並據此結論他們必須在技術上做出區隔、在發表任何可專利內容前先向 McGill 技術移轉辦公室揭露，並進行正式的 freedom-to-operate 分析。保留事項也講得直白：公司尚未設立，只有一份一年期的設立計畫；沒有營收、沒有簽定的代工合約、也沒有投資條件書；他們並直言技術經濟分析中許多參數是文獻估計值而非自己量測的結果，而這正是敏感度分析存在的理由：它是給濕實驗室與乾實驗室的降風險待辦清單。他們的倫理自我評估罕見地不替自己說話，承認 LanTurn 既沒有修復尾礦，也沒有實質減少尾礦量；再開採可能把採礦的傷害重新帶回那些幾十年沒有新礦場的社區；而這些稀土多數會流向消費產品與國防，而不是清潔能源的故事，並明確承諾不會用後者來行銷。","partners":["Nuvau Minerals Corp. (Peter van Alphen, Bastien Fresia, Gilles Roy; tolling model advice and a letter of support)","Kingston Process Metallurgy Inc. (Dr. Boyd Davis, Dr. Fariborz Faraji; letter of support, scale-up and demonstration, biomining division launching 2027)","BoxOne Ventures (Felicity Meyer, cleantech investment manager; ongoing mentorship)","McGill Dobson Centre for Entrepreneurship / Dobson Lean Startup Accelerator (entered September 2026; Dr. Neils Billou)","Chris Corkery, McGill research commercialisation and tech transfer","Concordia Bioprocessing Facility (Dr. Lalit Kumar; 1000 L fermentation scale-up)","National Research Council Canada (mine tailings samples)","An unnamed large Canadian mining company (real tailings samples, intends to continue research together)","UNEP Minerals Unit (Julia Vilela Carvalho), Earthworks (Jan Morrill), C2M2A (Marilyn Spink)","Dr. Andrew Zimmerman, University of Florida (biochar conversion of spent yeast)","The Lumb Group, McGill; Mira Loock; Dr. Denzel Ignacia; Dr. Kevin Gardner; Barstow lab and REEgen (in contact)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6040/wiki/entrep-page/tab-2/pt-financial-analysis.avif","caption":"Financial analysis of the Ashram tailings re-mining case study, giving USD 51M NPV over 15 years in the high-uptake scenario against a marginally negative NPV in the low-uptake case","caption_zh":"Ashram 尾礦再開採個案研究的財務分析：高採用情境下 15 年 NPV 為 5,100 萬美元，低採用情境則略為負值","credit":"Team McGill, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6040/wiki/entrep-page/tab-2/pt1-opex-capex.avif","caption":"Gate-to-gate CAPEX and OPEX breakdown for LanTurn, showing desorption columns and resins at about 92 percent of capital cost and fermentation at 54-68 percent of operating cost","caption_zh":"LanTurn 的 gate-to-gate 資本支出與營運支出拆解：脫附管柱與樹脂約佔資本成本 92%，發酵佔營運成本 54-68%","credit":"Team McGill, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6040/wiki/entrep-page/tab-3/tolling-model-2.avif","caption":"The B2B tolling business model: the mine keeps ownership and liability for its tailings, LanTurn processes on site and returns a concentrated mixed rare earth oxide","caption_zh":"B2B 代工商業模式：尾礦的所有權與責任留在礦場，LanTurn 在現場處理並交回濃縮的混合稀土氧化物","credit":"Team McGill, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6040/wiki/entrep-page/tab-2/ashram-map.avif","caption":"The proposed Ashram Rare Earths Project in Nunavik, Quebec, chosen as the demonstration case because its tailings are too dilute for existing methods but rich enough for LanTurn","caption_zh":"位於魁北克 Nunavik 的 Ashram 稀土專案規劃案，被選為示範案例，因為其尾礦對現有方法來說太稀，但對 LanTurn 已足夠富集","credit":"Team McGill, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Run the techno-economic analysis early and let its sensitivity results set the lab's experimental targets: McGill's TEA produced a hard number (about 35 mg/g adsorption capacity once the mixed-oxide impurity discount is applied) that became the wet lab's de-risking goal, which is how commercialisation work earns its place rather than sitting beside the science. Pair that with their TRL-staged plan, where each phase names its funding figure, funding source and named partner facility, so an institution can see exactly what the next stage costs and who must say yes.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"及早做技術經濟分析，並讓敏感度分析的結果來設定實驗室的實驗目標：McGill 的技術經濟分析算出一個硬指標（計入混合氧化物雜質折價後約 35 mg/g 的吸附容量），這個數字成為濕實驗室的降風險目標；商業化工作要這樣才站得住腳，而不是擺在科學旁邊各做各的。再搭配他們以 TRL 分期的計畫，每一階段都寫明資金金額、資金來源與具名的合作設施，讓機構一眼就看出下一階段要花多少錢、需要誰點頭。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/mcgill/","https://2026.igem.wiki/mcgill/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/mcgill/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/mcgill/assets/index-DZ45NXgC.js"],"awards_zh":["最佳創業 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物製造專案 — 入圍"],"rank":14},"6041":{"team":"UOregon","id":"6041","section":"Overgrad","country":"United States","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/uoregon/","projectTitle":"AquaFlock","tagline":"E. coli engineered to sequester groundwater nitrate as cyanophycin, then flocculate so the nitrogen can be harvested back as fertilizer","summary":"UOregon engineered E. coli to pull excess environmental nitrate into the nitrogen storage polymer cyanophycin and, once a cyanophycin threshold is reached, to express flocculation proteins so cells sink and can be harvested as a fertilizer substitute, closing the nitrogen loop. The target users are rural well owners and farmers in Oregon whose water is rarely tested. The education practice is the standout: three original curricula built for three audiences with increasing prior knowledge, developed through an explicit Design-Build-Test-Learn loop and grounded in Universal Design for Learning plus STEAM. The team also built an offline desktop search engine indexing the full text of 1,354 iGEM team wikis and 20,761 pages from 2022-2025.","awards":["Best Education — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Education itself was run as a DBTL engineering cycle, with a documented Reflective Theory of Change diagram and a standardised success rubric (engagement, science understanding, creativity), both adapted from an Oregon State University STEM Research Center presentation at the Polar STEAM Summit 2026. Learning objectives were written against the measurable verbs of Bloom's Taxonomy (Remember, Understand, Apply, Analyze, Evaluate, Create).","dataviz":"Hand-illustrated scientific diagrams throughout: all educational materials were digitally illustrated by hand by the team, including a central-dogma comic, illustrated workbooks, and illustrated synthetic-biology-tool cards used as a tactile matching activity.","datascience":"Post-workshop feedback surveys with section-level ranking; for Workshop 3, 8 of 15 respondents had heard of synthetic biology before attending, and bioethics and science communication ranked as the favourite sections, with the illustrated workbook, real-world examples and small-group discussions named the most effective learning tools.","software":"iGEM Wiki Search: a desktop application that searches the full text of 1,354 team wikis and 20,761 pages from the 2022-2025 competitions from a single search box, running offline with no server. It automates wiki collection and processing, builds a full-text index, ranks whole projects rather than individual pages, crawls responsibly, handles JavaScript-only wikis, and was tested cross-platform. The team benchmarked it explicitly against iGEM's Phoenix Project (metadata only) and iGEM Munich 2024's Data Explorer (2019 wikis only, no source links), and links every result back to its original page.","stack":["desktop application (offline)","full-text indexing","web crawler with JavaScript rendering","Universal Design for Learning (UDL) framework","STEAM curriculum design","Bloom's Taxonomy"],"techniques":["cyanophycin nitrogen-storage pathway engineering","flocculation-protein inducible circuit","split biosensor","nitrate sequestration assays","AquaFlock hardware settling system"],"frameworks_zh":"教育本身就以 DBTL 工程迴圈的方式執行，並留下反思式改變理論（Reflective Theory of Change）圖與一套標準化的成效評分量表（參與度、科學理解、創造力），兩者都改編自奧勒岡州立大學 STEM Research Center 在 Polar STEAM Summit 2026 的報告。學習目標則依 Bloom's Taxonomy 的可測量動詞撰寫（記憶、理解、應用、分析、評鑑、創造）。","dataviz_zh":"全程使用手繪科學圖解：所有教材都由團隊成員親手數位繪製，包括一本中心法則漫畫、插畫式學習手冊，以及用於配對活動的插畫版合成生物學工具卡（可動手操作）。","datascience_zh":"工作坊後的回饋問卷採分段排序設計；第三場工作坊中，15 位回覆者有 8 人在參加前就聽過合成生物學，生物倫理與科學傳播被評為最喜歡的段落，插畫手冊、真實世界案例與小組討論則被指為最有效的學習工具。","software_zh":"iGEM Wiki Search：一款桌面應用程式，從單一搜尋框即可檢索 2022-2025 年各屆 1,354 個隊伍 wiki、20,761 個頁面的全文，離線執行、無需伺服器。它自動化了 wiki 的收集與處理、建立全文索引、以整個專案而非單一頁面為排序單位、以負責任的方式爬取、能處理僅靠 JavaScript 渲染的 wiki，並做過跨平台測試。團隊明確地把它與 iGEM 的 Phoenix Project（僅有詮釋資料）以及 iGEM Munich 2024 的 Data Explorer（僅 2019 年 wiki、無原始連結）做比較，並讓每一筆結果都連回原始頁面。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"UOregon's central design principle is quotable and transferable: 'Accessibility should lower the barrier of entry into complex science, not the complexity of the science itself.' Instead of one generic outreach talk, the team wrote three original curricula for three audiences with increasing prior knowledge and ran them as three DBTL iterations across June, July and October 2026, carrying the lessons of each into the next. Workshop 1 ('Intro to Synthetic Biology') was a one-hour session plus an illustrated take-home worksheet delivered to 30 high school students at the Oregon Humane Society summer camp; students reviewed the central dogma and plasmid parts and then designed their own engineered bacterium to solve a problem of their choosing. Post-event debriefs with students and camp staff produced four concrete fixes (establish prior knowledge first, add more real-world relevance, shorten transitions to reduce cognitive load, create more peer-interaction points), which were fed directly into Workshop 2. Workshop 2 ('Engineering SynBio Solutions') was a two-hour session for 20 high school students at SAIL (Student Academy to Inspire Learning), an existing University of Oregon STEM summer camp for students from diverse learning backgrounds; materials were a fully illustrated workbook, a hand-drawn comic that told the central dogma as a story, slides, and hands-on activities, with each of five sections framed by its own guiding question and sequenced to scaffold from foundational biology to CRISPR and plasmids to genetic circuits to experimental design. Workshop 3 ('SynBio Solutions to Real-World Problems') was a two-hour session for 20 first- and second-year undergraduate science students at the University of Oregon, funded by a University of Oregon Knight Campus Graduate Student Association outreach mini-grant; because this audience already had foundational biology, the team swapped the comic for a matching-game refresher, added directed evolution and de novo protein design alongside CRISPR and plasmids, and then extended into two sections the earlier workshops could not reach: small-group bioethics analysis of three real-world synthetic biology applications, and a science-communication activity in which students decorated tote bags to explain what they had learned to an audience of their own choosing. Evidence of impact is tied to the standardised rubric rather than headcount alone: engagement, understanding and creativity were tracked across iterations through direct post-workshop feedback forms and indirect observation, Workshop 2 students asked unprompted questions beyond the taught material (one asked whether CRISPR and plasmids could be used at once), and the Workshop 3 survey ranked bioethics and science communication highest. Beyond workshops, the team published a comic illustrating the AquaFlock project's journey and released the iGEM Wiki Search desktop tool specifically to make it easier for future teams to find and build on predecessors' work - an education contribution aimed at the iGEM community itself.","ihp":"Human Practices was framed around rural equity: people living outside major cities receive less financial backing, less testing of wells and waterways, and less proactive healthcare, so the project is designed as a circular chain of agricultural, health and economic support for communities marginalised by municipal systems. The team mapped a four-step implementation path (in the home, then at the agricultural source, then harvest, then reduce/reuse/recycle) and stated the striking design goal that 'our product is made to eventually become obsolete' once nitrate levels fall out of the unsafe range. A field trip to the Metropolitan Wastewater Management Commission regional wastewater treatment facility serving Eugene and Springfield let the team interview plant operators, who confirmed nitrate control (alongside PFAS and silicon) is an unsolved challenge, validating a gap their smaller-scale system could fill. Four UN SDGs were adopted as focal areas: 3 (good health), 4 (quality education), 6 (clean water and sanitation) and 12 (responsible consumption and production).","realWorld":"The intended users are rural Oregon well owners and farmers; harvested flocs become a local fertilizer substitute, localising fertilizer access and cutting nitrate at source. Context established on the description page: roughly half of applied nitrogen fertilizer is taken up by plants and the rest leaches as nitrate, driving eutrophication, harmful algal blooms and hypoxia as well as direct human health risk from contaminated drinking water.","partners":["Oregon Humane Society (summer camp, Workshop 1 venue and audience)","SAIL - Student Academy to Inspire Learning, University of Oregon STEM summer camp (Workshop 2)","University of Oregon Knight Campus Graduate Student Association (outreach mini-grant funding Workshop 3)","Metropolitan Wastewater Management Commission (MWMC) Regional Wastewater Treatment Facility, Eugene-Springfield","Oregon State University STEM Research Center (Reflective Theory of Change and success-measurement frameworks)"],"publicEngagement_zh":"UOregon 的核心設計原則值得引用也可被其他隊伍沿用：「無障礙應該降低進入複雜科學的門檻，而不是降低科學本身的複雜度。」團隊沒有只做一場通用的外推演講，而是為先備知識遞增的三種受眾撰寫三套原創課程，並在 2026 年 6 月、7 月與 10 月以三次 DBTL 迭代實際執行，把每一次的經驗帶進下一次。第一場工作坊（Intro to Synthetic Biology）是一小時課程加一份插畫回家作業單，對象是奧勒岡人道協會夏令營的 30 位高中生；學生複習中心法則與質體組成，然後自行設計一株工程菌來解決自選的問題。活動後與學生及營隊人員的檢討產出四項具體修正（先建立先備知識、增加真實世界關聯、縮短段落轉換以降低認知負荷、增加同儕互動點），並直接帶入第二場工作坊。第二場工作坊（Engineering SynBio Solutions）是兩小時課程，對象是 SAIL（Student Academy to Inspire Learning，奧勒岡大學既有的 STEM 夏令營，招收來自多元學習背景的學生）的 20 位高中生；教材包含一本全插畫學習手冊、一本把中心法則說成故事的手繪漫畫、投影片與動手活動，五個段落各有自己的引導問題，並刻意從基礎生物學鋪陳到 CRISPR 與質體、再到基因迴路與實驗設計。第三場工作坊（SynBio Solutions to Real-World Problems）是兩小時課程，對象是奧勒岡大學 20 位大一、大二理學院學生，由奧勒岡大學 Knight Campus 研究生協會的外推小額補助支持；由於這群受眾已有基礎生物學，團隊把漫畫換成配對遊戲式複習，在 CRISPR 與質體之外加入定向演化與 de novo 蛋白質設計，再延伸出前兩場無法觸及的兩個段落：針對三個真實合成生物學應用的小組生物倫理分析，以及一個科學傳播活動，讓學生彩繪提袋，向自選的受眾說明自己學到什麼。成效證據扣在標準化量表上，而不只是人數：參與度、理解與創造力透過工作坊後的直接回饋表與間接觀察在各次迭代間追蹤，第二場的學生主動問出超出授課範圍的問題（有人問 CRISPR 與質體能否同時使用），第三場的問卷則把生物倫理與科學傳播排在最前面。工作坊之外，團隊出版了一本描繪 AquaFlock 專案歷程的漫畫，並釋出 iGEM Wiki Search 桌面工具，目的正是讓未來的隊伍更容易找到並接續前人的工作——這是一項針對 iGEM 社群本身的教育貢獻。","ihp_zh":"人類實踐以鄉村公平為框架：住在大城市以外的人得到較少財務支持、水井與水體較少被檢測、也較少獲得主動的醫療照護，因此本專案被設計成一條循環的鏈，為被市政系統邊緣化的社區提供農業、健康與經濟上的支持。團隊繪出四步落地路徑（先在住家、再到農業污染源、接著收取、最後減量／再利用／回收），並提出一個很鮮明的設計目標：「我們的產品被設計成最終會被淘汰」——一旦硝酸鹽濃度降回安全範圍即不再需要。團隊走訪服務 Eugene 與 Springfield 的 Metropolitan Wastewater Management Commission 區域污水處理廠，訪談廠務操作人員，他們確認硝酸鹽控制（與 PFAS、矽並列）仍是未解的難題，印證了這套較小規模系統可以補上的缺口。團隊選定四項聯合國 SDG 作為焦點：3（健康與福祉）、4（優質教育）、6（潔淨水與衛生）與 12（責任消費與生產）。","realWorld_zh":"預期使用者是奧勒岡州的鄉村水井持有者與農民；收取下來的絮凝物成為當地的肥料替代品，使肥料取得在地化，同時從源頭減少硝酸鹽。專案說明頁建立了脈絡：施用的氮肥大約只有一半被植物吸收，其餘淋溶成硝酸鹽，造成優養化、有害藻華與缺氧，也對飲用受污染水源的人體健康構成直接風險。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6041/wiki/pages/education/edu-wksp1-main-photo.avif","caption":"Workshop 1: one-hour intro to synthetic biology for 30 high school students at the Oregon Humane Society camp","credit":"Team UOregon, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"第一場工作坊：為奧勒岡人道協會營隊 30 位高中生舉辦的一小時合成生物學入門"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6041/wiki/pages/education/edu-wksp2-main-photo.avif","caption":"Workshop 2 at the SAIL STEM summer camp: 20 high school students working through the illustrated workbook and comic","credit":"Team UOregon, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"在 SAIL STEM 夏令營的第二場工作坊：20 位高中生使用插畫學習手冊與漫畫"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6041/wiki/pages/education/edu-wksp1-wkst.avif","caption":"The hand-illustrated take-home worksheet from Workshop 1, covering the central dogma and plasmid parts","credit":"Team UOregon, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"第一場工作坊的手繪回家作業單，內容涵蓋中心法則與質體組成"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6041/wiki/pages/education/wksp3-1.avif","caption":"Workshop 3 for 20 undergraduate science students, adding bioethics discussion and a tote-bag science-communication activity","credit":"Team UOregon, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"第三場工作坊，對象為 20 位大學部理學院學生，新增生物倫理討論與提袋科學傳播活動"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6041/wiki/pages/education/measuring-success.avif","caption":"The team's standardised measure of success across workshop iterations: engagement, science understanding and creativity","credit":"Team UOregon, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"團隊在各次工作坊迭代間使用的標準化成效量表：參與度、科學理解與創造力"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Run outreach as a DBTL cycle with a fixed success rubric: build three differentiated versions of the same curriculum for audiences at different prior-knowledge levels, debrief with the host staff after each delivery, and score every iteration on the same three criteria (engagement, understanding, creativity) so improvement is demonstrable rather than asserted.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/uoregon/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uoregon/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/uoregon/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/uoregon/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/uoregon/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/uoregon/field-trip","https://2026.igem.wiki/uoregon/sustainability"],"projectTitle_zh":"AquaFlock","tagline_zh":"改造 E. coli 將地下水中的硝酸鹽固定為氮儲存聚合物 cyanophycin，再誘導細胞絮凝沉降，使氮得以回收作為肥料","summary_zh":"UOregon 改造 E. coli，把環境中過量的硝酸鹽轉入氮儲存聚合物 cyanophycin，並在 cyanophycin 累積達到閾值後表現絮凝蛋白，使細胞沉降、可被收取作為肥料替代品，藉此閉合氮循環。目標使用者是奧勒岡州水質少有檢測的鄉村水井持有者與農民。最突出的是教育實踐：針對先備知識遞增的三種受眾，自行開發三套原創課程，以明確的 Design-Build-Test-Learn 迴圈迭代，並以通用學習設計（UDL）與 STEAM 為基礎。團隊另外做了一套離線桌面搜尋引擎，索引 2022-2025 年 1,354 個 iGEM 隊伍 wiki、共 20,761 個頁面的全文。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把外推當成 DBTL 迴圈來跑，並搭配一套固定的成效量表：為先備知識不同的受眾做出同一套課程的三種差異化版本，每次執行後都與主辦單位人員檢討，並以同樣的三項標準（參與度、理解、創造力）為每次迭代評分，讓進步是可被證明的，而不是自己宣稱的。","awards_zh":["最佳教育 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"rank":7},"6043":{"team":"Vilnius-Lithuania","id":"6043","section":"Undergrad","country":"Lithuania","village":"Foundational Advance","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/vilnius-lithuania/","projectTitle":"BMClick: One Shell to Click Them All","projectTitle_zh":"BMClick：一殼點擊萬物","tagline":"Bacterial microcompartment shells rebuilt outside the cell and made programmable by click chemistry, plus Ladder Detector, which annotates a gel in about a minute.","tagline_zh":"把細菌微區室外殼在細胞外重建，並以點擊化學使其表面可程式化；另有 Ladder Detector，約一分鐘標註完一張電泳膠影像。","summary":"BMClick rebuilds bacterial microcompartments (BMCs), the proteinaceous shells bacteria use to sequester metabolic reactions, in vitro and makes their surface programmable through click chemistry at an amber-codon-incorporated non-canonical amino acid, turning a natural containment system into a modular platform for working with purified biomolecules. The aim is to recover the organisation a cell provides, protecting therapeutic nucleic acids from nucleases, separating the steps of a reconstructed pathway, and extending the temperature and pH range over which enzymes work, while keeping the precision of in vitro conditions. The project also produced functional macroscopic materials from BMC-T shell proteins, and in vitro encapsulation was demonstrated with a HiBiT-SpyCatcher cargo and confirmed by cryo-EM. The dry-lab deliverable is Ladder Detector, a React + FastAPI web app that segments bands in a gel photograph using GelGenie's released U-Net models and then identifies which commercial ladder was run in the marker lane, a step no existing tool automated.","summary_zh":"BMClick 在體外重建細菌微區室（BMC）——細菌用來區隔代謝反應的蛋白質外殼——並透過在以 amber 密碼子嵌入的非天然胺基酸上進行點擊化學，使外殼表面可程式化，把一套天然的包覆系統變成處理純化生物分子的模組化平台。目標是重現細胞所提供的組織性：保護治療用核酸不被核酸酶分解、分隔重建路徑中的各個步驟、擴大酵素可作用的溫度與 pH 範圍，同時保有體外條件的精確性。團隊也用 BMC-T 外殼蛋白做出具功能的巨觀材料，並以 HiBiT-SpyCatcher 載物示範體外包覆，再由 cryo-EM 確認。乾實驗的產出是 Ladder Detector：一個 React + FastAPI 網頁應用程式，先用 GelGenie 已釋出的 U-Net 模型分割電泳膠照片中的條帶，再判定標記道跑的是哪一種市售分子量標準品（ladder）——這一步是現有工具都沒有自動化的。","awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Software — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Undergrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"React web client plus a Python FastAPI server exposing a REST API documented as OpenAPI 3.1 (Ladder Detector API 0.1.0, Apache 2.0), with five endpoints split into a Segmentation group (GET /segmentation-models, POST /segment-image, POST /extract-band-details) and a Ladder group (GET /markers, POST /detect-ladder). There is deliberately no database layer: the application collects and stores no user data and keeps all configuration in files on the server. Deployment is Docker Compose with three services (frontend on 5173, backend on 8000, interactive API docs at /docs), and the segmentation models are pulled at build time from the GelGenie model registry on Hugging Face, so a HF access token is a prerequisite alongside Git and Docker.","frameworks_zh":"React 網頁前端搭配 Python FastAPI 伺服器，對外提供以 OpenAPI 3.1 文件化的 REST API（Ladder Detector API 0.1.0，Apache 2.0），共五個端點，分為 Segmentation 群組（GET /segmentation-models、POST /segment-image、POST /extract-band-details）與 Ladder 群組（GET /markers、POST /detect-ladder）。刻意不設資料庫層：應用程式不收集也不儲存任何使用者資料，所有設定都放在伺服器上的檔案裡。部署採 Docker Compose，共三個服務（前端 5173、後端 8000、互動式 API 文件在 /docs），分割模型在建置時從 Hugging Face 上的 GelGenie 模型庫拉取，因此除了 Git 與 Docker 之外，還需先備妥 Hugging Face 存取權杖。","dataviz":"The core output is the annotated gel image itself: upload a photograph, optionally crop or rotate, mark the marker lanes, and the app detects bands and writes the size labels on. Accepted input is PNG, JPEG, WebP and TIFF; the annotated result comes back as PNG. Where automation is imperfect the user gets real editing tools rather than a take-it-or-leave-it answer: a brush, an eraser and a magic wand for refining band detection, plus the ability to override the identified ladder or edit assigned values directly. A project can be saved and reloaded as a .gelproj file carrying the band segmentation and lane markup, and frontend and backend exchange JSON.","dataviz_zh":"核心輸出就是標註好的電泳膠影像本身：上傳照片，必要時裁切或旋轉，標出標記道，應用程式便偵測條帶並把大小標籤寫上去。可接受的輸入格式為 PNG、JPEG、WebP 與 TIFF，標註結果以 PNG 回傳。在自動化不完美的地方，使用者拿到的是真正的編輯工具，而不是只能全盤接受或放棄的答案：筆刷、橡皮擦與魔術棒可修正條帶偵測，也可以直接覆寫判定出的 ladder 或編輯指定的數值。專案可存成 .gelproj 檔再載回，檔內帶著條帶分割與道次標記；前後端之間以 JSON 交換資料。","datascience":"The ladder-identification evaluation is the strongest part of the work. The team contacted Thermo Fisher Scientific for the band patterns of its DNA, RNA and protein ladders, scoped to six ladders their own lab uses, and then built a dataset of 172 marker-lane samples by combining their own gels, figures from published articles, and donated photographs solicited from the Vilnius University Life Sciences Center community and the organisers of the International Biology Olympiad. Because the algorithm is not machine learning but still has tunable parameters, they split 30% for parameter tuning and 70% for evaluation, used K-fold cross-validation within the tuning set, manually grouped samples that came from the same source or the same image so related samples could not leak across the split, and stratified by ladder. Four combinations were then tested on the held-out set: Dynamic Time Warping reached 52.42% (absolute run distance) and 62.90% (relative), while adjusted Needleman-Wunsch reached 89.52% and 91.13%. They published per-class tables, stated the two relevant baselines explicitly (about 17% for guessing one of six, about 26% for always guessing the most common class), and diagnosed their own failure case: Protein_6 was consistently confused with DNA_14 because both ladders have the same number of bands, so the gap penalties that normally separate ladders of different band counts provide no signal and only band positions remain. Relative run distance was chosen over absolute despite similar overall accuracy, because it handled Protein_6 better (61.9% vs 47.62%) and is the simpler of the two. Measured end-to-end annotation time is about one minute or less.","datascience_zh":"ladder 判定的評估是整份工作最紮實的部分。團隊向 Thermo Fisher Scientific 取得其 DNA、RNA 與蛋白質 ladder 的條帶圖譜，範圍限定在自家實驗室實際使用的六種 ladder，再結合自己跑的膠體、已發表文獻中的圖，以及向 Vilnius University Life Sciences Center 社群與 International Biology Olympiad 主辦方徵集到的照片，建成 172 個標記道樣本的資料集。由於演算法並非機器學習，但仍有可調參數，他們切出 30% 做參數調整、70% 做評估，在調參集內使用 K-fold 交叉驗證，並人工把來自同一來源或同一張影像的樣本歸為同一組，使相關樣本不會跨切分洩漏，同時依 ladder 分層。接著在保留測試集上比較四種組合：Dynamic Time Warping 的準確率為 52.42%（絕對移動距離）與 62.90%（相對移動距離），調整過的 Needleman-Wunsch 則達 89.52% 與 91.13%。他們公開各類別表格，明確列出兩條相關基線（六選一隨機猜測約 17%，永遠猜最常見類別約 26%），也診斷了自己的失敗案例：Protein_6 一直被誤判為 DNA_14，因為兩種 ladder 的條帶數相同，平常能區分不同條帶數 ladder 的 gap penalty 因此提供不了訊息，只剩條帶位置可用。整體準確率相近，他們仍選相對移動距離而非絕對值，因為它在 Protein_6 上表現較好（61.9% 對 47.62%），而且是兩者中較簡單的做法。實測端到端標註時間約一分鐘以內。","software":"Ladder Detector solves a real and unglamorous problem: gel annotation is done by hand, is repetitive and inconsistent, and the team found that although several gel-analysis tools exist, none automated the annotation step, even though almost every published gel figure is annotated. The pipeline has two stages. Band segmentation reuses rather than reinvents: GelGenie (Aquilina et al., Nature Communications 2025) showed that a lightweight U-Net and nnU-Net clearly beat classical Watershed and Multi-Otsu approaches, so Ladder Detector runs GelGenie's released models, defaulting to the Universal lightweight U-Net (seconds on an ordinary CPU) with nnU-Net and a sharp-band fine-tune selectable. Ladder identification is the team's own contribution, and the design decision behind it is instructive: their first idea was an image classifier over marker-lane crops, which they dropped after a consultation on two grounds, that they could not gather enough samples to train it reliably and that an image classifier would likely latch onto resolution, lighting or gel provenance instead of the band positions that actually distinguish ladders. They moved to numerical data instead, extracting band centroids from the segmentation mask and deriving absolute run distance (distance from the top of the lane) and relative run distance (normalised by lane height). The absolute approach exploits the empirical near-linearity of migration distance against log10(size): for each ladder in the registry, both sequences are min-max normalised, the log sizes inverted, aligned with an adjusted Needleman-Wunsch, a least-squares line fitted to the matched pairs, and the ladder scored by R-squared minus a penalty per unmatched band. The relative approach compares against per-ladder reference profiles taken from vendor charts and scores 1 - RMSE with the same unmatched-band penalty. The process flow deliberately keeps two human checkpoints, segmentation review and marker-lane selection, and the wiki explains why: segmentation is not always accurate, and when a gel has several marker lanes the app has no reliable way to tell which holds the ladder. The API exists specifically so the tool can become one step in an automated pipeline. It was deployed as a public web client at https://ladder-detector.onrender.com, which is the right instinct, but as of checking the service returns 'This service has been suspended by its owner', so the only working route today is self-hosting: 'git clone https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/vilnius-lithuania/ladder-detector.git', add a Hugging Face token to backend/.env, 'docker compose up --build'. Honest limitations are listed: only six ladders supported because of data availability, segmentation imperfect enough to need manual correction, and the classical identification approach possibly improvable by a trained model given a larger dataset. Licence Apache 2.0; it is described as a prototype.","software_zh":"Ladder Detector 解決的是一個真實又不起眼的問題：電泳膠標註都靠手工，重複而且不一致；團隊發現雖然已有數種膠體分析工具，卻沒有一個把標註這一步自動化，即使幾乎每張發表的膠體圖都有標註。流程分兩階段。條帶分割選擇沿用而非重造：GelGenie（Aquilina 等人，Nature Communications 2025）已證明輕量 U-Net 與 nnU-Net 明顯優於傳統 Watershed 與 Multi-Otsu 方法，因此 Ladder Detector 直接執行 GelGenie 釋出的模型，預設為 Universal 輕量 U-Net（在普通 CPU 上只需數秒），另可選用 nnU-Net 與針對銳利條帶微調的版本。ladder 判定才是團隊自己的貢獻，而背後的設計決策很值得參考：他們最初的想法是對標記道裁切影像做影像分類，在一次諮詢後放棄，理由有兩點——他們蒐集不到足以可靠訓練的樣本量，而且影像分類器很可能抓住的是解析度、打光或膠體來源，而不是真正能區分 ladder 的條帶位置。他們改用數值資料，從分割遮罩取出條帶質心，推導出絕對移動距離（距道次頂端的距離）與相對移動距離（以道次高度正規化）。絕對法利用了移動距離對 log10（大小）近乎線性的經驗關係：對註冊表中的每一種 ladder，兩組序列都做 min-max 正規化、將 log 大小反轉、以調整過的 Needleman-Wunsch 對齊，再對配對點做最小平方直線擬合，並以 R-squared 減去每個未配對條帶的罰分來為該 ladder 評分。相對法則是與各 ladder 取自廠商圖表的參考圖譜比對，以 1 - RMSE 計分，並採同樣的未配對條帶罰分。流程刻意保留兩個人工檢查點——分割結果審閱與標記道選擇——wiki 也說明了原因：分割並非總是準確，而且當一張膠體上有多個標記道時，應用程式無法可靠判斷哪一道才是 ladder。API 的存在就是為了讓這個工具能成為自動化流程中的一個環節。它曾以公開網頁前端部署在 https://ladder-detector.onrender.com，這個直覺是對的，但查核時該服務回傳 'This service has been suspended by its owner'，所以今天唯一可行的路徑是自行架設：'git clone https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/vilnius-lithuania/ladder-detector.git'，在 backend/.env 加入 Hugging Face 權杖，再執行 'docker compose up --build'。限制也誠實列出：因資料可得性只支援六種 ladder；分割仍不夠準確、需要人工修正；而傳統的判定方法在資料集更大時，或許可由訓練過的模型做得更好。授權為 Apache 2.0；團隊自述這是一個原型。","stack":["React","Python","FastAPI","REST / OpenAPI 3.1","Docker + Docker Compose","Hugging Face model registry","GelGenie U-Net and nnU-Net models","PyTorch (via GelGenie models)","JSON","Render (deployment, now suspended)","Apache 2.0","iGEM GitLab"],"techniques":["U-Net / nnU-Net semantic segmentation of gel bands","band centroid extraction per lane","adjusted Needleman-Wunsch sequence alignment","Dynamic Time Warping (evaluated and rejected)","log10 size vs migration distance least-squares fitting with R-squared scoring","min-max normalisation for scale-invariant matching","RMSE scoring against vendor reference profiles","gap-penalty scoring for unmatched bands","grouped and stratified train/test splitting to prevent leakage","K-fold cross-validation for parameter tuning","amber-codon non-canonical amino acid incorporation and click chemistry (wet lab)","cryo-EM confirmation of in vitro shell assembly"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education was rebuilt from scratch after a stakeholder told them their plan was wrong. The team had scouted a venue, contacted student organisations and planned to book a music band for one large science festival; Ieva Lingytė, a past team lead, warned them that a bigger event does not mean a bigger audience and that they should go to people rather than expect people to come to them. They scrapped it. The replacement framework borrows Ray Oldenburg's 'third place' sociology: home is the first place, university and formal events the second, and informal public spaces where people gather by choice (cafés, museums, clubs, shelters) the third, where status matters little and conversation is the main activity. Every event was then placed inside a community that already existed, with the format kept flat and walk-away-able for someone with no biology background who had not planned to meet science that evening: genetics discussed through the animals in the room at a cat shelter, fungi taught as a painting workshop ('Science Paints') at the MO Museum, and slots joined at the 'BŪTENT!' discussion festival and the VU Alumni Festival where the audience already existed. They iterated on format too, shortening and sharpening the questions for the second 'Science Talks' after the first showed people wanted more direct ones, and the discussion festival surfaced recognising fake science marketing as the topic people were most misinformed about. Separate consultations with Uršulė Barkauskaitė and Austėja Klevaitė specifically covered adapting activities for older adults, a group the team had no resources to involve meaningfully before.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育活動在一位利害關係人指出他們的規劃有問題之後，整個重做。團隊原本已勘好場地、聯繫學生組織，還打算為一場大型科學節請樂團演出；前任隊長 Ieva Lingytė 提醒他們，活動辦得更大並不等於觸及更多人，應該走向人群，而不是期待人群走過來。他們把原案全部作廢。新的架構借用 Ray Oldenburg 的「第三場所」社會學：家是第一場所，大學與正式活動是第二場所，而人們出於自願聚集的非正式公共空間（咖啡館、博物館、俱樂部、收容所）是第三場所，在那裡身分地位並不重要，交談才是主要活動。於是每場活動都放進一個本來就存在的社群裡，形式刻意保持平等、可隨時離席，讓沒有生物背景、當晚也沒打算遇到科學的人能自在參與：在貓咪收容所藉現場的動物談遺傳學、在 MO Museum 以繪畫工作坊（「Science Paints」）教真菌，並加入「BŪTENT!」討論節與 VU Alumni Festival 既有觀眾的場次。形式也經過迭代：第一場「Science Talks」顯示大家想要更直接的問題，第二場便把題目縮短並問得更尖銳；討論節則讓「辨識假科學行銷」浮現為民眾最容易被誤導的主題。另外與 Uršulė Barkauskaitė 和 Austėja Klevaitė 的個別諮詢，專門處理如何為年長者調整活動——這是團隊先前沒有資源好好納入的族群。","ihp":"More than 30 stakeholder meetings over 9 months, structured as open dialogue aimed at constructive criticism rather than presentation, with each insight systematically evaluated afterwards and failing approaches dropped. They named the loop the CLICK cycle (Consider, Listen, Implement, Check, Know your limitations) and published five values including Critical Reflection, which they define as examining their own baseline assumptions and being honest about limitations given that parts of the platform could have therapeutic value. Advice is mapped on an interactive timeline where every meeting records Description, Insights, Integration and Next steps, with three explicit revision points. Concrete redirections: alumni from the 2023 'Exullose' and 2025 'iXPOSE' teams set a realistic nine-month scope; the Kerfeld Laboratory advised on BMC assembly and protein modification; Prof. Rolandas Meškys shaped turning in vitro assembling BMC proteins into a modular platform; Dr. Yali Wang confirmed BMC-T functional material formation was possible after the team's own tests had repeatedly failed; critique from Ieva Lingytė (Biomatter Designs) and Dr. Juozas Nainys (Atrandi Biosciences) expanded a narrow thermostability aim into pH resistance testing and pushed them to find more creative applications, which produced the three-branch toolkit; and a consultation with Augustas Rinkevičius is recorded as 'Rethinking our ladder detection', the meeting that moved the software off an image classifier onto numerical band-distance matching.","ihp_zh":"9 個月內超過 30 場利害關係人會談，形式是開放對話、以取得建設性批評為目的，而不是做簡報；每則意見事後都系統性評估，行不通的方向就放掉。他們把這個循環命名為 CLICK cycle（Consider、Listen、Implement、Check、Know your limitations），並提出五項價值，其中 Critical Reflection 被定義為檢視自己的預設前提，並在平台部分內容可能具治療價值的前提下誠實面對限制。建議都標在一條互動時間軸上，每場會談記錄 Description、Insights、Integration 與 Next steps，並有三個明確的修正節點。具體的轉向包括：2023 年「Exullose」與 2025 年「iXPOSE」團隊的校友幫他們把範圍收斂到九個月做得到的程度；Kerfeld Laboratory 就 BMC 組裝與蛋白質修飾提供建議；Prof. Rolandas Meškys 促成把體外自組裝的 BMC 蛋白轉為模組化平台的方向；在團隊自己多次試驗失敗後，Dr. Yali Wang 確認 BMC-T 功能性材料的形成是可行的；Ieva Lingytė（Biomatter Designs）與 Dr. Juozas Nainys（Atrandi Biosciences）的批評，把原本只看耐熱性的狹窄目標擴展到 pH 耐受性測試，並推動他們找出更有創意的應用，進而產生三條分支的工具箱；而與 Augustas Rinkevičius 的諮詢記錄為「Rethinking our ladder detection」，正是讓軟體從影像分類器轉向數值條帶距離比對的那場會議。","realWorld":"Commercial viability was reviewed with industry rather than assumed: Ieva Lingytė at Biomatter Designs and Dr. Juozas Nainys at Atrandi Biosciences reviewed and reprioritised the three project paths, Dr. Ignas Galminas took a pitch on the platform's commercial potential, Eglė Radzevičienė advised on intellectual property and industry realities, and the Vilnius University Innovation department ran a market analysis in October. Therapeutic plausibility of BMC shells as drug-delivery nanocarriers was checked with Prof. Aurelija Žvirblienė rather than claimed. The team also presented at the Nordic iGEM Conference.","realWorld_zh":"商業可行性是和業界一起檢視出來的，不是自己假設的：Biomatter Designs 的 Ieva Lingytė 與 Atrandi Biosciences 的 Dr. Juozas Nainys 審視並重新排序了專案的三條路徑，Dr. Ignas Galminas 聽取關於平台商業潛力的提案，Eglė Radzevičienė 就智慧財產權與產業現實提供建議，Vilnius University 創新部門則在 10 月做了市場分析。BMC 外殼作為藥物遞送奈米載體的治療可行性，也是向 Prof. Aurelija Žvirblienė 求證過，而非逕行宣稱。團隊另外在 Nordic iGEM Conference 發表。","partners":["Kerfeld Laboratory","Thermo Fisher Scientific (ladder band-pattern data)","Vilnius University Life Sciences Center community (gel image donations)","International Biology Olympiad organisers (gel image donations)","Biomatter Designs","Atrandi Biosciences","Promega","Vilnius University Innovation department","MO Museum","BŪTENT! discussion festival","iGEM Vilnius-Lithuania alumni (Exullose 2023, iXPOSE 2025)","Caszyme, Seqvision, Thorlabs, Noatech, SnapGene (sponsors)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6043/wiki/software-images/original-photo-vs-result-2.avif","caption":"The original gel electrophoresis photograph next to Ladder Detector's automatically annotated result.","caption_zh":"原始的膠體電泳照片，與 Ladder Detector 自動標註後的結果並列。","credit":"Team Vilnius-Lithuania, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6043/wiki/software-images/tech-stack.avif","caption":"Ladder Detector's technology stack: a React web client over a Python FastAPI server, with no database layer because no user data is stored.","caption_zh":"Ladder Detector 的技術堆疊：React 網頁前端架在 Python FastAPI 伺服器上；因為不儲存使用者資料，所以沒有資料庫層。","credit":"Team Vilnius-Lithuania, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6043/wiki/software-images/ladder-detector-final-process-flow.avif","caption":"The process flow, showing which steps the application performs and which two verification checkpoints are deliberately left to the user.","caption_zh":"流程圖，顯示哪些步驟由應用程式執行，以及哪兩個驗證檢查點刻意留給使用者。","credit":"Team Vilnius-Lithuania, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6043/wiki/software-images/metric-explanation-dark.avif","caption":"The two metrics derived from band centroids: absolute run distance from the top of the lane, and the same value normalised by marker-lane height.","caption_zh":"由條帶質心推導出的兩項指標：自道次頂端起算的絕對移動距離，以及同一數值以標記道高度正規化後的相對移動距離。","credit":"Team Vilnius-Lithuania, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Build on the published model rather than training your own, and say why: Ladder Detector takes GelGenie's peer-reviewed U-Net weights for segmentation and spends its own effort on the one step nobody had automated, then rejects an image classifier on the explicit grounds that it would learn lighting and resolution instead of band positions. The transferable practice is their evaluation hygiene, a grouped and stratified split that stops samples from the same gel image leaking between tuning and test, stated random and majority-class baselines, per-class accuracy tables, and a published diagnosis of the one class the method fails on.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"用已發表的模型，而不是自己訓練一個，並且把理由說清楚：Ladder Detector 直接採用 GelGenie 經同儕審查的 U-Net 權重做分割，把自己的力氣花在沒人自動化過的那一步；並明確說明為何不用影像分類器——那會學到打光與解析度，而不是條帶位置。真正可移植的作法是他們的評估紀律：以分組與分層切分，避免同一張電泳膠影像的樣本在調參集與測試集之間洩漏；明列隨機猜測與多數類別兩條基線；提供各類別準確率表格；並公開診斷方法唯一失敗的那個類別。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/vilnius-lithuania/","https://2026.igem.wiki/vilnius-lithuania/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/vilnius-lithuania/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/vilnius-lithuania/education","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/vilnius-lithuania/ladder-detector","https://ladder-detector.onrender.com/"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳軟體 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（大學組）"],"rank":21},"6045":{"team":"UNILausanne","id":"6045","section":"Overgrad","country":"Switzerland","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/unilausanne/","projectTitle":"ASTACi: Detect, Disarm, Defend","projectTitle_zh":"ASTACi：偵測、解除、防禦","tagline":"A field-deployable LAMP assay for the crayfish plague pathogen, a sub-CHF-10 open-source incubator to run it, and an ecological model that decided which treatment strategy to pursue.","tagline_zh":"一套可現地部署、用於偵測螯蝦瘟病原的 LAMP 檢測法，一台成本低於 10 CHF 的開源恆溫加熱裝置來執行它，以及一個生態模型來決定該採取哪一套處理策略。","summary":"UNILausanne addressed crayfish plague, caused by the oomycete Aphanomyces astaci, with three complementary strategies: detect the pathogen in water with loop-mediated isothermal amplification, disarm the invasive signal crayfish that carries it using RNAi, and defend native crayfish with a protective protein supplement. The measurement work asks whether the LAMP assay is specific enough to separate A. astaci from the closely related A. frigidophilus, sensitive enough to be useful, and robust enough to survive real lake and river water. The hardware is C.L.A.W., a hand-sized USB-powered incubator built with the original author of the MobileLAMP design, fully open-source at under CHF 10 per unit. A stochastic two-species population model was validated against a documented field case and then used to decide how to split effort between the disarm and defend strategies.","summary_zh":"UNILausanne 以三項互補策略處理由卵菌 Aphanomyces astaci 引起的螯蝦瘟：以迴圈介導等溫擴增（LAMP）偵測水中的病原、以 RNAi 解除攜帶病原的入侵種訊號螯蝦的威脅，並以具保護作用的蛋白質補充劑防禦原生螯蝦。量測工作所問的問題是：這套 LAMP 檢測是否專一到足以把 A. astaci 與近緣的 A. frigidophilus 區分開來、是否靈敏到足以實用，以及是否穩健到能承受真實的湖水與河水。硬體是 C.L.A.W.，一台手掌大小、以 USB 供電的恆溫加熱裝置，與 MobileLAMP 設計的原作者共同打造，完全開源且單台成本低於 10 CHF。一個隨機性的雙物種族群模型先以一個有文獻紀錄的野外案例驗證，再用來決定該如何在「解除」與「防禦」兩項策略之間分配資源。","awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Measurement is organised around three stated requirements for a field assay (distinguish the pathogen from close relatives, offer a low detection limit, remain reliable under different environmental conditions), which become the specificity, sensitivity and robustness sections. The model is organised as sensitivity analysis, then validation against a real documented outcome, then use, with assumptions and limitations listed as expandable sections and each parameter annotated with its definition, the value used and the basis for that value, including explicit statements of 'no literature value exists' where none does.","frameworks_zh":"量測以現地檢測的三項明定需求為架構（把病原與近緣物種區分開來、提供低檢測極限、在不同環境條件下維持可靠），這三項分別對應專一性、靈敏度與穩健性三個章節。模型的編排依序為敏感度分析、對照真實文獻紀錄結果的驗證，最後才是應用；假設與限制以可展開區塊逐條列出，每個參數都標註其定義、所採用的數值以及該數值的依據，在確實查無資料時也明白寫出「文獻中並無此數值」。","dataviz":"Annotated agarose gel panels paired with photographs of colorimetric tube results; a qPCR standard curve of Ct against log10 template concentration with a linear regression over the assay's linear range; a temperature-stability plot showing three individual C.L.A.W. runs in grey, the mean +/- SD in orange and a shaded band marking the 60 to 65 C LAMP window, analysed and plotted in R 4.5.1 with ggplot2; an animated monthly-cycle schematic of the ecological model; interactive population-trajectory charts with median lines, shaded likely-outcome ranges, hoverable values, a toggleable data table and clickable legend entries; a heat-map grid of percentage native decline across competition and transmission values with the selected cell outlined.","dataviz_zh":"加註說明的瓊脂糖凝膠電泳圖，與呈色反應管的照片並列；qPCR 標準曲線以 Ct 對 log10 模板濃度作圖，並在檢測的線性範圍內做線性迴歸；溫度穩定性圖以灰線呈現 C.L.A.W. 的三次個別運行、以橙色呈現平均值 +/- SD，並以陰影帶標出 60 至 65 C 的 LAMP 作用區間，全部以 R 4.5.1 搭配 ggplot2 分析與繪製；生態模型的月週期示意圖以動畫呈現；互動式族群軌跡圖附有中位數線、標示可能結果範圍的陰影區、可滑過查看的數值、可切換顯示的資料表與可點選的圖例項目；熱圖網格呈現原生族群衰退百分比隨競爭與傳播參數的變化，並以外框標示所選取的格位。","datascience":"Specificity was engineered rather than assumed: multiple LAMP primer sets were designed and compared, with the best-performing set placing the F3 primer over a 10 bp deletion present in A. frigidophilus, and the team found that removing the optional loop primers eliminated false positives, a result they turn into a recommendation for other teams. Sensitivity was established by serial dilution with three replicates per level, giving a preliminary limit of detection of 5.5 x 10^-5 ng template per reaction, about 5 x 10^-6 ng/uL in the final reaction, below which amplification became inconsistent; a missing band in one lane is attributed to a probable pipetting error rather than quietly dropped. That figure is then benchmarked against the gold standard by running a qPCR standard curve for A. astaci, Ct against log10 concentration in triplicate, with a lowest detected concentration of about 1 x 10^-7 ng/uL, so the team can say its assay sits within one order of magnitude of the reference method instead of claiming parity. Robustness testing produced the most useful negative result: lake and river water pH was measured (5.8 for distilled, 7.04 to 7.11 for Lake Geneva, 7.26 to 8.16 for river water), samples were spiked with synthetic DNA, and amplification was robust across the range on gel, but the pH-sensitive colorimetric readout failed to change colour at higher starting pH, so the assay is robust and its readout is not. The team converts this into three explicit recommendations: run a no-template control with every new primer set, drop the loop primers if the NTC gives false positives, and check environmental pH or confirm a colorimetric negative by gel before calling a sample clean. Hardware is calibrated rather than trusted: a thermometer placed directly in the tube bore read about 10 C above the display, so the thermostat is set to 52.5 C to reach 62.5 C in the tube, and this calibration step is written into the published manual; heating from 27 to 62.5 C takes about five minutes with an overshoot to around 70 C at eight minutes because the sensor sits under the block, so the protocol specifies a 10-minute preheat, after which the tube bore holds 62.7 +/- 1.2 C over 30 minutes across three independent runs. The ecological model is stochastic with many replicates per condition reported as medians with percentile bands, is subjected to a sensitivity analysis to identify which parameters matter, and is then validated by sweeping competition and transmission against a real documented displacement (Bubb, Thom and Lucas tracked 15 invasive and 20 native crayfish at a river site in 2003 and found zero natives on resurvey in 2005); the team chose moderate competition with beta = 0.9, a 95% match, over the closest 97% fit because the latter would have contradicted their neutral-habitat baseline, and they state that the remaining gap was left open rather than closed by adjusting habitat.","datascience_zh":"專一性是設計出來的，而不是假定而來：團隊設計並比較了多組 LAMP 引子，表現最佳的一組把 F3 引子設計在 A. frigidophilus 具有的一段 10 bp 缺失上；團隊並發現移除選用性的 loop 引子即可消除假陽性，並把這項結果寫成給其他團隊的建議。靈敏度以序列稀釋建立，每一稀釋度做三個重複，得到初步檢測極限為每次反應 5.5 x 10^-5 ng 模板，約相當於最終反應中的 5 x 10^-6 ng/uL，低於此量時擴增就變得不一致；某一道缺失的條帶被歸因於可能的移液操作失誤，而不是被悄悄剔除。這個數字接著以黃金標準方法對標：團隊為 A. astaci 建立 qPCR 標準曲線，以三重複做 Ct 對 log10 濃度作圖，最低可偵測濃度約為 1 x 10^-7 ng/uL，因此團隊得以說自家檢測與參考方法相差在一個數量級之內，而不是宣稱兩者相當。穩健性測試產生了最有用的負面結果：團隊量測了湖水與河水的 pH（蒸餾水 5.8、日內瓦湖 7.04 至 7.11、河水 7.26 至 8.16），在樣本中加入合成 DNA，凝膠結果顯示擴增在整個範圍內都穩健，但對 pH 敏感的呈色判讀在起始 pH 偏高時無法變色，因此檢測本身穩健，其判讀方式則不然。團隊把這一點轉化為三項明確建議：每組新引子都要跑無模板對照（NTC）、若 NTC 出現假陽性就捨棄 loop 引子，以及在判定樣本乾淨之前先檢查環境 pH，或以凝膠確認呈色法的陰性結果。硬體是經過校正而不是直接信任：直接插入試管孔的溫度計讀值比顯示值高約 10 C，因此恆溫器設定在 52.5 C 才能讓管內達到 62.5 C，這道校正步驟也寫進了公開的操作手冊；由 27 C 升溫至 62.5 C 約需五分鐘，並在第八分鐘超調至約 70 C，原因是感測器位於加熱塊下方，因此流程規定須預熱 10 分鐘，之後在三次獨立運行中，試管孔於 30 分鐘內維持在 62.7 +/- 1.2 C。生態模型為隨機模型，每一條件下執行多次重複，結果以中位數搭配百分位區間呈現；模型先經敏感度分析找出真正重要的參數，再以掃描競爭與傳播參數的方式，對照一起有文獻紀錄的實際取代事件進行驗證（Bubb、Thom 與 Lucas 於 2003 年在一處河段追蹤 15 隻入侵種與 20 隻原生螯蝦，2005 年複查時原生個體數為零）；團隊選了中等競爭、beta = 0.9、吻合度 95% 的組合，而不是吻合度最高的 97%，因為後者會與他們設定的中性棲地基準相矛盾，而他們也說明剩餘的落差是被保留下來，而不是靠調整棲地參數來消除。","software":"C.L.A.W. is fully open-source with a published assembly manual containing a parts list with prices and suppliers, step-by-step assembly instructions, wiring diagrams, and guidance on settings and calibration; STL files for the base, cover, lid, tube support and button are provided with an interactive 3D viewer on the wiki. The design builds on the published MobileLAMP device and the team worked with its corresponding author to correct a missing circuit connection. Analysis and plotting were done in R 4.5.1 with ggplot2.","software_zh":"C.L.A.W. 完全開源，並公開了組裝手冊，內含標示價格與供應商的零件清單、逐步組裝說明、接線圖，以及設定與校正的指引；底座、外殼、上蓋、試管座與按鈕的 STL 檔案皆有提供，並在 wiki 上搭配互動式 3D 檢視器。這套設計以已發表的 MobileLAMP 裝置為基礎，團隊並與其通訊作者合作，修正了一處缺漏的電路連接。分析與繪圖以 R 4.5.1 搭配 ggplot2 完成。","stack":["Vazyme fluorescent LAMP/RT-LAMP kit","NEB WarmStart Colorimetric LAMP 2X master mix","Agarose gel electrophoresis","TaqMan qPCR (Vralstad assay)","R 4.5.1 with ggplot2","3D printing (STL)","USB power bank electronics","Stochastic two-species population simulation"],"techniques":["Primer-set comparison for specificity","Loop-primer removal to suppress false positives","Serial dilution limit of detection with replicates","Benchmarking against a gold-standard method","Environmental matrix (lake and river water) testing","pH measurement of sample matrices","No-template controls on every primer set","Thermometer-in-tube calibration of a heater","Temperature stability as mean +/- SD across runs","Parameter sensitivity analysis","Model validation against a documented field outcome"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"An education page and a games section accompany the project, alongside an inclusivity page that includes a dyslexia-friendly display option on the wiki itself.","publicEngagement_zh":"專案另設有教育頁面與遊戲區，以及一個包容性頁面；wiki 本身也提供對閱讀障礙者友善的顯示選項。","ihp":"A conversation with La Maison de la Riviere, a Swiss foundation for aquatic ecosystem research and conservation, changed a decision the model had already made. The simulations showed monotonically that moving effort from protein supplementation toward RNAi always helped the native population, which suggested abandoning the defend strategy. The foundation described native crayfish reintroduced into a lake with no invasive crayfish present that still died because A. astaci was already in the water, a case the model could not represent because it tracks the pathogen only through the invasive population. The team kept developing the defend strategy for that use case and documented explicitly that the model's scope, not the strategy, was the limitation.","ihp_zh":"與瑞士水域生態系研究暨保育基金會 La Maison de la Riviere 的一場對話，推翻了模型原本已經做出的決定。模擬結果單調地顯示，把資源從蛋白質補充移往 RNAi 永遠對原生族群有利，這意味著應該放棄「防禦」策略。該基金會描述了一個案例：原生螯蝦被重新引入一座並沒有入侵種螯蝦的湖泊，卻仍然死亡，因為 A. astaci 早已存在於水中。模型無法呈現這種情形，因為它只透過入侵種族群追蹤病原。團隊因此為這個使用情境繼續發展「防禦」策略，並明確記錄下來：限制來自模型的適用範圍，而不是這項策略本身。","realWorld":"The target users are named and the design follows from them: fishermen and conservationists who must run the test at the water's edge without a laboratory, which is why C.L.A.W. runs from a standard USB power bank, costs under CHF 10, and is published with everything needed to rebuild it. The outlook section lists three concrete improvements with reasons (a heated lid to stop condensation reducing the reaction volume, a larger aluminium block so controls can run alongside samples, and freeze-dried reagents for a self-contained field kit), and the next steps for the assay are stated as replacing synthetic DNA with isolated pathogen DNA and then with environmental samples, possibly with a pre-enrichment step.","realWorld_zh":"目標使用者被明確指名，設計也由此推導而來：必須在沒有實驗室的水邊執行檢測的漁民與保育工作者，這正是 C.L.A.W. 以標準 USB 行動電源供電、成本低於 10 CHF，並公開了重製所需一切資料的原因。展望一節列出三項具體改良並說明理由（加熱上蓋以避免冷凝水減少反應體積、加大鋁製加熱塊讓對照組能與樣本同時進行、以及凍乾試劑以做成自給自足的現地套組）；檢測本身的下一步則明定為先以分離自病原的 DNA 取代合成 DNA，再進一步改用環境樣本，並可能加入預先富集（pre-enrichment）步驟。","partners":["Dr Ganga Chinna Rao Devarapu (corresponding author, MobileLAMP)","La Maison de la Riviere","Vazyme","New England Biolabs","IDT","Microsynth","Twist Bioscience","Promega"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6045/wiki/hardware/frame-023.webp","caption":"C.L.A.W. (Compact LAMP ASTACi Water-incubator), the team's hand-sized, USB-powered LAMP incubator. It is fully open-source, built from off-the-shelf and 3D-printed parts for under CHF 10 per device.","caption_zh":"C.L.A.W.（Compact LAMP ASTACi Water-incubator），團隊自製的手掌大小、USB 供電 LAMP 恆溫加熱裝置。完全開源，以市售零件與 3D 列印件組成，單台成本低於 10 CHF。","credit":"Team UNILausanne, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6045/wiki/figure-hardware/claw-stability-graph.avif","caption":"Temperature in the C.L.A.W. tube bore over a 30-minute incubation after a 10-minute preheat, read every five minutes with a glass thermometer inserted directly into the bore. Grey lines are the three individual runs, orange is mean +/- SD, and the shaded band marks the 60 to 65 C LAMP window; the bore held 62.7 +/- 1.2 C.","caption_zh":"預熱 10 分鐘後，C.L.A.W. 試管孔在 30 分鐘恆溫反應期間的溫度，以直接插入孔內的玻璃溫度計每五分鐘讀取一次。灰線為三次個別運行，橙色為平均值 +/- SD，陰影帶標示 60 至 65 C 的 LAMP 作用區間；管孔維持在 62.7 +/- 1.2 C。","credit":"Team UNILausanne, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6045/wiki/measurement/fig2.avif","caption":"Agarose gel of LAMP amplicons across a serial dilution of template DNA, three replicates per level, establishing a preliminary limit of detection of 5.5 x 10^-5 ng per reaction. The team attributes the one missing band to a probable pipetting error rather than removing the lane.","caption_zh":"模板 DNA 序列稀釋後 LAMP 產物的瓊脂糖凝膠電泳，每一稀釋度三個重複，據此建立每次反應 5.5 x 10^-5 ng 的初步檢測極限。團隊把唯一缺失的條帶歸因於可能的移液操作失誤，而不是把該道結果移除。","credit":"Team UNILausanne, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6045/wiki/measurement/fig3.avif","caption":"qPCR standard curve for A. astaci, Ct against log10 template concentration in triplicate with a linear regression over the assay's linear range. Benchmarking against this gold standard lets the team state that their LAMP assay sits within one order of magnitude rather than claiming equivalence.","caption_zh":"A. astaci 的 qPCR 標準曲線，以三重複呈現 Ct 對 log10 模板濃度，並在檢測的線性範圍內做線性迴歸。對標這項黃金標準方法，讓團隊得以說自家 LAMP 檢測相差在一個數量級之內，而不是宣稱兩者等效。","credit":"Team UNILausanne, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Test the readout in the matrix it will actually meet, not only the chemistry: the team's LAMP amplification worked in river water while its pH-based colour change did not, a failure invisible in distilled-water validation and the kind that quietly produces false negatives in the field.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"要在判讀方式真正會遇到的樣本基質中測試它，而不只是測試化學反應：這支團隊的 LAMP 擴增在河水中可行，但以 pH 為基礎的變色判讀卻失效；這種失效在蒸餾水驗證中完全看不出來，而且正是會在現場悄悄產生假陰性的那一類問題。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/unilausanne/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/unilausanne/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/unilausanne/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/unilausanne/","https://2026.igem.wiki/unilausanne/design-detect","https://2026.igem.wiki/unilausanne/human-practices"],"awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"rank":7},"6053":{"team":"HKSSC","id":"6053","section":"High School","country":"Hong Kong","village":"Food & Nutrition","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hkssc/","projectTitle":"Engineering E. coli to express prbA, a paraben-degrading esterase, as a pre-treatment for food waste recycling","projectTitle_zh":"改造 E. coli 表現除對羥基苯甲酸酯的酯酶 prbA，作為廚餘回收的前處理步驟","tagline":"If preservatives are designed to stop microbes, can we design microbes to stop preservatives?","tagline_zh":"既然防腐劑的設計目的是抑制微生物，我們能不能設計微生物來分解防腐劑？","summary":"HKSSC (St. Stephen's College, Hong Kong) noticed a bottleneck nobody was talking about: Hong Kong's O-PARK organic resources recovery centre runs anaerobic digestion on food waste, but the chemical preservatives already in that waste inhibit the very microbes doing the digesting. They cloned prbA, a paraben esterase from Enterobacter cloacae that hydrolyses parabens to 4-hydroxybenzoic acid and needs no complex cofactors, into pET22b+ under a T7 promoter with a pelB signal peptide directing it to the periplasm, then characterised it with CFU-based MIC assays, a pNPA esterase assay and HPLC. They won Best New Basic Part at high school level largely on the strength of the prbA part family - including the previously unregistered native promoter and RBS, which they located in silico with BPROM and then built into a promoterless GFP reporter construct. The dry lab and statistics are the standout: structure-guided mutant design in HotSpot Wizard on an AlphaFold model, and a Michaelis-Menten kinetic analysis defended with two-way ANOVA, a Brown-Forsythe Levene variance check and Welch-Satterthwaite contrasts with Holm correction.","summary_zh":"HKSSC（香港聖士提反書院）注意到一個少有人談的瓶頸：香港 O-PARK 有機資源回收中心以厭氧消化處理廚餘，但廚餘中既有的化學防腐劑會抑制負責消化的微生物本身。他們將 prbA（來自 Enterobacter cloacae 的對羥基苯甲酸酯酯酶，可將 paraben 水解為 4-hydroxybenzoic acid，且不需複雜輔因子）選殖進 pET22b+，置於 T7 啟動子下，並以 pelB 訊號肽導向周質空間，再以 CFU 為基礎的 MIC 試驗、pNPA 酯酶活性試驗與 HPLC 進行特性分析。他們以 prbA 元件家族的實力拿下高中組最佳新基礎元件獎——其中包括此前未註冊的天然啟動子與 RBS，團隊先用 BPROM 以電腦預測其位置，再建成無啟動子的 GFP 報告基因構築。乾實驗與統計是全隊亮點：以 AlphaFold 模型在 HotSpot Wizard 中進行結構導向的突變體設計，以及一套以雙因子 ANOVA、Brown-Forsythe（基於中位數的 Levene）變異數檢定與經 Holm 校正的 Welch-Satterthwaite 對比加以支撐的 Michaelis-Menten 動力學分析。","awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best New Basic Part — Winner (High School)","Best Education — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Agriculture / Food & Nutrition / Fashion & Cosmetics / Art & Design)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Three distinct computational strands. (1) Structure and protein engineering: the prbA structure was taken from AlphaFold and visualised in UCSF Chimera, which revealed a long flexible N-terminal tail consistent with the 31-residue signal peptide and justified the Cycle 2 switch to pelB periplasmic targeting. HotSpot Wizard 3.1 (Loschmidt Laboratories) was then used for a full structure-guided mutagenesis workflow: stability hotspots were ranked by B-factor and relative accessible surface area (ASA), buried residues filtered out, and three candidates triaged - A198 (50% ASA, highest flexibility) rejected because the Correlated Positions tab showed it needs a compensating mutation elsewhere; P329 rejected because only one amino acid occurs at that homologous position; N240 (34% ASA) selected, with Amino Acid Frequencies showing histidine as the commonest homolog residue and Mutational Landscape giving Asp/His/Ser an 88% probability of preserving function. They used the Design Library function with a minimal frequency threshold of 10% to generate degenerate codons for saturation mutagenesis at N240 and back-translated an E. coli K12-optimised mutant sequence. A second, separate hotspot run targeted catalytic efficiency rather than stability, prioritising A221 and A140 (mutability score 6, both in the catalytic pocket and substrate access tunnel) and designing an RCY degenerate codon library giving 50% Ala / 50% Thr with ~94% chance of seeing both variants in 5 colonies. (2) Molecular docking: methyl-paraben (PubChem CID 117065203) was docked across the whole prbA structure using HotSpot Wizard's docking module and visualised in Chimera to confirm N240 is not in the ligand-binding region - and they honestly flagged that histidine ionises near pH 6, so the mutation could backfire. Earlier docking with CB-Dock2 in PyMOL identified the catalytic serines. (3) Promoter prediction: BPROM was run on the 247 bp upstream region of prbA, predicting a sigma-70 promoter with an LDF score of 5.30 (threshold 0.20), a consensus -10 box TATAAT at position 163 (score 68), a near-consensus -35 box TTGAAA at 142 (score 23), 21 bp spacing and TSS at 178. (4) Enzyme kinetics: a Michaelis-Menten model fitted to pNPA assay data, plus a 35-page mathematical modelling report, with Monod kinetics recommended by Professor Patrick Lee for future digester-scale work.","frameworks_zh":"運算工作分成三條（實為四條）明確路線。(1) 結構與蛋白質工程：prbA 結構取自 AlphaFold，並以 UCSF Chimera 視覺化，從中看出一段長而柔軟的 N 端尾巴，與 31 個殘基的訊號肽相符，也成為 Cycle 2 改用 pelB 周質導向的依據。接著以 HotSpot Wizard 3.1（Loschmidt Laboratories）執行完整的結構導向突變流程：依 B-factor 與相對可及表面積（ASA）排序穩定性熱點，濾除埋藏殘基，並篩選出三個候選位點——A198（ASA 50%、柔軟度最高）因 Correlated Positions 頁顯示它需要在別處有補償性突變而捨棄；P329 因該同源位置只出現一種胺基酸而捨棄；最後選定 N240（ASA 34%），其 Amino Acid Frequencies 顯示組胺酸是同源序列中最常見的殘基，Mutational Landscape 則給出 Asp/His/Ser 有 88% 機率保留功能。他們用 Design Library 功能、以 10% 的最低頻率門檻，為 N240 的飽和突變產生簡併密碼子，並反轉譯出一段以 E. coli K12 最佳化的突變序列。另有一次獨立的熱點分析針對催化效率而非穩定性，優先考慮 A221 與 A140（可突變性分數 6，兩者都位於催化口袋與受質進入通道內），並設計出 RCY 簡併密碼子庫，產生 50% Ala / 50% Thr，在 5 個菌落中看到兩種變異體的機率約 94%。(2) 分子對接：methyl-paraben（PubChem CID 117065203）以 HotSpot Wizard 的對接模組對整個 prbA 結構進行對接，並在 Chimera 中視覺化，確認 N240 不在配體結合區——他們也誠實指出組胺酸在 pH 6 附近會解離，因此這個突變可能反而不利。更早期則以 PyMOL 搭配 CB-Dock2 對接，找出催化用的絲胺酸。(3) 啟動子預測：對 prbA 上游 247 bp 區域執行 BPROM，預測出一個 sigma-70 啟動子，LDF 分數 5.30（門檻 0.20），位置 163 處有共有序列 -10 box TATAAT（分數 68），位置 142 處有接近共有序列的 -35 box TTGAAA（分數 23），間距 21 bp，TSS 位於 178。(4) 酵素動力學：以 Michaelis-Menten 模型擬合 pNPA 試驗數據，另有一份 35 頁的數學建模報告；Patrick Lee 教授建議未來放大到消化槽尺度時改用 Monod 動力學。","dataviz":"The wiki carries a 35-page mathematical modelling PDF embedded inline for the kinetics section. More interesting is how they made the data defensible rather than merely pretty: initial velocity versus substrate concentration plotted for all four enzyme conditions (1 and 10 ug/mL porcine liver esterase control, 1 and 8 ug/mL recombinant prbA), Michaelis-Menten fits overlaid, and the statistical validation laid out as readable tables with the F statistics, degrees of freedom and p-values spelled out and each test explained in plain language for a non-statistician reader. Every chart in results is captioned with a complete alt text describing the plate layout or chromatogram, and both HPLC calibration chromatograms and time-course chromatograms (T0, T1, T2, T4) are shown rather than just a summary number.","dataviz_zh":"wiki 在動力學段落內嵌了一份 35 頁的數學建模 PDF。更值得注意的是他們讓數據站得住腳、而非只求好看：四種酵素條件（1 與 10 ug/mL 豬肝酯酶對照、1 與 8 ug/mL 重組 prbA）的初始速度對受質濃度都有作圖，疊上 Michaelis-Menten 擬合曲線，統計驗證則整理成易讀的表格，把 F 統計量、自由度與 p 值一一列出，並用非統計背景讀者也看得懂的語言逐項解釋每個檢定。結果頁的每張圖都有完整的替代文字說明盤面配置或層析圖譜，HPLC 的校正層析圖與時間序列層析圖（T0、T1、T2、T4）也都完整呈現，而非只給一個總結數字。","datascience":"This is the most statistically disciplined high school dataset of the five teams reviewed. Because they could only measure enzyme input by total powder weight rather than molar concentration, they refused to report kcat/Km and instead defined a mass-normalised catalytic capacity metric Q = Vmax / (Cmass x Km), valid only in the low-substrate regime (S << Km), with units cancelling to L g-1 min-1. Recombinant prbA at 1 ug/mL scored Q = 9.518 L g-1 min-1 versus Q = 4.545 for commercial porcine liver esterase at the same mass concentration - a 2.09-fold advantage. They then proved the difference was not pipetting noise: a two-way ANOVA across 4 enzyme conditions x 7 non-zero substrate concentrations gave enzyme condition F(3,64) = 52.530, p = 3.01e-17; substrate F(6,64) = 92.111, p = 1.49e-29; interaction F(18,64) = 21.012, p = 3.15e-20. A Brown-Forsythe Levene test (median-based, chosen over mean-based Levene precisely because outliers drag the mean) returned p = 0.01898, rejecting equal variances - so rather than ignore it they switched to Welch-Satterthwaite contrasts with Holm correction for multiple comparisons, confirming significance at 0.25 mM (p = 0.03452), 0.20 mM (p = 0.04225) and 0.10 mM (p = 0.00408). Separately, they chose CFU plate counts over OD600 for MIC determination because OD600 is confounded by precipitation and dead cells, and built an OD600-to-CFU/mL standard curve for proper per-cell normalisation. MIC was bracketed empirically: 400-500 mg/L methyl-paraben for wild-type BL21(DE3), 1000-1500 mg/L for the Cycle 1 prbA-idt construct, and 500-600 mg/L for the Cycle 2 pelB construct - and they published the awkward finding that Cycle 2 was worse than Cycle 1, diagnosed it from faint SDS-PAGE bands as a protein-isolation methodology problem, and opened Cycle 3 with 6xHis-tag IMAC purification to fix it.","datascience_zh":"這是所審五隊高中組中統計最為嚴謹的一份資料。由於他們只能以總粉末重量、而非莫耳濃度來量測酵素投入量，他們拒絕報告 kcat/Km，改為定義一個以質量標準化的催化容量指標 Q = Vmax / (Cmass x Km)，並限定只在低受質區間（S << Km）成立，單位相消後為 L g-1 min-1。在相同質量濃度下，1 ug/mL 的重組 prbA 得到 Q = 9.518 L g-1 min-1，市售豬肝酯酶則為 Q = 4.545——高出 2.09 倍。接著他們證明這個差異不是移液誤差：對 4 種酵素條件 x 7 個非零受質濃度所做的雙因子 ANOVA 顯示，酵素條件 F(3,64) = 52.530、p = 3.01e-17；受質 F(6,64) = 92.111、p = 1.49e-29；交互作用 F(18,64) = 21.012、p = 3.15e-20。Brown-Forsythe Levene 檢定（基於中位數，之所以不用基於平均數的 Levene，正是因為離群值會拉動平均數）得到 p = 0.01898，拒絕變異數齊一——他們沒有略過這點，而是改用經 Holm 多重比較校正的 Welch-Satterthwaite 對比，確認在 0.25 mM（p = 0.03452）、0.20 mM（p = 0.04225）與 0.10 mM（p = 0.00408）具顯著性。另外，他們在測定 MIC 時選擇 CFU 平盤計數而非 OD600，因為 OD600 會被沉澱與死菌混淆，並建立 OD600 對 CFU/mL 的標準曲線，以便做出正確的單細胞標準化。MIC 以實驗夾擠出區間：野生型 BL21(DE3) 為 400-500 mg/L methyl-paraben，Cycle 1 的 prbA-idt 構築為 1000-1500 mg/L，Cycle 2 的 pelB 構築為 500-600 mg/L——他們公開了 Cycle 2 比 Cycle 1 更差這個尷尬結果，並從 SDS-PAGE 上微弱的條帶診斷出這是蛋白質分離方法的問題，進而開啟 Cycle 3，改以 6xHis-tag IMAC 純化來修正。","software":"Two released pieces of software, both genuinely built rather than mocked up. FoodSafe is a native iOS app in Swift (source at https://github.com/judeliucodex/Foodsave, initial scaffold AI-assisted then refined by the software team) with two features: a 60-second swipe-left/swipe-right food-sorting game (100 points per correct call plus combo bonuses, backed by a food library for post-game review) and an AI-assisted food safety checker that sends a photo to DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash's vision model and returns a danger-meter rating with the observations behind the judgement. They are explicit about the limits - a photograph cannot establish safety, pathogens can be invisible, and the meter is an AI estimate, not a measurement - and about distribution, noting it is on TestFlight for invited testers rather than the App Store. Microbe Wars is a browser-based 2D arena game written entirely in Python by the team and hosted at https://igem-game.vercel.app, where the player fights paraben enemies as prbA using weapons like an enzyme pipette, with campaign/endless/practice modes, four difficulty tiers and a levelling system. On the parts side they contributed BBa_26SZRX0Y (prbA CDS), BBa_264E443U and BBa_26XQ4J7K (stop/start-codon-free variants), BBa_262HI0IB (native promoter + RBS, the Best New Basic Part), composite parts BBa_26SU8KOK (pelB + prbA) and BBa_26MSEOFB (native promoter/RBS + GFPuv), colony PCR and Gibson primers, and a curated 'PrbA's Family' part collection (UUID 9f037d92-78bb-470b-b139-c4ce28d4cc86).","software_zh":"兩套實際發布的軟體，都是真的做出來、不是畫出來的。FoodSafe 是以 Swift 寫成的原生 iOS 應用程式（原始碼在 https://github.com/judeliucodex/Foodsave，初始骨架借助 AI 生成，之後由軟體組改寫），有兩項功能：一個 60 秒左右滑動分類廚餘的小遊戲（每答對一題 100 分，另有連擊加成，並搭配一個食物資料庫供賽後複習），以及一個 AI 輔助的食品安全檢查器，將照片送入 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 的視覺模型，回傳一個危險程度評級以及支撐該判斷的觀察依據。他們明確說明限制——照片無法證明食物安全、病原可能看不見、這個評級是 AI 的估計而非量測——也明確說明散布方式，指出它放在 TestFlight 供受邀測試者使用，而非上架 App Store。Microbe Wars 是一款完全由隊員以 Python 寫成的瀏覽器 2D 競技場遊戲，架在 https://igem-game.vercel.app，玩家化身 prbA、使用酵素移液管等武器對抗 paraben 敵人，有戰役／無盡／練習三種模式、四個難度階層與升級系統。元件方面，他們貢獻了 BBa_26SZRX0Y（prbA CDS）、BBa_264E443U 與 BBa_26XQ4J7K（去除終止／起始密碼子的版本）、BBa_262HI0IB（天然啟動子 + RBS，即最佳新基礎元件）、複合元件 BBa_26SU8KOK（pelB + prbA）與 BBa_26MSEOFB（天然啟動子/RBS + GFPuv）、菌落 PCR 與 Gibson 引子，以及一組策劃過的「PrbA's Family」元件集合（UUID 9f037d92-78bb-470b-b139-c4ce28d4cc86）。","stack":["AlphaFold","UCSF Chimera","HotSpot Wizard 3.1","CB-Dock2","PyMOL","BPROM","PubChem","Michaelis-Menten kinetics","two-way ANOVA","Brown-Forsythe Levene test","Welch-Satterthwaite contrasts with Holm correction","Swift / iOS / TestFlight","DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash vision API","Python","Vercel","GitHub","HPLC","pNPA spectrophotometric esterase assay"],"techniques":["structure-guided saturation mutagenesis site triage (ASA, B-factor, correlated positions, mutational landscape)","degenerate codon library design","whole-surface molecular docking to rule out interference with the active site","in silico sigma-70 promoter prediction then promoter-trap GFP validation","CFU-based MIC rather than OD600, with an OD600-to-CFU standard curve","mass-normalised catalytic capacity metric (Q) when molar data is unavailable","variance-homogeneity diagnostics driving the choice of post-hoc test","multiple-comparison correction","publishing a negative/contradictory cycle result and diagnosing it"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education ran under a framework they called LITTLE GEM (Gauge, Engage, Modify), reaching ages 3 to 101 across one kindergarten (Pods Kindergarten, Wan Chai), two primary schools (SSCPS and Shap Pat Heung Rural Committee Kung Yik She Primary School), a senior centre run by Suicide Prevention Services, their own school, and partner high school teams. Formats were built per audience rather than recycled: a DNA rainbow coin-toss game booth at a public carnival that engaged over 170 participants in three hours; a 'Find a Match' food-waste card game and DNA clay-modelling for 3-6 year olds; strawberry and banana DNA extraction for primary students; a Kahoot quiz; a live beta test of the FoodSafe app; and an original comic book, 'The Tragedy of Margaret in Food Waste', which they also staged as a drama skit with Margaret the frog as the lead. For the elderly they ran a physical food-waste card-matching game and clay craft. Internally, the HKSSC iGEM Club ran 8 after-school workshops over 7 months for ages 11-16 (4 lab, 3 IHP, 1 software) covering DNA, pipetting and serial dilution with P200 and P10 micropipettes across 28 participants, gel electrophoresis, and DNA keychain making, with Wayground quizzes for review - a deliberate pipeline for future team members. They measured learning rather than attendance: at SSCPS, 0% of 20 students knew what iGEM was and 10% knew synthetic biology before the workshop, versus 100% able to state iGEM's core goal and define synthetic biology afterwards, with 100% successfully extracting visible DNA; at KYS the post-presentation Kahoot returned 90% (18/20) accuracy. They also moved from one-off baseline surveys to paired pre/post questionnaires after realising the carnival survey only measured perception, not learning gain.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育工作在他們自稱 LITTLE GEM（Gauge、Engage、Modify）的架構下進行，觸及 3 歲到 101 歲的對象，場域包括一所幼稚園（灣仔 Pods Kindergarten）、兩所小學（SSCPS 與十八鄉鄉事委員會公益社小學）、一間由生命熱線（Suicide Prevention Services）經營的長者中心、自己的學校，以及合作的高中隊伍。活動形式是依對象設計、而非重複套用：在一場公眾嘉年華設置 DNA 彩虹擲幣遊戲攤位，3 小時內吸引超過 170 人參與；為 3 至 6 歲孩童設計「Find a Match」廚餘配對卡牌遊戲與 DNA 黏土模型；帶小學生做草莓與香蕉的 DNA 萃取；一場 Kahoot 問答；FoodSafe 應用程式的現場 beta 測試；以及一本原創漫畫《The Tragedy of Margaret in Food Waste》，他們還把它改編成由青蛙 Margaret 擔任主角的短劇。對長者則安排實體的廚餘配對卡牌遊戲與黏土手作。團隊內部，HKSSC iGEM Club 在 7 個月間為 11 至 16 歲學員辦了 8 場課後工作坊（4 場濕實驗、3 場 IHP、1 場軟體），共 28 位參與者，內容涵蓋 DNA、以 P200 與 P10 微量移液器進行吸量與連續稀釋、膠體電泳，以及 DNA 鑰匙圈製作，並用 Wayground 測驗複習——這是為未來隊員刻意鋪設的人才管道。他們量測的是學習成效、不是人數：在 SSCPS，工作坊前 20 位學生中有 0% 知道 iGEM 是什麼、10% 知道合成生物學，工作坊後 100% 能說出 iGEM 的核心目標並定義合成生物學，且 100% 成功萃取出可見的 DNA；在公益社小學，演講後的 Kahoot 正確率為 90%（18/20）。他們也在察覺嘉年華問卷只量到觀感、而非學習增益之後，從一次性的基線調查改為前後配對問卷。","ihp":"IHP ran on a six-step cycle of their own design, the iCycle (Identify, Initiate, Interact, Insight, Improve, and a sixth step, Inspire), with the deliberate twist that Improve feeds back into Interact so broad stakeholders can be revisited. Stakeholders were sorted into four functions - Information, Implementation, Safety & Technical, and iGEMer feedback - and they covered the whole disposal-to-treatment pipeline: public and restaurants (disposal), EPD (collection), O-PARK (treatment). The design changes are specific. CityU Professor Patrick Lee told them flatly that engineered microbes cannot legally be placed in collection bins in Hong Kong and must be used in a controlled environment with a kill switch, which reshaped their entire safety and implementation framing; he also said demonstrating paraben loss is stronger evidence than showing translation and told them to use both HPLC and the pNPA assay alongside Monod kinetics - which is exactly what the results page then does. HKU advised them they were over-engineering enzyme optimisation, that expressing the protein was enough to demonstrate the concept, that they should focus on the bacteria rather than the enzyme, and that instead of immediately adding a kill switch they should compare growth rates of wild-type versus transgenic E. coli and determine MIC by growing bacteria across paraben concentrations - which became the project's central experimental design. The Environmental Protection Department replied by institutional email with real operating data: food waste pH is 4-6 and varies with contents, impurities are removed and the waste slurried with process water, and the slurry stabilises in a buffer tank for 2-3 days before digestion. HKSSC acted on both constraints, testing their microbes under different pH conditions (which is also why pH stability became the target of the HotSpot Wizard work) and adding bin-contamination messaging to their education workshops. The HKUST Black Soldier Fly Bin team confirmed preservatives are a real but under-documented problem, endorsed pre-treatment in the bin before food reaches O-PARK, and pointed out HKSSC had not considered how to feed their E. coli - advising a layer of food replaced weekly. The KYS student survey revealed a misconception that catering, not households, produces most food waste, and that students knew about the problem but not the solutions, so the team added Smart Food Waste Bin content to the comic and to later activities. The elderly survey showed forgetting purchased food was a key driver of waste, which generated a planned 'food record' fridge-inventory reminder feature for the FoodSafe app.","ihp_zh":"IHP 以他們自行設計的六步循環 iCycle（Identify、Initiate、Interact、Insight、Improve，以及第六步 Inspire）運作，刻意安排的巧思是讓 Improve 回饋到 Interact，使廣泛的利害關係人可以再次接觸。利害關係人依功能分為四類——資訊、實作、安全與技術、iGEMer 回饋——並覆蓋了從丟棄到處理的整條鏈：公眾與餐廳（丟棄）、環保署（收運）、O-PARK（處理）。設計上的改動相當具體。香港城市大學的 Patrick Lee 教授直言，在香港不可能合法把工程菌放進收集桶，必須在受控環境中使用並配備致死開關，這重塑了他們整個安全與落地的論述框架；他也指出證明 paraben 被分解比展示蛋白質被轉譯更有力，並要他們同時使用 HPLC 與 pNPA 試驗、再搭配 Monod 動力學——結果頁做的正是這些。香港大學方面則提醒他們在酵素最佳化上過度工程化，能把蛋白質表現出來就足以證明概念，重點應放在細菌而非酵素，而且不要急著加致死開關，應先比較野生型與轉殖 E. coli 的生長速率，並在一系列 paraben 濃度下培養細菌來測定 MIC——這後來成為整個專題的核心實驗設計。環境保護署以機構電子郵件回覆了真實的運轉資料：廚餘 pH 為 4-6 並隨成分變動，雜質會先去除、廚餘再與製程水打成漿液，漿液在緩衝槽中穩定 2-3 天後才進入消化。HKSSC 針對這兩項限制都採取了行動，在不同 pH 條件下測試他們的菌（這也是 pH 穩定性成為 HotSpot Wizard 工作目標的原因），並在教育工作坊中加入廚餘桶污染的宣導內容。香港科技大學的黑水虻廚餘桶團隊確認防腐劑確實是個真問題但文獻記載不足，支持在食物進入 O-PARK 之前就在桶內做前處理，也指出 HKSSC 沒有考慮要怎麼餵養他們的 E. coli——建議鋪一層食物並每週更換。公益社小學的學生問卷揭露了一個迷思，以為大部分廚餘來自餐飲業而非家戶，也顯示學生知道問題存在但不知道解法，因此團隊在漫畫與後續活動中加入了智慧廚餘桶的內容。長者問卷顯示忘記自己買過的食物是浪費的主要成因之一，由此催生了 FoodSafe 應用程式規劃中的「食物記錄」冰箱庫存提醒功能。","realWorld":"The intended deployment is a pre-treatment step dropped into infrastructure that already exists - the EPD's smart food-waste bins in public rental housing estates and the front end of O-PARK's anaerobic digestion line - rather than a new facility, and the team repeatedly checks the design against real operating constraints (pH 4-6, impurities, 2-3 day buffer-tank residence, and the legal bar on releasing GMOs into public bins). They frame the contribution as a reusable framework rather than a single product: parabens are one preservative class, and the enzymatic pre-treatment approach is pitched as adaptable to other persistent inhibitors and micropollutants. Impact is mapped to SDG 4 (target 4.7), SDG 7 (target 7.2, higher biomethane yield from more complete digestion), SDG 11, SDG 12 (targets 12.4 and 12.5) and SDG 13. There is no formal business model, revenue forecast or regulatory filing plan on the wiki, and FoodSafe deliberately stops short of public App Store release on cost and effort grounds - both stated plainly rather than overclaimed.","realWorld_zh":"預期的落地方式是把一個前處理步驟放進既有的基礎設施——環保署在公共屋邨設置的智慧廚餘桶，以及 O-PARK 厭氧消化線的前端——而不是另建新設施，團隊也反覆用真實運轉限制（pH 4-6、雜質、緩衝槽 2-3 天的停留時間，以及不得將基改生物釋放到公共收集桶的法規門檻）檢驗設計。他們把貢獻定位為可重複使用的框架、而非單一產品：paraben 只是防腐劑的一類，酵素前處理的做法被定位為可延伸到其他難分解的抑制物與微量污染物。影響力對應到 SDG 4（細項 4.7）、SDG 7（細項 7.2，更完整的消化帶來更高的生物甲烷產率）、SDG 11、SDG 12（細項 12.4 與 12.5）與 SDG 13。wiki 上沒有正式的商業模式、營收預估或法規申請計畫，FoodSafe 也因成本與人力考量而刻意不公開上架 App Store——兩者都直白說明，沒有誇大。","partners":["Hong Kong Environmental Protection Department (EPD), Organic Waste Infrastructure group","O-PARK (Organic Resources Recovery Centre)","Professor Patrick Lee, City University of Hong Kong","The University of Hong Kong (enzyme characterisation and biosafety consultation)","HKUST Black Soldier Fly Bin team","Yataki Japanese Restaurant","Suicide Prevention Services (carnival booth and Elderly Community Centre)","Pods Kindergarten","St. Stephen's College Preparatory School (SSCPS)","Shap Pat Heung Rural Committee Kung Yik She Primary School (KYS)","HongKong-PuiChing iGEM team","Asia-Pacific iGEMer Community (APiC) and Greater Bay Area SynBio Alliance (iGBA)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6053/wiki/modelling/image1.avif","caption":"The prbA paraben esterase structure retrieved from AlphaFold and visualised in UCSF Chimera; the long flexible N-terminal tail matches the 31-residue signal peptide and justified switching to pelB periplasmic targeting.","caption_zh":"取自 AlphaFold、並以 UCSF Chimera 視覺化的 prbA 對羥基苯甲酸酯酯酶結構；長而柔軟的 N 端尾巴與 31 個殘基的訊號肽相符，成為改用 pelB 周質導向的依據。","credit":"Team HKSSC, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6053/wiki/results/image20.avif","caption":"Initial velocity versus pNPA substrate concentration for all four enzyme conditions, fitted to Michaelis-Menten kinetics - the data behind the mass-normalised catalytic capacity metric Q showing recombinant prbA outperforming commercial liver esterase 2.09-fold at equal mass.","caption_zh":"四種酵素條件下初始速度對 pNPA 受質濃度的關係，並以 Michaelis-Menten 動力學擬合——這是支撐質量標準化催化容量指標 Q 的數據，顯示在相同質量下重組 prbA 的表現優於市售肝酯酶 2.09 倍。","credit":"Team HKSSC, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6053/wiki/software/image14.avif","caption":"FoodSafe's AI-assisted food safety checker: a photographed apple rated 'Totally Fine' by DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash's vision model, with the supporting observations shown so users can inspect the reasoning rather than just the verdict.","caption_zh":"FoodSafe 的 AI 輔助食品安全檢查器：一顆拍照上傳的蘋果被 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 的視覺模型評為「Totally Fine」，並列出支撐的觀察依據，讓使用者能檢視判斷理由、而不只看到結論。","credit":"Team HKSSC, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6053/wiki/software/image10.avif","caption":"Microbe Wars campaign gameplay - a browser-based 2D arena game written in Python by the team, in which players fight paraben enemies as prbA.","caption_zh":"Microbe Wars 的戰役模式畫面——一款由隊員以 Python 寫成的瀏覽器 2D 競技場遊戲，玩家化身 prbA 對抗 paraben 敵人。","credit":"Team HKSSC, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"The copyable thing here is statistical honesty as a competitive advantage: HKSSC could not measure molar enzyme concentration, so instead of quietly reporting an invalid kcat/Km they invented and justified a mass-normalised metric (Q) valid only below Km, then ran a two-way ANOVA, discovered unequal variances with a median-based Brown-Forsythe test, and switched to Welch-Satterthwaite contrasts with Holm correction rather than ignoring the violation. Pair that with their habit of publishing the cycle that went backwards (Cycle 2's MIC was worse than Cycle 1's) and diagnosing why - a high-school-plus centre will gain more credibility from that than from any extra experiment.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"此處最值得借鏡的是把統計上的誠實變成競爭優勢：HKSSC 無法量測酵素的莫耳濃度，於是他們沒有默默報出一個不成立的 kcat/Km，而是自行定義並論證一個以質量標準化的指標（Q），並明確限定只在低於 Km 的區間成立；接著跑雙因子 ANOVA，用基於中位數的 Brown-Forsythe 檢定發現變異數不齊一，便改用經 Holm 校正的 Welch-Satterthwaite 對比，而不是忽略這項違反。再加上他們習慣把走回頭路的循環也公開（Cycle 2 的 MIC 比 Cycle 1 更差）並診斷原因——對一個高中以上層級的中心而言，這比多做一個實驗更能贏得可信度。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/hkssc/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hkssc/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/hkssc/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/hkssc/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/hkssc/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/hkssc/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/hkssc/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/hkssc/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/hkssc/contribution","https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6053/wiki/modelling/wiki-modelling-final.pdf","https://github.com/judeliucodex/Foodsave","https://igem-game.vercel.app","https://api.igem.org/v1/teams/6053"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳新基礎元件 — 得主（高中組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（農業 / 食品與營養 / 時尚與美妝 / 藝術與設計）"],"rank":110},"6054":{"team":"SJTU-BioX-Shanghai","id":"6054","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/sjtu-biox-shanghai/","projectTitle":"Dual-Armor","projectTitle_zh":"Dual-Armor（雙重護甲）","tagline":"An engineered living dressing that breaks open wound biofilm, clears pathogens and supports tissue repair in chronic wounds","tagline_zh":"一種工程化活體敷料，能破壞傷口生物膜、清除病原菌，並支持慢性傷口的組織修復","summary":"SJTU-BioX-Shanghai built Dual-Armor, an engineered-microbe dressing for chronic wounds, targeting the biofilm that a meta-analysis of 2,666 chronic wounds found in 68% of cases; about 18.6 million people develop diabetic foot ulcers each year and roughly 65% recur within five years. The team's inclusivity work is the most systematically theorised of the 2026 cohort: they built a two-layer framework in which four dimensions (VOICE, OPPORTUNITY, ACCESSIBILITY, PARTICIPATION) locate where participation is blocked and a five-step pathway, HEALS (Hear, Examine, Act, Learn, Share), governs how each barrier is answered. Twelve activities are each written up against both layers, and patient input visibly changed the product: Dual-Armor was repositioned from a stand-alone treatment to an auxiliary post-debridement dressing, and patients' fear of live bacteria touching the wound drove the physical-containment hardware design.","summary_zh":"SJTU-BioX-Shanghai 做出 Dual-Armor，一款用於慢性傷口的工程菌敷料，針對的是生物膜——一項涵蓋 2,666 例慢性傷口的統合分析發現其中 68% 有生物膜；每年約有 1,860 萬人罹患糖尿病足潰瘍，約 65% 在五年內復發。該隊的包容性工作是 2026 年各隊中理論化最系統的：他們建立了一個雙層架構，以四個面向（VOICE、OPPORTUNITY、ACCESSIBILITY、PARTICIPATION）定位參與在哪裡受阻，並以五步路徑 HEALS（Hear、Examine、Act、Learn、Share）規範每一道障礙如何被回應。十二項活動都分別對照兩個層次寫成紀錄，病人的意見也明顯改變了產品：Dual-Armor 從獨立療法重新定位為清創後的輔助敷料，而病人對活菌接觸傷口的恐懼促成了實體圍阻硬體的設計。","awards":["Inclusivity Award — Nominee (Undergrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Self-built two-layer inclusivity framework: four dimensions named by the question each asks - VOICE (Can I be heard?), OPPORTUNITY (Can I get in?), ACCESSIBILITY (Can I engage in a way that works for me?), PARTICIPATION (Can I stay and contribute?) - plus HEALS (Hear, Examine, Act, Learn, Share) as the common action pathway every activity follows. Education was mapped onto three learner pathways (students: Understand to Learn to Create; public: Encounter to Understand; peer educators: Share to Adapt to Continue) and grounded in Constructionism and UDL 3.0, applied retrospectively as a mirror rather than imposed in advance. Photovoice was used with a proper citation to Wang and Burris (1997).","frameworks_zh":"自建的雙層包容性架構：四個面向各以它所提出的問題命名——VOICE（我能被聽見嗎？）、OPPORTUNITY（我能進得來嗎？）、ACCESSIBILITY（我能以適合自己的方式參與嗎？）、PARTICIPATION（我能留下來並有所貢獻嗎？）——再加上 HEALS（Hear、Examine、Act、Learn、Share），作為每一項活動共同遵循的行動路徑。教育工作對應到三條學習者路徑（學生：理解—學習—創造；大眾：接觸—理解；同儕教育者：分享—調整—延續），並以建構論與 UDL 3.0 為基礎，但是回溯性地當成一面檢視的鏡子，而非事前強加的框架。Photovoice 的使用也正確引用了 Wang 與 Burris（1997）。","dataviz":"Co-designed care journey maps with colour-coded burden stickers marking pain, inconvenience, cost and psychological pressure; a handbook development flow figure; the four-dimension and HEALS framework figures; stakeholder overview of included groups.","dataviz_zh":"共同設計的照護歷程圖，以顏色標示的負擔貼紙標記疼痛、不便、費用與心理壓力；手冊開發流程圖；四面向與 HEALS 架構圖；納入族群的利害關係人總覽。","datascience":"Paired pre/post questionnaires across activities: six patient questionnaires and six in-depth inpatient interviews with published anonymised results (66.7% had three or more episodes of infection, worsening or recurrence in the previous year; 83.3% described the wound's impact on daily life as large or very large); the Beneath the Wound role-play playtest collected five anonymous questionnaires at a 100% response rate, with mean self-rated understanding of five core concepts rising from 1.8 to 3.52/5, understanding of MRSA from 1.2 to 3.4/5 (the largest gain), inclusivity-experience mean 4.03/5, and 'every role carried real weight' and 'the host favored no position' both 4.4/5; pre/post testing at the Life Science x AI summer camp. The team repeatedly states sample limits rather than overclaiming.","datascience_zh":"各項活動都採配對的前後測問卷：六份病人問卷與六場住院病人深度訪談，並公開去識別化結果（66.7% 在過去一年內有三次以上的感染、惡化或復發；83.3% 形容傷口對日常生活的影響為大或非常大）；「Beneath the Wound」角色扮演試玩收回五份匿名問卷，回收率 100%，五項核心概念的自評理解度平均從 1.8 升到 3.52/5，對 MRSA 的理解從 1.2 升到 3.4/5（增幅最大），包容性體驗平均 4.03/5，「每個角色都有實際份量」與「主持人不偏袒任何立場」都是 4.4/5；Life Science x AI 夏令營也做了前後測。該隊一再說明樣本的限制，而不是過度宣稱。","software":"Two open-source tools, both built from a named barrier. LabSafeMom gives pregnant, pregnancy-planning or breastfeeding researchers per-protocol risk guidance: submit a protocol and get a structured risk overview, safety controls and a PPE checklist against a knowledge base of 119 hazard entries built from public occupational-health references including NIOSH. Critically it has two separated modes - Basic runs entirely in the browser against a local deterministic rule set with no generative model, so the same input always yields the same reasoning and every score is traceable to a stated rule and reference; Enhanced adds natural-language protocol analysis only when the user supplies their own API key, and risk scores still come from auditable rules. Every report states it is an aid for discussion with an institutional EHS office and a qualified clinician, never a substitute. LabMate reduces bench friction for new researchers: it ingests protocols as PDF, TXT, Markdown, CSV or pasted text in Chinese or English, generates a preparation checklist, guides steps with smart timers, keeps an exportable lab record (Markdown, text or print), offers a Chinese-English toggle, four themes (Light, Lab, Dark, Sunset) and large-font options, and runs locally and offline with privacy-first handling.","software_zh":"兩項開源工具，都是從一項被指名的障礙出發做出來的。LabSafeMom 為懷孕、準備懷孕或哺乳中的研究人員提供逐一實驗流程的風險指引：送入一份流程，就得到結構化的風險總覽、安全管制措施與個人防護裝備檢核表，依據的是一個含 119 筆危害條目的知識庫，由 NIOSH 等公開職業衛生資料建立。關鍵在於它有兩個彼此分離的模式——Basic 完全在瀏覽器中依本地的確定性規則集運作，不用生成式模型，因此同樣的輸入永遠得到同樣的推論，每個分數都可追溯到明確的規則與出處；Enhanced 只在使用者自行提供 API key 時才加入自然語言的流程分析，而風險分數仍然來自可稽核的規則。每份報告都註明它是與校內 EHS 單位及合格臨床醫師討論時的輔助，絕不是替代。LabMate 則降低新進研究人員在實驗台上的摩擦：可讀入 PDF、TXT、Markdown、CSV 或直接貼上的中英文流程文字，生成準備檢核表，以智慧計時器引導步驟，保留可匯出的實驗紀錄（Markdown、純文字或列印），提供中英文切換、四種主題（Light、Lab、Dark、Sunset）與大字型選項，並以隱私優先的方式在本地離線運作。","stack":["browser-based deterministic rule engine (LabSafeMom Basic mode)","optional user-supplied-key LLM analysis (Enhanced mode)","offline-first local protocol parser (LabMate)","accessible web front end with dyslexia-font and animation toggles","Photovoice participatory method","paired pre/post survey instruments"],"techniques":["biofilm disruption","pathogen clearance by engineered microbes","naringenin-related mechanisms","physical containment hardware for live-bacteria dressings","post-debridement auxiliary dressing design"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"The framing sentence is the one to steal: 'Open is not enough. A door can stand open while some people never have the chance to reach it.' Under VOICE, the team visited the vascular disease department of Shanghai Hospital of Integrated Traditional Chinese and Western Medicine, collecting six patient questionnaires and six in-depth inpatient interviews plus conversations with attending clinicians and ward care workers, and published the bilingual instrument and the anonymised results as PDFs. Patients' top fears were recurrent infection, healing time, pain and amputation risk; clinicians focused on debridement, exudate management and dressing fit; care workers identified post-discharge dressing changes and disinfection as the weakest link in the care chain. This directly repositioned Dual-Armor as an auxiliary dressing for continuous post-debridement care and drove the physical-containment hardware. A Photovoice study then handed the camera to patients, who chose which objects and scenes represented their treatment - wheelchairs, bedside equipment, nursing supplies - and explained why; for inpatients who could not shoot themselves, the team operated the camera but the subject, the explanation and the consent to display always remained the participant's. The authorised, de-identified photographs with the participants' own accounts became an exhibition at Shanghai Jiao Tong University that drew more than one hundred visits, with faces, wound close-ups, bed numbers and records deliberately excluded. The team's reflection is unusually principled: 'creating an opportunity for expression does not give the researchers ownership of the images', and the quality of an exhibition can never take priority over informed consent. Co-design went further: patients, caregivers and care workers drew the whole chronic-wound care journey with colour-coded stickers for pain, inconvenience, cost and psychological pressure, and caregivers added the hidden labour of accompanying visits and watching for abnormalities. The questions they raised repeatedly ('what do I do when the dressing sticks to the wound?', 'which smell means something is wrong?') became the actual table of contents of a 23-page Home-Care Handbook, which translates professional guidance into red-amber-green warning signals, a six-step dressing-change method and hand-fillable care record tables, deliberately offers an executable alternative after every 'do not do this', and gives separate dressing-change options for urban and primary-care settings. The draft was reviewed by clinicians from burn and reconstructive surgery and from endocrinology, who corrected the iodine and hydrogen peroxide guidance, the timing of diabetic foot care and primary-care dressing substitutes. The handbook is published free in Chinese and English, with printable appendix tables so it works for people without digital devices. The team also wrote Beneath the Wound, a 46-page host-facilitated ethics role-play (plus 10 pages of character cards in five- and six-player sets) in which players take the parts of a 72-year-old diabetic-foot patient, family members, the attending physician and ethics roles, and reach a decision with no standard answer over about two and a half hours; information is deliberately distributed - the physician holds risk data, the ethics member remembers past failures, the family waits for authority, the patient carries fear - so players must persuade each other with incomplete information. The full script and cards are released for other teams. Under OPPORTUNITY, the team ran no-prerequisite synthetic biology lessons at a middle school in Bazhong, Sichuan and a small rural class in Hou'an Village, Taizhou, Zhejiang, chosen precisely because students there rarely meet frontier science, using physical role-play of the central dogma and a 'Building a Cell Factory' design task, requiring no specialised equipment, delivered partly by video lesson in Hou'an, and evaluated with pre- and post-questionnaires; students produced their own posters, plasmid maps and models. These were followed by guided SJTU wet-lab visits to supply the missing middle step between a school lesson and university research, and by sustained mentoring of VGA-Pinion, a first-time US high-school team, from emails and online meetings through to an in-person Shanghai lab visit, with advice on project narrative, model-parameter grounding and Human Practices structure, always framed as ideas rather than decisions made for them. Under ACCESSIBILITY, 'Touch Life, See Hope' was a braille chronic-wound postcard co-creation at SJTU in which participants from several majors learned the braille alphabet, writing board and stylus, then discovered that accessibility is redesign rather than transcription - a tactile reader cannot skim, so messages had to be shortened, care advice separated from decorative text, and card layout built around how a finger moves; the cards carry Dual-Armor characters so sighted and non-sighted readers recognise them, and an 11-page English Braille Postcard Co-Creation Toolkit was released so others can run the session. 'Light Deep in the Lilong' is a sixteen-page bilingual illustrated story about Grandma Li, a 76-year-old retired Chinese-language teacher with an unhealed diabetic foot wound, written for the readers conventional material ignores - above all children in the patient's family - with wound microbes as characters mapped one-to-one onto Dual-Armor's functional modules; a bilingual audio edition is in preparation so reading need not depend on sight, and the story was read live to students in Bazhong. The wiki itself is an accessibility artefact, prompted by a senior student with ADHD who reported reading difficulty on many websites: it uses the Okabe-Ito colourblind-safe palette (#E69F00, #56B4E9, #F0E442, #D55E00, #0072B2), a one-click dyslexia-friendly font toggle, a one-click animation kill switch and a reading progress bar. Under PARTICIPATION the team turned inward to people already in science, building LabSafeMom for pregnant researchers and LabMate for new bench members. Education also produced a Base-Pairing Challenge card game, a diabetes scripted game, 'Dual-Armor Werewolf' (a social-deduction game where E. coli, S. epidermidis, immune cells and S. aureus are the roles and naringenin mechanisms are built into role relationships), a picture book and audiobook, clay cell-model making, a bioethics debate with no preset answer, and a six-step student design task (Problem, Chassis, Function, Safety, Teamwork, Presentation). Finally, the team co-authored a cross-team Education Activity Handbook with other university iGEM teams, taking responsibility for Part 7 on spatialised education and exhibitions with their Urban Orienteering chapter, explicitly so that future iGEMers do not start from scratch.","publicEngagement_zh":"值得借用的是那句定調的話：「開放還不夠。門可以一直開著，但有些人始終沒有機會走到門前。」在 VOICE 面向，該隊走訪上海市中西醫結合醫院的周圍血管科，收集六份病人問卷與六場住院病人深度訪談，並與主治醫師及病房照護員對談，再把雙語問卷工具與去識別化結果以 PDF 公開。病人最害怕的是感染復發、癒合時間、疼痛與截肢風險；臨床醫師關注清創、滲液管理與敷料貼合度；照護員指出出院後的換藥與消毒是整條照護鏈最弱的一環。這直接把 Dual-Armor 重新定位為清創後持續照護用的輔助敷料，也推動了實體圍阻硬體。接著的 Photovoice 研究把相機交給病人，由他們自己選擇哪些物件與場景代表自己的治療——輪椅、床邊設備、護理用品——並說明原因；對無法自己拍攝的住院病人，由團隊代為操作相機，但拍攝對象、說明內容與展示的同意權始終屬於參與者。這些經授權、去識別化的照片連同參與者自己的敘述，成為上海交通大學的一場展覽，參觀超過一百人次，並刻意排除臉部、傷口特寫、床號與病歷。該隊的反思格外有原則：「創造一個表達的機會，並不等於研究者取得了影像的所有權」，展覽的品質也絕不能優先於知情同意。共同設計走得更遠：病人、家屬照顧者與照護員一起畫出完整的慢性傷口照護歷程，用不同顏色的貼紙標記疼痛、不便、費用與心理壓力，照顧者還補上了陪同就醫與留意異常這些看不見的勞動。他們反覆提出的問題（「敷料黏在傷口上的時候該怎麼辦？」、「哪一種氣味代表出了問題？」）直接成為一本 23 頁《居家照護手冊》的實際目錄。手冊把專業指引轉譯成紅—黃—綠三級警示訊號、六步換藥法與可手寫填寫的照護紀錄表，刻意在每一句「不要這樣做」之後都給出一個可執行的替代做法，並針對都市與基層醫療場域分別提供換藥選項。草稿由燒傷整形外科與新陳代謝科的臨床醫師審閱，他們修正了碘與過氧化氫的使用指引、糖尿病足照護的時機，以及基層可用的敷料替代品。手冊以中英文免費公開，並附可列印的附錄表格，讓沒有數位裝置的人也用得上。該隊還寫了《Beneath the Wound》，一份 46 頁、由主持人帶領的倫理角色扮演腳本（另有 10 頁角色卡，分五人與六人兩種配置），玩家分別扮演一位 72 歲的糖尿病足病人、家屬、主治醫師與倫理相關角色，在約兩個半小時內做出一個沒有標準答案的決定；資訊被刻意分散配置——醫師掌握風險數據、倫理成員記得過去的失敗、家屬等待權威表態、病人承受恐懼——因此玩家必須在資訊不完整的情況下彼此說服。完整腳本與角色卡已釋出給其他隊伍。在 OPPORTUNITY 面向，該隊在四川巴中的一所國中與浙江台州后安村的一個小型鄉村班級開設零先修要求的合成生物學課程，選這兩個地點正是因為當地學生少有機會接觸前沿科學；課程用肢體角色扮演演示中心法則，加上一項「打造細胞工廠」的設計任務，完全不需要專門器材，在后安村有一部分以影片授課，並以前後測問卷評估；學生自己做出海報、質體圖譜與模型。之後再安排到上海交大的導覽式濕實驗室參訪，補上學校課程與大學研究之間缺掉的中間一環；另外也長期輔導首次參賽的美國高中隊伍 VGA-Pinion，從電子郵件、線上會議一路到實地到上海參訪實驗室，在專案敘事、模型參數依據與 Human Practices 架構上提供建議，而且一貫定位為提供想法，不是替他們做決定。在 ACCESSIBILITY 面向，「Touch Life, See Hope」是在上海交大舉辦的點字慢性傷口明信片共創活動，來自多個系所的參與者先學點字字母、點字板與點字筆，接著就發現無障礙是重新設計而不是逐字轉譯——觸覺讀者無法快速瀏覽，所以訊息必須縮短、照護建議必須與裝飾性文字分開，卡片版面也要照手指移動的方式重新安排；卡片上放了 Dual-Armor 的角色，讓視覺與非視覺讀者都認得出來，並釋出一份 11 頁的英文點字明信片共創工具包，讓別人也能照著辦。「Light Deep in the Lilong」是一則 16 頁的雙語繪本故事，主角是李奶奶，一位 76 歲、退休的國文老師，有一處遲遲未癒的糖尿病足傷口；故事寫給傳統素材忽略的讀者，尤其是病人家裡的孩子，傷口微生物被寫成角色，並與 Dual-Armor 的功能模組一一對應；雙語有聲版正在製作，讓閱讀不必依賴視覺，故事也在巴中現場朗讀給學生聽。wiki 本身就是一件無障礙產出，起因是一位患有 ADHD 的高年級學生反映許多網站讀起來很吃力：網站採用 Okabe-Ito 色盲友善配色（#E69F00、#56B4E9、#F0E442、#D55E00、#0072B2）、一鍵切換的讀寫障礙友善字型、一鍵關閉動畫，以及閱讀進度條。在 PARTICIPATION 面向，該隊轉向已經身在科學領域裡的人，為懷孕的研究人員做 LabSafeMom，為新進實驗室成員做 LabMate。教育方面也產出了鹼基配對挑戰卡牌遊戲、糖尿病劇本遊戲、「Dual-Armor 狼人殺」（一款社交推理遊戲，角色就是 E. coli、S. epidermidis、免疫細胞與 S. aureus，柚皮素的作用機制則寫進了角色關係裡）、一本繪本與有聲書、黏土細胞模型製作、一場沒有預設答案的生物倫理辯論，以及一項六步驟的學生設計任務（問題、載體、功能、安全、團隊合作、簡報）。最後，該隊與其他大學 iGEM 隊伍合著了一本跨隊《教育活動手冊》，負責第 7 章空間化教育與展覽的部分，貢獻「城市定向」一章，明確就是為了讓未來的 iGEMer 不必從零開始。","ihp":"The project began with a team member's own fall injury and the experience of caring for the wound. Patient and caregiver evidence was treated as design input rather than validation: ward findings are documented on the Integrated Human Practices page and traced through to three specific changes (product repositioning to post-debridement auxiliary dressing, physical containment of live bacteria, and the decision to co-write a care handbook with clinical staff). The team draws an explicit principle: patients may not decide gene circuits or material parameters, but they decide what the technology must respond to, and lack of specialist knowledge is never a reason to exclude them from design. Limits are stated rather than hidden - six patients cannot represent everyone, and acceptance expressed in a hypothetical interview must still be verified in real use.","ihp_zh":"專案的起點是一位隊員自己跌倒受傷、並照護那處傷口的經驗。病人與照顧者的證據被當成設計輸入，而不是事後驗證：病房訪查的發現記錄在 Integrated Human Practices 頁面，並一路追溯到三項具體改變（產品重新定位為清創後輔助敷料、活菌的實體圍阻，以及決定與臨床人員共同撰寫照護手冊）。該隊明確提出一項原則：病人也許不決定基因迴路或材料參數，但他們決定這項技術必須回應什麼，而缺乏專業知識永遠不能成為把他們排除在設計之外的理由。限制是寫明的而非藏起來的——六位病人無法代表所有人，在假設性訪談中表達的接受度，仍然必須在真實使用中驗證。","realWorld":"Open, reusable outputs: the 23-page Home-Care Handbook in Chinese and English with printable records; the Beneath the Wound full script, host guide and character cards; the Braille Postcard Co-Creation Toolkit; the bilingual illustrated story and forthcoming audio edition; LabSafeMom and LabMate as live apps with open source; teaching decks for the central dogma, cell factory, bioethics debate and engineered-microorganism design; game cards; and the co-authored cross-team Education Activity Handbook. A beginner's guide for new iGEM teams covering schedule planning, stage tasks and common questions is planned for open release on the wiki.","realWorld_zh":"開放、可重複使用的產出：23 頁中英文《居家照護手冊》，附可列印的紀錄表；《Beneath the Wound》的完整腳本、主持人指南與角色卡；點字明信片共創工具包；雙語繪本故事與即將推出的有聲版；LabSafeMom 與 LabMate 都是可直接使用的應用程式並且開源；中心法則、細胞工廠、生物倫理辯論與工程微生物設計的教學簡報；遊戲卡牌；以及合著的跨隊《教育活動手冊》。另有一份給 iGEM 新隊伍的入門指南，涵蓋時程規劃、各階段任務與常見問題，計畫在 wiki 上公開釋出。","partners":["Shanghai Hospital of Integrated Traditional Chinese and Western Medicine - vascular disease department (patients, clinicians, ward care workers)","clinicians in burn and reconstructive surgery and endocrinology (handbook review)","Bazhong Middle School, Sichuan","Hou'an Village rural class, Taizhou, Zhejiang","Shanghai Jiao Tong University (exhibition venue, wet lab visits, braille co-creation)","VGA-Pinion (first-time US high-school iGEM team, project AstraEV)","ECNU iGEM","iGEM East China Regional Exchange teams","co-authors of the cross-team Education Activity Handbook","East China Five Universities Science & Art Micro-painting Competition"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6054/wiki/images/inclusivity/braille-1.avif","caption":"'Touch Life, See Hope': writing chronic-wound knowledge onto braille postcards, with an open English toolkit released so others can run it","caption_zh":"「Touch Life, See Hope」：把慢性傷口知識寫上點字明信片，並釋出開放的英文工具包讓別人也能照著辦","credit":"Team SJTU-BioX-Shanghai, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6054/wiki/images/inclusivity/act2-exhibition-1.avif","caption":"The de-identified Photovoice exhibition at Shanghai Jiao Tong University, visited by more than one hundred people","caption_zh":"上海交通大學的去識別化 Photovoice 展覽，參觀人次超過一百","credit":"Team SJTU-BioX-Shanghai, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6054/wiki/images/inclusivity/act3-journey-map.avif","caption":"Co-drawn chronic-wound care journey maps with colour-coded burden stickers, which became the handbook's table of contents","caption_zh":"共同繪製的慢性傷口照護歷程圖，附顏色標示的負擔貼紙，後來成為手冊的目錄","credit":"Team SJTU-BioX-Shanghai, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6054/wiki/images/inclusivity/act4-playtest.avif","caption":"First playtest of 'Beneath the Wound', a two-and-a-half-hour ethics role-play about an experimental living therapy","caption_zh":"「Beneath the Wound」首次試玩，一場關於實驗性活體療法、長達兩個半小時的倫理角色扮演","credit":"Team SJTU-BioX-Shanghai, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6054/wiki/images/inclusivity/labsafemom-ui-1.avif","caption":"LabSafeMom: auditable per-protocol hazard guidance for pregnant researchers, with a deterministic browser-only default mode","caption_zh":"LabSafeMom：為懷孕研究人員提供可稽核的逐流程危害指引，預設模式是確定性、只在瀏覽器執行","credit":"Team SJTU-BioX-Shanghai, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6054/wiki/images/inclusivity/bazhong-1.avif","caption":"No-prerequisite synthetic biology lessons at a middle school in Bazhong, Sichuan, using role-play instead of equipment","caption_zh":"四川巴中一所國中的零先修合成生物學課程，以角色扮演取代器材","credit":"Team SJTU-BioX-Shanghai, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Adopt SJTU's two-layer discipline: classify every engagement by which barrier it removes (can I be heard, get in, engage in my format, stay and contribute) and run each one through Hear-Examine-Act-Learn-Share, ending every activity with a downloadable artefact someone else can run - a toolkit, a script, a handbook - and a written statement of what the evidence does not prove.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"值得借用 SJTU 的雙層紀律：把每一項參與活動依它所排除的障礙分類（我能被聽見嗎、我能進得來嗎、我能用適合自己的形式參與嗎、我能留下來並有所貢獻嗎），並讓每一項都走完 Hear-Examine-Act-Learn-Share，每項活動都以一份別人可以直接拿去執行的可下載產出作結——工具包、腳本、手冊——再加上一段明白寫出證據尚未能證明什麼的說明。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/sjtu-biox-shanghai/","https://2026.igem.wiki/sjtu-biox-shanghai/inclusivity","https://2026.igem.wiki/sjtu-biox-shanghai/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/sjtu-biox-shanghai/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/sjtu-biox-shanghai/description"],"awards_zh":["包容性獎 — 入圍（大學組）"],"rank":7},"6058":{"team":"HK-Joint-School","id":"6058","section":"High School","country":"Hong Kong","village":"Manufacturing / Environment","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hk-joint-school/","projectTitle":"FlaminGone","projectTitle_zh":"FlaminGone","tagline":"A non-toxic biological fire-retardant coating, plus PyroForge, a live protein-language-model web app that predicts thermostability from sequence alone.","tagline_zh":"無毒的生物性防火塗層，外加 PyroForge：一個已上線的蛋白質語言模型網頁應用，僅憑序列就能預測熱穩定性。","summary":"FlaminGone replaces halogenated chemical fire retardants with a self-assembling biological coating: E. coli's CsgA curli subunit forms an amyloid scaffold, fused to hydrophobic BslA for weatherproofing and polyethylene-binding peptides for substrate anchoring, in a two-layer system that sidesteps secretion limits and steric hindrance. Under fire testing the matrix forms a dense char shield that halts flame propagation and self-extinguishes, BslA prevents rain washout across weathering, and Arabidopsis assays indicated no ecotoxicity. To design the fusion peptides without waiting on crystal structures, the team built PyroForge, a publicly deployed web application that uses a frozen ESM-2 650M protein language model as a feature extractor under three lightweight custom-trained heads predicting melting temperature, folding free energy and per-mutation stability change, then scans every single-residue substitution and returns a ranked shortlist. For a high school team the engineering rigour is remarkable: a published S669 benchmark against 21 competing methods, Zenodo-archived weights and datasets with DOIs, 226-respondent user acceptance testing, and documented bugs that changed the model's reported accuracy.","summary_zh":"FlaminGone 以能自組裝的生物塗層取代含鹵素的化學阻燃劑：用 E. coli 的 CsgA curli 次單元形成類澱粉蛋白支架，融合疏水性的 BslA 以提供耐候能力、以及聚乙烯結合胜肽以錨定在基材上，並採用雙層設計繞開分泌量上限與立體障礙的問題。火燒測試中，這個基質會形成緻密的碳化屏障，阻止火焰延燒並自行熄滅；BslA 在耐候測試中可防止被雨水沖掉；Arabidopsis 試驗也顯示沒有生態毒性。為了不必等晶體結構就能設計融合胜肽，團隊做了 PyroForge：一個已公開部署的網頁應用，把凍結參數的 ESM-2 650M 蛋白質語言模型當作特徵擷取器，上面接三個自行訓練的輕量預測頭，分別預測熔解溫度、摺疊自由能與各突變造成的穩定性變化，接著掃描每一個單一殘基取代並回傳排序後的候選清單。以高中隊伍而言，其工程嚴謹度相當突出：公開與 21 種競爭方法對比的 S669 基準測試、在 Zenodo 上以 DOI 典藏的權重與資料集、226 人參與的使用者接受度測試，以及把改變了模型回報準確度的程式錯誤完整記錄下來。","awards":["Best Software — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"React + TypeScript + Vite + Mantine frontend over a FastAPI backend with Pydantic schema validation that rejects malformed inputs at the API boundary with HTTP 400 before they reach the queue. Celery with Redis splits work across three purpose-separated queues: 'fast' for sequence predictions and registry search using the resident ESM-2 (about 1 s), 'heavy' for GPU-bound mutation scanning and model training (minutes), and 'io' for network-bound ESMFold calls with waits up to 300 s, specifically so long network waits never occupy a GPU worker slot. Six Docker containers run on a GPU host via Docker Compose and a systemd unit, with only an Nginx reverse proxy exposed publicly and FastAPI, Redis and the workers isolated on the internal Docker network. Nginx also enforces the rate limiting, because the deployment is intentionally unauthenticated. The backend exposes five engines through a central registry (Prediction, Optimization, Visualization, Registry, Procurement) and rejects checkpoints whose normalization statistics do not match.","frameworks_zh":"前端為 React + TypeScript + Vite + Mantine，後端為 FastAPI，並以 Pydantic 做結構驗證，格式錯誤的輸入在 API 邊界就以 HTTP 400 擋掉，不會進到工作佇列。Celery 搭配 Redis 把工作分到三條依用途區分的佇列：fast 處理使用常駐 ESM-2 的序列預測與 Registry 搜尋（約 1 秒）、heavy 處理吃 GPU 的突變掃描與模型訓練（數分鐘）、io 處理受網路限制、等待最長 300 秒的 ESMFold 呼叫，這樣設計正是為了讓漫長的網路等待不會佔住 GPU 工作者的名額。六個 Docker 容器透過 Docker Compose 與一個 systemd unit 跑在 GPU 主機上，對外只開放 Nginx 反向代理，FastAPI、Redis 與工作者都隔離在內部 Docker 網路。流量限制也由 Nginx 執行，因為這套部署刻意不做身分驗證。後端透過一個中央登錄機制提供五個引擎（Prediction、Optimization、Visualization、Registry、Procurement），並會拒絕正規化統計量不相符的模型檢查點。","dataviz":"Seven workflow-ordered UI cards: sequence input (protein or DNA, with the longest ORF translated), composition descriptors, thermodynamic prediction with a plus/minus 95% confidence interval and a High/Low/Unavailable reliability flag keyed to sequence length relative to the training distribution, the ranked mutation shortlist, a browser 3D structure from ESMFold coloured by per-residue stability from the mutation scan, an iGEM Registry homology search that reports how many parts were searched and the snapshot build date so a zero-hit result stays interpretable, and codon optimisation reporting CAI and GC content with a hand-off to a DNA vendor. Long operations run asynchronously with the client polling every two seconds; fast ones return synchronously. History lives in browser local storage, managed from a sidebar, with large structure files stripped to fit quota, and an error boundary isolates individual card failures so one broken card does not take the page down. Benchmark results are published as figures: the S669 pooled-versus-within-protein comparison, the grouped cross-validation precision distribution, and the held-out scatter for all three heads.","dataviz_zh":"介面依工作流程排成七張卡片：序列輸入（蛋白質或 DNA，DNA 會轉譯最長的 ORF）、組成特徵描述、帶 ±95% 信賴區間的熱力學預測（並依序列長度相對於訓練分布的位置標示 High／Low／Unavailable 可信度）、排序後的突變候選清單、由 ESMFold 產生並在瀏覽器中呈現的 3D 結構（依突變掃描得到的各殘基穩定性上色）、iGEM Registry 同源搜尋（會回報搜尋了多少零件以及快照的建立日期，讓零命中的結果仍然可以解讀），以及回報 CAI 與 GC 含量、可直接轉交 DNA 合成廠商的密碼子最佳化。耗時的操作以非同步執行，前端每兩秒輪詢一次；快的操作則同步回傳。歷史紀錄存在瀏覽器 local storage 並由側邊欄管理，過大的結構檔會被剝除以符合容量限制；錯誤邊界會隔離單張卡片的失敗，讓一張壞掉的卡片不會拖垮整個頁面。基準測試結果以圖表公開：S669 的 pooled 與 within-protein 對比、分組交叉驗證的精確率分布，以及三個預測頭在保留集上的散布圖。","datascience":"ESM-2 650M is frozen and used only to map sequences to 1,280-dimensional vectors, with three light heads on top: a PCA-100 to Ridge plus gradient boosting model for Tm trained on Meltome Atlas (4,000 training proteins, 1,106 held out, 5,106 total), an MLP [128, 1024, 128, 1024] for dG whose architecture came from a Hyperband neural architecture search, and an MLP [256, 256, 256] with dropout 0.324 for ddG trained on the Tsuboyama 2023 mega-scale dataset (494,370 rows across 449 parent proteins). The ddG head takes both the mutant embedding and the mutant-minus-wildtype difference embedding, which removes sequence-invariant features and sharpens within-protein ranking at the acknowledged cost of cross-protein absolute comparison. Internal validation is grouped cross-validation across 266 parent proteins: top-5 precision 73.6% genuinely stabilising against a 19.8% baseline, with per-protein precision reported as varying from 0% to 100% and roughly 20% of proteins scoring below 50%. External benchmarking on S669 (669 variants, 94 proteins, no prior tuning) places PyroForge 18th of 22 methods on pooled ranking but 2nd of 22 on within-protein ranking and 1st among sequence-only methods, with a +0.248 Spearman improvement over zero-shot ESM-2 (95% CI +0.051 to +0.502); the team explains that this split is exactly what their design choice predicts. Limitations are published rather than buried: Ssym shows only a non-statistically-significant trend, ranking quality drops sharply beyond 400 residues, and the Tm Pearson r of 0.810 is said to overstate performance because the distribution is bimodal between thermophiles and mesophiles, with weaker within-group ordering. Trusted regimes are tabulated (scanning and folding to 400 aa, dG and ddG trusted at 10-72 aa, Tm training window 20-400 aa) and out-of-bounds inputs return low-confidence flags rather than failing silently. Four engineering iterations are documented with their numbers: random row splits leaked protein identity and inflated correlation to 0.85, which grouped parent-protein splitting corrected to a realistic 0.46; training on forward mutations only gave inconsistent reverse predictions (r = 0.27), fixed to 0.95 by appending negated reverse mutations; expanding Tm training from 237 proteins to the Meltome Atlas cut held-out error to 5.9 degrees C; and a sign-inversion bug had the optimizer ranking the most destabilising mutations first, fixed and locked down with an end-to-end regression test. Unit tests encode thermodynamic invariants directly: ddG(wt to wt) = 0, ddG(A to B) = -ddG(B to A), batched scan consistency against single-pair prediction, complete parent-protein holdout with no split overlap, a sign floor so top-k never returns predicted-destabilising variants, and CAI normalisation within synonymous codon families.","datascience_zh":"ESM-2 650M 參數凍結，只用來把序列映射成 1,280 維向量，上面接三個輕量預測頭：Tm 使用 PCA-100 接 Ridge 再加梯度提升模型，以 Meltome Atlas 訓練（4,000 個訓練蛋白質、1,106 個保留、合計 5,106 個）；dG 使用 [128, 1024, 128, 1024] 的 MLP，架構來自 Hyperband 神經架構搜尋；ddG 使用 [256, 256, 256]、dropout 0.324 的 MLP，以 Tsuboyama 2023 的大規模資料集訓練（449 個親代蛋白質、共 494,370 列）。ddG 預測頭同時吃突變體的嵌入向量與「突變體減野生型」的差值嵌入向量，這會去掉與序列無關的特徵、強化同一蛋白質內部的排序能力，代價是跨蛋白質的絕對值比較變差，這點他們自己也承認。內部驗證採跨 266 個親代蛋白質的分組交叉驗證：前五名中真正具穩定化效果的精確率為 73.6%，基線為 19.8%；他們也如實回報各蛋白質的精確率從 0% 到 100% 不等，約有 20% 的蛋白質低於 50%。S669 的外部基準測試（669 個變異、94 個蛋白質、事前未做任何調校）中，PyroForge 在 pooled 排序上是 22 種方法中的第 18 名，但在蛋白質內部排序上是 22 種中的第 2 名，且在純序列方法中排名第 1，Spearman 相關比 zero-shot ESM-2 高出 +0.248（95% 信賴區間 +0.051 至 +0.502）；團隊並說明這樣的落差正是他們的設計選擇所預期的結果。限制是公開寫出來而不是藏起來：Ssym 上只呈現未達統計顯著的趨勢；序列超過 400 個殘基後排序品質明顯下降；Tm 的 Pearson r 為 0.810，但他們自己說這高估了實際表現，因為分布在嗜熱菌與嗜溫菌之間呈雙峰，組內的排序能力較弱。可信範圍以表格列出（掃描與摺疊預測到 400 個胺基酸、dG 與 ddG 的可信範圍為 10-72 個胺基酸、Tm 的訓練視窗為 20-400 個胺基酸），超出範圍的輸入會回傳低可信度標記，而不是無聲失敗。四次工程迭代都附上數字：隨機切分資料列會洩漏蛋白質身分、使相關係數虛高到 0.85，改為依親代蛋白質分組切分後修正為較真實的 0.46；只用正向突變訓練會讓反向預測不一致（r = 0.27），補上取負號的反向突變後提升到 0.95；Tm 的訓練資料從 237 個蛋白質擴大到 Meltome Atlas 後，保留集誤差降到 5.9 °C；另外有一個正負號反轉的錯誤，讓最佳化器把最不穩定化的突變排在最前面，修正後並以端對端回歸測試鎖住。單元測試直接把熱力學不變量寫進去：ddG(wt to wt) = 0、ddG(A to B) = -ddG(B to A)、批次掃描結果必須與單一配對預測一致、親代蛋白質完全保留且各切分之間沒有重疊、設下正負號底線讓 top-k 永遠不會回傳預測為不穩定化的變異，以及同義密碼子家族內的 CAI 正規化。","software":"PyroForge is live and needs no installation: https://pyroforge.26650078.xyz/, hosted on the team's own GPU server, with a QR code on the wiki and a three-step try-it path (New, paste the sample protein G B1 domain sequence, Run Prediction, Run Optimization). That makes it one of the few 2026 iGEM software tools a stranger can actually use in a browser. The problem it addresses is concrete: most established thermostability predictors need a solved 3D structure, which blocks work on newly designed or novel sequences with no PDB counterpart, so PyroForge is deliberately sequence-only and uses no structural data during prediction. The workflow is Input, Predict, Optimize, Fold, Order. Browser-only execution was explicitly ruled out with reasons given (ESM-2 650M needs about 2.5 GB of weights, a site-saturation scan is O(L x 20) sequential forward passes, and a 60-residue scan takes about a minute on a GPU using around 5.6 GB VRAM), which is why the architecture committed to a server backend with a job queue. Scope exclusions are equally explicit: no user accounts and no server-side storage, so analyses stay in the browser, and no live pricing, with synthesis quotes delegated to vendors. Four hard constraints shaped the design and are documented: ESM-2 and PyTorch are not fork-safe so the worker is single-slot and length caps, task timeouts and per-IP rate limits are enforced; Apple MPS produces near-constant ESM-2 embeddings that collapse predictions to the training mean, so serving hardware must match training hardware (and the team therefore refuses to publish its MPS-collected latency numbers as product figures); the deployment is unauthenticated on an open school GPU server so all security sits at the reverse proxy; and the folding service and iGEM Registry snapshot are separate services that report their status to the UI. Operational problems were solved rather than papered over: the public iGEM FASTA endpoint returned 403s, so the pipeline digests MySQL dumps directly and yields 22,294 clean protein parts; the archived ESM Atlas API returned 504s, so ESMFold was moved to a self-hosted instance on a second GPU with ESM Atlas kept only as an outage fallback. Reproducibility is unusually complete for iGEM: source under Apache 2.0 at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/hk-joint-school/pyroforge, a full software document (user guide, API reference, deployment, provenance, known limits) and an engineering document as PDFs, and datasets and trained weights archived on Zenodo with DOIs (10.5281/zenodo.23455762 for the embedding archive and Meltome Tm file, 10.5281/zenodo.23456193 for the three model weights plus their evaluation reports), with ESM-2 and ESMFold weights deliberately not redistributed but loaded from their original releases at runtime, and a DATA.md documenting column definitions and what was actually verified. The tool was also used for its own project: PyroForge proposed mutations on an AI-designed fire-retardant peptide, and in a burnt-net assay the optimised Alp2 coating burned 8.5 cm (SD 0.4) against Alp1's 10.5 cm (SD 0.5), with more char formation. The team then adds the caveat themselves, noting that a different coating in the same project, CsgA-BslA-PEbp, burned less still at 7.1 cm, so the assay does not claim PyroForge beat every other design. Honest security posture: access control and TLS are listed as future work before exposure beyond the internal trusted network.","software_zh":"PyroForge 已經上線而且不需安裝：https://pyroforge.26650078.xyz/，架在團隊自己的 GPU 伺服器上，wiki 上附 QR code，並提供三步驟的試用路徑（New、貼上範例的 protein G B1 domain 序列、Run Prediction、Run Optimization）。這讓它成為 2026 年 iGEM 少數幾個陌生人真的可以在瀏覽器裡直接使用的軟體工具。它要解決的問題很具體：多數既有的熱穩定性預測工具都需要已解出的 3D 結構，這讓沒有 PDB 對應結構的新設計或新穎序列無法處理，因此 PyroForge 刻意只用序列，預測過程完全不使用結構資料。工作流程為 Input、Predict、Optimize、Fold、Order。純瀏覽器端執行被明確排除，並附上理由（ESM-2 650M 的權重約需 2.5 GB、飽和突變掃描是 O(L x 20) 次連續前向運算、60 個殘基的掃描在 GPU 上約需一分鐘並佔用約 5.6 GB VRAM），這也是架構最後選擇伺服器後端搭配工作佇列的原因。不做什麼也同樣寫得清楚：沒有使用者帳號、伺服器端不儲存任何資料，所以分析結果留在瀏覽器裡；也不提供即時報價，合成報價交給廠商處理。有四項硬性限制形塑了整個設計，而且都寫進文件：ESM-2 與 PyTorch 並非 fork-safe，所以工作者只有單一名額，並強制長度上限、任務逾時與單一 IP 的流量限制；Apple MPS 產生的 ESM-2 嵌入向量近乎常數，會讓預測塌陷到訓練集平均值，因此服務用的硬體必須與訓練用的硬體一致（團隊也因此拒絕把在 MPS 上量到的延遲數字當作產品規格公布）；部署在學校開放的 GPU 伺服器上且不做身分驗證，所有安全性都落在反向代理；摺疊預測服務與 iGEM Registry 快照是獨立的服務，各自把狀態回報到介面上。營運上的問題是真的被解決，而不是含糊帶過：iGEM 公開的 FASTA 端點回傳 403，於是流程改為直接消化 MySQL dump，整理出 22,294 個乾淨的蛋白質零件；已封存的 ESM Atlas API 回傳 504，於是把 ESMFold 改成架在第二張 GPU 上的自架服務，ESM Atlas 只留作停機時的備援。可重現性在 iGEM 中算是罕見地完整：原始碼以 Apache 2.0 授權放在 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/hk-joint-school/pyroforge，另有完整的軟體文件（使用手冊、API 參考、部署說明、資料來源、已知限制）與工程文件的 PDF，資料集與訓練好的權重以 DOI 典藏在 Zenodo（10.5281/zenodo.23455762 為嵌入向量封存檔與 Meltome Tm 檔案，10.5281/zenodo.23456193 為三個模型權重及其評估報告）；ESM-2 與 ESMFold 的權重刻意不再散布，而是在執行時從其原始發布處載入，並以一份 DATA.md 記錄欄位定義與實際驗證過的內容。這個工具也真的用在自己的專案上：PyroForge 針對一條以 AI 設計的阻燃胜肽提出突變建議，在燒網測試中，最佳化後的 Alp2 塗層燒毀長度為 8.5 cm（標準差 0.4），Alp1 則為 10.5 cm（標準差 0.5），且碳化層更多。團隊接著自己補上但書：同一個專案中另一種塗層 CsgA-BslA-PEbp 燒毀長度更短，只有 7.1 cm，所以這項測試並未宣稱 PyroForge 勝過其他每一種設計。資安態度也很誠實：存取控制與 TLS 被列為未來工作，要在對內部可信網路以外開放之前補上。","stack":["React","TypeScript","Vite","Mantine","FastAPI","Pydantic","Celery","Redis","Nginx","Docker Compose","systemd","PyTorch","ESM-2 650M","ESMFold (self-hosted + ESM Atlas fallback)","scikit-learn (PCA, Ridge, gradient boosting)","Zenodo (DOI archiving)","iGEM Registry MySQL dump ingestion","Apache 2.0","iGEM GitLab"],"techniques":["protein language model embeddings as frozen features","difference-embedding (mutant minus wildtype) for within-protein mutation ranking","site-saturation mutational scanning","Hyperband neural architecture search","grouped (parent-protein-disjoint) cross-validation","antisymmetry augmentation with negated reverse mutations","S669 and Ssym external benchmarking","Spearman within-protein versus pooled ranking analysis","confidence intervals and out-of-distribution reliability flagging","Codon Adaptation Index optimisation","ESMFold structure prediction with per-residue stability heatmapping","homology search against an iGEM Registry protein snapshot","invariant-based unit testing of thermodynamic properties","user acceptance testing with a structured survey"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education was built on a declared framework of one vision, four core philosophies and a set of user-specific strategies, with every initiative formatted for a particular age group and interest rather than reused, and each event documented with execution details, feedback analysis method and measured impact so other teams can reproduce it. The range extends unusually far down the age scale, including a Synthetic Biology Carnival at St. Dominic Anglo-Chinese Kindergarten built around sensory stimulation and mutual prosocial learning. The team's stated method is companionship and mutual engagement rather than monologue, and they publish a timeline and quantified impact per domain. The software itself was also engaged with the public: user acceptance testing surveyed 226 people through the complete analysis workflow.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育工作建立在一個明確宣告的框架上：一個願景、四項核心理念，以及一組針對不同使用者的策略；每一項活動都為特定年齡層與興趣量身設計，而不是重複套用，並且每場活動都記錄執行細節、回饋分析方法與量測到的影響，讓其他團隊可以複製。年齡範圍往下延伸得異常遠，包括在 St. Dominic Anglo-Chinese Kindergarten 舉辦、以感官刺激與彼此間利社會學習為設計主軸的合成生物學嘉年華。團隊自述的方法是陪伴與相互參與，而不是單向演講，並公布時間軸與各領域的量化影響。軟體本身也做了公眾參與：使用者接受度測試讓 226 人實際走完完整的分析流程。","ihp":"Stakeholders were grouped into three categories with distinct purposes: Target Users (public and industry, for safety, deployment, cost, liability and market acceptance), Science (subject experts, to validate the scientific basis), and ESG (regulators, testing bodies and environmental stakeholders, for sustainability and certification). The pivot is clearly recorded: the team started focused on improving fire retardancy and interviewed fire safety experts to build a verification plan, then consulted management at a major Hong Kong real estate developer (SHKP) who told them the critical problem with halogenated retardants is the toxic gases they release, including hydrogen chloride, hydrogen bromide and carcinogenic dioxins. The research focus shifted to making the coating non-toxic and low-smoke. An environmental analysis expert then reviewed the redesigned coating and shaped which metrics the verification plan should measure. For the software, the external benchmark exists because of one specific conversation: Prof. Joshua Ho of the School of Biomedical Sciences at the University of Hong Kong told them to run a head-to-head comparison with methods already in use, and the team ran S669 against 21 other methods and published the result including the places it ranks poorly. The 226-person UAT produced three documented fixes: ESMFold timeouts (resolved by moving folding to their own GPU), an optimization view that did not make sequence position and substitution coordinates readable (redesigned to highlight mutated positions and list the top five with residue numbers), and protein-only input (expanded to accept DNA).","ihp_zh":"利害關係人被分成三類，各有不同目的：Target Users（公眾與產業界，針對安全性、部署方式、成本、責任歸屬與市場接受度）、Science（領域專家，用以驗證科學基礎），以及 ESG（主管機關、檢測單位與環境相關的利害關係人，針對永續性與認證）。轉向的過程記錄得很清楚：團隊一開始專注於提升阻燃效果，並訪談消防安全專家以建立驗證計畫，之後向香港一家大型地產開發商（SHKP）的管理階層請益，對方指出含鹵素阻燃劑真正嚴重的問題在於它們釋放的有毒氣體，包括氯化氫、溴化氫與致癌的戴奧辛。研究重心因此轉向讓塗層無毒且低煙。接著一位環境分析專家檢視重新設計後的塗層，並決定了驗證計畫應該量測哪些指標。至於軟體，外部基準測試之所以存在，是因為一次具體的對話：香港大學生物醫學學院的 Prof. Joshua Ho 要他們與實際在使用的方法做正面比較，於是團隊跑了 S669、對比 21 種其他方法，並把結果連同排名難看的部分一併公布。226 人的使用者接受度測試帶來三項有記錄的修正：ESMFold 逾時（改由自家 GPU 執行摺疊預測解決）、最佳化檢視畫面無法清楚呈現序列位置與取代座標（重新設計成標示突變位置，並列出前五名及其殘基編號），以及原本只接受蛋白質輸入（擴充為也接受 DNA）。","realWorld":"The problem framing is quantitative: 43% of all fire disasters occurred in the past decade according to a study in Science, and WHO projects extreme fire events increasing in frequency by up to 50% by the end of the century, with 2025 Los Angeles and San Diego fires causing 31 deaths, over 200,000 evacuations and more than 18,000 destroyed structures. The coating is positioned as a spray-on product for firefighters and communities whose non-negotiable requirement, set by stakeholders, is being low-smoke, non-toxic and biodegradable rather than merely effective. Arabidopsis assays were run to check ecotoxicity, BslA weatherproofing was tested across weathering for rain washout, and the team notes the platform extends to other industrial materials by swapping the binding domain. PyroForge's own industrial framing is thermostable enzymes that improve reaction efficiency and reduce cooling demand.","realWorld_zh":"問題的鋪陳是有數字的：根據 Science 的一項研究，所有火災災難中有 43% 發生在過去十年；WHO 預測到本世紀末，極端火災事件的發生頻率最多會增加 50%；2025 年洛杉磯與聖地牙哥的大火造成 31 人死亡、逾 200,000 人撤離、超過 18,000 棟建築物毀損。這款塗層被定位為提供給消防人員與社區的噴塗產品，而利害關係人設定的不可妥協條件是低煙、無毒且可生物分解，而不只是有效。團隊以 Arabidopsis 試驗檢查生態毒性，並在耐候測試中驗證 BslA 防雨水沖刷的能力，也指出只要替換結合結構域，這個平台就能延伸到其他工業材料。PyroForge 自身的產業定位則是耐熱酵素，用以提升反應效率並降低冷卻需求。","partners":["Sun Hung Kai Properties (SHKP)","Prof. Joshua Ho, School of Biomedical Sciences, University of Hong Kong","Ir. Prof. Yuen (fire safety)","Prof. Ruan","Prof. Chan","Dr. Wong","Prof. Guan","St. Dominic Anglo-Chinese Kindergarten"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6058/wiki/software/system-archi.avif","caption":"PyroForge system architecture: Nginx reverse proxy as the only public surface, with FastAPI, Redis and three purpose-separated Celery queues (fast, heavy, io) isolated on the internal Docker network.","caption_zh":"PyroForge 的系統架構：Nginx 反向代理是唯一對外開放的介面，FastAPI、Redis 與三條依用途區分的 Celery 佇列（fast、heavy、io）都隔離在內部 Docker 網路中。","credit":"Team HK-Joint-School, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6058/wiki/software/optimization.avif","caption":"The Optimization card: a site-saturation scan over every single-residue substitution, ranked by predicted ddG, returning a top-five shortlist with residue numbers.","caption_zh":"Optimization 卡片：對每一個單一殘基取代做飽和突變掃描，依預測的 ddG 排序，回傳含殘基編號的前五名候選清單。","credit":"Team HK-Joint-School, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6058/wiki/software/s669-pooled-vs-within.avif","caption":"The S669 benchmark against 21 other methods: 18th of 22 on pooled ranking but 2nd of 22 within-protein and 1st among sequence-only methods, exactly the trade-off the difference-embedding design predicts.","caption_zh":"與 21 種其他方法比較的 S669 基準測試：pooled 排序在 22 種中排第 18，但蛋白質內部排序排第 2、純序列方法中排第 1，正是差值嵌入設計所預期的取捨。","credit":"Team HK-Joint-School, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6058/wiki/software/visualization.avif","caption":"The Visualization card: an ESMFold 3D model rendered in the browser with residues coloured by per-residue stability scores taken from the mutation scan.","caption_zh":"Visualization 卡片：在瀏覽器中呈現的 ESMFold 3D 模型，殘基依突變掃描得到的各殘基穩定性分數上色。","credit":"Team HK-Joint-School, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Run the head-to-head external benchmark and publish the ranks you lose on: PyroForge's S669 result (18th of 22 pooled, 2nd of 22 within-protein, 1st among sequence-only) is more convincing than a flattering number because the team explains why their architecture produces exactly that split. The second transferable practice is their bug ledger, where a random train/test split that inflated correlation from 0.46 to 0.85 and a sign-inversion that ranked the most destabilising mutations first are both published with the invariant unit tests now preventing them.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"去做正面對決的外部基準測試，並把自己輸掉的名次也公布出來：PyroForge 的 S669 結果（pooled 排序 22 名中的第 18、蛋白質內部排序 22 名中的第 2、純序列方法中的第 1）之所以比一個好看的數字更有說服力，是因為團隊解釋了為什麼他們的架構必然產生這樣的落差。第二項可以借鏡的做法是他們的錯誤紀錄簿：隨機切分訓練與測試集使相關係數從 0.46 虛高到 0.85，以及正負號反轉讓最不穩定化的突變被排在最前面，兩件事都公開寫出來，並附上如今用來防堵它們的不變量單元測試。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/hk-joint-school/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hk-joint-school/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/hk-joint-school/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/hk-joint-school/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/hk-joint-school/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/hk-joint-school/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/hk-joint-school/contribution","https://pyroforge.26650078.xyz/","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/hk-joint-school/pyroforge","https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23455762","https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23456193"],"awards_zh":["最佳軟體 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6060":{"team":"DTU-Denmark","id":"6060","section":"Overgrad","country":"Denmark","village":"Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/dtu-denmark/","projectTitle":"Enzymatic degradation of wind turbine blade epoxy","tagline":"A chemo-enzymatic route to the resin fraction of decommissioned wind turbine blades, assessed honestly against the alternatives","summary":"DTU engineered laccases (ItL-03 from a spruce bark beetle gut metagenome, CueO variants and homologues) and unspecific peroxygenases (PaDa-I, WamPa, PabUPO-II, MroUPO, Fett) to attack the amine crosslinks of cured epoxy from wind turbine blades, layered on top of a published acid-plus-peroxide solvolysis pretreatment. They used NNBT, a small water-soluble molecule carrying the tertiary amine of the crosslink, as a defined model substrate, and showed by MALDI-TOF that PaDa-I performs N-dealkylation on it with Purpald confirmation of lactaldehyde release. The decisive work is a prospective comparative life-cycle assessment in SimaPro (ReCiPe 2016 Midpoint H) of five end-of-life routes, which found their own enzymatic route is NOT the best option on almost any indicator - and they published that. Seven interviews across DTU Wind, DTU Sustain, DTU Chemistry, SDU and industry, plus documented non-responses from Siemens Gamesa, Orsted and MAKEEN Energy, drove changes to the chemical target, the model substrate, the host organism, the enzyme-ranking criterion and the project's stated goal.","awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Three parallel enzyme-discovery pipelines agreed after advice from the 2025 team's dry-lab head: an 'easy' track of literature enzymes known to oxidise the relevant bonds, a 'medium' track of homologue mining, and a 'hard' track of rational engineering and generative design. Plus a prospective comparative LCA (SimaPro, ReCiPe 2016 Midpoint H, functional unit of blade mass with cutting/transport/metal separation excluded as identical across routes) and a Kremser-equation model of the countercurrent solvent extraction stage.","dataviz":"An interactive clickable process-flow diagram that zooms from the five-route overview into the enzymatic routes with every parameter on the box (acid molarity, temperature, residence time, enzyme loading in mg/L, number of reuses, recovery fractions); one SDG per plot with burdens above zero and credits below; an interactive stakeholder map where each pin opens the interview, colour-coded by engagement status so non-responses stay visible.","datascience":"Sequence mining of UniProt, Pfam and BLAST rather than metagenomic libraries; multiple sequence alignment to transfer organic-solvent-tolerance mutations from PaDa-I onto GroGu and PabUPO-II; a novel substrate-access-channel discovery pipeline used in place of docking affinity ranking; molecular dynamics; generative enzyme design on the DTU HPC. Every LCA parameter is published with its source, the mismatch between source and use, and a 'weakest link' label (e.g. partition coefficients taken from a 1980 phenol-extraction paper using MIBK rather than ethyl acetate, flagged explicitly).","software":"LCA input data, assumptions and mapping code released open source so other teams can rebuild the model in SimaPro or another tool; lectures, workshops and guides collected on the contribution page.","stack":["SimaPro","Ecoinvent","ReCiPe 2016 Midpoint (H)","Boltz-2","molecular dynamics","BAGEL","Raygun","BLAST / UniProt / Pfam","DTU HPC","Opentrons liquid handler"],"techniques":["molecular docking (deliberately demoted)","substrate channel geometry analysis","multiple sequence alignment mutation transfer","generative protein design","Gibson assembly (laccases)","Golden Gate (UPOs)","96-well colorimetric screening (ABTS, NNBT, NBD, Purpald)","CO-difference spectroscopy for correctly folded heme","MALDI-TOF product identification","prospective LCA with contribution analysis"],"frameworks_zh":"在徵詢 2025 年隊伍乾實驗室負責人的建議後，確立三條並行的酵素探索管線：「容易」路線為文獻中已知能氧化相關鍵結的酵素，「中等」路線為同源蛋白探勘，「困難」路線為理性工程與生成式設計。此外還有一項前瞻式比較 LCA（SimaPro、ReCiPe 2016 Midpoint H，功能單位為葉片質量，切割／運輸／金屬分離因在各路線間相同而排除），以及一個以 Kremser 方程式建立的逆流溶劑萃取段模型。","dataviz_zh":"一張可互動點擊的製程流程圖，可由五路線總覽放大到各酵素路線，每個方塊上都標出參數（酸的莫耳濃度、溫度、滯留時間、以 mg/L 表示的酵素投加量、再利用次數、回收率）；每一項 SDG 各自一張圖，負擔畫在零線以上、效益畫在零線以下；還有一張可互動的利害關係人地圖，點選圖釘即展開該場訪談，並以顏色標示互動狀態，讓無回應者仍然看得見。","datascience_zh":"以 UniProt、Pfam 與 BLAST 做序列探勘，而非總體基因組資料庫；以多序列比對把 PaDa-I 的有機溶劑耐受突變轉移到 GroGu 與 PabUPO-II 上；以一套新的底物進入通道探索流程取代以嵌合親和力排序；分子動力學模擬；在 DTU HPC 上執行生成式酵素設計。每一個 LCA 參數都連同來源、來源與實際用途之間的落差，以及一個「最弱環節」標籤一併公開（例如分配係數取自 1980 年一篇使用 MIBK 而非乙酸乙酯的酚萃取論文，明確標示出來）。","software_zh":"LCA 的輸入資料、假設與對映程式碼皆以開源釋出，讓其他隊伍能在 SimaPro 或其他工具中重建模型；講座、工作坊與指南則整理在貢獻頁面上。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education was pointed at the specific blind spot the project exposed rather than at synthetic biology in general: visits to international high schools taught the wind sector's end-of-life emissions and the idea of thinking in full sustainability circles early, and a Lifelong Learning workshop took the same low-impact recycling discussion to an audience of working professionals. For the iGEM community they ran a BioBrick workshop, an intellectual-property introduction ('Protecting Your Ideas'), a World Cafe team-to-team roundtable and a podcast, and presented at the Nordic iGEM Conference. State of Green gave them a platform to put the blade-waste problem to people from ministries, academia and the energy sector.","ihp":"DTU's IHP is built as a decision trail, not a visitor log: every interview card carries an explicit 'Implementation' list, and there is a separate section on approaches they chose NOT to pursue. The single biggest change came from Dr Javier (Postdoc, DTU Sustain, one of the few in his group working on resin chemistry rather than glass-fibre recovery) across two interviews on 3 March and 24 June 2026. He posed what the team calls the sharpest experimental question raised in the project - can an enzyme replace the cleaving solvent, acting on a swollen but still crosslinked network? - and told them to start from a well-documented literature pretreatment rather than invent one and layer enzymes on top. The result was a hard reframing: the enzymatic step stopped being a standalone degradation claim and became a complement to solvolysis, with a new explicit objective of testing whether enzymes could substitute for part of the solvent-cleavage step, and a second research line on engineering solvent tolerance into the enzymes. Justine Beauson (Senior Researcher, Composites Manufacturing and Testing, DTU Wind) was the first contact; she confirmed thermoset epoxy is what is coming down now, referred the team to a turbine OEM, and in a 6 October email follow-up explained that the Blade Material Passport is compiled independently of any thinking about disposal and will tell you a blade is epoxy but never the formulation - which is why the team abandoned any attempt to match real blade resin and why 'collaboration between the production and the waste-management industries' became the organising claim on the sustainability page. Jesper Kjaer Jorgensen (Postdoc, Composites, DTU) then supplied fully cured SWANCOR 2519-1A/BS, a commercial non-NDA amine-cured bisphenol-A epoxy, and agreed with the team's hypothesis that the tertiary amine crosslink is the vulnerable point: the team writes plainly that 'without those cubes we would have had either no workable material or a different one', and the target shifted from the epoxy backbone to the amine crosslinks, changing which bonds they went after, how they measured degradation and which products they hoped to recover. Robert (PhD, Eukaryotic Molecular Cell Biology) delivered the hardest reality check - thermoset degradation is heavily researched, the field contains many low-quality papers with missing controls and uncharacterised substrates, and a six-month student project cannot run a metagenomic discovery campaign - and the team's response is laid out item by item: they screened roughly 33 enzymes rather than thousands, worked from public databases rather than metagenomic libraries, used a colorimetric assay rather than a fluorescent reporter, added MALDI-TOF, and had a postdoc rather than students perform the hazardous epoxy pretreatment. Carlos G. Acevedo-Rocha (Senior Researcher, Computational Protein Engineering, BRIGHT) told them not to base findings on docking affinity values because there is no significant correlation with experimental activity, and endorsed their early-stage channel-discovery pipeline: they abandoned the plan to filter homologue candidates on Boltz-2 affinity scores and rebuilt candidate selection around channel geometry plus molecular dynamics. Cecilia Castellvi Domingo (PhD, heterologous expression of UPOs) changed the chassis and the protocol - Komagataella phaffii on an episomal AP17 backbone rather than S. cerevisiae or E. coli, harvest at day 5 instead of day 6 to reduce proteolysis, lower induction temperature, and the CO-difference spectrum assay that gave them a direct measurement of correctly folded heme-containing enzyme (0.019 uM in a six-fold concentrated sample) that activity assays could not. Lykke Margot Ricard (Associate Professor in Sustainable Innovation, SDU, who had mapped Danish blade treatment options for the Danish EPA) asked who the retaker is, and in response every workstream was required to name a recoverable product, the quality it would need and a potential buyer - which is also why the team says the ideal process recovers a product rather than incinerating residues. The European Environment Agency answered that it holds no data on retired blade management, that the WEEE Directive does not cover wind turbines and that no dedicated EU legislation exists, so there is no reporting obligation; the team then marked the landfill share as an unverifiable input in the LCA rather than quoting a number. Most unusually, they publish their failures of access: Siemens Gamesa never replied to email and had no relevant expert at the DSE careers fair, nobody at Orsted could speak to blade end-of-life, MAKEEN Energy did not reply, and the team states outright that the groups with the greatest influence over adoption 'were therefore among the least represented in our discussions, limiting our analysis' - and makes those gaps visible on the stakeholder map, which rates each group by influence over adoption and interest separately, including 'unknown' for potential buyers of recovered compounds because no market has been shown to exist.","realWorld":"The need is a quantified bottleneck rather than a slogan: Danish blade waste currently goes to mixed-waste landfill or is shipped abroad by lorry and ferry, the Danish wind industry's voluntary landfill ban took effect on 1 January 2026, a Danish EPA screening detected bisphenol A in every tank leaching test on blade material, and the EEA confirmed there is no EU legislation or reporting obligation for wind-turbine waste at all pending the WEEE revision in the Circular Economy Act. SDGs are justified target by target with numbers from their own LCA, and the headline finding is one most teams would hide: in the base industrial scale-up scenario (projected to about 2035) the enzymatic route emits 2.1 kg CO2 eq per kg of blade against 1.4 for solvolysis and 0.9 for pyrolysis, adds 0.38 person-equivalents of human carcinogenic toxicity against 0.022 for solvolysis, uses about 36% more water, and cement co-processing is best on almost every indicator - so they state that enzymatic and solvolysis are the only routes with clear net burdens, trace the hotspot to the H2O2 supply chain and UPO production, and convert that into a research direction (make UPO production more efficient, recover a product instead of incinerating residues, reuse immobilised enzyme and compute the break-even number of reuses). SDG targets are matched one-to-one with their own data on SDG 3 (illness from hazardous chemicals), 6 (water-use efficiency), 7 (renewable share and clean-energy research cooperation), 8 (the Energy Transition Alliance estimate that a UK blade-recycling segment could add 20,000 jobs to offshore wind's 60,000-by-2030 target), 9, 12, 13, 14, 15 and 17. Limitations are declared inside the SDG analysis rather than buried: unknown reaction product, no demonstration of enzyme performance on real blade material, one blade type only, transport excluded by the system boundary, microplastic and BPA leaching not characterised by ReCiPe, and no penalty in the cut-off model for losing glass fibre as a resource. What happens next: the LCA inputs, assumptions and mapping code are open source, the OEM's requirements (handle multi-material blades at reasonable cost and pace) are recorded as requirements for future development rather than achievements, and relationships with State of Green, the Center for Biosolutions and DTU are described as collaborations that can continue beyond iGEM.","partners":["DTU Wind and Energy Systems","DTU Sustain","DTU Chemistry","DTU Biotechnology and Biomedicine","DTU Biosustain","University of Southern Denmark (SDU Innovation and Design Engineering)","Biotechnology Research Institute for the Green Transition (BRIGHT)","European Environment Agency","State of Green","Center for Biosolutions","an anonymous wind turbine OEM","Tailwind Bio","Danish Working Environment Authority (Arbejdstilsynet) epoxy certification"],"publicEngagement_zh":"教育瞄準的是這個專案所揭露的特定盲點，而不是泛泛的合成生物學：團隊走訪國際高中，講授風電產業的生命終期排放，以及及早以完整永續循環來思考的觀念；一場 Lifelong Learning 工作坊則把同樣關於低衝擊回收的討論帶給在職專業人士。對 iGEM 社群，他們辦了 BioBrick 工作坊、一場智慧財產權入門課（Protecting Your Ideas）、一場 World Cafe 形式的隊際圓桌，以及一集 podcast，並在 Nordic iGEM Conference 上報告。State of Green 則提供了舞台，讓他們把葉片廢棄物問題帶到部會、學界與能源業人士面前。","ihp_zh":"DTU 的 IHP 是一條決策軌跡，而不是一本訪客簽到簿：每一張訪談卡都附有明確的「落實」清單，另有一個專節說明他們「選擇不走」的方向。最大的一次轉向來自 Dr Javier（DTU Sustain 博士後，該組少數研究樹脂化學而非玻璃纖維回收的人）在 2026 年 3 月 3 日與 6 月 24 日的兩場訪談。他提出了團隊認為整個專案中最犀利的實驗問題——酵素能否取代裂解溶劑，直接作用在已膨潤但仍交聯的網狀結構上？——並建議他們從文獻中記載完整的前處理出發，而不是自己發明一套，再在上面疊加酵素。結果是一次徹底的重新定位：酵素步驟不再是獨立的降解主張，而成為溶劑分解的補充，並新增一個明確目標——測試酵素能否取代部分溶劑裂解步驟，同時開出第二條研究線，為酵素工程化出溶劑耐受性。Justine Beauson（DTU Wind 複合材料製造與測試資深研究員）是第一位聯繫對象；她確認現在退役下來的正是熱固性環氧樹脂，把團隊轉介給一家風機原廠（OEM），並在 10 月 6 日的電子郵件追問中說明，Blade Material Passport 的編製完全沒有考慮處置問題，只會告訴你葉片是環氧樹脂，卻絕不會給你配方——這正是團隊放棄去比對真實葉片樹脂的原因，也是「生產業與廢棄物管理業之間的協作」成為永續頁面核心主張的原因。接著 Jesper Kjaer Jorgensen（DTU 複合材料博士後）提供了完全固化的 SWANCOR 2519-1A/BS，一款無保密協議限制的商用胺固化雙酚 A 環氧樹脂，並同意團隊的假說：三級胺交聯是脆弱點。團隊直言「沒有那些方塊，我們手上要麼沒有可用的材料，要麼是另一種材料」，標的也因此從環氧樹脂主鏈轉到胺類交聯，改變了他們要攻擊哪些鍵結、如何量測降解，以及期望回收哪些產物。Robert（真核分子細胞生物學博士生）給出最嚴厲的現實檢驗——熱固性材料降解已被大量研究、該領域有許多缺少對照、底物未經鑑定的低品質論文，而一個六個月的學生專案不可能跑完整的總體基因組探索——團隊的回應逐條列出：他們篩選約 33 個酵素而非數千個、以公開資料庫而非總體基因組資料庫為起點、採用比色分析而非螢光報告子、加入 MALDI-TOF，並讓博士後而非學生執行危害性的環氧樹脂前處理。Carlos G. Acevedo-Rocha（BRIGHT 計算蛋白質工程資深研究員）告訴他們不要把結論建立在嵌合親和力數值上，因為那與實驗活性並無顯著相關，同時認可他們早期階段的通道探索流程：於是他們放棄以 Boltz-2 親和力分數篩選同源候選的計畫，改以通道幾何加上分子動力學重建候選篩選。Cecilia Castellvi Domingo（研究 UPO 異源表現的博士生）改變了宿主與操作流程——改用帶 episomal AP17 骨架的 Komagataella phaffii，而非 S. cerevisiae 或 E. coli；第 5 天而非第 6 天收取以減少蛋白水解；降低誘導溫度；以及 CO 差異光譜分析，讓他們得到正確折疊、含血基質酵素的直接量測值（六倍濃縮樣品中為 0.019 uM），這是活性分析做不到的。Lykke Margot Ricard（SDU 永續創新副教授，曾為丹麥環保署盤點丹麥葉片處理選項）問了「接手的人是誰？」，於是每條工作線都被要求指名一項可回收的產物、它需要達到的品質，以及可能的買家——這也是團隊主張理想製程應回收產物而非焚燒殘渣的原因。歐洲環境署答覆說他們並未掌握退役葉片管理的資料、WEEE 指令並不涵蓋風力機、也沒有專門的歐盟法規，因此不存在通報義務；團隊於是在 LCA 中把掩埋比例標記為無法驗證的輸入，而不是引用一個數字。最不尋常的是，他們把自己接觸失敗的部分也公開了：Siemens Gamesa 從未回信，在 DSE 就業博覽會上也沒有相關專家；Orsted 沒有人能談葉片生命終期；MAKEEN Energy 未回覆。團隊直接寫出，對採用與否影響力最大的那些群體「因此也是我們討論中代表性最低的，限制了我們的分析」，並把這些缺口標示在利害關係人地圖上——該圖分別以對採用的影響力與興趣程度評比每個群體，連回收化合物的潛在買家也標為「未知」，因為尚未有證據顯示市場存在。","realWorld_zh":"需求是被量化的瓶頸，而不是一句口號：丹麥的葉片廢棄物目前進入混合廢棄物掩埋場，或以卡車與渡輪運往國外；丹麥風電業自願性的掩埋禁令自 2026 年 1 月 1 日起生效；丹麥環保署的篩查在葉片材料的每一次槽式浸出試驗中都檢出雙酚 A；而歐洲環境署確認，在《循環經濟法》修訂 WEEE 之前，歐盟對風力機廢棄物根本沒有任何法規或通報義務。各項 SDG 都以團隊自己 LCA 的數字逐一標的論證，而最醒目的發現是多數隊伍會藏起來的：在工業規模放大的基準情境（推估至約 2035 年）下，酵素路線每公斤葉片排放 2.1 kg CO2 eq，相較溶劑分解為 1.4、熱裂解為 0.9；人體致癌毒性增加 0.38 人當量，相較溶劑分解為 0.022；用水量多約 36%；而水泥共處理在幾乎每一項指標上都最佳——於是他們明白寫出，酵素路線與溶劑分解是唯二有明顯淨負擔的路線，將熱點追溯到 H2O2 供應鏈與 UPO 生產，並把它轉化為研究方向（提高 UPO 生產效率、回收產物而非焚燒殘渣、重複使用固定化酵素並計算損益兩平的再利用次數）。SDG 標的與他們自己的資料一對一對應，涵蓋 SDG 3（危害性化學物質致病）、6（用水效率）、7（再生能源佔比與潔淨能源研究合作）、8（Energy Transition Alliance 估計英國葉片回收產業可為離岸風電 2030 年 6 萬個就業目標再增加 2 萬個工作機會）、9、12、13、14、15 與 17。限制條件寫在 SDG 分析之內，而非埋在角落：反應產物未知、未在真實葉片材料上展示酵素效能、只用一種葉片類型、運輸被系統邊界排除、微塑膠與 BPA 浸出未被 ReCiPe 納入特徵化，以及在截斷模型中沒有對玻璃纖維作為資源的損失給予懲罰。接下來的走向：LCA 的輸入、假設與對映程式碼皆為開源；OEM 的要求（能以合理成本與速度處理多材料葉片）被記錄為未來開發的需求而非已達成的成果；與 State of Green、Center for Biosolutions 及 DTU 的關係則被描述為可在 iGEM 之後延續的合作。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6060/wiki/human-practices/stakeholder-photos/javier.webp","caption":"Javier, postdoc at DTU Sustain working on resin chemistry, whose question about whether an enzyme could replace the cleaving solvent reframed the whole project as a complement to solvolysis","credit":"Team DTU-Denmark, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"Javier，DTU Sustain 從事樹脂化學研究的博士後，他關於酵素能否取代裂解溶劑的問題，讓整個專案重新定位為溶劑分解的補充"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6060/wiki/human-practices/stakeholder-photos/lykke.avif","caption":"Lykke Margot Ricard (SDU), who mapped Danish blade treatment options for the Danish EPA and made every workstream name a recoverable product and a buyer","credit":"Team DTU-Denmark, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"Lykke Margot Ricard（SDU），曾為丹麥環保署盤點丹麥葉片處理選項，要求每條工作線都指名一項可回收產物與一位買家"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6060/wiki/header-illustrations/engagement-human-practices.avif","caption":"Header illustration for the integrated human practices section, which is organised as an interactive stakeholder map rated by influence over adoption and interest","credit":"Team DTU-Denmark, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"整合式人類實踐章節的標頭插畫，該章節以一張依採用影響力與興趣程度評比的互動式利害關係人地圖編排"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6060/wiki/education/photos/sog-1.avif","caption":"At State of Green, where the team put the blade-waste problem to people from ministries, academia and the energy sector","credit":"Team DTU-Denmark, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"在 State of Green，團隊把葉片廢棄物問題帶到部會、學界與能源業人士面前"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Run a comparative LCA against the incumbent technologies early enough that it can still change the research plan, and publish it even when it says your own route loses - then convert each losing indicator into a named engineering target, and record the stakeholders who never replied so the gaps in your evidence base are visible rather than invisible.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/dtu-denmark/","https://2026.igem.wiki/dtu-denmark/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/dtu-denmark/sustainability","https://2026.igem.wiki/dtu-denmark/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/dtu-denmark/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/dtu-denmark/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/dtu-denmark/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/dtu-denmark/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/dtu-denmark/software"],"projectTitle_zh":"風力機葉片環氧樹脂的酵素降解","tagline_zh":"針對退役風力機葉片中樹脂部分的化學—酵素複合路線，並誠實地與其他替代方案比較","summary_zh":"DTU 改造了漆酶（來自雲杉樹皮甲蟲腸道總體基因組的 ItL-03、CueO 變異體與同源蛋白）與非專一性過氧合酶（PaDa-I、WamPa、PabUPO-II、MroUPO、Fett），用來攻擊風力機葉片已固化環氧樹脂中的胺類交聯，並疊加在一篇已發表的酸加過氧化氫溶劑分解前處理之上。他們以 NNBT 這個帶有交聯點三級胺、可溶於水的小分子作為定義明確的模型底物，並以 MALDI-TOF 顯示 PaDa-I 對其進行 N-脫烷基反應，再以 Purpald 確認乳醛的釋出。真正關鍵的工作是在 SimaPro 中（ReCiPe 2016 Midpoint H）對五種生命終期路線所做的前瞻式比較生命週期評估，結果發現他們自己的酵素路線在幾乎每一項指標上都不是最佳選項——而他們把這個結果公開了。橫跨 DTU Wind、DTU Sustain、DTU Chemistry、SDU 與產業界的七場訪談，加上 Siemens Gamesa、Orsted 與 MAKEEN Energy 無回應的完整記錄，促使他們更動了化學標的、模型底物、宿主生物、酵素排序標準，以及專案本身所宣稱的目標。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"及早做與現行技術的比較 LCA，早到它還能改變研究計畫，並且即使結果顯示自己的路線輸了也照樣公開——然後把每一項落敗的指標轉成一個指名的工程目標，並記錄下那些始終沒有回覆的利害關係人，讓證據基礎上的缺口被看見，而不是隱形。","awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 入圍"],"rank":47},"6064":{"team":"DKU","id":"6064","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"Software & AI","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/dku/","projectTitle":"PeptiCraft","projectTitle_zh":"PeptiCraft","tagline":"An AI-assisted platform that turns a product brief into a traceable shortlist of recombinant fusion-protein candidates for skincare and medical aesthetics.","tagline_zh":"以 AI 輔助的平台，可將產品需求說明轉換為一份可追溯的重組融合蛋白候選清單，應用於保養品與醫學美容。","summary":"PeptiCraft addresses a specific physical problem: a free 10-30 residue bioactive peptide has essentially no structural stability, is degraded quickly by proteases, cannot be cast or gelled into a material, and diffuses away from where it is needed. The team's hypothesis is that such a peptide can be rescued by gene-fusing it to a structural scaffold, here a 364-residue recombinant Bombyx mori silk fibroin (FibLNT8-10xRep-FibHCT) chosen because its mechanical behaviour comes from sequence repeats rather than a folded globular core and therefore survives editing. The dry lab streamed 849,416,450 published protein sequences, kept the 19.9 million that are 3-30 standard residues, and ran them down an eight-round funnel to 496 assembled constructs across four functional directions, with a 99.9975% overall rejection rate. Three antioxidant candidates and a scaffold-only control were then expressed in E. coli and assayed: Top1 roughly doubled the scaffold's radical-scavenging capacity (TEAC 0.375 vs 0.195 mmol TE/g, p = 0.0075), no construct was cytotoxic to human keratinocytes, and no construct significantly protected cells against oxidative stress.","summary_zh":"PeptiCraft 針對一個具體的物理問題：游離的 10-30 個殘基生物活性胜肽幾乎沒有結構穩定性，會被蛋白酶快速降解，無法被澆鑄或膠化成材料，而且會從需要它的位置擴散離開。團隊的假設是，這類胜肽可藉由基因融合接上結構性支架而獲得補救；此處採用 364 個殘基的重組 Bombyx mori 絲蛋白（FibLNT8-10xRep-FibHCT），選它是因為其力學表現來自序列重複單元而非摺疊的球狀核心，因此能承受序列改動。乾實驗以串流方式處理 849,416,450 條已發表蛋白質序列，保留其中長度為 3-30 個標準殘基的 1,990 萬條，再讓它們通過八輪漏斗式篩選，最終在四個功能方向上得到 496 個組裝完成的構築體，整體淘汰率為 99.9975%。隨後在 E. coli 中表現三個抗氧化候選物與一個僅含支架的對照並進行檢測：Top1 的自由基清除能力約為支架的兩倍（TEAC 0.375 對 0.195 mmol TE/g，p = 0.0075）；所有構築體對人類角質細胞皆無細胞毒性；也沒有任何構築體能顯著保護細胞免於氧化壓力。","awards":["Best Software & AI Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A live, publicly accessible web application at https://pepticraft.pages.dev (Cloudflare Pages) serving 496 constructs over 19 endpoints, with a three-step workflow: define your needs (functions and product format), design the protein, review recommended expression strategies. The computational pipeline behind it is built as sixteen discrete predictive services, declared per stage and started on demand rather than run continuously, because keeping every service alive left a GPU context allocated per service until the card filled; in practice two to five live services at a time, which the team describes as removing contention rather than managing it. State lives in a columnar database rather than CSV hand-offs, with checkpoint and resume, progressive batch writes, and every result write as an upsert keyed on candidate identifier so batches can be re-run without duplicates and different rounds can write different columns of the same row. Batch size is explicitly chosen as the amount of work the team is willing to recompute, not as a performance parameter, on the stated assumption that a fourteen-hour pipeline will fail somewhere. Source: https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/dku/pepticraft-2, with a PeptiCraft-Project-Master-Reference.md in docs/.","frameworks_zh":"一個已上線、公開可用的網頁應用（https://pepticraft.pages.dev，Cloudflare Pages），透過 19 個端點提供 496 個構築體，工作流程分三步：定義需求（功能與產品型態）、設計蛋白質、檢視建議的表現策略。背後的計算流程由 16 個獨立的預測服務構成，依階段宣告、按需啟動而非持續運行，因為讓所有服務常駐會使每個服務各佔一份 GPU context，直到顯示卡記憶體用盡；實務上同時僅有 2 到 5 個服務在線，團隊形容這是消除資源競爭而非管理資源競爭。狀態存放在欄式資料庫而非以 CSV 交接，具備檢查點與續跑、漸進式批次寫入，且每次結果寫入都是以候選物識別碼為鍵的 upsert，因此批次可重跑而不產生重複，不同輪次也能寫入同一列的不同欄位。批次大小明確是以「團隊願意重算多少工作量」來選定，而非作為效能參數，其前提假設是一個長達 14 小時的流程一定會在某處失敗。原始碼：https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/dku/pepticraft-2，docs/ 下附有 PeptiCraft-Project-Master-Reference.md。","dataviz":"The platform's defining display is the safety panel, which resolves to four verdicts rather than three: clear, exceeded, borderline and not assessed, so that an unmeasured gate can never be read as a passed one. Of the 496 constructs, 198 carry no immunogenicity measurement from either pathway and say so. Where a value exists it is shown against its applicable range, because the MHC class I predictor accepts only 5-15 residue peptides and returns zero outside that window, so a stored zero is not evidence of low immunogenicity. Alongside the constructs the platform serves a hand-compiled reference layer: 8 scaffold protein clusters with 16 patent sequence variants carrying real amino-acid sequences and graded E1-E5 by evidence level, and 15 curated linker entries with literature provenance. Five application routes (injectable filler, wound dressing, mask patch, topical film, hair care) are ordered by barrier integrity and each binds its own immunogenicity threshold (0.35, 0.35, 0.50, 0.50, 0.60). Every number on a candidate is traceable to its source. The wiki itself publishes the funnel as a diagram with per-source pass rates and reports the round-by-round wall-clock times.","dataviz_zh":"平台最具代表性的呈現是安全性面板，它給出四種判定而非三種：通過、超標、臨界與未評估，使未經測量的關卡絕不會被誤讀為已通過。496 個構築體中有 198 個在兩條路徑上都沒有免疫原性量測值，平台也如實標示。有數值時會連同其適用範圍一併顯示，因為 MHC class I 預測器只接受 5-15 個殘基的胜肽，超出此範圍會回傳 0，因此存下來的 0 並不代表免疫原性低。除構築體之外，平台還提供一層人工彙編的參考資料：8 個支架蛋白叢集、16 個帶有真實胺基酸序列並依證據等級分為 E1-E5 的專利序列變體，以及 15 筆附文獻出處的連接子條目。五種應用途徑（注射填充劑、傷口敷料、面膜貼片、外用薄膜、護髮）依皮膚屏障完整性排序，各自綁定專屬的免疫原性閾值（0.35、0.35、0.50、0.50、0.60）。候選物上的每一個數字都可回溯到來源。wiki 本身以圖表公布整個漏斗，附上各資料來源的通過率，並逐輪報告實際執行時間。","datascience":"The pipeline is governed by five explicitly stated principles that are the project's methodological contribution. (1) Hierarchical filtering, never cross-attribute averaging: each round either sorts and takes a percentile or applies a threshold and eliminates, on the grounds that a blend is only meaningful when components share a unit and a direction, which antioxidant activity and haemolysis risk do not. (2) Safety is a hard threshold: toxicity (ToxinPred3 at 0.38), haemolysis (HemoPI2 at 0.55) and MHC class I immunogenicity (MHCflurry at 0.50, tightened to 0.35 for wound dressing and injectable routes) are pass-or-eliminate, never scored, weighted or compensable, while MHC class II (NetMHCIIpan) is a soft signal and allergenicity (AlgPred2) and B-cell epitope (BepiPred-3.0) are reported only. (3) The functional activity score is used exactly once, in round 1, so the two channels stay independent. (4) The pipeline has exactly one weighted average and its weights come from the data, computed as each component's winsorised standard deviation (truncated at the 5th and 95th percentiles so one outlier cannot dominate) normalised to sum to one, with any manual coefficient invalid without a recorded justification, which is a rule against tuning weights after seeing which constructs won. (5) Order by cost: moving the toxicity predictor out of round 1 onto a 50,000-sequence subset took it from an estimated 22 hours to about 48 minutes with no effect on the result. The design feature that makes the whole thing falsifiable is a dual channel: a Bottom channel of candidates predicted to be poor is carried through the entire identical pipeline as a matched negative control (100 of the 250 constructs in the v1.4 run, 206 of the 496 on the platform), so if both channels behave the same at the bench the pipeline's central assumption is refuted. Round 8 re-predicted the top ten of each channel with a second, independent structure model: mean confidence 0.52 against 0.42 for the primary, same trend and same ordering at the top. The final structural score is published as a formula: 0.40 x SASA + 0.40 x (1 - Aggrescan3D) + 0.20 x normalised pLDDT, with confidence at half weight because a predicted structure is evidence about a construct, not the construct itself. Verification: 115 backend tests (113 pass, 2 skipped), 91 static-data-layer assertions, and 58 end-to-end walkthrough assertions, where the static walkthrough serves the export directory over HTTP, reads it with the frontend's own data layer, compares an interface-assembled sequence against the service's sample residue by residue, and fails if any read reaches the network. Data scale: a 367,717,240-row per-tool score table at roughly 130 GB, plus a second immunogenicity pathway of about 147.5M rows across 131 alleles.","datascience_zh":"整個流程由五條明確陳述的原則所規範，這些原則正是本專案的方法論貢獻。（1）階層式篩選，絕不跨屬性取平均：每一輪要嘛排序後取百分位，要嘛套用閾值直接淘汰，理由是只有當各組成項共享同一單位與同一方向時，混合才有意義，而抗氧化活性與溶血風險並不符合這個條件。（2）安全性採硬性閾值：毒性（ToxinPred3，0.38）、溶血（HemoPI2，0.55）與 MHC class I 免疫原性（MHCflurry，0.50，在傷口敷料與注射途徑收緊至 0.35）皆為通過或淘汰，絕不計分、加權或互相補償；MHC class II（NetMHCIIpan）為軟性訊號，致敏性（AlgPred2）與 B 細胞抗原決定位（BepiPred-3.0）僅作報告之用。（3）功能活性分數只在第 1 輪使用一次，以保持兩條通道彼此獨立。（4）整個流程只有一處加權平均，而其權重來自資料本身：以各組成項經 winsorise 處理的標準差（在第 5 與第 95 百分位截尾，使單一離群值無法主導）計算，再正規化至總和為 1；任何人工指定的係數若無書面理由即視為無效，這是一條防止在看到哪些構築體勝出後才回頭調整權重的規則。（5）依計算成本排序：將毒性預測器自第 1 輪移出、改在 50,000 條序列的子集上執行，使其耗時從估計的 22 小時降到約 48 分鐘，且不影響結果。使整套方法可被否證的設計是雙通道：一條由預測表現不佳的候選物組成的 Bottom 通道，以配對陰性對照的身分走完完全相同的流程（v1.4 執行中 250 個構築體裡的 100 個，平台上 496 個裡的 206 個），因此若兩條通道在實驗桌上表現相同，流程的核心假設即被反駁。第 8 輪以第二個獨立的結構模型重新預測兩條通道的前十名：平均信賴度 0.52，主模型為 0.42，趨勢相同、前段排序也相同。最終的結構分數以公式公開：0.40 x SASA + 0.40 x (1 - Aggrescan3D) + 0.20 x 正規化 pLDDT，其中信賴度只給一半權重，因為預測出的結構是關於構築體的證據，而不是構築體本身。驗證方面：115 項後端測試（113 項通過、2 項跳過）、91 項靜態資料層斷言，以及 58 項端到端流程斷言；靜態流程測試會以 HTTP 提供匯出目錄，再用前端自己的資料層讀取，將介面組裝出的序列與服務端樣本逐一殘基比對，若有任何讀取動作連上網路即判定失敗。資料規模：一張 367,717,240 列的各工具分數表，約 130 GB，另有第二條免疫原性路徑，涵蓋 131 個等位基因、約 1.475 億列。","software":"PeptiCraft is one of the very few 2026 iGEM software tools that is both live and candid about its own limits. Four things make it worth copying. First, the pipeline's own history is published as four versions with their failure modes, and the team says plainly that the version that succeeded was not a better implementation but a different arrangement of where each kind of judgement is allowed to happen. Version 1.1's hard filters removed 94% of an already-curated antioxidant peptide set on safety grounds alone. Version 1.2 ran end to end on 1,081,772 sequences in six and a half hours and its output exposed two composition errors found by inspecting the arithmetic of stored results rather than by any crash: safety attributes could be outvoted because small safety coefficients sat inside a weighted total alongside a strong activity term, and the antioxidant signal leaked past the channel split because the later ranking composite still carried an antioxidant term at the largest coefficient, which weakened the very comparison the dual channel existed to enable. A third error was found the same way: a construct-level composite assigned half the final weight turned out to have a spread of only 0.011 between its 25th and 75th percentiles across the top ninety, so at half weight it was ordering on noise, and it was removed. All three were fixed by changing the pipeline's structure rather than by adjusting coefficients. Second, every elimination is recorded with its cause, with discarded candidates written out rather than dropped along with the tool and score that removed them, which makes the funnel auditable after the fact and lets a rejection rate be stated per round. Third, the team re-evaluated the 18 predictive tools against their own library and reclassified what each can actually support: three can eliminate a candidate, two can rank, one ranks weakly. Fourth, the composition of the output is reported as a consequence rather than a choice: a 30-residue ceiling removes almost all of a full-length reference proteome (0.33% pass rate) and almost none of a metagenomic small-protein catalogue (3.07%), so 96.3% of the surviving pool is metagenomic and only 3.7% carries functional annotation, which the team notes means experimental evidence for these sequences is scarce and the output is a set of predictions. One planned reduction step was tested and abandoned and said so: clustering at 90% identity achieved only 0.2-5% reduction because short peptides are too diverse for identity clustering. The wet-lab comparison is reported with unusual statistical restraint: the developability composite's ordering of the three tested candidates matched the measured TEAC ordering exactly while the antioxidant predictor's ordering was nearly its reverse, and the team immediately points out that three candidates cannot support a rank-correlation statistic, that a chance match has probability one in six, that the composite scores span only 0.024, that adjacent TEAC differences are not individually significant, and that the agreement is therefore compatible with measurement error alone. They then state it as a hypothesis for future work rather than a finding: exposure may predict activity better than sequence score, because a peptide buried in the scaffold cannot reach what it reacts with.","software_zh":"PeptiCraft 是 2026 年 iGEM 少數既真正上線、又坦白說明自身限制的軟體工具之一。有四點值得借鏡。第一，流程本身的歷程以四個版本連同各自的失效模式公開，團隊直言成功的那個版本並不是實作得更好，而是重新安排了各類判斷被允許發生的位置。版本 1.1 的硬性篩選僅憑安全性理由，就剔除了一組已經人工整理過的抗氧化胜肽集合中的 94%。版本 1.2 在 1,081,772 條序列上端到端執行了 6.5 小時，其輸出暴露出兩個分數組成上的錯誤，而這兩個錯誤是靠檢視已存結果的算術、而非任何程式崩潰才被發現的：安全性屬性可能被壓過，因為較小的安全性係數與強勢的活性項同處於一個加權總和之中；抗氧化訊號也越過通道切分而外洩，因為後續的排序複合分數仍以最大係數帶著一個抗氧化項，這恰恰削弱了雙通道設計原本要促成的比較。第三個錯誤以同樣方式被找出：一個被賦予最終一半權重的構築體層級複合分數，在前九十名中第 25 與第 75 百分位之間的全距僅 0.011，因此在一半權重下它其實是在依雜訊排序，於是被移除。三者都是透過改變流程結構來修正，而非調整係數。第二，每一次淘汰都記錄原因，被捨棄的候選物會連同淘汰它的工具與分數一併寫出而非直接丟棄，使整個漏斗事後可被稽核，也讓每一輪都能給出淘汰率。第三，團隊以自己的序列庫重新評估 18 個預測工具，並重新界定各工具實際能支撐的用途：3 個可用來淘汰候選物、2 個可用來排序、1 個排序能力薄弱。第四，輸出的組成被當作後果而非選擇來報告：30 個殘基的上限幾乎剔除了整個全長參考蛋白質體（通過率 0.33%），卻幾乎沒有剔除總體基因體（metagenomic）小蛋白目錄（3.07%），因此存活下來的序列池中有 96.3% 來自總體基因體，只有 3.7% 帶有功能註釋；團隊指出這意味著這些序列的實驗證據稀少，而輸出的是一組預測。有一個原先規劃的縮減步驟經測試後放棄，並如實說明：以 90% 相同度進行叢集只縮減了 0.2-5%，因為短胜肽的多樣性過高，不適合用相同度叢集。濕實驗的比較以罕見的統計節制來報告：可開發性複合分數對三個受測候選物的排序與實測的 TEAC 排序完全一致，而抗氧化預測器的排序則幾乎完全相反；團隊隨即指出，三個候選物無法支撐任何等級相關統計量、隨機吻合的機率為六分之一、複合分數的全距僅 0.024、相鄰的 TEAC 差異各自並不顯著，因此這項一致性完全可能僅由測量誤差造成。接著他們把它表述為後續研究的假設而非結論：暴露程度對活性的預測力可能優於序列分數，因為埋在支架內部的胜肽無法接觸到它要反應的對象。","stack":["Cloudflare Pages (live deployment)","columnar database with checkpoint/resume","GPU-hosted predictive microservices","ToxinPred3","HemoPI2","MHCflurry","NetMHCIIpan","AlgPred2","BepiPred-3.0","AnOxPePred","SoDoPE","TemStaPro","OmegaFold / ESMFold","AlphaFold (cross-validation)","Aggrescan3D","SASA computation","iGEM GitLab"],"techniques":["hierarchical single-criterion filtering","hard safety vetoes with no compensation","winsorised-standard-deviation data-derived weighting","dual-channel (selected vs control) screening with matched negatives","cost-ordered pipeline scheduling","combinatorial linker and insertion-position enumeration","re-scoring solubility and thermal stability on the assembled fusion rather than the free peptide","relative solvent-accessible surface area of the functional region","aggregation-propensity indexing","pLDDT normalisation","independent second-model structure cross-validation","REML mixed-effects modelling with Dunnett comparisons","ABTS/TEAC radical-scavenging assay","upsert-keyed idempotent batch writes"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Science publicity followed one stated principle: start with a familiar question, explain the science, connect it back to PeptiCraft, and close with a question that invites reflection. Twelve distinct topics were covered across four entry points (skincare and peptides 4, protein engineering 4, AI-assisted biology 3, safety and responsibility 1), published through Instagram and Rednote, moving from 'what are peptides in skincare' and 'why can combining beneficial ingredients still create problems' through linkers, silk fibroin and skin-barrier delivery to whether AI can design biology. Two campus events pushed past explanation into argument: 'Beyond ChatGPT', co-run with the DKU AI Club, walked from transformers to AlphaFold, ESM/ESMFold and generative protein design with PeptiCraft as the case study, deliberately using it to explain why protein design is hard and why experimental validation remains necessary; and a bioethics debate with the DKU Debate Society on the motion that AI-designed cosmetic bioengineering should not get a free pass. A 'Campus Voices' video interviewed students as prospective users about whether they would use AI-designed skincare and what would make them trust or distrust it, and the team reports the split answer (interest in discovery alongside demands for stronger evidence) while explicitly stating these individual perspectives should not be treated as conclusions about wider public attitudes.","publicEngagement_zh":"科普推廣遵循一條明確原則：從一個熟悉的問題開始，說明科學，連回 PeptiCraft，最後以一個引發思考的問題收尾。內容涵蓋四個切入點、共 12 個主題（保養與胜肽 4、蛋白質工程 4、AI 輔助生物學 3、安全與責任 1），透過 Instagram 與小紅書發布，從「保養品裡的胜肽是什麼」、「為什麼把有益成分混在一起仍可能出問題」，一路談到連接子、絲蛋白與皮膚屏障遞送，再到 AI 能否設計生物。兩場校內活動從說明推進到論辯：與 DKU AI Club 合辦的「Beyond ChatGPT」從 transformer 講到 AlphaFold、ESM/ESMFold 與生成式蛋白質設計，並以 PeptiCraft 作為案例，刻意用它來說明為何蛋白質設計困難、為何實驗驗證仍屬必要；另一場是與 DKU Debate Society 合辦的生物倫理辯論，辯題為「AI 設計的美容生物工程不應被輕易放行」。一支名為「Campus Voices」的影片以潛在使用者的身分訪問學生，詢問他們是否會使用 AI 設計的保養品，以及什麼會讓他們信任或不信任它；團隊報告了意見分歧的結果（對新發現感興趣，同時要求更強的證據），並明確指出這些個別觀點不應被當作關於更廣泛公眾態度的結論。","ihp":"Ten exchange activities produced six specific, named design changes, including the entire cell-based assay programme and the rule that an application's immunogenicity threshold is set by barrier integrity, which is why the five application routes each carry their own threshold. Scientific exchanges ran with XJTLU, Synbiopunk x CCiC, the VIT Gathering and the SJTU-Software AI x Synthetic Biology Roundtable; the industry exchange was a company visit to Changzhou Taimeirui Biotechnology, which brought production, cost and translation into focus. The team contributed to the JLU-NBBMS Dry Lab Summer Course and to a collaborative handbook, 'Together with iGEM: Across Villages, From Myths to Facts'. The most unusual feature is the human practices page itself, which answers four questions about PeptiCraft and refuses to overclaim on any of them: its current role is early-stage research support and commercial advantage remains unproven; early feedback exposed an unclear link between tool outputs and recommendations, which prompted clearer workflow displays, score explanations and missing-assessment labels, but independent user testing is still needed to establish whether people interpret recommendations correctly; the Top1 ABTS result does not establish ranking accuracy, cellular protection or lower research costs; and the page states outright that the effects of all this engagement on understanding and adoption remain unmeasured.","ihp_zh":"十場交流活動帶來六項具體且指名的設計變更，包括整套細胞檢測計畫，以及「應用的免疫原性閾值由皮膚屏障完整性決定」這條規則，這也是五種應用途徑各有專屬閾值的原因。學術交流的對象包括 XJTLU、Synbiopunk x CCiC、VIT Gathering 以及 SJTU-Software 的 AI x 合成生物學圓桌；產業交流則是前往 Changzhou Taimeirui Biotechnology 的企業參訪，讓生產、成本與技術轉譯成為焦點。團隊參與了 JLU-NBBMS 的乾實驗暑期課程，並共同編寫手冊《Together with iGEM: Across Villages, From Myths to Facts》。最不尋常的是整合式人類實踐頁面本身：它回答關於 PeptiCraft 的四個問題，而且四個都拒絕誇大。工具目前的定位是早期研究輔助，商業優勢仍未獲證實；早期回饋暴露出工具輸出與建議之間的連結不清楚，因而促成更清楚的工作流程顯示、分數說明與「未評估」標示，但仍需獨立的使用者測試，才能確認人們是否正確解讀這些建議；Top1 的 ABTS 結果並不足以證明排序準確性、細胞保護效果或研究成本的降低；頁面也直接寫明，上述所有參與活動對理解與採用的影響仍未經測量。","realWorld":"The market case is sourced: a US$450bn global beauty industry in 2025 projected to US$590bn by 2030 at about 5% annual growth (McKinsey State of Beauty), collagen raw materials at US$1.41bn growing 11.0% CAGR 2020-2023 with Chinese retail collagen products at RMB 58.42bn growing 41.9% CAGR, and peptides already appearing in 17% of 88 sensitive-skin facial cosmetics in a Portuguese pharmacy sample. The project restricts itself explicitly to topical and cosmetic-material use, functional skincare and dressing products where activity is delivered by a material that stays where it is applied, and states that nothing in the work concerns systemic delivery. Silk fibroin was chosen partly because it already has an established recombinant E. coli expression route in the literature, which the team says makes the wet lab tractable rather than speculative. The team's own list of what practical application would still require is specific: reproducible software, verified sequence-to-result links, suitable prediction models, user testing, and for product translation consistent production, storage and formulation studies, application-specific function and safety evidence, cost assessment, and a clear regulatory pathway.","realWorld_zh":"市場論述附有來源：2025 年全球美容產業規模 4,500 億美元，預計以每年約 5% 的成長率於 2030 年達到 5,900 億美元（McKinsey State of Beauty）；膠原蛋白原料市場 14.1 億美元，2020-2023 年複合年成長率 11.0%，其中中國膠原蛋白零售產品達人民幣 584.2 億元，複合年成長率 41.9%；而在一項葡萄牙藥局的取樣中，88 款敏感肌臉部化妝品裡已有 17% 含有胜肽。專案明確將自身限制在外用與化妝品材料用途，也就是活性由停留在塗敷位置的材料所遞送的機能性保養與敷料產品，並聲明整個研究不涉及全身性遞送。選擇絲蛋白的原因之一，是文獻中已有成熟的 E. coli 重組表現路線，團隊表示這讓濕實驗變得可行而非空想。團隊自行列出的實際應用前提相當具體：可重現的軟體、經驗證的序列與結果對應關係、合適的預測模型、使用者測試；而要走到產品轉譯，還需要穩定一致的生產、儲存與配方研究、針對特定應用的功效與安全性證據、成本評估，以及清楚的法規路徑。","partners":["Changzhou Taimeirui Biotechnology","SJTU-Software","XJTLU-Software","JLU-NBBMS","TJUSLS_China","NJTECH-CHINA-A","Tsinghua-A","PekingHSC","HKUST (GZ)","DUT-China","JLU-SPH","JLU-FBH","JLU-CP","DKU AI Club","DKU Debate Society","Duke Kunshan University Innovation and Entrepreneurship","SnapGene (sponsor)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6064/wiki/project-20261020/image8.avif","caption":"PeptiCraft's library page safety panel, which resolves to four verdicts (clear, exceeded, borderline, not assessed) so an unmeasured gate can never be read as a passed one.","caption_zh":"PeptiCraft 序列庫頁面的安全性面板，給出四種判定（通過、超標、臨界、未評估），使未經測量的關卡絕不會被誤讀為已通過。","credit":"Team DKU, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6064/wiki/project-20261020/image4.avif","caption":"The screening funnel: 849 million published sequences scanned down to 19.9 million short-peptide candidates, with per-source pass rates showing why 96.3% of the pool is metagenomic.","caption_zh":"篩選漏斗：從 8.49 億條已發表序列掃描縮減至 1,990 萬個短胜肽候選物，各資料來源的通過率說明了為何序列池中有 96.3% 來自總體基因體。","credit":"Team DKU, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6064/wiki/project-20261020/image5.avif","caption":"Combined Trolox Equivalent Antioxidant Capacity with Dunnett annotations across four independent experiments: Top1 at 0.375 against the scaffold control's 0.195 mmol TE/g.","caption_zh":"四次獨立實驗合併後的 Trolox 當量抗氧化能力與 Dunnett 標註：Top1 為 0.375，支架對照為 0.195 mmol TE/g。","credit":"Team DKU, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6064/wiki/project-20261020/image10.avif","caption":"Baseline-corrected protection ratios in HaCaT cells under oxidative stress, where no construct showed significant protection.","caption_zh":"氧化壓力下 HaCaT 細胞經基線校正的保護比值，其中沒有任何構築體顯示出顯著的保護效果。","credit":"Team DKU, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Carry a deliberately unpromising control channel through the identical pipeline, so the screen's central assumption can be refuted at the bench rather than merely presented, and make safety a non-compensable veto that no activity score can outvote. Equally transferable is their reporting of a positive result: when the composite's ordering matched the measured ordering of three candidates, they computed that a chance match has probability one in six and labelled the agreement compatible with measurement error, then restated it as a hypothesis instead of a finding.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"刻意讓一條預期表現不佳的對照通道走完完全相同的流程，使篩選的核心假設能在實驗桌上被反駁，而不只是被陳述；並把安全性設為不可補償的否決條件，任何活性分數都無法推翻它。同樣值得借鏡的是他們報告正向結果的方式：當複合分數對三個候選物的排序與實測排序一致時，他們算出隨機吻合的機率為六分之一，將這項一致性標示為與測量誤差相容，再把它重新表述為假設而非結論。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/dku/","https://2026.igem.wiki/dku/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/dku/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/dku/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/dku/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/dku/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/dku/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/dku/social-engagement","https://2026.igem.wiki/dku/education","https://pepticraft.pages.dev/","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/dku/pepticraft-2"],"awards_zh":["最佳軟體與 AI專案 — 入圍"],"rank":7},"6072":{"team":"GEMS-Taiwan","id":"6072","section":"High School","country":"Taiwan","village":"Space, Foundational Advance, Software & AI, Biomanufacturing","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/","projectTitle":"ReLEAF","projectTitle_zh":"ReLEAF","tagline":"A stress-responsive optogenetic bioreactor that predicts crop stress from field sensors and forecasts, then uses green light to make plant-protective proteins on the farm.","tagline_zh":"一套逆境響應式的光遺傳學生物反應器：先由田間感測器與氣象預報推估作物逆境，再以綠光在農場端生產保護植物的蛋白質。","summary":"ReLEAF closes a loop: field sensors and weather forecasts feed a stress-index model, the model sets a green-light dose, green light drives the cyanobacterial CcaSR two-component system in Bacillus subtilis WB800, and the cells secrete ACC deaminase into a hollow-fiber perfusion bioreactor that lets protein out and keeps cells in. The unit is about 40 x 24 x 62 cm, designed to stand beside a Taiwanese smallholder paddy where the average agricultural manager is 63.8 years old and precision agriculture is otherwise out of reach. It swept the high-school technical awards (Measurement, Hardware, Integrated Human Practices) largely on provenance discipline: four self-built devices with release build manuals, a digital twin that caught a failing photometer 26.7 hours before it died, a pre-registered growth forecast scored against a later run, and an input ledger that marks every number as measured, cited or modelled. Its distinguishing quality is honesty — the wiki repeatedly withdraws its own claims, and that is also where its dry-lab weaknesses are visible.","summary_zh":"ReLEAF 把整件事做成一個閉環：田間感測器與氣象預報餵給逆境指數模型，模型決定綠光劑量，綠光驅動 Bacillus subtilis WB800 中來自藍綠菌的 CcaSR 雙組分系統，菌體再把 ACC deaminase 分泌到中空纖維灌流式生物反應器裡——蛋白質可以出去，菌留在裡面。整台機器約 40 x 24 x 62 cm，設計上就是要擺在台灣小農的稻田旁；台灣農業經營者平均年齡 63.8 歲，精準農業對他們本來遙不可及。這個專案幾乎囊括高中組的技術類獎項（Measurement、Hardware、Integrated Human Practices），主要靠的是來源標註的紀律：四台自製裝置都附有釋出版組裝手冊；數位孿生在光度計徹底失效前 26.7 小時就抓到它正在壞；一份預先登錄的生長預測被後來的實驗實際評分；還有一份輸入明細帳，把每個數字標明是自己量的、引用的，還是模型算的。它最特別的品質是誠實——wiki 一再撤回自己先前的主張，而這也正是乾實驗弱點看得見的地方。","awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best Measurement — Winner (High School)","Best Hardware — Winner (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Winner (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Space / Foundational Advance / Software & AI / Biomanufacturing)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Four strands. (1) A fitted crop-stress index: rather than weighting temperature, water and light by expert judgement, they fitted weights to Taiwan's own harvest record — 25 years of county rice yields from the Agriculture and Food Agency against ERA5 daily reanalysis weather (2001-2025), treating a season below the county trend as a stressed season, and exhaustively scoring all 2^15 - 1 = 32,767 combinations of fifteen candidate stress terms on held-out years. First and second rice crops were fitted separately; the second crop pays for wind, light and badly timed water, and heat adds nothing once those three are in — which the wiki notes undercuts the wet lab's heat programme. County error over 2016-2025 was 365 kg/ha against 419 for a plain trend line (32% error reduction on the second crop). A genuinely prospective test was frozen on 26 September 2026 before any county published; four of sixteen counties reported at 7.9% error against the trend's 8.8%, which the team correctly calls too few to establish performance. (2) Protein design (the GRAFT methodology: Generate, Restraints, Assembly, Flex, Triage) selected and shaped three protectants before any cloning — BoPEP4 (a 23-aa Brassica oleracea plant elicitor peptide docked against the PEPR1 receptor and run as nine all-atom MD trajectories), LEA14 (151-aa late embryogenesis abundant protein, five N-His constructs including a borrowed K-segment membrane-binding motif joined by a GGGGS linker), and ACC deaminase. The standout findings are negative and caught in time: a C-terminal 6xHis purification tag that every earlier check had approved was shown in simulation to cap the chemical group forming the peptide's strongest receptor contact, so the tag moved to the N-terminus; an Asn23 clamp was found to be five contacts rather than one salt bridge; a truncation ladder identified 9-23 as the production length (33% less mass) with the grip holding 98.5% of frames for 7-23 against 77.1% for the next rung down; and an AlphaFold confidence gate set before the result came back was failed for LEA14 with its partner, so by prior agreement no structure was handed on. For ACC deaminase no mutant was ordered at all, because the modelling said the enzyme meets far less substrate than it could handle and the largest available gain is a change to the medium (apoplast pH 5.5, where the Glu12-His227 contact holds in 99.9% of frames). (3) A reactor digital twin: an autoencoder trained on the healthy first 120 hours of a 434-hour run, scoring a sensor axis (the reference beam, which never passes through the culture) separately from a process axis (specific growth rate), so it can distinguish a culture event from a failing instrument; plus a Kalman-filter batch forecaster and a logistic growth prior fitted from the light plate. (4) Dose and fleet models: an arithmetic ledger from millilitres on a petri dish to US dollars per hectare, and a payback curve plotted across the whole efficacy axis.","frameworks_zh":"共四條線。(1) 擬合出來的作物逆境指數：他們沒有憑專家判斷去給溫度、水分與光照配權重，而是拿台灣自己的收穫紀錄來擬合——農糧署 25 年的各縣市稻作產量，對上 ERA5 逐日再分析氣象資料（2001-2025），把低於縣市趨勢的期作視為逆境期作，並在保留年份上窮舉評分十五個候選逆境項的全部 2^15 - 1 = 32,767 種組合。一期與二期稻作分別擬合；二期要付的代價是風、光與時機不對的水分，而這三項進去之後，熱逆境再加也沒有貢獻——wiki 自己指出，這一點削弱了濕實驗的熱逆境主軸。2016-2025 年的縣市誤差為 365 kg/ha，單純趨勢線則是 419（二期稻作誤差降低 32%）。真正前瞻性的檢驗在 2026 年 9 月 26 日、任何縣市公布數據之前就封存；十六個縣市中有四個已回報，誤差 7.9%，趨勢線為 8.8%，團隊也正確地說這太少，還不足以確立效能。(2) 蛋白質設計（GRAFT 方法論：Generate、Restraints、Assembly、Flex、Triage）在任何選殖之前就先選定並調整了三種保護蛋白——BoPEP4（23 個胺基酸的 Brassica oleracea 植物誘導胜肽，與 PEPR1 受體進行分子對接，並跑了九條全原子分子動力學軌跡）、LEA14（151 個胺基酸的晚期胚胎發育豐富蛋白，五種 N 端 His 構築體，其中一個借用了 K-segment 膜結合模體，以 GGGGS 連接子接上）與 ACC deaminase。最突出的發現都是負面的，而且及時被攔下來：一個先前每道檢查都放行的 C 端 6xHis 純化標籤，在模擬中被證明會蓋住形成該胜肽最強受體接觸的化學基團，於是標籤改到 N 端；Asn23 的夾持被發現是五個接觸，而不是一個鹽橋；截短系列指出 9-23 是生產用長度（質量少 33%），其中 7-23 的夾持在 98.5% 的幀中維持，再短一階則只有 77.1%；而一道在結果出來之前就設好的 AlphaFold 信心門檻，LEA14 與其夥伴蛋白並未通過，於是依先前的約定，沒有任何結構被往下傳。至於 ACC deaminase，一個突變體都沒有訂，因為模型顯示這個酵素實際遇到的受質遠少於它處理得來的量，而可取得的最大增益是改變環境介質（質外體 pH 5.5，此時 Glu12-His227 接觸在 99.9% 的幀中維持）。(3) 反應器數位孿生：用一次 434 小時實驗中健康的前 120 小時訓練自編碼器，並把感測軸（參考光束，從不穿過培養液）與製程軸（比生長速率）分開評分，因此能區分是培養事件還是儀器故障；另有 Kalman 濾波器批次預測器，以及由光照板擬合出的 logistic 成長先驗。(4) 劑量與機隊模型：一條從培養皿上的毫升數一路算到每公頃美元的算術帳，以及一條畫滿整個效力軸的回收期曲線。","dataviz":"The wiki's signature device is provenance colour-coding. The M4 dose ledger is drawn as a single top-to-bottom chain from 1.67 mL on a 10 cm plate to US$3800 capital per hectare, with a rail down the left that is green while every row still rests on a measurement and turns amber at the rice canopy correction, so a reader can see exactly where measurement stops and modelling begins; rows below inherit the model and two add assumptions of their own. Every model input is tabulated with a provenance column (seven from their own bench, four public records, two published constants, one from Geospatial Analysis, one neither measured nor cited), and the five assumptions get a table of 'what rests on it' and 'what would overturn it'. A timing diagram overlays the three-day Central Weather Administration forecast horizon, the three arrival arms the plant team ran, and the 5.4-day reactor lead time on a days-from-stress axis to show visually that they do not fit. The three disagreeing timing runs are shown side by side with the third panel re-reading the middle panel's own tubes as total chlorophyll instead of per gram, so the ranking visibly reverses — the figure argues against the team's own earlier claim. Decay figures plot both candidate interpretations through the same 28-hour reading and label the 22-fold divergence ('What one endpoint cannot say'). The payback plot marks their own 68-years-at-efficacy-1 point and Geospatial Analysis's 4.9-year estimate on the same axis and names the disagreement rather than hiding it. The digital twin UI itself puts optical density, pH, four pressure traces and the pump and valve controls on one screen; the description page opens with an interactive seven-block system map and a GIS choropleth of county nighttime temperature with circles scaled by rice yield trend.","dataviz_zh":"這個 wiki 的標誌性手法是用顏色標示資料來源。M4 劑量帳被畫成一條自上而下的單一鏈條，從 10 cm 培養皿上的 1.67 mL 一路到每公頃 US$3800 的資本支出，左側有一條軌道：只要每一列仍站在量測之上就是綠色，到了稻作冠層校正那一列轉為琥珀色，讀者因此能清楚看見量測在哪裡結束、模型從哪裡開始；下方各列繼承這個模型，其中兩列還各自加上自己的假設。每一項模型輸入都列表標註來源欄（七項出自自己的實驗桌、四項公開紀錄、兩項已發表常數、一項來自 Geospatial Analysis、一項既沒量也沒引用），五條假設則各有一張「什麼建立在它之上」與「什麼會推翻它」的表。一張時序圖把中央氣象署三天的預報時程、植物組跑的三條到達時間臂，以及 5.4 天的反應器前置時間疊在同一條「距逆境天數」軸上，用看的就知道它們對不起來。三次互相矛盾的時序實驗並排呈現，第三格把第二格自己的管子改以總葉綠素而非每克葉綠素重新解讀，排序因此明顯翻轉——這張圖是在反駁團隊自己先前的主張。衰減圖把兩種可能的解讀都畫過同一個 28 小時讀值，並標出 22 倍的分歧（「單一端點說不出的事」）。回收期圖把自己算出的「效力為 1 時 68 年」那一點，和 Geospatial Analysis 的 4.9 年估計放在同一條軸上，並直接點名這個分歧，而不是藏起來。數位孿生介面本身把光密度、pH、四路壓力曲線以及泵與閥的控制放在同一個畫面；專案描述頁一開頭就是一張七區塊的互動系統圖，以及一張以縣市夜間溫度著色、圓圈大小依稻作產量趨勢縮放的 GIS 分級著色圖。","datascience":"Three practices lift this above typical high-school dry lab. First, pre-registration: on 1 October, before any WB800 bioreactor run, they registered a specific growth rate of 0.2986 h^-1 with a 90% interval of 0.2705-0.3300, a logistic curve shape with an NRMSE pass threshold of 15%, and inoculum-conditional times to OD 0.5, together with stated pass criteria. Run 6 gave 0.286 +/- 0.010 h^-1 (R2 0.978), inside the interval; the curve-shape endpoint was recorded as not scored because the prior misses the first seven hours by 30% and the run passes the prior's ceiling before hour 7. Run 7 was explicitly excluded from scoring because its three-hour lag has no term in the registered logistic and its fitted rate swings 0.16-0.46 h^-1 with the window choice. Second, anomaly detection with a diagnostic split: the autoencoder flagged the photometer at 216.3 h, 26.7 h before the OD channel failed at 243.0 h, and the window table shows the sensor axis at 100% alarms with the process axis at 0% during the drift — the model names which subsystem is broken, not just that something is. Third, forecast benchmarking against persistence rather than against nothing: the Kalman filter beat a no-change baseline by 41% at 2 h on the September run and by 24% at 8 and 12 h on run 7, with global-linear, exponential and local-linear alternatives reported as losers and the honest caveat that most of the run is above the photometer's linear range so the model forecasts the reading, not biomass. Other measurement work: the in-line photometer tracks a benchtop BioDrop with slope 1.018 (R2 0.995) to OD 1.2 across 45 paired TiO2 points and an iGEM silica protocol run in 2.5 mg steps, with a dilute-and-restore test returning within 0.2%; wall shear computed from pressure sensors and from the flow meter agree to 2.8%, so each sensor checks the other; and leaf-sensor bench characterisation found a +0.47 to +1.71 degC site-dependent offset against the air reference across 540 paired readings, with the conclusion stated that a 1.2-1.9 degC bias can hide or invent the very water-stress signal the twin would act on. Honest dry-lab weaknesses, stated by the team: a secreted-activity figure of 7.25 mU/mL at n = 1 and below quantitation; two induction runs that disagree on the sign of activity change over hours; the published CcaSR Hill curve (Castillo-Hair et al. 2019) assumed valid at 20 L when every induction was run at a single light intensity, so nothing tests it; a rice canopy correction of x2.44 that is modelled, not measured, and spans 1.68-3.52; a minimum effective dose that is unknown because the spray experiment varied salt and timing but never the applied amount; a withdrawn efficacy coefficient of 0.58; and only 17 of 25 modelled seasons ever crossing the trigger, so a ten-unit fleet runs on 4.3% of the calendar.","datascience_zh":"有三項做法讓這份乾實驗明顯高於一般高中水準。第一是預先登錄：10 月 1 日、在任何 WB800 生物反應器實驗之前，他們就登錄了比生長速率 0.2986 h^-1、90% 區間 0.2705-0.3300、logistic 曲線形狀與 15% 的 NRMSE 通過門檻，以及依接種量而定的到 OD 0.5 時間，並寫明通過標準。第 6 次實驗得到 0.286 +/- 0.010 h^-1（R2 0.978），落在區間內；曲線形狀這個端點被記為未評分，因為先驗在前七小時低估了 30%，而實驗在第 7 小時之前就超過先驗的上限。第 7 次實驗被明確排除在評分之外，因為它三小時的遲滯期在登錄的 logistic 模型裡沒有對應項，而擬合速率會隨視窗選擇在 0.16-0.46 h^-1 之間擺動。第二是帶診斷切分的異常偵測：自編碼器在 216.3 小時就標記光度計異常，比 OD 通道在 243.0 小時失效早了 26.7 小時，而視窗表顯示漂移期間感測軸是 100% 警報、製程軸是 0%——這個模型指出的是哪個子系統壞了，而不只是「有東西不對」。第三是預測要和持續性基線比，而不是不比：Kalman 濾波器在 9 月那次實驗的 2 小時預測比不變基線好 41%，在第 7 次實驗的 8 與 12 小時預測好 24%，全域線性、指數與局部線性等替代方案都被列為落敗者，並誠實加註：實驗大部分時間都在光度計的線性範圍之上，所以模型預測的是讀值，不是生物量。其他量測工作：線上光度計與桌上型 BioDrop 在 OD 1.2 以內的對應斜率為 1.018（R2 0.995），依據 45 組配對 TiO2 點與一份以 2.5 mg 為階的 iGEM 二氧化矽協議，稀釋後再回復的測試誤差落在 0.2% 之內；由壓力感測器與流量計分別算出的管壁剪應力一致到 2.8%，兩個感測器互為查核；葉面感測器的實驗桌特性化在 540 組配對讀值中發現，相對於空氣參考值有 +0.47 到 +1.71 degC、隨位置而異的偏移，並明白寫出結論：1.2-1.9 degC 的偏差足以隱藏或憑空製造出數位孿生要據以行動的那個水分逆境訊號。團隊自己列出的乾實驗弱點：分泌活性 7.25 mU/mL 只有 n = 1，而且低於定量極限；兩次誘導實驗對活性在數小時內變化的正負號彼此矛盾；已發表的 CcaSR Hill 曲線（Castillo-Hair 等人，2019）被假設在 20 L 規模仍成立，但每次誘導都只跑單一光強度，所以根本沒有東西在檢驗它；稻作冠層校正係數 x2.44 是模型算的、不是量的，範圍落在 1.68-3.52；最低有效劑量未知，因為噴施實驗變動了鹽度與時機，卻從未變動施用量；一個已撤回的效力係數 0.58；以及 25 個模擬期作中只有 17 個曾越過啟動門檻，所以十台機組的機隊一年只運作 4.3% 的日子。","software":"The digital twin is released MIT-licensed at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/gems-taiwan/digital-twin. It reads live OD600, pH, four pressure channels and turbine flow from the reactor loop, drives a pinch valve and four Luer valves, runs the autoencoder sensor alarm and the Kalman batch forecast, computes lumen pressure drop, transmembrane pressure and a fouling ratio through a hydraulic model, and applies the BLASTAM leaf-blast infection rule (a wet period counts when the leaf stays wet at least 10 hours at a mean of 22-25 degC, no infection below 15 or above 25 degC, past hours from the sensor and future hours estimated as wet at 90% relative humidity) to tell a grower to look for lesions five to ten days later. The team is clear about what is not wired up: green-light induction is tested but not integrated, dissolved-oxygen calibration did not hold, the protectant amount cannot be read in-line and comes from hand-drawn ELISA and DNPH samples, and every model so far has run on recorded data after a run with a person making every decision — so it is honestly a digital shadow moving toward a twin. Four open hardware devices ship with build manuals and print files: the hollow-fiber perfusion bioreactor (10-page assembly guide, 17-page brochure, 16-page user manual), a Pro and a Slim in-line photometer (12- and 13-page guides), and a 24-tube dual-wavelength light plate apparatus (10-page guide), plus a floating hydroponics plate with 13 seed positions, a 6.5 MB hardware notebook covering 23 March to 17 October 2026, and an LLM-assisted QGIS geospatial workflow over 346 farming townships with the data-preparation prompt published. Also contributed: 35 Registry parts in five SubtiToolKit Golden Gate modules, a 15-page plant protocol, a twentyfold scale-down of the ACC deaminase DNPH activity assay onto a 96-well plate, and waste-media protocols (hay, okara and sugarcane extracts benchmarked against LB).","software_zh":"數位孿生以 MIT 授權釋出於 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/gems-taiwan/digital-twin。它讀取反應器迴路的即時 OD600、pH、四路壓力通道與渦輪流量，驅動一個夾管閥與四個 Luer 閥，執行自編碼器感測警報與 Kalman 批次預測，透過水力模型計算管腔壓降、跨膜壓與積垢比，並套用 BLASTAM 稻熱病感染規則（葉面在平均 22-25 degC 下保持潤濕至少 10 小時才算一個濕潤期，低於 15 degC 或高於 25 degC 不發生感染，過去的時數取自感測器，未來的時數則在相對濕度 90% 時估為潤濕），以提醒農民在五到十天後去找病斑。團隊很清楚講出哪些還沒接起來：綠光誘導測過但尚未整合、溶氧校正撐不住、保護蛋白的量無法線上讀取而要靠人工取樣的 ELISA 與 DNPH、而且到目前為止每個模型都是在實驗結束後跑錄下來的資料、每個決策都由人做——所以老實說它是一個正朝數位孿生前進的「數位影子」。四台開源硬體裝置都附組裝手冊與列印檔：中空纖維灌流式生物反應器（10 頁組裝指南、17 頁產品說明、16 頁使用手冊）、Pro 與 Slim 兩款線上光度計（12 頁與 13 頁指南），以及 24 管雙波長光照板裝置（10 頁指南），另有一塊 13 個種子位的浮動水耕板、一份涵蓋 2026 年 3 月 23 日至 10 月 17 日的 6.5 MB 硬體筆記本，以及一套以 LLM 輔助、涵蓋 346 個農業鄉鎮的 QGIS 地理空間工作流程，連資料整備用的提示詞都公開。其他貢獻還包括：五個 SubtiToolKit Golden Gate 模組共 35 個 Registry 元件、一份 15 頁的植物實驗協議、把 ACC deaminase 的 DNPH 活性分析縮小二十倍搬到 96 孔盤，以及廢棄培養基協議（乾草、豆渣與甘蔗萃取液，以 LB 為對照基準）。","stack":["Python","autoencoder (anomaly detection)","Kalman filter","logistic growth fitting","exhaustive subset selection over 2^15 feature combinations","ERA5 reanalysis","QGIS","LLM-assisted GIS data preparation","AlphaFold (with pre-set confidence gate)","molecular docking","all-atom molecular dynamics","Arduino / ESP32","SHT31 air sensor","SN-3001-YM-N01 leaf sensor","Modbus RTU over RS485","I2C","BLASTAM leaf blast model","Hill function inversion (CcaSR transfer function)","MAD-based outlier filtering","GitLab (iGEM), MIT licence"],"techniques":["pre-registered prediction with stated pass criteria, scored after the fact","provenance ledger marking every input measured / cited / modelled","assumption register with falsification conditions","held-out and prospective (frozen-forecast) validation","forecast benchmarking against a persistence baseline","two-axis autoencoder separating sensor fault from process event","in-line photometer cross-calibration against a benchtop spectrophotometer (TiO2 and SiO2 standards)","dilute-and-restore proportionality test","redundant sensing (wall shear from pressure vs from flow)","anti-His ELISA and DNPH colorimetric activity assay","sensitivity analysis showing the activity term cancels out of the capital result","explicit withdrawal of an unsupported efficacy coefficient","payback plotted across the full efficacy axis instead of a point estimate"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"140 students across 5 schools in tiered lessons for elementary, junior high and high school audiences, with pre- and post-Kahoot surveys per cohort and the results published as per-question accuracy charts — including the failures, such as DNA base pairing where only 30% of students answered correctly. Everything is released on a dedicated education website: three lesson plans, three slide decks, two card games, two online games and a plant stress simulator (CropShield), free to download, with the stated aim of making the lessons work without the team in the room. Hands-on activities included plant stress experiments, planter making, an ATCG card game and vocabulary work. The team also edited its own claims down for honesty — a visible wiki comment records removing a '49-point' improvement claim and a 'standard teaching methods' comparison, and correcting a student count from 144 to 140. Separately, a Taiwan-specific engagement channel: a LINE official account called 'Nong You Zhu Shou' (Farmer's Assistant) with six functions — latest news, product introduction, crop stress alerts, a crop assistant AI chatbot keyed to terms like salinity, heat stress and pests, a Farmer's Diary where users post weather, crop photos, soil moisture and pest conditions and earn tokens redeemable for LINE stickers, and a Google Form feedback loop — built because interviews at the Farmer Expo and with Ms. Chen Hui-Wen showed smallholders could not reach the information that already exists online. A public event at Taipei Water Garden Organic Farmers' Market on 5 September 2026 (Taiwan Coffee x Cocoa Gelato Festival) drew over 400 visitors with over 200 registered participants, running a forum, booth activities including a data-physicalisation installation and a ring toss, and a plant stress event.","publicEngagement_zh":"5 所學校、140 位學生，課程按國小、國中與高中分層設計，每個群組都做課前與課後 Kahoot 問卷，結果以逐題正確率圖表公開——包括失敗的部分，例如 DNA 鹼基配對只有 30% 的學生答對。所有材料都放在專門的教育網站上免費下載：三份教案、三份簡報、兩款卡牌遊戲、兩款線上遊戲與一個植物逆境模擬器（CropShield），目標明確寫著要讓這些課程在團隊不在現場時也能運作。實作活動包括植物逆境實驗、做盆器、ATCG 卡牌遊戲與單字練習。團隊也為了誠實而修掉自己的說法——wiki 上留有一則可見的註記，記錄刪去「進步 49 分」的主張與和「標準教學法」的比較，並把學生人數從 144 更正為 140。另外還有一條台灣特有的互動管道：一個名為「農友助手」的 LINE 官方帳號，共六項功能——最新消息、產品介紹、作物逆境警示、以鹽害、熱逆境與蟲害等關鍵詞觸發的作物小幫手 AI 聊天機器人、使用者可張貼天氣、作物照片、土壤含水量與蟲害狀況並賺取可兌換 LINE 貼圖的點數的「農友日誌」，以及一條 Google 表單回饋迴路——會做這個，是因為在農業博覽會以及與陳慧文女士的訪談中發現，小農根本接觸不到網路上早就存在的資訊。2026 年 9 月 5 日在台北水花園有機農夫市集辦的公開活動（台灣咖啡 x 可可冰淇淋節）吸引超過 400 位到訪者、超過 200 位報名參與者，內容有一場論壇、含資料實體化裝置與套圈圈的攤位活動，以及一場植物逆境活動。","ihp":"31 stakeholders over seven months, structured as a project evolution map in four stages with named dates, plus four thematic expert pipelines (deployment, protectant design, plant and stress biology, bioreactor and hardware) and continuous engagement with five core experts. The decisive change came at the very start: the original design released engineered Bacillus subtilis into the soil with a DesK-DesR system reading temperature directly. Prof. Chen Wen-Liang (10 April) and bioprocess experts said two things were wrong — the bacteria could not be contained, and biological sensing was neither precise nor controllable enough — so sensing moved out of the cell into electronic sensors and an AIoT model, and a hollow-fiber perfusion bioreactor was built to hold the bacteria in while letting the protectants out. That one conversation produced the entire architecture. Other changes with a clear before/after: Dr. Paul Verslues (Academia Sinica, 3 April) argued that supplying pure proline is inefficient and risks suppressing the plant's own P5CS1 biosynthesis and proline-redox balance, so they abandoned proline delivery for a plant-regulation framework using bacterial signals and precursors, shifted from stress recovery to early detection, and re-scored outcomes on root growth and biomass. Dr. Elizabeth Sattely (Stanford, 27 June) told them their proof of concept was too broad and to do one stress very well instead of many superficially, and to look at peptides — which is why BoPEP4 entered the panel and why plant testing narrowed to heat and salinity. CH Biotech (9 July) pushed them toward computational screening to optimise protectants, comparison of root irrigation vs foliar vs drone spray, production cost per area, and Taiwanese regulatory research before acting. Prof. Huang Chieh-Chen (NCHU, 28 July and 6 August) moved the reactor from continuous to periodic operation, raised seedling-stage application, warned that excessive protectant concentrations harm plants so thresholds must be validated, and supplied the B. subtilis WB800 strain the project now runs on. Prof. Cheng Mei-Chun (28 August) found that inconsistent plant ages and treatment conditions meant earlier results may have reflected unintended stress rather than treatment, and the protocols were standardised in response. Yes Health iFarm (11 August) prompted reconsidering the 8/16 light cycle for 12/12, adding DO and OD to parameter planning, switching from pure oxygen to gentle aeration, and minimising transplants because transplantation itself is a stressor. Most interesting is the natural-farming thread: at a public forum co-hosted with Green Media on 5 September, Dr. Li Hsu-Ying and Ms. Chen argued that a plant protected from every stress never builds tolerance — 'raising a crop is like raising a child'. Rather than dismiss it, the team made that the specification for M1: the reactor should fire only when a threshold that genuinely reflects crop condition is crossed, which is why the 32% error reduction matters as evidence for a release rule rather than as a number. A farmer at the same forum asked whether the system breaks organic certification; the team researched the regulations and concluded it cannot be used on organic farms, then interviewed Mr. Chen Ke-Wei of the Lanyang River Friendly Farming Production Cooperative to work out what that means commercially. The project's origin question came from Ghanaian farmers via Gilbert Nkpeniyeng of Ubuntu Social Enterprise Ghana (1 February).","ihp_zh":"七個月內 31 位利害關係人，整理成一張分四階段、標明日期的專案演進圖，另有四條主題式專家管道（佈署、保護蛋白設計、植物與逆境生物學、生物反應器與硬體），並與五位核心專家持續往來。決定性的轉變發生在最開頭：最初的設計是把工程改造的 Bacillus subtilis 釋放到土壤裡，用 DesK-DesR 系統直接感測溫度。Chen Wen-Liang 教授（4 月 10 日）與生物製程專家指出兩件事錯了——細菌無法被圍堵，而生物式感測既不夠精準也不夠可控——於是感測從細胞內搬到體外的電子感測器與 AIoT 模型，並做出中空纖維灌流式生物反應器，把細菌留住、讓保護蛋白出去。那一場對話就決定了整個架構。其他有清楚前後對照的改變：Dr. Paul Verslues（中央研究院，4 月 3 日）指出直接供給純脯胺酸效率不佳，還可能抑制植物自身的 P5CS1 生合成與脯胺酸氧化還原平衡，於是他們放棄遞送脯胺酸，改採以細菌訊號與前驅物調節植物的架構，從逆境復原轉向早期偵測，並把成果指標改以根部生長與生物量重新評分。Dr. Elizabeth Sattely（Stanford，6 月 27 日）告訴他們概念驗證鋪得太廣，應該把一種逆境做得很好，而不是多種都做得很淺，並建議去看胜肽——這就是 BoPEP4 進入候選名單、植物測試收斂到熱逆境與鹽害的原因。CH Biotech（7 月 9 日）推動他們用計算篩選來最佳化保護蛋白、比較根部灌注、葉面噴施與無人機噴灑、計算每單位面積的生產成本，並在行動前先做台灣的法規研究。Huang Chieh-Chen 教授（中興大學，7 月 28 日與 8 月 6 日）把反應器從連續操作改為週期操作、提出在苗期施用、警告保護蛋白濃度過高會傷害植物因此門檻必須驗證，並提供了這個專案現在使用的 B. subtilis WB800 菌株。Cheng Mei-Chun 教授（8 月 28 日）發現植株年齡與處理條件不一致，意味著早期結果反映的可能是非預期的逆境而不是處理效果，團隊因此標準化了實驗協議。Yes Health iFarm（8 月 11 日）促使他們重新考慮把 8/16 光週期改為 12/12、把溶氧與 OD 納入參數規劃、從純氧改為溫和通氣，並盡量減少移植，因為移植本身就是一種逆境。最有意思的是自然農法這條線：9 月 5 日與 Green Media 共同主辦的公開論壇上，Dr. Li Hsu-Ying 與陳女士主張，一株被保護到完全沒有逆境的植物永遠建立不起耐受性——「養作物就像養小孩」。團隊沒有打發掉這個意見，而是把它變成 M1 的規格：反應器只有在一個真正反映作物狀態的門檻被跨越時才該啟動，這也正是那 32% 誤差降低之所以重要的原因——它是釋放規則的證據，而不只是一個數字。同一場論壇上有位農民問這套系統會不會破壞有機認證；團隊去查了法規，結論是它不能用在有機農場，接著訪談蘭陽溪友善耕作生產合作社的 Chen Ke-Wei 先生，釐清這在商業上意味著什麼。這個專案最初的問題，來自迦納農民，經由 Ubuntu Social Enterprise Ghana 的 Gilbert Nkpeniyeng 轉達（2 月 1 日）。","realWorld":"Positioned as a social enterprise with the vision 'every farmer is a biomanufacturer', deployed through farmer collectives and pilot cooperatives rather than direct sales, because the fleet analysis shows a reactor owned by a single farm is idle most of the season. The MVP is costed component by component: current bioreactor US$2280, leaf humidity sensor US$125, a drop-in sealed bacteria cartridge US$90 that opens automatically once seated so no one handles an open culture, and a Field Console mobile app; capital works out at about US$3800 per hectare before refills, service or labour. The regulatory target is contained-use answers in Taiwan by October 2027, and the team worked the pathway with Director Wu Tzu-Hsien (12 October), who pointed out their cost model was missing factory, labour, bacterial cultivation and waste-management costs, and with Prof. Chang Hung-Hao (31 August), who told them to narrow the initial application to a specific stress and crop. A conversation with Bioeconomy Corporation at BIO Asia-Taiwan redirected expansion research toward Southeast Asia, where agricultural sectors are large and GMO rules looser than the US or EU. Smart Agriweek Taiwan identified young farmers as the realistic early adopters and flagged that older farmers need a separate persuasion route. SWOT and PESTLE analyses name the real threats plainly: unclear regulation for cell-free agricultural biologics that may fall between biological pesticide and synthetic-biology-derived compound; protectant washing away; biofouling reducing yield; and the fact that only 3.47% of Taiwan's farmland was organic or eco-friendly by 2024, which both bounds and shapes the market. The payback analysis is the most commercially honest thing on the wiki: on their own loss figure of US$138 per hectare per crop, no point on the efficacy axis returns the capital on a useful horizon — 68 years even at perfect efficacy — while Geospatial Analysis reaches 4.9 years from a net benefit of US$1931 per crop, and the team states that the two do not yet price the same hectare rather than quietly adopting the favourable number. Deliverables include an 85-page business plan, a farmer-friendly user manual, and the three bioreactor documents.","realWorld_zh":"定位是社會企業，願景為「讓每一位農民都是生物製造者」，透過農民團體與試點合作社佈署，而非直接銷售，因為機隊分析顯示單一農場自己擁有一台反應器，大半個產季都在閒置。MVP 逐項估價：現行生物反應器 US$2280、葉面濕度感測器 US$125、一個 US$90 的密封式菌體卡匣（放到位後自動開啟，所以沒有人需要接觸開放的培養液），以及一個 Field Console 手機應用程式；資本支出約為每公頃 US$3800，不含補充、維修與人力。法規目標是在 2027 年 10 月前取得台灣封閉系統使用的答案；團隊和 Wu Tzu-Hsien 主任（10 月 12 日）一起走這條路徑，對方指出他們的成本模型漏掉廠房、人力、菌體培養與廢棄物管理成本，另與 Chang Hung-Hao 教授（8 月 31 日）討論，對方要他們把初期應用收斂到特定逆境與特定作物。在 BIO Asia-Taiwan 與 Bioeconomy Corporation 的一次對話，把擴張研究的方向轉往東南亞——那裡農業部門規模大，GMO 規範也比美國或歐盟寬鬆。Smart Agriweek Taiwan 指出青農才是現實中的早期採用者，並提醒年長農民需要另一套說服路徑。SWOT 與 PESTLE 分析把真正的威脅講得很白：無細胞農業生物製劑的法規定位不明，可能卡在生物農藥與合成生物學衍生化合物之間；保護蛋白會被沖走；生物積垢會降低產出；以及到 2024 年台灣只有 3.47% 的農地屬有機或友善耕作——這既限制也形塑了市場。回收期分析是整個 wiki 上商業上最誠實的一塊：以他們自己每公頃每期作 US$138 的損失數字來算，效力軸上沒有任何一點能在有用的時間尺度內回收資本——即使效力完美也要 68 年——而 Geospatial Analysis 以每期作 US$1931 的淨效益算出 4.9 年，團隊明白寫出這兩者定價的並不是同一公頃土地，而不是悄悄採用那個好看的數字。交付成果包括一份 85 頁的營運計畫書、一份對農民友善的使用手冊，以及三份生物反應器文件。","partners":["Prof. Chen Wen-Liang (containment and business plan)","Dr. Paul Verslues (Academia Sinica)","Dr. Elizabeth Sattely (Stanford University)","Prof. Drew Endy (Stanford University)","Dr. Jennifer Brophy","Prof. Cheng Mei-Chun","Prof. Huang Chieh-Chen (National Chung Hsing University; supplied B. subtilis WB800)","Prof. Huang Tzu-Pi (National Chung Hsing University)","Prof. Chang Jo-Shu","Prof. Chang Hung-Hao","Dr. Lin Wei-Yi","CH Biotech (Taiwan)","Yes Health iFarm","World Vegetable Center","Green Media (public forum co-host)","Gilbert Nkpeniyeng, Ubuntu Social Enterprise Ghana","Dr. Li Hsu-Ying and Ms. Chen (natural farming)","Mr. Chen Ke-Wei, Lanyang River Friendly Farming Production Cooperative","Ms. Chen Hui-Wen","Director Wu Tzu-Hsien","Mr. Riddler Lu","Taipei Expo Farmers Market","BIO Asia-Taiwan Exhibition","Taiwan SMART Agriweek","Bureau Francais de Taipei","Owl Lab","Geospatial Analysis (partner team)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6072/wiki/software/twin-screen-20261018-software.webp","caption":"The ReLEAF digital twin control screen on 18 October 2026, showing optical density, pH, four pressure traces and the pump and valve controls for a live bioreactor run on one page.","caption_zh":"2026 年 10 月 18 日的 ReLEAF 數位孿生控制畫面，在同一頁顯示即時生物反應器實驗的光密度、pH、四路壓力曲線以及泵與閥的控制。","credit":"Team GEMS-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6072/wiki/software/fig-r3-run434-software.svg","caption":"The 434-hour run: optical density above and the photometer's reference channel below, with the autoencoder sensor alarm at 216.3 hours marked 26.7 hours before the OD channel failed.","caption_zh":"那次 434 小時的實驗：上為光密度，下為光度計的參考通道，自編碼器的感測警報標在 216.3 小時，比 OD 通道失效早了 26.7 小時。","credit":"Team GEMS-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6072/wiki/model/stress-validation-island-model.webp","caption":"Island first-crop rice yield against predictions made from earlier years only; county error over 2016-2025 is 419 kg/ha for the plain trend and 365 kg/ha for the fitted stress-index model.","caption_zh":"全島一期稻作產量與僅以較早年份資料所做預測的對照；2016-2025 年的縣市誤差，單純趨勢線為 419 kg/ha，擬合出的逆境指數模型為 365 kg/ha。","credit":"Team GEMS-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6072/wiki/description/bioreactor-front-description.webp","caption":"The ReLEAF hollow-fiber perfusion bioreactor, about 40 x 24 x 62 cm, built to stand beside the field it supplies and to let protectant protein out while keeping the engineered bacteria in.","caption_zh":"ReLEAF 中空纖維灌流式生物反應器，約 40 x 24 x 62 cm，設計上就是要擺在它所供應的田邊，讓保護蛋白出去、把工程改造的細菌留在裡面。","credit":"Team GEMS-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"The transferable asset is the provenance discipline, and it is cheaper than it looks: tag every number in a model as measured-by-us, cited, or modelled; publish an assumption register that states what would overturn each step; and when two of your own runs disagree, show both and name the disagreement instead of picking the flattering one. Pair that with one pre-registered, date-stamped prediction scored against a later experiment — GEMS-Taiwan's registered growth rate is the single highest-credibility item on its wiki, and it cost nothing but committing in writing before the data arrived.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"可以帶走的資產是來源標註的紀律，而它比看起來便宜得多：把模型裡每個數字標成「我們量的」、「引用的」或「模型算的」；公開一份假設清單，逐條寫出什麼情況會推翻這一步；當自己的兩次實驗互相矛盾時，兩筆都放出來並指出矛盾，而不是挑那個好看的。再搭配一項預先登錄、有日期戳記的預測，並由後續實驗實際評分——GEMS-Taiwan 登錄的生長速率是整個 wiki 上可信度最高的一項，而它的成本只是在資料出現之前先把話寫下來。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/software/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/measurement/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/hardware/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/protein-design/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/entrepreneurship/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/contribution/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/parts/","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/gems-taiwan/digital-twin"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳量測 — 得主（高中組）","最佳硬體 — 得主（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 得主（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（太空 / 基礎推進 / 軟體與 AI / 生物製造）"],"rank":169},"6077":{"team":"UOttawa","id":"6077","section":"Undergrad","country":"Canada","village":"Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/","projectTitle":"Nulfur","projectTitle_zh":"Nulfur","tagline":"Break bonds, not the fuel: engineered biodesulfurization as a polishing step for refractory sulfur in diesel.","tagline_zh":"斷鍵，而不是斷燃料：以工程化生物脫硫作為柴油中難脫除硫化物的精製步驟。","summary":"Nulfur rebuilds the four-enzyme 4S biodesulfurization pathway (DszA, DszB, DszC plus a flavin reductase) from Rhodococcus erythropolis inside Pseudomonas putida KT2440, targeting dibenzothiophene (DBT) — the refractory sulfur compound that conventional hydrodesulfurization struggles to remove without running at 300-400 C and 3-6 MPa. Rather than replacing hydrodesulfurization, the team reframed the project after industry consultation as a modular side-stream polishing step on diesel. The project won on the strength of its alternative chassis work: because P. putida is a non-model organism, the team built the missing toolkit from scratch (a Golden Gate-compatible broad-host-range vector, a measured four-promoter set, and a working heat-shock transformation protocol) and published it as a handbook for other teams. That platform contribution, paired with an unusually deep dry lab (COBRApy genome-scale modelling, a FoldX/ThermoMPNN protein engineering pipeline, and an agentic AI research platform called Cofactor), won Best Alternative Platform and Best Wiki and Best Bioremediation Project nominations.","summary_zh":"Nulfur 把源自 Rhodococcus erythropolis 的四酶 4S 生物脫硫途徑（DszA、DszB、DszC 加上一個黃素還原酶）重建於 Pseudomonas putida KT2440 之中，標的是二苯并噻吩（DBT），也就是傳統加氫脫硫必須在 300-400 C、3-6 MPa 條件下才勉強能處理的難脫除硫化物。團隊在與業界諮詢後，並未把專案定位為取代加氫脫硫，而是重新定義為柴油上的模組化側流精製步驟。本專案的獲獎實力來自替代底盤的工作：由於 P. putida 屬於非模式生物，團隊從零建立起原本缺乏的工具組（一個相容於 Golden Gate 的廣宿主範圍載體、一組經過量測的四啟動子系列，以及一套可用的熱休克轉型流程），並把它整理成供其他團隊使用的手冊。這項平台貢獻，搭配一個深度罕見的乾實驗（COBRApy 基因組尺度代謝模型、FoldX/ThermoMPNN 蛋白質工程流程，以及名為 Cofactor 的代理式 AI 研究平台），為團隊贏得 Best Alternative Platform，並入圍 Best Wiki 與 Best Bioremediation Project。","awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Alternative Platform — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Three distinct computational layers. (1) Genome-scale metabolic modelling: the published P. putida KT2440 model iJN1463 was extended in COBRApy with the heterologous 4S pathway reactions (DszA/B/C/D), and flux balance analysis solved through GLPK over a 1000-point sweep of the DBT exchange flux bound showed metabolism never bottlenecks uptake, while forcing DszB flux revealed an NADH-limited ceiling of 9.80 mmol gDCW-1 h-1 that formate co-feeding raises 25.5% to 12.30. (2) A first-principles mass-transfer model of the biphasic reactor combining Hinze-Kolmogorov droplet-breakup scaling, film theory at the stagnant-sphere limit (Sh = 2), micellar solubilization above the CMC and Michaelis-Menten uptake, solved by bisection for the steady-state free DBT concentration; it predicts rhamnolipid raises effective DBT availability 2.8- to 34-fold. (3) A protein engineering pipeline that screened over 1,100 candidate substitutions in DszB and DszC using ConSurf conservation grades, MD-derived backbone RMSF, and an ensemble of FoldX (empirical force field) plus ThermoMPNN (deep learning on ProteinMPNN embeddings) for ddG, then validated catalytic integrity with explicit-solvent GROMACS MD (amber99sb-ildn, TIP3P) and AutoDock Vina ligand docking before shortlisting five mutants per enzyme.","frameworks_zh":"三個不同的計算層次。(1) 基因組尺度代謝模型：團隊在 COBRApy 中把已發表的 P. putida KT2440 模型 iJN1463 擴充，加入異源 4S 途徑的反應（DszA/B/C/D），並以 GLPK 求解通量平衡分析，對 DBT 交換通量上限做 1000 點掃描，結果顯示代謝從未成為攝取的瓶頸；而強制給定 DszB 通量後，則揭露出一個受 NADH 限制的上限 9.80 mmol gDCW-1 h-1，共餵入甲酸可將此上限提高 25.5% 至 12.30。(2) 雙相反應器的第一原理質傳模型，結合 Hinze-Kolmogorov 液滴破裂尺度律、停滯球極限下的薄膜理論（Sh = 2）、CMC 以上的微胞增溶，以及 Michaelis-Menten 型攝取，並以二分法求解穩態的游離 DBT 濃度；模型預測鼠李糖脂可讓有效的 DBT 可得量提高 2.8 至 34 倍。(3) 一條蛋白質工程流程，以 ConSurf 保守性等級、由分子動力學模擬得到的主鏈 RMSF，以及 FoldX（經驗力場）加上 ThermoMPNN（在 ProteinMPNN 嵌入向量上做深度學習）的集成來估算 ddG，篩選 DszB 與 DszC 中超過 1,100 個候選取代；接著以顯式溶劑的 GROMACS 分子動力學模擬（amber99sb-ildn、TIP3P）與 AutoDock Vina 配體對接驗證催化功能是否完好，最後為每個酶挑出五個突變體入選名單。","dataviz":"The wiki is a server-rendered-feel React site with a genuinely engineered visual layer: a WebGL/Three.js distillation-tower scene and animated pathway loop on the landing page, every equation rendered as its own labelled SVG so the derivation reads as a chain, and predictor-agreement scatter plots (Figure 9) that shade the quadrant where FoldX and ThermoMPNN both call a substitution stabilising and enlarge it to label the five mutations actually sent to the bench. The Human Practices page is built as a clickable stacked column where each band is one of seven kinds of conversation across 21 entries, so a judge can jump straight to the stakeholder group they care about. Every figure carries a long descriptive alt attribute that states the figure's actual numbers, not just its subject.","dataviz_zh":"這個 wiki 是一個讀起來像伺服器渲染的 React 網站，視覺層確實經過工程設計：首頁有以 WebGL/Three.js 製作的蒸餾塔場景與動畫化的途徑迴圈；每一條方程式都各自渲染成帶標註的 SVG，使整段推導讀起來像一條連貫的鏈；預測器一致性散布圖（圖 9）則把 FoldX 與 ThermoMPNN 同時判定該取代具穩定化效果的象限加上底色，並將該象限放大，標示出實際送進實驗台的五個突變。人類實踐頁面做成可點選的堆疊柱狀圖，每一段代表 21 筆紀錄中七類對話之一，讓評審可以直接跳到自己關心的利害關係人族群。每張圖都附有長篇描述性的 alt 屬性，寫出該圖實際的數值，而不只是它的主題。","datascience":"The headline data-science contribution is turning the protein engineering loop into a measured, auditable artefact. The team built a six-arm evaluation suite for Cofactor with four ablation regimes (bare, bare_prompt, tools, full) that add exactly one harness layer each, then scored outcomes: 37 deterministic probes in Arms A and B all pass, Arm C recorded zero workflow violations across 27 scorable runs under the phase machine versus two in the bare condition, and Arm D found the ungrounded condition hallucinated amino-acid positions while both grounded conditions did not. Arm E asked the agent to reconstruct the initial experimental designs of six published papers (three postdating the model's knowledge cutoff) and audited tool transcripts for contamination. On the wet-lab side, the promoter library was quantified as log-normalized mScarlet-i fluorescence per OD600 corrected for media background and P. putida autofluorescence, which revealed only three distinct expression tiers rather than the four reported in the literature.","datascience_zh":"最突出的資料科學貢獻，是把蛋白質工程的迭代迴圈變成一個可量測、可稽核的產出。團隊為 Cofactor 建立了六組評估套件，含四種消融（ablation）設定（bare、bare_prompt、tools、full），每一種剛好多加一層外框機制，然後對結果評分：A、B 兩組中 37 項確定性探測全數通過；C 組在階段狀態機之下，27 次可評分執行中記錄到零次流程違規，而在 bare 條件下為兩次；D 組則發現未加接地的條件會虛構出胺基酸位置，而兩種有接地的條件都沒有。E 組要求代理重建六篇已發表論文的初始實驗設計（其中三篇發表於模型知識截止日之後），並稽核工具的操作紀錄以檢查是否受到汙染。濕實驗方面，啟動子庫以每 OD600 的 mScarlet-i 螢光取對數歸一化後定量，並扣除培養基背景與 P. putida 自體螢光，結果顯示只有三個明顯的表現量層級，而非文獻報告中的四個。","software":"Cofactor, an agentic protein engineering platform released under MIT licence at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/uottawa/cofactor. It wraps a general-purpose LLM in an explicit phase state machine whose preconditions are checked against a 16-table SQLite store (.cofactor/research.sqlite3, WAL journaling, foreign keys) rather than against the model's claims, so runs resume across sessions and the research record stays readable without the tool. A deterministic tool layer covers sequence operations, RFC10 compliance checking, codon optimisation, restriction analysis, solubility scanning, and retrieval from UniProt, NCBI, RCSB PDB, AlphaFold, PubMed and Europe PMC; an ExecutionManager submits jobs to local, SSH or Slurm backends. Three frontends ship: a FastAPI web UI, a Textual TUI and a CLI, all bring-your-own-key and model-agnostic against any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. The team also released the P. putida handbook with protocols and the sanitized Golden Gate-ready pBBR1MCS-2 vector to the iGEM Registry.","software_zh":"Cofactor 是一個代理式蛋白質工程平台，以 MIT 授權釋出於 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/uottawa/cofactor。它把一個通用 LLM 包在一個明確的階段狀態機之中，各階段的前置條件是對照一個 16 張表的 SQLite 資料庫（.cofactor/research.sqlite3，WAL 日誌、外鍵）來檢查，而不是採信模型自己的說法，因此執行可以跨工作階段續跑，研究紀錄也不必依賴這個工具就能讀懂。確定性的工具層涵蓋序列操作、RFC10 相容性檢查、密碼子最佳化、限制酶切位分析、溶解度掃描，以及從 UniProt、NCBI、RCSB PDB、AlphaFold、PubMed 與 Europe PMC 擷取資料；ExecutionManager 則負責把運算工作送往本機、SSH 或 Slurm 後端。平台提供三種前端：FastAPI 網頁介面、Textual TUI 與 CLI，全部採自備金鑰、不限模型，可對接任何 OpenAI 相容端點。團隊同時釋出了 P. putida 手冊（含實驗流程）以及經過整理、可直接用於 Golden Gate 的 pBBR1MCS-2 載體至 iGEM Registry。","stack":["COBRApy","GLPK","iJN1463 genome-scale model","FoldX","ThermoMPNN","ProteinMPNN embeddings","ConSurf","GROMACS","amber99sb-ildn / TIP3P","AutoDock Vina","Python 3.11","SQLite (WAL)","FastAPI","Textual TUI","Slurm / SSH job submission","React","Three.js / WebGL","Open Babel"],"techniques":["Flux balance analysis","Genome-scale metabolic model extension","Hinze-Kolmogorov droplet-breakup scaling","Film-theory interfacial mass transfer","Micellar solubilization modelling","Michaelis-Menten uptake kinetics","Bisection root-finding","Sensitivity analysis over droplet size","ddG ensemble prediction","Molecular dynamics (RMSF, native-contact persistence)","Ligand docking","LLM agent harness with phase-gated state machine","Ablation-based evaluation (4 regimes, 6 arms)","Rubric scoring by two independent judges","Techno-economic analysis","Life cycle assessment","HAZOP / P&ID process safety analysis"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education is organised around four stated principles - Access, Adapt, Engage, Extend - and each initiative is written up against one of them. The team ran bilingual (English/French) sessions for 370+ children aged 4-13 in the Ottawa-Carleton District School Board's International and Indigenous Languages Program summer school, reached 70 more through the Ottawa Catholic School Board, and visited AcadeCap International School for ages 4-7. Original hands-on activities include Lava Lamps (oil properties), The Art of Consortia (a collaborative mural standing in for microbial division of labour), Mix and Match Genes, The Power of Bacterial DNA, and a Heavy vs Light Oil worksheet. For durability they published a free interactive children's magazine, Bio-Builder, distributed through local Ottawa public libraries explicitly to reach low-income families who cannot buy such resources, plus a demo list, infographics, a science and research podcast, and a full downloadable resource library of presentations and worksheets so the activities run without the team present. They also hosted the Great Canadian iGEM Incubator poster competition (with QGEM) and the Great Canadian Meetup pitch competition, both with published scoring rubrics.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育工作圍繞四項明定原則展開，即觸及（Access）、調適（Adapt）、參與（Engage）、延伸（Extend），每項活動都對應其中一項撰寫成果。團隊在 Ottawa-Carleton District School Board 的 International and Indigenous Languages Program 暑期學校，為 370 位以上 4 至 13 歲兒童舉辦英法雙語課程，又透過 Ottawa Catholic School Board 再觸及 70 人，並造訪 AcadeCap International School 面向 4 至 7 歲學童。原創的動手活動包括 Lava Lamps（油的性質）、The Art of Consortia（以共同創作壁畫類比微生物的分工）、Mix and Match Genes、The Power of Bacterial DNA，以及一份 Heavy vs Light Oil 學習單。為了讓成果能持續，團隊出版了免費的互動式兒童雜誌 Bio-Builder，並明確選擇透過渥太華當地公共圖書館發行，以觸及買不起這類資源的低收入家庭；此外還有示範清單、資訊圖表、一檔科學與研究播客，以及一座可完整下載的資源庫，收錄簡報與學習單，讓這些活動在團隊不在場時也能照樣進行。團隊另主辦了 Great Canadian iGEM Incubator 海報競賽（與 QGEM 合辦）以及 Great Canadian Meetup 提案競賽，兩者都公開了評分量表。","ihp":"21 conversations across seven categories, each logged in the same three-part structure: why we went, what we heard, what we changed. The changes are concrete. Dr. Jinwen Chen (Natural Resources Canada, CanmetENERGY-Devon) and Dr. Stephen Larter (Calgary, petroleum geochemist) both told the team to abandon heavy diluted bitumen for diesel because of viscosity, mass-transfer and emulsion-separation barriers, and because diesel carries a hard <10 ppm sulfur limit and concentrated refractory DBTs - the team moved its entire target stream to diesel polishing. Dr. Rasha Maal-Bared warned that viscous crude mixes in localised laminar flow, which put static mixing elements and bioreactor sizing into the continuous-flow design. Patrick Lumley (Safe Sulphur Systems, 33 years in sulfur recovery) said the aqueous sulfite byproduct needs pH control to prevent SO2 release and that Claus-plant load reduction is economically worthless - so a pH control loop went into the P&ID and the business case was rebuilt around hydrogen savings and reduced hydrotreating severity instead of sulfur throughput. Larter's warning about microbially influenced corrosion added corrosion and material-compatibility criteria to the reactor design. Faculty of Engineering Design Day feedback forced the pivot from a full HDS-replacement narrative to the complementary polishing model. Dr. Corrie DaCosta, a protein chemist, was consulted specifically about what Cofactor's output report must contain to be usable by the person doing the engineering, and the report format changed as a result.","ihp_zh":"七個類別、共 21 場對話，每一場都以相同的三段式結構記錄：我們為何去談、我們聽到了什麼、我們改了什麼。這些改動都很具體。Dr. Jinwen Chen（Natural Resources Canada, CanmetENERGY-Devon）與 Dr. Stephen Larter（Calgary，石油地球化學家）都建議團隊放棄重質稀釋瀝青、改做柴油，理由是黏度、質傳與乳化分離上的障礙，以及柴油有硬性的 <10 ppm 含硫上限且難脫除的 DBT 濃度較高，於是團隊把整個目標物流改為柴油精製。Dr. Rasha Maal-Bared 提醒，黏稠原油會以局部層流的方式混合，這一點把靜態混合元件與生物反應器尺寸納入了連續流設計。Patrick Lumley（Safe Sulphur Systems，於硫回收領域有 33 年經驗）指出，水相的亞硫酸鹽副產物需要 pH 控制以避免釋出 SO2，而減輕 Claus 製程負載在經濟上毫無價值，於是 P&ID 中加入了一個 pH 控制迴圈，商業論述也從硫處理量改為重建在節省氫氣與降低加氫處理嚴苛度之上。Larter 對微生物影響腐蝕的提醒，為反應器設計增加了腐蝕與材料相容性的準則。工學院 Design Day 的回饋，則促使團隊從「完全取代 HDS」的敘事轉向互補式的精製模式。團隊還特地向蛋白質化學家 Dr. Corrie DaCosta 請教 Cofactor 的輸出報告必須包含什麼內容，才能讓真正動手做工程的人用得上，報告格式也因此修改。","realWorld":"A fully worked commercialization case. Market sizing: TAM ~$3.1B (global HDS catalyst market), SAM ~$66M (Canada's 2.2% share, 16 refineries, ~2M bbl/day), SOM ~$1.4M from a single-refinery side-stream demo at a $0.40/bbl royalty on a 10,000 bbl/day stream. Revenue model is per-barrel licensing royalties, validated in conversation with an operations and project engineer. A techno-economic analysis compares BDS against HDS CAPEX of $16-42M USD for a 20,000-25,000 bbl/day refinery and projects 50-60% CAPEX reduction from eliminating high-pressure hydrogen hardware; a life cycle assessment with a declared system boundary and BDS/HDS inventories backs the environmental claim rather than asserting it. A staged timeline runs from proof of concept (2026) through publication and NSERC Alliance / Mitacs Accelerate / CRIN non-dilutive funding (2027), pilot demonstration on real feedstock plus formal pre-engagement with Environment and Climate Change Canada under New Substances Notification regulations for contained LMO deployment (2028-29), to licensing (2030+) and expansion into biodenitrogenation. The team deliberately targets smaller, older refineries facing Euro V limits with constrained hydrogen capacity rather than major oil sands operators, on Lumley's advice, and flags biogas producers as a faster early-revenue path. Risk analysis, SWOT, Business Model Canvas and a competitive positioning matrix are all published, and the team is explicit that Nulfur is harm reduction during the energy transition - \"a bridge, not a destination\".","realWorld_zh":"一份完整做到底的商業化論證。市場規模：TAM 約 31 億美元（全球 HDS 觸媒市場）、SAM 約 6,600 萬美元（加拿大佔 2.2%，16 座煉油廠，約 200 萬桶/日）、SOM 約 140 萬美元，來自單一煉油廠側流示範，以 10,000 桶/日的物流按每桶 $0.40 收取授權金計算。營收模式為按桶計價的授權金，並在與一位營運與專案工程師的對話中得到驗證。技術經濟分析把 BDS 與 HDS 相比，後者在 20,000 至 25,000 桶/日規模的煉油廠需 1,600 萬至 4,200 萬美元的資本支出，並推估取消高壓氫氣設備可減少 50-60% 資本支出；一份具明確系統邊界並附 BDS/HDS 清單的生命週期評估，支撐了環境效益的說法，而不是只是斷言。分階段時程由概念驗證（2026）、發表論文與申請 NSERC Alliance / Mitacs Accelerate / CRIN 等非稀釋性資金（2027）、以真實進料進行先導示範並依《新物質通報》法規就封閉式 LMO 部署正式向 Environment and Climate Change Canada 進行事前溝通（2028-29），到技術授權（2030 年以後）與擴展至生物脫氮。團隊依 Lumley 的建議，刻意以面臨 Euro V 限值且氫氣產能受限的中小型、老舊煉油廠為目標，而不是大型油砂業者，並指出沼氣生產者是更快取得初期營收的途徑。風險分析、SWOT、商業模式圖（Business Model Canvas）與競爭定位矩陣全部公開，團隊也明白表示 Nulfur 是能源轉型期間的傷害減緩，「一座橋，而非終點」。","partners":["Natural Resources Canada (CanmetENERGY-Devon)","Environment and Climate Change Canada, Low Carbon Fuels Division","Safe Sulphur Systems Ltd.","CDM Smith","Spanish National Research Council (CSIC), Systems Biology Program","Bedford Institute of Oceanography, Fisheries and Oceans Canada","Institute for Oil Sands Innovation / University of Alberta","University of Calgary","Queen's University","Arabian Gulf University","Hawk & Squirrel Innovation Inc.","Ottawa-Carleton District School Board (IILP Summer Program)","Ottawa Catholic School Board","AcadeCap International School","Ottawa Public Libraries","uOttawa eHub RevUp Circuit","MindFuel Tech Futures Challenge","QGEM (Great Canadian iGEM Incubator)","Clean Resource Innovation Network (CRIN)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6077/wiki/dry-lab/protein-engineering/fig-3.svg","caption":"Predictor-agreement scatter for 437 scored DszB mutations: the shaded quadrant is where FoldX and ThermoMPNN both call a substitution stabilising, enlarged to label the five variants advanced to the wet lab.","caption_zh":"437 個評分過的 DszB 突變的預測器一致性散布圖：加底色的象限是 FoldX 與 ThermoMPNN 同時判定該取代具穩定化效果的區域，放大後標示出推進到濕實驗的五個變異體。","credit":"Team UOttawa, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6077/wiki/dry-lab/cofactor/figures/fig-4b.avif","caption":"The Cofactor GUI - a local FastAPI web interface over the agentic protein engineering platform, showing chat, hypothesis and evidence views, job tracking and artifact browsing.","caption_zh":"Cofactor 的圖形介面，一個架在代理式蛋白質工程平台之上的本機 FastAPI 網頁介面，可見對話、假說與證據檢視、工作追蹤與產出檔案瀏覽。","credit":"Team UOttawa, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6077/wiki/dry-lab/consortia/fig-3.avif","caption":"Rate gain in DBT uptake from interfacial-area enhancement and micellar solubilization in isolation and combined; the shaded region is the synergy in excess of the product of the two isolated effects.","caption_zh":"界面面積增加與微胞增溶分別單獨作用與兩者併用時，DBT 攝取速率的增益；加底色的區域是超出兩個單獨效果相乘的協同作用部分。","credit":"Team UOttawa, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6077/wiki/education/adapt/art-consortia/pxl-20260716-173536329-mp.avif","caption":"The Art of Consortia activity in the Ottawa-Carleton District School Board summer language programme, where children build a shared mural to learn how a microbial consortium divides labour.","caption_zh":"在 Ottawa-Carleton District School Board 暑期語言課程中進行的 The Art of Consortia 活動，孩童共同創作一幅壁畫，藉此認識微生物群落如何分工。","credit":"Team UOttawa, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6077/wiki/process/igem-p-id-final.avif","caption":"Process and instrumentation diagram for the full-scale biodesulfurization plant, including the pH control loop added after Patrick Lumley warned that uncontrolled sulfite pH would release SO2.","caption_zh":"全規模生物脫硫廠的製程與儀控圖（P&ID），其中包含在 Patrick Lumley 提醒未受控制的亞硫酸鹽 pH 會釋出 SO2 之後才加入的 pH 控制迴圈。","credit":"Team UOttawa, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy uOttawa's human-practices template literally: a single page where every one of 21 stakeholder conversations is logged in the same three fields - why we went, what we heard, what we changed - with the change written as a specific design edit (a pH loop in the P&ID, a switch of feedstock, static mixers). It costs nothing to adopt, makes a student team's reasoning auditable, and is the clearest way a school research centre can show that outside input actually moved the project rather than decorating it.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"照字面抄下 uOttawa 的人類實踐範本：用單一頁面，把 21 場利害關係人對話全部以相同的三個欄位記錄下來，也就是我們為何去談、我們聽到了什麼、我們改了什麼，而「改了什麼」要寫成具體的設計變更（P&ID 中的一個 pH 控制迴圈、換掉進料、加裝靜態混合器）。採用它不花任何成本，卻能讓學生團隊的推理過程可被稽核，也是一個校內研究中心最清楚的方式，用以證明外部意見確實推動了專案，而不只是拿來裝飾。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/alternative-platform","https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/process-design-and-analysis","https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/gcm","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/uottawa/cofactor"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","最佳替代平台 — 得主（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 入圍"],"rank":110},"6078":{"team":"UPF-Barcelona","id":"6078","section":"Undergrad","country":"Spain","village":"Food & Agriculture","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/upf-barcelona/","projectTitle":"Vinesys","projectTitle_zh":"Vinesys","tagline":"Where the rain runs out, the roots hold on: engineering root-associated Bacillus subtilis to hold water around grapevine roots.","tagline_zh":"雨水用盡之處，根系仍然守住：改造根際共生的 Bacillus subtilis，把水留在葡萄藤根部周圍。","summary":"Vinesys engineers Bacillus subtilis to colonise the grapevine rhizosphere and overexpress gamma-PGA, a water-retaining biopolymer, plus ACC deaminase to trim the drought-stress hormone precursor ACC, forming a thin hydration shell where the bacterium attaches to the root. Drought is detected by a two-layer switch: an osmolarity-responsive promoter plus a salt-dependent intein (HutMCM2) that the team re-engineered in silico to splice at the roughly 600-725 mM intracellular K+ that B. subtilis actually reaches, rather than its native 1.5 M. The dry lab produced three distinct deliverables: RK4 solver, a standalone no-code genetic-circuit designer and simulator; a documented molecular-dynamics pipeline for tuning salt-dependent proteins; and iGEMforge, a Claude Code plugin of four research skills that they evaluated honestly and then declined to use for project decisions. Awards came for Software, Model and Education.","summary_zh":"Vinesys 改造 Bacillus subtilis，使其定殖於葡萄藤根際並過量表現保水生物聚合物 gamma-PGA，同時表現 ACC deaminase 以削減乾旱逆境荷爾蒙前驅物 ACC，在細菌附著於根部之處形成一層薄薄的保水殼。乾旱以雙層開關偵測：一個對滲透壓有反應的啟動子，加上一個依賴鹽濃度的內含肽（HutMCM2）；團隊以電腦重新改造該內含肽，使其在 B. subtilis 實際可達到的約 600-725 mM 胞內 K+ 濃度下進行剪接，而非其天然的 1.5 M。乾實驗產出三項明確的成果：RK4 solver，一套獨立、免寫程式的基因迴路設計與模擬工具；一條有完整文件的分子動力學流程，用於調校依賴鹽濃度的蛋白質；以及 iGEMforge，一個內含四項研究技能的 Claude Code 外掛——他們誠實地評估了它，然後決定不拿它來做專題決策。獲獎項目為軟體、模型與教育。","awards":["Best Software — Winner (Undergrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"RK4 solver is a desktop Python application with a GUI built in Dear PyGui, structured as three partially independent modules (GUI, compiler, solver) so the solver can be driven from Python without drawing anything on screen. It ships for Windows, macOS and Linux. Interchange is handled by two formats: a readable personal JSON format and SBML Level 3, which gives round-trip compatibility with COPASI and Tellurium. The molecular-dynamics pipeline runs ColabFold/AlphaFold for structures, FoldX for stability screening, MAFFT and BLAST for candidate selection, UCSF Chimera for inspection, and OpenMM with Amber force fields (tleap setup) for the simulations. iGEMforge is a Claude Code plugin: four Markdown SKILL files plus a couple of Python scripts in a folder, deliberately with no subagents, hooks or custom MCP servers.","frameworks_zh":"RK4 solver 是一套桌面 Python 應用程式，介面以 Dear PyGui 建構，架構分成三個部分獨立的模組（介面、編譯器、解算器），因此解算器可以直接用 Python 驅動、不必在畫面上畫出任何東西。它提供 Windows、macOS 與 Linux 版本。資料交換支援兩種格式：一種可讀的自訂 JSON 格式，以及 SBML Level 3，後者讓它能與 COPASI 和 Tellurium 雙向往返。分子動力學流程以 ColabFold/AlphaFold 取得結構，以 FoldX 做穩定性篩選，以 MAFFT 與 BLAST 挑選候選，以 UCSF Chimera 檢視，並以 OpenMM 搭配 Amber 力場（由 tleap 建置）執行模擬。iGEMforge 則是一個 Claude Code 外掛：四個 Markdown SKILL 檔加上幾支 Python 腳本放在一個資料夾裡，刻意不使用子代理、hook 或自訂 MCP 伺服器。","dataviz":"RK4 solver's results screen plots species concentrations while every parameter has a live slider that takes effect during the running simulation, which is the core interaction idea. The editor uses blocks whose icons follow SBOL Visual glyphs, with input pins always on the left and output pins on the right so links read left to right, collapsible blocks, and a diagnostics/warnings pane with connection rules that refuse to let you build an invalid circuit. The wiki itself is built as explanatory interactive JavaScript rather than static figures: an in-browser Euler-vs-RK4 comparison on x'' = -x, a step-through animation of the solver's operator stack, a replayable eval harness showing the same prompt answered with and without an iGEMforge skill, and a hoverable stakeholder map on the entrepreneurship page.","dataviz_zh":"RK4 solver 的結果畫面會繪製各物種濃度，而每個參數都配有即時滑桿，在模擬執行中就會生效，這是整個互動設計的核心想法。編輯器使用方塊，其圖示沿用 SBOL Visual 的字符，輸入接點一律在左、輸出接點在右，使連線由左讀到右；方塊可折疊，並有一個診斷／警示面板，其連接規則會直接拒絕讓你搭出不合法的迴路。wiki 本身是以解說性的互動 JavaScript 做成、而非靜態圖表：一個在瀏覽器內針對 x'' = -x 比較 Euler 與 RK4 的示範、一段逐步播放解算器運算子堆疊的動畫、一個可重播的評估面板展示同一道提示在有與沒有 iGEMforge 技能下的回答差異，以及創業頁面上一張可滑過查看的利害關係人地圖。","datascience":"The solver was validated numerically against COPASI: three example circuits were exported to SBML and re-simulated in COPASI under LSODA with identical parameters, initial concentrations and simulation time, and every quantity that means the same thing in both tools agreed within 0.21%, most within 0.01%. The apparent 13.4% and 98.5% discrepancies on free mazF and mazE were traced to a labelling difference in rapid-equilibrium binding, not integration error, and resolved by comparing totals (mazF + 2*FEF, mazE + FEF), which then matched within 0.01% and 0.09%. iGEMforge was evaluated in two rounds: 11 hand-graded assertion tests in round one, then 28 cases run three times per arm (with-skill vs. without-skill) using Claude Code's `claude plugin eval` with an LLM-as-a-judge against team-written rubrics, including real cases, synthetic cases with deliberately planted flaws, and 'silence' cases where a skill should stay out of the way. The MD work used replicas, a wild-type positive control at its known 1.5 M threshold, an uncharged no-effect control, and re-ran its analysis under several different attack-distance cutoffs to show the conclusion did not depend on one arbitrary value.","datascience_zh":"解算器以數值方式對 COPASI 驗證：三個範例迴路匯出為 SBML，並在相同參數、起始濃度與模擬時間下用 COPASI 的 LSODA 重跑，凡是在兩套工具中意義相同的量值都在 0.21% 以內吻合，多數在 0.01% 以內。游離 mazF 與 mazE 上看似 13.4% 與 98.5% 的差異，被追溯為快速平衡結合下標示方式的差別、而非積分誤差，改以總量比較（mazF + 2*FEF、mazE + FEF）後即分別在 0.01% 與 0.09% 以內吻合。iGEMforge 經過兩輪評估：第一輪是 11 項人工評分的斷言測試，第二輪則是 28 個案例、每個組別（有技能對無技能）各跑三次，使用 Claude Code 的 `claude plugin eval`，以 LLM 當評審、對照隊員自行撰寫的評分準則，案例涵蓋真實情境、刻意植入瑕疪的合成情境，以及技能應當不出手的「沉默」情境。分子動力學工作使用了重複模擬、一個在已知 1.5 M 門檻下的野生型正對照、一個不帶電的無效應對照，並在數個不同的作用距離截斷值下重跑分析，以證明結論不取決於某一個任意選定的數值。","software":"RK4 solver is the main tool: a free, open-source, cross-platform application that turns a hand-drawn genetic circuit into a running ODE simulation with no code at all, aimed squarely at iGEM teams, high-school and undergraduate students, and explicitly not at replacing COPASI or SimBiology. Eight block types are implemented (production with Hill activation/repression, degradation, complex formation in rapid-equilibrium or kinetic mode, extracellular species with six dosing regimes, cell entry, export, catalysis with Michaelis-Menten or mass action, and a link probe), and the compiler translates the drawing into a flat list of stack operators which the solver evaluates with Euler or 4th-order Runge-Kutta. The architecture is worth copying: the translator sorts each block's contribution by the species it points to rather than by the block's own species, a redesign forced by discovering that complex formation was writing its negative terms into the wrong derivative. It was validated twice, against COPASI numerically and against the team's own biocontainment toxin-antitoxin model biologically, and it was user-tested, with non-expert testers building and tuning a toggle switch in 5 to 20 minutes after a short introduction to the notation. Limitations are stated plainly on the wiki (deterministic only, partial SBML import, custom block unfinished, GUI not yet as intuitive as they want) with a three-horizon roadmap including SBOL-based integration with the iGEM Registry that would pull part parameters in and mark any user override as traceably overwritten. Source: https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/upf-barcelona/upf-software (team repo https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/upf-barcelona). It is distributed as a downloadable cross-platform application, not a hosted web service, so there is no click-and-use URL. The second tool, iGEMforge, is the most interesting negative result of the season: a Claude Code plugin of four skills (scientific-evidence, experimental-design, mathematical-modeling, bio-wiki-animations) built over two DBTL cycles, in which round-one hand-grading suggested the skills helped (bio-wiki-animations 12/13 assertions with the skill against 5/12 without) but round two with three runs per arm and an LLM judge showed no clear average gain (experimental-design -0.11, scientific-evidence +0.04, mathematical-modeling no clear difference), at substantially higher token cost (309k vs 224k; 468k vs 201k). Testing revealed that three of four skills intermittently stalled waiting on user confirmation and returned nothing; cycle two fixed it with a single rule written into the skills ('state the assumption or caveat and continue'), which restored output in 3 of 3 runs but still did not beat the base model. The team's conclusion, published on the wiki, is that the evidence was too thin to use iGEMforge for Vinesys decisions, and they list cost, privacy, over-trust and installation risks explicitly.","software_zh":"RK4 solver 是主要工具：一套免費、開源、跨平台的應用程式，能把手繪的基因迴路變成可執行的 ODE 模擬，完全不需寫程式，明確針對 iGEM 隊伍、高中與大學部學生，也明確表示不是要取代 COPASI 或 SimBiology。已實作八種方塊類型（具 Hill 活化／抑制的生產、降解、以快速平衡或動力學模式處理的複合物形成、含六種投藥方式的胞外物種、進入細胞、輸出、以 Michaelis-Menten 或質量作用處理的催化，以及一個連線探針），編譯器把圖轉成一份扁平的堆疊運算子清單，解算器再以 Euler 或四階 Runge-Kutta 求解。它的架構值得借鏡：轉譯器是依每個方塊所指向的物種、而非方塊自身的物種來歸類其貢獻項，這項重新設計是在發現複合物形成會把負項寫進錯誤的微分式之後被迫做的。它驗證了兩次，一次是數值上對 COPASI，一次是生物上對團隊自己的生物圍堵毒素－抗毒素模型；也做過使用者測試，非專家測試者在簡短介紹符號後，於 5 到 20 分鐘內就能搭出並調校一個雙穩態開關。限制在 wiki 上直白列出（僅支援確定性模擬、SBML 匯入不完整、自訂方塊尚未完成、介面還沒有他們想要的那麼直覺），並附上一份三階段路線圖，其中包括以 SBOL 為基礎與 iGEM Registry 整合，可自動帶入元件參數，並把使用者的任何覆寫標記為可追溯的覆寫。原始碼：https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/upf-barcelona/upf-software （團隊 repo https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/upf-barcelona ）。它以可下載的跨平台應用程式形式散布，不是架在網路上的服務，因此沒有可以點開就用的網址。第二項工具 iGEMforge 是本季最有意思的負面結果：一個包含四項技能（scientific-evidence、experimental-design、mathematical-modeling、bio-wiki-animations）的 Claude Code 外掛，歷經兩輪 DBTL 開發；第一輪的人工評分看起來技能有幫助（bio-wiki-animations 在有技能時通過 12/13 項斷言，無技能時 5/12），但第二輪每組跑三次並加上 LLM 評審後，顯示平均並無明確增益（experimental-design -0.11、scientific-evidence +0.04、mathematical-modeling 無明確差異），而 token 成本卻顯著更高（309k 對 224k；468k 對 201k）。測試還發現四項技能中有三項會間歇卡住、等待使用者確認而什麼都不回；第二輪以寫進技能的一條規則修掉（「說明該假設或保留條件並繼續」），使 3 次執行都恢復輸出，但仍未勝過基礎模型。團隊公開在 wiki 上的結論是，證據太薄弱，不足以用 iGEMforge 來做 Vinesys 的決策，並明確列出成本、隱私、過度信任與安裝等風險。","stack":["Python","Dear PyGui","SBML Level 3","SBOL Visual","JSON","COPASI (validation target)","Tellurium","OpenMM","Amber force field / tleap","ColabFold","AlphaFold","FoldX","MAFFT","BLAST","UCSF Chimera","Claude Code plugin (Markdown skills + Python)","claude plugin eval","iGEM GitLab","JavaScript (interactive wiki figures)"],"techniques":["ODE modelling of genetic circuits","4th-order Runge-Kutta and Euler integration","stack-machine operator compilation of differential equations","Hill activation/repression kinetics","rapid-equilibrium and kinetic complex formation","Michaelis-Menten catalysis","molecular dynamics with near-attack-conformation (NAC) readout","ddG stability screening","pLDDT/PAE structure confidence assessment","LLM-as-a-judge evaluation with pre-written rubrics","A/B testing with planted-flaw synthetic cases","SBML round-trip cross-validation"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education is organised around an explicit six-step method the team named WONDER (Who, Objectives, Notice, Dialogue, Evidence, Record), whose last step feeds back into the first like a DBTL cycle, and which is rooted in Catalan educacio del lleure (leisure education) practice that several team members came from through scouting. Audiences were plotted on two axes, age and prior synbio interest, and the session language (Catalan, Spanish or English) was chosen from the barrier they wanted to lower. Each session required a before-and-after measure, at least one artefact participants made themselves, a rubric completed within 24 hours, and a written summary within a day covering what actually happened and what they would change, published on the wiki so other teams can run the session without them. Activities spanned a MiniGEM where pre-university students designed their own synthetic biology projects, an escape room at CosmoCaixa, La Nit de la Recerca, the UPF Summer School, a role-play at the PRBB, SynBYSS, Centre Civic Guinardo, scout groups (Cau La Floresta) and several schools, plus a round table with iGEM UB.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育工作圍繞團隊自行命名的六步方法 WONDER（Who、Objectives、Notice、Dialogue、Evidence、Record）展開，最後一步會像 DBTL 循環那樣回饋到第一步；這套方法源自加泰隆尼亞的 educació del lleure（休閒教育）實務，幾位隊員是透過童軍活動帶著這個背景進來的。對象依兩個軸向配置——年齡與既有的合成生物學興趣——使用的語言（加泰隆尼亞語、西班牙語或英語）則依他們想降低的哪一道門檻來決定。每一場活動都必須有前後對照的量測、至少一件由參與者自己動手做出的成品、在 24 小時內填完的評分表，以及一天內寫成的書面摘要，說明實際發生了什麼、以及下次會改什麼，並公開在 wiki 上，讓其他隊伍不需要他們在場也能照著辦。活動包括一場讓大學前學生自己設計合成生物學專題的 MiniGEM、在 CosmoCaixa 的密室逃脫、La Nit de la Recerca、UPF 暑期學校、在 PRBB 的角色扮演、SynBYSS、Centre Cívic Guinardó、童軍團（Cau La Floresta）與數所學校，另有一場與 iGEM UB 的圓桌。","ihp":"Human practices is written as three acts with a stated principle of intentionality: every design choice should have a reason statable to an outsider, and where there is none they say so. 32 people outside the team across 8 countries, 52 documented exchanges and 103 survey respondents, with 9 of 10 project phases opened to outside input. The first grower they met corrected their founding premise, that drought was killing Catalan vineyards, by explaining that summer water stress is necessary for proper ripening and the real damage is to next season's crop; a second grower said vines did die in the first drought year, and the team kept both rather than reconciling them. A gamma-PGA geneticist in Pavia shrank the central claim from bulk soil water retention to a local hydration shell at the root. A Bordeaux researcher set a condition the design cannot meet (no deficit at flowering, moderate deficit later) and the team publishes it as a limit, not a feature. Two further conventions are worth copying: advice they chose not to follow stays on the page with the reason, and disagreements they could not resolve are printed unresolved. They also disclose that one advisor, Dr. Carolina Elizondo, holds an iGEM role, so readers can weigh her input.","ihp_zh":"人類實踐寫成三幕，並明示一項「刻意為之」的原則：每個設計選擇都應該有一個能對外人說清楚的理由，沒有理由的地方就直接說沒有。團隊外共 32 人、跨 8 個國家，52 次有紀錄的往來與 103 份問卷回覆，10 個專題階段中有 9 個開放外部意見。他們見到的第一位果農就糾正了他們的立論前提——他們原以為乾旱正在殺死加泰隆尼亞的葡萄園——說明夏季的水分逆境對正常成熟是必要的，真正受損的是下一季的收成；第二位果農則說在乾旱的第一年葡萄藤確實有死亡，團隊把兩種說法都保留下來，沒有去調和。一位在帕維亞研究 gamma-PGA 的遺傳學家把核心主張從整體土壤保水縮小為根部局部的保水殼。一位波爾多的研究者設下了這個設計做不到的條件（開花期不可有水分虧缺、之後可中度虧缺），團隊把它當成限制、而非賣點公開出來。另外兩項慣例值得借鏡：他們選擇不採納的建議連同理由留在頁面上，而無法化解的分歧就以未解決的狀態印出來。他們也揭露其中一位顧問 Dr. Carolina Elizondo 在 iGEM 內擔任職務，讓讀者得以衡量她的意見。","realWorld":"The entrepreneurship page is explicit that the current value is knowledge, education and visibility rather than product sales, with the project at contained laboratory proof of concept and no environmental release. More than 50 organisations were contacted since June 2026; wineries Clos Montblanc (DO Conca de Barberà), Sumarroca and Vallformosa (DO Penedès) were interviewed about how a new input would fit existing practice, with Vallformosa noting that acting at root level could mean lower adoption friction. IRTA, the Catalan government's agrifood research institute, reviewed the approach against its own Penedès soil-and-water initiative and provided winery contacts. The regulatory finding was that certification, not GMO status, is the binding constraint, and the business work reached a cost per hectare and a route to a field trial. Scale context: 52,000 ha of Catalan vineyard, 8,500 viticulturists, EUR 3.27 bn annual turnover, reservoirs at 14.3% in 2024.","realWorld_zh":"創業頁面明確表示目前的價值在於知識、教育與能見度，而不是產品銷售，專題處於封閉實驗室的概念驗證階段，沒有任何環境釋放。自 2026 年 6 月起接觸了超過 50 個組織；酒莊 Clos Montblanc（DO Conca de Barberà）、Sumarroca 與 Vallformosa（DO Penedès）接受訪談，談一項新投入品要如何融入既有做法，其中 Vallformosa 指出在根部層次作用可能代表採用阻力較低。加泰隆尼亞政府的農食研究機構 IRTA 以其自身的 Penedès 土壤與水計畫審視了這套做法，並提供酒莊人脈。法規上的發現是，真正的約束條件是認證、而不是基改身分；商業評估則推算出每公頃成本與一條走向田間試驗的路徑。規模背景：加泰隆尼亞葡萄園 52,000 公頃、8,500 位葡萄種植者、年營業額 32.7 億歐元，2024 年水庫蓄水率 14.3%。","partners":["IRTA (Institut de Recerca i Tecnologia Agroalimentàries)","Celler Clos Montblanc","Sumarroca","Vallformosa","Ajuntament de Barcelona (Departament de Ciència i Innovació)","CosmoCaixa","PRBB","iGEM UB","Anthropic (sponsor)","University of Pavia (gamma-PGA genetics)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6078/wiki/dry-lab/software/figure6.avif","caption":"Screenshot of the RK4 solver editor with the biocontainment toxin-antitoxin circuit built from linked blocks.","caption_zh":"RK4 solver 編輯器的畫面截圖，圖中是以連結方塊搭建的生物圍堵毒素－抗毒素迴路。","credit":"Team UPF-Barcelona, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6078/wiki/dry-lab/software/figure7.avif","caption":"RK4 solver output: internal resveratrol, mazF and FEF levels over time under sinusoidal resveratrol production.","caption_zh":"RK4 solver 的輸出：在正弦式的白藜蘆醇生產下，胞內白藜蘆醇、mazF 與 FEF 濃度隨時間的變化。","credit":"Team UPF-Barcelona, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6078/wiki/dry-lab/software/figure4.avif","caption":"The first hand-drawn sketches of the RK4 solver blocks, designed in the style of electronic circuit diagrams.","caption_zh":"RK4 solver 方塊最早的手繪草圖，設計上刻意採用電子電路圖的風格。","credit":"Team UPF-Barcelona, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Validate a simulator against the established tool in the field and publish the discrepancy table, including the one that looked like a 98% error and turned out to be a labelling difference, because that table is what makes a student-built solver trustworthy. Their AI work is the sharper lesson for a research centre: build the agent plugin, then actually A/B evaluate it with planted-flaw cases and an LLM judge, and be willing to publish that it did not beat the base model and that you therefore did not use it.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把自己寫的模擬器拿去和該領域既有的標準工具對驗，並公開差異對照表，包括那個看起來像 98% 誤差、實際上只是標示方式不同的項目——因為正是這張表讓學生自建的解算器變得可信。他們的 AI 工作對研究中心而言是更鋭利的一課：先把代理人外掛做出來，再真的用植入瑕疪的案例與 LLM 評審做 A/B 評估，並且願意公開它沒有勝過基礎模型、因此自己也沒有採用。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/upf-barcelona/","https://2026.igem.wiki/upf-barcelona/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/upf-barcelona/igem-forge","https://2026.igem.wiki/upf-barcelona/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/upf-barcelona/dry-tips","https://2026.igem.wiki/upf-barcelona/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/upf-barcelona/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/upf-barcelona/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/upf-barcelona/description","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/upf-barcelona/upf-software"],"awards_zh":["最佳軟體 — 得主（大學組）"],"rank":26},"6089":{"team":"BAID-China","id":"6089","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/baid-china/","projectTitle":"Neurofilux","projectTitle_zh":"Neurofilux","tagline":"An AI-designed antibody sandwich assay for blood neurofilament light chain, for cheap non-invasive early screening of neurodegenerative disease","tagline_zh":"以 AI 設計抗體的血液神經絲輕鏈三明治免疫檢測，用於低成本、非侵入性的神經退化疾病早期篩檢","summary":"BAID-China built Neurofilux, a blood test for neurofilament light chain (NfL), a biomarker of neuronal damage that rises years before Alzheimer's or ALS symptoms appear but is currently detectable only by expensive, invasive or insufficiently sensitive methods. They expressed the NfL rod domain (residues 93-396) as antigen, used the generative model RFantibody to design candidate antibodies, screened them with a multi-objective scoring pipeline, validated eight candidates experimentally and found two pairs outperforming commercial antibodies in sandwich ELISA, then converted the validated antibodies into nanobodies for stability and cost. Their inclusivity work is organised around a self-defined 3A framework - Adaptation, Awareness, Accessibility - and centres on a tactile magnetic genetic-circuit kit for blind children, developed in two phases and donated to a school for the visually impaired.","summary_zh":"BAID-China 做出 Neurofilux，一項檢測血液中神經絲輕鏈（NfL）的檢驗。NfL 是神經元損傷的生物標記，在阿茲海默症或 ALS 症狀出現前數年就會上升，但目前只能靠昂貴、侵入性或靈敏度不足的方法偵測。他們表現 NfL 的 rod domain（第 93–396 號殘基）作為抗原，用生成式模型 RFantibody 設計候選抗體，以多目標評分流程篩選，實驗驗證八個候選，找出兩組在三明治 ELISA 中表現優於市售抗體的配對，再把已驗證的抗體轉換為奈米抗體以提升穩定性並降低成本。他們的包容性工作圍繞自訂的 3A 架構——Adaptation、Awareness、Accessibility——核心是一套給視障兒童的觸覺磁性基因迴路教具，分兩階段開發，最後捐贈給一所視障學校。","awards":["Inclusivity Award — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Self-defined 3A inclusivity framework (Adaptation: convert visually-presented science into tactile, auditory and interactive forms; Awareness: dispel stereotypes and spread barrier-free science; Accessibility: remove visual, language and technical thresholds), with every activity required to map onto at least one dimension. Grounded in a literature review citing Hayes and Proulx (2023) on barriers for visually impaired science students and CAST (2024) Universal Design for Learning, plus Design Thinking, Empathy Mapping and Universal Design concepts taught by an invited expert. Accessibility work was benchmarked against WCAG.","frameworks_zh":"自訂的 3A 包容性架構（Adaptation：把以視覺呈現的科學內容轉換為觸覺、聽覺與互動形式；Awareness：破除刻板印象並推廣無障礙科學；Accessibility：移除視覺、語言與技術門檻），並要求每一項活動至少對應其中一個面向。基礎來自一份文獻回顧，引用 Hayes 與 Proulx（2023）關於視障科學學生所面對障礙的研究，以及 CAST（2024）的通用學習設計，另外還有外聘專家講授的設計思考、同理心地圖與通用設計概念。無障礙工作則以 WCAG 作為對標基準。","dataviz":"All wiki charts redrawn in the eight-colour Okabe-Ito colour-blind-safe palette, chosen because each colour keeps enough luminance difference to stay readable in greyscale; the team published a colour-blindness simulation figure verifying that elements remain distinguishable under red-green, blue-yellow and total colour-blindness simulation.","dataviz_zh":"wiki 上所有圖表都改用八色的 Okabe-Ito 色盲友善配色，選用理由是每個顏色之間都保有足夠的亮度差，轉成灰階後仍可閱讀；該隊並公開一張色盲模擬圖，驗證在紅綠色盲、藍黃色盲與全色盲模擬下各元素仍可區辨。","datascience":"Multi-objective computational scoring to rank AI-generated antibody candidates by predicted sensitivity; comparative legal and building-code research across China, Egypt, Pakistan and the United States compiled into an open-access international accessibility database; pre-activity knowledge survey of junior and senior high school students on neurodegenerative disease awareness.","datascience_zh":"以多目標計算評分，依預測靈敏度排序 AI 生成的候選抗體；比較中國、埃及、巴基斯坦與美國的法規與建築規範研究，彙整成一個開放取用的國際無障礙資料庫；針對國中與高中學生進行活動前的神經退化疾病認知調查。","software":"RFantibody generative AI model used for de novo antibody design, followed by computational screening and virtual validation of nanobody conversions; a laboratory accessibility audit tool and evaluation form built on universal design principles; a wiki accessibility plugin offering a five-step text magnifier, a language switcher and one-click return-to-top, with semantic HTML restructured so screen readers can parse the navigation hierarchy.","software_zh":"使用 RFantibody 生成式 AI 模型進行全新抗體設計，接著對奈米抗體轉換版本做計算篩選與虛擬驗證；依通用設計原則建立一套實驗室無障礙稽核工具與評估表；一個 wiki 無障礙外掛，提供五級文字放大、語言切換與一鍵回到頂端，並重寫為語意化 HTML，讓螢幕閱讀器能解析導覽階層。","stack":["RFantibody (generative antibody design)","multi-objective computational screening","sandwich ELISA","Okabe-Ito colour palette","semantic HTML / screen-reader-compatible markup","WCAG","trilingual wiki (Chinese, English, French)"],"techniques":["NfL rod domain (93-396 aa) expression as antigen","antibody pair selection for sandwich ELISA","nanobody conversion","CDR loop design on dominant epitopes","planned digital ELISA at fg/mL sensitivity"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"BAID-China started from evidence rather than instinct: a literature review on STEM barriers for disabled students (high lab benches, reading instrument data, observing phenomena, the need for written or sign-language support) plus a field visit to Bethel China, a charity for preschool children with visual impairments, where they identified two concrete problems - classes run with several children to one teacher, which blocks understanding, and tactile picture books that deliver touch sensation but almost no actual knowledge content. Both findings set the agenda. First strand: a team member, Audrey, joined the iGEM community project 'Accessibility in Synbio Labs' at the iGEM Annual Community Day in early 2026 and led BAID-China's inclusivity group through Phase 1 (research and database development) and Phase 2 (lab audits) alongside iGEM members from China, Egypt, Pakistan and the United States. With team Concordia-Shanghai they researched China's Accessibility Environment Construction Law, the Law on the Protection of Persons with Disabilities and GB 55019-2021 General Specifications for Accessibility in Architecture and Municipal Engineering, focusing on doorway clearance and wheelchair turning diameter, and the national research sets were compiled into an open-access comparative international database. The audit tool was then reviewed by Chloe Franklin, a scientist who uses a wheelchair, whose feedback changed it substantially: replace the Yes/No/N/A format with a scale that reflects degrees of accessibility because wheelchair users' needs differ widely; add specific measurable criteria with dimensional requirements; and weight audit items by importance, since building entrances, elevators, emergency evacuation routes and restrooms are foundational while equipment height and storage can be adjusted more easily. The team logged her suggestions, took them to weekly meetings, produced a new version, and credits co-creators by name (Sami from Team Toronto 2026, Mohamed, Sophie and Linda). They are honest that pilot testing was not completed within the season and commit to continuing next year. Second strand, and the signature contribution: Chloe Franklin's remark that a beautiful accessible lab on a high floor of a building with no accessible elevator is meaningless pushed the team from physical access to information access. They built a tactile magnetic genetic-circuit kit in which each component is a distinct shape rather than a colour or diagram: two circles of different sizes for input signals (large = normal cell, small = cancer cell), a star for an activator, an X for a repressor, an arrow for a promoter, a rectangle for a gene, a semicircle for a terminator and a pentagon for the output (anticancer drug release). This was embedded in a 45-minute workshop of four activities, run five times for more than 110 participants in total. Activity One sent sighted participants into the team's own laboratory in a wheelchair, where they discovered the doorway was barely wider than the chair, a slope and uneven bricks blocked independent movement, and bench spacing left no turning room. Activity Two brought in David Doyle, Project Head of the Accessibility in Synbio Labs community project, to teach Design Thinking, Empathy Mapping and Universal Design - the point being that environments should be designed around users rather than users adapting to environments. Activity Three recreated a standard Chinese middle-school microscope exercise, but half the participants were denied visual access: one student described cell shapes, features and spatial arrangement in words while the others had to reconstruct the specimen on paper, which reliably failed, demonstrating that people can sit in the same classroom and receive very different amounts of information. Activity Four had blindfolded participants assemble, by touch alone, a circuit that releases a drug when cancer cells are detected but not when normal cells are present. Phase 1 feedback exposed real design flaws - unclear verbal instructions about logical relationships between blocks, and block shapes and sizes that were hard to grasp or distinguish - which taught the team that simply converting a visual circuit diagram into differently shaped magnets is not sufficient. For Phase 2 they contacted a Beijing school for the visually impaired and visited twice. The first visit was deliberately not a lesson: team members read biology picture books to the children, using a caterpillar's growth to introduce change in living things, while observing how the children used language to describe scientific phenomena and how they responded to different question types. Because the seven participating children were aged 3-8 and had no basis for promoters, terminators or expression regulation, the team stripped the terminology out and kept only the Input-Regulation-Output logic, recast as a 'sound machine': children explored block shapes by touch, assembled the machine, and a volunteer clapped three times as the audio output when it worked. The star block was introduced as the machine's 'good assistant' that makes it run and the X block as the 'bad assistant' that stops it, so activation and repression were learned through immediate auditory feedback. The kit was then donated to the school so teachers can keep using and adapting it for different ages. Third strand: wiki accessibility treated as a deliverable with real user testing. All charts were redrawn in the Okabe-Ito palette and verified against red-green, blue-yellow and total colour-blindness simulations; the page code was rebuilt with semantic tags so screen readers can identify headings, paragraphs and buttons; an accessibility plugin in the lower right corner offers five text sizes with line and character spacing adjusted in step so layout does not break when enlarged, aimed explicitly at elderly readers; and the entire project is translated into Chinese, English and French with two switching paths. The team then invited a person with red-green colour blindness, elderly users and non-native English speakers to test it and iterated on their feedback. Fourth strand: public science communication on neurodegenerative disease, prompted by a survey finding that most junior high school students did not know what neurodegenerative diseases are, associated them only with memory decline in the elderly, or said 'this has nothing to do with me', while high school students had the capacity but no systematic channel; an interview with the local health bureau director in the Guangying area established that medical staff, government and charities are all delivering information but public acceptance is low and prevention habits are not forming, partly because the material is monotonous and dependent on visual text.","publicEngagement_zh":"BAID-China 從證據而非直覺出發：先做了一份關於身障學生 STEM 障礙的文獻回顧（實驗檯過高、讀取儀器數據、觀察現象，以及對文字或手語支援的需求），再實地走訪 Bethel China 這個服務學齡前視障兒童的公益機構，在那裡指認出兩個具體問題——課程是幾個孩子配一位老師，這會阻礙理解；而觸覺繪本給得了觸感，卻幾乎沒有實際的知識內容。這兩項發現定下了後續的工作議程。第一條路線：隊員 Audrey 在 2026 年初的 iGEM Annual Community Day 加入 iGEM 社群專案「Accessibility in Synbio Labs」，並帶領 BAID-China 的包容性小組，與來自中國、埃及、巴基斯坦與美國的 iGEM 成員一起完成第 1 階段（研究與資料庫建置）與第 2 階段（實驗室稽核）。他們與 Concordia-Shanghai 隊共同研究中國的《無障礙環境建設法》、《殘疾人保障法》與 GB 55019-2021《建築與市政工程無障礙通用規範》，聚焦門口淨寬與輪椅迴轉直徑，各國的研究成果最後彙整成一個開放取用的國際比較資料庫。稽核工具隨後由使用輪椅的科學家 Chloe Franklin 審閱，她的意見帶來實質修改：把 Yes/No/N/A 的格式改成能反映無障礙程度的量尺，因為輪椅使用者的需求差異很大；加入附具體尺寸要求的可量測標準；並依重要性為稽核項目加權，因為建築入口、電梯、緊急疏散路線與衛浴是基礎條件，而設備高度與儲物位置相對容易調整。該隊把她的建議逐項記錄，帶進每週會議，產出新版本，並具名致謝共同創作者（Team Toronto 2026 的 Sami，以及 Mohamed、Sophie 與 Linda）。他們坦言試行測試並未在本賽季內完成，並承諾明年繼續。第二條路線，也是該隊的招牌貢獻：Chloe Franklin 說過，一間漂亮的無障礙實驗室若位於沒有無障礙電梯的高樓層，就毫無意義——這句話把團隊從實體通行推向資訊取得。他們做出一套觸覺磁性基因迴路教具，每個元件以不同形狀而非顏色或圖示區分：兩個大小不同的圓形代表輸入訊號（大 = 正常細胞，小 = 癌細胞）、星形是活化子、X 形是抑制子、箭頭是啟動子、長方形是基因、半圓是終止子、五邊形是輸出（釋放抗癌藥物）。這套教具嵌入一場 45 分鐘、四個活動的工作坊，共舉辦五場，累計超過 110 位參與者。活動一讓明眼參與者坐輪椅進入該隊自己的實驗室，他們發現門口只比輪椅寬一點、一道斜坡與不平整的磚面讓人無法自行通行，實驗檯間距也完全沒有迴轉空間。活動二請來「Accessibility in Synbio Labs」社群專案的負責人 David Doyle 講授設計思考、同理心地圖與通用設計——重點在於環境應該圍繞使用者來設計，而不是讓使用者去適應環境。活動三重現中國國中標準的顯微鏡實驗，但有一半參與者被剝奪視覺管道：由一位學生用言語描述細胞形狀、特徵與空間排列，其他人必須在紙上重建該標本，結果一律失敗，示範了人們可以坐在同一間教室，卻接收到差距極大的資訊量。活動四則讓戴眼罩的參與者純靠觸覺組裝一組迴路，使其在偵測到癌細胞時釋放藥物、在正常細胞存在時不釋放。第 1 階段的回饋暴露出真正的設計缺陷——關於積件之間邏輯關係的口頭說明不夠清楚，積件的形狀與大小也不易掌握或區辨——這讓該隊明白，單純把視覺迴路圖換成不同形狀的磁鐵並不足夠。第 2 階段他們聯繫北京一所視障學校，前後拜訪兩次。第一次刻意不上課：隊員為孩子朗讀生物繪本，用毛毛蟲的成長引入生物的變化，同時觀察孩子如何用語言描述科學現象、以及他們對不同問法的反應。因為參與的七位孩子年齡在 3 至 8 歲之間，對啟動子、終止子或表現調控毫無基礎，該隊把術語全部拿掉，只保留「輸入—調控—輸出」的邏輯，改寫成一台「聲音機器」：孩子用觸覺探索積件形狀、組裝機器，成功時由一位志工拍手三下作為聲音輸出。星形積件被介紹為讓機器運轉的「好幫手」，X 形積件則是讓它停下來的「壞幫手」，於是活化與抑制透過即時的聽覺回饋被學會。教具隨後捐給這所學校，讓老師能持續使用並針對不同年齡調整。第三條路線：把 wiki 無障礙當成一項交付成果，並做了真實的使用者測試。所有圖表改用 Okabe-Ito 配色，並以紅綠色盲、藍黃色盲與全色盲模擬驗證；頁面程式碼以語意化標籤重建，讓螢幕閱讀器能辨識標題、段落與按鈕；右下角的無障礙外掛提供五種文字大小，行距與字距同步調整，放大時版面不會破掉，明確是為年長讀者設計；整個專案並翻譯成中文、英文與法文，提供兩種切換途徑。該隊接著邀請一位紅綠色盲者、年長使用者與非英語母語者實測，再依回饋反覆修改。第四條路線：關於神經退化疾病的科普。起因是一份調查發現，多數國中生不知道神經退化疾病是什麼，只把它與老年人的記憶衰退連在一起，或是說「這跟我沒關係」，而高中生雖有能力理解，卻缺乏系統性的管道；另一場對光影地區衛生主管的訪談指出，醫療人員、政府與公益組織都在傳遞資訊，但公眾接受度低、預防習慣也沒有養成，部分原因是素材單調且依賴視覺文字。","ihp":"The project's human practices thread runs through disease awareness and screening access: interviews with the local health bureau director in the Guangying area on why existing neurodegenerative-disease education fails to land, plus in-school surveys establishing an age-stratified knowledge gap, shaped the public communication strategy to differentiate content depth by audience. The inclusivity work is itself integrated practice - the Chloe Franklin and David Doyle consultations each produced documented, traceable changes to an artefact rather than general encouragement.","ihp_zh":"該專案的 human practices 主線貫穿疾病認知與篩檢可得性：對光影地區衛生主管的訪談探討現有神經退化疾病教育為何無法打中受眾，加上校內調查確立了依年齡分層的知識落差，兩者共同形塑了依受眾區分內容深度的科普策略。包容性工作本身就是整合式實踐——與 Chloe Franklin 和 David Doyle 的諮詢，各自都在某件產出上留下有紀錄、可追溯的修改，而不只是泛泛的鼓勵。","realWorld":"Open outputs: the comparative international laboratory-accessibility legal database, the laboratory accessibility audit tool PDF, the audit evaluation form PDF, the Chinese legal research document, the trilingual accessible wiki itself, and the physical tactile magnetic genetic-circuit kit, which was donated to a Beijing school for the visually impaired for continued teaching use. Commitments are explicit: pilot testing of the audit tool continues into the next season in collaboration with the wider iGEM community.","realWorld_zh":"開放產出：國際實驗室無障礙法規比較資料庫、實驗室無障礙稽核工具 PDF、稽核評估表 PDF、中國法規研究文件、三語無障礙 wiki 本身，以及實體的觸覺磁性基因迴路教具——後者已捐贈給北京一所視障學校，供其持續教學使用。承諾也寫得明確：稽核工具的試行測試將延續到下一賽季，與更廣的 iGEM 社群合作進行。","partners":["Bethel China (charity for preschool children with visual impairments; seven children tested the kit)","a school for the visually impaired in Beijing (kit donated)","iGEM community project 'Accessibility in Synbio Labs' (David Doyle, Project Head)","Chloe Franklin, scientist and wheelchair user (audit tool review)","Concordia-Shanghai iGEM (joint Chinese legal research)","Team Toronto 2026 (Sami) and Mohamed, co-creators of the audit tool","iGEM members from Egypt, Pakistan and the United States","Guangying area local health bureau"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6089/wiki/5.avif","caption":"Workshop Activity One: participants navigate the team's own laboratory in a wheelchair and record the barriers they meet","caption_zh":"工作坊活動一：參與者坐輪椅通行該隊自己的實驗室，並記錄沿途遇到的障礙","credit":"Team BAID-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6089/wiki/12.avif","caption":"Workshop Activity Three: one participant describes a microscope specimen in words while others try to reconstruct it on paper","caption_zh":"工作坊活動三：一位參與者用言語描述顯微鏡標本，其他人試著在紙上把它重建出來","credit":"Team BAID-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6089/wiki/16.avif","caption":"Workshop Activity Four: blindfolded participants build a genetic circuit from shape-coded magnetic pieces by touch alone","caption_zh":"工作坊活動四：戴眼罩的參與者純靠觸覺，用形狀編碼的磁性積件搭出一組基因迴路","credit":"Team BAID-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6089/wiki/24.avif","caption":"Phase 2 at a Beijing school for the visually impaired: seven children aged 3-8 build a 'sound machine' using the tactile kit","caption_zh":"第 2 階段在北京一所視障學校：七位 3 至 8 歲的孩子用這套觸覺教具組出一台「聲音機器」","credit":"Team BAID-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6089/wiki/in1.avif","caption":"The Okabe-Ito colour-blind-safe palette adopted for every chart on the wiki, verified with colour-blindness simulation","caption_zh":"wiki 上每一張圖表都採用的 Okabe-Ito 色盲友善配色，並以色盲模擬驗證","credit":"Team BAID-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6089/wiki/28.avif","caption":"Across five workshop sessions the team reached more than 110 participants","caption_zh":"五場工作坊累計觸及超過 110 位參與者","credit":"Team BAID-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Build the accessible teaching aid, then pilot it twice: first with sighted participants under blindfold so you catch your own design flaws in a controlled setting, then with the actual users after stripping out the terminology they do not yet have - and donate the finished kit to the partner school so it keeps teaching after you leave.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"先做出無障礙教具，再試教兩次：第一次讓明眼參與者戴上眼罩，在可控情境下抓出自己的設計缺陷，第二次面對真正的使用者，並先把他們還不具備的術語全部拿掉——最後把完成的教具捐給合作學校，讓它在你們離開之後繼續被用來教學。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/baid-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/baid-china/inclusivity","https://2026.igem.wiki/baid-china/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/baid-china/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/baid-china/entrepreneurship"],"awards_zh":["包容性獎 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6090":{"team":"BOKU-Vienna","id":"6090","section":"Overgrad","country":"Austria","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/boku-vienna/","projectTitle":"Algaeneering","projectTitle_zh":"Algaeneering","tagline":"Engineering the microalga Chlamydomonas reinhardtii into a vitamin C and folate factory to fight hidden hunger","tagline_zh":"把微藻 Chlamydomonas reinhardtii 改造成維生素 C 與葉酸工廠，對抗隱性飢餓","summary":"BOKU-Vienna overexpressed GGP (vitamin C) and GTPCHI plus ADCS (folate) in Chlamydomonas reinhardtii using Golden Gate Level 0/1/2 assembly, reaching a 4.5x increase in vitamin C in the GGP strain. The project was framed around hidden hunger, which affects an estimated two billion people, and was linked to UN SDGs 2, 3 and 12. Its education practice was built on an explicit didactic framework (the Didactic Triangle) and spanned four goals: sparking curiosity, classroom science, public dialogue and educational media. A genome-scale metabolic model was coupled to a calibrated bioreactor model and a nutritional impact model to translate lab titres into how many people a production plant could feed.","summary_zh":"BOKU-Vienna 以 Golden Gate Level 0/1/2 組裝，在 Chlamydomonas reinhardtii 中過表現 GGP（維生素 C）以及 GTPCHI 加 ADCS（葉酸），GGP 菌株的維生素 C 提高了 4.5 倍。專案以隱性飢餓為主軸，估計影響全球約 20 億人，並連結到聯合國永續發展目標 SDG 2、3 與 12。教育實踐建立在明確的教學框架（教學三角）之上，涵蓋四項目標：引發好奇、課堂科學、公眾對話與教育媒體。他們也把基因組尺度代謝模型接上經校正的生物反應器模型與營養影響模型，把實驗室效價換算成一座生產廠能餵養多少人。","awards":["Best Education — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Genome-scale metabolic modelling of C. reinhardtii (iCre1355, mixotrophic version) with flux balance analysis (FBA), flux variability analysis (FVA), in-silico knockouts and enzyme protein-cost ranking; dynamic FBA bioreactor model calibrated and validated against the team's own flask cultures; a nutritional impact model converting measured vitamin content into daily requirements and people supplied.","frameworks_zh":"C. reinhardtii 的基因組尺度代謝模型（iCre1355，混營版本），搭配通量平衡分析（FBA）、通量變異分析（FVA）、電腦模擬基因剔除與酵素蛋白成本排序；動態 FBA 生物反應器模型以團隊自己的搖瓶培養資料校正與驗證；另有營養影響模型，把量測到的維生素含量換算成每日需求量與可供應人數。","dataviz":"Interactive 'Try the trade-off' widget on the wiki: sliders let a visitor pick a vitamin and see (left) maximum vitamin flux versus growth rate from the genome-scale model and (right) the calibrated flask culture's biomass, ammonium, acetate and vitamin titre over up to 120 h, with the team's own measured points overlaid and a harvest-point marker. Each graph carries an explicit 'How to read this graph' panel and a parameter-provenance table.","dataviz_zh":"wiki 上的互動元件 Try the trade-off：訪客可用滑桿選擇一種維生素，左側顯示基因組尺度模型算出的最大維生素通量與生長速率之間的取捨，右側顯示經校正的搖瓶培養在最多 120 小時內的生物量、銨、乙酸與維生素效價，並疊上團隊自己的量測點與收穫時間點標記。每張圖都附一個明確的「如何讀這張圖」面板與參數來源表。","datascience":"Lab-to-model feedback loop: flask measurements (biomass, ammonium, acetate, vitamin titre) were used to calibrate model parameters, and the model's pre-registered 1-10x overexpression band was compared against the measured 4.5x vitamin C result. Known model gaps were stated openly (measured ammonium ~2 mM below model; no cell-death term).","datascience_zh":"實驗室與模型之間形成回饋迴圈：搖瓶量測（生物量、銨、乙酸、維生素效價）用來校正模型參數，模型事先登記的 1-10 倍過表現區間則與實測的 4.5 倍維生素 C 結果對照。已知的模型落差也公開寫明（實測銨濃度比模型低約 2 mM；模型沒有細胞死亡項）。","software":"Custom interactive children's learning platform (web app, guided by an algae mascot, virtual-microscope zoom from cell to molecule, 3D DNA double helix with VR headset support, base-pairing puzzle game) and a separate 13-module self-paced interactive learning platform with mini-games (lac operon switch, PCR exponential-growth slider, mRNA translation, Cas9 cut-site finder), instant feedback, no sign-up, and a teacher preview mode that unlocks all modules for classroom prep.","software_zh":"自製的互動式兒童學習平台（網頁應用，由一隻藻類吉祥物帶路，虛擬顯微鏡可從細胞縮放到分子，3D DNA 雙螺旋並支援 VR 頭戴裝置，還有鹼基配對拼圖遊戲），以及另一個 13 個模組、可自行調整進度的互動學習平台，內含小遊戲（lac operon 開關、PCR 指數成長滑桿、mRNA 轉譯、Cas9 切位尋找），提供即時回饋、免註冊，並有教師預覽模式可解鎖所有模組供課前準備。","stack":["genome-scale metabolic model iCre1355","flux balance analysis","flux variability analysis","dynamic FBA","web-based interactive learning platform","WebVR / 3D DNA model","Kahoot","Mentimeter / QR-code live surveys"],"techniques":["Golden Gate Assembly (Level 0 to Level 2)","C. reinhardtii transformation (UVM4)","vitamin C and folate assays","microscopy","protein-cost analysis of enzyme targets","bioreactor scale-up scenario modelling"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"BOKU-Vienna ran a four-pillar education strategy explicitly grounded in the Didactic Triangle (learner-educator-content), and designed every child-facing print and digital resource in the dyslexia-friendly ABeeZee font. Pillar 1 (sparking curiosity) included a three-day Children's University (KinderUNI) booth built as a six-station progressive learning path: project poster, live Chlorella tubes and Chlamydomonas microscope images, a handcrafted 3D algae organelle model, a custom web learning platform plus a VR headset for exploring a 3D DNA double helix, an interactive genetic-engineering poster, and a gamified 'plasmid toss' into a large algae model to represent transformation; gummy-bear DNA building ran alongside. The same station set was then carried to Karwan Haus, a Caritas Wien refugee shelter in Vienna, on 17 August 2026 for children aged 4-12, with the flyer translated into four languages, Arabic- and Russian-speaking team members explaining stations, illustration-heavy materials, child-sized lab coats and goggles lent by KinderUNI BOKU, Lego-brick Golden Gate Cloning, stamps and science badges; in the exit survey most children chose 'I would love to work in science in the future'. Pillar 2 put a three-week, four-visit curriculum into two primary schools (Ruckergasse in Vienna and Neuarzl in Tyrol) with strawberry DNA extraction, lab-safety and pipetting sessions, a construct-assembly exercise for the GGP enzyme, vitamin C detection, Kahoot recaps and a field trip to the ZOOM Children's Museum where pupils wrote, drew and voiced two stop-motion films about algae and genetic modification; a middle-school workshop ('Code of Life - How We Program Cells') added a red-cabbage anthocyanin biosensor experiment, and a high-school visit to BG/BRG Tulln had students identify C. reinhardtii against Spirulina and Chlorella under the microscope. Measured impact: in the primary-school pre/post evaluation, zero children named science as a desired profession at the start versus five at the end, and 75.0% said they had become curious about programming cells (16.7% wanted to learn more first, 8.3% said they definitely want to do it in future). Pillar 3 (public dialogue) comprised a booth at Austria's Long Night of Research (24 April 2026) with a live visitor survey board on GMO acceptance and awareness that over 5 billion people face micronutrient deficiency, the Muthgassen Summer Festival, a 'Future of Food' panel discussion at TU Wien's Boecklsaal on 3 October 2026 with about 60 attendees and four panelists spanning algae cosmetics (Rita Mota), UNICEF Austria malnutrition work (Michael Blauensteiner), algae production engineering (Lukas Neuwirth, ex-Ecoduna) and microalgae research (Johannes Stadlmann), run in three blocks with anonymous QR-code audience polling and spirulina cotton candy, plus a pub quiz for about thirty STEM and non-STEM students. Pillar 4 produced durable media: an illustrated German children's book 'Welche Sprache spricht das Leben?' co-developed with KinderBOKU (characters such as 'Grandma Polymerase' who knits DNA together), launched at Vienna's Pappenheimgasse public library for a 4th-grade and a 5th-grade class with a copy donated to the library's lending collection and a copy given to every child; a comic advised by Martina Froehlich of KinderBOKU; the German-language podcast 'AlgaeHearing' on Spotify, deliberately in German because accessible German science content is scarce; the 13-module interactive learning platform with a teacher preview mode; and a feature article in the German-language life-science magazine BioSpektrum (issue 32, 4 June 2026). Critically, all tested worksheets, workshop guides and experiment protocols were published as downloadable Open Educational Resources on eduvidual.at, the official learning platform of the Austrian Federal Ministry of Education, Science and Research, so Austrian teachers nationwide can reuse them. Named-attribution testimonials were collected from the teacher at Ruckergasse, the head of the Pappenheimgasse library, the head of KinderBOKU and a social worker at Karwan Haus.","publicEngagement_zh":"BOKU-Vienna 推動四大支柱的教育策略，明確以教學三角（學習者—教育者—內容）為基礎，並把所有面向兒童的印刷與數位素材都以對閱讀障礙友善的 ABeeZee 字體設計。支柱一（引發好奇）包含為期三天的兒童大學（KinderUNI）攤位，設計成六站循序漸進的學習動線：專案海報、活體 Chlorella 試管與 Chlamydomonas 顯微照片、手工製作的 3D 藻類胞器模型、自製網頁學習平台搭配 VR 頭戴裝置探索 3D DNA 雙螺旋、互動式基因工程海報，以及把質體投進大型藻類模型以代表轉形的遊戲化「丟質體」活動；旁邊同時進行用軟糖熊搭 DNA 的活動。同一組站點在 2026 年 8 月 17 日搬到維也納的 Karwan Haus（Caritas Wien 的難民收容所），對象是 4-12 歲兒童：傳單翻成四種語言、由會說阿拉伯語與俄語的隊員解說各站、素材以插圖為主、兒童尺寸的實驗衣與護目鏡由 KinderUNI BOKU 出借，另有樂高積木版 Golden Gate Cloning、印章與科學徽章；離場問卷中多數孩子選了「我以後很想做科學工作」。支柱二把一套為期三週、共四次到校的課程帶進兩所小學（維也納的 Ruckergasse 與提洛邦的 Neuarzl），內容包括草莓 DNA 萃取、實驗安全與移液練習、GGP 酵素的構築組裝練習、維生素 C 檢測、以 Kahoot 複習，以及到 ZOOM 兒童博物館的校外教學，學生在那裡自己撰稿、繪圖並配音完成兩部關於藻類與基因改造的停格動畫；國中階段的工作坊（Code of Life - How We Program Cells）加入紅甘藍花青素生物感測器實驗；到 BG/BRG Tulln 高中的參訪則讓學生在顯微鏡下分辨 C. reinhardtii 與 Spirulina、Chlorella。量測到的影響：小學課程的前後測中，一開始沒有任何孩子把科學列為想從事的職業，結束時有五位；75.0% 表示自己對改寫細胞的程式產生了好奇（16.7% 想先多了解一些，8.3% 表示未來一定要做）。支柱三（公眾對話）包括 2026 年 4 月 24 日奧地利研究長夜的攤位，現場設有看板調查訪客對基因改造的接受度，以及對全球逾 50 億人面臨微量營養素缺乏的認知；Muthgassen 夏日慶典；2026 年 10 月 3 日在 TU Wien Boecklsaal 舉辦的 Future of Food 論壇，約 60 人出席，四位與談人分別來自藻類化妝品（Rita Mota）、UNICEF Austria 的營養不良工作（Michael Blauensteiner）、藻類生產工程（Lukas Neuwirth，前 Ecoduna）與微藻研究（Johannes Stadlmann），分三段進行，搭配匿名 QR code 現場投票與螺旋藻棉花糖；另有一場約三十位 STEM 與非 STEM 學生參加的酒吧問答。支柱四產出可長期留存的媒材：與 KinderBOKU 共同開發的德文插畫童書 Welche Sprache spricht das Leben?（書中有像「聚合酶奶奶」這樣把 DNA 編織起來的角色），在維也納 Pappenheimgasse 公共圖書館對一個四年級與一個五年級班級舉行發表會，捐一本給圖書館的外借館藏，並送給每位孩子一本；由 KinderBOKU 的 Martina Froehlich 擔任顧問的漫畫；在 Spotify 上的德語 podcast AlgaeHearing，刻意用德語，因為平易近人的德語科學內容相當稀少；有教師預覽模式的 13 模組互動學習平台；以及在德語生命科學雜誌 BioSpektrum 刊出的專題文章（第 32 期，2026 年 6 月 4 日）。最關鍵的是，所有經過實測的學習單、工作坊指引與實驗流程，都以可下載的開放教育資源發布在 eduvidual.at，也就是奧地利聯邦教育、科學與研究部的官方學習平台，讓全國教師都能重複使用。他們也收集了具名的推薦意見，分別來自 Ruckergasse 的老師、Pappenheimgasse 圖書館館長、KinderBOKU 負責人與 Karwan Haus 的一位社工。","ihp":"Human Practices was structured into three sequential phases, each with its own stakeholder set: (1) lab experts for technical feasibility, which changed key design decisions; (2) outside critics on GMOs, sustainability and ethics, where the team explicitly sought disconfirming rather than validating views; (3) nutrition and product-design conversations about who should be prioritised as a target group and how the product would be delivered. The team framed iHP against the reflective/responsible/responsive triad, mapped the project to SDGs 2, 3 and 12, and used the 'Future of Food' panel plus audience polling as a live iHP instrument. The panel's main takeaway was recorded honestly as 'our work is meaningful, but GMO-based projects are not without risk and open questions, especially when implemented at a larger scale'.","ihp_zh":"人類實踐分成三個依序進行的階段，各有自己的利害關係人：（1）實驗室專家，用於確認技術可行性，這一階段改變了關鍵設計決策；（2）針對基因改造、永續性與倫理的外部批評者，團隊明確尋求能證反自己的意見，而不是來背書的意見；（3）營養與產品設計的對話，討論該優先服務哪一個目標族群、產品又該如何遞送。團隊以反思性、負責性、回應性三者構成的框架檢視整合式人類實踐，把專案對應到 SDG 2、3 與 12，並把 Future of Food 論壇與現場投票當作即時的人類實踐工具。論壇的主要結論也誠實記錄下來：我們的工作有意義，但以基因改造為基礎的專案並非沒有風險與未解的問題，尤其是放大到更大規模實施的時候。","realWorld":"The impact model translated measured vitamin content into concrete figures: 25 g dry algae per day covers one daily folate requirement and 116 g covers vitamin C; a hypothetical 100 m3 production plant at wild-type folate content could cover the yearly folate need of roughly 900 adults or 490 pregnant women. The design reactor scenario produced 0.46 g/L/day, nitrogen-capped, at about 1.5x the flask vitamin titre. The team also published a separate 'iGEM guide' page for teams starting out.","realWorld_zh":"影響模型把量測到的維生素含量換算成具體數字：每天 25 g 乾藻可滿足一日的葉酸需求，116 g 可滿足維生素 C；若以野生型的葉酸含量計算，一座假想的 100 m3 生產廠可覆蓋約 900 名成人或 490 名孕婦一年的葉酸需求。設計反應器情境的產量為 0.46 g/L/day，受氮源上限限制，維生素效價約為搖瓶的 1.5 倍。團隊另外也做了一個給新手隊伍的 iGEM 指南頁面。","partners":["KinderBOKU / KinderUNI BOKU (BOKU University children's science programme)","Caritas Wien - Karwan Haus refugee shelter","ZOOM Children's Museum, Vienna","Pappenheimgasse public library, Vienna","Ruckergasse Primary School, Vienna","Neuarzl Primary School, Tyrol","BG/BRG 21 bilingual middle school","BG/BRG Tulln high school","TU Wien (Boecklsaal venue)","eduvidual.at - Austrian Federal Ministry of Education, Science and Research learning platform","BioSpektrum magazine","UNICEF Austria (panelist)","Stroeck (sponsor, panel catering)","Polymun"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6090/wiki/hp-and-education/kinderuni/kinderuni-02.avif","caption":"Children at the Children's University (KinderUNI) six-station synthetic biology booth in Vienna","caption_zh":"維也納兒童大學（KinderUNI）六站式合成生物學攤位上的孩子們","credit":"Team BOKU-Vienna, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6090/wiki/hp-and-education/karwan-haus/karwan-haus-golden-gate-assembly-via-lego-bricks.avif","caption":"Teaching Golden Gate assembly with Lego bricks at Karwan Haus, a Caritas Wien refugee shelter","caption_zh":"在 Caritas Wien 的難民收容所 Karwan Haus 用樂高積木教 Golden Gate 組裝","credit":"Team BOKU-Vienna, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6090/wiki/hp-and-education/childrensbook/childrensbook-front.avif","caption":"The team's illustrated German children's book, co-developed with KinderBOKU and donated to a Vienna public library","caption_zh":"團隊與 KinderBOKU 共同開發的德文插畫童書，並捐贈給維也納一間公共圖書館","credit":"Team BOKU-Vienna, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6090/wiki/hp-and-education/lernplattform/1-overview-of-our-interactive-learning-platform-with-13-modules.avif","caption":"The free 13-module interactive learning platform, with no sign-up and a teacher preview mode","caption_zh":"免費的 13 模組互動學習平台，免註冊並具教師預覽模式","credit":"Team BOKU-Vienna, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6090/wiki/hp-and-education/panel-discussion/panel-discussion-people.avif","caption":"The 'Future of Food' public panel discussion at TU Wien, about 60 attendees with live QR-code polling","caption_zh":"在 TU Wien 舉辦的 Future of Food 公開論壇，約 60 人出席並以 QR code 現場投票","credit":"Team BOKU-Vienna, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6090/wiki/hp-and-education/primary-school/primary-school-02.avif","caption":"Pupils extracting DNA during the three-week primary-school curriculum","caption_zh":"三週小學課程中正在萃取 DNA 的學生","credit":"Team BOKU-Vienna, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Publish every tested worksheet, workshop guide and experiment protocol as open educational resources on the national ministry education platform (as BOKU did on eduvidual.at), so school use continues after the project ends, and measure the same cohort before and after (career aspirations plus curiosity items) so learning gain is a number, not an anecdote.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把每一份實測過的學習單、工作坊指引與實驗流程，都當作開放教育資源發布在國家教育部的學習平台上（就像 BOKU 放在 eduvidual.at 那樣），讓專案結束後學校仍能繼續使用；並對同一批學生做前後測（職業志向加上好奇心題項），讓學習成效成為一個數字，而不是一則軼事。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/boku-vienna/","https://2026.igem.wiki/boku-vienna/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/boku-vienna/inclusivity","https://2026.igem.wiki/boku-vienna/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/boku-vienna/model"],"awards_zh":["最佳教育 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"rank":7},"6096":{"team":"XJTLU-China","id":"6096","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-china/","projectTitle":"dogmaOS — programming translation rhythm for soluble protein expression","tagline":"Design where and for how long the ribosome should pause, then re-engineer the host tRNA pool to make that pause possible.","summary":"XJTLU-China asked whether soluble yield of hard-to-express recombinant proteins in E. coli can be improved by deliberately programming *where* translation slows down, rather than by maximising expression. Their dry-lab system catmaOS (Codon-Aware Translation Modeling and Analysis Operating System) chains four models: structural co-translational folding priority (M1), evolutionary conserved slow-codon evidence (M2), a five-layer translation-kinetics and ribosome-traffic engine with constrained Pareto selection (M3-A to M3-E), and host tRNA-pool intervention design (M4). The framework picked a single synonymous G-CSF design (W1-S) out of six candidates and an engineered BL21-AlaPro chassis, both of which went to the bench; Four-Leaf Clover RT-qPCR then measured the actual tRNA knockdown and that number was fed back into M3-A as an updated host context. It won Best Model (Undergraduate) and Best Education (Undergraduate).","awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Model — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Education — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"catmaOS is a four-model, five-layer multiscale pipeline and is unusually explicit about what each layer is and is not. M1 is a structural-bioinformatics scoring model: it builds a residue-level evidence table from PDB coordinates (G-CSF, PDB 1RHG chain B, UniProt P09919, RefSeq NM_000759.4), runs DSSP for secondary structure and relative solvent accessibility, solves a self-consistent native-contact occupancy model as chain length grows (Jacobs-Shakhnovich) to detect folding events at a 1 kBT free-energy-drop threshold with a 4 Angstrom contact cutoff, adds Kyte-Doolittle hydrophobic exposure, cysteine-neighbourhood scores, DSSP transition and beta-initiation tracks and an AGGRESCAN-style aggregation propensity, then fuses them with availability-aware weights into a 0-100 priority score and shifts it downstream by a 35-codon ribosome exit-tunnel offset (scanned 30-40 codons for sensitivity). M2 is a comparative-genomics model: MAFFT L-INS-i protein alignment projected back to codons with PAL2NAL, GtRNAdb/tRNAscan-SE high-confidence tRNA gene copy numbers per species, a frozen codon-anticodon wobble-penalty table, a tRNA-adaptation-style effective supply W_s(c) converted to within-species relative 'resistance', a top-25%-resistance slow-codon label, a strict same-amino-acid filter, and Henikoff position-based sequence weighting to produce a weighted slow-codon conservation score with an explicit effective-coverage track. M3 is the kinetic core: M3-A decomposes intrinsic codon dwell into decoding (inverse effective cognate/wobble supply with a near-cognate competition term, K_dec = 0.80, gamma_near = 0.50), peptidyl-transfer (proline/EF-P arrest context), basal translocation and ViennaRNA RNAplfold local-unpaired-probability RNA resistance, with four ablation configurations A0-A3 to attribute mechanism; M3-B feeds that rate vector into TWO independent ribosome-traffic backends — a deterministic Ribosome Flow Model with Extended Objects (RFMEO) steady state and a stochastic Gillespie kinetic Monte Carlo extended-object TASEP (5 replicates, SEM bands, warm-up discarded) — and cross-validates them with Pearson, Spearman, concordance and top-k hotspot overlap plus an alpha-beta boundary-sensitivity grid; M3-C maps traffic-safe dwell envelopes, exit-tunnel availability gates, relative contact-order folding demand, a finite-state productive-pathway propagator p_{L+1} = p_L exp(s Q_L dt_L) run over a 0.5/1/2 scale grid (direction called 'robust' only when the sign holds across scales), and a time-weighted unsatisfied-native-contact exposure proxy E_U = sum_L U(L) tau(L); M3-D closes a first-order steady-state mRNA balance M_ss = k_tx / (k_deg,eff + mu) with a scikit-learn mRNA-decay predictor trained on 5,486 curated E. coli half-life records (Chen 2015, Selinger 2003) split gene-grouped 3,883/765/838; M3-E generates synonymous candidates under reading-frame, GC, motif, restriction-site and homopolymer constraints and selects by constrained Pareto dominance over four frozen objectives (maximise terminal flux J, minimise ribosome load R, maximise productive-pathway C4, minimise exposure C5), with exact enumeration for small spaces and NSGA-II for large ones, scored for precision/recall against exact fronts. M4 extends design to the host: it maps target codons to BL21 tRNA genes, clusters and promoters with a weighted K-12-to-BL21 transfer score (S_map = 0.45 S_signature + 0.20 S_ordered + 0.15 S_count + 0.15 I_80 + 0.05 I_200), proposes copy-number reduction or 1-3 substitutions in a 29-bp promoter core against 15/30/50% weakening tiers, and ranks them with a three-model ML ensemble trained on 112,955 measured core promoters from the published MBRS L4 library (Zhou 2025), held out by -35/-10 motif pairs (67,978/7,680/37,297) achieving r = 0.677, MAE = 0.506 on log2(1+strength).","dataviz":"Eighteen numbered model figures that read as a single argument. Aligned multi-track profiles put six normalised structural feature tracks (F1-F6) above the availability-aware composite score so a reader can see which feature drove a peak; priority profiles are paired with an evidence-coverage track underneath so a high score with thin evidence cannot be misread as a finding. Figure 8 is a tunnel-length sensitivity heatmap (rows = assumed exit-tunnel length 30-40 codons, columns = codon position, fixed 0-100 teal scale, light-grey cells for genuinely unavailable data rather than zero) so the reader can watch high-priority bands migrate as an assumption changes. Figure 11 is a codon-level audit matrix (18 homolog rows x codons 110-121, green = slow in that species' tRNA context, white = comparable, grey = non-comparable). Figure 14 is a log2(candidate/WT) dwell heatmap restricted to edited positions only, with the x-axis explicitly flagged as non-continuous and the legend explaining that +1 means 2x. Figure 16 is a three-panel dot plot of WT-normalised flux, ribosome load and exposure on matched candidate rows, deliberately NOT collapsed into one score. KMC traces carry +/- SEM bands and separate unblocked residence from blocked waiting. Captions state the direction of preference and whether a quantity is measured or a relative model proxy.","datascience":"Two supervised models were trained from public measurement data and one from their own: an mRNA degradation proxy (D2) on 5,486 curated E. coli half-life records with gene/protein/CDS-grouped splits, a 29-bp promoter-strength ensemble on 112,955 measured core promoters held out by -35/-10 motif pairs (a genuinely out-of-distribution split, r = 0.677), and a codon-occupancy regression on 107,627 codon-level Ribo-seq observations across 125 genes with a documented 14-nt P-site offset, first/last 10 codons excluded, and gene-held-out evaluation (22,025 test observations). The team audits its own provenance in public: several dataset source fields are annotated 'unconfirmed', 'remains to be confirmed' or 'not an attributed published dataset size' rather than quietly cited. Model 4's proL promoter screen predicted 0.727 (native) vs 0.386/0.366/0.358 (P1-P3); the built strain BL21-AlaPro was then measured by Four-Leaf Clover RT-qPCR, showing rpoD-normalised mature tRNA falling from 63.98 to 23.42 (alaXW) and 6.828 to 2.254 (proL), and those measured numbers were returned to M3-A as a new effective-supply table for a full A-E rerun. The headline wet-lab readout: TolB-G-CSF model-designed sequence in the engineered host reached a mean soluble/insoluble ratio of 0.140 vs 0.075 for the commercial sequence in WT host (DnaK-normalised, n = 3 biological replicates, ~1.87-fold). Crucially the team also reports the negative result honestly — for PfCHT1 and leptin, insoluble bands weakened but no clear soluble enrichment appeared, and the results figure is literally titled 'Solubility Gains Remain Unclear'.","software":"catmaOS 4.02.06 ships as a downloadable Windows x64 source release with Setup.cmd/Start.cmd, a pinned requirements-lock.txt, a private .venv, a local browser workspace on 127.0.0.1:8767 (sequences never leave the user's machine), a 28-page PDF user manual, and four precomputed read-only interactive demos embedded in the wiki with JSON/CSV export. Every run emits a reproducibility bundle: request.json (typed input, label, source, parameters), result.json on a versioned schema 1.0.0 with input hash, module status and reproducibility record, curves.csv, metrics.csv, exact_candidates.csv, native/evidence-result.json and run.log, all zipped per run_id. The design rule stated on the page — 'missing values stay missing' and 'a completed run confirms the requested task finished; it does not imply every model was executed' — is the discipline most teams lack.","stack":["Python 3.14","NumPy","SciPy","pandas","Biopython","scikit-learn","Matplotlib","DSSP","MAFFT L-INS-i","PAL2NAL","ViennaRNA / RNAplfold","AGGRESCAN","GtRNAdb / tRNAscan-SE","NSGA-II","custom RFMEO solver","custom Gillespie KMC"],"techniques":["co-translational folding free-energy model","structural bioinformatics / DSSP feature fusion","exit-tunnel coordinate mapping with sensitivity scan","comparative genomics codon alignment","tRNA adaptation index-style supply model","Henikoff sequence weighting","ODE/steady-state ribosome flow model (RFMEO)","stochastic Gillespie kinetic Monte Carlo TASEP with extended objects","finite-state Markov folding-pathway propagation","steady-state mRNA mass balance","multi-objective constrained Pareto optimisation","NSGA-II genetic algorithm","machine-learning regression (promoter strength, mRNA decay, codon occupancy)","out-of-distribution held-out validation","ablation studies","backend cross-validation","parameter-scenario robustness analysis","model-to-measurement feedback loop"],"frameworks_zh":"catmaOS 是一條四模型、五層的多尺度管線，並且異常明確地說明每一層「是什麼」與「不是什麼」。M1 是結構生物資訊評分模型：它由 PDB 座標（G-CSF，PDB 1RHG 鏈 B，UniProt P09919，RefSeq NM_000759.4）建立殘基層級的證據表，以 DSSP 取得二級結構與相對溶劑可及性，隨鏈長增長求解一個自我一致的原生接觸佔據模型（Jacobs-Shakhnovich），以 1 kBT 自由能下降為閾值、4 Angstrom 接觸截斷來偵測摺疊事件，再加入 Kyte-Doolittle 疏水暴露、半胱胺酸鄰域分數、DSSP 轉換與 beta 起始軌跡，以及 AGGRESCAN 式的聚集傾向，然後以考量資料可得性的權重融合成 0-100 的優先度分數，並依 35 個密碼子的核醣體出口通道偏移往下游位移（並掃描 30-40 個密碼子做敏感度分析）。M2 是比較基因組學模型：以 MAFFT L-INS-i 做蛋白質比對、用 PAL2NAL 投影回密碼子，取用 GtRNAdb/tRNAscan-SE 各物種高可信度 tRNA 基因套數，搭配一張凍結的密碼子—反密碼子搖擺懲罰表，將 tRNA 適應度式的有效供給 W_s(c) 轉換為物種內的相對「阻力」，以阻力前 25% 標記慢密碼子，施加嚴格的同一胺基酸過濾，並以 Henikoff 位置式序列加權產生一個加權慢密碼子保守度分數，另附明確的有效覆蓋度軌跡。M3 是動力學核心：M3-A 把密碼子的內在停留時間分解為解碼（有效同源/搖擺供給的倒數，加上近同源競爭項，K_dec = 0.80、gamma_near = 0.50）、胜肽基轉移（脯胺酸/EF-P 停滯情境）、基礎轉位，以及以 ViennaRNA RNAplfold 局部未配對機率表示的 RNA 阻力，並以四組消融設定 A0-A3 歸因機制；M3-B 把該速率向量輸入兩套獨立的核醣體流量後端——一個是確定性的含延伸物件核醣體流量模型（RFMEO）穩態解，一個是隨機 Gillespie 動力學蒙地卡羅的延伸物件 TASEP（5 次重複、SEM 帶、捨棄暖機段）——並以 Pearson、Spearman、一致性係數與前 k 名熱點重疊度交叉驗證，另加一張 alpha-beta 邊界敏感度網格；M3-C 繪出流量安全的停留時間包絡、出口通道可得性閘門、相對接觸次序的摺疊需求、一個在 0.5/1/2 尺度網格上執行的有限狀態生產性路徑傳遞子 p_{L+1} = p_L exp(s Q_L dt_L)（只有當正負號在各尺度間維持一致時才稱該方向「穩健」），以及一個時間加權的未滿足原生接觸暴露代理量 E_U = sum_L U(L) tau(L)；M3-D 以 scikit-learn 的 mRNA 衰減預測器（訓練於 5,486 筆整理過的 E. coli 半衰期記錄，Chen 2015、Selinger 2003，按基因分群切分為 3,883/765/838）閉合一階穩態 mRNA 平衡 M_ss = k_tx / (k_deg,eff + mu)；M3-E 在讀框、GC 含量、motif、限制酶切位與同聚物等限制下產生同義候選，並以四個凍結目標的受限 Pareto 支配進行選擇（最大化末端通量 J、最小化核醣體負載 R、最大化生產性路徑 C4、最小化暴露 C5），小搜尋空間用精確列舉、大空間用 NSGA-II，並以對照精確 Pareto 前緣的精確率/召回率評分。M4 把設計延伸到宿主：它將目標密碼子對映到 BL21 的 tRNA 基因、基因簇與啟動子，使用加權的 K-12 到 BL21 轉移分數（S_map = 0.45 S_signature + 0.20 S_ordered + 0.15 S_count + 0.15 I_80 + 0.05 I_200），提出降低套數或在 29 bp 啟動子核心做 1-3 個置換，對應 15/30/50% 的弱化層級，並以三模型 ML 整合（訓練於已發表 MBRS L4 資料庫的 112,955 個實測核心啟動子，Zhou 2025，依 -35/-10 motif 配對留出，67,978/7,680/37,297）排序，在 log2(1+強度) 上達到 r = 0.677、MAE = 0.506。","dataviz_zh":"十八張編號的模型圖，讀起來像一條完整的論證。對齊的多軌剖面圖把六條正規化的結構特徵軌（F1-F6）放在考量可得性的綜合分數之上，讓讀者看出是哪個特徵推高了某個峰；優先度剖面圖下方必定配一條證據覆蓋度軌，使「高分但證據薄弱」不會被誤讀成發現。圖 8 是通道長度敏感度熱圖（列為假設的出口通道長度 30-40 個密碼子，行為密碼子位置，固定 0-100 的藍綠色標尺，真正無資料的格子以淺灰表示而非以零填補），讓讀者看見高優先度帶隨著假設改變而遷移。圖 11 是密碼子層級的稽核矩陣（18 列同源蛋白 x 密碼子 110-121，綠色代表在該物種的 tRNA 情境下為慢密碼子，白色代表可比較，灰色代表不可比較）。圖 14 是只限於被編輯位置的 log2(候選/WT) 停留時間熱圖，x 軸明確標示為非連續，圖例也說明 +1 意即 2 倍。圖 16 是以 WT 正規化的通量、核醣體負載與暴露三面板點圖，候選列彼此對齊，刻意不壓縮成單一分數。KMC 軌跡附有 +/- SEM 帶，並把未受阻的停留與受阻的等待分開呈現。圖說都標明偏好的方向，以及該量是實測值還是相對的模型代理量。","datascience_zh":"兩個監督式模型由公開量測資料訓練，另一個由團隊自己的資料訓練：mRNA 降解代理模型（D2）以 5,486 筆整理過的 E. coli 半衰期記錄訓練，並按基因/蛋白質/CDS 分群切分；29 bp 啟動子強度整合模型以 112,955 個實測核心啟動子訓練，依 -35/-10 motif 配對留出（這是真正的分布外切分，r = 0.677）；密碼子佔據回歸則用了橫跨 125 個基因的 107,627 筆密碼子層級 Ribo-seq 觀測值，記錄了 14 nt 的 P 位偏移、排除頭尾各 10 個密碼子，並採基因留出評估（22,025 筆測試觀測）。團隊公開稽核自己的資料來源：有幾個資料集的來源欄位被標註為「未確認」、「尚待確認」或「非來自有明確出處的已發表資料集規模」，而不是悄悄引用。模型 4 的 proL 啟動子篩選預測值為 0.727（原生）對 0.386/0.366/0.358（P1-P3）；建成的 BL21-AlaPro 菌株隨後以 Four-Leaf Clover RT-qPCR 量測，顯示以 rpoD 正規化的成熟 tRNA 由 63.98 降至 23.42（alaXW）、由 6.828 降至 2.254（proL），而這些實測值被送回 M3-A 作為新的有效供給表，完整重跑 A-E。濕實驗室的主要讀值：在工程宿主中，模型設計序列 TolB-G-CSF 的可溶/不可溶比平均達 0.140，相較於野生型宿主中商用序列的 0.075（以 DnaK 正規化，n = 3 生物重複，約 1.87 倍）。關鍵的是，團隊也誠實報告負面結果——PfCHT1 與 leptin 的不可溶條帶變弱，但沒有出現明顯的可溶性富集，結果圖的標題就直接寫著「Solubility Gains Remain Unclear」（可溶性提升仍不明確）。","software_zh":"catmaOS 4.02.06 以可下載的 Windows x64 原始碼版本發布，附 Setup.cmd/Start.cmd、鎖定版本的 requirements-lock.txt、私有 .venv、在 127.0.0.1:8767 上執行的本機瀏覽器工作區（序列絕不離開使用者的機器）、一份 28 頁 PDF 使用手冊，以及四個預先計算、嵌入 wiki 的唯讀互動示範，可匯出 JSON/CSV。每次執行都會產出一份可重現性包：request.json（具型別的輸入、標籤、來源、參數）、採版本化綱要 1.0.0 的 result.json（含輸入雜湊、模組狀態與可重現性記錄）、curves.csv、metrics.csv、exact_candidates.csv、native/evidence-result.json 與 run.log，全部依 run_id 打包成 zip。頁面上明文寫出的設計規則——「缺失值就保持缺失」以及「一次完成的執行只確認所請求的任務已結束，不代表每個模型都真的跑過」——正是多數隊伍缺少的紀律。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Best Education winner (Undergraduate). The team built an explicit education framework rather than a list of events: a four-tier 'Lifelong Learning Pathway' (interest inspiration, knowledge building, interdisciplinary co-creation, professional impact) that replaces age-banding with depth of engagement, crossed with a four-stage activity structure (Reach, Construct, Dialogue, Extension) and Gardner's theory of multiple intelligences as the design lens for choosing an activity format. They reached over 2,000 people through 21 activities — workshops, exhibitions and the Learning Mall Premium online platform — and produced 18 reusable education toolkits, with the Extension stage deliberately designed so each activity leaves behind a game, handbook or toolkit rather than ending at the event.","ihp":"A CARE framework distilled from stakeholder conversations: Create Accessibility, Accountable Storytelling, Real-world Alignment, Ethical Design. It originated in a question from Dr Lanlan Han about who actually benefits and how strong the evidence is. The interview timeline is structured as Problem / Design / Scope, and the team documents how it narrowed its own claim: starting from 'boost heterologous protein expression in E. coli', literature and interviews with Dr Antony Kam and industry expert Dr Xijun Piao (CATUG Biotechnology, Suzhou) pushed them to redefine success as soluble usable protein rather than total expression, and to state explicitly that dogmaOS is 'not positioned as a universal protein-production platform'. Mid-stage consultations with Dr Yongtao Zhu, Dr Chun Chan, Prof Sheng Yang (Shanghai Institutes for Biological Sciences, CAS), Prof Zhiliang Lu, Dr Avinash Pandreka (Oxford Suzhou Centre for Advanced Research), Dr Kozo Hamada and Prof Zhongmei Liu (Jiangnan University) convinced them that translation speed alone could not explain folding outcomes, which is what created Model 3 and Model 4.","realWorld":"Target selection was driven by real demand: G-CSF, leptin, PfCHT1 and FGF2 were chosen with researchers and protein-production companies as proteins that are hard to express in E. coli and have clear research or clinical uses spanning public health, rare disease and basic research. The team maps the project to SDGs 3, 9, 12 and 17. Accessibility is the commercial thesis — rather than selling a service, catmaOS is released as free local software so academic labs and iGEM teams with only basic E. coli facilities can do upstream optimisation instead of paying for repeated trial-and-error. Safety is built in: non-pathogenic strains, BSL-1 practice, autoclaved waste, and FLP-FRT removal of the kanamycin cassette after lambda-Red genome editing.","partners":["Xi'an Jiaotong-Liverpool University","CATUG Biotechnology (Suzhou) Co., Ltd.","Shanghai Institutes for Biological Sciences, Chinese Academy of Sciences","Oxford Suzhou Centre for Advanced Research","Jiangnan University","GenScript","SnapGene"],"publicEngagement_zh":"Best Education 得主（大學部）。團隊建立的是明確的教育框架，而不是一串活動清單：一條四層的「終身學習路徑」（興趣啟發、知識建構、跨領域共創、專業影響），以參與深度取代年齡分層，再與四階段活動結構（觸及、建構、對話、延伸）交叉，並以 Gardner 的多元智能理論作為選擇活動形式的設計視角。他們透過 21 場活動——工作坊、展覽與 Learning Mall Premium 線上平台——觸及超過 2,000 人，並產出 18 套可重複使用的教育工具包；「延伸」階段是刻意設計的，讓每場活動都留下一個遊戲、手冊或工具包，而不是在活動結束時就終止。","ihp_zh":"他們從利害關係人對話中萃取出一套 CARE 框架：Create Accessibility（創造可及性）、Accountable Storytelling（負責任的敘事）、Real-world Alignment（與真實世界對齊）、Ethical Design（倫理設計）。它源自 Dr Lanlan Han 的一個問題：究竟誰會受益，以及證據有多強。訪談時間軸依「問題／設計／範圍」編排，團隊也記錄了自己如何收斂主張：起點是「提升 E. coli 中的異源蛋白表現」，但文獻以及與 Dr Antony Kam 和產業專家 Dr Xijun Piao（蘇州 CATUG Biotechnology）的訪談，促使他們把成功重新定義為「可用的可溶性蛋白」而非總表現量，並明確聲明 dogmaOS「並不被定位為通用的蛋白質生產平台」。中期與 Dr Yongtao Zhu、Dr Chun Chan、Prof Sheng Yang（中國科學院上海生命科學研究院）、Prof Zhiliang Lu、Dr Avinash Pandreka（牛津蘇州先進研究中心）、Dr Kozo Hamada 與 Prof Zhongmei Liu（江南大學）的諮詢，說服他們單憑轉譯速度無法解釋摺疊結果——這正是模型 3 與模型 4 誕生的原因。","realWorld_zh":"標的的選擇由真實需求驅動：G-CSF、leptin、PfCHT1 與 FGF2 是與研究人員及蛋白質生產公司共同選定的，它們都在 E. coli 中難以表現，且在公共衛生、罕見疾病與基礎研究上有明確的研究或臨床用途。團隊把專案對應到 SDG 3、9、12 與 17。可及性就是其商業論點——catmaOS 不以服務販售，而是以免費的本機軟體釋出，讓只有基本 E. coli 設備的學術實驗室與 iGEM 隊伍能自行做上游最佳化，而不必付錢去反覆試誤。生物安全內建在設計中：使用非病原菌株、遵循 BSL-1 操作、廢棄物高壓滅菌，並在 lambda-Red 基因組編輯後以 FLP-FRT 移除卡那黴素抗性卡匣。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6096/wiki/assets/drylab/model/figure-08.svg","caption":"Figure 8: exit-tunnel sensitivity heatmap. Rows are assumed ribosome exit-tunnel lengths of 30-40 codons, columns are G-CSF codon positions, and the fixed 0-100 teal scale shows structural priority. Light-grey cells mark genuinely unavailable structural data rather than a score of zero, so the reader can watch high-priority bands migrate as a modelling assumption changes.","credit":"Team XJTLU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"圖 8：出口通道敏感度熱圖。列為假設的核醣體出口通道長度 30-40 個密碼子，行為 G-CSF 的密碼子位置，固定的 0-100 藍綠色標尺表示結構優先度。淺灰色格子標示真正缺乏結構資料之處，而不是以零分充數，讓讀者看見高優先度帶隨著建模假設改變而遷移。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6096/wiki/assets/drylab/model/figure-11.svg","caption":"Figure 11: codon-level audit matrix for reference positions 110-121. Each row is a retained homolog; green marks codons called slow in that species' own tRNA context, white marks other comparable synonymous codons, grey retains non-comparable cells. Positions 115 and 121 were slow in all 18 homologs while 118 was slow in none.","credit":"Team XJTLU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"圖 11：參考位置 110-121 的密碼子層級稽核矩陣。每一列是一個保留下來的同源蛋白；綠色標示在該物種自身 tRNA 情境下被判為慢的密碼子，白色標示其他可比較的同義密碼子，灰色則保留不可比較的格子。位置 115 與 121 在全部 18 個同源蛋白中都是慢的，而 118 在任何一個中都不是。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6096/wiki/assets/merge-20261020/catmaos-figure-12.svg","caption":"Figure 12: the full 'how long to pause' panel, linking synonymous candidate generation to intrinsic dwell (M3-A), kinetic Monte Carlo ribosome traffic with SEM bands (M3-B), folding trajectories and contact exposure (M3-C), the mRNA decay proxy (M3-D) and the constrained objective screen (M3-E) in which four of six candidates pass the flux and ribosome-burden gates.","credit":"Team XJTLU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"圖 12：完整的「該停多久」面板，把同義候選的產生串連到內在停留時間（M3-A）、附 SEM 帶的動力學蒙地卡羅核醣體流量（M3-B）、摺疊軌跡與接觸暴露（M3-C）、mRNA 衰減代理模型（M3-D），以及受限目標篩選（M3-E），其中六個候選有四個通過通量與核醣體負擔的閘門。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6096/wiki/assets/drylab/model/figure-16.svg","caption":"Figure 16: throughput, ribosome load and exposure trade-offs for wild type plus six synonymous candidates, shown as three WT-normalised panels on matched rows and deliberately not collapsed into a single score. W1-F had flux 0.781 and load 1.079, failing the flux >= 0.95 constraint; W1-S passed on all four objectives and went to the bench.","credit":"Team XJTLU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"圖 16：野生型加六個同義候選的產出量、核醣體負載與暴露之間的取捨，以三個以 WT 正規化的面板呈現、候選列彼此對齊，並刻意不壓縮成單一分數。W1-F 的通量為 0.781、負載為 1.079，未通過通量 >= 0.95 的限制；W1-S 四個目標全部通過，進入濕實驗室。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Pair every model score with an explicit evidence-coverage track and run a sensitivity scan over your least-defensible assumption (here, exit-tunnel length), so a figure shows not just the answer but how much of it is real data; and keep competing objectives as separate aligned panels rather than summing them into one invented score. Both are achievable with matplotlib by a motivated 16-year-old and immediately make a model honest.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-china/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-china/software/","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-china/measurement/","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-china/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-china/results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-china/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-china/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-china/education/"],"projectTitle_zh":"dogmaOS — 以程式化的轉譯節奏提升可溶性蛋白質表現","tagline_zh":"設計核醣體該在哪裡、停多久，再重新改造宿主的 tRNA 庫讓這個停頓成為可能。","summary_zh":"XJTLU-China 要問的是：在 E. coli 中難以表現的重組蛋白，其可溶產量能否透過刻意規劃轉譯*在哪裡*變慢來提升，而不是靠把表現量最大化。他們的乾實驗室系統 catmaOS（Codon-Aware Translation Modeling and Analysis Operating System）串接四個模型：結構上的共轉譯摺疊優先度（M1）、演化上保守的慢密碼子證據（M2）、含受限 Pareto 選擇的五層轉譯動力學與核醣體流量引擎（M3-A 至 M3-E），以及宿主 tRNA 庫的干預設計（M4）。這套框架從六個候選中挑出單一個同義密碼子設計（W1-S），以及一個工程化的 BL21-AlaPro 載體株，兩者都進了濕實驗室；接著以 Four-Leaf Clover RT-qPCR 量測實際的 tRNA 剔除程度，再把這個數字回饋進 M3-A 作為更新後的宿主情境。本專案獲得 Best Model（大學部）與 Best Education（大學部）。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"為每一個模型分數都配上一條明確的證據覆蓋度軌，並對你最站不住腳的那個假設（此處是出口通道長度）做敏感度掃描，讓一張圖不只呈現答案，也呈現其中有多少是真實資料；同時把互相競爭的目標維持為各自對齊的面板，而不是加總成一個自創的分數。這兩件事用 matplotlib、一個有心的 16 歲學生就做得到，而且立刻能讓模型變得誠實。","awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳模型 — 得主（大學組）","最佳教育 — 得主（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）"],"rank":66},"6098":{"team":"ICJFLS","id":"6098","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/icjfls/","projectTitle":"ORA-GUARD","projectTitle_zh":"ORA-GUARD","tagline":"An engineered oral probiotic that degrades the sulfur compounds causing halitosis instead of sterilising the mouth","tagline_zh":"一株工程改造的口腔益生菌，分解造成口臭的硫化合物，而不是把整個口腔消毒","summary":"ICJFLS engineered Streptococcus salivarius K12, a GRAS oral probiotic, to express a Sox enzyme cluster plus an MTO enzyme that catalytically degrade the volatile sulfur compounds (H2S, methanethiol, dimethyl sulfide) responsible for bad breath, positioning it as a Live Biotherapeutic Product rather than a mouthwash. Plasmid expression was abandoned after stability tests showed near-total plasmid loss within five days without selection, so the cassettes were moved into the chromosome by CRISPR-Cas9, and a four-layer biosafety system (D-alanine auxotrophy via alr knockout, a PcspA RNA-thermometer suicide switch, no antibiotic resistance markers) was added in direct response to public fear of live GMO bacteria. The entrepreneurship case is numerically specific, with per-dose cost, retail price, gross margin and a named contract manufacturer. They were nominated for Best Entrepreneurship in the High School section.","summary_zh":"ICJFLS 把 Streptococcus salivarius K12 這株列為 GRAS 的口腔益生菌加以工程改造，使其表現 Sox 酵素叢集與一個 MTO 酵素，以催化方式分解造成口臭的揮發性硫化物（H2S、甲硫醇、二甲基硫），並把產品定位為活體生物治療產品（LBP），而不是漱口水。質體表現在穩定性測試顯示沒有選擇壓力時五天內質體幾乎全部流失後便被放棄，改以 CRISPR-Cas9 把表現卡匣送進染色體；同時針對民眾對活體 GMO 細菌的恐懼，直接加上四層生物安全系統（以 alr 基因剔除造成的 D-丙胺酸營養缺陷、PcspA RNA 溫度計自殺開關、不使用抗生素抗性標記）。創業面的論證有具體數字：每劑成本、零售價、毛利率，以及指名的委外製造商。他們入圍高中組 Best Entrepreneurship。","awards":["Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"TAM-SAM-SOM with figures carried through to a revenue target, Business Model Canvas, three-tier business model (B2C subscription, B2B2C through dental clinics, technology licensing), cost structure and pricing with gross margin, a capability gap analysis, a 2026-2035 development roadmap, a risk register, and a comparative regulatory table for LBPs across the US, EU and China. Seven named appendices are listed, including a five-year financial projection model and a patent landscape and IP strategy.","frameworks_zh":"TAM-SAM-SOM，且數字一路貫通到營收目標；Business Model Canvas；三層式商業模式（B2C 訂閱、透過牙科診所的 B2B2C、技術授權）；成本結構與定價含毛利率；能力缺口分析；2026-2035 開發路線圖；風險清單；以及一份美國、歐盟與中國三地 LBP 法規的比較表。另列出七份具名附錄，包括五年財務預測模型與專利地圖及智財策略。","dataviz":"Twelve entrepreneurship figures plus six data tables: TAM/SAM/SOM breakdown, business model canvas, revenue projection chart, product-format panel, roadmap, capability-gap chart and the three-jurisdiction LBP regulatory comparison. Survey results are charted as public attitudes, concerns and information needs.","dataviz_zh":"12 張創業相關圖表加上 6 張資料表：TAM/SAM/SOM 拆解、商業模式圖、營收預測圖、產品形式面板、路線圖、能力缺口圖，以及三個法律管轄區的 LBP 法規比較。問卷結果則繪成民眾態度、顧慮與資訊需求三類圖表。","datascience":"A 745-response questionnaire analysed by age, gender and region, with roughly one third of respondents having experienced halitosis, and results segmented into pain points, safety concerns and information needs. In-vitro degradation efficiency in artificial saliva was benchmarked against purified enzymes. Plasmid-stability passaging produced the five-day loss figure that drove the architecture change.","datascience_zh":"一份 745 份回覆的問卷，依年齡、性別與地區分析，約三分之一的受訪者曾有口臭經驗，結果再切分為痛點、安全顧慮與資訊需求。人工唾液中的體外分解效率以純化酵素為對照基準。質體穩定性的連續傳代實驗則產生了那個五天流失的數字，直接促成架構變更。","software":"","stack":["S. salivarius K12 chassis","CRISPR-Cas9 genomic integration","Sox enzyme gene cluster","MTO enzyme","PcspA RNA thermometer","artificial saliva in-vitro system"],"techniques":["chromosomal integration instead of plasmid expression","D-alanine auxotrophy by alr knockout","temperature-inducible toxin kill switch","VSC quantification in artificial saliva","plasmid retention passaging assay"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A 745-response online questionnaire spanning ages, genders and regions, surfacing the three questions the public actually asks about live engineered bacteria: will it get out of control in the body, will there be side effects, could it be transmitted to others. They then reported a finding most teams would bury, that patients care about what is in it for me and how it works rather than technical sophistication, and rewrote their communication from 'the technology is advanced' to 'it is safe and effective for you'. They also ran public education activities and attended CCIC, the Conference of China iGEMer Community.","publicEngagement_zh":"一份跨年齡、性別與地區、共 745 份回覆的線上問卷，問出了民眾對活體工程細菌真正會問的三個問題：它會不會在體內失控、會不會有副作用、會不會傳染給別人。接著他們報告了一項多數團隊會藏起來的發現：病人在意的是「這對我有什麼好處」和「它怎麼作用」，而不是技術有多精密；於是他們把溝通訊息從「技術很先進」改寫為「它對你安全又有效」。他們也辦了公眾教育活動，並出席 CCIC（Conference of China iGEMer Community）。","ihp":"An explicit dialogue-reflection-iteration-redialogue loop with six documented stakeholder groups, and in each case the design consequence is named. Public fear turned a single safety mechanism into the four-layer defence system. Practising dentists and an oral microbiology researcher killed the original oral-capsule concept on the grounds that capsules have limited local effect in the mouth, which is what produced the mouthwash, lozenge, chewing gum and toothpaste format set and raised the priority on mucosal adhesion and colonisation. At CCIC, senior teams warned that gene editing in non-model organisms would be a bottleneck, so L. reuteri was adopted as a backup chassis, and they shared kill-switch leakage data that caused the team to drop a high-leakage design for the temperature-inducible one. A bioethics professor and a biosafety policy advisor are the reason plasmid expression was abandoned for CRISPR-Cas9 chromosomal integration and why genome-stability and animal toxicology studies were pre-planned.","ihp_zh":"一條明確的對話—反思—迭代—再對話迴路，涵蓋六個有紀錄的利害關係人群體，而且每一次都指出設計上的後果。民眾的恐懼把單一安全機制變成四層防護系統。執業牙醫與一位口腔微生物學研究者否決了最初的口服膠囊構想，理由是膠囊在口腔內的局部作用有限，這才產生漱口水、口含錠、口香糖與牙膏這組產品形式，並把黏膜黏附與定殖的優先度往上提。在 CCIC，資深團隊警告在非模式生物中做基因編輯會是瓶頸，因此團隊把 L. reuteri 納為備用底盤菌株；他們也分享了致死開關的洩漏數據，使團隊捨棄一個高洩漏設計，改用溫度誘導型的版本。一位生物倫理學教授與一位生物安全政策顧問，則是他們放棄質體表現、改走 CRISPR-Cas9 染色體嵌入的原因，也是基因體穩定性與動物毒理學研究被預先排入計畫的原因。","realWorld":"This is a genuine business case with real numbers, and it is the unit economics that separate it from the typical canvas exercise. They state a production cost of roughly RMB 0.5 per dose for freeze-dried bacterial powder plus RMB 0.3 for packaging and filling, totalling about RMB 0.8 per dose falling to RMB 0.3-0.5 at volume; retail pricing of RMB 199 for a 30-dose mouthwash bottle and RMB 159 for a 30-tablet box; and a resulting gross margin of 70-80 percent benchmarked against high-end probiotics. The SOM is built bottom-up rather than taken as a share of the TAM: 100,000 halitosis sufferers at an average RMB 200 per month giving roughly RMB 20 million (about USD 2.8 million) in year one or two, through Tmall, JD.com, Douyin and dental-clinic channels. Market research is partly real and partly desk work: the 745-response questionnaire and dentist interviews are theirs, while the USD 13.44 billion global halitosis market and the RMB 77.9 billion China oral-care figure come from Insight Partners, Frost and Sullivan and similar reports. The competitive analysis is specific and fair, naming BLIS Technologies' BLIS K12 and correctly observing that its deodorising mechanism is indirect because it works through salivaricin bacteriocins, whereas ORA-GUARD catalytically destroys the VSC molecules. The regulatory analysis is the strongest part and is genuinely credible: they identify that NMPA's 2020 biological-products registration classification treats LBPs as therapeutic biological products containing microorganisms, note honestly that neither NMPA nor the FDA has yet issued complete LBP-specific technical guidance, and draw the correct strategic conclusion that this is both policy risk and a chance to help set the standard, with early regulator engagement as the stated tactic. Partners are named rather than implied: Shandong Bona Technology Group for probiotic fermentation and freeze-drying, with industrialisation discussions already begun, and Shijia Doctor Dental Hospital as a clinical and channel partner. Be blunt about the gaps, though. There is no registered company, no incubator place, no grant and no investor commitment; investment partners are described only as a category ('biotechnology VCs and oral care industry funds'). The IP position is weaker than it first reads: the strain construction strategy and genetic circuits are said to form technical barriers that are 'planned to be protected through patent applications', so nothing is filed. The revenue projection figure is labelled as internal estimates, and the appendices (five-year financial model, patent landscape) are listed as titles rather than linked documents, so the deepest financial work is asserted rather than shown. Continuation is a licensing-and-partnering intent rather than a funded plan, and an LBP approval route of that length will outlast any student team unless the Bona relationship becomes a formal transfer.","realWorld_zh":"這是一份有真實數字的商業論證，而把它和典型的商業模式圖作業區分開來的，正是單位經濟。他們寫出冷凍乾燥菌粉每劑生產成本約 RMB 0.5，加上包裝與充填 RMB 0.3，每劑合計約 RMB 0.8，量產後可降到 RMB 0.3-0.5；零售定價為 30 劑漱口水一瓶 RMB 199、30 錠一盒 RMB 159；由此得出的毛利率為 70-80%，並以高階益生菌為對照基準。SOM 是自下而上建起來的，而不是從 TAM 取一個比例：100,000 名口臭患者、每人每月平均 RMB 200，在第一或第二年約為 RMB 2,000 萬（約 USD 280 萬），通路為 Tmall、JD.com、Douyin 與牙科診所。市場研究一部分是實作、一部分是桌面作業：745 份問卷與牙醫訪談是他們自己做的，而全球口臭市場 USD 134.4 億與中國口腔照護 RMB 779 億這兩個數字則來自 Insight Partners、Frost and Sullivan 等報告。競爭分析具體而公允，指名 BLIS Technologies 的 BLIS K12，並正確指出其除臭機制是間接的——它透過 salivaricin 細菌素作用——而 ORA-GUARD 是以催化方式破壞 VSC 分子。法規分析是最強的一段，也確實可信：他們指出 NMPA 2020 年的生物製品註冊分類把 LBP 視為含微生物的治療用生物製品，誠實說明 NMPA 與 FDA 都還沒有發布完整的 LBP 專屬技術指引，並得出正確的策略結論——這既是政策風險，也是參與制定標準的機會，而他們明講的戰術是及早與法規機關往來。合作夥伴是指名的，不是暗示的：Shandong Bona Technology Group 負責益生菌發酵與冷凍乾燥，產業化討論已經開始；Shijia Doctor Dental Hospital 則是臨床與通路夥伴。不過缺口要講白：沒有登記公司、沒有進駐育成中心、沒有補助、也沒有投資人承諾；投資夥伴只以類別描述（「生技創投與口腔照護產業基金」）。智財的位置也比初讀起來弱：菌株建構策略與基因迴路被說成構成技術門檻，而這些是「計畫透過專利申請加以保護」，所以其實什麼都還沒提出申請。營收預測被標為內部估計，附錄（五年財務模型、專利地圖）只列標題而沒有連結文件，所以最深的財務工作是宣稱而非展示。後續發展是授權與合作的意向，而不是有資金的計畫；而一條那麼長的 LBP 審批路徑，會比任何學生團隊都活得久——除非與 Bona 的關係變成正式的技術移轉。","partners":["Shandong Bona Technology Group Co., Ltd. (probiotic fermentation, freeze-drying, technology transfer and industrialisation discussions)","Shijia Doctor Dental Hospital and dental clinics (clinical trials and channel)","Practising dentists and an oral microbiology researcher (dosage form and colonisation advice)","A bioethics professor and a biosafety policy advisor","CCIC (Conference of China iGEMer Community) experts and past award-winning teams","University synthetic biology laboratories"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6098/wiki/entrepre/fig-3-entrepre.avif","caption":"TAM, SAM and SOM analysis for ORA-GUARD, with the SOM built bottom-up from 100,000 target users at RMB 200 per month","caption_zh":"ORA-GUARD 的 TAM、SAM 與 SOM 分析，其中 SOM 由 100,000 名目標使用者、每人每月 RMB 200 自下而上建立","credit":"Team ICJFLS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6098/wiki/entrepre/fig-11-entrepre.avif","caption":"Comparative overview of Live Biotherapeutic Product regulatory pathways in the US, EU and China","caption_zh":"美國、歐盟與中國的活體生物治療產品法規路徑比較總覽","credit":"Team ICJFLS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6098/wiki/entrepre/fig-10-entrepre10.avif","caption":"ORA-GUARD development roadmap from 2026 proof of concept to 2035","caption_zh":"ORA-GUARD 從 2026 年概念驗證到 2035 年的開發路線圖","credit":"Team ICJFLS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6098/wiki/entrepre/fig-12-entrepre.avif","caption":"Gap analysis between current team capabilities and the capabilities needed to commercialise ORA-GUARD","caption_zh":"團隊現有能力與將 ORA-GUARD 商業化所需能力之間的缺口分析","credit":"Team ICJFLS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Insist on three numbers before any market slide: cost per dose, price per unit and resulting gross margin, built from the actual process (freeze-drying plus fill-and-finish) rather than from a market-report percentage. And copy their SOM discipline, where the obtainable market is users times spend per user per month, not a fraction of a global TAM.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"在任何市場投影片之前，先要求三個數字：每劑成本、每單位售價，以及由此得出的毛利率，而且要從真實製程（冷凍乾燥加上充填包裝）算出來，不是從市場報告的百分比推出來。另外值得照抄的是他們的 SOM 紀律：可取得市場是使用者人數乘以每人每月花費，而不是全球 TAM 的一個比例。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/icjfls/","https://2026.igem.wiki/icjfls/entrepreneurship/","https://2026.igem.wiki/icjfls/human-practices/"],"awards_zh":["最佳創業 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6102":{"team":"ZJU-China","id":"6102","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/zju-china/","projectTitle":"NEST","projectTitle_zh":"NEST","tagline":"A sequence-defined SELP hydrogel with a SnoopTag2 plug socket, so one cartilage scaffold can be reconfigured by swapping functional peptides","tagline_zh":"一款序列明確定義的 SELP 水凝膠，搭配 SnoopTag2 插槽，因此同一個軟骨支架只要更換功能性胜肽就能重新配置","summary":"ZJU-China built NEST, a silk-elastin-like protein (SELP) hydrogel carrying SnoopTag2 as a standardised ligation interface, so that repair peptides (Link-N, a chondroitin-sulfate-retaining CPC module, a magnetically responsive anisotropy module, a mitochondrial delivery module) can be attached without redesigning the material. They engineered a SnoopLigase2-ZJU variant for the ligation chemistry, purified SELP by inverse transition cycling optimised to 65 degrees C in PBS with 2 M NaCl, and validated GAG binding by AviTag-BirA site-specific biotinylation onto streptavidin beads with DMMB quantification. The commercial case is a full process-economics build rather than a canvas, with equipment, land, working capital, medium, IPTG, kanamycin, labour by shift and waste volumes all costed, plus a 2026-2042 stage-gated roadmap and a ten-year discounted cash-flow model. They were nominated for Best Entrepreneurship (Undergrad) and Best Biomanufacturing.","summary_zh":"ZJU-China 打造了 NEST，一種帶有 SnoopTag2 作為標準化連接介面的絲蛋白-彈性蛋白樣蛋白（SELP）水凝膠，使修復用胜肽（Link-N、一個可保留硫酸軟骨素的 CPC 模組、一個具磁響應性的非等向性模組、一個粒線體遞送模組）能夠直接接上，而不必重新設計材料本身。團隊為這套連接化學改造出 SnoopLigase2-ZJU 變異體，以反相轉變循環純化 SELP 並將條件最佳化為含 2 M NaCl 的 PBS、65 度 C，並以 AviTag-BirA 位點專一性生物素化接到鏈黴親和素磁珠上、再以 DMMB 定量來驗證 GAG 結合。商業論證是一份完整的製程經濟模型，而不是一張商業模式圖：設備、土地、營運資金、培養基、IPTG、卡那黴素、按班別計算的人力與廢棄物量全部估算成本，另有 2026-2042 的階段關卡路線圖與一套十年折現現金流模型。團隊入圍 Best Entrepreneurship（大學部）與 Best Biomanufacturing。","awards":["Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Biomanufacturing Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"TAM-SAM-SOM with a documented estimation basis and a stated conversion coefficient from osteoarthritis prevalence to the cartilage-repair addressable population, three-tier competitor analysis, NREL-style techno-economic cost structure (fixed capital investment, land, working capital, variable and fixed operating costs, annual capex), a ten-year cash-flow and NPV model, a Sustainable Business Model Canvas, a tiered critical/high risk register tied to stage-gate decisions, a staged financing plan from angel through Series B, a skill-gap analysis across eight capability areas, and a TCFD-shaped ESG framework (governance, strategy, risk and opportunity, metrics and targets).","frameworks_zh":"TAM-SAM-SOM 架構，附有明確記錄的估算依據，以及一個由骨關節炎盛行率換算到軟骨修復可觸及人口的轉換係數；三層級競爭者分析；NREL 式的技術經濟成本結構（固定資本投資、土地、營運資金、變動與固定營運成本、年度資本支出）；一套十年現金流與 NPV 模型；一張永續商業模式圖；一份依關鍵/高風險分級並綁定階段關卡決策的風險清冊；一套由天使輪到 B 輪的分階段籌資計畫；橫跨八個能力領域的技能落差分析；以及一個依 TCFD 架構撰寫的 ESG 框架（治理、策略、風險與機會、指標與目標）。","dataviz":"Nine entrepreneurship figures: SAM and SOM projections, a three-panel budget classification and estimation-basis summary, the 2026-2042 roadmap across R&D, manufacturing, regulatory, fundraising and commercialisation lanes, a ten-year cash-flow chart distinguishing inflows, outflows, net and discounted cash flows, the business model canvas, a skills radar, and three competition-award photographs. A downloadable NEST cost sheet PDF carries the underlying calculations, and five per-module notebook PDFs back the wet-lab work.","dataviz_zh":"九張創業相關圖表：SAM 與 SOM 推估、一張三面板的預算分類與估算依據彙總、橫跨研發、製造、法規、募資與商業化五條軌道的 2026-2042 路線圖、一張區分流入、流出、淨現金流與折現現金流的十年現金流圖、商業模式圖、一張技能雷達圖，以及三張競賽獲獎照片。可下載的 NEST 成本表 PDF 內含底層計算，另有五份各模組的實驗紀錄 PDF 支撐濕實驗成果。","datascience":"The costing is done from first principles rather than from benchmarks. Required SELP output for the initial market is derived first, then equipment is sized against it, giving major equipment of CNY 7.45 million (about USD 1.11 million) estimated with input from Beijing Weixinkang Medical. Consumables are itemised: roughly CNY 290,700 per year for the three main LB components, 7.47 kg of IPTG and 1.57 kg of kanamycin annually, plus PBS and sodium chloride for purification, and about 31,360 L of spent culture medium as annual waste. Labour is modelled as a sum over operations of fully loaded hourly cost, with day and night shifts priced separately against actual Zhejiang biomanufacturing job adverts (CNY 6,000-8,000 per month, conservatively the low end) and Hangzhou cleaner salaries, totalling about CNY 2.6603 million per year. The cash-flow model uses a 10 percent real cost of capital, a 13.27 percent revenue CAGR from a cartilage-repair market report and 2 percent annual cost inflation at a fixed USD 1 = CNY 6.72.","datascience_zh":"成本估算是從第一原理做起，而不是照抄業界標竿。團隊先推導出初期市場所需的 SELP 產量，再據此估算設備規模，得到主要設備約 745 萬 CNY（約 111 萬 USD），此數字參考了 Beijing Weixinkang Medical 的意見。耗材逐項列出：三種主要 LB 成分每年約 290,700 CNY、每年 7.47 kg 的 IPTG 與 1.57 kg 的卡那黴素，加上純化用的 PBS 與氯化鈉，以及每年約 31,360 L 的廢培養基。人力成本以各項操作的全額負擔時薪加總建模，日班與夜班分別定價，依據浙江生物製造業的實際徵才廣告（每月 6,000-8,000 CNY，保守取下限）與杭州清潔人員薪資，合計每年約 266.03 萬 CNY。現金流模型採 10% 的實質資金成本、取自一份軟骨修復市場報告的 13.27% 營收 CAGR，以及每年 2% 的成本通膨，匯率固定為 1 USD = 6.72 CNY。","software":"","stack":["E. coli BL21(DE3)","SELP (silk-elastin-like protein) inverse transition cycling","SnoopTag2 / SnoopLigase2-ZJU","AviTag-BirA biotinylation","streptavidin magnetic beads","DMMB GAG assay","Fe3O4 magnetic nanoparticles with DogTag-TVN","DOPE/DOTAP/DSPE-PEG-Mal liposomes","confocal microscopy and TEM"],"techniques":["modular peptide-peptide ligation as a product interface","temperature and salt-optimised ITC purification (65 C, 2 M NaCl)","site-specific biotinylation for immobilised binding assays","TEV and ULP1 protease processing","liposome-mitochondria complex assembly and uptake","lyophilisation and hydrogel re-formation"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A committed rather than rhetorical plan: during R&D they intend to spend at least CNY 50,000 annually on patient education, public lectures and open science materials, support SynEduGlobal for synthetic-biology education, establish a charitable fund for rural medical outreach and cartilage-health awareness, and continue working with Non-place Studio to use art to build understanding of synthetic biology and empathy for people with cartilage injuries. They also name limited public understanding of hydrogel therapy as a genuine commercial risk to patient confidence and access, not just a communications gap.","publicEngagement_zh":"這是一份有承諾而非只是說法的計畫：團隊打算在研發期間每年至少投入 50,000 CNY 於病患教育、公眾講座與開放科學素材，支持 SynEduGlobal 推動合成生物學教育，設立一筆慈善基金用於偏鄉醫療推廣與軟骨健康意識宣導，並持續與 Non-place Studio 合作，以藝術建立社會對合成生物學的理解，以及對軟骨損傷患者的同理。團隊也把公眾對水凝膠療法理解有限一事，指認為對病患信心與可及性的實質商業風險，而不只是溝通上的落差。","ihp":"Their iHP is organised as design-build-test-learn cycles, with an Implementation stage split into hardware, industrial production and entrepreneurship cycles. The entrepreneurship cycle consulted stakeholders across manufacturing, sales, government regulation, finance and entrepreneurship support, and the documented consequence is specific: they gave cost greater weight in the material design, built the detailed business model, went looking for a CDMO partner, and secured a first expression of investment interest. Clinicians fed back that the material's complexity could complicate market approval, which pushed attention toward regulatory simplicity. Professor Erik Forsberg guided the cash-flow and NPV analysis, and Beijing Weixinkang Medical supplied the equipment cost estimates, so industry input is embedded in the numbers rather than quoted alongside them.","ihp_zh":"他們的整合式人類實踐以設計-建構-測試-學習（DBTL）循環編排，其中「落實」階段再分為硬體、工業生產與創業三個循環。創業循環諮詢了製造、銷售、政府法規、財務與創業輔導等各方利害關係人，而留下紀錄的後果相當具體：團隊在材料設計中給了成本更高的權重、建立了詳細的商業模式、開始尋找 CDMO 夥伴，並取得了第一份投資意向。臨床醫師回饋指出材料的複雜度可能使上市審查變得棘手，這使團隊把注意力轉向法規上的簡潔性。Erik Forsberg 教授指導了現金流與 NPV 分析，Beijing Weixinkang Medical 則提供設備成本估算，因此業界意見是嵌進數字裡，而不是擺在數字旁邊引用。","realWorld":"A genuinely serious venture attempt with one glaring soft spot. The strong parts first. The business model is a phased B2B: research partnerships and technology-development licensing early to build relationships and validate demand, then supply of implant material and delivery solutions to clinical institutions, with orthopaedic companies and hospitals as customers and patients explicitly identified as beneficiaries rather than initial sales targets. Research grants and equity are accounted separately from operating income, which is a distinction most teams blur. The MVP is honestly narrow, the SELP-SnoopTag2 hydrogel alone, with production and storage stability already demonstrated in the lab and the remaining path stated plainly: classification confirmation, product testing, animal studies, clinical trials, NMPA registration, and a medical-device manufacturing licence for the manufacturer, expected to take ten years. The first indication is focal knee-cartilage defects in China, chosen for surgical volume and clinical-evidence base. The cost model is the standout: equipment, land, working capital, itemised media and reagents, shift-differentiated labour, and waste volumes, published as a downloadable cost sheet. Financing is staged and concrete, with real named programmes and amounts: Hangzhou's 5050 Plan (CNY 1 million start-up, up to CNY 10 million in R&D grants), up to CNY 6 million for a first Class III registration manufactured in Hangzhou via Hangzhou Medical Port, up to USD 500,000 from the GenScript Life Science Research Fund, and crucially a named investor, Ms. Zhang Jie of Huadan Angel, who in a stakeholder interview expressed willingness to discuss roughly CNY 1.5 million after first-round samples meet expectations. Industrial relationships are specific and functional rather than decorative: Weixinkang and Lanyiwei on Class III manufacturing and market access, Yuanyi Bio on fermentation and purification, Yiru Bio on scale-up, Shanghai Lingjiu Medical as a possible CDMO, WuXi AppTec's device-testing centre for registration testing, and Evonik, Arthrex and Smith+Nephew as international targets. They won Gold at Zhejiang University's Dandelion Student Innovation Competition (with prize money) and two Golds at SynBio Challenges 2026, in both the main and the industry track, the latter for the SnoopLigase2-ZJU enzyme system, which is independent validation outside iGEM. IP is planned with real specificity: a Chinese invention patent to be filed in November 2026 covering the SELP-SnoopTag2 structure, manufacturing and purification methods, hydrogel formulation, crosslinking system and peptide attachment, with a prior-art search on SnoopTag2, SELP and Ru/SPS crosslinking before any public data release, and the correct observation that treatment methods are not patentable in China so claims must sit on products and manufacturing. The roadmap is stage-gated across 2026-2042 with a criterion and a required-resources list for each window, and they say outright that they will not assign a break-even year or market-share forecast without a defensible financial model. Now the blunt part. That restraint is contradicted by the headline number: a ten-year NPV of about USD 427 million on an initial investment of about USD 8.69 million, produced by assuming NEST captures 10, 25, 50, 75 and then 100 percent of its SOM in years one to five and holds 100 percent of SOM for years six to ten. Capturing the entire serviceable obtainable market and keeping it, for a Class III implant that by their own roadmap will not be registered until roughly 2037, is not a scenario; it is an upper bound, and they label it only as 'favorable assumptions'. There is also no incorporated entity (the name NexCode Biotechnologies appears but no registration is claimed), no filed patent yet, no signed investment, and no animal data at all, which they state clearly as a limitation on any safety or efficacy claim. The honest reading is that the cost side of this model is excellent and the revenue side is aspirational.","realWorld_zh":"這是一次真正認真的創業嘗試，但有一處明顯的軟肋。先談強的部分。商業模式是分階段的 B2B：早期以研究合作與技術開發授權建立關係並驗證需求，之後再向臨床機構供應植入材料與遞送方案，客戶為骨科公司與醫院，而病患被明確定義為受益者，而不是初期的銷售對象。研究補助與股權募資與營運收入分開記帳，這是多數團隊會混在一起的區分。MVP 的範圍很誠實地窄，只有 SELP-SnoopTag2 水凝膠本身，其生產與儲存穩定性已在實驗室中驗證，剩下的路徑也明白寫出：分類確認、產品檢測、動物試驗、臨床試驗、NMPA 註冊，以及製造商的醫療器材製造許可，預期需要十年。第一個適應症是中國的膝關節局部軟骨缺損，選擇理由是手術量與臨床證據基礎。成本模型是最突出的部分：設備、土地、營運資金、逐項列出的培養基與試劑、區分班別的人力，以及廢棄物量，全部做成可下載的成本表公開。籌資規劃分階段且具體，列出真實的計畫名稱與金額：杭州的 5050 計畫（100 萬 CNY 創業金，研發補助最高 1,000 萬 CNY）、透過 Hangzhou Medical Port 在杭州製造並取得第一張第三類註冊最高可得 600 萬 CNY、GenScript Life Science Research Fund 最高 500,000 USD，而關鍵是還有一位具名投資人，Huadan Angel 的 Zhang Jie 女士，她在利害關係人訪談中表示，待第一輪樣品達到預期後，願意洽談約 150 萬 CNY。產業關係具體且具功能性，而不是拿來裝飾：Weixinkang 與 Lanyiwei 負責第三類製造與市場准入、Yuanyi Bio 負責發酵與純化、Yiru Bio 負責放大量產、Shanghai Lingjiu Medical 為可能的 CDMO、WuXi AppTec 的器材檢測中心負責註冊檢測，而 Evonik、Arthrex 與 Smith+Nephew 則列為國際目標對象。團隊在浙江大學 Dandelion Student Innovation Competition 獲金獎（含獎金），並在 SynBio Challenges 2026 的主賽道與產業賽道各拿一面金獎，後者是憑 SnoopLigase2-ZJU 酶系統，屬於 iGEM 之外的獨立驗證。智財規劃也有實際的細節：預計於 2026 年 11 月提出一件中國發明專利，涵蓋 SELP-SnoopTag2 結構、製造與純化方法、水凝膠配方、交聯系統與胜肽接合，並在任何資料公開前先就 SnoopTag2、SELP 與 Ru/SPS 交聯做先前技術檢索；團隊也正確地指出治療方法在中國不可專利，因此請求項必須落在產品與製造上。路線圖在 2026-2042 間設有階段關卡，每個時間窗都附一條判準與一份所需資源清單，而他們也直言，在沒有站得住腳的財務模型之前，不會指定損益兩平年度或市佔率預測。現在談直白的部分。這份自制卻被最醒目的那個數字推翻了：以約 869 萬 USD 的初始投資，推出約 4.27 億 USD 的十年 NPV，而計算方式是假設 NEST 在第一到第五年分別拿下 SOM 的 10%、25%、50%、75% 然後 100%，並在第六到第十年持續握有 100% 的 SOM。對一項依他們自己的路線圖大約要到 2037 年才會註冊完成的第三類植入物來說，吃下整個可服務可取得市場並一直守住，並不是一種情境，而是一個上限；他們卻只把它標為「有利假設」。此外，公司實體並不存在（文中出現 NexCode Biotechnologies 這個名稱，但沒有宣稱已完成登記）、專利尚未提出、投資尚未簽約，動物實驗資料也完全沒有，而這一點他們自己明確列為任何安全性或療效主張的限制。誠實的讀法是：這個模型的成本面極為出色，營收面則屬一廂情願。","partners":["Beijing Weixinkang Medical Co., Ltd. (Class III manufacturing, sales qualification, market access; equipment cost estimates)","Lanyiwei (Class III medical-device manufacturing and market access)","Yuanyi Bio (synthetic-biology production, fermentation, purification)","Yiru Bio (entrepreneurship and scale-up experience)","Shanghai Lingjiu Medical Technology (biomedical materials, prospective CDMO)","Huadan Angel (Ms. Zhang Jie; expressed willingness to discuss ~CNY 1.5 million early investment)","Professor Erik Forsberg (cash-flow and NPV methodology)","WuXi AppTec medical-device testing centre (prospective registration testing)","Zhejiang University School of Innovation and Entrepreneurship (Dandelion competition)","Non-place Studio (art and public understanding), SynEduGlobal (education)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6102/wiki/images/hp/entrepreneurship/003.avif","caption":"NEST development roadmap and milestones for R&D, manufacturing, regulatory affairs, fundraising and commercialisation, 2026-2042","caption_zh":"NEST 在研發、製造、法規事務、募資與商業化各方面的開發路線圖與里程碑，2026-2042","credit":"Team ZJU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6102/wiki/images/hp/entrepreneurship/004.avif","caption":"Ten-year cash-flow analysis separating inflows, outflows, net and discounted cash flows at a 10 percent real cost of capital","caption_zh":"十年現金流分析，以 10% 的實質資金成本區分流入、流出、淨現金流與折現現金流","credit":"Team ZJU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6102/wiki/images/hp/entrepreneurship/005.avif","caption":"NEST sustainable business model canvas for the phased B2B licensing-then-supply model","caption_zh":"NEST 的永續商業模式圖，對應先授權再供貨的分階段 B2B 模式","credit":"Team ZJU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6102/wiki/images/hp/entrepreneurship/009.avif","caption":"Gold Award for the SnoopLigase2-ZJU enzyme system in the industry track of SynBio Challenges 2026","caption_zh":"SnoopLigase2-ZJU 酶系統在 SynBio Challenges 2026 產業賽道獲得金獎","credit":"Team ZJU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy their bottom-up cost sheet: size the required output first, then let equipment, media, IPTG and antibiotic quantities, shift-differentiated labour rates taken from real local job adverts, and annual waste volumes fall out of it, and publish the whole thing as a downloadable file. Then apply the discipline they stated but did not follow on their own revenue line: never model capturing 100 percent of a serviceable obtainable market, and label any such figure as an upper bound rather than a forecast.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"抄下他們那份自下而上的成本表：先把所需產量定出來，再讓設備、培養基、IPTG 與抗生素用量、取自真實當地徵才廣告並區分班別的人力費率，以及年度廢棄物量全部由此推導出來，最後把整份資料做成可下載的檔案公開。接著，把他們自己說了卻沒有做到的紀律套用到營收那一側：永遠不要把模型設定成拿下可服務可取得市場的 100%，而且任何這類數字都該標示為上限，而不是預測。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/zju-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/zju-china/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/zju-china/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/zju-china/assets/wiki-Bwf3O9W2.js","https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6102/wiki/hp-file/nest-cost-sheet.pdf"],"awards_zh":["最佳創業 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物製造專案 — 入圍"],"rank":14},"6105":{"team":"Mingdao","id":"6105","section":"High School","country":"Taiwan","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/mingdao/","projectTitle":"Waste-to-Watt — bioethanol from plastic-coated paper containers","tagline":"Turn the coffee cups and lunch boxes 7,000 students throw away every day into fuel, by pairing enzymes with a glucose-eating microbe in one pot.","summary":"Mingdao take used paper containers — coffee cups, lunch boxes, ramen bowls — and break their cellulose to glucose with an enzyme cocktail for fermentation to bioethanol. The obstacle is end-product inhibition: cellulase is inhibited by cellobiose and beta-glucosidase by glucose. Their answer is Simultaneous Saccharification and Fermentation, putting Zymomonas mobilis in the same vessel as a glucose sink so neither enzyme ever sees inhibitory product. Three models carry it: a Michaelis-Menten competitive-inhibition fit to their own pNPG assay data giving Km, Vmax and Ki for BglA at fermentation-compatible conditions; a Monod fit to their own Z. mobilis growth curves giving mu_max, Ks and biomass yield; and a coupled ODE in SciPy that feeds every one of those measured parameters into a closed-versus-open simulation of the real one-pot reactor. Every parameter in model three came from their own bench.","awards":["Best Model — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Three models in strict dependency order, and the thing that makes this exemplary for a school team is that the third model contains no borrowed numbers — every parameter was measured by the students in models one and two. MODEL 1 is classical enzyme kinetics on BglA beta-glucosidase from Thermotoga maritima, cloned into pET-24a(+) and auto-induced in E. coli BL21(DE3) in Studier's ZYM-5052 medium. They deliberately characterised it at fermentation-compatible conditions (34 C, Bis-Tris pH ~6.4) rather than the enzyme's thermophilic optimum of 80-100 C, because those are the conditions Z. mobilis can survive. The pNPG assay was run as a two-dimensional matrix: three substrate concentrations (1, 2.5, 5 mM) crossed with a 1000-to-0 mM two-fold glucose dilution series, read kinetically at 405 nm over 30 min. Absorbance was converted to product with their own pNP standard curve (Abs405 = 4.0005 x [pNP, mM] + 0.0477, R2 = 0.9989, n = 3). Initial velocity was extracted by a Python script that uses R2 to define the linear region of each progress curve — they require R2 >= 0.995 and discard conditions that fail, which is why two glucose points are explicitly omitted from Table 4. Km and Vmax were first estimated by Lineweaver-Burk double-reciprocal linearisation (Vmax = 0.36 Abs/min, Km = 2.49 mM), then re-estimated by a GLOBAL FIT of the competitive-inhibition Michaelis-Menten equation v = Vmax[S] / (Km(1 + [I]/Ki) + [S]) across all glucose and all pNPG levels at once (Vmax = 0.45 Abs/min, Km = 3.73 mM, Ki = 121 mM) — and they explain why the global fit is the better estimate, because it uses every data point instead of the three zero-glucose ones. MODEL 2 is Monod kinetics on Z. mobilis, grown across a glucose gradient (0, 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2, 4, 8, 20 mM) in RM medium at 34 C with OD600 read every 30 min for 8 h and glucose tracked in parallel with a household FORA G31 blood-glucose meter. Specific growth rate was obtained the textbook way — convert OD600 to ln(OD600), identify the log phase as the linear region, take the slope with Excel SLOPE and confirm linearity with RSQ, selecting the log-phase window per condition because higher glucose sustains exponential growth longer — then a Python script fitted the Monod equation mu = mu_max[S]/(Ks + [S]) by non-linear regression, giving mu_max = 0.55 /h and Ks = 0.16 mM. They also built their own OD600-to-dry-cell-weight calibration (dilution series, pellets dried at 80 C for 24 h, medium blank subtracted) giving DCW = 1.56 x OD600 - 0.032 (R2 = 0.99), and derived the biomass yield Y_X/S = 0.064 g/g from the 20 mM condition. MODEL 3 is a coupled ODE system for the fed-batch SSF vessel, integrated with scipy.integrate.solve_ivp using RK45 (Dormand-Prince 5(4)), comparing a closed system (enzyme alone) against an open system (enzyme plus 0.05 g/L Z. mobilis inoculum) with cellobiose fed in and the stoichiometric 1 cellobiose to 2 glucose conversion. All seven parameters are listed with their provenance stated in the code comments: Vmax 0.45, Km 3.73, Ki 121 from Model 1; mu_max 0.55, Ks 0.16, Y_X/S 0.064 from Model 2. The result is the proof of concept: in the closed system glucose accumulates, the enzyme is inhibited and the reaction stalls; in the open system Z. mobilis holds glucose low and near-complete saccharification is achieved.","dataviz":"The figures are plain but rigorous, and the discipline is in the captions and the metadata. Every figure names the instrument (BioTek Synergy H1 microplate reader; FORA G31 glucose meter, FORA Taiwan, range 20-600 mg/dL), the buffer and temperature, the replicate count, and the error measure — and where error bars are too small to see the caption says so and points to the table of values. Every figure links its own raw CSV by filename (1mM_pNPG_various_Glucose_Mingdao_MODEL.csv, Kinetics_pNPG_1_2.5_5mM_Glucose_0_to_1000mM.csv, and so on) and every analysis names the Python script that produced it (MODEL_1_enzyme_kinetics_analyzer.py, MODEL_1_lineweaver_burk_analysis.py, MODEL_1_calculate_Ki.py, MODEL_2_Z_mobilis_monod_fit.py, MODEL_3_Coupled_ODE_for_SSF_Simulation.py). The dual-axis growth-and-consumption plot (OD600 rising on the left axis as residual glucose falls on the right) makes the coupling visible in one picture. The ln(OD600)-versus-time panel shows the actual linear fits the growth rates came from rather than just reporting mu. The coupled ODE section is presented as a four-panel simulation of 7-day fed-batch SSF plus a direct closed-versus-open comparison. Most distinctively, the Model 3 page is written as a TUTORIAL: three worked examples build up from dy/dt = ry (exponential growth), through dy/dt = ry(1 - y/K) (logistic S-curve, with a second panel showing the growth rate falling as y approaches K), to a four-variable coupled system of biomass, nutrient, oxygen and pH — each with its complete, downloadable, commented Python script printed in full on the wiki, each with plain-language explanations of what RK45 does and why a coupled system cannot be solved one equation at a time.","datascience":"This is the cohort's clearest example of a model fitted entirely to the team's own measurements and then read against literature with real care. Each fitted parameter is compared to published values with the discrepancy explained rather than hidden: Vmax is far below Mehmood's 238 IU/mg for purified enzyme, which they attribute correctly to two causes — crude lysate in which the recombinant protein is only an estimated 30-40% of total protein, so their Vmax is a relative rate and not a mass-normalised specific activity, and operation at 34 C rather than the 80-100 C thermophilic optimum, supported by Li et al.'s finding that the same enzyme peaks at 90 C and declines sharply toward 30 C. Their mu_max of 0.55 /h sits inside the reported 0.3-1.1 /h range for Z. mobilis. Their Ks of 0.16 mM is 3-7x lower than published values, and rather than claiming a better result they warn it 'should be regarded as an approximate estimate and not over-interpreted' because it falls below their lowest tested glucose concentration (0.25 mM) and because the organism grew on yeast extract alone at 0 mM glucose (mu = 0.29 /h). Their OD-to-DCW factor of 1.56 g/L per OD600 looked 4x higher than E. coli cuvette values, so they worked out why — a 96-well plate with 100 uL gives a ~0.31 cm light path versus 1 cm in a cuvette — and rescaled it (1.56 x 0.31 = 0.48 g/L per OD600) to land inside the literature range, then explained why they benchmarked against E. coli at all (no published Z. mobilis value exists, and both are similarly sized rod-shaped Gram-negative bacteria). Y_X/S = 0.064 g/g matched the reported 0.055-0.06 g/g, and they read the low value correctly as favourable, since it means most glucose goes to ethanol rather than cell mass while still acting as a sink. Limitations are stated squarely: n = 1 per condition in the inhibition matrix, with robustness argued only from consistency across the three independent substrate levels; three substrate points is 'just enough to obtain a rough estimate' of Km and Vmax; and the central caveat that all enzyme parameters were measured on pNPG while the real SSF feed is cellobiose, so applying them is an approximation — with ten Kate et al.'s distinct cellobiose values cited as evidence it will matter, and direct cellobiose characterisation named as future work. They also scope the simulation honestly: 'this season's simulation tested one inoculum (0.05 g/L) against one feed rate; scanning a range of inocula and enzyme loadings is the next step.' The explicit choice of which target to model is itself good practice: they modelled beta-glucosidase because it is the part they characterised themselves, because glucose inhibition is the rate-limiting bottleneck, and because it is the step the Z. mobilis sink directly relieves, while cellulase was an existing documented BioBrick (BBa_K118023) and cellobiose inhibition of it is declared future work.","software":"All scripts and raw data are published with running instructions in the team's software repository, named per figure so any reader can reproduce a specific number. The Model 3 page functions as a free standing teaching resource: simpleODE.py, extendedODE.py and coupledODE.py are each printed in full and downloadable, with the SciPy and Dormand-Prince references cited properly. The analysis scripts were written with AI-assisted coding tools under the guidance of Kai-Hsiang Chen, a teacher at the school's Information Technology and Digital Learning Center — credited by name, which is the right way to be transparent about how a high school team got to a non-linear global fit.","stack":["Python","NumPy","SciPy (scipy.integrate.solve_ivp, RK45 / Dormand-Prince 5(4); non-linear regression)","Matplotlib","Excel (SLOPE, RSQ)","BioTek Synergy H1 microplate reader","FORA G31 glucose meter","AI-assisted coding tools"],"techniques":["Michaelis-Menten enzyme kinetics","Lineweaver-Burk double-reciprocal linearisation","competitive product-inhibition model and Ki determination","global non-linear fitting across a two-dimensional substrate x inhibitor matrix","R2-gated selection of the linear region for initial-rate extraction","standard-curve calibration (pNP absorbance to concentration)","Monod growth kinetics","log-linear specific growth rate estimation","OD600-to-dry-cell-weight calibration with light-path correction","biomass yield (Y_X/S) determination","coupled ODE system integration with adaptive-step Runge-Kutta","closed-versus-open counterfactual simulation","parameter provenance tracking from assay to simulation","literature benchmarking of fitted parameters with discrepancy analysis"],"frameworks_zh":"三個模型依嚴格的依賴順序排列；讓這份工作成為高中團隊典範的是，第三個模型沒有任何借來的數字——每一個參數都是學生在模型一與模型二中親自量測的。模型一是針對來自 Thermotoga maritima 的 BglA beta-葡萄糖苷酶所做的古典酵素動力學；該基因選殖進 pET-24a(+)，並在 E. coli BL21(DE3) 中以 Studier 的 ZYM-5052 培養基自動誘導表現。他們刻意在相容於發酵的條件（34 C、Bis-Tris pH 約 6.4）下進行特性分析，而非該酵素 80-100 C 的嗜熱最適溫度，因為那才是 Z. mobilis 能存活的條件。pNPG 分析以二維矩陣進行：三個基質濃度（1、2.5、5 mM）與 1000 至 0 mM 的二倍序列稀釋葡萄糖交叉組合，在 405 nm 下動力學讀取 30 分鐘。吸光值以他們自製的 pNP 標準曲線換算成產物量（Abs405 = 4.0005 x [pNP, mM] + 0.0477，R2 = 0.9989，n = 3）。初始速率由一支 Python 程式擷取，該程式以 R2 界定每條進程曲線的線性區間——他們要求 R2 >= 0.995，不合格的條件直接捨棄，這也是表 4 中明確省略兩個葡萄糖數據點的原因。Km 與 Vmax 先以 Lineweaver-Burk 雙倒數線性化估計（Vmax = 0.36 Abs/min、Km = 2.49 mM），再以競爭型抑制 Michaelis-Menten 方程 v = Vmax[S] / (Km(1 + [I]/Ki) + [S]) 對所有葡萄糖與所有 pNPG 濃度一次性全域擬合重新估計（Vmax = 0.45 Abs/min、Km = 3.73 mM、Ki = 121 mM）——他們並說明為何全域擬合是較佳的估計：它用上了每一個數據點，而不只是三個無葡萄糖的點。模型二是 Z. mobilis 的 Monod 動力學：在 34 C 的 RM 培養基中以葡萄糖梯度（0、0.25、0.5、1、2、4、8、20 mM）培養，每 30 分鐘讀取一次 OD600 共 8 小時，並以家用 FORA G31 血糖機平行追蹤葡萄糖。比生長速率以教科書做法取得——把 OD600 轉成 ln(OD600)，將線性區間認定為對數生長期，用 Excel 的 SLOPE 取斜率並以 RSQ 確認線性，且逐一條件選定各自的對數期區間，因為葡萄糖濃度越高，指數生長維持得越久——接著以一支 Python 程式用非線性回歸擬合 Monod 方程 mu = mu_max[S]/(Ks + [S])，得到 mu_max = 0.55 /h 與 Ks = 0.16 mM。他們也自建 OD600 對乾菌重的校正曲線（序列稀釋、菌體於 80 C 乾燥 24 小時、扣除培養基空白），得到 DCW = 1.56 x OD600 - 0.032（R2 = 0.99），並從 20 mM 條件推得生物量產率 Y_X/S = 0.064 g/g。模型三是饋料批次 SSF 反應槽的耦合 ODE 系統，以 scipy.integrate.solve_ivp 搭配 RK45（Dormand-Prince 5(4)）積分，比較封閉系統（僅有酵素）與開放系統（酵素加上 0.05 g/L 的 Z. mobilis 接種量），其中纖維二糖持續饋入，並採 1 莫耳纖維二糖轉成 2 莫耳葡萄糖的化學計量。七個參數全部列出，並在程式註解中標明出處：Vmax 0.45、Km 3.73、Ki 121 來自模型一；mu_max 0.55、Ks 0.16、Y_X/S 0.064 來自模型二。結果即為概念驗證：封閉系統中葡萄糖累積、酵素被抑制、反應停滯；開放系統中 Z. mobilis 把葡萄糖壓在低濃度，糖化幾近完全。","dataviz_zh":"圖表樣式樸素但嚴謹，真正的紀律體現在圖說與後設資料上。每張圖都標明儀器（BioTek Synergy H1 微量盤判讀儀；FORA G31 血糖機，FORA Taiwan，量測範圍 20-600 mg/dL）、緩衝液與溫度、重複次數以及誤差的定義——若誤差棒小到看不見，圖說會明講並指向數值表。每張圖都以檔名連結自己的原始 CSV（1mM_pNPG_various_Glucose_Mingdao_MODEL.csv、Kinetics_pNPG_1_2.5_5mM_Glucose_0_to_1000mM.csv 等），每項分析也都註明產生它的 Python 程式（MODEL_1_enzyme_kinetics_analyzer.py、MODEL_1_lineweaver_burk_analysis.py、MODEL_1_calculate_Ki.py、MODEL_2_Z_mobilis_monod_fit.py、MODEL_3_Coupled_ODE_for_SSF_Simulation.py）。雙軸的生長與消耗圖（左軸 OD600 上升、右軸殘餘葡萄糖下降）讓耦合關係在一張圖裡就看得見。ln(OD600) 對時間的圖呈現生長速率實際所依據的線性擬合，而不只是報出 mu 值。耦合 ODE 一節以四格圖呈現 7 天饋料批次 SSF 的模擬，外加封閉對開放系統的直接比較。最特別的是，模型三的頁面是當作教學講義來寫的：三個範例從 dy/dt = ry（指數生長）開始，經過 dy/dt = ry(1 - y/K)（邏輯斯 S 曲線，並以第二格圖顯示 y 趨近 K 時生長速率如何下降），一路推到生物量、養分、氧氣與 pH 的四變數耦合系統——每個範例都在 wiki 上完整印出可下載、帶註解的 Python 程式，並以白話解釋 RK45 做了什麼，以及為什麼耦合系統不能一條方程一條方程分開解。","datascience_zh":"在本屆團隊中，這是「模型完全擬合自隊伍自己的量測、再認真對照文獻解讀」最清楚的例子。每個擬合參數都與已發表數值比較，而差異是被解釋而非被藏起來：Vmax 遠低於 Mehmood 以純化酵素測得的 238 IU/mg，他們正確地歸因於兩點——使用的是粗萃取液，其中重組蛋白估計僅佔總蛋白的 30-40%，因此他們的 Vmax 是相對速率而非以質量標準化的比活性；以及操作溫度為 34 C 而非 80-100 C 的嗜熱最適溫度，此點並有 Li 等人「同一酵素在 90 C 達到高峰、往 30 C 急遽下降」的結果支持。他們的 mu_max 0.55 /h 落在 Z. mobilis 已報導的 0.3-1.1 /h 區間內。他們的 Ks 0.16 mM 比已發表值低 3-7 倍，但他們沒有藉此宣稱結果更好，反而警告這個值「應視為近似估計，不宜過度解讀」，因為它低於所測試的最低葡萄糖濃度（0.25 mM），而且在 0 mM 葡萄糖、僅有酵母抽出物的條件下該菌仍能生長（mu = 0.29 /h）。他們的 OD 對乾菌重換算係數為每單位 OD600 1.56 g/L，看起來比 E. coli 以比色管量得的值高 4 倍，於是他們追究原因——96 孔盤裝 100 uL 的光徑約 0.31 cm，而比色管為 1 cm——並據此重新換算（1.56 x 0.31 = 0.48 g/L per OD600），使其落回文獻範圍，接著解釋為何要拿 E. coli 當基準（並無已發表的 Z. mobilis 數值，而兩者都是尺寸相近的桿狀革蘭氏陰性菌）。Y_X/S = 0.064 g/g 與已報導的 0.055-0.06 g/g 相符，而他們也正確地把這個偏低的數值讀成有利條件：它意味著大部分葡萄糖流向乙醇而非菌體，同時菌體仍能扮演消耗端。限制也說得直白：抑制矩陣中每個條件僅 n = 1，穩健性只能靠三個獨立基質濃度之間的一致性來論證；三個基質濃度點「只夠得到 Km 與 Vmax 的粗略估計」；以及最核心的保留——所有酵素參數都是以 pNPG 量測，而真實 SSF 的進料是纖維二糖，因此直接套用只是近似；他們並引用 ten Kate 等人明顯不同的纖維二糖數值作為「這個差異會有影響」的證據，把直接以纖維二糖進行特性分析列為後續工作。他們對模擬的適用範圍也誠實交代：「本季的模擬只測試了一種接種量（0.05 g/L）對一種饋料速率；掃描不同接種量與酵素添加量是下一步。」明確交代為何選這個對象建模，本身就是好做法：他們選 beta-葡萄糖苷酶，是因為那是他們自己做過特性分析的部分、因為葡萄糖抑制是速率限制的瓶頸、也因為那正是 Z. mobilis 消耗端能直接紓解的步驟；至於纖維素酶則是既有且有文獻記載的 BioBrick（BBa_K118023），其纖維二糖抑制問題則明示為後續工作。","software_zh":"所有程式與原始資料連同執行說明一併公開在團隊的軟體儲存庫中，並依圖表命名，使任何讀者都能重現特定數值。模型三的頁面本身就是一份可獨立使用的教材：simpleODE.py、extendedODE.py 與 coupledODE.py 都完整印出且可下載，SciPy 與 Dormand-Prince 的參考文獻也引用得宜。分析程式是在該校資訊科技與數位學習中心教師 Kai-Hsiang Chen 的指導下，借助 AI 輔助編程工具撰寫的——並且具名致謝，這正是一支高中團隊交代自己如何做出非線性全域擬合的正確透明做法。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"The project itself grew out of the school's own waste stream — more than 7,000 students and 400 staff eat lunch at Mingdao High School every school day — which gives every conversation about it an immediate, local referent. Materials from the Human Practices work are published as downloads.","ihp":"The best-structured high school Human Practices narrative in this set, because it starts from a question the students genuinely could not answer. Sitting with a used paper container in front of them, somebody asked where it actually goes, and none of them knew, despite having sorted those containers into their own bin for years because a sign told them to. They then wrote down five open questions and took each one to the people who could answer it: where does our paper waste actually go (following one container as far as they could); why will nobody take it, given that it is collected separately and has a price; is the problem already solved, since they had heard used paper containers become recycled tissue paper — and they state explicitly that if that were true for their waste there would be no need for a synthetic biology solution at all; could they build the paper-to-fuel conversion themselves, having never used an enzyme, a fermenting microbe or a vessel; and could the process ever leave the laboratory. The page is organised as two acts, Act I Following the Waste (outward, to the problem that defines the project) and Act II Building the Answer (back to the bench), with further sections on what the technology would do to the stakeholders involved, where they agreed and disagreed, and how each of the five questions was answered. Setting out in advance a condition under which their own project would be unnecessary is a standard of intellectual honesty worth copying.","realWorld":"Plastic-coated paper containers are the category everyone in the recycling chain would rather not receive, which is the market gap the project aims at. The engineering choice is driven by that reality: Simultaneous Saccharification and Fermentation in one vessel avoids the separate hydrolysis and fermentation steps that would make a small-scale, on-site unit impractical, and the model's stated purpose is to estimate how much Z. mobilis to inoculate in a fermentor to match the glucose production rate of beta-glucosidase — a directly operational question. The team also note that accepting lower enzyme activity at 34 C is a deliberate trade for compatibility with the microbe, and that the coupled system lets even a sub-optimal-temperature enzyme run effectively by keeping glucose low.","partners":["Mingdao High School","Mingdao High School Information Technology and Digital Learning Center"],"publicEngagement_zh":"這個專案本身就源自學校自己的廢棄物流——Mingdao High School 每個上課日有超過 7,000 名學生與 400 名教職員在校內用餐——因此任何關於它的對話都有立即可感的在地指涉。人類實踐工作的相關材料以可下載檔案形式公開。","ihp_zh":"這是本組高中隊伍中結構最好的人類實踐敘事，原因在於它從一個學生真的答不出來的問題出發。面前擺著一個用過的紙容器，有人問它最後到哪裡去，結果沒有人知道——儘管他們多年來都依照告示把這類容器丟進專屬回收桶。他們接著寫下五個開放問題，逐一帶去問能回答的人：我們的紙類廢棄物實際去了哪裡（他們盡可能追蹤一個容器的流向）；既然它是分類回收且有價格，為什麼沒有人要收；這個問題是不是早已解決，因為他們聽說用過的紙容器會變成再生衛生紙——他們並明確表示，若這對自己學校的廢棄物也成立，那就完全不需要合成生物學的解方；他們自己做不做得出紙到燃料的轉換，畢竟他們從未用過酵素、發酵微生物或反應槽；以及這個程序究竟有沒有可能走出實驗室。頁面以兩幕編排：第一幕 Following the Waste（向外走，走向界定專案的問題），第二幕 Building the Answer（回到實驗檯）；其後另有幾節討論這項技術會對相關利害關係人造成什麼影響、他們在哪些地方意見一致或不一致，以及五個問題各自如何得到解答。事先明訂一個會讓自己的專案變得不必要的條件，是值得效法的學術誠實標準。","realWorld_zh":"淋膜紙容器是回收鏈上人人都不想收的類別，這正是本專案瞄準的市場缺口。工程選擇正是由這個現實驅動：在單一反應槽內進行同步糖化發酵，避開了會讓小型現地機組難以成立的水解與發酵分離步驟；而模型明確宣示的目的，是估算發酵槽中應接種多少 Z. mobilis 才能匹配 beta-葡萄糖苷酶的葡萄糖生成速率——一個直接可操作的問題。團隊也指出，接受 34 C 下較低的酵素活性，是為了與微生物相容而刻意做的取捨，而耦合系統藉由把葡萄糖壓在低濃度，讓即使處於非最適溫度的酵素也能有效運作。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6105/wiki/model2.avif","caption":"The Waste-to-Watt SSF fermentor: cellulase and beta-glucosidase saccharify paper-container cellulose to glucose while Zymomonas mobilis simultaneously ferments that glucose to bioethanol, so neither enzyme ever accumulates enough product to inhibit itself.","credit":"Team Mingdao, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"Waste-to-Watt 的 SSF 發酵槽：纖維素酶與 beta-葡萄糖苷酶把紙容器纖維素糖化成葡萄糖，Zymomonas mobilis 同時把葡萄糖發酵成生質乙醇，因此兩種酵素都不會累積到足以自我抑制的產物量。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6105/wiki/model-fig1-v2.avif","caption":"Glucose-gradient inhibition of 1 mM pNPG hydrolysis by BglA beta-glucosidase, across a 1000-to-0 mM two-fold glucose dilution series read kinetically at 405 nm. The same matrix was run at 2.5 and 5 mM pNPG, and the three datasets were fitted globally to the competitive-inhibition equation to give Ki = 121 mM.","credit":"Team Mingdao, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"以 BglA beta-葡萄糖苷酶水解 1 mM pNPG 時的葡萄糖梯度抑制，葡萄糖為 1000 至 0 mM 的二倍序列稀釋，於 405 nm 動力學讀取。同一矩陣也在 2.5 與 5 mM pNPG 下執行，三組資料一併全域擬合競爭型抑制方程，得到 Ki = 121 mM。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6105/wiki/model20.avif","caption":"The team's own OD600-to-dry-cell-weight calibration for Z. mobilis (pellets dried at 80 C for 24 h, medium blank subtracted), giving DCW = 1.56 x OD600 - 0.032 with R2 = 0.99. When the factor looked 4x higher than E. coli values, they worked out that a 96-well plate gives a ~0.31 cm light path versus 1 cm in a cuvette and rescaled it back into the literature range.","credit":"Team Mingdao, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"團隊自建的 Z. mobilis OD600 對乾菌重校正曲線（菌體於 80 C 乾燥 24 小時、扣除培養基空白），得到 DCW = 1.56 x OD600 - 0.032，R2 = 0.99。當這個係數看起來比 E. coli 的值高 4 倍時，他們查出 96 孔盤的光徑約 0.31 cm、比色管為 1 cm，並據此重新換算回文獻範圍。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6105/wiki/model24.avif","caption":"The payoff: the coupled ODE comparison of a closed system (beta-glucosidase alone, where glucose accumulates, the enzyme is inhibited and the reaction stalls) against an open system (beta-glucosidase plus Z. mobilis, where the microbe holds glucose low and near-complete saccharification is reached). Every parameter in this simulation was measured by the team in Models 1 and 2.","credit":"Team Mingdao, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"關鍵成果：耦合 ODE 對封閉系統（僅 beta-葡萄糖苷酶，葡萄糖累積、酵素被抑制、反應停滯）與開放系統（beta-葡萄糖苷酶加上 Z. mobilis，微生物把葡萄糖壓在低濃度，糖化幾近完全）的比較。此模擬中的每一個參數都由團隊在模型一與模型二中親自量測。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"This is the template for a school-level model done properly: measure your own kinetic and growth parameters at the conditions your real system will actually run at, fit them with a named equation and a script you publish, and then build one coupled simulation in which every single parameter traces back to one of your own measurements — plus a closed-versus-open counterfactual so the simulation answers a yes/no design question. Mingdao also show how to benchmark against literature: when a fitted value disagrees, explain the mechanism (light-path length, crude lysate purity, sub-optimal temperature) rather than hiding it.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/mingdao/","https://2026.igem.wiki/mingdao/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/mingdao/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/mingdao/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/mingdao/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/mingdao/contribution/"],"projectTitle_zh":"Waste-to-Watt——以淋膜紙容器製造生質乙醇","tagline_zh":"把 7,000 名學生每天丟掉的咖啡杯與餐盒變成燃料：在同一個反應槽裡讓酵素與一株吃葡萄糖的微生物並肩工作。","summary_zh":"Mingdao 收集用過的紙容器——咖啡杯、餐盒、泡麵碗——以酵素組合將其中的纖維素水解成葡萄糖，再發酵成生質乙醇。障礙在於產物抑制：纖維素酶受纖維二糖抑制，beta-葡萄糖苷酶則受葡萄糖抑制。他們的解法是同步糖化發酵，把 Zymomonas mobilis 放進同一個反應槽作為葡萄糖的消耗端，使兩種酵素都不會遇上抑制性產物。支撐整個專案的是三個模型：以自己的 pNPG 分析數據擬合 Michaelis-Menten 競爭型抑制方程，求出 BglA 在相容於發酵條件下的 Km、Vmax 與 Ki；以自己量測的 Z. mobilis 生長曲線擬合 Monod 方程，求出 mu_max、Ks 與生物量產率；最後以 SciPy 建立耦合 ODE，把上述每一個實測參數帶入真實單槽反應器的封閉對開放模擬。模型三中的每一個參數都出自他們自己的實驗檯。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"這是高中層級建模做對了的範本：在真實系統實際運行的條件下量測自己的動力學與生長參數，用具名方程與公開的程式進行擬合，再建一個耦合模擬，其中每一個參數都能回溯到自己的某次量測——並加上封閉對開放的反事實對照，讓模擬能回答一個是非題式的設計問題。Mingdao 也示範了如何對照文獻：當擬合值與文獻不符時，解釋其機制（光徑長度、粗萃取液純度、非最適溫度），而不是把它藏起來。","awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6108":{"team":"GU Frankfurt","id":"6108","section":"Overgrad","country":"Germany","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/gu-frankfurt/","projectTitle":"HIDE","projectTitle_zh":"HIDE","tagline":"Hiding a transplanted organ from the immune system instead of suppressing the immune system","tagline_zh":"把移植器官藏起來不讓免疫系統看見，而不是去壓制免疫系統","summary":"Around 183,000 transplants a year are followed by lifelong immunosuppression, which protects the graft by weakening the whole patient. HIDE attacks the cause instead: a synNotch receptor carrying a computationally designed binder recognises the donor organ's mismatched HLA class I alleles, triggers production and export of shRNA in extracellular vesicles, and silences only those 'non-self' HLAs by RNA interference, leaving the rest of the immune system intact. Three research fields are bridged at once (synNotch, RNAi, exosome delivery), with the binder and the shRNA both designed in silico by the dry lab and validated by FACS, qPCR, western blot and nanoparticle tracking analysis. It won Best Part Collection and Best Education because the by-products are as usable as the therapy: HUSH, an open-source RNAi design framework for polymorphic gene families, and TRUST, a framework for communicating about death and grief that iGEM did not previously have.","summary_zh":"每年約有 183,000 例移植手術，術後隨之而來的是終身免疫抑制——為了保住移植物，卻削弱了整個病人。HIDE 改從病因下手：一個帶有以電腦設計的結合子（binder）的 synNotch 受體辨識捐贈器官上不相配的 HLA class I 等位基因，觸發 shRNA 的生產並以胞外囊泡輸出，再透過 RNA 干擾只沉默那些「非自體」的 HLA，其餘免疫系統維持完整。此專題一次串起三個研究領域（synNotch、RNAi、exosome 遞送），結合子與 shRNA 都由乾實驗以電腦設計，並以 FACS、qPCR、西方墨點法與奈米顆粒追蹤分析驗證。它拿下最佳元件集合與最佳教育獎，因為其副產物和療法本身一樣好用：HUSH，一套針對多型性基因家族的開源 RNAi 設計框架；以及 TRUST，一套談論死亡與哀傷的溝通框架，這是 iGEM 此前所沒有的。","awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Part Collection — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Software — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Education — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Therapeutics Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Two pipelines solving an allele-discrimination problem that has no off-the-shelf method. For the binder, the team deliberately picked the harder target: HLA-A*01 (allele frequency around 15%) rather than the more common HLA-A*02, because A*01 carries fewer polymorphisms relative to other common alleles and therefore makes a specific binder harder to design; an IPD-IMGT multiple sequence alignment of HLA-A*01:01:01:01 against A*02:01:01:01 and A*03:01:01:01 located the usable mismatches, concentrated in and around the peptide-binding groove of the polymorphic alpha1 and alpha2 domains. They then generated roughly 2,000 de novo binders with BindCraft and RFdiffusion3, scored affinity and specificity against target and off-target HLAs with Boltz-2 and AlphaFold, and carried the eight most promising designs into molecular dynamics simulations for stability, across six design batches with combined MD results. For the shRNA, sequence alignment identified nucleotide-level discriminating positions, candidates were designed and evaluated with siDirect, and every candidate was screened against the human genome for off-targets in other human mRNAs. HUSH then added 150 further shRNAs with alignment-aware targeting.","frameworks_zh":"兩條流程，處理一個沒有現成方法的等位基因辨別問題。在結合子方面，團隊刻意挑了較難的標的：選 HLA-A*01（等位基因頻率約 15%）而非更常見的 HLA-A*02，因為 A*01 相對於其他常見等位基因的多型性較少，要設計出具專一性的結合子因此更難；他們以 IPD-IMGT 把 HLA-A*01:01:01:01 與 A*02:01:01:01、A*03:01:01:01 做多序列比對，找出可用的不相配位點，這些位點集中在多型性的 alpha1 與 alpha2 區域的胜肽結合溝及其周邊。接著以 BindCraft 與 RFdiffusion3 產生約 2,000 個從頭設計的結合子，用 Boltz-2 與 AlphaFold 對標的與非標的 HLA 評估親和力與專一性，再把最有潛力的 8 個設計帶入分子動力學模擬檢驗穩定性，前後共六批設計並彙整模擬結果。在 shRNA 方面，序列比對找出核苷酸層級的辨別位點，候選序列以 siDirect 設計與評估，每個候選都再對人類基因組篩查在其他人類 mRNA 上的脫靶可能。HUSH 之後又追加了 150 條具序列比對意識的標靶 shRNA。","dataviz":"The wiki is built as an explorable system rather than a document. The dry-lab overview is a hover-and-click hitbox diagram where each component (Binder, shRNA, HUSH) reveals its rationale and links through to its own results page. The HLA class I architecture is a draggable 3D structure coloured by domain (alpha1, alpha2, alpha3, beta2m) so the reader can see for themselves that the variation sits in the groove. The MSA is shown in classic dash notation against the A*01 reference so each mismatch is countable. MD runs are published as per-binder, per-allele animations (for example binder FR57 against HLA-A*01, A*02 and A*03 side by side), which makes specificity visible rather than tabulated. The HUSH page embeds a working mockup of the five-stage wizard with sample data that the reader can step through, and the mascot Heidi narrates each step. Human practices is an interactive stakeholder map filterable by affiliation and by part of the construct, so a reader can ask 'who shaped the binder?' and get an answer. Education statistics are presented as before-and-after pairs, not totals.","dataviz_zh":"這個 wiki 做成一套可探索的系統、而不是一份文件。乾實驗總覽是一張可滑過與點擊的熱區圖，每個組件（Binder、shRNA、HUSH）都會展開其設計理由，並連到各自的結果頁。HLA class I 的結構以可拖曳的 3D 模型呈現、依區域上色（alpha1、alpha2、alpha3、beta2m），讀者自己就看得出變異位在結合溝上。多序列比對以傳統的破折號記法對照 A*01 參考序列呈現，使每個不相配位點都數得出來。分子動力學的結果以每個結合子、每個等位基因為單位的動畫發表（例如把結合子 FR57 對 HLA-A*01、A*02 與 A*03 並排呈現），讓專一性看得見、而非只列成表。HUSH 頁面內嵌一個可運作的五階段精靈模擬界面，附上範例資料供讀者逐步操作，並由吉祥物 Heidi 逐步解說。人類實踐做成一張可依所屬單位、也可依構築的哪個部分篩選的互動利害關係人地圖，讀者可以直接問「是誰影響了結合子的設計？」並得到答案。教育成效以前後對照的成對數據呈現，而不是總量。","datascience":"HUSH exists because the team audited the tool landscape and found it stagnant: commercial RNAi designers are proprietary black boxes whose algorithms and option sets are undocumented, and even non-commercial siDirect is neither open-source nor pipeline-integrable, while recent published advances for discriminating highly similar sequences had been implemented nowhere. HUSH therefore folds multiple sequence alignment into the design step itself: a target sequence plus an optional panel of related sequences (the alleles to spare) switches on allele-aware targeting and an MSA stage, and the tool inspects the input up front (molecule type, length, GC content, panel size) and warns, for example, that a GC-rich target may cause the seed filter to reject every candidate, then offers to relax that filter in the criteria step. Protein input is flagged because it must be resolved to a transcript first. Safety is a scoring stage, not a disclaimer: candidates are aligned with Bowtie against NCBI human RefSeq, and the team proposes extending the standard off-target check to known single-nucleotide polymorphisms that could create unwanted off-targets. Designed siRNAs convert to shRNAs with hairpin-loop guidance and thermodynamic evaluation of structure integrity.","datascience_zh":"HUSH 之所以存在，是因為團隊盤點了工具生態後發現它停滯不前：商用 RNAi 設計工具是專有的黑盒子，演算法與選項設定都沒有文件，就連非商業的 siDirect 也既非開源、也無法整進流程，而近年已發表的、用於辨別高度相似序列的進展則完全沒有任何實作。因此 HUSH 把多序列比對折進設計步驟本身：輸入一條標的序列，再加上一組可選的相關序列（也就是要保留的等位基因），就會啟動具等位基因意識的標靶設定與一個比對階段；工具會在一開始就檢視輸入（分子類型、長度、GC 含量、序列組大小）並提出警示，例如 GC 含量高的標的可能導致種子區過濾器把所有候選都剔除，接著在條件設定步驟提供放寬該過濾器的選項。蛋白質輸入會被標記，因為必須先解析為對應的轉錄本。安全性是一個評分階段、不是免責聲明：候選序列以 Bowtie 對 NCBI human RefSeq 比對，團隊並提議把標準脫靶檢查擴及已知的單核苷酸多型性，因為這些位點可能造成不想要的脫靶。設計好的 siRNA 會在髮夾環的設計指引與結構完整性的熱力學評估下轉換為 shRNA。","software":"HUSH (Human genome-Universal Silencing Hairpin designer), open-source on GitLab, ships in four interfaces around one core HushSession object: a guided five-step web wizard plus a compact expert mode exposing thermodynamic constants and selection rules, a CLI for one-shot pipeline use, a persistent in-terminal shell with saved input and panels, and an MCP server so an AI agent can drive it. A REST API provides compatibility for external pipelines. The three stated design tenets are research-first (every option documented with the research behind it), accessibility (upload a sequence and be guided, with proposed optimal choices derived from the sequence), and safety. The team also released START (SynBio Travellers, an educational browser game) and TRUST (a sensitive-topics framework), and the wiki repository is gitlab.igem.org/2026/gu-frankfurt.","software_zh":"HUSH（Human genome-Universal Silencing Hairpin designer）在 GitLab 上開源，圍繞同一個核心的 HushSession 物件提供四種介面：一個有引導的五步網頁精靈，外加一個精簡的專家模式可直接調整熱力學常數與篩選規則；一個供一次性整進流程使用的 CLI；一個可保存輸入與序列組、常駐於終端機的互動介面；以及一個 MCP 伺服器，讓 AI 代理人能驅動它。另有 REST API 供外部流程相容接取。他們明示的三項設計原則是研究優先（每個選項都附上背後研究的文件）、易用性（上傳序列就會被引導，並依序列推導出建議的最佳選項）與安全性。團隊另外釋出了 START（SynBio Travellers，一款教育用瀏覽器遊戲）與 TRUST（敏感議題框架），wiki 的程式庫在 gitlab.igem.org/2026/gu-frankfurt。","stack":["BindCraft","RFdiffusion3","Boltz-2","AlphaFold","molecular dynamics simulation","siDirect","Bowtie","NCBI RefSeq","IPD-IMGT/HLA alignment tool","GitLab (open source)","REST API","MCP server","CLI + terminal shell + web wizard"],"techniques":["de novo protein binder generation at ~2000-candidate scale","affinity and specificity co-scoring against off-target alleles","MD stability triage of top candidates","multiple sequence alignment driven allele discrimination","genome-wide off-target screening","SNP-aware off-target proposal","shRNA hairpin thermodynamic evaluation","synNotch receptor engineering","extracellular-vesicle RNA delivery","qPCR, FACS, western blot, nanoparticle tracking analysis readouts"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A five-media strategy (game, workshops, social dialogue, print, audio) built on training the team first: 19 members took the 'Basics of Science Communication' workshop from NaWik, the German National Institute for Science Communication, and used its core-message, cloverleaf and arrow tools as the basis of everything after. Outputs were then measured, not just counted: nine school workshops at two schools reached over 140 students, with the share who knew that the family decides when no donation wish is documented rising from 66.1% to 91.9%, and 103 of 147 students saying they would talk to others (counted conservatively at four people each as a take-home estimate). HIDE & SEEK, a printed educational magazine distributed in pharmacies, doctors' practices and gyms, raised average correct answers across four knowledge questions from 88% to 100%. They ran a Night of Science survey booth, presented HIDE on hr3 radio (about one million daily listeners), were featured in BIOspektrum, UniReport and Wissen wird, appeared on iGEM Lund's podcast 'The Sequence', built the START browser game, and distributed hundreds of organ donation cards.","publicEngagement_zh":"一套五種媒介的策略（遊戲、工作坊、社會對話、印刷、聲音），建立在先訓練自己團隊的基礎上：19 位成員上了德國國家科學傳播研究所 NaWik 的「科學傳播基礎」工作坊，並以其核心訊息、四葉草與箭頭等工具作為之後一切工作的基礎。產出接著被量測、不只是計數：在兩所學校舉辦九場校園工作坊、觸及超過 140 位學生，知道「在沒有書面捐贈意願紀錄時由家屬決定」的比例從 66.1% 升至 91.9%，147 位學生中有 103 位表示會再去告訴別人（保守以每人四位計算，作為擴散效果的估計）。《HIDE & SEEK》是一本在藥局、診所與健身房發放的印刷版教育雜誌，使四道知識題的平均正確率從 88% 提升到 100%。他們在 Night of Science 設了問卷攤位、在 hr3 廣播（每日約一百萬聽眾）介紹 HIDE，獲 BIOspektrum、UniReport 與 Wissen wird 報導，上了 iGEM Lund 的播客《The Sequence》，做出 START 瀏覽器遊戲，並發送了數百張器官捐贈卡。","ihp":"50 stakeholders in 44 interviews across six countries, sorted into five functions (defining the need, designing the therapy, route to the clinic, the donation debate, sensitive communication and education) and mapped against the part of the construct each one shaped. Documented changes: DSO and Eurotransplant quantified the logistics and donor shortage that justify the project; Prof. Urs Christen's account of lifelong immunosuppression side effects pushed the team toward a personalised approach; Dr. Venugopal Gudipati made binder accuracy the governing constraint on the receptor arm, and Dr. Gregory Allen shaped the synNotch design; CAR-T experts set the manufacturing, logistics and cost frame for an autologous therapy. In the donation debate the team interviewed politicians on both sides (Dr. Armin Grau and Helge Lindh), found both agreed the real deficit is education, and wrote a political proposal to make their workshops a mandatory part of school curricula, presented on 22 September 2026 to the cross-party Bundestag group 'Freiwilligkeit in der Organspende', which agreed to consider it. The largest change was procedural: interviewing people with lived transplant experience showed the team that iGEM has biosafety guidance but nothing on sensitive topics, which iGEM's own Human Practices committee confirmed when asked, so they built TRUST (Talking Responsibly and Understanding Sensitive Topics) with Dr. Katharina Karcher of the MASTERY project at Birmingham, transplant psychologist Dr. Angela Buchholz (who showed that unfamiliar language creates fear rather than understanding), supervisor Ariane Mantey-Strauss, ethicist Dr. Timo Sauer, nurse Sanjin Krupic, DSO's PD Dr. Ana Paula Barreiros, and former iGEM Safety and Security chief Alonso Flores, who pushed back that no framework can move responsibility off the teams themselves.","ihp_zh":"六個國家、44 場訪談、50 位利害關係人，依五項功能分類（界定需求、設計療法、通往臨床的路徑、捐贈議題的公共辯論、敏感溝通與教育），並對應到各自影響了構築的哪個部分。有紀錄的改動包括：DSO 與 Eurotransplant 量化了支撐本專題立論的物流與捐贈者短缺狀況；Prof. Urs Christen 對終身免疫抑制副作用的描述，推動團隊走向個人化的做法；Dr. Venugopal Gudipati 使結合子的準確性成為受體這一端的首要約束條件，Dr. Gregory Allen 則形塑了 synNotch 的設計；CAR-T 專家為一項自體療法設定了製造、物流與成本的框架。在捐贈議題的辯論上，團隊訪談了立場相對的兩位政治人物（Dr. Armin Grau 與 Helge Lindh），發現雙方都同意真正的缺口在教育，於是撰寫了一份政治提案，主張把他們的工作坊納入學校課綱的必修內容，並於 2026 年 9 月 22 日向德國聯邦議院跨黨派小組「Freiwilligkeit in der Organspende」提出，該小組同意納入考慮。最大的改動是程序上的：訪談有移植親身經驗的人之後，團隊發現 iGEM 有生物安全指引、卻完全沒有敏感議題的指引，詢問後 iGEM 自己的人類實踐委員會也確認如此，於是他們建立了 TRUST（Talking Responsibly and Understanding Sensitive Topics），合作者包括伯明罕 MASTERY 計畫的 Dr. Katharina Karcher、移植心理師 Dr. Angela Buchholz（她指出陌生的語彙製造的是恐懼、不是理解）、督導 Ariane Mantey-Strauss、倫理學者 Dr. Timo Sauer、護理師 Sanjin Krupic、DSO 的 PD Dr. Ana Paula Barreiros，以及前 iGEM 安全與保安負責人 Alonso Flores——後者反駁說，任何框架都無法把責任從隊伍自己身上移開。","realWorld":"The commercialisation strategy is an exclusive licensing agreement: HIDE retains the intellectual property while a large pharmaceutical partner takes manufacturing, distribution and payer negotiation, chosen because an autologous cell therapy's facility, consumable and specialist-salary costs cannot be matched by a start-up. Miltenyi Biotec has issued a letter of support. The analysis names the customer chain (pharmaceutical companies, statutory health insurers, transplant centres) rather than patients, because an advanced cell therapy cannot be sold direct, and works through German reimbursement specifically: near-universal statutory coverage funded at 14.6% of income, with price set by negotiation with the manufacturer. The page carries cost of goods per dose, a seven-year forecast, a regulatory roadmap with milestones and risks, a Business Model Canvas, SWOT and skill-gap analyses the team describes as an honest look at their own gaps, a PEST analysis, and a mapping to the UN Sustainable Development Goals. Input came from the iGEM Entrepreneurship Bootcamp, Innovectis and the Charite Berlin Regulatory Support Unit.","realWorld_zh":"商業化策略是獨家授權協議：HIDE 保留智慧財產權，由一家大型製藥夥伴承接製造、通路與付費方的議價，之所以這樣選，是因為自體細胞療法所需的廠房、耗材與專業人力薪資成本，新創公司無法負擔。Miltenyi Biotec 已出具支持函。分析中指名的客戶鏈是製藥公司、法定健保與移植中心、而不是病人，因為先進細胞療法無法直接銷售給病人；並具體走過德國的給付制度：近乎全民的法定保險以所得的 14.6% 籌資，價格則由與製造商議價決定。該頁面附有每劑的銷貨成本、七年期預測、含里程碑與風險的法規路線圖、商業模式畫布、團隊自稱是誠實檢視自身缺口的 SWOT 與技能落差分析、PEST 分析，以及對聯合國永續發展目標的對應。意見來源包括 iGEM 創業訓練營、Innovectis 與柏林 Charité 的法規支援單位。","partners":["Miltenyi Biotec (letter of support)","NaWik, National Institute for Science Communication","Deutsche Stiftung Organtransplantation (DSO)","Eurotransplant","Cross-party Bundestag group 'Freiwilligkeit in der Organspende'","Dr. Katharina Karcher, MASTERY, University of Birmingham","Dr. Angela Buchholz, University Hospital Hamburg-Eppendorf","Alonso Flores, former iGEM Safety and Security Programme Chief","Innovectis (Goethe University technology transfer)","Regulatory Support Unit, Charite Berlin","Prof. Rainer Blasczyk, Hannover Medical School","Prof. Klemens Budde, Charite","MD PhD Gregory Allen","Prof. Jens Kurreck, TU Berlin","iGEM Lund ('The Sequence' podcast)","hr3 (Hessischer Rundfunk)","BIOspektrum"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6108/wiki/images/drylab/hush/hush-1-input-page.avif","caption":"HUSH step one: the target sequence to silence plus an optional panel of related alleles to spare, with live input inspection reporting molecule type, length, GC content and readiness, and warning when a GC-rich target may defeat the seed filter.","caption_zh":"HUSH 的第一步：輸入要沉默的標的序列，再加上一組可選的、要保留的相關等位基因序列；系統即時檢視輸入並回報分子類型、長度、GC 含量與是否就緒，並在 GC 含量高的標的可能使種子區過濾器失效時提出警示。","credit":"Team GU Frankfurt, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6108/wiki/images/drylab/hush/hush-architecture.svg","caption":"HUSH architecture: one central HushSession interface serving the web wizard, the CLI, the terminal shell and the MCP server, so the same design logic is reachable by a newcomer, a pipeline or an AI agent.","caption_zh":"HUSH 的架構：一個中央的 HushSession 介面同時支撐網頁精靈、CLI、終端機互動介面與 MCP 伺服器，使同一套設計邏輯對新手、對流程、對 AI 代理人都可取用。","credit":"Team GU Frankfurt, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6108/wiki/images/wetlab/wetlab-figures-fixed/synnotch/fig-19-fr57-facs.svg","caption":"FACS characterisation of the designed binder FR57 in the synNotch receptor, testing whether a de novo binder discriminates HLA-A*01 from the near-identical A*02 and A*03 alleles.","caption_zh":"以 FACS 對 synNotch 受體上設計出的結合子 FR57 做特性分析，檢驗一個從頭設計的結合子能否把 HLA-A*01 與幾乎相同的 A*02、A*03 等位基因區分開來。","credit":"Team GU Frankfurt, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6108/wiki/images/education-page/images-cropped/workshop-figure-1.avif","caption":"One of nine school workshops on organ donation and synthetic biology, measured with before-and-after knowledge questions; the proposal to make these workshops curriculum-mandatory reached the German Bundestag.","caption_zh":"九場器官捐贈與合成生物學校園工作坊中的一場，以前後知識題量測成效；把這些工作坊納入課綱必修的提案已送進德國聯邦議院。","credit":"Team GU Frankfurt, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Two things are directly copyable. First, HUSH's premise: when the standard tool for your problem is a proprietary web form, the gap itself is a publishable contribution, so build the open version with the alignment step folded in and the safety check scored rather than disclaimed. Second, treat outreach as an experiment with a pre-and-post instrument (66.1% to 91.9% on a single factual question is worth more than 'we reached 500 people'), and build a TRUST-style written protocol before students run any activity touching death, illness or grief.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"有兩點可以直接借鏡。第一是 HUSH 的立論前提：當你問題領域裡的標準工具是一個專有的網頁表單，這個缺口本身就是可發表的貢獻，所以就把開源版本做出來，把序列比對這一步整合進去，並把安全性檢查做成評分、而不是免責聲明。第二是把科普當成實驗來做，備好前後測工具（在單一事實題上從 66.1% 提升到 91.9%，比「我們觸及 500 人」有價值得多），並在學生執行任何涉及死亡、疾病或哀傷的活動之前，先建立一份 TRUST 那樣的書面規範。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/gu-frankfurt/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gu-frankfurt/drylab","https://2026.igem.wiki/gu-frankfurt/binder-design","https://2026.igem.wiki/gu-frankfurt/hush","https://2026.igem.wiki/gu-frankfurt/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/gu-frankfurt/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/gu-frankfurt/trust","https://2026.igem.wiki/gu-frankfurt/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/gu-frankfurt/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/gu-frankfurt/start"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳元件集 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳軟體 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳教育 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳治療專案 — 入圍"],"rank":143},"6110":{"team":"TU Delft","id":"6110","section":"Overgrad","country":"Netherlands","village":"Biomanufacturing","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/","projectTitle":"MOSAIC","projectTitle_zh":"MOSAIC","tagline":"A modular elastin-like polypeptide coating platform that lets one implant surface be tuned to the tissue, and the patient, it sits in.","tagline_zh":"一個模組化的類彈性蛋白多肽塗層平台，讓同一種植入物表面能依其所在的組織、以及病人本身來調整。","summary":"MOSAIC is a modular implant coating built from elastin-like polypeptides (ELPs) that can be swapped part by part so a single platform serves many implants and tissues. The team's insight is that an implant coating has to match the stiffness and biochemistry of its target tissue: tissue stiffness spans 0.1 kPa in brain to over 1 MPa in bone, while titanium is around 100 GPa, so a one-size coating gives cells the wrong signal. They built five linked models to steer design before the lab work - an XGBoost predictor of ELP transition temperature, coarse-grained molecular dynamics of the surface-tethered hydrogel, an omics pipeline turning transcriptomic and proteomic atlases into tissue-specific coating recipes, a SuperPro Designer scale-up of ELP manufacturing, and a life-cycle assessment of that process - and they ran Value Sensitive Design across 13 interviews so stakeholders shaped the construct while it could still change. It took the Overgrad Grand Prize along with Best Wiki, Best Integrated Human Practices and Best Biomanufacturing Project.","summary_zh":"MOSAIC 是一種以類彈性蛋白多肽（ELP）構成的模組化植入物塗層，可逐一替換部件，因此單一平台就能服務多種植入物與組織。該隊的洞見是：植入物塗層必須匹配目標組織的硬度與生化特性；組織硬度從腦部的 0.1 kPa 到骨骼的超過 1 MPa，而鈦約為 100 GPa，所以一體適用的塗層只會給細胞錯誤的訊號。他們建了五個互相銜接的模型，在進實驗室之前先引導設計——以 XGBoost 預測 ELP 轉變溫度、對表面接枝水膠做粗粒化分子動力學模擬、一條把轉錄體與蛋白體圖譜轉成組織專一塗層配方的體學流程、用 SuperPro Designer 做 ELP 生產的放大模擬，以及該製程的生命週期評估——並在 13 場訪談中貫徹價值敏感設計（Value Sensitive Design），讓利害關係人在構築體還能改的階段就參與塑形。本隊拿下 Overgrad 組總冠軍，同時獲得最佳 Wiki、最佳整合式人類實踐與最佳生物製造專案。","awards":["Grand Prize Winner (Overgrad)","Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Model — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Biomanufacturing Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Five models, each tied to a design question. (1) LCST prediction: an XGBoost regressor trained on 230 literature-curated entries predicting ELP transition temperature from sequence composition, length, charge, hydrophobicity and solution conditions, with monotonic constraints forcing predicted LCST to fall as NaCl, ELP concentration or hydrophobicity rise, 216-combination exhaustive grid search over six hyperparameters under composition-grouped 5-fold CV, and a held-out set of 43 entries covering only 10 unique sequences; MAE 3.17 C, beating a linear fit of the Meyer-Chilkoti empirical relation, a 5-nearest-neighbour model and a mean baseline. (2) Molecular dynamics: coarse-grained CALVADOS 0.8.0 with CALVADOS 2 residue parameters in OpenMM 8.2 (one bead per residue, implicit solvent, Debye-Huckel screening, 293.15 K, 10 fs timestep, Langevin thermostat) simulating 16-chain surface-tethered ELP brushes on DelftBlue, the TU Delft supercomputer - chosen explicitly because ELPs are intrinsically disordered and AlphaFold is of limited use. Three MD modules resolve hydrogel stiffness (inter-chain lysine contacts as a proxy), crosslink placement (bridges versus wasted intra-chain loops) and RGD motif solvent accessibility, analysed by response surface modelling and per-lysine regression. (3) Omics-guided motif selection: an enhancement-based test across Human Protein Atlas bulk RNA-seq, the Proteome Atlas DIA-MS intensities, Tabula Sapiens single-cell via CZ CELLxGENE, and GEO datasets (GSE104782, GSE169396, GSE147287, GSE114007), annotated by matrisome, integrin and protease category, with per-dataset thresholds (HPA: >4x the mean of other tissues above 1 nTPM, plus stricter floors of 10 nTPM for ECM ligands and 3 nTPM for integrins) producing an ECM adhesion domain, an integrin target and a targetable protease per implant tissue. (4) Large-scale production: a pilot bioprocess in SuperPro Designer with three consecutive reactors reaching 5.11 g/L ELP, sized to coat 117 million and 22 million continuous glucose monitors, with full catabolic, anabolic and glycerol metabolic balances, downstream ITC/salting-out, homogenisation, flocculation, ion exchange and lyophilisation. (5) Environmental impact: an ISO 14040-style LCA of that flowsheet expressed in eco-costs across 14 categories (acidification, water stress, biodiversity and land-use change, carbon footprint, freshwater ecotoxicity, eutrophication, human toxicity cancer and non-cancer, landfill, metals scarcity, particulate matter, photochemical ozone, plastic soup, resource use), framed against the ESPR and the fact that wearables emit 1.1-6.1 kg CO2e per device.","frameworks_zh":"五個模型，每個都綁定一個設計問題。(1) LCST 預測：以 XGBoost 迴歸器在 230 筆文獻整理的資料上訓練，從序列組成、長度、電荷、疏水性與溶液條件預測 ELP 轉變溫度，並施加單調性約束，強制預測的 LCST 隨 NaCl、ELP 濃度或疏水性上升而下降；在依組成分組的 5 折交叉驗證下，對六個超參數做 216 組合的窮舉網格搜尋，並保留一組 43 筆、只涵蓋 10 條獨特序列的測試集；MAE 3.17 °C，優於 Meyer-Chilkoti 經驗關係式的線性擬合、5 近鄰模型與平均值基準線。(2) 分子動力學：在 OpenMM 8.2 中使用 CALVADOS 0.8.0 搭配 CALVADOS 2 的殘基參數（每個殘基一顆珠、隱式溶劑、Debye-Huckel 屏蔽、293.15 K、10 fs 時間步、Langevin 恆溫器），在台夫特理工大學的超級電腦 DelftBlue 上模擬 16 條鏈的表面接枝 ELP 刷層——明確選擇這條路線，是因為 ELP 本質上是無序蛋白質，AlphaFold 的用處有限。三個 MD 模組分別解析水膠硬度（以鏈間離胺酸接觸作為替代指標）、交聯位置（形成橋接、還是浪費在鏈內迴圈）與 RGD 模體的溶劑可及性，並以反應曲面模型與逐一離胺酸迴歸分析。(3) 體學導引的模體選擇：跨 Human Protein Atlas 的 bulk RNA-seq、Proteome Atlas 的 DIA-MS 強度、透過 CZ CELLxGENE 取得的 Tabula Sapiens 單細胞資料，以及 GEO 資料集（GSE104782、GSE169396、GSE147287、GSE114007）進行一項基於富集程度的檢定，並依基質體、整合素與蛋白酶類別註解，各資料集設有各自門檻（HPA：高於其他組織平均值 4 倍且大於 1 nTPM，另對 ECM 配體加設 10 nTPM、對整合素加設 3 nTPM 的較嚴下限），為每種植入組織產出一個 ECM 黏附區域、一個整合素標靶與一個可作為標靶的蛋白酶。(4) 大規模生產：在 SuperPro Designer 中建立先導製程，三座串聯反應器達到 5.11 g/L ELP，規模設定為可塗覆 1.17 億與 2,200 萬台連續血糖監測器，並具備完整的分解代謝、合成代謝與甘油代謝平衡，下游則包含 ITC／鹽析、均質化、絮凝、離子交換與冷凍乾燥。(5) 環境衝擊：對該流程圖做 ISO 14040 形式的生命週期評估，以生態成本表示，涵蓋 14 個類別（酸化、水資源壓力、生物多樣性與土地利用變化、碳足跡、淡水生態毒性、優養化、人體毒性之致癌與非致癌、掩埋、金屬稀缺、懸浮微粒、光化學臭氧、塑膠濃湯、資源使用），並以 ESPR 以及穿戴式裝置每台排放 1.1–6.1 kg CO2e 的事實作為對照框架。","dataviz":"Best Wiki winner, and the mechanics are worth copying: the wiki is authored in Markdown with structured components (Image with named figure references, FigNum auto-numbering, Collapsable deep-dive blocks, Reference by DOI) and it publishes a machine-readable mirror - every page is served as plain .md at /tu-delft/<page>.md with an llms.txt index, so the whole wiki is readable without JavaScript. The MOSAIC Designer ships as a live four-step in-browser app (annotate, codon-shuffle, swap, assemble-and-export). The clearest single visual argument is a pair of dot plots of the same six-VPGVG protein: one codon per amino acid leaves 190 repeated 8 nt stretches as diagonal stripes, the scrambled spelling leaves 3. The scale-up model is presented as an interactive flowsheet where clicking any equipment unit opens its specifications and stream details, and the entrepreneurship page carries a BOM Sankey, a company-analysis matrix and a CGM signal/lag model.","dataviz_zh":"最佳 Wiki 得主，而其技術做法值得照抄：wiki 以 Markdown 撰寫，搭配結構化元件（Image 帶具名圖號引用、FigNum 自動編號、Collapsable 深入段落、以 DOI 引用的 Reference），並發佈一份可被機器讀取的鏡像——每一頁都在 /tu-delft/<page>.md 以純 .md 形式提供，另附 llms.txt 索引，因此整個 wiki 不需 JavaScript 也能閱讀。MOSAIC Designer 以瀏覽器內四步驟的實際應用程式發佈（註解、密碼子打散、替換、組裝並匯出）。最清楚的單一視覺論證是同一個含六段 VPGVG 蛋白質的兩張點圖：每個胺基酸只用一種密碼子時，留下 190 段重複的 8 nt 片段，呈現為斜向條紋；改用打散的拼法後只剩 3 段。放大模型以互動式流程圖呈現，點選任一設備單元就會開啟其規格與物流細節；創業頁面則有一張 BOM 桑基圖、一個公司分析矩陣與一個 CGM 訊號／延遲模型。","datascience":"Their data engineering is as careful as the modelling. For LCST they searched 86 candidate sources (71 papers or reviews, 15 patents) and hand-extracted sequence, transition temperature, ELP-to-buffer concentration, buffer type, pH and added NaCl; where values existed only as published figures they built their own browser-based LCST Extractor that calibrates axes against tick marks, lets the user trace points along a curve, smooths with LOESS and takes the transition temperature from the steepest change in absorbance - a reproducible digitisation step instead of visual estimation. They treat two rows as the same ELP when amino acid composition matches and keep all rows of one ELP in the same fold, which is an explicit leakage guard, and they document the limitation that composition-only features cannot distinguish block from alternating arrangements of the same residues. The omics pipeline is the other half: it converts public transcriptomic and proteomic atlases into concrete, orderable sequence recipes per tissue, with documented fallback motifs when no tissue signature resolves.","datascience_zh":"他們的資料工程做得和建模一樣細。為了 LCST，他們檢索 86 個候選來源（71 篇論文或綜述、15 件專利），人工擷取序列、轉變溫度、ELP 對緩衝液的濃度、緩衝液種類、pH 與額外添加的 NaCl；若數值只存在於已發表的圖中，他們自建瀏覽器端的 LCST Extractor，以刻度線校正座標軸，讓使用者沿曲線描點，以 LOESS 平滑，並取吸光度變化最陡處作為轉變溫度——這是一個可重現的數位化步驟，取代目測估計。當胺基酸組成相同時，他們把兩列資料視為同一條 ELP，並把同一條 ELP 的所有資料列放在同一折內，這是明確的資料洩漏防範；他們也記錄了限制：只用組成特徵無法區分同樣殘基是以區塊式還是交替式排列。體學流程是另一半：它把公開的轉錄體與蛋白體圖譜轉換成每種組織具體、可直接下單的序列配方，並在找不出組織特徵時記錄備用模體。","software":"Four tools on iGEM GitLab. MOSAIC ELP Designer (https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/tu-delft/mosaic-elp-designer) solves the problem that repetitive ELP genes are near-impossible to synthesise: it annotates a pasted protein into parts and linkers, codon-scrambles the parts using a De Bruijn-window repeat check (default k = 3 codons, repeats counted from 6 to 18 nt, homopolymer rule on, BsaI/NdeI/BseRI/BamHI/XbaI excluded on both strands), designs compatible Golden Gate cut sites in the locked linkers so every new part combination assembles with the same overhangs, checks synthesisability, and exports order-ready library sequences; it runs as a web app at https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/designer. LCST Prediction (https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/tu-delft/lcst-prediction) is a Python pipeline with clean_data.ipynb, features.py, train_model.py, test_model.py, run_pipeline.py and predict.py, and bundles the LCST Extractor digitiser under tools/curve_extract. Molecular Dynamics Simulator (https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/tu-delft/molecular-dynamics-simulator) wraps the CALVADOS/OpenMM brush setup and per-module analysis. Tissue-Specific ELP Design (https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/tu-delft/tissue-specific-elp-design) is the omics pipeline. Data deposited at doi:10.5281/zenodo.23532676.","software_zh":"iGEM GitLab 上四項工具。MOSAIC ELP Designer（https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/tu-delft/mosaic-elp-designer）解決重複性高的 ELP 基因幾乎無法合成的問題：它把貼入的蛋白質註解為部件與連接子，以 De Bruijn 視窗重複檢查打散部件的密碼子（預設 k = 3 個密碼子，重複長度從 6 計算到 18 nt，啟用同聚物規則，並在雙股上排除 BsaI/NdeI/BseRI/BamHI/XbaI），在鎖定的連接子中設計相容的 Golden Gate 切位，使每一組新的部件組合都能以相同的 overhang 組裝，再檢查可合成性，最後匯出可直接下單的函式庫序列；它也以網頁應用程式的形式在 https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/designer 運行。LCST Prediction（https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/tu-delft/lcst-prediction）是一條 Python 流程，包含 clean_data.ipynb、features.py、train_model.py、test_model.py、run_pipeline.py 與 predict.py，並把 LCST Extractor 數位化工具收錄在 tools/curve_extract 下。Molecular Dynamics Simulator（https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/tu-delft/molecular-dynamics-simulator）封裝了 CALVADOS/OpenMM 的刷層設定與各模組分析。Tissue-Specific ELP Design（https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/tu-delft/tissue-specific-elp-design）則是那條體學流程。資料存放於 doi:10.5281/zenodo.23532676。","stack":["XGBoost","scikit-learn","Python / Jupyter","CALVADOS 0.8.0 (CALVADOS 2 parameters)","OpenMM 8.2","DelftBlue HPC","SuperPro Designer","Idemat / eco-costs LCA","Human Protein Atlas","Proteome Atlas (DIA-MS)","Tabula Sapiens via CZ CELLxGENE Census","NCBI GEO","De Bruijn-graph codon scrambling","Golden Gate / MoClo assembly design","LOESS smoothing","Markdown + component-based wiki with llms.txt","QCM-D (MVP validation)","iGEM GitLab","Zenodo"],"techniques":["monotonic feature constraints encoding known physics into a tree model","composition-grouped cross-validation as a leakage guard","exhaustive grid search with 5-fold CV on the training split only","benchmarking against a published empirical equation, kNN and a mean baseline","coarse-grained MD of intrinsically disordered proteins","response surface modelling and per-lysine regression on MD trajectories","bridge-versus-loop crosslink partition analysis","solvent-accessible-surface-area motif accessibility","enhancement-based tissue-specificity testing across four omics resolutions","techno-economic process simulation with full metabolic balances","ISO 14040 life-cycle assessment in single-indicator eco-costs","figure digitisation with axis calibration and LOESS","repeat-aware codon optimisation for synthesisable repetitive genes"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Outreach was built as two-way exchange rather than broadcast, and the recurring artefact is the DNA bracelet: visitors translate a DNA sequence to RNA to protein, each protein becoming a differently coloured bead, so they leave with both the concept and the object. They ran it at the Weekend of Science on the TU Delft campus in The Hague (part of a national programme of 2,000 activities in one weekend), at Neighbours' Day in the district where team members live using beads donated by a local artist, and alongside a codon wheel and a 'building blocks' horse-race game. They put a pond scoop next to a microscope and taught children to focus it, letting curiosity do the teaching for the younger visitors who found the implant problem itself uninteresting. Delft Dialogue brought the Human Practices co-lead, team lead and outreach manager on to discuss the technology's implications for medicine. They also hosted a PhD student from the Daan Brinks Lab for a cloning knowledge exchange and met other iGEM teams, noting specifically what they learned from Brussels' bees and Wageningen's PFAS project.","publicEngagement_zh":"外展活動被設計成雙向交流而非單向播送，反覆出現的產出是 DNA 手鍊：參觀者把一段 DNA 序列轉譯成 RNA 再轉成蛋白質，每種蛋白質對應一顆不同顏色的珠子，於是他們同時帶走概念與實物。他們在海牙台夫特理工校區的 Weekend of Science（一個週末內 2,000 場活動的全國性計畫的一部分）辦過，也在隊員居住的社區的 Neighbours' Day 辦過，珠子由當地一位藝術家捐贈，同場還有密碼子轉盤與一個「積木」賽馬遊戲。他們在顯微鏡旁放了一支撈池水的網勺，教孩子自己對焦，讓好奇心替他們教學——對那些覺得植入物問題本身很無聊的年幼參觀者尤其有效。Delft Dialogue 則請來 Human Practices 共同負責人、隊長與外展經理，討論這項技術對醫療的意涵。他們也接待了 Daan Brinks Lab 的一位博士生進行選殖技術交流，並與其他 iGEM 隊伍交流，特別提到從布魯塞爾隊的蜜蜂專案與 Wageningen 隊的 PFAS 專案學到的東西。","ihp":"Best IHP winner, and the structure is the reason. They used Value Sensitive Design in three explicit passes - conceptual (who MOSAIC affects), empirical (13 semi-structured interviews plus literature) and technical (values translated into design requirements) - adapted the Rathenau Institute's iGEM Guide to the Future into five actor groups (directly affected, those who govern access, industry, those who inform, nature), placed every actor on a power-interest grid using two questions (can this actor formally block market access, and does it have a direct stake), borrowed a 1-3 MCDA scoring scale to extend GRADE, and got formal TU Delft Human Research Ethics Committee approval before any interviews. Requirements they could not meet this year became explicitly labelled Future Perspectives rather than quiet omissions. The concrete changes: a philosopher of technology pointed out that modularity is simultaneously the strength and the regulatory risk, which pushed them to involve patients, clinicians and regulators while the construct was still open and to be wary of words like 'biomimicry' that make people assume safety. Antibiotic-resistance concerns made them drop antibiotics from the antimicrobial module entirely and search the literature for alternatives, landing on antimicrobial peptides. Kirby Lattwein (Erasmus MC, cardiovascular device infections) said their assays would not predict real-world performance, so they switched to clinically relevant strains and media and ran the AMP work in her lab on three clinical isolates from LVAD driveline infections plus two reference strains, and added LVAD drivelines as a use case. Surgeon Robin Atallah told them every minute in the operating room costs 50-70 euros and that surgeons resist deviating from routine, which pushed them toward a manufacturer-pre-coated implant rather than an in-theatre paste. Ambiguity about protein coatings in permanent blood contact made them set blood-contacting implants aside and focus on tissue-embedded and skin-crossing implants. Amir Zadpoor's point that loosening is a major failure mode drove the omics-guided motif model. A CGM industry interviewee's distinction between sensor and adhesive focused the MVP on the inserted sensor and his warning that manufacturers have little incentive to reduce sensor replacement sales sent the entrepreneurship team back to the business model.","ihp_zh":"最佳整合式人類實踐得主，而結構正是得獎原因。他們以三個明確階段運用價值敏感設計——概念階段（MOSAIC 影響到誰）、實證階段（13 場半結構訪談加上文獻）與技術階段（把價值轉譯為設計需求），並把 Rathenau Institute 的 iGEM Guide to the Future 改寫成五類行動者（直接受影響者、管控取得管道者、產業、提供資訊者、自然），再以兩個問題（這個行動者能否正式阻擋市場准入、以及它是否有直接利害關係）把每個行動者定位在權力—利益矩陣上，另外借用 1–3 分的 MCDA 評分尺度來擴充 GRADE，並在任何訪談之前取得台夫特理工大學人類研究倫理委員會的正式核准。今年做不到的需求被明確標示為 Future Perspectives，而不是悄悄省略。具體的改變如下：一位技術哲學家指出模組化同時是強項也是法規風險，這促使他們在構築體還開放時就納入病人、臨床醫師與法規人員，並對「生物擬態」這類會讓人誤以為安全的字眼保持警覺。對抗生素抗藥性的顧慮使他們把抗生素完全從抗微生物模組中移除，並回頭查文獻尋找替代方案，最後落在抗菌肽。Kirby Lattwein（Erasmus MC，心血管裝置感染）指出他們的分析方法無法預測真實世界表現，於是他們改用臨床相關菌株與培養基，並在她的實驗室中以三株來自 LVAD 傳動線感染的臨床分離菌加上兩株參考菌株進行抗菌肽實驗，也把 LVAD 傳動線納為應用場景。外科醫師 Robin Atallah 告訴他們，手術室裡每一分鐘要花 50–70 歐元，而外科醫師抗拒偏離既有流程，這把他們推向由製造商預先塗覆的植入物，而非在手術室現場塗抹的膏劑。蛋白質塗層在永久接觸血液情境下的不確定性，使他們暫時放下接觸血液的植入物，專注於埋入組織與穿皮的植入物。Amir Zadpoor 指出鬆動是主要的失效模式，這推動了體學導引的模體模型。一位 CGM 產業受訪者區分了感測器與黏貼膠，使 MVP 聚焦在植入體內的感測器；而他提醒製造商幾乎沒有動機去減少感測器替換的銷售，則讓創業小組回頭重做商業模式。","realWorld":"The MVP is deliberately the hardest possible test rather than the best-performing coating: a single construct, (VPGIG)23-VPGKG-LDASTVYAVTGRGDSPASSAASA-(VPGIG)24, with one lysine placed directly beside the RGD domain mid-chain, bonded through that lysine to a polydopamine-primed CGM polyurethane membrane, validated by QCM-D for attachment and a cell-adhesion assay against scrambled-RDG and lysine-free controls on the same purified batch. Commercially they chose continuous glucose monitors after a regulatory-driven application screen: they studied EU MDR and FDA pathways in detail (notified body versus 510(k)/PMA, Rule 14 class III escalation when a coating carries an active substance, Annex IX 4.10 review for changes to an approved device) and let that analysis eliminate candidates. The business model is ELP supply paid as a royalty per coated sensor, set as a share of the partner's net price per sensor, which they justify as how medical-technology licences are normally priced, with contracts structured to limit risk. They ran TAM/SAM/SOM, Porter's Five Forces, SWOT with explicit strategies, CGM market consolidation and GLP-1 agonist trend analysis, and three competitor case studies (LipoCoat, Surmodics, Bactiguard). Scale-up is costed for 117 million and 22 million CGMs per year with full technical and financial KPIs, backed by the LCA. IP is mapped as US and European ELP patent landscapes against TU Delft's ownership policy, with an explicit discussion of IP versus open-source science. A 3D-printed-organ bioink route is flagged as future work, since ELPs phase-transition reversibly above a set temperature.","realWorld_zh":"MVP 刻意設計成最嚴苛的測試，而不是表現最好的塗層：單一構築體 (VPGIG)23-VPGKG-LDASTVYAVTGRGDSPASSAASA-(VPGIG)24，在鏈中段 RGD 區域旁邊只放一個離胺酸，並透過該離胺酸鍵結到以聚多巴胺預處理的 CGM 聚胺酯薄膜上，以 QCM-D 驗證附著，並在同一批純化產物上，以打亂序列的 RDG 與無離胺酸的對照組進行細胞黏附試驗。商業上，他們在一輪由法規驅動的應用篩選後選定連續血糖監測器：他們詳細研究歐盟 MDR 與 FDA 的途徑（公告機構對比 510(k)/PMA、當塗層帶有活性物質時依規則 14 升級為第三類、核准器材變更時依附錄 IX 第 4.10 節審查），並讓這份分析淘汰其他候選。商業模式是 ELP 供應以每片已塗覆感測器的權利金計價，設定為合作夥伴每片感測器淨價的一定比例，他們以醫療科技授權的常見定價方式為理由，並以能限縮風險的方式設計合約。他們做了 TAM/SAM/SOM、波特五力分析、附明確策略的 SWOT、CGM 市場整併與 GLP-1 受體促效劑趨勢分析，以及三個競爭者案例研究（LipoCoat、Surmodics、Bactiguard）。放大生產則依每年 1.17 億與 2,200 萬台 CGM 計算成本，附完整的技術與財務 KPI，並以 LCA 為後盾。智慧財產權部分，他們把美國與歐洲的 ELP 專利佈局對照台夫特理工大學的所有權政策加以盤點，並明確討論了智財與開源科學之間的張力。3D 列印器官用生物墨水的路線被標為未來工作，因為 ELP 在特定溫度之上會可逆地發生相變。","partners":["Kirby Lattwein, Erasmus Medical Center (cardiovascular device infections; hosted the AMP assays)","Dr. Robin Atallah (bone-anchored prostheses surgeon)","Prof. Amir Zadpoor, TU Delft (implant loosening)","Prof. Gijsje Koenderink, TU Delft","Dirk Eijkel","Luca Hodes (ELP functionalisation / bioink idea)","Nikolas Gaio and Tim Bruines (industry interviews)","Daan Brinks Lab, TU Delft","TU Delft Human Research Ethics Committee","Rathenau Institute (iGEM Guide to the Future framework)","DHPC DelftBlue supercomputer"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6110/wiki/software/workflow.avif","caption":"What the MOSAIC Designer takes over: from a researcher's amino acid sequence through part identification, codon scrambling, Golden Gate cut-site design and synthesis feasibility checks to order-ready library sequences.","caption_zh":"MOSAIC Designer 接手了哪些工作：從研究者的胺基酸序列，經過部件識別、密碼子打散、Golden Gate 切位設計與合成可行性檢查，一路到可直接下單的函式庫序列。","credit":"Team TU Delft, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6110/wiki/software/annotate.avif","caption":"The MOSAIC Designer annotation step in the browser: a pasted sequence split into parts and linkers, each listed with its range, length and sequence, auto-filled from the detected repeat motif.","caption_zh":"瀏覽器中的 MOSAIC Designer 註解步驟：貼入的序列被切分為部件與連接子，各自列出範圍、長度與序列，並由偵測到的重複模體自動填入。","credit":"Team TU Delft, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6110/wiki/model/bioinformatics-pipeline-blockscheme.avif","caption":"The omics-guided motif selection pipeline: public transcriptomic and proteomic data filtered to implant-relevant tissues, annotated by matrisome, integrin and protease category, and reduced by an enhancement test to a per-tissue coating recipe.","caption_zh":"體學導引的模體選擇流程：公開的轉錄體與蛋白體資料先篩選到與植入物相關的組織，依基質體、整合素與蛋白酶類別註解，再以富集程度檢定收斂成每種組織的塗層配方。","credit":"Team TU Delft, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6110/wiki/outreach/bracelets/workshop-preview.avif","caption":"The DNA bracelet workshop, run at the Weekend of Science and Neighbours' Day: visitors translate DNA to RNA to protein, with each protein becoming a coloured bead they take home.","caption_zh":"在 Weekend of Science 與 Neighbours' Day 舉辦的 DNA 手鍊工作坊：參觀者把 DNA 轉譯成 RNA 再轉成蛋白質，每種蛋白質變成一顆可以帶回家的彩色珠子。","credit":"Team TU Delft, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Adopt their two cheap, high-leverage habits. First, build known physics into a small model instead of hoping it learns it: monotonic constraints on NaCl, concentration and hydrophobicity let 230 hand-curated data points beat a published empirical equation, which is exactly the regime a school lab works in. Second, make the wiki machine-readable - authoring pages as Markdown and publishing them at <page>.md with an llms.txt index cost them almost nothing and made the Best Wiki winner fully legible to any reader or tool, including judges skimming on a bad connection.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"值得採用他們兩個便宜又高槓桿的習慣。第一，把已知的物理直接寫進小模型，而不是指望模型自己學會：對 NaCl、濃度與疏水性施加單調性約束，讓 230 筆人工整理的資料點勝過已發表的經驗公式，而這正是學校實驗室所處的資料規模。第二，讓 wiki 可被機器讀取——用 Markdown 撰寫頁面、並在 <page>.md 發佈，再加一份 llms.txt 索引，幾乎沒有額外成本，卻讓這個最佳 Wiki 得主對任何讀者或工具都完全可讀，包括在連線品質不佳時快速瀏覽的評審。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/llms.txt","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/description.md","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/model.md","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/software.md","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/results.md","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/engineering.md","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/human-practices.md","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/entrepreneurship.md","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/outreach.md","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/contribution.md","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/parts.md","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/experiments.md"],"awards_zh":["總冠軍（研究生組）","Top 10（研究生組）","最佳模型 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 得主（研究生組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳創業 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳生物製造專案 — 得主"],"rank":289},"6115":{"team":"BNDS-China","id":"6115","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/bnds-china/","projectTitle":"OrbitColi","projectTitle_zh":"OrbitColi","tagline":"An AND-logic-gate engineered probiotic that senses oxidative stress in space and produces vitamin B2 and trehalose to protect astronauts","tagline_zh":"以 AND 邏輯閘設計的工程益生菌，在太空中感測氧化壓力並生產維生素 B2 與海藻糖來保護太空人","summary":"BNDS-China built OrbitColi, an engineered E. coli probiotic designed to sense oxidative conditions arising from cosmic radiation and microgravity and respond by producing vitamin B2 and trehalose, replacing fixed-dose supplements that degrade over multi-year missions. The scientific framing is quantitative: ISS crews receive 100-200 mSv per year against a 20 mSv occupational limit, and a three-year Mars round trip may accumulate 300-450 mSv. The team's distinguishing contribution is methodological: they invented and applied a five-step education framework, R.E.A.C.H. (Recognize, Experience, Apply, Communicate, Harvest), to every single outreach activity, with a pre-event diagnostic survey and a matched post-event survey, and they report their own failures against it. Integrated Human Practices used a parallel STAR framework (Scan, Test, Assemble, Reflect) across five cycles.","summary_zh":"BNDS-China 做了 OrbitColi，一株經改造的 E. coli 益生菌，設計用來感測宇宙輻射與微重力造成的氧化環境，並以生產維生素 B2 與海藻糖作為回應，取代在多年任務中會變質的固定劑量補充品。科學鋪陳是有數字的：國際太空站組員每年接受 100-200 mSv，職業曝露上限為 20 mSv，而三年的火星往返任務可能累積 300-450 mSv。團隊最具辨識度的貢獻在方法層面：他們自創並實際套用一套五步教育框架 R.E.A.C.H.（Recognize、Experience、Apply、Communicate、Harvest）到每一場推廣活動，搭配活動前的診斷性問卷與相對應的活動後問卷，而且會依這個框架回報自己哪裡做失敗了。整合式人類實踐則以平行的 STAR 框架（Scan、Test、Assemble、Reflect）跑了五個循環。","awards":["Best Education — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Two self-designed frameworks, both documented and reusable: R.E.A.C.H. for education (Recognize the audience's pre-existing attitudes before teaching; Experience through interactive formats; Apply by moving the audience from listeners to designers; Communicate to close the loop by harvesting informed project feedback into Integrated Human Practices; Harvest by quantifying the event's success and planning the next iteration) and STAR for iHP (Scan, Test, Assemble, Reflect) across five cycles: problem validation, end-user and market needs, technical design, biosafety and ethics, and production and final-product development. The REACH structure is published in detailed appendices so other teams can reuse it.","frameworks_zh":"兩套自行設計、都有文件且可重複使用的框架：教育用的 R.E.A.C.H.（Recognize，教之前先認識受眾原有的態度；Experience，以互動形式讓他們親身體驗；Apply，讓受眾從聽眾變成設計者；Communicate，把出於理解的專案回饋收攏回整合式人類實踐，閉合迴圈；Harvest，量化這場活動的成效並規劃下一次迭代），以及人類實踐用的 STAR（Scan、Test、Assemble、Reflect），共跑五個循環：問題驗證、終端使用者與市場需求、技術設計、生物安全與倫理，以及生產與最終產品開發。REACH 的結構以詳細附錄公開，讓其他團隊可以直接沿用。","dataviz":"Before-and-after bar charts of self-reported technique familiarity and interest; questionnaire-result figures published for each activity (pre and post); a timeline figure of all educational activities; pre-interview and final stakeholder influence/relevance maps for iHP, with the honest caveat printed on the figure that inclusion in the pre-interview map does not mean an interview took place.","dataviz_zh":"自評技術熟悉度與興趣的前後對比長條圖；每場活動都公布問卷結果圖（前測與後測）；一張涵蓋所有教育活動的時間軸圖；以及人類實踐的訪談前與最終版利害關係人影響力／相關性地圖，圖上還老實標註：出現在訪談前的地圖上並不代表訪談真的發生過。","datascience":"Systematic paired pre/post surveying with reported N and percentages, e.g. kindergarten cohort N = 14 matched responses, 21 student athletes aged 10-13 surveyed before and after, 16 valid responses per question from the elderly session, eight older adults aged 68-82 interviewed at the scoping stage, and two school-wide perception surveys on synthetic biology and on attitudes to engineered-bacteria consumption and space microbial applications, all published as downloadable files.","datascience_zh":"系統性的配對前後測問卷，都回報 N 值與百分比，例如幼兒園組 N = 14 份可配對回覆、21 位 10-13 歲學生運動員在活動前後各受測一次、長者場次每題 16 份有效回覆、在前期範疇界定階段訪談 8 位 68-82 歲長者，以及兩份全校性認知調查（對合成生物學的看法，以及對食用工程菌與太空微生物應用的態度），全部以可下載檔案公開。","software":"The project includes hardware and software components presented to audiences for feedback; the team learned an AI protein-design workflow from team NBJF (generate structure, fill amino-acid sequence, in-silico screening, wet-lab validation) and explicitly reserved wet-lab capacity because high in-silico scores can lose function in reality.","software_zh":"專案包含硬體與軟體元件，並拿給受眾試用以收集回饋；團隊向 NBJF 隊伍學到一套 AI 蛋白質設計流程（先生成結構、再填入胺基酸序列、電腦模擬篩選、濕實驗驗證），並明確保留濕實驗的量能，因為電腦模擬分數很高的設計在現實中仍可能失去功能。","stack":["R.E.A.C.H. education framework","STAR iHP framework","paired pre/post questionnaires","downloadable lesson slide decks and protocols","AND logic-gate genetic circuit design"],"techniques":["oxidative-stress-responsive promoter sensing","AND logic gate circuit","vitamin B2 and trehalose biosynthesis","protein thermal and radiation resistance engineering","strawberry DNA extraction","fluorescent E. coli painting"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"BNDS-China's practice is distinctive because every activity is written up against the same five-step template, R.E.A.C.H., which forces a pre-event diagnostic, an interactive delivery, a design task, a project-feedback loop and a quantified post-event evaluation - and the team reports honestly where a step was skipped. The highest-value example is a kindergarten programme for pre-literate 5-6 year olds. The Recognize step established through a pre-event survey that children already saw microbes as invisible enemies (hand-washing framing) and that 71.43% preferred interactive games to lectures. The team then rendered BioBrick standard assembly as a colour-coded tactile block system: a blue 'switch' promoter block that must come first, a red 'function' coding-sequence block compared to a light bulb, a yellow 'stop' terminator block compared to a vehicle brake, and a green 'little house' vector and chassis block, with assembly order taught as a chanted mantra ('Flip open the blue switch, let the red function bloom, halt with the yellow brake, and live inside the green room!'). Children worked in pairs and trios called 'syndicates' with visual challenge cards posing local problems (make plants glow to light a path to a playground at night; make a flower that masks the smell of garbage). The cleverest design move: the team deliberately rationed parts, giving one table switches but no coding blocks and the next table the reverse, so children had to discover what they lacked, approach other groups and barter - a lived introduction to the open-source iGEM Registry. A five-act puppet show, 'Microscopic Defense Line', dramatised a grazed arm at cell scale, and deliberately avoided weapons or war imagery: the White Blood Cell puppet hugged the bacterium to represent phagocytosis, two red blood cell actors held hands to bridge a vessel, and platelet actors pressed yellow paper against stretchy cloth to show clotting. Measured results from matched surveys (N = 14): before, 78.57% did not know what it meant to pass a function from one organism to another and 64.29% did not know or only vaguely knew what a gene is; after, 92.86% described synthetic biology as 'building blocks', 92.86% knew the promoter starts expression and 100% knew the coding sequence determines function; 42.86% had thought the body fights invaders like 'little soldiers' and none knew clots form, versus 100% afterwards understanding both white blood cell clearance and platelet repair; 100% enjoyed the activities and 92.86% wanted more science stories. The feedback even changed the project: children asked why immune clearance has to kill ('Can't they just change them? Make them friends?') and worried what happens if the yellow stop block falls off, which the team mapped onto transcriptional runaway, biocontainment and biocontamination and used to question their own antagonistic-clearance therapeutic model. Other formats, each with REACH write-ups: a BioCamp lecture on the whole molecular toolkit (PCR, gel electrophoresis, Southern/Northern/Western blotting, qPCR, rtPCR, FISH, CRISPR-Cas9, gene circuits) where each technique was framed by the question it answers, with the team candidly recording that the Apply and Communicate steps did not happen and that students still found the techniques complicated without hands-on work, and publishing the fix (fewer techniques per session, add pipetting and gel loading, one workflow diagram); a formal debate on 9 March 2026 with the BNDS British Debate Club on whether synthetic biology should modify human traits unrelated to serious disease, supported by a purpose-written Synthetic Bio Debate Information Packet covering definitions, design principles, systems thinking, intervention targets, risks, ethics and governance, with pre- and post-debate questionnaires; a campus art exhibition on environmental protection with a pop-art digital painting and an explanatory signboard, made with a visual-arts student, where the recorded criticism was that the symbols were too abstract; a bilingual comic published in the school newspaper BNDS Review and released as downloadable Chinese and English digital versions; and merchandise-as-conversation-starter at the Hongchuanghui Fair and school carnival, with original E. coli, yeast and budding-yeast cartoon designs on postcards, stickers and acrylic hair clips, where the team explicitly explained which features were biological and which were artistic licence. The inclusivity work is specific about barriers. At Tianyun Rehabilitation Center in Liulihe, Fangshan District, Beijing, working with hearing-impaired children and children with genetic conditions, the team discovered the children had no independent electronic devices and that a conventional questionnaire did not suit their communication needs, so after consulting the centre's teachers they switched to an illustrated storybook, 'Little Chef Mimi and Her Magical Yeast Friends', plus a colouring activity, and relied on the teachers to interpret the children's sign language - concluding that inclusive science education is about making sure every child's voice can be heard, not just making knowledge easier. For children with osteogenesis imperfecta ('porcelain doll' patients), the team first interviewed directors of the Sun and Rain Center rare-disease organisation, who explicitly advised against treating participants as fragile or showing pity; sessions were kept short, and when the team noticed holding pens was physically hard for some children, they abandoned the planned drawing activity mid-session for an open discussion and a 'wishing' segment, then shifted their long-term approach to accessible online workshops and distributing game materials directly to hospitals. For 21 student athletes aged 10-13 with limited access to systematic biology teaching or lab equipment, three experiments (strawberry DNA extraction, saliva pH around exercise, ruler-drop reaction tests) tied biology to their own bodies; afterwards all 21 reported confidence in understanding and completing experiments and all answered the DNA and synthetic-biology questions correctly. A lecture for older adults, built on scoping interviews with eight people aged 68-82 whose concerns were medical safety, side effects and the reliability of health information, used genetically modified food, vaccines and microbial insulin as familiar anchors, taught how to spot misleading health advertising and how AI can help check claims, and included making DNA-themed bracelets and illustrated tote bags carrying health-scam reminders; of 16 post-event responses, 15 (93.75%) rejected a misleading miracle-product claim, all 16 answered the GM food, vaccine, insulin and AI-checking items as intended, 81.25% found explanations easy to understand and 87.5% called the activity very helpful.","publicEngagement_zh":"BNDS-China 的做法之所以特別，是因為每一場活動都依同一套五步模板 R.E.A.C.H. 寫成紀錄，這套模板強制要求活動前診斷、互動式進行、一項設計任務、一條把回饋帶回專案的迴圈，以及可量化的活動後評估；而且團隊會誠實交代哪些步驟被跳過了。最有價值的例子是為尚未識字的 5-6 歲幼兒設計的幼兒園課程。Recognize 階段透過活動前問卷確認：孩子原本就把微生物看成看不見的敵人（來自洗手教育的框架），而且 71.43% 偏好互動遊戲而不是聽講。團隊接著把 BioBrick 標準組裝做成一套用顏色區分、可以動手操作的積木系統：藍色的「開關」是啟動子積木，必須放第一個；紅色的「功能」是編碼序列積木，比喻成燈泡；黃色的「停止」是終止子積木，比喻成車子的煞車；綠色的「小房子」則是載體與底盤積木，組裝順序以口訣教唱（打開藍色的開關，讓紅色的功能綻放，用黃色的煞車停住，住進綠色的房間！）。孩子以兩三人一組（稱為「小聯盟」）進行，並用圖像式挑戰卡提出身邊的問題（讓植物發光，照亮晚上通往遊樂場的小路；做一朵能蓋掉垃圾臭味的花）。最巧妙的設計是：團隊刻意限量發放零件，一桌只有開關、沒有編碼積木，另一桌剛好相反，孩子必須自己發現缺了什麼，再去找別組交換，用身體經驗認識開放共享的 iGEM Registry。一齣五幕偶戲「微觀防線」以細胞尺度演出手臂擦傷的過程，並刻意避開武器或戰爭的意象：白血球偶是用擁抱細菌來表現吞噬作用，兩位紅血球演員牽手搭成血管，血小板演員則把黃紙壓在有彈性的布上來表現凝血。配對問卷（N = 14）量到的結果：活動前，78.57% 不知道把一個生物的功能傳給另一個生物是什麼意思，64.29% 不知道或只模糊知道基因是什麼；活動後，92.86% 用「積木」描述合成生物學，92.86% 知道啟動子負責開始表現，100% 知道編碼序列決定功能；活動前有 42.86% 以為身體是像「小士兵」那樣對抗入侵者，沒有人知道會形成血塊，活動後則 100% 同時理解白血球的清除作用與血小板的修補；100% 喜歡這些活動，92.86% 希望聽到更多科學故事。回饋甚至改變了專案：孩子問為什麼免疫清除一定要殺死對方（不能把它們改造一下、變成朋友嗎？），也擔心黃色的停止積木掉了會怎樣；團隊把這些問題對應到轉錄失控、生物圍堵與生物污染，並用來反問自己以拮抗清除為基礎的治療模式是否恰當。其他形式也都有 REACH 紀錄：BioCamp 講座介紹整套分子工具（PCR、凝膠電泳、Southern／Northern／Western blotting、qPCR、rtPCR、FISH、CRISPR-Cas9、基因迴路），每項技術都以它要回答的問題來切入；團隊坦白記錄 Apply 與 Communicate 兩步並未發生，學生在沒有動手操作的情況下仍覺得這些技術很複雜，並公布改法（每場少講幾項技術、加入移液與上膠練習、用一張流程圖統整）；2026 年 3 月 9 日與 BNDS British Debate Club 合辦的正式辯論，題目是合成生物學是否應該修改與重大疾病無關的人類特徵，並特別編寫一份 Synthetic Bio Debate Information Packet 作為資料，涵蓋定義、設計原則、系統思考、介入標的、風險、倫理與治理，辯論前後都做問卷；以環境保護為題的校園藝術展，與一位視覺藝術科學生合作完成一幅普普風數位畫作與一面解說看板，紀錄中收到的批評是符號太抽象；在校刊 BNDS Review 刊出的雙語漫畫，並釋出可下載的中文與英文數位版；以及在 Hongchuanghui Fair 市集與校園嘉年華上用周邊商品開啟對話，把原創的 E. coli、酵母與芽生酵母卡通設計做成明信片、貼紙與壓克力髮夾，團隊並明確說明哪些特徵有生物學依據、哪些是藝術想像。在包容性方面，他們把障礙講得很具體。在北京市房山區琉璃河的天運康復中心，面對聽覺障礙兒童與罹患遺傳疾病的孩子，團隊發現這些孩子沒有可自行使用的電子設備，常規問卷也不符合他們的溝通需求，因此在請教中心老師後改用插畫故事書 Little Chef Mimi and Her Magical Yeast Friends 搭配著色活動，並依靠老師為孩子的手語翻譯；他們的結論是，包容性的科學教育重點在於讓每個孩子的聲音都能被聽見，而不只是把知識講得更簡單。面對成骨不全症（俗稱瓷娃娃）的孩子，團隊先訪談罕見疾病組織 Sun and Rain Center 的負責人，對方明確建議不要把參與者當成易碎的人、也不要表現同情；活動因此刻意縮短，當團隊注意到有些孩子握筆在生理上很吃力時，他們當場放棄原訂的繪畫活動，改成開放討論與一段「許願」環節，之後也把長期做法轉向可及性較高的線上工作坊，並直接把遊戲素材送到醫院。針對 21 位 10-13 歲、較難接觸系統性生物教學或實驗設備的學生運動員，三個實驗（草莓 DNA 萃取、運動前後的唾液 pH 值、落尺反應測試）把生物學和他們自己的身體連在一起；活動後 21 人全部表示有信心理解並完成實驗，DNA 與合成生物學的題目也全部答對。為長者設計的講座建立在對 8 位 68-82 歲長者的前期訪談上，他們關心的是醫療安全、副作用與健康資訊的可信度；講座以基因改造食品、疫苗與微生物生產的胰島素作為熟悉的切入點，教如何辨識誤導性的健康廣告，以及如何用 AI 幫忙查證說法，並包含製作 DNA 主題手環與印有防詐健康提醒的插畫提袋；活動後 16 份回覆中，有 15 份（93.75%）駁斥了一項誤導性的神奇產品宣稱，16 人在基因改造食品、疫苗、胰島素與用 AI 查證的題目上都如預期作答，81.25% 覺得解說容易理解，87.5% 認為這場活動很有幫助。","ihp":"Five iHP cycles (problem validation, end-user and market needs, technical design, biosafety and ethics, production and final product) were each run through the team's STAR loop. A pre-interview stakeholder map linked each cycle to the expert groups whose input it needed, and a final map recorded each stakeholder's influence on the project and the project's relevance to them. The team documented a hard limit transparently: regulatory restrictions prevented them from interviewing astronauts or national regulatory authorities. Aerospace food and nutrition experts defined the nutritional context; space medicine and clinical experts shaped the health-need and biosafety assessment. Education fed directly back into design, most notably the kindergarten children's biocontainment and mutualism questions. A cross-team exchange with team NBJF on AI protein design taught the team to compartmentalise the workflow and to avoid over-reliance on in-silico prediction, and they adopted NBJF's 'phenomenon-first, jargon-later' principle for explaining their AND logic-gate probiotic to lay audiences.","ihp_zh":"五個人類實踐循環（問題驗證、終端使用者與市場需求、技術設計、生物安全與倫理、生產與最終產品）都走過團隊自己的 STAR 迴圈。訪談前的利害關係人地圖把每個循環連到它需要哪些專家群，最終版地圖則記錄每位利害關係人對專案的影響力，以及專案對他們的相關性。團隊也透明記下一項硬性限制：法規限制使他們無法訪談太空人或國家主管機關。航太食品與營養專家界定了營養層面的脈絡；太空醫學與臨床專家則形塑了健康需求與生物安全評估。教育直接回饋到設計，最明顯的例子就是幼兒園孩子關於生物圍堵與互利共生的提問。與 NBJF 隊伍關於 AI 蛋白質設計的交流，讓團隊學會把流程切成區塊、避免過度依賴電腦模擬預測，他們也採用 NBJF 的先講現象、後講術語原則，向一般大眾解釋他們的 AND 邏輯閘益生菌。","realWorld":"The project targets a documented gap in astronaut health protection: pre-packaged vitamins and antioxidants provide fixed dosing that cannot track real-time biochemical change, and shelf-life degradation makes them unreliable over multi-year missions. Education outputs were deliberately packaged for reuse: an openly available children's book, downloadable comic in Chinese and English, the debate information packet, lecture slide decks, bilingual activity PowerPoints, the strawberry DNA extraction protocol, and detailed REACH appendices so other teams and educators can replicate the structure rather than just the activities.","realWorld_zh":"專案針對的是太空人健康防護上一個有紀錄的缺口：預先包裝的維生素與抗氧化劑只能提供固定劑量，無法跟隨即時的生化變化，而保存期限的衰減又讓它們在多年任務中不可靠。教育產出也刻意包裝成可重複使用的形式：公開取用的童書、可下載的中英文漫畫、辯論資料包、講座投影片、雙語活動 PowerPoint、草莓 DNA 萃取流程，以及詳盡的 REACH 附錄，讓其他團隊與教育者能複製的是這套結構，而不只是活動本身。","partners":["BNDS British Debate Club","Tianyun Rehabilitation Center, Liulihe, Fangshan District, Beijing (hearing-impaired and genetic-disease children)","Sun and Rain Center (rare-disease organisation, osteogenesis imperfecta families)","BNDS Review (International Department student newspaper)","iGEM team NBJF (AI protein design exchange)","Hongchuanghui Fair","local kindergarten","youth sports school / student athlete programme","senior citizens' club ('iGEM and seniors together club')"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6115/wiki/edu/image20.webp","caption":"Kindergarten children with the BioBrick 'building block' constructs they assembled in small 'syndicates'","caption_zh":"幼兒園孩子與他們在「小聯盟」中組裝出來的 BioBrick 積木構築","credit":"Team BNDS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6115/wiki/edu/image22.webp","caption":"The five-act puppet show 'Microscopic Defense Line', which showed phagocytosis as a hug rather than combat","caption_zh":"五幕偶戲「微觀防線」，把吞噬作用演成擁抱而不是戰鬥","credit":"Team BNDS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6115/wiki/edu/image24.webp","caption":"Guiding children at Tianyun Rehabilitation Center through the storybook 'Little Chef Mimi and Her Magical Yeast Friends'","caption_zh":"在天運康復中心帶著孩子讀故事書 Little Chef Mimi and Her Magical Yeast Friends","credit":"Team BNDS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6115/wiki/edu/image29.webp","caption":"Student athletes aged 10-13 extracting strawberry DNA during the under-resourced-children workshop","caption_zh":"10-13 歲的學生運動員在資源不足兒童工作坊中萃取草莓 DNA","credit":"Team BNDS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6115/wiki/edu/image36.webp","caption":"Older adults showing the DNA-themed bracelets they made during the health-literacy lecture","caption_zh":"長者展示他們在健康識能講座中做的 DNA 主題手環","credit":"Team BNDS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Adopt a single named template for every outreach event - BNDS-China's R.E.A.C.H. (Recognize with a pre-event diagnostic, Experience, Apply, Communicate project feedback back into design, Harvest with a matched post-event survey) - and publish the results including the steps you failed to complete; the paired pre/post numbers and the honest gaps are what turn a scrapbook of events into evidence.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"為每一場推廣活動採用同一套有名字的模板：BNDS-China 的 R.E.A.C.H.（Recognize 以活動前診斷開始、Experience、Apply、Communicate 把專案回饋帶回設計、Harvest 以相對應的活動後問卷收尾），並把結果連同自己沒做完的步驟一起公布；正是那些配對的前後測數字與誠實交代的缺口，讓一堆活動紀錄變成證據，而不只是剪貼簿。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/bnds-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bnds-china/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/bnds-china/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/bnds-china/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/bnds-china/contribution"],"awards_zh":["最佳教育 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":14},"6119":{"team":"UMA Malaga","id":"6119","section":"Undergrad","country":"Spain","village":"Diagnostics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/uma-malaga/","projectTitle":"Frida","tagline":"A SHERLOCK-type LwCas13a screen for rare-disease variants, with Diana, a tool that takes a disease name all the way to a plate map.","summary":"Frida uses CRISPR/LwCas13a (SHERLOCK-type collateral cleavage read as fluorescence) to screen for the mutations behind rare genetic diseases, with cystic fibrosis as the model disease and a tandem gRNA assembly system (Neith) for multiplexing. Because a single disease can have hundreds of pathogenic variants and each needs its own guide, the team built Diana (diana-grna-designer), a free MIT-licensed web app, command-line tool and F# library that goes from a disease name, OMIM number or MONDO id, through ClinVar's variant list, to ranked and scored guide RNAs, to an order-ready oligo list, to a combinatorial pooling plan and a decoder for the positive wells. The engineering is unusually disciplined for iGEM: 1,164 unit and component tests plus 75 Playwright browser tests, automated axe-core WCAG 2.2 AA accessibility scans of every page state, every dependency pinned and checksum-verified, and exports in GenBank, SBOL 3 and SBOL 2 that are read back by Biopython and pySBOL3 as part of the test suite. Most striking, the wet lab contradicted the software's central heuristic and the team published that: the synthetic-mismatch substitution rule did not discriminate alleles in the placements tried, so the rule became an option to compare rather than a promise.","awards":["Best Alternative Platform — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Software — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Diagnostics Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A single Blazor Server application (ASP.NET Core 9, C#, Razor components over SignalR, Bootstrap 5) calling an F# library ('gRNA') directly in the same process, with the grna CLI as a second front end over the identical calls so the web page and the terminal always agree. Native science runs as child processes: Bowtie 1.3.1 against a GRCh38 no-ALT index for off-targets, and ViennaRNA via Python 3 for folding. Everything ships in one Docker image (Compose v2) that bakes in the genome index deliberately, because Bowtie memory-maps the index and a volume or bind mount makes alignment more than ten times slower. External calls are limited to NCBI E-utilities, dbSNP Variation Services, ClinVar and the Monarch Initiative. The F# library also builds as a NuGet package (unpublished) referenceable from any .NET project, and the repository carries an agent skill so an AI assistant can install, start, health-check and drive the tool.","dataviz":"Ranked guide tables with nine sortable columns (spacer, GC score, GC %, homopolymers, off-targets, folding energy, unpaired share of spacer, mismatches against the other allele, score), filters on score, off-targets, GC range, allele mismatches and sequence fragment, the seed region underlined and the mutation marked in red, and status conveyed by shape and text rather than colour alone. Off-target chips read none/unique/caution/6+ saturated; expanding a row lists every GRCh38 alignment with chromosome, position, strand and mismatches. RNA structure is shown as dot-bracket plus a FORNA force-directed diagram rendered inside the page, so the sequence never leaves the machine unless the user clicks 'Open in FORNA'. Pooling produces a clickable, keyboard-navigable 96- or 384-well plate map where hovering a well lists its guides, and decoded positive wells are marked with a plus sign. Every term carries a plain-language tooltip, held in one file (HelpText.cs). Light and dark themes, a skip link, keyboard-operable tabs, and automated axe-core scans across WCAG 2.0-2.2 A and AA for every page state.","datascience":"Validation is reported as a matrix of what each part of the tool rests on, with three honest categories: automated tests, real sequences and services, and wet lab, where 'Tested' means lab work has started with no results yet and 'Not shown' is recorded as a result rather than a gap. Numbers: 1,164 NUnit/bUnit cases (1,151 pass, 13 self-skip when live services or ViennaRNA are absent), 75 Playwright/Chromium tests against a deterministic pipeline stand-in, pooling invariants proved over many (V, K) pairs (each guide in exactly R wells, no pool over K, every guide with a unique well set, consistent addressing on both plate formats), and decoding tested for single hits, collisions and dropouts. Hand checks rebuilt the rs334 and F508del designs from the NCBI sequences and confirmed the top deletion guides occur only in the deleted sequence, 6-8 letters from any wild-type window. The whole web flow was re-run against the real container on 2026-10-18 (cystic fibrosis disease search returning 1,517 ClinVar records, five designs, adapters, structure, shortlist, pooling and decoding). Performance was timed inside the container: 8-10 s for a transcript-position design, 28-38 s for a chromosome-position design (dominated by the NCBI download of the whole accession), 17 s for the disease search, about 1 s for a 100-guide pooling plan and 97 s for 100,000 guides. Export correctness was checked structurally: the annotated parts tile the sequence with no gap or overlap and equal the oligo DNA across all 64 combinations of repeat, adapters, flanks and T7 promoter, and the files are read back by Biopython and pySBOL3 with no error or warning.","software":"Diana has three chained but independently usable parts. Disease variants looks a disease up in the Monarch Initiative knowledge graph and lists the ClinVar records NCBI links to its OMIM number, showing ClinVar's own classification and review stars without re-interpreting them, capped at 3,000 records with the list flagged incomplete when it truncates. The Builder takes up to 50 inputs per run as rsIDs (resolved through NCBI Variation Services, keeping only the disease-relevant allele by default so rs334 gives one notation rather than twelve) or strict HGVS including c. positions on NM_/XM_ transcripts, which it converts using the GenBank coding range and says so in a notice; a c. position on a genomic record is refused with advice, because introns would put the guides in the wrong place. It then slides a window (23 nt default, 18-60 allowed) over both the original and mutated sequence on both strands, labels which strand is complementary to the mRNA and puts it first because LwCas13a binds RNA, and scores every candidate on four transparent criteria: GC content against a 40-60% target, homopolymer runs of 4 or more, Bowtie off-target hits in GRCh38 with up to two mismatches, and ViennaRNA minimum free energy of the complete guide under Turner 2004. Candidates sort on the ascending key (off-targets, -energy, -GC score, homopolymers), and the derived 0-1 score is explicitly a relative rank, not a prediction of activity. Two structure checks (is the direct-repeat hairpin intact in the fold, how much of the spacer stays unpaired) and an allele-discrimination count (fewest letters by which the target differs from the other allele, with a 'not discriminating' flag at 0 or 1) inform the choice without changing the ranking. The complete gRNA is built from the 36-nt LwCas13a direct repeat plus the spacer, optionally wrapped in the team's own Frida adapter (BsmBI Type IIS sites plus AAAC and GCTT fusion sites, so the repeat is acquired during Golden Gate assembly instead of being synthesised for every guide) and the BioBricks RFC[10] prefix/suffix adapter, which nest correctly so the junctions complete the standard sequences exactly. Cloning checks scan the DNA that would actually be ordered, on both strands, for ten enzymes (BsaI, BsmBI, SapI, BbsI, EcoRI, XbaI, SpeI, PstI, NotI, EcoRV), excluding sites an adapter carries on purpose, and show RFC[10] and RFC[1000] compatibility badges mirroring the Registry's own Assembly Compatibility rules. Guide Pooling then offers three combinatorial layouts (2D Fragmented, 2D Matrix, 3D) with stated well-count formulas, picks the cheapest automatically, places the result on 96- or 384-well plates and decodes a screen afterwards, distinguishing definite from ambiguous implications rather than hiding the collision case; the classic binary log2 model is deliberately excluded because it requires K = V/2 and breaks the five-guides-per-tandem-array limit. For 100 guides at K = 5 that is 40 wells instead of 100 reactions, a 60% saving. Exports: oligo CSV with optional T7 promoter and top/bottom strands plus a Restriction sites column so the warning travels with the order, FASTA, annotated GenBank, SBOL 3 (RDF/XML, Sequence Ontology roles) and SBOL 2 (added only because a libSBOLj-based tool rejected the SBOL 3 file). CSV fields starting with =, +, - or @ are neutralised so a spreadsheet does not execute them. Deployment is local by design: 'git clone https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/uma-malaga/diana-grna-designer.git && ./start.sh', which checks Docker, disk and Compose, then reports success only once http://localhost:5000/healthz answers; about 10 GB disk and 3 GB RAM. There is no hosted design API, and the wiki says why (the 4 GB index and native tools make a public server costly, and local running keeps patient-adjacent data private) and then demonstrates that a HTTP front end would be thin by writing and running a minimal ASP.NET Core /export endpoint over the same library, while labelling that sketch a test of the idea rather than a shipped service. What is live and clickable is the example gallery at https://diana-grna-designer-7723f5.igem.wiki/, which publishes the unedited grna output for rs334 (48 candidate spacers), F508del (36 candidates) and a 100-guide pooling plan, each recording the date (2026-10-19), the commit (19a8e08), the Docker image sha256, the tool versions (Bowtie 1.3.1, ViennaRNA 2.7.2), the exact commands run, and the note that a second run the same day gave identical designs. Documentation is layered: README.md for usage, architecture, configuration and troubleshooting; docs/ for the runtime contract, library usage, a manual test plan and a validation record; and BIOLOGICAL_REPORT.md, which maps each biological step to the code for a non-programming audience and lists the open scientific questions. The 'Extending Diana' section walks a specific future feature (a wobble-aware allele check) through all six places in the codebase it would touch, with a sketch of the F# function. Licence MIT, with third-party licences listed (Bowtie Artistic 2.0; ViennaRNA free for academic use, commercial use requiring a separate licence), and an explicit statement that parts of the code were written with an AI coding assistant and reviewed by the team, which remains responsible.","stack":[".NET 9 / ASP.NET Core","Blazor Server","C#","F#","SignalR","Bootstrap 5","Python 3","Bowtie 1.3.1","ViennaRNA 2.7.2","Docker + Compose v2","NUnit","bUnit","Playwright (Chromium)","axe-core","Biopython (export verification)","pySBOL3 / pySBOL2","SBOL 3 and SBOL 2","GenBank flat file","HGVS","NCBI E-utilities / dbSNP Variation Services","ClinVar","Monarch Initiative API","FORNA","GRCh38","MIT licence","iGEM GitLab"],"techniques":["LwCas13a / SHERLOCK guide RNA design","sliding-window candidate generation on both strands","multi-criteria scoring and lexicographic ranking","short-read alignment for off-target counting","RNA secondary structure minimum free energy (Turner 2004)","synthetic-mismatch (substitution rule) allele discrimination","combinatorial group testing / pooled screening (2D fragmented, 2D matrix, 3D layouts)","ambiguity-aware decoding of pooled positives","Type IIS Golden Gate adapter design","restriction-site screening against RFC[10] and RFC[1000]","SPDI to HGVS conversion","property-based invariant testing over (V, K) pairs","automated accessibility auditing","dependency pinning with checksum verification","resumable batch processing with distinct exit codes"],"frameworks_zh":"一個單一的 Blazor Server 應用程式（ASP.NET Core 9、C#、以 SignalR 承載的 Razor 元件、Bootstrap 5），在同一行程內直接呼叫一個 F# 函式庫（gRNA），並以 grna 命令列工具作為第二個前端、呼叫完全相同的介面，因此網頁與終端機永遠一致。原生科學工具以子行程執行：以 Bowtie 1.3.1 對 GRCh38 no-ALT 索引比對脫靶，以 Python 3 呼叫 ViennaRNA 做結構摺疊。所有東西都裝進一個 Docker 映像（Compose v2），並刻意把基因組索引烘進映像，因為 Bowtie 以記憶體映射方式讀取索引，改用 volume 或 bind mount 會讓比對慢上十倍以上。對外呼叫僅限 NCBI E-utilities、dbSNP Variation Services、ClinVar 與 Monarch Initiative。這個 F# 函式庫也可建置成 NuGet 套件（未發布），供任何 .NET 專案引用；程式庫中另附一個 agent skill，讓 AI 助理能安裝、啟動、健康檢查並操作這個工具。","dataviz_zh":"排序後的嚮導表格有九個可排序欄位（spacer、GC 分數、GC %、同聚物、脫靶數、摺疊能量、spacer 未配對比例、與另一對偶基因的錯配數、分數），可依分數、脫靶數、GC 範圍、對偶基因錯配與序列片段篩選，種子區以底線標示、突變以紅色標出，狀態同時以形狀與文字傳達，而不只靠顏色。脫靶標籤分為 none/unique/caution/6+ 飽和；展開一列會列出每一個 GRCh38 比對結果，含染色體、位置、股向與錯配數。RNA 結構以 dot-bracket 加上在頁面內繪製的 FORNA 力導向圖呈現，因此除非使用者點選「Open in FORNA」，序列絕不離開本機。混樣功能會產生可點擊、可用鍵盤巡覽的 96 孔或 384 孔盤位圖，滑過某孔即列出其中的嚮導，解碼後的陽性孔以加號標記。每個術語都附有平實語言的提示說明，統一放在一個檔案（HelpText.cs）中。另有亮色與暗色主題、跳至主要內容的連結、可鍵盤操作的頁籤，以及對每個頁面狀態橫跨 WCAG 2.0-2.2 A 與 AA 等級的 axe-core 自動掃描。","datascience_zh":"驗證以一張矩陣呈現工具每個部分各自建立在什麼基礎上，並誠實分成三類：自動化測試、真實序列與線上服務，以及濕實驗室；其中「已測試」意指實驗工作已開始但尚無結果，而「未顯示」被記錄為一項結果而非缺漏。數字如下：1,164 個 NUnit/bUnit 案例（1,151 通過，13 個在缺少線上服務或 ViennaRNA 時自行跳過）、75 個以確定性管線替身為對象的 Playwright/Chromium 測試、在許多 (V, K) 組合上證明的混樣不變量（每個嚮導恰好出現在 R 個孔、沒有任何池超過 K、每個嚮導都有唯一的孔位集合、兩種盤型的定址一致），以及針對單一命中、碰撞與漏失的解碼測試。人工檢查則從 NCBI 序列重建了 rs334 與 F508del 的設計，確認排名最前的缺失型嚮導只出現在被刪除的序列中，且與任何野生型視窗相距 6-8 個字母。整個網頁流程在 2026-10-18 以真實容器重跑一次（囊狀纖維化疾病查詢回傳 1,517 筆 ClinVar 記錄，以及五個設計、轉接子、結構、候選名單、混樣與解碼）。效能在容器內計時：轉錄本位置設計 8-10 秒、染色體位置設計 28-38 秒（主要耗在從 NCBI 下載整個 accession）、疾病查詢 17 秒、100 個嚮導的混樣計畫約 1 秒、100,000 個嚮導 97 秒。匯出正確性以結構方式檢查：標註的部件完整鋪滿序列、沒有空隙或重疊，並在 repeat、轉接子、側翼與 T7 啟動子的全部 64 種組合下都與寡核苷酸 DNA 相符；檔案再由 Biopython 與 pySBOL3 讀回，無任何錯誤或警告。","software_zh":"Diana 有三個彼此串接、但也可獨立使用的部分。「疾病變異」會在 Monarch Initiative 知識圖譜中查詢疾病，並列出 NCBI 連結到其 OMIM 編號的 ClinVar 記錄，照 ClinVar 自己的分類與審查星等呈現、不重新解讀，上限為 3,000 筆，截斷時會標示清單不完整。Builder 每次最多接受 50 筆輸入，可為 rsID（透過 NCBI Variation Services 解析，預設只保留與疾病相關的對偶基因，因此 rs334 只給出一種標記而非十二種），或嚴格的 HGVS，包括 NM_/XM_ 轉錄本上的 c. 位置——後者會用 GenBank 的編碼區範圍換算，並在通知中明示；若在基因組記錄上給 c. 位置則會被拒絕並附上建議，因為內含子會讓嚮導落在錯誤的位置。接著它在原始與突變序列的雙股上滑動視窗（預設 23 nt，允許 18-60），標示哪一股與 mRNA 互補並把它排在前面（因為 LwCas13a 結合 RNA），並以四項透明標準為每個候選評分：GC 含量相對 40-60% 的目標、長度 4 以上的同聚物、在 GRCh38 中容許最多兩個錯配的 Bowtie 脫靶命中數，以及在 Turner 2004 參數下完整嚮導的 ViennaRNA 最小自由能。候選以遞增鍵排序（脫靶數、-能量、-GC 分數、同聚物），而導出的 0-1 分數被明確說明為相對排名，不是活性預測。另有兩項結構檢查（摺疊後 direct-repeat 髮夾是否完整、spacer 有多少比例保持未配對）與一個對偶基因區辨計數（標的與另一對偶基因相差的最少字母數，為 0 或 1 時標記「無法區辨」），用於輔助選擇但不改變排名。完整的 gRNA 由 36 nt 的 LwCas13a direct repeat 加上 spacer 組成，可選擇再包上團隊自己的 Frida 轉接子（BsmBI Type IIS 切位加上 AAAC 與 GCTT 融合位，使 repeat 在 Golden Gate 組裝過程中取得，而不必為每個嚮導各合成一次）以及 BioBricks RFC[10] 前/後綴轉接子，兩者能正確嵌套，使接點恰好補完標準序列。選殖檢查會掃描真正會被下訂的 DNA（雙股）是否含有十種酵素的切位（BsaI、BsmBI、SapI、BbsI、EcoRI、XbaI、SpeI、PstI、NotI、EcoRV），並排除轉接子刻意帶入的切位，另顯示對應 Registry 自身組裝相容性規則的 RFC[10] 與 RFC[1000] 相容性標章。Guide Pooling 則提供三種組合式佈局（2D Fragmented、2D Matrix、3D）並列出各自的孔數公式，自動挑出最省的一種，把結果放到 96 孔或 384 孔盤上，並在篩檢後解碼，區分「確定」與「模稜兩可」的推論，而不是把碰撞情形藏起來；經典的二元 log2 模型被刻意排除，因為它要求 K = V/2，會違反每條串聯陣列最多五個嚮導的限制。以 100 個嚮導、K = 5 計算，這是 40 個孔而非 100 次反應，節省 60%。匯出格式包括：寡核苷酸 CSV（可選加 T7 啟動子、含上下股，並附一個限制酶切位欄位，讓警示隨訂單一起傳遞）、FASTA、有註解的 GenBank、SBOL 3（RDF/XML，使用 Sequence Ontology 角色）與 SBOL 2（純粹因為某個基於 libSBOLj 的工具拒收 SBOL 3 檔案才加上）。CSV 中以 =、+、- 或 @ 開頭的欄位會被中和，以免試算表將其當公式執行。部署刻意只在本機：「git clone https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/uma-malaga/diana-grna-designer.git && ./start.sh」，它會檢查 Docker、磁碟與 Compose，只有在 http://localhost:5000/healthz 有回應後才報告成功；約需 10 GB 磁碟與 3 GB 記憶體。沒有提供託管的設計 API，wiki 也說明了原因（4 GB 的索引與原生工具讓公開伺服器成本高昂，而本機執行能讓貼近病患的資料保持私密），接著又以同一函式庫寫出並實際執行一個極簡的 ASP.NET Core /export 端點，示範 HTTP 前端其實很薄，同時把這份草稿標示為概念驗證而非正式服務。真正上線可點的是 https://diana-grna-designer-7723f5.igem.wiki/ 的範例展示區，公開了 rs334（48 個候選 spacer）、F508del（36 個候選）與一份 100 嚮導混樣計畫的未經編輯 grna 輸出，每份都記錄日期（2026-10-19）、commit（19a8e08）、Docker 映像的 sha256、工具版本（Bowtie 1.3.1、ViennaRNA 2.7.2）、實際執行的指令，以及同日第二次執行得到完全相同設計的註記。文件分層撰寫：README.md 說明用法、架構、設定與疑難排解；docs/ 收錄執行期契約、函式庫用法、人工測試計畫與驗證紀錄；BIOLOGICAL_REPORT.md 則為非程式背景的讀者把每個生物步驟對應到程式碼，並列出尚未解決的科學問題。「Extending Diana」一節把一個具體的未來功能（考慮搖擺配對的對偶基因檢查）走過程式庫中會被動到的全部六個位置，並附上 F# 函式的草稿。授權為 MIT，並列出第三方授權（Bowtie 為 Artistic 2.0；ViennaRNA 學術使用免費、商業使用需另行授權），同時明確聲明部分程式碼是在 AI 程式助理協助下撰寫、由團隊審閱，責任仍由團隊承擔。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A survey of 227 people probed public awareness of rare diseases, and the team reported it with the limits visible: 90.7% recognised the importance of early diagnosis and 87.7% knew newborn screening differs between Spain's autonomous communities, but only 11% identified the cost as a share of family income and only 9.3% the true global prevalence. They also surfaced an awareness-engagement gap, with 63% reporting no rare-disease activity in the past year (144 of 227 chose 'none of the above'). Demographics are published in full (gender, education, age, occupation, contact with a patient) and the wiki states explicitly that the sample is exploratory, that the percentages describe the sample and are not estimates for the general population, and that the reference answers themselves need validating before an overall knowledge score can be claimed.","ihp":"The human practices team (named Athena) ran an iterative cycle they call BARI: Bibliographic research, Application, Reflection, Integration, explicitly not a linear pipeline, with each cycle able to send them back to reconsider an earlier assumption. The substantive shift was away from treating Frida as a technology gap: conversations with patients, healthcare professionals, researchers and patient associations revealed territorial inequalities in newborn screening across Spanish autonomous communities, differences in care pathways, and the consequences of diagnostic delay, which moved the question from 'can we build a detector' to 'where in the diagnostic pathway could such a tool actually respond to a need'. The team also records that screening programmes are not definitive diagnostic tools and require confirmatory testing, and that the associated wait can cause irreversible damage in infants. The wet-lab feedback into the software is the clearest integration of all: the lab's failure to discriminate alleles, traced partly to G-U wobble pairs that LwCas13a tolerates, was published, demoted the substitution rule to one option among the ranked candidates, turned the rule's positions and spacer length into user settings so revised placements can be tested without changing code, and set a wobble-aware allele check as the next feature.","realWorld":"Frida targets the rare-disease diagnostic odyssey, where heterogeneous presentation and many candidate mutations can mean years of uncertainty and repeated consultations. The project grew out of the University of Málaga's existing screening and early-detection research, and the PIs' professional network provided the first stakeholder contacts. Diana is deliberately shaped for a clinical-adjacent setting: no account needed, nothing persisted, loopback-only binding, non-root container, and local-only deployment so sequence data never leaves the researcher's machine.","partners":["University of Málaga (UMA) screening and early-detection groups","rare disease patient associations","Spanish newborn screening professionals","Anthropic (sponsor)","GenScript (sponsor)","Integrated DNA Technologies (sponsor)"],"publicEngagement_zh":"一份 227 人的問卷調查探詢公眾對罕見疾病的認識，而團隊在報告時把限制攤開來說：90.7% 認同早期診斷的重要性、87.7% 知道新生兒篩檢在西班牙各自治區之間有差異，但只有 11% 能指出成本佔家庭收入的比例、只有 9.3% 答對真實的全球盛行率。他們也揭露了認知與行動之間的落差：63% 表示過去一年沒有參與任何罕見疾病相關活動（227 人中有 144 人選擇「以上皆非」）。人口統計資料完整公開（性別、教育程度、年齡、職業、是否認識病患），wiki 並明確指出這份樣本屬探索性質、百分比只描述該樣本而非一般大眾的推估值，而且參考答案本身也需要先經驗證，才能宣稱一個整體的知識分數。","ihp_zh":"人類實踐小組（取名 Athena）執行一套他們稱為 BARI 的迭代循環：Bibliographic research（文獻研究）、Application（應用）、Reflection（反思）、Integration（整合），並明確說明這不是線性流程，每一輪都可能把他們送回去重新檢視先前的某個假設。實質的轉向是不再把 Frida 當成一個技術缺口的填補：與病患、醫療專業人員、研究者及病友協會的對話揭露了西班牙各自治區之間新生兒篩檢的地域不平等、照護路徑的差異，以及診斷延誤的後果，使問題從「我們能不能做出一個偵測器」轉為「在診斷路徑的哪一個環節，這樣的工具才真的回應了某個需求」。團隊也記錄下：篩檢計畫並非確診工具，必須有確認性檢驗，而隨之而來的等待可能在嬰兒身上造成不可逆的傷害。濕實驗室回饋到軟體上的部分是所有整合中最明確的一項：實驗未能區分對偶基因（部分原因追溯到 LwCas13a 可容忍的 G-U 搖擺配對）被如實公開，使取代規則降級為排序候選中的一個選項，並把該規則的位置與 spacer 長度改成使用者可調的設定，讓修正後的放置方式無須改程式即可測試，同時把「考慮搖擺配對的對偶基因檢查」列為下一個功能。","realWorld_zh":"Frida 針對的是罕見疾病的「診斷漂流」：症狀表現異質、候選突變眾多，往往意味著數年的不確定與一再的就診。專案源自馬拉加大學既有的篩檢與早期偵測研究，指導教授的專業人際網絡則提供了最初的利害關係人聯繫。Diana 刻意為貼近臨床的場景而設計：不需帳號、不留存任何資料、僅綁定 loopback、容器以非 root 執行，且只能本機部署，使序列資料絕不離開研究者的機器。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6119/wiki/images/software/v6-07-builder-ranked-table.avif","caption":"Diana's ranked spacer table: GC score, homopolymers, off-targets, assembly compatibility badges, folding energy, unpaired spacer share, mismatches against the other allele and the relative score, with the seed underlined and the mutation in red.","credit":"Team UMA Malaga, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"Diana 的 spacer 排序表：GC 分數、同聚物、脫靶數、組裝相容性標章、摺疊能量、spacer 未配對比例、與另一對偶基因的錯配數，以及相對分數；種子區以底線標示、突變以紅色呈現。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6119/wiki/images/software/v6-11-disease-results.avif","caption":"The ClinVar variants of cystic fibrosis pulled through the Monarch Initiative knowledge graph, with classification, review stars and conditions shown as ClinVar gives them.","credit":"Team UMA Malaga, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"透過 Monarch Initiative 知識圖譜取得的囊狀纖維化 ClinVar 變異，分類、審查星等與疾病條件皆照 ClinVar 原樣呈現。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6119/wiki/images/software/v6-22-pooling-plate-map.avif","caption":"The combinatorial pooling plate map: hovering a well shows which guides go into that tube, and arrow keys move between wells.","credit":"Team UMA Malaga, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"組合式混樣的盤位圖：滑過某孔即顯示哪些嚮導會進入該管，方向鍵可在孔位之間移動。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6119/wiki/images/software/v6-14-builder-complete-grna.avif","caption":"The complete gRNA card: the LwCas13a direct repeat in green and the chosen spacer in magenta, with choices for the repeat, the Frida and BioBricks adapters and custom flanks.","credit":"Team UMA Malaga, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"完整 gRNA 卡片：綠色為 LwCas13a 的 direct repeat，洋紅色為選定的 spacer，並可選擇 repeat、Frida 與 BioBricks 轉接子以及自訂側翼。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Publish a validation matrix that separates what automated tests prove, what a real run against live services proves, and what the bench has actually shown, and record 'not shown' as a result: Diana's wiki states outright that its ranking order, its substitution rule and its pooling layout are untested in the lab, and that the lab contradicted the substitution rule. A research centre should pair that honesty with Diana's two reusable mechanics, a pure scientific core (F#) that the GUI, the CLI and an AI agent skill all sit on as thin front ends, and a published example gallery pinned to a commit, image digest and exact commands so strangers can see real output without installing anything.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/uma-malaga/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/uma-malaga/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/uma-malaga/","https://diana-grna-designer-7723f5.igem.wiki/","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/uma-malaga/diana-grna-designer","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/uma-malaga"],"projectTitle_zh":"Frida","tagline_zh":"一套用於罕見疾病變異的 SHERLOCK 型 LwCas13a 篩檢，並搭配 Diana——一個能從疾病名稱一路做到盤位圖的工具。","summary_zh":"Frida 使用 CRISPR/LwCas13a（SHERLOCK 型的旁側切割，以螢光讀出）篩檢罕見遺傳疾病背後的突變，以囊狀纖維化作為模式疾病，並以串聯 gRNA 組裝系統（Neith）實現多重檢測。由於單一疾病可能有數百個致病變異、每個都需要自己的嚮導，團隊開發了 Diana（diana-grna-designer）——一個免費、採 MIT 授權的網頁應用程式、命令列工具與 F# 函式庫，能從疾病名稱、OMIM 編號或 MONDO id 出發，經過 ClinVar 的變異清單，產生排序並評分的嚮導 RNA、可直接下訂的寡核苷酸清單、組合式混樣（pooling）計畫，以及陽性孔位的解碼器。這個專案的工程紀律在 iGEM 中相當罕見：1,164 個單元與元件測試，加上 75 個 Playwright 瀏覽器測試、對每個頁面狀態自動執行 axe-core WCAG 2.2 AA 無障礙掃描、所有相依套件皆鎖定版本並驗證檢查碼，匯出的 GenBank、SBOL 3 與 SBOL 2 檔案還會在測試套件中由 Biopython 與 pySBOL3 讀回驗證。最醒目的是，濕實驗室推翻了軟體的核心啟發式規則，而團隊照實公開：在所嘗試的放置位置上，人工錯配取代規則並未能區分對偶基因，於是該規則從承諾降級為一個可供比較的選項。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"公開一張驗證矩陣，把「自動化測試能證明什麼」、「對線上服務的真實執行能證明什麼」與「濕實驗室實際展示了什麼」分開，並把「未顯示」記錄為一項結果：Diana 的 wiki 直接寫明，它的排序順序、取代規則與混樣佈局都未在實驗室中驗證，而實驗結果還推翻了取代規則。研究單位應該把這份誠實，與 Diana 的兩項可重複使用的機制搭配起來：一個純粹的科學核心（F#），讓 GUI、CLI 與一個 AI agent skill 都只作為薄前端架在上面；以及一個釘住 commit、映像摘要與確切指令的公開範例展示區，讓陌生人不必安裝任何東西就能看到真實輸出。","awards_zh":["最佳替代平台 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳軟體 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳診斷專案 — 入圍"],"rank":21},"6122":{"team":"Cornell","id":"6122","section":"Undergrad","country":"United States","village":"Fashion & Cosmetics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/","projectTitle":"Klothos","projectTitle_zh":"Klothos","tagline":"A smart bandage: engineered probiotics inside electrospun alginate nanofibers that release an anti-fibrotic peptide only where a wound is scarring badly.","tagline_zh":"一款智慧敷料：把工程改造的益生菌包在靜電紡絲的海藻酸鈉奈米纖維裡，只在傷口正走向嚴重疤痕化的地方釋放抗纖維化胜肽。","summary":"Every scar treatment on the market today starts after the scar has formed — silicone sheeting, intralesional steroid, laser and grafts are all passive or reactive, and none addresses fibrosis biology during the critical healing window. Klothos intervenes during healing instead: engineered bacteria secrete 810A, a 12-amino-acid peptide that binds the exposed C-terminal domain of CTGF (CCN2) and blocks fibroblast-to-myofibroblast activation, and expression is held behind a two-input AND gate built from the Pseudomonas syringae hrpR/hrpS/hrpL system so the peptide is only made when reactive oxygen species (via TrxC) and hypoxia (via Pfnr) are both present — the signature of unchecked remodelling. The bacteria are encapsulated in an alginate/PEO nanofiber matrix spun on a coaxial electrospinner the team designed and built themselves, because commercial instruments cost far more than an undergraduate team can reach. It won Best Hardware and Best Presentation on the strength of that open, flat-packable, interlock-protected electrospinner plus a modular 3D-printed coaxial spinneret adapter, and Best Fashion & Cosmetics on a project that is unusually complete end to end: 20-plus risk-rated commercialisation analysis, a six-phase FDA path, and a human practices programme built around people who actually live with scars.","summary_zh":"今天市面上每一種疤痕療法都是在疤痕形成之後才開始——矽膠片、病灶內類固醇注射、雷射與植皮，全都是被動或反應式的，沒有一種在癒合的關鍵時間窗內處理纖維化的生物學。Klothos 改在癒合過程中介入：工程改造的細菌分泌 810A，一段 12 個胺基酸的胜肽，會結合 CTGF（CCN2）暴露出來的 C 端結構域，阻斷纖維母細胞轉為肌纖維母細胞的活化；而其表現被關在一個以 Pseudomonas syringae 的 hrpR/hrpS/hrpL 系統建成的雙輸入 AND 邏輯閘之後，因此只有在活性氧（經 TrxC）與缺氧（經 Pfnr）同時存在時才會製造胜肽——那正是重塑失控的特徵。細菌被包覆在海藻酸鈉/PEO 奈米纖維基質中，而這層基質是用團隊自行設計並製作的同軸靜電紡絲機紡出來的，因為市售機器的價格遠超大學部團隊能負擔的範圍。他們憑著這台開源、可拆平收納、設有安全互鎖的靜電紡絲機，加上一個模組化的 3D 列印同軸噴絲頭轉接件，拿下 Best Hardware 與 Best Presentation；又以一個從頭到尾罕見完整的專案拿下 Best Fashion & Cosmetics：20 多項標定風險等級的商業化分析、一條六階段的 FDA 路徑，以及一套真正圍繞著帶著疤痕生活的人所建立的人類實踐計畫。","awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Hardware — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Education — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Fashion & Cosmetics Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Cornell's modelling splits cleanly into wet lab and product development. On the biology side: a production-degradation ODE (dF/dt = alpha*X - delta_F*F) for SUMO-His-810A accumulation against biomass; a Hill function for Tet and future inducible promoter activity; Michaelis-Menten kinetics for SUMO protease cleavage to recover active peptide; an ELISA-based Hill-Langmuir binding isotherm for 810A against CTGF/C, fixed at n=1 because there is a single site, with an explicit note that a fitted n far from 1 would indicate error rather than cooperativity; and a quadratic ligand-depletion model for the regime where accessible CTGF and peptide concentrations are comparable and the ordinary Langmuir assumption breaks. Downstream of binding they built a reduced-order dynamic systems model of fibroblast state transition, parameterised from a protein interaction network assembled in STRING v12.5 — filtered on the Scarring Human Phenotype Ontology term HP:0100699, recovering 48 weighted edges, merged with CCN2's 20 nearest first-degree and 10 nearest second-degree neighbours, surfacing SMAD3, FN1 and TGFB2 as major nodes. Those nodes and weights were then run in Netflux as a logic-based ODE network (normalised node activity with a time constant, modified Hill activation and inhibition functions) using COL1A1 accumulation as the proxy for extracellular matrix hardening, and the simulation tracks the downstream TGF-beta inhibition reported in Xiao et al. 2020. Wound environment is modelled explicitly: ROS as a transient peak function calibrated against Carney et al. 2019 time-series qRT-PCR of SOD1, MGST1 and PRDX6 in hypertrophic scars, oxygen as an exponential recovery function, each feeding a Hill-function promoter. AlphaFold was used to render 810A and the CTGF/C-810A-6xHis complex. On the hardware side: a semi-empirical predictor of shell-solution viscosity (polymer overlap and entanglement statistics via Mark-Houwink), conductivity (mobile ion contribution) and surface tension (surfactant adsorption with a CMC/CAC plateau), the Fridrikh scaling law for terminal jet radius from flow rate, jet current and surface tension, plus continuity-based flow rate and stepper-motor plunger speed models.","frameworks_zh":"Cornell 的建模清楚分成濕實驗與產品開發兩塊。生物學這側：一條描述 SUMO-His-810A 相對於生物量累積的生產—降解 ODE（dF/dt = alpha*X - delta_F*F）；一條描述 Tet 與未來誘導型啟動子活性的 Hill 函數；SUMO 蛋白酶切割以回收活性胜肽的 Michaelis-Menten 動力學；一條以 ELISA 為基礎、描述 810A 對 CTGF/C 結合的 Hill-Langmuir 結合等溫線，因為只有單一結合位而把 n 固定為 1，並明確註記若擬合出的 n 遠離 1，代表的是誤差而不是協同性；以及一個二次式的配體耗竭模型，用於可接觸的 CTGF 與胜肽濃度相當、普通 Langmuir 假設失效的情形。在結合之後的下游，他們建了一個纖維母細胞狀態轉換的降階動態系統模型，參數取自在 STRING v12.5 組成的蛋白質交互作用網路——以 Scarring 的 Human Phenotype Ontology 詞條 HP:0100699 過濾，取得 48 條加權邊，再與 CCN2 最近的 20 個一階鄰點與 10 個二階鄰點合併，浮現出 SMAD3、FN1 與 TGFB2 等主要節點。這些節點與權重接著在 Netflux 中以基於邏輯的 ODE 網路執行（帶時間常數的正規化節點活性、修改過的 Hill 活化與抑制函數），以 COL1A1 的累積作為細胞外基質硬化的替代指標，模擬並追蹤 Xiao 等人 2020 年報告的下游 TGF-beta 抑制。傷口環境也有明確建模：ROS 以一個暫態峰值函數描述，並以 Carney 等人 2019 年在肥厚性疤痕中對 SOD1、MGST1 與 PRDX6 的時間序列 qRT-PCR 校準；氧氣則用指數回復函數，兩者各自餵進一個 Hill 函數型啟動子。AlphaFold 則用來呈現 810A 以及 CTGF/C-810A-6xHis 複合體。硬體這側：一個半經驗預測器，用來推估殼層溶液的黏度（以 Mark-Houwink 處理高分子重疊與糾纏統計）、導電度（可動離子貢獻）與表面張力（界面活性劑吸附，帶 CMC/CAC 平台），加上由流率、射流電流與表面張力推出終端射流半徑的 Fridrikh 標度律，以及基於連續方程的流率與步進馬達推桿速度模型。","dataviz":"The standout is the Unified Readiness Classifier, which collapses three separate property predictions into a single green/yellow/red call on whether a formulation should go to the electrospinner at all — green means proceed to voltage-window testing, yellow allows one short trial or minor reformulation, red means reformulate first. It is rendered as a spinning-viability contour map over sodium alginate and PEO weight percentages produced by Monte Carlo sampling against literature results, so a reader can see the spinnable region rather than read a table of numbers. The alginate molecular-weight analysis is similarly well-framed: one plot puts viscosity on the left axis spanning more than four orders of magnitude while conductivity and surface tension on the right axis stay flat, which makes the whole argument visible at a glance — conductivity caps how much alginate you can dissolve, molecular weight decides whether that limit is reachable, and the optimum is interior rather than monotonic. The STRING network is shown as a force-directed layout and the Netflux run as normalised activity curves for CTGF, TGFB1, FN1, COL1A1, SMAD2 and SMAD3 together. The wiki itself is a scroll-driven 3D island journey ('scroll to travel, click an island to explore') with an interactive AND-gate widget letting the reader switch each input signal on and off, and a WebGL model of the electrospinner.","dataviz_zh":"最突出的是 Unified Readiness Classifier：它把三項各自獨立的性質預測收斂成一個綠/黃/紅的判斷，決定某個配方到底該不該送上靜電紡絲機——綠色代表可進入電壓窗測試，黃色允許一次短時間試紡或小幅調整配方，紅色代表先重新配方再說。它畫成一張以蒙地卡羅取樣對照文獻結果、橫跨海藻酸鈉與 PEO 重量百分比的可紡性等高線圖，讀者因此是看到可紡區域，而不是去讀一張數字表。海藻酸鈉分子量的分析框架也同樣好：同一張圖把跨越四個數量級以上的黏度放在左軸，而導電度與表面張力放在右軸且維持平坦，整個論點一眼就看得出來——導電度決定海藻酸鈉最多能溶多少、分子量決定那個上限是否達得到，而最佳點落在中間而非單調方向上。STRING 網路以力導向佈局呈現，Netflux 的執行結果則把 CTGF、TGFB1、FN1、COL1A1、SMAD2 與 SMAD3 的正規化活性曲線畫在一起。wiki 本身是一段由捲動驅動的 3D 島嶼旅程（「捲動前進，點島探索」），帶有一個互動式 AND 閘元件讓讀者自行開關兩路輸入訊號，以及一個靜電紡絲機的 WebGL 模型。","datascience":"The classifier is the clearest case of turning data into a predictive tool: rather than measuring solutions after purchase, Cornell predicts viscosity, conductivity and surface tension from formulation inputs (alginate concentration, PEO concentration and molecular weight, surfactant type and concentration, salt or buffer content, temperature) and uses the prediction to avoid spinning runs that cannot work. They name candidate implementations — logistic regression, random forest, or Gaussian process classification, favouring the Gaussian process on a small dataset because it returns uncertainty — and define a two-level validation plan: property-level (mean absolute error for viscosity, percent error for conductivity, absolute error in mN/m for surface tension against held-out measured formulations) and outcome-level (whether predicted-green formulations actually produce stable shell-only fibres, judged on Taylor cone formation, current stability, bead formation, dry deposition and fibre diameter distribution). They say outright that the classifier matters more than exact numerical accuracy, and that literature Mark-Houwink, CMC and adsorption constants are starting estimates to be recalibrated against the team's own measurements. Fibre morphology was quantified by image analysis: tortuosity as the ratio of fibre contour length to end-to-end distance, with a >1.10 threshold defining 'curly', giving 8% curly and 92% straight. Failure diagnosis was also model-driven — droplet breakup was traced to insufficient PEO chain entanglement at 100 kDa, leading them to raise PEO from 1.5% to 2% and cut back PS80 surfactant.","datascience_zh":"那個分類器是把資料變成預測工具最清楚的例子：Cornell 不是買了溶液再去量，而是從配方輸入（海藻酸鈉濃度、PEO 濃度與分子量、界面活性劑種類與濃度、鹽或緩衝液含量、溫度）預測黏度、導電度與表面張力，再用預測結果避開不可能成功的紡絲實驗。他們指名候選做法——邏輯斯迴歸、隨機森林或高斯過程分類——並在小資料集上偏好高斯過程，因為它會回報不確定性；也定義了兩層驗證計畫：性質層（黏度看平均絕對誤差、導電度看百分比誤差、表面張力看 mN/m 的絕對誤差，對照保留的實測配方）與結果層（被預測為綠色的配方是否真的紡出穩定的純殼層纖維，依 Taylor 錐形成、電流穩定性、珠狀缺陷、乾燥沉積與纖維直徑分佈判定）。他們直說分類結果比精確數值準確度更重要，也直說文獻上的 Mark-Houwink、CMC 與吸附常數只是起始估計值，要用團隊自己的量測重新校準。纖維形態以影像分析量化：彎曲度定義為纖維輪廓長度與端到端距離之比，以 >1.10 為「捲曲」門檻，結果是 8% 捲曲、92% 平直。失敗診斷同樣由模型驅動——液滴破碎被追溯到 100 kDa 下 PEO 鏈糾纏不足，因此他們把 PEO 從 1.5% 提高到 2%，並減少 PS80 界面活性劑。","software":"No standalone software release; the released artefact is the hardware. The electrospinner is published openly as a bill of materials, CAD files, circuit diagrams, assembly documentation, an operation manual and a dedicated safety manual, designed to be disassembled and flat-packed for transport by teams in shared or temporary workspaces. Control is an ESP32 DevKitC microcontroller driving an AHV24V30KVR5MAW high-voltage module (24 V in, up to 30 kV out) for digitised control in place of a potentiometer, with an access-door interlock and emergency stop that cut power and ground the high-voltage circuit. A separate contribution is the modular 3D-printed coaxial needle adapter, which keeps metal needle tips for conductivity while 3D-printing the structure, adaptable across needle gauges and core-shell flow configurations. They also publish a disulfide-bond-optimised SHuffle expression protocol (6xHis-SUMO fusion, SUMO as chaperone and clean cleavage handle) framed for reuse on other hard-to-express proteins such as insulin-like growth factors, antibody fragments and venom peptides, plus protocols for alginate preparation, crosslinking viability testing, escape testing, light microscopy ImageJ analysis and spectrographic bacterial settling.","software_zh":"沒有獨立的軟體釋出；真正釋出的成果是硬體。靜電紡絲機以材料清單、CAD 檔、電路圖、組裝文件、操作手冊與一本專門的安全手冊公開，並刻意設計成可拆解、可平板化收納，方便在共用或臨時工作空間裡的團隊搬運。控制端是 ESP32 DevKitC 微控制器，驅動一個 AHV24V30KVR5MAW 高壓模組（輸入 24 V，輸出可達 30 kV），以數位控制取代可變電阻；另有門蓋安全互鎖與緊急停止，會切斷電源並把高壓電路接地。另一項貢獻是模組化的 3D 列印同軸針頭轉接件：結構用 3D 列印，但保留金屬針尖以維持導電性，可適配不同針號與各種核—殼流配置。他們也公開一份針對雙硫鍵最佳化的 SHuffle 表現協議（6xHis-SUMO 融合，SUMO 同時作為分子伴護蛋白與乾淨的切割把手），並明白寫成可供其他難表現蛋白重複利用，例如類胰島素生長因子、抗體片段與毒液胜肽；此外還有海藻酸鈉製備、交聯後存活率測試、逃逸測試、光學顯微鏡 ImageJ 分析與以分光法測菌體沉降的各項協議。","stack":["STRING v12.5","Netflux (logic-based ODE network simulation)","AlphaFold","ImageJ","Monte Carlo sampling","Gaussian process / random forest / logistic regression classification","ESP32 DevKitC microcontroller","AHV24V30KVR5MAW 30 kV high-voltage module","CAD and 3D printing (coaxial spinneret, enclosure, extruder)","SDS-PAGE, Ni-NTA affinity chromatography, LC-MS, ELISA","16S rRNA sequencing against the NIH database"],"techniques":["Production-degradation ODE modelling","Hill function promoter induction modelling","Michaelis-Menten enzyme kinetics","Hill-Langmuir / one-site Langmuir binding isotherm fitting to ELISA dose-response","Quadratic ligand-depletion equilibrium modelling","Reduced-order signalling network modelling","Protein-protein interaction network assembly filtered by Human Phenotype Ontology term","Logic-based network simulation with modified Hill activation and inhibition","Transient-peak and exponential-recovery environmental signal models","Mark-Houwink viscosity scaling and polymer entanglement statistics","Fridrikh scaling law for terminal jet radius","Semi-empirical property prediction with a green/yellow/red readiness classifier","Fibre tortuosity quantification by image analysis","AND-gate transcriptional logic (hrpR/hrpS/hrpL)"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Cornell ran an unusually wide and genuinely iterative education programme. Plasmid Pals, their own educational game, was playtested with Big Brothers Big Sisters participants who then suggested how to make it more interactive. Plasmid bracelets plus an open-ended idea board asking visitors how they would use synthetic biology to change the world evolved into age-adapted versions for daycare, the Sciencenter and the State Fair — and when reading and spelling turned out to be barriers for roughly 20 preschoolers, the team switched to a cooking analogy (DNA as cookbook, RNA as copied recipe, protein as finished dish), writing up the lesson that activities must match developmental ability. A summer-camp session had about 80 students debate which scientific problems deserve funding using live polls, and a 30-minute lesson drew another 20-25 minutes of student-led questions about research careers and contributing without lab access. STEM Her Way was a four-session series in which high school girls learned synthetic biology and presented their own research proposals, rated 4.7/5 by 15 respondents across seven countries with every respondent recommending it. A shadowing programme drew more than 260 applications from the US and 17 countries for six high school scholars, later extended to five international students whose own project proposals the team helped assess for feasibility — a participant from Uzbekistan brought soil salinity as a community problem and the students developed Salt Guardians around it. They also ran a worldwide synthetic biology governance competition (regulatory pathways, biosafety and containment, access and equity, plus an open governance challenge), produced a narrative synthetic biology podcast, taught Lambert iGEM how to prepare stakeholder questions by sharing their own Human Practices deck and brainstorming guide, and swapped children's books with NUGEM — NUGEM translating Cornell's into Kazakh and Russian while Cornell translated NUGEM's into Mandarin, Spanish and French.","publicEngagement_zh":"Cornell 的教育計畫不只範圍罕見地廣，而且真的有迭代。他們自製的教育遊戲 Plasmid Pals 先找 Big Brothers Big Sisters 的參與者試玩，對方接著建議怎麼讓它更互動。質體手鍊搭配一塊開放式想法板（問參訪者會怎麼用合成生物學改變世界），後來演化出適配不同年齡的版本，用在托育機構、Sciencenter 與州博覽會——而當他們發現閱讀與拼字對約 20 位學前兒童是障礙時，便改用烹飪類比（DNA 是食譜書、RNA 是抄下來的食譜、蛋白質是做好的菜），並把「活動必須配合發展能力」這一課寫下來。一場夏令營課程讓約 80 位學生用即時投票辯論哪些科學問題值得被資助；一堂 30 分鐘的課後，又延伸出 20-25 分鐘由學生主導的提問，問的是研究職涯，以及沒有實驗室可用時要怎麼做出貢獻。STEM Her Way 是四場系列活動，高中女生在其中學合成生物學並發表自己的研究提案，15 位回覆者（來自七個國家）給出 4.7/5 的評分，且每位都願意推薦。隨行見習計畫為六個高中名額吸引到來自美國與 17 個國家的 260 多份申請，後來又擴大到五位國際學生，團隊協助評估他們自己的專案提案可行性——一位來自烏茲別克的參與者把土壤鹽化當作社區問題帶進來，學生們便圍繞它發展出 Salt Guardians。他們還辦了一場全球性的合成生物學治理競賽（法規路徑、生物安全與圍堵、取得與公平性，另加一個開放治理挑戰），製作了一檔敘事型合成生物學 podcast，透過分享自己的人類實踐簡報與腦力激盪指南，教 Lambert iGEM 如何準備利害關係人問題，並與 NUGEM 交換童書——NUGEM 把 Cornell 的譯成哈薩克語與俄語，Cornell 則把 NUGEM 的譯成中文、西班牙語與法語。","ihp":"Several interviews changed the project rather than decorating it. The clearest is hardware: advised not to build their own high-voltage power supply (especially from microwave parts) because the electrical risk is serious, the team dropped the homemade supply entirely, consulted Cornell's Afridi Lab, and bought a commercial regulated unit while sourcing other parts through Digi-Key and Mouser to hold cost down — the advice was that boosting voltage is easy but a stable regulated DC output is the hard part. Dr Insoo Hyun reframed safety itself: he introduced weighing risks and benefits against existing alternatives rather than assuming absolute safety, and warned that familiarity with a microorganism from food use does not demonstrate safety in an open wound, also pressing them to choose experimental models that resemble real wound conditions rather than the most convenient ones. Dr Joseph Fins pushed on preclinical evidence and asked whether delivering the peptide directly, without living bacteria, would be safer and simpler — which the team now carries explicitly as a documented de-risking architecture, with the trade-off (a pre-loaded matrix gives a fixed dose and loses the AND-gated release) stated rather than hidden. Dr Andrew Leask's input on CCN2/CTGF signalling shaped the target rationale, and reviewer pressure to confirm H2O2 is still detectable at the wound stage they target led them to work on sensor sensitivity and add the hypoxia AND gate for specificity. Burn survivor and former burn nurse Amy Acton and Andrea at the Phoenix Society for Burn Survivors changed how the team talks: survivors need support long after wounds heal — financial help for compression garments and procedures, emotional support, connection with others — treatments are costly, uncomfortable and variable, so do not promise how much a treatment will reduce scarring. Roughly 20 older adults and visitors at open events taught them that a scar's size or appearance does not predict its personal impact, and that open conversation surfaced concerns their structured survey questions missed; they concluded existing scales describe the scar but not what the person would want improved. Alison Bateman-House at NYU identified composition and method-of-production as their strongest patent claims and walked them through the one-year US grace period and PCT economics, which fed directly into the commercialisation plan. A kelp-farming conversation moved the sustainability case from biodegradability to sourcing, noting that North American kelp farmers' binding constraint is finding buyers rather than growing kelp since wild-harvested seaweed is substantially cheaper — a point that complicates rather than flatters their own narrative.","ihp_zh":"有幾場訪談是真的改了專案，而不是拿來裝飾。最清楚的是硬體：有人建議他們不要自製高壓電源（尤其不要用微波爐零件），因為電氣風險很嚴重，團隊因此完全放棄自製電源，去諮詢 Cornell 的 Afridi Lab，改買市售的穩壓機組，其他零件則透過 Digi-Key 與 Mouser 採購以壓低成本——那條建議是：把電壓升上去很容易，難的是穩定的穩壓直流輸出。Dr Insoo Hyun 重新定義了「安全」本身：他引入的是把風險與效益放在既有替代療法之上來權衡，而不是假設絕對安全；他也警告，某種微生物在食品中用得熟悉，並不表示它在開放傷口中是安全的，並要求他們選擇近似真實傷口條件的實驗模型，而不是最方便的那些。Dr Joseph Fins 針對臨床前證據施壓，並問：不帶活菌、直接遞送胜肽會不會更安全也更簡單——團隊現在明確把這條列為有紀錄的降風險架構，並把取捨（預先載藥的基質只能給固定劑量，會失去 AND 閘控制的釋放）寫出來而不是藏起來。Dr Andrew Leask 關於 CCN2/CTGF 訊息傳遞的意見形塑了標的的立論依據；而審查者要求確認在他們瞄準的傷口階段 H2O2 是否仍可偵測，則促使他們去處理感測靈敏度，並加上缺氧這一路 AND 閘以取得專一性。燒傷倖存者暨前燒傷護理師 Amy Acton 與 Phoenix Society for Burn Survivors 的 Andrea 改變了團隊說話的方式：倖存者在傷口癒合後很久仍需要支持——壓力衣與各項療程的經濟協助、情緒支持、與他人的連結——療法昂貴、不舒服而且效果不一，所以不要承諾一項療法能把疤痕減少多少。公開活動上約 20 位年長者與參訪者則教會他們：疤痕的大小或外觀無法預測它對個人的衝擊，而開放式對話浮現出的顧慮，是他們結構化問卷題目漏掉的；他們的結論是現有量表描述的是疤痕，而不是當事人想改善的東西。NYU 的 Alison Bateman-House 指出組成與製造方法是他們最強的專利請求項，並帶他們走過美國一年寬限期與 PCT 的經濟考量，這些直接進了商業化計畫。一場關於海帶養殖的對話，把永續性的論點從可生物降解轉向了原料來源，指出北美海帶養殖者真正的瓶頸是找到買家、而不是把海帶種出來，因為野採海藻便宜得多——這一點讓他們自己的敘事變得更複雜，而不是更好聽。","realWorld":"This is the most developed commercial package of the five. Target market is quantified: burn centres and academic hospitals in the American Northeast, where 2,255 medical institutions — 26 verified burn centres, 604 hospitals (31 with ACGME dermatology residencies) and 1,625 medical spas — serve an estimated 1.8 million addressable patients per year, or 2.2 patients per institution per day, with academic hospitals and verified burn centres targeted first as likeliest to trial new technology. The regulatory analysis identifies the real hazard: Klothos is a combination product (alginate nanofiber device plus engineered live bacteria), so FDA assigns a primary mode of action deciding whether CBER leads via IND/BLA or CDRH via 510(k)/PMA, and misclassification could force a restart costing an estimated 18-24 months and $500K-plus — hence a formal Pre-RFD consultation with the Office of Combination Products before committing development resources. They cite Azitra's engineered S. epidermidis with an open IND and FDA Fast Track as precedent that CBER will accept an IND for topical engineered bacteria. A six-phase plan runs from prototype and fibroblast assays, through an IND/IDE-enabling package with dermal safety, immunogenicity, biodistribution and microbial containment, to Phase I (with viable-organism monitoring because it is a live biotherapeutic) and a Phase II randomised controlled trial in surgical, burn, hypertrophic-scar-risk and revision-scar settings scored on POSAS, VSS and SCAR-Q. A freedom-to-operate analysis covers ten patents across four technology areas, with specific flags (the University of Manitoba colour-changing antibacterial nanofiber US20220047523A1 and NYCU's pending pH-sensitive electrospun bandage would need review before adding a pH indicator), plus PCT costs of roughly $17K to hold in 150 signatories and $20K per country thereafter. They map regulatory strategy across seven regions, including the MHRA consultation on modernising the GTMP definition (closed 22 June 2026) and Korea's MFDS review reforms cutting target timelines from about 420 to 295 days. Over 20 risks across technical, market, financial and regulatory categories are rated on severity, likelihood and detectability with mitigations and rendered as a heat map; a skill gap radar names what the 45-plus member team cannot yet do (pricing, physician adoption, launch strategy, clinical trial design) and how they would fill it. Reimbursement is treated honestly: novel combination products often lack an established billing code, so they model unit economics under both self-pay and reimbursed scenarios. The team won an ANSA grant and flagged Cornell's technology transfer office licensing terms as a Year 1 gating factor for any spinout.","realWorld_zh":"這是五個案例中商業化套件做得最完整的一份。目標市場有量化：美國東北部的燒傷中心與教學醫院，共 2,255 家醫療機構——26 家經認證的燒傷中心、604 家醫院（其中 31 家設有 ACGME 皮膚科住院醫師訓練）與 1,625 家醫美中心——服務估計每年 180 萬名可觸及病人，換算為每家機構每天 2.2 位病人，並優先瞄準最可能試用新技術的教學醫院與認證燒傷中心。法規分析點出真正的風險：Klothos 是組合式產品（海藻酸鈉奈米纖維裝置加上工程改造的活菌），因此 FDA 會指定一個主要作用模式，決定是由 CBER 走 IND/BLA 還是 CDRH 走 510(k)/PMA；分類錯誤可能迫使整個流程重來，估計代價是 18-24 個月與 50 萬美元以上——所以他們在投入開發資源之前，先向 Office of Combination Products 提出正式的 Pre-RFD 諮詢。他們引用 Azitra 已有 IND 並取得 FDA Fast Track 的工程改造 S. epidermidis 作為前例，證明 CBER 會接受外用工程細菌的 IND。六階段計畫從原型與纖維母細胞試驗開始，經過一套支持 IND/IDE 的資料包（皮膚安全性、免疫原性、生體分佈與微生物圍堵），到第一期臨床（因為是活體生物治療產品，需監測活菌），再到在手術、燒傷、肥厚性疤痕高風險與疤痕修整等情境下、以 POSAS、VSS 與 SCAR-Q 評分的第二期隨機對照試驗。自由實施分析涵蓋四個技術領域共十件專利，並標出具體警訊（University of Manitoba 的變色抗菌奈米纖維 US20220047523A1 與 NYCU 審查中的 pH 敏感靜電紡絲敷料，在加入 pH 指示劑之前都需要先行審視），另列出 PCT 成本：維持 150 個簽約國約 17K 美元，之後每個國家約 20K 美元。他們把法規策略攤在七個地區上，包括 MHRA 關於現代化 GTMP 定義的諮詢（2026 年 6 月 22 日結束）與韓國 MFDS 把目標審查時程從約 420 天縮短到 295 天的改革。超過 20 項風險分成技術、市場、財務與法規四類，依嚴重度、發生可能性與可偵測性評分，附上緩解措施並畫成熱圖；一張技能缺口雷達圖則指名這個 45 人以上的團隊目前做不到的事（定價、醫師採用、上市策略、臨床試驗設計）以及他們打算怎麼補。給付問題處理得很誠實：新穎的組合式產品往往沒有既成的給付代碼，因此他們把單位經濟同時放在自費與有給付兩種情境下計算。團隊拿到一筆 ANSA 補助，並把 Cornell 技術移轉辦公室的授權條件標為任何衍生公司在第一年的關卡因素。","partners":["Dr Andrew Leask (CCN2/CTGF signalling and pathological scarring)","Dr Insoo Hyun (bioethics)","Dr Joseph Fins (medical ethics)","Alison Bateman-House, NYU Grossman School of Medicine (medical ethics and IP)","Amy Acton, Phoenix Society for Burn Survivors","Lisa Placanica (prescription/outpatient model)","Afridi Lab, Cornell (high-power electronics)","Cornell technology transfer office and biosafety office / IBC","Lambert iGEM (human practices mentoring)","NUGEM (children's book translation exchange)","STEM Her Way","Big Brothers Big Sisters","Ithaca Sciencenter","Cornell Division B Science Olympiad","ANSA grant programme"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6122/wiki/modeling/productdev-14-spinning-viability-alginate-peo-classifier-map.avif","caption":"Predicted spinning viability across sodium alginate and PEO weight percentages, generated by Monte Carlo sampling over the viscosity, conductivity and surface tension models — the map behind the green/yellow/red readiness classifier that decides whether a formulation reaches the electrospinner.","caption_zh":"以蒙地卡羅取樣跑過黏度、導電度與表面張力模型後，預測出的海藻酸鈉與 PEO 重量百分比可紡性分佈——這張圖就是決定一個配方能不能上靜電紡絲機的綠/黃/紅就緒分類器背後的地圖。","credit":"Team Cornell, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6122/wiki/modeling/wetlab-17-fig4-string-ctgf-scarring-network.avif","caption":"Force-directed CTGF (CCN2)-centred protein interaction and scarring regulatory network built in STRING v12.5 by filtering on Human Phenotype Ontology term HP:0100699, with SMAD3, FN1 and TGFB2 as major nodes. Its 48 weighted edges became the parameters of the Netflux fibroblast simulation.","caption_zh":"以 Human Phenotype Ontology 詞條 HP:0100699 過濾、在 STRING v12.5 建出的以 CTGF（CCN2）為中心的蛋白質交互作用與疤痕化調控網路，力導向佈局呈現，主要節點為 SMAD3、FN1 與 TGFB2。其 48 條加權邊成為 Netflux 纖維母細胞模擬的參數。","credit":"Team Cornell, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6122/wiki/engineering-success/hardware-extruder-reservoir-coaxial-needle-collection-plate/eng-suc-hardware-web-2-0-fig-1.avif","caption":"The custom coaxial electrospinner: extruder, reservoir, coaxial needle and collection plate, built from inexpensive stock parts and 3D-printed components and designed to flat-pack for teams working in shared or temporary spaces.","caption_zh":"自製的同軸靜電紡絲機：擠出器、儲液槽、同軸針頭與收集板，由便宜的現成零件與 3D 列印件組成，並設計成可平板化收納，適合在共用或臨時空間工作的團隊。","credit":"Team Cornell, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6122/wiki/hardware/microscope/gfp-coaxial.avif","caption":"Micrograph of coaxially electrospun fibres containing GFP-expressing engineered E. coli, showing that cells remain fluorescent and therefore viable after encapsulation.","caption_zh":"含有表現 GFP 的工程改造 E. coli 的同軸靜電紡絲纖維顯微影像，顯示菌體在包覆之後仍有螢光，因此仍具活性。","credit":"Team Cornell, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Build the cheap version of the instrument and publish it properly. Cornell's winning move was deciding that an electrospinner — normally a specialised commercial purchase — could be made from stock parts and 3D prints, then releasing the bill of materials, CAD, circuit diagrams, assembly guide, operation manual and a separate high-voltage safety manual with interlocks and an emergency stop designed in. For a school-based centre the paired lesson is the readiness classifier: predict a formulation's viscosity, conductivity and surface tension from its recipe, label it green/yellow/red, and spend scarce lab time only on green — a cheap model that saves expensive experiments is worth more than an elaborate one that does not change what you do next.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把儀器的便宜版本做出來，然後好好公開它。Cornell 的關鍵一手，是判斷靜電紡絲機——通常得向廠商專購——可以用現成零件加 3D 列印做出來，接著把材料清單（BOM）、CAD、電路圖、組裝指南、操作手冊，以及一本獨立的高壓安全手冊（連同設計進去的安全互鎖與緊急停止）全部釋出。對校園型的中心來說，配套的一課是那個就緒分類器：從配方預測溶液的黏度、導電度與表面張力，標成綠/黃/紅，只把稀少的實驗時間花在綠色的配方上——一個能省下昂貴實驗的簡單模型，價值高於一個做得精緻卻不改變你下一步的模型。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/circuitry","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/extrusion-mechanism","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/encasement","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/fibers","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/wet-lab","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/notebook","https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/timeline"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","最佳硬體 — 得主（大學組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 得主（大學組）","最佳時尚與美妝專案 — 得主"],"rank":155},"6123":{"team":"BASIS-China","id":"6123","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/basis-china/","projectTitle":"HEAL — Hairball Elimination and Lysis","projectTitle_zh":"HEAL — 毛球清除與分解","tagline":"Keratinases for cat hairballs, held inside the cat by a kill switch keyed to bile acid, with the containment claim measured against real sewage and soil concentrations","tagline_zh":"以角蛋白酶分解貓毛球，並用以膽酸為訊號的致死開關把菌限制在貓體內，圍堵主張則對照真實污水與土壤中的濃度加以檢驗","summary":"BASIS-China engineered E. coli to express keratinases and proteases (p-Ker, Protease 1, Protease 2, MGY1820, MGY4907) with thioredoxin and thioredoxin reductase as synergistic helpers and LGOX plus KatG as gut antioxidant modules, aimed at digesting cat hairballs. The safety engineering is the standout: a bile-acid-responsive suicide switch in which membrane sensors TcpH and CadC-TcpP activate the pCadBA promoter to produce the unstable CcdA antitoxin, while the stable CcdB toxin is expressed constitutively, so the cell survives only where bile acid is present. Four Anderson promoters (J23100, J23102, J23104, J23114) were built to tune CcdB strength, and the response threshold was measured at roughly 0.1-0.2 mM taurocholic acid, then compared against feline duodenal bile salts at 15-42 mM and against published sewage and soil bile-acid levels orders of magnitude below the threshold. They won the Safety and Security Award in the High School section and were nominated for Best New Basic Part.","summary_zh":"BASIS-China 改造 E. coli 表現角蛋白酶與蛋白酶（p-Ker、Protease 1、Protease 2、MGY1820、MGY4907），並以 thioredoxin 與 thioredoxin reductase 作為協同輔助、LGOX 與 KatG 作為腸道抗氧化模組，目標是分解貓的毛球。安全設計是最突出的部分：一個對膽酸有反應的自殺開關，由膜上感應蛋白 TcpH 與 CadC-TcpP 活化 pCadBA 啟動子，產生不穩定的 CcdA 抗毒素，而穩定的 CcdB 毒素則持續表現，因此細胞只能在有膽酸的環境中存活。團隊建構四個 Anderson 啟動子（J23100、J23102、J23104、J23114）來調整 CcdB 的強度，量得反應閾值約在 0.1-0.2 mM 牛膽酸，再與貓十二指腸膽鹽的 15-42 mM、以及文獻中低於該閾值數個數量級的污水與土壤膽酸濃度對照。他們獲得高中組的 Safety and Security Award，並入圍 Best New Basic Part。","awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (High School)","Safety and Security Award — Winner (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A published five-step characterisation framework for environmentally responsive kill switches, written because the team found limited end-to-end guidance in existing iGEM wikis: confirm construction by gel and sequencing; tune toxin expression across promoters of differing strength to find an operating window; characterise the concentration-dependent growth response by time course; compare the measured response range against published signal concentrations in both the intended host and the likely receiving environments; and add an orthogonal reporter readout alongside growth. Alongside it, a transferable design concept (use an endogenous molecule abundant in the target host's intestine and scarce outside it) with the caveat that bile-acid composition varies by species so adopters must establish their own host's signal profile.","frameworks_zh":"團隊發表了一套針對環境反應型致死開關的五步驟特性分析框架，起因是他們發現既有 iGEM wiki 缺乏完整可循的指引：以膠體電泳與定序確認建構正確；用強度不同的啟動子調整毒素表現以找出操作區間；以時間序列分析濃度相依的生長反應；將量得的反應範圍與文獻中目標宿主體內及可能受納環境的訊號濃度對照；並在生長數據之外加入一個獨立的報導基因讀值。此外還提出一個可移轉的設計概念（選用在目標宿主腸道中含量豐富、而在體外罕見的內源分子），並附上提醒：膽酸組成因物種而異，採用者必須自行建立所用宿主的訊號分布。","dataviz":"Circuit diagrams for the switch in both the bile-acid-present and bile-acid-absent states, a promoter-variant design figure, assembly gels against the expected 3,704 bp fragment, OD600 growth curves at 0 and 30 mM TCA, serial-dilution spot plates across six TCA concentrations (0, 0.1, 1, 10, 15, 30 mM) for all four promoter variants plus empty vector, 270-minute time-course growth curves per promoter across 0-1 mM, fluorescence panels for all four variants, and a supplemented-versus-depleted sfGFP comparison. The iGEM approval email and a 17-page laboratory safety rules PDF are embedded.","dataviz_zh":"有膽酸與無膽酸兩種狀態下的迴路圖、啟動子變異體設計圖、對照預期 3,704 bp 片段的組裝電泳膠圖、0 與 30 mM TCA 下的 OD600 生長曲線、四個啟動子變異體加空載體在六種 TCA 濃度（0、0.1、1、10、15、30 mM）下的序列稀釋點滴盤、各啟動子在 0-1 mM 範圍內的 270 分鐘時間序列生長曲線、四個變異體的螢光圖組，以及添加與耗盡條件下的 sfGFP 對比。頁面並嵌入 iGEM 的核准電子郵件與一份 17 頁的實驗室安全規範 PDF。","datascience":"The containment claim is quantified on both sides, which is what distinguishes it. The switch threshold is placed at approximately 0.1-0.2 mM TCA, with limited growth below 0.2 mM and similar growth rates above 0.4 mM. That is then set against feline duodenal bile salts at 15-42 mM (Reber and Mosley), sewage total bile acids at 184-356 micrograms per litre, which they convert to roughly 4.7 x 10^-4 to 9.1 x 10^-4 mM using a representative molecular weight of 392.6 g/mol (Sebok et al.), and soil deoxycholic acid at 13.3 pmol/g in archaeological soil from Pompeii, converted to 1.33 x 10^-5 mmol/kg (Porru et al.). They show the unit conversions and then state that total bile salts and soil-associated bile acids are not directly equivalent to TCA in culture medium.","datascience_zh":"圍堵主張在兩端都有量化數字，這是它與眾不同之處。開關閾值定在約 0.1-0.2 mM TCA，低於 0.2 mM 時生長受限，高於 0.4 mM 則生長速率相近。這個數字接著拿去對照貓十二指腸膽鹽的 15-42 mM（Reber 與 Mosley）、污水總膽酸的 184-356 微克每公升——他們以代表性分子量 392.6 g/mol 換算成約 4.7 x 10^-4 至 9.1 x 10^-4 mM（Sebok 等人）——以及龐貝考古土壤中去氧膽酸的 13.3 pmol/g，換算為 1.33 x 10^-5 mmol/kg（Porru 等人）。他們把單位換算過程列出，並指出總膽鹽與土壤中的膽酸，並不直接等同於培養基中的 TCA。","software":"","stack":["E. coli DH5-alpha and BL21(DE3)","SnapGene","TcpH and CadC-TcpP bile-acid sensors with pCadBA","CcdA/CcdB toxin-antitoxin","Anderson promoter series BBa_J23100/J23102/J23104/J23114","sfGFP fused to CcdB","pET-28a and pET-32a","Ni-NTA affinity chromatography","SDS-PAGE"],"techniques":["bile-acid-gated conditional viability","promoter-strength tuning of a toxin to set an operating window","serial-dilution spot plating across an inducer gradient","time-course growth response curves","reporter fluorescence after inducer withdrawal as a viability proxy","in-vitro keratin degradation on washed shed hair and pharmaceutical-grade beta-keratin"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"","ihp":"An interview with an experienced stray-cat rescuer from Xiaobabenben in Shenzhen reframed the product requirement: limited volunteer capacity, poor acceptance of existing remedies and stress-related overgrooming pushed the team toward palatable formats cats would take voluntarily, minimising restraint and forced administration, and made gastrointestinal safety and animal comfort explicit evaluation priorities. The more unusual engagement was with iGEM itself: knowing that the Animal Use Form is not available to high-school teams, they contacted the iGEM Safety and Regulatory Committee before collecting any samples, and Chris Isaac, Director of Responsibility at iGEM HQ, approved the collection without an Animal Use Form on the basis that routine grooming causes no harm, which they then documented on their official Project Safety Form as instructed and published the approval email.","ihp_zh":"團隊訪談了深圳 Xiaobabenben 一位資深流浪貓救援者，重新界定了產品需求：志工人力有限、現有產品接受度不佳、以及壓力造成的過度舔毛，使團隊轉向貓願意主動吃下的可口劑型，盡量避免保定與強迫餵藥，也讓腸胃道安全與動物舒適成為明確的評估重點。更少見的互動對象是 iGEM 本身：團隊知道高中組無法申請 Animal Use Form，於是在採集任何樣本之前先聯繫 iGEM Safety and Regulatory Committee；iGEM 總部責任事務主任 Chris Isaac 以日常梳毛不造成傷害為由，核准他們在沒有 Animal Use Form 的情況下採集，團隊依指示將此事記載於正式的 Project Safety Form，並公開了核准信件。","realWorld":"No company, no patent, no pricing and no funding here, so the material worth taking is the safety practice, and it is the most rigorous high-school biocontainment work in this group. Four features make it serious. First, the switch is engineered as a tunable system rather than a single construct: four Anderson promoters of differing strength drive CcdB so the operating window can be matched to a required kill sensitivity, and all four variants are characterised in parallel in every assay, with empty vector alongside. Second, the containment claim is tested against the actual release pathway rather than a lab abstraction. They ask where the bacteria would end up after excretion, find published bile-acid concentrations for sewage and soil, convert them into the same units as their assay, and show the receiving environments sit three to four orders of magnitude below their measured threshold. Third, the evidence hierarchy is stated explicitly and never collapsed. They separate 'evidence of construct assembly, conditional growth suppression, and reporter expression' from 'evidence required to demonstrate containment in real-world settings', and they list, in their own words, what still stands in the way: residual bile acids in faecal material, differences between laboratory medium and environmental conditions, circuit drift over time, and possible horizontal transfer. They add two caveats most teams would omit, that genetic containment neither removes extracellular DNA nor replaces waste decontamination, and that their delivery microcapsules are designed to release bacteria in the intestine and therefore must not be counted as physical containment. They also note sfGFP tracks the circuit but does not independently establish viability, and that soil and sewage total bile acids are not equivalent to TCA in medium. Fourth, the chassis plan is honest about its own role: BSL-1 E. coli is declared a proof-of-concept model only, chosen because high-school teams may not use untested wild isolates or run animal trials, with the translational chassis identified as GRAS feline-native probiotics (Lactiplantibacillus plantarum, Lactobacillus acidophilus, Bifidobacterium animalis) to be ported into only after validation and under veterinary compliance. Enzyme safety is argued mechanistically rather than asserted, noting that gut mucus is glycoprotein-based while keratinases target cross-linked keratin disulfides, and substrate safety is covered by using washed, sterilised naturally shed hair and pharmaceutical-grade beta-keratin. Laboratory risk management is reagent-specific rather than generic, naming beta-mercaptoethanol (fume hood only, sealed tubes), unpolymerised acrylamide (pre-cast gels preferred, dedicated hazardous waste), kanamycin and ampicillin with the resistance marker on each vector identified and media neutralised and autoclaved before disposal, and Ni-NTA nickel waste segregated for hazardous recycling, plus a preference for blue LED over UV transilluminators. Waste is bleached at 10 percent for at least 30 minutes or autoclaved at 121 degrees C for 30 minutes before discharge. Continuation is community-facing: the five-step framework, the design concept, and characterisation data for the circuit and all four promoter variants submitted to the Registry as a reference for future teams building bile-acid-responsive kill switches, with the honest framing that the data are 'a starting point for further validation, rather than a claim that this circuit is ready for unrestricted deployment'. No animal trials were conducted, and they say so repeatedly rather than once.","realWorld_zh":"這裡沒有公司、沒有專利、沒有定價、也沒有募資，所以真正值得參考的是他們的安全實作——這是本組高中隊伍中最嚴謹的生物圍堵工作。有四個特點讓它站得住腳。第一，這個開關被設計成可調的系統，而非單一構築體：四個強度不同的 Anderson 啟動子驅動 CcdB，使操作區間能配合所需的致死靈敏度，而四個變異體在每一項試驗中都同步做特性分析，並一併放上空載體對照。第二，圍堵主張是對著實際的釋出途徑檢驗，而不是對著實驗室裡的抽象情境。他們追問細菌排出後會到哪裡，查出文獻中污水與土壤的膽酸濃度，換算成與自己試驗相同的單位，並顯示受納環境比他們量得的閾值低三到四個數量級。第三，證據層級被明確寫出，而且從未被混為一談。他們把「構築體組裝、條件性生長抑制與報導基因表現的證據」和「要在真實環境中證明圍堵所需的證據」分開，並以自己的話列出還擋在前面的問題：糞便中殘留的膽酸、實驗室培養基與環境條件的差異、迴路隨時間漂移，以及可能發生的水平基因轉移。他們還補上兩點多數隊伍會略去的提醒：遺傳層面的圍堵既不會清除胞外 DNA，也不能取代廢棄物去污；而他們的遞送微膠囊本來就是設計在腸道中釋放細菌，因此不能算作物理性圍堵。他們也註明 sfGFP 只能反映迴路狀態，無法獨立證明細胞存活；土壤與污水中的總膽酸也不等同於培養基中的 TCA。第四，底盤規劃對自身定位很誠實：BSL-1 的 E. coli 被明確定位為概念驗證模型，選它是因為高中隊伍不得使用未經檢驗的野生分離菌株、也不能進行動物實驗；真正要轉譯的底盤則指明為 GRAS 等級的貓源益生菌（Lactiplantibacillus plantarum、Lactobacillus acidophilus、Bifidobacterium animalis），且只有在驗證完成並符合獸醫規範後才會移轉過去。酵素安全性是用機制論證而非單憑宣稱：他們指出腸道黏液以醣蛋白為主，而角蛋白酶作用的對象是交聯的角蛋白雙硫鍵；基質安全性則以清洗滅菌後的自然脫落毛髮與藥用級 beta-keratin 來處理。實驗室風險管理是逐一針對試劑而非泛泛而談，明確點出 beta-mercaptoethanol（只在化學排氣櫃內操作、使用密封離心管）、未聚合的 acrylamide（優先使用預製膠、專用有害廢棄物容器）、kanamycin 與 ampicillin（標明每個載體上的抗性標記，培養基於棄置前先中和並高壓滅菌），以及 Ni-NTA 的鎳廢液分開收集送有害回收，另外也偏好以藍光 LED 取代紫外線透照儀。廢棄物在排放前以 10% 漂白水處理至少 30 分鐘，或以 121°C 高壓滅菌 30 分鐘。後續規劃是面向社群的：五步驟框架、設計概念，以及迴路與四個啟動子變異體的特性分析數據都提交到 Registry，作為未來要建構膽酸反應型致死開關的隊伍的參考，並誠實地說明這些資料是「進一步驗證的起點，而非主張這個迴路已可無限制部署」。他們沒有進行動物實驗，而且這一點是反覆說明，不只提一次。","partners":["iGEM Safety and Regulatory Committee / Chris Isaac, Director of Responsibility, iGEM HQ (proactive animal-use consultation and written approval)","Xiaobabenben stray-cat rescue, Shenzhen (animal-welfare and administration-format requirements)","Avant Nanshan Science Innovation Center (certified BSL-1 facility, lab managers, safety training)","Sangon Biotech, Shanghai (gene synthesis)","Cat owners who supplied routinely groomed shed hair"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6123/wiki/safety-20261021/switch-promoters.webp","caption":"Four Anderson promoter variants driving ccdB, built to tune toxin strength and find the suicide switch's operating window rather than ship a single construct","caption_zh":"驅動 ccdB 的四個 Anderson 啟動子變異體，目的是調整毒素強度、找出自殺開關的操作區間，而不是只交出單一構築體","credit":"Team BASIS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6123/wiki/safety-20261021/gfp-tca-withdrawal.webp","caption":"sfGFP fluorescence before and after taurocholic acid withdrawal, used as an orthogonal readout alongside growth and reported with the caveat that it does not independently establish viability","caption_zh":"撤除牛膽酸前後的 sfGFP 螢光，作為生長數據之外的獨立讀值，並附上提醒：它無法單獨證明細胞存活","credit":"Team BASIS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6123/wiki/safety/igem-approval.webp","caption":"Written approval from iGEM HQ's Director of Responsibility for the shed-hair collection, obtained before any samples were taken and documented on the Project Safety Form","caption_zh":"iGEM 總部責任事務主任對脫落毛髮採集的書面核准，在採集任何樣本之前取得，並記載於 Project Safety Form","credit":"Team BASIS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6123/wiki/safety/2.avif","caption":"Behaviour of the suicide switch with and without bile acid: the unstable CcdA antitoxin is made only when the sensor is on, leaving the stable CcdB toxin unopposed outside the host","caption_zh":"自殺開關在有無膽酸下的行為：不穩定的 CcdA 抗毒素只在感應器開啟時生成，因此在宿主體外，穩定的 CcdB 毒素便無人制衡","credit":"Team BASIS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Characterise any containment switch the way they did: tune the toxin across a promoter series to find an operating window, measure the response threshold as a number, then look up the signal concentration in the actual receiving environment, convert it into your assay's units, and show the gap — a containment claim is only as good as the comparison behind it. Pair that with their evidence ledger, a 'what our results establish' section beside a 'what remains before real-world use' section, and with asking the governing body in advance rather than assuming an unavailable form means the work cannot be done compliantly.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"任何圍堵開關都該照他們的方式做特性分析：用一系列啟動子調整毒素強度以找出操作區間，把反應閾值量成一個具體數字，再查出訊號分子在實際受納環境中的濃度，換算成自己試驗所用的單位，然後把差距呈現出來——圍堵主張有多可信，取決於背後那個對照有多紮實。再搭配他們的證據盤點：把「我們的結果能證明什麼」和「實際應用前還缺什麼」並列成兩段；以及在動手前先去問主管單位，而不是因為某份表單不開放，就認定這件事無法合規進行。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/basis-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/basis-china/safety-and-security/","https://2026.igem.wiki/basis-china/contribution/","https://2026.igem.wiki/basis-china/description/","https://registry.igem.org/parts/BBa_26NOEGF3"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（高中組）","安全與保安獎 — 得主（高中組）"],"rank":33},"6124":{"team":"Madrid-UCM","id":"6124","section":"Undergrad","country":"Spain","village":"Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/","projectTitle":"rePhlow: A modular synthetic-biology platform for phosphorus capture and valorisation from industrial wastewater","projectTitle_zh":"rePhlow：一個用於從工業廢水中捕集並加值利用磷的模組化合成生物學平台","tagline":"Phosphorus should not reach nature as pollution, and it should not leave industry as waste.","tagline_zh":"磷不該以污染的形式進入自然，也不該以廢棄物的形式離開工業。","summary":"rePhlow intercepts phosphorus in a defined industrial wastewater stream rather than attempting to 'solve eutrophication'. An immobilised enzyme panel (phosphatases, phospholipases, phytase) releases phosphorus from organic and condensed fractions; engineered Pseudomonas putida KT2440 carrying heterologous ppk1 and the Accumulibacter Pst high-affinity transport system, with pitB/ppx/ppkB knocked out by CRISPR base editing, accumulates it as polyphosphate inside core-shell alginate-chitosan capsules; the recovered polyP then feeds a coupled PPK2/DHAK biocatalytic cascade producing dihydroxyacetone phosphate. The capsules sit in a basket-type rotating-bed bioreactor the team built themselves, with encapsulation doubling as the EU contained-use regulatory strategy. The project is explicitly framed as a two-sided business: paid to remove phosphorus, paid again for the phosphorus recovered.","summary_zh":"rePhlow 選擇在一條明確界定的工業廢水流中攔截磷，而不是試圖「解決優養化」。一組固定化酶（磷酸酶、磷脂酶、植酸酶）先把磷從有機態與縮合態組分中釋放出來；經改造的 Pseudomonas putida KT2440 帶有異源 ppk1 與 Accumulibacter 的 Pst 高親和性運輸系統，並以 CRISPR 鹼基編輯剔除 pitB/ppx/ppkB，在核殼式海藻酸鹽-幾丁聚醣膠囊內把磷累積成聚磷酸鹽；回收得到的 polyP 再送入 PPK2/DHAK 偶聯的生物催化串聯，生產磷酸二羥丙酮。這些膠囊放在團隊自行打造的籃式旋轉床生物反應器中，而包覆本身同時就是歐盟封閉使用（contained use）的法規策略。這個專案明確定位為一門雙邊收費的事業：除磷收一次錢，回收到的磷再收一次。","awards":["Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A genome-scale constraint-based model of P. putida KT2440 (iJN1463, 2,927 reactions) was used to ask which conditions and genes actually limit polyphosphate accumulation, then systematically reduced to a kinetic model. Parsimonious FBA identified the active metabolic core, flux variability analysis separated reactions with real flexibility (respiration, redox balancing) from those that are merely accessory, and flux coupling analysis justified lumping the Entner-Doudoroff route into one net reaction while deliberately keeping oxidative phosphorylation as its own module. The result is a 45-reaction core and then a handful of lumped modules in which every rate law can be written and every parameter traced to a source. The team states plainly what the model cannot do: no explicit genetic or enzymatic regulation, borrowed kinetic constants from related species, the anaerobic half of an EBPR process not modelled, and conclusions valid only for aerobic polyP accumulation on a fixed medium.","frameworks_zh":"團隊以 P. putida KT2440 的基因組尺度限制式模型（iJN1463，2,927 個反應）去問：到底哪些條件與基因真正限制了聚磷酸鹽的累積，再系統性地把它縮減成一個動力學模型。簡約通量平衡分析（pFBA）找出活躍的代謝核心，通量變異性分析把真正具有彈性的反應（呼吸作用、氧化還原平衡）與僅屬附屬的反應區分開來，而通量耦合分析則為把 Entner-Doudoroff 途徑併為單一淨反應提供了依據，同時刻意保留氧化磷酸化作為獨立模組。結果是一個 45 個反應的核心，外加少數幾個集總模組，其中每一條速率式都寫得出來、每一個參數都能追溯到來源。團隊也明白說出模型做不到什麼：沒有明確的基因或酵素層級調控、動力學常數借自近緣物種、EBPR 製程的厭氧那一半並未建模，以及結論僅適用於固定培養基下的好氧 polyP 累積。","dataviz":"An interactive D3 force-directed metabolic flux map (shipped as a separate MetabolicNetworkGraph chunk) renders the 45-reaction core with line thickness proportional to pFBA flux and grey lines for zero-flux branches. Plotly-gl3d renders phenotype phase planes for PolyP flux over glucose x O2 and phosphate x glucose uptake. The sustainability page carries an interactive LCA slider that moves capsule phosphorus loading from 0 to 12 mg P/g and shows which side of the ~8 mg P/g climate crossover a given loading falls on. The entrepreneurship page carries a customer-facing sizing and quotation demo built on the team's own financial model.","dataviz_zh":"一張互動式 D3 力導向代謝通量圖（以獨立的 MetabolicNetworkGraph 區塊載入）呈現 45 個反應的核心，線條粗細與 pFBA 通量成正比，零通量分支以灰線表示。Plotly-gl3d 繪製了 PolyP 通量在葡萄糖 x O2 以及磷酸鹽 x 葡萄糖攝取兩組座標下的表型相平面。永續性頁面放了一個互動式 LCA 滑桿，可把膠囊的磷負載量由 0 調到 12 mg P/g，並顯示某一負載量落在約 8 mg P/g 氣候衝擊交叉點的哪一側。創業頁面則放了一個面向客戶的規模估算與報價示範，建立在團隊自己的財務模型之上。","datascience":"Single-variable sensitivity sweeps on ammonium, phosphate and oxygen uptake capacity, ATP-maintenance demand (ATPM as an energetic stress proxy) and PPK1 capacity as a multiple of the reference pFBA flux, yielding concrete predictions: PPK1 is essential but its reference capacity is already sufficient, and nitrogen limitation permits rather than forces polyP storage. On the commercial side, a ten-year financial model with declared sensitivity: capsule service life drives everything, giving a Year-5 gross margin of 54.7% at 500 reuse cycles, 25.7% at 100 cycles and -10.6% at 50. The LCA is run with an explicit sensitivity on phosphorus captured per gram of capsule.","datascience_zh":"團隊對銨、磷酸鹽與氧的攝取能力、ATP 維持需求（以 ATPM 作為能量壓力的代理指標），以及 PPK1 容量（以參考 pFBA 通量的倍數表示）做了單變數敏感度掃描，得到具體預測：PPK1 不可或缺，但其參考容量已經足夠，而氮限制是允許而非強迫 polyP 儲存。商業面則有一套十年財務模型並明白標示敏感度：膠囊使用壽命主導一切，在重複使用 500 次時第 5 年毛利率為 54.7%、100 次時為 25.7%、50 次時則為 -10.6%。LCA 也以每公克膠囊所捕集的磷量做了明確的敏感度分析。","software":"An ISO 14040/14044-aligned life cycle assessment built in openLCA over 16 impact categories, with the openLCA workbook, the full LCA report and a step-by-step LCA tutorial published as a reusable contribution for other iGEM teams. Protein work used PROSS (phylogenetic sequence information plus Rosetta energy calculations) for DHAK stabilisation, AlphaFold for SpyTag/SpyCatcher fusion models, PyMOL for superposition onto PDB 1UN9, and SWISS-MODEL homology models to guide affinity-tag placement and expression-host choice.","software_zh":"一份符合 ISO 14040/14044 的生命週期評估，以 openLCA 建立，涵蓋 16 個衝擊類別；openLCA 工作檔、完整 LCA 報告與一份逐步操作的 LCA 教學都已公開，作為可供其他 iGEM 團隊重複使用的貢獻。蛋白質工作方面，DHAK 的穩定化使用 PROSS（親緣序列資訊加上 Rosetta 能量計算），SpyTag/SpyCatcher 融合模型使用 AlphaFold，並以 PyMOL 疊合到 PDB 1UN9，另以 SWISS-MODEL 同源模型指引親和標籤的放置位置與表現宿主的選擇。","stack":["Python","React","React Router","Vite","D3.js","Plotly (gl3d)","openLCA","PROSS/Rosetta","AlphaFold","PyMOL","SWISS-MODEL","iJN1463 genome-scale model"],"techniques":["parsimonious FBA","flux variability analysis","flux coupling analysis","phenotype phase plane analysis","model reduction and reaction lumping","ODE kinetic modelling with traced parameters","structure-based enzyme stability redesign","homology modelling","life cycle assessment (ISO 14040/44)","techno-economic modelling with sensitivity analysis","TAM/SAM/SOM market sizing"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A public survey found respondents rated their own knowledge of water pollution at 2.4 out of 5 and only 54% knew phosphorus can become a contaminant, yet 89% would support recycling phosphorus from wastewater into a useful resource, and views on GM microorganisms for treatment leaned favourable. The team's conclusion is unusually specific and actionable: the barrier to acceptance is not resistance to the biotechnology but the invisibility of the problem. Outreach leaned on science comedy, a format the team actually won with: Diego performed monologues at the National Museum of Natural Sciences (MNCN-CSIC) and the Museum of Human Evolution in Burgos, and took first place at the 4th Monologos de Ciencia Complutense. Other activities were school talks at IES Alameda de Osuna and IES Humanejos, a live alginate-bead synthesis demonstration at Madrid es Ciencia, a talk to DIS Abroad Scandinavia students at Compluemprende covering both the science and the business model, a hands-on session at the Lamarr vocational camp, and best-poster plus best-oral-presentation awards at the XVIII UCM Health Sciences Students' Congress, where veterinary professionals raised animal toxin exposure in eutrophic waters as an angle the team had not considered. The team also hosted the iGEM European Meetup in Malaga, submitted to the MSP-Vector peer-reviewed iGEM journal (ranked among the three best submissions and refereeing three other teams' papers in turn), and ran a joint 'war on two fronts' campaign with iGEM UPF Barcelona's Vinesys contrasting water scarcity with nutrient pollution.","publicEngagement_zh":"一份公眾問卷發現，受訪者自評對水污染的了解程度為 5 分中的 2.4 分，只有 54% 知道磷可能成為污染物，但有 89% 支持把廢水中的磷回收成有用資源，而對於使用基改微生物處理廢水的看法則偏向正面。團隊的結論異常具體且可行動：接受度的障礙不在於對生物技術的抗拒，而在於這個問題本身看不見。科普推廣主要倚重科學喜劇，而這也是團隊真正拿下名次的形式：Diego 在國立自然科學博物館（MNCN-CSIC）與 Burgos 的人類演化博物館表演科學單口，並在第 4 屆 Monologos de Ciencia Complutense 奪得第一名。其他活動包括在 IES Alameda de Osuna 與 IES Humanejos 的校園演講、在 Madrid es Ciencia 現場示範海藻酸鹽珠的合成、在 Compluemprende 向 DIS Abroad Scandinavia 的學生講授科學內容與商業模式、在 Lamarr 技職營隊的動手課程，以及在第 18 屆 UCM 健康科學學生研討會同時獲得最佳海報與最佳口頭報告獎，會上獸醫專業人士提出了優養化水域中動物接觸毒素的議題，這是團隊原本沒有想到的切角。團隊另主辦了在 Malaga 舉行的 iGEM 歐洲聚會，並投稿至同儕審查的 iGEM 期刊 MSP-Vector（獲評為三篇最佳投稿之一，並反過來為另外三支團隊的論文擔任審稿），還與 iGEM UPF Barcelona 的 Vinesys 合辦了一場「兩線作戰」聯合宣傳，把缺水與營養鹽污染並置對照。","ihp":"This is one of the most rigorously structured integrated human practices sections of the year, and the structure is the contribution. The team adapted the EPSRC AREA framework (Anticipate, Reflect, Engage, Act) because it found that 'safe' and 'responsible' meant different things to different team members, and built a five-rung integration ladder with an explicit closure criterion: relevant concern recorded (consultation only); input produced a traceable modification; modification entered a construct, protocol, experiment, model or communication output; evidence generated to assess the modified design; the revised design taken back to the person whose input triggered it; and only when their response produces a further change is the loop described as closed. Twenty-five stakeholder encounters are documented with date, affiliation, the question asked, the challenge raised and what changed. The strongest chain starts with Bio-Oils Huelva's La Rabida biodiesel plant (20 March 2025), which described the phosphorus concentration, pH and temperature of its degumming effluent and warned that any new treatment would have to fit around existing infrastructure; the team turned those ranges into a semi-synthetic effluent recipe used before any real sample existed, made modular retrofit-compatibility an explicit design requirement ('a mid-sized industrial facility cannot rebuild its infrastructure around an experimental technology'), and later ran the engineered strain on real Bio-Oils effluent, where it accumulated more phosphorus than the wild type and survived. Aurelio Hidalgo (CBM, CSIC-UAM) reframed the enzyme problem before any design was fixed: 'an enzyme that is simply expressed and released is spent once; at the scale of a treatment stream, a single-use biocatalyst is neither economical nor recoverable', which killed both of the team's placeholders (secretion and a consortium) and moved the enzyme panel onto a reusable solid support, cleanly separating phosphorus release from uptake and storage. Silvia Diaz del Toro then pointed out that nothing in the design distinguished an enzyme that was immobilised from one verified to stay immobilised, so enzyme retention and leaching became explicit safety requirements and the immobilisation chemistry was selected to minimise detachment rather than to maximise activity; Juan Manuel Bolivar converted that into a de-risked model system with a characterised support, a characterised enzyme and an assay that works at the acidic pH the real enzymes need, because the team's first colorimetric assay would have failed there. Repsol (21 October 2025) said flatly that living GMOs would not be acceptable without convincing evidence that environmental release had been prevented, which elevated containment evidence above removal performance as a condition for implementation and generated a culture plus qPCR monitoring campaign with a divert-and-inactivate protocol. CEDEX, the public water-technology research body, told the team its malachite-green assay should not be presented as equivalent to an official reference method, after which rePhlow was reframed as a complement to established treatment rather than a replacement and method validation was written in as a necessary next step. The closed loop the team is proudest of is materials: Carmen Garcia Payo and Loreto Garcia Fernandez proposed core-shell capsules over simple beads, the team built them but could not see the internal structure, took that problem straight back to the same researchers, and received magnetite as an optical tracer plus cryosectioning, which became a wall-thickness measurement and leakage-testing pipeline. Two further things lift this above a meeting log: the team documents a change it chose not to make (Elvira Mateos' Accumulibacter polyamine route, declined because the metabolic burden outweighed an unquantifiable gain, written up explicitly because 'not adding a pathway is a design decision too'), and it records a non-expert voice, Inmaculada Alonso, a long-term resident near the San Juan reservoir, who described eutrophication as a slow change she had watched for decades without ever being told why. That conversation shifted the team towards perceptible restoration outcomes and clear communication as deliverables, and the team itself notes that one resident cannot represent everyone affected.","ihp_zh":"這是今年結構最嚴謹的整合式人類實踐章節之一，而這個結構本身就是貢獻。團隊改用了 EPSRC 的 AREA 框架（Anticipate、Reflect、Engage、Act），原因是他們發現「安全」與「負責」對不同團員而言意思並不相同；他們並建立了一個五階整合階梯，附明確的閉環判準：記錄到相關疑慮（僅為諮詢）；意見產生了可追溯的修改；修改進入了某個構築體、實驗流程、實驗、模型或溝通產出；產生了證據以評估修改後的設計；修改後的設計被帶回給當初提出意見的人；而只有當對方的回應又再引發一次改變時，這個迴圈才被稱為閉合。25 場利害關係人接觸都記錄了日期、單位、所問的問題、對方提出的挑戰，以及因此改變了什麼。最強的一條鏈始於 Bio-Oils Huelva 的 La Rabida 生質柴油廠（2025 年 3 月 20 日），該廠說明了其脫膠廢水的磷濃度、pH 與溫度，並警告任何新處理技術都必須配合既有設施；團隊把這些範圍轉成一份半合成廢水配方，在拿到任何真實樣本之前就先使用，並把模組化的改裝相容性列為明確的設計要求（「一座中型工業廠不可能為了一項實驗性技術重建自己的基礎設施」），後來也把工程菌株放到真實的 Bio-Oils 廢水中運行，結果累積的磷比野生型更多且存活下來。Aurelio Hidalgo（CBM, CSIC-UAM）在任何設計定案之前就重新框定了酶的問題：「一個只是表現出來並釋放到環境中的酶，用一次就沒了；在處理一整條廢水流的規模上，單次使用的生物催化劑既不經濟也無法回收」，這句話否決了團隊原本的兩個暫定方案（分泌表現與菌群共培養），把酶組移到可重複使用的固體載體上，乾淨地把磷的釋放與磷的吸收儲存分開。接著 Silvia Diaz del Toro 指出，設計中並沒有任何東西能區分「已被固定化的酶」與「經驗證會持續固定不脫落的酶」，於是酶的保留率與流失成為明確的安全要求，固定化化學的選擇標準也改為最小化脫落，而不是最大化活性；Juan Manuel Bolivar 則把這一點轉化成一個已去風險的模式系統，包含一個已表徵的載體、一個已表徵的酶，以及一套能在真實酶所需的酸性 pH 下運作的分析方法，因為團隊最初的呈色分析法在那個 pH 下會失效。Repsol（2025 年 10 月 21 日）直言，若無法提供足以說服人的證據證明已防止環境釋放，活體 GMO 不會被接受，這使「圍阻的證據」在實施條件上的位階高於除磷效能，並促成了一套培養加 qPCR 的監測計畫，以及一份分流並去活化的處置流程。公立水處理技術研究機構 CEDEX 告訴團隊，他們的孔雀綠呈色法不應被呈現為等同官方參考方法，此後 rePhlow 被重新定位為既有處理程序的補充而非替代，方法確效也被寫入為必要的下一步。團隊最自豪的閉合迴圈出現在材料上：Carmen Garcia Payo 與 Loreto Garcia Fernandez 建議採用核殼式膠囊而非單純的珠體，團隊做出來了卻看不到內部結構，於是把這個問題直接帶回給同一批研究人員，得到磁鐵礦作為光學示蹤劑以及冷凍切片的建議，最後發展成一套壁厚量測與滲漏測試流程。另有兩件事讓這一章超越了會議紀錄：團隊記錄了一項他們決定不做的改動（Elvira Mateos 提出的 Accumulibacter 多胺途徑，因代謝負擔大於無法量化的效益而婉拒，並特意寫下來，因為「不加入一條途徑同樣是一個設計決定」）；以及他們記錄了一位非專家的聲音，Inmaculada Alonso，San Juan 水庫附近的長期居民，她描述優養化是一種她看了幾十年、卻從來沒有人向她解釋過原因的緩慢變化。那場對話讓團隊轉向把「可被感知的復原成果」與「清楚的溝通」當成交付項目，而團隊自己也指出，一位居民無法代表所有受影響的人。","realWorld":"Need is framed with its own data, not a logo wall: 63% of assessed inland water bodies already eutrophic, ~1.15 million km2 of coastal waters with eutrophication potential, and the Mar Menor as a named Spanish case where a 2016 bloom destroyed over 80% of seagrass meadows, local income fell by an estimated share relative to unaffected areas and property values dropped. The team visited Mar Menor, Donana and the Embalse de San Juan to ground this. Nine SDG interactions were scored using the seven-point Nilsson, Griggs and Visbeck framework across SDGs 6, 9, 12, 13 and 14, and 22 stakeholder conversations were tracked through a Sustainability Model Canvas adapted from iGEM Hangzhou-BioX 2024, with six of them traced to engineering decisions and open loops marked as open. The most credible single act on this page is self-contradiction: the team's own ISO 14040/44 openLCA study over 16 impact categories finds that at the capsule loading it has actually achieved (1.5 mg P/g) rePhlow has a HIGHER climate-change impact than the chemical precipitation comparator, identifies phosphorus captured per gram of capsule as the single reversing variable, and publishes the ~8 mg P/g crossover rather than listing an achievement its own instruments contradict. Regulation is handled as strategy rather than context: Directive (EU) 2024/3019 replaces the Urban Wastewater Treatment Directive from August 2027 with phosphorus limits phased 2033-2045, but the team notes the binding obligation for its customer is the facility permit, not the urban Directive, and that EU law distinguishes contained use of GM microorganisms from deliberate release, making encapsulation plus downstream ultrafiltration a regulatory pathway as much as a safety feature; contained-use notification carries real 45-day and 90-day administrative lead times that are placed on the critical path. The cost model is stated as assumption, not result, at TRL 2-3: Business Plan V3 gives EUR 9,460 direct cost per module at a 50.2% gross margin, a pilot at EUR 69,800 of equipment plus EUR 450,000 cash cost, EUR 20,000 founder capital matched to the minimum share capital of the national technology-company grant line (up to EUR 250,000 at 70% of a >=EUR 175,000 budget), and a declared cost-of-goods sensitivity modelled twice at laboratory and bulk industrial prices. Two revenue models are offered: direct purchase of the module plus consumables and service, or Phosphorus-as-a-Service in which rePhlow retains ownership and therefore carries the capsule-lifetime risk itself. The beachhead is mid-sized agro-industrial and biofuel facilities with Bio-Oils Huelva as first prospective customer, and the four-phase plan has hard gates: four measurements (encapsulated-to-free uptake ratio, capsule service life in real effluent, phosphorus speciation of the Bio-Oils stream, enzyme leaching per cycle) must exist before Phase 2 opens, and at least one customer willing to pay the quoted price is required before scale-up rather than after. After the Jamboree: incorporation, a university technology-transfer novelty and freedom-to-operate assessment before deciding what to protect, a 12-month host-site pilot, then contract manufacturing, with the stated test that 'until repeat orders and positive unit economics without grant support both hold, rePhlow is a funded project rather than a company'.","realWorld_zh":"需求是用自己的資料撐起來的，不是貼一排機構標誌：已評估的內陸水體中有 63% 已呈優養化、約 115 萬 km2 的沿岸水域具優養化潛勢，並以西班牙的 Mar Menor 為具名案例，2016 年的一次藻華摧毀了超過 80% 的海草床，當地所得相對於未受影響地區下降了一定比例，房地產價值也隨之下跌。團隊實地走訪了 Mar Menor、Donana 與 Embalse de San Juan 來讓這些數字落地。九組 SDG 交互作用以 Nilsson、Griggs 與 Visbeck 的七點量表框架評分，涵蓋 SDG 6、9、12、13 與 14；22 場利害關係人對話則以改編自 iGEM Hangzhou-BioX 2024 的永續模式圖追蹤，其中六場可追溯到具體的工程決策，未閉合的迴圈也標記為未閉合。這一頁最可信的單一舉動是自我否證：團隊自己那份涵蓋 16 個衝擊類別的 ISO 14040/44 openLCA 研究發現，在他們實際達到的膠囊負載量（1.5 mg P/g）下，rePhlow 的氣候變遷衝擊高於化學沉澱的對照方案；研究指認每公克膠囊所捕集的磷量是唯一能翻轉結論的變數，並公開了約 8 mg P/g 的交叉點，而不是去列舉一項自家儀器數據並不支持的成就。法規被當成策略而非背景處理：歐盟指令 (EU) 2024/3019 將自 2027 年 8 月起取代都市廢水處理指令，磷限值分階段於 2033 至 2045 年生效，但團隊指出對其客戶具約束力的其實是廠區許可，而不是這份都市指令；他們也指出歐盟法規區分基改微生物的封閉使用與刻意釋放，使包覆加上下游超過濾既是安全措施，也同時是一條法規路徑；封閉使用通報有實際的 45 天與 90 天行政前置時間，而這些時間被放進了關鍵路徑。成本模型在 TRL 2-3 階段被明確陳述為假設而非結果：商業計畫 V3 給出每模組 9,460 EUR 的直接成本、50.2% 的毛利率，一座先導廠需 69,800 EUR 設備費加 450,000 EUR 現金成本，以及 20,000 EUR 的創辦人資本，後者對應國家級技術公司補助方案所要求的最低實收資本（在預算 >= 175,000 EUR 時最高補助 70%、上限 250,000 EUR），並明確以實驗室價格與工業大宗價格各做一次銷貨成本敏感度分析。團隊提出兩種營收模式：直接購買模組加耗材與服務，或 Phosphorus-as-a-Service，由 rePhlow 保留所有權，因此也自行承擔膠囊壽命的風險。灘頭堡市場是中型農工業與生質燃料廠，Bio-Oils Huelva 為第一個潛在客戶；四階段計畫設有硬性關卡：在第 2 階段開啟之前，必須先有四項量測（包覆與游離狀態的吸收比、膠囊在真實廢水中的使用壽命、Bio-Oils 廢水流的磷型態分析、每個循環的酶流失量），而且在放大量產之前、而非之後，必須至少有一個願意以報價付費的客戶。Jamboree 之後的規劃是：公司登記、在決定要保護什麼之前先做一次校內技轉的新穎性與自由實施評估、為期 12 個月的駐場先導運行，之後才進入委外製造；他們並明白立下檢驗標準：「在重複訂單與不靠補助也成立的正向單位經濟同時出現之前，rePhlow 都只是一個拿到資金的專案，而不是一家公司」。","partners":["Bio-Oils Huelva (biodiesel producer, La Rabida plant; industrial collaborator, effluent samples and first prospective customer)","Repsol (energy and petrochemical operator; containment requirements)","CEDEX, Centro de Estudios y Experimentacion de Obras Publicas (public water-technology research body)","Canal de Isabel II (water utility)","IMDEA Water","Centro de Biologia Molecular Severo Ochoa (CBM, CSIC-UAM)","Instituto de Quimica Organica General (IQOG-CSIC) - research stay for the revalorisation module","Centro de Investigaciones Biologicas (CIB-CSIC) - CRISPR base-editing plasmids","Fabrica UCM and Compluemprende (UCM entrepreneurship programmes)","APTenisa Launch, run by La Salle Technova Barcelona and subsidised by ENISA","Viroque Energy","iGEM UPF Barcelona (Vinesys) - joint water campaign","MSP-Vector peer-reviewed iGEM journal (Maastricht University)","Non-dilutive funders: FECYT, Santander X, Promega Iberica"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6124/wiki/assets/human-practices/travel-archive/bio-oils-01.webp","caption":"The Bio-Oils Huelva biodiesel plant, whose degumming effluent ranges became rePhlow's semi-synthetic test stream and later its first real sample.","caption_zh":"Bio-Oils Huelva 生質柴油廠，其脫膠廢水的數值範圍成為 rePhlow 的半合成測試水流，後來也成為第一個真實樣本的來源。","credit":"Team Madrid-UCM, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6124/wiki/assets/human-practices/travel-archive/cedex-01.webp","caption":"A CEDEX researcher showing the team the water-technology laboratory; this visit made them stop presenting their malachite-green assay as a finished method.","caption_zh":"一位 CEDEX 研究人員帶團隊參觀水處理技術實驗室；這次參訪讓他們不再把自己的孔雀綠呈色法當成已完成的方法來呈現。","credit":"Team Madrid-UCM, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6124/wiki/assets/human-practices/travel-archive/repsol-02.webp","caption":"The rePhlow team with Repsol specialists, the session in which containment evidence was made a precondition for industrial acceptability.","caption_zh":"rePhlow 團隊與 Repsol 的專家，正是在這場會談中，圍阻的證據被定為工業端可接受性的前提條件。","credit":"Team Madrid-UCM, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6124/wiki/assets/human-practices/travel-archive/embalse-san-juan-01.webp","caption":"Field sampling at the Embalse de San Juan reservoir, where a long-term resident described decades of eutrophication she had never had explained to her.","caption_zh":"在 Embalse de San Juan 水庫進行田野採樣，一位長期居住在此的居民在這裡描述了她經歷數十年、卻從未有人向她解釋過的優養化。","credit":"Team Madrid-UCM, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy Madrid's five-rung integration ladder with its closure rule: a stakeholder loop counts as closed only when the revised design has been taken back to the person who triggered the change and their response produces a further change. Copy also their willingness to publish an LCA that currently rules against their own technology, with the single reversing variable and its crossover value named.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"抄下 Madrid 的五階整合階梯以及它的閉環判準：一個利害關係人迴圈只有在修改後的設計被帶回給當初促成改變的那個人、而對方的回應又再引發一次改變時，才算真正閉合。也抄下他們願意公開一份目前判定對自家技術不利的 LCA，並明確指出那個唯一能翻轉結論的變數及其交叉點數值。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/","https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/assets/index-CDWW7OSW.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/assets/MetabolicNetworkGraph-C3qAiQFO.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/sustainability","https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/project-description","https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/education-communication","https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/safety-and-security","https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/collaboration-partnership"],"awards_zh":["最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳創業 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 入圍"],"rank":21},"6125":{"team":"Squirrel-Beijing","id":"6125","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/squirrel-beijing/","projectTitle":"PNPeeker","projectTitle_zh":"PNPeeker","tagline":"A whole-cell sensor that reports the bioavailable fraction of p-nitrophenol in soil, paired with a five-enzyme pathway that destroys it and a cold-triggered suicide switch","tagline_zh":"一種全細胞感測器，可報告土壤中對硝基苯酚（p-nitrophenol）的生物可利用部分，並搭配一條將其分解的五酵素途徑與一組低溫觸發的自殺開關","summary":"Squirrel-Beijing targeted p-nitrophenol, a US EPA priority pollutant found in more than 32 percent of Chinese agricultural soils at 0.8-30.5 micrograms per gram in places, and attacked the measurement problem rather than just the pollutant: HPLC reports total concentration, but ecological risk depends on the bioavailable fraction, which only a living sensor can read. They engineered the PobR transcriptional regulator with its PpobA promoter into an RFP reporter circuit showing concentration-dependent response from 0.001 to 10 mg/L, reconstructed the five-enzyme hydroquinone pathway (pnpA, B, C, E, D) that converts pNP all the way to beta-ketoadipate, and achieved 87-95 percent pNP removal at 10-500 micrograms per litre within 24 hours. They won Best New Composite Part in the High School section and were nominated for Best Village Project.","summary_zh":"Squirrel-Beijing 針對對硝基苯酚（p-nitrophenol）。這是美國 EPA 列管的優先污染物，出現在超過 32% 的中國農業土壤中，部分地點濃度達每公克 0.8-30.5 微克。團隊處理的不只是污染物本身，而是量測問題：HPLC 報告的是總濃度，但生態風險取決於生物可利用的那一部分，而這只有活體感測器才讀得出來。他們把 PobR 轉錄調控因子與其 PpobA 啟動子構築成 RFP 報告迴路，在 0.001 至 10 mg/L 之間呈現濃度依賴性反應；重建了把 pNP 一路轉化為 beta-ketoadipate 的五酵素氫醌途徑（pnpA、B、C、E、D）；並在 10-500 微克每公升的初始濃度下，於 24 小時內達成 87-95% 的 pNP 去除率。他們在 High School 組別獲得 Best New Composite Part 獎，並獲 Best Village Project 提名。","awards":["Best New Composite Part — Winner (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Climate Crisis / Conservation / Bioremediation)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Parts presented with explicit medal-tier labelling (Gold Medal Part, Silver Medal Part, Bronze Medal Part) so a reader can see which contribution criterion each satisfies, plus a dedicated 'Applications for Future iGEM Teams' section with four named reuse routes. For collaboration they defined P-E-A-F (Preparation, Exchange, Action, Feedback) as a transferable framework for cross-team work. The entrepreneurship page runs TAM-SAM-SOM, PEST, Porter's Five Forces, SWOT, 4Ps, Business Model Canvas, a milestone timeline, a five-year financial forecast, a five-category risk register and three exit routes.","frameworks_zh":"零件以明確的獎牌層級標示呈現（Gold Medal Part、Silver Medal Part、Bronze Medal Part），讀者因此能看出每項貢獻滿足的是哪一條標準；另有專設的「Applications for Future iGEM Teams」一節，列出四條指名的重用路徑。在合作方面，他們把 P-E-A-F（Preparation、Exchange、Action、Feedback）定義為可移轉的跨隊合作框架。創業頁面則跑過 TAM-SAM-SOM、PEST、Porter 五力分析、SWOT、4Ps、商業模式畫布、里程碑時程、五年財務預測、分五類的風險清單，以及三條退場路徑。","dataviz":"Characterisation figures that answer the questions a reuser actually asks: normalised GFP/OD600 promoter activity across five temperatures over 0-10 hours, growth curves of the lysis strain at 16, 25 and 37 degrees C over 12 hours, PCR gels confirming expected fragment sizes (GFP 717 bp, T4 Holin 657 bp, T4 Lysozyme 492 bp), the TAM-SAM-SOM illustration, the P-E-A-F framework diagram and a five-year financial forecast chart. A 28-term project glossary sits beside every page.","dataviz_zh":"特性分析圖表回答的是重用者真正會問的問題：五種溫度下 0-10 小時內經正規化的 GFP/OD600 啟動子活性、裂解菌株在 16、25 與 37 度 C 下 12 小時的生長曲線、確認片段大小符合預期的 PCR 膠體圖（GFP 717 bp、T4 Holin 657 bp、T4 Lysozyme 492 bp）、TAM-SAM-SOM 示意圖、P-E-A-F 框架圖，以及五年財務預測圖。每一頁旁邊都附有一份 28 條詞彙的專案詞彙表。","datascience":"Numbers are reported with ranges and conditions attached rather than as single best values: the sensor's response spans 0.001-10 mg/L, degradation is 87-95 percent across an initial-concentration range of 10-500 micrograms per litre at 24 hours, and the cold promoter reaches about 270.2 A.U. at 20 degrees C against 14.1 A.U. at 37 degrees C, a 19.2-fold window, with 15, 25 and 30 degrees C values all given so another team can pick an induction temperature. PobR itself was improved by computational screening (docking plus molecular dynamics) followed by site-directed mutation.","datascience_zh":"數字都連同範圍與條件一併報告，而不是只給單一最佳值：感測器的反應範圍橫跨 0.001-10 mg/L；在 10-500 微克每公升的初始濃度區間內，24 小時的降解率為 87-95%；低溫啟動子在 20 度 C 下約達 270.2 A.U.，在 37 度 C 下為 14.1 A.U.，形成 19.2 倍的操作窗口，並一併給出 15、25 與 30 度 C 的數值，讓別的團隊能自行挑選誘導溫度。PobR 本身則先以計算篩選（分子嵌合加上分子動力學模擬）改良，再進行定點突變。","software":"","stack":["E. coli","PobR / PpobA regulatory pair","pnpABCDE hydroquinone pathway","J23100 promoter with B0034 RBS","pCspA cold-inducible promoter with T4 Holin and T4 Lysozyme","RFP and GFP reporters","molecular docking and molecular dynamics","BioBrick RFC#10 assembly"],"techniques":["whole-cell biosensing of bioavailable pollutant fraction","computational regulator engineering then site-directed mutagenesis","dual-operon splitting of a long pathway to avoid transcription attenuation","temperature- and time-resolved promoter characterisation","cold-triggered lysis biocontainment","standardised quantitative pNP detection validated in complex environmental matrices"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"The 28-term project glossary deserves counting as public engagement in its own right, since it defines every technical term used across the wiki in plain language and is linked from every page. Its entry for OD600 is the giveaway on quality: it states that OD600 is a proxy for culture turbidity and 'does not by itself establish cell viability or complete cell lysis', which is a caveat on their own headline lysis result rather than a textbook definition.","publicEngagement_zh":"那份 28 條詞彙的專案詞彙表本身就值得被算作公眾參與，因為它用白話定義了整個 wiki 所使用的每一個專業名詞，並從每一頁連結過去。它關於 OD600 的條目最能看出品質：它指出 OD600 只是培養液濁度的替代指標，「本身並不足以證明細胞存活率或細胞完全裂解」，這是對他們自己的主要裂解結果所下的保留，而不是一條教科書式的定義。","ihp":"Expert interviews drove the project's framing toward bioavailability rather than total concentration, and the team captain made a specific management decision about them: recognising that the dry team could interview fluently but could not field highly technical follow-ups, and that the wet-lab team had the knowledge but not the interview role, the captain personally attended every human-practices expert interview to capture professional questions and suggestions on site and minimise information loss across the knowledge gap between subgroups. That is a documented organisational fix to a problem most teams never name.","ihp_zh":"專家訪談把專案的問題框架推向生物可利用度而非總濃度，而隊長針對訪談做了一項具體的管理決定：他認知到乾實驗組能流暢地訪談，但接不住高度技術性的追問，而濕實驗組有知識卻不擔任訪談角色，因此隊長親自出席每一場人類實踐的專家訪談，當場記錄專業問題與建議，把兩個分組之間知識落差造成的資訊流失降到最低。這是針對一個多數團隊從未指明的問題所做的、有記錄的組織性修正。","realWorld":"Two things to assess here, and the parts work is the stronger. On reusability, this is close to a model contribution. Every part is codon-optimised for E. coli and BioBrick RFC#10 compatible, so adoption needs no re-synthesis. Each part description states its position in the pathway and what it hands to the next step, so the five degradation enzymes read as a sequence rather than five entries. The composite parts are quantified with the conditions stated (the reporter circuit over 0.001-10 mg/L; the pnpABCDE module at 87-95 percent removal from 10-500 micrograms per litre in 24 hours), which is what lets another team tell whether their own result matches. The dual-operon design is explained as a solution to a named general problem, transcription attenuation in long polycistronic mRNAs causing downstream genes to under-express, and offered as a transferable strategy for any long pathway, which is the difference between publishing a part and publishing a technique. Best of all, they chose to satisfy the Bronze contribution criterion properly: rather than registering another new part, they took an existing Registry entry, BBa_K5083099, and generated the characterisation data it was missing, a full temperature gradient (15, 20, 25, 30, 37 degrees C) crossed with culture time, plus growth curves of the lysis strain at 16, 25 and 37 degrees C, concluding with exactly the practical guidance a reuser needs: strong induction at 15-20 degrees C with low basal expression at 30-37, high GFP at 20 degrees C, and clear density collapse to about 0.11 OD at 16 degrees C by 12 hours. They also label their own evidence carefully, saying the lysis data 'preliminarily demonstrate' an association between lower temperature and decreased cell density rather than claiming proven containment. The 'Applications for Future iGEM Teams' section then spells out four concrete reuse routes: swap the reporter to port the sensor to a colorimetric or portable platform; reuse the degradation module or borrow the operon-splitting strategy for a different pathway; use the temperature-resolved data to design a cold suicide switch; or combine sensing and degradation modules via RFC#10 for an integrated monitor-and-remediate strain, which they built themselves as a demonstration. On the commercial side the work is competent but thinner than the parts work, though it does carry real unit economics: pricing anchored at 30-50 percent of the HPLC/GC-MS comprehensive per-test cost of 150-300 RMB, giving 150 RMB per kit (lyophilised strain tube, reaction buffer, operating manual), against a unit cost of 75 RMB falling to 45 RMB at scale, so gross margin runs 50 percent to about 70 percent; a five-year forecast from 500 to 15,000 kits with break-even in year three at roughly 4,000 kits and 600,000 RMB revenue; and a start-up need of about 450,000 RMB over years one and two. The SOM is built bottom-up from Guangdong's roughly 2.5 million hectares of arable land with its three assumptions stated (South China at about 20 percent of the national market, biosensor penetration at 5-8 percent, initial share 3-5 percent), landing at USD 2-4 million. Be blunt, though: there is no registered entity, no patent, no incubator place, no investor conversation and no letter of intent, the funding sources are listed as categories (iGEM grants, school research funding, angel or incubator seed money, supervisor channels) rather than named prospects, and the regulatory discussion is a risk category rather than a mapped approval route. The venture is a well-constructed plan on paper; the parts are a real, usable deliverable.","realWorld_zh":"這裡有兩件事要評估，而零件方面的工作是較強的一邊。在可重用性上，這接近一個典範式的貢獻。每個零件都針對 E. coli 做過密碼子最佳化，並相容於 BioBrick RFC#10，因此採用者不需重新合成。每個零件的描述都說明它在途徑中的位置，以及它交給下一步的是什麼，因此那五個降解酵素讀起來是一條序列，而不是五筆各自獨立的條目。複合零件都附上條件做了量化（報告迴路涵蓋 0.001-10 mg/L；pnpABCDE 模組在 10-500 微克每公升下 24 小時去除 87-95%），這正是讓別的團隊能判斷自己的結果是否相符的依據。雙操縱子設計被解釋為針對一個明確指名的通用問題的解法，即長的多順反子 mRNA 中的轉錄衰減會使下游基因表現不足，並作為適用於任何長途徑的可移轉策略提出，這正是發表一個零件與發表一種技術之間的差別。最值得一提的是，他們選擇以踏實的方式滿足銅牌的貢獻條件：不是再註冊一個新零件，而是取用 Registry 上既有的條目 BBa_K5083099，補上它所缺少的特性分析資料，包括完整的溫度梯度（15、20、25、30、37 度 C）與培養時間交叉，加上裂解菌株在 16、25 與 37 度 C 的生長曲線，最後給出的正是重用者需要的實用建議：在 15-20 度 C 有強誘導、在 30-37 度 C 基礎表現低，20 度 C 下 GFP 高，而在 16 度 C 下到 12 小時時菌體密度明顯崩落至約 0.11 OD。他們也謹慎標示自己的證據強度，說裂解資料「初步顯示」較低溫度與細胞密度下降之間存在關聯，而不是宣稱生物圍阻已獲證實。「Applications for Future iGEM Teams」一節接著寫明四條具體的重用路徑：更換報告基因，把感測器移植到比色或可攜式平台；重用降解模組，或為另一條途徑借用操縱子切分策略；利用隨溫度解析的資料設計低溫自殺開關；或透過 RFC#10 把感測與降解模組組合成一株整合監測與修復的菌株，而這一株他們自己也做出來作為示範。商業面的工作稱得上紮實，但比零件部分薄了一些，不過它確實帶有真實的單位經濟：定價錨定在 HPLC/GC-MS 每次檢測綜合成本人民幣 150-300 元的 30-50%，得出每套試劑組人民幣 150 元（凍乾菌株管、反應緩衝液、操作手冊），對應單位成本人民幣 75 元、規模化後降至 45 元，因此毛利率從 50% 到約 70%；五年預測從 500 套成長到 15,000 套，第三年在約 4,000 套、人民幣 60 萬元營收處損益兩平；第一、二年合計需要約人民幣 45 萬元的啟動資金。SOM 由下而上從廣東約 250 萬公頃耕地推算而來，三項假設都明講（華南約占全國市場 20%、生物感測器滲透率 5-8%、初期市占 3-5%），最後落在 200 萬至 400 萬美元。但話說白了：沒有登記的法人實體、沒有專利、沒有進駐育成中心、沒有與投資人談過、也沒有意向書；資金來源只列出類別（iGEM 補助、學校研究經費、天使或育成種子資金、指導老師管道）而非具名的對象，法規討論也只是一個風險類別，而不是一條已繪製出的核准路徑。這個創業案在紙上是一份架構良好的計畫；零件才是真正可用的交付成果。","partners":["Partner iGEM teams engaged through the P-E-A-F collaboration framework","Academic experts consulted in human practices (attended personally by the team captain)","Supervisor collaboration channels named as a prospective funding route"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6125/wiki/contribution/img1.avif","caption":"Supplementary characterisation of the existing Registry part BBa_K5083099: PCR confirmation of GFP, T4 Holin and T4 Lysozyme fragments, normalised pCspA activity across temperatures and times, and growth curves of the lysis strain","caption_zh":"對 Registry 既有零件 BBa_K5083099 的補充特性分析：GFP、T4 Holin 與 T4 Lysozyme 片段的 PCR 確認、不同溫度與時間下經正規化的 pCspA 活性，以及裂解菌株的生長曲線","credit":"Team Squirrel-Beijing, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6125/wiki/contribution/img2.avif","caption":"Time-resolved response of the pCspA cold-inducible promoter at five temperatures, the data a future team needs to choose an induction temperature","caption_zh":"pCspA 低溫誘導型啟動子在五種溫度下隨時間解析的反應，正是未來團隊挑選誘導溫度所需的資料","credit":"Team Squirrel-Beijing, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6125/wiki/contribution/img4.avif","caption":"The Preparation-Exchange-Action-Feedback (P-E-A-F) collaboration framework, published as a transferable method for cross-team work","caption_zh":"Preparation-Exchange-Action-Feedback（P-E-A-F）合作框架，作為可移轉的跨隊合作方法發表","credit":"Team Squirrel-Beijing, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6125/wiki/entrepreneurship/img1.avif","caption":"TAM-SAM-SOM market sizing, with the obtainable market built bottom-up from Guangdong arable hectarage and three stated penetration assumptions","caption_zh":"TAM-SAM-SOM 市場規模估算，其中可取得市場是由廣東耕地面積與三項明示的滲透率假設由下而上推算而來","credit":"Team Squirrel-Beijing, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Make one deliverable per project be characterisation data added to somebody else's existing part, chosen because that part lacked the numbers a user would need, and report it as a parameter sweep (temperature crossed with time, with all intermediate values shown) rather than a single demonstration. Then write an explicit 'Applications for Future Teams' section naming who could reuse each module and how, and keep a plain-language glossary whose entries state the limits of your own measurements, as theirs does for OD600.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"讓每個專案至少有一項交付成果是為別人既有的零件補上特性分析資料，而挑選那個零件的理由正是它缺少使用者會需要的數據；並以參數掃描的形式報告（溫度與時間交叉，所有中間值都呈現），而不是單一次示範。接著寫一節明確的「Applications for Future Teams」，指名每個模組可以被誰重用、如何重用；再維護一份白話詞彙表，其中的條目要說明自己量測的侷限，就像他們對 OD600 所做的那樣。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/squirrel-beijing/","https://2026.igem.wiki/squirrel-beijing/parts/","https://2026.igem.wiki/squirrel-beijing/contribution/","https://2026.igem.wiki/squirrel-beijing/entrepreneurship/"],"awards_zh":["最佳新複合元件 — 得主（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（氣候危機 / 保育 / 生物復育）"],"rank":33},"6133":{"team":"GreatBay-SCIE","id":"6133","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/greatbay-scie/","projectTitle":"Expelliodor — Expel the Odor, on Your Terms","projectTitle_zh":"Expelliodor — 除去體味，由你決定","tagline":"Three de novo designed proteins that stop axillary odour before it forms, without killing the skin microbiome.","tagline_zh":"三個從頭設計的蛋白質，在體味形成之前就阻斷它，同時不殺死皮膚微生物相。","summary":"Axillary odour arises when Staphylococcus hominis imports the odourless precursor Cys-Gly-3M3SH through the peptide transporter PepTSh and converts it to 3M3SH. Rather than killing skin bacteria, GreatBay-SCIE attacked the uptake step three ways: a de novo small-molecule binding protein that sequesters the precursor, a de novo protein binder designed to lock PepTSh in its inward-facing conformation, and a cyclodextrin glucanotransferase engineered to glycosylate the precursor so the transporter no longer recognises it. This is the most sophisticated de novo protein design campaign of any high school team in the cohort — RFdiffusion3, Proteina-Complexa, ProteinMPNN, RoseTTAFold3 co-folding, 50-ns MD with MM/GBSA, and SPURS-guided thermostability engineering — organised around two frameworks they invented: a Characterize stage prepended to DBTL, and a funnel-shaped decision-gated workflow that spends expensive methods only on candidates that survive cheap ones. Nine precursor binders and five transporter binders were actually tested in vitro, with 4 of 9 and 4 of 5 significantly reducing 3M3SH.","summary_zh":"腋下體味的成因是 Staphylococcus hominis 透過胜肽運輸蛋白 PepTSh 把無味的前驅物 Cys-Gly-3M3SH 送進細胞，再轉換成 3M3SH。GreatBay-SCIE 沒有選擇殺死皮膚細菌，而是從三個方向攻擊這個攝入步驟：一個從頭設計的小分子結合蛋白把前驅物隔離起來、一個從頭設計的蛋白質結合子把 PepTSh 鎖在朝內的構形、以及一個經改造的環糊精葡萄糖轉移酶（CGTase）為前驅物加上糖基，使運輸蛋白不再認得它。這是本屆所有高中隊伍中最精巧的從頭蛋白質設計工作——RFdiffusion3、Proteina-Complexa、ProteinMPNN、RoseTTAFold3 共折疊、搭配 MM/GBSA 的 50 ns 分子動力學，以及由 SPURS 指引的熱穩定性工程——並圍繞他們自創的兩套框架組織起來：在 DBTL 之前加上一個 Characterize（特性描述）階段，以及一條漏斗狀、設有決策關卡的流程，讓昂貴的方法只花在通過便宜方法篩選的候選上。實際進入體外測試的有九個前驅物結合子與五個運輸蛋白結合子，其中 9 個中有 4 個、5 個中有 4 個顯著降低了 3M3SH。","awards":["Best Model — Nominee (High School)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (High School)","Inclusivity Award — Winner (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Agriculture / Food & Nutrition / Fashion & Cosmetics / Art & Design)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Two methodological contributions frame everything. The CHARACTERIZE-DBTL framework inserts a stage before Design with four substages — Problem Definition (what the design must achieve, in what context, with what intervention points), Target Definition (the exact molecule, protein, conformational state, interface or reaction to engineer, with boundaries), Mechanistic Characterization (assess the plausibility of the proposed mechanism against experimental, structural and computational evidence), and Design Specification (translate all of that into explicit requirements that become the literal inputs to the design tool). The DECISION-GATED WORKFLOW is a funnel in which each successive evaluation is more expensive than the last, so a large generated set is cut by cheap co-folding metrics before anything reaches molecular dynamics and only a handful reach the bench — explicitly chosen because they are a high school team with limited wet-lab resources. The Characterize stage paid off concretely in each of the three routes. For the PRECURSOR BINDER, characterisation established that 3M3SH exists as two stereoisomers with different smells, that the sweat-and-onion-like (S) form is the odour-relevant one, and that deep-learning design tools frequently introduce stereochemical errors — so the design specification became 'use Cys-Gly-(S)-3M3SH with explicitly defined stereochemistry as input and verify ligand chirality after structure generation before any candidate advances'. Two independent design routes were run in parallel for comparison: RFdiffusion3 (via Rosetta Foundry, with ProteinMPNN sequence redesign and RoseTTAFold3 co-folding validation, ranked by RF3's own ranking_score) and Proteina-Complexa (a partially-latent flow-matching model, ranked by a custom composite score). Top binders from each route went to 50-ns MD scored on ligand RMSD and MM/GBSA binding free energy. For the TRANSPORTER BINDER, characterisation drew on published MD showing that the inward-to-outward transition is the rate-limiting step of PepTSh's transport cycle, so stabilising the inward-facing state should block transport; they took the experimental inward-facing crystal structure (PDB 6EXS), built an outward-facing homology model in SWISS-MODEL, and compared them to find extracellular electrostatic networks (K64-E323, and the R184/D182/E340/R337 cluster) and hydrophobic patches present only in the inward-facing state — those became the target interface, with a specification of an 80-120 residue binder and a preference for compact designs to improve accessibility through a Gram-positive cell wall. Design was RFdiffusion3 backbone generation, ProteinMPNN sequence design, RF3 co-folding, interface-placement filtering, then a composite score of 0.50 x normalised ranking score + 0.25 x normalised pLDDT + 0.25 x normalised inverse PAE, then MD. For CGTase, characterisation enumerated the three modifiable groups on the precursor (amino, carboxyl, hydroxyl) and selected reactions by compatibility with the actual application environment — mildly acidic human skin with no external supply of ATP or NADH — which ruled out cofactor-dependent chemistry and left hydroxyl transglycosylation by CGTase; molecular docking from the 1CXL template with cluster analysis of poses, followed by MD of the wild-type complex, showed the non-native substrate stays stably accommodated in the catalytic pocket and identified which interactions were weak (around the carboxylate group and the hydrophobic tail), which became the rational-design targets for nine point mutants, each re-evaluated by MD. Two further optimisation campaigns followed: CGTase thermostability via SPURS (an AI stability predictor) after excluding conserved, ligand-binding and calcium-coordinating residues, with FireProt-style pairwise compatibility filtering and a diversity-preserving beam search assembling multi-point mutants at depths of 2, 4, 6 and 8 substitutions; and precursor-binder affinity via an adapted LASErMPNN neural-proofreading strategy, saturating point mutations within 5 Angstrom of the ligand, averaging probabilities across decoding orders and dropout to reduce sensitivity to individual predictions, ranking by delta-NLL = ln[P(a)/P(b)], and filtering out buried polar residues introduced without a suitable hydrogen bond.","frameworks_zh":"兩項方法論貢獻框定了全部工作。CHARACTERIZE-DBTL 框架在 Design 之前插入一個階段，內含四個子階段——問題界定（設計必須達成什麼、在什麼情境下、有哪些可介入的切入點）、標的界定（要工程改造的確切分子、蛋白質、構形狀態、介面或反應，並劃出邊界）、機制特性描述（依實驗、結構與運算證據評估所提機制的合理性），以及設計規格（把上述一切轉譯為明確要求，直接成為設計工具的輸入）。DECISION-GATED WORKFLOW（設有決策關卡的流程）則是一個漏斗，其中每一道後續評估都比前一道更昂貴，因此一大批生成結果先被便宜的共折疊指標篩掉，之後才有東西進入分子動力學，最後只有少數幾個上實驗檯——他們明白說這是因為自己是濕實驗資源有限的高中隊伍。Characterize 階段在三條路線上都帶來具體收穫。在前驅物結合子方面，特性描述確立了 3M3SH 以兩種氣味不同的立體異構物存在，其中帶汗味與洋蔥味的 (S) 型才是與體味相關的那一種，而深度學習設計工具經常引入立體化學錯誤——因此設計規格就寫成「以立體化學明確定義的 Cys-Gly-(S)-3M3SH 作為輸入，並在結構生成後、任何候選晉級之前，先驗證配體掌性」。他們並行跑了兩條獨立的設計路線以作比較：RFdiffusion3（經由 Rosetta Foundry，以 ProteinMPNN 重新設計序列、以 RoseTTAFold3 共折疊驗證，並依 RF3 自身的 ranking_score 排序）與 Proteina-Complexa（一個部分潛在的流匹配模型，依自訂的複合分數排序）。兩條路線中最佳的結合子都進入 50 ns 分子動力學，以配體 RMSD 與 MM/GBSA 結合自由能評分。在運輸蛋白結合子方面，特性描述引用已發表的分子動力學研究，顯示由內向外的轉換是 PepTSh 運輸循環的速率決定步驟，因此穩定住朝內狀態應可阻斷運輸；他們取用實驗測得的朝內晶體結構（PDB 6EXS），在 SWISS-MODEL 中建出朝外的同源模型，兩者相比以找出只在朝內狀態存在的胞外靜電網絡（K64-E323，以及 R184/D182/E340/R337 這組）與疏水區塊——這些就成了標的介面，規格則訂為 80-120 個殘基的結合子，並偏好結構緊緻的設計，以提升穿過革蘭氏陽性細胞壁的可及性。設計流程為 RFdiffusion3 生成骨架、ProteinMPNN 設計序列、RF3 共折疊、介面位置過濾，再以 0.50 x 標準化 ranking score + 0.25 x 標準化 pLDDT + 0.25 x 標準化 PAE 倒數的複合分數排序，最後進入分子動力學。在 CGTase 方面，特性描述列舉了前驅物上三個可修飾的官能基（胺基、羧基、羥基），並依與實際應用環境的相容性來挑選反應——弱酸性的人體皮膚，沒有外來的 ATP 或 NADH 供應——這排除了需要輔因子的化學反應，剩下由 CGTase 進行的羥基轉糖基化；以 1CXL 為模板的分子對接並對結合姿態做群聚分析，接著對野生型複合物做分子動力學，顯示這個非天然受質能穩定地容納在催化口袋中，也指出哪些交互作用較弱（羧酸根附近與疏水尾端），這些就成了九個點突變體的理性設計標的，每一個都再以分子動力學重新評估。之後還有兩輪最佳化：CGTase 的熱穩定性以 SPURS（一個 AI 穩定性預測模型）進行，先排除保守殘基、配體結合殘基與配位鈣離子的殘基，再以 FireProt 式的兩兩相容性過濾，並用保留多樣性的 beam search 在 2、4、6、8 個取代的深度上組裝多點突變體；前驅物結合子的親和力則以改寫過的 LASErMPNN 神經網絡校讀策略進行，對配體 5 埃以內的位點做飽和點突變，跨不同解碼順序與 dropout 平均機率以降低對單一預測的敏感度，依 delta-NLL = ln[P(a)/P(b)] 排序，並濾掉那些被引入卻沒有合適氫鍵的埋藏極性殘基。","dataviz":"Structural figures are used as arguments rather than decoration. The inward- versus outward-facing PepTSh comparison is drawn as four aligned panels — the inward structure, a close-up of its intact electrostatic network with dashed contacts and named residues, the outward homology model, and the same close-up showing those contacts broken — so the reader can see for themselves why the inward state is the one worth stabilising, with consistent colouring (green C-terminal bundle, blue N-terminal bundle, orange TMA/TMB) carried across every panel. The target interface is then shown three ways: the region highlighted on the whole structure, a side view with the extracellular direction arrowed, and a close-up with hotspot residues in orange bordering a green hydrophobic patch. The Characterize stage and the funnel-shaped decision-gated workflow are each drawn as schematics, the funnel visibly narrowing through each evaluation gate. MD trajectories are embedded as videos for all three systems. Most valuable of all, Figures 7 and 11 plot computational metric against experimental outcome — A412 signal reduction, calculated as 100 x (1 - mean binder A412 / mean control A412) — with each tested binder as a point, OLS regression lines, and both Pearson r and Spearman rho reported, separately for the two design routes. Every caption gives the n (n = 4 for RFdiffusion3, n = 5 for Proteina-Complexa and for transporter binders) and the full composite-score formula with its weights written out, so the figure can be re-derived. Assay figures carry error bars (+/- SD, n = 3) with significance asterisks defined.","dataviz_zh":"結構圖是當成論證使用、不是裝飾。朝內與朝外的 PepTSh 比較畫成四張對齊的面板——朝內結構、其完整靜電網絡的特寫（虛線標示接觸、並標出殘基名稱）、朝外的同源模型，以及同一區域顯示那些接觸已斷開的特寫——讓讀者自己看出為什麼朝內狀態才是值得穩定的那一個；配色（綠色 C 端束、藍色 N 端束、橘色 TMA/TMB）在每張面板間保持一致。標的介面接著以三種方式呈現：在整體結構上標出該區域、一張以箭頭標示胞外方向的側視圖，以及一張特寫，圖中橘色的熱點殘基圍繞著綠色的疏水區塊。Characterize 階段與漏斗狀的決策關卡流程各畫成一張示意圖，漏斗明顯隨每道評估關卡收窄。三套系統的分子動力學軌跡都以影片內嵌。最有價值的是圖 7 與圖 11，把運算指標對實驗結果作圖——A412 訊號降幅，計算方式為 100 x (1 - 結合子 A412 平均值 / 對照 A412 平均值)——每個受測結合子為一個點，附 OLS 迴歸線，並同時報告 Pearson r 與 Spearman rho，兩條設計路線分開呈現。每則圖說都給出 n 值（RFdiffusion3 為 n = 4，Proteina-Complexa 與運輸蛋白結合子為 n = 5），並把完整的複合分數公式連同權重寫出來，使圖可以被重新推導。試驗圖都帶誤差棒（+/- SD，n = 3）並定義顯著性星號。","datascience":"The genuinely unusual thing here is that the team treat their own scoring metrics as hypotheses to be tested against wet-lab data, and publish the result honestly even when it undermines them. Of 22 planned binders (11 per design tool), 9 were tested; 4 of 9 significantly reduced 3M3SH production, and 4 of 5 transporter binders did, with a maximum 21% reduction. Correlating metric against outcome gave a route-dependent answer: in the RFdiffusion3 branch the interface metrics agreed with experiment and all three MD metrics (MM/GBSA delta-G, and the mean and SD of ligand RMSD over 10-50 ns) showed the expected trend, while in the Proteina-Complexa branch the custom composite score correlated best (Pearson r = 0.76, Spearman rho = 0.60) but the MD metrics did NOT agree — and the team propose a specific mechanistic reason, that RF3 (a diffusion model, like RoseTTAFold3) may predict Proteina-Complexa outputs (partially latent flow matching) less accurately, so ligand RMSD may partly measure relaxation of a poor predicted pose rather than true instability. For the transporter binders they draw the sharper statistical lesson: 'in a filtered set of candidates, a single metric may have too little variation to support confident prediction of actual experimental performance' — i.e. gating on a metric destroys the variance you would need to validate it. They state plainly that the small candidate set 'cannot establish statistically significant relationships', that the results 'cannot concretely verify the usefulness of the single metrics and the weighted metrics we set', and they name the fixes: more independent MD runs, explicit entropy correction, an implicit membrane model in the free-energy calculation, a second folding tool such as AlphaFold, and larger datasets to recalibrate weights. The thermostability work produced a real, interpretable result in both directions: for the T370R/F183W parent, WR2, WR4 and WR8 all improved over the parent with WR8 best, suggesting SPURS (trained on pairwise mutagenesis data) can learn patterns that extrapolate to multi-point mutants and that the design introduced beneficial epistasis; but for the T370K parent only KR2 improved and the higher-order mutants did not, which the team diagnose as the beam search's path dependence — an ineffective mutation introduced at depth 4 is inherited by every deeper mutant. They are equally candid about build failures: the intended T370K mutant came back as T370L, so only T370R/F183W was tested as designed and the rational-design hypothesis is 'not fully verified because of the limited dataset'.","datascience_zh":"此處真正不尋常之處在於，團隊把自己的評分指標當成有待用濕實驗資料檢驗的假說，並在結果不利於自己時也誠實公開。原計畫 22 個結合子（每套設計工具 11 個）中有 9 個受測；9 個中有 4 個顯著降低 3M3SH 生成，運輸蛋白結合子則是 5 個中有 4 個，最大降幅 21%。把指標對結果做相關分析，答案隨路線而異：在 RFdiffusion3 這一支，介面指標與實驗一致，三個分子動力學指標（MM/GBSA 的 delta-G，以及 10-50 ns 間配體 RMSD 的平均值與標準差）都呈現預期趨勢；而在 Proteina-Complexa 這一支，自訂的複合分數相關性最好（Pearson r = 0.76、Spearman rho = 0.60），但分子動力學指標卻不一致——團隊並提出一個具體的機制性解釋：RF3（與 RoseTTAFold3 一樣是擴散模型）對 Proteina-Complexa（部分潛在的流匹配）的輸出可能預測得較不準，因此配體 RMSD 有部分可能量到的是一個不佳預測姿態的鬆弛過程、而非真正的不穩定。對運輸蛋白結合子，他們提出了更鋭利的統計教訓：「在一組已被篩選過的候選中，單一指標的變異量可能太小，不足以支撐對實際實驗表現的可信預測」——也就是說，拿某個指標當關卡篩選，會毀掉你驗證它所需的變異量。他們直白說明候選集太小「無法建立具統計顯著性的關係」、結果「無法確實驗證我們所設定的單一指標與加權指標是否有用」，並點名修正方向：更多次獨立的分子動力學、明確的熵修正、在自由能計算中加入隱式膜模型、第二個折疊工具（例如 AlphaFold），以及更大的資料集以重新校準權重。熱穩定性這部分在兩個方向上都得出真實且可解讀的結果：以 T370R/F183W 為親本時，WR2、WR4 與 WR8 都優於親本、WR8 最佳，顯示 SPURS（以兩兩突變資料訓練）可以學到能外推到多點突變體的規律，也顯示該設計引入了有益的上位效應；但以 T370K 為親本時只有 KR2 改善，更高階的突變體則沒有，團隊診斷這是 beam search 的路徑依賴性——在深度 4 引入的一個無效突變，會被每一個更深的突變體繼承。他們對構築失敗同樣坦白：原本要做的 T370K 突變體回來時變成 T370L，因此只有 T370R/F183W 是依設計受測，理性設計的假說「因資料集有限而未完全驗證」。","software":"FoundryUI, a node-based visual programming workbench for de novo protein design, explicitly inspired by ComfyUI (and by Blender and GameMaker as precedents for making technical workflows accessible). It wraps four Rosetta Foundry tools — RFdiffusion3, RoseTTAFold3, ProteinMPNN and LigandMPNN — as connectable nodes for input, generation, sequence redesign, folding, filtering, visualisation and saving, with typed connections that refuse incompatible links, 3D selectors so residues and atoms can be picked directly off a structure in the GUI rather than typed as indices, and sessions and runs so results survive a dropped connection. It ships pre-built workflows for ligand-binder design, protein-binder design, enzyme design, MPNN sequence design and folding prediction, and reads and writes PDB, FASTA, mmCIF, SMILES, JSON and CSV so outputs stay usable elsewhere. The stated motivation is collaboration as much as accessibility: a command line does not show why a step was chosen or how data moved between stages, whereas a graph does — making a workflow easier to explain, modify and hand to the next team. They tested it by teaching it: FoundryUI was used in a school club education activity so students could approach protein modelling through biological decisions instead of commands. All automation scripts are uploaded as reusable workflows for future iGEM teams.","software_zh":"FoundryUI 是一套以節點為基礎的視覺化程式設計工作台，用於從頭蛋白質設計，明確受 ComfyUI 啟發（並以 Blender 與 GameMaker 作為把技術流程變得平易近人的先例）。它把 Rosetta Foundry 的四個工具——RFdiffusion3、RoseTTAFold3、ProteinMPNN 與 LigandMPNN——包裝成可互連的節點，涵蓋輸入、生成、序列重新設計、折疊、過濾、視覺化與儲存，連接有型別、會拒絕不相容的連線；並提供 3D 選取器，讓殘基與原子可以直接在介面上從結構點選、而不必以索引輸入；還有工作階段與執行紀錄，使結果在連線中斷後仍然保留。它內附預建的工作流程，涵蓋配體結合子設計、蛋白質結合子設計、酵素設計、MPNN 序列設計與折疊預測，並可讀寫 PDB、FASTA、mmCIF、SMILES、JSON 與 CSV，讓輸出在別處仍然可用。他們聲明的動機中，協作與易用性同樣重要：命令列不會顯示某一步為何被選擇、資料如何在各階段之間流動，而一張流程圖會——這讓工作流程更容易解釋、修改並交給下一屆隊伍。他們用教學來測試它：FoundryUI 被用在校內社團的教育活動中，讓學生能透過生物學上的決策、而不是透過指令來接觸蛋白質建模。所有自動化腳本都以可重複使用的工作流程上傳，供未來的 iGEM 隊伍取用。","stack":["RFdiffusion3","Proteina-Complexa","ProteinMPNN","LigandMPNN","RoseTTAFold3","Rosetta Foundry","SPURS","LASErMPNN","SWISS-MODEL","molecular dynamics with MM/GBSA","molecular docking with pose clustering","FoundryUI (own software)","Python automation scripts"],"techniques":["de novo small-molecule binder design","de novo protein-protein binder design","inverse folding / sequence design","co-folding structure validation (pLDDT, PAE, ipSAE)","stereochemistry verification of generated ligands","conformational-state-selective targeting (inward vs outward transporter state)","homology modelling for comparative structure analysis","interface hotspot and hydrophobic patch identification","molecular docking with hierarchical pose clustering","50-ns molecular dynamics simulation","MM/GBSA binding free energy estimation","ligand RMSD stability analysis","rational enzyme active-site redesign","AI stability prediction (SPURS)","FireProt-style pairwise epistasis compatibility filtering","diverse beam search for multi-point mutant assembly","neural proofreading with delta-NLL ranking and decoding-order averaging","composite multi-metric scoring with explicit weights","decision-gated resource-aware candidate funnelling","metric-versus-experiment correlation analysis (Pearson and Spearman)","epistasis analysis across mutation depth","Ellman's assay quantification of thiol product"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Inclusivity Award winner, and the work is built on a framework (LIFT+: Learn, Intervene, Feedback, Transfer, Beyond) with six named target groups reachable in China who face barriers to synthetic biology — the blind community, the Deaf community, children on the autism spectrum, people from low socioeconomic backgrounds, modelling beginners, and older adults with limited formal education. Each group is introduced by a real scientist from that community paired with a sourced statistic: Wanda Diaz Merced, the blind astrophysicist who pioneered sonification of astronomical data, alongside the finding that only 2.1% of blind children globally have access to specialised education services; Temple Grandin alongside the 14.95% four-year-college enrolment rate for individuals with autism; Derek Braun, the deaf geneticist who built Gallaudet's first molecular genetics laboratory, alongside the ~80% of school-age deaf children out of school in low- and middle-income countries; Gabriel Reyes, founder of FLi Sci, alongside OECD data that 37% of disadvantaged students are low performers in science versus 12% of advantaged; and Jia Lanpo, the Zhoukoudian paleoanthropologist who had only a high school education, alongside the 17-point generational gap in tertiary education between adults aged 55-64 and 25-34. Deliverables include 20 tactile biology graphics covering 20 topics across 5 categories for the blind community, and — connecting directly to their dry lab — FoundryUI used as the teaching vehicle for computational protein design beginners. The page itself has an interactive animated version and a text-based alternative, which is the inclusivity principle applied to their own wiki.","publicEngagement_zh":"本隊獲包容性獎，整套工作建立在一個框架（LIFT+：Learn、Intervene、Feedback、Transfer、Beyond）之上，並指名六個在中國可觸及、且在接觸合成生物學時面臨障礙的對象群體——盲人社群、聽障社群、自閉症譜系兒童、社會經濟弱勢者、建模初學者，以及受正式教育有限的年長者。每個群體都由一位出身該社群的真實科學家開場，並搭配一項有出處的統計數據：Wanda Diaz Merced，開創以聲音化呈現天文資料的盲人天文物理學家，對應的數據是全球僅 2.1% 的盲童能取得特殊教育服務；Temple Grandin，對應自閉症者四年制大學的 14.95% 入學率；Derek Braun，建立 Gallaudet 第一座分子遺傳學實驗室的聽障遺傳學家，對應中低所得國家約 80% 學齡聽障兒童未就學；FLi Sci 創辦人 Gabriel Reyes，對應 OECD 資料中弱勢學生有 37% 的科學表現落後、優勢學生則為 12%；以及只受過高中教育的周口店古人類學家賈蘭坡，對應 55-64 歲與 25-34 歲成人在高等教育上 17 個百分點的世代落差。成果包括為盲人社群製作的 20 張觸覺生物學圖、涵蓋 5 大類 20 個主題，以及——直接與其乾實驗相連——以 FoundryUI 作為運算蛋白質設計初學者的教學載體。該頁面本身同時提供互動動畫版與純文字替代版，這正是把包容性原則套用在自己的 wiki 上。","ihp":"46 stakeholder interactions across local and international surveys, potential-customer interviews, expert discussions, industry meetings, written proposals and community seminars, organised into a five-stage framework with stakeholders classified into four groups by how they affect the team and how the team affects them, plus a closing 'Feedback to Future' section that explains how they decided which feedback to prioritise and revisited stakeholders to reflect. The clearest evidence that the integration was real is that it changed the project's own name: they started with 'Expelliodor — Expel the Odor', then, prompted by social scientists on stigma, asked whether 'expel' implied that odour is something everyone should eliminate, and why axillary odour should be judged differently from hair or eye colour. They concluded that underarm odour is a natural physiological trait rather than a flaw to be corrected and that managing it should be a matter of choice, and changed the slogan to 'Expel the Odor, on Your Terms' — keeping the scientific goal while adding personal autonomy. Medical experts pushed safety, industry professionals pushed real-world feasibility, and the whole design philosophy of not broadly suppressing skin bacteria or blocking sweat glands follows from that engagement.","ihp_zh":"46 次利害關係人互動，涵蓋本地與國際問卷、潛在客戶訪談、專家討論、產業會議、書面提案與社群講座，組織成一套五階段框架，並依「他們如何影響團隊」與「團隊如何影響他們」把利害關係人分成四類，最後附一個「Feedback to Future」段落，說明他們如何決定要優先處理哪些意見，以及如何回頭再找利害關係人反思。整合確實發生過的最明確證據是，它改了專題自己的名字：他們一開始用「Expelliodor — Expel the Odor」，之後在社會科學研究者就汙名化提問的促使下，自問「expel（除去）」是否暗示體味是每個人都該消除的東西，以及為什麼腋下體味要被用和髮色或眼睛顏色不同的標準評價。他們的結論是，腋下體味是自然的生理特徵、不是待矯正的缺陷，要不要處理它應該是個人選擇，於是把標語改成「Expel the Odor, on Your Terms」——保留科學目標，同時加上個人自主。醫學專家推動安全性，產業人士推動實際可行性，而整個「不廣泛抑制皮膚細菌、不阻塞汗腺」的設計哲學，正是從這些交流而來。","realWorld":"The entrepreneurship case is grounded in population genetics rather than vague market size: the ABCC11 odour-associated allele occurs at roughly 99.99% in African, 97.48% in European, 96.05% in Oceanian, 92.42% in American, 62.22% in Southern Asian and 21.54% in Eastern Asian populations, so even in East Asia where it is least common the absolute population means tens of millions may be affected — and limited public awareness compounds misunderstanding, stigma and discrimination. The team position Expelliodor against the actual failure modes of existing products (masking fragrances, aluminium-salt antiperspirants that suppress perspiration, and broad antibacterials that disturb the axillary microbiome) and argue their three strategies are complementary in time: the precursor binder captures what is already there, CGTase continuously modifies newly secreted precursor, and the transporter binder blocks uptake. CGTase thermostability optimisation was undertaken specifically for industrial production and transportation, which is why heat resistance during storage was a design objective at all.","realWorld_zh":"創業論證建立在族群遺傳學上、而不是模糊的市場規模：與體味相關的 ABCC11 等位基因在非洲族群出現率約 99.99%，歐洲 97.48%、大洋洲 96.05%、美洲 92.42%、南亞 62.22%、東亞 21.54%，因此即使在出現率最低的東亞，以絕對人口計仍可能有數千萬人受影響——而公眾認知不足又加劇了誤解、汙名與歧視。團隊把 Expelliodor 對照既有產品真正的失效模式來定位（以香味遮蓋、以鋁鹽止汗劑抑制排汗、以廣效抗菌劑擾亂腋下微生物相），並主張他們的三套策略在時間上互補：前驅物結合子捕捉已經存在的前驅物、CGTase 持續修飾新分泌的前驅物、運輸蛋白結合子則阻斷攝入。CGTase 的熱穩定性最佳化是專為工業生產與運輸而做，這也是儲存期間的耐熱性之所以成為設計目標的原因。","partners":["GreatBay-SCIE (Shenzhen College of International Education)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6133/wiki/drylab/model/overview-fig3.avif","caption":"The funnel-shaped decision-gated workflow: successive evaluation gates remove designs from a large generated space until a small testing set remains, with each gate more computationally expensive than the last. Designed explicitly so a high school team with limited wet-lab resources spends molecular dynamics time only on candidates that already survived cheap co-folding filters.","caption_zh":"漏斗狀的決策關卡流程：一道道評估關卡把設計從龐大的生成空間中逐步剔除，直到剩下一小組進入測試，而每一道關卡的運算成本都比前一道更高。這是刻意設計的，讓一支濕實驗資源有限的高中隊伍只把分子動力學的時間花在已通過便宜共折疊過濾的候選上。","credit":"Team GreatBay-SCIE, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6133/wiki/drylab/model/overview-fig6a-u.avif","caption":"Four RFdiffusion3 precursor binders plotted as computational metric against measured A412 signal reduction, with MM/GBSA binding free energy and both the mean and the standard deviation of MD ligand RMSD over 10-50 ns. All three MD metrics showed the expected trend in this branch — while the same metrics failed in the Proteina-Complexa branch, which the team report and explain rather than omit.","caption_zh":"四個 RFdiffusion3 前驅物結合子，以運算指標對實測 A412 訊號降幅作圖，指標包括 MM/GBSA 結合自由能，以及 10-50 ns 間分子動力學配體 RMSD 的平均值與標準差。在這一支中三個分子動力學指標都呈現預期趨勢——而同樣的指標在 Proteina-Complexa 那一支則失效，團隊選擇把這點報出並加以解釋，而非略過。","credit":"Team GreatBay-SCIE, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6133/wiki/drylab/model/overview-fig8b.avif","caption":"Close-up of the inward-facing PepTSh transporter (PDB 6EXS) showing the extracellular electrostatic network as dashed contacts linking K64 to E323 and connecting R184, D182, E340 and R337. Comparing this against the same region in an outward-facing homology model, where those contacts are broken, is what defined the binder's target interface.","caption_zh":"朝內構形的 PepTSh 運輸蛋白（PDB 6EXS）特寫，以虛線接觸顯示胞外靜電網絡，連結 K64 與 E323，並串起 R184、D182、E340 與 R337。把這張圖與朝外同源模型中同一區域（那些接觸已斷開）相比，正是界定結合子標的介面的依據。","credit":"Team GreatBay-SCIE, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6133/wiki/drylab/model/overview-fig9c.avif","caption":"The selected target interface on the extracellular surface of PepTSh: orange hotspot residues bordering a green hydrophobic patch on the blue extracellular face. These features exist only in the inward-facing conformation, so a binder that holds them is designed to block the inward-to-outward transition that published molecular dynamics identified as the rate-limiting step of transport.","caption_zh":"選定的標的介面位於 PepTSh 的胞外表面：藍色胞外面上，橘色的熱點殘基圍繞著綠色的疏水區塊。這些特徵只存在於朝內構形，因此一個能抓住它們的結合子，設計上即是要阻斷已發表分子動力學所指出的速率決定步驟——由內向外的轉換。","credit":"Team GreatBay-SCIE, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Add a Characterize stage before Design: write down the biological mechanism, the exact target and the application environment, and turn them into an explicit design specification that becomes the literal input to your tool — GreatBay's specification to use the (S) stereoisomer and verify chirality after generation prevented a whole class of silent AI-design error. Then plot every computational score you used against the wet-lab outcome and report the correlation, including the honest finding that gating on a metric removes the variance you would need to validate it.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"在 Design 之前加上一個 Characterize 階段：把生物機制、精確標的與應用環境寫下來，並轉成一份明確的設計規格，讓它直接成為工具的輸入——GreatBay 在規格中規定使用 (S) 立體異構物、並在生成後驗證掌性，這一步就擋掉了一整類無聲無息的 AI 設計錯誤。接著把你用過的每一個運算指標對濕實驗結果作圖、報告相關性，連同那個誠實的發現也一併報出：拿某個指標當關卡篩選，會把你驗證該指標所需的變異量給消掉。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/greatbay-scie/","https://2026.igem.wiki/greatbay-scie/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/greatbay-scie/software/","https://2026.igem.wiki/greatbay-scie/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/greatbay-scie/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/greatbay-scie/measurement/","https://2026.igem.wiki/greatbay-scie/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/greatbay-scie/inclusivity/","https://2026.igem.wiki/greatbay-scie/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/greatbay-scie/entrepreneurship/"],"awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（高中組）","包容性獎 — 得主（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（農業 / 食品與營養 / 時尚與美妝 / 藝術與設計）"],"rank":47},"6145":{"team":"MIT-MAHE","id":"6145","section":"Undergrad","country":"India","village":"Food & Agriculture / Manufacturing","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/mit-mahe/","projectTitle":"MAHEK","projectTitle_zh":"MAHEK","tagline":"Sustainable cuminaldehyde from Pseudomonas putida, and NetFlux, a web tool that turns a genome-scale metabolic model into a drawable pathway and a ranked list of knockouts.","tagline_zh":"用 Pseudomonas putida 永續生產枯茗醛，並開發 NetFlux——一個把基因組尺度代謝模型化成可繪製路徑與剔除策略排序清單的網頁工具。","summary":"MAHEK addresses the fragrance industry's dependence on petrochemical synthesis and wasteful seed extraction by producing cuminaldehyde biologically. The chassis is Pseudomonas putida F1, a solvent-tolerant soil bacterium that already makes cuminaldehyde as an intermediate in p-cymene degradation; CRISPR-Cas9-mediated homologous recombination knocks out cymC, the p-cumic aldehyde dehydrogenase, arresting the pathway exactly at the target compound. The dry lab's deliverable is NetFlux, a React + FastAPI web application that compresses a genome-scale metabolic model into a readable 'production corridor' using a novel extraction algorithm (SCOPE) and then pools OptKnock and OptForce into one co-ranked list of knockout and regulation strategies, each traced to the gene and linked to BiGG. The team also won the Inclusivity Award for work with visually impaired learners that ended in Vision Empower adopting their tactile models for use in schools across India.","summary_zh":"MAHEK 針對香料產業依賴石化合成、以及種子萃取耗費資源的問題，改以生物方式生產枯茗醛（cuminaldehyde）。宿主是 Pseudomonas putida F1，一株耐溶劑的土壤細菌，它在 p-cymene 降解途徑中本來就會產生枯茗醛作為中間產物；以 CRISPR-Cas9 介導的同源重組剔除 cymC（p-cumic 醛脫氫酶），讓途徑恰好停在目標化合物。乾實驗的交付成果是 NetFlux，一個 React + FastAPI 的網頁應用程式，它以自創的擷取演算法（SCOPE）把基因組尺度代謝模型壓縮成一條可讀的「生產走廊」，再把 OptKnock 與 OptForce 的結果匯整成單一的共同排序清單，列出剔除與調控策略，每一項都追溯到對應基因並連結到 BiGG。該隊也以針對視障學習者的工作獲得包容性獎，成果是 Vision Empower 採用了他們的觸覺模型，用於印度各地的學校。","awards":["Best Software — Nominee (Undergrad)","Inclusivity Award — Winner (Undergrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"React + TypeScript single-page frontend split into three modules (parameter panel, pathway map viewer, interventions table) sharing one run state; FastAPI backend with Pydantic request/response schemas, auto-generated OpenAPI 3.1 documentation and a Swagger UI at /docs; a JobManager running strain design on a bounded background worker pool so heavy requests do not time out; SQLite (mfghub.db) as the model/reaction/metabolite/gene/medium catalogue, rebuilt from the GEMs on every server image build; and Docker Compose bringing up database, API and web client together. Core science runs on COBRApy.","frameworks_zh":"React + TypeScript 的單頁前端分成三個模組（參數面板、路徑圖檢視器、干預策略表格），共用同一份執行狀態；FastAPI 後端採 Pydantic 的請求／回應結構，自動生成 OpenAPI 3.1 文件並在 /docs 提供 Swagger UI；以 JobManager 在有上限的背景工作者池上執行菌株設計，避免繁重的請求逾時；以 SQLite（mfghub.db）作為模型／反應／代謝物／基因／培養基的目錄，每次建置伺服器映像時都由 GEM 重新產生；並以 Docker Compose 一次啟動資料庫、API 與網頁用戶端。核心科學運算跑在 COBRApy 上。","dataviz":"Pathways are drawn as interactive metabolic maps flowing strictly left to right, with line width proportional to mass flow, metabolites as nodes carrying compartment suffixes, reactions as arrows colour-coded by their FVA annotation, and the substrate-to-target corridor explicitly highlighted. Hovering a reaction opens an inspection card with reaction name and ID, knockout-candidate status, flux and FVA range, coupling and bounds, subsystem, gene associations and gene rules, and its producers and consumers. Each click of Generate opens its parameters in a new tab so settings can be compared side by side. Results export as GraphML, JSON and CSV straight from the browser. The interventions table shows a baseline header (wild-type growth rate, yield floor and ceiling) against which every ranked design is judged, and separates committed 'Ranked Designs' from weaker single-reaction 'Hypotheses (leads)', with the wiki telling users not to compare yield numbers across the two tables.","dataviz_zh":"路徑以互動式代謝圖繪製，嚴格由左至右流動，線寬與質量流成正比，代謝物為節點並帶有區室後綴，反應為箭頭並依其 FVA 註解上色，由基質到目標產物的走廊則被明確標示強調。將游標停在某個反應上會開啟檢視卡，列出反應名稱與 ID、是否為剔除候選、通量與 FVA 範圍、耦合關係與上下界、所屬子系統、基因關聯與基因規則，以及它的生產者與消耗者。每次點選 Generate 都會在新分頁開啟當次參數，方便並排比較設定。結果可直接從瀏覽器匯出為 GraphML、JSON 與 CSV。干預策略表格以一列基準值為標頭（野生型生長速率、產率下限與上限），作為評判每一項排序設計的依據，並把已確信的「Ranked Designs」與較弱的單一反應「Hypotheses (leads)」分開，wiki 上也告訴使用者不要跨這兩張表比較產率數字。","datascience":"Benchmarked without a ground truth by defining what a useful pathway must do and measuring that instead. SCOPE was run on 9 GEMs with up to 5 target products each, 40 organism-product pairs in total: 100% of extracted pathways were fully connected from substrate to target, and the mean corridor was 55.1 reactions against a mean model size of 934, i.e. 7.8% of the network (models up to 1,762 reactions reduced to about 55). Essential reactions were identified independently with FVA and then checked for recall: 20.3 essential reactions per product on average, 17.5 retained, overall recall 0.863, above 0.90 in five of nine organisms, with the weakest cases (iJN1463 at 0.616, iJN1026 at 0.719) reported rather than hidden. Eleven curated GEMs ship with the tool, covering bacteria, a cyanobacterium, an archaeon, yeast and a diatom. The metabolic model behind the wet lab extended iJN1463 with the full p-cymene degradation route (cymA, cymB, cymC, cmtA-cmtE), linking to native metabolism through OP4ENH.","datascience_zh":"在沒有真實標準的情況下進行基準測試，做法是改為定義一條有用的路徑必須做到什麼，然後量測它。SCOPE 在 9 個 GEM 上執行，每個最多 5 個目標產物，共 40 組物種—產物配對：所有擷取出的路徑都 100% 從基質到目標完整連通，走廊平均 55.1 個反應，相對於平均模型規模 934 個反應，即網路的 7.8%（最多 1,762 個反應的模型被縮減到約 55 個）。必需反應另以 FVA 獨立判定，再檢查召回率：每個產物平均 20.3 個必需反應，保留 17.5 個，整體召回率 0.863，在九個物種中有五個高於 0.90，而表現最差的案例（iJN1463 為 0.616、iJN1026 為 0.719）是公開報告而非隱藏。工具內附十一個經整理的 GEM，涵蓋細菌、一種藍綠菌、一種古菌、酵母與一種矽藻。濕實驗背後的代謝模型則把 iJN1463 擴充為完整的 p-cymene 降解路線（cymA、cymB、cymC、cmtA-cmtE），並透過 OP4ENH 與原生代謝相連。","software":"NetFlux solves two linked problems in metabolic engineering: genome-scale models are too large to read, and strain-design algorithms waste most of their compute on reactions that can never carry flux. Its five-stage pipeline is the substance. Stage 1 solves FBA then pFBA and converts the flux distribution into a Mass Flow Graph (nodes = reactions, edges = metabolite mass flow). Stage 2 applies FASTCC against a fixed consistency threshold to strip blocked reactions, which the team identifies as the single largest source of computational expense. Stage 3 is SCOPE, their GUDIE-derived extractor: log-normalise the heavy-tailed edge weights, compute a flux-coupling score per reaction against the target, seed an interest signal at the target and propagate it with Personalised PageRank, combine coupling and interest into a per-edge score, expand outward over a bounded number of hops admitting reactions above a threshold anchored to the target's immediate neighbourhood, then an optional repair step that closes a broken corridor with a flux-weighted shortest path. Stage 4 annotates the corridor with FVA so each reaction is typed as essential-and-fixed, flexible, or a natural up/downregulation candidate. Stage 5 pools OptForce and OptKnock and co-ranks their proposals into one ordered list, resolving each to a gene linked to BiGG. Two design decisions stand out for reuse: the REST API is versioned, OpenAPI 3.1-specified and language-agnostic with async job polling (submit, get a job_id, poll), and all compute is deliberately RAM-only, with uploaded models referenced by short-lived tokens, a 30-minute SessionCache, and nothing a client submits ever written to disk or database. Users can upload their own GEM as .json or .sbml. It is self-hosted rather than publicly deployed: 'git clone https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/mit-mahe/netflux && docker compose up --build', then http://localhost:5173/, with stated system requirements of 2-4 GB RAM, any modern multi-core CPU and no GPU. A video guide and a step-by-step interpretation guide are on the wiki, and the limitation is stated plainly: constraint-based predictions describe what the network allows at steady state, not kinetics or regulation, so every strategy is a wet-lab hypothesis. Repo: https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/mit-mahe/netflux (team repo https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/mit-mahe).","software_zh":"NetFlux 解決代謝工程中兩個相連的問題：基因組尺度模型太大而無法閱讀，而菌株設計演算法把大部分運算浪費在永遠不可能帶有通量的反應上。它的五階段流程才是實質內容。階段 1 先解 FBA，再解 pFBA，並把通量分布轉換為質量流圖（節點＝反應，邊＝代謝物的質量流）。階段 2 以固定的一致性門檻套用 FASTCC，剔除受阻反應，該隊指出這正是運算成本最大的單一來源。階段 3 是 SCOPE，他們由 GUDIE 衍生出的擷取器：先把重尾分布的邊權重做對數正規化，計算每個反應相對於目標的通量耦合分數，在目標處播下興趣訊號並以個人化 PageRank 傳播，把耦合與興趣合成每條邊的分數，再在有上限的跳數內向外擴展，納入分數高於某門檻（該門檻以目標的鄰近區域為基準）的反應，最後還有一個選用的修補步驟，以通量加權的最短路徑補起斷掉的走廊。階段 4 以 FVA 註解走廊，讓每個反應被歸類為必需且固定、具彈性，或可自然上調／下調的候選。階段 5 匯整 OptForce 與 OptKnock，把兩者的提案共同排序成單一清單，並各自解析到連結 BiGG 的基因。兩項設計決策特別值得借用：REST API 有版本控制、以 OpenAPI 3.1 規格描述、與語言無關，並採非同步工作輪詢（送出、取得 job_id、輪詢）；以及所有運算刻意只在記憶體中進行，上傳的模型以短效期權杖引用，搭配 30 分鐘的 SessionCache，用戶端送出的任何資料都不會寫入磁碟或資料庫。使用者可上傳自己的 GEM，格式為 .json 或 .sbml。它採自行架設而非公開部署：「git clone https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/mit-mahe/netflux && docker compose up --build」，然後開啟 http://localhost:5173/，所列系統需求為 2-4 GB RAM、任何現代多核心 CPU，不需 GPU。wiki 上有影片指南與逐步判讀指南，限制也寫得很直白：基於約束的預測描述的是網路在穩態下允許什麼，而不是動力學或調控，因此每一項策略都是待濕實驗驗證的假說。程式庫：https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/mit-mahe/netflux（團隊程式庫 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/mit-mahe）。","stack":["React","TypeScript","FastAPI","Pydantic","Python","COBRApy","SQLite","Docker","Docker Compose","OpenAPI 3.1 / Swagger UI","REST / JSON-over-HTTP","GraphML","SBML","BiGG database","KaTeX (wiki maths)","iGEM GitLab"],"techniques":["Flux Balance Analysis (FBA)","parsimonious FBA (pFBA)","Flux Variability Analysis (FVA)","Mass Flow Graph representation of metabolism","FASTCC flux-consistency pruning","flux coupling analysis","Personalised PageRank network propagation","GUDIE-style user-defined subgraph extraction","flux-weighted shortest-path repair","OptKnock bilevel knockout search","OptForce intervention search","co-ranking of competing optimisation outputs","recall benchmarking against independently derived essential reactions","CRISPR-Cas9 homologous recombination (wet lab)"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Sessions were run across India in English, Hindi, Telugu, Kannada and Marathi so language would not be a barrier, and deliberately extended beyond students: the team visited old age homes to learn how residents' associations with traditional scents had changed over their lifetimes, then introduced them to synthetic biology. Workshops included household-materials DNA extraction from bananas at Purple Space Library Manipal (50 students, grades 1-7, split by age group), recombinant DNA via insulin at GenWise Camp, and deeper project discussion with grade 11-12 biology students at Vidya Mandir Chennai. Teachers were walked through each protocol step so they could keep running the demonstration after the team left. 'Beyond Sight', an audio-only podcast, carried five conversations with visually impaired professionals (a radio jockey, a geneticist, the founder of assistive-technology company TorchIT, an ophthalmologist, and one of only three blind women to have submitted before the Supreme Court of India). A Colourblind Awareness Day Instagram series ran on 6 September.","publicEngagement_zh":"活動在印度各地以英語、印地語、泰盧固語、坎納達語與馬拉提語進行，讓語言不成為障礙，並刻意延伸到學生以外的族群：該隊走訪養老院，了解住民對傳統香氣的連結如何隨一生改變，再向他們介紹合成生物學。工作坊包括在 Purple Space Library Manipal 用家中材料從香蕉萃取 DNA（50 位學生，1 至 7 年級，依年齡分組）、在 GenWise Camp 以胰島素講解重組 DNA，以及在 Vidya Mandir Chennai 與 11、12 年級生物學生進行更深入的專案討論。他們也帶老師走過每一個實驗步驟，讓團隊離開後老師能繼續操作示範。純音訊的 podcast「Beyond Sight」收錄五場與視障專業人士的對談（一位廣播主持人、一位遺傳學家、輔助科技公司 TorchIT 的創辦人、一位眼科醫師，以及印度最高法院僅有三位曾出庭陳述的盲人女性之一）。色盲意識日的 Instagram 系列則於 9 月 6 日發布。","ihp":"Stakeholder analysis walked the whole cumin supply chain, from traders who buy directly from farmers to internationally working perfumers, finding that each group holds a different version of the same problem. Hard numbers anchor the premise: India supplies about 70-80% of world cumin, the 2026 crop was projected at 9.0-9.2 million bags against roughly 11 million in 2025 (a 15-20% decline), hydrodistillation yields about 2.56% essential oil, and cuminaldehyde is a fraction of that. The decisive conversation was with Givaudan, which revealed that fragrance houses procure whole cumin essential oil rather than isolated cuminaldehyde; this redirected the team's target customer from fragrance houses to aroma compound manufacturers, where demand for isolated, sustainably produced cuminaldehyde actually exists. The inclusivity work was itself integrated rather than decorative: conversations with Vision Empower (IIIT Bangalore) identified that Indian educational structures restrict visually impaired students from science, and the team then built tactile models, trialled them with Mrs Nagarathna, a visually impaired educator, revised on her feedback, and tested with a ninth-grade student. Fixes were deliberately minimal and buildable from cheap materials: the existing DNA model distinguished bases only by colour, so each base got a texture instead (adenine smooth tape, thymine jute, guanine bubble wrap, cytosine velvet) wrapped around the existing model so it did not need rebuilding; the mitosis model's components were only drawn on, so they were rebuilt in clay with pipe-cleaner chromosomes. Vision Empower approved both the content and the models and will use them across their associated schools. A separate conversation with an Indian Sign Language expert established that, unlike ASL, ISL has no centralised place to learn it, which the team records as a gap they did not close.","ihp_zh":"利害關係人分析走遍整條小茴香供應鏈，從直接向農民收購的貿易商到跨國工作的調香師，發現每個群體掌握的是同一個問題的不同版本。具體數字支撐了前提：印度供應全球約 70-80% 的小茴香，2026 年產量預估為 900 萬至 920 萬包，相對於 2025 年的約 1,100 萬包（下降 15-20%），水蒸餾的精油產率約 2.56%，而枯茗醛只佔其中一部分。關鍵的一場對話來自 Givaudan，對方透露香料公司採購的是整支小茴香精油，而非分離純化的枯茗醛；這使該隊把目標客戶從香料公司轉向香氣化合物製造商，因為對分離、永續生產之枯茗醛的需求其實存在於那裡。包容性工作本身是整合進專案的，不是裝飾：與 Vision Empower（IIIT Bangalore）的對談指出印度的教育結構限制了視障學生接觸科學，該隊因此製作觸覺模型，先與視障教育者 Nagarathna 女士試用、依她的回饋修改，再與一位九年級學生測試。修改刻意最小化、並可用便宜材料自行製作：原有的 DNA 模型只用顏色區分鹼基，於是每個鹼基改以不同質感區分（腺嘌呤用平滑膠帶、胸腺嘧啶用麻布、鳥嘌呤用氣泡紙、胞嘧啶用絨布），直接包覆在原模型上，不必重做；而細胞分裂模型的構造原本只是畫上去的，便改用黏土重做，染色體以毛根製作。Vision Empower 核可了內容與模型，並將在其合作學校推廣使用。另一場與印度手語專家的對談則確認，與美國手語不同，印度手語沒有集中的學習管道，該隊把這點記錄為自己沒有解決的缺口。","realWorld":"A consumer survey found the barrier is information rather than opposition, with respondents already aware of land use, extraction and climate pressures and nearly half willing to pay slightly more for lower environmental impact, though more were worried about long-term effects of ingredients made by engineered microorganisms. Producer-side work found that Indian companies import aroma compounds from China, the UAE and France despite domestic cumin dominance, and that price is the deciding factor for buyers because raw material cost passes straight to consumers. The team wrote 'An iGEMer's Guide to Upscaling', a structured upscaling and biomanufacturing guide, after finding no iGEM-oriented resource bridging flask scale to industrial scale, and 'The Aroma Atlas', a catalogue of everyday scents, their active ingredients and current production methods, as a starting point for teams looking for compounds worth making sustainably. Six cym operon genes were submitted to the Registry as basic parts (BBa_26CFFF0H, BBa_26R7VUFV, BBa_26MJ8EI9, BBa_26SS8791, BBa_26AS8UG2, BBa_26AW7YAF).","realWorld_zh":"一份消費者調查發現，障礙在於資訊而非反對：受訪者本來就知道土地利用、萃取與氣候壓力，近半數願意為較低的環境衝擊多付一點錢，不過更多人擔心工程微生物所製成分的長期影響。生產端的調查則發現，印度企業儘管本國小茴香產量居主導地位，仍從中國、阿聯與法國進口香氣化合物，而價格是買方的決定因素，因為原料成本會直接轉嫁給消費者。該隊發現沒有任何面向 iGEM、能從搖瓶規模接到工業規模的資源，於是寫了結構化的放大與生物製造指南《An iGEMer's Guide to Upscaling》；另外還做了《The Aroma Atlas》，彙整日常香氣、其活性成分與目前的生產方式，作為其他隊伍尋找值得永續生產之化合物的起點。cym 操縱子的六個基因已作為基礎元件提交到 Registry（BBa_26CFFF0H、BBa_26R7VUFV、BBa_26MJ8EI9、BBa_26SS8791、BBa_26AS8UG2、BBa_26AW7YAF）。","partners":["Vision Empower / IIIT Bangalore","Givaudan","Score Foundation / Project Eyeway","TorchIT","Navjeevan Blind School, Pune","Purple Space Library Manipal","GenWise Camp","Vidya Mandir Senior Secondary School, Chennai","Manipal Academy of Higher Education","Anthropic (sponsor)","BioRender, GenScript, IDT, NEB, SnapGene (sponsors)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6145/wiki/dry-lab/software/fig-2-architecture.avif","caption":"NetFlux architecture: React/TypeScript frontend, FastAPI backend with Pydantic schemas and a bounded JobManager worker pool, over a SQLite model catalogue and precomputed Mass Flow Graphs.","caption_zh":"NetFlux 架構：React/TypeScript 前端、搭配 Pydantic 結構與有上限 JobManager 工作者池的 FastAPI 後端，底層是 SQLite 模型目錄與預先計算的質量流圖。","credit":"Team MIT-MAHE, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6145/wiki/dry-lab/software/fig-1-pipeline.avif","caption":"The five-stage NetFlux pipeline: Mass Flow Graph construction, FASTCC pruning, SCOPE/GUDIE corridor extraction, FVA annotation, and the pooled OptKnock/OptForce design engine.","caption_zh":"NetFlux 的五階段流程：建構質量流圖、FASTCC 修剪、SCOPE/GUDIE 走廊擷取、FVA 註解，以及匯整 OptKnock/OptForce 的設計引擎。","credit":"Team MIT-MAHE, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6145/wiki/dry-lab/software/fig-4-user-guide.avif","caption":"An extracted production corridor drawn automatically from a genome-scale model, flowing left to right with line width proportional to mass flow and reactions coloured by FVA annotation.","caption_zh":"由基因組尺度模型自動繪出的生產走廊，由左至右流動，線寬與質量流成正比，反應則依 FVA 註解上色。","credit":"Team MIT-MAHE, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6145/wiki/dry-lab/software/fig-6-user-guide.avif","caption":"The intervention strategy suite: ranked designs with yield floor, retained growth, coupling strength and the specific gene to edit, separated from weaker exploratory leads.","caption_zh":"干預策略組合：已排序的設計列出產率下限、保留的生長、耦合強度與應編輯的具體基因，並與較弱的探索性線索分開。","credit":"Team MIT-MAHE, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"When there is no ground truth to benchmark against, define what a correct output must satisfy and measure that: NetFlux's credibility rests on three published numbers (100% corridor connectivity, 7.8% of the network retained, 0.863 recall of independently FVA-derived essential reactions), with the weakest organisms named. A research centre should also copy the ephemeral-compute design, user-uploaded models held in RAM behind short-lived tokens and never written to disk, which makes a shared analysis service usable with data people will not hand over.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"當沒有真實標準可供對標時，就定義一個正確輸出必須滿足哪些條件，然後去量測它：NetFlux 的可信度建立在三個公開數字上（走廊連通性 100%、僅保留網路的 7.8%、對獨立以 FVA 推得之必需反應的召回率 0.863），而且把表現最差的物種指名出來。研究中心也值得照抄它的短暫運算設計——使用者上傳的模型只存在記憶體中，以短效期權杖存取，絕不寫入磁碟，這讓一個共用的分析服務也能處理別人不願交出的資料。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/mit-mahe/","https://2026.igem.wiki/mit-mahe/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/mit-mahe/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/mit-mahe/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/mit-mahe/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/mit-mahe/inclusivity","https://2026.igem.wiki/mit-mahe/implementation","https://2026.igem.wiki/mit-mahe/contribution","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/mit-mahe/netflux"],"awards_zh":["最佳軟體 — 入圍（大學組）","包容性獎 — 得主（大學組）"],"rank":33},"6151":{"team":"Uni-Padua-IT","id":"6151","section":"Undergrad","country":"Italy","village":"Space","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/uni-padua-it/","projectTitle":"C.O.S.M.I.C. (Cyanobacterial Oxygen Supply for Martian Inhabitant Complexes)","projectTitle_zh":"C.O.S.M.I.C.（火星居住複合體的藍綠菌供氧系統）","tagline":"A Nostoc-based life-support chassis for Mars, plus ReTIsigner, an open codon optimiser for the 35,799 hosts other tools ignore.","tagline_zh":"以 Nostoc 為基礎的火星生命維持底盤，外加 ReTIsigner：一個開放的密碼子最佳化工具，支援其他工具忽略的 35,799 種宿主。","summary":"Uni-Padua-IT engineered the filamentous cyanobacterium Nostoc sp. PCC 7120 as a Martian life-support organism: it fixes CO2 into breathable oxygen, degrades the perchlorates that poison Martian water (via native NarB and a heterocyst-compartmentalised pcrABD plus chlorite dismutase), and carries pprA from Deinococcus radiodurans for radiation-damage repair, behind a copper-dependent MazF kill switch. Because no free codon optimiser listed their chassis, they forked TIsigner into ReTIsigner, a frequency-weighted codon optimiser that reads any of the 35,799 Kazusa codon usage tables, enforces GC bounds, actively excises RFC restriction sites and reports CAI, GC and translation-initiation opening energy. ReTIsigner was validated in silico over 100 sequences and four hosts, then in vivo: a ReTIsigner-optimised eYFP gave a 2.16-fold common-effect increase in specific fluorescence across DH5-alpha and BL21 (p = 0.002, permutation test stratified by strain). They also built an open-source acoustic (piezo + Arduino) bubble sensor so oxygen production can be followed without opening a sealed culture.","summary_zh":"Uni-Padua-IT 把絲狀藍綠菌 Nostoc sp. PCC 7120 改造成火星上的生命維持生物：它把 CO2 固定成可供呼吸的氧氣、分解污染火星水源的過氯酸鹽（透過原生的 NarB，加上區隔在異形細胞中的 pcrABD 與亞氯酸鹽歧化酶），並帶有來自 Deinococcus radiodurans 的 pprA 以修復輻射損傷，整套系統受一個銅依賴型 MazF kill switch 控制。由於沒有任何免費的密碼子最佳化工具收錄他們的底盤，團隊把 TIsigner 分支成 ReTIsigner：一個以頻率加權的密碼子最佳化工具，可讀取 35,799 份 Kazusa 密碼子使用表中的任何一份、強制 GC 含量上下界、主動剔除 RFC 限制酶切位，並回報 CAI、GC 與轉譯起始的開啟能量。ReTIsigner 先在電腦上以 100 條序列、四種宿主驗證，再做活體驗證：經 ReTIsigner 最佳化的 eYFP 在 DH5-alpha 與 BL21 中，比生螢光的共同效應提高 2.16 倍（p = 0.002，依菌株分層的排列檢定）。他們也做了一個開放原始碼的聲學氣泡感測器（壓電元件加 Arduino），讓人不必打開密閉培養就能追蹤產氧情況。","awards":["Best Software — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Space Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"SvelteKit single-page frontend built from scratch, talking to a Flask backend over a single documented HTTP endpoint (POST /optimise); a worker pool behind Flask shells out to the compiled scientific binaries. The whole stack is shipped as a two-stage Docker image (Node.js 22 build stage; Miniconda runtime pinning Python 3.6.9, ViennaRNA 2.5.1 and Infernal 1.1.5) exposing port 5050.","frameworks_zh":"前端是從零寫起的 SvelteKit 單頁應用，透過單一且有文件的 HTTP 端點（POST /optimise）與 Flask 後端通訊；Flask 後面的工作者池再呼叫編譯好的科學運算執行檔。整套系統以兩階段的 Docker 映像發布（Node.js 22 建置階段；Miniconda 執行階段釘住 Python 3.6.9、ViennaRNA 2.5.1 與 Infernal 1.1.5），對外開放 5050 連接埠。","dataviz":"Results view compares input against each optimised sequence in a results card showing CAI, GC content and opening energy, so sequences no longer have to be analysed one at a time in external tools. A built-in guided tour walks a first-time user through every field of the run configuration. Exports in three reproducible formats (CSV, PDF, FASTA), each recording the full run configuration plus the computed analyses. Validation figures (specific-fluorescence bar charts and ratio plots with 95% CIs) are published as SVG on the wiki, and the system is explained with two architecture diagrams: the POST /optimise request path and one iteration of the annealing loop.","dataviz_zh":"結果頁把輸入序列與每一條最佳化後的序列並排比較，結果卡片上列出 CAI、GC 含量與開啟能量，使用者不必再把序列一條一條丟到外部工具分析。內建的導覽會帶第一次使用的人走過執行設定的每一個欄位。匯出支援三種可重現的格式（CSV、PDF、FASTA），每一種都記錄完整的執行設定與計算出的分析結果。驗證圖表（比生螢光長條圖與附 95% 信賴區間的比值圖）以 SVG 發布在 wiki 上，系統則以兩張架構圖說明：POST /optimise 的請求路徑，以及退火迴圈的單次迭代。","datascience":"In silico benchmark over 100 coding sequences optimised for four hosts spanning roughly 31-75% GC, recording GC, CAI, opening energy and failure rate with and without a codon usage table: supplying a table cut the failure rate from 52% to 2% while leaving opening energy essentially unchanged (mean difference +/-0.06 kcal/mol). Wet-lab validation used independent cultures as the unit of replication, three cultures per sample each in technical triplicate, fluorescence compared at matched optical density rather than fixed time, two detection channels, and a permutation test stratified by strain; the team explicitly states the confidence interval (about 1.6-2.8x) and what the data does not license them to claim.","datascience_zh":"電腦模擬基準測試涵蓋 100 條編碼序列，針對四種 GC 含量約 31-75% 的宿主最佳化，記錄有無提供密碼子使用表時的 GC、CAI、開啟能量與失敗率：提供表格可讓失敗率從 52% 降到 2%，而開啟能量基本上不變（平均差異 ±0.06 kcal/mol）。濕實驗驗證以獨立培養作為重複的單位，每個樣本三個培養、各做技術三重複，螢光在相同光密度下比較而不是固定時間點比較，使用兩個偵測通道，並做依菌株分層的排列檢定；團隊也明確寫出信賴區間（約 1.6-2.8 倍），以及這份資料不足以讓他們主張什麼。","software":"ReTIsigner is a free, Apache 2.0-licensed codon optimiser for non-model hosts, and it is the clearest example this year of forking an existing scientific tool rather than rebuilding one. The team started from TIsigner (Bhandari, Lim & Gardner), contacted its authors for feedback on their proposal, and then added four things TIsigner lacked: frequency-weighted synonymous codon sampling driven by any Kazusa codon usage table (35,799 organisms) instead of one-amino-acid-one-codon, an optional GC bound enforced as a feasibility filter, active position-targeted removal of restriction sites with a re-check for newly introduced sites, and in-app CAI/GC analysis per output sequence. The restriction-site work is the headline engineering result: optimising perchlorate reductase subunit A for Nostoc under RFC 10 and RFC 1000 constraints was still running after 15 hours under the original random-substitution behaviour, and completed in seconds afterwards, yielding registry part BBa_268WDVEB. Architecturally the optimiser sits behind POST /optimise so it is usable headlessly without the Svelte interface, and the Docker image removes the platform problem that ViennaRNA and Infernal binaries create on Windows ('docker build -t retisigner . && docker run -p 5050:5050 retisigner'). It ships a user guide, a development guide documenting the system and its API calls, a video tutorial (https://video.igem.org/w/rN6WnodTKYxiNitzfSUVZ3) that optimises BBa_E0040 GFP for Clostridium acetobutylicum ATCC 824, and a public repository at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/uni-padua-it/retisigner-svelte (team repo: https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/uni-padua-it). It is self-hosted via Docker rather than offered as a hosted public web service, which is the one gap: there is no URL a stranger can click. They also positioned ReTIsigner honestly against the field, reproducing Table 1 of Demissie et al. (2025) and adding their own row with a tilde rather than a tick in the CAI column, and comparing feature-by-feature against the two previous iGEM codon optimisers (HebrewU 2018, MIT 2023). They published an open call for collaboration on 9 August 2026 offering to optimise any team's sequence for their chassis and received no replies, and they say so on the wiki.","software_zh":"ReTIsigner 是一個免費、以 Apache 2.0 授權、針對非模式宿主的密碼子最佳化工具，也是今年最清楚的一個案例：把既有的科學工具分支延伸，而不是從頭重做一個。團隊從 TIsigner（Bhandari、Lim 與 Gardner）出發，先聯絡原作者取得對他們提案的意見，再補上 TIsigner 缺少的四件事：以任何一份 Kazusa 密碼子使用表（35,799 種生物）驅動、按頻率加權的同義密碼子抽樣，取代一個胺基酸只配一個密碼子的做法；可選的 GC 含量上下界，作為可行性過濾條件；針對位置主動剔除限制酶切位，並重新檢查是否因此產生新的切位；以及在應用程式內針對每條輸出序列做 CAI 與 GC 分析。限制酶切位這一塊是最亮眼的工程成果：在 RFC 10 與 RFC 1000 的限制下為 Nostoc 最佳化過氯酸鹽還原酶 A 次單元，在原本隨機取代的行為下跑了 15 小時還沒結束，改良後幾秒內就完成，並產出 Registry 零件 BBa_268WDVEB。架構上，最佳化引擎放在 POST /optimise 之後，因此不需要 Svelte 介面也能以無介面方式呼叫；Docker 映像則解決 ViennaRNA 與 Infernal 執行檔在 Windows 上造成的平台問題（docker build -t retisigner . && docker run -p 5050:5050 retisigner）。它附有使用手冊、記錄系統與 API 呼叫的開發指南、一支示範把 BBa_E0040 GFP 針對 Clostridium acetobutylicum ATCC 824 最佳化的教學影片（https://video.igem.org/w/rN6WnodTKYxiNitzfSUVZ3），以及公開的程式庫 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/uni-padua-it/retisigner-svelte（團隊程式庫：https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/uni-padua-it）。它只能透過 Docker 自行架設，並沒有提供已託管的公開網路服務，這是唯一的缺口：沒有一個陌生人可以直接點進去的網址。他們也誠實地把 ReTIsigner 放在同領域中定位：重製 Demissie et al.（2025）的表 1，並在自己那一列的 CAI 欄位放上波浪號而不是打勾，同時與過去兩個 iGEM 的密碼子最佳化工具（HebrewU 2018、MIT 2023）逐項比較功能。他們在 2026 年 8 月 9 日公開徵求合作，願意替任何隊伍把序列針對其底盤做最佳化，結果沒有收到任何回覆，而他們也把這件事寫在 wiki 上。","stack":["SvelteKit","Svelte","Node.js 22","Python 3.6.9","Flask","Docker (multi-stage)","Miniconda/Conda","ViennaRNA 2.5.1 (RNAplfold)","Infernal 1.1.5","REST/HTTP API","Apache 2.0","iGEM GitLab","Arduino (hardware)"],"techniques":["Simulated annealing search","frequency-weighted synonymous codon sampling","mRNA translation-initiation opening-energy minimisation","Codon Adaptation Index (CAIcal/Sharp-Li definition)","GC-bound feasibility filtering","active restriction-site excision","Kazusa codon-usage-table parsing","permutation testing stratified by strain","in silico benchmarking across GC-spanning hosts","acoustic (piezoelectric) frequency-sweep sensing"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A public survey on space research and biotechnology directly reshaped the team's communication: 76.5% of respondents rated using living organisms for oxygen and water highly while only 28.2% rated colonisation highly, so the team separated the usefulness of the technology from support for settling Mars; 42.2% knew little or nothing about GMOs, so explanations of what they modify and why were rewritten more accessibly; and 94.8% called a genetic safety system fundamental or very important, so the kill switch and confined bioreactor were given more space. Education activities grew out of the same consultations.","publicEngagement_zh":"一份關於太空研究與生物技術的公眾問卷，直接改變了團隊的溝通方式：76.5% 的受訪者高度肯定利用活體生物生產氧氣與水，但只有 28.2% 高度支持殖民，因此團隊把技術本身的有用性與支持移居火星這兩件事分開陳述；42.2% 對基因改造生物所知甚少或完全不知，因此關於他們改了什麼、為什麼要改的說明都重寫得更平易；94.8% 認為基因層面的安全機制是根本或非常重要的，因此 kill switch 與密閉式生物反應器也獲得更多篇幅。教育活動也是從同一批諮詢長出來的。","ihp":"Human practices is written as a sequence of questions with an explicit 'what we changed' and, unusually, a 'what we couldn't fix' for each. Consultations with photosynthesis and cyanobacteria professors (Nicoletta La Rocca, Daniela Billi) cut the cold-tolerance module. iGEM Darmstadt 2025, who had built the same perchlorate constructs in B. subtilis, warned them off pcrABCD's oxygen sensitivity, which led to testing native NarB first and then compartmentalising pcrABD in heterocysts. A presentation to NASA's Open Science Data Repository Analysis Working Group moved the radiation module from survival-at-high-dose to genome integrity over generations, and pushed them toward a terrestrial use case (perchlorate in groundwater near propellant plants) when the Moon turned out to have no perchlorate. ESA flight-operations engineers (Davide Vertuani, Paolo Ferri) made them reason about the journey, not just arrival. Philosopher Telmo Pievani and space-habitat designer Serena Crotti changed how the bioreactor is framed within a crew's daily life. Most relevant to a dry-lab centre: they took their hardware manual and code to an instrumentation professor and an electronics PhD student (Simone Del Favero, Samuele Faccin) before publishing, and as a result weakened their own claim (the sensor detects gas bubbles, it does not measure oxygen), redrew the circuit with no crossing wires, documented timing resolution, and added a table separating proven from untested.","ihp_zh":"人類實踐以一連串問題的形式書寫，每個問題都明確寫出「我們改了什麼」，而且少見地還有一欄「我們沒能解決什麼」。與光合作用及藍綠菌領域教授（Nicoletta La Rocca、Daniela Billi）的諮詢砍掉了耐冷模組。2025 年的 iGEM Darmstadt 隊伍曾在 B. subtilis 中做過同樣的過氯酸鹽構築，提醒他們 pcrABCD 對氧氣敏感，使他們先測試原生的 NarB，再把 pcrABD 區隔到異形細胞中。向 NASA 的 Open Science Data Repository Analysis Working Group 報告後，輻射模組的目標從在高劑量下存活改成跨世代維持基因組完整性；而當他們發現月球上並沒有過氯酸鹽時，這條線也把他們推向一個地面上的應用場景（推進劑工廠附近地下水中的過氯酸鹽）。ESA 的飛行操作工程師（Davide Vertuani、Paolo Ferri）讓他們必須思考航程本身，而不只是抵達之後。哲學家 Telmo Pievani 與太空棲地設計師 Serena Crotti 則改變了生物反應器在組員日常生活中的定位方式。對乾實驗室型的研究單位最有參考價值的是：他們在發表之前，先把硬體手冊與程式碼拿給一位儀器專業的教授與一位電子學博士生（Simone Del Favero、Samuele Faccin）看，結果主動下修自己的主張（這個感測器偵測的是氣泡，並不量測氧氣）、把電路圖重畫成沒有交叉線、記錄時間解析度，並加上一張表把已驗證與未驗證的部分分開。","realWorld":"The team identified a terrestrial application independent of any Mars mission: perchlorate contaminates groundwater near propellant and pyrotechnics manufacturing and is regulated, and biological removal is already an active research area. They were unable to secure an ionising radiation source (INFN Legnaro's Van de Graaff accelerator unavailable; IOV Padova's linear accelerator caps at roughly 6 Gy/min against a 6 kGy LD50), and report that the pprA radiation claim is therefore untested rather than glossing over it.","realWorld_zh":"團隊找出一個與火星任務無關、在地球上就成立的應用：過氯酸鹽會污染推進劑與煙火製造廠附近的地下水，而且受法規管制，生物性移除也已經是活躍的研究領域。他們沒能取得游離輻射源（INFN Legnaro 的 Van de Graaff 加速器無法使用；IOV Padova 的線性加速器上限約 6 Gy/min，而 LD50 為 6 kGy），並直接說明 pprA 的抗輻射主張因此尚未驗證，而不是把它含糊帶過。","partners":["iGEM Darmstadt 2025","NASA Open Science Data Repository Analysis Working Group","European Space Agency (flight operations)","University of Padua (Biology, Chemistry, Information Engineering)","University of Rome Tor Vergata","TISIGNER authors (Bhandari, Lim, Gardner)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6151/wiki/software/new-frontend.avif","caption":"The ReTIsigner interface the team built from scratch in SvelteKit, replacing the original TIsigner form.","caption_zh":"團隊以 SvelteKit 從零打造的 ReTIsigner 介面，取代了原本 TIsigner 的表單。","credit":"Team Uni-Padua-IT, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6151/wiki/software/guided-tour.avif","caption":"The in-app guided tour that walks a first-time user through configuring a whole optimisation run.","caption_zh":"應用內建的導覽，帶第一次使用的人走完一次完整最佳化執行的設定。","credit":"Team Uni-Padua-IT, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6151/wiki/software/results-opt.avif","caption":"The results card: input sequence against an optimised output, with CAI and GC content computed in-app.","caption_zh":"結果卡片：輸入序列與最佳化後的輸出並排，CAI 與 GC 含量都在應用內計算。","credit":"Team Uni-Padua-IT, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6151/wiki/software/request-schema.avif","caption":"System architecture: the SvelteKit frontend posts a run to Flask, which hands it to a worker pool that shells out to RNAplfold and Infernal.","caption_zh":"系統架構：SvelteKit 前端把一次執行 POST 給 Flask，Flask 再交給工作者池，由其呼叫 RNAplfold 與 Infernal。","credit":"Team Uni-Padua-IT, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6151/wiki/software/optimisation-schema.avif","caption":"One iteration of the simulated annealing search, with the team's two additions: restriction-site removal before scoring and a GC-bound feasibility check.","caption_zh":"模擬退火搜尋的單次迭代，含團隊新增的兩項：在評分前先剔除限制酶切位，以及 GC 含量上下界的可行性檢查。","credit":"Team Uni-Padua-IT, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Fork and extend an existing, cited scientific tool instead of building a new one, and validate the extension at the bench: ReTIsigner's credibility comes from a 2.16-fold wet-lab expression result, a 52%-to-2% failure-rate benchmark, and a published 'what we are entitled to claim' section that names its own limits. A research centre should also copy their packaging discipline, one Docker command plus a documented HTTP endpoint so the engine is reusable headlessly, and their habit of sending documentation to an outside instrumentation expert before publishing it.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"分支並延伸一個既有、被引用過的科學工具，而不是另造一個新的，並且在實驗台上驗證你加上去的部分：ReTIsigner 的可信度來自 2.16 倍的濕實驗表現結果、失敗率從 52% 降到 2% 的基準測試，以及一段公開寫明「我們有資格主張什麼」、同時指出自身限制的段落。研究單位也值得學他們的封裝紀律：一道 Docker 指令加上一個有文件的 HTTP 端點，讓引擎可以在無介面的情況下被重複使用；還有他們在發表之前先把文件送給外部儀器專家審閱的習慣。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/uni-padua-it/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uni-padua-it/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/uni-padua-it/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/uni-padua-it/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/uni-padua-it/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/uni-padua-it/judging","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/uni-padua-it/retisigner-svelte","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/uni-padua-it"],"awards_zh":["最佳軟體 — 得主（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 得主（大學組）","最佳太空專案 — 入圍"],"rank":59},"6157":{"team":"UCAS-China","id":"6157","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/","projectTitle":"PARCEL","tagline":"An inhaled, protein-based mRNA carrier that makes airway cells produce their own asthma medicine.","summary":"PARCEL is an inhaled mRNA delivery platform built from elastin-like polypeptides (ELPs) rather than lipid nanoparticles. The fusion protein ELP-Pum2-EEP13 uses Pum2 to grab mRNA carrying a PRS tag in its 3' UTR, ELP phase separation to encapsulate and protect it, an endosomal escape peptide to get out of the endosome, and a Sortase A-conjugated anti-UPK1B scFv to target airway club cells; the cargo is mRNA for SLPI (inhibiting neutrophil elastase and the mucus hypersecretion it triggers) plus a lower dose of IFN-lambda-1 (antiviral defence and Th2 suppression). It won 1st Runner-up and Best Integrated Human Practices because the stakeholder work genuinely steered the science: clinicians moved the project from rescue therapy to maintenance therapy, and an asthma mechanism researcher killed one of the two original cargoes outright. The dry lab is unusually complete, modelling the whole chain from E. coli production through nebulizer aerosol deposition to a PK-PD readout in FEV1 and FeNO, with every module feeding the next.","awards":["1st Runner-up (Undergrad)","Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best New Composite Part — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Therapeutics Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Six connected modules sharing parameters and declared input-output relationships. (1) Production: a SimBiology ODE model of a quorum-sensing kill switch (LuxI/LuxRm A1 variant, pLuxRm-driven lysis) combining growth-dependent dilution with AHL kinetics, swept across Anderson promoters to find the one that lyses the culture just before ELP phase transition - this chose the promoter the wet lab used. (2) Assembly: AlphaFold 3 predicted the three fusion-protein monomers (1052-1322 residues), coarse-grained into Martini 3 and run in GROMACS for 2-3 microseconds at 298 K, 1 bar, 150 mM NaCl, 50 mg/mL protein, with pLDDT used to justify stabilising the Pum2 fold while leaving ELP flexible; alongside this they built CAPE (Coverage and Assembly Prediction for Protein Ensembles), a reduced free-energy model calibrated against wet-lab data, and used Bayesian optimization over CAPE as the objective to redistribute ELP repeats around Pum2 instead of brute-forcing every combination. (3) Pulmonary delivery: MPPD v3.04 on the adult Yeh-Schum five-lobe geometry screened log-normal aerosol size distributions, flow rates and inhaled volumes against deposition in the last three conducting generations per lobe, then ANSYS Fluent CFD simulated 3D airway transport, feeding a distal airway and airway-surface-liquid transport model and a reference cell-composition mapping that converts deposition into surface contacts per club cell. (4) Intracellular release: a hybrid ODE-stochastic model of one particle per endosome (median 560 nm, ~2,400 fusion chains and therefore 2,400 EEP copies per particle), tracking acidification, ELP disassembly, EEP-mediated membrane opening and RNA degradation to output intact cytosolic RNA over time, with intact RNA tracked separately from fluorescent label. (5) PK-PD: a four-compartment model (bone marrow, blood, airway wall, epithelial lining fluid) with 25 species, 53 assignment rules and 51 reactions, adapted from Gadkar et al.'s severe asthma immune network, giving four clinical readouts - FeNO, FEV1, relative goblet-cell count and 15-minute mucin release - used to compare SLPI:IFN-lambda-1 payload ratios and dosing frequency. (6) Response prediction: an affine mapping baseline plus residual CellFlow (flow matching) trained on public cytokine-perturbation scRNA-seq.","dataviz":"The model landing page opens with a scripted animation that walks the whole mechanism in sequence - the E. coli shell fills with protein, lyses, chains assemble into PARCEL, the particle travels into the bronchi, binds a club-cell receptor, is endocytosed, disassembles, releases mRNA, and mucus drops one step per round - with replay and skip controls and a text fallback when JavaScript is off. AlphaFold monomer structures are embedded as interactive viewers with pLDDT and protein-region colouring and cartoon/C-alpha toggles, so a reader can see directly why Pum2 was treated as rigid and ELP as flexible. The wiki also carries font-size controls (A-/Default/A+) for accessibility. On the software side, the AeroEase Android app turns raw device timestamps into an expandable-card Overview with a seven-day activity chart and a date-filtered History, and the FeroEase app plots live temperature, pH and OD600 with a falling-trend detector that flags the harvest window.","datascience":"Two concrete pieces. The target screen: using the Human Lung Cell Atlas they compared healthy adult club cells against other lung epithelial cells on fold change, adjusted p-value and detection fraction, and from 68 genes passing the criteria selected UPK1B - 2.28-fold enriched, adjusted p = 0.00559, RNA detected in 45.92% of club cells versus 3.43% of other epithelial cells. They then checked antibody accessibility (Human Surfaceome; UniProt O75841, 260 aa, four transmembrane regions, extracellular stretches at 37-60 and 108-229) and cross-tissue selectivity (archived GTEx: 0.11 TPM lung vs 21.90 TPM bladder; Human Protein Atlas showing membranous expression in urothelium), and stated plainly that UPK1B is not club-cell exclusive so the analysis prioritises an experimental candidate rather than demonstrating selective targeting. The response-prediction benchmark is equally honest: affine mapping cut mean-expression error 7.1% against predicting no change and beat the mean-response baseline, while the nonlinear residual CellFlow model improved some mean-expression predictions but worsened distributional agreement and the selected RNA panels - so they kept affine as the reference model and named cross-donor validation and RNA reconstruction as the open problems. Tasks were set up as donor-held-out rotations on GSE249307 and GSE246368 with unpaired source and target cells.","software":"Four software deliverables. AeroEase, an Android companion app for the nebulizer, syncs ESP32-C3 button timestamps over BLE through a validated handshake with checksum, session and duplicate checks, clock calibration from the phone, and acknowledgement only after durable storage, then presents them as a locally stored medication-use diary with daily and seven-day counts, date-filtered history, CSV export, and a rule-based offline assistant that answers questions without any cloud call; the team repeatedly states the records document device actions, not delivered dose or confirmed inhalation. FeroEase, written in Flutter, monitors the two-stage fermentation over Wi-Fi with temperature, pH, stirring control and a falling-OD600 trend detector that identifies the lysis harvest window a bench fermenter does not report. The bioinformatics pipeline for club-cell target selection is the third. A browser-based quiz game supports the education activities. Hardware: AeroEase is a portable vibrating-mesh nebulizer on an ESP32-C3 with rechargeable power, session logging, BLE, a gravity-fed reservoir and physically separated liquid and electronics compartments in a modular 3D-printed housing; FeroEase is an ESP32-S3 two-stage culture platform with pH and temperature sensing, controlled heating, motor stirring and transmitted-light OD600 tracking. Build resources and a user manual with source code access are published on the wiki.","stack":["AlphaFold 3","GROMACS","Martini 3 coarse-grained force field","MATLAB SimBiology","MPPD v3.04 (Multiple-Path Particle Dosimetry)","ANSYS Fluent","CellFlow (flow matching)","Human Lung Cell Atlas (HLCA)","Human Surfaceome","UniProt","GTEx","Human Protein Atlas","GEO (GSE249307, GSE246368)","Flutter","Android / Kotlin","ESP32-C3","ESP32-S3","Bluetooth Low Energy","SQLite (on-device)"],"techniques":["Coarse-grained molecular dynamics","Reduced free-energy modelling (custom CAPE model)","Bayesian optimization for sequence design","Quorum-sensing ODE modelling with growth dilution","Computational fluid dynamics aerosol deposition","Regional lung dosimetry screening","Hybrid ODE-stochastic single-endosome simulation","Compartmental PK-PD with Hill-function assignment rules","Differential expression with detection-fraction filtering","Affine distribution mapping","Flow matching for single-cell perturbation response","Donor-held-out cross-validation","Membrane topology and surfaceome annotation screening","SWOT analysis"],"frameworks_zh":"六個相互連接的模組，共用參數並明確宣告輸入輸出關係。(1) 生產：以 SimBiology 建立一個群體感應自殺開關的 ODE 模型（LuxI/LuxRm A1 變異體，由 pLuxRm 驅動裂解），結合生長造成的稀釋與 AHL 動力學，掃過各個 Anderson 啟動子，找出恰好在 ELP 相變之前讓培養液裂解的那一個——這決定了濕實驗室使用的啟動子。(2) 組裝：以 AlphaFold 3 預測三個融合蛋白單體（1052-1322 個殘基），粗粒化為 Martini 3 並在 GROMACS 中以 298 K、1 bar、150 mM NaCl、50 mg/mL 蛋白濃度執行 2-3 微秒，並以 pLDDT 作為「穩定 Pum2 摺疊、同時保留 ELP 柔性」的依據；同時他們建立了 CAPE（Coverage and Assembly Prediction for Protein Ensembles），一個以濕實驗室資料校準的簡化自由能模型，並以 CAPE 為目標函數做貝氏最佳化，重新分配 Pum2 周圍的 ELP 重複單元，而不是暴力枚舉所有組合。(3) 肺部遞送：以 MPPD v3.04 在成人 Yeh-Schum 五肺葉幾何上，針對各肺葉最後三個傳導分支世代的沉積量，篩選對數常態的氣霧粒徑分布、流速與吸入體積；再以 ANSYS Fluent CFD 模擬三維呼吸道傳輸，接著餵入末端呼吸道與呼吸道表面液層的傳輸模型，以及一個參考細胞組成對映，把沉積量換算為每個棒狀細胞的表面接觸數。(4) 細胞內釋放：一個每個內體一顆粒的 ODE-隨機混合模型（中位粒徑 560 nm，每顆約 2,400 條融合蛋白鏈、因此有 2,400 份 EEP），追蹤酸化、ELP 解組裝、EEP 媒介的膜開孔與 RNA 降解，輸出隨時間變化的完整細胞質 RNA 量，並把完整 RNA 與螢光標記分開追蹤。(5) PK-PD：一個四區室模型（骨髓、血液、呼吸道壁、上皮襯液），含 25 個物種、53 條指派規則與 51 個反應，改編自 Gadkar 等人的重度氣喘免疫網路，產出四項臨床讀值——FeNO、FEV1、相對杯狀細胞數與 15 分鐘黏液素釋放量——用於比較 SLPI:IFN-lambda-1 的載量比與給藥頻率。(6) 反應預測：一個仿射對映的基線，加上以公開細胞激素擾動 scRNA-seq 訓練的殘差式 CellFlow（flow matching）。","dataviz_zh":"模型首頁一開始就是一段腳本化動畫，依序走過整個機制——E. coli 外殼充滿蛋白、裂解、蛋白鏈組裝成 PARCEL、顆粒進入支氣管、結合棒狀細胞受體、被內吞、解組裝、釋出 mRNA，而黏液每一輪下降一階——並附重播與跳過控制，在 JavaScript 關閉時還有純文字替代版本。AlphaFold 單體結構以互動檢視器嵌入，可依 pLDDT 與蛋白區域著色、並切換 cartoon/C-alpha 呈現，讓讀者直接看出為何 Pum2 被視為剛性、ELP 被視為柔性。wiki 另附字級控制（A-/預設/A+）以提升無障礙性。軟體方面，AeroEase Android 應用程式把裝置的原始時間戳轉成可展開卡片的總覽，含七日活動圖表與可依日期篩選的歷史紀錄；FeroEase 應用程式則即時繪出溫度、pH 與 OD600，並以下降趨勢偵測器標出收取時機。","datascience_zh":"兩項具體工作。標靶篩選：他們以 Human Lung Cell Atlas 比較健康成人棒狀細胞與其他肺上皮細胞的倍數變化、校正後 p 值與偵測比例，從 68 個通過門檻的基因中選出 UPK1B——富集 2.28 倍、校正後 p = 0.00559，RNA 在 45.92% 的棒狀細胞中被偵測到，其他上皮細胞僅 3.43%。接著他們檢查抗體可及性（Human Surfaceome；UniProt O75841，260 個胺基酸，四個跨膜區，細胞外區段在 37-60 與 108-229）與跨組織選擇性（存檔的 GTEx：肺 0.11 TPM 對膀胱 21.90 TPM；Human Protein Atlas 顯示尿路上皮有膜上表現），並直言 UPK1B 並非棒狀細胞專屬，因此這份分析是在排序一個可供實驗的候選，而非證明選擇性標靶。反應預測的基準測試同樣誠實：仿射對映相較於「預測沒有變化」把平均表現量誤差降低 7.1%，也優於平均反應基線；而非線性的殘差 CellFlow 模型雖改善了部分平均表現量預測，卻使分布一致性與所選的 RNA panel 變差——因此他們保留仿射模型作為參考模型，並把跨捐贈者驗證與 RNA 重建列為未解問題。任務設定為在 GSE249307 與 GSE246368 上以捐贈者留出輪替，來源細胞與目標細胞未配對。","software_zh":"四項軟體產出。AeroEase 是霧化器的 Android 伴隨應用程式，透過 BLE 同步 ESP32-C3 按鈕的時間戳，採用帶檢查碼、session 與重複檢查的驗證握手、以手機校正時鐘，並且只有在資料持久儲存後才回覆確認；接著把這些資料呈現為本機儲存的用藥日誌，含每日與七日次數、依日期篩選的歷史、CSV 匯出，以及一個規則式的離線助理，不需任何雲端呼叫即可回答問題；團隊反覆強調這些紀錄記載的是裝置動作，而非實際遞送劑量或已確認的吸入。FeroEase 以 Flutter 撰寫，透過 Wi-Fi 監測兩階段發酵，提供溫度、pH、攪拌控制，以及一個 OD600 下降趨勢偵測器，用來判定一般實驗室發酵槽不會回報的裂解收取窗口。第三項是用於棒狀細胞標靶選擇的生物資訊管線。另有一個瀏覽器版益智遊戲支援教育活動。硬體方面：AeroEase 是建立在 ESP32-C3 上的可攜式振動篩網霧化器，具可充電電源、session 記錄、BLE、重力供液儲槽，以及在模組化 3D 列印外殼中實體隔開的液體與電子艙；FeroEase 則是一套 ESP32-S3 兩階段培養平台，具 pH 與溫度感測、受控加熱、馬達攪拌與穿透光 OD600 追蹤。製作資源與含原始碼取得方式的使用手冊都公開在 wiki 上。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education was designed from two findings in their own clinician interviews and 461-person questionnaire: patients stop medication once they feel better, and parents refuse to start it for children out of fear of side effects, so compliance - not just awareness - became the target. Activities are segmented by audience. For children: a booth with biology-themed games at the Huairou District National Science Popularization Month fair (September 2026), doubling as a questionnaire collection point, plus a Life Science Classroom proposal for fifth and sixth graders in Huairou primary schools teaching respiratory tract structure through illustrations and interactive demos, published as a downloadable PDF so other teams can run it. For university students: an iGEM Winter Camp training new members with offline wet-lab tutorials (plasmid extraction, PCR, homologous recombination, protein purification) and online dry-lab and modelling tracks, and an annual Microbial Painting competition open to all majors as a recruitment funnel - which failed to produce the expected colony patterns, and the team published the three reasons why (cell sedimentation from static suspension, insufficient streaking density, IPTG induction of EGFP suppressing growth) and used it to teach participants that negative results are normal and troubleshooting is the skill. For the general public: a Public Science Day stall and a browser quiz game on synthetic biology and iGEM.","ihp":"The team formalised its own cycle, RCSF (Reflect-Connect-Share-Feedback), as a deliberate parallel to the DBTL engineering cycle, and ran the project through nine documented iterations with 20 individuals, teams and institutions across six defined communities (academia, medical professionals, industry, supervisors, patients and families, the public), 44 asthma patient representatives and 419 public representatives from under-10s to over-60s. Each community is introduced with who they are, what they know, and why their position matters. The changes are specific and traceable. Doctor Fei Wang's input moved the project from rapid-acting therapy to asthma maintenance treatment, which reset the whole target population. Professor Huaiyong Chen, who studies respiratory disease mechanisms, explained that in asthma many club cells differentiate into mucus-producing goblet cells - supporting the shift away from immune cells to airway epithelium - and told them that NKX2-1, one of their two original cargoes, matters in development but has little effect in adulthood, so it was dropped and SLPI took its place. Professor Pingsheng Liu's survey of liposome, LNP and polymeric carrier limitations fed directly into the ELP carrier rationale and the protein sequence design. Professor Yufei Xia flagged subtle flaws in the experimental design and walked them through the standard in vivo/in vitro validation workflow. Yaozhong Cao, a former iGEMer, argued with them about target specificity, which is upstream of the UPK1B antibody screen. Professor Xiaoru Huang, an ethics of science and technology researcher, reviewed the biosafety and bioethics discipline. They contacted the Huairou District Bureau of Landscaping and Forestry about local pollen and catkin management, grounding the project in Beijing's own regulation (the Measures implementing the Forest Law, effective 1 January 2026) and in observed thunderstorm asthma cases. Patient work was handled with explicit informed consent and privacy statements, and the questionnaire reports its own demographics (21 recovered, 21 currently medicated, 419 unaffected). The team states its guiding principle as 'local people solving local problems', and the HP group's standing job was to track every subteam's bottlenecks and feed external input back into each one.","realWorld":"The entrepreneurship work is a self-critical commercial assessment rather than a pitch. The team states outright that PARCEL's case must rest on defined unmet needs rather than technological novelty, and tabulates the strengths as well as the limitations of inhaled corticosteroids, bronchodilators and biologics before positioning PARCEL as a non-hormonal, lower-frequency, modular maintenance option. The SWOT names real weaknesses: delivery efficiency and duration of expression were only shown in HEK293T in vitro, so mucus, mucociliary clearance, local enzymes and immune uptake remain unaddressed; a combined protein-plus-mRNA product multiplies CMC burden across ELP molecular weight, purity, impurity profile and phase-transition behaviour and mRNA sequence integrity and stability, then payload ratio, condensate characteristics, batch consistency and storage; and the team lists the expertise it does not have (toxicology, regulatory affairs, clinical development, IP, market access). Opportunities are equally concrete - the modular Pum2/PRS-tag design means a new payload needs no new carrier, CAS institutes supply the analytical capability they lack, and China's pay-for-performance medical insurance pilot offers a reimbursement pathway for a therapy that can demonstrate efficacy. They commit to re-reviewing the SWOT at each development milestone.","partners":["Institute of Biophysics, Chinese Academy of Sciences","Institute of Process Engineering, Chinese Academy of Sciences","Institute of Chemistry, Chinese Academy of Sciences","Tsinghua University","Haihe Hospital, Tianjin University","Inner Mongolia International Hospital of Mongolian Medicine","Qingdao Municipal Hospital","Central Hospital of Kaifeng, Henan Province","Meishan Cardio Cerebrovascular Disease Hospital","242 Hospital, Shenyang Medical College","Weikang Pingsheng (Beijing) Biotechnology Co., Ltd.","Huairou District Bureau of Landscaping and Forestry, Beijing","iGEM ENTER team (Harvard Medical School)","Conference of China iGEMer Community (CCiC)","Huairou District primary schools","GenScript","MathWorks","SnapGene"],"publicEngagement_zh":"教育是從團隊自己的臨床訪談與 461 人問卷中的兩項發現設計出來的：病患一覺得好轉就停藥，而家長因為害怕副作用而拒絕讓孩子開始用藥——因此目標變成服藥遵從性，而不只是知識認知。活動依受眾分層。對兒童：在懷柔區全國科普月市集（2026 年 9 月）設攤，辦生物主題遊戲，同時兼作問卷蒐集點；另提出一份「生命科學課堂」方案，針對懷柔區小學五、六年級學生，透過插畫與互動示範教授呼吸道結構，並以可下載 PDF 發布，讓其他隊伍也能照著做。對大學生：辦 iGEM 冬令營培訓新成員，實體課程教濕實驗（質體萃取、PCR、同源重組、蛋白質純化），線上則有乾實驗與建模組；還有一年一度、不限系所的「微生物繪畫」競賽作為招募漏斗——這項活動並未長出預期的菌落圖樣，團隊公開了三個原因（靜置懸浮液造成細胞沉降、塗盤密度不足、IPTG 誘導 EGFP 抑制生長），並藉此教參與者：負面結果是正常的，排除問題才是真功夫。對一般大眾：公眾科學日攤位，以及一個關於合成生物學與 iGEM 的瀏覽器益智遊戲。","ihp_zh":"團隊把自己的循環形式化為 RCSF（Reflect-Connect-Share-Feedback），刻意與工程的 DBTL 循環平行，並讓專案走過九次有記錄的迭代，涉及六個明確界定社群（學界、醫療專業人員、產業、指導教師、病患與家屬、公眾）中的 20 位個人、團隊與機構，以及 44 位氣喘病患代表和 419 位從未滿 10 歲到 60 歲以上的公眾代表。每個社群在介紹時都說明他們是誰、知道什麼，以及為何他們的立場重要。改變具體且可追溯。王飛醫師的意見把專案從速效治療轉向氣喘長期控制治療，整個目標族群因此重設。研究呼吸道疾病機制的陳懷勇教授說明，在氣喘中許多棒狀細胞會分化為產生黏液的杯狀細胞——支持了從免疫細胞轉向呼吸道上皮的方向——並告訴他們兩個原始貨物之一的 NKX2-1 在發育期重要、但在成年期影響甚微，因此該基因被捨棄，由 SLPI 取代。劉平生教授對微脂體、LNP 與高分子載體限制的梳理，直接進入 ELP 載體的立論與蛋白序列設計。夏宇飛教授指出實驗設計中細微的缺陷，並帶他們走過標準的體內／體外驗證流程。前 iGEMer 曹耀中與他們就標靶專一性爭論過，而這正位於 UPK1B 抗體篩選的上游。研究科技倫理的黃小茹教授審閱了生物安全與生物倫理的規範。他們也就當地花粉與柳絮管理聯繫懷柔區園林綠化局，把專案扣回北京自身的法規（《森林法》實施辦法，2026 年 1 月 1 日生效）與觀察到的雷雨氣喘案例。涉及病患的工作都有明確的知情同意與隱私聲明，問卷也報告自身的人口組成（21 位已康復、21 位正在用藥、419 位未受影響）。團隊把自己的指導原則寫為「在地的人解決在地的問題」，而 HP 組的常態任務就是追蹤各子組的瓶頸，並把外部意見回灌到每一組。","realWorld_zh":"創業部分是一份自我批判的商業評估，而不是推銷說詞。團隊直接寫明，PARCEL 的立論必須建立在明確未被滿足的需求之上，而不是技術新穎性，並在把 PARCEL 定位為非荷爾蒙、較低給藥頻率、模組化的長期控制選項之前，先列表比較吸入型皮質類固醇、支氣管擴張劑與生物製劑各自的優點與限制。SWOT 直指真正的弱點：遞送效率與表現持續時間只在 HEK293T 的體外系統中展示過，因此黏液、黏液纖毛清除、局部酵素與免疫吞噬都還沒處理；蛋白加 mRNA 的複合產品會讓 CMC 負擔倍增，橫跨 ELP 分子量、純度、雜質輪廓與相變行為，以及 mRNA 序列完整性與穩定性，再加上載量比、凝聚體特性、批次一致性與保存；團隊也列出自己不具備的專業（毒理、法規事務、臨床開發、智慧財產、市場准入）。機會同樣具體——模組化的 Pum2/PRS 標籤設計意味著換新貨物不需要新載體；中科院各所能提供他們缺少的分析能力；中國的醫保按療效付費試點，為能展示療效的療法提供了給付途徑。他們承諾在每個開發里程碑重新檢視這份 SWOT。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6157/wiki/humanpractices/hp-overview0.avif","caption":"The Human Practices overview: 20 individuals and institutions across six defined communities, 44 asthma patient representatives and 419 public representatives, mapped onto nine project iterations of the team's own RCSF cycle.","credit":"Team UCAS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"人類實踐總覽：六個明確界定社群中的 20 位個人與機構、44 位氣喘病患代表與 419 位公眾代表，對映到團隊自創 RCSF 循環的九次專案迭代。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6157/wiki/software/upk1b-volcano-2.avif","caption":"The club-cell antibody target screen: UPK1B highlighted in the differential-expression volcano against other lung epithelial cells, 2.28-fold enriched with adjusted p = 0.00559 and detected in 45.92% of club cells.","credit":"Team UCAS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"棒狀細胞抗體標靶篩選：UPK1B 在與其他肺上皮細胞比較的差異表現火山圖中被標出，富集 2.28 倍、校正後 p = 0.00559，並在 45.92% 的棒狀細胞中被偵測到。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6157/wiki/hardware/aeroease/pictures/fig6-hardware-2-yhz.avif","caption":"The AeroEase portable vibrating-mesh nebulizer prototype, built on an ESP32-C3 with BLE session logging and a modular 3D-printed housing separating the liquid reservoir from the electronics.","credit":"Team UCAS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"AeroEase 可攜式振動篩網霧化器原型，建立在 ESP32-C3 上，具 BLE session 記錄，模組化 3D 列印外殼把液體儲槽與電子元件隔開。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6157/wiki/education/education-huairou0.avif","caption":"The team's booth at the Huairou District National Science Popularization Month fair, running biology games with children while collecting the public asthma-perception questionnaire.","credit":"Team UCAS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"團隊在懷柔區全國科普月市集的攤位，與兒童進行生物遊戲，同時蒐集公眾氣喘認知問卷。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6157/wiki/software/app-charts-3up.avif","caption":"The AeroEase Android app turning raw BLE device timestamps into a medication-use diary with daily and seven-day activity charts, date-filtered history and CSV export, all stored on the phone.","credit":"Team UCAS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"AeroEase Android 應用程式把 BLE 裝置的原始時間戳轉為用藥日誌，含每日與七日活動圖表、依日期篩選的歷史與 CSV 匯出，全部儲存在手機本機。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Steal the RCSF cycle: UCAS-China gave human practices the same named, repeatable four-step loop (Reflect, Connect, Share, Feedback) that engineering gets with DBTL, mapped every stakeholder into one of six communities with a stated reason for including them, and then showed nine iterations where the loop closed - including dropping a cargo gene because one researcher said it does nothing in adults. A school research centre can run that loop on any project, and the second lesson is just as cheap to copy: publish what failed, as they did with the microbial painting that never grew, and the reasons why.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/model-part1","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/model-part2","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/model-part3","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/model-part4","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/model-part5","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/model-part6","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/inclusivity","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/measurement"],"projectTitle_zh":"PARCEL","tagline_zh":"一種吸入式、以蛋白質為基礎的 mRNA 載體，讓呼吸道細胞自己製造氣喘藥。","summary_zh":"PARCEL 是一個吸入式 mRNA 遞送平台，以類彈性蛋白多肽（ELP）而非脂質奈米顆粒構成。融合蛋白 ELP-Pum2-EEP13 以 Pum2 抓取 3' UTR 帶有 PRS 標籤的 mRNA，利用 ELP 的相分離把它包裹並保護起來，再以內體逃脫肽離開內體，並以 Sortase A 接合的抗 UPK1B scFv 鎖定呼吸道棒狀細胞（club cell）；所攜帶的貨物是 SLPI 的 mRNA（抑制嗜中性球彈性蛋白酶及其引發的黏液過度分泌），加上較低劑量的 IFN-lambda-1（抗病毒防禦與 Th2 抑制）。本專案獲得亞軍與 Best Integrated Human Practices，因為利害關係人工作真的導引了科學：臨床醫師把專案從急救治療轉向長期控制治療，而一位氣喘機制研究者則直接否決了兩個原始貨物之一。乾實驗室的完整度相當罕見，從 E. coli 生產、經霧化器氣霧沉積，一路模擬到以 FEV1 與 FeNO 表示的 PK-PD 讀值，每一個模組都餵給下一個。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把 RCSF 循環學走：UCAS-China 讓人類實踐擁有和工程的 DBTL 一樣有名字、可重複的四步迴圈（Reflect、Connect、Share、Feedback），把每位利害關係人歸入六個社群之一並說明納入理由，然後展示了九次確實閉合的迭代——包括因為一位研究者說某基因在成年期沒有作用，就直接拿掉一個貨物基因。學校的研究單位在任何專案上都能跑這個迴圈；第二個教訓同樣便宜好學：公開失敗的部分，就像他們公開那場始終沒長起來的微生物繪畫活動，以及失敗的原因。","awards_zh":["亞軍（大學組）","Top 10（大學組）","最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 得主（大學組）","最佳治療專案 — 入圍"],"rank":212},"6158":{"team":"HongKong-JSS","id":"6158","section":"High School","country":"Hong Kong","village":"Agriculture","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-jss/","projectTitle":"MerMAID - MerR-based Mercury Assay for In-field Detection","projectTitle_zh":"MerMAID - MerR-based Mercury Assay for In-field Detection","tagline":"One mercury ion among a billion molecules of water - a living sensor that glows red, read by a portable detector fed by a modular sample-extraction platform.","tagline_zh":"十億個水分子中的一個汞離子——一個會發紅光的活體感測器，由可攜式偵測器讀取，前端再接上模組化的樣品萃取平台。","summary":"HongKong-JSS is a four-school joint team (Y.W.C.A. Hioe Tjo Yoeng College, Po Leung Kuk Celine Ho Yam Tong College, Pentecostal School, Yan Oi Tong Tin Ka Ping Secondary School) that built a complete mercury-screening system for agricultural water and soil: a MerR-regulated E. coli biosensor expressing mRFP1e, a portable modular fluorescence reader, and a motorised sample-extraction platform that turns soil and water into a standard assay input. They designed, built and tested 13 biosensor prototypes - 2 aptamer-based and 11 protein-based - of which two protein designs responded to Hg2+, with the best showing low background, a response down to about 1 ppb (0.005 uM, roughly sixfold below the WHO drinking-water guideline of 6 ug/L), no cross-response to Cd2+, Pb2+ or Zn2+ at the concentrations tested, and retained function after alginate encapsulation. It took 1st Runner-up Grand Prize in the High School section and won Best Village Project, and the reason is visible on every page: the wiki's standing rule is that every number carries its conditions and a source, and the team separates demonstrated results from deployment claims more rigorously than most university teams.","summary_zh":"HongKong-JSS 是四校聯隊（Y.W.C.A. Hioe Tjo Yoeng College、Po Leung Kuk Celine Ho Yam Tong College、Pentecostal School、Yan Oi Tong Tin Ka Ping Secondary School），為農業用水與土壤做出一整套汞篩檢系統：一個由 MerR 調控、表現 mRFP1e 的 E. coli 生物感測器、一台可攜式模組化螢光讀取儀，以及一座可把土壤與水轉換成標準檢測輸入的電動樣品萃取平台。他們設計、製作並測試了 13 個感測器原型——2 個基於適體（aptamer）、11 個基於蛋白質——其中兩個蛋白質設計對 Hg2+ 有反應，表現最好的背景值低、反應可下探到約 1 ppb（0.005 uM，約為 WHO 飲用水指引值 6 ug/L 的六分之一），在測試濃度下對 Cd2+、Pb2+ 或 Zn2+ 沒有交叉反應，而且在海藻酸鈉包覆後仍保有功能。他們拿下高中組 1st Runner-up Grand Prize 與 Best Village Project，而理由在每一頁都看得見：這個 wiki 的常規是每個數字都要帶著它的條件與來源，而且團隊把「已展示的結果」和「佈署時的主張」分得比多數大學團隊更嚴格。","awards":["1st Runner-up (High School)","Top 10 (High School)","Best New Composite Part — Nominee (High School)","Best Model — Nominee (High School)","Best Hardware — Nominee (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Winner (Agriculture / Food & Nutrition / Fashion & Cosmetics / Art & Design)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"The headline model is a calibration-and-inverse-prediction framework rather than a mechanistic simulation, and it is unusually well executed. Image signals were defined explicitly before any fitting: colour response C = 1 - (G_pellet / G_white) from green-channel intensity measured in ImageJ on pellets photographed against a white tile, and fluorescence response F = R_pellet / R_background from red-channel intensity inside a light box, with the matched untreated control from the same run and timepoint subtracted (delta-C, delta-F) and no OD normalisation. They then fitted a log-linear model delta-S = A + b log10(c / 0.005 uM) with 0.005 uM chosen as the reference so A is directly interpretable, giving delta-C = 0.04363 + 0.07591 log10(c/0.005) and delta-F = 0.42290 + 1.08721 log10(c/0.005). Crucially, calibration and validation data were separated up front - 20 calibration measurements from four runs (2, 6, 8 and 13 October) and 10 held-out validation measurements from two further runs (14 and 15 October) for each readout, all at the four-hour timepoint across 0.005, 0.01, 0.03, 0.05 and 0.1 uM. The model was inverted to estimate unknown concentration, c-hat = 0.005 uM x 10^((delta-S - A)/b), and scored by RMSE on the held-out runs: approximately 0.0483 uM for colour and 0.0319 uM for fluorescence, with all numerical predictions included so that failures were not hidden (a 0.1 uM sample on 15 October was estimated at 0.246 uM by colour). On the hardware side they ran CAD-based dry-lab studies for a UV advanced-oxidation-process reactor, modelling fluid flow dynamics, UV photo-oxidation kinetics and lamp exposure times for both a batch quartz-tube reactor and a thin-layer millifluidic cassette, computing a residence time of 192.6 s and a modelled minimum-to-maximum light ratio of 92.2% across the 1 mm layer; the filter assembly was developed parametrically in OpenSCAD. Promoter selection also used in silico promoter-strength analysis, which predicted J23106 to be comparable to P429 and so added it as a comparison design.","frameworks_zh":"主要的模型是一套校正與反推預測的框架，而不是機制性模擬，而且執行得罕見地好。影像訊號在任何擬合之前就先明確定義：顏色反應 C = 1 - (G_pellet / G_white)，取自把菌體沉澱物放在白色磁磚上拍照後、以 ImageJ 量得的綠色通道強度；螢光反應 F = R_pellet / R_background，取自燈箱內的紅色通道強度；並扣除同一批次、同一時間點的對應未處理對照（delta-C、delta-F），不做 OD 正規化。接著擬合一條對數線性模型 delta-S = A + b log10(c / 0.005 uM)，之所以選 0.005 uM 當參考點，是為了讓 A 可直接解讀，結果為 delta-C = 0.04363 + 0.07591 log10(c/0.005) 與 delta-F = 0.42290 + 1.08721 log10(c/0.005)。關鍵在於校正與驗證資料一開始就分開——每一種讀值都有來自四個批次（10 月 2、6、8、13 日）的 20 筆校正量測，以及來自另外兩個批次（10 月 14、15 日）的 10 筆保留驗證量測，全部取第四小時的時間點，濃度為 0.005、0.01、0.03、0.05 與 0.1 uM。模型被反轉來估計未知濃度，c-hat = 0.005 uM x 10^((delta-S - A)/b)，並在保留批次上以 RMSE 評分：顏色約 0.0483 uM，螢光約 0.0319 uM，而且所有數值預測都列出來，失敗不被藏起（10 月 15 日一個 0.1 uM 的樣品，用顏色估成 0.246 uM）。硬體方面，他們為一座 UV 高級氧化程序（AOP）反應器做了基於 CAD 的乾實驗研究，為批次式石英管反應器與薄層毫流體匣兩種設計建模流體流動、UV 光氧化動力學與燈管曝照時間，算出滯留時間 192.6 s，並在 1 mm 厚的液層內模擬出 92.2% 的最小/最大光強比；濾材組件則以 OpenSCAD 參數化開發。啟動子的選擇也用了電腦模擬的啟動子強度分析，預測 J23106 與 P429 相當，因此把它加為比較用設計。","dataviz":"Presentation is built around separating what was measured from what is assumed. Charts show individual run points alongside coloured means and error bars rather than only pooled summaries, the model page plots known versus estimated concentration against a dashed perfect-prediction line with out-of-calibration-range estimates marked separately, and tables consistently split 'experimental finding' from 'design goal' and 'prototype performance' from 'deployment claim'. Every figure caption states its conditions. The hardware readout itself is a data-visualisation artefact: Detection Unit V3.0 pairs a Hamamatsu C12880 miniature spectrometer (288-pixel detector, 340-850 nm, 12 nm typical FWHM) with two ESP32-S3-N16R8 microcontrollers driving a local TFT display and a Wi-Fi-connected web interface that shows the recorded spectrum and the raw signal at a user-selected target wavelength, with online data logging, registered devices, selected-wavelength trends and recorded runs reviewable on a phone or computer. A red/amber/green status display was added later, and the team deliberately separated device status, fluorescence reading, concentration estimate and safety judgement on screen so that a green operational light cannot be misread as 'this sample is safe'.","dataviz_zh":"呈現方式圍繞著「把量到的和假設的分開」來建構。圖表會把個別批次的點與有顏色區分的平均值及誤差棒一起畫出來，而不是只給彙總值；模型頁把已知濃度對估計濃度畫在一條虛線完美預測線旁，並把落在校正範圍外的估計值另外標記；表格則一貫地把「實驗發現」與「設計目標」、「原型表現」與「佈署主張」切開。每張圖的說明都寫明其條件。硬體讀取端本身就是一件資料視覺化成品：Detection Unit V3.0 把 Hamamatsu C12880 微型光譜儀（288 像素偵測器、340-850 nm、典型半高寬 12 nm）與兩顆 ESP32-S3-N16R8 微控制器配在一起，驅動一個本機 TFT 顯示器與一個連 Wi-Fi 的網頁介面，顯示記錄到的光譜與使用者選定目標波長的原始訊號，並支援線上資料記錄、已註冊裝置、選定波長的趨勢，以及可在手機或電腦上回顧的歷史批次。紅/黃/綠狀態顯示是後來加的，而團隊刻意在畫面上把裝置狀態、螢光讀值、濃度估計與安全判斷分開，以免綠色的運作指示燈被誤讀成「這個樣品是安全的」。","datascience":"The analysis is notable for publishing its own limitations as a work plan. They state that the pooled model does not separately estimate run-to-run variation, that the reported concentrations are point estimates with no uncertainty intervals, that no detection or quantification limit has been established, and that rounded signal values were used as fitting inputs. They then specify the fixes concretely: a random-intercept mixed model delta-S_ri = A + b log10(c_ri/0.005) + u_r + e_ri with run-specific slopes only if the data support them and with convergence and singularity checks; inverse-calibration intervals that distinguish prediction for a new run from prediction for a run containing a measured reference standard; a per-run intercept correction A_r = delta-S_standard,r - b log10(c_standard/0.005) estimated from a known standard run alongside every experiment; leave-one-run-out cross-validation over six folds with the warning that selecting and evaluating on the same cross-validation results produces optimistic estimates; and comparison of the local log-linear fit against a four-parameter logistic model if data across 0.001-5 uM becomes available. They also ran and reported an exploratory sensitivity check swapping calibration runs, and honestly noted that because the validation runs were examined during that comparison they no longer constitute a completely untouched final assessment. Results-page statistics use two-sided paired t-tests across five independent paired runs with explicit notice that p-values are unadjusted for the three readouts. Hardware performance was quantified the same way: automated water delivery gave a coefficient of variation of 1.95% against 7.41% across 10 manual syringe runs, drainage retained volumes of 0.28, 0.31 and 0.30 mL (mean ~0.30 mL, about 95% liquid recovery), and reducing tubing bore from 7 mm to 1 mm over a 10 cm segment was computed to cut geometric dead volume accordingly.","datascience_zh":"這份分析最值得注意的地方，是把自己的限制當成工作計畫公開。他們寫明：彙總模型沒有單獨估計批次間變異、報告的濃度是點估計而沒有不確定區間、尚未建立偵測極限或定量極限，以及擬合輸入用的是四捨五入後的訊號值。接著他們把修法具體寫出來：一個隨機截距混合模型 delta-S_ri = A + b log10(c_ri/0.005) + u_r + e_ri，只有在資料支持時才加入批次專屬斜率，並做收斂與奇異性檢查；反向校正的區間，並區分「對一個新批次的預測」與「對一個含有已量測參考標準品的批次的預測」；每批次的截距校正 A_r = delta-S_standard,r - b log10(c_standard/0.005)，由每次實驗旁同時跑的已知標準品估得；六折的留一批次交叉驗證，並附上警語：在同一組交叉驗證結果上同時做選擇與評估會產生過於樂觀的估計；以及若未來取得 0.001-5 uM 範圍的資料，就把局部對數線性擬合與四參數邏輯斯模型比較。他們也做了並報告一次交換校正批次的探索性敏感度檢查，並誠實指出：因為驗證批次在那次比較中已被看過，它們已不再構成完全未經接觸的最終評估。結果頁的統計使用五組獨立配對批次的雙尾配對 t 檢定，並明確註明 p 值未針對三種讀值做多重比較校正。硬體效能也用同樣方式量化：自動化給水的變異係數為 1.95%，而 10 次人工針筒操作為 7.41%；排液殘留體積為 0.28、0.31 與 0.30 mL（平均約 0.30 mL，約 95% 液體回收率）；而把 10 cm 管段的管徑從 7 mm 縮到 1 mm，經計算可相應減少幾何死體積。","software":"Open hardware and firmware rather than a bioinformatics tool. The Detection Unit CAD is published in Onshape (https://cad.onshape.com/documents/2228cb45d05bdbc67479791d) and the firmware and software at https://github.com/hkjssplkchc2026/mercurysense, containing ESP32 firmware, the C12880 spectrometer driver, acquisition instructions and Python/web monitoring software, with a live monitoring web app for reviewing spectra and runs. The Extraction Unit code is at https://github.com/davidlueng986-alt/MerMAID-Extraction-Unit. An itemised bill of materials is published with a ~USD 357 core-component subtotal (LED 2x 560 nm at USD 2.60, etc.), and the team states plainly that this overshot the USD 40 affordability target stakeholders had asked for. The detection unit went through four versions (AS7343 14-channel spectral sensor in a laser-cut acrylic box, to an opaque 3D-printed enclosure with recessed lid and adjustable optical mounts, to the C12880 spectrometer with interchangeable filters, fluid handling and web interface) and the extraction platform through three, with state-machine control sequences published for the water, soil and UV-AOP modules together with error-handling tests covering pump timeouts, watchdog recovery, soil-mass checks, stirring feedback, reagent availability and weighing faults. An educational browser game, 'Small Signal: a MerMAID field school', is published as a 3-5 minute pixel-art laboratory game in which players build a biological signal path, compare an unknown sample with its controls, and decide what the evidence supports - and is labelled a beta prototype whose educational effectiveness has not yet been evaluated. Repository: https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/hongkong-jss.","software_zh":"釋出的是開源硬體與韌體，而不是生物資訊工具。Detection Unit 的 CAD 公開在 Onshape（https://cad.onshape.com/documents/2228cb45d05bdbc67479791d），韌體與軟體在 https://github.com/hkjssplkchc2026/mercurysense，內含 ESP32 韌體、C12880 光譜儀驅動程式、擷取說明與 Python/網頁監控軟體，另有一個可回顧光譜與歷史批次的即時監控網頁應用程式。萃取單元的程式碼在 https://github.com/davidlueng986-alt/MerMAID-Extraction-Unit。材料清單逐項公開，核心元件小計約 USD 357（例如 2 顆 560 nm LED 為 USD 2.60），而團隊也直說這超出了利害關係人要求的 USD 40 可負擔門檻。偵測單元走過四個版本（雷射切割壓克力盒內的 AS7343 14 通道光譜感測器，到帶內凹上蓋與可調光學固定座的不透光 3D 列印外殼，再到搭配可更換濾片、流體操作與網頁介面的 C12880 光譜儀），萃取平台走過三個版本，並公開水、土壤與 UV-AOP 模組的狀態機控制序列，以及涵蓋泵浦逾時、watchdog 復歸、土壤質量檢查、攪拌回饋、試劑可用性與秤重故障的錯誤處理測試。另有一款教育用瀏覽器遊戲「Small Signal: a MerMAID field school」，是一個 3-5 分鐘的像素風實驗室遊戲，玩家在其中建立一條生物訊號路徑、把未知樣品與其對照比較，並判斷證據能支持什麼——而它被標明為 beta 原型，教育成效尚未評估。版本庫：https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/hongkong-jss。","stack":["ImageJ (green/red channel intensity extraction)","log-linear calibration with inverse prediction","RMSE on held-out runs","planned random-intercept mixed model and leave-one-run-out cross-validation","four-parameter logistic model (proposed)","paired two-sided t-tests","Onshape CAD","OpenSCAD (parametric filter assembly)","3D printing and laser cutting","ESP32-S3-N16R8 microcontrollers","Hamamatsu C12880MA miniature spectrometer","AS7343 spectral sensor","Python / web monitoring interface","GitHub","CFD and UV photo-oxidation kinetics dry-lab simulation","alginate encapsulation"],"techniques":["pre-registered split of calibration and validation runs before fitting","control subtraction within the same run and timepoint","inverse calibration to estimate unknown concentrations","flagging estimates outside the calibration range instead of reporting them silently","including failed predictions in the error metric","exploratory calibration-set sensitivity check, with disclosure that it contaminated the held-out set","publishing a specific statistical work plan for unmodelled run-to-run variance","coefficient-of-variation comparison of automated versus manual fluid handling","spectral matching of LED, excitation filter and reporter emission to suppress background","interface design that separates device status from safety judgement"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Nine targeted outreach events reaching over 2,400 participants, organised as an explicit four-tier framework. Tier 1 (primary students and parents, over 1,600 people) ran interactive Open Day and Information Day booths at Y.W.C.A. Hioe Tjo Yoeng College and Po Leung Kuk Celine Ho Yam Tong College with strawberry DNA extraction and live gel electrophoresis demonstrations. Tier 2 (over 730 secondary peers) covered Microbiology 101 for Grade 10 students on microbe handling, laboratory safety, cleanliness and contamination prevention, and a morning assembly for 700 Grade 7-12 students that framed synthetic biology through agricultural mercury contamination and explained how cellular components can be repurposed as logic gates and biosensors. Tier 3 is the most durable: a two-day Teacher Biotech Training Workshop for 30 local school teachers covering PCR and agarose gel electrophoresis, combined with a standing loan programme letting those teachers borrow DNA samples and laboratory equipment from the team - a deliberate attempt to leave teaching capacity behind after the competition ends. Tier 4 took the work into public and civic space: an exhibitor stand at InnoEX 2026, the international innovation and technology exhibition in Hong Kong, and a presentation alongside the Drainage Services Department at its Annual Media Briefing, which put the project on an official government webpage and into local news. They also ran a street interview with 30 members of the public specifically about a 'mercury-free' produce certification label, finding unanimous support for the idea, 14 people rating it very important for public health, 12 supporting it even at higher vegetable prices, 22 willing to buy certified produce at normal prices and 4 willing to pay extra - while also recording that 19 respondents remained somewhat or very worried about engineered bacteria leaking from the sealed device against only 8 who were not, a finding they published rather than buried. The browser game 'Small Signal' extends this by teaching the reasoning - compare the unknown against its controls, then decide what the evidence can support.","publicEngagement_zh":"九場有明確對象的推廣活動、超過 2,400 位參與者，並編排成一套明示的四層架構。第一層（國小學生與家長，超過 1,600 人）在 Y.W.C.A. Hioe Tjo Yoeng College 與 Po Leung Kuk Celine Ho Yam Tong College 的開放日與資訊日設互動攤位，示範草莓 DNA 萃取與現場膠體電泳。第二層（超過 730 位中學同儕）包括為 10 年級學生開的 Microbiology 101，內容涵蓋微生物操作、實驗室安全、清潔與污染預防，以及一場 700 位 7 至 12 年級學生的朝會，從農業汞污染切入合成生物學，並說明細胞元件如何被改用成邏輯閘與生物感測器。第三層最耐久：為 30 位本地學校教師辦的兩天教師生技培訓工作坊，涵蓋 PCR 與瓊脂膠體電泳，再搭配一個常設的借用方案，讓這些教師可以向團隊借 DNA 樣品與實驗設備——這是刻意要在競賽結束後把教學能力留下來。第四層把成果帶進公共與公民空間：在香港的國際創新科技展 InnoEX 2026 設攤，並在渠務署的年度媒體簡報會上與該署一同發表，使專案登上官方政府網頁與本地新聞。他們也針對一個「無汞」農產認證標籤，對 30 位市民做街訪，發現這個想法獲得一致支持：14 人認為它對公共衛生非常重要、12 人即使蔬菜價格因此較高仍支持、22 人願意以正常價格購買認證農產、4 人願意多付錢——同時也記錄下有 19 位受訪者對工程改造細菌從密封裝置洩漏仍有些或非常擔心，而不擔心的只有 8 位；這個發現他們選擇公開而非埋掉。瀏覽器遊戲「Small Signal」則延伸這條線，教的是推論方式——先把未知樣品和它的對照比較，再判斷證據能支持什麼。","ihp":"Human Practices ran on a stated operating principle - respond promptly to stakeholder feedback, and let it drive the next hardware revision - structured across four stages and a five-question cycle (Inspiration, Intercommunication, Investigation, Implementation, Impact) with the rule that each engagement must end in either a documented change or a documented reason for no change. There is also a five-tier Target User Prioritisation Pyramid which they explicitly label a working framework rather than a validated exposure ranking, and which puts underserved communities near suspected contamination sources such as informal e-waste processing sites above farmers, researchers, regulators and the general public. The traceable changes: the Drainage Services Department's guidance moved them off the chromoproteins used in earlier projects onto mRFP1e as a dual readout - visible colour for non-specialists plus a more sensitive fluorescence channel for quantification - and DSD, the Water Supplies Department and university researchers together pushed them to test lower concentrations, benchmark against international reference values, and assess cross-response to interfering heavy metals (hence the Cd2+/Pb2+/Zn2+ selectivity panel). Koo's Farm and local wet market vendors demanded numerical readings instead of qualitative colour indicators, which is the direct reason the AS7343 14-channel sensor was replaced by the wavelength-resolved Hamamatsu C12880 and why a numerical display and web readout exist. University professors said soil particulates must be removed before optical measurement and recommended a modular design, which produced the separate water, soil and planned organic-mercury extraction modules. Users reported excessive syringe force on the V1 filter stack (2 um pre-filter plus 0.45 um membrane), so manual syringe delivery was replaced by pump-driven dosing - measured as an improvement from 7.41% to 1.95% coefficient of variation. On-site trials at Blue Girl Organic Farm and Yeung Marine Products Limited with agricultural soil extracts, irrigation water and fish pond water (run without GM bacteria, since they could not legally be taken out of the lab) produced requests for clearer indicators and better protection against water and mud, answered with a red/amber/green status display, a reinforced housing, and maintenance access and modularity designed into the proposed V4.0. A second public survey combining street interviews with hands-on demonstrations for 195 people found 87.7% more confident that ordinary people could participate in checking soil and water safety and 84.1% finding the digital readout easy to understand - and the team immediately noted that perceived confidence and readability do not establish analytical accuracy, and separated device status from safety judgement in the interface as a direct result. More Happy Farm said plainly that not every farmer wants to own a device, which pushed them towards a service model. Throughout, they keep stating what their evidence does not cover: a response in a controlled biological assay does not establish accurate measurement in soil extracts, reliable operation of the complete device, or suitability for regulatory decisions.","ihp_zh":"人類實踐依一條寫明的運作原則進行——對利害關係人的回饋迅速回應，並讓它驅動下一次硬體改版——架構分四個階段、搭配五問循環（Inspiration、Intercommunication、Investigation、Implementation、Impact），規則是每次互動都必須以一項有紀錄的改變、或一項有紀錄的「為何不改」作結。另有一座五層的目標使用者優先序金字塔，他們明確標示這是一個工作用框架，而不是經過驗證的暴露風險排序；金字塔把靠近疑似污染源（例如非正式電子廢棄物處理場）的弱勢社區，排在農民、研究者、法規機關與一般大眾之上。可追溯的改變包括：渠務署的建議讓他們放棄早期專案使用的發色蛋白，改用 mRFP1e 做雙重讀值——給非專業者看的可見顏色，加上更靈敏、可供定量的螢光通道；渠務署、水務署與大學研究者則一起推動他們測試更低濃度、對照國際參考值做基準比較，並評估干擾重金屬的交叉反應（因此有了 Cd2+/Pb2+/Zn2+ 的選擇性測試組）。Koo's Farm 與本地街市攤商要求的是數值讀數、不是定性的顏色指示，這正是 AS7343 14 通道感測器被換成可分辨波長的 Hamamatsu C12880 的直接原因，也是數值顯示與網頁讀值存在的原因。大學教授指出土壤顆粒必須在光學量測前移除，並建議模組化設計，於是產生了分開的水模組、土壤模組與規劃中的有機汞萃取模組。使用者反映 V1 的濾材疊層（2 um 前濾加 0.45 um 濾膜）需要的推針力過大，因此人工針筒給液被換成泵浦驅動給液——實測變異係數從 7.41% 改善到 1.95%。在 Blue Girl Organic Farm 與 Yeung Marine Products Limited 用農地土壤萃取液、灌溉水與魚塘水做的現地試驗（因為基改細菌依法不能帶出實驗室，所以是在沒有基改細菌的情況下進行）帶回了「指示要更清楚」與「要更能防水防泥」的要求，回應方式是紅/黃/綠狀態顯示、強化外殼，以及在提案中的 V4.0 設計進維護入口與模組化。第二次公眾調查結合街訪與對 195 人的實機示範，發現 87.7% 更有信心認為一般人也能參與檢查土壤與水的安全、84.1% 覺得數位讀值容易理解——而團隊立刻指出，感受到的信心與可讀性並不等於分析準確度，並因此直接在介面上把裝置狀態與安全判斷分開。More Happy Farm 則直白表示，不是每個農民都想自己擁有一台裝置，這把他們推向服務模式。整份文件中，他們一再說明自己的證據沒有涵蓋什麼：在受控生物檢測中有反應，並不代表在土壤萃取液中能準確量測、不代表整台裝置能可靠運作，也不代表適合用於法規決策。","realWorld":"The commercial concept is Certification-as-a-Service rather than instrument sales: farmers pay an annual subscription, the team visits to test soil on site with MerMAID, passing farms receive a 'Heavy Metal-Free' certificate and logo for supermarket packaging that lets them command a premium, and random surprise re-tests throughout the year (affordable precisely because the test is cheap and fast) guard the certificate's integrity. The plan is backed by a SWOT matrix, a competitor comparison against off-site laboratory testing (HKD 500+ per test, weeks of turnaround) and quick chemical test strips, and a five-step business plan naming AFCD, the Hong Kong Organic Resource Centre and premium supermarkets as the partners whose endorsement would make the certificate a standard. What lifts it above a typical student business plan is the case-study section: they analyse three real commercial analogues - Hygiena's reader-plus-consumables-plus-records model, SGS's accredited food-safety testing service, and Hong Kong's AFCD/VMO Accredited Farm Scheme - and draw out the uncomfortable implications, including that MerR-responsive bioavailable Hg(II) and a reference method's total-mercury result may be different measurands that cannot be assumed to agree just because both are labelled mercury, that a logo on packaging cannot replace a sample-to-report record tied to farm, location, date, sample ID and method scope, and that the full cost per valid result must include consumables, controls, staff time, storage, failed runs and waste handling. They state outright that the USD 350 build cost missed the USD 40 target, that the certification journey is a proposed direction, that the current prototype does not establish that any farm or product is heavy-metal-free, and that they claim no certification authority. Real-world constraints are acknowledged rather than wished away: engineered microbes cannot legally be placed in bins or taken into the field in Hong Kong, the on-site demonstrations therefore ran without GM bacteria, and the sub-five-minute loading and readout sequence is distinguished from the five hours of reporter expression the actual assay needs.","realWorld_zh":"商業概念是「認證即服務」，而不是賣儀器：農民付年度訂閱費，團隊到場用 MerMAID 檢測土壤，通過的農場取得「無重金屬」證書與標章，可用在超市包裝上取得溢價，而全年不定期的突擊複檢（正因為檢測便宜又快才負擔得起）則守住證書的可信度。這套計畫有 SWOT 矩陣支撐，另有與委外實驗室檢測（每次 HKD 500 以上、等待數週）以及快速化學試紙的競品比較，還有一份五步驟營運計畫，指名漁農自然護理署（AFCD）、香港有機資源中心與高階超市為能讓這張證書變成標準的背書夥伴。真正讓它高於一般學生商業計畫的是案例研究那一節：他們分析了三個真實的商業對照——Hygiena 的「讀取儀＋耗材＋紀錄」模式、SGS 的認證食品安全檢測服務，以及香港 AFCD/VMO 的認可農場計畫——並把令人不舒服的推論攤出來，包括：MerR 所反應的生物可利用 Hg(II) 與參考方法測得的總汞，可能是兩個不同的被測量，不能因為都叫「汞」就假定一致；包裝上的標章無法取代一份綁定農場、地點、日期、樣品編號與方法範圍的「樣品到報告」紀錄；而每一筆有效結果的完整成本，必須把耗材、對照、人力時間、保存、失敗批次與廢棄物處理都算進去。他們直說 USD 350 的製作成本沒達到 USD 40 的目標、認證這條路只是提案方向、目前的原型並不能證明任何農場或產品無重金屬，而且他們不主張自己具有任何認證權限。現實限制也是承認而不是迴避：在香港，工程改造的微生物依法不能丟進垃圾桶或帶到田間，因此現地示範是在沒有基改細菌的情況下進行；而五分鐘以內的裝填與讀取流程，也和實際檢測所需的五小時報告基因表現時間明確區分開來。","partners":["Drainage Services Department (DSD), Hong Kong - external adviser, including Dr Van","Environmental Protection Department (EPD)","Agriculture, Fisheries and Conservation Department (AFCD)","Water Supplies Department (WSD)","WEEE-PARK","Dr. Li Wai Chin, The Education University of Hong Kong","Prof. Liang and CUHK researchers","Blue Girl Organic Farm","Yeung Marine Products Limited","HKFYG Jockey Club Organic Farm","Koo's Farm","More Happy Farm","local wet market vendors","InnoEX 2026","IDT, New England Biolabs, Twist Bioscience, miniPCR/miniOne, BTEA (sponsors)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6158/wiki/model/figure-1.avif","caption":"Control-subtracted colour and pellet-fluorescence signals against log mercury concentration, with each calibration run coloured separately and the pooled log-linear fit overlaid.","caption_zh":"扣除對照後的顏色與菌體沉澱物螢光訊號對汞濃度對數作圖，每個校正批次以不同顏色標示，並疊上彙總後的對數線性擬合線。","credit":"Team HongKong-JSS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6158/wiki/model/figure-2.avif","caption":"Known versus estimated mercury concentration for the held-out validation runs, against a dashed perfect-prediction line, with estimates falling outside the calibration range marked separately rather than dropped.","caption_zh":"保留驗證批次的已知濃度對估計濃度，搭配一條虛線完美預測線；落在校正範圍之外的估計值另外標記，而不是直接刪掉。","credit":"Team HongKong-JSS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6158/wiki/hardware/hw13.avif","caption":"Detection Unit V3.0: the Hamamatsu C12880 miniature spectrometer with its driver board, an ESP32-S3-N16R8 for Wi-Fi, and the mobile web interface showing the recorded spectrum and raw signal at a selected wavelength - the upgrade stakeholders forced by demanding numbers, not colours.","caption_zh":"Detection Unit V3.0：Hamamatsu C12880 微型光譜儀與其驅動板、負責 Wi-Fi 的 ESP32-S3-N16R8，以及顯示記錄光譜與選定波長原始訊號的手機網頁介面——這次升級，是利害關係人要求數字而非顏色所逼出來的。","credit":"Team HongKong-JSS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6158/wiki/education/edu05-new-png.avif","caption":"The two-day Teacher Biotech Training Workshop for 30 local school teachers, covering PCR and agarose gel electrophoresis and backed by an ongoing DNA sample and equipment loan programme so the teaching capacity outlasts the team.","caption_zh":"為 30 位本地學校教師辦的兩天教師生技培訓工作坊，涵蓋 PCR 與瓊脂膠體電泳，並以持續的 DNA 樣品與設備借用方案為後盾，讓教學能力比團隊活得更久。","credit":"Team HongKong-JSS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Adopt their calibration discipline wholesale: split runs into calibration and validation before fitting anything, subtract a control from the same run and timepoint, invert the fit to predict unknowns, report RMSE on the held-out runs with the failures left in, flag out-of-range estimates, and then publish the statistical work you have not done yet (run-aware mixed model, inverse-calibration uncertainty intervals, leave-one-run-out cross-validation, a per-run reference standard) as a named plan. The second lesson is their teacher-capacity play - training 30 local teachers in PCR and gel electrophoresis and lending them the reagents and kit - which multiplies a school team's reach far more cheaply than any one-off workshop.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把他們的校正紀律整套搬走：在擬合任何東西之前就先把實驗批次分成校正組與驗證組；扣掉同一批次、同一時間點的對照；把擬合式反轉來預測未知樣品；在保留的批次上報告 RMSE，而且把失敗案例留在裡面；標出超出範圍的估計值；然後把自己還沒做的統計工作（考慮批次的混合模型、反向校正的不確定區間、留一批次交叉驗證、每批次一個參考標準品）寫成一份具名的計畫公開。第二課是他們培養師資的這一手——訓練 30 位本地教師做 PCR 與膠體電泳，並把試劑與器材借給他們——這比任何一次性的工作坊都更便宜地放大了一支校隊的影響範圍。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-jss/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-jss/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-jss/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-jss/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-jss/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-jss/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-jss/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-jss/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-jss/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-jss/contribution","https://github.com/hkjssplkchc2026/mercurysense","https://github.com/davidlueng986-alt/MerMAID-Extraction-Unit","https://cad.onshape.com/documents/2228cb45d05bdbc67479791d","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/hongkong-jss","https://api.igem.org/v1/teams/6158"],"awards_zh":["亞軍（高中組）","Top 10（高中組）","最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳模型 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳硬體 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 得主（農業 / 食品與營養 / 時尚與美妝 / 藝術與設計）"],"rank":219},"6165":{"team":"SMS-Shenzhen","id":"6165","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Climate Crisis / Conservation / Bioremediation (inferred from project scope; no village stated on the wiki)","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/sms-shenzhen/","projectTitle":"kisMET - selective biosorption of residual metals from battery-recycling wastewater","tagline":"Catching the last one percent of lithium, cobalt, nickel and manganese without more chemistry","summary":"kisMET targets the tail-end wastewater of spent lithium-ion battery recycling, where metal concentrations fall to parts-per-million and solvent extraction stops being economic. The team engineered Komagataeibacter rhaeticus to decorate its own bacterial cellulose with a secreted fusion protein built from a signal peptide, a carbohydrate-binding module, a HiBiT reporter tag and a swappable ion-binding peptide, assembled by Golden Gate on a pSEVA331 backbone under a rhamnose-inducible promoter. Four SP/CBM scaffolds and an eight-member ion-binding-peptide panel were designed so the binding specificity can be changed without redesigning the platform. Evidence so far covers cultivation, construct and reporter comparisons, single-metal binding experiments and cellulose-degradation assays; the team states clearly that selectivity in mixed wastewater, closed-loop cellulose reuse and complete metal recovery are design objectives, not results.","awards":["Best New Composite Part — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A prospective carbon-footprint and techno-economic model, built in two levels: Level A is a preliminary estimate of the material-production module using the team's own measured fermentation parameters, and Level B is the full wastewater-treatment system, deferred until adsorption and recycling performance exist. The functional unit is treatment of one tonne of end-of-pipe battery-recycling wastewater, with the system boundary held identical for the kisMET route and the chemical-precipitation baseline (reagent manufacturing and sludge disposal only; pump and agitation energy excluded). Emission factors are taken from peer-reviewed literature using ecoinvent v3.9.1 global-average datasets, cradle-to-gate. There is no mechanistic or kinetic model - no Langmuir or Freundlich isotherm fitting, no adsorption kinetics, no structural modelling of the ion-binding peptides - which is the clearest gap in an adsorption project.","dataviz":"Engineering and Results figures for HiBiT reporter signals, construct and scaffold comparisons, single-metal (Li/Co/Ni/Mn) experiments and cellulose degradation; a plasmid design schematic showing interchangeable IBP modules alongside the circular map of the optimised pSEVA331 construct; an LCA system-boundary diagram separating the Level A and Level B modules; an SDG interaction map. Education reports platform analytics as a table with the caveat that reach is not a measure of learning.","datascience":"Scenario and sensitivity reasoning rather than inferential statistics: medium raw-material emissions computed for a 40 mL YPD batch, then scaled under three dry bacterial-cellulose yield scenarios because the team's own dry-weight yield was never measured, then expressed per tonne of wastewater; emission offsets calculated per metal for substitution of virgin salts and separately for cellulose recycling substituting only the glucose carbon source. The honesty is the notable part: outputs are labelled as trend analysis only, bead productivity is taken from published shake-flask ranges for the same strain, local Chinese grid factors are excluded, and the whole thing is described as a qualitative trend comparison and not an ISO-compliant LCA. The team also states which named parameters are the priority model inputs (fermentation yield, adsorption performance, cycle number) following expert advice.","software":"No software deliverable beyond the wiki itself. There is an explicit generative-AI disclosure stating that AI was used only for readability editing and website implementation, and that no scientific claim, data figure, gel image, microscopy image, measurement plot or reference was model-generated.","stack":["spreadsheet-level carbon-footprint and techno-economic model","ecoinvent v3.9.1 literature emission factors","HiBiT luminescent reporter quantification","Golden Gate assembly design with interchangeable modules","public sequence databases for SP / CBM / IBP module retrieval","spectrophotometry and metal-concentration readings","wiki built from a public repository"],"techniques":["functional-unit and system-boundary definition for a comparative footprint","three-scenario yield sensitivity analysis to cover an unmeasured parameter","per-metal substitution offset accounting","cost-per-use rather than cost-per-batch framing for a reusable bead (taken directly from an industry interview)","explicit trade-off register (removal efficiency vs energy, valorisation vs reagent burden, cellulose recycling vs enzyme input, cost vs treatment stability)","sample fractionation reasoning (residual liquid A vs digestion liquid B) to keep figure interpretation within what controls support"],"frameworks_zh":"一套前瞻性的碳足跡與技術經濟模型，分兩層建構：A 層是以團隊自己量測的發酵參數，對材料生產模組所做的初步估算；B 層是完整的廢水處理系統，但因吸附與回收效能尚未取得而暫緩。功能單位是處理 1 公噸電池回收末端廢水，且 kisMET 路線與化學沉澱基準線採用完全相同的系統邊界（僅計入試劑製造與污泥處置；排除泵送與攪拌能耗）。排放係數取自同儕審查文獻，使用 ecoinvent v3.9.1 的全球平均資料集，範圍為搖籃到大門。沒有任何機制性或動力學模型——沒有 Langmuir 或 Freundlich 等溫線擬合、沒有吸附動力學、沒有離子結合肽的結構建模——這是一個吸附專案最明顯的缺口。","dataviz_zh":"Engineering 與 Results 頁面有 HiBiT 報導訊號、構築體與支架比較、單一金屬（Li/Co/Ni/Mn）實驗與纖維素降解的圖；質體設計示意圖呈現可互換的 IBP 模組，旁邊並列最佳化後 pSEVA331 構築體的環狀圖譜；一張 LCA 系統邊界圖把 A 層與 B 層模組分開；以及一張 SDG 交互關係圖。教育部分以表格呈現各平台數據，並註明觸及人數不是學習成效的量尺。","datascience_zh":"用的是情境與敏感度推論，而非推論統計：先算出 40 mL YPD 批次的原料排放，再因團隊始終未量測自己的乾重產率而套用三種細菌纖維素乾重產率情境放大，最後換算成每公噸廢水；排放抵換則逐一金屬計算，一組對應取代原生鹽類，另一組對應纖維素回收只取代葡萄糖碳源。誠實是值得一提的地方：輸出被標示為僅供趨勢分析，顆粒生產力取自同一菌株已發表的搖瓶範圍，中國當地電網係數未納入，整件事也被明講為定性趨勢比較，而非符合 ISO 的 LCA。團隊也依專家建議，具名列出哪些參數是優先的模型輸入（發酵產率、吸附效能、循環使用次數）。","software_zh":"除了 wiki 本身之外沒有軟體產出。頁面上有明確的生成式 AI 揭露，說明 AI 僅用於可讀性潤稿與網站實作，沒有任何科學主張、數據圖、膠體影像、顯微影像、量測圖或參考文獻是由模型生成的。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"The most intellectually honest education page in this cohort, and worth reading as a model regardless of its scale. Four channels, chosen because the audience already uses them rather than building a team website: a WeChat official account, a Xiaohongshu account, a printed two-page bilingual handbook, and two offline events (a school-wide iGEM club class for 59 students on 14 September 2026, and a community booth at Xiangmi Park on 2 October 2026 reaching over 70 visitors, run jointly with iGEM team Yucai-SZ). Three stated principles, each derived from something that failed: teach the phenomenon before the technology (their third and best post never mentions kisMET at all, only where the metal in water comes from); keep the channel open in both directions; and republish the same material in two formats. The analytics are reported against the team's own interest: the team introduction outperformed the project introduction roughly two to one, the purely scientific piece reached the fewest readers, and across three posts and 1,206 reads they received zero comments - from which they conclude that an open door is not an invitation, and propose polls and photo requests instead. The handbook uses one visual language and three analogies (a sponge for the cellulose bead, a magnet for the ion-binding peptide, one grain of rice in a swimming pool for ppm) and is released under CC BY 4.0 for other teams to print, translate or re-analogise.","ihp":"A five-stage programme on a Motivation -> Message -> Move reflection loop, built almost entirely from industry interviews, and it genuinely relocated the project's target user. Lu Binda (SUSTech doctoral student working on Juhefeng's battery-recycling R&D) mapped the value chain and established that front-end and back-end companies have entirely different wastewater. The team then visited Meizhou Zhongrun, a front-end physical recycler, and learned it sells electrode powder downstream and generates little wastewater - so it is not a customer. That finding redirected them to GEM, a downstream hydrometallurgical company, which confirmed that lithium, nickel, cobalt and manganese do remain in the tail stream after solvent extraction and require precipitation or adsorption. Further interviews covered Dynanonic, professional wastewater treatment firms, officials from the Ministry of Ecology and Environment on biosafety and compliance, and Li Zongjin of Lingzhu Tech twice - the second time producing industrial cost ranges for every process step and the modelling rule that cost per use, not cost per batch, decides whether a reusable bead can compete.","realWorld":"The platform is deliberately modular: swapping the ion-binding peptide retargets it at rare earths from e-waste or other heavy metals without touching the core system. Acting on advice from BIT-China and their industry interviews, the team chose to pursue technology licensing with established battery companies rather than founding a company - a realistic read of their own position. Named limitations are published rather than buried: Komagataeibacter fermentation is oxygen-transfer and shear-sensitive in stirred bioreactors, candidate peptides have only been tested in single-metal solutions, and cellulose breakdown does not by itself demonstrate that engineered cells have been inactivated, so a validated containment and disposal procedure is still required. Their closing self-assessment - that as a high-school team they offer not scale but time, willingness to re-explain, and the honesty to say when an explanation failed - is the right framing.","partners":["Juhefeng / Lu Binda, SUSTech (battery recycling R&D)","Meizhou Zhongrun (front-end physical recycling)","GEM (downstream hydrometallurgical recycling)","Dynanonic","Li Zongjin, Lingzhu Tech (fermentation scale-up, TEA and LCA)","Ministry of Ecology and Environment officials","iGEM team BIT-China (commercial pathway advice)","iGEM team Yucai-SZ (joint Xiangmi Park community booth)"],"publicEngagement_zh":"本屆最具學術誠實的教育頁面，不論規模大小都值得當作範例來讀。他們用四個管道，選擇的理由是受眾本來就在用這些平台，而不是自建團隊網站：微信公眾號、小紅書帳號、一份雙語兩頁印刷手冊，以及兩場實體活動（2026 年 9 月 14 日為 59 名學生開設的全校 iGEM 社課，以及 2026 年 10 月 2 日在 Xiangmi Park 與 iGEM 隊伍 Yucai-SZ 合辦的社區攤位，觸及逾 70 位參觀者）。他們明述三項原則，每一項都來自某次失敗的經驗：先講現象再講技術（他們第三篇、也是最好的一篇貼文完全沒提到 kisMET，只談水中的金屬從哪裡來）；讓管道保持雙向暢通；以及同一份材料用兩種格式重新發布。數據是以不利於自己的方式報出來的：團隊介紹的表現約為專案介紹的兩倍，純科學那篇的讀者最少，而三篇貼文、1,206 次閱讀之下他們收到零則留言——他們由此得出「門開著不等於邀請」的結論，並提議改用投票與徵照片的方式。手冊採用一套統一的視覺語言與三個類比（纖維素顆粒是海綿、離子結合肽是磁鐵、ppm 是游泳池裡的一粒米），並以 CC BY 4.0 釋出，供其他團隊印製、翻譯或改寫類比。","ihp_zh":"一套五階段的流程，架在 Motivation -> Message -> Move 的反思迴圈上，幾乎完全由產業訪談構成，而且真的讓專案的目標使用者換了位置。Lu Binda（SUSTech 博士生，參與 Juhefeng 的電池回收研發）為他們梳理了價值鏈，確立前端與後端公司的廢水完全不同。團隊接著拜訪前端物理回收商 Meizhou Zhongrun，得知該公司把電極粉料賣往下游、幾乎不產生廢水——因此不是客戶。這個發現把他們導向下游的濕法冶金公司 GEM，對方確認溶劑萃取後的末端流中確實殘留鋰、鎳、鈷、錳，必須靠沉澱或吸附處理。後續訪談還包括 Dynanonic、專業廢水處理公司、就生物安全與法規遵循諮詢生態環境部官員，以及兩度訪問 Lingzhu Tech 的 Li Zongjin——第二次談出了每個製程步驟的產業成本區間，以及一條建模準則：決定一顆可重複使用的顆粒有無競爭力的是每次使用成本，而不是每批次成本。","realWorld_zh":"平台刻意設計成模組化：更換離子結合肽就能把目標轉向電子廢棄物中的稀土或其他重金屬，核心系統不必動。依據 BIT-China 的建議與自己的產業訪談，團隊選擇與既有電池公司進行技術授權，而不是創業——這是對自身位置的現實判斷。具名的限制是公開寫出來而非埋起來：Komagataeibacter 的發酵在攪拌式生物反應器中對氧氣傳遞與剪切力敏感；候選肽只在單一金屬溶液中測試過；而纖維素被分解本身並不足以證明工程菌已去活化，因此仍需要一套經驗證的收容與廢棄處理程序。他們結尾的自我評估——身為高中團隊，他們能提供的不是規模，而是時間、願意再解釋一次的意願，以及承認某次解釋失敗的誠實——是正確的定位。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6165/wiki/description-fig3-ibp-swap.avif","caption":"Molecular design of the pSEVA331 expression system, showing the interchangeable ion-binding-peptide modules that let the platform be retargeted to a different metal without redesign.","credit":"Team SMS-Shenzhen, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"pSEVA331 表現系統的分子設計，顯示可互換的離子結合肽模組，使平台能在不重新設計的情況下改為針對另一種金屬。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6165/wiki/education-handbook-page-b-kismet-kombucha.avif","caption":"Page B of the bilingual printed handbook, telling the kombucha bacterial-cellulose story and introducing the sponge and magnet analogies; released under CC BY 4.0 for reuse.","credit":"Team SMS-Shenzhen, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"雙語印刷手冊的 B 頁，講述康普茶細菌纖維素的來歷，並引入海綿與磁鐵兩個類比；以 CC BY 4.0 釋出供再利用。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6165/wiki/education-wechat-article-stats.avif","caption":"The WeChat account back end, reported by the team against their own interest: the team introduction outperformed the project introduction, and the purely scientific post reached the fewest readers of all.","credit":"Team SMS-Shenzhen, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"微信公眾號後台，由團隊以不利於自己的方式報出：團隊介紹的表現優於專案介紹，而純科學那篇貼文的讀者數是全部中最少的。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6165/wiki/hp-gem.avif","caption":"Interview with GEM, the downstream hydrometallurgical recycler whose confirmation that metals remain in the tail stream after solvent extraction validated kisMET's target application point.","credit":"Team SMS-Shenzhen, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"與下游濕法冶金回收商 GEM 的訪談；對方確認溶劑萃取後金屬仍殘留於末端流中，驗證了 kisMET 的目標應用點。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"The dry lab is real but narrow: a spreadsheet-level carbon-footprint and techno-economic model with a defined functional unit, literature emission factors and a three-scenario sensitivity sweep is squarely within one high-school season and is exactly the kind of modelling most teams skip, yet for an adsorption project the absence of any isotherm or kinetics fitting is a conspicuous hole that a single afternoon with their own single-metal data would have filled. The limiting factor is mentorship rather than tooling, compute or time - nobody told them that Langmuir and Freundlich fits are a spreadsheet exercise, while someone clearly did teach them how to scope an LCA.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/sms-shenzhen/","https://2026.igem.wiki/sms-shenzhen/attributions","https://2026.igem.wiki/sms-shenzhen/team","https://2026.igem.wiki/sms-shenzhen/safety"],"projectTitle_zh":"kisMET——從電池回收廢水中選擇性生物吸附殘餘金屬","tagline_zh":"不靠更多化學藥劑，把鋰、鈷、鎳、錳的最後百分之一攔下來","summary_zh":"kisMET 瞄準廢鋰離子電池回收的末端廢水：此時金屬濃度已降到 ppm 等級，溶劑萃取不再符合經濟效益。團隊改造 Komagataeibacter rhaeticus，讓它以自身分泌的融合蛋白修飾自己產生的細菌纖維素；該融合蛋白由訊息肽、碳水化合物結合模組、HiBiT 報導標籤與可替換的離子結合肽組成，以 Golden Gate 組裝於 pSEVA331 骨架上，由鼠李糖誘導型啟動子驅動。他們設計了四組 SP/CBM 支架與八個成員的離子結合肽組，使結合專一性可在不重新設計平台的情況下更換。目前的證據涵蓋培養、構築體與報導基因比較、單一金屬結合實驗以及纖維素降解分析；團隊明確表示，混合廢水中的選擇性、纖維素的閉環再利用與金屬的完全回收都是設計目標，而非已得的結果。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"乾實驗是真的做了，但範圍很窄：以試算表層級完成的碳足跡與技術經濟分析，有明確定義的功能單位、取自文獻的排放係數與三情境敏感度掃描，這完全在一個高中賽季做得到，也正是多數團隊會跳過的建模。然而對一個吸附專案來說，完全沒有任何等溫線或動力學擬合是個顯眼的缺口——用他們自己的單一金屬數據，一個下午就能補上。限制因素是指導，而不是工具、算力或時間：沒有人告訴他們 Langmuir 與 Freundlich 擬合其實是試算表作業，但顯然有人教過他們如何界定一份 LCA 的範圍。","awards_zh":["最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6166":{"team":"GHCIS","id":"6166","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Climate Crisis, Conservation & Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/","projectTitle":"ARGUS","projectTitle_zh":"ARGUS","tagline":"A paper-based toehold-switch assay plus a browser-based image-analysis and surveillance platform for environmental antimicrobial resistance gene monitoring.","tagline_zh":"一套紙基 toehold switch 檢測，搭配一個在瀏覽器中執行的影像分析與監測平台，用於環境中抗藥性基因的監測。","summary":"ARGUS pairs a cell-free, paper-based toehold switch assay for three antimicrobial resistance genes (mcr-1, blaNDM-1, blaKPC-2) with portable temperature-control hardware and a full-stack web platform that reads the colorimetric plate from a phone photo, grades each gene, and stores location-linked records for regional review. Recombinase polymerase amplification feeds trigger RNA to switches that drive colour-producing enzymes — blue for MCR1 (GusA), yellow for NDM1 (XylE), purple-shifted for KPC2 (LacZ). The project is framed inside the One Health approach, targeting the gap between institution-led metagenomic surveys and the routine, fine-grained environmental monitoring that networks like CARSS do not cover. It won Best Software and Best Part Collection on the strength of a genuinely deployable platform (Docker or native Node, SQLite, role-based access, documented deployment) and a NUPACK design pipeline that reproduced a published sequence grammar and then found an error in it — all presented with an unusually disciplined limitations section that refuses to claim sensitivity, specificity or a detection limit it has not measured.","summary_zh":"ARGUS 把針對三個抗藥性基因（mcr-1、blaNDM-1、blaKPC-2）的無細胞紙基 toehold switch 檢測，與可攜式溫控硬體以及一個全端網頁平台結合起來：平台能從手機照片讀取呈色反應盤、為每個基因評級，並儲存與地點連結的紀錄以供區域層級審閱。重組酶聚合酶擴增（RPA）產生觸發 RNA 餵給開關，再驅動呈色酶，MCR1 為藍色（GusA）、NDM1 為黃色（XylE）、KPC2 則偏紫（LacZ）。專案置於 One Health 架構之下，瞄準的是機構主導的總體基因體調查與日常、細緻的環境監測之間的落差，而後者正是 CARSS 這類網路並未涵蓋的部分。團隊憑一個真正可部署的平台（Docker 或原生 Node、SQLite、角色式存取控制、文件化的部署流程），以及一條重現了已發表序列語法、進而在其中找出一個錯誤的 NUPACK 設計流程，拿下 Best Software 與 Best Part Collection；而這一切的呈現都搭配一個紀律異常嚴謹的限制章節，拒絕聲稱任何尚未量測到的靈敏度、專一性或檢測極限。","awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best Part Collection — Winner (High School)","Best Software — Winner (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Climate Crisis / Conservation / Bioremediation)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"The modelling is a toehold switch design and screening pipeline in locally installed NUPACK 4.1.0.1 (rna95-nupack3 Serra-Turner 1995 material model, 37 degC, 1.0 M Na+, 0 M Mg2+, 100 nM switch and 100 nM trigger, maximum complex size 2). They reproduced the 36-nt mRNA sensor sequence grammar from Table S4 of Green et al. 2014 exactly, and verified the construction formula against four published sequences (mCherry B, mCherry C, cat, aadA) with exact matches on all four before designing anything new. Each switch is 126 nt: GGG leader, 30-nt exposed toehold, 6-bp target-driven invasion region, stem-loop containing the RBS and AUG, 9-nt programmed refolding module, 21-nt linker and the first 9 nt of GFP. For every 36-nt window across each complete CDS they computed the NUPACK base-pairing matrix of the full mRNA and scored target local single-strandedness, switch toehold single-strandedness, the normalised ensemble defect of the intended OFF conformation, and mean occupancy of the 15 expected stem base pairs — excluding windows with GC content below 30% or above 70%, four consecutive identical bases, a GGGG stretch created by the GGG leader, or a stop codon in the switch reading frame, and requiring candidate start positions at least 15 nt apart. Notably, they found that Equation 5 of the original supplementary information is internally inconsistent (it describes higher local single-strandedness as preferable while ranking the total score low-to-high), kept the published weights of 5, 4 and 3, and converted both single-strandedness terms into deficits so that lower penalty ranks better. Conservation screening used family CDSs from NCBI AMRFinderPlus release 2026-08-07.1: the primary designs cover 98/98 blaNDM, 295/295 blaKPC and 37/37 mcr-1 panel sequences exactly, with the alternatives' exceptions named (NDM1-S3 misses blaNDM-56, KPC2-S3 misses blaKPC-248). Cross-reactivity was computed as a tube-equilibrium matrix: cognate activation proxies of 0.906 (NDM1-S1), 0.940 (KPC2-S1) and 0.873 (MCR1-S1) against off-diagonal values from 8.10e-07 to 2.92e-04. Input integrity was checked and hashed (SHA256 prefixes recorded per file), including catching that the blaNDM-1 SnapGene record is stored in reverse orientation so the reverse complement had to be used — exactly the kind of silent error that would have produced a useless trigger.","frameworks_zh":"建模部分是一條在本機安裝的 NUPACK 4.1.0.1 上執行的 toehold switch 設計與篩選流程（rna95-nupack3 的 Serra-Turner 1995 材料模型、37 degC、1.0 M Na+、0 M Mg2+、開關與觸發物各 100 nM、最大複合物大小為 2）。團隊完整重現了 Green et al. 2014 表 S4 中 36-nt mRNA 感測器的序列語法，並在設計任何新序列之前，先以四條已發表序列（mCherry B、mCherry C、cat、aadA）驗證其構築公式，四條全部完全相符。每個開關長 126 nt：GGG 前導序列、30-nt 外露 toehold、6-bp 由標的驅動的入侵區、含 RBS 與 AUG 的莖環、9-nt 程式化再折疊模組、21-nt 連接子，以及 GFP 的前 9 nt。團隊對每條完整 CDS 上的每一個 36-nt 窗格，計算完整 mRNA 的 NUPACK 鹼基配對矩陣，並對標的的局部單股性、開關 toehold 的單股性、預期 OFF 構形的正規化系集缺陷，以及 15 個預期莖部鹼基對的平均佔有率計分；同時排除 GC 含量低於 30% 或高於 70%、出現四個連續相同鹼基、因 GGG 前導序列而產生 GGGG 片段，或開關讀框中出現終止密碼子的窗格，並要求候選起始位置彼此至少相距 15 nt。值得注意的是，他們發現原始補充資料中的式 5 內部自相矛盾（文字描述較高的局部單股性為佳，但總分的排序卻由低到高），於是保留了已發表的權重 5、4 與 3，並把兩個單股性項都轉換成缺額，使罰分越低者排名越好。保守性篩選使用 NCBI AMRFinderPlus 2026-08-07.1 版的家族 CDS：主要設計完全涵蓋 blaNDM 的 98/98、blaKPC 的 295/295 與 mcr-1 panel 序列的 37/37，替代設計的例外也逐一指名（NDM1-S3 漏掉 blaNDM-56、KPC2-S3 漏掉 blaKPC-248）。交叉反應性以試管平衡矩陣計算：同源活化代理值分別為 0.906（NDM1-S1）、0.940（KPC2-S1）與 0.873（MCR1-S1），而非對角值則在 8.10e-07 至 2.92e-04 之間。輸入資料的完整性都經檢查與雜湊處理（逐檔記錄 SHA256 前綴），其中也抓到 blaNDM-1 的 SnapGene 記錄是以反向方向儲存，因此必須改用反向互補序列，而這正是那種會默默產生一個無用觸發物的錯誤。","dataviz":"Figures are oriented so higher is always better on the candidate-metrics panel, which is a small but real accessibility decision. The NUPACK cross-gene activation proxy matrix is drawn as a heatmap of the three primary designs so the three-order-of-magnitude gap between diagonal and off-diagonal is immediately legible. The sensor sequence architecture is rendered as an annotated 126-nt schematic. In the software, the data visualisation is the product: the administration console combines maps, regional rankings, per-gene trend charts and record-level inspection, with configurable alert rules and CSV/JSON export, while the client presents each plate as a four-grade result per gene (Negative, Weak Positive, Positive, Strong Positive) over the reviewed photograph. An annotated one-sample example plate figure documents the expected output for a published example image so anyone can reproduce the workflow end to end. The team is explicit that this example is a reproducible workflow demonstration, not a validation dataset, and that regional maps describe submitted records under the selected filters rather than population prevalence.","dataviz_zh":"候選指標面板上的圖都把方向統一成數值越高越好，這是個小而確實的易讀性決定。NUPACK 的跨基因活化代理矩陣以三個主要設計的熱圖呈現，使對角與非對角之間三個數量級的差距一眼就看得出來。感測器的序列架構則繪製成一張帶註解的 126-nt 示意圖。在軟體這一側，資料視覺化本身就是產品：管理主控台結合地圖、區域排名、各基因趨勢圖與逐筆紀錄檢視，並附可設定的警示規則與 CSV/JSON 匯出；用戶端則在已審閱的照片之上，以每個基因四級判定（Negative、Weak Positive、Positive、Strong Positive）呈現每一盤結果。一張帶註解的單樣本範例盤圖，記錄了一張已公開範例影像應有的輸出，讓任何人都能從頭到尾重現整套流程。團隊明確指出這個範例只是可重現的流程示範，不是驗證資料集，而區域地圖描述的是在所選篩選條件下已提交的紀錄，而不是族群盛行率。","datascience":"The colour-grading algorithm is the headline and it is specified completely enough to reimplement. Analysis runs locally in JavaScript in the browser with no external AI or image-conversion service at runtime. The pipeline prepares the image (max dimension 2400 px; grid detection on a working image of max 1400 px), locates the active well grid (9, 12 or 15 wells for one, two or three loaded samples, always including the positive and negative control in every gene row), averages all sRGB pixels inside a disk of half the well radius, converts through linear RGB and XYZ D65 to CIE Lab, and then deliberately discards lightness L*, projecting only on a* and b* so the score tracks chromatic change. For a sample s with same-row negative control n and positive control p it computes the control direction v = p - n, a normalised score t = ((s - n) . v) / (v . v), and a residual r = ||(s - n) - tv||, so NC sits at t = 0 and PC at t = 1 and scores are not clamped to that interval. Quality gates are quantitative: control separation must satisfy ||v|| >= 2, the residual must satisfy r <= max(4, 0.6 x ||v||), expected directions are delta-b < 0 for MCR1, delta-b > 0 for NDM1 and delta-a - delta-b > 0 for KPC2, and missing, black, identical, reversed or insufficiently separated controls or |t| > 100 produce no estimate at all. Crucially, an absent classification is defined as unresolved and the documentation states it must not be treated as Negative — a failure mode most teams would silently default. Per-gene thresholds are published (MCR1 t < 0.20 Negative to t >= 1.60 Strong Positive; NDM1 and KPC2 on their own scales), along with the deliberately awkward note that a sample at MCR1 t = 1.00 is Weak Positive under the sample thresholds even though the PC label displays Strong Positive, because the PC and NC labels are control-role defaults rather than independent validation. The limitations section then declines to claim what was not measured: the 0, 3 and 5 micromolar trigger RNA conditions do not establish sensitivity, specificity, a detection limit or a concentration calibration, and the team states that large-scale real-world samples will be needed to set optimal colour thresholds and evaluate sensitivity, specificity, NPV and PPV. Wet-lab feedback iteratively adjusted the colour interpretation and capture workflow, and the team notes this aligned software with their process but does not substitute for testing across devices and lighting conditions.","datascience_zh":"呈色評級演算法是全案重點，而且規格寫得完整到足以重新實作。分析完全在瀏覽器中以 JavaScript 於本機執行，執行期不依賴任何外部 AI 或影像轉換服務。流程先整備影像（最大邊 2400 px；網格偵測則在最大 1400 px 的工作影像上進行），定位出啟用中的反應孔網格（載入一、二或三個樣本時分別為 9、12 或 15 孔，且每個基因列都必定包含陽性與陰性對照），接著平均半徑為孔半徑一半的圓盤內所有 sRGB 像素，經線性 RGB 與 XYZ D65 轉換為 CIE Lab，然後刻意捨棄明度 L*，只投影在 a* 與 b* 上，使分數追蹤的是色度變化。對於樣本 s、同列陰性對照 n 與陽性對照 p，演算法計算對照方向 v = p - n、正規化分數 t = ((s - n) . v) / (v . v) 以及殘差 r = ||(s - n) - tv||，因此 NC 落在 t = 0、PC 落在 t = 1，而分數並不被限制在這個區間內。品質關卡都是量化的：對照分離度必須滿足 ||v|| >= 2、殘差必須滿足 r <= max(4, 0.6 x ||v||)，預期方向為 MCR1 的 delta-b < 0、NDM1 的 delta-b > 0 與 KPC2 的 delta-a - delta-b > 0；而對照缺失、全黑、完全相同、方向反轉或分離不足，或 |t| > 100 的情形，一律不產出任何估計值。關鍵在於，沒有分類結果被定義為「無法判定」，文件並明文規定不得將其視為 Negative，而這正是多數團隊會默默預設掉的失效模式。各基因的閾值都已公開（MCR1 為 t < 0.20 判為 Negative，至 t >= 1.60 判為 Strong Positive；NDM1 與 KPC2 各有自己的尺度），並附上一條刻意讓人不舒服的說明：某個 MCR1 t = 1.00 的樣本，依樣本閾值會判為 Weak Positive，儘管 PC 的標籤顯示為 Strong Positive，因為 PC 與 NC 的標籤只是依對照角色給定的預設值，而不是獨立驗證的結果。限制章節接著拒絕聲稱任何未經量測的事：0、3 與 5 微莫耳的觸發 RNA 條件並不足以建立靈敏度、專一性、檢測極限或濃度校正曲線，團隊也明說，要訂出最佳呈色閾值並評估靈敏度、專一性、NPV 與 PPV，必須有大規模的真實樣本。濕實驗的回饋曾反覆調整呈色判讀與拍攝流程，而團隊指出這讓軟體與他們的操作流程對齊，但並不能取代跨裝置與跨照明條件的測試。","software":"ARGUS is a complete, deployable web platform released at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/ghcis/argus with a hosted client, a user guide PDF, a README quick start and a lossless example plate image (assets/example-plate.webp). Architecture: a browser client for field users and an administration console for institutions, with image processing in the browser and reviewed results validated server-side and persisted to SQLite, with documented backup procedures. Deployment is genuinely turnkey — Docker Engine or Desktop with Compose v2 via scripts/deploy.sh, or native Node.js (24.21.0 pinned in .nvmrc, documented minimum 22.16) via scripts/deploy-native.mjs, both of which build, check readiness and print local and LAN access links; public HTTPS deployment takes a domain and email, and automatic street-level location uses a Geoapify key. Three roles are implemented — field user, administrator and root — where field users work only with their own captures, administrators review regional data, export records and manage alerts, and root manages accounts and audit or demonstration-data operations; passwords are 12-200 characters, an initial root password is generated privately, and existing passwords survive restart and redeployment. Records are searchable by gene, result and date, downloadable as JSON summaries, and printable to PDF. The team also honestly flags that local analysis still depends on the server for authentication and storage, that a retained upload draft does not make it offline, that SQLite allows only one application instance per database volume, and that institution verification, jurisdiction-specific permissions, a documented versioned integration API and connections to CARSS or WHO networks all remain future work with no endorsement claimed. Hardware is released as STEP and STL files (top cover, backing card, electronic enclosure, sleeve, sample stage, three RPA unit variants) covering the ARGUS Temperature Controller — a three-layer design giving constant temperature for RPA and the colorimetric reaction plus stable uniform illumination for software-assisted capture — and the ARGUS Test Strip Card, whose substrate was chosen with material recovery and biodegradability in mind.","software_zh":"ARGUS 是一個完整且可部署的網頁平台，釋出於 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/ghcis/argus，並附有線上版用戶端、使用手冊 PDF、README 快速上手說明，以及一張無損的範例反應盤影像（assets/example-plate.webp）。架構上分為供現場使用者操作的瀏覽器用戶端與供機構使用的管理主控台，影像處理在瀏覽器內完成，審閱後的結果則在伺服器端驗證並寫入 SQLite，備份程序也有文件記載。部署確實做到整備即用：可用帶 Compose v2 的 Docker Engine 或 Desktop 透過 scripts/deploy.sh，或用原生 Node.js（.nvmrc 中釘選 24.21.0，文件載明最低 22.16）透過 scripts/deploy-native.mjs，兩者都會建置、檢查就緒狀態並印出本機與區域網路的連線網址；公開 HTTPS 部署需要一個網域與一個電子郵件位址，而自動取得街道級位置則需要 Geoapify 金鑰。系統實作了三種角色，即現場使用者、管理者與 root：現場使用者只能處理自己拍攝的資料，管理者可審閱區域資料、匯出紀錄並管理警示，root 則管理帳號以及稽核與示範資料相關操作；密碼長度為 12 至 200 字元，初始 root 密碼以私密方式產生，既有密碼在重啟與重新部署後仍然有效。紀錄可依基因、結果與日期搜尋，可下載為 JSON 摘要，也可列印成 PDF。團隊也誠實指出，本機分析仍依賴伺服器進行認證與儲存、保留上傳草稿並不等於支援離線、SQLite 使每個資料庫卷冊只允許一個應用程式實例，而機構身分驗證、依管轄範圍設定的權限、有版本管理且文件化的整合 API，以及與 CARSS 或 WHO 網路的連接，全都仍屬未來工作，並未聲稱取得任何背書。硬體以 STEP 與 STL 檔釋出（上蓋、背板卡、電子件外殼、套筒、樣本載台、三種 RPA 單元變體），涵蓋 ARGUS 溫度控制器（一個三層設計，為 RPA 與呈色反應提供恆溫，並為軟體輔助的拍攝提供穩定均勻的照明）以及 ARGUS 試紙卡，後者的基材是在考量材料回收與生物降解性之下選定的。","stack":["NUPACK 4.1.0.1 (local install)","rna95-nupack3 / Serra-Turner 1995 material model","NCBI AMRFinderPlus (release 2026-08-07.1)","GenBank / SnapGene sequence records","JavaScript (in-browser image analysis)","Node.js 24.21.0","Docker + Compose v2","SQLite","REST API with role-based access control","Geoapify geocoding","CIE Lab colour space (sRGB -> linear RGB -> XYZ D65 -> Lab)","recombinase polymerase amplification (RPA)","cell-free paper-based expression","GusA / XylE / LacZ colorimetric reporters","STEP and STL CAD","GitLab (iGEM)"],"techniques":["exhaustive sliding-window candidate scanning over full CDSs","ensemble defect and base-pairing probability analysis","tube equilibrium cross-reactivity matrix","family-level conservation coverage screening","sequence integrity checking with SHA256 hashing and orientation verification","reproduction and error-correction of a published scoring equation","chromaticity-only colour classification (L* discarded)","same-row internal control projection with normalised score and residual","explicit quality gates and an unresolved (not Negative) failure state","staged two-round experimental validation plan with predefined replacement designs","role-based access control and audit separation","reproducible one-command deployment"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A tiered education programme with its own documented iteration framework, INSPIRE (Identify the audience, Notice prior knowledge and needs, Set learning goals, Plan content and format, Implement the activity, Review responses and feedback, Evolve the design), applied uniformly to every activity so each record shows design, delivery, feedback and the resulting change. Four audience groups are defined with explicit prior-knowledge characteristics, stage goals and formats: primary school (stories, analogies, stickers, games, scenario Q&A), junior high (pre-class questions, mechanism explanations, group discussion and retelling), high school (posters, questionnaires, lectures, cards, experiments, peer exchange) and the general public (visual-text content, social media). The feedback-to-change table is the strongest artefact: teachers preferred familiar health examples so hygiene activities and organ stickers were added; children struggled with abstract concepts so stories and analogies replaced them; poster votes lacked explanations so posters plus a questionnaire were introduced; the questionnaire revealed interests and gaps which drove targeted lectures; long lectures reduced engagement so a 'Biology Werewolf' social-deduction game was created; Werewolf rounds ran too long so a 5-8 minute online version was built; online participation lacked learning evidence so Club Fair question cards were added; students preferred hands-on learning so medicinal-herb experiments were introduced; students struggled with protein function so examples and group discussion were added. Partner feedback from Ulink prompted platform-specific adaptations for Xiaohongshu and WeChat, and questions raised at a Morning Meetup caused a revision of the afternoon pitch. The team also traced a knowledge gap found in human practices — that the public associates AMR with hospitals and personal antibiotic use but has weak understanding of the One Health links between animals, environment and humans — directly into the education content, extending it from rational antibiotic use to livestock and environmental transmission pathways.","publicEngagement_zh":"一套分層的教育方案，附有自己文件化的迭代框架 INSPIRE（Identify 辨識受眾、Notice 留意既有知識與需求、Set 設定學習目標、Plan 規劃內容與形式、Implement 執行活動、Review 檢視反應與回饋、Evolve 演進設計），並一致套用到每一項活動，使每筆紀錄都呈現設計、執行、回饋，以及因此產生的改變。團隊界定了四個受眾群，各有明確的既有知識特徵、階段目標與形式：小學（故事、類比、貼紙、遊戲、情境問答）、國中（課前提問、機制講解、小組討論與複述）、高中（海報、問卷、講座、卡片、實驗、同儕交流）與一般公眾（圖文內容、社群媒體）。回饋對應改變的表格是其中最有力的產出：老師偏好熟悉的健康例子，於是加入衛生習慣活動與器官貼紙；兒童難以掌握抽象概念，於是改以故事與類比替代；海報投票缺少說明，於是改成海報加問卷；問卷揭露了興趣與知識缺口，進而促成針對性的講座；過長的講座降低參與度，於是設計了一款「生物狼人殺」社交推理遊戲；狼人殺的回合進行太久，於是又做了 5 至 8 分鐘的線上版；線上參與缺乏學習成效的證據，於是加上社團博覽會的問答卡；學生偏好動手學習，於是引入藥用植物實驗；學生難以理解蛋白質功能，於是補上實例與小組討論。來自 Ulink 的合作回饋促成了針對小紅書與微信的平台化調整，而在一場 Morning Meetup 上被提出的問題，則讓團隊改寫了下午的簡報。團隊也把人類實踐中發現的一處知識缺口直接帶進教育內容，也就是公眾會把抗藥性與醫院及個人用藥聯想在一起，卻對動物、環境與人之間的 One Health 連結理解薄弱，因此把內容從合理用藥延伸到畜牧與環境傳播途徑。","ihp":"A deliberately sequenced, evidence-first process rather than a stakeholder list. They began by asking not 'who should we interview' but 'who would be affected, who would participate in use or deployment, and who could change the project's direction', grouping stakeholders into five exploratory categories and then deliberately starting with the public — not because the public decides anything, but to build a social-needs baseline whose gaps would determine who to approach next. A bilingual online questionnaire returned 281 valid responses: safety, result accuracy and price were selected by 72.24%, 61.57% and 46.98% of respondents; 67.26% worried about inaccurate results and 55.87% about product safety; 44.48% worried they would not know what to do after detecting a risk and 33.45% that they could not understand the results. The methodological discipline here is notable for a high-school team: because questions Q12-Q19 branched on respondents' stated first priority, the price and speed branches had small samples, so they explicitly refused to convert 'within RMB 30' or 'results within 30 minutes' into product requirements and instead carried them forward as questions to validate with frontline users. They then re-mapped stakeholders on power and interest axes, noting that the map represented types rather than named interviewees and that specific participants were identified only as each cycle raised new questions. Concrete design changes are tabulated: frontline practitioners wanted information useful for antibiotic selection, so the team retained preliminary monitoring and data support while explicitly acknowledging the unmet diagnostic need rather than overclaiming; industry advice on hardware and consumable costs replaced a proposed microfluidic format with cellulose filter paper and revised strip assembly and substrate use; and industry advice to swap the expression system for crude lysate was considered and rejected, keeping the current cell-free system because of background-interference concerns — a documented decision to not follow advice, with a reason. Expert discussions about controlled access to environmental and public-health data are what produced the three-tier role model in the software.","ihp_zh":"這是一個刻意排出順序、以證據為先的流程，而不是一張利害關係人清單。團隊一開始問的不是「我們該訪問誰」，而是「誰會受到影響、誰會參與使用或部署、誰有能力改變專案的方向」，把利害關係人分成五個探索性類別，然後刻意從公眾開始，不是因為公眾能決定什麼，而是為了建立一條社會需求的基線，讓其中的缺口決定下一步該找誰。一份雙語線上問卷回收 281 份有效回應：安全性、結果準確度與價格分別被 72.24%、61.57% 與 46.98% 的受訪者選取；67.26% 擔心結果不準確、55.87% 擔心產品安全性；44.48% 擔心偵測到風險後不知道該怎麼辦，33.45% 擔心自己看不懂結果。這裡的方法學紀律對一支高中團隊而言相當突出：由於第 Q12 至 Q19 題是依受訪者自述的首要考量分支，價格與速度分支的樣本數偏小，因此他們明確拒絕把「RMB 30 以內」或「30 分鐘內出結果」轉換成產品規格，而是把它們當成待與一線使用者驗證的問題往下帶。接著他們在權力與利益兩軸上重新繪製利害關係人圖，並註明該圖呈現的是類型而非具名受訪者，具體參與者只在每一輪循環引出新問題時才被指認出來。具體的設計改動都列成表：一線從業人員希望得到對選擇抗生素有用的資訊，於是團隊保留初步監測與資料支援的定位，同時明確承認診斷需求尚未被滿足，而不是過度宣稱；業界關於硬體與耗材成本的建議，使原先提議的微流體形式被改為纖維素濾紙，並修改了試紙組裝方式與基材用法；而業界建議改用粗裂解液取代表現系統一事，團隊考慮後予以否決，因為擔心背景干擾而保留現行的無細胞系統，這是一個有紀錄、有理由的「不採納建議」的決定。至於軟體中的三層角色模型，則是由專家討論環境與公共衛生資料的受控存取所催生出來的。","realWorld":"ARGUS is positioned for institution-led procurement rather than consumer sale: government monitoring programmes or authorised implementing institutions buy and organise the system, trained frontline inspectors, veterinary-service personnel or environmental monitoring staff run the screening, and farms and herders support sample access, with results recorded in a defined programme and escalated for confirmatory testing. The near-term target is preliminary screening of water samples from livestock breeding sites, with medical wastewater named as a separate adjacent application and any clinical use explicitly deferred to independent validation and regulatory assessment. The long-term scale target price is about US$3.73 per routine screen, subject to cost and production validation, with a target detection time of about 40 minutes and isothermal amplification at roughly 37-42 degC. The proposed governance model assigns national coordination, provincial review and local sample collection to different institutional levels, and the team is careful to state that implementing it requires verified organisational identities, jurisdiction-restricted permissions and defined reporting responsibilities, that possible alignment with CARSS would require agreement on remit, data definitions and reporting interfaces, and that no official endorsement, institutional adoption or network connection is claimed at this stage. Product boundaries are written into the marketing position: environmental AMR preliminary screening and trend monitoring only, never the sole basis for clinical diagnosis, administrative penalties or individual medication decisions, and an alert should prompt investigation rather than be read as a population prevalence estimate. The named development path is broader validated applications (more phones, lighting conditions, assay batches and independent samples, with a shared evaluation dataset for measuring classification consistency), then a versioned integration API with defined schemas, authentication, permissions, error responses and reproducible examples distinguishing capture identifiers from sample positions and describing location precision, sampling time, assay version, controls and quality status, then institution-led deployment.","realWorld_zh":"ARGUS 的定位是機構主導的採購，而不是消費端販售：由政府監測計畫或獲授權的執行機構購置並組織整套系統，由受訓的一線稽查人員、獸醫服務人員或環境監測人員執行篩檢，農場與牧民協助取得樣本，結果記錄在一個明確界定的計畫中，並向上轉介做確認性檢測。近期目標是對畜牧養殖場的水樣進行初步篩檢，醫療廢水則被列為另一個相鄰的應用，而任何臨床用途都明確延後至獨立驗證與法規評估之後。長期規模化的目標價格約為每次例行篩檢 US$3.73，但仍待成本與量產驗證，目標檢測時間約 40 分鐘，等溫擴增溫度約在 37 至 42 degC。團隊提出的治理模式把全國協調、省級審閱與地方採樣分派給不同層級的機構，並謹慎指出若要實際落實，必須有經驗證的組織身分、依管轄範圍限定的權限與明確的通報責任；他們也指出若要與 CARSS 接軌，需先就職權範圍、資料定義與通報介面達成共識，而現階段並未聲稱取得任何官方背書、機構採用或網路連接。產品邊界被寫進了市場定位本身：僅限環境抗藥性的初步篩檢與趨勢監測，絕不作為臨床診斷、行政處罰或個人用藥決定的唯一依據，而一則警示應促成調查，而不是被讀成族群盛行率的估計。團隊所列的發展路徑是：先擴大經驗證的應用範圍（更多手機、照明條件、檢測批次與獨立樣本，並建立一份共用評估資料集以量測分類一致性），接著建立有版本管理的整合 API，具備明確的結構定義、認證、權限、錯誤回應與可重現範例，並區分拍攝識別碼與樣本位置，載明位置精度、採樣時間、檢測版本、對照與品質狀態，最後才進入機構主導的部署。","partners":["Ulink (education platform feedback)","Frontline livestock practitioners and grassroots veterinarians","Industry advisors on hardware and consumable cost","AMR, molecular detection, environment and public-health technical experts","Agricultural and livestock management authorities (engagement target)","CARSS / China Antimicrobial Resistance Surveillance System (named alignment goal, not a partnership)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6166/wiki/software/figure-02.avif","caption":"ARGUS feature map: client functions (location, plate photographs, local four-grade analysis, personal records), console functions (regional review, alerts, exports), account management and operations.","caption_zh":"ARGUS 功能圖：用戶端功能（定位、反應盤拍照、本機四級分析、個人紀錄）、主控台功能（區域審閱、警示、匯出），以及帳號管理與維運。","credit":"Team GHCIS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6166/wiki/software/figure-05.avif","caption":"The local colour recognition and storage pipeline: image preparation, active well-grid detection, central well pixel sampling, conversion to CIE Lab, control validation, gene-specific grading and SQLite storage.","caption_zh":"本機呈色辨識與儲存流程：影像整備、啟用中反應孔網格偵測、孔中央像素取樣、轉換為 CIE Lab、對照驗證、各基因評級，以及 SQLite 儲存。","credit":"Team GHCIS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6166/wiki/model/candidate-nupack-metrics.avif","caption":"NUPACK metrics for the nine toehold switch candidates across mcr-1, blaNDM-1 and blaKPC-2, with every column oriented so higher values are preferable.","caption_zh":"mcr-1、blaNDM-1 與 blaKPC-2 共九個 toehold switch 候選的 NUPACK 指標，每一欄都已把方向調整為數值越高越好。","credit":"Team GHCIS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6166/wiki/hardware/assembled-controller.avif","caption":"The assembled ARGUS Temperature Controller with viewing window, power connection and temperature control unit, providing both the reaction environment and uniform illumination for phone-based image capture.","caption_zh":"組裝完成的 ARGUS 溫度控制器，具觀察窗、電源接頭與溫度控制單元，同時提供反應所需環境與手機拍攝所需的均勻照明。","credit":"Team GHCIS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Two things to copy. In software, write the algorithm down to the equation and the threshold — same-row internal controls, a chromaticity-only projection, numeric quality gates, and an explicit 'unresolved, and not to be read as Negative' state — then ship it with one-command Docker deployment and a reproducible example input, because a tool a judge can actually run beats a screenshot of one. In human practices, copy their refusal to convert a small branched survey sample into a product requirement: carrying '30 minutes' forward as a question to validate rather than a specification is the single cheapest credibility gain available to a student team.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"有兩件事值得照抄。在軟體上，把演算法一路寫到方程式與閾值為止，包括同列的內部對照、僅取色度的投影、數值化的品質關卡，以及一個明確的「無法判定，且不得讀作 Negative」狀態，然後以一行指令的 Docker 部署與一份可重現的範例輸入一起釋出，因為一個評審真的跑得起來的工具，勝過一張工具的截圖。在人類實踐上，照抄他們拒絕把一份樣本數偏小的分支問卷結果直接轉成產品規格的做法：把「30 分鐘」當成一個待驗證的問題而不是一項規格往下帶，是學生團隊能取得的最廉價的可信度提升。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/software/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/hardware/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/entrepreneurship/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/inclusivity/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/contribution/","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/ghcis/argus"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳元件集 — 得主（高中組）","最佳軟體 — 得主（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（氣候危機 / 保育 / 生物復育）"],"rank":136},"6174":{"team":"Hongwen School","id":"6174","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/","projectTitle":"BrewXOS","projectTitle_zh":"BrewXOS","tagline":"Creating additional value within an existing spent-grain economy: brewer's spent grain to candidate arabinoxylan oligosaccharides.","tagline_zh":"在既有的酒糟經濟中創造額外價值：把啤酒酒糟轉為候選的阿拉伯木聚醣寡醣。","summary":"Hongwen School (Shanghai and Qingdao) engineered Bacillus subtilis WB600 to secrete xylan-degrading enzymes that convert the arabinoxylan fraction of brewer's spent grain (BSG) into candidate arabinoxylan oligosaccharides (AXOS). Five strains - single Xyn2 and Xyn11A, two dual combinations with the GH62 arabinofuranosidase Abf62A, and a triple construct - were compared; the triple strain reached 257.10 +/- 5.55 U/mL apparent supernatant activity and a parental-adjusted index of 107.91 +/- 6.64 mg xylose equivalents per gram dry BSG after 12 h, 32.8% above the better dual strain. Alongside this they built BrewXOS Fermenter Mini, a small fermentation-monitoring prototype with a main-cap/sub-cap lid, headspace O2/CO2 sensing and a touchscreen interface, and tested it with real users. The Human Practices work is the best part of the project: a GRAIN x TRACE framework forces every stakeholder interaction to end in a named change plus the evidence for it, or be flagged as an open loop.","summary_zh":"Hongwen School（上海與青島）改造 Bacillus subtilis WB600，使其分泌木聚醣降解酵素，將啤酒酒糟（BSG）中的阿拉伯木聚醣部分轉化為候選的阿拉伯木聚醣寡醣（AXOS）。團隊比較了五個菌株——單獨表現 Xyn2 與 Xyn11A、兩種與 GH62 阿拉伯呋喃糖苷酶 Abf62A 的雙酵素組合，以及一個三酵素構築體；三酵素菌株在 12 小時後達到 257.10 +/- 5.55 U/mL 的上清液表觀活性，以及經親代校正的 107.91 +/- 6.64 mg 木糖當量/公克乾酒糟，比表現較好的雙酵素菌株高出 32.8%。此外他們還做了 BrewXOS Fermenter Mini，一台小型發酵監測原型機，具備主蓋／副蓋結構的槽蓋、頂空 O2/CO2 偵測與觸控螢幕介面，並找真實使用者測試。人類實踐是整個專案最好的部分：GRAIN x TRACE 框架要求每一次利害關係人互動都必須收束成一項具名的改變加上其證據，否則就標記為未閉合的迴路。","awards":["Best Hardware — Nominee (High School)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Agriculture / Food & Nutrition / Fashion & Cosmetics / Art & Design)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"GRAIN x TRACE, the team's own two-tier Human Practices documentation framework: GRAIN (Ground the problem, Reframe the purpose, Adapt the science, Iterate toward implementation, Nourish the ecosystem) tracks project-wide evolution while TRACE (Trigger, Relevant voices, Advice and tensions, Change, Evidence and evaluation) records each interaction, with a stated closed-loop rule that advice without a change, or a plan without implementation proof, is explicitly flagged rather than presented as integrated. Published as a reusable template. There is no Model or Software page and no in-silico work - the team does not claim any.","frameworks_zh":"GRAIN x TRACE 是團隊自創的兩層人類實踐記錄框架：GRAIN（Ground the problem、Reframe the purpose、Adapt the science、Iterate toward implementation、Nourish the ecosystem）追蹤整個專案的演進，TRACE（Trigger、Relevant voices、Advice and tensions、Change、Evidence and evaluation）則記錄每一次互動，並明訂閉環規則——有建議卻沒有改變、或有計畫卻沒有落實證明，都會被明確標記出來，而不是假稱已經整合。此框架以可重複使用的模板形式發布。專案沒有 Model 或 Software 頁面，也沒有任何電腦模擬工作，團隊自己也沒有這樣宣稱。","dataviz":"Survey charts for the 219-response questionnaire (awareness of BSG and prebiotics, trust factors); paired strain-comparison plots showing apparent supernatant activity and 12 h reducing-sugar change with means and SD (n = 3); process traces of temperature, pH and headspace O2/CO2 from the 18 h integrated hardware run; CAD and layout diagrams of the Fermenter Mini.","dataviz_zh":"219 份問卷的調查圖表（對 BSG 與益生質的認知、信任因素）；配對的菌株比較圖，顯示上清液表觀活性與 12 小時還原醣變化，標有平均值與標準差（n = 3）；18 小時硬體整合運轉的溫度、pH 與頂空 O2/CO2 製程曲線；以及 Fermenter Mini 的 CAD 與配置圖。","datascience":"Careful descriptive statistics with stated limits rather than inference: survey percentages reported against each question's own denominator and explicitly not extrapolated nationally (44.29% of respondents were minors, 43.38% middle-school students); DNS reducing-sugar yields parental-adjusted against WB600 controls and labelled as an operational index, not verified AXOS mass; a 22% AX content assumption flagged where it drives a derived 49.05% apparent conversion index; user-task timings and error counts (5 min 40 s to 1 min 50 s; errors 2 to 0) reported with the caveat that the user sample is too small to generalise. No LCA or TEA has been done and the team says so.","datascience_zh":"全是謹慎的描述統計並明說適用範圍，而不是做推論：問卷百分比各以該題自身的分母計算，並明確表示不外推到全國（44.29% 的填答者為未成年人、43.38% 為國中生）；DNS 還原醣產量以 WB600 對照做親代校正，並標示為操作型指標，而非已驗證的 AXOS 質量；22% 的 AX 含量假設，在推導出 49.05% 表觀轉化指標的地方被特別標註；使用者任務時間與錯誤次數（5 分 40 秒降到 1 分 50 秒；錯誤由 2 次降到 0 次）則附註使用者樣本太小、無法一般化。團隊沒有做 LCA 或 TEA，並自己說明了這點。","software":"Arduino firmware for BrewXOS Fermenter Mini, structured into separate modules for sensor acquisition, display update, command parsing and serial output, with bidirectional UART at 9600 bps to a serial touchscreen HMI. A debugging episode is documented in detail: the touchscreen required raw hexadecimal command framing with a %%% terminator, and after fixing the formatting the buttons and sliders could drive the pumps, stirrer and UV-C. Alarm thresholds were moved out of firmware constants into touchscreen-configurable, power-loss-persistent settings after a user complained that different strains need different limits.","software_zh":"BrewXOS Fermenter Mini 的 Arduino 韌體，分成感測器讀取、顯示更新、指令解析與序列輸出等獨立模組，透過 9600 bps 雙向 UART 與序列式觸控螢幕 HMI 通訊。一段除錯過程被詳細記錄下來：觸控螢幕需要以原始十六進位格式下指令並加上 %%% 結尾符，修正格式後，按鈕與滑桿才能驅動幫浦、攪拌器與 UV-C。警報閾值原本寫死在韌體常數裡，在一位使用者反映不同菌株需要不同上下限後，被移出韌體，改成可在觸控螢幕上設定、且斷電後仍保留的參數。","stack":["Bacillus subtilis WB600 (six-protease-deficient secretion host)","pDG1730 integration vector (amyE locus)","E. coli DH5a for propagation","Arduino Mega 2560 with expansion board","serial touchscreen HMI (UART)","waterproof DS18B20 temperature probe","pH probe, headspace O2 and CO2 sensors","PTC heater and thermoelectric cooler via relays","peristaltic pumps, UV-C strip","3D-printed split lid, motor mount, sensor slots and casing","CAD/STEP assembly export"],"techniques":["colony PCR artefact diagnosis by annealing-temperature and template-concentration variation","restriction digestion and sequencing confirmation","multi-tier (single, dual, triple) modular gene assembly with per-tier strain stocks and sequencing records","DNS reducing-sugar assay with D-xylose calibration","TLC against xylobiose and xylotriose standards","enzyme activity assay at 55 C, pH 5.0","task-based external user testing of hardware with timed repeats and error counts"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Outreach was derived from measured knowledge gaps rather than chosen first: 74.88% of 219 survey respondents reported little or no knowledge of prebiotics and senior interviewees repeatedly confused probiotics with prebiotics, so the team ran senior-living-community workshops on four topics - prebiotics versus probiotics, dietary fibre and gut microbiota, and how to spot exaggerated therapeutic claims and incomplete safety disclosure - using plain-language analogies ('food components that certain beneficial gut microbes can use') while still naming the microbes and enzymes involved. Clinicians set the limits: prebiotics were framed as general dietary support and microbiome shifts were not presented as treatment. Evaluation used teach-back rather than a comprehension question: identical three-question show-of-hands polls before and after, plus asking participants to restate the core concepts in their own words, with short verbal feedback instead of long forms for older participants. The team keeps the distinction between acting on a knowledge gap and proving a durable change, saying there is no longitudinal data. They also published six reusable assets (a B. subtilis construction troubleshooting log, a selection-marker and host-compatibility guide, a multi-tier assembly decision framework, the hardware package with BOM/CAD/sensor matrix, the GRAIN x TRACE template and a senior-outreach toolkit), each with an explicit boundary clause.","publicEngagement_zh":"推廣活動是從量到的知識缺口推導出來的，而不是先選定主題：219 位填答者中有 74.88% 表示對益生質所知甚少或完全不知道，受訪的長者也一再把益生菌與益生質混為一談，因此團隊在銀髮社區辦了四個主題的工作坊——益生質與益生菌的差別、膳食纖維與腸道菌相，以及如何辨識誇大的療效宣稱與不完整的安全資訊揭露——用白話的類比（「某些有益腸道微生物可以利用的食物成分」），同時仍然明講涉及哪些微生物與酵素。界線由臨床醫師劃定：益生質被定位為一般性的飲食支持，菌相變化也不被呈現為治療。評量採用回述法而非理解測驗題：活動前後各做一次完全相同的三題舉手調查，並請參與者用自己的話重述核心概念，對年長參與者則以簡短口頭回饋取代冗長表單。團隊清楚區分「針對知識缺口採取行動」與「證明產生了持久改變」兩件事，並說明他們沒有長期追蹤資料。他們也發布了六項可重複使用的資源（B. subtilis 建構的疑難排解記錄、選擇標記與宿主相容性指南、多層次組裝決策框架、含 BOM/CAD/感測器對照表的硬體包、GRAIN x TRACE 模板，以及銀髮推廣工具包），每一項都附上明確的適用範圍說明。","ihp":"This is one of the strongest high-school IHP records of the year because the register of changes is specific, attributed and sometimes negative. Mr Zhou at the Brewing Industry Association gave macro figures (35-36 million kL of beer a year, roughly 5.5-6 million t of wet spent grain, summer output 20-30% above winter, over 80% already in the animal feed chain, an economic transport radius of about 50 km) and the team responded by retiring its founding premise - BrewXOS is not competing with dumping but with a mature feed pathway - and rebuilding its economics as full cost accounting per tonne of wet grain, with near-site or in-park third-party processing instead of in-house brewery lines. Manager Wu of a 300,000 t/year brewery (50,000 t wet BSG, collected by buyers at near-zero cost) confirmed it and the team redefined breweries as raw-material partners who already have an acceptable option. Master He, a municipal landfill worker of six years, supplied the counterweight: 60-90 t/month at nearly 80% moisture, handling costs of 70-80 RMB/t driven by leachate, odour, liner and labour, persisting not from indifference but from absent local off-takers - so the team deleted both extreme narratives, fixed 70-80 RMB/t as a local baseline and upgraded localised processing from a business preference to a hard environmental constraint, because a route relying on high-energy drying or long-haul transport would eat its own gains. Dr Chen, a gastroenterologist at Ruijin Hospital, delivered the single strongest design change: she gave a three-tier evidence ladder (mechanistically plausible / observed in healthy populations / demonstrated in clinical patients), pointed out that marketing AXOS as suitable for IBS directly conflicts with low-FODMAP management, and the team formally struck 'designed specifically for IBS', 'relieves IBS symptoms' and 'improves the gut environment' from its positioning, rewrote the wiki to separate in vitro, healthy-human and patient evidence, and added human tolerance testing as a mandatory milestone. Professor Xu (College of Life Sciences, Zhejiang University) produced three laboratory changes: he stopped a primer redesign by identifying two ~90 bp direct repeats capable of PCR template switching, so the team kept its 1,571 bp clones, raised the annealing temperature and watched the spurious ~400 bp band fade; he made them re-annotate pDG1730 by host role, which replaced erythromycin and ampicillin with spectinomycin for B. subtilis selection and turned lawn-like background into isolated verified colonies; and he pushed them from one-step assembly to tiered construction and to add Abf62A as a testable hypothesis, not an assumed improvement, explicitly because excessive debranching could collapse AXOS into low-substitution XOS. Professor Qing Zhao (Shanghai Chenshan Plant Science Research Center, CAS) moved them from endpoint assays to process logging, which is why the hardware project exists at all; a hardware engineer then rejected their monolithic lid and produced the main-cap/sub-cap architecture, a deepened recessed motor seat and sliding probe slots so routine fluid handling no longer disturbs the impeller shaft and wiring. Downstream, Ms Yang (dairy QC) narrowed the goal from 'a BrewXOS yogurt' to ingredient compatibility in plain fermented milk; Ms Han (Swire Coca-Cola Nanjing) listed pH 2.5-4, hot-fill and a 9-12 month shelf life and said plainly that a premium would not be paid for environmental claims, so RTD beverages became a long-term specification-setting target; Pharmacist Tang moved pharmacies from launch channel to late-stage channel; and Mr Shen of a Chongming ecological farm ('I never look at the price per ton - I look at the cost per kilogram of gain') converted the feed route from wet grain or liquid AXOS into a standardised premix pourable into an existing mixer, judged on feed conversion ratio, diarrhoea rate and mortality. The team also publishes what it rejected - diverting all spent grain away from feed, leading with sustainability, launching a consumer product - with reasons.","ihp_zh":"這是今年最強的高中組 IHP 紀錄之一，因為它的改變清冊具體、有出處，有時還是負面的結論。釀酒工業協會的周先生提供了總量級的數字（每年 3,500-3,600 萬千升啤酒、約 550-600 萬公噸濕酒糟、夏季產量比冬季高 20-30%、八成以上已進入動物飼料鏈、經濟運輸半徑約 50 公里），團隊因此放棄了創始前提——BrewXOS 競爭的對手不是棄置，而是一條成熟的飼料路徑——並把經濟模型重建為以每公噸濕酒糟計的全成本會計，加工改採廠區鄰近或園區內的第三方處理，而非在啤酒廠內自設產線。一間年產 30 萬公噸啤酒廠的吳經理（年產 5 萬公噸濕酒糟，由收購商以近乎零成本運走）證實了這個說法，團隊於是把啤酒廠重新定義為「已經有可接受出路」的原料夥伴。在市政掩埋場工作六年的何師傅則提供了反面的配重：每月 60-90 公噸、含水率近 80%，處理成本每公噸 70-80 人民幣，主要來自滲出水、臭味、阻水布與人力，而這種狀況之所以持續，不是因為沒人在意，而是當地沒有接手的下游——團隊因此刪掉兩種極端敘事，把每公噸 70-80 人民幣定為當地基準，並把「在地化加工」從商業偏好升級為硬性的環境限制條件，因為任何依賴高耗能乾燥或長程運輸的路線，都會把自己省下的好處吃掉。瑞金醫院的腸胃科陳醫師帶來了單一影響最大的設計改變：她給出一個三層的證據階梯（機制上說得通／在健康族群中觀察到／在臨床病人身上證實），並指出把 AXOS 當作適合 IBS 患者來行銷，與低 FODMAP 飲食管理直接衝突；團隊因此正式從定位中刪去「專為 IBS 設計」、「緩解 IBS 症狀」與「改善腸道環境」等說法，重寫 wiki 以區分體外、健康人體與病人三類證據，並把人體耐受性試驗加為必經的里程碑。浙江大學生命科學學院的徐教授促成三項實驗上的改變：他指出兩段約 90 bp 的同向重複序列可能造成 PCR 模板跳換，因而阻止了一次引子重新設計，團隊保留原本 1,571 bp 的選殖株、提高黏合溫度，便看到那條約 400 bp 的雜帶淡去；他要求團隊依宿主用途重新註解 pDG1730，結果把 B. subtilis 的篩選用藥從 erythromycin 與 ampicillin 換成 spectinomycin，使原本像菌毯的背景變成可驗證的單一菌落；他也推動團隊從一步式組裝改為分層建構，並把加入 Abf62A 當作一個可檢驗的假設，而不是預設會更好，理由很明確：過度去分支可能讓 AXOS 崩解成低取代度的 XOS。中國科學院上海辰山植物科學研究中心的趙清教授讓他們從終點測定轉向製程記錄，硬體這條線才會存在；接著一位硬體工程師否決了他們一體成形的槽蓋，提出主蓋／副蓋架構、加深的凹陷式馬達座與可滑動的探針插槽，使日常加液取樣不再碰到攪拌軸與線路。下游端，乳品品管的楊小姐把目標從「做一款 BrewXOS 優格」收窄為「在原味發酵乳中的原料相容性」；太古可口可樂（南京）的韓小姐列出 pH 2.5-4、熱充填與 9-12 個月保存期限的要求，並直言不會為了環境訴求付出溢價，因此即飲（RTD）飲料變成一個長期的規格設定目標；唐藥師把藥局從首發通路改為後期通路；崇明一家生態農場的沈先生（「我從來不看每公噸多少錢，我看的是每公斤增重的成本」）則把飼料路線從濕酒糟或液態 AXOS 改成可直接倒入既有混料機的標準化預混料，評判標準是飼料轉換率、腹瀉率與死亡率。團隊也公布了他們否決的選項——把所有酒糟都從飼料用途轉走、以永續作為主打訴求、直接推出消費端產品——並附上理由。","realWorld":"Need is grounded in the literature (BSG is about 85% of brewing's solid byproducts, roughly 20 kg wet grain per 100 L of beer at 60-80% moisture, a 2025 review estimating about 37.8 million t/year globally) and then immediately qualified by field evidence that feed conversion already works in most Chinese settings, so the project's claim is additional value in regions with unstable disposal channels and dense brewery clusters, not displacement. SDG claims are narrow and target-level: SDG 12 (12.2, 12.5 and 12.6) and SDG 9 (9.5, moving toward 9.4) are the primary goals with SDGs 3 and 8 held explicitly as aspirations, and the page says what it cannot support - no measured waste diversion at commercial scale, no demonstrated industrial resource-efficiency gain, no quantified learning improvement. Implementation is an evidence-gated five-stage sequence (product identity; process balance; application evaluation; net-impact comparison; partner validation) with plain fermented milk as the immediate compatibility matrix, beverages long-term, pharmacies late-stage and a feed premix as a parallel route. The regulatory position is stated rather than finessed: China's 2024 National Health Commission approval of sugarcane-bagasse arabinoxylan specifies source, process and intake limits and does not extend to spent-grain-derived AXOS, so BrewXOS has no novel-food clearance and the team refuses to blur AX and AXOS in public materials. Costs are handled as a bill of materials (RMB 3,480.29 for the prototype, flagged as material cost rather than total ownership) plus a local illustration from the landfill data (RMB 4,200-7,200/month handling at that site; treating 10% of the flow would give 6-9 t wet BSG and roughly 130-194 kg xylose equivalents/month, marked as arithmetic rather than a forecast). After the Jamboree the roadmap is structural characterisation and batch consistency, a safety panel (microbial counts, mycotoxins, heavy metals, pesticide residues, processing impurities), clarifying the filing pathway, fermented-milk compatibility baselines, hardware calibration and safety validation, LCA and TEA so a fair comparison with the feed route is possible, re-engaging the same stakeholders to check whether the changes answered them, and publishing the open-source assets with their boundaries annotated. The team states that no LCA or TEA exists yet and therefore no net environmental benefit may be claimed.","realWorld_zh":"需求有文獻支撐（BSG 約佔釀酒固體副產物的 85%，每 100 公升啤酒約產生 20 公斤含水率 60-80% 的濕酒糟，2025 年一篇回顧估計全球每年約 3,780 萬公噸），但立刻又被田野證據限縮：在中國多數場景中，轉作飼料其實已經行得通，因此專案的主張是在棄置管道不穩定且啤酒廠密集的地區創造額外價值，而不是取代現有做法。SDG 的主張很收斂，而且細到指標層級：以 SDG 12（12.2、12.5、12.6）與 SDG 9（9.5，並朝 9.4 邁進）為主要目標，SDG 3 與 8 則明確僅列為願景；頁面也寫出哪些是他們無法支持的說法——沒有商業規模下實測的廢棄物轉移量、沒有已證實的工業資源效率提升、也沒有量化的學習成效改善。落地規劃是一套以證據為關卡的五階段流程（產品定性；製程平衡；應用評估；淨影響比較；夥伴驗證），以原味發酵乳作為最近期的相容性載體，飲料為長期目標、藥局為後期通路，飼料預混料則是一條並行路線。法規定位是直接說明，而不是打模糊：中國國家衛生健康委員會 2024 年核准的甘蔗渣阿拉伯木聚醣，規定了來源、製程與攝取量上限，並不涵蓋以酒糟為來源的 AXOS，因此 BrewXOS 並沒有新食品原料的許可，團隊也拒絕在公開資料中把 AX 與 AXOS 混著講。成本以物料清單（BOM）呈現（原型機 3,480.29 人民幣，並標明這是物料成本而非總持有成本），再加上一個取自掩埋場資料的在地試算（該場址每月處理費 4,200-7,200 人民幣；若處理其中 10% 的量，相當於 6-9 公噸濕酒糟、每月約 130-194 公斤木糖當量，並註明這只是算術，不是預測）。Jamboree 之後的路線圖包括：結構鑑定與批次一致性、一組安全性檢驗（微生物數、黴菌毒素、重金屬、農藥殘留、製程雜質）、釐清送審路徑、發酵乳相容性基準、硬體校正與安全驗證、完成 LCA 與 TEA 以便與飼料路線做公平比較、再找同一批利害關係人回頭確認這些改變是否真的回應了他們的意見，以及發布標註適用範圍的開源資源。團隊明言目前還沒有 LCA 或 TEA，因此不能主張任何淨環境效益。","partners":["Brewing Industry Association (Mr Zhou)","Qiandao Lake Brewery, Zhejiang (Manager Wu; donated the BSG feedstock)","Local municipal landfill solid-waste operations (Master He)","Dr Chen, gastroenterologist, Ruijin Hospital","Professor Xu, College of Life Sciences, Zhejiang University","Professor Qing Zhao, Shanghai Chenshan Plant Science Research Center, Chinese Academy of Sciences","Engineer Sun, food industry R&D","Hardware engineer (lid structural design consultant)","Dairy enterprise yogurt QC (Ms Yang)","Swire Coca-Cola Nanjing (Ms Han)","Pharmacist Tang and a retail pharmacy","Ecological farm, Chongming, Shanghai (Mr Shen)","iGEM Shanghai-SDG 2025 (cross-team exchange on bioprocessing hardware and SDG assessment)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6174/wiki/public/hp/integration-pathway.webp","caption":"The GRAIN x TRACE integration pathway: how stakeholder input reshaped problem definition, purpose, scientific design, implementation strategy and knowledge sharing, with TRACE recording each question-to-change-to-evidence loop.","caption_zh":"GRAIN x TRACE 的整合路徑：利害關係人的意見如何重塑問題定義、目的、科學設計、落地策略與知識分享，而 TRACE 則記錄每一個「問題—改變—證據」的迴路。","credit":"Team Hongwen School, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6174/wiki/public/hp/brewery-visit.webp","caption":"Brewery visit during the Ground phase, where an existing low-cost feed outlet for spent grain forced the team to abandon its assumption that breweries needed a new disposal technology.","caption_zh":"Ground 階段的啤酒廠參訪，現場既有的低成本酒糟飼料出路，迫使團隊放棄「啤酒廠需要新的廢棄物處理技術」這個假設。","credit":"Team Hongwen School, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6174/wiki/public/hp/farm-visit.webp","caption":"Farm visit and interview in Chongming, Shanghai, where cost per kilogram of weight gain turned the animal-feed route into a standardised premix concept.","caption_zh":"在上海崇明的農場參訪與訪談，每公斤增重的成本把動物飼料這條路線變成標準化預混料的構想。","credit":"Team Hongwen School, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6174/wiki/public/hp/gastroenterologist-consultation.webp","caption":"Consultation with a gastroenterologist at Ruijin Hospital, whose three-tier evidence framework led the team to remove all IBS-related claims from the project positioning.","caption_zh":"與瑞金醫院腸胃科醫師的諮詢，她的三層證據框架促使團隊從專案定位中移除所有與 IBS 相關的宣稱。","credit":"Team Hongwen School, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy the TRACE closed-loop rule: log every stakeholder interaction as Trigger, Relevant voice, Advice and tensions, Change and Evidence, and mark an interaction as an open loop whenever there is advice without a project change or a plan without proof of implementation. It converts engagement from a photo gallery into an auditable decision ledger, and the companion 'what we did not adopt, and why' table is what makes the adopted changes credible.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"值得照抄的是 TRACE 的閉環規則：把每一次利害關係人互動記錄成觸發事件（Trigger）、相關聲音（Relevant voices）、建議與衝突（Advice and tensions）、改變（Change）與證據（Evidence），只要出現「有建議卻沒有專案改變」或「有計畫卻沒有落實證明」，就標記為未閉合的迴路。這樣做能把參與互動從照片牆變成可稽核的決策帳本，而配套的「我們沒有採納什麼、為什麼」表格，才是讓那些已採納的改變站得住腳的關鍵。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/sustainability","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/safety-and-security","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/assets/index-BCz246wW.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/assets/HumanPracticesArticle-C7wSXf0T.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/assets/sustainability-Bw_LueMp.js","https://registry.igem.org/collections/c1986de4-b393-49a8-8341-4f5d4b150efe"],"awards_zh":["最佳硬體 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（農業 / 食品與營養 / 時尚與美妝 / 藝術與設計）"],"rank":21},"6177":{"team":"SEHS","id":"6177","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Therapeutics / health (inferred from project scope; no village stated on the wiki)","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/sehs/","projectTitle":"FusionDrive - an anti-TIGIT-IL-2v fusion protein for gastric cancer immunotherapy","projectTitle_zh":"FusionDrive：用於胃癌免疫治療的 anti-TIGIT-IL-2v 融合蛋白","tagline":"Release the immune brake and bias the accelerator, in one molecule","tagline_zh":"以單一分子鬆開免疫煞車，並把油門偏向正確的細胞族群","summary":"Starting from the high gastric-cancer burden in their home province of Shandong, SEHS designed FusionDrive, a fusion protein joining an anti-TIGIT antibody to an engineered IL-2 variant through a G4S linker. The antibody Fab blocks CD155-TIGIT inhibitory signalling to reverse T-cell exhaustion, while the Fc-fused IL-2v carries a low-alpha/high-beta modification that reduces CD25 binding and so biases stimulation away from regulatory T cells. Across five DBTL cycles the team built the antibody, the wild-type IL-2 fusion and the variant fusion in CHO cells and compared them by SDS-PAGE, TIGIT-binding ELISA (EC50 0.6317 nM for the antibody, 1.335 nM after IL-2 fusion) and flow cytometry for CD25 and pSTAT5. Because the iGEM high-school White List left Jurkat as the only available T-cell line, they used PHA induction to create CD25-high and CD25-low populations as a stand-in for the Treg receptor phenotype.","summary_zh":"從家鄉山東省沉重的胃癌負擔出發，SEHS 設計了 FusionDrive，一種以 G4S 連接子把 anti-TIGIT 抗體接上經改造 IL-2 變體的融合蛋白。抗體的 Fab 段阻斷 CD155-TIGIT 抑制訊號以逆轉 T 細胞耗竭；與 Fc 融合的 IL-2v 則帶有 low-alpha/high-beta 改造，降低對 CD25 的結合，從而讓刺激偏離調節型 T 細胞。在五個 DBTL 循環中，團隊於 CHO 細胞內製作了抗體、野生型 IL-2 融合蛋白與變體融合蛋白，並以 SDS-PAGE、TIGIT 結合 ELISA（抗體 EC50 為 0.6317 nM，融合 IL-2 後為 1.335 nM）以及針對 CD25 與 pSTAT5 的流式細胞術加以比較。由於 iGEM 高中組的 White List 只留下 Jurkat 這一株可用的 T 細胞株，他們改以 PHA 誘導製造 CD25 高表現與低表現族群，作為 Treg 受體表現型的替代。","awards":["Best Alternative Platform — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"No computational model of any kind: there is no Model or Software page on the site, and no docking, structure prediction or kinetic simulation anywhere in the project. The design reasoning is literature-driven (lowalpha/highbeta IL-2 variants, G4S linker flexibility) rather than simulated. The hardware page does include a comparative literature review of three published protein-detection instruments used to specify a device.","frameworks_zh":"完全沒有任何形式的計算模型：網站上沒有 Model 或 Software 頁面，整個專案也找不到分子嵌合、結構預測或動力學模擬。設計論證是文獻驅動（low-alpha/high-beta IL-2 變體、G4S 連接子的柔性）而非模擬驅動。硬體頁面倒是收錄了三款已發表蛋白質檢測儀器的比較性文獻回顧，用來訂出裝置規格。","dataviz":"Clean, interpretable assay figures: concentration-response ELISA binding curves for all three molecular formats with fitted EC50 values, flow-cytometry panels reporting both positive-cell percentage and mean fluorescence intensity, PHA induction screening results, and pSTAT5 response split across CD25-defined subpopulations. Figure captions state what is being compared.","dataviz_zh":"檢測圖表乾淨且可解讀：三種分子形式的 ELISA 濃度反應結合曲線並附擬合出的 EC50 值、同時報告陽性細胞百分比與平均螢光強度的流式細胞術圖組、PHA 誘導篩選結果，以及依 CD25 定義的次族群分別呈現的 pSTAT5 反應。圖說明確寫出所比較的對象。","datascience":"Dose-response curve fitting to extract EC50 is the real quantitative work, and it is done properly - including diagnosing why the first ELISA saturated (the TIGIT-Fc coating antigen was being detected by the anti-human IgG1-HRP secondary) and re-running with His-tagged TIGIT. Flow-cytometry gating is used to separate populations and compare signalling within each, with both %positive and MFI reported rather than one summary number. No inferential statistics (no ANOVA, no stated replicate counts or error bars in the text), so the analysis is descriptive rather than statistical.","datascience_zh":"以劑量反應曲線擬合取得 EC50 是真正的定量工作，而且做得正確，包括診斷出第一次 ELISA 為何飽和（作為塗覆抗原的 TIGIT-Fc 被 anti-human IgG1-HRP 二級抗體偵測到），並改用帶 His 標籤的 TIGIT 重跑。流式細胞術的 gating 用來分離族群並比較各族群內的訊號傳遞，且同時報告陽性百分比與 MFI，而不是只給一個摘要數字。沒有推論統計（沒有 ANOVA，文中也沒有說明重複次數或誤差線），因此分析屬描述性而非統計性。","software":"None.","software_zh":"無。","stack":["TIGIT-binding ELISA with EC50 curve fitting","flow cytometry (CD25, pSTAT5; %positive and MFI)","SDS-PAGE under reducing and non-reducing conditions","CHO transient expression and protein purification","SolidWorks-style CAD for the compact detection device","Gibson assembly / homologous recombination cloning with Sanger verification"],"techniques":["concentration-response curve fitting and EC50 comparison across three molecular formats","assay-interference troubleshooting and antigen substitution","phenotype-based model adaptation (PHA-induced CD25-high population as a Treg receptor proxy)","subpopulation-resolved signalling comparison","comparative literature review to specify instrument requirements"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Modest and mostly instrumental to the Human Practices work rather than a programme in its own right. There is an online questionnaire with 131 respondents (concerns clustered on efficacy, long-term side effects and cost, plus a stated appetite for disease knowledge), school outreach including a session with 15 final-year high-school students with a post-activity feedback survey, and a dual-use forum organised with two Shandong University academics after the iGEM Safety and Security Committee raised dual-use analysis. The Education page exists but is empty.","publicEngagement_zh":"規模不大，而且多半是為整合式人類實踐工作服務，而非獨立成章的計畫。內容包括一份 131 人回覆的線上問卷（疑慮集中在療效、長期副作用與費用，並表達想了解疾病知識的意願）、一場與 15 位高三學生進行並附活動後回饋調查的校園推廣，以及在 iGEM Safety and Security Committee 提出兩用性分析要求後，與兩位山東大學學者合辦的兩用性論壇。Education 頁面存在，但是空的。","ihp":"Genuinely project-shaping, organised around four questions and a stakeholder table that pairs each input with the team's response and its outcome status. The pivot is documented honestly: the team began assuming alcohol consumption meant liver cancer, and oncologist Dr Meng Min redirected them to gastric cancer, pointing out that because gastric cancer is predominantly East Asian it receives less targeted-drug investment than globally prevalent cancers. Professor Yang Zhe's warning about excessive immune activation reframed the bifunctional design and set 'advanced gastric cancer, combination therapy' as the research context. Antibody engineer Professor Liu Zhifang's point that binding must be re-measured after adding modules is directly why TIGIT binding was tested separately for all three formats. A WuXi AppTec expert (anonymised as Dr Z) pushed them to distinguish a change in response bias from a change in overall activity, and reviewed their questionnaire wording. A patient's family member (Ms Wang) shifted the evaluation goal toward completing treatment rather than efficacy alone. The Safety and Security Committee exchange is what selected CHO cells as the chassis.","ihp_zh":"確實形塑了專案，圍繞四個問題與一張利害關係人表格展開，表中把每一項輸入與團隊的回應及其結果狀態配對。轉向的過程被誠實記錄：團隊起初假設飲酒意味著肝癌，腫瘤科醫師 Dr Meng Min 把他們導向胃癌，並指出胃癌以東亞為主，因此相較於全球普遍的癌症，得到的標靶藥物投資較少。Professor Yang Zhe 關於免疫過度活化的警告重新框定了雙功能設計，並把「晚期胃癌、合併療法」設為研究情境。抗體工程專家 Professor Liu Zhifang 指出加上模組後必須重新量測結合力，這正是三種形式都分別測試 TIGIT 結合的直接原因。一位 WuXi AppTec 的專家（匿名為 Dr Z）促使他們區分反應偏向的改變與整體活性的改變，並審閱了他們的問卷用語。一位病患家屬（Ms Wang）把評估目標從單看療效轉向能否完成治療。與 Safety and Security Committee 的往來，則是選定 CHO 細胞作為宿主細胞的原因。","realWorld":"The Alternative Platform page is the real deliverable and the most transferable thing here: a documented mammalian expression and functional-evaluation workflow built entirely inside the 2025-onward iGEM high-school White List, which bans Check-in and Animal Use forms. CHO cells produce the molecules, Jurkat cells measure the response, and the team shows how to translate a tumour-immunology question into something testable with only a whitelisted cell line - including the PHA/CD25 trick that substitutes a receptor phenotype for an unavailable cell type. Contribution also covers the fusion-protein workflow, the modular architecture, documented assay interference, and a compact organoid-chip detection device prototype (sample chamber, constant-temperature heating, illumination, image acquisition, control system) specified as a low-cost alternative to a microplate reader. The business plan covers staged financing and technology licensing.","realWorld_zh":"Alternative Platform 頁面才是真正的交付成果，也是這裡最可移轉的東西：一套完全建立在 2025 年起生效的 iGEM 高中組 White List 之內的哺乳動物細胞表現與功能評估流程，而該清單禁止 Check-in 與 Animal Use 表單。CHO 細胞負責生產分子，Jurkat 細胞負責量測反應，團隊並示範了如何只用清單允許的細胞株，把一個腫瘤免疫學問題轉譯成可檢驗的實驗，包括用 PHA/CD25 的手法以受體表現型替代一株取用不到的細胞類型。貢獻還涵蓋融合蛋白流程、模組化架構、記錄下來的檢測干擾，以及一台精簡的類器官晶片檢測裝置原型（樣品室、恆溫加熱、照明、影像擷取、控制系統），其規格定位為微量盤判讀儀的低成本替代方案。商業計畫涵蓋分階段募資與技術授權。","partners":["Dr Meng Min, oncologist","Professor Yang Zhe (tumour immunology)","Professor Liu Zhifang, antibody engineering","WuXi AppTec drug-development expert (anonymised as Dr Z)","Shandong University academics (dual-use forum)","iGEM Safety and Security Committee","President Zhang Zhongjiang (health communication and business planning)","a patient's family member (anonymised as Ms Wang)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6177/wiki/description/fig-03.avif","caption":"From design to initial validation: the five engineering cycles taking FusionDrive from anti-TIGIT antibody to wild-type IL-2 fusion to the low-alpha/high-beta IL-2 variant fusion.","caption_zh":"從設計到初步驗證：五個工程循環把 FusionDrive 從 anti-TIGIT 抗體推進到野生型 IL-2 融合蛋白，再到 low-alpha/high-beta IL-2 變體融合蛋白。","credit":"Team SEHS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6177/wiki/alternative-platform/fig-04.avif","caption":"TIGIT-binding ELISA concentration-response curves for the three molecular formats, the dataset from which the team fitted EC50 values of 0.6317 nM (antibody) and 1.335 nM (IL-2 fusion).","caption_zh":"三種分子形式的 TIGIT 結合 ELISA 濃度反應曲線，團隊即由這組資料擬合出 0.6317 nM（抗體）與 1.335 nM（IL-2 融合蛋白）的 EC50 值。","credit":"Team SEHS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6177/wiki/alternative-platform/fig-08.avif","caption":"pSTAT5 responses across CD25-defined Jurkat populations, the readout built to test the low-alpha design using only a whitelisted cell line.","caption_zh":"依 CD25 定義的 Jurkat 族群中的 pSTAT5 反應，這是為了只用清單允許的細胞株來檢驗 low-alpha 設計而建立的讀值。","credit":"Team SEHS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6177/wiki/alternative-platform/fig-01.avif","caption":"Overview of the FusionDrive mammalian cell expression and functional evaluation platform, built entirely within the iGEM high-school White List.","caption_zh":"FusionDrive 哺乳動物細胞表現與功能評估平台總覽，完全建立在 iGEM 高中組 White List 之內。","credit":"Team SEHS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"SEHS is a wet-lab-first project whose dry lab is thin but not decorative: EC50 curve fitting and subpopulation-resolved flow-cytometry analysis are real quantitative work and well within high-school reach, yet an antibody-cytokine fusion project with no structure prediction, no linker modelling and no docking is leaving free analysis on the table. The limiting factor is clearly mentorship rather than tooling or compute - the team had access to CHO culture and a flow cytometer, which is far rarer than a free AlphaFold or HDOCK run, so someone simply never pointed them at the computational side.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"SEHS 是一個以濕實驗為主的專案，乾實驗雖然薄弱卻不是裝飾：EC50 曲線擬合與分族群解析的流式細胞術分析都是扎實的定量工作，也完全在高中生的能力範圍內；然而一個抗體與細胞激素融合的專案若完全沒有結構預測、沒有連接子建模、也沒有分子嵌合，等於把現成可做的分析留在桌上沒撿。限制因素顯然是指導而非工具或算力：團隊能用到 CHO 細胞培養與流式細胞儀，這比免費跑一次 AlphaFold 或 HDOCK 稀有得多，只是從來沒有人把他們指向計算這一側。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/sehs/","https://2026.igem.wiki/sehs/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/sehs/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/sehs/alternative-platform","https://2026.igem.wiki/sehs/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/sehs/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/sehs/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/sehs/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/sehs/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/sehs/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/sehs/safety"],"awards_zh":["最佳替代平台 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6178":{"team":"HFI","id":"6178","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/","projectTitle":"TWO EcN, ONE METABOLIC MISSION - A Probiotic Synergistic Therapy for the Rare Disease Hyperlysinemia","projectTitle_zh":"TWO EcN, ONE METABOLIC MISSION — 以益生菌協同療法治療罕見疾病高離胺酸血症","tagline":"A dual-strain E. coli Nissle 1917 consortium, physically stapled together with SpyTag/SpyCatcher, that degrades dietary lysine in the gut so hyperlysinemia patients can escape lifelong diet restriction.","tagline_zh":"一組以 SpyTag/SpyCatcher 實體釘接在一起的雙菌株 E. coli Nissle 1917 群落，在腸道中分解飲食來源的離胺酸，讓高離胺酸血症患者得以擺脫終身飲食限制。","summary":"HFI (International Department, The Affiliated High School of South China Normal University, Guangzhou) built an orally delivered live biotherapeutic for hyperlysinemia, a rare AASS-mutation disorder with no approved therapy and an incidence near 1 in 411,000. They split the human saccharopine pathway across two EcN populations - an upstream strain expressing LKR and SDH, a downstream strain expressing ALDH and AASDHPPT - knocked out the endogenous ldcC lysine decarboxylase by CRISPR-Cas9 to remove background lysine consumption, and covalently coupled the two strains using eCPX-displayed SpyTag/SpyCatcher so intermediates pass between cells over a short diffusion distance. Biosafety is handled by a dual-input kill switch where an arabinose-driven Bxb1 serine integrase inverts the lysis-E cassette and an oxygen-sensing PcyoA promoter only fires outside the anaerobic gut. The project won because the dry lab genuinely steered the wet lab (NetLogo screening picked the RBS before cloning), the part collection was fully characterised with HPLC-MS, and the education and IHP programmes were unusually systematic for a high school team.","summary_zh":"HFI（廣州華南師範大學附屬中學國際部）為高離胺酸血症打造了一款口服的活體生物療法；這是一種由 AASS 突變造成的罕見疾病，目前沒有核准療法，發生率約為 1/411,000。他們把人體的 saccharopine 代謝路徑拆分到兩群 EcN 上——上游菌株表現 LKR 與 SDH，下游菌株表現 ALDH 與 AASDHPPT——並以 CRISPR-Cas9 剔除內源的 ldcC 離胺酸脫羧酶，以消除背景的離胺酸消耗；再以 eCPX 展示的 SpyTag/SpyCatcher 把兩個菌株以共價方式耦合起來，使中間產物在很短的擴散距離內於細胞間傳遞。生物安全由一個雙輸入致死開關處理：由阿拉伯糖驅動的 Bxb1 絲胺酸整合酶會把 lysis-E 卡匣反轉，而感測氧氣的 PcyoA 啟動子只有在離開厭氧的腸道環境後才會啟動。此專題之所以勝出，是因為乾實驗確實引導了濕實驗（NetLogo 篩選在選殖之前就選定了 RBS）、元件集合以 HPLC-MS 做了完整特性分析，而教育與 IHP 的規劃對一支高中隊伍而言異常地系統化。","awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best Part Collection — Nominee (High School)","Best Education — Winner (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Winner (Infectious Diseases / Therapeutics / Diagnostics / Oncology)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Two complementary models, both used to make decisions rather than decorate the wiki. First, an agent-based stochastic contact model in NetLogo 3D 7.0.4: 200 cells (100 SpyTag type A, 100 SpyCatcher type B) random-walk in a periodic box spanning -16 to 16 units, diffusion speed 0.17 per tick, interaction radius 1.4, 2,000 ticks; each successful A-B contact creates an undirected graph edge, decrements both cells' remaining binding capacity, and merges cluster IDs, so a bacterial aggregate is literally a connected component of a graph. They swept seven RBS parts (B0032, B0033, B0035, B0029, B0031, B0030, B0034) mapped to 5-100 surface display sites and tracked mean cluster size, max cluster size and the full size distribution, expanding the noisy 30-site condition to 60 replicate runs to characterise its stochastic variance (max 109.6 +/- 34.5). Second, a mass-conserving 13-state-variable compartmental ODE simulator of the lysine cascade: metabolites L (lysine), S (saccharopine), A (AASA) and P (AAA) across three compartments (extracellular medium, upstream SpyCatcher cytoplasm, downstream SpyTag cytoplasm), Michaelis-Menten rate laws with half-saturation 0.2, a saturating contact signal H = B/(0.05+B) converting occupied binding capacity into extra inter-strain exchange conductance g_CT, integrated with fourth-order Runge-Kutta at base step 0.001 (reported backbone mass-balance error ~3.77e-15), with toxic AASA exposure summarised by trapezoidal AUC.","frameworks_zh":"兩個互補的模型，都是用來做決策、而不是裝點 wiki。第一個是在 NetLogo 3D 7.0.4 中建的代理人隨機接觸模型：200 個細胞（100 個 SpyTag 的 A 型、100 個 SpyCatcher 的 B 型）在 -16 到 16 單位的週期性邊界盒中隨機漫步，擴散速度為每 tick 0.17，交互作用半徑 1.4，共 2,000 個 tick；每一次成功的 A-B 接觸就建立一條無向圖的邊、把兩個細胞剩餘的結合容量各減一，並合併群集 ID，因此一個細菌聚集體實際上就是圖上的一個連通分量。他們掃過七個 RBS 元件（B0032、B0033、B0035、B0029、B0031、B0030、B0034），對應到 5 到 100 個表面展示位點，並追蹤平均群集大小、最大群集大小與完整的大小分布，其中把雜訊較大的 30 位點條件擴充到 60 次重複執行，以描述其隨機變異（最大值 109.6 +/- 34.5）。第二個是一個質量守恆、含 13 個狀態變數的隔室 ODE 模擬器，描述離胺酸的串聯反應：代謝物 L（離胺酸）、S（saccharopine）、A（AASA）與 P（AAA），分布在三個隔室（胞外培養基、上游 SpyCatcher 的細胞質、下游 SpyTag 的細胞質）；採 Michaelis-Menten 速率式、半飽和常數 0.2，並以一個飽和式的接觸訊號 H = B/(0.05+B) 把已佔用的結合容量轉換為額外的跨菌株交換傳導 g_CT，以四階 Runge-Kutta 積分、基礎步長 0.001（報告的骨幹質量平衡誤差約 3.77e-15），並以梯形法 AUC 彙總具毒性的 AASA 暴露量。","dataviz":"Both models were ported to interactive browser pages embedded in the wiki, so a judge or reader can move the sliders and re-run the simulation live with no local install: the ODE metabolic simulator at https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/static/model/metabolism.html and the NetLogo cluster model at https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/static/model/netlogo.html. Outputs are dynamic cluster visualisations, metabolite time-course curves and quantitative readouts. Alongside this they reported the full cluster-size distribution (not just means), particle-weighted versus number-weighted distributions, and a table pairing each RBS part number with its translational strength tier and simulated outcome, which makes the in-silico screen auditable.","dataviz_zh":"兩個模型都移植成內嵌於 wiki 的互動網頁，使評審或讀者不必在本機安裝任何東西就能拉動滑桿、即時重跑模擬：ODE 代謝模擬器在 https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/static/model/metabolism.html ，NetLogo 群集模型在 https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/static/model/netlogo.html 。輸出為動態的群集視覺化、代謝物時間曲線與定量讀數。除此之外，他們報告了完整的群集大小分布（不只是平均值）、以顆粒加權與以數量加權的分布對照，以及一張把每個 RBS 元件編號與其轉譯強度等級、模擬結果並列的表格，使這次電腦篩選可供查核。","datascience":"The dry lab was used specifically to fill a measurement gap: they could not quantify the short-lived intermediates saccharopine and AASA in the wet lab, so the ODE model predicted them and exposed an explicit design trade-off - at SC:ST 2:1 lysine clearance is fastest (residual lysine 0.0519) but AASA peaks highest (0.3767, AUC 10.43), while at 1:2 AASA stays low (peak 0.1123, AUC 3.14) but 0.2980 lysine is left unconsumed. That framing (two goals that cannot be maximised at once) drove the choice of co-culture ratios actually tested. The cluster model's prediction that moderate display (B0035, 15 sites, mean max cluster 48.67 cells, about 24% of the system) sits in the usable middle regime while 50+ sites collapses 91-98% of cells into one giant component was then checked at the bench by fluorescence microscopy with ImageJ quantification of red-green overlapping cluster count and core area (3 clusters/field at 2:1 rising to 16 at 1:1 and 14 at 1:2, mean core area 15.04 to 19.41 um2), and the simulated ratio ranking matched the HPLC lysine-removal ranking. Measurement side: a cheap ninhydrin colorimetric screen was calibrated against FDAA-derivatised HPLC-MS (lysine derivative at 17.04 min, m/z 398.1, calibration R2 = 0.9985).","datascience_zh":"乾實驗被明確用來填補量測上的缺口：他們在濕實驗中無法定量短命的中間產物 saccharopine 與 AASA，於是用 ODE 模型預測，並藉此揭露一個明確的設計取捨——在 SC:ST 為 2:1 時離胺酸清除最快（殘餘離胺酸 0.0519），但 AASA 的峰值也最高（0.3767，AUC 10.43）；而在 1:2 時 AASA 維持在低位（峰值 0.1123，AUC 3.14），卻有 0.2980 的離胺酸未被消耗。這種「兩個目標無法同時最大化」的框架，決定了實際測試的共培養比例。群集模型預測中等展示量（B0035、15 個位點，最大群集平均 48.67 個細胞，約為整個系統的 24%）落在可用的中間區域，而 50 個位點以上則會讓 91-98% 的細胞塌縮成單一巨大連通分量；這項預測接著在實驗檯上以螢光顯微鏡檢驗，並用 ImageJ 定量紅綠重疊的群集數與核心面積（2:1 時每視野 3 個群集，1:1 升至 16 個、1:2 為 14 個，核心面積平均 15.04 至 19.41 um2），模擬得到的比例排序與 HPLC 測得的離胺酸移除排序一致。量測方面：以 FDAA 衍生化的 HPLC-MS 校正了一套便宜的 ninhydrin 比色篩檢（離胺酸衍生物滯留時間 17.04 分鐘、m/z 398.1，校正曲線 R2 = 0.9985）。","software":"No standalone software tool was released, but the two models are published as free-standing interactive web pages inside the wiki (metabolism.html and netlogo.html) and the complete NetLogo source (setup, go, update-cluster-distribution, avg-cluster-size, max-cluster-size, sweep-rbs, scan-catcher-series procedures) is printed in full on the Model page so another team can rerun the screen. Repository: https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/hfi. They also contributed a documented part collection to the Registry including BBa_26S7HLMM (ldcC target sequence) and BBa_269KMPAL (pEcgRNA-ldcC), plus the two models listed as community contributions.","software_zh":"沒有釋出獨立的軟體工具，但兩個模型以可獨立運作的互動網頁發布在 wiki 內（metabolism.html 與 netlogo.html），而完整的 NetLogo 原始碼（setup、go、update-cluster-distribution、avg-cluster-size、max-cluster-size、sweep-rbs、scan-catcher-series 等程序）則完整印在 Model 頁上，讓其他隊伍可以重跑這次篩選。程式庫：https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/hfi 。他們也向 Registry 貢獻了一組有完整文件的元件集合，包括 BBa_26S7HLMM（ldcC 標的序列）與 BBa_269KMPAL（pEcgRNA-ldcC），另有兩個模型列為社群貢獻。","stack":["NetLogo 3D 7.0.4","agent-based / graph connected-component modelling","ODE system (13 state variables, 3 compartments)","fourth-order Runge-Kutta integration","Michaelis-Menten kinetics","trapezoidal AUC integration","interactive HTML/JS model front-ends","ImageJ","HPLC-MS (FDAA derivatisation)","CRISPR-Cas9 genome editing","GitLab"],"techniques":["in-silico RBS strength screening before cloning","replicate-expanded stochastic variance characterisation (n=60 at the unstable condition)","cluster-size distribution analysis","strain-ratio flux trade-off analysis (AASA peak vs AUC vs residual lysine)","model-to-bench validation by fluorescence microscopy + ImageJ","colorimetric assay calibrated against HPLC-MS","mass-balance error reporting as a numerical sanity check"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education was designed from survey data rather than guesswork, and ran on an explicit five-step cycle they named CLEAR (Connect, Layer, Engage, Assess, Reinforce) in which every activity had to report a measured outcome and a change for the next iteration. Highlights: a self-written microbiology comic book issued in Cantonese and Mandarin dialect versions, with English, Japanese and German recorded audiobooks and text versions in Arabic, German, Russian, French, Korean, Portuguese, Japanese, Thai, Spanish and Indonesian - explicitly supplied as text so local educators can generate their own AI text-to-speech audio in languages the team does not speak. They ran a 100+ student conference at HFI International, a HFI Academic Summit with hands-on fruit DNA extraction, recorded lab-technique video lessons (pipetting, agarose gel electrophoresis, clean bench, plus an SMA rare-disease case study) on iGEM Video and Bilibili, an online Q&A session on Tencent Meeting, a university biology major exhibition poster, a Gobi Desert biology trip, a synthetic biology student society, outreach at the Guangzhou Social Welfare Institute, and a professional session with HSBC on financial literacy. Impact was measured with paired pre/post surveys: at the Academic Summit (n=24) correct identification of synthetic biology rose 79% to 96% with the 'synthetic biology is another name for genetic testing' misconception falling 8% to 0%, and correct understanding that DNA is in every living cell including fruit cells rose 42% to 88%. They also tracked platform metrics honestly, noting that 15 WeChat posts drew 248 likes, 955 views, 63 shares and zero comments, concluding one-way delivery was failing and pivoting to interactive formats, after which video lessons drew comments for the first time.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育工作是依問卷資料設計、而非憑猜測，並依他們命名為 CLEAR（Connect、Layer、Engage、Assess、Reinforce）的明確五步循環運作，其中每項活動都必須回報一項可量測的結果與下一輪的一項改動。亮點包括：一本自行創作的微生物學漫畫，發行粵語與國語方言版本，並錄製英語、日語與德語有聲書，另提供阿拉伯語、德語、俄語、法語、韓語、葡萄牙語、日語、泰語、西班牙語與印尼語的文字版——文字版是刻意提供的，讓各地教育者能用 AI 文字轉語音自行生成團隊成員不會說的語言的音檔。他們在 HFI 國際部辦了一場 100 人以上的學生會議、一場包含動手做水果 DNA 萃取的 HFI 學術高峰會，在 iGEM Video 與 Bilibili 上發布實驗技術影片課程（吸量操作、瓊膠電泳、無菌操作檯，另有一則 SMA 罕病案例研究），在騰訊會議上辦線上問答，在大學生物科系展覽張貼海報，辦了一趟戈壁沙漠生物考察，成立了合成生物學學生社團，到廣州市社會福利院做科普，並與匯豐銀行合辦一場金融素養的專業講座。成效以前後配對問卷量測：在學術高峰會（n=24）中，能正確辨識合成生物學的比例從 79% 升至 96%，「合成生物學只是基因檢測的另一個說法」這個迷思從 8% 降到 0%，而正確理解 DNA 存在於每個活細胞、包括水果細胞中的比例從 42% 升至 88%。他們也誠實追蹤平台數據，指出 15 篇微信貼文獲得 248 個讚、955 次瀏覽、63 次分享與零則留言，由此判斷單向傳遞行不通，轉而採用互動形式，之後影片課程才首次出現留言。","ihp":"IHP ran through a named six-step cycle (LYSERA: Listen, Yield, Shape, Execute, Reflect, Apply) across six sequenced phases - stakeholder mapping on an interest/power matrix, a 434-response public survey, technical validation, clinical and patient engagement, commercial and regulatory consultation, and peer review - then looped back through phases 3 to 6 a second time. The changes are concrete. Dr. Mingjun Sun (Sichuan University, synthetic biology and AI protein design) argued the lag between lysine detection and enzyme expression would make the probiotics miss the postprandial treatment window, so HFI abandoned the lysine-responsive promoter entirely and switched to constitutive expression of all degradation enzymes; he also warned that SpyTag/SpyCatcher aggregation risk scales with expression level and suggested building a computational model instead of trial and error, which is the direct origin of the NetLogo cluster model and the choice of medium-to-low strength RBS. Professor Liujie Huo questioned whether intestinal lysine concentration tracks blood lysine at all, forcing them to re-examine the physiological basis and repositioning of the product. The public survey changed the language of every outreach material: 'genetically modified' was replaced with 'engineered' across all materials because the survey showed the former triggered unease, and because 76.04% of respondents had heard of rare diseases but could not name one while only 8.29% could name three, education was rebuilt to start from absolute basics. Survey findings that 56.22% supported national insurance coverage and 59.45% preferred prescription-drug regulation validated the hospital-first go-to-market route and tiered pricing. Mr. Guodong Huo of the Illness Challenge Foundation insisted patients are not defined by their condition, which set a non-stigmatising language policy and a no-false-hope rule for all materials. Safety feedback (protease degradation risk) added simulated intestinal fluid stability tests to the experimental plan.","ihp_zh":"IHP 以一個命名過的六步循環（LYSERA：Listen、Yield、Shape、Execute、Reflect、Apply）貫穿六個依序推進的階段——以興趣／影響力矩陣繪製利害關係人地圖、一份 434 份回覆的公眾問卷、技術驗證、臨床與病友端接觸、商業與法規諮詢，以及同儕審閱——之後再把第 3 到第 6 階段跑過第二輪。改動相當具體。四川大學的Mingjun Sun 博士（合成生物學與 AI 蛋白質設計）指出，從偵測到離胺酸到酵素表現之間的時間落差會讓益生菌錯過餐後的治療窗口，於是 HFI 徹底放棄了對離胺酸有反應的啟動子，改為讓所有分解酵素都以組成型表現；他也警告 SpyTag/SpyCatcher 的聚集風險會隨表現量上升，建議建一個運算模型、而不是靠試誤，這正是 NetLogo 群集模型與選用中低強度 RBS 的直接來源。Liujie Huo 教授則質疑腸道內的離胺酸濃度究竟是否與血中離胺酸連動，迫使他們重新檢視產品的生理學基礎與定位。公眾問卷改變了所有科普材料的用語：所有材料中的「基因改造」都換成了「工程改造」，因為問卷顯示前者會引發不安；又因為 76.04% 的受訪者聽過罕見疾病但說不出任何一種、只有 8.29% 能說出三種，教育內容便重建為從最基本處開始。問卷顯示 56.22% 支持納入國家醫保、59.45% 偏好以處方藥方式管理，這佐證了先走醫院的上市路徑與分級定價。病痛挑戰基金會的Guodong Huo 先生強調病人不該被其疾病定義，這確立了所有材料的非汙名化用語政策與「不給假希望」原則。安全性方面的意見（蛋白酶降解風險）則讓實驗計畫加上了模擬腸液的穩定性測試。","realWorld":"A full commercial dossier for EcN-BioShield covering unmet need, TAM/SAM/SOM, PESTEL, Porter's Five Forces, SWOT, competitor analysis against lysine-free medical foods such as Hyper LYS Anamix Infant (UK NHS ~GBP 54 per 400 g can, roughly GBP 1,500-2,000/year), a Business Model Canvas, and a 20-year financial projection. Pricing was set at 2,000 CNY per 30-capsule bottle (24,000 CNY per patient-year) after stakeholder consultation on affordability, with a modelled initial funding requirement of 1,260,000 CNY, break-even in year 16.79 and cumulative payoff of 59,020,546 CNY by year 20 - unusually long-horizon honesty for a student plan. They mapped three regulatory routes in parallel because hyperlysinemia is not in China's Rare Disease Catalog and there is no settled Live Biotherapeutic Product registration pathway, including applying to NMPA's Center for Drug Evaluation for Orphan Drug Designation. Risk management is broken out by regulatory, clinical, commercial, technical, public-acceptance, competitive and financial risk, with an early/mid/long-term (1-5, 5-10, 11+ year) milestone timeline. Ethical commitments include tiered pricing plus advocacy for national insurance coverage, no overstatement of readiness, age-appropriate formulations, and patient-data confidentiality.","realWorld_zh":"EcN-BioShield 有一份完整的商業文件，涵蓋未滿足需求、TAM/SAM/SOM、PESTEL、波特五力、SWOT，以及對照無離胺酸醫療食品（如 Hyper LYS Anamix Infant，英國 NHS 每 400 g 罐約 54 英鎊，約每年 1,500-2,000 英鎊）的競爭分析，另有商業模式畫布與一份 20 年財務預測。價格在就可負擔性諮詢利害關係人後，訂為每瓶 30 顆膠囊 2,000 人民幣（每位患者每年 24,000 人民幣），模型推算初始資金需求為 1,260,000 人民幣，於第 16.79 年損益兩平，到第 20 年累積回報 59,020,546 人民幣——對一份學生計畫而言，這種長期視野的誠實相當罕見。他們並行規劃了三條法規路徑，因為高離胺酸血症並未列入中國的罕見病目錄，而活體生物治療產品也沒有定案的註冊途徑，其中包括向 NMPA 藥品審評中心申請孤兒藥資格。風險管理依法規、臨床、商業、技術、公眾接受度、競爭與財務分別拆開，並附一條短／中／長期（1-5、5-10、11 年以上）的里程碑時程。倫理承諾包括分級定價並同時倡議納入國家醫保、不誇大技術成熟度、提供符合各年齡層的劑型，以及病人資料保密。","partners":["Dr. Mingjun Sun, Sichuan University","Professor Liujie Huo","Professor Shengbo Wu","Professor Ran An","Professor Xiaofeng Yang","Dr. Guangquan Chen (clinician)","Mr. Guodong Huo, Illness Challenge Foundation (rare disease advocacy)","Mr. Junhao Li, Mr. K and Mr. Mao Ye (commercial / regulatory advisers)","HSBC (financial literacy and investment workshop)","2nd iGBA Exchange Event","South China Regional iGEM Exchange","HKUST (GZ) iGEM team","Guangzhou Social Welfare Institute","Cataverse Lab"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6178/wiki/model/4.avif","caption":"NetLogo agent-based output: simulation trajectories (A) and cluster-size distributions (B) under different SpyCatcher binding capacities, showing the transition from fragmented association at low display to near-global condensation at 50+ sites.","caption_zh":"NetLogo 代理人模型輸出：不同 SpyCatcher 結合容量下的模擬軌跡（A）與群集大小分布（B），顯示從低展示量時的零散結合，到 50 個位點以上時近乎全域凝聚的轉變。","credit":"Team HFI, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6178/wiki/model/1.avif","caption":"The team's NetLogo 3D model interface used to screen candidate RBS parts for SpyCatcher surface display before any cloning was done.","caption_zh":"團隊用來在任何選殖工作開始之前篩選 SpyCatcher 表面展示候選 RBS 元件的 NetLogo 3D 模型介面。","credit":"Team HFI, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6178/wiki/model/10.avif","caption":"HPLC quantification of residual lysine in culture supernatant across three strain ratios, with and without the SpyTag/SpyCatcher binding module - the wet-lab test of the model's prediction (the 2:1 ratio performed best, as simulated; the crosslinking benefit itself was not significant).","caption_zh":"以 HPLC 定量三種菌株比例下培養上清液中的殘餘離胺酸，並比較有無 SpyTag/SpyCatcher 結合模組——這是對模型預測的濕實驗檢驗（2:1 比例表現最佳，與模擬一致；但交聯本身帶來的益處並不顯著）。","credit":"Team HFI, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6178/wiki/education/figure-9.avif","caption":"The HFI Academic Summit, where a hands-on fruit DNA extraction activity was added in response to feedback that the previous session had been too academically dense; pre/post surveys measured the learning gain.","caption_zh":"HFI 學術高峰會；因前一場活動被反映過於學術密集，這次加入了動手做水果 DNA 萃取的活動，並以前後問卷量測學習增益。","credit":"Team HFI, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy HFI's habit of making the dry lab a gatekeeper for the wet lab: a free NetLogo agent-based model screened seven candidate RBS parts and picked B0035 before a single plasmid was built, and an ODE model predicted the intermediates the team physically could not measure - both then republished as live browser sliders so a reader can rerun them. The second transferable move is their CLEAR/LYSERA discipline of refusing to log any outreach or stakeholder meeting unless it produced a measured outcome (paired pre/post surveys, engagement metrics including the embarrassing zero-comment result) and a named change in the next iteration.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"值得借鏡的是 HFI 讓乾實驗擔任濕實驗守門人的習慣：一個免費的 NetLogo 代理人模型篩過七個候選 RBS 元件、在一個質體都還沒做出來之前就選定了 B0035，而一個 ODE 模型則預測了團隊實際上量不到的中間產物——兩者之後都以可在瀏覽器即時操作的滑桿重新發布，讓讀者能自己重跑。第二項可移植的做法是他們 CLEAR／LYSERA 的紀律：任何科普活動或利害關係人會面，若沒有產出可量測的結果（前後配對問卷、互動數據，包括那個令人難為情的零留言結果）以及下一輪具名的改動，就不予登錄。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/inclusivity","https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/awards","https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/static/model/metabolism.html","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/hfi","https://api.igem.org/v1/teams/6178"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳元件集 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳教育 — 得主（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 得主（傳染病 / 治療 / 診斷 / 腫瘤）"],"rank":143},"6185":{"team":"Lambert-GA","id":"6185","section":"High School","country":"United States","village":"Conservation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/","projectTitle":"SWARM - de novo minibinders against Deformed Wing Virus paired with multiplexed RNAi against Varroa destructor","projectTitle_zh":"SWARM——針對殘翅病毒的 de novo minibinder，搭配針對蜂蟹蟎 Varroa destructor 的多工 RNAi","tagline":"Protecting honeybees by hitting both the virus and the mite that carries it, with the first reported minibinder confirmed to bind DWV's VP3.","tagline_zh":"同時打擊病毒與攜帶病毒的蟎來保護蜜蜂，並做出已確認可結合 DWV VP3 的首例 minibinder。","summary":"Lambert iGEM (Suwanee, Georgia) built SWARM to attack the two linked causes of honeybee colony collapse: Deformed Wing Virus and the Varroa destructor mite that vectors it. US beekeepers reported losing 55.6% of managed colonies between April 2024 and April 2025, and Georgia's large operations lost roughly 88,000 colonies in nine months. SWARM pairs a computationally designed 79-amino-acid minibinder against the exposed P-domain of DWV's VP3 capsid protein - experimentally confirmed by biolayer interferometry at KD = 603.6 nM (95% CI 497.1-733.3 nM), to the team's knowledge the first reported minibinder with confirmed binding to VP3 - with a multiplexed dsRNA construct silencing three Varroa salivary-gland genes (Vd-CHIsal, Vd-CHIBIN, VdAV422) at once to blunt resistance. Both components are delivered through feeding practices beekeepers already use. They took the High School Grand Prize plus Best Model, Best Wiki, Best Sustainable Development Impact and Best Village Project, and the modelling is the headline: four linked models spanning protein design benchmarking on 5,721 experimentally labelled designs, oral pharmacokinetics with Sobol sensitivity analysis, a 13-ODE RNAi network, and an individual-based six-year colony epidemiology simulation across two climates.","summary_zh":"Lambert iGEM（喬治亞州 Suwanee）做出 SWARM，攻擊造成蜜蜂蜂群崩解的兩個相連原因：殘翅病毒（DWV）與傳播它的蜂蟹蟎 Varroa destructor。美國養蜂人報告在 2024 年 4 月至 2025 年 4 月間損失了 55.6% 的管理蜂群，喬治亞州的大型蜂場在九個月內損失約 88,000 個蜂群。SWARM 把一個以計算設計、長 79 個胺基酸的 minibinder（針對 DWV 的 VP3 外殼蛋白中暴露的 P-domain，並以生物層干涉技術實驗確認 KD = 603.6 nM，95% CI 497.1-733.3 nM，就該隊所知是首例確認可結合 VP3 的 minibinder）與一個多工 dsRNA 構築體配對，後者同時靜默三個 Varroa 唾液腺基因（Vd-CHIsal、Vd-CHIBIN、VdAV422）以降低抗性風險。兩個組件都透過養蜂人原本就在用的餵食方式投遞。該隊拿下高中組總冠軍，外加最佳模型、最佳 Wiki、最佳永續發展影響與最佳 Village 專案，而建模是最醒目的部分：四個互相銜接的模型，涵蓋在 5,721 個有實驗標註的設計上做蛋白質設計基準測試、含 Sobol 敏感度分析的口服藥物動力學、一個 13 條 ODE 的 RNAi 網路，以及一個跨兩種氣候、以個體為基礎的六年蜂群流行病學模擬。","awards":["Grand Prize Winner (High School)","Top 10 (High School)","Best Model — Winner (High School)","Best Hardware — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Winner (High School)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Winner (High School)","Best Village Project — Winner (Climate Crisis / Conservation / Bioremediation)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Four models, each doing distinct work. (1) Minibinder design. No de novo minibinder or validated minibinder epitope existed for DWV, so they compared isolated P-domain structures against the assembled capsid to assess which surfaces are actually accessible, and investigated five candidate epitopes (an initial C-terminal region at I405/F408, EP-1 at I302/Y359/R395, EP-2 at V322/Q325/Y346, the QP/A-ridge at Q325/P326, and a putative catalytic triad at H277/S278/D294). They benchmarked computational confidence metrics against 5,721 labelled designs across 41 protein targets (849 confirmed binders, 4,872 non-binders) using ROC-AUC: minimum ipSAE scored 0.806 and ipSAE 0.801 pooled, Boltz-2 ipTM only 0.628, and a combined 38-metric ensemble just 0.541 - barely above chance - so adding metrics did not help. They also found minimum ipSAE degrades when comparing designs within a single target, which is exactly their use case, so they built a filtering framework combining predicted interface quality, amino-acid composition, predicted aggregation propensity, independent monomer prediction and cross-tool agreement; the motivating evidence was a candidate whose repeated minimum ipSAE predictions ranged from 0.000 to 0.676. Designs were generated with three independent tools - Mosaic, BindCraft and BoltzProt - with Boltz and Protenix used for additional structural evaluation; across 1,176 pairwise comparisons the median Jaccard similarity between BindCraft and Mosaic target-contact residue sets was 0.000 and their predicted interface centres were a median 42.9 angstroms apart, proving the tools explore genuinely different surfaces. Round 1 submitted 15 designs and produced zero confirmed binders (including 5G51_V4_seed01 at ipSAE 0.927 and ipTM 0.958, which failed); Round 2 generated 103 candidate entries, submitted 20, and produced one confirmed binder, l79_s469532_mpnn9, a BindCraft design associated with the QP/A-ridge that notably did not have the highest minimum ipSAE in the batch. Total compute spend was under USD 400 across 35 tested candidates, which they contrast against the USD 10,000 GPU budget per single-target campaign in Anthropic's 2026 autonomous binder-design technical report. (2) Minibinder dosing. A two-compartment oral pharmacokinetic model following functional protein from feeder to crop to gut to hemolymph: dG/dt = R_crop(t) - (ka + kt + kg)G and dH/dt = kaG - khH, with crop emptying fitted from Fournier et al. as V_crop = max(0, 17.966 - 0.159 t_min) uL reaching zero at about 113 minutes, digestive half-lives sampled log-normally around 31 and 54 minute values measured for native Manse-AS peptide in Myzus persicae and Acyrthosiphon pisum aphid gut extracts, and circulating stability from a juvenile hormone esterase analogue. 1,000 parameter sets were simulated for a 40,000-bee colony over 56 days; at a selected 100 nM average circulating concentration the median requirement was 29.60 g prepared protein (0.529 g/day prepared, 0.447 g/day active swallowed). Sobol total-effect sensitivity indices on log10(course mass), from 1,024 base samples and 7,168 model evaluations, ranked circulating functional loss 0.606, digestive loss 0.263, gut absorption 0.116, hemolymph volume 0.018 and intestinal transit 0.005 - and they reported that the gram-scale analysis failed its numerical checks so only the log-scale ranking is given. (3) RNAi model. A 13-species, 23-reaction ODE network in MATLAB SimBiology covering Dicer-2 processing of multiplexed dsRNA into three siRNAs, Ago2 loading into RISC, RISC-mediated Michaelis-Menten cleavage of a targeted Renilla transcript, untargeted Firefly as the control, plus transcription, translation, plasmid dilution, protein turnover and free-RNA degradation, with every rate parameter tabulated against its source and explicitly labelled as a measurement, a team estimate or an assumption. Predicted signal decrease was 37.50% with one siRNA, 67.51% with two, 83.41% with three directly delivered siRNAs, and 83.04% with the multiplexed dsRNA construct - the key result, since it predicts that bundling three guides into one molecule preserves knockdown. Local normalised sensitivity put RISC-mediated cleavage (Vm_1) at -1.72, the dominant assumption, while free Ago2 was near zero. (4) Epidemiological model. An individual-based six-year daily simulation of a two-deep-box Langstroth hive with about 42,000 brood cells, tracking adult bees individually by age, task, infection status and relative syrup intake, and mites on adults individually with sealed-cell brood and mites grouped by developmental day. It composes published frameworks - Sumpter and Martin for mite-virus-colony dynamics, Khoury/Myerscough/Barron for the saturating colony-size term N/(w+N) and forager recruitment R = alpha - sigma(F/N), Betti/Wahl/Zamir for infection-driven mortality, BEEPOP and BEEHAVE for seasonal development and weather-dependent foraging, and Martin and Calis for mite development and transfer. Daily weather was generated from NOAA 1991-2020 climate normals and 2011-2020 daily records preserving warm/cold runs, with foraging requiring a dry day above 12.8 C; 20 matched weather sequences per scenario across Atlanta and Ithaca gave 800 six-year simulations. Minibinder protection enters per bee as p_i(t) = 1 - exp(-K x_i u(t)) calibrated to 52.6% mean reduction in infection probability at full uptake with a lognormal intake distribution (mean-to-median ratio 1.68, sigma 1.0214); RNAi enters as an exposure state dF_i/dt = k_u x_i u(t)(1 - F_i) - k_loss F_i feeding f_treated(t_c) = f_0[1 - r_max F(t_c)] at brood capping, with r_max = 93.6% from an external study reporting 0.13 offspring per treated mother mite versus 2.04 in control.","frameworks_zh":"四個模型，各自承擔不同的任務。(1) minibinder 設計。DWV 既沒有 de novo minibinder，也沒有經驗證的 minibinder 抗原決定位，於是他們把單獨的 P-domain 結構與組裝完成的外殼相比，評估哪些表面實際上可及，並研究五個候選抗原決定位（最初是 I405/F408 的 C 端區域、EP-1 於 I302/Y359/R395、EP-2 於 V322/Q325/Y346、QP/A 脊於 Q325/P326，以及推測的催化三元體 H277/S278/D294）。他們以 ROC-AUC 把計算信心指標對照 41 個蛋白質標靶、共 5,721 個有標註的設計（849 個確認的結合者、4,872 個非結合者）做基準測試：最小 ipSAE 得 0.806、合併的 ipSAE 得 0.801，Boltz-2 的 ipTM 只有 0.628，而把 38 項指標合起來的集成模型只有 0.541——幾乎只比亂猜好一點，所以加更多指標並沒有幫助。他們還發現，若是在單一標靶內部比較不同設計，最小 ipSAE 的表現會退化，而那恰恰是他們的使用情境，於是他們建了一個篩選框架，結合預測的介面品質、胺基酸組成、預測的聚集傾向、獨立的單體預測與跨工具一致性；促成這個決定的證據是某個候選的最小 ipSAE 重複預測值從 0.000 到 0.676 之間擺盪。設計以三個獨立工具生成——Mosaic、BindCraft 與 BoltzProt——另以 Boltz 與 Protenix 做額外的結構評估；在 1,176 組兩兩比較中，BindCraft 與 Mosaic 的標靶接觸殘基集合的 Jaccard 相似度中位數為 0.000，兩者預測的介面中心相距中位數 42.9 Å，證明這些工具探索的其實是不同的表面。第 1 輪送出 15 個設計，確認的結合者為零（包括 ipSAE 0.927、ipTM 0.958 的 5G51_V4_seed01，它失敗了）；第 2 輪產生 103 個候選條目、送出 20 個，得到一個確認的結合者 l79_s469532_mpnn9，這是一個與 QP/A 脊相關的 BindCraft 設計，而且值得注意的是它的最小 ipSAE 並非該批中最高。35 個測試候選的運算總花費不到 400 美元，他們把這個數字對照 Anthropic 2026 年自主結合蛋白設計技術報告中每一個單一標靶戰役 10,000 美元的 GPU 預算。(2) minibinder 劑量。一個兩室口服藥物動力學模型，追蹤有功能的蛋白質從餵食器到蜜胃、到腸道、再到血淋巴：dG/dt = R_crop(t) - (ka + kt + kg)G 與 dH/dt = kaG - khH，蜜胃排空由 Fournier 等人的資料擬合為 V_crop = max(0, 17.966 - 0.159 t_min) uL，約在 113 分鐘歸零；消化半衰期以對數常態分布取樣，中心落在 Myzus persicae 與 Acyrthosiphon pisum 蚜蟲腸道萃取物中對原生 Manse-AS 肽所量到的 31 與 54 分鐘；循環中的穩定性則取自一個幼生荷爾蒙酯酶的類比物。他們為一個 40,000 隻蜜蜂的蜂群模擬 1,000 組參數、為期 56 天；在選定的平均循環濃度 100 nM 下，需求量中位數為 29.60 g 配製蛋白（每日配製 0.529 g，每日實際吞下的活性成分 0.447 g）。以 1,024 個基礎樣本、7,168 次模型評估計算 log10（療程質量）的 Sobol 總效應敏感度指數，排序為循環中功能損失 0.606、消化損失 0.263、腸道吸收 0.116、血淋巴體積 0.018、腸道通過 0.005——而且他們報告以公克為單位的分析沒有通過數值檢查，所以只提供對數尺度的排序。(3) RNAi 模型。在 MATLAB SimBiology 中建立的 13 個物種、23 個反應的 ODE 網路，涵蓋 Dicer-2 把多工 dsRNA 切成三種 siRNA、Ago2 載入 RISC、RISC 介導並符合 Michaelis-Menten 動力學地切割被標靶的 Renilla 轉錄本、未被標靶的 Firefly 作為對照，再加上轉錄、轉譯、質體稀釋、蛋白質更新與游離 RNA 降解，每個速率參數都列表並附來源，並明確標示它是量測值、團隊估計值或假設值。預測的訊號下降為：一種 siRNA 37.50%、兩種 67.51%、三種直接投遞的 siRNA 83.41%，而多工 dsRNA 構築體為 83.04%——這是關鍵結果，因為它預測把三條導引序列綁進同一個分子仍能維持抑制效果。局部正規化敏感度把 RISC 介導的切割（Vm_1）排在 -1.72，是最主導的假設，而游離 Ago2 則接近零。(4) 流行病學模型。一個以個體為基礎、以日為單位、為期六年的模擬，對象是一個兩層深箱的 Langstroth 蜂箱、約 42,000 個子脾巢房，逐一追蹤成蜂的年齡、任務、感染狀態與相對糖水攝取量，成蜂身上的蟎也逐一追蹤，封蓋巢房與其中的蟎則依發育天數分組。它組合了多個已發表的框架——Sumpter 與 Martin 的蟎—病毒—蜂群動態、Khoury/Myerscough/Barron 的飽和型蜂群規模項 N/(w+N) 與採集蜂招募 R = alpha - sigma(F/N)、Betti/Wahl/Zamir 的感染致死率、BEEPOP 與 BEEHAVE 的季節性發育與天氣相依採集行為，以及 Martin 與 Calis 的蟎發育與轉移。每日天氣由 NOAA 1991-2020 氣候正常值與 2011-2020 每日紀錄生成，並保留暖期與冷期的連續性，採集行為則要求當日無雨且高於 12.8 °C；亞特蘭大與 Ithaca 兩地每個情境各有 20 組配對天氣序列，共 800 次六年模擬。minibinder 的保護以每隻蜂的 p_i(t) = 1 - exp(-K x_i u(t)) 進入模型，校準為完全攝取時感染機率平均下降 52.6%，攝取量採對數常態分布（平均值對中位數比 1.68，sigma 1.0214）；RNAi 則以暴露狀態 dF_i/dt = k_u x_i u(t)(1 - F_i) - k_loss F_i 進入，在封蓋時代入 f_treated(t_c) = f_0[1 - r_max F(t_c)]，其中 r_max = 93.6% 取自一份外部研究，該研究報告處理過的母蟎平均產下 0.13 個後代，對照組為 2.04。","dataviz":"The Best Wiki award is earned by making the models inspectable rather than illustrated. The VP3 epitope map is an interactive 3D viewer with five selectable, labelled regions and a toggle to overlay the confirmed minibinder's predicted pose, backed by a table giving each region's residues, structural rationale and experimental outcome. All 35 submitted minibinder designs are published in a sortable, filterable, searchable table - by design round, by experimental result - with each row expandable to show ipTM, ipSAE (labelled as to whether it is directional minimum ipSAE), design region, BLI sensor loading, the assay note and the source record, plus a full CSV download; failures and 'no usable result' entries are given equal prominence to the one success. A separate full-screen minibinder viewer shows the VP3 and GFP designs. The epidemiological model has a clickable four-stage 'one day in the model' diagram, a weekly-resolution Colony Viewer, and location-switchable figure sets for Atlanta and Ithaca covering colony survival, annual pollination, per-crop pollination and crop bloom windows, with results expressed relative to a paired Varroa-free colony under matched weather. Sensitivity results are shown as Matplotlib SVGs with bootstrap error bars. PRINCE ships a local web application with an interactive Structural context panel showing geometry findings, assessment status and crystal-contact summaries with per-residue measurements, JSON and CSV export, and two screencast demo videos (web app and CLI). The Modeling Instructional Series is seven videos teaching other teams a four-stage workflow for turning wet-lab protocols into MATLAB SimBiology models.","dataviz_zh":"最佳 Wiki 這個獎是靠把模型做成可檢視而非只是插圖贏來的。VP3 抗原決定位圖是一個互動式 3D 檢視器，有五個可選取、已標註的區域，並可切換疊上已確認 minibinder 的預測結合姿態，背後還有一張表格列出每個區域的殘基、結構上的理由與實驗結果。所有 35 個送出的 minibinder 設計都公開在一張可排序、可篩選、可搜尋的表格中——可依設計輪次、依實驗結果排序——每一列都可展開顯示 ipTM、ipSAE（並標示它是否為方向性的最小 ipSAE）、設計區域、BLI 感測器載入量、試驗備註與來源紀錄，另附完整 CSV 下載；失敗與「無可用結果」的條目與唯一的成功案例被同等醒目地呈現。另有一個全螢幕的 minibinder 檢視器展示 VP3 與 GFP 的設計。流行病學模型配有一張可點選的四階段「模型中的一天」圖、一個週解析度的 Colony Viewer，以及可切換地點（亞特蘭大與 Ithaca）的圖組，涵蓋蜂群存活、年度授粉量、各作物授粉量與作物開花期，所有結果都相對於同一天氣條件下配對的無 Varroa 蜂群表示。敏感度分析結果以 Matplotlib SVG 呈現，附拔靴法誤差棒。PRINCE 附一個在本機執行的網頁應用程式，其互動式 Structural context 面板顯示幾何分析結果、評估狀態與晶體接觸摘要，並附逐一殘基的量測值、JSON 與 CSV 匯出，以及兩支錄影示範（網頁版與 CLI）。Modeling Instructional Series 是七支影片，教其他隊伍一套四階段流程，把濕實驗流程轉成 MATLAB SimBiology 模型。","datascience":"The defining habit is turning other people's experimental data into a decision rule, then keeping the honest ledger. PRINCE's antibody epitope ranker was trained on 6,937 experimentally observed antibody-antigen interfaces across 1,549 antigen clusters, split by antigen cluster with sequence-homology checks between train, validation and test; it scored a cluster-averaged top-three majority-hit rate of 50.8% across 251 test clusters against 23.3% random, and on the harder retrospective subset of 93 clusters with no training homolog at 30% sequence identity or above it scored 45.8% against 23.8% random. An earlier residue-level benchmark on 110 common interfaces gave PRINCE a macro AUROC of 0.6722 against BepiPred-3.0 at 0.6524 and PeSTo at 0.6521, and the lightweight web-app scorer was benchmarked separately at 0.648 against 0.645 for exposure alone - a near-null result they published. Separately they retrospectively analysed 1,307 experimentally tested minibinder designs across 15 targets and found that across the 13 targets evaluable for site-level comparison the best-performing site averaged a 64% success rate against a 32% target-wide average, meaning site choice roughly doubles the hit rate; ranking by surface exposure alone put the best site in the top three for 10 of 13 targets (77%) against about 49% random, reported p = 0.032. Reporter work was properly calibrated with linear fits RLU_R = 206,101[Rluc] + 70,894 and RLU_F = 624[Fluc] + 57.8. Model validation against external data is laid out as a side-by-side table of published observation versus model output with an interpretation column that repeatedly says the comparison does not constitute validation: simulated managed mite loads of 2.42 (Atlanta) and 1.26 (Ithaca) per 100 bees against the USDA APHIS National Honey Bee Survey mean of 4.14 in positive samples, 27.8% and 8.8% of colony-months above three mites per 100 bees against 41.7% of survey samples, median untreated survival of 2.1 and 2.0 years against a Finnish study's 4-5 years from low initial infestation, and a simulated mean autumn population of 285 mites (range 165-514) against an observed 340. Headline outcome: all untreated colonies were lost by the end of year three, while SWARM alone retained 96.7% of reference crop pollination in Atlanta and 94.7% in Ithaca at year six against 45.1% and 79.8% for amitraz under an assumed five-year decline in effectiveness, with SWARM ahead in all 20 paired simulations at each location. Under the chosen assumptions RNAi supplied most of the benefit and the minibinder a smaller increment - a conclusion that undercuts their own flagship protein work, and they say so.","datascience_zh":"最具代表性的習慣，是把別人的實驗資料轉成一條決策規則，然後老實記帳。PRINCE 的抗體抗原決定位排序器訓練於 1,549 個抗原叢集中、共 6,937 個實驗觀察到的抗體—抗原介面，並依抗原叢集切分，且在訓練、驗證與測試集之間做序列同源性檢查；它在 251 個測試叢集上取得叢集平均的前三名多數命中率 50.8%，相對於隨機的 23.3%，而在較困難的回溯子集（93 個叢集，訓練集中沒有序列相同度 30% 以上的同源物）上取得 45.8%，相對於隨機的 23.8%。較早一次在 110 個常見介面上的殘基層級基準測試，PRINCE 的宏觀 AUROC 為 0.6722，BepiPred-3.0 為 0.6524、PeSTo 為 0.6521；而輕量版網頁應用程式的評分器另外測得 0.648，相對於僅用暴露程度的 0.645——這是一個近乎無差異的結果，而他們照樣公開。另外，他們回溯分析了 15 個標靶上 1,307 個經實驗測試的 minibinder 設計，發現在可做位點層級比較的 13 個標靶中，表現最好的位點平均成功率為 64%，相對於全標靶平均的 32%，也就是說選位點大約讓命中率翻倍；單憑表面暴露程度排序，就能在 13 個標靶中有 10 個（77%）把最佳位點排進前三名，相對於隨機約 49%，報告的 p = 0.032。報告基因的工作也做了適當校準，線性擬合為 RLU_R = 206,101[Rluc] + 70,894 與 RLU_F = 624[Fluc] + 57.8。對外部資料的模型驗證以並排表格呈現，一欄是已發表的觀察值、一欄是模型輸出，另加一欄判讀，而該欄一再指出這些比較並不構成驗證：模擬的管理蜂群蟎負荷為每 100 隻蜂 2.42（亞特蘭大）與 1.26（Ithaca），對照 USDA APHIS National Honey Bee Survey 陽性樣本平均值 4.14；蟎數高於每 100 隻蜂三隻的蜂群月份比例為 27.8% 與 8.8%，對照調查樣本的 41.7%；未處理蜂群的存活中位數為 2.1 與 2.0 年，對照一份芬蘭研究從低初始感染起算的 4-5 年；而模擬的秋季平均蟎數為 285 隻（範圍 165-514），對照觀察值 340。主要結果：所有未處理的蜂群在第三年結束前全部覆滅，而只用 SWARM 的蜂群在第六年仍保有亞特蘭大 96.7%、Ithaca 94.7% 的參考作物授粉量，相對於 amitraz 在假設效力五年遞減下的 45.1% 與 79.8%，且在每個地點的全部 20 組配對模擬中 SWARM 都領先。在所選定的假設下，大部分效益來自 RNAi，minibinder 只提供較小的增量——這個結論削弱了他們自己的招牌蛋白質工作，而他們照實寫了出來。","software":"PRINCE (released open source) is the team's software tool: it ranks candidate binding sites on a user-supplied protein structure before any compute is spent on design, combining a trained site ranker over geometric, atomic and protein-language-model features with a lightweight structural surface scorer, a crystal-contact and geometry checker that compares a chain alone against its crystal surroundings to flag where neighbouring copies cover a proposed site and where sections are missing or atomic positions uncertain, and a literature-evidence layer. It ships as a locally run web application for interactive use and a CLI for automated workflows, with JSON/CSV export, documentation, a command-line reference and a reproduction guide. Model: https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/lambert-ga/prince-model ; web app: https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/lambert-ga/prince-webapp ; team repo: https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/lambert-ga. Hardware (Best Hardware nominee): Vapor-X, an automated vacuum dryer built on the Clausius-Clapeyron relation, using a 12 V vacuum pump to lower pressure in a sealed Mason jar while a flexible resistive heating pad gently warms the sample, controlled by a Raspberry Pi Pico W on a custom PCB with an OLED display and rotary encoder for target temperature, vacuum strength and drying time. Prototype components cost USD 80.07 (USD 95.52 including PCB assembly) against USD 5,000-25,000 for a benchtop lyophiliser. It was validated externally: testing at the University of Alabama at Birmingham recovered 38 of 43 measured compounds (88.4%) within 5% of undried controls, and testing at Georgia Institute of Technology showed GFP fluorescence comparable to controls after drying GFP DNA and cell lysates; internal Bradford-assay work and a classroom deployment assessed recovery and usability. Also released: the seven-video Modeling Instructional Series for teams with no modelling experience, and the full model result records and 1,000 paired parameter records for the dosing model as downloadable JSON and CSV.","software_zh":"PRINCE（已開源釋出）是該隊的軟體工具：它在任何運算花在設計之前，先對使用者提供的蛋白質結構排序候選結合位點，結合一個以幾何、原子與蛋白質語言模型特徵訓練的位點排序器、一個輕量的結構表面評分器、一個晶體接觸與幾何檢查器（把單一鏈與其晶體環境相比，標示鄰近複本在哪裡覆蓋了擬選位點、以及哪裡有區段缺失或原子位置不確定），再加上一層文獻證據。它同時提供在本機執行的網頁應用程式供互動使用，以及供自動化流程使用的 CLI，附 JSON/CSV 匯出、說明文件、指令列參考與重現指南。模型：https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/lambert-ga/prince-model ；網頁應用程式：https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/lambert-ga/prince-webapp ；團隊程式庫：https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/lambert-ga。硬體（最佳硬體入圍）：Vapor-X，一台依 Clausius-Clapeyron 關係式打造的自動真空乾燥機，用 12 V 真空泵降低密封梅森罐內的壓力，同時以可彎折的電阻式加熱墊輕微加溫樣品，並由自製 PCB 上的 Raspberry Pi Pico W 控制，配備 OLED 顯示器與旋轉編碼器，可設定目標溫度、真空強度與乾燥時間。原型零件成本 80.07 美元（含 PCB 組裝為 95.52 美元），對照桌上型冷凍乾燥機的 5,000 至 25,000 美元。它也經過外部驗證：在阿拉巴馬大學伯明罕分校的測試中，43 個量測化合物有 38 個（88.4%）回收率落在未乾燥對照組的 5% 以內；在喬治亞理工學院的測試中，乾燥 GFP DNA 與細胞裂解液後的 GFP 螢光與對照組相當；另有內部 Bradford 蛋白質定量工作與一次課堂實地使用，評估回收率與可用性。另外釋出的還有：為毫無建模經驗的隊伍製作的七支影片 Modeling Instructional Series，以及劑量模型的完整模型結果紀錄與 1,000 組配對參數紀錄，皆可下載為 JSON 與 CSV。","stack":["BindCraft","Mosaic","BoltzProt","Boltz-2","Protenix","ipSAE / minimum ipSAE / ipTM / pLDDT confidence metrics","ROC-AUC benchmarking","Jaccard similarity of interface contact sets","self-consistency RMSD","protein language model features","scikit-learn","MATLAB SimBiology","ODE systems (13 species, 23 reactions)","individual-based / agent-based colony simulation","Sobol variance-based sensitivity analysis","local normalised sensitivity coefficients","Matplotlib","biolayer interferometry (BLI, via Adaptyv Bio)","dual-luciferase reporter assay","Sf9 insect cell culture","NOAA climate normals and daily records","Raspberry Pi Pico W","custom PCB","3D printing","Nebius GPU compute","Opentrons","GitLab"],"techniques":["benchmarking design-confidence metrics against thousands of labelled experimental outcomes instead of trusting them","detecting metric instability by repeating predictions on the same candidate","measuring tool diversity quantitatively (Jaccard 0.000, 42.9 angstrom interface separation) to justify using three design tools","site-level rather than design-level success analysis (best site 64% vs target-wide 32%)","cluster-split benchmarking with sequence-homology checks and a no-homolog retrospective subset","variance-based global sensitivity analysis with bootstrap intervals and disclosed failed numerical checks","paired-weather-sequence experimental design so treatments are compared under matched conditions","composing several published models into one individual-based simulation with per-framework attribution","separating measured inputs from assumed inputs in every parameter table","publishing all 35 tested designs including failures and unusable assays, with a CSV download","external third-party hardware validation at two universities"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Over 30 initiatives reaching more than 530 participants worldwide, organised around three stated principles (quality information, diversity and outreach, hands-on lessons) and mapped individually to UN SDGs. For elementary audiences they wrote and illustrated an original children's book, 'The Mite-ty Adventure of Bentley the Bee', for ages 5-9, iterated against feedback from elementary teachers, designed to be legible to readers with colour vision deficiencies, translated into 13 languages, read aloud to first-graders at Sharon Elementary, and now held in the Atlanta Botanical Garden's library as part of its pollinator education. They also ran a Sharon Elementary Critter Club workshop in which students learned pollination while physically preparing the plots of their own pollinator garden. For middle school they ran Riverwatch workshops and a week-long Biotech Bootcamp for 62 campers structured one day per iGEM committee, with candy DNA models, micropipetting, strawberry DNA extraction, a C. elegans RNAi feeding experiment observed under the microscope across the week, and a 'germiest place in school' swabbing experiment; pre/post survey comparisons were collected. For older audiences there were pollinator presentations, a high school debate, a Connectivity Night, webinars, a keynote at the NWGA RESA STEM for Tomorrow Forum, a Concrete Jungle workshop, a Gardener's Handbook with practical pollinator-friendly planting guidance, a Bee PSA, mentorship, and a GBA Fall Conference and mini jamboree. Two inclusivity programmes carry the Best Sustainable Development Impact award. Flowers for the Future partners with a non-profit supporting Afghan girls barred from school past sixth grade to obtain a GED; Lambert teaches a multi-week 'Intro to Synthetic Biology' course there (central dogma, units and dimensional analysis, DNA and mutations, gene expression, genetic engineering techniques including transformation, transfection, viral vectors and CRISPR, PCR and gel electrophoresis, experimental design, scientific writing, bioethics), now in its third semester and reaching about 120 students, with a linked FFF-BioBuilderClub. Exceptional Science! brings kinesthetic science lessons to the neurodivergent class at their own school - acid-base reactions, genetics, density, candy DNA models, a rainbow pinwheel density experiment - plus a honeybee/DWV movement game where students first forage freely as healthy bees and then may only hop, citing research that physical activity improves inhibition and rule-switching response times in children with ADHD; they also published a Neurodivergent Handbook.","publicEngagement_zh":"超過 30 項活動，觸及全球 530 位以上參與者，圍繞三項明示原則組織（優質資訊、多元與外展、動手操作的課程），並逐項對應到聯合國 SDG。針對小學受眾，他們自寫自畫了一本童書《The Mite-ty Adventure of Bentley the Bee》，適合 5 至 9 歲，依小學老師的回饋反覆修改，設計上考量色彩視覺缺陷讀者也能閱讀，翻譯成 13 種語言，在 Sharon Elementary 朗讀給一年級學生，現在也收藏於亞特蘭大植物園圖書館，成為其授粉者教育的一部分。他們還辦了 Sharon Elementary Critter Club 工作坊，學生一邊學授粉，一邊實際整理自己授粉花園的苗床。針對國中，他們辦了 Riverwatch 工作坊與為期一週、62 位營隊學員參加的 Biotech Bootcamp，架構上每天對應一個 iGEM 委員會，內容包括糖果 DNA 模型、微量吸管操作、草莓 DNA 萃取、一整週在顯微鏡下觀察的 C. elegans RNAi 餵食實驗，以及一項「學校裡最多細菌的地方」採樣實驗；並收集了前後測問卷比較。針對年齡更長的受眾，則有授粉者主題演講、一場高中辯論、一場 Connectivity Night、數場線上研討會、NWGA RESA STEM for Tomorrow Forum 的主題演講、一場 Concrete Jungle 工作坊、一本附實用授粉友善種植指引的《Gardener's Handbook》、一支蜜蜂公益宣導片、師徒輔導，以及 GBA 秋季會議與一場迷你 jamboree。兩項包容性計畫撐起了最佳永續發展影響獎。Flowers for the Future 與一個支援被禁止升學到六年級以上的阿富汗女孩考取 GED 的非營利組織合作；Lambert 在那裡開設為期數週的「合成生物學入門」課程（中心法則、單位與因次分析、DNA 與突變、基因表現、基因工程技術包含轉形、轉染、病毒載體與 CRISPR、PCR 與凝膠電泳、實驗設計、科學寫作、生物倫理），目前已進入第三學期，觸及約 120 位學生，並附設一個 FFF-BioBuilderClub。Exceptional Science! 則把身體動覺式的科學課帶進自己學校的神經多樣性班級——酸鹼反應、遺傳學、密度、糖果 DNA 模型、彩虹風車密度實驗——另有一個蜜蜂／DWV 的肢體遊戲，學生先以健康蜜蜂的身分自由採集，之後只能用跳的方式移動，依據的是運動能改善 ADHD 兒童抑制控制與規則切換反應時間的研究；他們也出版了一本《Neurodivergent Handbook》。","ihp":"IHP ran across four sequenced phases (food insecurity/agriculture/city planners, beekeepers, experts and professors, then policymakers and governmental organisations), with every interaction processed through a four-step cycle they call H.I.V.E. - Hear, Inquire, Validate, Evolve - and a hard rule that a cycle is incomplete unless it ends in a concrete change or a documented reason why no change was warranted. Each stakeholder is also tagged with the SDGs they bear on, which is how the SDG scoring on the Sustainability page is built. The pivots are named, dated and attributed on a published timeline. February 2026: Dr. Aashish Manglik (UCSF) told them computational nanobody discovery still needs libraries of hundreds to thousands of candidates - 'For our computational design projects, we still make libraries of hundreds or thousands of candidates' - so testing 10 to 50 would likely fail even with a correct pipeline, and pointed them at BindCraft and Protenix; the team abandoned nanobodies for minibinders, which changed the entire wet lab. July 2026: Dr. Morgane Golan prompted the move to Sf9 cells as the RNAi model system. August 2026: Tudor Cotet and Corey Howe of Adaptyv Bio told them to stop targeting the P-domain broadly and focus designs on specific binding hotspots, and Cotet reviewed the failed first campaign before round two. September 2026: Dr. Mark Styczynski (Georgia Tech) pushed them off over-specific model parameters onto literature-supported ones, which is why every parameter table now carries a source attribution and an honest label; and Samantha Houck's input added SDG 11 to their framework. Professors Benjamin Lamp and Tatsuhiko Kadowaki, both DWV specialists, narrowed the target to VP3's exposed P-domain and warned how hard epitope selection is without experimental binding data, which made epitope evaluation a first-class modelling step and directly motivated PRINCE - as did Dr. Michael Hecht (Princeton) emphasising the uncertainty of epitope selection. Professor Raymond Owens (Oxford / Rosalind Franklin Institute) reframed binder choice around production cost and failure rate. Entomologist Dr. Jeff Pettis answered the ecological question head-on, saying eliminating Varroa would be 'completely fine' because they are obligate parasites invasive to the US, which underpins the safety case; he also named the political context, that pollinators are undervalued and under-resourced. On the practice side, Peter Helfrich (President, Metro Atlanta Beekeepers Association) identified DWV as the most dangerous threat and stressed that treatments must not harm brood, which made brood safety an explicit project priority; board member Claressa Lucas supplied the line that frames the whole project, 'It's not a matter of if there are Varroa mites. Every colony has them.' Professor Lewis Bartlett (University of Georgia) endorsed sucrose solution as a practical delivery vehicle, and contacts associated with Norroa, the registered RNA-based Varroa treatment, informed the syrup-pouch format. Sharanya Madhavan of Concrete Jungle, after six months of conversations and a joint workshop, connected bee health to rising food insecurity and urban pollinator corridors, which reshaped the outreach programme.","ihp_zh":"IHP 分四個依序進行的階段（糧食不安全／農業／城市規劃者、養蜂人、專家與教授，最後是政策制定者與政府組織），每一次互動都走過他們稱為 H.I.V.E. 的四步循環——Hear、Inquire、Validate、Evolve——並設下一條硬規則：除非最後導致一項具體改變，或留下不需改變的理由紀錄，否則該循環不算完成。每位利害關係人也標註其所關聯的 SDG，永續頁面上的 SDG 評分就是這樣建起來的。所有轉向都在公開的時間軸上具名、標日期並註明來源。2026 年 2 月：Dr. Aashish Manglik（UCSF）告訴他們，計算式奈米抗體探索仍然需要數百到數千個候選的函式庫——「在我們的計算設計專案裡，我們還是會做數百或數千個候選的函式庫」——所以即使流程正確，只測 10 到 50 個很可能會失敗，並把他們引向 BindCraft 與 Protenix；該隊於是放棄奈米抗體改做 minibinder，這改變了整個濕實驗。2026 年 7 月：Dr. Morgane Golan 促成改用 Sf9 細胞作為 RNAi 的模式系統。2026 年 8 月：Adaptyv Bio 的 Tudor Cotet 與 Corey Howe 告訴他們不要廣泛針對整個 P-domain，而要把設計聚焦在特定的結合熱點，Cotet 並在第二輪之前檢視了失敗的第一輪戰役。2026 年 9 月：Dr. Mark Styczynski（喬治亞理工）把他們從過度特定的模型參數推向有文獻支持的參數，這就是為什麼現在每張參數表都附來源出處與誠實標註；而 Samantha Houck 的意見則為他們的架構加上 SDG 11。兩位 DWV 專家 Benjamin Lamp 與 Tatsuhiko Kadowaki 教授把標靶收斂到 VP3 暴露的 P-domain，並提醒在沒有實驗結合資料的情況下選抗原決定位有多困難，這使抗原決定位評估成為第一級的建模步驟，也直接催生了 PRINCE——Dr. Michael Hecht（普林斯頓）強調抗原決定位選擇的不確定性亦然。Raymond Owens 教授（牛津／Rosalind Franklin Institute）則把結合蛋白的選擇重新框定在生產成本與失敗率上。昆蟲學家 Dr. Jeff Pettis 直接回答了生態問題，他說消滅 Varroa 會「完全沒問題」，因為牠們是對美國而言入侵性的專性寄生者，這支撐了安全性論述；他也點明政治脈絡：授粉者被低估、資源不足。實務一端，Peter Helfrich（大亞特蘭大養蜂人協會會長）指出 DWV 是最危險的威脅，並強調處理方式絕不能傷害蜂子，這使蜂子安全成為專案的明確優先項；理事 Claressa Lucas 則提供了為整個專案定調的一句話：「問題不是有沒有蜂蟹蟎。每一個蜂群都有。」Lewis Bartlett 教授（喬治亞大學）認可糖水是可行的投遞載體；而與已登記之 RNA 型 Varroa 處理劑 Norroa 相關的聯絡人，則提供了糖漿袋形式的資訊。Concrete Jungle 的 Sharanya Madhavan 在六個月的對話與一場合辦工作坊之後，把蜂群健康與日益嚴重的糧食不安全、都市授粉者廊道連結起來，這重塑了外展計畫。","realWorld":"A business-to-business licensing strategy rather than a direct-sales fantasy: established agricultural biotechnology manufacturers would produce and distribute SWARM through existing commercial networks, priced at USD 39.99 per hive treatment against an estimated mature manufacturing cost of USD 25.00, targeting commercial beekeepers who supply pollination services to high-value agriculture. The plan models 300,000 annual treatments by 2034 (base case 150,000, long-term goal one million), giving roughly USD 12 million in retail sales and USD 525,000 in licensing royalties under a proposed 5% royalty, and is supported by TAM/SAM/SOM, market competition and SWOT analysis, an AIDA distribution model, beekeeper return-on-investment calculations, revenue and sales forecasts, manufacturing and operating expense breakdowns, break-even analysis and a risk-management section. The four-year plan is sequenced around the real regulatory gate: 2027 R&D, 2028 product optimisation and safety, 2029 field validation and partnerships, 2030 commercialisation preparation, with a manufacturing partner and pesticide registration secured before launch - sensible given Norroa/Vadescana was registered as a biopesticide in 2025 and is the obvious precedent. Vapor-X is handled as a separate commercialisation track, offered either through manufacturer licensing or open-source release to educational and research laboratories, with prototype and commercial manufacturing cost breakdowns and an explicit open-source contribution to future iGEM teams. Implementation is built around equipment beekeepers already own: dsRNA in a sealed flexible syrup pouch with an adhesive cover over proboscis-sized feeding openings placed in the brood box (modelled on the Norroa format, where worker bees redistribute syrup into brood stores and nurse bees incorporate it into brood food), and the minibinder as a dried packet mixed into sucrose solution and served through a standard hive-top feeder. Throughout, the team draws the line clearly: BLI established binding to a VP3 construct, not neutralisation of assembled virus; neither component has been tested in a honeybee colony; the 100 nM circulating concentration is a selected simulation value, not an established protective threshold; and the RNAi potency figure is an external conditional effect, not a measurement of SWARM's own construct. Impact is mapped through a 'Roots-to-Fruits' model linking seven SDGs - 2, 4, 5, 8, 11, 15 and 17.","realWorld_zh":"商業策略是企業對企業的授權，而不是直接銷售的幻想：由既有的農業生技製造商透過現有商業網路生產與配銷 SWARM，定價為每蜂箱療程 39.99 美元，對照成熟量產後估計的 25.00 美元製造成本，目標客戶是為高價值農業提供授粉服務的商業養蜂人。計畫預估 2034 年達到年銷 300,000 份療程（基準情境 150,000，長期目標 100 萬），在擬議 5% 權利金下帶來約 1,200 萬美元零售額與 525,000 美元授權金，並以 TAM/SAM/SOM、市場競爭與 SWOT 分析、AIDA 配銷模型、養蜂人投資報酬計算、營收與銷售預測、製造與營運費用拆解、損益兩平分析與風險管理章節支撐。四年計畫依真正的法規關卡排序：2027 研發、2028 產品最佳化與安全性、2029 田間驗證與合作、2030 商業化準備，並在上市前先取得製造夥伴與農藥登記——考慮到 Norroa/Vadescana 已於 2025 年登記為生物農藥、是最明顯的先例，這樣的安排很合理。Vapor-X 則作為獨立的商業化路線處理，可選擇授權給製造商或對教育與研究實驗室開源釋出，並附原型與量產的成本拆解，以及明確要對未來 iGEM 隊伍開源貢獻的承諾。實作方式圍繞養蜂人已有的器材設計：dsRNA 裝在密封的軟質糖漿袋中，袋上以黏貼封膜覆蓋口器大小的餵食開口，放入育子箱（參考 Norroa 的形式，由工蜂把糖漿重新分配到子脾儲存區，再由育兒蜂將其納入蜂子的食物）；minibinder 則做成乾燥包，混入糖水後以標準的蜂箱上部餵食器供應。全程中該隊都把界線畫得很清楚：BLI 證實的是對一個 VP3 構築體的結合，而不是對組裝完成病毒的中和；兩個組件都還沒在真正的蜂群中測試過；100 nM 循環濃度是模擬中選定的數值，不是已確立的保護門檻；而 RNAi 的效力數字來自外部研究的條件性效果，不是對 SWARM 自身構築體的量測。影響力以一個「Roots-to-Fruits」模型對應到七項 SDG——2、4、5、8、11、15 與 17。","partners":["Dr. Aashish Manglik, University of California, San Francisco","Professor Benjamin Lamp","Professor Tatsuhiko Kadowaki","Dr. Michael Hecht, Princeton University","Professor Raymond Owens, University of Oxford / Rosalind Franklin Institute","Dr. Mark Styczynski, Georgia Institute of Technology (Styczynski Lab)","Dr. Jeff Pettis, entomologist","Professor Lewis Bartlett, University of Georgia","Professor Jamie Ellis","Professor Jennifer Leavey, Georgia Tech","Dr. Morgane Golan","Tudor Cotet and Corey Howe, Adaptyv Bio (minibinder design advice and BLI testing)","an engineer at Boltz (target structure and hotspot redirection)","Metro Atlanta Beekeepers Association (Peter Helfrich, Claressa Lucas)","Concrete Jungle (Sharanya Madhavan)","GreenLight Biosciences","representatives associated with Norroa / Vadescana","Flowers for the Future (Afghan girls' GED programme)","University of Alabama at Birmingham (John Moore - Vapor-X validation)","Georgia Institute of Technology (Vapor-X GFP validation)","Nebius, Boltz, Twist Bioscience, GenScript, Promega, New England Biolabs, Opentrons, Addgene (sponsors)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6185/wiki/modeling/img-6251.avif","caption":"The epidemiological model pipeline: how minibinder protection (assigned per bee from its syrup intake) and RNAi exposure at brood capping enter the individual-based colony simulation.","caption_zh":"流行病學模型的流程：minibinder 保護（依每隻蜂的糖水攝取量逐一指派）與封蓋時的 RNAi 暴露，如何進入以個體為基礎的蜂群模擬。","credit":"Team Lambert-GA, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6185/wiki/modeling/no-treatment-against-the-swarm-therapeutic-atlanta.avif","caption":"Simulated adult bee population in Atlanta over six years: seasonal cycles persist under SWARM while the untreated colony trajectory declines to zero - all untreated colonies were lost by the end of year three.","caption_zh":"亞特蘭大六年間的模擬成蜂族群：在 SWARM 之下季節性週期得以維持，而未處理蜂群的軌跡則一路降到零——所有未處理蜂群在第三年結束前全部覆滅。","credit":"Team Lambert-GA, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6185/wiki/modeling/crop-pollination-delivered-per-year-atlanta-georgia-blueberry-watermelon-squash-cucumber-apple.avif","caption":"Predicted annual crop pollination in Atlanta (blueberry, watermelon, squash, cucumber, apple), each treatment normalised against its own matched Varroa-free colony before averaging across 20 weather sequences.","caption_zh":"亞特蘭大的年度作物授粉量預測（藍莓、西瓜、南瓜、小黃瓜、蘋果），每種處理都先對照自己配對的無 Varroa 蜂群正規化，再在 20 組天氣序列間取平均。","credit":"Team Lambert-GA, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6185/wiki/hardware/vapor-x-prototype.avif","caption":"Vapor-X, the team's USD 80 automated vacuum dryer, with its Mason jar vacuum chamber, heated sample stand, OLED display and rotary encoder - externally validated at UAB (38 of 43 compounds recovered within 5% of undried controls) and Georgia Tech.","caption_zh":"Vapor-X，該隊 80 美元的自動真空乾燥機，配有梅森罐真空腔、加熱樣品座、OLED 顯示器與旋轉編碼器——並經 UAB（43 個化合物中有 38 個回收率落在未乾燥對照組的 5% 以內）與喬治亞理工外部驗證。","credit":"Team Lambert-GA, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"The transferable insight is that Lambert beat the metric rather than trusting it: they benchmarked ipSAE, ipTM and a 38-metric ensemble against 5,721 labelled experimental designs, found the ensemble barely beat chance (ROC-AUC 0.541) and that their eventual hit did not even have the best score, then showed with 1,307 prior designs that choosing the right epitope roughly doubles the hit rate (64% at the best site vs 32% target-wide) and released that insight as open-source software, PRINCE - landing the first confirmed DWV VP3 binder on under USD 400 of compute. A high-school-plus centre should copy that whole posture: cheap compute plus a public dataset plus honest benchmarking, and publish every tested candidate including the failures in a sortable, downloadable table.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"可轉移的洞見是：Lambert 不是信任指標，而是打敗了指標。他們拿 ipSAE、ipTM 與一個 38 項指標的集成模型，對 5,721 個有實驗標註的設計做基準測試，發現集成模型幾乎只比亂猜好一點（ROC-AUC 0.541），而他們最終成功的那個設計甚至不是分數最高的；接著他們用 1,307 個先前的設計證明，選對抗原決定位大約可讓命中率翻倍（最佳位點 64%，相對於全標靶平均 32%），並把這個洞見以開源軟體 PRINCE 釋出——總計用不到 400 美元的運算費用，就做出首例確認可結合 DWV VP3 的結合蛋白。高中以上的研究單位都值得照抄這整套姿態：便宜的運算加上公開資料集加上誠實的基準測試，並把每一個測過的候選（包括失敗的）都公開在一張可排序、可下載的表格裡。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/model-design","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/model-minibinder","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/model-rnai","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/model-epidemiological","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/implementation","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/safety","https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/contribution","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/lambert-ga/prince-model","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/lambert-ga/prince-webapp","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/lambert-ga","https://api.igem.org/v1/teams/6185"],"awards_zh":["總冠軍（高中組）","Top 10（高中組）","最佳模型 — 得主（高中組）","最佳硬體 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 得主（高中組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 得主（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 得主（氣候危機 / 保育 / 生物復育）"],"rank":301},"6187":{"team":"Toronto","id":"6187","section":"Overgrad","country":"Canada","village":"Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/","projectTitle":"PetaBite","projectTitle_zh":"PetaBite","tagline":"Planetary-scale bioprospecting for plastic-degrading enzymes: mine 300M candidates, then match an enzyme to each real-world condition.","tagline_zh":"行星尺度的塑膠分解酵素生物探勘：挖出 3 億個候選序列，再為每一種真實環境條件配對出合適的酵素。","summary":"PetaBite attacks PET and microplastic pollution by abandoning the field's usual strategy of engineering a handful of known enzymes and instead searching the natural sequence landscape at planetary scale. The dry lab rebuilt PETadex from scratch into PETadex V2: 1.74 billion plastic-degrading enzyme homologs recovered from NCBI nr and the Logan assembly of the entire Sequence Read Archive, filtered by 53 hand-curated catalytic HMMs to 291,922,243 complete catalytic ORFs, each annotated with the pH, temperature, salinity and environment of the sample it came from. They paired this with PETai activity labels scraped from literature by an LLM pipeline and by 20+ human curators, pretrained PlasticESM (LoRA adapters on ESM-C) on the corpus, and built a hardware bioreactor array to feed condition-specific measurements back into the model. They won Best Model largely for scientific honesty: a homology-component-grouped split showed that sequence length beats their own embeddings, and they reported that rather than the inflated random-split numbers.","summary_zh":"PetaBite 處理 PET 與微塑膠污染的方式，不走這個領域慣用的改造少數已知酵素路線，而是在行星尺度上搜尋自然界的序列地景。乾實驗室把 PETadex 從頭重建成 PETadex V2：從 NCBI nr 以及整個 Sequence Read Archive 的 Logan 組裝中找回 17.4 億條塑膠分解酵素的同源序列，再以 53 個人工校正的催化 HMM 過濾成 291,922,243 條完整的催化 ORF，每一條都標註來源樣本的 pH、溫度、鹽度與環境。他們再搭配 PETai 活性標籤，這些標籤由一條 LLM 流程與 20 多位人工標註者從文獻中擷取；並在這個語料上預訓練 PlasticESM（在 ESM-C 上加 LoRA adapter）；還做了一套硬體生物反應器陣列，把特定條件下的量測值回饋給模型。他們拿下 Best Model，很大一部分是因為科學上的誠實：依同源性連通元件分組的資料切分顯示，單純的序列長度表現勝過他們自己的嵌入向量，而他們選擇回報這個結果，而不是隨機切分那組虛高的數字。","awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Model — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Hardware — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"The PETadex V2 pipeline chains DIAMOND homology search against NCBI nr (42,053,081 hits down to 7,825,107 non-redundant sequences at E < 1e-5) with 53 catalytic profile HMMs built by a jackhmmer-analogous four-iteration loop that only advanced homologs retaining every canonical catalytic residue, then searched 2,740,458 catalytic-domain centroids against the Logan assembly of the SRA (87.0 Pb of raw reads compressed to 1.8 Pb of contigs) to recover 5.57 billion hits and 291,922,243 complete catalytic ORFs. Structures came from AlphaFold DB (575,770 hits, via UniProt idmapping) plus their own ESMFold2 run: 1,793,781 sequences folded in 16.6 hours on up to 80 GPUs (851.6 GPU-hours, median pLDDT 92.3), benchmarked against 244 experimental PDB structures to choose the full model under 150 aa and ESMFold2-Fast above it at 32 diffusion steps and 3 refinement loops. On the learning side they continued masked-language-model pretraining of ESM-C 300M on PETadex using LoRA adapters on all four projections of every transformer block (240 adapter tensors, 14.7M trainable parameters, backbone frozen) to produce PlasticESM, and probed its embeddings with ridge regression under homology-component-grouped cross-validation. Supporting layers include CATH and Pfam domain assignment, SignalP 6.0 secretion prediction over all ORFs, Biopython ProtParam biochemical properties, InterProScan plus HMMER accessory-domain analysis, and a reconstruction of the TED (The Encyclopedia of Domains) novelty-discovery pipeline adapted to PETadex HMMs.","frameworks_zh":"PETadex V2 流程先用 DIAMOND 對 NCBI nr 做同源搜尋（42,053,081 個命中，在 E < 1e-5 下收斂到 7,825,107 條非重複序列），再串接 53 個催化型 profile HMM；這些 HMM 以類似 jackhmmer 的四輪迭代迴圈建立，只讓保留全部標準催化殘基的同源序列進入下一輪。接著以 2,740,458 個催化結構域中心序列搜尋 SRA 的 Logan 組裝（87.0 Pb 的原始讀序壓縮成 1.8 Pb 的 contig），取得 55.7 億個命中與 291,922,243 條完整的催化 ORF。結構來自 AlphaFold DB（透過 UniProt idmapping 取得 575,770 個命中），加上自己跑的 ESMFold2：1,793,781 條序列在最多 80 張 GPU 上於 16.6 小時內完成摺疊預測（851.6 GPU 小時，pLDDT 中位數 92.3），並以 244 個實驗解出的 PDB 結構做基準，據此決定 150 個胺基酸以下用完整模型、以上改用 ESMFold2-Fast，擴散步數 32、精修迴圈 3 次。在學習端，他們在 PETadex 上繼續對 ESM-C 300M 做遮罩語言模型預訓練，在每個 transformer 區塊的四個投影上都加 LoRA adapter（240 個 adapter 張量、1,470 萬個可訓練參數、主幹凍結），產出 PlasticESM，並以脊迴歸在依同源性連通元件分組的交叉驗證下探測其嵌入向量。輔助層包括 CATH 與 Pfam 的結構域指派、對所有 ORF 執行 SignalP 6.0 分泌預測、Biopython ProtParam 的生化性質、InterProScan 搭配 HMMER 的輔助結構域分析，以及重建 TED（The Encyclopedia of Domains）的新穎性發現流程並調整成適用 PETadex 的 HMM。","dataviz":"The wiki is the clearest dataviz work in the cohort: a 300-million-protein 'PETadex Model Landscape' rendered as three explorable layers (what we found, what we know, what we predict), a draggable component map of the 46 PETadex-PAZy families, a 3D structure viewer that highlights the catalytic triad, oxyanion hole and docked PET dimer for each of 16 CATH fold groups, and a BioSample viewer that drills from a real sample (e.g. SAMN03075713, Arctic tundra soil) down through its sequencing run to individual ORFs and their 90% identity clusters. The Sharded DIAMOND search and the per-enzyme record card both ship as live in-page demos that replay ten real searches, sped up from 45 seconds to two. There is also a 'PETadex Project Calendar' that walks week by week from March to October with an explicit 'What went wrong, and what we changed' panel per workstream, and a PETamon mini-game that teaches why no single enzyme cleans up every plastic.","dataviz_zh":"這份 wiki 是本屆資料視覺化做得最清楚的：一個涵蓋 3 億個蛋白質的 PETadex Model Landscape，分成三個可探索的圖層（我們找到什麼、我們知道什麼、模型預測什麼）；一張可拖曳的 46 個 PETadex-PAZy 家族元件圖；一個 3D 結構檢視器，對 16 個 CATH 摺疊群各自標示催化三元體、氧陰離子孔與嵌入的 PET 二聚體；以及一個 BioSample 檢視器，可從一個真實樣本（例如 SAMN03075713，北極凍原土壤）往下鑽到它的定序執行，再到個別 ORF 及其 90% 相似度叢集。分片式 DIAMOND 搜尋與單一酵素的紀錄卡都做成頁內即時示範，重播十次真實搜尋，並把原本 45 秒的過程加速到 2 秒。另有一份 PETadex Project Calendar，從三月到十月逐週呈現，每條工作線都附一個明確的「哪裡出錯、我們改了什麼」面板；還有一個 PETamon 小遊戲，用來說明為什麼沒有單一酵素能清掉所有塑膠。","datascience":"Their central data-science contribution is turning a literature corpus into training labels and then proving honestly that the labels, not the corpus, are the bottleneck. An automated LLM extraction pipeline gathered 11,000 identifiers via the PAZy API, screened them to 900 seed papers, expanded by forward and backward citation to 50,000 candidates, filtered to ~4,600, converted full texts to structured JSON with Docling, Grobid and PyMuPDF, and extracted 51,455 cleaned measurement entries across 31,441 enzymes; Claude Sonnet benchmarked best (95.0% precision, 87.1% recall) with zero hallucinated enzymes across 32 double-scraped papers. In parallel, 20+ members spent 450+ hours hand-extracting 61 papers through a standardized interactive HTML schema with autogenerated IDs and built-in error checks, giving a ground truth where 78% of independent scraper pairs agreed within 10%. The benchmark result is the headline: under random five-fold splits stock ESM-C reached rho = 0.72 on kcat and 0.74 on melting temperature, but splitting folds by connected homology component dropped the same embeddings by 0.49 to 1.01 while a single sequence-length column lost at most 0.18 — because 90-92% of labelled sequences have a homologous relative elsewhere in the set. Length itself reached rho = +0.343 on kcat and beat both embeddings on all twelve target sets, so they reported the negative result, published the model card alongside the weights so nobody reuses the adapters expecting activity prediction, and designed round 2 to be chosen by model uncertainty rather than predicted activity.","datascience_zh":"他們在資料科學上的核心貢獻，是把文獻語料轉成訓練標籤，然後誠實地證明瓶頸在標籤、而不在語料。一條自動化的 LLM 擷取流程透過 PAZy API 蒐集 11,000 個識別碼，篩選成 900 篇種子論文，再以前向與後向引用擴展到 50,000 篇候選，過濾到約 4,600 篇，以 Docling、Grobid 與 PyMuPDF 把全文轉成結構化 JSON，最後擷取出涵蓋 31,441 個酵素的 51,455 筆清理後量測資料；基準測試中 Claude Sonnet 表現最佳（精確率 95.0%、召回率 87.1%），在 32 篇重複擷取的論文中沒有任何憑空生成的酵素。同時，20 多位成員花了 450 多小時，透過一套標準化的互動式 HTML 結構（自動產生 ID 並內建錯誤檢查）人工擷取 61 篇論文，建立出一份基準答案，其中 78% 的獨立擷取配對結果差異在 10% 以內。最關鍵的是基準測試結果：在隨機五折切分下，未調整的 ESM-C 在 kcat 上達到 rho = 0.72、在熔解溫度上達到 0.74；但改以同源性連通元件切分折數後，同樣的嵌入向量下降了 0.49 到 1.01，而單一的序列長度欄位最多只掉 0.18，原因是有 90-92% 的標註序列在資料集中還有同源的親戚。序列長度本身在 kcat 上達到 rho = +0.343，並在全部十二組目標上都勝過兩種嵌入向量，於是他們回報了這個負面結果，並在釋出權重時一併公布模型卡，以免有人把這些 adapter 當成活性預測工具重複使用；第二輪的挑選標準也改為依模型不確定度，而不是依預測活性。","software":"Two tools released under MIT at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/toronto/petabite. LOBSTER (Library Optimization for Bioprospecting Sequences Through Economical Recombination) splits PETase cores into fragment positions and designs degenerate-codon oligos that combinatorially assemble by Golden Gate to cover as many natural cores as possible — it synthesized a 1,744-sequence library at 45% of individual-synthesis cost (55% nucleotide reduction) for the IsPETase and LCC 90% identity clusters. Sharded DIAMOND Search splits the 307M-sequence corpus into 32 shards searched in parallel by serverless cloud workers, returning ranked neighbours for a pasted protein in under a minute with nothing to install, live at petadex.net. Datasets are on Zenodo (PETadex catalytic ORF corpus v1.1 + sharded search DB, 23.8 GB, doi:10.5281/zenodo.23457986) and Hugging Face (petadex/plasticesm-dualseed, petadex/catalytic-orfs-90pid, petadex/petai-activity-labels, each label source published separately); analysis notebooks live at github.com/petadex/igem-toronto and github.com/petadex/petabite. Hardware: a parallel bioreactor array, up to 96 units, at about $204 CAD per reactor, with PID temperature control holding 37 C within +/-0.3 C, dual-photodiode OD600 with three-point quadratic calibration (R^2 = 0.993 on yeast), peristaltic pumps under Arduino PWM control, 150 RPM stirring, and a single-file Python dashboard over USB serial; it grew E. coli over 4 hours in the final test.","software_zh":"兩個工具以 MIT 授權釋出於 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/toronto/petabite。LOBSTER（Library Optimization for Bioprospecting Sequences Through Economical Recombination）把 PETase 核心切成片段位置，設計簡併密碼子寡核苷酸，再以 Golden Gate 組合式組裝，盡可能覆蓋更多天然核心；針對 IsPETase 與 LCC 的 90% 相似度叢集，它以逐一合成成本的 45% 做出一個 1,744 條序列的庫（核苷酸用量減少 55%）。Sharded DIAMOND Search 把 3.07 億條序列的語料切成 32 個分片，由無伺服器的雲端工作者並行搜尋，貼上一條蛋白質序列即可在一分鐘內回傳排序後的鄰近序列，不需安裝任何東西，已上線於 petadex.net。資料集放在 Zenodo（PETadex 催化 ORF 語料 v1.1 加上分片搜尋資料庫，23.8 GB，doi:10.5281/zenodo.23457986）與 Hugging Face（petadex/plasticesm-dualseed、petadex/catalytic-orfs-90pid、petadex/petai-activity-labels，每個標籤來源各自獨立發布）；分析用的 notebook 放在 github.com/petadex/igem-toronto 與 github.com/petadex/petabite。硬體方面是一套可擴充到 96 台的平行生物反應器陣列，每台約 204 加元，PID 溫控可把 37 C 維持在 ±0.3 C 以內，雙光二極體 OD600 搭配三點二次校正（在酵母上 R^2 = 0.993），蠕動泵由 Arduino PWM 控制，攪拌 150 RPM，並以單一檔案的 Python 儀表板透過 USB 序列埠操作；最終測試中成功培養 E. coli 達 4 小時。","stack":["DIAMOND","HMMER / jackhmmer-style iterative HMM building","MMseqs2 (cross-check)","USEARCH","Logan SRA assembly","NCBI nr","PAZy","PlasticDB","BacDive","NCBI BioSample","ESM-C 300M / ESMC-600M","LoRA (PlasticESM)","ESMFold2 / ESMFold2-Fast","AlphaFold DB","ColabFold v1.5.5","SignalP 6.0","InterProScan","CATH","Pfam","Foldseek","umap-learn","scikit-learn ridge regression","Biopython ProtParam","Weights & Biases","Hugging Face Datasets","Docling","Grobid","PyMuPDF","Claude Sonnet (LLM extraction)","Parquet","AWS S3 + serverless workers","Arduino Nano","Python (dashboard)"],"techniques":["planetary-scale metagenomic homology mining","catalytic-residue-constrained profile HMMs","hierarchical clustering at 90/60/30% identity","homology-component-grouped cross-validation","permutation tests and fold-centred scoring","model-free controls (sequence length, amino-acid composition)","continued masked-language-model pretraining with LoRA adapters","UMAP embedding atlas with shuffled/random/fragment negative controls","silhouette scoring per CATH domain","LLM literature extraction benchmarked against double-human curation","uncertainty-driven active learning for round 2 library selection","degenerate-codon Golden Gate library design","sharded parallel sequence search","PID temperature control and dual-photodiode OD600 calibration"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Toronto hosted three conferences, including a 'Rethink plastic' microplastics conference built around two questions (what happens to plastic once it enters the environment, and what can we realistically do about it), deliberately framing PetaBite as one approach among many alongside prevention, policy and community action. They mentored two high-school synthetic biology teams, ran sustained exchanges with four universities abroad, and carried out eight campus collaborations across the University of Toronto reaching over 800 students and community members. Outreach ran on humour rather than lecture: a promotion video combining live action with original animation and PETase-inspired axolotl mascots, a 'Road to Jamboree' Instagram Reels series using trends and familiar formats, and a newsletter, The Waterfront, with 300+ subscribers. Instagram content drew over 105,000 views, 250+ new followers, 2,500+ profile visits and 374 link clicks through to the project and the conference.","publicEngagement_zh":"Toronto 辦了三場會議，其中包括一場名為 Rethink plastic 的微塑膠會議，圍繞兩個問題設計（塑膠進入環境之後會發生什麼事，以及我們現實上能做什麼），並刻意把 PetaBite 定位成眾多途徑之一，與預防、政策和社區行動並列。他們輔導兩支高中合成生物學隊伍、與四所海外大學保持長期交流，並在多倫多大學校內完成八項合作，接觸超過 800 名學生與社區成員。推廣靠的是幽默而不是說教：一支結合實拍與原創動畫、以 PETase 為靈感設計六角恐龍吉祥物的宣傳片，一系列運用熱門趨勢與熟悉格式的 Road to Jamboree Instagram Reels，以及訂閱者超過 300 人的電子報 The Waterfront。Instagram 內容累積超過 105,000 次觀看、新增 250 多名追蹤者、2,500 多次個人檔案造訪，以及 374 次連往專案與會議的連結點擊。","ihp":"Roughly 70 stakeholders across four continents, and the changes are specific. A public event where biosafety dominated the questions told them containment has to come before technical detail, so every subsequent public-facing event opened with containment. Regulatory and ethics conversations led them to prioritize enzyme candidates with close homology to naturally occurring proteins and to lead with a contained bioreactor rather than dosing enzymes into open process streams. A researcher's clarification that PETases are only a subset of plastic-degrading enzymes made them explicitly define scope throughout the documentation. Hardware feedback on optical channels led them to separate the optical-density path from the colorimetric degradation readout so dye cannot corrupt cell-density estimates, and a GFP recommendation gave them a route to reporting activity per enzyme rather than per cell; the same conversations reframed the 40 mL reactor as the directed-evolution and Michaelis-Menten instrument and split off the 1,000-to-50 intermediate screen as a separate smaller-format problem. A CGM-adjacent interviewee's distinction between sensor and adhesive reshaped MVP scope. Indigenous knowledge holders reframed plastic pollution as a matter of relationships among people, land and water rather than a technical problem, which fed country-specific regulatory profiles for Pakistan, India, Nigeria, Indonesia and Canadian Indigenous communities addressing waste colonialism and ethics dumping. All of this was codified into a reusable MERGE framework (Multidisciplinary outreach, Education, Regulatory oversight, Global database, Environmental consideration) and a Regulatory Oversight Framework covering Canada's Roadmap for Open Science, FAIR, the Nagoya Protocol, dual-use research of concern, PIPEDA, the Directive on Automated Decision-Making and the EU AI Act.","ihp_zh":"橫跨四大洲、約 70 位利害關係人，而且帶來的改變都很具體。一場公開活動中提問幾乎都集中在生物安全，讓他們意識到圍堵必須講在技術細節之前，因此之後每一場對外活動都從圍堵講起。法規與倫理的對話讓他們優先選擇與天然蛋白質高度同源的酵素候選，並以密閉式生物反應器作為主要方案，而不是把酵素直接投入開放的製程水流。一位研究者指出 PETase 只是塑膠分解酵素的一個子集，促使他們在整份文件中都明確界定範圍。關於光學通道的硬體回饋，讓他們把光密度量測路徑與比色法的降解讀值分開，避免染劑干擾細胞密度估計；另有人建議使用 GFP，讓他們能以每個酵素而不是每個細胞為單位回報活性；同一批討論也把 40 mL 反應器重新定位為做定向演化與 Michaelis-Menten 動力學的器材，並把從 1,000 篩到 50 的中間篩選另立為一個規格較小的獨立問題。一位從事連續血糖監測相關工作的受訪者把感測器與黏貼材料分開看待，重塑了最小可行產品的範圍。原住民族知識持有者把塑膠污染重新框定為人、土地與水之間的關係問題，而不只是技術問題，這也促成針對巴基斯坦、印度、奈及利亞、印尼與加拿大原住民社群的個別法規側寫，探討廢棄物殖民主義與倫理傾倒。這些全都被整理成一套可重複使用的 MERGE 框架（Multidisciplinary outreach、Education、Regulatory oversight、Global database、Environmental consideration），以及一份法規監督框架，涵蓋加拿大的 Roadmap for Open Science、FAIR 原則、名古屋議定書、兩用性顧慮研究、PIPEDA、自動化決策指令與 EU AI Act。","realWorld":"PetaScale is the commercialization arm, explicitly framed as taking PetaBite from 0-to-1 to 1-to-n. The beachhead is wastewater treatment plants, validated through 20 feasibility conversations with operators, engineers and managers across Ontario, Alberta and Newfoundland, with PETases immobilized in packed-bed reactors so the enzyme stays contained. Three adjacent verticals are mapped: microfibre filtration, landfill leachate and textile effluent. Their differentiation is explicit against Carbios, Samsara Eco and Protein Evolution, all of which build around one engineered enzyme and one operating window (Carbios amorphizes PET and runs near 70 C) — PetaScale instead matches the enzyme to the site's existing temperature, pH and salinity so no heating or pretreatment is needed. Regulatory mapping covers CEPA, EPA TSCA Section 5 and provincial discharge permits, with tailwinds from EU Regulation 2023/2055, Directive 2024/3019 and Canada's Federal Plastics Registry. Validation signal: their associate RNAlab screened 161 randomly selected natural enzymes and two outperformed FAST-PETase. They tested the model across five Canadian national and four global competitions plus two international conferences, placed top 3 in six, attended Y Combinator Startup School, Web Summit Vancouver, SynBioBeta Global and the Canadian Food Forward Summit, completed the Wilbe incubator sprint, opened early discussions with three Canadian VC firms, and raised support from 17 sponsors.","realWorld_zh":"PetaScale 是商業化的那條線，明確定位為把 PetaBite 從 0 到 1 推進到 1 到 n。切入點是污水處理廠，並透過安大略、亞伯達與紐芬蘭三地 20 場與操作員、工程師與管理者的可行性對話加以驗證，PETase 固定在填充床反應器中，讓酵素留在系統內。另外盤點三個相鄰的垂直市場：微纖維過濾、垃圾掩埋場滲出水與紡織廢水。他們的差異化講得很明確：對手 Carbios、Samsara Eco 與 Protein Evolution 都是圍繞單一改造酵素與單一操作視窗（Carbios 先把 PET 非晶化，並在接近 70 C 下運作），而 PetaScale 是把酵素配對到場址既有的溫度、pH 與鹽度，因此不需要加熱或前處理。法規盤點涵蓋 CEPA、EPA TSCA 第 5 條與各省的排放許可，並有 EU Regulation 2023/2055、Directive 2024/3019 與加拿大 Federal Plastics Registry 作為順風。驗證訊號方面：合作實驗室 RNAlab 篩選了 161 個隨機挑選的天然酵素，其中兩個表現勝過 FAST-PETase。他們把這套模式拿到五項加拿大全國與四項全球競賽、再加兩場國際會議上測試，有六項進入前三名，並參加 Y Combinator Startup School、Web Summit Vancouver、SynBioBeta Global 與 Canadian Food Forward Summit，完成 Wilbe 育成衝刺計畫，與三家加拿大創投開啟初期接觸，並取得 17 家贊助者的支持。","partners":["RNAlab (associate lab, Logan project)","Environment and Climate Change Canada","U.S. EPA","U of T Trash Team","Wastewater treatment plant operators across Ontario, Alberta and Newfoundland","Wilbe startup incubator","Y Combinator Startup School","SynBioBeta Global","Web Summit Vancouver","Indigenous knowledge holders (Canada)","Four partner universities abroad","Two mentored high-school iGEM teams"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6187/wiki/drylab-page/figures/petadex-workflow-overview.svg","caption":"Overview of the PETadex V2 discovery pipeline: curated PAZy enzymes seed catalytic HMMs, which mine NCBI nr and the Logan SRA assembly down to 291,922,243 complete catalytic ORFs.","caption_zh":"PETadex V2 探索流程概覽：以人工校正的 PAZy 酵素作為種子建立催化 HMM，再從 NCBI nr 與 Logan 的 SRA 組裝中挖掘，最後收斂到 291,922,243 條完整的催化 ORF。","credit":"Team Toronto, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6187/wiki/drylab-page/figures/homology-leakage.svg","caption":"The team's headline negative result: the same ridge probe scored under homology-component-grouped splits (hollow) versus random five-fold splits (filled). ESM-C embeddings gain 0.49-1.01 from the random split; a single sequence-length column gains at most 0.18.","caption_zh":"團隊最重要的負面結果：同一個脊迴歸探測器分別在依同源性連通元件分組的切分（空心）與隨機五折切分（實心）下的得分。ESM-C 的嵌入向量因為隨機切分而多拿 0.49-1.01；單一的序列長度欄位最多只多拿 0.18。","credit":"Team Toronto, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6187/wiki/drylab-page/figures/landscape-spin-poster.avif","caption":"The interactive PETadex Model Landscape, which lets a visitor explore 300 million proteins in three layers: what was found, what is known about each sequence, and what the model predicts.","caption_zh":"互動式的 PETadex Model Landscape，讓訪客以三個圖層探索 3 億個蛋白質：找到了什麼、關於每條序列已知什麼，以及模型預測什麼。","credit":"Team Toronto, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6187/wiki/hardware-notebook/overview/finalresult/1.avif","caption":"The final parallel bioreactor build: about $204 CAD per unit, with PID temperature control, dual-photodiode OD600, peristaltic pumps and stirring, driven from a single-file Python dashboard over USB serial.","caption_zh":"最終版的平行生物反應器：每台約 204 加元，具 PID 溫控、雙光二極體 OD600、蠕動泵與攪拌，並由單一檔案的 Python 儀表板透過 USB 序列埠驅動。","credit":"Team Toronto, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy their evaluation discipline, not their compute budget: grouping train/test splits by homology component and forcing every model to beat zero-parameter controls (sequence length, amino-acid composition) is free, and it is what turned a plausible-looking rho = 0.72 into an honest negative result that reviewers rewarded. Pair that with their hybrid labelling pattern — an LLM extraction pipeline benchmarked against a small, double-scored, schema-driven human corpus — which is exactly the right shape for a school research centre that has many students and little GPU time.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"要學的是他們的評估紀律，而不是他們的運算預算：把訓練與測試的切分依同源性連通元件分組，並要求每個模型都必須勝過零參數對照（序列長度、胺基酸組成），這些都不花錢，卻正是把一個看起來很漂亮的 rho = 0.72 變成一個讓評審願意給分的誠實負面結果的關鍵。再搭配他們混合式的標註模式：一條 LLM 擷取流程，以一份規模不大、雙人重複評分、依結構表單建立的人工語料作為基準；對於學生多、GPU 時數少的校內研究單位來說，這正是合適的形狀。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/","https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/project/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/dry-lab/overview/","https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/dry-lab/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/software/","https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/hardware/","https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/entrepreneurship/","https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/beyond-the-bench/outreach/","https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/contribution/","https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/safety-and-security/"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳模型 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳硬體 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳創業 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 入圍"],"rank":124},"6196":{"team":"TAU-Israel","id":"6196","section":"Overgrad","country":"Israel","village":"Therapeutics / Foundational Advance","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/tau-israel/","projectTitle":"CERNAL","tagline":"A biological compiler: supply RNA expression data, get ranked RNA logic-gate circuit designs that fire only in the cell state you specify.","summary":"CERNAL treats the transcriptome as a fingerprint of cellular state and compiles that fingerprint into an RNA logic circuit: it picks the transcripts that distinguish a target cell from its neighbour, scans each transcript for an accessible, unique, constructible trigger window, designs a toehold-style switch whose hairpin hides the ribosome binding site until that trigger unzips it, combines switches into AND and NOT gates, ranks every candidate on shared thermodynamic metrics, and assembles the winner into an annotated plasmid. Because the sensing element is the cell's own RNA rather than a characterised transcription factor, the approach is intended to be host-agnostic, and the team demonstrated it in three proofs of concept: endometriosis logic in HEK293T, a PFOA/PFAS biosensor in E. coli, and CRISPRa gates in yeast. The software is a Django Ninja + React 19 application with a strictly isolated scientific engine, a versioned HTTP API with Python, R and MATLAB clients, SBOL 3 export, and an IBBIS Common Mechanism biosecurity gate that withholds sequence files when screening cannot be completed. The team filed a provisional patent through Tel Aviv University's TTO and built a full market case around cell and gene therapy developers.","awards":["Best Software — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A React 19 static single-page application (TanStack Router, React Query for server state, polling and mutations) built into Django's static assets, over Django Ninja typed HTTP routes with a shared error envelope, Django ORM models for persistent state, and a thin django-q2 task that dispatches work through the engine interface. The v1 runtime deliberately uses SQLite with write-ahead logging, foreign keys and a busy timeout, plus a single ORM-backed queue worker, so the queue is a database table and no separate broker (Redis, RabbitMQ) is needed; rate-limit state also lives in a database cache rather than per-process counters. Worker timeout is one hour with max attempts set to one, explicitly to avoid silently repeating an expensive calculation. The scientific engine is a separate package: it does not import Django, routers, application modules, the database or Django settings, configuration arrives as frozen request records, and an abstract-syntax-tree test catches ordinary, conditional and function-local imports that would break that boundary. Platform code may import only engine.contract and engine.client, never the scientific internals, which means the engine runs and is tested with no web server, database or network, and could be moved to a remote process behind the same request/result interface. Requirements: Python 3.13, uv, Node 22+ for the frontend build, ViennaRNA and Biopython; run './do install && ./do migrate && ./do superuser && ./do build-frontend' then the dev server and a worker in a second terminal, because without the worker submissions just sit queued.","dataviz":"The project landing page is an extended scroll-driven explainer that animates the actual mechanism: zooming into a cytoplasm of coloured transcripts, lining them up by abundance to show the state fingerprint, highlighting the transcripts strong in cell A only versus cell B only, picking one, finding the trigger window, then showing the hairpin lock with its buried RBS being unzipped by the key, and finally the same locks becoming AND and NOT gates. The software page is organised as a 'field guide' with chapters, every claim linked to its implementation record, and a five-step auto-playing screen recording of a real run (recorded from the local app on 11 October 2026) with per-step 'you should see' statements and a static-image fallback for users without JavaScript. The results explorer shows ranked candidates with full metric decomposition, construct views, warnings, and the rejected candidates kept visible; user decision tags (none, pinned, shortlisted, rejected, synthesize) are annotations that explicitly do not change any computational or release result. Run states are drawn as a six-state machine with eight permitted transitions.","datascience":"Validation is answered against the Best Software ballot questions one by one, each linked to an implementation or measurement record, and separated into four kinds of evidence that the wiki says do not substitute for one another: software checks, recorded execution, structure comparisons and host experiments. Two external comparisons anchor the predictions: the RNA-accessibility score was compared against published in-cell SHAPE measurements across 450 E. coli RNA records, and the switch-ranking metrics were tested against Green et al.'s measured toehold ON/OFF ratios. Gene selection used published expression data for the PFOA analysis and, separately, an endometriosis analysis with healthy-tissue context, stratifying AREG and SELE across superficial peritoneal and deep ovarian lesions. The AND-gate study enumerated hundreds of thousands of candidate designs, and examining the best and worst of each architecture surfaced failure modes before anything was built, notably switches that score well only because they stay closed and targets that look good only on paper. At the bench, dozens of toehold candidates were designed and a subset tested in bacteria, with bacterial NOT-gate results, yeast guide-RNA experiments and human-cell input-expression studies providing different pieces of evidence; the wiki says testing is ongoing and names the remaining gate-validation work. Capabilities are labelled Implemented, Conditional (execution or release depends on infrastructure, data or screening) or Incomplete, with the stated rule that missing evidence is never scored as a numerical zero and a high score cannot fill it. The removed off-target scanner is explicitly not replaced by a zero-valued measurement. The recorded demonstration run is reported with its failure included: a 711-nt mCherry input produced 21 ranked designs, but FASTA, GenBank and SBOL release was held because the screening service was unavailable.","software":"CERNAL is the most engineering-mature iGEM software this year, and its distinguishing feature is that almost every claim is qualified by what it does not establish. The pipeline runs: differential-expression table or direct transcript in; gene ranking; sliding-window trigger enumeration scored by ViennaRNA-predicted accessibility (RNAplfold partition functions, base-pair probabilities, minimum free energy) with positions and sequence context retained; gate design across six families (single-input toehold, prokaryotic and eukaryotic AND, prokaryotic and eukaryotic NOT, CRISPR-based); cross-family ranking on shared metric definitions with normalisation and weights so candidates from compatible gate families sit in one list; circuit composition from a Boolean expression; and annotated plasmid assembly with RFC10 and RFC1000 restriction-site checks against the selected assembly standard. Three interfaces sit over one engine: a guided four-step web wizard (inputs, logic, payload, vector), a versioned HTTP API with OpenAPI docs at /api/docs and five core endpoints (GET /api/version for capabilities, POST /api/design returning a job handle, GET /api/design/{id} for cheap polling, GET /api/design/{id}/results with ?format=csv, GET /api/artifacts/{id}/download with ownership checks), and an optional LLM chatbot for picking a reference gene. Client packages ship for Python, R and MATLAB plus curl examples, and the team publishes which clients are actually verified: Python has recorded live-server CI conformance, R has later checks, MATLAB has archived wrapper defects and no fresh conformance claimed. API keys carry a cern_live_ prefix with only a SHA-256 digest stored, two scopes (read, design), expiry, revocation, 60 requests per minute and two concurrent runs by default, and an object owned by another account returns 404 rather than confirming its existence. Strict submission rejects misspelled constraint keys with a structured 422 and suggestions rather than silently applying a default, and the stated compatibility promise within an API schema version is additive-only. Formats: RNA sequences and differential-expression tables in, custom GenBank backbones in, FASTA, annotated GenBank, SBOL 3 (preserving sequence features, part roles and provenance) and CSV out, with Biopython handling GenBank and ViennaRNA the thermodynamics. Two things are unusual. First, biosecurity is wired into the pipeline, not bolted on: an IBBIS Common Mechanism integration (HMM sequence-profile models plus similarity search) screens the final switch and the assembled construct and holds sequence export when screening evidence is unavailable or unresolved, and the wiki states that a hold is not a completed screen. Second, the team separates scientific computation from AI-assisted development and says so in a dedicated section: the reviewed runtime contains no generative AI, LLM, neural network, trained classifier or remote inference service, the Python and JavaScript manifests include no AI inference SDK, and design runs send no biological data to an AI provider, while AI assistance used in interface design, coding and documentation is recorded in attribution. Reproducibility is handled by publishing a fixed 7.1 MiB source snapshot (revision 9a5ca657) with a checksum manifest, noting candidly that this revision was not on the public repository when checked and that the public repo may contain a different revision, so the snapshot is not substituted for it. Documentation is layered: a public documentation index, architecture diagrams, a scientific-engine module map, an API reference generated into a committed file with a freshness test that detects drift, decision records (including one on choosing SBOL 3), typed contracts and docstrings on cross-component data, and a repository map for new contributors. Four named reuse points are offered for teams who want only a piece: the engine contract, gate-family hooks, the scoring layer and the window utility. Repo: https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/tau-israel/cernal. A hosted deployment exists at https://cernal.app (also cernal.duckdns.org, same host) but it is gated, the wiki says to sign in with a lab account or request access, and the host did not respond when checked, so the dependable route is the published source snapshot and a local install. Upstream credit is kept explicit: a separate eukaryotic AND research notebook reads ranked CSVs exported from the third-party NucSyn Platform, and the wiki states that NucSyn is neither invoked nor bundled by the production engine and that the two sets of scores remain distinct.","stack":["Python 3.13","Django","Django Ninja","django-q2","SQLite (WAL)","uv","React 19","TanStack Router","React Query","Vite","Node 22+","ViennaRNA (RNAplfold, RNAfold, RNAcofold)","Biopython","SBOL 3","GenBank","OpenAPI","IBBIS Common Mechanism","Python / R / MATLAB client packages","DESeq2-style differential expression input","iGEM GitLab"],"techniques":["RNA secondary-structure prediction via partition functions and base-pair probabilities","accessibility profiling of sliding trigger windows","toehold switch design (hairpin-sequestered RBS)","prokaryotic and eukaryotic AND and NOT gate architectures","CRISPRa gate design","cross-family metric normalisation and weighted ranking","Boolean circuit composition","differential-expression gene ranking with Benjamini-Hochberg adjustment and log2 fold thresholds","benchmarking predictions against in-cell SHAPE data","benchmarking against Green et al. measured ON/OFF ratios","HMM sequence-profile biosecurity screening","architecture-boundary enforcement via AST import tests","state-machine run lifecycle with explicit terminal outcomes","transactional result import with checksum verification"],"frameworks_zh":"一個 React 19 靜態單頁應用程式（TanStack Router、以 React Query 管理伺服器狀態、輪詢與變更），建置進 Django 的靜態資源中，底層是 Django Ninja 的具型別 HTTP 路由（共用的錯誤封包格式）、以 Django ORM 模型保存狀態，以及一個透過引擎介面派送工作的輕量 django-q2 任務。v1 執行環境刻意使用啟用 write-ahead logging、外鍵與 busy timeout 的 SQLite，加上單一個以 ORM 為後端的佇列工作者，因此佇列就是一張資料庫表，不需要獨立的訊息中介（Redis、RabbitMQ）；速率限制狀態也存在資料庫快取，而不是各行程各自計數。工作者逾時設為一小時、最大嘗試次數設為一，明確是為了避免無聲地重跑一次昂貴的計算。科學運算引擎是獨立套件：它不 import Django、路由、應用模組、資料庫或 Django 設定，設定值以凍結的請求紀錄形式傳入，並有一個抽象語法樹測試會抓出會破壞這條界線的一般、條件式與函式內 import。平台程式碼只能 import engine.contract 與 engine.client，絕不能碰科學內部實作，這表示引擎在沒有網頁伺服器、資料庫或網路的情況下也能執行與測試，並可在相同的請求／結果介面後方移到遠端行程。環境需求：Python 3.13、uv、前端建置需 Node 22+、ViennaRNA 與 Biopython；執行「./do install && ./do migrate && ./do superuser && ./do build-frontend」後啟動開發伺服器，並在第二個終端機開一個工作者，因為沒有工作者時送出的任務只會一直排隊。","dataviz_zh":"專案首頁是一段長捲動式的導覽解說，動畫呈現真正的機制：鏡頭推進一個充滿彩色轉錄本的細胞質，依豐度排列以顯示狀態指紋，標出只在細胞 A 或只在細胞 B 高表現的轉錄本，挑出一個，找到觸發視窗，接著展示把 RBS 埋起來的髮夾鎖被鑰匙拉開，最後同樣的鎖變成 AND 與 NOT 閘。軟體頁面編排成一本分章的「田野指南」，每項主張都連到對應的實作紀錄，另有一段五步驟自動播放的真實執行螢幕錄影（2026 年 10 月 11 日自本機應用程式錄製），每一步都附「你應該會看到什麼」的敘述，並為關閉 JavaScript 的使用者提供靜態圖片替代。結果瀏覽器以完整的指標分解呈現排序後的候選，含構築檢視與警示，並且被淘汰的候選仍然看得見；使用者的決策標記（無、釘選、入選、淘汰、送合成）只是註記，明確不會改變任何計算或釋出結果。執行狀態畫成一個六狀態機，含八種允許的轉換。","datascience_zh":"驗證是逐題對照 Best Software 評分表的問題來回答，每一題都連到一筆實作或量測紀錄，並分成四種彼此不可互相取代（wiki 明言）的證據：軟體檢查、已記錄的執行、結構比較，以及宿主實驗。兩項外部比較為預測結果提供錨點：RNA 可及性分數與已發表的細胞內 SHAPE 量測在 450 筆 E. coli RNA 記錄上比較；開關排序指標則對照 Green 等人實測的 toehold ON/OFF 比值檢驗。基因選擇在 PFOA 分析中使用已發表的表現資料，另有一項子宮內膜異位症分析納入健康組織作為對照，把 AREG 與 SELE 分別依腹膜淺層病灶與卵巢深層病灶分層。AND 閘研究枚舉了數十萬個候選設計，而檢視每種架構中最好與最差的案例，在任何東西被建造之前就浮現了失效模式，特別是那些「只因為一直維持關閉所以分數漂亮」的開關，以及只在紙上好看的標的。在實驗台上，他們設計了數十個 toehold 候選並測試其中一部分於細菌中，細菌 NOT 閘結果、酵母嚮導 RNA 實驗與人類細胞輸入表現研究各提供了不同片段的證據；wiki 說明測試仍在進行，並指名尚待完成的閘驗證工作。各項能力分別標示為已實作（Implemented）、有條件（Conditional，執行或釋出取決於基礎設施、資料或篩查）或未完成（Incomplete），並明訂一條規則：缺少的證據絕不以數值零計分，高分也不能填補它。被移除的脫靶掃描器明確不以一個零值量測來替代。那次有記錄的示範執行連失敗一起報告：一個 711 nt 的 mCherry 輸入產生 21 個排序設計，但因篩查服務無法使用，FASTA、GenBank 與 SBOL 的釋出被扣住。","software_zh":"CERNAL 是今年工程成熟度最高的 iGEM 軟體，而它最與眾不同之處在於，幾乎每一項主張都附帶說明它「沒有」證明什麼。管線流程為：輸入差異表現表格或直接給定轉錄本；基因排序；以滑動視窗枚舉觸發序列，並以 ViennaRNA 預測的可及性評分（RNAplfold 分配函數、鹼基配對機率、最小自由能），保留位置與序列脈絡；跨六個家族的閘設計（單輸入 toehold、原核與真核 AND、原核與真核 NOT、CRISPR 式）；以共用的指標定義、搭配正規化與權重做跨家族排序，使相容閘家族的候選能並列於同一份清單；由布林運算式組出迴路；最後進行帶註解的質體組裝，並依選定的組裝標準做 RFC10 與 RFC1000 限制酶切位檢查。三個介面架在同一個引擎上：一個四步驟引導式網頁精靈（輸入、邏輯、酬載、載體）；一個版本化的 HTTP API，在 /api/docs 提供 OpenAPI 文件與五個核心端點（GET /api/version 查詢能力、POST /api/design 回傳工作代號、GET /api/design/{id} 供低成本輪詢、GET /api/design/{id}/results 可加 ?format=csv、GET /api/artifacts/{id}/download 並檢查所有權）；以及一個選用的 LLM 聊天機器人協助挑選參考基因。客戶端套件提供 Python、R 與 MATLAB 版本並附 curl 範例，團隊也公開哪些客戶端真正經過驗證：Python 有針對實際伺服器的 CI 一致性紀錄，R 有後續檢查，MATLAB 則有已歸檔的包裝器缺陷、且未聲稱有新的一致性驗證。API 金鑰帶 cern_live_ 前綴、只儲存 SHA-256 摘要，具兩種範圍（read、design）、有效期限、撤銷機制，預設每分鐘 60 次請求與兩個並行執行；屬於其他帳號的物件會回傳 404，而不是確認它存在。嚴格的提交模式會以結構化的 422 與建議拒絕拼錯的限制鍵，而不是悄悄套用預設值；而在同一個 API 綱要版本內，相容性承諾明訂為「僅增不減」。格式方面：輸入為 RNA 序列與差異表現表格、可帶入自訂 GenBank 骨架；輸出為 FASTA、帶註解的 GenBank、SBOL 3（保留序列特徵、部件角色與來源資訊）與 CSV，GenBank 由 Biopython 處理、熱力學由 ViennaRNA 處理。有兩點不尋常。第一，生物安全是接進管線內部、而非事後外掛：整合 IBBIS Common Mechanism（HMM 序列輪廓模型加上相似度搜尋）篩查最終開關與組裝完成的構築，並在篩查證據不可得或未釐清時扣住序列匯出；wiki 也明言，一次扣住並不等於一次完成的篩查。第二，團隊在專節中把科學運算與 AI 輔助開發分開並明白說出：經審查的執行環境不含任何生成式 AI、LLM、神經網路、訓練好的分類器或遠端推論服務，Python 與 JavaScript 的相依清單中沒有任何 AI 推論 SDK，設計執行也不會把生物資料送到任何 AI 供應商；而介面設計、寫程式與文件撰寫中使用的 AI 協助則記錄在貢獻聲明裡。可重現性的處理方式是發布一份固定的 7.1 MiB 原始碼快照（修訂版 9a5ca657）與檢查碼清單，並坦言在查核時這個修訂版並不在公開程式庫上、公開程式庫可能含有不同修訂版，因此該快照並不取代公開程式庫。文件分層：公開文件索引、架構圖、科學運算引擎的模組地圖、產生到一個已版控檔案中的 API 參考（附偵測漂移的新鮮度測試）、決策紀錄（包括選擇 SBOL 3 的那一則）、跨元件資料的型別契約與 docstring，以及給新貢獻者的程式庫導覽。對只想取用其中一部分的隊伍，他們指名提供四個可重用的接點：引擎契約、閘家族掛鉤、評分層與視窗工具。程式庫：https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/tau-israel/cernal 。另有託管部署於 https://cernal.app （以及同一主機的 cernal.duckdns.org），但有存取限制，wiki 說明需以實驗室帳號登入或申請權限，而查核時該主機沒有回應，因此可靠的路徑是已發布的原始碼快照加上本機安裝。上游來源的歸屬也保持明確：一份獨立的真核 AND 研究筆記本讀取自第三方 NucSyn Platform 匯出的排序 CSV，而 wiki 明言正式環境的引擎既不呼叫也不包裝 NucSyn，兩套分數也維持區分。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"The team ran a Mini-Jamboree where CERNAL was demonstrated live to other iGEM teams and then surveyed the participants (7 responses): all agreed synthetic biology lacks a generalizable approach for designing intracellular circuits responding to user-defined stimuli, 71.4% said they would use such a tool during iGEM and 85.7% afterwards, with interest spread across biosensing (57.1%), cell engineering (57.1%), and diagnostics, therapeutics and environmental sensing (28.6% each). The team states plainly that this is a directional signal from a small, self-selected group of peers and not market evidence, and that its value is that the demand they claim was checked with outside users rather than asserted. AIS-China was given the interface to use and returned three concrete usability fixes that the team adopted: clearer placement of downloads, a more prominent New Circuit entry point, and meaningful run names. A video walkthrough, in-app FAQ and public FAQ source support new users.","ihp":"Human practices operated under a stated 'Responsibility-by-Design' philosophy whose point was to turn the phrase into constraints. Patient accounts set the design goal: Shir Parchef waited 18 years for an endometriosis diagnosis and underwent an 11-hour procedure with six surgeons; Netta Ben Moshe was told incapacitating pain was ordinary cramps; Helen Altschuler described patients' willingness to support research because so little else exists. From these the team set the target as eliminating pathology rather than masking symptoms, and without systemic hormonal ablation. Dr. Berkowitz told them a therapy that shrinks lesions without relieving pain or preserving fertility has no clinical utility, which made them stratify AREG and SELE across both superficial peritoneal and deep ovarian lesions so the logic covers the 'invisible' lesions driving the worst pain rather than only what imaging shows. Several loops closed by narrowing the claim rather than widening it: after input from Dr. Berman the PFAS biosensor is positioned as a low-cost triage tool that prioritises which of Israel's hundreds of wells need urgent lab testing, explicitly not a replacement for LC-MS, and the team states it has not solved RNA delivery. Conversations with Neta Agmon about practical inputs and outputs and with AIS-China about user workflow shaped which interfaces were documented for reuse.","realWorld":"A provisional patent application was filed through Tel Aviv University's technology transfer office. The market case is built from Alliance for Regenerative Medicine sector data: 1,089 commercial cell and gene therapy developers in a US$1.7B total addressable market, of which 553-731 use genetic modification, and applying a stated 30% in-house design assumption gives a beachhead of 166-219 accounts worth US$0.25-0.33B, with four organisations shortlisted for first contact and HEK293/HEK293T chosen as the entry cell line because it is widely used in industry. The competitive positioning is specific rather than dismissive: Cello 2.0 maps circuit specifications to characterised parts and Asimov Kernel provides construct design, simulation and workflow tools, but both depend on predefined specifications, characterised parts or host-specific workflows, whereas CERNAL starts from transcriptomic state; the wiki notes these citations support design context and are not an absolute claim that no competing route exists. The MVP is a 5-10 week design-partner cycle from discovery to structured feedback, and the team reports CERNAL has already produced 730 E. coli and 110 yeast circuit candidates as a routine pipeline rather than a demo.","partners":["Tel Aviv University technology transfer office","endometriosis patients and advocates (Shir Parchef, Netta Ben Moshe, Helen Altschuler)","clinicians (Dr. Berkowitz)","water-research and PFAS analysis experts (Dr. Berman)","AIS-China (interface user testing)","Neta Agmon","IBBIS (Common Mechanism screening)","NucSyn Platform (upstream, offline data interface)","Alliance for Regenerative Medicine (market data)"],"publicEngagement_zh":"團隊辦了一場 Mini-Jamboree，向其他 iGEM 隊伍現場示範 CERNAL，並對參與者做問卷（7 份回覆）：所有人都同意合成生物學缺少一套可通用的方法來設計回應使用者自訂刺激的細胞內迴路，71.4% 表示會在 iGEM 期間使用這樣的工具、85.7% 表示在 iGEM 之後會使用，興趣分布於生物感測（57.1%）、細胞工程（57.1%），以及診斷、治療與環境感測（各 28.6%）。團隊直言這只是來自一小群自我選擇的同儕的方向性訊號，不是市場證據，其價值在於他們所宣稱的需求是向外部使用者查核過的，而不是自己斷言的。他們把介面交給 AIS-China 實際使用，對方回報了三項具體的易用性修正並被採納：下載位置更清楚、New Circuit 入口更顯眼、執行名稱要有意義。另有影片導覽、應用程式內 FAQ 與公開 FAQ 原始檔支援新使用者。","ihp_zh":"人類實踐以明確宣示的「Responsibility-by-Design」哲學運作，其重點是把這個詞變成實際的約束條件。病患的敘述設定了設計目標：Shir Parchef 等了 18 年才確診子宮內膜異位症，並接受一場由六名外科醫師進行、長達 11 小時的手術；Netta Ben Moshe 被告知那種使人無法行動的疼痛只是普通經痛；Helen Altschuler 描述病患之所以願意支持研究，是因為其他選擇實在太少。由此團隊把目標設定為消除病理本身而非掩蓋症狀，且不訴諸全身性的荷爾蒙抑制。Dr. Berkowitz 告訴他們，一種能縮小病灶但不能緩解疼痛、也不能保全生育力的療法在臨床上沒有用處，於是他們把 AREG 與 SELE 同時依腹膜淺層與卵巢深層病灶分層，讓邏輯涵蓋那些造成最嚴重疼痛、卻「看不見」的病灶，而不只是影像上顯示的部分。有幾個迴圈是以收窄主張而非擴大主張來閉合的：在 Dr. Berman 提供意見後，PFAS 生物感測器被定位為低成本的初篩工具，用來判斷以色列數百口井中哪些需要緊急送實驗室檢驗，明確不是 LC-MS 的替代品；團隊也聲明自己並未解決 RNA 遞送問題。與 Neta Agmon 關於實務輸入與輸出的討論，以及與 AIS-China 關於使用者工作流程的交流，則決定了哪些介面會被寫成可重用的文件。","realWorld_zh":"團隊透過台拉維夫大學技術移轉辦公室提出臨時專利申請。市場論證建立在 Alliance for Regenerative Medicine 的產業資料上：1,089 家商業化細胞與基因治療開發商、總可觸及市場 17 億美元，其中 553-731 家使用基因改造；再套用明確標示的「30% 自行設計」假設，得到 166-219 個客戶的灘頭市場、價值 2.5-3.3 億美元，並列出四個優先接洽的組織；入門細胞株選擇 HEK293/HEK293T，因為它在產業中廣泛使用。競爭定位具體而不輕蔑：Cello 2.0 把迴路規格對映到已鑑定部件，Asimov Kernel 提供構築設計、模擬與工作流程工具，但兩者都依賴預先定義的規格、已鑑定部件或特定宿主的流程，而 CERNAL 的起點是轉錄體狀態；wiki 也註明這些引用是用來支撐設計脈絡，並非絕對主張「不存在任何競爭路徑」。MVP 是一個 5-10 週的設計夥伴循環，從探索到結構化回饋；團隊並報告 CERNAL 已以常規管線（而非示範）產出 730 個 E. coli 與 110 個酵母迴路候選。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6196/wiki/software/01-inputs.avif?v=4","caption":"CERNAL's Inputs panel: E. coli selected as host and a 711-nucleotide mCherry transcript entered as a Direct Trigger mRNA, from the recorded five-step walkthrough.","credit":"Team TAU-Israel, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"CERNAL 的輸入面板：選定 E. coli 為宿主，並輸入一段 711 個核苷酸的 mCherry 轉錄本作為 Direct Trigger mRNA，取自那段錄製的五步驟導覽。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6196/wiki/software/cernal-s03-generated-v1.webp","caption":"The three decisions behind one RNA design: recognition-site selection, compatible switch design and comparison, with host experiments and not computation establishing function.","credit":"Team TAU-Israel, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"一個 RNA 設計背後的三項決策：辨識位點選擇、相容開關設計與比較，並明示功能是由宿主實驗、而非計算所確立。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6196/wiki/software/cernal-s19-generated-v1.webp","caption":"The engine/platform boundary: the engine takes a versioned request and returns candidates plus an artifact manifest, with a source-level import test enforcing the separation.","credit":"Team TAU-Israel, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"引擎與平台的界線：引擎接受一個版本化的請求，回傳候選設計加上一份產物清單，並以原始碼層級的 import 測試強制這道分隔。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6196/wiki/software/cernal-s21-generated-v1.webp","caption":"The automation surface: query the version endpoint for capabilities, submit a design once, keep the job handle, poll status, inspect results and request only permitted files.","credit":"Team TAU-Israel, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"自動化介面：先向 version 端點查詢能力，提交設計一次，保留工作代號，輪詢狀態，檢視結果，並只索取被允許的檔案。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Build the scientific engine as a package that cannot import the web framework, the database or the settings, and enforce it with an automated import test, so the science can be run, tested and reused headlessly and the UI is only one of three front ends. Then adopt their reporting discipline: label every capability Implemented, Conditional or Incomplete, never score a missing measurement as zero, publish a recorded run that includes the step where it failed, and keep AI-assisted development in the attribution record and out of the scientific runtime.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/tau-israel/","https://2026.igem.wiki/tau-israel/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/tau-israel/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/tau-israel/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/tau-israel/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/tau-israel/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/tau-israel/contribution","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/tau-israel/cernal","https://cernal.app"],"projectTitle_zh":"CERNAL","tagline_zh":"一個生物編譯器：輸入 RNA 表現資料，得到排序後的 RNA 邏輯閘迴路設計，只在你指定的細胞狀態下啟動。","summary_zh":"CERNAL 把轉錄體當成細胞狀態的指紋，並把這個指紋編譯成 RNA 邏輯迴路：它挑出能把目標細胞與鄰近細胞區分開來的轉錄本，掃描每個轉錄本尋找可及、專一且可建構的觸發視窗，設計 toehold 式開關——其髮夾結構會把核醣體結合位藏起來，直到觸發序列把它拉開——再把多個開關組合成 AND 與 NOT 閘，以共用的熱力學指標為每個候選排序，最後把勝出者組裝成帶註解的質體。由於感測元件是細胞自身的 RNA 而非已鑑定的轉錄因子，這套方法的設計意圖是與宿主無關，團隊也以三個概念驗證示範：HEK293T 中的子宮內膜異位症邏輯、E. coli 中的 PFOA/PFAS 生物感測器，以及酵母中的 CRISPRa 閘。軟體是一個 Django Ninja + React 19 應用程式，具嚴格隔離的科學運算引擎、版本化的 HTTP API（附 Python、R 與 MATLAB 客戶端）、SBOL 3 匯出，以及一道 IBBIS Common Mechanism 生物安全閘門——在篩查無法完成時扣住序列檔案不放。團隊透過台拉維夫大學技轉辦公室提出臨時專利申請，並圍繞細胞與基因治療開發商建立了完整的市場論證。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把科學運算引擎做成一個不能 import 網頁框架、資料庫或設定檔的套件，並以自動化的 import 測試強制執行，讓科學部分能在無介面的情況下執行、測試與重用，而 UI 只是三個前端之一。接著採用他們的報告紀律：把每項能力標示為已實作、有條件或未完成；絕不把缺少的量測計為零；公開一次連失敗步驟一起呈現的錄製執行；並把 AI 輔助開發留在貢獻聲明中、排除在科學執行環境之外。","awards_zh":["最佳軟體 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"rank":7},"6197":{"team":"HangzhouFourteenAP","id":"6197","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Space, Foundational Advance, Software & AI, Biomanufacturing","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/","projectTitle":"DCO (Dental Calculus Obstructor)","projectTitle_zh":"DCO (Dental Calculus Obstructor)","tagline":"A four-enzyme cocktail plus a hydroxyapatite-binding antimicrobial peptide coating that dismantles dental plaque biofilm before it mineralises into calculus.","tagline_zh":"四種酵素的組合，加上一層會結合羥基磷灰石的抗菌胜肽塗層，在牙菌斑生物膜礦化成牙結石之前就把它拆掉。","summary":"DCO is a three-module biological oral care system: an enzyme cocktail that degrades the organic matrix holding plaque biofilm together, a tooth-binding antimicrobial peptide that coats enamel to block re-colonisation, and a controlled-release system to coordinate them. The enzymes are two recombinantly expressed glycoside hydrolases — PmGH87 (alpha-1,3-glucanase) and CoGH66 (alpha-1,6-glucanase), which act cooperatively because CoGH66 removes alpha-1,6 branches and exposes new PmGH87 cleavage sites — plus commercially sourced DNase I and papain for extracellular DNA and protein. It addresses a real and specific burden: 96.7% of Chinese adults aged 35-44 have dental calculus, over 900 million have periodontal disease, only 20.1% of elderly people saw a dentist in the past year, and the dentist-to-population ratio is about 1:7,768. It won Best Village Project on a tight problem-to-product chain, a FoldX mutation-prioritisation pipeline whose prediction was wrong and whose failure is reported in full, and an unusually commercially literate entrepreneurship section that refuses to make anti-calculus claims it cannot support.","summary_zh":"DCO 是一套三模組的生物性口腔照護系統：一組分解牙菌斑生物膜有機基質的酵素組合、一種會結合牙面、覆蓋琺瑯質以阻止細菌重新定殖的抗菌胜肽，以及一套協調兩者的控制釋放系統。酵素包含兩種以重組方式表現的醣苷水解酶——PmGH87（alpha-1,3-葡聚醣酶）與 CoGH66（alpha-1,6-葡聚醣酶），兩者具協同作用，因為 CoGH66 會移除 alpha-1,6 分支、露出新的 PmGH87 切割位——再加上市購的 DNase I 與木瓜酵素，分別處理胞外 DNA 與蛋白質。它針對的是真實而具體的負擔：中國 35-44 歲成人有 96.7% 有牙結石、超過 9 億人有牙周疾病、過去一年只有 20.1% 的高齡者看過牙醫，而牙醫與人口比約為 1:7,768。它拿下 Best Village Project，靠的是一條從問題到產品的緊密鏈條、一套預測錯了卻把失敗完整報出來的 FoldX 突變優先排序流程，以及一份罕見具商業素養、而且拒絕提出自己支持不了的抑制牙結石主張的創業章節。","awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best Measurement — Nominee (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Winner (Space / Foundational Advance / Software & AI / Biomanufacturing)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Two computational pipelines, both modest in tooling but well-reasoned and, importantly, both reported against their experimental outcome. (1) A CoGH66 mutation prioritisation pipeline built to avoid screening hundreds of mutants in the wet lab. Starting from the substrate-bound structure PDB 8IUB (CoGH66 with isomaltotriose bound, so no re-docking was needed), they used PyMOL to extract all protein residues within 4.0 A of the substrate, giving an 18-residue binding pocket (Y166, D167, Q169, Q172, I190, Y217, L219, H250, L252, F256, I260, D293, L295, N395, K429, E430, Y431, N434) consistent with the published catalytic cleft and +2 to -4 subsites. Domain annotation came from CD-Search (Glyco_hydro_66 at residues 22-560, E-value 0) and InterPro (glycosidases at 104-440), with sequence translation via Novopro. They then layered evolutionary information: BLASTp against the NCBI non-redundant protein database, deliberately selecting homologs from different bacterial species at 30-70% identity to avoid over-representing near-identical sequences and to capture naturally tolerated substitutions, aligned with MAFFT and visualised as an ESPript conservation map. Of the 18 contact residues, seven (Y166, Q169, Q172, I190, H250, N395, K429) showed species-specific natural substitutions and were taken as plastic; the remaining eleven were conserved and deliberately left alone. Mutants were built in PyMOL, repaired and scored in FoldX for both stability change and binding change, with an operational priority threshold of binding delta-delta-G < -1 kcal/mol chosen explicitly because it exceeds typical FoldX error. (2) Antimicrobial peptide selection: after a literature review identified four hydroxyapatite-binding AMP candidates, they used AlphaFold Server to predict peptide-calcium ion coordination as a first computational filter, reasoning that hydroxyapatite presents Ca2+ as the primary interaction site, and ranked candidates by pTM and interface pTM (ipTM) scores. SHABP (21 aa, cyclic and disulfide-constrained) and G12R (18 aa, linear alpha-helical) both reached pTM around 0.4, above DNase-fused and HBAMP alternatives, and both were advanced into parallel experimental validation on the grounds of their distinct structural strategies (conformational stability versus membrane disruption).","frameworks_zh":"兩條計算流程，工具都不花俏，但論理紮實，而且重要的是兩條都對照了自己的實驗結果來報告。(1) 一條 CoGH66 突變優先排序流程，目的是避免在濕實驗裡篩選上百個突變體。他們從帶受質的結構 PDB 8IUB 出發（CoGH66 結合 isomaltotriose，所以不需要重新對接），用 PyMOL 取出所有距受質 4.0 A 以內的蛋白質殘基，得到一個 18 個殘基的結合口袋（Y166、D167、Q169、Q172、I190、Y217、L219、H250、L252、F256、I260、D293、L295、N395、K429、E430、Y431、N434），與已發表的催化裂隙及 +2 到 -4 亞位點一致。結構域註解來自 CD-Search（Glyco_hydro_66 位於殘基 22-560，E-value 0）與 InterPro（glycosidases 位於 104-440），序列轉譯用 Novopro。接著他們疊上演化資訊：以 BLASTp 搜尋 NCBI 非冗餘蛋白質資料庫，刻意挑選不同細菌物種、相似度 30-70% 的同源序列，以避免幾乎相同的序列被過度代表，並捕捉自然界能容忍的取代；再以 MAFFT 對齊，並以 ESPript 繪成保守性圖。18 個接觸殘基中有七個（Y166、Q169、Q172、I190、H250、N395、K429）出現物種間的自然取代，被視為可變動的；其餘十一個是保守的，刻意不動。突變體在 PyMOL 建模，在 FoldX 中修復並同時對穩定性變化與結合變化計分，並設定一個可操作的優先門檻：結合 delta-delta-G < -1 kcal/mol，選這個值的理由寫得很明白——它超過 FoldX 的典型誤差。(2) 抗菌胜肽的選擇：文獻回顧找出四個會結合羥基磷灰石的 AMP 候選後，他們用 AlphaFold Server 預測胜肽與鈣離子的配位，作為第一道計算篩選，理由是羥基磷灰石主要以 Ca2+ 作為交互作用位點，並以 pTM 與介面 pTM（ipTM）分數為候選排序。SHABP（21 個胺基酸，環狀且由雙硫鍵限制構形）與 G12R（18 個胺基酸，線性 alpha 螺旋）的 pTM 都達到約 0.4，高於融合 DNase 的版本與 HBAMP，兩者都被推進平行的實驗驗證，理由是它們採取的結構策略不同（構形穩定性對上膜破壞）。","dataviz":"The model page leads with a schematic workflow diagram of the whole mutation-prioritisation pipeline, so the logic from structure to alignment to energy calculation is readable before any numbers appear, and ends with a three-dimensional localisation figure placing the two prioritised positions in the pocket (protein green, mutated positions red with arrows, substrate yellow, other 4.0 A contacts cyan). The genuinely notable choice is an interactive 3D model of the CoGH66-isomaltotriose complex embedded in the wiki as a glTF file exported from PyMOL, so a reader can rotate the enzyme and inspect the contact residues rather than squint at a static render — a cheap but effective way to make a structural argument inspectable. Tables carry the natural substitutions observed per non-conserved position with counts, and the full FoldX energy results for every tested mutant rather than only the winners. Measurement figures pair the physical artefact with its quantification throughout: a 96-well plate photograph alongside the bar chart derived from it for the DNS reducing-sugar assay, the crystal violet extracts, and the acridine orange fluorescence images with the ImageJ intensity quantification in the identical group order so the reader can check the numbers against the wells. Standard curves are shown with their regression equations and R2 values (BCA at Y = 0.8964X - 0.2574, R2 = 0.9951).","dataviz_zh":"模型頁以整條突變優先排序流程的示意圖開場，因此從結構到序列對齊再到能量計算的邏輯，在任何數字出現之前就讀得懂；頁尾則是一張三維定位圖，把兩個被優先的位置放進口袋裡（蛋白質綠色，突變位置紅色並加箭頭，受質黃色，其他 4.0 A 接觸殘基青色）。真正值得注意的選擇，是把 CoGH66-isomaltotriose 複合體的互動式 3D 模型以 PyMOL 匯出的 glTF 檔嵌進 wiki，讀者因此可以自己轉動酵素、檢視接觸殘基，而不是瞇著眼看一張靜態渲染圖——這是一個便宜但有效的做法，讓結構論證變得可檢視。表格列出每個非保守位置觀察到的自然取代及其出現次數，並給出所有測試突變體的完整 FoldX 能量結果，而不是只列贏家。量測的圖表則一貫地把實體成品與其量化結果配成一組：DNS 還原糖分析的 96 孔盤照片旁邊就是由它導出的柱狀圖，結晶紫萃取液也是，而吖啶橙螢光影像與 ImageJ 的強度量化更採完全相同的分組順序，讓讀者可以拿數字去對孔位。標準曲線都附上迴歸式與 R2 值（BCA 為 Y = 0.8964X - 0.2574，R2 = 0.9951）。","datascience":"The most valuable dry-lab content is a documented computational failure. The pipeline predicted Y166Q as the top candidate (the only mutant meeting the -1 kcal/mol binding threshold, at -1.63 kcal/mol) with Q172P as a secondary candidate retained despite only -0.38 kcal/mol because of its predicted stabilising effect and natural occurrence in homologs. Site-directed mutagenesis (reverse PCR with back-to-back mutation-carrying primers, DpnI digestion of methylated parental template, self-ligation), colony PCR at the expected ~1726 bp, and Sanger sequencing confirmed both constructs (Y166Q TAC to CAG; Q172P CAG to CCG). The DNS activity assay then inverted the ranking: Q172P gave the highest apparent activity at net OD 1.881, wild type 0.996, and Y166Q only 0.629 — the computational winner was worse than wild type. The team's response is the right one: they revised the ranking in the text, named Q172P the leading experimental candidate, reclassified Y166Q as a mechanistic probe rather than quietly dropping it, and had already flagged in advance that Q172P introduces a proline and may alter main-chain conformation so its FoldX estimate should be read with caution. They also controlled the comparison properly rather than letting protein load explain the result: BCA quantification gave WT 12.1, Y166Q 10.9 and Q172P 9.1 microgram/mL, crude lysates were normalised to equal total protein before the DNS assay, and the wiki explicitly notes that Q172P's lower total protein means its activity signal cannot be attributed to a higher load. The measurement work on the artificial dental calculus model is similarly self-critical. Gravimetric analysis of six treatment conditions (negative control, four single-component omissions, complete cocktail) found no significant weight-loss differences, and the team attributed this to balance sensitivity and to non-uniform mineralisation producing variability that masked the effect, then moved to more sensitive assays rather than reporting a null as a result. Crystal violet quantification at OD gave the complete cocktail a significant reduction against the negative control (p < 0.05), with the papain-omission comparison reported honestly as a trend toward significance at p = 0.08 and interpreted as papain playing a supporting rather than dominant role under single-treatment conditions. Acridine orange fluorescence with ImageJ quantification showed significance against the negative control and against the DNase-I-omission group, supporting the mechanistic model that eDNA cleavage lets the other enzymes penetrate, while the overall small between-group differences led them to conclude that the primary mode of action is structural matrix dismantling rather than direct bactericidal potency. Limitations are stated plainly, including that the B. subtilis surrogate model does not replicate the Streptococcus mutans-specific EPS composition the glucanases actually target. The AlphaFold peptide screen also carries its own caveat: the team notes that peptide-Ca2+ coordination cannot fully replicate crystal-surface binding, that pTM around 0.4 indicates only moderate confidence, and that the scores were used for relative ranking rather than as affinity estimates.","datascience_zh":"最有價值的乾實驗內容是一次有紀錄的計算失敗。流程預測 Y166Q 為首選（唯一達到 -1 kcal/mol 結合門檻的突變體，為 -1.63 kcal/mol），Q172P 雖只有 -0.38 kcal/mol 仍被保留為次要候選，理由是它預測具穩定化效果且在同源序列中天然出現。定點突變（以背對背帶突變引子的反向 PCR、DpnI 切除甲基化的親代模板、再自我接合）、預期約 1726 bp 的菌落 PCR，以及 Sanger 定序都確認了兩個構築體（Y166Q TAC 改為 CAG；Q172P CAG 改為 CCG）。接著 DNS 活性分析把排序翻了過來：Q172P 的表觀活性最高，淨 OD 1.881，野生型 0.996，而 Y166Q 只有 0.629——計算上的贏家比野生型還差。團隊的回應是對的：他們在正文中修正排序、把 Q172P 定為實驗上的領先候選，並把 Y166Q 重新歸類為機制探針，而不是悄悄把它丟掉；而且他們事前就已標註 Q172P 引入一個脯胺酸、可能改變主鏈構形，因此它的 FoldX 估計值應保留地讀。他們也把比較控制好，沒有讓蛋白質上樣量來解釋結果：BCA 定量得到 WT 12.1、Y166Q 10.9、Q172P 9.1 microgram/mL，粗萃液在 DNS 分析前已正規化到相同總蛋白量，而 wiki 也明白指出 Q172P 的總蛋白較低，所以它的活性訊號不能歸因於上樣量較高。人工牙結石模型上的量測工作同樣自我批判。六種處理條件（陰性對照、四組各缺一種成分、完整組合）的重量分析沒有找出顯著的失重差異，團隊把原因歸於天平靈敏度與礦化不均造成的變異掩蓋了效應，接著改用更靈敏的分析方法，而不是把一個無顯著結果當成結論報出來。以 OD 做的結晶紫定量顯示完整組合相對陰性對照有顯著下降（p < 0.05），而缺木瓜酵素那組的比較則誠實報為「趨近顯著」的 p = 0.08，並解讀為在單次處理條件下，木瓜酵素扮演的是輔助而非主導角色。吖啶橙螢光搭配 ImageJ 定量顯示相對於陰性對照與缺 DNase I 組都有顯著差異，支持「切斷 eDNA 能讓其他酵素滲透進去」這個機制模型；而組間整體差異偏小，則讓他們得出結論：主要作用模式是結構性地拆解基質，而不是直接的殺菌力。限制也寫得很白，包括 B. subtilis 替代模型並不能複製葡聚醣酶實際針對的 Streptococcus mutans 特有 EPS 組成。AlphaFold 的胜肽篩選也帶著自己的保留：團隊指出胜肽與 Ca2+ 的配位無法完全複製晶體表面的結合、pTM 約 0.4 只代表中等信心，而這些分數是用來做相對排序，而不是當成親和力估計值。","software":"No standalone released software tool; the dry lab is a documented analysis pipeline rather than a product, and the wiki itself is a React/Vite single-page application with GSAP animation. Released reusable resources instead: the full mutation-prioritisation methodology as a reproducible protocol, the interactive glTF structural model, PDF slide decks for all four education audiences (two elementary sessions dated 5-28 and 6-11, a high school deck, and an elderly-residents deck), a consolidated enzyme stabilisation and controlled-release guide offered as a generalised framework for multi-enzyme formulations across biocatalysis, food processing and environmental remediation, and a 'lessons learned for future iGEM teams' section. Constructs were expressed from codon-optimised genes in pET-32a via seamless cloning, carrying an N-terminal thioredoxin (TrxA) tag for soluble expression, a 6xHis tag for IMAC purification and an enterokinase site for optional tag removal, under T7 promoter control in E. coli Rosetta(DE3), with CoGH66 confirmed at approximately 76.54 kDa. The team also documented a safety-driven substitution they consulted the iGEM committee about: because Streptococcus mutans is not on the iGEM White List they used B. subtilis as a surrogate in the artificial calculus model, and because Aspergillus niger is not listed they used commercially available edible fungi as a material source.","software_zh":"沒有獨立釋出的軟體工具；乾實驗是一條有紀錄的分析流程，而不是一項產品，而 wiki 本身是以 React/Vite 寫成、帶 GSAP 動畫的單頁應用程式。釋出的反而是可重複使用的資源：整套突變優先排序方法學寫成可重現的協議、互動式 glTF 結構模型、四種教育對象的 PDF 簡報（兩場國小場次，日期為 5-28 與 6-11、一份高中簡報、一份長者住民簡報）、一份整合的酵素穩定化與控制釋放指南（以通用框架的形式提出，可用於生物催化、食品加工與環境復育等領域的多酵素配方），以及一節「給未來 iGEM 團隊的經驗教訓」。構築體以密碼子最佳化的基因、透過無縫選殖放入 pET-32a，帶 N 端硫氧化還原蛋白（TrxA）標籤以利可溶性表現、6xHis 標籤供 IMAC 純化，以及一個腸激酶切位可選擇性移除標籤，在 E. coli Rosetta(DE3) 中由 T7 啟動子驅動，CoGH66 經確認約為 76.54 kDa。團隊也記錄了一項出於安全、並向 iGEM 委員會諮詢過的替換：因為 Streptococcus mutans 不在 iGEM White List 上，他們在人工牙結石模型中以 B. subtilis 作為替代菌；又因為 Aspergillus niger 未列入，他們改以市售食用真菌作為材料來源。","stack":["PyMOL","FoldX","MAFFT","ESPript","BLASTp / NCBI non-redundant database","NCBI CD-Search","InterPro","AlphaFold Server (pTM / ipTM)","glTF (interactive 3D export)","ImageJ","PDB 8IUB","Novopro translation tool","DNS (3,5-dinitrosalicylic acid) reducing-sugar assay","BCA protein quantification","crystal violet biofilm quantification","acridine orange fluorescence microscopy","pET-32a / E. coli Rosetta(DE3)","React + Vite + GSAP (wiki)"],"techniques":["structure-guided binding-pocket contact extraction at 4.0 A","evolutionary tolerance filtering via homolog MSA conservation mapping","FoldX delta-delta-G stability and binding energy calculation with a pre-set error-aware threshold","reporting a failed computational prediction and reclassifying the candidate as a mechanistic probe","total-protein normalisation before activity comparison (BCA then equal-load DNS)","site-directed mutagenesis by reverse PCR with DpnI selection and self-ligation","Sanger sequencing verification of point mutations","single-component omission (leave-one-out) assay design to test synergy","escalation from an insensitive assay (gravimetry) to more sensitive orthogonal assays","Student's t-test with reported non-significant and borderline p values","AlphaFold interface confidence scores for relative peptide ranking","White List-driven surrogate organism substitution with committee consultation"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Four-tier education (primary school, high school, elderly residents, general public) with the explicit design principle that they did not just teach knowledge but recorded what changed after participants went home — brushing, flossing, denture care, diet, dental visits and attitudes toward synthetic biology. The best single tool is a tangible genetic circuit built from electronic building blocks: a touch sensor stands for the promoter, a toggle switch module for the lac operator, a button for lactose as inducer, an LED for the RBS, a small fan for the target gene and a manual power-off switch for the terminator, so children physically discover that touching the sensor alone does nothing because the operator blocks by default, and that the circuit only runs when the inducer is held. For younger children they wrote child-friendly science comics and ran plaque disclosing tablets as a reveal — children chewed the tablets, rinsed, saw red and blue patches on their own teeth, were asked to guess and ask questions first, and were then shown microscope images with the framing 'this is not dirt, this is a city'. The team records the emotional shift honestly: children moved from fearing bacteria to being curious about them and from passive listening to asking and designing. High school sessions used a full script and deck covering project background, enzyme mechanism, experimental process and application value, and specifically targeted the soft-plaque-versus-hard-calculus confusion. The nursing home session simplified everything into plain language and images and delivered concretely actionable care: a soft-bristled small-headed brush at 45 degrees to the gumline, gentle brushing with no horizontal scrubbing, bedtime brushing more important than morning, floss or interdental brushes rather than toothpicks, and denture care rules (rinse after meals, remove and soak overnight, never boiling water, never toothpaste, never sleep in them), with the explicit disclaimer that this is science communication and does not replace professional dental advice. Public outreach at Wushan Square used display boards, roll-up banners, hand fans and leaflets on plaque versus calculus and scaling misconceptions.","publicEngagement_zh":"四層教育（國小、高中、長者住民、一般大眾），並明確以一條設計原則貫穿：他們不只教知識，還記錄參與者回家之後改變了什麼——刷牙、使用牙線、假牙照護、飲食、看牙醫，以及對合成生物學的態度。最好的單一教具是用電子積木搭出來的實體基因迴路：觸控感測器代表啟動子、切換開關模組代表 lac 操作子、按鈕代表作為誘導物的乳糖、LED 代表 RBS、小風扇代表目標基因、手動電源開關代表終止子，孩子因此能親手發現：只碰感測器沒有用，因為操作子預設是阻斷的；只有一直按住誘導物，迴路才會運轉。針對更小的孩子，他們寫了適合兒童的科普漫畫，並用牙菌斑顯示劑做揭曉：孩子嚼下顯示劑、漱口，看見自己牙齒上的紅藍斑塊，先被要求猜測與提問，然後才看顯微影像，搭配一句定調的話——「這不是髒東西，這是一座城市」。團隊誠實記下情緒上的轉變：孩子從怕細菌變成對細菌好奇，從被動聽講變成會問、會設計。高中場次使用完整的腳本與簡報，涵蓋專案背景、酵素機制、實驗流程與應用價值，並特別針對「軟的牙菌斑」與「硬的牙結石」這個常見混淆。養護機構的場次把一切簡化成白話與圖像，並給出具體可執行的照護：軟毛小頭牙刷、與牙齦線成 45 度、輕刷不橫向來回、睡前刷牙比早上更重要、用牙線或牙間刷而不要用牙籤，以及假牙照護規則（餐後沖洗、夜間取下浸泡、絕不用滾水、絕不用牙膏、絕不戴著睡），並明確聲明這是科學傳播，不能取代專業牙醫建議。在吳山廣場的公眾推廣則用展示板、立式海報、扇子與傳單，說明牙菌斑與牙結石的差別以及洗牙的常見誤解。","ihp":"Twelve named advisors spanning clinical dentistry, periodontics, microbial control, pharmaceutics, gene circuit regulation, management and marketing, and oral care product regulatory and quality management, engaged in a staged problem-framing process. Problem framing combined a 350-respondent user questionnaire, an in-depth clinical interview with Dr. Lei Lihong (Second Affiliated Hospital, Zhejiang University School of Medicine) and an industry interview with Mr. Fan Wenjun (healthcare investment), triangulated against the Fourth National Oral Health Epidemiological Survey specifically to avoid bias from a single interview source. The survey quantified both misconception and the knowing-doing gap: 61% worry that scaling damages enamel, 23% believe brushing removes calculus, only 6% claim to fully understand it; and separately, 52% know calculus forms at the gingival margin and in deep interdental spaces but only 25% floss or use an irrigator daily, 48% know brushing cannot remove calculus but only 38% get scaling once or twice a year, and 84% know calculus causes periodontitis but only 25% have a six-monthly examination. The project-defining intervention came from Dr. Wang Yongwu (Hangzhou First People's Hospital), who said that using enzymes to dissolve already-mineralised calculus is 'like an egg hitting a stone' — and the team did not just accept the efficacy point but derived a safety consequence from it: because calculus and enamel and dentin are both calcium phosphate mineralised tissues, any non-selective demineralising agent would risk enamel or dentin demineralisation, sensitivity or erosion. That reframed the entire target from mineralised calculus to the organic matrix of the early pre-mineralisation biofilm, which is the intervention window the whole project now occupies. Dr. Lei and Dr. Yuan Yifang (Affiliated Stomatological Hospital of Zhejiang Chinese Medical University) corroborated it and specified what to attack: the polysaccharide-protein cross-linking and the stabilising role of eDNA that together hold the biofilm's three-dimensional structure against salivary washing. Four design constraints emerged from the interview set — efficacy validation, penetration ability, cytotoxicity safety and stability assurance — which became the selection criteria for the enzyme cocktail and delivery system. A second concrete pivot: experts pointed out that enzymatic removal does not prevent recolonisation because salivary proteins form a pellicle within minutes, which is why the hydroxyapatite-binding AMP module exists at all; the computational peptide screen was conducted on their explicit recommendation. A third: on discovering that bovine pancreatic DNase I is already commercially available at roughly 80-160 yuan per 100 mg and widely used, they strategically stopped trying to recombinantly express it and concentrated the synthetic biology effort on the glycoside hydrolases where the EPS matrix offered a real opportunity. Dr. Lei also set a boundary the team kept: any active ingredient in a daily product must be safe and must not disrupt the normal oral microbiome or damage soft tissues.","ihp_zh":"十二位具名顧問，橫跨臨床牙科、牙周病學、微生物控制、藥劑學、基因迴路調控、經營與行銷，以及口腔照護產品的法規與品質管理，並以分階段的問題界定流程進行。問題界定結合一份 350 人的使用者問卷、一場與 Dr. Lei Lihong（浙江大學醫學院附屬第二醫院）的深度臨床訪談，以及一場與 Mr. Fan Wenjun（醫療投資）的產業訪談，再與第四次全國口腔健康流行病學調查三方交叉驗證，目的明確是避免單一訪談來源造成的偏誤。問卷同時量化了誤解與「知道卻做不到」的落差：61% 擔心洗牙會傷琺瑯質、23% 以為刷牙可以去掉牙結石、只有 6% 自稱完全了解；另一方面，52% 知道牙結石形成在牙齦邊緣與較深的齒間縫隙，但只有 25% 每天使用牙線或沖牙機；48% 知道刷牙去不掉牙結石，但只有 38% 一年洗牙一到兩次；84% 知道牙結石會導致牙周炎，但只有 25% 每半年檢查一次。真正定義整個專案的介入來自 Dr. Wang Yongwu（杭州市第一人民醫院），他說用酵素去溶解已經礦化的牙結石「如同以卵擊石」——而團隊不只接受了這個療效上的判斷，還從它推導出一項安全後果：因為牙結石與琺瑯質、象牙質同樣是磷酸鈣礦化組織，任何沒有選擇性的去礦化劑都可能造成琺瑯質或象牙質去礦化、敏感或侵蝕。這把整個標的從「已礦化的牙結石」重新框定為「礦化前早期生物膜的有機基質」，也就是整個專案現在所處的介入時間窗。Dr. Lei 與 Dr. Yuan Yifang（浙江中醫藥大學附屬口腔醫院）印證了這一點，並指出該攻擊什麼：多醣—蛋白質的交聯，以及 eDNA 的穩定作用，兩者共同撐住生物膜的三維結構、抵抗唾液沖刷。訪談整體浮現四項設計限制——療效驗證、滲透能力、細胞毒性安全與穩定性保證——後來成為酵素組合與遞送系統的選擇標準。第二個具體轉向：專家指出酵素清除無法防止重新定殖，因為唾液蛋白會在幾分鐘內形成薄膜，這正是會結合羥基磷灰石的 AMP 模組之所以存在的原因；而計算胜肽篩選也是依他們的明確建議才做的。第三個：在發現牛胰 DNase I 市面上每 100 mg 約 80-160 元、而且廣泛使用之後，他們策略性地停止嘗試自行重組表現它，把合成生物學的力氣集中在 EPS 基質真正留有機會的醣苷水解酶上。Dr. Lei 也設下一條團隊始終守住的界線：日常用品中的任何有效成分都必須安全，而且不能擾亂正常口腔微生物相或傷害軟組織。","realWorld":"The most commercially literate section of the five teams, and notable for restraint. The problem is scoped deliberately narrowly: the project does not aim to replace professional scaling, but to serve adults who cannot or will not undergo frequent scaling with a daily, safe, evidence-based product that interferes with plaque maturation and reduces mineralisation risk before it happens — daily prevention and risk reduction, not treatment of existing calculus or periodontal disease. Target segment is urban young people aged 20-30, students and people one to five years into their first jobs, chosen because they have purchasing power, care about social image and have not yet entrenched habits. Channels are specified rather than gestured at: online seeding on Douyin, Xiaohongshu and Bilibili, e-commerce subscriptions, and offline placement in convenience stores, beauty collection stores and supermarkets, with trial experience areas in beauty collection stores. A B-end clinic seed-trial path runs in parallel with the C-end consumer path, and contingencies are written down (if clinic repeat-purchase is below expectation, optimise usage instructions and physician script training; if C-end subscription retention declines, control ad spend pace and iterate the product experience). Six quarterly milestones run from improving the dual recombinant enzyme lab data and stability, patent drafting and seed trials in three to five clinics, through pilot scale-up and third-party safety testing, to daily chemical regulatory filing, first commercial production, retail rollout and a monthly subscription. A three-year P&L is projected (revenue 45 with net -30 and about 35% gross margin, then revenue 280 with net +120 and about 58% gross margin, then revenue 950 with net +530 and about 65% gross margin). IP strategy notes that existing Chinese patents in this space are mostly single-enzyme or simple multi-enzyme combinations and rarely apply microcapsule encapsulation systematically to oral enzyme care, and acquisition by listed biotech oral care entrants such as Bloomage Biotech or Weimeizi (Saky) is named as the exit after commercial validation. Most creditable: all marketing materials and product claims will state explicitly that the product does not replace professional scaling or periodontal treatment, and the portable chewing gum format is to be marketed only for post-meal freshness with no preventive or anti-calculus claim at all — a team voluntarily giving up its best marketing line because it has not earned it yet. Sustainability is argued concretely rather than with SDG slogans: all four actives are proteins expected to degrade to amino acids and peptides after use, and no live organisms are released.","realWorld_zh":"這是五支團隊中商業素養最高的一節，而且以自制著稱。問題範圍刻意收窄：這個專案不打算取代專業洗牙，而是服務那些不能或不願頻繁洗牙的成人，提供一項日常、安全、有證據支持的產品，在牙菌斑成熟與礦化發生之前就介入並降低風險——是日常預防與風險降低，不是治療既有的牙結石或牙周疾病。目標客群是 20-30 歲的都市年輕人、學生與初入職場一到五年者，選擇理由是他們有購買力、在意社交形象，而習慣還沒固化。通路是指名的，不是含糊帶過：在抖音、小紅書與 Bilibili 做線上種草、電商訂閱，以及便利商店、美妝集合店與超市的線下舖貨，並在美妝集合店設試用體驗區。B 端的診所試用路徑與 C 端的消費者路徑並行，應變方案也寫下來了（若診所回購低於預期，就優化使用說明與醫師話術訓練；若 C 端訂閱留存下滑，就控制廣告投放節奏並迭代產品體驗）。六個季度里程碑從改善雙重組酵素的實驗數據與穩定性、專利撰寫與三到五家診所的種子試用，經中試放大與第三方安全檢測，到日用化學品法規備查、首次商業化生產、零售上架與月訂閱制。並預估三年損益（營收 45、淨損 -30、毛利率約 35%；接著營收 280、淨利 +120、毛利率約 58%；再接著營收 950、淨利 +530、毛利率約 65%）。智財策略指出，這個領域現有的中國專利多為單一酵素或簡單多酵素組合，少有系統性地把微膠囊包覆應用在口腔酵素照護上；而在商業驗證後被上市的生技口腔照護業者（例如 Bloomage Biotech 或 Weimeizi（Saky））併購，則被指名為退場方式。最值得肯定的是：所有行銷素材與產品宣稱都會明確寫出本產品不取代專業洗牙或牙周治療，而便攜的口香糖形式更只會以餐後清爽為訴求，完全不帶任何預防或抑制牙結石的宣稱——一支團隊自願放棄自己最好的行銷台詞，因為它還沒賺到。永續性也是具體論述而非 SDG 口號：四種有效成分都是蛋白質，使用後預期會降解為胺基酸與胜肽，而且沒有釋出任何活體生物。","partners":["Dr. Lei Lihong, Associate Chief Physician, Second Affiliated Hospital, Zhejiang University School of Medicine","Dr. Wang Yongwu, Director and Chief Physician of Stomatology, Hangzhou First People's Hospital","Dr. Yuan Yifang, Affiliated Stomatological Hospital of Zhejiang Chinese Medical University","Dr. Huang Jie, Attending Physician of Stomatology, Hangzhou First People's Hospital","Prof. Jia Shiliang, Zhejiang University of Technology (microbial control and protocol validation)","Prof. Yu Haining, Zhejiang University of Technology (natural products and gut microecology)","Dr. Wang Zhiguo, Institute of Aging Research, Hangzhou Normal University (tRNA engineering, gene circuit regulation)","Dr. Shi Jing, Zhejiang University / Texas A&M / Westlake University","Mr. Fan Wenjun, Hangzhou Zhuanjiabang Medical Investment Management","Dr. Wang Haoran, Founder and CEO, Niulan Biotech","Prof. Wu Shiqi, Zhejiang University of Finance and Economics (business plan, market analysis)","Mr. Yu Feng, Quality and Research Center Director, Hangzhou Namei Zhikang Technology (oral care regulatory filing and QC)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6197/wiki/content/model/modeling-figure1.avif","caption":"The CoGH66 mutation prioritisation workflow: PyMOL contact identification in PDB 8IUB, mapping onto the MAFFT/ESPript conservation map to select substitutable sites, point mutation in PyMOL, and FoldX delta-delta-G calculation to rank candidates.","caption_zh":"CoGH66 突變優先排序工作流程：在 PDB 8IUB 中用 PyMOL 找出接觸殘基、對映到 MAFFT/ESPript 保守性圖以挑出可取代位置、在 PyMOL 做點突變，再以 FoldX 計算 delta-delta-G 為候選排序。","credit":"Team HangzhouFourteenAP, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6197/wiki/content/model/modeling-figure5.avif","caption":"Expression and BCA quantification of CoGH66 wild type and the two predicted mutants: SDS-PAGE, the BCA plate, the standard curve (Y = 0.8964X - 0.2574, R2 = 0.9951) and the resulting concentrations (WT 12.1, Y166Q 10.9, Q172P 9.1 microgram/mL) used to normalise total protein before the activity assay.","caption_zh":"CoGH66 野生型與兩個預測突變體的表現與 BCA 定量：SDS-PAGE、BCA 盤、標準曲線（Y = 0.8964X - 0.2574，R2 = 0.9951），以及由此得到、用於在活性分析前正規化總蛋白量的濃度（WT 12.1、Y166Q 10.9、Q172P 9.1 microgram/mL）。","credit":"Team HangzhouFourteenAP, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6197/wiki/content/engineer/engineering-figure12.avif","caption":"Enzymatic degradation of artificial dental calculus: the BF, MU and BF+MU model samples, before/after images for each omission condition, the non-significant gravimetric weight-loss panel, and the crystal violet absorbance quantification where the complete cocktail is significantly below the no-enzyme control and the papain-omission comparison sits at p = 0.08.","caption_zh":"人工牙結石的酵素分解：BF、MU 與 BF+MU 模型樣品、各缺一成分條件的前後影像、無顯著差異的重量失重圖，以及結晶紫吸光度定量——其中完整組合顯著低於無酵素對照，而缺木瓜酵素的比較落在 p = 0.08。","credit":"Team HangzhouFourteenAP, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6197/wiki/content/education/education-figure11.avif","caption":"A primary school pupil assembling the lac-operon genetic circuit from electronic building blocks, with the small fan standing in for the target gene driven by the touch-sensor promoter, toggle-switch operator and button inducer.","caption_zh":"一位國小學生用電子積木組出 lac 操作子基因迴路，由觸控感測器啟動子、切換開關操作子與按鈕誘導物驅動代表目標基因的小風扇。","credit":"Team HangzhouFourteenAP, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Their best transferable move is reporting the computational prediction that lost: FoldX picked Y166Q, the bench picked Q172P, and the wiki revises its own ranking and demotes the failed candidate to a mechanistic probe while showing that BCA normalisation rules out protein load as the explanation. A high-school dry lab earns more credibility from one honestly scored wrong prediction with the confound controlled than from three unvalidated ones. Also copy the cheap inspectability trick — export the docked structure as a glTF so a reader can rotate it — and the commercial restraint of marketing a format with no efficacy claim until the evidence exists.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"他們最值得帶走的一手，是把算錯的計算預測報出來：FoldX 選的是 Y166Q，實驗桌選的是 Q172P，而 wiki 修正了自己的排序，把失敗的候選降級為機制探針，同時用 BCA 正規化排除「蛋白質上樣量不同」這個解釋。一個高中乾實驗，從一項誠實評分、而且把混淆因子控制住的錯誤預測裡得到的可信度，高於三項未經驗證的預測。另外值得照抄的是那個便宜的「可檢視性」技巧——把對接後的結構匯出成 glTF，讓讀者可以自己轉動它——以及那份商業上的自制：在證據出現之前，只推一個完全不帶療效主張的產品形式。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/measurement/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/entrepreneurship/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/sustainable/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/safety/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/assets/index-CoIamzKT.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/assets/Model-CLIAyY10.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/assets/HumanPractice-B3gOYwBY.js"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳量測 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 得主（太空 / 基礎推進 / 軟體與 AI / 生物製造）"],"rank":124},"6199":{"team":"SUIS-SFLS","id":"6199","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/suis-sfls/","projectTitle":"TyroFix","projectTitle_zh":"TyroFix","tagline":"Recyclable magnetic-bead tyrosinase that cheaply DOPA-modifies recombinant mussel adhesive protein, sold as a B2B raw material","tagline_zh":"可回收再用的磁珠固定化酪胺酸酶，以低成本對重組貽貝黏附蛋白進行 DOPA 修飾，並以 B2B 原料的形式販售","summary":"SUIS-SFLS expressed three microbial tyrosinases, immobilised them on magnetic beads so the enzyme can be magnetically recovered and reused, and used the recycled catalyst to hydroxylate Mfp3-linker-Mfp6 fusion mussel foot proteins into DOPA-bearing wet adhesives for skin and wound repair. The commercial thesis is unusually self-aware: after expert interviews they abandoned the idea of selling a finished dressing and repositioned as an upstream B2B raw-material supplier, splitting the same protein stock into TyroFix Mini (cosmetic grade) and TyroFix ProMax (Class II medical grade) and running both regulatory tracks in parallel from day one so that test data never has to be repeated. They are the only high-school team here with a genuine financial model, including capex, cost per litre, pricing, gross margin and breakeven year for each line, published as downloadable PDFs. They were nominated for Best Entrepreneurship in the High School section.","summary_zh":"SUIS-SFLS 表現了三種微生物來源的酪胺酸酶，把它們固定化在磁珠上使酶能以磁性回收並重複使用，再以回收的催化劑把 Mfp3-linker-Mfp6 融合的貽貝足蛋白羥化成帶 DOPA 的濕態黏合劑，用於皮膚與傷口修復。商業論述的自我認識異常清楚：在專家訪談之後，團隊放棄了販售成品敷料的想法，改定位為上游的 B2B 原料供應商，把同一批蛋白質原料拆成 TyroFix Mini（化妝品級）與 TyroFix ProMax（第二類醫療器材級），並從第一天就讓兩條法規途徑平行推進，使檢測資料永遠不必重做。他們是本批中唯一具備真正財務模型的高中團隊，模型包含各產品線的資本支出、每公升成本、定價、毛利率與損益兩平年度，並以可下載的 PDF 公開。團隊入圍高中組的 Best Entrepreneurship。","awards":["Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Golden-circle style Why/How/What mission, PESTLE run separately for each product line, SWOT per line, 4P marketing model, Business Model Canvas, a stakeholder power-interest map, TAM-SAM-SOM per line with stated assumptions, a five-phase 36-month milestone plan, and a two-line financial model with breakeven analysis.","frameworks_zh":"黃金圈式的 Why/How/What 使命陳述、針對兩條產品線分別執行的 PESTLE、各產品線的 SWOT、4P 行銷模型、商業模式圖、一張利害關係人權力-利益圖、各產品線皆附明確假設的 TAM-SAM-SOM、一份五階段 36 個月的里程碑計畫，以及一套含損益兩平分析的雙產品線財務模型。","dataviz":"Thirteen entrepreneurship figures including two separate PESTLE diagrams, competitive positioning, purity and performance indicator panels, a technology roadmap, a business model canvas, a milestone chart and two financial-planning charts. Two downloadable PDFs (financial-planning-mini.pdf, financial-planning-promax.pdf) carry the underlying budgets. Survey results are reported with response percentages and mean Likert scores.","dataviz_zh":"十三張創業相關圖表，包括兩張分開繪製的 PESTLE 圖、競爭定位圖、純度與效能指標面板、一張技術路線圖、一張商業模式圖、一張里程碑圖，以及兩張財務規劃圖。兩份可下載的 PDF（financial-planning-mini.pdf、financial-planning-promax.pdf）載有底層預算。問卷結果以回應百分比與李克特量表平均分數呈現。","datascience":"A 290-response consumer survey quantified to a usable level: over 90 percent reporting skin issues, acne and marks at 62.76 percent, dryness at 48.62 percent, sensitivity at 45.17 percent, satisfaction with existing repair products at 3.34 out of 5, weak efficacy as the main complaint at 72.61 percent, safety at 82.07 percent and repair efficacy at 75.86 percent as the top purchase factors, willingness to try at 3.57 out of 5, and over 60 percent accepting CNY 100-150 with CNY 110-120 as the sweet spot. Cost modelling is benchmarked against recombinant human insulin industrial fermentation.","datascience_zh":"一份 290 份回應的消費者問卷被量化到可用的程度：超過 90% 表示有皮膚問題，痘痘與痘印佔 62.76%、乾燥佔 48.62%、敏感佔 45.17%；對現有修復類產品的滿意度為 5 分中的 3.34 分，最主要的抱怨是效果不明顯（72.61%）；購買決策的首要因素為安全性（82.07%）與修復效果（75.86%）；願意嘗試的程度為 5 分中的 3.57 分；超過 60% 可接受 100 至 150 CNY 的價位，而 110 至 120 CNY 是最佳價格帶。成本估算以重組人類胰島素的工業發酵作為對標基準。","software":"","stack":["magnetic-bead immobilised tyrosinase","E. coli expression","Mfp3-linker-Mfp6 fusion constructs","chromatography and TFF ultrafiltration","HPLC purity assay","NIH/3T3 cytotoxicity assay"],"techniques":["enzyme immobilisation and magnetic recovery","controlled DOPA hydroxylation","three DBTL cycles on fermentation and purification","wet adhesion measurement in kPa","endotoxin quantification","lyophilisation and reconstitution feasibility"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A 290-response online questionnaire that went beyond sentiment into purchase behaviour, capturing preferred formats, trusted information sources (dermatologists, real user reviews, official brand channels), trial triggers (free samples at 30.69 percent, professional recommendation at 30 percent) and an explicit price band. They also read the result honestly, noting that trust comes from experimental and clinical data (76.21 percent) and transparent mechanism (63.79 percent), and then used those channels to plan promotion rather than inventing a campaign.","publicEngagement_zh":"一份 290 份回應的線上問卷，內容不只停在態度層面，而是進入購買行為，蒐集了偏好的產品形式、受信任的資訊來源（皮膚科醫師、真實使用者評價、品牌官方管道）、試用誘因（免費試用品 30.69%、專業推薦 30%），以及一個明確的價格帶。團隊也誠實解讀結果，指出信任來自實驗與臨床資料（76.21%）以及機制透明（63.79%），然後就用這些管道來規劃推廣，而不是另外發明一套行銷活動。","ihp":"Five named expert interviews, each with the background stated, the question asked, the feedback, the team's reflection and the concrete project adjustment. Dr. Dongfeng Wang (Deputy Chief Physician, Wuhan Petrochemical Hospital) converted vague 'good adhesion' into care-process requirements and gave quantitative design targets: film formation in about 5 seconds, breathability with water resistance, partial degradation in 3-5 days, and validation moving from superficial to deeper wounds. Mr. Yanxuan Song (medical device engineer and founder of a Guangzhou tech-beauty chain) widened their notion of cost to include purification, storage, transport and handling losses, and suggested lyophilised powder with a reconstitution solution to cut cold-chain burden. Mr. Jiujiang Zhang of CIRS Group, a Class II and III device regulatory specialist, established the rule that shared raw-material origin does not permit shared submission pathways. Mr. Xiaofei Ji, an ISO 13485 internal auditor and NPDP holder who has taken more than ten Class III products to approval, delivered the decisive advice: a student team should start at raw-material supply, treat reproducibility and batch records as early concerns, and settle IP before approaching any manufacturer. That advice visibly rewrote the deliverable, from a finished dressing to a characterised protein plus quality documentation.","ihp_zh":"五場具名的專家訪談，每一場都記錄了對方背景、所問的問題、回饋內容、團隊的反思，以及具體的專案調整。Dr. Dongfeng Wang（Wuhan Petrochemical Hospital 副主任醫師）把模糊的「黏得好」轉換成照護流程上的要求，並給出量化的設計目標：約 5 秒成膜、兼具透氣與防水、3 至 5 天部分降解，以及驗證順序由淺層傷口推進到較深的傷口。Mr. Yanxuan Song（醫療器材工程師，廣州一家科技美容連鎖的創辦人）把團隊對成本的理解擴大到純化、儲存、運輸與操作損耗，並建議改用凍乾粉末搭配復溶液以降低冷鏈負擔。CIRS Group 的 Mr. Jiujiang Zhang，第二類與第三類器材法規專家，確立了一條原則：原料來源相同並不代表可以共用申報途徑。Mr. Xiaofei Ji，ISO 13485 內部稽核員與 NPDP 持證者，曾把十件以上第三類產品送到取證，他給出的建議最具決定性：學生團隊應該從原料供應切入，把再現性與批次紀錄當成早期就要處理的課題，並在接觸任何製造商之前先把智財談定。這項建議明顯重寫了交付項目，從成品敷料改為一份完成特性鑑定的蛋白質加上品質文件。","realWorld":"The most financially literate high-school entrepreneurship case in this set, and the honesty is what makes it credible. Each line has a built-up cost model rather than a percentage: Mini needs about CNY 6.8 million of equipment (seed shakers, a 200 L fermenter, high-pressure homogeniser, chromatography system, industrial centrifuge, TFF ultrafiltration) depreciated straight-line over six years, about CNY 2.3 million of R&D, and about CNY 71 per litre to produce against a $12-18 per litre price, giving roughly 34 percent gross margin and cumulative profitability in year 3 to 4. ProMax adds an aseptic filling line, sterile filtration and a lyophiliser for about CNY 11.65 million, carries about CNY 8.15 million of R&D split CNY 5.1 million expensed and CNY 3.05 million capitalised, costs about CNY 163.5 per litre against a $22-32 price, and yields only about 15.9 percent gross margin with breakeven in year 5 to 6. Volume ramps are stated (Mini 1,000 then 5,000 then 15,000 then 30,000 litres; ProMax 200 then 1,000 then 3,000 then 8,000), and the whole budget is downloadable as two PDFs. The regulatory path is the most detailed of any team in this group and is clearly researched rather than guessed: ordinary non-special-use cosmetic filing with NMPA plus a CMA-certified safety assessment for a new cosmetic ingredient and a three-year post-market monitoring period, versus provincial Class II contact-wound-dressing registration requiring ISO 13485, 100,000-class cleanrooms, GB/T 16886 biocompatibility and a clinical evaluation route, with the deliberate choice of the equivalent-product comparison pathway to avoid human trials. They identify the specific trap that cosmetic test reports cannot be reused for device registration and design around it by running both safety programmes in parallel, and cite Giant Biogene and Fu Erjia as real companies that use the shared-campus, separated-workshop model they intend to copy. Market sizing is more careful than usual, with Frost and Sullivan figures for both markets, stated percentage assumptions for SAM, and a SOM expressed as a penetration range tied to winning 10-15 recurring B2B accounts or 2-3 licensed device partners. Now the blunt part. There is no registered entity, no funding, no incubator place, no signed letter of intent and no patent filed, only a stated plan to file three categories of patents before any external collaboration. More seriously, the competitive-efficacy section blurs sources: head-to-head performance claims against Komfymed's recombinant collagen dressing, and a 65-patient trial where MAP hydrogel healed wounds in 5.7 days versus 7.3 for rhEGF, read as literature values for mussel adhesive protein generally rather than data the team generated, yet are written as 'our advantage'. A reader should treat those numbers as borrowed benchmarks. Their own SWOT is candid about this, listing an absent intended use, no confirmed device classification, no design controls, no risk-management file, no biocompatibility package and no clinical evidence strategy. Continuation is a licensing-and-supply intent built on a correct strategic insight (cash from the fast cosmetic line funds the slow medical line), but the entity that would execute it does not yet exist.","realWorld_zh":"這是本批中財務素養最高的高中創業案，而讓它可信的正是那份誠實。每條產品線都有自下而上建起的成本模型，而不是一個百分比：Mini 需約 680 萬 CNY 的設備（種子搖瓶培養、一座 200 L 發酵槽、高壓均質機、層析系統、工業離心機、TFF 超過濾），以六年直線法攤提折舊，研發約 230 萬 CNY，生產成本約每公升 71 CNY，對應每公升 12 至 18 美元的售價，毛利率約 34%，在第 3 至 4 年累積轉為獲利。ProMax 另加無菌充填線、除菌過濾與凍乾機約 1,165 萬 CNY，研發約 815 萬 CNY，其中 510 萬 CNY 費用化、305 萬 CNY 資本化，成本約每公升 163.5 CNY，對應 22 至 32 美元的售價，毛利率僅約 15.9%，損益兩平落在第 5 至 6 年。產量爬升也明確列出（Mini 為 1,000、5,000、15,000 然後 30,000 公升；ProMax 為 200、1,000、3,000 然後 8,000），整份預算並以兩份 PDF 提供下載。法規路徑是這組團隊中最詳細的一份，而且明顯是查過而不是猜的：一邊是向 NMPA 進行普通（非特殊用途）化妝品備案，加上化妝品新原料所需的 CMA 認證安全評估與三年上市後監測期；另一邊是省級第二類接觸傷口敷料註冊，需要 ISO 13485、十萬級無塵室、GB/T 16886 生物相容性與一條臨床評價路徑，而團隊刻意選擇同類產品比對路徑以避開人體試驗。他們指認出一個具體的陷阱，即化妝品的檢測報告無法沿用於器材註冊，並以同步推進兩套安全性計畫的方式來設計繞過它；他們也引用 Giant Biogene 與 Fu Erjia 作為實際採用共用廠區、分隔車間模式的公司，而那正是他們打算效法的做法。市場規模估算也比一般團隊謹慎，兩個市場都引用 Frost and Sullivan 的數字，SAM 有明確的百分比假設，SOM 則表示為一個滲透率區間，並綁定在拿下 10 至 15 個經常性 B2B 客戶或 2 至 3 個取得許可的器材合作夥伴之上。現在談直白的部分。公司實體不存在、沒有資金、沒有育成中心席位、沒有簽署的意向書，也還沒有提出任何專利，只有一項「在任何對外合作之前先提出三類專利」的計畫。更嚴重的是，競爭效能那一節把來源混在一起：與 Komfymed 的重組膠原蛋白敷料做正面對比的效能宣稱，以及一項 65 位病患的試驗中 MAP 水凝膠在 5.7 天癒合傷口、而 rhEGF 為 7.3 天的數據，讀起來像是貽貝黏附蛋白這類材料的一般文獻值，而不是團隊自己做出來的資料，卻被寫成「我們的優勢」。讀者應把那些數字當成借來的標竿值看待。他們自己的 SWOT 對此相當坦白，列出尚無確定的預期用途、尚未確認的器材分類、沒有設計管制、沒有風險管理檔案、沒有生物相容性資料包，也沒有臨床證據策略。後續規劃是一份授權與供貨的意向，建立在一個正確的策略洞察之上（由快速變現的化妝品線提供現金，支撐較慢的醫療線），但要執行它的那個實體目前還不存在。","partners":["Dr. Dongfeng Wang, Deputy Chief Physician, Wuhan Petrochemical Hospital (clinical wound care)","Mr. Yanxuan Song, medical device engineer and founder of Guangzhou Baiyoubai Tech-Beauty Chain (clinic operations and procurement)","Dr. Shengbo Wu (synthetic biology)","Mr. Jiujiang Zhang, CIRS Group Medical Devices Division (Class II and III regulatory affairs)","Mr. Xiaofei Ji, medical device development and quality systems expert (value-chain positioning)","SnapGene and Tsingke (listed sponsors)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6199/wiki/entrepreneurship/figure-11.avif","caption":"Financial planning for TyroFix Mini: capex, R&D spend, CNY 71 per litre production cost and the volume ramp to 30,000 litres by year five","caption_zh":"TyroFix Mini 的財務規劃：資本支出、研發支出、每公升 71 CNY 的生產成本，以及到第五年爬升至 30,000 公升的產量","credit":"Team SUIS-SFLS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6199/wiki/entrepreneurship/figure-12.avif","caption":"Financial planning for TyroFix ProMax, the Class II medical line, showing the lower 15.9 percent gross margin and later breakeven","caption_zh":"TyroFix ProMax（第二類醫療器材線）的財務規劃，顯示較低的 15.9% 毛利率與較晚的損益兩平","credit":"Team SUIS-SFLS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6199/wiki/entrepreneurship/figure-9.avif","caption":"Business model canvas for the two-line B2B raw-material supply model","caption_zh":"雙產品線 B2B 原料供應模式的商業模式圖","credit":"Team SUIS-SFLS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6199/wiki/entrepreneurship/figure-10.avif","caption":"Thirty-six-month milestone plan across five phases, from DBTL cycles to first B2B supply agreements","caption_zh":"橫跨五個階段的 36 個月里程碑計畫，從 DBTL 循環到第一批 B2B 供貨協議","credit":"Team SUIS-SFLS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Adopt their repositioning discipline: ask industry experts where a student-scale team actually belongs in the value chain, and be willing to drop the finished product for an upstream raw material plus characterisation and quality documentation, which is a deliverable a small lab can genuinely own. Then publish the budget as a downloadable model with capex, cost per unit, price, gross margin and breakeven year, so the plan can be criticised on its arithmetic rather than its adjectives.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"採用他們重新定位的紀律：去問業界專家，一支學生規模的團隊究竟該站在價值鏈的哪一段，並願意放掉成品、改做上游原料加上特性鑑定與品質文件，因為那才是一個小實驗室真正扛得起來的交付項目。接著把預算做成可下載的模型公開，含資本支出、單位成本、價格、毛利率與損益兩平年度，讓整個計畫可以被人用算術來批評，而不是用形容詞。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/suis-sfls/","https://2026.igem.wiki/suis-sfls/entrepreneurship/","https://2026.igem.wiki/suis-sfls/human-practices/"],"awards_zh":["最佳創業 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6214":{"team":"HongKong-HS","id":"6214","section":"High School","country":"Hong Kong","village":"Diagnostics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-hs/","projectTitle":"AmpliRen - a urine-based home screening kit concept for chronic kidney disease using urinary miRNA and hybridisation chain reaction","projectTitle_zh":"AmpliRen——以尿液 miRNA 與雜交鏈反應建構的慢性腎臟病居家篩檢套組概念","tagline":"Early signals. Made visible. A small sample telling a bigger story.","tagline_zh":"及早的訊號，看得見的呈現。一份小小的檢體，說出更大的故事。","summary":"HongKong-HS is a five-school joint team (Wah Yan College Kowloon, Pope Paul VI College, C&MA Sun Kei Secondary School, Tsung Tsin Christian Academy, St. Paul's School Lam Tin) tackling chronic kidney disease, which affects roughly 788 million adults worldwide, has risen past 405,000 recorded adult cases in Hong Kong, and is usually caught only at stage 3-5 because creatinine-based eGFR does not move until about half of kidney function is gone. AmpliRen detects two urinary microRNAs - miR-21-5p for fibrosis severity and miR-192-5p as an early warning, together reported at 89% sensitivity and 82% specificity - and amplifies the signal enzyme-free at room temperature with hybridisation chain reaction, whose G-rich hairpin loops fold into G-quadruplexes that bind hemin to form a DNAzyme and oxidise TMB into a colour change visible in natural light. The project is a genuine four-cycle engineering story: the team started with toehold switches designed in miRADAR and screened in NUPACK, found EGFP output too weak and invisible, pivoted to HCR, then to G-quadruplex-containing probes, then to hemin/TMB colorimetry. It was nominated for Best Wiki on one of the most ambitious scroll-driven, 3D-visualised wikis in the competition.","summary_zh":"HongKong-HS 是由五校組成的聯隊（九龍華仁書院、保祿六世書院、宣道會鄭榮之中學、崇真書院、藍田聖保祿學校），處理的是慢性腎臟病：全球約有 7.88 億成人受影響，香港的成人紀錄病例已超過 405,000 例，而由於基於肌酸酐的 eGFR 要等到腎功能大約失去一半才會變動，病情通常要到第 3 至 5 期才被發現。AmpliRen 偵測兩種尿液 microRNA——miR-21-5p 反映纖維化嚴重度，miR-192-5p 作為早期警訊，兩者合併的報告數據為靈敏度 89%、專一性 82%——並以雜交鏈反應（HCR）在室溫下不用酵素放大訊號；其富含 G 的髮夾環會折疊成 G-四聯體，結合血基質（hemin）形成 DNAzyme，氧化 TMB 產生在自然光下即可看見的顏色變化。這個專題是一段貨真價實、歷經四輪的工程故事：團隊一開始用 miRADAR 設計、在 NUPACK 中篩選 toehold switch，發現 EGFP 的輸出太弱、看不見，轉而改用 HCR，再改用含 G-四聯體的探針，最後改成 hemin/TMB 比色。它以本屆最具野心的捲動敘事、3D 視覺化 wiki 之一獲最佳 wiki 提名。","awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Infectious Diseases / Therapeutics / Diagnostics / Oncology)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"The dry lab is nucleic-acid thermodynamics rather than protein design, and it is used as a hard screen at every cycle. Candidate toehold switches were generated with miRADAR, the design tool released by the 2024 Wageningen iGEM team - a deliberate reuse of another team's software rather than reinventing it - producing 9 candidates for miR-21-5p and 7 for miR-192-5p. Every candidate was then simulated in NUPACK (RNA mode, 37 C, default model options and algorithm settings, 1 uM toehold and 3 uM miRNA to keep the trigger in excess) and scored against five explicit criteria: bound-toehold equilibrium concentration, absence of unintended secondary structure downstream of the ribosome binding site (which would block the ribosome and cause false negatives), hybrid minimum free energy (HMFE) versus toehold minimum free energy (TMFE) so that the bound state is thermodynamically favoured and the switch does not prefer to dimerise with another switch, C-G content for hairpin stability, and RBS location. They tabulated the HMFE-TMFE difference for every candidate in kcal/mol and read NUPACK's base-pair equilibrium-probability plots to check that loop-maintaining base pairs drop to low probability on target binding so the switch can fully linearise - selecting toeholds 6 and 7 for miR-192-5p and 7 and 9 for miR-21-5p. The same NUPACK workflow was then reapplied to HCR: H1/H2 hairpin pairs (the miR-21-5p pair adopted from Miao et al. 2016, the miR-192-5p pair built in house) were simulated at 37 C with 1 uM hairpin and 3 uM miRNA, confirming long H1-H2 polymer formation with target but also predicting unintended H1-H2 binding in the absence of target - a background-leakage problem the model found before the gel did. Minimum-free-energy structures were computed for H1 alone, H2 alone, H1+miRNA and the full miRNA-H1-H2 complex for both targets. In Cycle 4, double-loop G4H1/G4H2 hairpins based on Peng et al. (2022) had InG4 G-quadruplex motifs inserted into the loops, and NUPACK was used to confirm both complex formation and that the InG4 sequences sit in the loops where they can fold and leave the polymer after HCR. The two probe pairs were deliberately given different geometries - longer stems and smaller loops for miR-192-5p, shorter stems and larger loops for miR-21-5p.","frameworks_zh":"乾實驗做的是核酸熱力學、而非蛋白質設計，而且在每一輪都被當成硬性篩選使用。候選 toehold switch 以 miRADAR 產生，那是 2024 年 Wageningen iGEM 隊伍釋出的設計工具——刻意重複利用別隊的軟體、而不是重新造一次輪子——為 miR-21-5p 產出 9 個候選、為 miR-192-5p 產出 7 個。每個候選接著在 NUPACK 中模擬（RNA 模式、37 C、預設模型選項與演算法設定，toehold 1 uM、miRNA 3 uM 以維持觸發端過量），並依五項明確標準評分：已結合 toehold 的平衡濃度、核糖體結合位下游是否沒有非預期的二級結構（若有會阻擋核糖體並造成偽陰性）、雜合最小自由能（HMFE）與 toehold 最小自由能（TMFE）的對比（使結合態在熱力學上占優，且開關不會偏好與另一個開關形成雙體）、維持髮夾穩定的 C-G 含量，以及 RBS 的位置。他們把每個候選的 HMFE-TMFE 差值以 kcal/mol 列表，並閱讀 NUPACK 的鹼基配對平衡機率圖，確認在結合標的後維持環狀結構的鹼基配對機率會降到很低，使開關能完全線性化——最後為 miR-192-5p 選定 toehold 6 與 7、為 miR-21-5p 選定 7 與 9。同一套 NUPACK 流程之後再套用到 HCR：H1/H2 髮夾對（miR-21-5p 那一對取自 Miao 等人 2016 年的研究，miR-192-5p 那一對則自行建構）在 37 C、髮夾 1 uM、miRNA 3 uM 下模擬，確認在有標的時會形成長的 H1-H2 聚合物，但也預測在沒有標的時 H1 與 H2 會發生非預期的結合——這個背景洩漏問題，是模型比膠片更早發現的。兩個標的都計算了 H1 單獨、H2 單獨、H1+miRNA 以及完整 miRNA-H1-H2 複合物的最小自由能結構。在第四輪，他們依 Peng 等人（2022）設計的雙環 G4H1/G4H2 髮夾把 InG4 這種 G-四聯體基序插入環中，並用 NUPACK 確認複合物會形成、以及 InG4 序列確實位在環上，使其能折疊並在 HCR 之後離開聚合物。兩對探針被刻意賦予不同的幾何形狀——miR-192-5p 用較長的莖與較小的環，miR-21-5p 則用較短的莖與較大的環。","dataviz":"The wiki itself is the data-visualisation achievement and is why it was nominated for Best Wiki. The landing page is a scroll-driven narrative that zooms from two kidneys, through tissue and the filtration barrier, down to the molecular signal, with each stage labelled as an illustrative view rather than clinical eGFR categories. The HCR mechanism is animated across four scroll states - two locked hairpins, target binding and toehold opening, chain growth into a double-stranded nanowire, then potassium-dependent G-quadruplex folding with hemin - so a reader physically watches the amplification cascade instead of reading a paragraph about it. Epidemiology is presented as individually sourced stat cards, each carrying its own population, year and citation (788 million adults globally, GBD 2023/The Lancet 2025; 87% unaware, CDC 2026 NHANES 2021-2023; 405,833 Hong Kong adult cases 2021, Yue et al.; 2,571 on the transplant waiting list; 1,226 registered deaths in 2024) with an explicit note that one figure is a recorded-case count, not a current population estimate. The kit concept is presented as an interactive unboxing with three fitted compartments and a pannable close-up, and the team labels it openly as AI-assisted imagery and animation made with Higgsfield and as a research concept, not a validated diagnostic product. The engineering page is built as a clickable 22-note timeline across four Design-Build-Test-Learn cycles. Every figure carries a full descriptive caption and alt text.","dataviz_zh":"這份 wiki 本身就是資料視覺化上的成就，也是它獲最佳 wiki 提名的原因。首頁是一段捲動驅動的敘事，從兩顆腎臟一路放大穿過組織與過濾屏障、下探到分子訊號，每個階段都標註為示意性的呈現、而非臨床 eGFR 分期。HCR 的機制以四個捲動狀態做成動畫——兩個鎖住的髮夾、標的結合並打開 toehold、鏈成長為雙股奈米線，然後是依賴鉀離子的 G-四聯體折疊與 hemin 結合——讓讀者實際看著整段放大串聯反應發生，而不是讀一段文字描述。流行病學以逐項標註來源的數據卡呈現，每張卡都帶自己的族群、年份與引用（全球 7.88 億成人，GBD 2023／The Lancet 2025；87% 不知情，CDC 2026，NHANES 2021-2023；香港 2021 年成人病例 405,833，Yue 等人；2,571 人在移植等候名單上；2024 年登錄死亡 1,226 人），並明確註明其中一個數字是紀錄病例數、不是當前的族群估計值。套組概念以互動式開箱呈現，內有三個嵌合的隔間與可平移的特寫，團隊也公開標註那是用 Higgsfield 製作的 AI 輔助圖像與動畫，且屬研究概念、不是經驗證的診斷產品。工程頁面做成一條可點擊的 22 則註記時間軸，橫跨四輪 Design-Build-Test-Learn 循環。每張圖都附完整的敘述性圖說與替代文字。","datascience":"Analysis is modest in volume but correctly specified. Cell-free EGFP expression was compared with and without target miRNA across five repeats against both positive controls (pET-14b-EGFP with no toehold) and no-plasmid negative controls, read on a fluorometer at 488 nm excitation and 507-513 nm emission, with significance tested by one-sample t-test on fold change; the honest outcome was that miR-21 candidates showed no significant difference, miR-192-5p-6 was significant but minimal at 1.03-fold, and miR-192-5p-7 showed a more pronounced 1.51-fold increase that did not reach significance - and they reported that rather than spin it. ThT fluorescence and hemin/TMB colorimetric assays were analysed by one-way ANOVA with Dunnett post-hoc against the 0 pM control: miR-21 gave significant signal at 100 pM, 10 nM and 100 nM (n=3, p<0.001), while miR-192 was significant at 100 nM (p=0.01 and p=0.002) but also, unexpectedly, significantly lower than control at 1 nM - an anomaly they diagnosed as free miR-192-5p G4H1 self-folding into a G-quadruplex and producing colour without target, and then turned into a concrete future-work list (splitting the G4, stabilising the hairpin stem, tuning C-G/A-T content, optimising toehold length). Plasmid work was confirmed by Sanger sequencing and miniprep A260/280 purity, and gel evidence was escalated from agarose to PAGE when agarose smearing proved inconclusive.","datascience_zh":"分析在量上不多，但規格設定正確。無細胞的 EGFP 表現在有無標的 miRNA 兩種條件下各做五次重複比較，並同時對照正對照（pET-14b-EGFP、不含 toehold）與無質體的負對照，以螢光儀在激發 488 nm、發射 507-513 nm 下讀取，並以單樣本 t 檢定檢驗倍數變化的顯著性；誠實的結果是 miR-21 的候選沒有顯著差異，miR-192-5p-6 雖達顯著但幅度極小（1.03 倍），而 miR-192-5p-7 顯示較明顯的 1.51 倍上升卻未達顯著——他們照實報告，沒有美化。ThT 螢光與 hemin/TMB 比色試驗以單因子 ANOVA 搭配 Dunnett 事後檢定、對照 0 pM 控制組分析：miR-21 在 100 pM、10 nM 與 100 nM 都有顯著訊號（n=3，p<0.001），miR-192 則在 100 nM 顯著（p=0.01 與 p=0.002），但也出現意料之外的結果——在 1 nM 時顯著低於控制組；他們診斷這個異常是游離的 miR-192-5p G4H1 自行折疊成 G-四聯體、在沒有標的時就產生顏色，並把它轉化成一份具體的後續工作清單（拆分 G4、穩定髮夾莖部、調整 C-G/A-T 含量、最佳化 toehold 長度）。質體工作以 Sanger 定序與 miniprep 的 A260/280 純度確認，膠片證據則在瓊膠出現拖尾、結果不明確時升級為 PAGE。","software":"No standalone software or hardware was released. The dry lab is the application of existing tools - NUPACK for thermodynamic simulation and another iGEM team's miRADAR for candidate generation - plus a bespoke wiki front end. Two toehold switch candidates per target were cloned into pET-14b-EGFP using XbaI and NdeI sites between the T7 promoter and the EGFP reporter and verified by Sanger sequencing, and an mCherry colorimetric variant was in progress when the season ended.","software_zh":"沒有釋出獨立的軟體或硬體。乾實驗是既有工具的應用——以 NUPACK 做熱力學模擬、以另一支 iGEM 隊伍的 miRADAR 產生候選——再加上一個訂製的 wiki 前端。每個標的有兩個 toehold switch 候選，以 XbaI 與 NdeI 位點選殖進 pET-14b-EGFP、置於 T7 啟動子與 EGFP 報告基因之間，並以 Sanger 定序確認；一個 mCherry 比色版本在賽季結束時仍在進行中。","stack":["NUPACK","miRADAR (Wageningen iGEM 2024)","one-way ANOVA with Dunnett post-hoc","one-sample t-test","Sanger sequencing","cell-free expression + fluorometry","microplate reader","PAGE and agarose gel electrophoresis","ThT fluorescence assay","hemin / TMB G-quadruplex DNAzyme colorimetry","Higgsfield (AI-assisted concept imagery)","scroll-driven 3D web visualisation"],"techniques":["HMFE vs TMFE thermodynamic ranking of toehold candidates","equilibrium base-pair probability inspection to verify hairpin linearisation on target binding","in-silico prediction of background leakage (unintended H1-H2 binding without target) before bench testing","MFE structure comparison across free hairpin, hairpin+target and full ternary complex","loop-position verification for inserted G-quadruplex motifs","fold-change analysis against both positive and no-plasmid negative controls","escalating gel resolution (agarose to PAGE) when a result is inconclusive","diagnosing a statistically anomalous result as probe self-folding and converting it into a redesign list"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education reached over 800 participants and was built on three stated principles - a Cascading Peer-Educator Model, Gamified Educational Experiences, and Reflective Learning. The peer-educator model is the distinctive one: rather than only teaching end-learners, they trained non-iGEM junior-form Science Team members as Student Facilitators with both content and facilitation skills, then had those facilitators independently run workshops for their schoolmates, and published a training guide for holding a secondary school workshop plus a CKD brochure for older adults so the materials outlive the team. Activities were designed per audience and deliberately low-cost and replicable: at Salesian Yip Hon Millennium Primary School's STEAM Day (about 600 students and parents) they ran a micropipette drip-art station, a magnetic miRNA detection game in which only the target miRNA card hides a magnet so it alone sticks to a paper toehold-switch model, and a health-knowledge ping-pong ball toss into an illustrated face; at Shek Lei Catholic Primary School, strawberry DNA extraction delivered entirely in Cantonese with terms simplified ('cell walls' became 'the surface of the strawberry') and a 'Blood Vessel Clearing Game' using paper, drawing supplies and a hand-made wooden vessel model, with students drawing their own food items and testing whether they fit through. Secondary outreach covered St. Paul's School (Lam Tin) with 169 participants and Hoi Ping Chamber of Commerce Secondary School with 19, using a micropipetting precision-dyeing challenge and a 'Detective on Call' online DNA fingerprinting game. They also ran a card game for community-centre children including ethnic-minority children, an elderly workshop, a Hong Kong Joint Secondary Schools Science Fair booth, and regional middle-school outreach in the Greater Bay Area. Reflection was built in with structured worksheets, exit cards and open Q&A, and every activity records what they changed next - after noticing their terminology was too advanced for young children they switched to plainer language, more gestures and more Cantonese, and they adapted in real time when a student asked 'Why strawberries? Why not apples?' by adding an impromptu discussion.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育工作觸及超過 800 位參與者，建立在三項明示的原則上——階梯式同儕教育者模式、遊戲化的教育體驗，以及反思式學習。同儕教育者模式是最特別的一項：他們不只教最終學習者，而是把非 iGEM 的初中科學隊成員訓練成學生輔導員，同時傳授內容與帶領技巧，再讓這些輔導員自行為同校同學舉辦工作坊；他們並公開了一份中學工作坊的帶領指南與一本給長者的慢性腎臟病手冊，使材料能在團隊之後繼續存在。活動依對象設計，刻意低成本且可複製：在慈幼葉漢千禧小學的 STEAM 日（約 600 位學生與家長）他們設了微量移液器滴畫站、一個磁性 miRNA 偵測遊戲（只有標的 miRNA 卡片裡藏有磁鐵，因此只有它會黏上紙做的 toehold switch 模型），以及把健康知識乒乓球投進繪製臉孔的投擲遊戲；在石籬天主教小學，草莓 DNA 萃取全程以粵語進行、術語也簡化（「細胞壁」改成「草莓的表面」），另有一個用紙、繪圖用品與手工木製血管模型做的「清血管遊戲」，讓學生自己畫食物、再測試它們能不能通過。中學端的科普涵蓋藍田聖保祿學校 169 位參與者與海壩商會中學 19 位，使用微量移液精準染色挑戰與「Detective on Call」線上 DNA 指紋遊戲。他們也為社區中心的兒童（包括少數族裔兒童）辦了卡牌遊戲、辦了長者工作坊、在香港聯校科學展覽設攤，並在大灣區做了區域性的中學科普。反思被制度化為結構式學習單、離場卡與開放問答，每項活動都記錄下一次改了什麼——在發現自己的術語對幼童太進階後，他們改用更淺白的語言、更多手勢與更多粵語；當一位學生問「為什麼是草莓？為什麼不是蘋果？」時，他們當場加入一段即興討論來應對。","ihp":"IHP was organised as four parallel two-way feedback loops (Public, Healthcare, Science, Industry) feeding both the wet lab and the education team, structured over three stages (Understanding the Problem, Identifying the Needs, Develop & Co-design) and processed through a four-step cycle they call LIVP (Locate, Iterate, Validate, Propose). The design changes are traceable to named people. Professor Chan Ting Fung (RNA biology) assessed the toehold-switch limitations and identified HCR as the alternative worth trying for signal amplification - the single biggest pivot in the project - and later recommended expanding the H1/H2 sequence design space to mask the ribosome binding site to eliminate background leakage, noted that lithium interference in urine is negligible, and told them to test sodium's effect on the DNAzyme experimentally. Professor Szeto Cheuk Chun (Head of Medicine and Therapeutics, CUHK, whose research is urinary biomarkers) confirmed miRNA as near-ideal for urine because of its stability, told them to run miR-21-5p and miR-192-5p in parallel as a complementary test (which is why the kit has two detection pathways and a six-well chamber), said biomarkers are detectable in urine that has not been high-speed centrifuged so they could drop centrifugation from the workflow, warned that urinary chromogens may interfere with a visible colour readout, set a user-experience target of roughly half an hour to result, and endorsed a colour change readable under natural light - which is precisely why the team ended up on G4/hemin colorimetry rather than ThT fluorescence, since ThT needs UV excitation and a fluorescence reader. Professor Ma Ming Yao established that the kit must be positioned as a screening flag prompting medical follow-up, never a diagnosis, and that false positives and negatives must be managed responsibly, and that high-risk patients are the target - which reshaped how the whole wiki speaks about the product and prompted a community education workshop for the elderly. A medical laboratory technologist insisted on a clear, reasonable cut-off concentration for the target miRNA, rigorous quality control, timely sample processing, and a larger sample size for credibility, which pushed the team towards a multi-target design. E-SENSE Innovation & Technology Limited said clinicians will only recommend a home test backed by real-world clinical data with low false-positive and false-negative rates, which pushed the wet lab to run the cell-free EGFP validation and the HCR sensitivity series. Public input was quantified: a street interview of 137 people and an online survey of 283 found 52% had never heard of CKD or diabetic kidney disease and only 28% had heard of both, 60% did not know or were unsure that early kidney disease can be symptomless, and 63.2% of street respondents cited absence of symptoms as their reason for not getting screened.","ihp_zh":"IHP 組織成四條並行的雙向回饋迴路（公眾、醫療、科學、產業），同時回饋到濕實驗與教育組，結構上分三個階段（理解問題、界定需求、開發與共同設計），並透過他們稱為 LIVP（Locate、Iterate、Validate、Propose）的四步循環處理。設計上的改動都可追溯到具名的人。Chan Ting Fung 教授（RNA 生物學）評估了 toehold switch 的限制，並指出 HCR 是值得一試的訊號放大替代方案——這是整個專題最大的一次轉向——之後又建議擴大 H1/H2 的序列設計空間以遮蔽核糖體結合位、消除背景洩漏，並指出尿液中鋰的干擾可忽略，要他們以實驗檢驗鈉對 DNAzyme 的影響。Szeto Cheuk Chun 教授（香港中文大學內科及藥物治療學系主任，研究領域為尿液生物標記）確認 miRNA 因其穩定性而近乎是尿液檢測的理想對象，要他們把 miR-21-5p 與 miR-192-5p 並行作為互補檢測（這就是套組有兩條偵測路徑與六孔反應室的原因），指出生物標記在未經高速離心的尿液中仍可偵測、因此可以把離心從流程中去掉，並警告尿中的色素可能干擾可見光的顏色讀取，另訂下約半小時內出結果的使用體驗目標，並支持採用自然光下即可判讀的顏色變化——這正是團隊最終走向 G4/hemin 比色、而非 ThT 螢光的原因，因為 ThT 需要紫外激發與螢光讀取儀。Ma Ming Yao 教授確立了這套套組必須定位為提示就醫追蹤的篩檢旗標、絕不是診斷，偽陽性與偽陰性必須負責任地管理，且目標對象是高風險患者——這重塑了整個 wiki 談論產品的方式，也促成了一場為長者舉辦的社區教育工作坊。一位醫務檢驗師堅持標的 miRNA 必須有清楚、合理的判讀切點、嚴謹的品質管制、及時的檢體處理，以及更大的樣本數以取得可信度，這推動團隊走向多標的設計。E-SENSE Innovation & Technology Limited 則表示，臨床醫師只會推薦有真實世界臨床數據支撐、且偽陽性與偽陰性率都低的居家檢測，這推動濕實驗去做無細胞 EGFP 驗證與 HCR 的靈敏度系列實驗。公眾意見也有量化：街訪 137 人與線上問卷 283 份顯示，52% 從未聽過慢性腎臟病或糖尿病腎病變、只有 28% 兩者都聽過，60% 不知道或不確定早期腎病可能完全沒有症狀，而街訪受訪者中有 63.2% 把沒有症狀列為自己不去篩檢的理由。","realWorld":"The intended product is an at-home urine screening kit, costed against a system where each Hong Kong dialysis patient runs about HKD 50,000 per year and where confirming CKD currently needs repeat clinic visits over a three-month window because uACR varies by 30% or more day to day and cystatin C is several times the price of creatinine and rarely reimbursed. Every design decision is pulled towards deployability: urine rather than blood, no centrifuge, enzyme-free isothermal amplification at room temperature, and a colour change readable in natural light without any instrument. The team is consistently careful about regulatory and clinical positioning - the kit is repeatedly described as a screening flag that prompts follow-up and complements, rather than replaces, eGFR and uACR, and the kit visualisation is explicitly captioned as a research concept, not a validated diagnostic product. What is not present on the wiki is a business model, pricing, manufacturing plan or named regulatory pathway; industry engagement with E-SENSE is framed around clinical credibility and usability requirements rather than commercialisation, and the honest gap they name is the need for real-world paired clinical data before a home device is justified.","realWorld_zh":"預期產品是一套居家尿液篩檢套組，其成本論證放在這樣的制度背景下：香港每位洗腎病人每年約需 50,000 港元，而目前要確診慢性腎臟病需要在三個月內多次回診，因為 uACR 的日間變異達 30% 以上，而 cystatin C 的價格是肌酸酐的數倍且很少獲得給付。每個設計決策都被推向可部署性：用尿液而非血液、不需離心、在室溫下不用酵素的恆溫放大，以及不需任何儀器、在自然光下即可判讀的顏色變化。團隊在法規與臨床定位上始終謹慎——套組被反覆描述為提示追蹤的篩檢旗標，是 eGFR 與 uACR 的補充、而非取代，套組的視覺呈現也明確標註為研究概念、不是經驗證的診斷產品。wiki 上沒有的是商業模式、定價、製造計畫或指名的法規路徑；與 E-SENSE 的產業交流也是圍繞臨床可信度與可用性要求、而非商業化，而他們自己點名的誠實缺口是：在居家裝置站得住腳之前，仍需要真實世界的配對臨床資料。","partners":["Professor Szeto Cheuk Chun, Chinese University of Hong Kong (urinary biomarkers)","Professor Chan Ting Fung (RNA biology)","Professor Ma Ming Yao (nephrologist)","Professor Tang Chi Wai, Sydney (nephrologist)","Dr. Au Wing Han (nephrologist)","E-SENSE Innovation & Technology Limited","a clinical medical laboratory technologist","Salesian Yip Hon Millennium Primary School","Shek Lei Catholic Primary School","St. Paul's School (Lam Tin)","Hoi Ping Chamber of Commerce Secondary School","Wageningen iGEM 2024 (miRADAR software reused)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6214/wiki/project/engineering/fig-10-complex-formation-of-toehold-7-for-mir-192-5p-nupack.avif","caption":"NUPACK equilibrium complex-formation analysis for toehold 7 against miR-192-5p; the red bars show the active toehold-miRNA complex concentration used to rank candidates alongside the HMFE-versus-TMFE comparison.","caption_zh":"以 NUPACK 分析 toehold 7 對 miR-192-5p 的平衡態複合物生成；紅色長條顯示有活性的 toehold-miRNA 複合物濃度，這與 HMFE 對 TMFE 的比較一併用來為候選排序。","credit":"Team HongKong-HS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6214/wiki/project/engineering/fig-46-mirna-h1-h2-complex.avif","caption":"Predicted minimum-free-energy structure of the miR-192-5p-H1-H2 hybridisation chain reaction complex, used to verify polymer formation and that the inserted G-quadruplex motifs sit in the hairpin loops.","caption_zh":"miR-192-5p-H1-H2 雜交鏈反應複合物的預測最小自由能結構，用來確認聚合物會形成，以及插入的 G-四聯體基序確實位在髮夾環上。","credit":"Team HongKong-HS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6214/wiki/project/results/hcr/results-fig18-coloured-result-of-h1-h2-g-quadruplex-with-hemin-and-tmbs.avif","caption":"The naked-eye readout the whole project was redesigned to reach: HCR products with G-quadruplex/hemin DNAzyme oxidising TMB across a range of miR-21 and miR-192 concentrations, stopped with sulphuric acid and read at 450 nm.","caption_zh":"整個專題為之重新設計、最終要達到的肉眼讀數：HCR 產物上的 G-四聯體/hemin DNAzyme 在一系列 miR-21 與 miR-192 濃度下氧化 TMB，以硫酸終止反應後於 450 nm 讀取。","credit":"Team HongKong-HS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6214/wiki/education/figure-5.avif","caption":"A primary student using the team's magnetic toehold-switch model to simulate miRNA detection - only the target miRNA card contains a hidden magnet, so molecular specificity becomes something a child can feel.","caption_zh":"一位小學生用團隊的磁性 toehold switch 模型模擬 miRNA 偵測——只有標的 miRNA 卡片裡藏著磁鐵，於是分子專一性變成一個小孩摸得到的東西。","credit":"Team HongKong-HS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Two things to steal. First, NUPACK plus a reused iGEM software tool (Wageningen's miRADAR) is a complete, free, high-school-feasible dry lab: HongKong-HS ranked 16 candidate switches on explicit thermodynamic criteria (HMFE vs TMFE, downstream secondary structure blocking the RBS, equilibrium base-pair probability) and predicted the background-leakage failure mode before the gel showed it. Second, their wiki proves that the best data visualisation is mechanism animation plus per-figure provenance - every statistic carries its own population, year and source, and the AI-generated product imagery is labelled as such, which is exactly the standard a research centre's outputs should hold itself to.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"有兩點值得借走。第一，NUPACK 再加上一個重複利用的 iGEM 軟體工具（Wageningen 的 miRADAR）就構成一套完整、免費、高中可行的乾實驗：HongKong-HS 依明確的熱力學標準（HMFE 對 TMFE、下游二級結構是否遮蔽 RBS、平衡態鹼基配對機率）為 16 個候選開關排序，並在膠片顯示之前就預測出背景洩漏這種失效模式。第二，他們的 wiki 證明最好的資料視覺化就是機制動畫加上每張圖各自的出處——每一項統計數據都附上自己的族群、年份與來源，AI 生成的產品圖也如實標註，而這正是一個研究中心的產出應該自我要求的標準。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-hs/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-hs/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-hs/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-hs/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-hs/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-hs/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-hs/safety","https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-hs/contribution","https://api.igem.org/v1/teams/6214"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（傳染病 / 治療 / 診斷 / 腫瘤）"],"rank":84},"6219":{"team":"XJTLU-Software","id":"6219","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"Software & AI","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-software/","projectTitle":"AMPilot","tagline":"An AI research workbench for antimicrobial peptide design, where the application owns the research record and the model only ever receives a request.","summary":"AMPilot is a live, hosted AI-assisted research workbench for antimicrobial peptide design, built around the argument that a conversation is an entry point but the research has to live in inspectable materials. Sources stay linked to their records, candidate sequences stay in files, and documents remain editable after the conversation moves on, across twelve implemented research stages grouped into five phases from framing a question to a bench handoff. The team wrote their own agent harness rather than using LangChain, LlamaIndex, AutoGen, DSPy or LiteLLM, specifically so the application rather than a framework owns the saved research state and the policy that turns it into model context, and so that a model proposal becomes an executable action only through a validated tool boundary. The sequence generator, TC-SRF, adapts the ProtFlow latent flow-matching pipeline with scientific-text conditioning via cross-attention and adaptive normalisation plus a constraint-aware decoder that refuses a residue unless some allowed suffix can still satisfy the stated length, charge and composition contract. Validation includes a 16-participant randomised AB/BA crossover user study, which is the most rigorous usability evidence any iGEM software team produced this year.","awards":["Best Software & AI Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A Vue frontend rendering documents, files, questions and progress from server state, over a Python backend (Python 3.11, Node.js 22.12+) whose two named components are StudioRunner, which reads the workspace, runs the engine and reconciles delivery, and CompatibleEngine, which owns the inner model and tool loop and sends ordinary JSON over HTTP via httpx. Persistent state is SQLite with WAL, foreign-key checks and a busy timeout, holding tasks, sources, attachments, research items, questions, decisions and versioned documents, with transactions and version checks so a stale edit cannot silently overwrite a newer document. There are three deliberately separated entry points: five public scientific API routes that need no account, the authenticated hosted workbench (which locks the engine to the self-developed compatible path), and a local MCP bridge started with 'npm run mcp' that accepts a loopback backend and exposes a filtered read-only tool subset, with generation, evaluation, document writing and construct creation excluded by a mutating-tool filter. The team is explicit about what 'self-developed' does and does not mean: the dependency manifest has no agent framework, but ordinary libraries, external language models and scientific packages remain dependencies, and using an SDK would not inherently surrender control of message history; an optional Codex app-server adapter exists but delegates its inner runtime and is kept as a separate, non-conflated path. Licence Apache-2.0, with the TC-SRF-AMP generator MIT-licensed and carrying its own upstream attribution. Live at https://ampilotlab.com (Guest mode with checkpoints in the browser; API docs at /docs, OpenAPI at /openapi.json); source at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/xjtlu-software/ampilot, pinned at commit 31c2491 for the wiki.","dataviz":"The workbench presents a sequence workspace where a circular plasmid map and the base-level sequence stay connected to the original GenBank annotations, a public knowledge base with separate entry points into catalogues of sequences, MIC values, literature, drugs, clinical trials and patents, and a progress rail that makes unfinished stages visible. The rail's twelve stages are checked against saved outputs rather than against a conversational claim that a stage is complete, which is the key design idea. The measurement planner uses a typed claim rather than free text: a reading carries its quantity and endpoint, unit and subject, target organism, basis (predicted, observed or inferred), the model and the data it was fitted on, and the conditions and scope within which its interpretation applies, with compatible quantities and units checked at that boundary. Every screenshot on the wiki is captioned with its capture date (17 October 2026), the record shown, and an explicit statement that it illustrates the interface and not a biological outcome or a measured user benefit.","datascience":"Three layers of evidence, all dated and tied to commits. CI: on 2026-10-20 the team retrieved GitLab's job records and JUnit report for pipeline 776168 at commit 1ca9596, with all six jobs (lint, bundle, frontend, backend-rest, backend-science, backend-agent) passing: 2,622 backend tests passed with 43 skipped and 0 failures, plus 153 frontend tests. They then publish exactly what CI skipped and why (7 for a missing curated document index, 24 for an uninstalled clinical library, 2 for a missing research corpus, 2 for the unvendored HemoPI2 program, and so on), stating that the pipeline's fallback permits such skips so a green pipeline is not evidence every scientific model ran, and that a module skipped at collection can stand for more than one uncollected test. A separate fresh local full-suite run on a Mac mini at the same commit gave 2,677 passed, 1 skipped, 0 failed, and the team discloses that one installed regressor's digest differs from the public asset manifest, records both digests, and says the run tests the installed environment rather than certifying byte-identical assets. A local storage microbenchmark measured 400 reads and 400 writes across 8 workers on synthetic data (read 294.1 ops/s at P95 32.47 ms, write 2,895.6 ops/s at P95 4.86 ms, Python 3.11.16, SQLite 3.53.4, Darwin arm64, WAL with synchronous=FULL) and says plainly that this measures storage operations, not simultaneous users or model throughput. The TC-SRF checkpoint was inspected on 19 October 2026 under a restricted CPU load with a matching SHA-256: training step 10,000, best validation total loss 0.1246988252 at step 10,000, zero stale validation evaluations, with the team stating these are stored training state rather than a newly measured score and that they do not prove convergence, recover the loss trajectory or establish validation-set independence. The user study is the standout: 16 participants (8 bioinformatics postgraduates, 8 experimental researchers), each using both a conventional toolchain (PubMed plus web tools plus local scripts) and AMPilot, in a randomised AB/BA crossover with 8 per order, parallel tasks crossed with tools, and at least 48 hours between sessions. Tasks were salt-tolerant short cationic peptides for P. aeruginosa and protease-resistant short amphipathic peptides for MRSA. Results: completion 11/16 conventional vs 15/16 AMPilot; task time 142.5 +/- 28.6 vs 41.2 +/- 37.3 minutes with non-completions assigned the 180-minute cap, a paired reduction of 101.3 minutes (95% CI 81.4-121.2, SEM 9.35); operation and format errors 3.8 +/- 1.2 vs 0.4 +/- 0.5; System Usability Scale 58.2 +/- 9.4 vs 84.5 +/- 6.2. A completers-only sensitivity analysis is reported separately and labelled descriptive rather than paired because the subsets differ. The team states the study supports integration for these tasks and does not establish improved candidate activity, general effectiveness, or a population-wide usability ranking.","software":"The engineering argument is about who owns context, and it is the most interesting one in iGEM 2026. A long research task accumulates source passages, candidate evaluations, document versions and revised decisions; sending every repeated body is wasteful, but replacing them with a fluent model-written summary erases their identity and scope. AMPilot therefore constructs each request from explicit records with a preserved path back to omitted detail, under three stated rules (retention of identifiers, current verdicts and tool order; non-mutation, meaning a request is projected and the saved record is never overwritten; retrieval, meaning the place omitted evidence can be read again is always named). Concretely: the two most recent eligible search responses stay intact while older ones become source indexes only when the replacement is shorter, with a route back via read_source(source_id); the two most recent heavy analysis reads stay whole while older ones are truncated at 400 serialized characters per field without generating a new model-written summary, with a route back via read_research_item(item_id); and when the outer snapshot is rebuilt, revoked decisions move from confirmed_decisions into withdrawn_decisions so a retracted choice stops acting as a requirement while remaining in the audit record. Two loops with two responsibilities: an outer pass reads the workspace and builds the snapshot, while the inner provider loop projects a request-local copy of the message list, streams the response, validates and executes tool calls, matches results to tool-call IDs and appends receipts, with a 32-logical-response budget across a turn (and the honest note that transport retries and evidence-review calls fall outside that count). The tool registry supplies JSON Schema to the model and validates incoming arguments again on the server, refusing unknown tools, invalid arguments and mutations without an active task, and the wiki adds that a valid schema establishes a well-formed request, not a correct scientific conclusion. Delivery reconciliation is the mechanism that most directly addresses LLM failure: after the engine returns, StudioRunner checks promised work against saved outputs and outstanding questions, because 'a fluent closing message is not a delivery receipt', and if a summary fails evidence review after a report was already saved, a deterministic receipt links to the existing work instead of publishing the unchecked summary. Failure handling is designed rather than incidental: a stop records a cancelled task state, supersedes pending proposals, terminates the TC-SRF subprocess and kills it after a grace period, and rejects late publication by checking task status before any workspace write; a version conflict returns a conflict rather than overwriting, so an agent cannot silently restore figures the researcher removed; and an unresolved claim keeps the evidence and stores objections with the draft rather than treating them as approval. Five public API routes expose single functions without a chat thread: POST /api/v1/peptides/evaluate, POST /api/v1/peptides/assay, POST /api/v1/constructs/design (GenBank and SBOL out), GET /api/v1/corpus/search and POST /api/v1/measurements/plan, each row on the wiki carrying its own stated limit (the public corpus route is lexical and explicitly not the local BGE-M3 hybrid retrieval pipeline; the measurement route returns 503 when its bundle is unavailable). Reproducibility is staged honestly: a fresh checkout is described as a starting point rather than every runtime dependency, with predictor and explorer assets fetched through a manifest and SHA-256-checked, local artifacts rebuilt and content-checked, and optional neural services configured separately, with the note that fetched-file checksums and rebuilt-artifact content checks are different guarantees and that not all SQLite or serialized model files are byte-identical across platforms. Data lifecycle is recover-first: Trash stops active work and retains the research, permanent removal requires an exact-record confirmation plus a check that background work has stopped, file cleanup failures stay queued for retry, and the 30-day maintenance command is described as administrator-operated rather than an automatic timer, with the explicit statement that row deletion is not physical-media erasure and that the guide does not promise regulatory compliance. Deployment limits are named too: replicated recovery and a PostgreSQL migration remain work to validate before anyone describes this as distributed high availability. A smaller reusable amp-select package is published separately.","stack":["Python 3.11","Vue","Node.js 22.12+","SQLite (WAL)","httpx","JSON Schema tool contracts","OpenAPI","MCP (local read-only bridge)","ProtFlow latent flow-matching","Hourglass / CHEAP / HPCT protein compression","12-layer transformer velocity field","BGE-M3 hybrid retrieval (local)","GenBank","SBOL","GitLab CI (6 jobs)","Apache-2.0 (AMPilot) / MIT (TC-SRF-AMP)"],"techniques":["application-owned agent harness with bounded logical-response budget","non-destructive request projection with routes back to omitted evidence","delivery reconciliation of promised work against saved outputs","optimistic-concurrency version conflict handling","latent flow matching with text conditioning (cross-attention plus adaptive layer normalisation)","condition-consistency auxiliary loss","constraint-aware look-ahead decoding over length, charge, composition and fixed positions","typed measurement claims with unit and quantity compatibility checking","lexical and semantic (BGE-M3 hybrid) literature retrieval with provenance","study-conditioned measurement planning","randomised AB/BA crossover user study with paired analysis and 95% CIs","System Usability Scale measurement","asset-manifest checksum verification"],"frameworks_zh":"前端以 Vue 從伺服器狀態渲染文件、檔案、問題與進度；後端為 Python（Python 3.11、Node.js 22.12+），其中兩個具名元件是 StudioRunner——負責讀取工作區、執行引擎並核對交付——以及 CompatibleEngine，掌管內層的模型與工具迴圈，並透過 httpx 以 HTTP 傳送一般的 JSON。持久化狀態存於 SQLite，啟用 WAL、外鍵檢查與 busy timeout，保存任務、來源、附件、研究項目、問題、決策以及帶版本的文件，並以交易與版本檢查確保過時的編輯不會無聲覆寫較新的文件。入口被刻意分成三個：五條無需帳號的公開科學 API 路徑；需登入的代管工作台（引擎被鎖定在自行開發的相容路徑上）；以及以 npm run mcp 啟動的本機 MCP 橋接，它只接受回路（loopback）後端，並只暴露經過篩選的唯讀工具子集，生成、評估、文件寫入與構築體建立都被「會改動狀態的工具」過濾器排除在外。團隊明確界定「自行開發」是什麼、不是什麼：依賴清單中沒有任何 agent 框架，但一般函式庫、外部語言模型與科學套件仍然是依賴；而且使用 SDK 本身並不等於交出訊息歷史的控制權。另有一個選用的 Codex app-server 轉接層，但它會把內層執行時期委派出去，因此被保留為一條獨立、不與主路徑混為一談的路徑。授權為 Apache-2.0，TC-SRF-AMP 生成器則為 MIT 授權並附上自己的上游出處標註。網站已上線於 https://ampilotlab.com （Guest 模式在瀏覽器中保留檢查點；API 文件在 /docs，OpenAPI 在 /openapi.json）；原始碼在 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/xjtlu-software/ampilot ，wiki 所對應的版本固定在 commit 31c2491。","dataviz_zh":"工作台提供一個序列工作區，其中環狀質體圖譜與鹼基層級的序列都與原始 GenBank 註解保持連動；另有一個公開知識庫，對序列、MIC 數值、文獻、藥物、臨床試驗與專利各目錄設有獨立入口；以及一條進度軌，讓尚未完成的階段一目了然。進度軌上的十二個階段，是以已儲存的輸出來檢核，而不是以對話中「這階段完成了」的宣稱為準，這是整個設計的關鍵想法。量測規劃器使用具型別的主張而非自由文字：一筆讀值會帶著它的量值與指標、單位與受測對象、目標菌種、依據（預測、觀測或推論）、所用模型與其擬合所依據的資料，以及其解釋適用的條件與範圍，而量值與單位的相容性就在那個邊界上檢查。wiki 上每張截圖的圖說都註明擷取日期（2026 年 10 月 17 日）、畫面所顯示的紀錄，並明白寫出它呈現的是介面，而不是生物學結果或實測的使用者效益。","datascience_zh":"三層證據，全部標註日期並綁定到特定 commit。CI 方面：2026-10-20 團隊取出 GitLab 上 pipeline 776168（commit 1ca9596）的工作紀錄與 JUnit 報告，六個 job（lint、bundle、frontend、backend-rest、backend-science、backend-agent）全部通過：後端 2,622 項測試通過、43 項跳過、0 項失敗，另有 153 項前端測試。接著他們把 CI 究竟跳過了什麼、原因為何逐條公開（7 項因缺少已整理的文件索引、24 項因未安裝臨床函式庫、2 項因缺少研究語料、2 項因未隨附 HemoPI2 程式，依此類推），並說明 pipeline 的後援機制允許這類跳過，因此一條綠燈的 pipeline 不能證明每個科學模型都跑過，而且在收集階段被跳過的一個模組，可能代表不只一項未被收集的測試。另外在同一個 commit 上於 Mac mini 進行的全新本機完整測試，結果為 2,677 項通過、1 項跳過、0 項失敗；團隊並揭露其中一個已安裝迴歸器的摘要值與公開資產清單不符，同時記下兩個摘要值，並說明這次執行測的是已安裝的環境，而不是認證資產位元完全相同。一項本機儲存層的微基準測試在合成資料上以 8 個 worker 量測 400 次讀取與 400 次寫入（讀取 294.1 ops/s、P95 32.47 ms；寫入 2,895.6 ops/s、P95 4.86 ms；Python 3.11.16、SQLite 3.53.4、Darwin arm64、WAL 搭配 synchronous=FULL），並直接說明這測的是儲存操作，而不是同時上線人數或模型吞吐量。TC-SRF 的檢查點於 2026 年 10 月 19 日在受限 CPU 負載下檢視，SHA-256 相符：訓練步數 10,000、最佳驗證總損失 0.1246988252（出現在第 10,000 步）、零筆過期的驗證評估；團隊說明這些是已儲存的訓練狀態，而非新量測的分數，並不能證明收斂、重建損失軌跡或確立驗證集的獨立性。使用者研究是最突出的部分：16 位參與者（8 位生物資訊研究生、8 位實驗研究人員），每人都使用傳統工具鏈（PubMed 加網頁工具加本機程式）與 AMPilot 兩者，採隨機化 AB/BA 交叉設計、每種順序 8 人，平行任務與工具交叉配置，兩次操作之間至少間隔 48 小時。任務分別是針對 P. aeruginosa 的耐鹽短鏈陽離子肽，以及針對 MRSA 的抗蛋白酶短鏈兩親性肽。結果：完成數為傳統工具 11/16 對 AMPilot 15/16；任務耗時 142.5 +/- 28.6 分鐘對 41.2 +/- 37.3 分鐘（未完成者以 180 分鐘上限計），配對後縮短 101.3 分鐘（95% CI 81.4-121.2，SEM 9.35）；操作與格式錯誤 3.8 +/- 1.2 對 0.4 +/- 0.5；系統可用性量表 58.2 +/- 9.4 對 84.5 +/- 6.2。僅計完成者的敏感度分析另外報告，並標示為描述性而非配對分析，因為兩組的子集合並不相同。團隊說明這項研究支持的是在這些任務上整合使用，並未證明候選分子活性提升、一般性的有效性，或適用於整體族群的可用性排名。","software_zh":"這個工程論點談的是上下文歸誰掌管，也是 iGEM 2026 中最有意思的一個。一項長時間的研究任務會累積文獻段落、候選評估、文件版本與修訂過的決策；把每一段重複的本體都送出去很浪費，但換成一份流暢的、由模型撰寫的摘要，則會抹去它們的身分與適用範圍。因此 AMPilot 每次都從明確的紀錄組建請求，並保留一條回到被省略細節的路徑，依據三條明述的規則：保留（保留識別碼、當前判定與工具順序）；不變動（請求是投影出來的，已儲存的紀錄永不被覆寫）；可取回（被省略的證據可在何處再次讀取，一律明確指出）。具體做法是：最近兩筆符合條件的搜尋回應完整保留，較舊的只在替換後更短時才轉為來源索引，並透過 read_source(source_id) 留下回頭路；最近兩筆較龐大的分析讀取完整保留，較舊的每個欄位截斷為 400 個序列化字元，且不另外產生模型撰寫的摘要，並透過 read_research_item(item_id) 留下回頭路；而當外層快照重建時，被撤回的決策會從 confirmed_decisions 移到 withdrawn_decisions，使已撤回的選擇不再作為需求發揮作用，但仍留在稽核紀錄中。兩個迴圈各有一份職責：外層走一遍工作區、建出快照；內層的供應商迴圈則投影出一份屬於該次請求的訊息串副本，串流回應、驗證並執行工具呼叫、把結果對應回工具呼叫 ID 並附上回執，單一回合的預算為 32 個邏輯回應（並誠實註明傳輸重試與證據審查呼叫不計入這個數字）。工具註冊表向模型提供 JSON Schema，並在伺服器端再次驗證傳入的參數，拒絕未知工具、無效參數，以及在沒有進行中任務時的狀態改動；wiki 並補上一句：通過 schema 驗證只確立請求格式正確，並不代表科學結論正確。交付核對是最直接針對 LLM 失誤的機制：引擎回傳後，StudioRunner 會把承諾的工作與已儲存的輸出及尚未解決的問題逐項比對，因為「一段流暢的結語不是交付證明」；若報告已儲存但摘要未通過證據審查，系統會給出一份決定性的回執，連結到既有成果，而不是發布那份未經檢核的摘要。失效處理是設計出來的，而不是順便做的：停止動作會記錄任務的取消狀態、作廢待處理的提議、終止 TC-SRF 子程序並在寬限期後強制結束，並在任何寫入工作區之前檢查任務狀態以拒絕遲來的發布；版本衝突會回傳衝突而不是覆寫，因此 agent 無法無聲地把研究者刪掉的圖還原回去；而未解決的主張則保留證據，把異議與草稿一起存下，而不是當成同意。五條公開 API 路徑在沒有對話串的情況下各提供單一功能：POST /api/v1/peptides/evaluate、POST /api/v1/peptides/assay、POST /api/v1/constructs/design（輸出 GenBank 與 SBOL）、GET /api/v1/corpus/search 以及 POST /api/v1/measurements/plan；wiki 上每一列都標明自己的限制（公開語料路徑是詞彙式檢索，並明確指出不是本機的 BGE-M3 混合檢索管線；量測路徑在其資源包不可用時回傳 503）。可重現性分階段交代得很誠實：全新 checkout 被描述為起點，而不是涵蓋所有執行時期依賴；預測器與探索器資產透過清單取得並做 SHA-256 檢查，本機產物則重新建置並做內容檢查，選用的神經網路服務另行設定；並註明下載檔案的檢查碼與重建產物的內容檢查是兩種不同的保證，而且並非所有 SQLite 或序列化模型檔在不同平台上都位元完全相同。資料生命週期以可復原為先：丟進垃圾桶會停止進行中的工作但保留研究內容；永久刪除需要逐筆精確確認，並檢查背景作業已停止；檔案清除失敗會留在佇列中重試；而 30 天的維護指令被描述為由管理者手動執行，而不是自動計時器；文件並明白寫出刪除資料列不等於實體媒體抹除，指南也不承諾符合法規遵循。部署上的限制也具名列出：在任何人把它稱為分散式高可用性之前，複本復原與 PostgreSQL 遷移都還是待驗證的工作。另有一個較小、可重複使用的 amp-select 套件單獨發布。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education is organised as three pathways (observe and explain; design and test; critique and deliberate) joined by adaptation and a shared foundation in synthetic biology and engineering thinking, reaching 6 learner groups, over 300 participants, 8 or more organisations and institutions, and 15 or more activities. The plan was built from expert advice before delivery rather than after: the team took the question of how to help people with very different backgrounds find their own way in to Dr Justin Fendos, trained at the Yale Teaching Center and founding director of the Dongseo Scientific Teaching Center in South Korea, across two visits, and shaped the plan around how he adapts materials to a syllabus and to a learner's stage. The stated aim was to teach the ideas behind synthetic biology even where they extend beyond AMPilot itself.","ihp":"The guiding image is a ship built inside a glass bottle: it may have beautiful sails and never know whether it can withstand real wind. The team's framework insists software teams should not move from idea to implementation, but should ground the idea in social reality, narrow it to a real bottleneck, translate that into a scope, and only then develop along two parallel tracks of fitting real practice and learning to act responsibly. Stakeholders deliberately spanned clinical medicine, infection and antimicrobial resistance research, environmental science and One Health, and experimental AMP work, grouped by principal contribution and engaged at every stage rather than in one round of interviews. A respiratory physician with over ten years of clinical experience at Nanjing Brain Hospital, including severe respiratory infection and respiratory failure, and a documented case at a hospital in Wuhu, Anhui where a patient acquired a resistant infection, anchored the clinical reality. Environmental and One Health input then widened the frame from hospital treatment to the pathways by which antibiotics, resistant bacteria and resistance genes circulate, and the team records the resulting complication honestly: pollution sources, microbial communities and detection capacity vary, and no single indicator can fully describe the risk. The 16-participant crossover study is itself an integrated human practices output, run by the HP team and reported on the software page with its design, its confidence intervals and its stated limits.","realWorld":"The problem is anchored in The Lancet's 2024 global burden estimate: 4.71 million deaths associated with bacterial antimicrobial resistance in 2021, 1.14 million attributable to it, and a reference-scenario projection of roughly 1.91 million attributable deaths annually by 2050, with knock-on effects on surgery and cancer care that depend on effective infection control. The named audiences are AMP researchers at universities and research institutions, synthetic biology and iGEM teams, and early-stage R&D professionals in biopharmaceutical companies. The team frames the longer-term goal as making the workflow reusable for other functional peptides by swapping domain knowledge, generation and evaluation models and experimental requirements. Contributions are offered at three independently usable levels: the software and its interfaces, an organised AMP knowledge base, and human practices questions and editable records for connecting stakeholder engagement to design.","partners":["Nanjing Brain Hospital (respiratory medicine)","AMR and One Health researchers","Dr Justin Fendos (Yale Teaching Center / Dongseo Scientific Teaching Center)","DKU (scientific exchange)","SJTU-Software (AI x Synthetic Biology Roundtable)","Xi'an Jiaotong-Liverpool University"],"publicEngagement_zh":"教育工作編排為三條路徑（觀察與解釋；設計與測試；批判與商議），由因材調整與合成生物學及工程思維的共同基礎串起，觸及 6 個學習者群體、逾 300 位參與者、8 個以上的組織與機構，以及 15 場以上的活動。計畫是先取得專家建議才執行，而不是事後補：團隊把「如何幫助背景差異極大的人各自找到切入點」這個問題，分兩次拜訪請教 Dr Justin Fendos——他受訓於 Yale Teaching Center，並是南韓 Dongseo Scientific Teaching Center 的創始主任——並依他如何將教材配合課綱與學習者階段調整的方式來塑形整個計畫。他們明述的目標是傳授合成生物學背後的觀念，即使那些觀念已超出 AMPilot 本身。","ihp_zh":"貫穿全篇的意象是一艘造在玻璃瓶裡的船：帆或許很漂亮，卻永遠不知道自己能否撐住真正的風。團隊的框架主張：軟體隊伍不該直接從想法走到實作，而應先把想法落在社會現實上、收斂到一個真實的瓶頸、轉譯成專案範圍，然後才沿兩條並行軸線開發——貼合真實實務，以及學習負責任地行動。利害關係人刻意橫跨臨床醫學、感染與抗藥性研究、環境科學與 One Health，以及 AMP 的實驗工作，按主要貢獻分組，並在每個階段持續互動，而不是集中在一輪訪談。臨床現實由兩件事定錨：一位在 Nanjing Brain Hospital 累積十年以上臨床經驗、處理過嚴重呼吸道感染與呼吸衰竭的胸腔科醫師，以及一件記錄在案的病例——安徽蕪湖某醫院一名病人感染了具抗藥性的細菌。接著環境與 One Health 的意見把框架從醫院治療拉寬到抗生素、抗藥菌與抗藥基因的流通途徑，而團隊也誠實記下隨之而來的複雜性：污染來源、微生物群落與檢測能力各地不同，沒有任何單一指標能完整描述風險。那項 16 人的交叉設計研究本身就是整合式人類實踐的產出，由 HP 團隊執行，並連同設計、信賴區間與明述的限制一起報告在軟體頁面上。","realWorld_zh":"問題以 The Lancet 2024 年的全球疾病負擔估計定錨：2021 年有 471 萬例死亡與細菌抗藥性相關，其中 114 萬例可直接歸因；在參考情境下，預計到 2050 年每年約有 191 萬例可歸因死亡；此外還會連帶衝擊依賴有效感染控制的外科手術與癌症照護。明確指名的受眾是大學與研究機構的 AMP 研究者、合成生物學與 iGEM 隊伍，以及生技製藥公司的早期研發人員。團隊把較長期的目標定為：藉由更換領域知識、生成與評估模型以及實驗需求，讓整套工作流程可重複用於其他功能性肽。貢獻分三個可各自獨立使用的層次：軟體及其介面、一套整理好的 AMP 知識庫，以及把利害關係人互動連結到設計決策的人類實踐問題與可編輯紀錄。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6219/wiki/software/ampilot-live-sequence-workspace-v2.avif","caption":"The live AMPilot sequence workspace: a circular map of the public reference record 1S with the base-level sequence and annotation list kept connected to the original GenBank annotations.","credit":"Team XJTLU-Software, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"AMPilot 已上線的序列工作區：公開參考紀錄 1S 的環狀圖譜，鹼基層級序列與註解清單都與原始 GenBank 註解保持連動。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6219/wiki/software/ampilot-live-knowledge-explorer-v2.avif","caption":"The live public knowledge base, with separate entry points into the sequence, MIC, literature, drug, clinical-trial and patent catalogues.","credit":"Team XJTLU-Software, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"已上線的公開知識庫，對序列、MIC、文獻、藥物、臨床試驗與專利各目錄設有獨立入口。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6219/wiki/software/ampilot-live-research-canvas-v2.avif","caption":"The New research screen with an unsent example request to review evidence for AMP stability, captured as the entry interface rather than a completed run.","credit":"Team XJTLU-Software, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"New research 畫面，其中有一則尚未送出的範例請求，要求審查 AMP 穩定性的相關證據；此圖呈現的是進入介面，而不是一次已完成的執行。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6219/wiki/software/case-candidate-009.avif","caption":"An actual candidate expanded in AMPilot, showing its sequence, calculated properties and predicted MIC alongside the evidence it came from.","credit":"Team XJTLU-Software, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"AMPilot 中展開的一個實際候選分子，顯示其序列、計算所得性質與預測 MIC，旁邊並列它所依據的證據。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Make the application, not the model, own the research record: AMPilot checks a stage complete against saved outputs rather than a conversational claim, reconciles promised work against what was actually written because a fluent closing message is not a delivery receipt, and shortens repeated context by replacing bodies with indexes that name exactly how to read the detail again instead of substituting an AI summary. Then prove the tool's value the way they did, with a randomised AB/BA crossover study reporting completion, time with confidence intervals, error counts and SUS, and with a published list of exactly which CI tests were skipped and why.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-software/","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-software/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-software/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-software/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-software/user-guide","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-software/deployment-guide","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-software/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-software/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-software/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-software/results","https://ampilotlab.com","https://ampilotlab.com/docs","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/xjtlu-software/ampilot"],"projectTitle_zh":"AMPilot","tagline_zh":"一套用於抗菌肽設計的 AI 研究工作台：研究紀錄由應用程式掌管，模型從頭到尾只收到一份請求。","summary_zh":"AMPilot 是一套已上線、代管的 AI 輔助研究工作台，用於抗菌肽設計，其核心主張是：對話只是入口，研究本身必須存放在可檢視的材料裡。文獻來源始終與其紀錄相連，候選序列留在檔案中，文件在對話往前推進後仍可編輯；整個流程涵蓋十二個已實作的研究階段，歸納為五個時期，從界定問題一路到交付實驗檯。團隊自行撰寫 agent 執行框架，而不採用 LangChain、LlamaIndex、AutoGen、DSPy 或 LiteLLM，目的很明確：讓已儲存的研究狀態、以及把該狀態轉成模型上下文的策略，由應用程式而非外部框架掌管；也讓模型的提議只有通過經驗證的工具邊界才會變成可執行的動作。序列生成器 TC-SRF 改編自 ProtFlow 的潛在空間流匹配管線，透過交叉注意力與自適應正規化加入科學文本條件，並配上一個具約束意識的解碼器：除非仍有某個允許的後綴能滿足既定的長度、電荷與組成條件，否則它會拒絕該殘基。驗證包含一項 16 人、隨機化 AB/BA 交叉設計的使用者研究，這是本年度所有 iGEM 軟體隊伍中最嚴謹的可用性證據。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"讓研究紀錄由應用程式而不是模型掌管：AMPilot 判斷某階段是否完成，依據的是已儲存的輸出而非對話中的宣稱；它會把承諾的工作與實際寫入的內容逐項核對，因為一段流暢的結語並不是交付證明；而縮短重複上下文的做法，是把內容本體換成索引、明確指出要如何再次讀回細節，而不是改放一份 AI 摘要。接著就照他們的方式證明工具的價值：一項隨機化 AB/BA 交叉設計研究，報告完成數、含信賴區間的耗時、錯誤次數與 SUS，並公開列出 CI 中究竟有哪些測試被跳過、以及為什麼。","awards_zh":["最佳軟體與 AI專案 — 入圍"],"rank":7},"6220":{"team":"WHU-China","id":"6220","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/whu-china/","projectTitle":"DifferPhase","projectTitle_zh":"DifferPhase","tagline":"Phase-separated condensates split plasmids unevenly at division, so one founder population differentiates into a stable division of labour","tagline_zh":"相分離凝聚體在細胞分裂時把質體不均勻地分配出去，讓單一起始族群分化成穩定的分工體系","summary":"WHU-China built DifferPhase, a platform that uses liquid-liquid phase separation to force asymmetric inheritance at cell division, so a single founder population can differentiate into several engineered sub-populations each carrying a different part of a long metabolic pathway. A YhjH-mCherry-PopZ fusion (Ymp) condenses at the cell pole and locally degrades c-di-GMP, so one daughter inherits the condensate and stays a low-c-di-GMP founder while the other becomes a high-c-di-GMP buffer cell; Slr supplies c-di-GMP to set up the gradient, and a tripartite split-GFP sensor built from GFP10-PilZ and FimX-GFP11 reports c-di-GMP in real time. Two orthogonal partitioning systems (ParB/parS and SopB/sopC) then drive different plasmids into different daughters, and a cross-interlocked dual toxin-antitoxin pair holds the resulting multi-plasmid state without antibiotics. They won Best New Composite Part in the Undergrad section and were nominated for Best New Basic Part.","summary_zh":"WHU-China 建立了 DifferPhase 平台，利用液-液相分離在細胞分裂時強制產生不對稱繼承，讓單一起始族群能分化成數個工程化子族群，各自攜帶長代謝途徑的不同片段。YhjH-mCherry-PopZ 融合蛋白（Ymp）會在細胞極凝聚，並在局部降解 c-di-GMP，因此一個子代細胞繼承凝聚體、維持低 c-di-GMP 的起始細胞狀態，另一個則變成高 c-di-GMP 的緩衝細胞；Slr 負責提供 c-di-GMP 以建立濃度梯度，而由 GFP10-PilZ 與 FimX-GFP11 組成的三元 split-GFP 感測器則即時回報 c-di-GMP 濃度。接著以兩套正交的分配系統（ParB/parS 與 SopB/sopC）把不同質體推進不同的子代細胞，並用一對交互連鎖的雙毒素-抗毒素系統，在不使用抗生素的情況下維持多質體狀態。他們獲得大學部組的 Best New Composite Part，並入圍 Best New Basic Part。","awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best New Composite Part — Winner (Undergrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Parts organised as a four-module architecture rather than a flat list (founder cell maintenance, buffer cell dedifferentiation, differentiation, plasmid maintenance), with each module's basic and composite parts grouped under a stated function, so a reader can take one module without the rest. Contribution is written as six separable deliverables: the platform, the founder-maintenance module, the asymmetric partitioning tool, the plasmid-maintenance toolkit, a semi-solid medium protocol, and the human-practices material.","frameworks_zh":"元件以四模組架構組織，而不是列成一張平面清單（起始細胞維持、緩衝細胞去分化、分化、質體維持），每個模組底下的基本元件與複合元件都歸在一個明述的功能之下，讀者因此可以只取走其中一個模組。貢獻則寫成六項可分開取用的交付物：平台本身、起始細胞維持模組、不對稱分配工具、質體維持工具包、一份半固體培養基操作流程，以及人類實踐的材料。","dataviz":"Module-level schematics for each of the four contributions (LLPS differentiation platform, Ymp founder maintenance, ParBS/SopBC asymmetric partitioning, dual-TA plasmid maintenance toolkit), plasmid maps, and confocal images of polar condensates. Parts tables carry Registry IDs linked directly to each entry, with type and main function in separate columns.","dataviz_zh":"四項貢獻各自的模組層級示意圖（LLPS 分化平台、Ymp 起始細胞維持、ParBS/SopBC 不對稱分配、雙 TA 質體維持工具包）、質體圖譜，以及細胞極凝聚體的共軛焦顯微影像。元件表格附有 Registry ID 並直接連到各個條目，型別與主要功能分列不同欄位。","datascience":"Quantitative readouts are designed into the parts rather than added afterward: the split-GFP sensor turns an intracellular second messenger into fluorescence, an MrkH/pmrkA-sfGFP cassette reports c-di-GMP-dependent activation, a parS-lacZ-J23106-mCherry-LAA reporter uses LAA-tagged degradation so fluorescence decays once the plasmid is lost (making partitioning failure measurable), and eCFP, mTagBFP and eYFP variants let several plasmids be tracked in the same field. A double-layer plate swimming assay provides a cheap quantifiable proxy for intracellular c-di-GMP.","datascience_zh":"量化讀值是設計進元件裡的，而不是事後補上：split-GFP 感測器把一個胞內第二傳訊者轉成螢光訊號；MrkH/pmrkA-sfGFP 卡匣回報 c-di-GMP 依賴性的活化；parS-lacZ-J23106-mCherry-LAA 報導子利用 LAA 標籤造成的降解，使質體一流失螢光就衰減，讓分配失敗變成可量測的事件；eCFP、mTagBFP 與 eYFP 等變異體則讓多個質體能在同一視野中同時追蹤。雙層培養盤的游動試驗另提供一個便宜又可量化的胞內 c-di-GMP 代用指標。","software":"","stack":["E. coli DH5-alpha, MG1655 and BL21(DE3)","PopZ condensates from Caulobacter crescentus","YhjH c-di-GMP phosphodiesterase","Slr diguanylate cyclase from Synechocystis PCC 6803","tripartite split-GFP (GFP1-9 / GFP10-PilZ / FimX-GFP11)","ParB-parS and SopB-sopC partitioning systems","EL222 blue-light transcription factor with pBLI","LasR/pLas and FleQ quorum circuits","ccdA/ccdB and mazE/mazF toxin-antitoxin pairs","confocal microscopy with agarose embedding"],"techniques":["engineered asymmetric division via condensate inheritance","orthogonal plasmid partitioning","sopC repeat-number variation to tune partitioning","cross-interlocked dual toxin-antitoxin plasmid maintenance","dual-inducer (arabinose/IPTG) orthogonal control from one plasmid","double-layer plate swimming assay"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Three campus pop-up events, online and in-person teaching outreach, and science comics, each pitched at a different audience and explicitly framed as inviting discussion of the technology's limitations as well as its possibilities rather than only promoting it. Channels include WeChat and Xiaohongshu.","publicEngagement_zh":"三場校園快閃活動、線上與實體的教學推廣，以及科普漫畫，各自針對不同受眾設計，並明確定位為邀請大家一起討論這項技術的限制與可能性，而不只是宣傳它。使用的管道包括微信與小紅書。","ihp":"Campus and medical-student surveys plus interviews with residents living near East Lake in Wuhan, chosen because the platform's candidate applications include water purification, so the people consulted are the ones who would live next to a deployment. Those conversations were used to understand information needs, attitudes and specific safety concerns rather than to gauge enthusiasm. Cross-disciplinary expert discussions and exchanges with other iGEM teams were then used to interrogate the platform's underlying principles and application requirements, and the team states that these perspectives clarified which questions the project still needs to answer around effectiveness, safety and public concern.","ihp_zh":"團隊做了校園與醫學生問卷，並訪談住在武漢東湖附近的居民——之所以選他們，是因為平台的候選應用之一是水質淨化，被諮詢的正是未來會住在部署地點旁邊的人。這些對話被用來理解民眾的資訊需求、態度與具體的安全顧慮，而不是用來測量支持熱度。接著以跨領域專家討論與其他 iGEM 隊伍的交流，去檢驗平台的基本原理與應用條件；團隊表示這些觀點讓他們更清楚：在成效、安全與公眾顧慮上，專案還有哪些問題需要回答。","realWorld":"There is no venture, no company and no commercial claim here, and the implementation discussion is deliberately conditional: the engineered strains are designed for controlled laboratory use only, there is no plan for environmental release, and they state that any future move toward practical products would require sealed equipment and comprehensive safety testing first. Natural rubber biosynthesis is presented as a conceptual demonstration of the platform, not as a product, with cancer therapy, water purification and plastic degradation named as directions the architecture could serve. So the real-world value is as reusable infrastructure, and on that count this is one of the better part contributions of the year. What makes these parts genuinely inheritable is fourfold. First, modular packaging: 34 parts are grouped into four functionally independent modules, and the contribution text names, for each module, who else could use it and for what, so a future team can adopt the plasmid-maintenance toolkit without touching the differentiation platform. Second, every part description states its provenance and its role in the circuit, not just its identity, including which organism a protein came from and what it contributes to the system (PopZ as the condensate scaffold ensuring asymmetric inheritance, Slr as the c-di-GMP source that establishes the gradient). Third, measurement is built in: the split-GFP c-di-GMP sensor, the MrkH-driven reporter, and especially the LAA-tagged mCherry reporter whose signal decays on plasmid loss turn otherwise invisible behaviours into assayable ones, which is what lets another team verify the part works in their hands. Fourth, and most unusually, they publish the engineering failures as part annotations: the dual-input araC-pBAD-YmP / T7-lacO-Slr circuit is documented as needing stronger T7-optimised terminators to reduce read-through, and several cassettes are annotated with the specific biTT or T7 terminator placement used to prevent read-through between transcription units. An honest note about where the terminator problem bites is more useful to a reuser than a clean claim. The dual-TA design also removes antibiotic selection entirely, which they correctly frame as reducing the spread of resistance, and the safety reasoning is specific rather than boilerplate: all chassis are BSL-1 whitelist Risk Group 1 strains, MazF and CcdB are acknowledged as potent toxins whose killing is confined to the engineered population, and no gene used encodes a virulence factor. They also standardised and published protocols (Ymp condensate confocal imaging with induction, embedding and imaging parameters; the double-layer swimming assay with medium formulations, inoculation method and data-interpretation guidance), which is the part of a contribution that usually goes missing. Continuation is framed as community reuse rather than a company: tools, protocols and a reference framework offered to future teams building multi-cell division-of-labour systems, with sopC mutants and optimisation schemes earmarked for submission as further parts.","realWorld_zh":"這裡沒有創業、沒有公司、也沒有商業主張，落地討論也刻意保持在條件句的層次：工程菌株只設計給受控的實驗室環境使用，沒有任何環境釋出的計畫；團隊也說明，未來若要往實用產品推進，必須先有密閉設備與完整的安全測試。天然橡膠的生合成只是用來概念性展示平台，不是產品；癌症治療、水質淨化與塑膠降解則被列為這套架構可能服務的方向。因此它的真實世界價值在於可重複使用的基礎設施，而就這一點而言，這是今年比較好的元件貢獻之一。讓這些元件真正可被後人接手的原因有四個。第一是模組化包裝：34 個元件被歸入四個功能獨立的模組，貢獻說明針對每個模組指名誰還能拿去用、用來做什麼，因此未來的隊伍可以只採用質體維持工具包，完全不必碰分化平台。第二，每個元件的說明都寫出來源與它在迴路中的角色，而不只是它是什麼，包括某個蛋白質取自哪種生物、以及它對整個系統有什麼貢獻（PopZ 作為確保不對稱繼承的凝聚體骨架、Slr 作為建立梯度的 c-di-GMP 來源）。第三，量測是內建的：split-GFP 的 c-di-GMP 感測器、由 MrkH 驅動的報導子，尤其是質體一流失訊號就衰減的 LAA 標籤 mCherry 報導子，把原本看不見的行為變成可檢測的對象，這正是別的隊伍能驗證元件在自己手上是否管用的關鍵。第四，也是最少見的：他們把工程失敗寫成元件註記——雙輸入的 araC-pBAD-YmP / T7-lacO-Slr 迴路被註明需要更強、針對 T7 最佳化的終止子以降低讀通，數個卡匣也標註了為避免轉錄單元之間讀通而採用的 biTT 或 T7 終止子配置位置。對重用者而言，老實說明終止子問題會在哪裡咬人，比一句漂亮的結論有用得多。雙 TA 設計也完全免除了抗生素篩選，團隊正確地把這一點解釋為減少抗藥性擴散；安全論述是具體的，而不是罐頭文字：所有底盤都是 BSL-1 白名單的 Risk Group 1 菌株，MazF 與 CcdB 被明白承認是強效毒素、但其殺菌作用限制在工程化族群之內，而且所用的基因沒有一個編碼毒力因子。他們也把操作流程標準化並公開（Ymp 凝聚體的共軛焦影像拍攝，含誘導、包埋與拍攝參數；雙層游動試驗，含培養基配方、接種方式與數據判讀指引），而這通常正是一份貢獻中最常被省略的一塊。後續規劃是面向社群重用，而不是開公司：把工具、流程與一套參考框架提供給未來要建構多細胞分工系統的隊伍，並預計把 sopC 突變體與最佳化方案再提交為新的元件。","partners":["Wuhan University School of Life Sciences (BSL-1 facilities, Regulations on the Management of Laboratory Biosafety)","Residents near East Lake, Wuhan (interviews on water-purification application and safety concerns)","Cross-disciplinary academic experts and other iGEM teams (principle and application review)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6220/wiki/whu-contribution2-fig1.avif","caption":"The LLPS-mediated platform for cellular functional differentiation, offered as a reference framework for future multi-cell division-of-labour systems","caption_zh":"以 LLPS 介導的細胞功能分化平台，作為未來多細胞分工系統的參考框架","credit":"Team WHU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6220/wiki/whu-contribution2-fig3.avif","caption":"ParBS and SopBC orthogonal condensate partitioning, the reusable tool for driving different plasmids into different daughter cells","caption_zh":"ParBS 與 SopBC 的正交凝聚體分配，是把不同質體推進不同子代細胞的可重用工具","credit":"Team WHU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6220/wiki/whu-contribution2-fig4.avif","caption":"Cross-interlocked dual toxin-antitoxin plasmid maintenance toolkit: each plasmid supplies the antitoxin for the other's toxin, so neither can be lost and no antibiotic selection is needed","caption_zh":"交互連鎖的雙毒素-抗毒素質體維持工具包：每個質體提供對方毒素所需的抗毒素，因此兩者都不會流失，也不需要抗生素篩選","credit":"Team WHU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6220/wiki/whu-contribution2-fig2.avif","caption":"Ymp (YhjH-mCherry-PopZ) founder-cell maintenance module, with the published confocal protocol for observing polar condensates","caption_zh":"Ymp（YhjH-mCherry-PopZ）起始細胞維持模組，附上已公開的共軛焦操作流程以觀察細胞極凝聚體","credit":"Team WHU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Package parts the way WHU did: group them into functionally independent modules, and for each module state in writing who outside the project could reuse it and for what, so adopters can take one piece without the whole system. Then ship the three things that actually make reuse possible — a built-in measurement part (their LAA-tagged reporter that decays on plasmid loss), the standardised protocol with induction, sample-prep and imaging parameters, and an honest annotation of the known weakness, such as terminator read-through, recorded on the part itself.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"元件就該照 WHU 的方式包裝：依功能分成彼此獨立的模組，並為每個模組明文寫出專案之外的誰可以拿去重用、用來做什麼，讓採用者能只取走其中一塊，而不必整套搬走。接著交付三樣真正讓重用成為可能的東西——內建的量測元件（他們那個質體一流失螢光就衰減的 LAA 標籤報導子）、含誘導、樣品製備與影像參數的標準化操作流程，以及對已知弱點的誠實註記，例如終止子讀通的問題，直接記在該元件本身上。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/whu-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/whu-china/parts/","https://2026.igem.wiki/whu-china/contribution/","https://2026.igem.wiki/whu-china/safety/","https://2026.igem.wiki/whu-china/description/"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳新複合元件 — 得主（大學組）"],"rank":33},"6222":{"team":"WageningenUR","id":"6222","section":"Overgrad","country":"Netherlands","village":"Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/","projectTitle":"Triton","projectTitle_zh":"Triton","tagline":"Capture, degrade and sense trifluoroacetate: a three-module biological system for the smallest forever chemical, aimed at reverse-osmosis concentrate.","tagline_zh":"捕捉、分解並偵測三氟乙酸鹽：針對最小的永久性化學物質設計的三模組生物系統，目標是逆滲透濃縮液。","summary":"Triton targets trifluoroacetate (TFA), the ultra-short-chain PFAS that makes up more than 98% of all PFAS measured in EU river and groundwater and was found in the blood of all 110 Europeans tested in a 2026 study. Rather than one trick, they built three modules shaped entirely by stakeholder input: a de novo protein binder on bacterial cellulose beads to concentrate TFA out of reverse-osmosis concentrate, a growth-coupled directed hyper-evolution platform to push fluoroacetate dehalogenases from monofluoroacetate toward difluoroacetate and then TFA, and a riboswitch biosensor for continuous on-site monitoring. The dry lab contributed two reusable tools - PIGEON, an active-learning in silico evolution loop that lifted a Boltz-2 binding probability by over 33%, and DISARM, which retargets existing aptamers to new small-molecule ligands without SELEX. They took 1st Runner-up Grand Prize plus Best Measurement, Best Presentation and Best Bioremediation Project.","summary_zh":"Triton 針對的是三氟乙酸鹽（TFA）——這種超短鏈 PFAS 佔歐盟河川與地下水所測得全部 PFAS 的 98% 以上，而 2026 年一項研究在 110 位受測歐洲人的血液中全數驗出。他們沒有只靠一招，而是做了三個完全由利害關係人意見塑形的模組：把 de novo 蛋白質結合體固定在細菌纖維素微珠上，用來把 TFA 從逆滲透濃縮液中濃縮出來；一個與生長耦合的定向超演化平台，把氟乙酸脫鹵酶從單氟乙酸推向二氟乙酸、再推向 TFA；以及一個核糖開關生物感測器，用於現場連續監測。乾實驗貢獻了兩項可重複使用的工具——PIGEON，一個主動學習的 in silico 演化迴圈，把 Boltz-2 的結合機率提升超過 33%；以及 DISARM，不需 SELEX 就能把現有核酸適體重新導向新的小分子配體。該隊拿下總冠軍亞軍，外加最佳量測、最佳簡報與最佳生物復育專案。","awards":["1st Runner-up (Overgrad)","Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Measurement — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"The capture module is a full generative-plus-evaluative protein design stack. They first searched the literature and the PDB for anything reported to bind TFA and found no strong binder, then generated de novo candidates with Proteina-Complexa and BoltzGen (both denoising generative models, seeded with the TFA conformation taken from PDB 4FVX), reasoning that evolution never had selective pressure to bind a molecule that did not exist before 1922. Every candidate was scored with Boltz-2 rather than docking, with the choice justified explicitly: AutoDock Vina treats the protein as rigid and correlated poorly with experiment (R^2 = 0.604 on a 2016 benchmark), while Boltz-2 is trained on millions of experimental binding measurements and approaches free-energy-perturbation accuracy over 1000x faster. No natural or de novo scaffold passed 0.540, held by the L-2-haloacid dehalogenase RSc1362 (PDB 3UMB). Rational pocket design came next: they mined the literature for residues that prefer the CF3 group over CH3 (arginine, methionine, glycine, histidine, glutamine, phenylalanine) with their distance preferences, used PLIP to find TFA-contacting residues, and applied a three-criterion automated mutation script - 12 of 14 mutable scaffolds improved, with a caltractin A4H substitution jumping 0.118 to 0.518, and RSc1362_v2 reaching 0.566. Then PIGEON (Protein In silico Guided Evolution and Optimization Network) closed the loop: ESM3 embeddings of the RSc1362 family paired with Boltz-2 scores train a ridge regression under repeated leave-one-out CV; ESM3 guided decoding then proposes mutations against a custom objective that rewards binding gains while preserving pTM and charges binding losses tenfold (so a 0.01 binding loss would need +0.67 pTM to break even); binding-pocket residues are protected, four designs per parent across ten parents per round, best-per-parent carried forward, newly folded scores appended to the training set. Over 50 rounds RSc1362_v3 reached 0.723, a 33% gain over wild type, with the regression's Spearman rho rising from 0.65 to 0.92 and mean pTM flat - evidence the gain was learned, not lucky. Degradation design was grounded in published QM/MM work mapping the full FAcD catalytic cycle (Asp-His-Asp triad, fluoride-binding pocket His150/Trp151/Tyr213) onto MFA, DFA and TFA, which showed the rate-determining step shifts from nucleophilic attack to C-F activation after the first fluorine and that the barrier rises ~11.8 kcal/mol from MFA to DFA but only ~1.8 from DFA to TFA; that single insight set their whole strategy of evolving for DFA first.","frameworks_zh":"捕捉模組是一整套生成加評估的蛋白質設計堆疊。他們先在文獻與 PDB 中搜尋任何被報告可結合 TFA 的蛋白質，結果沒有找到強結合者，於是用 Proteina-Complexa 與 BoltzGen（兩者都是去噪生成模型，以取自 PDB 4FVX 的 TFA 構形為起點）生成 de novo 候選，理由是演化從未有過結合一個 1922 年之前並不存在的分子的選擇壓力。每個候選都以 Boltz-2 而非對接評分，而這個選擇有明確理由：AutoDock Vina 把蛋白質視為剛性，與實驗的相關性不佳（2016 年一項基準測試中 R^2 = 0.604），而 Boltz-2 訓練於數百萬筆實驗結合量測，接近自由能擾動的精度，速度卻快 1000 倍以上。沒有任何天然或 de novo 骨架超過 0.540，該分數由 L-2-鹵酸脫鹵酶 RSc1362（PDB 3UMB）保持。接著是理性的口袋設計：他們從文獻中整理出偏好 CF3 基團勝於 CH3 的殘基（精胺酸、甲硫胺酸、甘胺酸、組胺酸、麩醯胺酸、苯丙胺酸）及其距離偏好，用 PLIP 找出接觸 TFA 的殘基，並套用一個三項判準的自動突變腳本——14 個可突變骨架中有 12 個改善，其中 caltractin 的 A4H 取代從 0.118 跳到 0.518，RSc1362_v2 則達到 0.566。然後由 PIGEON（Protein In silico Guided Evolution and Optimization Network）把迴圈閉合：RSc1362 家族的 ESM3 嵌入搭配 Boltz-2 分數，在反覆的留一交叉驗證下訓練一個脊迴歸；再由 ESM3 的引導式解碼針對自訂目標函數提出突變，該函數獎勵結合力提升、同時維持 pTM，並把結合力的損失以十倍計價（因此 0.01 的結合力損失需要 +0.67 的 pTM 才能打平）；結合口袋的殘基受到保護，每輪有十個親代、每個親代四個設計，各親代取最佳者進入下一輪，新折疊出的分數再附加回訓練集。經過 50 輪，RSc1362_v3 達到 0.723，比野生型提升 33%，而迴歸模型的 Spearman rho 從 0.65 升到 0.92、平均 pTM 持平——證明這個提升是學來的，不是碰巧。分解模組的設計則建立在已發表的 QM/MM 研究上，該研究把完整的 FAcD 催化循環（Asp-His-Asp 三元體、由 His150/Trp151/Tyr213 構成的氟離子結合口袋）對應到 MFA、DFA 與 TFA，結果顯示在第一個氟之後，速率決定步驟從親核攻擊轉為 C-F 活化，而能障從 MFA 到 DFA 上升約 11.8 kcal/mol，從 DFA 到 TFA 卻只上升約 1.8；僅憑這個洞見，就定下了他們先針對 DFA 演化的整體策略。","dataviz":"The wiki is a scroll-driven explainer that teaches the problem before the solution: TFA's ECHA Repr. 1B classification, the 110-of-110 blood result, the >98%-of-all-PFAS share and the 34-of-36 tap water samples each land as their own beat, with a stacked TFA-versus-all-other-PFAS bar and a four-property card (accumulating, unregulated, unbreakable, tiny) before the three-step Capture/Degrade/Sense walkthrough. Stakeholder quotes are first-class design elements, each with a named face, rather than buried on a human practices page - Peter Fischer's 'it's not a question of if TFA will be added to the Drinking Water Directive, it's a question of when' and Bert van der Wal's 'a TFA binder would be fantastic, then you have gold in your hands' carry the narrative. The measurement page is built as a decision aid rather than a result log: a comparison scorecard across five media lets another team pick conditions for their own question. The front page also includes a scoring widget that opens the visitor's own mail client to send feedback to the team.","dataviz_zh":"這個 wiki 是以捲動帶動的解說，先把問題教懂再談解法：TFA 的 ECHA Repr. 1B 分類、110 人中 110 人驗出的血液結果、佔全部 PFAS 超過 98% 的比例，以及 36 份自來水樣本中 34 份驗出，各自成為一個節拍；在進入捕捉／分解／偵測三步驟導覽之前，先有一張 TFA 對其他所有 PFAS 的堆疊長條圖，以及一張四項性質卡（會累積、未受管制、無法分解、極小）。利害關係人的引語是第一級的設計元素，各自配上具名的人物照片，而不是被埋在 human practices 頁面裡——Peter Fischer 的「TFA 會不會被納入飲用水指令不是問題，問題是何時」以及 Bert van der Wal 的「有了 TFA 結合蛋白會非常棒，那你手上就握著黃金」撐起了整篇敘事。量測頁面被做成決策輔助工具而非結果紀錄：一張橫跨五種介質的比較評分表，讓其他隊伍能依自己的研究問題挑選條件。首頁還有一個評分小工具，會開啟訪客自己的郵件程式，把回饋寄給團隊。","datascience":"The Best Measurement work is the data-science highlight because they treated an assay as a product. Starting from the Belcher alizarin-lanthanum fluoride chemistry as used qualitatively by Bygd et al., they rebuilt it as a quantitative method: a ratiometric readout found by searching for the isosbestic point and selecting the optimal numerator wavelength in each medium, with stated acceptance thresholds (R^2 >= 0.95, >= 40 nm separation, >= 20% signal change, positive slope) and selection by lowest LOD, then LOD = 3.3 sigma/b and LOQ = 10 sigma/b with an explicit rule for which sigma to use. Fixed conditions are all stated (100 uM 1:1 alizarin:lanthanum, 84 mM acetate buffer pH 5.2, 25 v/v% acetone added after a 1-hour dark incubation, per-well volumes in 96-well format) and the data analysis is written as a procedure rather than a result, so another team reproduces the method even if their numbers differ. They characterised it as a tool across four fluorochemicals (MFA, DFA, TFA, PFOA), two hosts (E. coli MG1655, P. putida KT2440) and five media (demi water, M9, HEPES-buffered M9, 20 mM HEPES, tap water), and documented the limits as carefully as the working range: phosphate interferes, response saturates above 40 uM, 5 mM fluorochemicals suppress signal up to 60%. Controls are enumerated by class - measurement (10 blank wells for sigma, 40 uM spike, literature condition reproduced before any change), matrix (M9 as a phosphate-interference control, 93-hour incubated supernatant, fluorochemical spikes) and biological (wild-type and empty-vector negatives, MFA as a should-work substrate, PFOA as a should-not).","datascience_zh":"獲得最佳量測的工作是資料科學上的亮點，因為他們把一項分析法當成產品來做。起點是 Bygd 等人以定性方式使用的 Belcher 茜素—鑭氟離子化學，他們把它重建為定量方法：以搜尋等吸收點並在每種介質中挑選最佳分子波長的方式，得到一組比值式讀值，並訂有明確的驗收門檻（R^2 >= 0.95、分離度 >= 40 nm、訊號變化 >= 20%、斜率為正），再以最低 LOD 作為選擇依據，接著以 LOD = 3.3 sigma/b 與 LOQ = 10 sigma/b 計算，並明訂應採用哪一個 sigma。固定條件全部寫明（100 uM、1:1 的茜素比鑭，84 mM 醋酸緩衝液 pH 5.2，暗處培養 1 小時後加入 25 v/v% 丙酮，以 96 孔格式列出每孔體積），而資料分析是寫成一套程序而非一個結果，因此其他隊伍即使數值不同也能重現方法。他們把它當成工具加以特性化，橫跨四種氟化合物（MFA、DFA、TFA、PFOA）、兩種宿主（E. coli MG1655、P. putida KT2440）與五種介質（去離子水、M9、HEPES 緩衝的 M9、20 mM HEPES、自來水），並把限制記錄得和可用範圍一樣仔細：磷酸鹽會干擾、反應在高於 40 uM 後飽和、5 mM 的氟化合物會把訊號壓抑達 60%。對照組依類別一一列出——量測類（10 個空白孔用於求 sigma、40 uM 加標、在任何改動之前先重現文獻條件）、基質類（以 M9 作為磷酸鹽干擾對照、培養 93 小時的上清液、氟化合物加標）與生物類（野生型與空載體陰性對照、以 MFA 作為應當有效的底物、以 PFOA 作為應當無效的底物）。","software":"PIGEON and DISARM, both with code on the iGEM GitLab at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/wageningenur. PIGEON is the generalisable one: an active-learning loop over ESM3 embeddings, ridge regression and ESM3 guided decoding against a user-defined objective, which the team explicitly documents as retargetable to solubility, thermostability or ipTM rather than only Boltz-2 binding probability, and which they distinguish from a conventional ML model because it proposes mutations rather than only scoring given inputs. DISARM (Detecting Interaction Sites for Aptamer Retargeting by Mutation) recommends mutations that retarget an existing aptamer or riboswitch to a new ligand of similar size: it identifies favourable nucleotide positions around the ligand, compares them with the existing aptamer's nucleotide positions and backbone connection points, and returns 50 candidates while preserving secondary structure - positioned as a partial replacement for SELEX, or at least a rational starting library. They validated 10 DISARM riboswitches in the wet lab (4 PFOA, 4 TFA, 2 scrambled controls) and reported honestly that one PFOA riboswitch met the success criterion and no TFA riboswitch did. The contribution page also packages a reusable defluorination framework - the fluoride assay with calibration procedure, controls, sample prep and analysis workflow plus a step-by-step experimental video - and a hypermutation platform and expression architecture described as adaptable to any enzyme.","software_zh":"PIGEON 與 DISARM，程式碼都放在 iGEM GitLab 的 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/wageningenur。PIGEON 是可泛用的那一個：一個在 ESM3 嵌入、脊迴歸與 ESM3 引導式解碼之上針對使用者自訂目標運作的主動學習迴圈；該隊明確記錄它可改用於溶解度、熱穩定性或 ipTM，而不限於 Boltz-2 的結合機率，並說明它與一般機器學習模型的區別在於它會提出突變，而不只是為既有輸入評分。DISARM（Detecting Interaction Sites for Aptamer Retargeting by Mutation）則推薦突變，把現有的核酸適體或核糖開關重新導向尺寸相近的新配體：它找出配體周圍有利的核苷酸位置，與現有適體的核苷酸位置及骨架連接點相比，並在維持二級結構的前提下回傳 50 個候選——定位是部分取代 SELEX，或至少提供一個理性的起始函式庫。他們在濕實驗中驗證了 10 個 DISARM 核糖開關（4 個 PFOA、4 個 TFA、2 個打亂序列對照），並誠實報告只有一個 PFOA 核糖開關達到成功標準，TFA 則沒有任何一個達到。貢獻頁面還包裝了一套可重複使用的去氟框架——氟離子分析法連同校正程序、對照組、樣品前處理與分析流程，外加一支逐步示範的實驗影片——以及一個被描述為可適用於任何酵素的超突變平台與表現架構。","stack":["Boltz-2","BoltzGen","Proteina-Complexa","ESM3 (embeddings + guided decoding)","Ridge regression (scikit-learn)","PLIP (Protein-Ligand Interaction Profiler)","AutoDock Vina (benchmarked against, not used)","AMBER / molecular dynamics","Protein Data Bank","AlphaFold (model AF-P00506-F1)","Python","iGEM GitLab","96-well plate UV-Vis absorbance (400-700 nm)","BLASTp / BLASTn against patent sequence databases"],"techniques":["de novo binder generation by denoising generative models","learned affinity prediction in place of rigid-body docking","literature-derived CF3 residue-preference rules applied as automated pocket mutations","active-learning in silico directed evolution with a custom multi-objective reward","asymmetric penalty weighting to prevent objective gaming (10x on binding loss)","binding-pocket residue protection during mutagenesis","repeated leave-one-out cross-validation on small design sets","tracking surrogate-model Spearman rho across rounds as evidence of learning","ratiometric absorbance assay with isosbestic-point calibration","LOD/LOQ determination from blank replicates","per-medium recalibration as a documented local step","growth-coupled directed hyper-evolution","in silico aptamer retargeting as a SELEX alternative"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Triton has no separate education or outreach page; its public-facing work is the wiki itself, built as a scroll-driven public explainer that teaches why TFA matters before it mentions synthetic biology - the ECHA reproductive-toxicity classification, the 110-of-110 blood study, the >98% PFAS share, the 34-of-36 tap water result - with named stakeholder quotes and faces carrying the argument, a front-page feedback widget that opens the visitor's own mail client, and a step-by-step experimental video for the fluoride assay published for other labs to follow. Their documented engagement effort went into the professional and policy community rather than schools: over 30 stakeholders through interviews, company visits and events, with every stakeholder given an explanation of why the team reached out, what was learned and what was or was not incorporated, plus a published analysis of future regulatory and industrial developments offered as a starting point for anyone working on TFA contamination.","publicEngagement_zh":"Triton 沒有獨立的教育或外展頁面；它面向公眾的工作就是 wiki 本身，做成以捲動帶動的公眾解說，在提到合成生物學之前先講清楚 TFA 為何重要——ECHA 的生殖毒性分類、110 人中 110 人的血液研究、佔 PFAS 超過 98% 的比例、36 份自來水中 34 份的結果——論證由具名的利害關係人引語與照片撐起，首頁有一個會開啟訪客自己郵件程式的回饋小工具，另有一支氟離子分析法的逐步實驗影片，公開供其他實驗室照著做。他們有紀錄的互動投注在專業與政策社群，而非學校：透過訪談、企業參訪與活動接觸超過 30 位利害關係人，每一位都附上為何主動聯繫、學到什麼、以及哪些有被納入或沒有被納入的說明，另外還公開一份對未來法規與產業發展的分析，提供給任何投入 TFA 污染議題的人作為起點。","ihp":"The most traceable chain of design changes in the cohort, and the shifts are structural rather than cosmetic. They started intending only to degrade TFA; stakeholders told them they were missing an essential step. Peter Fischer (Aqualab Zuid, one of six companies legally tasked with assessing Dutch drinking water quality) showed that TFA can only be measured by LC-MS on samples shipped to a central lab, so it is expensive, discontinuous and ex situ - which meant the bioreactor could not be operated at all, and directly created the biosensor module. Frank Schoonenberg (process engineer, Vitens) explained that reverse osmosis filters TFA but does not destroy it, that the resulting concentrate is currently discharged, and that discharging it will be prohibited - so they designed Triton to treat RO concentrate rather than drinking water, filling a need nobody currently serves. Bert van der Waal and Peyman Salehian then showed that even 5-10x RO concentration leaves TFA far too dilute (an ideal 10x on the Dutch 2.2 ug/L indicative value reaches only 22 ug/L against a milligram-per-litre target), which created the capture module. Amanda Larasati ruled out ion exchange resins because resin leaching bars them from Dutch water infrastructure. Tue Kjaergaard Nielsen warned that measuring TFA reduction produces false positives because TFA adsorbs to surfaces rather than being degraded, pushing them to measure released fluoride instead. Clemens Mayer (molecular evolution, Groningen) led them to directed evolution for an enzyme that does not yet exist. Amin Espah Borujeni helped redesign the riboswitch proof-of-concept experiments after the published plasmid failed to reproduce. Regulatory interviews established that a product containing no viable GMOs faces a considerably simpler approval path, which they explored alongside deliberate release and which shaped biosafety from an early stage. They also document conflicting stakeholder views and explain why some were not implemented.","ihp_zh":"這是本屆最可追溯的一條設計變更鏈，而且這些轉向是結構性的，不是門面功夫。他們一開始只打算分解 TFA；利害關係人告訴他們漏掉了一個必要步驟。Peter Fischer（Aqualab Zuid，法定負責評估荷蘭飲用水品質的六家公司之一）指出 TFA 目前只能把樣品送到中央實驗室以 LC-MS 量測，所以昂貴、不連續且屬於異地檢測——這意味著生物反應器根本無法運轉，也直接催生了生物感測器模組。Frank Schoonenberg（Vitens 製程工程師）說明逆滲透能濾掉 TFA 但不會把它破壞，產生的濃縮液目前直接排放，而未來排放將被禁止——於是他們把 Triton 設計成處理逆滲透濃縮液而非飲用水，填補了目前無人服務的需求。接著 Bert van der Waal 與 Peyman Salehian 指出，即使逆滲透濃縮 5 至 10 倍，TFA 仍然遠遠太稀（以荷蘭 2.2 ug/L 的指標值理想濃縮 10 倍也只到 22 ug/L，而目標是每公升毫克等級），這催生了捕捉模組。Amanda Larasati 排除了離子交換樹脂，因為樹脂析出使它們無法用於荷蘭的水利基礎設施。Tue Kjaergaard Nielsen 警告，量測 TFA 的減少會產生偽陽性，因為 TFA 會吸附到表面而非被分解，這促使他們改為量測釋出的氟離子。Clemens Mayer（分子演化，格羅寧根）引導他們走向定向演化，去做一個目前還不存在的酵素。Amin Espah Borujeni 在已發表質體無法重現之後，協助他們重新設計核糖開關的概念驗證實驗。法規訪談確立了不含活體基改生物的產品，核准路徑會明顯簡單許多，他們把這條路徑與刻意釋放一併探討，並在早期就以此形塑生物安全設計。他們也記錄了利害關係人之間相互衝突的意見，並說明為何有些沒有採納。","realWorld":"Implementation is specified as a real retrofit rather than a concept: Triton sits downstream of existing split-stream reverse osmosis at a drinking water plant, with the capture module as a granular filter of bacterial cellulose beads carrying TFA-binding proteins attached through a cellulose-binding domain, eluted with a wash buffer so beads are reused, feeding a three-day bioreactor where evolved dehalogenase turns TFA into oxalate and fluoride while the riboswitch biosensor monitors continuously. Biosafety is specified per module: the beads contain no living cells and need no extra measures, the biosensor's small water stream is collected and autoclaved, and the bioreactor effluent gets UV sterilisation before discharge. Timeline is roughly 10 years to drinking-water implementation, with permitting, certification and grid congestion named as the bottlenecks rather than construction, and the biosensor identified as the faster path. The market analysis is sharply scoped - not water treatment, not PFAS at large, but the destruction of PFAS that filtration cannot retain, noting destruction was 24.9% of the PFAS treatment market in 2025 and is the fastest-growing segment at a projected 10.1% CAGR against 7.1% overall. The business plan runs a six-phase TRL 3 to 9 roadmap with a gate per phase, a cost analysis across physical and human capital, 2.6M euro to raise and break-even in 2033, six commercial and adoption risks each with a mitigation, five technical failure modes each with a fallback, an operational plan with a Dreyfus-model skill gap analysis resolved build/borrow/outsource, and a SWOT identifying a co-development partner as the predominant stakeholder. IP is worked out concretely: the software is not patentable because its source is deposited on the iGEM GitLab (but is copyright-protected), while BLASTp against the patented protein database returned only 43.30% maximum identity for DAR3835 and H1_ML against claims requiring 95%, so the evolved enzymes remain patentable.","realWorld_zh":"實作被指定為真正的既有設施改裝，而不是一個概念：Triton 設在飲用水廠既有分流式逆滲透的下游，捕捉模組是一座以細菌纖維素微珠構成的顆粒濾床，微珠上透過纖維素結合區域接上 TFA 結合蛋白，以沖洗緩衝液洗脫後微珠可重複使用，接著進入一座停留三天的生物反應器，由演化後的脫鹵酶把 TFA 轉成草酸鹽與氟離子，同時由核糖開關生物感測器連續監測。生物安全依模組分別規定：微珠不含活細胞，不需額外措施；生物感測器的小量水流會被收集並高壓滅菌；生物反應器出流則在排放前先經紫外線滅菌。時程上約需 10 年才能進入飲用水應用，而被指名的瓶頸是許可、認證與電網壅塞，而不是施工，生物感測器則被認定是較快的路徑。市場分析的範圍劃得很銳利——不是水處理、也不是整個 PFAS 領域，而是過濾無法攔住之 PFAS 的破壞處理；文中指出破壞處理在 2025 年佔 PFAS 處理市場的 24.9%，且是成長最快的區段，預估年複合成長率 10.1%，相對於整體的 7.1%。商業計畫包含一份六階段、TRL 3 到 9 的路線圖，每階段設有關卡，一份涵蓋實體與人力資本的成本分析，需募資 260 萬歐元並於 2033 年損益兩平，六項商業與採用風險各附緩解措施，五種技術失效模式各附備案，一份以 Dreyfus 模型做技能落差分析並以自建／借用／外包解決的營運計畫，以及一份把共同開發夥伴認定為最主要利害關係人的 SWOT。智慧財產權也處理得很具體：軟體因原始碼已存放於 iGEM GitLab 而不可申請專利（但受著作權保護），而以 BLASTp 比對專利蛋白質資料庫，DAR3835 與 H1_ML 對要求 95% 相同度的專利請求項只有最高 43.30% 相同度，因此演化後的酵素仍可申請專利。","partners":["Vitens (Frank Schoonenberg, process engineer)","Aqualab Zuid (Peter Fischer, scientific advisor)","Prof. Bert van der Waal, Wageningen University (environmental sciences)","Peyman Salehian (enzyme development)","Clemens Mayer, University of Groningen (molecular evolution)","Amin Espah Borujeni (riboswitch design)","Tue Kjaergaard Nielsen","Amanda Larasati","WaterIQ (Freddy Dekkers)","Harrie Timmer","RIVM","Arcadis","Witteveen+Bos","Nijhuis Saur","Bas Eickhout (policy)","Christos Batianis and Enrique Asin-Garcia, Wageningen University"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6222/wiki/text-images/general/triton-wholesystem-v5.avif","caption":"The full Triton system: reverse-osmosis concentrate passes a bacterial-cellulose capture filter to concentrate TFA, then a bioreactor where evolved dehalogenase cleaves the C-F bond while a riboswitch biosensor monitors concentration continuously.","caption_zh":"完整的 Triton 系統：逆滲透濃縮液先通過細菌纖維素捕捉濾床把 TFA 濃縮起來，再進入生物反應器，由演化後的脫鹵酶切開 C-F 鍵，同時由核糖開關生物感測器連續監測濃度。","credit":"Team WageningenUR, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6222/wiki/text-images/dry-lab/capturing-drylab/kevin-engineering-figure-7b.webp","caption":"Fifty rounds of PIGEON in silico evolution across five runs, lifting RSc1362's Boltz-2 binding probability from 0.540 to 0.723 while the surrogate model's Spearman rho rises from 0.65 to 0.92 and mean pTM stays flat.","caption_zh":"五次執行、各 50 輪的 PIGEON in silico 演化，把 RSc1362 的 Boltz-2 結合機率從 0.540 提升到 0.723，同時代理模型的 Spearman rho 從 0.65 升到 0.92，平均 pTM 保持持平。","credit":"Team WageningenUR, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6222/wiki/text-images/measurement/triton-measurement-scorecard.avif","caption":"The medium comparison scorecard from the Best Measurement work, which lets another team choose assay conditions for their own research question rather than copying a single validated setup.","caption_zh":"最佳量測工作中的介質比較評分表，讓其他隊伍能依自己的研究問題挑選分析條件，而不是照抄單一組已驗證的設定。","credit":"Team WageningenUR, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6222/wiki/text-images/measurement/triton-measurement-cuvettes.webp","caption":"The alizarin-lanthanum fluoride assay in practice: the spectral shift on fluoride release is visible to the naked eye above roughly 20 uM, so no fluoride electrode, ion chromatography or 19F-NMR is needed.","caption_zh":"實際操作中的茜素—鑭氟離子分析法：氟離子釋出時的光譜位移在大約 20 uM 以上就肉眼可見，因此不需要氟離子電極、離子層析或 19F-NMR。","credit":"Team WageningenUR, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Build the measurement first and publish it as a product, not a result: their fluoride assay won Best Measurement because the protocol, the LOD/LOQ derivation, the acceptance thresholds, the comparison across five media and the documented failure modes (phosphate interference, saturation above 40 uM) all let another lab decide in advance whether it fits - and it needs only a 96-well plate reader and two cheap reagents, which is squarely within a high-school research centre's reach. The companion habit worth copying is PIGEON's reward design: charging a loss in the primary objective tenfold against the secondary one stops a model from quietly trading away the thing you actually care about.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"先把量測做出來，並且把它當成產品而不是結果來發表：他們的氟離子分析法之所以贏得最佳量測，是因為操作流程、LOD/LOQ 的推導、驗收門檻、五種介質間的比較，以及記錄下來的失效模式（磷酸鹽干擾、高於 40 uM 後飽和），全都讓另一間實驗室能事先判斷它適不適合自己——而且只需要一台 96 孔盤判讀儀與兩種便宜試劑，完全落在高中研究單位的能力範圍內。另一個值得照抄的習慣是 PIGEON 的獎勵設計：把主要目標的損失以十倍計價於次要目標之上，可以阻止模型悄悄把你真正在意的東西交換掉。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/design/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/dry-lab-overview/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/capturing/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/capturing-dry-lab/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/degradation/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/sensing/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/riboswitch/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/measurement/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/entrepreneurship/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/implementation/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/contribution/"],"awards_zh":["亞軍（研究生組）","Top 10（研究生組）","最佳量測 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳創業 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 得主"],"rank":264},"6236":{"team":"ZQT-Nanjing","id":"6236","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Biomanufacturing / sustainable production (inferred from project scope; no village stated on the wiki)","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/","projectTitle":"EcToBloom","projectTitle_zh":"EcToBloom","tagline":"A greener, low-salt route to ectoine, finished as a compostable bacterial-cellulose repair mask","tagline_zh":"更環保的低鹽 ectoine（依克多因）製程，最後做成可堆肥的細菌纖維素修護面膜","summary":"EcToBloom rebuilds the ectoine biosynthesis route (ectB-ectA-ectC from halophilic bacteria) in non-halophilic E. coli BL21(DE3) so that ectoine can be made under conventional low-salt fermentation instead of the industrial high-salt 'bacterial milking' process that corrodes equipment and produces untreatable saline wastewater. A second engineered strain carries acsAB and acsCD to make its own bacterial cellulose membrane, which is combined with a silk fibroin layer and loaded with ectoine to give a preservative-free, compostable three-layer repair mask. Titres rose from 0.503 g/L (same-batch wild type) to 4.425 g/L in the first engineered strain, 5.344 g/L on an optimised medium and 6.852 g/L after introducing the feedback-desensitised LysC T352I aspartokinase. The team also explored wheat-straw hydrolysate and other paper wastes as non-food carbon sources.","summary_zh":"EcToBloom 把 ectoine（依克多因）的生合成路徑（來自嗜鹽細菌的 ectB-ectA-ectC）重建在非嗜鹽的 E. coli BL21(DE3) 中，讓 ectoine 可以在常規的低鹽發酵條件下生產，取代工業上會腐蝕設備、又產生難以處理含鹽廢水的高鹽「細菌擠乳」製程。第二株工程菌帶有 acsAB 與 acsCD，可自行生產細菌纖維素膜，再與絲蛋白層結合並載入 ectoine，做成不含防腐劑、可堆肥的三層修護面膜。效價從同批次野生型的 0.503 g/L 提升到第一株工程菌的 4.425 g/L，在最佳化培養基上達 5.344 g/L，導入解除回饋抑制的 LysC T352I 天門冬胺酸激酶後達 6.852 g/L。團隊也嘗試以小麥稈水解液與其他紙類廢棄物作為非食用碳源。","awards":["Best New Composite Part — Nominee (High School)","Best Project Promotion Video — Winner (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"No mathematical or computational model. The Model, Software, Measurement and Hardware pages are left as unedited iGEM template text (award blurb plus 'Inspirations' links), so the project has no kinetic model, no flux analysis and no in-silico design loop. The engineering logic is reasoned verbally from pathway biochemistry (feedback inhibition of LysC, pathway stoichiometry via a single operon) rather than simulated.","frameworks_zh":"沒有任何數學或計算模型。Model、Software、Measurement 與 Hardware 四個頁面都還是未編輯過的 iGEM 範本文字（獎項說明加上 Inspirations 連結），因此這個專案沒有動力學模型、沒有通量分析，也沒有電腦模擬的設計迴圈。工程邏輯是用文字從路徑生化機制推論出來的（LysC 的回饋抑制、以單一操縱子達成路徑化學計量），而不是模擬出來的。","dataviz":"Figure-led quantitative reporting across Results and Description: a titre roadmap annotating each stage's value, bar charts with individual replicate dots and SD error bars, 0-48 h growth curves (OD600) with error bars, production time courses, four single-factor screening panels (carbon source, initial glucose, nitrogen source, NH4Cl concentration), plasmid maps, annotated gel panels, and a stakeholder impact map on Human Practices. Figures carry long explanatory captions that state what the bars, dots and error bars are.","dataviz_zh":"在 Results 與 Description 兩頁以圖為主做量化呈現：一張標註各階段數值的效價路線圖、含個別重複資料點與標準差誤差棒的長條圖、附誤差棒的 0-48 小時生長曲線（OD600）、生產隨時間變化的曲線、四組單因子篩選圖（碳源、初始葡萄糖、氮源、NH4Cl 濃度）、質體圖譜、加註說明的電泳膠圖，以及人類實踐頁面的利害關係人影響地圖。圖說都寫得很長，明確交代長條、資料點與誤差棒各代表什麼。","datascience":"Real but basic experimental data analysis: n = 3 biological replicates throughout, mean +/- SD, fold-change comparisons restricted to same-batch controls, HPLC quantification against a standard calibration curve, and single-factor medium optimisation. Notably careful about statistical honesty for a high-school team: they refuse to add titres from different batches into a 'cumulative improvement', flag that the wild-type signal sits near the method's limit of quantification with high between-replicate variance, and list blank matrices, spike-recovery and peak-purity checks as the follow-up needed.","datascience_zh":"實驗資料分析是真的做了，但相當基礎：全程 n = 3 生物重複、以平均值 ± 標準差呈現、倍數變化的比較僅限同批次對照、HPLC 以標準校正曲線定量，以及單因子培養基最佳化。以高中隊伍而言，他們在統計誠實度上特別謹慎：拒絕把不同批次的效價相加成所謂的累積改善，點明野生型訊號接近方法的定量極限、重複之間變異很大，並列出空白基質、加標回收與峰純度檢查作為後續該補的工作。","software":"No software deliverable. Their 'code' contribution is the published source of a synthetic-biology educational card game, released so other teams can fork, translate and extend it.","software_zh":"沒有軟體產出。他們在程式方面的貢獻，是公開一款合成生物學教育卡牌遊戲的原始檔，讓其他團隊可以分支、翻譯與延伸。","stack":["HPLC (C18 reverse phase, acetonitrile:water 20:80, 210 nm) with standard calibration curve","OD600 growth curves with dilution-corrected linear range","agarose gel electrophoresis + colony PCR + Sanger sequencing verification","alkaline purification and dry-weight quantification of intracellular vs extracellular cellulose","plasmid map / pathway figure production"],"techniques":["same-batch controlled fold-change comparison","mean +/- SD with n = 3 biological replicates and per-replicate data points plotted","single-factor screening (carbon source, glucose concentration, nitrogen source, NH4Cl concentration)","growth-vs-production time-course analysis to assess metabolic burden","limit-of-quantification reasoning and explicit refusal to pool across batches","rational point-mutation design (LysC T352I) from literature feedback-inhibition mechanism"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"The strongest dimension of this project. A BLOOM-framework education programme runs across four age bands with different media for each: food-chain lessons, comics and perler-bead biology art for kindergarten and primary pupils; mini STEM research projects and lab visits for middle schoolers; genetic-circuit design, ethics debating ('Can we do it - but should we?'), knowledge competitions and a purpose-built 'Synthetic Biology Laboratory' card game for high schoolers; plus science journaling and a shared educational website built with team NBJF. A separate strand studies gender equity in science ('Do girls really have equal freedom to choose science?'), including a student-and-parent study of post-Gaokao major choice, and a campus sustainability strand ('Waste Detectives', 'Is it really green?'). The wiki landing page is itself a piece of science communication built like a promotional video: a relatable domestic scene (face mask on the sofa), then the hidden cost, then the named molecule, then a hard cost-comparison table ($385/kg ectoine against $0.33-0.89/kg glycerin), then the two engineering modules, then the vision - concrete-consequence-first rather than mechanism-first. The award-winning promotion video itself is not embedded on the wiki, so only this narrative architecture can be verified here.","publicEngagement_zh":"這是整個專案最強的一面。以 BLOOM 框架設計的教育計畫橫跨四個年齡層，各用不同媒介：幼兒園與小學生是食物鏈課程、漫畫與拼拼豆豆生物藝術；國中生是小型 STEM 研究專題與實驗室參訪；高中生則是基因迴路設計、倫理辯論（我們做得到，但我們應該做嗎？）、知識競賽，以及專門設計的卡牌遊戲 Synthetic Biology Laboratory；另外還有科學寫作，以及與 NBJF 隊伍合建的共用教育網站。另一條支線研究科學領域的性別平等（女孩真的有同樣的自由選擇科學嗎？），包括針對高考後選填科系的學生與家長調查；還有一條校園永續支線（垃圾偵探、它真的環保嗎？）。wiki 首頁本身就是一件科學傳播作品，結構像一支宣傳片：先是一個人人熟悉的居家場景（沙發上的面膜），接著是被隱藏的代價，然後點出那個分子的名字，再放一張硬邦邦的成本比較表（ectoine 每公斤 385 美元，甘油每公斤 0.33-0.89 美元），然後是兩個工程模組，最後是願景；先講具體後果，而不是先講機制。那支得獎的宣傳片本身並沒有嵌在 wiki 上，所以這裡能查證的只有這套敘事架構。","ihp":"A five-stage Aspiration -> Action -> Analysis -> Adaptation loop with documented project changes at each stage. Stage 1: a 397-response questionnaire on skincare habits and dryness (67.51% reported regular skincare routines, over 80% linked dryness to weather or environment), which narrowed the project from general skincare to barrier repair and widened the target user beyond naturally dry skin. Stage 2: interviews with students, parents, adult consumers, beauty retail staff and a facial-mask industry expert. Stage 3: technical feasibility with Nanjing Tech University researchers (Dr Huang Luming, Dr Fu Yangkai) and Tian Xiaodong of the Institute of Microbiology, CAS - this is where carbon/nitrogen optimisation and the upstream metabolic-engineering idea came from. Stage 4: a dermatologist, mask manufacturers and a cosmetic formulator set the boundaries of what the team could claim. Stage 5: farmers on wheat-straw supply, an environmental researcher on saline and fermentation wastewater risk, plus biosafety and commercialisation. Closes with a stakeholder impact map and reflection.","ihp_zh":"一個五階段的 Aspiration、Action、Analysis、Adaptation 迴圈，每一階段都記錄了專案因此做出的改變。階段一：一份 397 份回覆的保養習慣與乾燥問題問卷（67.51% 表示有固定保養流程，超過 80% 把乾燥歸因於天氣或環境），把專案從一般保養收斂到屏障修護，也把目標使用者從天生乾性膚質往外擴大。階段二：訪談學生、家長、成年消費者、美妝零售人員與一位面膜產業專家。階段三：與南京工業大學的研究人員（Dr Huang Luming、Dr Fu Yangkai）以及中國科學院微生物研究所的 Tian Xiaodong 討論技術可行性，碳源與氮源最佳化、以及上游代謝工程的想法就是從這裡來的。階段四：一位皮膚科醫師、面膜製造商與一位化妝品配方師界定了團隊可以宣稱的範圍。階段五：與農民討論小麥稈供應、與一位環境研究者討論含鹽與發酵廢水的風險，再加上生物安全與商業化。最後以利害關係人影響地圖與反思收尾。","realWorld":"The project is framed end-to-end as a manufacturing-route substitution rather than a molecule demo: low-salt fermentation to cut corrosion and saline wastewater, agricultural residue as feedstock, in-house membrane production so the mask substrate is not a purchased black box, and a compostable end-of-life. Cost framing is explicit (ectoine at $385.46/kg against hyaluronic acid at $43-113/kg; reactor cost estimates of EUR 3,000/m3 for salt-resistant materials). Contributions are deliberately packaged for reuse: three registered parts with full Registry documentation (BBa_K5481012 acsAB-acsCD bacterial cellulose module, BBa_26XUR2FA LysC T352I, and an ectABC-lysC* composite), published game code, and a reusable questionnaire plus report framework for the women-in-STEM study. The Entrepreneurship page is unfilled template.","realWorld_zh":"整個專案從頭到尾都被定位成一次製程路線的替換，而不是一次分子的示範：以低鹽發酵減少腐蝕與含鹽廢水、以農業殘渣作為原料、自行生產膜材讓面膜基材不是外購的黑盒子，以及可堆肥的生命週期終點。成本的鋪陳也很明確（ectoine 每公斤 385.46 美元，玻尿酸每公斤 43-113 美元；耐鹽材質反應器的成本估計為每立方公尺 3,000 歐元）。貢獻也刻意包裝成可重複使用的形式：三個已登錄且具完整 Registry 文件的零件（BBa_K5481012 的 acsAB-acsCD 細菌纖維素模組、BBa_26XUR2FA 的 LysC T352I，以及一個 ectABC-lysC* 複合零件）、公開的遊戲程式碼，以及女性參與 STEM 研究所用的可重複使用問卷與報告框架。Entrepreneurship 頁面則仍是未填寫的範本。","partners":["Nanjing Tech University (Dr Huang Luming, Dr Fu Yangkai)","Institute of Microbiology, Chinese Academy of Sciences (Tian Xiaodong)","iGEM team NBJF (shared educational website)","facial mask industry expert 'Director Jin' and mask manufacturers","dermatologist and cosmetic formulator","local wheat farmers","environmental researcher (saline/fermentation wastewater)","Nanjing Foreign Language School and six other Nanjing-area partner schools"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6236/wiki/description/img1-v2008.avif","caption":"The EcToBloom low-salt green manufacturing platform: engineered chassis, renewable feedstock, biosynthesised ectoine and biodegradable mask, ending in the three-layer BC-Silk-Ectoine repair mask.","caption_zh":"EcToBloom 的低鹽綠色製造平台：工程底盤、可再生原料、生物合成的 ectoine 與可生物分解的面膜，最後收在三層的 BC-Silk-Ectoine 修護面膜。","credit":"Team ZQT-Nanjing, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6236/wiki/results/img1.avif","caption":"Roadmap of experimental results, annotating the titre reached at each stage: wild type 0.503 g/L, engineered strain 4.425 g/L, optimised medium 5.344 g/L, LysC T352I strain 6.852 g/L.","caption_zh":"實驗結果路線圖，標註各階段達到的效價：野生型 0.503 g/L、工程菌株 4.425 g/L、最佳化培養基 5.344 g/L、LysC T352I 菌株 6.852 g/L。","credit":"Team ZQT-Nanjing, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6236/wiki/human-practices/img17-v1126.avif","caption":"Stakeholder impact map closing the five-stage Human Practices loop, from consumers and retail staff to metabolic engineers, dermatologists, farmers and environmental researchers.","caption_zh":"收束五階段人類實踐迴圈的利害關係人影響地圖，從消費者與零售人員，到代謝工程研究者、皮膚科醫師、農民與環境研究者。","credit":"Team ZQT-Nanjing, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6236/wiki/education/img17.avif","caption":"'Synthetic Biology Laboratory', the team's purpose-built card game for high-school learners, whose code was published so other teams can modify and translate it.","caption_zh":"Synthetic Biology Laboratory，團隊為高中學習者專門設計的卡牌遊戲，程式碼已公開，讓其他團隊可以修改與翻譯。","credit":"Team ZQT-Nanjing, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Everything ZQT-Nanjing actually did on the dry side - replicated HPLC titres with error bars, single-factor medium screening, growth-versus-production curves, a 397-person survey and a genuinely excellent multi-age communication programme - is reachable by a motivated high-school team in one season, and it won the video award without a single line of modelling: their Model, Software, Measurement and Hardware pages are untouched template text. The limiting factor here is not compute or tooling but mentorship and framing: nobody appears to have suggested that even a two-ODE growth-and-product model or a simple cost model of the low-salt route would have cost a week and turned a strong wet-lab story into a complete one.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"ZQT-Nanjing 在乾實驗室這一側真正做到的事——帶誤差棒的重複 HPLC 效價、單因子培養基篩選、生長與生產對照曲線、397 人問卷，以及一套真的很優秀的跨年齡溝通計畫——都是一支有動力的高中隊伍在一季之內做得到的；而他們拿下影片獎項時，完全沒有寫過一行模型：Model、Software、Measurement 與 Hardware 四頁都還是未改過的範本文字。這裡的限制因素不是運算資源或工具，而是指導與框架：似乎沒有人提醒他們，就算只是一個兩條 ODE 的生長與產物模型，或一個低鹽製程的簡單成本模型，大概也只要一週，就能把一個紮實的濕實驗故事變成一個完整的故事。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/","https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/parts"],"awards_zh":["最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳專案宣傳影片 — 得主（高中組）"],"rank":33},"6242":{"team":"GCGS","id":"6242","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Infectious Diseases, Therapeutics, Diagnostics & Oncology","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/gcgs/","projectTitle":"PathoLogic","tagline":"A dual-response engineered E. coli Nissle 1917 probiotic, delivered as an inhalable live biotherapeutic, that degrades Pseudomonas aeruginosa biofilm in cystic fibrosis lungs.","summary":"PathoLogic engineers E. coli Nissle 1917 into a living sensor that fires only when it detects two simultaneous signals of the cystic fibrosis airway — low iron (via Fur) and high C4-HSL quorum-sensing molecule from Pseudomonas aeruginosa (via RhlR) — wired as an AND gate. On dual activation, Lysis E lyses the cells to release alginate lyase, which degrades the alginate-based extracellular polymeric matrix that shields P. aeruginosa from antibiotics and immunity. The product concept is a spray-dried, matrix-protected inhalable live biotherapeutic positioned as an adjunct, not a replacement, for inhaled antibiotics. It won Best New Improved Part on a genuinely instructive two-cycle engineering story: adding SsrA degradation tags to RhlR killed the leakage but also killed the induction, and only replacing the weak wild-type Prhl with the engineered Prhl(LR) recovered a working sensor. The dry lab is the thinnest of the five high-school Top 10 teams; its strength is wet-lab characterisation discipline and an exceptionally thorough regulatory and stakeholder analysis.","awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best New Improved Part — Winner (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Infectious Diseases / Therapeutics / Diagnostics / Oncology)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"GCGS has no dedicated model or software page (both routes 404) and this is the clear weak point relative to the other four Top 10 high-school teams. The one modelling claim is a circuit-level simulation of the Fur-RhlR dual-response AND gate, which predicted that the low transcriptional activity of the native rhl promoter would prevent the full circuit from functioning — consistent with the 2016 Tokyo_Tech iGEM team's finding of weak native Prhl activity — and which therefore justified upgrading to the engineered Prhl(LR) (BBa_K1529310) in design cycle 2b. The simulation's structure, parameters, equations and software are not documented on the wiki, so it reads as a design-justification step rather than a reproducible model. No protein structure prediction, docking, molecular dynamics, flux analysis or machine learning appears anywhere on the wiki; the alginate lyase and Lysis E modules were taken from literature rather than computationally designed. Quantitative analysis is instead concentrated in assay-level fitting: the dual-response circuit's C4-HSL response under low-iron conditions was fitted by linear regression against log concentration (Y = 2.582X + 39.04, R2 = 0.894), yielding a limit of detection of 53.1 nM that the team mapped against physiologically relevant C4-HSL concentrations measured in clinical sputum, plus cross-reactivity testing against related signal molecules and a growth-curve validation in artificial lung fluid over 48 h showing the engineered strain remains viable with a moderate relative growth decrease on dual-signal stimulation, consistent with Lysis-E-driven conditional autolysis.","dataviz":"Figures are conventional but competently used and consistently paired with their physical source. The engineering and improve pages present AND-logic characterisation as four-condition bar panels, growth curves across the full C4-HSL dose gradient per construct with 8-hour endpoint comparisons and significance annotation, and a dedicated analytical-performance figure carrying the dose-response regression, limit of detection and cross-reactivity results together. Agarose gels, transformation plates, colony PCR and Sanger traces are shown for every construction step rather than asserted. The circuit designs are drawn side by side as 'existing part BBa_K2315014' against 'the improved part', so the specific change in each cycle is visible rather than described. Human practices and education present survey data as high-resolution chart figures (398 valid responses on the public survey). The landing page uses an animated scroll narrative structured as Sense / Respond / Restore to make the AND gate legible before any biology, and a dual-response system diagram carries the mechanism. There is no interactive or computational visualisation, no dashboard and no in-browser tool.","datascience":"The genuine intellectual contribution is a clean design-build-test-learn argument about a trade-off, which is a form of data reasoning even without computation. Cycle 2a fused four SsrA degradation tags (LAA, LVA, ASV, AAV, spanning a range of known degradation kinetics) to the C-terminus of RhlR on the wild-type Prhl, assembled all five constructs including the untagged control onto pTrc99k by homologous recombination, and ran 8-hour time-course dose-response experiments across blank, solvent-only, 10 micromolar, 100 micromolar and 1 mM C4-HSL in sequence-verified DH5-alpha. The result was interpreted carefully rather than selectively: growth curves showed only LAA suffered a small but significant final-density reduction (p < 0.05), consistent with its fastest protein turnover imposing extra proteolytic burden, while LVA, ASV and AAV showed no significant growth penalty — so the tags are not generally toxic. Fluorescence showed all tags reduced basal background as intended, but LAA, LVA and AAV lost induction so completely that no statistically significant difference remained between blank control and 1 mM C4-HSL, and only the moderate-rate ASV tag retained weak but distinguishable induction. The team drew the correct general conclusion: when a promoter's maximal transcriptional output is weak, the SsrA-driven degradation rate can exceed the synthesis rate, so tuning protein turnover cannot compensate for inadequate transcriptional capacity — background suppression and induced output cannot both be optimised from the degradation side alone. Cycle 2b tested that inference by swapping in Prhl(LR) and re-characterising the whole panel, identifying RhlR-SsrA-ASV-Prhl(LR) as the combination achieving both low leakage and robust induction, which was then integrated into the final AND gate. Human practices also drove a methodological change: because experts noted iron limitation varies across patient airways, characterisation was switched from a single fixed low-iron concentration to a dose-response design, and because the public survey flagged off-target activation concerns, low uninduced leakage became an explicit selection criterion rather than a nice-to-have.","software":"No software released and no software page. Contributions are biological and documentary: the optimised composite part pCon-RhlR-SsrA-ASV-Prhl(LR)-GFP (BBa_26QSD9SO) submitted to the Registry as a reusable C4-HSL biosensor for future teams, an improvement on the existing part BBa_K2315014 originally characterised by Shanghai_tech_2017, and a part collection page documenting the Fur and RhlR sensing modules, the Lysis E effector-release module and the alginate lyase cargo. Alginate lyase expression was confirmed at the theoretical ~42.2 kDa with supernatant and pellet fractionation. No repository link appears on the wiki for either code or hardware.","stack":["E. coli Nissle 1917 (EcN) chassis","E. coli DH5-alpha","pTrc99k backbone","homologous recombination assembly","Fur iron-responsive regulator","RhlR / Prhl and Prhl(LR) quorum-sensing promoter (BBa_K1529310)","SsrA ClpXP degradation tags (LAA / LVA / ASV / AAV)","Lysis E","alginate lyase","GFP reporter","artificial lung fluid model","linear regression dose-response fitting","circuit-level simulation (undocumented tooling)"],"techniques":["two-cycle design-build-test-learn with a documented trade-off","degradation-tag variant screening across a kinetic range","AND-gate logic characterisation across four input conditions","time-course dose-response with solvent and blank controls","limit-of-detection determination by log-linear regression","cross-reactivity testing against related signal molecules","growth-penalty control to separate toxicity from circuit effect","colony PCR and Sanger sequencing verification","SDS-PAGE with supernatant/pellet fractionation","physiologically-matched validation in artificial lung fluid","stakeholder-driven switch from fixed-concentration to dose-response characterisation"],"frameworks_zh":"GCGS 沒有專門的模型或軟體頁面（兩個網址都是 404），相較其他四支 Top 10 高中隊伍，這是明顯的弱點。唯一的建模主張是對 Fur-RhlR 雙重反應 AND 閘的迴路層級模擬，它預測原生 rhl 啟動子的轉錄活性過低，會使完整迴路無法運作——這與 2016 年 Tokyo_Tech 隊伍發現原生 Prhl 活性偏弱的結果一致——因此也成為在設計循環 2b 升級為工程化 Prhl(LR)（BBa_K1529310）的依據。該模擬的結構、參數、方程式與所用軟體都未記載在 wiki 上，因此它讀起來是一個為設計辯護的步驟，而不是可重現的模型。wiki 上任何地方都沒有蛋白質結構預測、分子嵌合、分子動力學、通量分析或機器學習；alginate lyase 與 Lysis E 模組取自文獻，而非以計算設計。量化分析反而集中在分析層級的擬合：雙重反應迴路在低鐵條件下對 C4-HSL 的反應以對數濃度做線性回歸擬合（Y = 2.582X + 39.04，R2 = 0.894），得到 53.1 nM 的偵測極限，並與臨床痰液中實測的生理相關 C4-HSL 濃度相互對照；此外還有對相近訊號分子的交叉反應測試，以及在人工肺液中 48 小時的生長曲線驗證，顯示工程菌株在雙訊號刺激下仍保持存活、相對生長有中度下降，與 Lysis E 驅動的條件式自溶一致。","dataviz_zh":"圖表形式常規，但使用得當，而且一貫地與其實體來源配對呈現。工程與改良頁面以四種條件的長條面板呈現 AND 邏輯特性鑑定，並對每個構築畫出整個 C4-HSL 劑量梯度的生長曲線、含 8 小時終點比較與顯著性標註，另有一張專門的分析效能圖，把劑量反應回歸、偵測極限與交叉反應結果擺在一起。每一個建構步驟都附上洋菜膠電泳、轉型平盤、菌落 PCR 與 Sanger 定序軌跡，而不是只憑文字宣稱。迴路設計以「既有部件 BBa_K2315014」對照「改良後的部件」並列繪出，讓每一輪的具體改動看得見而非只被描述。人類實踐與教育把問卷資料做成高解析度圖表（公眾問卷有 398 份有效回覆）。首頁使用以 Sense／Respond／Restore 編排的捲動動畫敘事，讓讀者在接觸任何生物學之前就看懂 AND 閘，另有一張雙重反應系統示意圖承載機制。沒有任何互動式或計算式視覺化，沒有儀表板，也沒有瀏覽器內的工具。","datascience_zh":"真正的智識貢獻是一段關於取捨的乾淨 design-build-test-learn 論證——即使沒有計算，這也是一種資料推理。循環 2a 把四種 SsrA 降解標籤（LAA、LVA、ASV、AAV，涵蓋一段已知降解動力學範圍）融合到野生型 Prhl 上 RhlR 的 C 端，以同源重組把包含未加標籤對照在內的五個構築組裝到 pTrc99k 上，並在經定序確認的 DH5-alpha 中，依序對空白、僅溶劑、10 微莫耳、100 微莫耳與 1 mM C4-HSL 做 8 小時時間序列劑量反應實驗。結果的解讀謹慎而非選擇性：生長曲線顯示只有 LAA 的最終密度出現小幅但顯著的下降（p < 0.05），與其最快的蛋白質更替帶來額外蛋白水解負擔一致，而 LVA、ASV 與 AAV 沒有顯著的生長代價——因此這些標籤並非普遍具毒性。螢光結果顯示所有標籤都如預期降低了基礎背景值，但 LAA、LVA 與 AAV 徹底失去誘導能力，使空白對照與 1 mM C4-HSL 之間不再有統計上顯著的差異，只有中等速率的 ASV 標籤保留了微弱但可分辨的誘導。團隊得出了正確的一般性結論：當一個啟動子的最大轉錄輸出偏弱時，SsrA 驅動的降解速率可能超過合成速率，因此調整蛋白質更替無法彌補轉錄能力不足——光從降解端下手，無法同時最佳化背景抑制與誘導輸出。循環 2b 換上 Prhl(LR) 並重新鑑定整組構築來檢驗這個推論，確認 RhlR-SsrA-ASV-Prhl(LR) 是同時達成低滲漏與穩健誘導的組合，隨後整合進最終的 AND 閘。人類實踐也促成了方法上的改變：因為專家指出不同病患呼吸道的缺鐵程度並不一致，特性鑑定從單一固定的低鐵濃度改為劑量反應設計；又因為公眾問卷標出對非目標處活化的擔憂，低度的未誘導滲漏從「有就更好」升格為明確的篩選標準。","software_zh":"未釋出任何軟體，也沒有軟體頁面。貢獻屬於生物與文件層面：最佳化後的複合部件 pCon-RhlR-SsrA-ASV-Prhl(LR)-GFP（BBa_26QSD9SO）已提交至 Registry，作為未來隊伍可重用的 C4-HSL 生物感測器，是對既有部件 BBa_K2315014（最初由 Shanghai_tech_2017 鑑定）的改良；另有一個部件集合頁面，記載 Fur 與 RhlR 感測模組、Lysis E 效應釋放模組與 alginate lyase 貨物。Alginate lyase 的表現已在理論值約 42.2 kDa 處確認，並做了上清液與菌體沉澱的分離。wiki 上沒有任何程式碼或硬體的程式庫連結。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Audience-segmented education from primary school through university students to industry professionals, governed by a self-designed GCGS reflective cycle (Gather information, Construct and conduct, Synthesize and sustain) applied after every activity, with the content depth and communication strategy varied per group. The distinguishing feature is a written ethics policy for rare disease communication, derived directly from expert advice rather than invented: person-first language, participants review any content referencing their stories before publication, no overly emotional narratives, no framing that implies patients are a burden, anonymity respected, and no fabricated data. A WeChat official account was launched in Chinese to serve the Chinese-speaking general public after the survey showed over 60% of respondents had never heard of cystic fibrosis and nearly half were unaware of the biofilm mechanism; it publishes rare-disease knowledge aimed at patients' psychological needs and gives patients a platform to connect and support each other, which is unusually thoughtful for a high-school outreach channel. Objectives are differentiated by tier — sparking curiosity in young students through hands-on activities, helping non-biology-major students grasp synthetic biology principles, reducing stigma through responsible communication with the public, and giving professionals and industry stakeholders technical and translational insight. Education strategy was explicitly treated as an output of the human practices work rather than a parallel track.","ihp":"Seven structured expert interviews plus a 398-response bilingual public survey, organised around a self-designed reflective model and reaching into regulation, manufacturing and finance rather than stopping at academia. The clearest documented change is a scope reduction the team accepted against its own interest: Dr. Guangquan Chen (Tongji University School of Medicine, with clinical and research experience in CF) gave candid feedback that the VOC diagnostic module, while feasible, was not innovative because existing research already confirms CF patients exhale characteristic VOCs without engineered bacteria. The team de-emphasised the VOC module, repositioned it as a future extension, and refocused entirely on biofilm degradation and antibiotic-adjuvant therapy. Dr. Ran An (Shanghai Jiao Tong University) identified four biosafety risks and ranked horizontal gene transfer highest; the team added a temperature-sensitive kill switch as a second containment layer on top of the existing mission-complete self-lysis system, and explicitly declined the pH-sensitive switch as technically challenging — a documented rejection with a reason, echoed independently by Dr. Xin Wang (Henan University of Technology), who noted insufficient pH difference inside and outside the body and pressed for multi-layered containment including auxotrophy against pulmonary over-colonisation, leakage to the digestive tract and horizontal gene transfer. Dr. Wang also raised that long-term antibiotic therapy already disrupts the CF lung microbiota and an engineered probiotic may interfere further, which the team adopted as a named safety endpoint: monitoring the impact of the engineered strain on respiratory microbial composition in future studies. Dr. An separately forced a positioning correction, stressing that the product must clearly present its adjunctive role because the biofilm is the target, not standalone infection treatment — language that now runs through the whole wiki. Dr. Baoshan Xu (Hospital of Stomatology, Sun Yat-sen University, rare genetic diseases) set the communication priority order as eliminating stigma first, building inclusion second, sharing disease knowledge third, and recommended person-first language, avoiding emotional narratives and letting patients review content, which became the education ethics policy. Two experimental design changes came from stakeholder input: dose-response characterisation across a low-iron gradient instead of a single fixed concentration, to reflect heterogeneous airway iron limitation between patients, and low uninduced leakage elevated to a critical selection criterion because the public survey showed off-target activation was a top concern. Commercial and regulatory engagement included Ms. Qing Yao (co-founder and chairwoman of Guangzhou Hanguang Pharmaceutical, a 25-year-old top-50 Chinese OTC pharmaceutical company), an anonymised biopharmaceutical R&D and industry strategy expert, HSBC investment and commercial banking professionals, Prof. Tao Wei (Guangdong Shaohe Biotechnology and South China Agricultural University, computational biology) and Dr. Huihui Bao (China National Center for Food Safety Risk Assessment).","realWorld":"A rare-disease market analysis grounded in Chinese reimbursement reality rather than global TAM arithmetic. CF is in China's First Rare Disease Catalog (2018), was once considered extremely rare in Asian populations at roughly 1 in 32,000 births against 1 in 3,300 in Caucasian populations, and is severely under-diagnosed — reported Chinese cases in the past decade reached 2.5 times the total reported in the preceding thirty years, with current estimates possibly exceeding 20,000 patients. Over 78% of adult CF patients develop chronic P. aeruginosa infection. The unmet need is stated precisely: no approved therapy directly targets and degrades the biofilm matrix, inhaled antibiotics cannot penetrate it, airway clearance improves symptoms without eliminating pathogens, and CFTR modulators (elexacaftor/tezacaftor/ivacaftor) work only for specific genotypes, are expensive and cannot reverse established structural lung damage. The access model follows expert advice that rare disease drugs do not need broad distribution: regional CF diagnosis and treatment centres and expert networks are the efficient channel, with respiratory physicians at those centres as the prescribing decision-makers. Payer analysis is survey-grounded — over 90% of respondents preferred public or collective payment, with 51.26% supporting rare disease funds combined with charity and 40.45% supporting national insurance against only about 8% for self-pay — and expert input that commercial insurers show limited willingness to cover rare diseases led the team to prioritise the National Healthcare Security Administration and local rare disease funds. They identify that few inhaled live biotherapeutic products have been approved for clinical use in China, so the regulatory and clinical pathway is genuinely unclear, and name long-term platform expansion to other chronic P. aeruginosa lung infections such as COPD and bronchiectasis. The product form is a spray-dried, matrix-protected EcN formulation designed to reach deep lung tissue.","partners":["Dr. Ran An, Shanghai Jiao Tong University (gut microbiota regulation, biosafety)","Dr. Xin Wang, Henan University of Technology (synthetic biology, enzyme engineering, formulation)","Dr. Baoshan Xu, Hospital of Stomatology, Sun Yat-sen University (rare genetic diseases, communication ethics)","Dr. Guangquan Chen, Tongji University School of Medicine (CF genetics and molecular diagnostics)","Ms. Qing Yao, Guangzhou Hanguang Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd.","Prof. Tao Wei, Guangdong Shaohe Biotechnology / South China Agricultural University","Dr. Huihui Bao, China National Center for Food Safety Risk Assessment","HSBC (investment and commercial banking professionals)","An anonymised biopharmaceutical R&D and industry strategy expert","Shanghai_tech_2017 iGEM team (origin of improved part BBa_K2315014)","Tokyo_Tech 2016 iGEM team (native Prhl activity finding)"],"publicEngagement_zh":"教育依受眾分層，從小學生、大學生到產業專業人士，並由一套自行設計的 GCGS 反思循環（Gather information 蒐集資訊、Construct and conduct 建構與執行、Synthesize and sustain 綜合與延續）在每場活動後施行，內容深度與溝通策略也依群體調整。最突出之處是一份針對罕見疾病溝通的書面倫理準則，而且直接源自專家建議而非自行想像：以人為先的語言、任何提及當事人故事的內容都須由其本人在發布前審閱、不使用過度煽情的敘事、不以「病患是負擔」的框架陳述、尊重匿名，以及不捏造資料。問卷顯示超過 60% 的回覆者從未聽過囊狀纖維化、近半數不知道生物膜機制後，團隊開設了中文微信公眾號服務華語大眾；它發布針對病患心理需求的罕見疾病知識，並為病患提供彼此連結與互相支持的平台，對一個高中生的外推管道而言格外用心。目標依層級分化——以動手活動引發年幼學生的好奇、幫助非生物科系學生掌握合成生物學原理、以負責任的溝通減少對公眾的污名化，並為專業人士與產業利害關係人提供技術與轉譯層面的洞見。教育策略被明確視為人類實踐工作的產出，而不是一條平行的支線。","ihp_zh":"七場結構化專家訪談，加上一份 398 份回覆的雙語公眾問卷，圍繞一個自行設計的反思模型組織起來，並延伸到法規、製造與財務，而不是停在學界。記錄最清楚的一次改變是團隊接受了一項對自己不利的範圍縮減：陳光全醫師（同濟大學醫學院，具囊狀纖維化臨床與研究經驗）坦率指出，VOC 診斷模組雖然可行但並不創新，因為既有研究已確認囊狀纖維化病患會呼出特徵性 VOC，不需要工程菌。團隊因此淡化 VOC 模組，把它重新定位為未來的延伸，並完全聚焦於生物膜降解與抗生素輔助療法。安然博士（上海交通大學）指出四項生物安全風險並把水平基因轉移排在首位；團隊於是在既有的「任務完成即自溶」系統之上，加上一道溫度敏感的自殺開關作為第二層圍堵，同時明確拒絕 pH 敏感開關、理由是技術上困難——這是一次有記錄、有理由的拒絕，而王新博士（河南工業大學）也獨立呼應了同樣看法：他指出體內外的 pH 差異不足，並力促採用多層圍堵、包括以營養缺陷型來防範肺部過度群落化、洩漏至消化道與水平基因轉移。王博士另外提出，長期抗生素治療本身就已擾亂囊狀纖維化肺部的微生物相，工程益生菌可能進一步干擾；團隊把這點採納為一個明確命名的安全終點：在未來研究中監測工程菌株對呼吸道微生物組成的影響。安博士另外促成了一次定位修正，強調產品必須清楚呈現其輔助角色，因為標的是生物膜，而不是單獨治療感染——這套措辭現在貫穿整個 wiki。徐寶山醫師（中山大學附屬口腔醫院，罕見遺傳疾病）把溝通的優先順序定為：首先消除污名、其次建立包容、第三才是傳遞疾病知識，並建議使用以人為先的語言、避免煽情敘事、讓病患審閱內容——這些後來成為教育倫理準則。有兩項實驗設計的改變來自利害關係人意見：以低鐵梯度做劑量反應鑑定而非單一固定濃度，以反映不同病患呼吸道缺鐵程度的異質性；以及把低度未誘導滲漏提升為關鍵篩選標準，因為公眾問卷顯示非目標處活化是最主要的顧慮。商業與法規方面的接觸包括姚清女士（廣州漢光藥業共同創辦人暨董事長，一家創立 25 年的中國 OTC 製藥前 50 強企業）、一位匿名的生物製藥研發與產業策略專家、匯豐銀行的投資與商業銀行專業人士、魏濤教授（廣東韶禾生物科技／華南農業大學，計算生物學）與包慧慧博士（中國國家食品安全風險評估中心）。","realWorld_zh":"一份扎根於中國給付現實、而非全球 TAM 算術的罕見疾病市場分析。囊狀纖維化列入中國《第一批罕見病目錄》（2018），曾被認為在亞洲族群中極為罕見，發生率約為每 32,000 名新生兒 1 例，相對白人族群為 1/3,300，且嚴重低診——過去十年中國報告的病例數達到之前三十年總數的 2.5 倍，目前推估患者可能超過 20,000 人。超過 78% 的成年囊狀纖維化病患會發展為慢性綠膿桿菌感染。未被滿足的需求描述得很精確：沒有任何已核准療法直接針對並降解生物膜基質、吸入型抗生素無法穿透它、呼吸道清潔能改善症狀但無法清除病原，而 CFTR 調節劑（elexacaftor/tezacaftor/ivacaftor）只對特定基因型有效、價格昂貴，且無法逆轉已形成的肺部結構性損傷。取得途徑依專家建議設計：罕見疾病藥物不需要廣泛鋪貨，區域性的囊狀纖維化診療中心與專家網絡才是有效率的通路，而這些中心的胸腔科醫師就是處方決策者。付費方分析以問卷為基礎——超過 90% 的回覆者偏好公共或集體支付，其中 51.26% 支持罕見疾病基金搭配慈善、40.45% 支持納入國家醫保，而僅約 8% 支持自費——再加上專家指出商業保險對罕見疾病的承保意願有限，使團隊優先鎖定國家醫療保障局與地方罕見疾病基金。他們也指出，中國極少有吸入式活體生物製劑取得臨床使用核准，因此法規與臨床路徑確實不明確；並點出長期的平台延伸方向：其他慢性綠膿桿菌肺部感染，例如 COPD 與支氣管擴張症。產品形式是噴霧乾燥、以基質保護的 EcN 配方，設計目標是抵達深層肺組織。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6242/wiki/improve/figure-1.avif","caption":"The modification strategy for the RhlR response system across both improvement cycles: SsrA degradation tags on RhlR, then replacement of wild-type Prhl with the engineered Prhl(LR).","credit":"Team GCGS, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"RhlR 反應系統在兩輪改良中的修改策略：先在 RhlR 上加 SsrA 降解標籤，再把野生型 Prhl 換成工程化的 Prhl(LR)。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6242/wiki/improve/ssra-tag-circuit-replacement.avif","caption":"Genetic circuit designs compared: the existing Registry part BBa_K2315014 against the improved RhlR-SsrA tag construct built in cycle 2b.","credit":"Team GCGS, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"基因迴路設計對照：既有的 Registry 部件 BBa_K2315014 對比循環 2b 建構的改良版 RhlR-SsrA 標籤構築。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6242/wiki/engineering/analytical-performance.avif","caption":"Analytical performance of the Fur-RhlR dual-response circuit: C4-HSL dose-response under low iron fitted as Y = 2.582X + 39.04 (R2 = 0.894), giving a limit of detection of 53.1 nM, with cross-reactivity results.","credit":"Team GCGS, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"Fur-RhlR 雙重反應迴路的分析效能：低鐵條件下的 C4-HSL 劑量反應擬合為 Y = 2.582X + 39.04（R2 = 0.894），得到 53.1 nM 的偵測極限，並附交叉反應結果。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6242/wiki/ihp/survey-figure-8-high-resolution.avif","caption":"Public survey results on synthetic biology awareness and attitudes (398 valid responses): 30% had heard only the term and 27% had never heard of synthetic biology or genetically engineered bacteria, while 50% viewed it as a valuable technology requiring strict ethical review and safety oversight.","credit":"Team GCGS, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"公眾對合成生物學認知與態度的問卷結果（398 份有效回覆）：30% 只聽過這個名詞、27% 從未聽過合成生物學或基因工程菌，而 50% 認為它是一項有價值的技術，但需要嚴格的倫理審查與安全監管。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy the engineering logic, and read the gap as a warning. Their transferable asset is a two-cycle DBTL that isolates a real trade-off — SsrA tags cut leakage but, on a weak promoter, degradation outruns synthesis and kill induction too, so you must raise transcriptional capacity rather than keep tuning turnover — plus the discipline of running a growth-curve control so a signal loss cannot be mistaken for toxicity. The warning is that GCGS reached High School Top 10 with essentially no model or software page, and it is the one clear hole in an otherwise strong wiki: a modest, fully documented ODE model of their own AND gate, with parameters and code, would have cost little and closed it.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/gcgs/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gcgs/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gcgs/improve/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gcgs/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gcgs/results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gcgs/part-collection/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gcgs/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gcgs/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gcgs/entrepreneurship/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gcgs/contribution/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gcgs/notebook/"],"projectTitle_zh":"PathoLogic","tagline_zh":"一株具雙重反應的工程化 E. coli Nissle 1917 益生菌，以可吸入式活體生物製劑形式遞送，用來降解囊狀纖維化肺部中綠膿桿菌（Pseudomonas aeruginosa）的生物膜。","summary_zh":"PathoLogic 把 E. coli Nissle 1917 工程化為一個活體感測器，只有在同時偵測到囊狀纖維化呼吸道的兩個訊號時才啟動——低鐵（透過 Fur）與來自綠膿桿菌的高濃度 C4-HSL 群體感應分子（透過 RhlR）——兩者接成一個 AND 閘。雙重活化時，Lysis E 使細胞裂解，釋出 alginate lyase，降解以 alginate 為基礎的胞外高分子基質，而該基質正是綠膿桿菌抵禦抗生素與免疫系統的屏障。產品概念是一種噴霧乾燥、以基質保護的可吸入式活體生物製劑，定位為吸入型抗生素的輔助療法，而非取代。它以一段真正具教學價值的兩輪工程故事獲得 Best New Improved Part：在 RhlR 上加 SsrA 降解標籤雖消除了滲漏，卻也連誘導一起消滅，唯有把弱的野生型 Prhl 換成工程化的 Prhl(LR)，才救回一個可用的感測器。乾實驗室是五支高中組 Top 10 隊伍中最薄弱的；其強項在於濕實驗室的特性鑑定紀律，以及一份格外完整的法規與利害關係人分析。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"學走他們的工程邏輯，同時把那個缺口讀作警訊。他們可被沿用的資產是一段兩輪 DBTL，乾淨地隔離出一個真實的取捨——SsrA 標籤能降低滲漏，但在弱啟動子上，降解速率會跑在合成之前，把誘導一起消滅，因此你必須提升轉錄能力，而不是繼續調整更替速率——再加上做生長曲線對照的紀律，使訊號消失不會被誤認為毒性。警訊則是：GCGS 幾乎沒有模型或軟體頁面就進了高中組 Top 10，而這正是這個整體出色的 wiki 上唯一明顯的破洞：一個規模不大、但完整記載參數與程式碼的自家 AND 閘 ODE 模型，成本很低，就能把洞補上。","awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳改良元件 — 得主（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（傳染病 / 治療 / 診斷 / 腫瘤）"],"rank":117},"6243":{"team":"William-and-Mary","id":"6243","section":"Undergrad","country":"United States","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/william-and-mary/","projectTitle":"BROKEN: Building Resilient Optimized Engineered Networks","projectTitle_zh":"BROKEN: Building Resilient Optimized Engineered Networks","tagline":"Bringing failure analysis from mature engineering disciplines into synthetic biology: detect, mitigate and predict how genetic circuits break.","tagline_zh":"把成熟工程領域的失效分析帶進合成生物學：偵測、緩解並預測基因迴路是怎麼壞掉的。","summary":"William & Mary argued that synthetic biology measures whether a circuit works and almost never measures how long it keeps working. BROKEN therefore ran longitudinal experiments on four previously engineered circuits in laboratory cultures and in seawater microcosms, following them through serial passaging to deterioration rather than stopping at initial success. The team paired functional readouts (OD600, beta-carotene production, GFP, biofilm morphology, starch hydrolysis, colony-forming units) with molecular verification (PCR, restriction digests, gels, NanoDrop) and with multi-omics (RNA-seq, genomic DNA sequencing, long-read plasmid sequencing), then built mechanistic ODE models and machine-learning approaches to predict time to failure. The reliability framing came directly from Integrated Human Practices and turned safety into the project's central motivation, which is reflected in its Safety and Security Award.","summary_zh":"William & Mary 主張合成生物學一向只量迴路「會不會動」，幾乎從不量它「還能動多久」。因此 BROKEN 對四個先前已工程改造的迴路做縱向實驗，在實驗室培養液與海水微宇宙中，透過連續傳代一路追到功能衰退，而不是在初步成功時就停下。團隊把功能性讀值（OD600、beta-胡蘿蔔素產量、GFP、生物膜形態、澱粉水解、菌落形成單位）與分子層面的驗證（PCR、限制酶切、電泳膠、NanoDrop）以及多體學（RNA-seq、基因體 DNA 定序、長讀長質體定序）配在一起，再建立機制性 ODE 模型與機器學習方法來預測失效時間。這套以可靠性為核心的框架直接來自整合式人類實踐，把安全變成整個專案的主要動機，而這也反映在他們拿到的 Safety and Security Award 上。","awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Undergrad)","Safety and Security Award — Winner (Undergrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A stated measurement philosophy of multitiered (population, circuit output, viability, DNA integrity, transcription), multimodal (optical, biochemical, microbiological, sequencing) and redundant measurement, with the explicit rationale that a falling fluorescence signal could equally mean circuit dysfunction, reduced growth, altered reporter maturation or changed physiology. An extension of the standard Design-Build-Test-Learn cycle so that engineering does not end at a functioning construct but continues through systematic longevity and failure testing in both laboratory and realistic environmental conditions, with results feeding back into design.","frameworks_zh":"他們寫明一套量測哲學：多層次（族群、迴路輸出、存活率、DNA 完整性、轉錄）、多模態（光學、生化、微生物學、定序）且具冗餘的量測，理由也說得清楚——螢光訊號下降，同樣可能代表迴路失能、生長變慢、報告蛋白成熟改變，或生理狀態改變。他們也擴充了標準的 Design-Build-Test-Learn 循環，使工程不在「構築體能運作」時就結束，而是繼續走到實驗室與真實環境條件下的系統性壽命與失效測試，並把結果回饋到設計。","dataviz":"Longitudinal fluorescence and beta-carotene time-course figures, kill-switch and thymineless-death assay panels, DNA mutation tables for the corrosion-prevention construct, leakiness panels and circuit-expression comparisons across experiments, all numbered as a continuous figure series across the results and measurement pages.","dataviz_zh":"縱向螢光與 beta-胡蘿蔔素的時間序列圖、致死開關與缺胸腺嘧啶死亡分析的面板、防腐蝕構築體的 DNA 突變表、洩漏表現面板，以及跨實驗的迴路表現比較，全部以連續編號的圖序貫穿結果頁與量測頁。","datascience":"The headline measurement contribution is absolute-style fluorescence calibration: the team prepared concentration series of fluorescein and sulforhodamine 101 in PBS, measured four replicates at each concentration with PBS blanks to assess solvent background, fitted linear regressions of fluorophore concentration against RFU with reported R2 greater than 0.99, and then used published extinction coefficients and quantum yields to estimate conversion factors between the calibration dyes and S65T GFP, mKate2, mCherry and cpGFP, so that plate-reader readings could enter the mathematical models as concentration-like variables instead of instrument-dependent arbitrary units. They state the limitation plainly, that because dye and protein optical properties differ these conversions are estimates contingent on the correction factors. Normalisation is handled explicitly: beta-carotene is reported as A454/OD600 so that per-cell production is separated from cell number, uncontaminated LB is measured as a blank, and OD600 is used both to standardise serial transfers and to interpret every fluorescence comparison. Where optical turbidity cannot answer the biological question, the technique changes: CFU counts are used for kill-switch viability and for thymineless death and rescue, on the advice of Dr Andrei Kuzminov, with plating on thymidine-supplemented medium so that the assay does not itself impose further starvation. Reporter maturation delay was built into measurement timing after Dr Sean Sleight pointed out that a delay in fluorescence is not a delay in transcription. The RNA-seq pipeline is specified end to end: fastp for adapter trimming and quality filtering, SortMeRNA for residual rRNA removal, HISAT2 alignment against combined host-plus-plasmid references built as merged FASTA and GFF files, featureCounts for gene-level assignment and DESeq2 for differential expression; genome assemblies from Plasmidsaurus were annotated with Bakta in Geneious Prime and variant tables exported. Modelling carries uncertainty properly: SciPy least-squares fits of the lambda-repressor model give R2 = 0.82 and chi2/dof = 0.88 at 30 C, and the team reports that the 42 C prediction degrades to R2 = 0.55 with chi2/dof = 7.57, six to eight times worse than the in-sample value and therefore larger than measurement noise explains, rather than presenting the prediction as validated. A light-responsive fit is reported as poor at the assumed error (chi2/dof = 4.7, p = 0.0009) with the specific failure described (the dark curve fits, the light curve is flat then bursts). Because the labelled dataset is tiny (N = 16), model selection uses leave-one-out and leave-one-series-out rather than a train/test split, with benchmarking across OLS, Ridge, Lasso, Elastic Net, random forest and Gaussian process; Ridge on circuit fraction plus stress genes gives leave-one-out R2 = 0.61, and a classifier reaches AUC 0.880 and accuracy 0.830, both reported with the caveat that 16 samples cannot establish a general predictor.","datascience_zh":"最主要的量測貢獻是接近絕對值的螢光校正：團隊在 PBS 中配製螢光素與 sulforhodamine 101 的濃度系列，每個濃度測四個重複並以 PBS 空白評估溶劑背景，對螢光團濃度與 RFU 擬合線性迴歸、報告 R2 大於 0.99，再以已發表的吸光係數與量子產率估算校正染料與 S65T GFP、mKate2、mCherry 及 cpGFP 之間的換算因子，使盤式讀取儀的讀值能以「類似濃度」的變數進入數學模型，而不是以依賴儀器的任意單位進入。他們也把限制講白：因為染料與蛋白質的光學性質不同，這些換算只是估計值，且取決於那些校正因子。正規化處理得很明確：beta-胡蘿蔔素以 A454/OD600 報告，把每個細胞的產量與細胞數分開；未受污染的 LB 當空白量測；OD600 既用來標準化連續接種，也用來解讀每一次螢光比較。而當光學濁度回答不了生物學問題時，技術就換掉：依 Dr Andrei Kuzminov 的建議，致死開關的存活率以及缺胸腺嘧啶死亡與其救援都改用 CFU 計數，並塗在添加胸苷的培養基上，以免分析本身又施加額外的飢餓。在 Dr Sean Sleight 指出「螢光的延遲不等於轉錄的延遲」之後，報告蛋白的成熟延遲也被納入量測時程設計。RNA-seq 流程從頭到尾都寫明：以 fastp 做接頭修剪與品質過濾、SortMeRNA 去除殘餘 rRNA、以合併成單一 FASTA 與 GFF 檔的宿主加質體參考序列做 HISAT2 比對、featureCounts 做基因層級歸屬、DESeq2 做差異表現；來自 Plasmidsaurus 的基因體組裝則在 Geneious Prime 中以 Bakta 註解並匯出變異表。建模也把不確定性處理得妥當：以 SciPy 最小平方擬合 lambda 抑制子模型，在 30 degC 下得到 R2 = 0.82、chi2/dof = 0.88，而團隊報告 42 degC 的預測退化到 R2 = 0.55、chi2/dof = 7.57，比樣本內數值差六到八倍，因此大於量測雜訊所能解釋的範圍——他們沒有把這個預測當成已驗證。一個光反應模型的擬合則在假設誤差下被報為不佳（chi2/dof = 4.7，p = 0.0009），並描述出具體的失效形式（暗處的曲線擬合得好，光照的曲線先平坦後暴衝）。由於有標註的資料集極小（N = 16），模型選擇採留一法與留一序列法，而不是訓練/測試切分，並在 OLS、Ridge、Lasso、Elastic Net、隨機森林與高斯過程之間做基準比較；以迴路比例加上逆境基因為特徵的 Ridge 得到留一法 R2 = 0.61，分類器達到 AUC 0.880、準確率 0.830，而兩者都附上保留說明：16 個樣本無法確立一個通用的預測器。","software":"All modelling and analysis code is published with documentation on the team's iGEM GitLab, with instructions for both terminal use and a web interface. A Guidebook for Circuit Failure Measurement is released as a PDF, offering a tiered approach scaled to a laboratory's budget, from accessible functional assays through molecular diagnostics to sequencing and multi-omics. Longitudinal RNA-seq and DNA-seq datasets are released for the community, paired with functional, growth and viability measurements so that molecular change can be linked to observed performance. The hardware, software, alternative-platform and entrepreneurship wiki pages remain unfilled iGEM templates.","software_zh":"所有建模與分析程式碼都連同文件發表在團隊的 iGEM GitLab 上，並附終端機與網頁介面兩種使用說明。另釋出一本 PDF 版的《迴路失效量測指南》，提供依實驗室預算分層的做法，從負擔得起的功能性分析，到分子診斷，再到定序與多體學。縱向 RNA-seq 與 DNA-seq 資料集也公開給社群，並與功能、生長與存活率量測配對，使分子層面的變化能和觀察到的效能連起來。至於 wiki 上的硬體、軟體、替代平台與創業頁面，仍停留在未填寫的 iGEM 範本。","stack":["fastp","SortMeRNA","HISAT2","featureCounts","DESeq2","Bakta","Geneious Prime","Plasmidsaurus (Oxford Nanopore long-read)","SciPy (least_squares)","scikit-learn-style regression benchmarking","Plate reader fluorescence and OD600","Flow-cytometry-free CFU viability"],"techniques":["Fluorescein and sulforhodamine 101 calibration curves (R2 > 0.99)","Dye-to-protein conversion factors via extinction coefficient and quantum yield","OD600 normalisation and blank subtraction","A454/OD600 product normalisation","CFU viability in place of turbidity","Reporter maturation-aware timing","Longitudinal serial passaging to a failure endpoint","Seawater microcosm environmental testing","chi2/dof goodness of fit","Leave-one-out and leave-one-series-out validation","Model benchmarking on a fixed small dataset"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"","ihp":"Integrated Human Practices reframed the project three times over. Contributors from aerospace, civil and electrical engineering backgrounds pushed the team to adopt not only the methods of failure engineering but its mindset, that failure should be anticipated and designed for rather than observed after the fact. The most consequential shift was the recognition that circuit failure is a biosafety problem, not a performance problem, which moved safety from a secondary consideration to the central motivation and underpins the team's Safety and Security Award. Technical guidance entered the DBTL cycle directly: Dr Alex Porter pressed the team on the gap between laboratory performance and behaviour under realistic environmental conditions, which produced the seawater microcosm experiments; Dr Sean Sleight raised fluorescent-protein maturation, which changed measurement timing; and Dr Andrei Kuzminov argued that OD600 and fluorescence could not measure survival during thymineless death, which replaced the planned readout with CFU-based viability.","ihp_zh":"整合式人類實踐把這個專案重新框定了三次。來自航太、土木與電機工程背景的貢獻者，推動團隊不只採用失效工程的方法，更採用它的心態：失效應該被預期、被設計進去，而不是事後才觀察到。影響最大的轉變，是認知到迴路失效是生物安全問題，不是效能問題；這把安全從次要考量移到核心動機，也支撐起團隊的 Safety and Security Award。技術建議則直接進了 DBTL 循環：Dr Alex Porter 針對實驗室表現與真實環境條件下的行為落差施壓，因而產生海水微宇宙實驗；Dr Sean Sleight 提出螢光蛋白成熟的問題，改變了量測時程；而 Dr Andrei Kuzminov 主張 OD600 與螢光無法量測缺胸腺嘧啶死亡期間的存活，於是原定讀值被換成以 CFU 為基礎的存活率。","realWorld":"The project's deliverables are aimed at the field rather than at a product: an open-source set of standard operating protocols written so that someone who was not present can follow them, a tiered Guidebook for Circuit Failure Measurement scaled to different budgets, publicly released longitudinal multi-omics datasets for comparative failure analysis and model validation, and a proposed extension of DBTL that adds systematic longevity and failure testing. The team also models building on previously published circuits rather than treating initial characterisation as an endpoint, and frames kill switches and other safety-critical circuits as the components that most need the failure analysis mature engineering disciplines already apply.","realWorld_zh":"這個專案的交付成果瞄準的是整個領域，而不是一項產品：一套開源的標準操作程序，寫法確保沒在現場的人也能照著做；一本依不同預算分層的《迴路失效量測指南》；公開釋出的縱向多體學資料集，供比較性失效分析與模型驗證使用；以及一項 DBTL 的擴充提案，加入系統性的壽命與失效測試。團隊也示範了在既有已發表迴路之上繼續做，而不是把初步特性化當成終點，並把致死開關與其他安全關鍵迴路定位為最需要成熟工程領域早已在做的那種失效分析的元件。","partners":["Dr Alex J. Porter","Dr Sean Sleight","Dr Andrei Kuzminov","Plasmidsaurus"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6243/wiki/figures/figure1-betacarotene-assay.avif","caption":"Beta-carotene assay following circuit output over serial passaging. Absorbance at 454 nm is normalised to OD600 so that a fall in total pigment can be separated from a fall in cell number.","caption_zh":"追蹤連續傳代過程中迴路輸出的 beta-胡蘿蔔素分析。454 nm 的吸光度以 OD600 正規化，使總色素下降能與細胞數下降分開。","credit":"Team William-and-Mary, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6243/wiki/figures/figure3-killswitch-assay.avif","caption":"Kill-switch assay. Colony-forming unit counts before and after induction are used instead of OD600 or fluorescence, because the intended output of a kill switch is loss of viability rather than loss of reporter signal.","caption_zh":"致死開關分析。誘導前後改用菌落形成單位計數，而非 OD600 或螢光，因為致死開關預期的輸出是失去存活力，而不是失去報告訊號。","credit":"Team William-and-Mary, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6243/wiki/figures/figure10-thymineless-rescue.avif","caption":"Thymineless rescue measured by CFU on thymidine-supplemented medium, an assay design adopted after Dr Andrei Kuzminov advised that optical density and fluorescence would not measure survival directly.","caption_zh":"以添加胸苷培養基上的 CFU 量測缺胸腺嘧啶後的救援；這個分析設計是在 Dr Andrei Kuzminov 指出光密度與螢光無法直接量測存活之後才採用的。","credit":"Team William-and-Mary, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6243/wiki/figures/fig11-hd260828-gfp-fluorescence-timecourse.avif","caption":"GFP fluorescence time course for an engineered construct. Raw plate-reader RFU values are converted toward concentration-like units using fluorescein and sulforhodamine 101 calibration curves (R2 > 0.99) before entering the mathematical models.","caption_zh":"一個工程改造構築體的 GFP 螢光時間序列。盤式讀取儀的原始 RFU 值先以螢光素與 sulforhodamine 101 的校正曲線（R2 > 0.99）換算成類似濃度的單位，才進入數學模型。","credit":"Team William-and-Mary, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Calibrate fluorescence against a dye concentration series before any number leaves the plate reader, and report model fits with chi2/dof against the measurement error rather than R2 alone, so that an out-of-sample prediction that is six times worse than the in-sample fit is visible as a failure instead of being dressed up as a moderate correlation.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"在任何數字離開盤式讀取儀之前，先用一組染料濃度系列校正螢光；而模型擬合要用對照量測誤差的 chi2/dof 來報告，不要只報 R2——這樣一個比樣本內擬合差六倍的樣本外預測，才會被看成失效，而不是被包裝成「中等程度的相關」。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/william-and-mary/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/william-and-mary/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/william-and-mary/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/william-and-mary/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/william-and-mary/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/william-and-mary/engineering"],"awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（大學組）","安全與保安獎 — 得主（大學組）"],"rank":40},"6244":{"team":"QingdaoAcademy","id":"6244","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/","projectTitle":"UPKeep","projectTitle_zh":"UPKeep","tagline":"From green tides to new possibilities: enzymes that turn collected Ulva into sugars for further biological use.","tagline_zh":"從綠潮到新的可能：用酵素把收集來的 Ulva 轉化為可供後續生物利用的醣類。","summary":"QingdaoAcademy (Qingdao, Shandong) built UPKeep around the Ulva prolifera green tides that wash onto the Yellow Sea coast each summer. Stage 1 uses a free, configurable cellulosome - four enzyme modules (Cel9A, Cel6B, Cel9B-N, BglC) docked onto a CBM3a-bearing scaffoldin via cohesin-dockerin pairs - to open the cellulose-rich cell wall; Stage 2 applies an INPNC-Uly1040 ulvan lyase fusion to depolymerise ulvan into oligosaccharides proposed as a cosmetic moisturising ingredient. Containment is an iron-responsive Fur/ccdB-TetR/ccdA toxin-antitoxin circuit, modelled as a 13-state ODE system, while interface selection rests on a 25-pair AlphaFold 3 screen with HADDOCK and PRODIGY follow-up. The Human Practices work is unusually well engineered for a first-year high-school team: thirteen numbered design decisions, each with the stakeholder, what was said, what changed and the follow-up evidence.","summary_zh":"QingdaoAcademy（山東青島）以每年夏天湧上黃海沿岸的 Ulva prolifera 綠潮為題，建立了 UPKeep。第一階段使用一個游離、可組態的纖維小體（cellulosome），由四個酵素模組（Cel9A、Cel6B、Cel9B-N、BglC）透過 cohesin-dockerin 配對接到帶有 CBM3a 的支架蛋白上，用來打開富含纖維素的細胞壁；第二階段則以 INPNC-Uly1040 ulvan 裂解酶融合蛋白把 ulvan 解聚成寡醣，並提議作為化妝品的保濕成分。生物圍阻採用鐵離子反應型的 Fur/ccdB-TetR/ccdA 毒素-抗毒素迴路，以 13 個狀態變數的 ODE 系統建模；界面的選擇則建立在 25 組配對的 AlphaFold 3 篩選上，再以 HADDOCK 與 PRODIGY 做後續分析。對一支第一年參賽的高中隊伍來說，人類實踐的工作設計得異常嚴謹：十三項編號的設計決策，每一項都列出利害關係人、對方說了什麼、改了什麼，以及後續證據。","awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (High School)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Agriculture / Food & Nutrition / Fashion & Cosmetics / Art & Design)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Two linked models. (1) Cellulosome recognition: all 25 cohesin-dockerin pairings screened with AlphaFold Server (AF3), two protein chains plus two calcium ions per request, seed 101, five outputs each - 125 structures - ranked by five-output mean protein-pair ipTM with bidirectional interchain PAE, interface contacts and pose spread examined; seven pairs (the five intended A-a, B-b, C-c, F-f, T-t plus the two highest-scoring mismatches B-c and T-b) taken through HADDOCK refinement and PRODIGY affinity estimation against the native 1OHZ reference. (2) Iron-responsive containment: a 13-state ODE model (sensed intracellular iron, Fur RNA, total and iron-bound Fur, shared ccdB/TetR transcript, TetR, ccdA RNA, free CcdB, free CcdA, inactive complex, a damage proxy, log population and log survival) in hours, used to study response delay after iron withdrawal or restoration, how the iron threshold shifts with the chosen endpoint, and which parameters dominate that threshold.","frameworks_zh":"兩個相互連結的模型。（1）纖維小體辨識：全部 25 組 cohesin-dockerin 配對都以 AlphaFold Server（AF3）篩選，每次請求輸入兩條蛋白質鏈加兩個鈣離子，seed 為 101，各產生五個輸出，共 125 個結構；以五個輸出的蛋白質配對 ipTM 平均值排序，並檢視雙向的鏈間 PAE、界面接觸與構型分散程度；其中七組配對（五組預期的 A-a、B-b、C-c、F-f、T-t，加上分數最高的兩組錯配 B-c 與 T-b）進一步做 HADDOCK 精修與 PRODIGY 親和力估計，並以天然的 1OHZ 作為參考對照。（2）鐵離子反應型生物圍阻：一個 13 個狀態變數的 ODE 模型（感測到的胞內鐵、Fur RNA、總 Fur 與結合鐵的 Fur、共用的 ccdB/TetR 轉錄本、TetR、ccdA RNA、游離 CcdB、游離 CcdA、失活複合體、一個損傷代理變數、族群對數與存活率對數），時間以小時為單位，用來研究撤除或恢復鐵之後的反應延遲、鐵濃度閾值如何隨所選終點而移動，以及哪些參數主導該閾值。","dataviz":"Matplotlib-generated SVG figures throughout: an LCA climate comparison separating enzymatic gross emissions, the residue-substitution credit and the net result across three scenarios; log-axis water and energy comparisons; a 25x25 ipTM heat matrix with the intended diagonal outlined and the two mismatch candidates highlighted in orange; predicted Kd on a logarithmic axis with per-model dots and cluster spans; interactive 3D structure viewers with a pLDDT colour mode; a stakeholder influence-versus-impact map and an SDG interaction map, both downloadable as SVG and PNG; survey charts transcribed from original screenshots with each question's own denominator retained.","dataviz_zh":"全站圖表皆以 Matplotlib 產生 SVG：一張生命週期評估的氣候比較圖，把酵素路線的毛排放、殘渣替代的抵減額以及三種情境下的淨結果分開呈現；水與能源的對數軸比較圖；一張 25x25 的 ipTM 熱圖矩陣，預期的對角線以框線標出，兩個錯配候選以橘色強調；對數軸上的預測 Kd 值，附各模型的點與叢集區間；可互動的 3D 結構檢視器並附 pLDDT 上色模式；一張利害關係人影響力對衝擊的地圖與一張 SDG 交互作用地圖，兩者都可下載為 SVG 與 PNG；以及由原始截圖轉錄而來的問卷圖表，每一題各自的分母都保留下來。","datascience":"Reproducibility is treated as a deliverable: submitted sequences, AF3 requests, structures, a configuration-status manifest, per-model metrics for all 125 AF3 structures and all 25 pair summaries are downloadable as JSON, with official page snapshots, plain-text logs and parsed values archived under a result-snapshots directory and task/cluster filenames linking models to local inputs. HADDOCK scores are reconstructed from saved energy terms with the default weighting (Evdw + 0.2 Eelec + Edesolv + 0.1 Eair) and reported as mean +/- population SD over four cluster representatives. Pose uncertainty is quantified rather than hidden (mean/max pairwise dockerin Ca RMSD after cohesin alignment of about 10.99/17.76 A for T-t), and the team notes that B-b and B-c Kd ranges overlap with median dG differing by 0.05 kcal/mol, so cross-binding must be tested experimentally rather than declared resolved. A process LCA on a basis of 1 t fresh Ulva at 90% moisture gives 34 kWh, 8,800 L water and 264 kg CO2e gross, with a residue-substitution credit sweep (0-1 kg soybean meal displaced per kg theoretical remaining dry matter) producing a 34.4-264 kg CO2e/t net range; a literature-based nutrient conversion gives 18-54 kg N and 2.5-9.2 kg P per dry tonne.","datascience_zh":"可重現性被當作一項交付成果：送出的序列、AF3 請求、結構檔、組態狀態清單、全部 125 個 AF3 結構的各模型指標以及全部 25 組配對摘要，都可下載為 JSON；官方頁面的快照、純文字日誌與解析後的數值歸檔在 result-snapshots 目錄下，並以任務／叢集檔名把模型連回本機輸入。HADDOCK 分數由儲存的能量項以預設權重（Evdw + 0.2 Eelec + Edesolv + 0.1 Eair）重建，並以四個叢集代表的平均值 +/- 母體標準差報告。構型的不確定性被量化而非隱藏（T-t 在 cohesin 對齊後，dockerin Ca 原子的兩兩 RMSD 平均／最大值約為 10.99／17.76 A），團隊並指出 B-b 與 B-c 的 Kd 範圍重疊、中位 dG 僅相差 0.05 kcal/mol，因此交叉結合必須用實驗檢驗，而不能宣稱已經解決。以含水率 90% 的 1 公噸新鮮 Ulva 為基準所做的製程生命週期評估，得到 34 kWh、8,800 L 水與 264 kg CO2e 的毛排放；再對殘渣替代抵減做掃描（每公斤理論剩餘乾物質替代 0-1 kg 豆粉），得出 34.4-264 kg CO2e/t 的淨值區間；依文獻換算的養分量則為每公噸乾重 18-54 kg N 與 2.5-9.2 kg P。","software":"No standalone software tool. Dry-lab outputs are the AF3/HADDOCK/PRODIGY screening archive, the ODE reconstruction (independently re-derived from the report's equations and parameter tables on 20 October 2026, with added parameter stress tests), the LCA and nutrient-accounting workbooks, the downloadable activity-classification CSV, and an AP242 STEP CAD assembly of the Ulva collection ROV exported from Onshape.","software_zh":"沒有獨立的軟體工具。乾實驗的產出是 AF3/HADDOCK/PRODIGY 的篩選檔案庫、ODE 重建（於 2026 年 10 月 20 日依報告中的方程式與參數表獨立重新推導，並加上參數壓力測試）、生命週期評估與養分核算的試算表、可下載的活性分類 CSV，以及一份由 Onshape 匯出的 Ulva 收集 ROV 的 AP242 STEP CAD 組裝檔。","stack":["AlphaFold Server (AF3)","HADDOCK","PRODIGY","molecular 3D viewer with pLDDT colouring","ODE integration with sensitivity and parameter stress tests","Matplotlib v3.11.2","Onshape (AP242 STEP export)","Wenjuanxing online survey platform"],"techniques":["interface screening by ipTM, interchain PAE and contact analysis","docking refinement and binding-affinity estimation","cross-binding and selectivity risk identification","13-state ODE dynamics, threshold and sensitivity analysis","scenario life-cycle assessment with substitution credits","nitrogen and phosphorus material-flow accounting","colony-PCR template-preparation comparison (direct colony vs 2/10 suspension vs liquid culture)","moisture-uptake gravimetry under controlled humidity and hydroxyl-radical scavenging assay"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Engagement was sequenced on survey evidence rather than instinct: of 259 respondents 228 had at least heard of Ulva (88.03%) but only 34 claimed familiarity, and 142 of 263 knew little or nothing about synthetic biology (53.99%), so the booklet starts with everyday coastal effects and existing post-collection uses before engineered bacteria, surface display or cellulosomes appear at all. A harbour interviewee's remark that online video would reach people better than a poster at the pier redirected the channel strategy to short videos on Bilibili, Xiaohongshu, Douyin and WeChat Channels. A joint activity with OUC-Haide (the 17-C collaboration) was cross-checked before delivery and two content errors - a pH item and an mRNA pairing error - were found and corrected, with simulations, three-level hints and a reset path added. Continued participation runs through the school biology club and repeated lessons rather than one-off events, and the team keeps SDG 4 targets 4.4 and 4.7 separate from its claims about measured learning.","publicEngagement_zh":"參與活動的順序是依問卷證據而非直覺安排：259 位回覆者中有 228 人至少聽過 Ulva（88.03%），但只有 34 人自稱熟悉；263 人中有 142 人對合成生物學所知甚少或一無所知（53.99%），因此手冊從日常的海岸影響與現有的收集後用途講起，之後才出現工程菌、表面展示或纖維小體。一位港口受訪者說網路影片比碼頭海報更能觸及民眾，這把通路策略轉向 Bilibili、小紅書、抖音與微信視頻號上的短影片。與 OUC-Haide 合辦的活動（17-C 合作）在交付前先經交叉檢核，找出並修正了兩處內容錯誤（一道 pH 題與一處 mRNA 配對錯誤），並加入模擬、三層提示與重設路徑。持續參與是透過學校生物社與反覆授課，而非一次性活動；團隊也把 SDG 4 的 4.4 與 4.7 兩項目標，與自己關於學習成效的主張分開陳述。","ihp":"Twenty-two HP activities across six activity types are compressed into a register of thirteen numbered decisions (D01-D13), each naming the stakeholder, the quote, the change and the follow-up record - and several of them killed the team's favourite ideas. D02 is the clearest: the team wanted one system in which E. coli produced enzymes and degraded Ulva in a single reaction, but Seawin's Technical Director explained that cells and different enzymes each need their own temperature, pH and nutrient conditions, and Vland's Chief Scientist added that cells themselves generate metabolic acid, so the one-step process was split into separate cell-culture and enzyme-reaction steps and the planned pH-based function switch was abandoned entirely (D03). D04 came from peer pressure plus specialist correction: CCiC judges and teams flagged the expression burden of an extracellular cell-anchored cellulosome, and a Shanxi University doctoral researcher warned against loading too many cohesins onto one scaffoldin because of cleavage risk, so the team moved to a free cellulosome, accepting extraction and purification as explicit tasks, and planned separate expression followed by assembly. D05 is an honest unresolved tension rather than a tidy win: the cellulosome researcher supported adding BglC to hydrolyse accumulating cellobiose while Vland warned that glucose would then inhibit downstream, so the enzyme was retained with the trade-off written into the reaction-condition study. D06 dismantled the CBS-inspired shortcut of feeding hydrolysate straight into culture - Bright Moon pressed on carbon, nitrogen and aeration and Vland demanded composition analysis and experimental validation, so growth and enzyme production became separately measured questions, later yielding the observation that at pH 7 a 40% hydrolysate medium supported growth and target-protein expression with a longer lag phase. D07 is the strongest stakeholder-to-design chain: a beauty-salon manager said she would hesitate to trust Qingdao Ulva as a raw material because of possible pollution, which the team carried into a joint consultation with Professors Ning Wu and Jing Wang at the Institute of Oceanology, CAS, where contamination resolved into two concrete, separately measurable requirements - seaweed's high salt content means inadequate desalting could cause osmotic imbalance on skin, so ultrafiltration desalting and concentration entered the sample-preparation plan, and because E. coli is the production host, endotoxin must be specifically measured and controlled for higher-end or damaged-skin use. Biosafety specialist Prof. Zhihang Chen then converted an end-stage pair of controls (heat treatment plus a kill switch) into process-wide control, separating live cells, nucleic acids and endotoxin, each with its own treatment and assessment target, and prompting work on ClearColi and Rosetta chassis compatibility. D08 had Gather Great Ocean puncture the assumption that a mature brown-seaweed business implies a market for ulvan oligosaccharides - its Ulva powder goes to aquaculture feed, and it told the team to first establish what advantage ulvan oligosaccharides have over other materials - which sent them to the two professors for assay methods they could actually run (moisture uptake by desiccator and balance, in vitro antioxidant assays) and added molecular-weight profiling after the 500 Da skin-penetration literature. D13 reframed feedstock itself: the Yellow Sea Fisheries Research Institute separated ecological abundance, visible shoreline biomass and what a processor can reliably obtain, and added sand removal, dewatering and acquisition cost, so the team retained a reduced-supply scenario instead of assuming continued large blooms. Even packaging was corrected - YUTOECO's engineering manager said the proposal was still too broad, so inner contact packaging is now specified around sealing, barrier and storage needs and only the outer layer explores moulded plant fibre.","ihp_zh":"六種活動類型下的 22 場人類實踐活動，被壓縮成一份十三項編號決策（D01-D13）的紀錄，每一項都指名利害關係人、引述原話、說明改動與後續記錄，而其中有幾項直接否決了團隊最鍾愛的構想。D02 最為明確：團隊原想做一個讓 E. coli 在單一反應中同時生產酵素並降解 Ulva 的系統，但 Seawin 的技術總監說明細胞與各種酵素各自需要不同的溫度、pH 與營養條件，Vland 的首席科學家則補充細胞自身會產生代謝酸，於是一步式製程被拆成細胞培養與酵素反應兩個獨立步驟，原先計畫的以 pH 為基礎的功能開關也被完全放棄（D03）。D04 來自同儕壓力加上專家糾正：CCiC 的評審與其他團隊指出把纖維小體錨定在細胞表面會造成表現負擔，一位山西大學的博士研究者則警告不要在單一支架蛋白上掛太多 cohesin，因為有被切斷的風險，於是團隊改採游離纖維小體，接受萃取與純化成為明確的工作項目，並規劃先分別表現再組裝。D05 是一項誠實且未解的張力，而不是漂亮的勝利：研究纖維小體的學者支持加入 BglC 來水解累積的纖維二醣，Vland 則警告隨之產生的葡萄糖會抑制下游，於是這個酵素被保留下來，而取捨被寫進反應條件的研究中。D06 推翻了受 CBS 啟發、直接把水解液餵入培養的捷徑：Bright Moon 針對碳源、氮源與通氣追問，Vland 則要求成分分析與實驗驗證，於是生長與酵素生產變成兩個分別量測的問題，後來也得到一項觀察：在 pH 7 下，40% 水解液的培養基能支持生長與目標蛋白表現，但延滯期較長。D07 是從利害關係人連到設計的最強鏈條：一位美容沙龍經理表示，因為可能有污染，她會猶豫是否信任青島的 Ulva 作為原料；團隊把這個疑慮帶進與中國科學院海洋研究所 Professors Ning Wu 與 Jing Wang 的聯合諮詢，污染在那裡被拆解成兩項具體且可分別量測的要求：海藻含鹽量高，脫鹽不足可能在皮膚上造成滲透壓失衡，因此超過濾脫鹽與濃縮被納入樣品製備計畫；而由於生產宿主是 E. coli，內毒素必須被專門量測並控制，尤其是用於高階產品或受損肌膚時。生物安全專家 Prof. Zhihang Chen 接著把原本放在末端的兩道控制（熱處理加上自殺開關）轉為貫穿整個製程的控制，把活細胞、核酸與內毒素分開處理，各自有自己的處理方式與評估目標，也促成了對 ClearColi 與 Rosetta 宿主相容性的研究。在 D08 中，Gather Great Ocean 戳破了「成熟的褐藻事業意味著 ulvan 寡醣也有市場」這個假設：該公司的 Ulva 粉末是供水產飼料使用，並要團隊先確立 ulvan 寡醣相對於其他材料有什麼優勢；這促使他們向那兩位教授請教真正做得到的檢測方法（以乾燥器與天平量吸濕量、體外抗氧化檢測），並在讀過 500 Da 皮膚穿透的文獻後加入分子量分布分析。D13 重新框定了原料本身：黃海水產研究所把生態量、岸邊可見的生物量，以及加工業者實際能穩定取得的量三者區分開來，並加上除砂、脫水與取得成本，於是團隊保留了一個供應量減少的情境，而不是假設大規模藻華會持續發生。連包裝都被糾正：YUTOECO 的工程經理指出提案仍然太籠統，因此現在內層接觸性包裝是依密封、阻隔與儲存需求來訂規格，只有外層才探索模塑植物纖維。","realWorld":"The real-world case is anchored in the existing Qingdao system rather than in a waste narrative: harbour workers, the Municipal Marine Development Bureau and processors described coordinated pier collection, dewatering and drying, trucking to downstream companies, feed and fertiliser uses and decayed material returned to sea - so the team compares four handling routes on cost, product value and nutrient destination and positions UPKeep as an added high-value step, noting Gather Great Ocean's blunt 'there is no waste material'. SDGs are claimed at target level with the team's own numbers: SDG 12 (12.2, 12.5, 12.6, 12.8) carries the LCA, with the enzymatic scenario at 264 kg CO2e/t gross and about 35 kg CO2e/t net when each kg of remaining dry matter displaces 1 kg of soybean meal at 2.75 kg CO2e/kg, 34 kWh/t against 389 kWh/t for the feed-meal route, and 8,800 L/t water driven chiefly by membrane diafiltration; SDG 14 (14.1, 14.2) carries nitrogen and phosphorus accounting to final destination and marine-ecology consultation; SDG 9 (9.4) the process and enzyme-recovery work; SDG 3 (3.9) storage, odour and coastal handling exposure; SDG 4 (4.4, 4.7) education; and SDG 8 (8.2, 8.8) worker protection and cost responsibility. The SDG dialogue partner was Professor Pierre Failler (Economics, University of Portsmouth), whose advice - 'do the economics first, and don't mix the concepts' and 'doing a single project on its own is very difficult, you need a cluster model' - made the team keep the business plan and the LCA as separate documents. The most concrete real-world act is not a product: after Hongdao interviews about slippery coastal working conditions, on 6 October 2026 the team filed a proposal through Qingdao's 12319 public-service platform requesting anti-slip footwear and gloves for frontline sanitation workers, and received an official reply on 9 October describing purchase and distribution of anti-slip equipment, safety reminders, site inspection and weather-based adjustment of operations; the remotely operated Ulva collection vehicle (a 648 x 462 x 419 mm PVC-framed ROV with a forward nylon-mesh basket, published as an AP242 STEP model) is justified on the same worker-exposure grounds. Entrepreneurship is deliberately modest - the first offer is an oligosaccharide research sample plus production route, assay results and a proposed quality-information sheet to cosmetic ingredient developers, with a cream-base-versus-cream-plus-ingredient demonstrator, revenue only after formulation qualification, and cost priorities named as enzyme production and recovery, purification, drying, batch quality and packaging. Regulatory status is not claimed anywhere; residue destined for fertiliser is explicitly excluded where it contains engineered cells, and no packaging prototype has been made.","realWorld_zh":"真實世界的論述錨定在青島既有的體系上，而不是一套廢棄物敘事：港口工人、市海洋發展局與加工業者描述了碼頭的協同收集、脫水與乾燥、卡車運往下游公司、飼料與肥料用途，以及腐敗物料被送回海裡的情形；團隊因此就成本、產品價值與養分最終去向比較四條處理路徑，並把 UPKeep 定位為一道增加高價值的步驟，同時引述 Gather Great Ocean 直白的一句「沒有廢料」。SDG 的主張以目標層級提出，並附上團隊自己的數字：SDG 12（12.2、12.5、12.6、12.8）承載生命週期評估，酵素情境的毛排放為 264 kg CO2e/t，若每公斤剩餘乾物質替代 1 公斤以 2.75 kg CO2e/kg 計的豆粉，則淨值約 35 kg CO2e/t，能耗 34 kWh/t（飼料粉路線為 389 kWh/t），用水 8,800 L/t，主要來自薄膜透析過濾；SDG 14（14.1、14.2）承載氮與磷一路追到最終去向的核算以及海洋生態諮詢；SDG 9（9.4）對應製程與酵素回收工作；SDG 3（3.9）對應儲存、異味與海岸作業的暴露；SDG 4（4.4、4.7）對應教育；SDG 8（8.2、8.8）對應工人保護與成本責任。SDG 對話的對象是 Professor Pierre Failler（University of Portsmouth，經濟學），他的建議（「先把經濟算清楚，不要把概念混在一起」以及「單獨做一個專案非常困難，你需要一個群聚模式」）使團隊把商業計畫與生命週期評估維持為兩份獨立文件。最具體的真實世界行動並不是一項產品：在 Hongdao 針對海岸作業濕滑環境的訪談之後，團隊於 2026 年 10 月 6 日透過青島 12319 公共服務平台提交建議，要求為一線環衛工人提供防滑鞋與手套，並於 10 月 9 日收到官方回覆，說明防滑裝備的採購與發放、安全提醒、現場巡檢以及依天候調整作業；那台遙控操作的 Ulva 收集車（648 x 462 x 419 mm 的 PVC 框架 ROV，前方裝有尼龍網籃，以 AP242 STEP 模型公開）也是以同樣的工人暴露理由為依據。創業部分刻意保守：第一個提供物是寡醣研究樣品，加上生產路線、檢測結果與一份提議的品質資訊表，對象是化妝品原料開發者，並附上乳霜基底對乳霜加成分的示範品；營收只在配方通過驗證後才出現；成本重點則明確點名酵素生產與回收、純化、乾燥、批次品質與包裝。法規狀態在任何地方都沒有被宣稱；用於肥料的殘渣在含有工程細胞時被明確排除，而包裝原型尚未製作。","partners":["Qingdao Municipal Marine Development Bureau","Hongdao fishing harbour fishers, boat operators, coastal sanitation workers and residents","Seawin Biotech (Technical Director, two consultations)","Vland Biotech (Chief Scientist, two consultations)","Bright Moon Seaweed Group (company visit and R&D consultation)","Qingdao Gather Great Ocean Algae Industry Group","Yellow Sea Fisheries Research Institute, Chinese Academy of Fishery Sciences","Professors Ning Wu and Jing Wang, Institute of Oceanology, Chinese Academy of Sciences","Prof. Zhihang Chen (biosafety)","Cellulosome researcher, Shanxi University","Professor Pierre Failler, University of Portsmouth (SDG consultation, 20 October 2026)","YUTOECO / YUTO (packaging engineering)","iGEM OUC-Haide (17-C collaboration)","CCiC conference and Unconference participants","A student and a beauty salon manager (prospective skincare users)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6244/wiki/engagement/qa-8fac1d1be36d-hp01-8fac1d1be3.avif","caption":"HP01: interviews at Hongdao fishing harbour with fishers, boat operators, coastal sanitation workers and residents, which corrected the team's assumption that the Ulva utilisation chain was undeveloped.","caption_zh":"HP01：在 Hongdao 漁港對漁民、船員、海岸環衛工人與居民進行訪談，這修正了團隊原先以為 Ulva 利用鏈尚未發展的假設。","credit":"Team QingdaoAcademy, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6244/wiki/engagement/qa-38a681455267-hp03-38a6814552.avif","caption":"HP03: consultation with the Qingdao Municipal Marine Development Bureau on existing collection, transport and post-collection handling, used to locate the project's point of entry.","caption_zh":"HP03：就既有的收集、運輸與收集後處理向青島市海洋發展局諮詢，用來定位專案的切入點。","credit":"Team QingdaoAcademy, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6244/wiki/engagement/qa-2a0007cd5e6a-hp12-2a0007cd5e.avif","caption":"HP12: joint consultation with Professors Ning Wu and Jing Wang at the Institute of Oceanology, CAS, where a user's contamination worry became separate desalting and endotoxin requirements.","caption_zh":"HP12：與中國科學院海洋研究所 Professors Ning Wu 與 Jing Wang 的聯合諮詢，一位使用者的污染疑慮在此化為脫鹽與內毒素兩項獨立要求。","credit":"Team QingdaoAcademy, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6244/wiki/engagement/qa-74aa66d13ac0-hp16a-74aa66d13a.avif","caption":"HP16: visit to Bright Moon Seaweed, whose R&D staff redirected the team's effort onto enzyme selection and ratios and onto membrane separation and sample condition.","caption_zh":"HP16：參訪 Bright Moon Seaweed，其研發人員把團隊的力氣導向酵素選擇與比例，以及薄膜分離與樣品條件。","credit":"Team QingdaoAcademy, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Keep a numbered decision register like UPKeep's D01-D13, where each row is initial idea / stakeholders / what we heard / what we changed / why it matters, cross-linked to the interview record and to the experiment that tests the change - including rows where two advisers disagreed and the tension was retained rather than resolved. Their second habit is worth copying too: push a vague public worry ('Ulva might be polluted') to experts until it becomes separately measurable specifications (desalting, endotoxin, DNA residue, live-cell viability).","gemsTakeaway_zh":"維護一份像 UPKeep 的 D01-D13 那樣的編號決策紀錄，每一列都是「最初想法／利害關係人／我們聽到什麼／我們改了什麼／為什麼重要」，並與訪談記錄以及檢驗該項改動的實驗相互連結，其中也包含兩位顧問意見相左、而這份張力被保留而非被抹平的那些列。他們的第二個習慣同樣值得照做：把一個模糊的公眾疑慮（「Ulva 可能受污染」）一路追問到專家那裡，直到它變成幾項可以分別量測的規格（脫鹽、內毒素、DNA 殘留、活細胞存活率）。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/","https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/sustainability","https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/team"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（農業 / 食品與營養 / 時尚與美妝 / 藝術與設計）"],"rank":21},"6245":{"team":"ABOA","id":"6245","section":"Overgrad","country":"Finland","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/","projectTitle":"Benzophe-none","tagline":"Degrading benzophenone-3 before it reaches our waters","summary":"ABOA (University of Turku) set out to express the benzophenone-3 (BP-3, oxybenzone) catabolic pathway of Rhodococcus oxybenzonivorans in E. coli so that this sunscreen UV filter could be destroyed inside a wastewater treatment plant rather than released into the Baltic and the oceans. The team built a modular restriction-based plasmid system (10 plasmids, 10 genes covering four pathway steps, codon-optimised and RFC10/RFC1000 compatible) that lets homologous flavin reductases and flavin-dependent oxidoreductases be co-expressed, separated, swapped and re-tagged between 6xHis and GST using only NcoI, NdeI and XhoI. Enzyme expression and solubility were obtained to varying degrees, but the activity question was not resolved: BP-3 and BP-1 absorbance overlaps NADH so the spectrophotometric assay was inconclusive, and the triple-quadrupole LC-MS run failed on missing controls and incompatible vials. The team says this plainly and positions the work as a first step plus a designed-but-untested 28-part Golden Gate system (38 parts in total) handed to the community.","awards":["Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"No modelling framework. The /model, /software and /hardware pages are unfilled iGEM template stubs carrying only the award description text, which is worth stating plainly: this project has essentially no dry-lab component.","dataviz":"Hand-drawn schematic figures only: the proposed R. oxybenzonivorans catabolic pathway, the plasmid map set, the LC-MS detection strategy, the Golden Gate assembly map, and a single process diagram running from the Golden Gate construct to a fixed-carrier bioreactor at the end of a wastewater plant. Survey results are reported as percentages in prose rather than plotted.","datascience":"A 136-response consumer survey on sunscreen habits and environmental awareness (93% use sunscreen regularly; 68% say environmental friendliness influences purchase; 57% aware some sunscreen ingredients harm the environment; 52% read ingredient lists; 52% believe sunscreen slows tanning but only 9% skip it for that reason; 70% would protect their skin over the environment if forced to choose). Percentages are honestly computed per question because response counts varied. No statistical modelling.","software":"None. Sequence work was done with off-the-shelf tools: NCBI protein BLAST to find Rhodococcus homologues of every proposed pathway enzyme, Benchling for the Golden Gate overhang design and SnapGene for visualising the final construct.","stack":["NCBI protein BLAST","Benchling","SnapGene"],"techniques":["homologue search across Rhodococcus strains (USK10, USK13, R. jostii, R. oxybenzonivorans)","codon optimisation for E. coli","RFC10 / RFC1000 part compatibility","Golden Gate overhang design (BsaI, six positions A-F in pET28g)","NADH-coupled activity assay","triple-quadrupole LC-MS method adaptation"],"frameworks_zh":"沒有任何建模框架。/model、/software 與 /hardware 三個頁面都是未填寫的 iGEM 模板殘稿，只留著獎項說明文字；這點值得直說：本專案基本上沒有乾實驗成分。","dataviz_zh":"只有手繪示意圖：所提出的 R. oxybenzonivorans 分解代謝途徑、質體圖譜組、LC-MS 偵測策略、Golden Gate 組裝圖，以及一張從 Golden Gate 構築體一路到污水處理廠末端固定載體生物反應器的製程圖。問卷結果以文字敘述中的百分比呈現，沒有繪圖。","datascience_zh":"一份 136 份回覆的消費者問卷，調查防曬乳使用習慣與環境意識（93% 經常使用防曬乳；68% 表示環境友善會影響購買；57% 知道某些防曬成分會危害環境；52% 會看成分表；52% 認為防曬會讓曬黑變慢，但只有 9% 因此不擦；70% 若必須二選一，會選擇保護皮膚而非環境）。由於各題的回覆數不同，百分比是誠實地逐題計算。沒有統計建模。","software_zh":"沒有。序列工作使用現成工具完成：以 NCBI protein BLAST 尋找每個所提途徑酵素在 Rhodococcus 中的同源序列，以 Benchling 設計 Golden Gate 的黏合末端，並以 SnapGene 視覺化最終構築體。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A 136-person anonymous survey on sunscreen habits collected at public events and on social media, designed both to gather data and to raise awareness; it was later used to shape the team's social posts. Secondary-school visits with age-split formats (project pitch plus a Kahoot on synthetic biology fundamentals for upper secondary; a hands-on osmosis experiment for lower secondary), with a return invitation and a further school event booked for after the Jamboree. A red-cabbage pH indicator workshop for primary-school children at Turku main library during Turku Day, linked out to ocean acidification. A joint appearance with Aalto-Helsinki at Children's Medical Day at the Heureka Science Centre (22 August 2026) running three workshops, where the team also collected survey responses. An article about the project and about iGEM in the magazine of Suomen Solubiologit ry (the Finnish cell biologists' association), with a follow-up article agreed for after the Jamboree. A laboratory visit by science journalist Ritva Setala and photographer Marttiina Sairanen from the regional newspaper Turun Sanomat. Recruitment-oriented booths at the Study in Turku fair and the TYY Opening Carnival with Aboa Turku ry, where the team deliberately worked against first-year students' sense that an international synthetic biology competition is beyond them.","ihp":"ABOA's integrated human practices is genuinely integrated on the technical side and well-documented in method: previous ABOA teams advised contacting stakeholders before the project idea was fixed, and the team set a rule that every meeting had a written objective beforehand and a debrief afterwards whose notes fed project decisions. The strongest single causal chain runs through the Turku wastewater treatment plant. Process engineer Jouko Tuomi, with trainees Nea Lempiainen and Heli Karinkanta, told them that purified enzymes are too delicate and expensive to run in a plant, that enzyme activity decays, and that whole cells on fixed carriers in a flow-through bioreactor are what the activated sludge process already does well - and the team changed its implementation from purified enzymes to intact cells as a result, then built a Golden Gate system specifically to put all pathway enzymes into one cell. The same conversation produced three further changes: they dropped the idea of inoculating their strain into the activated sludge itself because the plant warned it would wreck the existing microbial balance for months and their strain would simply be out-competed; they moved the bioreactor to the end of the treatment train after filtration, with coagulation and UV kill as the existing backstop; and they took up the plant's suggestion of treating a concentrated side stream rather than the whole flow, since influent BP-3 is too dilute to treat economically. The plant also told them that in Finland plants operate underground so mining new space costs tens of millions of euros and changes are made essentially only when law requires them, and that efficiency ranks above cost in technology selection - which is why the team's own staging plan is wastewater-sample testing, then a small on-site test station, then integration. A second chain runs through the construct design: Dr. Rongbin Wang's explanation that BioBrick parts cannot cleanly build in-frame fusion proteins or swap purification tags made the team abandon the BioBrick route entirely for expression-ready plasmids modified with standard restriction enzymes; Dr. Jarmo Kapyla's point that neither His- nor GST-tag performance can be predicted made them commit to testing both experimentally with His as primary and GST as backup, and also told them colony PCR is insufficient verification (they could not afford sequencing primers and say so, recommending sequencing for the next stage); Dr. Tuomas Huovinen supplied concrete expression parameters they adopted (200 mL culture to OD600 0.8, 0.4 mM IPTG, 26 C post-induction, 16 h), the Western blot with HRP-conjugated anti-6xHis antibodies to see proteins SDS-PAGE could not, and electroporation to fix poor heat-shock transformation. A third chain is about not making the problem worse: Dr. Timo Vuorisalo (ecology) told them to check whether the pathway intermediates might themselves be endocrine disruptors, so they searched the ECHA ED Expert Group assessment list and found none of the intermediates listed; Professor Tuulia Hyotylainen (exposomes, Orebro) confirmed that degrading one aromatic ring is very likely to abolish the endocrine activity, which validated attacking only the early pathway steps, and warned that wastewater conditions will be far less favourable than the lab bench; Professor Emma Camp (Future Reefs, UTS) added that the bacteria must be tested under realistic wastewater conditions and contained, and that BP-3 is one stressor among many on reefs rather than the main one. Harri Helminen of the Finnish supervisory agency confirmed UV filters are among the top five endocrine disruptors of concern in water ecosystems, told them no comprehensive BP-3 measurement exists for Finnish waters, explained that Environmental Quality Standards are set 100-1000 times below the lowest concentration with observed biological effect, and placed BP-3 within the revised EU Urban Waste Water Treatment Directive (in force 2025, requirements generally expected by 2036, 80% micropollutant removal) - which is the regulatory anchor for the whole project. Health-side consultations changed emphasis rather than engineering: Merike Laine of the Helsinki Allergy and Asthma Association said UV filters are less prominent allergens than fragrances and preservatives, so the team deliberately de-emphasised skin reactions, and dermatologist Dr. Susanna Majasuo prompted them to research why BP-3 is already regulated and to add a comparison of alternative UV filters, which they did, and to run the consumer survey. Cosmetic manufacturer Dermosil explained that the industry has moved from single filters to multi-filter formulations (naming Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Ethylhexyl Triazone, Bis-Ethylhexyloxyphenol Methoxyphenyl Triazine and others) and that approved filters' risks are outweighed by unprotected UV exposure - useful context, though it mainly validated rather than redirected the project. Where this IHP is weaker than its documentation suggests is that the central technical claim was never demonstrated: no stakeholder input could rescue the activity assay, and the Golden Gate system the WWTP conversation motivated remains untested in the lab.","realWorld":"Implementation is specified concretely and in the plant's own terms: an enclosed bioreactor placed as a biological post-treatment step after the activated sludge process and a filtration step, with engineered E. coli immobilised on cellulose via an adhesive catecholamine moiety or on polystyrene beads to make coated filters, followed by coagulation and UV inactivation of escapees, plus a kill switch for environments outside the reactor and engineered auxotrophy as a further containment layer. The driver is regulatory and dated: the revised EU Urban Waste Water Treatment Directive entered force in 2025 and requires 80% removal of micropollutants including BP-3, with requirements generally expected to be met by 2036, and the team notes that ozonation leaves incompletely degraded residues, activated carbon only adsorbs and is expensive to replace, and reverse osmosis/nanofiltration achieved 95% BP removal in a South Korean pilot but at high capital and energy cost. SDG claims name sub-targets - 6.3, 14.1, 14.2, 14.7, 2.1, 12.4, 12.8, 11.4, 11.5, 11.6, 8.4, 8.9, 1.4, 13.3 - and are backed by cited literature on coral ecosystem services and BP concentrations (influent up to 3795 ug/L and effluent 223 ug/L in the UK; up to 241 ng/g dry weight in Hawaiian coral tissue; zooxanthellae harmed at chronic exposure as low as 60 ng/L). The outstanding feature is the Limitations and conflicts section, which is more honest than most: it states that implementation cost could not be estimated because it is highly regional and that even Finnish industry professionals could not help, that Finnish wastewater temperatures differ from the most BP-3-affected regions so strain survival and efficiency may not transfer, that high cost could worsen inequality between developed and developing countries, that the team cannot guarantee the degradation intermediates are safe to release, that the SDG 2030 horizon is unreachable for a technology needing years more development, that a plant-based solution may be less effective than one deployed at beaches, and that the project could be used for greenwashing of reef tourism - concluding that the best solution is to limit BP-3 use altogether and that Benzophe-none is explicitly the second-best option. After the Jamboree: 38 registry parts (10 characterised expression parts plus the 28-part untested Golden Gate set), a follow-up Suomen Solubiologit article, a school event already booked, and a continuing recruitment pipeline through Aboa Turku ry for the 2027 team.","partners":["Jouko Tuomi, process engineer, Turku wastewater treatment plant, with trainees Nea Lempiainen and Heli Karinkanta","Dr. Rongbin Wang, postdoctoral researcher, Biochemistry, University of Turku","Dr. Jarmo Kapyla, University Lecturer, Biochemistry, University of Turku","Dr. Tuomas Huovinen, University Lecturer, Biochemistry, University of Turku","Dr. Matilda Krakstrom, postdoctoral researcher, Turku Bioscience Centre","Professor Matej Oresic, University of Turku / Turku Bioscience Centre","Dr. Timo Vuorisalo, Docent in Ecology and Environmental Science, University of Turku","Harri Helminen, Water and Marine Management Unit, Finnish supervisory agency","Professor Tuulia Hyotylainen, Orebro University, Sweden","Professor Emma Camp, Future Reefs Team, University of Technology Sydney","Merike Laine, skin and cosmetics specialist, Helsingin Allergia- ja Astmayhdistys ry","Dr. Susanna Majasuo, dermatologist, CMO and CEO of Ihotalo, Turku","Dermosil (Finnish cosmetics company)","Dr. Sari Puustinen, senior researcher and coordinating teacher of sustainable development studies, University of Turku","Associate Professor Pauli Kallio (PI) and senior lab technician Merja Nylander, Department of Molecular Plant Biology, University of Turku","iGEM team Aalto-Helsinki","Aboa Turku ry","Suomen Solubiologit ry","Turun Sanomat (regional newspaper)"],"publicEngagement_zh":"一份 136 人的匿名問卷，調查防曬乳使用習慣，在公開活動與社群媒體上收集，既為蒐集資料也為提升意識；後來也用來形塑團隊的社群貼文。走訪中學時按年齡分成不同形式（高中階段是專案簡報加一場合成生物學基礎的 Kahoot；國中階段是動手做的滲透實驗），並獲得再訪邀請，另一場校內活動已預約在 Jamboree 之後。在 Turku Day 期間於 Turku 總圖書館為小學生舉辦紫高麗菜 pH 指示劑工作坊，並延伸連結到海洋酸化。2026 年 8 月 22 日與 Aalto-Helsinki 共同出席 Heureka Science Centre 的 Children's Medical Day，舉辦三場工作坊，團隊也在現場收集問卷回覆。在芬蘭細胞生物學會 Suomen Solubiologit ry 的刊物上發表一篇介紹專案與 iGEM 的文章，並已談定 Jamboree 之後再寫一篇後續。地方報 Turun Sanomat 的科學記者 Ritva Setala 與攝影 Marttiina Sairanen 到實驗室採訪。在 Study in Turku 博覽會與 TYY Opening Carnival 與 Aboa Turku ry 合辦招募性質的攤位，團隊並刻意化解大一學生「國際合成生物學競賽離我太遠」的心理。","ihp_zh":"ABOA 的整合式人類實踐在技術面是真正整合進去的，方法也記錄得很完整：歷屆 ABOA 團隊建議在專案構想定案之前就先接觸利害關係人，而本屆團隊訂下規則——每場會議事前都要有書面目標，事後都要做會後整理，筆記直接餵進專案決策。最有力的一條因果鏈來自 Turku 的污水處理廠。製程工程師 Jouko Tuomi 與實習生 Nea Lempiainen、Heli Karinkanta 告訴他們：純化酵素太脆弱、太貴，無法在處理廠裡運作，酵素活性會衰退，而把完整菌體固定在載體上、放進流通式生物反應器，正是活性污泥程序本來就做得好的事——團隊因此把實作從純化酵素改成完整細胞，並進一步建立 Golden Gate 系統，專門用來把途徑中所有酵素放進同一個細胞。同一場對話還帶來三項改變：他們放棄把自己的菌株直接接種進活性污泥的想法，因為處理廠警告這會讓既有的微生物平衡失衡好幾個月，而且他們的菌株終究會被競爭淘汰；他們把生物反應器移到處理流程末端、過濾之後，以既有的混凝與紫外線滅菌作為後盾；他們也採納處理廠的建議，處理濃縮後的旁流而非全量水流，因為進水中的 BP-3 太稀，處理起來不符經濟。處理廠還告訴他們，芬蘭的處理廠在地下運作，開挖新空間要花數千萬歐元，因此基本上只有法律要求時才會改動；而在技術選擇上，效率的排序高於成本——這也是團隊自訂分階段計畫（先用污水樣本測試、再設小型現地測試站、最後才整合）的原因。第二條鏈貫穿構築體設計：Dr. Rongbin Wang 說明 BioBrick 零件無法乾淨地組出讀框一致的融合蛋白，也無法更換純化標籤，這讓團隊完全放棄 BioBrick 路線，改用以標準限制酶改造、可直接表現的質體；Dr. Jarmo Kapyla 指出 His 標籤與 GST 標籤的表現都無法事先預測，於是他們決定兩者都做實驗測試，以 His 為主、GST 為備案；他也告訴他們菌落 PCR 不足以作為驗證（他們負擔不起定序引子，這點也照實寫出，並建議下一階段要做定序）；Dr. Tuomas Huovinen 提供了他們採用的具體表現參數（200 mL 培養至 OD600 0.8、0.4 mM IPTG、誘導後 26 C、16 小時）、以接合 HRP 的 anti-6xHis 抗體進行西方墨點法以看見 SDS-PAGE 看不到的蛋白，以及改用電穿孔來解決熱休克轉形效率不佳的問題。第三條鏈關於別把問題弄得更糟：Dr. Timo Vuorisalo（生態學）要他們查核途徑中的中間產物本身會不會也是內分泌干擾物質，於是他們搜尋 ECHA ED Expert Group 的評估清單，發現清單上並未列入任何一個中間產物；Professor Tuulia Hyotylainen（Orebro，暴露體研究）確認只要分解掉一個芳香環，內分泌活性極可能就會消失，這支持了只攻擊途徑前段步驟的策略，但她也警告污水環境的條件會遠不如實驗檯；Professor Emma Camp（UTS，Future Reefs）補充菌體必須在真實的污水條件下測試並加以收容，而且 BP-3 只是珊瑚礁眾多壓力源之一，並非主因。芬蘭監理機關的 Harri Helminen 確認紫外線濾劑屬於水域生態系最受關注的前五大內分泌干擾物質，並告訴他們芬蘭水體並沒有全面性的 BP-3 量測資料；他說明環境品質標準的訂定會比觀測到生物效應的最低濃度再低 100 至 1000 倍，並把 BP-3 置入修訂後的歐盟都市污水處理指令之中（2025 年生效，一般預期 2036 年前須符合要求，微污染物去除率 80%）——這正是整個專案的法規定錨點。健康面的諮詢改變的是論述重點而非工程設計：Helsinki Allergy and Asthma Association 的 Merike Laine 表示紫外線濾劑作為過敏原的重要性低於香料與防腐劑，因此團隊刻意淡化皮膚反應這條線；皮膚科醫師 Dr. Susanna Majasuo 則促使他們研究 BP-3 為何已被納管、補上替代紫外線濾劑的比較（他們確實做了），並進行消費者問卷。化妝品製造商 Dermosil 說明業界已從單一濾劑轉向多濾劑配方（並具名 Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate、Ethylhexyl Triazone、Bis-Ethylhexyloxyphenol Methoxyphenyl Triazine 等），且已核准濾劑的風險低於毫無防護的紫外線曝曬——這是有用的背景，不過它主要是驗證而非改變專案方向。這份 IHP 比它的文件看起來要弱的地方在於：核心技術主張始終沒有被證實——沒有任何利害關係人的意見能救回活性分析，而由污水廠對話所促成的 Golden Gate 系統，在實驗室裡仍未經測試。","realWorld_zh":"實作的規格具體，而且是用處理廠自己的語言寫的：一座密閉生物反應器，置於活性污泥程序與過濾步驟之後，作為生物性後處理段；工程化 E. coli 透過具黏附性的兒茶胺基團固定在纖維素上，或固定在聚苯乙烯顆粒上以製成塗層濾材；之後再以混凝與紫外線去活化逸出的菌體，另設自殺開關以應對反應器之外的環境，並以工程化的營養缺陷型作為再一層收容。驅動力來自法規，且有明確時程：修訂後的歐盟都市污水處理指令於 2025 年生效，要求包含 BP-3 在內的微污染物去除率達 80%，一般預期 2036 年前須達成；團隊並指出臭氧處理會留下未完全分解的殘留物、活性碳只是吸附且更換昂貴，而逆滲透／奈米過濾在南韓的試驗中達到 95% 的 BP 去除率，但資本與能源成本都高。SDG 主張具名到子目標——6.3、14.1、14.2、14.7、2.1、12.4、12.8、11.4、11.5、11.6、8.4、8.9、1.4、13.3——並有關於珊瑚生態系服務與 BP 濃度的文獻支持（英國的進水最高 3795 ug/L、出水 223 ug/L；夏威夷珊瑚組織中最高達 241 ng/g 乾重；蟲黃藻在低至 60 ng/L 的長期曝露下即受害）。最突出的是「限制與衝突」一節，比大多數團隊誠實得多：它寫明實作成本無法估算，因為高度因地而異，連芬蘭的業界專業人士都幫不上忙；芬蘭的污水溫度與受 BP-3 影響最嚴重的地區不同，因此菌株的存活率與效率不一定能轉移；高成本可能加深已開發與開發中國家之間的不平等；團隊無法保證降解中間產物可以安全排放；對一項還需要數年開發的技術而言，SDG 的 2030 年期程是達不到的；設在處理廠的解方可能不如部署在海灘的解方有效；而這個專案也可能被用來替珊瑚礁觀光漂綠——結論是最好的解方是全面限制 BP-3 的使用，而 Benzophe-none 明確只是次佳選項。Jamboree 之後：38 件 Registry 零件（10 件已做特性分析的表現零件，加上 28 件未經測試的 Golden Gate 組）、一篇 Suomen Solubiologit 的後續文章、一場已預約的校內活動，以及透過 Aboa Turku ry 為 2027 年團隊持續運作的招募管道。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6245/wiki/images/wwtppersonnel-edited.avif","caption":"The team with process engineer Jouko Tuomi and trainees Nea Lempiainen and Heli Karinkanta at the Turku wastewater treatment plant, the meeting that switched the implementation from purified enzymes to whole cells on fixed carriers.","credit":"Team ABOA, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"團隊與 Turku 污水處理廠的製程工程師 Jouko Tuomi 及實習生 Nea Lempiainen、Heli Karinkanta 合影；正是這場會議讓實作從純化酵素改為固定在載體上的完整細胞。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6245/wiki/images/description/figure6description.avif","caption":"Figure 4: the route from the Golden Gate construct to a fixed-carrier bioreactor at the end of a wastewater treatment plant, where immobilised E. coli degrade BP-3.","credit":"Team ABOA, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"圖 4：從 Golden Gate 構築體到污水處理廠末端固定載體生物反應器的路徑，固定化的 E. coli 在其中分解 BP-3。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6245/wiki/images/description/figure5description.avif","caption":"Golden Gate assembly with homologous enzymes: pET28g backbone with six insert positions A-F and BsaI-designed overhangs, built to express the whole pathway in one cell (designed but not experimentally tested).","credit":"Team ABOA, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"以同源酵素進行的 Golden Gate 組裝：pET28g 骨架搭配 A 至 F 六個插入位置與以 BsaI 設計的黏合末端，用來在單一細胞中表現整條途徑（已設計但未經實驗測試）。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6245/wiki/images/description/figure3description.avif","caption":"Figure 1: the proposed catabolic pathway degrading benzophenone-3 to benzoic acid and 3-oxoadipic acid in Rhodococcus oxybenzonivorans, adapted from Baek et al.","credit":"Team ABOA, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"圖 1：Rhodococcus oxybenzonivorans 中將二苯甲酮-3 分解為苯甲酸與 3-氧己二酸的所提分解代謝途徑，改編自 Baek 等人。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Take ABOA's two transferable habits: write the objective of every stakeholder meeting before it happens and debrief it into notes immediately afterwards so the decision trail survives, and write an explicit Limitations and conflicts section that names the SDG trade-offs your own project creates - cost-driven inequity, unknown intermediate toxicity, and the risk of being used for greenwashing - rather than only the goals it serves.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/sustainability","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/public-engagement","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/design","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/safety-and-security","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/team"],"projectTitle_zh":"Benzophe-none","tagline_zh":"在二苯甲酮-3 進入水體之前先把它分解掉","summary_zh":"ABOA（University of Turku）著手在 E. coli 中表現 Rhodococcus oxybenzonivorans 的二苯甲酮-3（BP-3，氧苯酮）分解代謝途徑，目的是讓這種防曬紫外線濾劑在污水處理廠內就被分解，而不是排入波羅的海與大洋。團隊建立了一套模組化、以限制酶為基礎的質體系統（10 個質體、10 個基因，涵蓋途徑中的四個步驟，已做密碼子最佳化並相容於 RFC10/RFC1000），只用 NcoI、NdeI 與 XhoI 就能把同源的黃素還原酶與黃素依賴型氧化還原酶共表現、分離、互換，並在 6xHis 與 GST 兩種標籤之間更換。酵素表現與可溶性有不同程度的成果，但活性問題並未解決：BP-3 與 BP-1 的吸收與 NADH 重疊，使分光光度法分析無法定論；三重四極桿 LC-MS 的分析則因缺少對照組與樣品瓶不相容而失敗。團隊把這點直說出來，並把成果定位為第一步，外加一套已設計但未測試的 28 件式 Golden Gate 系統（合計 38 件零件）交給社群。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"ABOA 有兩個值得學走的習慣：每場利害關係人會議前先寫下目標，結束後立刻做會後整理成筆記，讓決策軌跡留得下來；以及寫一節明確的「限制與衝突」，具名列出自己的專案所造成的 SDG 取捨——成本導致的不公平、中間產物毒性未知、以及被用來漂綠的風險——而不是只列它所服務的目標。","awards_zh":["最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"rank":7},"6249":{"team":"Heidelberg","id":"6249","section":"Undergrad","country":"Germany","village":"Foundational Advance","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/heidelberg/","projectTitle":"VOYAGE","projectTitle_zh":"VOYAGE","tagline":"An acoustic platform for observation and organization of living systems: gas vesicles engineered into a programmable interface between ultrasound and biology.","tagline_zh":"一個用於觀察與組織活體系統的聲學平台：把氣體囊泡改造成超音波與生物學之間可程式化的介面。","summary":"Fluorescence microscopy sees molecular detail but light scattering stops it at tissue depth; X-ray reaches deep but uses ionising radiation; ultrasound penetrates deep without radiation and can even push cells around, but has no molecular specificity. VOYAGE closes that gap with gas vesicles — gas-filled protein nanostructures from aquatic microorganisms, built from GvpA with GvpC reinforcing the outer shell — which scatter ultrasound as genetically encodable contrast agents and buckle at a collapse pressure that can be tuned by engineering GvpC. From that one part the team built four capabilities: GvpC variants with distinct pressure responses as a basis for multiplexed acoustic imaging, a kinase-responsive GvpC that turns phosphorylation into an acoustic signal, latch-based biosensors that report soluble targets, and DARPin- or SpyCatcher-directed vesicles that act as acoustic handles, enriching labelled HEK293T cells roughly tenfold at the side outlet of an acoustophoretic chip and lining them up at pressure antinodes while unlabelled cells sit at the nodes. It won Best Wiki and Best Part Collection because the delivery matched the science: a modular part collection with expression systems for Dolichospermum flos-aquae gas vesicles in mammalian cells and Serratia gas vesicles in E. coli, an accessibility guide for working with gas vesicles on a budget, and ATLAS — a full computational companion spanning all-atom molecular dynamics, three protein design pipelines, a fine-tuned segmentation model and an ultrasound signal model.","summary_zh":"螢光顯微術看得到分子層級的細節，但光散射讓它進不到組織深處；X 光可以深入，卻使用游離輻射；超音波既能深入又不需輻射，甚至能推動細胞，但沒有分子專一性。VOYAGE 以氣體囊泡填補這個落差，這種來自水生微生物、充滿氣體的蛋白質奈米結構由 GvpA 構成，外殼再由 GvpC 強化，它們能散射超音波而成為可由基因編碼的顯影劑，並在某個崩潰壓力下發生挫曲，而該壓力可透過改造 GvpC 來調整。團隊從這一個零件發展出四種能力：具不同壓力響應的 GvpC 變體，作為多工聲學成像的基礎；一個可響應激酶的 GvpC，把磷酸化轉換成聲學訊號；基於鎖扣（latch）的生物感測器，用以回報可溶性標的；以及由 DARPin 或 SpyCatcher 導向的囊泡，充當聲學把手，在聲泳晶片的側出口把標記過的 HEK293T 細胞富集約十倍，並把它們排列在壓力波腹上，而未標記的細胞則停在波節。本案拿下 Best Wiki 與 Best Part Collection，因為交付的成果與科學內容相稱：一組模組化零件集，含在哺乳類細胞中表現 Dolichospermum flos-aquae 氣體囊泡以及在 E. coli 中表現 Serratia 氣體囊泡的表現系統、一份在有限預算下操作氣體囊泡的可及性指南，以及 ATLAS，一套完整的運算伴隨工具，涵蓋全原子分子動力學模擬、三條蛋白質設計流程、一個微調過的分割模型與一個超音波訊號模型。","awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Part Collection — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Foundational Advance Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"ATLAS is the most physics-heavy dry lab of the five, in four parts. (1) All-atom molecular dynamics: two neighbouring ribs of 20-25 GvpA from PDB 8GBS in a periodic box, TIP3P water with 150 mM NaCl, CHARMM36 force field, GvpC 33-residue repeats docked on the outer face with full-length termini predicted by AlphaFold2, energy minimisation then restrained equilibration then 6-10 ns production at 310 K in GROMACS 2024, at least three independent runs per variant. Bending stiffness EI is extracted by decomposing each rib's height profile into waves and fitting the equipartition relation where mean squared amplitude falls as the fourth power of wave number, analysed in equal 1.5-2 ns blocks with Welch's t-test across runs, then converted to a critical buckling pressure by classical Timoshenko shell theory at R = 42.5 nm and rib spacing s = 4.9 nm. GvpC binding free energy comes from steered MD (1 nm/ns, force constant 1000 kJ/nm^2) seeding 25 umbrella sampling windows along the centre-of-mass reaction coordinate, recombined by WHAM into a potential of mean force. Wettability was tested by measuring water contact angle on the gas-facing wall face. (2) An in silico evolution pipeline for GvpC: AlphaFold2 predictions of a Serratia GvpA tetramer and a GvpC repeat aligned onto the experimental Dolichospermum GvpA-GvpC complex and repacked, then LigandMPNN redesigning interface residues across four tiers from fully native to all ten positions, with candidates screened by Boltz-2 co-folding, AlphaFold2 in initial-guess mode and PyRosetta relaxation. (3) A de novo binder pipeline: RFdiffusion3 generating backbones against four adjacent GvpA chains, ProteinMPNN designing eight sequences per backbone, AlphaFold2 re-prediction, then filtering on interface PAE, binder pLDDT and RMSD. (4) A biosensor pipeline where RFdiffusion3 designs a blocking latch fused to the binder at freely chosen hotspots, ProteinMPNN redesigns it, and AlphaFold2 scores three states — construct plus GvpA alone (should not bind), construct plus target alone (latch should displace by more than 3.0 A RMSD), and construct plus both (both bound, latch fully dissociated) — with PyRosetta interface delta-G estimates on each bound state.","frameworks_zh":"ATLAS 是五者之中物理含量最高的乾實驗，共分四部分。(1) 全原子分子動力學模擬：取自 PDB 8GBS 的兩條相鄰肋，各由 20 至 25 個 GvpA 組成，置於週期性邊界盒中，使用含 150 mM NaCl 的 TIP3P 水與 CHARMM36 力場，GvpC 的 33 個殘基重複單元對接在外側面上，全長末端則由 AlphaFold2 預測；流程為能量最小化、受限平衡，再於 GROMACS 2024 中於 310 K 進行 6 至 10 ns 的生產階段模擬，每個變體至少三次獨立執行。彎曲剛度 EI 的萃取方式是把每條肋的高度輪廓分解成波，再擬合均方振幅隨波數四次方遞減的均分定理關係，分析時切成等長的 1.5 至 2 ns 區塊並以 Welch t 檢定跨執行比較，最後依古典 Timoshenko 殼理論在 R = 42.5 nm、肋間距 s = 4.9 nm 的條件下換算成臨界挫曲壓力。GvpC 的結合自由能來自導引式分子動力學（1 nm/ns，力常數 1000 kJ/nm^2），沿質心反應座標播下 25 個傘形取樣視窗，再以 WHAM 重組成平均力位能。潤濕性則以量測朝氣側壁面的水接觸角來檢驗。(2) 一條 GvpC 的電腦內演化流程：把 AlphaFold2 預測的 Serratia GvpA 四聚體與一個 GvpC 重複單元疊合到實驗解出的 Dolichospermum GvpA-GvpC 複合體上並重新打包，再以 LigandMPNN 對介面殘基進行重新設計，分成由完全保留原生序列到十個位置全部開放的四個層級，候選者則以 Boltz-2 共折疊、AlphaFold2 的 initial-guess 模式與 PyRosetta 鬆弛來篩選。(3) 一條 de novo 結合蛋白流程：以 RFdiffusion3 針對四條相鄰的 GvpA 鏈生成主鏈骨架，以 ProteinMPNN 為每個骨架設計八條序列，再以 AlphaFold2 重新預測，最後依介面 PAE、結合蛋白 pLDDT 與 RMSD 篩選。(4) 一條生物感測器流程：由 RFdiffusion3 設計一個阻擋型鎖扣，在可自由選定的熱點上與結合蛋白融合，再由 ProteinMPNN 重新設計，並由 AlphaFold2 對三種狀態評分，即構築體加 GvpA（應該不結合）、構築體加標的（鎖扣應位移超過 3.0 A RMSD）、以及構築體同時加兩者（兩者皆結合、鎖扣完全脫離），並對每一種結合狀態以 PyRosetta 估算介面 delta-G。","dataviz":"This is the Best Wiki winner and the visualisation is doing real work rather than decoration. Every technical term carries an inline definition on hover (acoustic contrast, acoustic pressure, xAM, acoustophoresis, DARPin, pLDDT, i_pAE), and every computational tool gets an 'Explore this software' panel explaining what it is, how it works and what its published benchmarks are — so a reader can follow the pipeline without already knowing LigandMPNN or CellSAM. Structures are interactive: a 'View in 3D' control turns the progression from one GvpA, to a rib inside its cryo-EM density (EMD-14238), to the 13,450-copy vesicle, to the GvpC cage; MD trajectories play as interactive animations of the wall rippling; and biosensor constructs can be rotated with and without bound GFP. The GVSAM results are presented as a ten-image gallery where the reader switches each test image between raw, ground truth, GVSAM prediction with true positives, false positives and false negatives marked, and the base CellSAM prediction — which lets a sceptic check the model rather than take the F1 score on trust. Design pipelines appear as schematic flow diagrams, and the binder filtering is shown as KDE plots overlaying all 1,429 designs against the 13 accepted ones on each metric, making visible that many designs pass individual gates while almost none pass all three.","dataviz_zh":"這是 Best Wiki 的得主，而視覺化在這裡真的在做事，不是裝飾。每個技術名詞都附有滑過即顯示的行內定義（acoustic contrast、acoustic pressure、xAM、acoustophoresis、DARPin、pLDDT、i_pAE），每一個運算工具都配有一個「Explore this software」面板，說明它是什麼、怎麼運作、已發表的基準表現如何，因此讀者即使原本不懂 LigandMPNN 或 CellSAM 也能跟上整條流程。結構是互動式的：一個「View in 3D」控制項帶著讀者從單一 GvpA，到置於其冷凍電顯密度（EMD-14238）中的一條肋，到由 13,450 個複本組成的完整囊泡，再到 GvpC 外籠；分子動力學軌跡以互動動畫播放囊泡壁的波動；生物感測器構築體也可在結合與未結合 GFP 的狀態下旋轉檢視。GVSAM 的結果以十張影像的圖庫呈現，讀者可針對每張測試影像切換原始影像、真實標註、標出真陽性/假陽性/假陰性的 GVSAM 預測，以及未微調的 CellSAM 預測，讓抱持懷疑的人能自己查核模型，而不是只能相信那個 F1 分數。設計流程以示意流程圖呈現，結合蛋白的篩選則以 KDE 圖呈現，把全部 1,429 個設計疊在 13 個入選者之上逐一指標比較，使「許多設計能通過單一關卡、卻幾乎沒有設計能同時通過三關」這件事變得看得見。","datascience":"The honesty is the distinguishing feature. The MD model predicts a 1.63-fold stiffness increase from truncated GvpC against 1.48-fold measured experimentally — close — but its absolute collapse pressure estimate of 124-137 kPa without GvpC sits well below the experimental 195 kPa, and the team states plainly that ATLAS is therefore suited to ranking variants rather than predicting absolute pressures, because a whole vesicle is not an idealised wall patch. The umbrella sampling gives 43.5 kJ/mol to remove one GvpC repeat (about 17 k_B T at 310 K) and notes that the free energy plateaus once the repeat has moved 0.55 nm, when only 24% of original atom contacts remain, so most of the cost is paid before the last contacts break. The wetting hypothesis was tested and rejected on its merits: 122.8 degrees without GvpC against 122.2 with, a 0.6-degree difference against the roughly 6 degrees a condensation mechanism would require. Screening thresholds were calibrated against controls rather than chosen by feel — the redesigned sequences were run alongside native Serratia GvpC repeat 3 and nine negative controls, and of all metrics tested only AlphaFold2 interface PAE separated them cleanly (135 of 200 designs passed the 12.0 gate, all nine negative controls failed, the native repeat passed at 11.42), with the team stating explicitly that only that one threshold is calibrated and the other three are a priori safeguards whose predictive value is unproven. PyRosetta interface energies are reported but excluded from selection because they did not discriminate the controls. GVSAM's evaluation was adapted to the problem: intersection over union is unsuitable for objects this small because a one-pixel shift wrecks it, so a hit requires the annotated box centre to lie inside the prediction within 2 px and the areas to differ by at most fourfold, each annotation matchable once, highest-scoring first — with recall, precision and F1 pooled across images and 95% confidence intervals bootstrapped over images. They report F1 rising from 0.2% (base CellSAM) to 42% (GVSAM) with false positives down 97%, and openly diagnose overfitting: validation loss bottomed at epoch 6 while training loss kept falling, so that checkpoint was taken. Two team members annotated independently to reduce single-annotator bias, images of deliberately varying quality and images with no vesicles at all were kept for robustness, and the 108 annotated images were split 70/20/10 at image level with vesicle and non-vesicle images split separately. Ultrasound analysis in GAS uses median intensity and median absolute deviation rather than mean and standard deviation because ultrasound speckle makes single-pixel brightness fluctuate with intensity, with background subtracted as the median recorded after all vesicles were destroyed, and collapse pressure taken as P50 from a four-parameter regression fit (R-squared above 0.99 on all curves).","datascience_zh":"誠實是這一節最顯著的特徵。分子動力學模型預測截短的 GvpC 會帶來 1.63 倍的剛度提升，實驗量到的是 1.48 倍，相當接近；但它對未加 GvpC 時崩潰壓力的絕對估計為 124 至 137 kPa，遠低於實驗值 195 kPa，而團隊明白表示，因此 ATLAS 適合用來為變體排序，而不是預測絕對壓力，原因是一個完整囊泡並不等於一塊理想化的壁面片段。傘形取樣得到移除一個 GvpC 重複單元需 43.5 kJ/mol（在 310 K 約為 17 k_B T），並指出自由能在該重複單元移動 0.55 nm 後即趨於平台，此時僅剩 24% 的原始原子接觸，也就是大部分代價在最後幾個接觸斷開之前就已付清。潤濕假說經過檢驗並依證據被否定：未加 GvpC 為 122.8 度，加了之後為 122.2 度，差距 0.6 度，而凝結機制所需的差距約為 6 度。篩選閾值是對照校正出來的，不是憑感覺定的：重新設計的序列與原生的 Serratia GvpC 第 3 重複單元以及九個陰性對照一起執行，所有測試過的指標中只有 AlphaFold2 的介面 PAE 能乾淨地把它們分開（200 個設計中有 135 個通過 12.0 的門檻、九個陰性對照全部未過、原生重複單元以 11.42 通過），而團隊明確指出只有這一個閾值經過校正，另外三個屬於先驗性的防護措施，其預測價值尚未得到證實。PyRosetta 的介面能量雖有報告，但因為無法區分對照而被排除於選擇之外。GVSAM 的評估方式則依問題本身調整：交集比聯集（IoU）對這麼小的物件不適用，因為位移一個像素就會毀掉它，因此判定為命中的條件是標註框中心必須落在預測框內且相差 2 px 以內、面積差距最多四倍，每個標註只能被配對一次，並由分數最高者優先；召回率、精確率與 F1 跨影像彙總，95% 信賴區間則以影像層級的 bootstrap 估計。他們報告 F1 由 0.2%（未微調的 CellSAM）提升到 42%（GVSAM），假陽性減少 97%，並公開診斷出過度配適：驗證損失在第 6 個 epoch 觸底，而訓練損失仍持續下降，因此取用了那個檢查點。兩位團員各自獨立標註以降低單一標註者偏誤，刻意保留了品質參差的影像以及完全沒有囊泡的影像以檢驗穩健性，而那 108 張標註影像在影像層級上以 70/20/10 切分，有囊泡與無囊泡的影像分別切分。GAS 中的超音波分析採用中位數強度與中位數絕對偏差，而不是平均值與標準差，因為超音波的斑點雜訊會讓單一像素的亮度隨強度波動；背景以所有囊泡被摧毀後記錄到的中位數相減，崩潰壓力則取自四參數迴歸擬合得到的 P50（所有曲線的 R 平方均高於 0.99）。","software":"ATLAS ships as a documented end-to-end pipeline with its own comprehensive user guide, covering the MD characterisation route, the GvpC in silico evolution pipeline and the de novo binder and biosensor design pipelines. GVSAM is a fine-tuned derivative of CellSAM (itself built on Meta's Segment Anything Model with an Anchor DETR based CellFinder detector and a ViT-B encoder) retrained to detect gas vesicle clusters rather than whole cells, trained with Dice plus binary cross-entropy with logits, batch size 3, learning rate 1e-4 (backbone 1e-5), weight decay 1e-4, annotated in napari and converted to bounding boxes by a Python script, with 90 and 270 degree rotation augmentation to cope with only 108 images. GAS is the physics-informed fitting model that converts raw cross-amplitude-modulation ultrasound data into pressure-dependent signal curves. On the wet side the team released the VOYAGE part collection (expression systems for D. flos-aquae gas vesicles in mammalian cells and Serratia gas vesicles in E. coli, plus characterisation and purification parts), an extensive collection of optimised gas vesicle protocols including AFM and darkfield imaging, and an accessibility guide for working with gas vesicles on a budget — which includes using the open-source 3D-printed OpenFlexure microscope for darkfield imaging of purified vesicles and live-cell imaging of producers, explicitly so that teams with limited resources can replicate the work. The Fail Forward Guide is the fourth released artefact.","software_zh":"ATLAS 以一條有完整文件的端到端流程釋出，並附有自己的詳盡使用指南，涵蓋分子動力學表徵路線、GvpC 的電腦內演化流程，以及 de novo 結合蛋白與生物感測器的設計流程。GVSAM 是 CellSAM 的微調衍生版（CellSAM 本身建立在 Meta 的 Segment Anything Model 之上，搭配基於 Anchor DETR 的 CellFinder 偵測器與 ViT-B 編碼器），重新訓練成偵測氣體囊泡叢集而非完整細胞，訓練使用 Dice 加上帶 logits 的二元交叉熵，批次大小 3、學習率 1e-4（骨幹網路 1e-5）、權重衰減 1e-4，標註在 napari 中完成並以一支 Python 程式轉成邊界框，另以 90 度與 270 度旋轉做資料擴增，以因應只有 108 張影像的限制。GAS 則是那個融入物理的擬合模型，把原始的交叉振幅調變超音波資料轉換成隨壓力變化的訊號曲線。濕實驗一側，團隊釋出了 VOYAGE 零件集（在哺乳類細胞中表現 D. flos-aquae 氣體囊泡、在 E. coli 中表現 Serratia 氣體囊泡的表現系統，加上表徵與純化相關零件）、一套內容豐富的氣體囊泡最佳化實驗流程（含 AFM 與暗場成像），以及一份在有限預算下操作氣體囊泡的可及性指南，其中包括使用開源 3D 列印的 OpenFlexure 顯微鏡，對純化後的囊泡做暗場成像並對產生菌做活細胞成像，明確就是為了讓資源有限的團隊也能重現這項工作。Fail Forward 指南是第四項釋出的產出。","stack":["GROMACS 2024 with CHARMM36 and TIP3P","Umbrella sampling with WHAM","Steered molecular dynamics","Martini coarse-grained MD (tested and rejected)","AlphaFold2 (including initial-guess mode)","Boltz-2","LigandMPNN","ProteinMPNN","RFdiffusion3 (Rosetta Commons Foundry)","BindCraft (hallucination, with custom loss penalty)","PyRosetta","CellSAM / Segment Anything Model (fine-tuned as GVSAM)","napari","k-Wave acoustic wave simulation","Verasonics Vantage NXT (v2.3.3), 5.2 MHz linear probe, xAM sequence","OpenFlexure open-source 3D-printed microscope","Atomic force microscopy"],"techniques":["Thermal-fluctuation spectrum analysis to extract bending stiffness","Timoshenko shell theory conversion of stiffness to buckling pressure","Potential of mean force / binding free energy calculation","Contact-angle measurement to test a wetting collapse mechanism","Cross-species structural templating justified by sequence identity and repeat periodicity","Tiered interface redesign (native through full redesign)","Negative-control-calibrated metric gating","Multi-state conditional scoring of a conformational switch","Transfer learning / fine-tuning a segmentation foundation model on 108 images","Position-and-size matching criterion in place of IoU for small objects","Bootstrapped confidence intervals over images","Robust statistics (median, MAD) against ultrasound speckle","Cross-amplitude modulation nonlinear ultrasound imaging with hydrophone calibration","Four-parameter regression for P50 collapse pressure","Acoustophoretic cell sorting and standing-wave spatial patterning"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Heidelberg's education programme, Fail Forward, takes error culture in science as its subject rather than synthetic biology content, which makes it unusually distinctive. The centrepiece is the Error Bar, billed as 'a night of scientific f*ck ups': around 80 students and researchers in the university's student bar in July, with successful professionals telling their own stories of things going wrong and what they learned. It was deliberately not a lecture — a short presentation introduced structural problems including publication bias against negative results and mental health stressors in academia, then interactive activities invited participants to share their own experiences, and recreation therapist Brady Hughes ran a workshop on distinguishing a fiasco from a crisis, reappraising situations and using grounding exercises, ending with the group shredding their recent failures together. A panel discussion with around 120 participants extended the theme from personal to institutional failure in the healthcare system, bringing researchers, healthcare professionals, patient advocates and the public into one room, with one panellist making the publication-bias argument in concrete terms: unpublished negative studies mean the same approach gets tried repeatedly, wasting resources and re-exposing participants to risk. All of it was distilled into the Fail Forward Guide, which includes background on failure in academia, expert interviews, and a tutorial for hosting your own Error Bar anywhere in the world — and the team has already committed to making the Error Bar recurring, with an open-mic session planned and PIs who missed it asking to join the next one. Alongside this they ran a Science Cinema with the local student cinema Unikino Heidelberg (over 70 participants for GATTACA, followed by a presentation and open discussion on how realistic the scenario is and which elements of that society we can already find in our own), a documentary screening with gynaecologist Dr Kathrin Haßdenteufel providing medical context and a Q&A (40 participants, every seat taken), a Science Pub Quiz, a Science Slam, school workshops, a laboratory summer school, a lecture series, and a full-day alumni event at the Marsilius-Kolleg bringing around 45 current and former iGEM Heidelberg members from every year the university has competed.","publicEngagement_zh":"Heidelberg 的教育方案 Fail Forward 以科學中的錯誤文化為題，而不是以合成生物學的內容為題，這使它格外獨特。核心活動是 Error Bar，號稱「一場科學搞砸之夜」：七月間約 80 位學生與研究人員聚在校內學生酒吧，由已有成就的專業人士講述自己出錯的經歷以及從中學到什麼。它刻意不是一場講座：先以簡短報告引介結構性問題，包括對負面結果的發表偏差與學術界的心理健康壓力源，接著以互動活動邀請參與者分享自身經驗，而休閒治療師 Brady Hughes 則帶了一場工作坊，講如何區分「慘敗」與「危機」、如何重新評估處境以及如何運用接地練習，最後全場一起把自己近期的失敗碎掉。一場約 120 人參與的座談會把主題由個人失敗延伸到醫療體系的制度性失敗，把研究人員、醫療專業人員、病友代表與一般公眾聚在同一個場域，其中一位與談者把發表偏差的論點講得非常具體：未發表的負面研究意味著同一套做法會被反覆嘗試，既浪費資源，也讓受試者再次承擔風險。所有這些都被整理進 Fail Forward 指南，內容包含學術界失敗現象的背景、專家訪談，以及一份在世界任何地方自行舉辦 Error Bar 的操作教學；團隊也已承諾讓 Error Bar 固定舉辦，並規劃了開放麥克風場次，而錯過這場活動的 PI 們也主動要求參加下一場。除此之外，他們與當地學生電影院 Unikino Heidelberg 合辦了 Science Cinema（《GATTACA》場次超過 70 人參與，之後有一場簡報與公開討論，談這個情節有多寫實，以及那個社會的哪些元素在我們自己的社會中已經看得到）、一場由婦產科醫師 Dr Kathrin Haßdenteufel 提供醫學背景並進行問答的紀錄片放映（40 人參與，座位全滿）、一場 Science Pub Quiz、一場 Science Slam、校園工作坊、一所實驗室暑期學校、一系列講座，以及在 Marsilius-Kolleg 舉辦的全日校友活動，聚集了約 45 位涵蓋該校參賽以來各屆的現任與前任 iGEM Heidelberg 成員。","ihp":"The clearest example of stakeholder input changing method rather than framing came from Prof Dr Frauke Gräter, interviewed on modelling strategy. The team first built exactly what she proposed — two Martini coarse-grained sheets with gas between them, tested at different pressures — and it taught them something by failing: the flat patch collapsed even without any applied pressure, because it lacks the closed curved geometry that holds a real vesicle open. That killed the approach and, building on her point that relative differences are what matter for ranking and that a small wall section is representative, they switched to measuring bending stiffness on an all-atom repeating patch and converting it through shell theory. Her warning about sampling is why they chose bending rather than stretching as the primary measurement, ran every simulation at least three times and compared several GvpC variants rather than only wild type; her advice on pulling speed went into the steered MD, where they pulled at several speeds and used only runs in which GvpC genuinely came off. They also tried her suggested coarse-grained model as a fast pre-screen, found it could not distinguish the variants, and state that every reported result therefore comes from all-atom simulation. Elsewhere: Prof Pfeifer warned that GvpA is highly conserved and vulnerable to mutation, redirecting the whole engineering effort onto GvpC as the modular target, and explained which accessory genes the expression constructs needed. Dr Huber's feedback on how long even one sub-idea takes changed how many aspects they attempted and forced explicit prioritisation. A stakeholder conversation led them to replace the D. flos-aquae / P. megaterium expression mix with a Serratia-based cassette in E. coli, which is what finally gave them expression and purification and set the host for everything downstream. Protein design expert Paul Kittner diagnosed a real failure mode: hallucination tools like BindCraft are biased toward hydrophobic interfaces because their structure predictors are trained on natural ones, and GvpA's outward-facing surface is hydrophilic — he advised adding a custom penalty term to the generation loss, which worked and let them target the hydrophilic face, and also pointed them to diffusion models as less biased, which is why RFdiffusion3 became the backbone generator. Dr Michael Jendrusch told them bluntly that no existing pipeline suited their biosensing goal and sketched the binder-plus-latch architecture they built, including the multi-state scoring step and the advice to screen with pooled assays and Twist Oligo Pools rather than testing candidates individually. Prof Dr Karl Rohr's advice is why GVSAM fine-tunes CellSAM rather than training from scratch. Mentor Molina Ramirez moved from interview subject to collaborator, supervising imaging, adapting the xAM script to their specific transducer, and advising them to use beamformed rather than pixel data and median rather than mean normalisation to suppress outliers. Prof Dr Georg Schmitz gave them a falsifiable clinical test — look first with the transducer you already have at frequencies close to clinical scanners, and only go higher if nothing appears — which they followed and passed at 5-7 MHz. Dr Lakshmanan's practical warnings (closing a low-quality tube cap can generate enough pressure to collapse vesicles) shaped handling, and her advice to modify GvpC termini shaped the latch design.","ihp_zh":"利害關係人意見改變了方法而不只是改變說法，最清楚的例子來自 Prof Dr Frauke Gräter，團隊就建模策略訪問了她。他們一開始完全照她的提議做：兩片 Martini 粗粒化的片層、中間夾氣，在不同壓力下測試；而這個做法因為失敗而教了他們一件事：那片平面片段即使完全不施加壓力也會塌掉，因為它缺少真實囊泡賴以撐開的封閉曲面幾何。這否決了原本的路線，而他們順著她的另一個論點（排序時真正要緊的是相對差異，而一小塊壁面具有代表性），改為在全原子的重複片段上量測彎曲剛度，再透過殼理論換算。她對取樣的提醒，正是他們選擇以彎曲而非拉伸作為主要量測、每個模擬至少跑三次、並比較多個 GvpC 變體而不只是野生型的原因；她關於拉伸速度的建議則進入了導引式分子動力學，他們以數種速度拉伸，並只採用 GvpC 真的脫落的那些執行結果。他們也試過她建議的粗粒化模型作為快速預先篩選，發現它無法區分這些變體，因此明白說明所有回報的結果都來自全原子模擬。其他部分：Prof Pfeifer 提醒 GvpA 高度保守且經不起突變，把整個工程改造的重心導向以 GvpC 為模組化標的，並說明表現構築體需要哪些輔助基因。Dr Huber 關於「即使只做一個子想法也要耗多久」的回饋，改變了他們嘗試的面向數量，並迫使他們明確排序優先。一場利害關係人對話讓他們把 D. flos-aquae / P. megaterium 的表現組合換成在 E. coli 中以 Serratia 為基礎的表現匣，而這才終於讓他們做出表現與純化，也定下了後續一切的宿主。蛋白質設計專家 Paul Kittner 診斷出一個真實的失效模式：像 BindCraft 這類幻覺式工具偏向疏水性介面，因為其結構預測器是在天然介面上訓練的，而 GvpA 朝外的表面是親水的；他建議在生成損失中加入自訂的懲罰項，這個做法有效，讓他們得以瞄準親水面，他也指出擴散模型的偏差較小，這正是 RFdiffusion3 成為主鏈生成器的原因。Dr Michael Jendrusch 直言現有流程沒有一條適合他們的生物感測目標，並勾勒出他們後來實作的「結合蛋白加鎖扣」架構，包括多狀態評分步驟，以及建議以混合池檢測與 Twist Oligo Pools 篩選，而不是逐一測試候選者。Prof Dr Karl Rohr 的建議，是 GVSAM 選擇微調 CellSAM 而非從頭訓練的原因。業師 Molina Ramirez 由受訪者轉為合作者，指導影像拍攝、把 xAM 腳本改寫成適合他們特定探頭的版本，並建議改用經波束成形的資料而非像素資料，以及以中位數而非平均數做歸一化以壓制離群值。Prof Dr Georg Schmitz 給了他們一個可否證的臨床檢驗，也就是先用手上現有的探頭、在接近臨床掃描儀的頻率下觀察，只有在什麼都看不到時才往更高頻率走；他們照做了，並在 5 至 7 MHz 通過。Dr Lakshmanan 的實務提醒（蓋上一個品質不佳的試管蓋，產生的壓力就足以讓囊泡崩潰）形塑了操作方式，而她建議修改 GvpC 末端的意見則形塑了鎖扣的設計。","realWorld":"The target application is monitoring engineered cell therapies, chosen because the alternatives are genuinely inadequate: PET tracking needs suitable radioactive tracers and costly specialised equipment, with each scan requiring tracer administration so measurements are days apart rather than continuous; bioluminescence imaging needs no such infrastructure but cannot penetrate patient tissue; and biopsy is invasive, reports only the sampled site, and cannot show how therapeutic cells redistribute. Ultrasound is comparatively inexpensive, widely available and needs no ionising radiation or tracer, which is the whole argument for a genetically encoded acoustic reporter. Crucially they tested the frequency question rather than assuming it: all measurements were made at 5-7 MHz, a range clinical scanners use, so purified vesicles, GV-expressing bacteria and mammalian cells were all detected as clear scattering signals against a degassed negative control without resorting to high frequencies that would limit penetration depth — while stating openly that whether a therapeutic cell can accumulate enough vesicles for a detectable in vivo signal remains to be established. The team has patent work on a modular, reversible acoustic label: because interchangeable binding proteins attach vesicles to a chosen target, the target's acoustic properties change without genetically modifying it, which matters for cell-therapy manufacturing where the product must not be altered. Named next steps are specific — test one ATLAS binder against a marker with existing clinical use such as HER2 or PD-L1, and test two gas vesicle variants with distinct collapse pressures in a tissue-mimicking phantom to establish whether both signals can be read in one measurement, with a published liver phantom protocol cited as a starting point — plus quantifying sorting efficiency and validating cell viability after label removal. A collaboration with PHOENICS is sketched on shared mechanism: the PHOENICS cell computes through phosphorylation and the GvpC sensor turns phosphorylation into ultrasound, so together they would make an engineered cell's internal decision readable from outside the body.","realWorld_zh":"目標應用是監測經工程改造的細胞治療，選擇理由是現有替代方案確實不足：PET 追蹤需要合適的放射性示蹤劑與昂貴的專用設備，而且每次掃描都得施予示蹤劑，所以量測之間相隔數天而非連續；生物發光成像不需要這類基礎設施，卻無法穿透病患的組織；活體組織檢查則具侵入性，只能反映取樣的那一處，也無法顯示治療用細胞如何重新分布。相較之下超音波便宜、普及，且不需要游離輻射或示蹤劑，而這正是做一個基因編碼聲學報導子的全部理由。關鍵是他們實際檢驗了頻率這個問題，而不是先假設答案：所有量測都在臨床掃描儀使用的 5 至 7 MHz 範圍內進行，因此純化後的囊泡、表現 GV 的細菌與哺乳類細胞，都在對照除氣的陰性樣本下被偵測為清楚的散射訊號，而不必動用會限制穿透深度的高頻；同時他們也公開表示，治療用細胞能否累積足夠的囊泡以產生可偵測的活體內訊號，仍待確立。團隊在一個模組化、可逆的聲學標籤上有專利工作：由於可互換的結合蛋白會把囊泡掛到選定的標的上，標的本身的聲學性質因而改變，卻不需要對它做基因改造，而這對產品不得被改變的細胞治療製造而言相當重要。所列的下一步很具體，包括把一個 ATLAS 結合蛋白拿去對付一個已有臨床用途的標記（例如 HER2 或 PD-L1），以及在模擬組織的假體（phantom）中測試兩個崩潰壓力不同的氣體囊泡變體，以確認兩個訊號能否在同一次量測中被讀出來，並引用一份已發表的肝臟假體流程作為起點；此外還要量化分選效率，並驗證移除標籤後的細胞存活率。他們也勾勒了與 PHOENICS 的合作，立基於共通的機制：PHOENICS 的細胞以磷酸化進行運算，而 GvpC 感測器把磷酸化轉換成超音波，兩者合起來就能讓一個工程細胞的內部決策從體外被讀出來。","partners":["Prof Dr Frauke Gräter (molecular dynamics and modelling strategy)","Prof Felicitas Pfeifer (gas vesicle biology)","Dr Huber (gas vesicle structure)","Dr Anupama Lakshmanan (gas vesicle engineering)","Paul Kittner (protein design, hallucination bias)","Dr Michael Jendrusch (protein design pipelines)","Prof Dr Karl Rohr (biomedical image analysis)","Prof Dr Georg Schmitz, Chair of Medical Engineering, Ruhr University Bochum","Molina Ramirez (ultrasound imaging mentor and collaborator)","Brady Hughes, recreation therapist (Error Bar workshop)","Dr med Kathrin Haßdenteufel (documentary screening)","iGEM PHOENICS (proposed integration)","Unikino Heidelberg and ZEP Heidelberg","iGEM Heidelberg alumni network (2008-2026)","The OpenFlexure Project (open-source microscopy)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6249/wiki/img/model/gvpc-evolution-pipeline.svg","caption":"The complete in silico GvpC redesign pipeline: the template is split into interface and structural residues, interface redesign is deep-learning-guided with LigandMPNN while structural residues are chosen rationally, candidates are predicted and filtered by structure predictors and physical constraints, and validated variants feed back to retune the gating strategy.","caption_zh":"完整的 GvpC 電腦內重新設計流程：模板先拆成介面殘基與結構殘基，介面的重新設計由 LigandMPNN 以深度學習導引，結構殘基則依理性判斷選定；候選者經結構預測器與物理約束預測並篩選，而通過驗證的變體再回饋回來重新調校篩選策略。","credit":"Team Heidelberg, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6249/wiki/img/gvpa-binders/metrics-1-01788a672d.svg","caption":"Interface PAE distribution across all 1,429 de novo GvpA binder designs (orange) against the 13 accepted ones (blue). Nearly half of all designs failed on this metric alone, which is why the pipeline reports each gate separately rather than a single composite score.","caption_zh":"全部 1,429 個 de novo GvpA 結合蛋白設計（橙色）與 13 個入選者（藍色）的介面 PAE 分布。將近一半的設計光是這一個指標就被淘汰，這也是為什麼這條流程分別回報每一道關卡，而不是一個綜合分數。","credit":"Team Heidelberg, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6249/wiki/img/model/gvsam-base-vs-finetuned-a.webp","caption":"Recall, precision and F1 with bootstrapped 95% confidence intervals for GVSAM against the base CellSAM model on 10 held-out microscopy images containing 114 annotated gas vesicle clusters — F1 rose from 0.2% to 42% after fine-tuning on just 108 annotated images, with false positives down 97%.","caption_zh":"GVSAM 與未微調的 CellSAM 模型在 10 張保留測試顯微影像（含 114 個標註氣體囊泡叢集）上的召回率、精確率與 F1，附以 bootstrap 估計的 95% 信賴區間。僅以 108 張標註影像微調後，F1 由 0.2% 提升至 42%，假陽性減少 97%。","credit":"Team Heidelberg, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6249/wiki/img/education/error-bar-1.webp","caption":"The Error Bar, 'a night of scientific f*ck ups': around 80 students and researchers in the university student bar hearing established scientists talk about their own failures, with interactive activities and a workshop on distinguishing a fiasco from a crisis.","caption_zh":"Error Bar，號稱「一場科學搞砸之夜」：約 80 位學生與研究人員在校內學生酒吧，聽已有成就的科學家講述自己的失敗，並搭配互動活動以及一場區分「慘敗」與「危機」的工作坊。","credit":"Team Heidelberg, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"The transferable dry-lab habit is calibrating your filters against negative controls before you trust them: Heidelberg ran nine deliberately bad sequences plus the real binder through the identical pipeline, found that only AlphaFold2 interface PAE separated them, said so, and refused to select on the metrics that failed the test — a discipline that costs nothing but compute and turns a pile of prediction scores into an actual decision rule. On the human side, copy Fail Forward: an evening where senior scientists tell students about their own failures, plus a written guide that includes instructions for running the event yourself. For a high-school-plus research centre whose students will mostly meet failure before success, an institutional format that makes failure discussable is worth more than another outreach workshop — and the guide means you can run it next term without inventing it.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"最值得移植的乾實驗習慣，是在信任自己的篩選條件之前先用陰性對照校正它：Heidelberg 刻意做了九條壞序列，與真正的結合蛋白一起跑同一條流程，發現只有 AlphaFold2 的介面 PAE 能把它們分開，於是明白說出來，並拒絕以那些沒通過測試的指標來做選擇。這份紀律除了算力之外不花任何成本，卻能把一堆預測分數變成一條真正可用的決策規則。在人的那一側，請照抄 Fail Forward：一個讓資深科學家向學生講述自身失敗的夜晚，再加上一份書面指南，裡面還包含自行舉辦這場活動的操作說明。對一個學生多半會先遇到失敗才遇到成功的高中以上研究機構而言，一種讓失敗變得可以談的制度化形式，價值高於再辦一場科普工作坊，而那份指南意味著下學期你就能直接辦，不必從零發明。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/heidelberg/","https://2026.igem.wiki/heidelberg/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/heidelberg/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/heidelberg/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/heidelberg/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/heidelberg/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/heidelberg/application","https://2026.igem.wiki/heidelberg/part-collection","https://2026.igem.wiki/heidelberg/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/heidelberg/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/heidelberg/public-outreach"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","最佳元件集 — 得主（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 得主（大學組）","最佳基礎推進專案 — 入圍"],"rank":129},"6254":{"team":"UAlberta","id":"6254","section":"Undergrad","country":"Canada","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/","projectTitle":"gleyeco","projectTitle_zh":"gleyeco","tagline":"A modular fusion protein that uses the eye's own sugar coating as an anchor, delivered in a hydrogel, so dry eye medicine stays put.","tagline_zh":"一個模組化融合蛋白，把眼睛本身的糖衣當成錨點，並以水膠遞送，讓乾眼症藥物留在原處。","summary":"Dry eye disease affects an estimated 34.6% of people globally and 21.3% of Canadian adults, and the central problem is not the drug but the delivery: blinking and tear drainage clear a topical therapeutic within minutes. gleyeco treats the ocular glycocalyx as a docking site rather than a barrier, fusing a Galectin-3 carbohydrate-recognition domain (binding Core 1 O-glycans on mucins), a tandem pair of the 12-residue hyaluronic-acid-binding peptide HABpep, and IL-1RA (anakinra) as the therapeutic payload, delivered from a crosslinked PEG/hyaluronic acid hydrogel as a drop or a contact lens. The team built a five-stage dry lab pipeline with its own acronyms - GLARE, InSiGHT, VOIR, I-SPY, HOPE - that chooses the target, engineers the binder, sets the valency, predicts the yield and tunes the gel, and released GLARE as an installable Python package. It won Best Entrepreneurship on an unusually rigorous commercial case (38-patient survey, two clinician letters of support, a letter of intent from a clinic, competitor matrix against Restasis/Cequa/Xiidra, PESTEL, 10-year plan) and was nominated for the Inclusivity Award for an open-access Inclusivity in Research course, an Adaptive Technology Kit and a rural teachers' programme.","summary_zh":"乾眼症估計影響全球 34.6% 的人口，以及 21.3% 的加拿大成人，而核心問題不在藥物、而在遞送：眨眼與淚液排出會在幾分鐘內把局部用藥沖掉。gleyeco 把眼表的糖萼視為停靠位點、而非屏障，將一個 Galectin-3 的碳水化合物辨識區（結合黏液素上的 Core 1 O-glycan）、一組串聯的 12 殘基玻尿酸結合胜肽 HABpep，以及作為治療酬載的 IL-1RA（anakinra）融合在一起，再由交聯的 PEG／玻尿酸水膠以點眼液或隱形眼鏡形式遞送。團隊建了一條五階段的乾實驗流程，各有自創的縮寫——GLARE、InSiGHT、VOIR、I-SPY、HOPE——分別負責選定標的、改造結合子、設定價數、預測產率與調校水膠，並把 GLARE 釋出為可安裝的 Python 套件。它以一份異常嚴謹的商業論證（38 位病患問卷、兩封臨床醫師支持函、一家診所的意向書、對照 Restasis/Cequa/Xiidra 的競品矩陣、PESTEL、10 年計畫）拿下最佳創業獎，並以一門開放取用的「研究中的包容性」課程、一套輔具技術套件與一項偏鄉教師計畫獲得包容性獎提名。","awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Inclusivity Award — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Therapeutics Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Five named operations, each handing its result to the next. GLARE (Glycan-Lectin Analysis for Recognition and Evaluation) mines global glycan databases of 50,000+ catalogued sequences, filters to the 134 unique structures documented in ocular tissue (cornea, tear film, lacrimal gland), confirms O-glycans dominate, then screens Galectin-3's off-target risk across other organs and three cancers under identical statistics with multiple-hypothesis-testing correction, and finally re-runs the analysis under a dry-eye disease signature, finding the disease phenotype exposes over 2.5x more accessible binding sites. InSiGHT (In Silico Glycan Honed Targeting) engineers Galectin-3 to favour Core 1 over LacNAc: mutation sites were chosen from the literature (H46, N48, R50, N62, W69, E72 hydrogen-bonding residues plus nearby polar R32, E53, R74), a Clustal Omega multiple sequence alignment of all available mammalian galectins from PDB and NCBI (which excluded the perfectly conserved W69 and flagged the poorly conserved E53), and a PyMOL structural alignment of 12 galectin CRDs against Galectin-3 (PDB 3ZSJ, 0.86 Angstrom) that identified the E53-V58 loop and the I33/N31 positions as differentiators; a Python script generates mutant combinations, FoldX builds the structures, HADDOCK and Schrodinger dock Core 1 and LacNAc in parallel after AutoDock Vina proved unable to handle large flexible glycans, and GROMACS scores binding strength - batched across RunPod for parallel FoldX jobs. Ten mutants (Alpha through Kappa) went to the bench. VOIR (Valency Optimization and Integrated Retention) uses the valentBind model to compute bivalent avidity as a function of linker length and glycan target density, concluding that a second binding domain gives the largest gain, a third a moderate one, and a fourth nothing - and recommending (GGGGS)6-16 linkers. I-SPY (I Shall Produce Yield) curates the BL21(DE3)-based iBB1018 genome-scale reconstruction in COBRApy for the SHuffle T7 Express chassis, adds a demand reaction for the heterologous fusion protein, and runs flux balance analysis to locate metabolic bottlenecks. HOPE (Hydrogel Optimization for Pharmacokinetic Evaluation) models mesh size with the Peppas-Merrill and then the Canal-Peppas form of Flory-Rehner, using interpolated PEGDA swelling data and MeHA degree of methacrylation, and derives protein diffusivity from it.","frameworks_zh":"五項具名的作業，每一項把結果交給下一項。GLARE（Glycan-Lectin Analysis for Recognition and Evaluation）從收錄超過 50,000 條序列的全球糖鏈資料庫中挖掘資料，篩出在眼部組織（角膜、淚膜、淚腺）中有文獻記載的 134 種獨特結構，確認 O-glycan 為主，接著以完全相同的統計方法、並施以多重假說檢定校正，篩查 Galectin-3 在其他器官與三種癌症上的脫靶風險，最後再以乾眼症的疾病特徵重跑分析，發現疾病表現型會暴露出超過 2.5 倍的可及結合位點。InSiGHT（In Silico Glycan Honed Targeting）改造 Galectin-3，使其偏好 Core 1 而非 LacNAc：突變位點的選擇依據文獻（形成氫鍵的 H46、N48、R50、N62、W69、E72，再加上鄰近的極性殘基 R32、E53、R74）、一份以 Clustal Omega 對 PDB 與 NCBI 中所有可得哺乳類 galectin 所做的多序列比對（因此排除了完全保守的 W69，並標記出保守性很低的 E53），以及一份用 PyMOL 把 12 個 galectin 的碳水化合物辨識區對比 Galectin-3（PDB 3ZSJ，0.86 埃）的結構比對，由此指出 E53-V58 這段環與 I33/N31 位點是關鍵差異處；接著以 Python 腳本生成突變組合、以 FoldX 建構結構，並在 AutoDock Vina 被證明無法處理大型柔性糖鏈之後，改用 HADDOCK 與 Schrödinger 並行對接 Core 1 與 LacNAc，再以 GROMACS 評分結合強度——FoldX 的工作則透過 RunPod 分批並行執行。最終有十個突變體（Alpha 到 Kappa）進入實驗檯。VOIR（Valency Optimization and Integrated Retention）以 valentBind 模型計算雙價的親合力如何隨連接子長度與糖鏈標的密度變化，結論是加上第二個結合區收益最大、第三個中等、第四個則毫無助益——並建議採用 (GGGGS)6-16 的連接子。I-SPY（I Shall Produce Yield）在 COBRApy 中整理以 BL21(DE3) 為基礎的 iBB1018 基因組尺度代謝模型以符合 SHuffle T7 Express 底盤，加入該異源融合蛋白的需求反應，再以通量平衡分析找出代謝瓶頸。HOPE（Hydrogel Optimization for Pharmacokinetic Evaluation）以 Peppas-Merrill、再以 Flory-Rehner 的 Canal-Peppas 形式建模網目孔徑，使用內插的 PEGDA 膨潤資料與 MeHA 的甲基丙烯醯化程度，並由此推導蛋白質的擴散係數。","dataviz":"The modelling page is organised as a relay: five labelled operations (Choose, Improve, Multiply, Produce, Deliver) in a flow a reader clicks into, each with its own write-up and its own Impressiveness/Design/Validation/Exemplarity framing. The software page embeds a live in-browser CLI simulator for GLARE with clickable example commands (--cell eye, --binding-galectins eye, --target-compare eye core1 stn, --disease-compare dry_eye) so a judge can run the pipeline's logic without installing Python. For audiences without a biology background the team built the gleyecobuddies: Lecto (Galectin-3, with the binding site built into the character design), Ana (IL-1RA, a red plus sign) and Happy (HABpep, a blue rectangle standing for a wall that holds the drug in place), deliberately layered on top of the standard Symbol Nomenclature for Glycans rather than replacing it, and justified as serving visual learners, neurodivergent people and children. All InSiGHT results are reported with the predictors' disagreements visible rather than averaged.","dataviz_zh":"建模頁面組織成一條接力賽：五個具名作業（Choose、Improve、Multiply、Produce、Deliver）排成一條讀者可點入的流程，每一項都有自己的說明，並各自以 Impressiveness／Design／Validation／Exemplarity 的架構呈現。軟體頁面內嵌一個可在瀏覽器執行的 GLARE 命令列模擬器，附上可點擊的範例指令（--cell eye、--binding-galectins eye、--target-compare eye core1 stn、--disease-compare dry_eye），讓評審不必安裝 Python 就能跑過整條流程的邏輯。為沒有生物背景的對象，團隊設計了 gleyecobuddies：Lecto（Galectin-3，角色設計中直接畫出結合位）、Ana（IL-1RA，一個紅色加號）與 Happy（HABpep，一個藍色長方形，代表把藥物留在原處的一道牆），並刻意疊加在標準的糖鏈符號命名法（SNFG）之上、而非取代它，理由是要服務視覺型學習者、神經多樣性者與兒童。所有 InSiGHT 的結果都把各預測工具之間的不一致直接呈現出來，而不是平均掉。","datascience":"The team repeatedly uses modelling to avoid spending bench time, and reports the limits of each prediction. GLARE's stated limitations are unusually frank: the database records which structures have been documented in a tissue, not how much is displayed, so enrichment results describe structural patterns and must not be read as surface density; the diseased-versus-healthy split is built from literature signatures rather than a labelled patient dataset, and the pipeline is written so a real patient-derived list can be dropped in unchanged; binding strengths come from published microarray data, not from their own fusion protein; the tissue panel is small, and the cervix moved along the same mucin O-glycan axis as the eye so other mucosal surfaces would need direct testing. In InSiGHT they caught their own pipeline's instability - mutating key polar residues to alanine did not abolish predicted binding as it should, and one HADDOCK run gave mutant Gamma -6.495 kcal/mol against Core 1 while a separate run of the same mutant gave -3.84, which they report as evidence the pipeline needs repeated runs. For VOIR they state the point is the optimal linker length range, not the headline avidity ratio, because the values are literature-derived estimates not validated in vitro. For HOPE the model behaved as theory predicts (mesh falling from 16 nm at 5% w/v PEGDA to about 10 nm at 25%, predicted protein diffusivity from about 60 to 37 micrometres squared per second against 97 in free water) and they say plainly they could not build the equivalent alginate model, and that an OpenFOAM CFD attempt failed because the corneal absorption boundary condition had to be written in C++ and did not run reliably, so they fell back to a 1D Python model for sensitivity analysis.","datascience_zh":"團隊反覆以建模來省下實驗檯時間，並報告每項預測的限制。GLARE 所聲明的限制異常坦白：資料庫記錄的是某組織中有哪些結構被記載過、而不是展示了多少，因此富集結果描述的是結構模式，絕不可讀成表面密度；疾病與健康的分組是依文獻特徵建構、不是來自有標註的病患資料集，流程寫法則讓真正的病患來源清單可以原封不動地替換進來；結合強度來自已發表的微陣列資料、而非他們自己的融合蛋白；組織樣本面很小，而子宮頸在黏液素 O-glycan 這個軸上與眼睛走向相同，因此其他黏膜表面仍需直接測試。在 InSiGHT 中，他們抓出自己流程的不穩定：把關鍵極性殘基突變為丙胺酸後，預測的結合並未如理應發生那樣被消除；而同一個突變體 Gamma 對 Core 1 的一次 HADDOCK 執行給出 -6.495 kcal/mol，另一次獨立執行卻給出 -3.84，他們把這點報出來，作為流程需要多次重複執行的證據。在 VOIR 方面，他們聲明重點在於最佳連接子的長度區間、而不是那個醒目的親合力倍數，因為那些數值是文獻推導的估計、未經體外驗證。HOPE 的模型行為符合理論預期（網目孔徑從 5% w/v PEGDA 時的 16 nm 降到 25% 時約 10 nm，預測的蛋白質擴散係數從約每秒 60 平方微米降到 37，自由水中則為 97），他們也直白表示自己無法建出對應的 alginate 模型，而一次 OpenFOAM CFD 的嘗試失敗了，因為角膜吸收的邊界條件必須用 C++ 寫、執行起來不穩定，於是他們退回用一維 Python 模型做敏感度分析。","software":"GLARE, released as an importable Python package (v0.2.0, Python 3.10+) at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/ualberta/software-glare, runnable from the command line with a clear module structure separating tissue validation, binding analysis, cross-tissue comparison, disease signatures and docking-structure generation behind a single pipeline interface, with generalised inputs so another team can point it at a different tissue, lectin or glycan. A browser-based CLI simulator on the wiki lets anyone try it without installing. The Adaptive Technology Kit is an open-source hardware release: 3D-printable PCR strip-tube and microfuge-tube openers (in multiple design variants, because user testing showed different researchers preferred different models), an agarose gel loader, an SDS gel loader, a braille stamper, a keyboard tool, a pencil holder, a non-slip tray, a microscope phone holder, and a tactile map of the iGEM lab with published blueprints. A Synthetic Biology Lab Manual and the full Rural Teachers Synbiosium materials are published as free PDFs, as is the DNA-as-Code Kit.","software_zh":"GLARE 以可匯入的 Python 套件釋出（v0.2.0，需 Python 3.10+），位於 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/ualberta/software-glare ，可由命令列執行，模組結構清楚，把組織驗證、結合分析、跨組織比較、疾病特徵與對接結構生成分開，並統一在單一流程介面之後；輸入設計得夠通用，讓其他隊伍能把它指向不同的組織、凝集素或糖鏈。wiki 上的瀏覽器版命令列模擬器讓任何人不必安裝就能試用。輔具技術套件則是一項開源硬體發布：可 3D 列印的 PCR 連管與微量離心管開蓋器（有多種設計版本，因為使用者測試顯示不同研究者偏好不同款式）、瓊膠膠體上樣器、SDS 膠上樣器、點字壓印器、鍵盤輔具、鉛筆握持器、防滑托盤、顯微鏡手機架，以及一張 iGEM 實驗室的觸覺地圖，圖紙全部公開。一本《合成生物學實驗手冊》與偏鄉教師 Synbiosium 的完整教材都以免費 PDF 發布，DNA-as-Code 套件亦然。","stack":["Python 3.10+","COBRApy","iBB1018 genome-scale reconstruction","BiGG Models","Glycowork","GlyTouCan / GlyGen","Glycam-Web","FoldX","HADDOCK","Schrodinger","GROMACS","AutoDock Vina (rejected)","AlphaFold 2","PyMOL","Clustal Omega (EMBL-EBI)","RunPod (parallel compute)","valentBind","OpenFOAM (attempted)","Next.js / React wiki"],"techniques":["Database mining with multiple-hypothesis-testing correction","Disease-signature enrichment analysis","Cross-tissue off-target screening","Multiple sequence alignment for conservation-guided site selection","Structural alignment of homologue binding pockets","Combinatorial in silico saturation mutagenesis","Protein-glycan docking","MD-based binding strength estimation","Batched GPU/cloud job parallelisation","Flux balance analysis","Genome-scale model curation for a non-reference strain","Bivalent avidity / valency modelling","Flory-Rehner (Peppas-Merrill and Canal-Peppas) mesh-size calculation","Diffusivity estimation from mesh size","1D transport modelling for sensitivity analysis","Isothermal titration calorimetry (experimental Kd)"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Three distinct, durable programmes rather than one-off booths. (1) The Inclusivity in Research Course, an open-access training run through Google Classroom, built from a nationwide survey and expert consultations, with modules on a Native Land activity, the team's own 'Just Ask' framework and neurodivergent inclusion, creating open spaces, blind and visually impaired inclusion, Deaf and hard-of-hearing inclusion, racialized people, women and 2SLGBTQIA+ and gender minorities, navigating reporting processes, and an accessibility resource bank - each with downloadable slides, infographics and interactive summaries. It was piloted with their own team, neighbouring labs and Canadian iGEM teams, and the three pieces of pilot feedback (offer multiple learning formats, add scenario-based practice, cover more groups) were each implemented as narrated audio and slideshows, self-reflection prompts and real lab case studies, and two new modules. (2) The Rural Teachers Synbiosium, a half-day online professional development event for rural Alberta teachers, mapped explicitly onto the Alberta middle and high school curriculum, covering case studies and how to secure funding, with three guest speakers including Amino Labs CEO Julie Legault, 9 free hands-on kits distributed (teachers chose between a one-day yeast-fermentation race car and a multi-day pigment-engineering agar art project) and all materials shipped in advance to lower the burden. (3) Public outreach at K-Days, an Edmonton summer festival, where visitors attempted lab tasks while simulating different visual impairments, plus a DNA-as-code bracelet activity, and tabling at Alberta's Women in STEM week after being invited by the Alberta Women in Science Network. The team also presented at the Canadian Glycomics Symposium, CNAS Research Day, Darwin Day, Cell Biology Research Day, the RE Peter Conference and the Canadian iGEM GCI Conference, and ran a hands-on workshop at Canmore Collegiate High School - which is what revealed the rural access problem and started the Synbiosium.","publicEngagement_zh":"三項各自獨立、能持續下去的計畫，而不是一次性的攤位。(1)「研究中的包容性」課程，是一門透過 Google Classroom 開放取用的訓練課程，由一份全國性問卷與專家諮詢建構而成，模組涵蓋原住民土地認識活動、團隊自創的「Just Ask」框架與神經多樣性包容、營造開放空間、視障者包容、聽障與重聽者包容、被種族化的群體、女性與 2SLGBTQIA+ 及性別少數、如何走通申訴流程，以及一個無障礙資源庫——每個模組都有可下載的簡報、資訊圖與互動摘要。課程先在自己團隊、鄰近實驗室與加拿大其他 iGEM 隊伍試行，三項試行回饋（提供多種學習形式、加入情境演練、涵蓋更多群體）分別被落實為旁白音檔與投影片、自我反思提問與真實實驗室案例，以及兩個新模組。(2) 偏鄉教師 Synbiosium，是一場為亞伯達省偏鄉教師辦的半日線上專業發展活動，明確對齊亞伯達省國中與高中課綱，內容涵蓋案例研究與如何爭取經費，有三位客座講者（包括 Amino Labs 執行長 Julie Legault），發出 9 份免費的動手做套件（教師可在一日的酵母發酵賽車與多日的色素工程洋菜藝術專題之間選擇），所有材料都事先寄達以降低教師負擔。(3) 公眾科普：在愛德蒙頓的夏季節慶 K-Days 設攤，讓參觀者在模擬不同視覺障礙的狀態下嘗試實驗室工作，另有 DNA 編碼手環活動；並在受亞伯達女性科學網絡邀請後，於該省 Women in STEM 週設攤。團隊也在加拿大糖體學研討會、CNAS 研究日、達爾文日、細胞生物學研究日、RE Peter 會議與加拿大 iGEM GCI 會議發表，並在 Canmore Collegiate 高中辦了一場動手做工作坊——正是那場活動揭露了偏鄉的取用問題，並促成了 Synbiosium。","ihp":"Every stakeholder entry is logged as a Key Insight paired with an Action Taken, and the actions are real design reversals. Dr Warren Wakarchuk (Scientific Director of GlycoNet) warned that small-molecule binding pockets hold cargo too tightly to release on the eye and that yeast adds problematic sugar tags, and noted eukaryotic tissue autofluoresces green under UV - so the team abandoned the binding-pocket release concept, chose E. coli over yeast, switched the reporter from GFP to mScarlet, and retargeted abundant normal ocular glycans instead of rare disease-specific ones. Dr Lisa Willis (glyco-immunology) raised immune safety and challenged them to test whether the Galectin-3 and HA domains cooperate or compete for binding - so instead of assuming more binding is better, they redesigned the experimental plan to measure each domain separately by isothermal titration calorimetry. Dr Carr advised narrowing from retinal delivery to corneal inflammation in dry eye with IL-1RA cargo and offered Xenopus eye tissue for ex vivo testing. An advisor recommended the SHuffle T7 strain and told them their fusion protein was not complex enough to justify a chaperone plasmid, so they dropped it. Dr Amandeep helped unify the five separate models into one pipeline and suggested using eye images as GLARE input to make it diagnostic - the team pursued it, found it infeasible, said so, and redirected to modelling; he also pointed them to RunPod, which is why FoldX now runs in parallel. Jezlyn warned that chemical and UV crosslinking would denature mScarlet, so they moved to physical ionic crosslinking with calcium chloride, wrote autoclaving protocols for sterility, and were pointed at the Peppas-Merrill and Flory-Rehner equations that became HOPE. Dr Cortez told them not to add a second nickel column but to optimise their existing HisTrap/FPLC wash stringency, which they did and documented on Coomassie gels. Optometrist Dr Abdo Kattan explained that his multi-product dry eye package (omega 3s, drops, lid wipes, goggles) has very low compliance because it is time-consuming, expensive and impossible to attribute benefit to - which refocused the whole project on one affordable single-product treatment. Separately, CD44 was dropped entirely as the HA-retention domain in favour of tandem HABpep after it kept appearing in the insoluble fraction and the literature revealed isoforms linked to cancer therapy resistance. On the inclusivity side, Nicholas Piroddi (a medical researcher with autism) was consulted, then consulted a second time to review how the course represented neurodiversity, which added the institutional reporting-pathways module; ASVI's input became the blind and visually impaired module; and user testing of the 3D-printed tube openers at the WinSTEM expo is why the kit ships multiple variants of the same tool.","ihp_zh":"每一條利害關係人紀錄都登錄為一則關鍵洞見配一則採取的行動，而這些行動都是真正的設計翻盤。GlycoNet 科學總監 Dr Warren Wakarchuk 警告，小分子結合口袋抓得太緊、到了眼睛上無法釋放酬載，而酵母會加上有問題的糖基修飾，並指出真核組織在紫外光下會發出綠色自體螢光——於是團隊放棄了結合口袋釋放的構想、選擇 E. coli 而非酵母、把報告基因從 GFP 換成 mScarlet，並把標的從罕見的疾病專一糖鏈改為量多的正常眼部糖鏈。Dr Lisa Willis（糖免疫學）提出免疫安全性問題，並要他們檢驗 Galectin-3 區與玻尿酸結合區在結合上是協同還是競爭——於是他們不再假設結合越多越好，而是重新設計實驗計畫，以等溫滴定量熱法分別量測兩個區域。Dr Carr 建議從視網膜遞送收斂到以 IL-1RA 為酬載的乾眼症角膜發炎，並提供 Xenopus 眼組織供離體測試。一位顧問推薦 SHuffle T7 菌株，並指出他們的融合蛋白還不夠複雜、不足以正當化使用伴護蛋白質體，於是他們把它去掉。Dr Amandeep 協助把五個獨立模型統整成一條流程，並建議以眼睛影像作為 GLARE 的輸入，使其具診斷功能——團隊確實去嘗試、發現不可行、如實說明，並把方向轉回建模；他也指點他們使用 RunPod，這就是 FoldX 現在能並行執行的原因。Jezlyn 警告化學與紫外交聯都會使 mScarlet 變性，於是他們改用氯化鈣的物理離子交聯、撰寫高壓滅菌的無菌操作規程，並被指向後來成為 HOPE 的 Peppas-Merrill 與 Flory-Rehner 方程式。Dr Cortez 告訴他們不要再加第二根鎳管柱，而是把現有 HisTrap/FPLC 的沖洗嚴苛度最佳化，他們照做並以考馬斯染色膠記錄下來。驗光師 Dr Abdo Kattan 說明他那套多產品的乾眼療程（omega 3、點眼液、眼瞼清潔棉片、護目鏡）順從性極低，因為耗時、昂貴，而且根本無法歸因是哪一項帶來改善——這使整個專題重新聚焦到一項負擔得起的單一產品療法上。另外，CD44 作為玻尿酸滯留區被完全捨棄、改用串聯 HABpep，原因是它一再出現在不可溶部分，且文獻顯示其某些異構體與癌症治療抗性有關。在包容性這一端，他們諮詢了 Nicholas Piroddi（一位自閉症的醫學研究者），之後又第二度請他審閱課程如何呈現神經多樣性，由此增補了機構申訴途徑的模組；ASVI 的意見成為視障模組；而 3D 列印開蓋器在 WinSTEM 展會上的使用者測試，正是套件為同一項工具提供多種版本的原因。","realWorld":"The strongest undergraduate commercial case of the five. Evidence of demand is tabulated by customer role with the strength of evidence named: letters of support from Dr Abdo Kattan and Dr Matthew Benson (and a signed letter of intent from Kattan's clinic to work with them), 86% of 38 surveyed dry eye patients interested in a synthetic biology treatment, and an application in interview stage with the Nucleate Canada accelerator. The patient survey plus three clinician interviews produced five explicit unmet needs - fewer doses, longer retention, no burning or stinging, targeted anti-inflammatory action, contact lens compatibility - which the product is then measured against. A competitor matrix compares gleyeco line by line with Restasis (AbbVie), Cequa (Sun Pharma) and Xiidra (Bausch + Lomb) on mechanism, dosing, time to effect, clinical evidence, tolerability, lens compatibility, 30-day cost and Canadian availability, citing prescribing information and Drugs.com prices as of 15 October 2026, and crucially labels gleyeco's own entries as design goals that preclinical and clinical data must confirm. The gap identified is precise: every anti-inflammatory option is dosed at least twice daily and none occupies targeted once-daily treatment. TAM/SAM/SOM, regional opportunity, bottom-up dynamics, current distribution network, a Size-Potential-Access analysis, a beachhead market defined by role (users, decision makers, payers, pharmaceutical partners), a 10-year implementation plan and an exit strategy all follow. The PESTEL analysis is specific to Canadian biotech: Health Canada's Reliance Order syncing review with the FDA if filed within 120 days, Alberta Innovates and FAST cutting trial start-up from 90+ to 45 days, PMPRB price controls pushing them toward private payers first, over 75% of Canadian life-science investment coming from abroad so Phase 2 needs a partner, the USD/CAD rate at 1.4, and the fact that the RE Peter Conference and Jamboree disclosures start the novelty clock (12 months in Canada, absolute novelty required in Europe). Clinical milestones were set directly from a clinician's roadmap, and lab eye models have been offered by two separate researchers for the move from proof of concept to preclinical.","realWorld_zh":"五支隊伍中大學部最強的商業論證。需求證據依客戶角色列表，並標明證據強度：Dr Abdo Kattan 與 Dr Matthew Benson 的支持函（以及 Kattan 診所簽署的合作意向書）、38 位受訪乾眼症患者中有 86% 對合成生物學療法感興趣，以及一份已進入面試階段的 Nucleate Canada 加速器申請。病患問卷加上三場臨床醫師訪談，整理出五項明確的未滿足需求——更少的給藥次數、更長的滯留時間、不刺痛不灼熱、標的性的抗發炎作用、與隱形眼鏡相容——產品隨後就以這些標準來檢視。競品矩陣逐項把 gleyeco 與 Restasis（AbbVie）、Cequa（Sun Pharma）與 Xiidra（Bausch + Lomb）在機制、給藥、起效時間、臨床證據、耐受性、隱形眼鏡相容性、30 天費用與加拿大可取得性上比較，引用的是處方資訊與 2026 年 10 月 15 日的 Drugs.com 價格，而關鍵在於他們把 gleyeco 自己那一欄標示為設計目標，有待臨床前與臨床資料確認。他們指出的缺口很精確：所有抗發炎選項都至少每日給藥兩次，沒有任何一項占住「標的性、每日一次」這個位置。接著是 TAM/SAM/SOM、區域機會、自下而上的動態分析、現行通路網絡、一份 Size-Potential-Access 分析、依角色界定的灘頭市場（使用者、決策者、付費方、製藥夥伴）、一份 10 年執行計畫與一套退場策略。PESTEL 分析專就加拿大生技環境而寫：加拿大衛生部的 Reliance Order 在 120 天內送件即可與 FDA 審查同步、Alberta Innovates 與 FAST 把試驗啟動時間從 90 天以上縮短到 45 天、PMPRB 的價格管制推使他們先走自費市場、超過 75% 的加拿大生命科學投資來自海外因此第二期需要夥伴、美元兌加元匯率為 1.4，以及 RE Peter 會議與 Jamboree 的公開揭露會啟動新穎性時鐘（加拿大 12 個月，歐洲則要求絕對新穎性）。臨床里程碑直接依一位臨床醫師的路線圖設定，而兩位不同的研究者都提供了實驗室眼睛模型，供他們從概念驗證邁向臨床前。","partners":["GlycoNet (Canadian Glycomics Network)","Nucleate Canada","Amino Labs","Alberta Women in Science Network (AWSN)","Alberta Sports and Recreation Association for the Blind / ASVI","MolScreen","Genome Alberta","University of Alberta Student Innovation Centre","Canmore Collegiate High School","Dr Abdo Kattan's optometry clinic (letter of intent)","Alberta Innovates / FAST","Canadian iGEM GCI Conference","Canadian Glycomics Symposium","rural Alberta school teachers (Synbiosium cohort)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6254/wiki/model-page/glare-fig1.avif","caption":"GLARE, the glycan-lectin screening pipeline: 50,000+ catalogued glycan sequences filtered to the 134 documented in ocular tissue, then screened for Galectin-3 off-target risk across other organs and under a dry-eye disease signature.","caption_zh":"GLARE，糖鏈—凝集素篩選流程：從收錄超過 50,000 條糖鏈序列中篩出在眼部組織有文獻記載的 134 種，再篩查 Galectin-3 在其他器官上的脫靶風險，以及在乾眼症疾病特徵下的表現。","credit":"Team UAlberta, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6254/wiki/model-page/insight-folder/insight-figure2.avif","caption":"Predicted binding strength of Galectin-3 mutants against the Core 1 target, scored by HADDOCK, Schrodinger and GROMACS, with the predictors' disagreements left visible rather than averaged.","caption_zh":"Galectin-3 突變體對 Core 1 標的的預測結合強度，由 HADDOCK、Schrödinger 與 GROMACS 評分，並把各預測工具之間的不一致直接保留下來、而非平均掉。","credit":"Team UAlberta, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6254/wiki/model-page/hope-folder/hydrogel-modelling-figure-3.avif","caption":"HOPE hydrogel modelling: mesh size falls from 16 nm at 5% w/v PEGDA to about 10 nm at 25%, and predicted protein diffusivity falls from roughly 60 to 37 micrometres squared per second against 97 in free water.","caption_zh":"HOPE 水膠建模：網目孔徑從 5% w/v PEGDA 時的 16 nm 降到 25% 時約 10 nm，預測的蛋白質擴散係數則從每秒約 60 平方微米降到 37，而自由水中為 97。","credit":"Team UAlberta, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6254/wiki/inclusivity-page/map-in-use.avif","caption":"The tactile map of the iGEM lab in use - part of the open-source Adaptive Technology Kit, published with blueprints alongside 3D-printable tube openers, gel loaders and a braille stamper.","caption_zh":"iGEM 實驗室觸覺地圖的實際使用畫面——這是開源輔具技術套件的一部分，與可 3D 列印的開蓋器、膠體上樣器與點字壓印器一同連同圖紙公開。","credit":"Team UAlberta, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6254/wiki/model-page/voir-folder/fig1-voir.avif","caption":"VOIR valency modelling: bivalent avidity as a function of linker length from the valentBind model, which showed a second binding domain gives the largest gain, a third a moderate one, and a fourth none.","caption_zh":"VOIR 的價數建模：以 valentBind 模型算出雙價親合力隨連接子長度的變化，結果顯示加上第二個結合區收益最大、第三個中等、第四個則毫無助益。","credit":"Team UAlberta, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy UAlberta's two-column human practices habit - every conversation written as one Key Insight and one Action Taken, where the action is a concrete reversal (GFP to mScarlet, yeast to E. coli, CD44 dropped for HABpep, chemical crosslinking dropped for calcium) - because it forces a team to admit when advice changed nothing. The other directly adaptable asset is their rural pivot: they went in planning to help schools found competition teams, learned from the teachers that capacity was the real constraint, and instead built a curriculum-aligned half-day online session with pre-shipped kits and a free lab manual, which is exactly the model a Taiwanese research centre could run for under-resourced schools.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"值得借鏡的是 UAlberta 那套雙欄式人類實踐習慣——每一次對話都寫成一則關鍵洞見配一則採取的行動，而行動都是具體的翻盤（GFP 改成 mScarlet、酵母改成 E. coli、捨棄 CD44 改用 HABpep、捨棄化學交聯改用鈣離子）——因為這會迫使團隊承認哪些建議其實什麼都沒改變。另一項可直接移植的資產是他們在偏鄉的轉向：他們原本打算協助學校成立競賽隊伍，從教師那裡才明白真正的限制是能量不足，於是改為設計一場對齊課綱的半日線上課程，搭配事先寄達的實驗套件與一份免費實驗手冊——這正是台灣的研究中心可以為資源不足學校推行的模式。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/overview","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/proof-of-concept","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/hydrogels","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/inclusivity","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/science-communication","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/safety-and-security","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/ualberta/software-glare"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","包容性獎 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳創業 — 得主（大學組）","最佳治療專案 — 入圍"],"rank":110},"6263":{"team":"Bist-China","id":"6263","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/bist-china/","projectTitle":"PyrLac Glow","projectTitle_zh":"PyrLac Glow","tagline":"A dual lactate-pyruvate fluorescent sensing system as a low-cost grassroots pre-screening tool for cancer risk","tagline_zh":"一套乳酸-丙酮酸雙指標螢光感測系統，作為基層可用的低成本癌症風險初篩工具","summary":"PyrLac Glow reads the Warburg effect directly: two allosteric fluorescent biosensors, built by inserting YFP into the transcription regulators PdhR (pyruvate) and LldR (L-lactate), report the concentrations and the ratio of the two metabolites through a dual-lock mechanism. The project targets a specific structural gap in Chinese cancer screening - CT, endoscopy and liquid biopsy are accurate but inaccessible at grassroots level, while conventional serum tumour markers are cheap but not specific enough - with fewer than 10% of patients diagnosed early. The team ran 16 in-depth interviews across clinical practice, research, industry, public health, insurance, education and engineering, plus two questionnaires (208 and 113 valid responses), organised into five sequential stages each answering one question and each closing with a 'What we changed' statement. The biomarker architecture, the product category, the deployment scenarios, the hardware scope, the software permission model and the outreach strategy all changed as a direct result.","summary_zh":"PyrLac Glow 直接讀取 Warburg 效應：團隊把 YFP 插入轉錄調控蛋白 PdhR（丙酮酸）與 LldR（L-乳酸），做成兩個異位調節型螢光生物感測器，透過雙鎖機制回報這兩個代謝物的濃度及其比值。專案針對的是中國癌症篩檢中一個具體的結構性缺口——CT、內視鏡與液態生物檢體檢測雖然準確，基層卻拿不到；傳統血清腫瘤標記便宜，專一性卻不足——而早期診斷的病人不到 10%。團隊做了 16 場深度訪談，涵蓋臨床、研究、產業、公共衛生、保險、教育與工程領域，另有兩份問卷（208 份與 113 份有效回覆），並整理成五個依序推進的階段，每個階段回答一個問題，並以一段「我們改了什麼」收尾。生物標記架構、產品類別、部署場景、硬體範圍、軟體權限模型與推廣策略，全都因此直接改變。","awards":["Best New Composite Part — Nominee (High School)","Best Hardware — Nominee (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Infectious Diseases / Therapeutics / Diagnostics / Oncology)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A multi-evidence computational screening workflow to choose YFP insertion breakpoints in each sensor, combining conserved domain annotation, static structural rigidity assessment, physicochemical profiling, molecular docking and molecular dynamics. For PdhR they built a five-feature weighted scoring model that scores and ranks every residue along the full-length sequence, with C-terminal oligomerisation residues included but penalised by steric hindrance and conformational tolerance terms, and high-scoring candidates still requiring manual secondary verification. For LldR they started from experimentally validated insertion hotspots reported in patent CN113004420A rather than scoring blind.","frameworks_zh":"一套多重證據的運算篩選流程，用來為每個感測器挑選 YFP 的插入斷點，結合保守功能域註解、靜態結構剛性評估、理化性質分析、分子對接與分子動力學模擬。針對 PdhR，他們建了一個五項特徵的加權評分模型，對全長序列上的每個胺基酸殘基評分排序，C 端的寡聚化殘基雖納入計算，但會被立體阻礙與構形容忍度兩項扣分，而高分的候選位點仍須人工二次確認。針對 LldR，他們則從專利 CN113004420A 中已有實驗驗證的插入熱點出發，而不是盲目評分。","dataviz":"An interactive five-stage IHP architecture diagram with collapsible numbered nodes, a four-group stakeholder classification map (end screening users, clinical practitioners, industry and technical developers, public health and policy regulators) with each group's concerns attached, and a closed-loop summary figure pairing core achievements, key limitations and future plans.","dataviz_zh":"一張互動式的五階段 IHP 架構圖，節點可編號收合；一張四群利害關係人分類圖（篩檢終端使用者、臨床工作者、產業與技術開發者、公共衛生與政策監管者），各群的關切事項附在旁邊；以及一張閉環總結圖，把核心成果、主要限制與未來計畫對照並列。","datascience":"Questionnaire analysis with explicit sampling-bias reporting: 78.37% female respondents, 91.83% urban, income above 20,000 RMB per year, and the team states outright that the sample under-covers rural, low-income and elderly male populations and makes those groups a target for later outreach. Hardware requirement data were gathered in a second, deliberately non-overlapping questionnaire. Apo-to-holo conformational modelling explains the sensing mechanism: hinge flexibility distorts the embedded YFP beta-barrel for low basal fluorescence, and ligand-induced contraction rigidifies the hinge so YFP refolds and fluorescence rises.","datascience_zh":"問卷分析明確交代抽樣偏差：填答者 78.37% 為女性、91.83% 住在都市、年收入高於 20,000 人民幣，團隊也直接說明樣本對農村、低收入與高齡男性族群覆蓋不足，並把這些族群列為後續推廣的目標。硬體需求資料則透過第二份刻意不重疊的問卷收集。apo 到 holo 的構形模擬解釋了感測機制：鉸鏈的柔性會使嵌入的 YFP beta 桶狀結構變形，因而基礎螢光很低；配體結合引發的收縮則讓鉸鏈變硬，YFP 重新摺疊，螢光隨之上升。","software":"A modular data processing backbone designed with a former Microsoft vice president: signal acquisition, data buffering, data quality verification, sample labelling, separate processing pipelines for CMOS sensors and photoresistors, data storage and visualisation, with anonymous sample IDs, full retention of both raw and processed data, spreadsheet export at prototype stage, and module decoupling so sensors or verification algorithms can be upgraded without rebuilding the system.","software_zh":"一套模組化的資料處理骨架，與一位前微軟副總裁共同設計：訊號取得、資料緩衝、資料品質驗證、樣本標記、CMOS 感測器與光敏電阻各自獨立的處理流程、資料儲存與視覺化；樣本採用匿名 ID，原始與處理後資料全部保留，原型階段可匯出試算表，模組之間彼此解耦，因此更換感測器或驗證演算法時不必重建整個系統。","stack":["molecular docking","molecular dynamics simulation","conserved domain annotation","weighted multi-feature residue scoring","CMOS sensor and photoresistor pipelines","Kahoot (for outreach assessment)"],"techniques":["allosteric transcription-factor biosensor engineering (YFP insertion into PdhR and LldR)","insertion breakpoint screening","standard curve construction with biological and technical replicates","fluorescence characterisation","POCT prototype design with disposable preloaded cartridges"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Outreach is unusually self-critical for a high school team. They produced two differentiated brochures (a children's version with illustrations and simple language, and a systematic middle/high school version covering experimental principles), ran an activity at Suzhou Science and Technology Town Foreign Language High School for about 60 ninth-graders using a Kahoot quiz to build the prerequisite cell-biology concepts before introducing the project, and a themed lacquer-fan creation exercise so students re-expressed the science visually. A shopping-mall event reached a broad cross-section but returned only three completed questionnaires from high foot traffic, and the team published that failure with a diagnosis: a mall suits short accessible outreach rather than detailed survey collection, their material distribution lacked interactive elements and 'often raised suspicion', and next time they would lead with their school and iGEM identity to build trust and standardise the introduction between team members. For a professional audience they rewrote the talk, cutting health-management content and expanding the Warburg effect, dual-biomarker and protein-expression material, then coded the questions received into knowledge and attitude dimensions. A 30-student pre-study tested whether a single outreach event can shift awareness at all.","publicEngagement_zh":"推廣活動對一支高中隊伍來說罕見地自我批判。他們做了兩種版本的手冊（兒童版用插圖與淺顯語言，國高中版則系統地講實驗原理），在蘇州科技城外國語高中為約 60 位九年級學生辦活動，先用 Kahoot 問答建立必要的細胞生物學概念，再介紹專案，並安排一場以此為主題的漆扇創作，讓學生用視覺方式重新表達這些科學內容。在購物中心辦的活動雖然接觸到各式各樣的人，但在人流很大的情況下只回收三份完整問卷；團隊把這次失敗連同診斷一起公開：購物中心適合簡短易懂的推廣，不適合蒐集詳細問卷；他們發放的材料缺少互動元素，而且「常常引起懷疑」；下一次他們會先亮出學校與 iGEM 的身分來建立信任，並統一隊員之間的開場說法。面對專業聽眾時，他們重寫了演講內容，刪掉健康管理的部分，擴充 Warburg 效應、雙生物標記與蛋白質表現的篇幅，再把收到的問題依知識面與態度面編碼分類。另有一場 30 位學生的前導研究，用來檢驗單次推廣活動究竟能不能改變認知。","ihp":"Bist-China's five-stage structure forces each stakeholder round to produce a change, and the changes are substantial rather than cosmetic. The single biggest one is the biomarker architecture: the initial design used lactate alone, and a pathologist at a hospital in Zhuhai, Guangdong told them that many benign physiological fluctuations produce fluorescent signals resembling malignant signatures, so a single-marker assay 'would not be clinically accepted for large-scale pre-screening' - the team abandoned the single-lactate scheme and adopted combined lactate-pyruvate detection, making specificity and anti-interference the primary optimisation goals. Dr Feiran Han (Director of the Institute of Science and Technology, LC-Bio) then confirmed dual-marker feasibility but told them two markers were the right number for a high-school project because a third would dilute validation depth, so they locked the panel at two and built standardised SOPs with replicates and standard curves converting fluorescence into metabolite concentrations. Stage 1 produced a product-category change: cancer survivors described the 1-2 year early warning window missed through fear of positive results, and oncologist Dr Wu Qing explained that fewer than 10% of cases are caught early and that clinicians fear false positives triggering public panic - crucially, Dr Wu partially contradicted the patient interviews, saying patients often refuse screening not because of cost but because they do not know how to interpret an ambiguous result, which the team records as shifting their attention 'from reducing cost to designing unambiguous result communication'. PyrLac Glow was repositioned from a diagnostic device to a risk pre-screening tool that refers high-risk individuals onward, with an explicit trade-off rule carried forward into Stage 2: prioritise reducing missed diagnoses while tolerating interpretable false positives. Staff at Cuiyuan Community Health Service Center in Xihu District, Hangzhou killed the household self-test idea outright - community centres have no high-precision instruments or full-time pathologists, send samples out for 3-7 day report cycles, have overloaded general practitioners, and will only adopt after official medical device certification - so the team abandoned household positioning and fixed three deployment scenarios. Prof. Ying Xiao of Shanghai University of Traditional Chinese Medicine changed the report interface: avoid absolute 'cancer / no cancer' conclusions and use physical-examination-style wording (metabolic abnormality, potential risk, re-test recommended), and treat constitution information as auxiliary explanation only since using it to reduce false positives remains a hypothesis. The most consequential safety change came from Erika Ferreri (Bellevue College, Washington State Department of Health, 21 years in medical laboratory education), who found the prototype could output cancer risk conclusions directly to ordinary users: the team re-scoped it as a bench-side research prototype for trained professionals, stripped risk judgments from the device interface so it reports only raw concentrations and quality-control status, added unique sample IDs, full raw-data retention and error-triggered automatic re-testing, separated the operator backend from the doctor and patient report interface, and deferred patient-facing reports until clinical validation - 'this transformed the prototype from an open prototype to a controlled medical research device'. A mechanical manufacturing chairman stopped them wasting the season on shell appearance and tolerances, imposing a core-function-first rule and forward design from commercially available standard components. Commercially, an AIA insurance specialist's view that insurers will not lead on immature technology and barely accept results from private organisations directly removed insurance as a primary channel, redirecting the strategy to corporate physical examinations and public medical screening; a corporate HR director with a 500-RMB-per-employee annual budget set a 200-RMB consumable cost target and added the third deployment scenario the team had missed; an IVD company chairman located the real gap between student prototype and product in batch stability and clinical validation rather than principle verification, turning a 5% to 15% CV benchmark into a quality-control design target. Most tellingly, they record advice they declined with reasons: they rejected educational psychologist Margaret's suggestion to invest in short-video platforms because a high-school team lacks the resources for continuous content production and the compliance capacity for medical-adjacent content, substituting a school health-curriculum lecture series and printed booklet; and they only partially accepted Erika Ferreri's multi-language recommendation, supporting Chinese and English now and deferring the rest. They also resolved a genuine disagreement among the iGEM teams they consulted about whether to validate biology before building hardware by choosing a middle path with a stated rule - hardware parameters must be re-validated against final Stage 2 experimental parameters before freezing.","ihp_zh":"Bist-China 的五階段結構要求每一輪利害關係人互動都必須產出一項改變，而這些改變是實質的，不是裝飾性的。最大的一項是生物標記架構：最初的設計只用乳酸，廣東珠海一家醫院的病理科醫師告訴他們，許多良性的生理波動也會產生類似惡性特徵的螢光訊號，因此單一標記的檢測「在臨床上不會被接受用於大規模初篩」——團隊於是放棄單一乳酸方案，改採乳酸與丙酮酸併檢，並把專一性與抗干擾能力列為首要的最佳化目標。LC-Bio 科技研究院院長 Feiran Han 博士接著確認雙標記可行，但告訴他們對一個高中專案而言兩個標記正好，加第三個只會稀釋驗證的深度，因此他們把檢測組合鎖定在兩個標記，並建立標準化 SOP，含重複試驗與把螢光換算成代謝物濃度的標準曲線。第一階段帶來的是產品類別的改變：癌症康復者描述了因為害怕陽性結果而錯過的 1-2 年預警窗口；腫瘤科醫師 Wu Qing 說明早期發現的個案不到 10%，而臨床端擔心偽陽性引發社會恐慌——關鍵在於，Wu 醫師部分推翻了病人訪談的結論，他指出病人拒絕篩檢往往不是因為費用，而是不知道該怎麼解讀一個模糊的結果，團隊因此記下自己的注意力「從降低成本轉向設計不含糊的結果溝通方式」。PyrLac Glow 從診斷儀器重新定位為風險初篩工具，把高風險者轉介出去，並把一條明確的取捨規則帶進第二階段：優先降低漏診，同時容許可被解釋的偽陽性。杭州市西湖區翠苑社區衛生服務中心的人員直接否決了家用自我檢測的構想——社區中心沒有高精度儀器也沒有專職病理人員，樣本要外送、報告週期 3-7 天，家庭醫師本身已經超載，而且只有在取得正式醫療器材認證後才會採用——團隊因此放棄家用定位，改而確定三種部署場景。上海中醫藥大學的 Ying Xiao 教授改變了報告介面：避免「有癌／沒癌」這種絕對結論，改用健檢式的措辭（代謝異常、潛在風險、建議複檢），而體質資訊只能作為輔助說明，因為用它來降低偽陽性目前仍只是假設。影響最深的安全性改變來自 Erika Ferreri（Bellevue College、華盛頓州衛生部，在醫事檢驗教育領域 21 年），她發現原型機會直接把癌症風險結論輸出給一般使用者：團隊於是把它改定位為供受過訓練的專業人員使用的實驗檯邊研究原型，從儀器介面上移除風險判斷，只回報原始濃度與品管狀態，加入唯一的樣本 ID、原始資料完整保留與錯誤觸發的自動複檢，把操作者後台與醫師、病人的報告介面分開，並把面向病人的報告延後到完成臨床驗證之後——「這讓原型從一台開放式原型變成受控的醫療研究裝置」。一位機械製造業董事長阻止他們把整個賽季浪費在外殼外觀與公差上，要求以核心功能優先，並從市面上現成的標準零件往前推導設計。在商業面，AIA 的一位保險專員認為保險公司不會在技術成熟前走在前面，也幾乎不接受民間機構出具的檢測結果，這個看法直接把保險從主要通路名單上刪除，策略轉向企業健檢與公共醫療篩檢；一位企業人資主管的年度預算是每位員工 500 人民幣，由此訂出 200 人民幣的耗材成本目標，也補上了團隊原本漏掉的第三種部署場景；一位 IVD 公司董事長指出，學生原型與產品之間真正的差距在批次穩定性與臨床驗證，而不在原理驗證，於是把 CV 值 5% 到 15% 的基準變成品管的設計目標。最能說明問題的是，他們把謝絕的建議連同理由一起記錄下來：他們否決了教育心理學家 Margaret 投入短影音平台的建議，理由是高中隊伍既沒有持續產出內容的資源，也沒有處理醫療相關內容所需的法規遵循能力，改以學校健康課程的系列講座與印製小冊子替代；對 Erika Ferreri 的多語言建議則只部分採納，目前支援中文與英文，其餘延後。他們諮詢的 iGEM 隊伍之間，對「要不要先驗證生物學再做硬體」存在真實的分歧，團隊以折衷路線解決，並訂下明確規則——硬體參數在定版之前，必須對照第二階段最終的實驗參數重新驗證一次。","realWorld":"The need is quantified against the system that would have to absorb the product: roughly 50% of cancers worldwide diagnosed at advanced stage, fewer than 10% of Chinese patients diagnosed early, 3-7 day report turnaround at community centres with no on-site pathologist, and 58.65% of their own 208 respondents unfamiliar with or completely unaware of early screening - from which they draw the sharpest framing in the project, that the bottleneck is the public 'does not know screening is needed' rather than refuses screening. Cost targets come from stakeholders rather than guesswork and are triangulated across two independent sources: public expectation of under 1,000 RMB per test from the questionnaire, and a per-person threshold of 200 RMB from the corporate HR budget of about 500 RMB per employee per year. Hardware constraints are equally specific: results within 30 minutes, wireless transmission to a phone (62.83% called this very necessary), disposable preloaded disc cartridges, single-use safety (76.11% support), and professional-scenario priority. The regulatory path is laid out concretely - medical device registration and official certification as the precondition for community adoption, POCT specifications for the operating manual, and prospective clinical trials enrolling high-risk populations with 1-2 years of follow-up to establish consistency and positive and negative predictive value, with a staged roadmap of top-tier hospital pilot, data-driven validation, then guideline endorsement, and a stated commercialisation horizon of 3-5 years (5-10 for widespread adoption). No SDG is claimed anywhere on the wiki, which is a genuine gap for a project that frames itself in public-health terms. The limitations section is honest and specific: laboratory validation only with no large clinical sample set for threshold training, no medical device qualification, the science communication plan still at design stage, and the questionnaire sample biased toward urban populations. Future work is committed to a clinical-pilot-first route before any market expansion.","realWorld_zh":"需求是對著「未來得吸收這項產品的那套體系」來量化的：全球約 50% 的癌症在晚期才被診斷、中國僅不到 10% 的病人早期確診、社區中心沒有駐點病理人員且報告需 3-7 天，以及他們自己 208 位填答者中有 58.65% 對早期篩檢不熟悉或完全不知道——由此導出整個專案最銳利的一句定調：瓶頸在於民眾「不知道需要篩檢」，而不是拒絕篩檢。成本目標來自利害關係人而非憑空猜測，並以兩個獨立來源交叉驗證：問卷顯示民眾期待單次檢測在 1,000 人民幣以下，而企業人資每位員工每年約 500 人民幣的預算，推出每人 200 人民幣的門檻。硬體限制同樣具體：30 分鐘內出結果、無線傳輸到手機（62.83% 認為非常必要）、預先裝填的一次性碟式卡匣、單次使用的安全性（76.11% 支持），以及以專業場景為優先。法規路徑寫得很具體——取得醫療器材登錄與正式認證是社區採用的前提條件、操作手冊依 POCT 規範撰寫，並以前瞻性臨床試驗納入高風險族群、追蹤 1-2 年以建立一致性與陽性、陰性預測值；階段性路線圖則是頂尖醫院試點、資料驅動的驗證，再爭取納入臨床指引，並明言商業化時程為 3-5 年（普及則需 5-10 年）。整個 wiki 沒有任何 SDG 的主張，對一個以公共衛生為訴求的專案來說，這是一個真正的缺口。限制一節誠實而具體：只有實驗室驗證，沒有大型臨床樣本可供訓練判讀閾值；沒有醫療器材資格；科學傳播計畫仍停留在設計階段；問卷樣本也偏向都市人口。未來工作明確承諾先走臨床試點，再談任何市場擴張。","partners":["Cuiyuan Community Health Service Center, Xihu District, Hangzhou","LC-Bio (Dr Feiran Han)","Multicell Biotech (Dr Qingliang Yang)","Shanghai University of Traditional Chinese Medicine (Prof. Ying Xiao)","Bellevue College / Washington State Department of Health (Erika Ferreri)","AIA Insurance","an IVD companion diagnostic company","a mechanical processing enterprise","Suzhou Science and Technology Town Foreign Language High School","ZJU-China, ZJUT-China, HiZJU-China, Hangzhou-Fourteen-AP, OTIA-Hangzhou, WUXI-DSAS, iZJU-China and ZZU-China iGEM teams"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6263/wiki/hp/h-2.avif","caption":"Interview with oncology clinician Dr Wu Qing, who partially contradicted the patient interviews and moved the team's focus from cost reduction to unambiguous result communication","caption_zh":"與腫瘤科臨床醫師 Wu Qing 的訪談，他部分推翻了病人訪談的結論，使團隊的重心從降低成本轉向不含糊的結果溝通","credit":"Team Bist-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6263/wiki/hp/h-3.avif","caption":"Interview at Cuiyuan Community Health Service Center, Hangzhou, which ended the household self-test positioning and fixed three professional deployment scenarios","caption_zh":"在杭州翠苑社區衛生服務中心的訪談，終結了家用自我檢測的定位，並確定三種專業部署場景","credit":"Team Bist-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6263/wiki/hp/h-5.avif","caption":"Interview with Dr Feiran Han of LC-Bio, who confirmed the dual-biomarker design and advised locking the panel at two markers rather than adding a third","caption_zh":"與 LC-Bio 的 Feiran Han 博士訪談，他確認了雙生物標記的設計，並建議把檢測組合鎖定在兩個標記、不要再加第三個","credit":"Team Bist-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6263/wiki/hp/h-9.avif","caption":"Cross-team communication session with nine Chinese iGEM teams, where a disagreement about validating biology before building hardware was resolved into an explicit re-validation rule","caption_zh":"與九支中國 iGEM 隊伍的跨隊交流，會中對「是否先驗證生物學再做硬體」的分歧，最後收束成一條明確的重新驗證規則","credit":"Team Bist-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Record the advice you declined and why, alongside the advice you took: Bist-China's refusals (short-video outreach beyond their compliance capacity, multi-language deferred to commercialisation) and its openly flagged stakeholder contradictions are what prove the engagement was deliberation rather than endorsement-collection.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把你謝絕的建議與理由，和你採納的建議並列記下來：Bist-China 的拒絕（短影音推廣超出他們的法規遵循能力、多語言支援延到商業化階段再做），以及他們公開標示出的利害關係人意見矛盾，正是證明這場互動是真正的審議，而不是在收集背書。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/bist-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bist-china/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/bist-china/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/bist-china/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/bist-china/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/bist-china/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/bist-china/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/bist-china/results"],"awards_zh":["最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳硬體 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（傳染病 / 治療 / 診斷 / 腫瘤）"],"rank":35},"6264":{"team":"NBJF","id":"6264","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Space / Foundational Advance (Best Village Project nominee; the village is not named on the wiki, but the project is framed as DNA data storage for long-duration spaceflight)","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nbjf/","projectTitle":"AI-assisted de novo design of a thermostable TdT for enzymatic DNA synthesis","projectTitle_zh":"以 AI 輔助 de novo 設計耐熱 TdT，用於酵素式 DNA 合成","tagline":"Redesigning nature's DNA typewriter so information can be written into DNA","tagline_zh":"重新設計自然界的 DNA 打字機，讓資訊得以寫入 DNA","summary":"NBJF tackled the write step of DNA data storage. Enzymatic DNA synthesis using terminal deoxynucleotidyl transferase (TdT) avoids the toxic chemistry of phosphoramidite synthesis, but wild-type TdT has a melting temperature of roughly 40 C and a catalytic pocket that does not accommodate bulky modified nucleotides. Over seven Design-Build-Test-Learn cycles the team built an AI-assisted de novo protein design pipeline (RFdiffusion backbone generation, ProteinMPNN/LigandMPNN inverse folding, ESMFold and AlphaFold refolding checks, TemStaPro and SaProt thermostability scoring), screened a large candidate library down to a shortlist, expressed 85 designs, and obtained a de novo TdT that retains DNA extension activity at elevated temperature and accepts oxyamino-modified nucleotides. A final cycle used 100 ns molecular dynamics at 300/350/400 K to explain why.","summary_zh":"NBJF 處理的是 DNA 資料儲存中的「寫入」這一步。以末端去氧核苷酸轉移酶（TdT）進行酵素式 DNA 合成，可避開亞磷醯胺合成的有毒化學，但野生型 TdT 的熔解溫度只有約 40 °C，催化口袋也容納不下體積龐大的修飾核苷酸。經過七個設計—建構—測試—學習（DBTL）循環，該隊建立了一條 AI 輔助的 de novo 蛋白質設計流程（以 RFdiffusion 生成骨架、以 ProteinMPNN/LigandMPNN 做反向折疊、以 ESMFold 與 AlphaFold 重新折疊檢查、以 TemStaPro 與 SaProt 評分熱穩定性），把龐大的候選函式庫篩到一份短名單，表現 85 個設計，並得到一個在較高溫度下仍保有 DNA 延伸活性、且可接受氧胺基修飾核苷酸的 de novo TdT。最後一個循環以 300/350/400 K 下各 100 ns 的分子動力學模擬解釋其原因。","awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Space / Foundational Advance / Software & AI / Biomanufacturing)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Structure-based generative protein design plus all-atom molecular dynamics, not kinetic modelling. The design loop is: functionally constrained RFdiffusion backbone generation (motif scaffolding, keeping the DNA-binding region and active site as constraints) -> ProteinMPNN/LigandMPNN inverse folding (LigandMPNN used for sequence design in the DNA-containing structural environment) -> ESMFold for structural recovery -> AlphaFold refinement -> TemStaPro (sequence-based) and SaProt (structure-based) thermostability scoring. Cycle 7 is a full biophysics workflow: AlphaFold 3 protein-DNA-dATP-2Mg2+-Na+ complex model, ORCA quantum-chemical geometry optimisation of dATP, RESP charges via Multiwfn, AmberTools parameterisation, ff19SB protein / OL21 DNA / OPC water / GAFF ligand force fields, energy minimisation, NVT heating, NPT density equilibration with gradual restraint release, then 100 ns production runs per system at 300 K, 350 K and 400 K.","frameworks_zh":"以結構為基礎的生成式蛋白質設計，加上全原子分子動力學，而非動力學建模。設計迴圈是：帶功能約束的 RFdiffusion 骨架生成（模體支架化，把 DNA 結合區與活性位點保留為約束條件）-> ProteinMPNN/LigandMPNN 反向折疊（在含 DNA 的結構環境中以 LigandMPNN 做序列設計）-> 以 ESMFold 檢查結構回復 -> AlphaFold 精修 -> 以 TemStaPro（序列為基礎）與 SaProt（結構為基礎）評分熱穩定性。第 7 循環則是一整套生物物理流程：以 AlphaFold 3 建出蛋白質-DNA-dATP-2Mg2+-Na+ 的複合體模型，以 ORCA 做 dATP 的量子化學幾何最佳化，透過 Multiwfn 計算 RESP 電荷，以 AmberTools 參數化，採用 ff19SB 蛋白質／OL21 DNA／OPC 水／GAFF 配體力場，先能量最小化、NVT 升溫、NPT 密度平衡並逐步釋放約束，再對每個系統在 300 K、350 K 與 400 K 下各執行 100 ns 的正式模擬。","dataviz":"Quantitative screening plots rather than decoration: RMSD-versus-pLDDT scatter of the whole candidate library showing the trade-off and the small fraction satisfying both criteria, representative predicted-structure overlays showing the failure mode (compact Rossmann-like folds instead of the open catalytic conformation), and MD analysis panels for RMSD, RMSF, DSSP secondary-structure occupancy, hydrogen-bond counts, radius of gyration, SASA, free-energy landscapes and Markov state model populations. The engineering page also carries a reading-guide layout that routes a non-specialist through four entry points.","dataviz_zh":"是定量的篩選圖而非裝飾：整個候選函式庫的 RMSD 對 pLDDT 散佈圖，顯示兩者的取捨，以及同時滿足兩項標準的小比例；代表性的預測結構疊圖，呈現失效模式（折成緊緻的類 Rossmann 折疊，而不是開放的催化構形）；以及 MD 分析面板，涵蓋 RMSD、RMSF、DSSP 二級結構佔比、氫鍵數、迴轉半徑、SASA、自由能地景與馬可夫狀態模型的族群分布。工程頁面還附有一份閱讀導引版面，為非專業讀者安排四個入口。","datascience":"Library-scale screening with explicit multi-metric criteria instead of a single score: two independent design batches of 100 backbones each, 1,000 inverse-folded sequences per backbone, scored on both RMSD to the design target and pLDDT, yielding 94 candidates meeting both thresholds. Later cycles add cross-model agreement (ESMFold recovery plus two orthogonal thermostability predictors) and a spatial-placeholder strategy to enlarge the catalytic pocket. Experimental side: 85 de novo sequences expressed under one unified B0034/expression framework, 25 giving detectable SDS-PAGE expression - reported as an application dataset rather than a success claim.","datascience_zh":"以函式庫規模篩選，並採明確的多重指標標準而非單一分數：兩批獨立設計各 100 個骨架，每個骨架 1,000 條反向折疊序列，同時以對設計目標的 RMSD 與 pLDDT 評分，產出 94 個同時通過兩項門檻的候選。後續循環再加上跨模型一致性（ESMFold 的結構回復加上兩個互相獨立的熱穩定性預測器）與一項擴大催化口袋的空間佔位策略。實驗端：85 條 de novo 序列在同一套 B0034／表現架構下表現，其中 25 條在 SDS-PAGE 上可偵測到表現——這是以應用資料集的形式呈現，而不是宣稱成功。","software":"No standalone released application, but the team wrote automated scripts chaining backbone generation, sequence design, structural validation, candidate screening and MD analysis, and publish this as a reproducible, scalable de novo protein design workflow explicitly intended to lower the barrier for future iGEM teams. The Software special-award page was not among the project's own pages.","software_zh":"沒有獨立釋出的應用程式，但該隊撰寫了自動化腳本，把骨架生成、序列設計、結構驗證、候選篩選與 MD 分析串接起來，並把它作為一條可重現、可擴展的 de novo 蛋白質設計工作流程公開，明確目的是降低未來 iGEM 隊伍的門檻。軟體特別獎頁面並不在該專案自己的頁面之中。","stack":["RFdiffusion (motif scaffolding)","ProteinMPNN and LigandMPNN","ESMFold","AlphaFold and AlphaFold 3","TemStaPro","SaProt","ORCA (QM geometry optimisation)","Multiwfn (RESP charge fitting)","AmberTools (ff19SB, OL21, OPC, GAFF)","molecular dynamics production runs (100 ns per system)","DSSP, RMSD/RMSF/Rg/SASA analysis, free-energy landscapes, Markov state models","automation scripts for the screening pipeline"],"techniques":["functionally constrained generative backbone design","inverse folding in a ligand/DNA-aware structural context","multi-model cross-screening (fold recovery + two thermostability predictors)","RMSD/pLDDT joint thresholding to filter a large candidate library","spatial placeholder strategy to enlarge a catalytic pocket","temperature-series MD (300/350/400 K) to compare designed vs wild-type protein","Markov state modelling and free-energy landscape analysis of conformational states","closing the loop: computational mechanism analysis run only after wet-lab activity data existed"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A seven-stage education programme that is unusually serious about access rather than reach: synthetic biology classes in schools; accessibility work including sign-language science communication and multilingual courses; creative formats (picture books, board games, art activities); community-specific sessions; digital microlearning; an explicit 'Inclusion and Equal Opportunities in STEM' stage; and international/cross-school scientific exchange. The team also co-built an educational website referenced by ZQT-Nanjing.","publicEngagement_zh":"一個七階段的教育計畫，對「可及性」而非「觸及人數」認真到不尋常：在學校開設合成生物學課程；無障礙工作包括手語科學傳播與多語課程；創意形式（繪本、桌遊、藝術活動）；針對特定社群的場次；數位微學習；一個明確的「STEM 中的包容與機會平等」階段；以及國際與跨校的科學交流。該隊也共同建置了一個教育網站，並被 ZQT-Nanjing 引用。","ihp":"An ASK -> LISTEN -> REFLECT -> INTEGRATE -> EVALUATE framework applied across four milestones, with the team stating up front that they did not want Human Practices to be a photo album. The decisive conversation was with Li Yang, an information-storage professional at Huawei, who pointed out that storage density alone decides nothing and that write/read/reliability/maintenance costs govern adoption - after which the team explicitly abandoned 'build a DNA storage device' and narrowed to the enzymatic-writing bottleneck. Han Minghao (synthetic biology / DNA engineering) then identified TdT thermostability, substrate compatibility and reaction controllability as the specific handles. Later stages cover intellectual property (two lawyers, Zhang and Wu, on who owns an AI-designed protein and on open science versus commercialisation), sustainability (Mr Liao on agricultural production, leading to a stated sustainability position on whether enzymatic synthesis is genuinely greener), and a Responsible AI section. Eight stakeholder categories were mapped.","ihp_zh":"一套 ASK -> LISTEN -> REFLECT -> INTEGRATE -> EVALUATE 的架構，套用於四個里程碑，而該隊開頭就說明他們不想讓 Human Practices 變成一本相簿。關鍵的一場對話來自華為的資訊儲存專業人士李揚，他指出單靠儲存密度決定不了任何事，真正左右採用與否的是寫入、讀取、可靠性與維護成本——此後該隊明確放棄「做一台 DNA 儲存裝置」，收斂到酵素式寫入這個瓶頸。接著韓明昊（合成生物學／DNA 工程）指出 TdT 的熱穩定性、底物相容性與反應可控性是具體的著力點。後續階段涵蓋智慧財產權（兩位律師張、吳討論 AI 設計出的蛋白質歸誰所有，以及開放科學與商業化之間的張力）、永續性（廖先生談農業生產，並促成一段關於酵素式合成是否真的更環保的明確立場），以及一個負責任 AI 的章節。共盤點八類利害關係人。","realWorld":"The project is positioned as a tool-enzyme improvement inside a named industrial bottleneck rather than a finished product, which is the right call and was itself a Human Practices outcome. Deliverables for reuse: six new coding parts (BBa_263ET0E5 De novo TdT as the primary characterised part, plus five sequence-diverse variants BBa_26DIWVPI, BBa_266N6QG1, BBa_26BMB5EM, BBa_26NOOCP1, BBa_26YHUEKK), new application data added to the existing RBS BBa_B0034 documenting its behaviour across a library of 85 artificially designed coding sequences, and the automated de novo design workflow itself. The IP strand is unusually mature for a high-school team: they asked practising lawyers who owns an AI-generated sequence before assuming they could license it.","realWorld_zh":"該專案定位為在一個被指名的產業瓶頸之中改良工具酵素，而不是一個成品，這個判斷是對的，而且本身就是 Human Practices 的成果。可重複使用的交付成果：六個新的編碼元件（BBa_263ET0E5 De novo TdT 為主要經特性化的元件，另有五個序列多樣的變體 BBa_26DIWVPI、BBa_266N6QG1、BBa_26BMB5EM、BBa_26NOOCP1、BBa_26YHUEKK）；為既有的 RBS BBa_B0034 新增應用資料，記錄它在 85 條人工設計編碼序列函式庫中的行為；以及那套自動化的 de novo 設計工作流程本身。智慧財產權這條線對一支高中隊伍而言成熟得不尋常：他們在假設自己可以授權之前，先去問了執業律師 AI 生成的序列歸誰所有。","partners":["Li Yang, Huawei (information storage)","Han Minghao (synthetic biology and DNA engineering)","Lawyer Zhang (research achievements and intellectual property)","Lawyer Wu (open science and technology commercialisation)","Mr Liao (agricultural production / sustainability)","iGEM team ZQT-Nanjing (shared educational website)","partner schools in the cross-school exchange programme"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6264/wiki/engineering/img1.avif","caption":"The seven Design-Build-Test-Learn cycles, from the first unconstrained de novo design through structural reanalysis of wild-type TdT, pocket enlargement, expression screening and the closing molecular-dynamics cycle.","caption_zh":"七個設計—建構—測試—學習循環，從最初無約束的 de novo 設計，經過野生型 TdT 的結構再分析、口袋擴大、表現篩選，到收尾的分子動力學循環。","credit":"Team NBJF, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6264/wiki/description/img4.avif","caption":"'Meet our DNA typewriter': terminal deoxynucleotidyl transferase, the template-independent polymerase the project redesigns for controlled, letter-by-letter DNA writing.","caption_zh":"「來見見我們的 DNA 打字機」：末端去氧核苷酸轉移酶，這個不依賴模板的聚合酶正是本專案為了可控、逐字寫入 DNA 而重新設計的對象。","credit":"Team NBJF, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6264/wiki/contribution/img2.avif","caption":"The reproducible de novo protein design workflow the team released for future iGEM teams, chaining RFdiffusion, ProteinMPNN, LigandMPNN, ESMFold, TemStaPro and SaProt with automation scripts.","caption_zh":"該隊為未來 iGEM 隊伍釋出的可重現 de novo 蛋白質設計工作流程，以自動化腳本串接 RFdiffusion、ProteinMPNN、LigandMPNN、ESMFold、TemStaPro 與 SaProt。","credit":"Team NBJF, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6264/wiki/education/img16.avif","caption":"Education Stage VI, inclusion and equal opportunities in STEM, part of a seven-stage programme that also included sign-language science communication and multilingual courses.","caption_zh":"教育計畫第六階段，STEM 中的包容與機會平等，屬於一個同時包含手語科學傳播與多語課程的七階段計畫。","credit":"Team NBJF, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"This is the ceiling, not the benchmark: the generative-design half (RFdiffusion, ProteinMPNN, ESMFold, AlphaFold, TemStaPro) is genuinely reachable by a strong high-school team in one season because the tools are free, documented and runnable on Colab-class GPUs, but Cycle 7 - ORCA quantum chemistry, RESP charge fitting, four-force-field Amber parameterisation and 100 ns MD at three temperatures with Markov state analysis - is not something students assemble unaided. The limiting factors there are mentorship and compute in that order; a Taiwanese programme could reproduce NBJF's screening pipeline with a laptop and a cloud GPU, but would need a university collaborator to attempt the MD.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"這是天花板，不是基準線：生成設計那一半（RFdiffusion、ProteinMPNN、ESMFold、AlphaFold、TemStaPro）一支強的高中隊伍確實有可能在一季內做到，因為這些工具免費、文件完整，且能在 Colab 等級的 GPU 上執行；但第 7 循環——ORCA 量子化學、RESP 電荷擬合、四套力場的 Amber 參數化，以及三個溫度下各 100 ns 的 MD 加上馬可夫狀態分析——不是學生能獨力組起來的。那一段的限制因素依序是指導與運算資源；台灣的計畫用一台筆電加上雲端 GPU 就能重現 NBJF 的篩選流程，但要嘗試 MD 則需要大學端的合作者。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/nbjf/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nbjf/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/nbjf/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/nbjf/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/nbjf/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/nbjf/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/nbjf/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/nbjf/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/nbjf/notebook"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（太空 / 基礎推進 / 軟體與 AI / 生物製造）"],"rank":14},"6269":{"team":"UZurich","id":"6269","section":"Overgrad","country":"Switzerland","village":"Conservation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/","projectTitle":"SeisMIC","projectTitle_zh":"SeisMIC","tagline":"Stabilising Alpine slopes from within: engineered bacteria precipitate calcite between soil grains, with four linked models deciding where it is worth doing.","tagline_zh":"從內部穩定阿爾卑斯山坡：工程菌在土壤顆粒之間沉積方解石，再由四個互相串接的模型決定哪裡值得施作。","summary":"SeisMIC adapts microbially induced calcite precipitation (MICP) to Alpine slope stabilisation, where heavy rainfall is now 26% more frequent and 12% more intense and concrete anchoring is often out of proportion to the risk. Sporosarcina pasteurii hydrolyses urea so calcium carbonate crystallises around soil particles, filling pores and binding loose grains, and the team worked on the four limits that stop MICP transferring to the Alps: uneven cementation, scaling across large slopes, cold sensitivity and ammonium production. The distinctive contribution is the dry lab, which is a geospatial and economic decision system rather than a protein pipeline: an infinite-slope Factor of Safety model run across all of Switzerland on daily historical rainfall, a PHREEQC reactive transport model of calcite formation down a soil column, a QGIS MICP feasibility map, and an economic model using Flow-Py runout simulation to put a Swiss franc figure on damage avoided. The models are linked to each other and were reshaped by named expert feedback, which is what earned the Best Model nomination.","summary_zh":"SeisMIC 把微生物誘導方解石沉積（MICP）用在阿爾卑斯山區的坡地穩定上；當地強降雨的發生頻率已增加 26%、強度增加 12%，而混凝土錨定工程往往與實際風險不成比例。Sporosarcina pasteurii 水解尿素，使碳酸鈣在土壤顆粒周圍結晶，填滿孔隙並把鬆散顆粒黏結起來；團隊針對 MICP 要移植到阿爾卑斯山區所面臨的四項限制著手：膠結不均、在大面積坡地上的放大問題、對低溫的敏感性，以及銨的生成。最具辨識度的貢獻在乾實驗室，而且它是一套地理空間與經濟的決策系統，不是蛋白質流程：一個以每日歷史降雨資料、在全瑞士範圍執行的無限坡安全係數模型；一個以 PHREEQC 建立、模擬方解石沿土柱形成的反應性傳輸模型；一張 QGIS 的 MICP 可行性地圖；以及一個以 Flow-Py 滑動路徑模擬為基礎、把避免掉的損失換算成瑞士法郎的經濟模型。這些模型彼此串接，並依具名專家的意見反覆修改，這也是它獲得 Best Model 入圍的原因。","awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Model — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Conservation Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Four models, explicitly chained so each one's output is the next one's input. (1) Slope Stability: an infinite-slope model computing the Factor of Safety from effective cohesion, effective friction angle, slope angle, soil unit weight and the pore-pressure ratio, split into a temporal model that drives soil saturation and pore-water pressure from daily historical rainfall through a bucket hydrology scheme and is validated against recorded landslide events, and a spatial model that runs the same calculation Switzerland-wide to find unstable pixels and, crucially, to output the additional effective cohesion MICP would have to supply - a direct, quantitative target the wet lab can be measured against. Root cohesion is modelled as a parallel natural source, with scenarios for bare soil, roots, MICP and roots plus MICP; the modelled unstable share falls from 82.8% to 28.9% under combined roots and MICP, stabilising 65.04% of initially unstable pixels. (2) Reactive Transport: an adaptation of the Razbani et al. model in PHREEQC, simulating a 52 cm sand column as ten stacked cells with bacteria pre-attached to grains and a urea/CaCl2 cementation solution pumped from below over ~52 hours, using Michaelis-Menten ureolysis kinetics (Rmax, Km, initial reactive surface area, biomass decay time td) and calcite precipitation rate constants k1 = 1.55e-6 and k2 = 0.501 mol m-2 s-1, reproducing both continuous-flow and stop-flow experiments; run with the wet lab's own recipe (1.015 M urea, 2 M CaCl2) it showed more than 2 M CaCl2 brings no benefit, and it predicts 77-79% of lab calcite still forms at 4 C, identifying acidic pH rather than temperature as the bigger obstacle. (3) MICP Feasibility: a binary suitability classification in QGIS combining public Swiss soil and terrain layers on stone content, water storage capacity, permeability and slope, giving 67.06% of Switzerland as technically feasible, then overlaid on landslide hazard and on the stability output to produce a MICP Injection Map - 67.32% of modelled unstable pixels fall inside feasible areas. (4) Economic: unstable cells (FoS <= 1) become release areas fed into the open-source Flow-Py gravitational mass-flow model, producing a runout envelope of 425.2 km2 from 568,627 release cells in the mpp = 1.0 scenario (62.0% of canton Glarus, 348.7-425.2 km2 across tested hydrological conditions); historical landslide frequencies and damage costs then give expected annual damage per asset class (roads, buildings, railways, forests, agricultural land), and tracing the highest-damage locations back to their contributing release areas says where treatment would pay. Combined roots and MICP lower estimated annual damage from CHF 583,000 to CHF 351,000, a 39.8% reduction. A directed evolution strand runs alongside, aimed at a non-GMO second strain.","frameworks_zh":"四個模型明確串成一條鏈，每一個的輸出就是下一個的輸入。（1）坡地穩定性：一個無限坡模型，以有效凝聚力、有效內摩擦角、坡角、土壤單位重與孔隙水壓比計算安全係數，並分成兩部分：時間模型以每日歷史降雨透過水桶式水文架構推算土壤飽和度與孔隙水壓，並以已記錄的山崩事件驗證；空間模型則把同一套計算跑遍全瑞士，找出不穩定的像元，而關鍵在於它會輸出 MICP 必須補上的額外有效凝聚力，這是一個可以用來檢驗濕實驗成果的直接量化目標。根系凝聚力被當成另一個平行的自然來源建模，並設定裸土、根系、MICP 以及根系加 MICP 四種情境；在根系加 MICP 的組合下，模型中的不穩定比例從 82.8% 降到 28.9%，使原本不穩定的像元中有 65.04% 變得穩定。（2）反應性傳輸：把 Razbani 等人的模型改寫到 PHREEQC 中，將一根 52 cm 的砂柱模擬成十個堆疊的單元格，細菌預先附著在顆粒上，尿素與 CaCl2 的膠結溶液從底部打入、歷時約 52 小時，採用 Michaelis-Menten 的尿素水解動力學（Rmax、Km、初始反應表面積、生物量衰減時間 td）與方解石沉澱速率常數 k1 = 1.55e-6 與 k2 = 0.501 mol m-2 s-1，可同時再現連續流與停流實驗；以濕實驗自己的配方（1.015 M 尿素、2 M CaCl2）執行時，顯示 CaCl2 超過 2 M 並沒有好處，而且預測在 4 C 下仍可形成實驗室條件 77-79% 的方解石，指出真正較大的障礙是偏酸的 pH 值，而不是溫度。（3）MICP 可行性：在 QGIS 中做二元適宜性分類，結合瑞士公開的土壤與地形圖層（含石率、蓄水容量、透水性與坡度），得出全瑞士 67.06% 的面積在技術上可行，再疊上山崩危害圖與穩定性模型的輸出，產出一張 MICP 注入地圖；模型中的不穩定像元有 67.32% 落在可行區域內。（4）經濟：不穩定的單元格（FoS <= 1）成為崩塌起始區，輸入開放原始碼的 Flow-Py 重力質流模型；在 mpp = 1.0 情境下，568,627 個起始單元產生 425.2 km2 的滑動覆蓋範圍（佔 Glarus 州的 62.0%，在測試過的各種水文條件下為 348.7-425.2 km2）；再結合歷史山崩頻率與損失成本，得出各類資產（道路、建築、鐵路、森林、農地）的年期望損失，並把損失最高的地點回溯到造成它的起始區，指出在哪裡施作最划算。根系加 MICP 的組合把估計年損失從 583,000 瑞士法郎降到 351,000 瑞士法郎，減少 39.8%。另有一條定向演化支線並行進行，目標是做出一株非基因改造的第二菌株。","dataviz":"The modelling work is presented as a prototype decision tool, not a figure dump. An Integrated Dashboard connects slope stability, MICP feasibility, rainfall and potential damage into a single interactive surface for deployment planning, and the team is unusually honest about its state: it currently covers slope stability and selected treatment scenarios and does not yet integrate all four models, so it is labelled a prototype of the intended end-user tool. The model landing page leads with four headline numbers (-53.9% unstable area, 67.06% of Switzerland feasible, 67.32% overlap, -39.8% annual damage, 77-79% calcite at 4 C) each linked to the model that produced it, with arrow navigation between models. Supporting visuals are decision-oriented rather than decorative: unstable share and p95 pore-pressure by canton (which ties instability to the cantonal offices that actually do prevention planning), seasonal cohesion requirements, a required-cohesion histogram, sensitivity analysis, an agreement map against the SilvaProtect reference dataset, and per-asset risk maps for roads, railways, buildings, forest and agricultural land. Derivations are offered as downloadable PDFs (infinite-slope FoS, critical saturation, bucket model) so the maths can be checked independently. An Awards page states plainly which awards the team is claiming and summarises the evidence for each.","dataviz_zh":"建模成果是以一個決策工具的原型來呈現，而不是一堆圖的堆疊。一個整合式儀表板把坡地穩定性、MICP 可行性、降雨與潛在損失串在同一個互動介面上，供施作規劃使用；團隊對它的現況也異常誠實：目前只涵蓋坡地穩定性與部分處理情境，還沒整合全部四個模型，因此標示為預期終端使用者工具的原型。模型首頁一開始就放四個標題數字（不穩定面積 -53.9%、全瑞士 67.06% 可行、67.32% 的重疊、年損失 -39.8%、4 C 下 77-79% 的方解石），每個數字都連到產出它的模型，模型之間也以箭頭導覽。輔助圖表是為決策服務，而不是裝飾：依州別呈現的不穩定比例與第 95 百分位孔隙水壓（把不穩定情形對應到真正負責防災規劃的州級單位）、各季節所需的凝聚力、所需凝聚力的直方圖、敏感度分析、與 SilvaProtect 參考資料集的一致性地圖，以及道路、鐵路、建築、森林與農地的分類資產風險地圖。推導過程以可下載的 PDF 提供（無限坡安全係數、臨界飽和度、水桶模型），讓數學可以被獨立檢查。另有一個獎項頁面明白寫出團隊要爭取哪些獎項，並摘要各項的證據。","datascience":"Their strongest data-science moment is a debugging story they chose to publish. The adapted PHREEQC model initially would not run at all, failing with 'Model failed to converge for initial solution 0'; raising iteration counts, changing tolerances and step size and improving initial guesses did nothing, and removing the calcite-equilibrium constraint made it converge to a physically absurd pH of 1.5. They computed the charge balance at fixed pH from 1 to 12, found it never reached zero, inspected the species and discovered ammonium was almost entirely in its neutral form (5.67e-2 M Amm against 8e-11 M AmmH+) because the reaction AmmH+ = Amm + H+ in the phreeqc.dat database carried no equilibrium constant, so PHREEQC set it to 0 instead of about -9.25; they fixed it with the parameters of the database's own NH4+ = NH3 + H+ reaction. The stated lesson - always check the values a model produces, not just the absence of errors - is the reusable part. The rest of the pipeline is integration work: joining national rainfall records, landslide inventories, digital elevation models, land cover and soil property rasters into one framework, validating predicted instability against recorded events and against SilvaProtect, running sensitivity analyses, and carrying each model's limitations on its own page.","datascience_zh":"他們在資料科學上最強的一刻，是一段自己選擇公開的除錯經歷。改寫後的 PHREEQC 模型起初完全跑不起來，錯誤訊息是 Model failed to converge for initial solution 0；提高迭代次數、改容許誤差與步長、改善初始猜測值全都沒用，而把方解石平衡的限制條件移除後，它收斂到物理上荒謬的 pH 1.5。他們在 pH 1 到 12 的固定值下計算電荷平衡，發現它從來沒有歸零，再檢查各化學種，發現銨幾乎完全以中性形式存在（Amm 為 5.67e-2 M，AmmH+ 只有 8e-11 M），原因是 phreeqc.dat 資料庫中 AmmH+ = Amm + H+ 這個反應沒有帶平衡常數，PHREEQC 因此把它設為 0，而不是約 -9.25；他們用資料庫本身 NH4+ = NH3 + H+ 反應的參數修好了這個問題。他們寫下的教訓才是可以帶走的部分：永遠要檢查模型產出的數值，而不只是確認沒有出現錯誤訊息。流程的其餘部分是整合工作：把全國降雨紀錄、山崩清冊、數值高程模型、土地覆蓋與土壤性質網格圖併進同一個框架，以已記錄事件與 SilvaProtect 驗證預測出的不穩定情形，執行敏感度分析，並在每個模型自己的頁面上列出它的限制。","software":"Code is published: the rainfall-triggered slope instability and MICP modelling at https://github.com/Alizzie/RainfallTriggeredSlopeInstabilityMICP, with the team repository at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/uzurich. They did not build a standalone released application; the deliverables are the four validated models, the nationwide MICP Feasibility Map and MICP Injection Map (which they note did not previously exist for Switzerland in any public form), and the Integrated Dashboard prototype on the wiki. They also published a measurement framework for MICP experiments - biological screening, calcium measurement, powder recovery and soil analysis as several independent readouts rather than one, with assay limitations and validation checks documented so future teams can interpret MICP experiments more reliably.","software_zh":"程式碼已公開：降雨誘發坡地不穩定與 MICP 建模的程式在 https://github.com/Alizzie/RainfallTriggeredSlopeInstabilityMICP，團隊程式庫則在 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/uzurich。他們沒有做出可獨立發布的應用程式；交付成果是四個經驗證的模型、全國範圍的 MICP 可行性地圖與 MICP 注入地圖（他們指出瑞士過去並沒有任何公開形式的同類地圖），以及 wiki 上的整合式儀表板原型。他們也發布了一套 MICP 實驗的量測框架：把生物篩選、鈣含量量測、粉末回收與土壤分析當成幾個獨立的讀值而不是單一指標，並記錄各項分析的限制與驗證檢查，讓後續團隊能更可靠地解讀 MICP 實驗。","stack":["PHREEQC (+ patched phreeqc.dat)","QGIS","Flow-Py","Python","R","Swiss digital elevation and soil/terrain rasters","MeteoSwiss rainfall records and climate scenarios","Swiss landslide inventories","SilvaProtect (validation reference)","GitHub / iGEM GitLab","interactive web dashboard"],"techniques":["infinite-slope Mohr-Coulomb Factor of Safety","bucket hydrology model for antecedent soil moisture","pore-pressure ratio scenario sweeps","back-solving for required additional cohesion as a wet-lab target","root cohesion versus engineered cohesion scenario comparison","Michaelis-Menten ureolysis kinetics in a 1D reactive transport column","charge-balance diagnosis of a thermodynamic database error","sensitivity analysis to identify controlling parameters","binary multi-criteria raster suitability classification","map overlay to find instability-feasibility intersections","gravitational mass-flow runout simulation","expected annual damage (EAD) estimation per asset class","tracing damage back to contributing release areas","validation against an independent national hazard dataset"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education was run as a two-way exchange explicitly tied to the values the team set in its Human Practices work - transparency, honesty, communication and collaboration - and they state that those became practical criteria for how they communicated rather than abstract principles. Social media carried three recurring formats: 'What even is...?' deep dives into a single concept, 'Word of the Week' introducing one piece of terminology at a time without burying readers in project detail, and 'Myth vs. Fact' separating common assumptions about bacteria, biotechnology and climate change from what the evidence supports. In-person work included an Activity Fair stand and workshops, plus ZurichLernt, and across every activity they tried to distinguish three things for their audience: what is already known, what their own project demonstrated, and what they could not investigate within the time and resources available. They brought in a strategic communication professional to test their assumptions about how to build a campaign, since nobody on the team had communications training.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育工作被當成雙向交流來做，並明確連到團隊在人類實踐中設定的價值：透明、誠實、溝通與合作；他們表示這些價值後來變成實際的溝通判準，而不是抽象原則。社群媒體上有三個固定欄目：What even is...? 深入談一個概念、Word of the Week 一次只介紹一個術語而不讓讀者被專案細節淹沒，以及 Myth vs. Fact 把關於細菌、生物技術與氣候變遷的常見假設與證據支持的內容分開。實體活動包括一個 Activity Fair 攤位與工作坊，以及 ZurichLernt；在每一場活動中，他們都試著替受眾區分三件事：哪些是已知的、哪些是他們自己的專案證明的，以及哪些在既有時間與資源下沒能研究。由於隊上沒有人受過傳播訓練，他們還請來一位策略傳播專業人士，檢驗他們對於如何經營一場傳播活動的假設。","ihp":"The interview process itself is the method: prepare (write down why this person, what you hope to learn, which assumptions you want tested, and how their input could change SeisMIC), interview with enough flexibility to follow unexpected leads, then reflect back in an interview log on what actually changed, what challenged an assumption, what new concern it raised and who to speak to next. Stakeholders were mapped on a power-interest matrix used to decide how to approach each one rather than to rank importance, and ELSI was treated as a connected framework rather than three boxes. Concrete changes: a researcher told them to start from the environment rather than the organism rather than defaulting to E. coli because it is well characterised. A pore-scale fluid dynamics researcher listed the parameters no MICP model should omit (temperature, pH, oxygen, ion and calcite concentrations, urea hydrolysis, water saturation) and recommended sensitivity analysis to find which dominate - so they dropped a machine learning idea rather than spending the summer discovering it could not be trained, moved the reactive transport work onto established software instead of a custom implementation, and added the sensitivity analysis. Dr. Joaquin Jimenez-Martinez's feedback changed how they treat temperature, bacterial survival and pH. Stakeholders and their PIs repeatedly asking how much vegetation already contributes is why root cohesion was added to the stability model. A microbiologist corrected their premise directly - ammonia release makes soil more basic, not acidic - sending them back to locate the real problem, and suggested reading pH change around colonies with plate indicators; another suggested nitrification inhibitors to stop nitrate forming. An expert pointed out that innovative biological methods usually fail on political opposition rather than feasibility, technology or financing, and suggested they also consider protected natural areas. They dropped CLIMADA after Prof. David Bresch's guidance and reframed the economic benefit as fewer slope failures. Residents below the slopes said what they value most is the surrounding nature, which made the ecological cost of the treatment something to investigate rather than assume; their hesitation about engineered bacteria eased once biomineralisation was explained as a natural process, which told the team their job is explaining the mechanism rather than defending the idea.","ihp_zh":"訪談流程本身就是方法：先準備（寫下為什麼找這個人、希望學到什麼、想檢驗哪些假設，以及對方的意見可能如何改變 SeisMIC），訪談時保留足夠彈性以追著意外出現的線索走，之後再在訪談紀錄中回顧：實際改變了什麼、哪一項假設受到挑戰、產生了什麼新的顧慮，以及下一個該找誰談。利害關係人以權力與關注度矩陣標定，而這張圖是用來決定該怎麼接觸每一個人，不是用來排重要性；ELSI 也被當成互相連結的框架，而不是三個獨立的盒子。具體的改變：一位研究者告訴他們要從環境出發，而不是從生物出發，不要只因為 E. coli 研究得最清楚就預設使用它。一位研究孔隙尺度流體力學的研究者列出任何 MICP 模型都不該漏掉的參數（溫度、pH、氧氣、離子與方解石濃度、尿素水解、水分飽和度），並建議以敏感度分析找出哪些參數主導全局；於是他們放棄了一個機器學習的想法，而不是花掉整個夏天才發現它根本訓練不起來，也把反應性傳輸的工作搬到成熟的軟體上而不是自己實作，並補上敏感度分析。Dr. Joaquin Jimenez-Martinez 的意見改變了他們處理溫度、細菌存活與 pH 值的方式。利害關係人與他們的指導教授一再問植被本身已經貢獻了多少，這就是穩定性模型加入根系凝聚力的原因。一位微生物學家直接糾正了他們的前提：釋出氨會讓土壤變得更鹼而不是更酸，使他們回頭去找真正的問題所在，並建議用培養皿指示劑讀取菌落周圍的 pH 變化；另一位則建議使用硝化抑制劑來阻止硝酸鹽生成。一位專家指出，創新的生物方法通常敗在政治阻力，而不是可行性、技術或資金，並建議他們也把自然保護區納入考慮。在 Prof. David Bresch 的建議下，他們放棄使用 CLIMADA，並把經濟效益重新表述為坡地破壞次數的減少。住在坡地下方的居民說他們最在意的是周邊的自然環境，這讓處理手段的生態代價成為必須實際調查、而不是憑假設帶過的事；而當生物礦化被解釋成一個自然過程後，他們對工程菌的疑慮也緩和下來，這也讓團隊明白自己的工作是把機制講清楚，而不是替這個想法辯護。","realWorld":"The business case is built on a gap they verified rather than assumed: many at-risk Swiss slopes get no protection because concrete and anchors are disproportionate to the risk, and two cantons, Lucerne and Glarus, independently described exactly such slopes. Interviews with Marco Peyer (Risktec) and Prof. David Bresch (ETH Zurich) moved them off insurers and onto the real decision chain - the canton decides and pays, an engineering office proposes the method, the federal government co-finances - so the customer is cantonal natural-hazard offices and their consulting engineers. The offer is deliberately a bundle: a site-specific treatment delivered together with the modelling that shows how much damage it avoids, because as Ulrich Kaiser pointed out, prevention has a visibility problem - a stabilised slope produces no event, no headline and no credit, while the cost is immediate and concrete, so proving avoided damage has to be part of the product. Interest is reported honestly as interest, not sales: one canton offered to connect them with a suitable slope and another asked to follow the damage model, with the team stating plainly that neither is a customer yet. The roadmap is about five to eight years from lab to a first slope, with Swiss approval staged as lab, then field trial, then market. Risks are named with mitigations: urea run-off requires rinsing (one company converts the run-off to fertiliser) and they are investigating a lower-urea route while stating nothing is settled at field scale; containment is handled by a kill switch plus a second strain adapted by directed evolution without genetic engineering.","realWorld_zh":"商業論證建立在一個經過查證、而不是憑假設的缺口上：瑞士許多有風險的坡地根本沒有任何防護，因為混凝土與錨定工程與風險不成比例，而 Lucerne 與 Glarus 兩州各自獨立描述過正是這樣的坡地。與 Marco Peyer（Risktec）和 Prof. David Bresch（ETH Zurich）的訪談讓他們離開保險公司這條線，轉向真正的決策鏈：由州政府決定並出錢、工程顧問公司提出方法、聯邦政府共同出資，因此客戶是州級的自然災害辦公室及其顧問工程師。他們刻意把產品做成一個組合包：針對場址的處理方案，連同證明它能避免多少損失的建模一起交付；因為正如 Ulrich Kaiser 指出的，預防工作有一個能見度問題：穩定下來的坡地不會發生事件、不會上新聞、也不會有人記功，而成本卻是立即而具體的，所以證明避免了多少損失必須是產品的一部分。外界的興趣也誠實地被描述為興趣，而不是業績：一個州提議幫他們連結一處合適的坡地，另一個州要求持續追蹤損失模型，而團隊明白寫出這兩者都還不是客戶。時程大約是從實驗室到第一處坡地需要五到八年，瑞士的核准流程分為實驗室、田間試驗、再到市場三個階段。風險都指名並附上緩解方式：尿素逕流需要沖洗處理（有一家公司會把逕流轉成肥料），他們也在研究低尿素的路線，同時說明在田間規模上什麼都還沒定案；圍堵則由 kill switch 加上一株以定向演化、不經基因工程改造而適應環境的第二菌株來處理。","partners":["Prof. David Bresch, ETH Zurich (climate risk / economic framing)","Dr. Joaquin Jimenez-Martinez (pore-scale fluid dynamics in MICP)","Marco Peyer, Risktec (natural hazard consulting)","Ulrich Kaiser (economics of prevention)","Canton of Lucerne (natural hazard office)","Canton of Glarus (natural hazard office)","University of Zurich (UZH MNF, ULF, Science Alumni)","Galbiati Stiftung","Alpine residents and farming communities below at-risk slopes"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6269/wiki/stability-model/pipeline-overview.avif","caption":"The slope stability modelling pipeline, which joins rainfall records, landslide inventories, terrain and soil data into an infinite-slope Factor of Safety calculation and outputs the extra cohesion MICP would need to supply.","caption_zh":"坡地穩定性建模流程：把降雨紀錄、山崩清冊、地形與土壤資料併入無限坡安全係數計算，並輸出 MICP 需要補上的額外凝聚力。","credit":"Team UZurich, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6269/wiki/stability-model/stability-interactive.avif","caption":"The interactive slope stability view behind the Integrated Dashboard prototype, which the team presents as a planning tool for deciding where MICP treatment is worth investigating rather than as a finished product.","caption_zh":"整合式儀表板原型背後的互動式坡地穩定性檢視畫面；團隊把它定位為決定哪裡值得進一步評估 MICP 處理的規劃工具，而不是完成品。","credit":"Team UZurich, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6269/wiki/economic-model/risk-map-rounded.avif","caption":"Economic risk map for canton Glarus: Flow-Py runout from unstable release cells combined with historical landslide frequency and damage costs to give expected annual damage by location.","caption_zh":"Glarus 州的經濟風險地圖：以 Flow-Py 從不穩定的起始單元模擬滑動範圍，再結合歷史山崩頻率與損失成本，得出各地點的年期望損失。","credit":"Team UZurich, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6269/wiki/human-practices/education/activity-fair/af1.avif","caption":"The team at their Activity Fair stand, part of an education programme run as two-way exchange and explicitly tied to the transparency and honesty values set in their Human Practices work.","caption_zh":"團隊在 Activity Fair 的攤位；整個教育計畫以雙向交流的方式進行，並明確連結到他們在人類實踐中設定的透明與誠實價值。","credit":"Team UZurich, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Steal their interview discipline, which needs no equipment: before every expert conversation write down why this person, what you hope to learn, which assumption you want tested and how their answer could change the project, then log afterwards what actually changed and who to talk to next - that single loop is what let them kill an untrainable machine learning idea in one conversation instead of losing a summer to it. Their published PHREEQC debugging story is the second lesson worth printing on the wall: a model that runs without errors can still be wrong, so check the values, not just the exit code.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"值得照抄的是他們的訪談紀律，而且完全不需要設備：每一場專家對談之前，先寫下為什麼找這個人、希望學到什麼、想檢驗哪一個假設，以及對方的回答可能如何改變專案；談完之後再記錄實際改變了什麼、下一個該找誰。就是這一個迴圈，讓他們在一次對話中就砍掉一個訓練不起來的機器學習想法，而不是賠掉一整個夏天。他們公開的 PHREEQC 除錯故事是第二個值得貼在牆上的教訓：一個能順利跑完、沒有錯誤訊息的模型，仍然可能是錯的，所以要檢查數值，而不只是看結束代碼。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/stability-model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/reactive-transport-model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/injection-model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/economic-model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/methods/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/directed-evolution/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/measurement/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/human-practices-overview/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/entrepreneurship/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/sustainability/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/contribution/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/awards/"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳模型 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳保育專案 — 入圍"],"rank":98},"6276":{"team":"Michigan","id":"6276","section":"Undergrad","country":"United States","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/michigan/","projectTitle":"MagNav","projectTitle_zh":"MagNav","tagline":"Magnetically steered Magnetospirillum magneticum carrying a heat-triggered therapeutic, with RiboTherm, an MCMC optimiser for RNA thermometers.","tagline_zh":"以磁場導引的 Magnetospirillum magneticum 攜帶熱觸發的治療分子，並搭配 RiboTherm，一套用於 RNA 溫度計的 MCMC 最佳化工具。","summary":"MagNav uses Magnetospirillum magneticum AMB-1, a magnetotactic bacterium that follows external magnetic fields and thrives in low-oxygen environments, as a vector for delivering ClyA into ovarian cancer and endometriotic tissue. Alternating magnetic fields generate heat inside the bacteria, which induces therapeutic expression through a sigma-32 heat shock promoter; because heat shock promoters leak and imprecise expression would damage healthy tissue, the team added an RNA thermometer in the 5' UTR that folds to sequester the Shine-Dalgarno sequence and physically block ribosome binding until the temperature rises. The dry lab built RiboTherm to redesign that thermometer: an open-source Python package that searches 32 designable positions with a Metropolis-Hastings MCMC sampler against a two-term objective combining a ddG-open switching score with a novel Jensen-Shannon ensemble regulariser that keeps the 37 degree C silent state close to the parent. Three designs went to the bench, one (M1) held basal expression below the Neupert U8 parent while still responding at 45 degree C, and the team reports the rest of the comparison with explicit caveats about a single unreplicated blot.","summary_zh":"MagNav 以 Magnetospirillum magneticum AMB-1 作為載體，把 ClyA 遞送到卵巢癌與子宮內膜異位組織；這是一種會循外加磁場移動、且在低氧環境中生長良好的磁趨性細菌。交流磁場在細菌體內產生熱，透過 sigma-32 熱休克啟動子誘導治療蛋白表現；由於熱休克啟動子會滲漏，而表現不精準會傷害健康組織，團隊在 5' UTR 加入一個 RNA 溫度計，使其摺疊後把 Shine-Dalgarno 序列包藏起來，在溫度上升之前以物理方式阻擋核糖體結合。乾實驗打造 RiboTherm 來重新設計這個溫度計：一個開源的 Python 套件，以 Metropolis-Hastings MCMC 取樣器在 32 個可設計位置上搜尋，目標函數由兩項構成，結合 ddG-open 的切換分數與一個新提出的 Jensen-Shannon 系集正則化項，後者讓 37 度 C 的靜默狀態保持接近母序列。三個設計進入實驗驗證，其中 M1 的基礎表現低於 Neupert U8 母序列，同時仍能在 45 度 C 下反應；團隊報告其餘比較結果時，明確加上「只有單一次、未重複的墨點」這項保留。","awards":["Best New Improved Part — Winner (Undergrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"RiboTherm is a standalone open-source Python package built on ViennaRNA (RNAfold/RNAheat and base-pair probability matrices) and distributed as a 30 KB ZIP from the wiki at https://2026.igem.wiki/michigan/downloads/rnatherm-design-main.zip, with installation, directory layout, CLI and a worked example in the repository README. A design campaign is specified entirely in one YAML file, and the package's architecture keeps four things declared independently so any one can be swapped without touching the others: the construct and which positions may mutate, the feature functions that score a candidate, the objective weights that combine them, and the sampler. The team is explicit that their own scientific contribution sits only in the middle two, and that a new feature is registered as a function taking the folded ensemble, the temperatures and a window and returning a number. Each run writes a copy of its own configuration alongside one trajectory file per chain, and stores both feature values rather than only the combined objective, so a campaign can be re-scored at a different lambda without re-folding anything. Null-distribution comparison and final design selection are deliberately left outside the package. No hosted web deployment; wiki repo at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/michigan.","frameworks_zh":"RiboTherm 是一個獨立的開源 Python 套件，建立在 ViennaRNA 之上（RNAfold/RNAheat 與鹼基配對機率矩陣），並以 30 KB 的 ZIP 從 wiki 發布（https://2026.igem.wiki/michigan/downloads/rnatherm-design-main.zip），安裝方式、目錄結構、CLI 與一個完整範例都寫在 repository 的 README 裡。一次設計運算完全由單一 YAML 檔指定，而套件的架構讓四件事各自獨立宣告，因此任何一項都能替換而不必動到其他三項：構築體與可突變的位置、為候選序列評分的特徵函數、把它們組合起來的目標權重，以及取樣器。團隊明確指出自己的科學貢獻只落在中間那兩項，而新的特徵是以一個函數註冊，該函數接收摺疊後的系集、溫度與視窗，並回傳一個數字。每次執行都會把自己的組態複製一份寫出，並為每條鏈各寫一個軌跡檔，且同時儲存兩項特徵值而非只存合併後的目標值，因此一次運算可以在不同的 lambda 下重新評分，完全不必重新摺疊。虛無分布的比較與最終設計的挑選則刻意留在套件之外。沒有架設網頁服務；wiki 的 repository 位於 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/michigan。","dataviz":"The model page is written as a methods paper and figures carry that weight: minimum-free-energy structures of the Neupert U1-U10 thermometers with SD, spacer and start codon colour-coded by role; heat-capacity curves computed with RNAheat plus a two-state test across the Sen et al. library; the correlation between ddG-open and measured fold change as a function of the scoring window half-width; a context-length convergence plot shown on a log scale with and without the base-pair span cap, alongside a full context-by-context pairwise divergence matrix; the Pareto front with 5,000 grey null sequences behind the four design campaigns shaded light to dark by lambda and the three selected designs marked; a figure explaining how a YAML campaign is specified and what it produces; MFE structures of the three designs against the parent with black rings on mutated positions; and the western blot. Every figure caption states what the figure does and does not support.","dataviz_zh":"模型頁面是以方法論文的方式撰寫，圖表也承擔了相應的重量：Neupert U1-U10 溫度計的最小自由能結構，SD、間隔區與起始密碼子依角色上色；以 RNAheat 計算的熱容曲線，加上在 Sen 等人序列庫上的雙態檢驗；ddG-open 與實測倍數變化之間的相關性如何隨評分視窗半寬而變；以對數尺度呈現、分別有與沒有鹼基配對跨距上限的上下文長度收斂圖，旁邊附上完整的上下文對上下文兩兩散度矩陣；Pareto 前沿圖，後方是 5,000 條灰色虛無序列，四次設計運算依 lambda 由淺至深著色，三個被選中的設計都有標示；一張說明 YAML 運算如何指定、以及它產出什麼的圖；三個設計與母序列的 MFE 結構對照，突變位置以黑圈標出；以及那張西方墨點圖。每一張圖說都寫明這張圖支持什麼、不支持什麼。","datascience":"The design space is roughly 4^32, about 2 x 10^19 sequences, which the team notes would take about a year to enumerate even parallelised, so they used a Metropolis-Hastings MCMC optimiser with single-nucleotide uniform proposals. Four campaigns of eight independent chains at 20,000 moves each gave 640,000 scored proposals, 391,835 of them unique. A 5,000-sequence null distribution was built first to calibrate hyperparameters, and it revealed that the two objective terms sit on completely different scales: random sequences score about 0.91 on JS-mean against the parent's 0.0095, nearly two orders of magnitude apart, while ddG-open spans only about +0.5 to -1.8 kcal/mol against the parent's -1.33, with only about 3% of random sequences beating the parent at all. The selection rule was fixed before any results were inspected: beat U8+2GC on ddG-open, then rank by lowest JS-mean. The headline number is published plainly: 335,408 sequences beat the parent on switching, but only 28 of those also beat it on ensemble similarity, which the team presents as the clearest statement of how sharp the Pareto front is. They connect that front to published theory, noting that recent work finds threshold temperature inversely proportional to peak sensitivity in two-state models and that the tradeoff survives in multi-state and branched models. Two methodological choices are documented with their justification. First, the base-pair span is capped at 150 nt throughout, because ViennaRNA's predictions become unreliable beyond roughly 100-200 nt, and applying the cap is what makes truncation defensible: with it, the windowed ensemble converges to 0.0095 at 100 nt of flanking context, while without it the metric never converges, staying between 0.024 and 0.048 at every length because unpredictable long-range pairs keep reshuffling the ensemble. Second, the reference pairing vectors are computed once from the full 1,189 nt construct folded at 37 degree C, not from the truncated layout the sampler scores on, and the team flags this as the detail easiest to get wrong on reimplementation. They also publish an accessibility check that was never used in selection, P(SD unpaired) at 42 over 37 degree C, where all three designs improve on the parent's 1.95x (M1 3.03x, M2 4.78x, M3 4.33x). Limits on the incoming data are stated too: the Sen et al. library used for fitting was measured in a cell-free E. coli extract with no membrane, no chromosomal transcription and a different ribosome and RNase load, so transferring it to living AMB-1 is named as the largest untested assumption carried by the model.","datascience_zh":"設計空間約為 4^32，大約 2 x 10^19 條序列；團隊指出即使平行化，完整列舉也要大約一年，因此他們改用以單核苷酸均勻提議的 Metropolis-Hastings MCMC 最佳化器。四次運算、每次八條獨立鏈、每條鏈 20,000 步，共得到 640,000 個被評分的提議，其中 391,835 個互異。他們先建立一個 5,000 條序列的虛無分布來校正超參數，而這也揭露兩個目標項的尺度完全不同：隨機序列的 JS 平均值約為 0.91，母序列則為 0.0095，相差將近兩個數量級；ddG-open 只橫跨約 +0.5 到 -1.8 kcal/mol，母序列為 -1.33，而隨機序列中只有約 3% 能勝過母序列。篩選規則在檢視任何結果之前就先固定：先在 ddG-open 上勝過 U8+2GC，再依 JS 平均值由低到高排序。主要數字被直白公布：335,408 條序列在切換性上勝過母序列，但其中只有 28 條同時在系集相似度上也勝過它；團隊把這當作對 Pareto 前沿有多陡最清楚的陳述。他們也把這條前沿連回已發表的理論，指出近期研究發現在雙態模型中閾值溫度與峰值靈敏度成反比，而這項取捨在多態與分支模型中依然存在。兩項方法選擇都連同理由記錄下來。第一，鹼基配對跨距全程上限為 150 nt，因為 ViennaRNA 的預測在大約 100-200 nt 之外就不再可靠，而套上這個上限正是截斷之所以站得住腳的原因：有上限時，視窗內的系集在 100 nt 的側翼上下文處收斂到 0.0095；沒有上限時，這個指標從不收斂，在每個長度都停留在 0.024 到 0.048 之間，因為無法預測的長程配對不斷把系集重新洗牌。第二，參考配對向量只計算一次，由完整的 1,189 nt 構築體在 37 度 C 下摺疊得到，而不是取樣器實際評分所用的截斷版本；團隊特別標示這是重新實作時最容易弄錯的細節。他們也公布了一項從未用於挑選的可及性檢查：42 度 C 對 37 度 C 的 P(SD 未配對) 比值，三個設計都勝過母序列的 1.95 倍（M1 為 3.03 倍、M2 為 4.78 倍、M3 為 4.33 倍）。輸入資料的限制同樣寫明：用於擬合的 Sen 等人序列庫是在無細胞的 E. coli 萃取液中量測，沒有膜、沒有染色體轉錄，核糖體與 RNase 的負荷也不同，因此把它移轉到活的 AMB-1 上，被指名為這個模型所承載的最大未經檢驗假設。","software":"The interesting engineering contribution is the Jensen-Shannon ensemble regulariser, which answers a different question from standard RNA inverse design. Rather than asking whether two sequences share a single most stable structure, it fixes a 30-nucleotide window centred on the Shine-Dalgarno sequence, reads each position's in-window pairing-partner distribution off the base-pair probability matrix, renormalises it to a probability distribution (assigning a uniform distribution where in-window pairing probability is negligible rather than leaving it undefined), and takes the mean Jensen-Shannon divergence against the reference. JS was chosen over KL because it is symmetric, always finite even where one distribution puts no weight, zero for identical distributions and bounded above by one bit. The consequence is visible in the results: all three designs fold to an identical MFE structure at both 37 and 42 degree C, so their predicted switching comes entirely from reweighting within the ensemble rather than from a change in the single most stable fold, and the team notes that inverse-design methods matching MFE structures at two temperatures cannot produce these sequences by construction. The structural finding is also reported: all three designs leave the anti-SD, loop and spacer at wild type and remodel only the anti-spacer, a pattern that held across the entire low-JS candidate set, suggesting the other elements of U8+2GC are already near-optimal for this scaffold. M2 is reported as the best-supported design in the sweep, independently rediscovered by two chains under both lambda = 5 and lambda = 10 and visited 45 times. The limits are listed without hedging: the package relies on ViennaRNA equilibrium thermodynamics so anything kinetically controlled is out of reach; it searches by single-nucleotide substitution only so insertions and deletions, including a changed stem length, are unreachable by construction, which the team notes is a real restriction given that the two most differently behaved thermometers in the Sen library differ by a single deletion; it needs a new reference ensemble per construct; runs are not resumable; and a design question involving several interacting switches or a target that cannot be written as a number is out of scope. Three things are named as what must change to apply it elsewhere (rewrite the construct block and rebuild the reference, set the temperatures and base-pair span for the new regime, re-tune the sampler temperature because lambda rescales the objective and the acceptance behaviour with it), with lambda = 0 offered as a pure ddG-open search for systems with no silent reference. The wet-lab validation is reported with unusual restraint: a single western blot without a loading control or replicates, induced at 45 degree C rather than the 42 degree C the designs were optimised for, so only a qualitative ordering is claimed and none of the predicted fold changes can be checked. M3 gave no detectable band in any lane including the 30 degree C control and is read as a construct that did not express, which the team notes cost them the one clean test of the regulariser, since M2 and M3 were matched on ddG-open (-1.851 vs -1.830) and differed mainly in JS-mean (0.0204 vs 0.0166) at only four positions. Of the two results they do claim, the second is qualified as 'an observation rather than evidence' because with n = 2 and a qualitative readout coincidence cannot be excluded. AI use is disclosed: Claude Code helped create the wiki figures and scaffolded much of the RiboTherm code, with all output reviewed before implementation.","software_zh":"最有意思的工程貢獻是 Jensen-Shannon 系集正則化項，它回答的問題與標準的 RNA 逆向設計不同。它不問兩條序列是否共用同一個最穩定結構，而是固定一個以 Shine-Dalgarno 序列為中心、寬 30 個核苷酸的視窗，從鹼基配對機率矩陣讀出每個位置在視窗內的配對對象分布，再把它重新正規化成機率分布（在視窗內配對機率可忽略之處指派均勻分布，而不是讓它未定義），然後取相對於參考的 Jensen-Shannon 散度平均值。選用 JS 而非 KL 的理由是：它對稱、即使其中一個分布在某處完全沒有權重也始終有限、對相同分布為 0，且上界為 1 bit。這個選擇的後果在結果中看得見：三個設計在 37 度 C 與 42 度 C 下都摺疊成完全相同的 MFE 結構，因此它們被預測的切換行為完全來自系集內部的權重重分配，而不是最穩定摺疊構型的改變；團隊並指出，在兩個溫度下以匹配 MFE 結構為目標的逆向設計方法，在設計原理上根本不可能產生這些序列。結構上的發現也一併報告：三個設計都讓 anti-SD、環區與間隔區維持野生型，只重塑 anti-spacer，而這個模式在整個低 JS 候選集合中一致出現，顯示 U8+2GC 的其他元件對這個骨架而言已接近最佳。M2 被報告為整次搜尋中證據最充分的設計，在 lambda = 5 與 lambda = 10 兩種設定下都被兩條鏈獨立重新找到，並被造訪 45 次。限制則毫不迴避地列出：套件依賴 ViennaRNA 的平衡熱力學，因此任何受動力學控制的現象都無法觸及；它只以單核苷酸置換搜尋，所以插入與刪除（包括改變莖長）在設計原理上就無法到達，而團隊指出這是一項真實的限制，因為 Sen 序列庫中行為差異最大的兩個溫度計正好只差一個刪除；它對每個構築體都需要一份新的參考系集；執行過程無法續跑；而涉及多個交互作用開關、或目標無法寫成一個數字的設計問題，則不在適用範圍內。要把它套用到別處，必須改變的三件事被明確點名（改寫 construct 區塊並重建參考、為新的條件設定溫度與鹼基配對跨距、重新調校取樣器溫度，因為 lambda 會把目標函數連同接受行為一起重新縮放），並提供 lambda = 0 作為純 ddG-open 搜尋，供沒有靜默參考的系統使用。濕實驗驗證以罕見的節制來報告：只有一次西方墨點，沒有上樣對照也沒有重複，而且是在 45 度 C 下誘導，但設計最佳化的目標溫度是 42 度 C，因此只主張定性的排序，所有被預測的倍數變化都無法檢核。M3 在包括 30 度 C 對照在內的每一道都沒有可偵測的條帶，被判讀為一個沒有表現的構築體；團隊指出這讓他們失去唯一一次對正則化項的乾淨檢驗，因為 M2 與 M3 在 ddG-open 上相當（-1.851 對 -1.830），主要差異在 JS 平均值（0.0204 對 0.0166），且只差四個位置。他們確實主張的兩項結果中，第二項被限定為「一項觀察而非證據」，因為在 n = 2 且讀值為定性的情況下，無法排除巧合。AI 使用也有揭露：Claude Code 協助製作 wiki 圖表，並為 RiboTherm 的大部分程式碼搭起骨架，所有產出在實作前都經過審閱。","stack":["Python","ViennaRNA (RNAfold, RNAheat, base-pair probability matrices)","NUPACK (reference literature method)","YAML campaign configuration","numpy/scipy-style numerics","ZIP source distribution","iGEM GitLab (wiki repo)"],"techniques":["Metropolis-Hastings MCMC discrete sequence optimisation","custom two-term objective with weighted regularisation","Jensen-Shannon divergence over per-position base-pair-probability distributions","ddG-open ensemble free-energy difference between temperatures","partition-function and heat-capacity (Cp) based melting-temperature estimation","two-state van't Hoff fitting","synthetic melt curves from base-pair probability matrices","null distribution construction for hyperparameter calibration","Pareto front analysis","base-pair span capping for folding-model reliability","sequence-context convergence testing","pre-registered selection rule","western blot qualitative validation"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"MSBTalks is a multimedia podcast series of recorded in-person and Zoom conversations with experts across synthetic biology, cancer biology, reproductive health, microbiology, chemical engineering and biophysics, published on the team's YouTube channel. The stated motive is unusual: the team modelled the episodes on office-hours conversations and published them specifically to show students what approaching an expert looks like, because they knew from their own experience how much nervousness precedes those meetings. Additional accessible outputs include a pre-printed manuscript, a videogame and a physical modeling kit.","publicEngagement_zh":"MSBTalks 是一個多媒體播客系列，收錄與合成生物學、癌症生物學、生殖健康、微生物學、化學工程與生物物理學各領域專家的實體與 Zoom 對談，發布在團隊的 YouTube 頻道。其動機並不常見：團隊是以教授 office hours 的對話為原型來設計每一集，並特意公開，目的是讓學生看見主動接觸專家實際上是什麼樣子，因為他們從自身經驗知道這類會面之前有多緊張。其他可取用的產出還包括一份預印稿、一款電玩遊戲與一套實體建模套件。","ihp":"Human practices was framed around the fact that live-bacteria therapeutics attract scrutiny because bacteria are associated with contamination and infection rather than benefit, so the team worked through the bioethical considerations and then tested MagNav's framing with stakeholders. Expert conversations changed specific things. Dr. Costas Lyssiotis (Maisel Professor of Oncology, Michigan) agreed that localisation and specificity were the most important goal, told them the novelty of magnetically guided treatment meant AMB-1's magnetotaxis would need thorough characterisation, and told them to spell out why injecting AMB-1 near a tumour would not cause infection or sepsis; he also pushed them to hold the wiki to publication standards. Dr. Nicole Koropatkin (Microbiology and Immunology, Michigan) advised fusing synthetic surface proteins to small native proteins already known to localise where needed, and on working with a strain like AMB-1 that resists standard transformation. Dr. Geoffrey Greene (Ben May Department for Cancer Research, Chicago) endorsed the two-step targeting approach of hypoxia plus folate-receptor-alpha binding because combining two steps reduces off-target effects, and was sceptical of selective estrogen receptor degraders.","ihp_zh":"整合式人類實踐的框架建立在一個事實上：活菌療法之所以招來審視，是因為細菌讓人聯想到污染與感染而非益處；因此團隊先梳理生物倫理上的考量，再把 MagNav 的論述框架拿去與利害關係人檢驗。專家對談改變了具體的事。Dr. Costas Lyssiotis（密西根大學 Maisel 腫瘤學講座教授）同意局部定位與專一性是最重要的目標，並告訴他們磁場導引治療的新穎性意味著 AMB-1 的磁趨性需要徹底的特性分析，也要他們寫清楚為什麼在腫瘤附近注射 AMB-1 不會造成感染或敗血症；他同時督促他們把 wiki 做到可發表的水準。Dr. Nicole Koropatkin（密西根大學微生物與免疫學）建議把合成的表面蛋白融合到已知會定位至所需位置的小型原生蛋白上，並就如何操作像 AMB-1 這類抗拒標準轉形程序的菌株提供意見。Dr. Geoffrey Greene（芝加哥大學 Ben May 癌症研究部）支持低氧加上葉酸受體 alpha 結合的兩段式標靶策略，因為結合兩道步驟可降低非目標效應，但他對選擇性雌激素受體降解劑持懷疑態度。","realWorld":"The problem is framed with cited figures: over 21,000 estimated new US ovarian cancer diagnoses in 2026, a 52% five-year relative survival rate for 2016-2022, 190 million reproductive-aged women affected by endometriosis worldwide, and an average 6.7-year endometriosis diagnostic delay for patients aged 18-45. MagNav is positioned as a modular and more precise alternative or addition to existing standards of care rather than a replacement, potentially usable alongside existing medication and surgery, and the team notes that novel therapies take years to become accessible. The customisable framework is presented as extensible to other cancers and reproductive diseases by changing the payload and targeting ligand.","realWorld_zh":"問題的框架附有引用數字：2026 年美國估計超過 21,000 例新確診卵巢癌、2016-2022 年的五年相對存活率為 52%、全球有 1.9 億名生育年齡女性受子宮內膜異位症影響，以及 18-45 歲患者平均 6.7 年的子宮內膜異位症確診延遲。MagNav 被定位為現行標準治療的模組化、更精準的替代或補充方案，而不是取代，可能與現有藥物與手術並用；團隊也指出新療法要變得可及需要數年。這套可客製化的框架被呈現為可延伸到其他癌症與生殖疾病，只需更換負載與標靶配體。","partners":["University of Michigan Medical School (Rogel Center for Pancreatic Cancer; Microbiology and Immunology)","Ben May Department for Cancer Research, University of Chicago","Michigan Synthetic Biology Team / University of Michigan"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6276/wiki/wiki2-model-final-008.webp","caption":"The Pareto front between switching (ddG-open) and basal expression (JS-mean): 5,000 grey null sequences behind four design campaigns shaded by lambda, with the three selected designs marked on the low-JS end.","caption_zh":"切換性（ddG-open）與基礎表現（JS 平均值）之間的 Pareto 前沿：5,000 條灰色虛無序列在後，四次設計運算依 lambda 著色，三個被選中的設計標示在低 JS 的一端。","credit":"Team Michigan, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6276/wiki/wiki2-model-final-009.webp","caption":"How a RiboTherm design campaign is specified: one YAML file declaring construct, features, objective weights and sampler independently, running eight chains and writing both feature values so a campaign can be re-scored without re-folding.","caption_zh":"一次 RiboTherm 設計運算如何指定：單一 YAML 檔各自獨立宣告構築體、特徵、目標權重與取樣器，執行八條鏈，並同時寫出兩項特徵值，使運算可在不重新摺疊的情況下重新評分。","credit":"Team Michigan, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6276/wiki/wiki2-model-final-007.webp","caption":"Choosing how much sequence context to fold: with the base-pair span capped at 150 nt the windowed ensemble converges by 100 nt of flanking context, while without the cap it never converges.","caption_zh":"要摺疊多少序列上下文：把鹼基配對跨距上限設為 150 nt 時，視窗內的系集在 100 nt 的側翼上下文處即收斂；沒有這個上限則永不收斂。","credit":"Team Michigan, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6276/wiki/wiki2-model-final-011.webp","caption":"Western blot against ClyA for the three RiboTherm designs and the two reference constructs, a single run without a loading control or replicates, with M3 giving no detectable band in any lane.","caption_zh":"針對三個 RiboTherm 設計與兩個參考構築體、以 ClyA 為標的的西方墨點，單一次執行，沒有上樣對照也沒有重複，其中 M3 在任何一道都沒有可偵測的條帶。","credit":"Team Michigan, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Fix the selection rule before looking at any results, then publish the number that shows how hard the problem is: 335,408 of 391,835 sequences beat the parent on switching but only 28 also beat it on ensemble similarity, which turns an optimisation run into a statement about the design space rather than a list of winners. Also copy their habit of justifying a computational shortcut by showing what happens without it, as with the 150 nt base-pair span cap that is the only reason truncated folding converges at all.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"在看到任何結果之前就先把篩選規則定下來，然後公布那個能顯示問題有多難的數字：391,835 條序列中有 335,408 條在切換性上勝過母序列，但其中只有 28 條同時在系集相似度上也勝過它，這讓一次最佳化運算從一份贏家名單變成一項關於設計空間的陳述。同樣值得照做的是他們為計算捷徑提出理由的習慣：直接展示不用它會發生什麼事，就像 150 nt 的鹼基配對跨距上限，那正是截斷後的摺疊計算之所以能收斂的唯一原因。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/michigan/","https://2026.igem.wiki/michigan/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/michigan/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/michigan/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/michigan/downloads/rnatherm-design-main.zip","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/michigan"],"awards_zh":["最佳改良元件 — 得主（大學組）"],"rank":26},"6278":{"team":"Stanford University","id":"6278","section":"Undergrad","country":"USA","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/stanford-university/","projectTitle":"KelePatch","tagline":"A logic-gated, cell-state-specific RNA therapy for keloid scars, delivered by a microneedle patch shaped to the wound.","summary":"KelePatch builds an ADAR-based RADAR RNA sensor that only switches on inside keloid myofibroblasts, so a therapeutic payload is produced in diseased cells and not in healthy skin. The team designed a 26-part modular sensor collection across five fibrosis transcripts (ADAM12, POSTN, ASPN, COL11A1, SPP1), validated them in HEK293 cells, combined the two best into a dual-input AND gate for extra selectivity, and tested in healthy dermal fibroblasts and keloid-derived fibroblasts; they also paired a sensor with Cas12a2 to show the output is not limited to fluorescent reporters. Alongside the wet lab they built RADAR-Scout, a published web platform that takes a cell type and a gene and returns a ranked, structure-aware list of RADAR sensor candidates plus a mechanistic simulation of how it will behave. It won the Grand Prize because every layer connects: 960,518 single cells of transcriptomics pick the trigger, ViennaRNA folding energy ranks the sensor, ODE models explain the delay they saw at the bench, and a U-Net++ computer vision pipeline turns a photo of a scar into a 3D-printable patch.","awards":["Grand Prize Winner (Undergrad)","Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Model — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Therapeutics Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Four stacked layers. (1) Single-cell transcriptomics at scale: a processing pipeline integrating 26 scRNA-seq cohorts across cardiac, cutaneous, renal, hepatic and pulmonary fibrosis - 960,518 cells and 1,728 donor-population observations from CELLxGENE, CELLxGENE Census and GEO - with donor-level statistics averaged at equal donor weight so large-cell-count donors do not dominate. Rather than ordinary differential expression, they score each candidate across three populations (Pathological, Healthy, Bystander) to ask whether a transcript is abundant in the target cell and absent from neighbours, which is what an intracellular sensor actually requires. (2) RNA structure prediction: 19 predictors computed with ViennaRNA 2.7.2 (RNAfold for MFE and ensembles, RNApfold for per-nucleotide unpaired probability, RNAcofold for the sensor-trigger duplex) spanning sequence composition, secondary structure, accessibility and hybridization. (3) Mechanistic kinetics: five interconnected deterministic mass-action ODE models with a stochastic counterpart, covering plasmid nuclear entry, single-trigger plasmid, single-trigger RNA, AND-gate plasmid and AND-gate RNA delivery, built on Ligon et al.'s lipoplex delivery cascade with occupancy resolved into nine pit states and ten endosome states; 82 parameters are tabulated with provenance, and four are fitted by simulated annealing in Python against Cohen et al.'s qPCR nuclear copy-number data (p_entry = 0.107, K_sat = 232, k_TX = 0.273). A nine-state hybridization/editing scheme tracks the joint status of both AND-gate sites. (4) Device physics: finite element analysis using Fick's law, the Stokes-Einstein relation and Darcy's law for LNP diffusion through keloid extracellular matrix, plus a nociceptor-count model for pain.","dataviz":"RADAR-Scout is the visualization: a deployed web app (https://radar-scout.vercel.app/, with a companion dashboard at https://radar-scout-dashboard.vercel.app/) where the keloid view ranks 600 filtered genes across five cohorts on the left and plots every candidate sensor for the selected gene on the right, so a target and a sensor are chosen in the same screen, with filters for region type, codon variant, duplex length and isoform, and shortlist/CSV export. Changing the selected tissue reruns the isoform analysis live. The wiki itself is a hand-built site with per-page accent colours and mascot illustrations, and the modelling page is written so a reader can follow each decision: predictor correlations are shown three ways (full Spearman matrix at n = 24, per-replicate rho, then all predictors ranked) and the team states plainly that non-significant predictors are 'unresolved at n = 24 rather than confirmed null'. Parameter tables flag which values are fitted, which are placeholders, and which disagreements remain unresolved.","datascience":"The core result is a replacement for a field convention. The informal RADAR design guideline was to pick the candidate with the lowest GC content. Stanford built a 5x5 experimental library of 25 sensors, measured them by flow cytometry in HEK293 across two replicates (r = 0.94), gated the top 5% mCherry-positive cells and took geometric-mean GFP / geometric-mean mCherry as the output metric, then correlated 19 computational predictors against it. Sensor partition-function folding free energy reached Spearman rho = 0.62-0.63, against -0.29 for GC content and -0.31 for longest homopolymer - so folding energy, not composition, became the ranking filter inside RADAR-Scout. They were honest about what failed: linear, Ridge and Elastic Net regression on the same features reached only Q2 = 0.20, which is explicitly what pushed them from statistical fitting to mechanistic ODEs. Cross-organ analysis of the top 300 genes per organ found 857 of 1,136 distinct genes appeared in only one organ and pairwise Jaccard similarity of 0.050-0.145, so they rejected the idea of a universal fibrosis biomarker set. Isoform filtering uses GTEx Oxford Nanopore long-read data (~150,000 transcripts, 92 samples, 15 tissues) to check the trigger sequence is actually present in the isoforms that cell type expresses.","software":"RADAR-Scout, live at https://radar-scout.vercel.app/ with a dashboard at https://radar-scout-dashboard.vercel.app/. It solves a real engineering problem: the Gao lab's published RADAR candidate table has roughly 7 million rows and could not be held in memory, so build_database.py ingests human_RADAR_sensor_candidates.csv.gz into a SQLite database in 100,000-row chunks with an index on the gene column, and the app queries it read-only with 50 candidates per API page. The computer vision pipeline for personalized microneedle patches uses a U-Net++ with a ResNet34 encoder (from segmentation_models.pytorch) to segment keloid wound photographs, then drives the Autodesk Fusion 360 API to emit a CAD/STL file for 3D printing. Separately, SynBase (https://synbase.web.app/home.html) is a released, free, account-based online learning platform. Parts: 26 modular RADAR parts including 15 functional sensors across five transcripts, novel composite synthetic triggers that each test an entire sensor panel for one gene, a dual-input AND gate, and T7 in vitro transcribed capped polyadenylated mRNA versions.","stack":["ViennaRNA 2.7.2 (RNAfold, RNApfold, RNAcofold)","CELLxGENE / CELLxGENE Census","GEO (GSE163973, GSE181316)","Human Dermal Fibroblast Atlas","GTEx long-read (Oxford Nanopore) RNA-seq","Ensembl / GENCODE annotations","Python","SQLite","Vercel","U-Net++ with ResNet34 encoder (segmentation_models.pytorch)","Autodesk Fusion 360 API","Benchling","Firebase (SynBase)"],"techniques":["Deterministic mass-action ODE modelling","Stochastic (occupancy-resolved) simulation","Simulated annealing parameter fitting","Quasi-steady-state approximation for competitive ADAR binding","Nine-state hybridization/editing state machine","Differential expression with pathological/healthy/bystander contrast","Isoform-level expression filtering","RNA minimum free energy and partition-function analysis","Spearman and Pearson predictor screening","Linear/Ridge/Elastic Net regression (reported as insufficient)","Jaccard similarity for cross-organ overlap","Flow cytometry gating (95th percentile mCherry)","Finite element analysis (Fick, Stokes-Einstein, Darcy)","Semantic image segmentation","Parametric CAD generation"],"frameworks_zh":"四個堆疊的層次。(1) 大規模單細胞轉錄體學：一條處理管線整合了心臟、皮膚、腎臟、肝臟與肺部纖維化的 26 個 scRNA-seq 世代資料——來自 CELLxGENE、CELLxGENE Census 與 GEO 的 960,518 個細胞與 1,728 筆捐贈者—族群觀測——並以等權重的捐贈者層級統計平均，避免細胞數多的捐贈者主導結果。他們沒有採用一般的差異表現分析，而是把每個候選在三個族群（病理、健康、旁觀者）上評分，問的是某個轉錄本是否在目標細胞中豐富、同時在鄰近細胞中缺席——這才是細胞內感測器真正需要的條件。(2) RNA 結構預測：以 ViennaRNA 2.7.2 計算 19 個預測因子（RNAfold 算 MFE 與集合、RNApfold 算每個核苷酸的未配對機率、RNAcofold 算感測器—觸發序列雙股），涵蓋序列組成、二級結構、可及性與雜合。(3) 機制動力學：五個互相連接的確定性質量作用 ODE 模型，外加一個隨機版本，涵蓋質體進入細胞核、單觸發質體、單觸發 RNA、AND 閘質體與 AND 閘 RNA 遞送，建立在 Ligon 等人的 lipoplex 遞送串級之上，並把佔據狀態細分為九個凹陷狀態與十個內體狀態；82 個參數連同出處一併列表，其中四個以 Python 的模擬退火對照 Cohen 等人的 qPCR 核內複本數資料擬合（p_entry = 0.107、K_sat = 232、k_TX = 0.273）。一套九狀態的雜合／編輯方案則追蹤 AND 閘兩個位點的聯合狀態。(4) 裝置物理：以有限元素分析，運用 Fick 定律、Stokes-Einstein 關係式與 Darcy 定律，模擬 LNP 在蟹足腫細胞外基質中的擴散，另有一個以痛覺受器數量估算疼痛的模型。","dataviz_zh":"RADAR-Scout 本身就是視覺化成果：一個已部署的網頁應用（https://radar-scout.vercel.app/ ，另有搭配的儀表板 https://radar-scout-dashboard.vercel.app/ ），在蟹足腫檢視中，左側把 600 個經篩選的基因在五個世代資料上排序，右側則繪出所選基因的每一個候選感測器，因此標的與感測器在同一個畫面中選定；並可依區域類型、密碼子變異、雙股長度與異構物篩選，支援候選名單與 CSV 匯出。切換所選組織會即時重跑異構物分析。wiki 本身是手工打造的網站，各頁有自己的輔色與吉祥物插畫，而建模頁面的寫法讓讀者能跟上每一個決定：預測因子的相關性以三種方式呈現（n = 24 的完整 Spearman 矩陣、各重複的 rho，以及所有預測因子的排序），團隊也直言未達顯著的預測因子是「在 n = 24 下尚未釐清，而非已確認為無效」。參數表標示哪些值是擬合而來、哪些是暫代值，以及哪些矛盾仍未解決。","datascience_zh":"核心成果是取代了一個領域慣例。RADAR 設計的非正式準則原本是挑 GC 含量最低的候選。Stanford 建了一個 5x5 的 25 個感測器實驗庫，在 HEK293 中以流式細胞儀量測、做兩次重複（r = 0.94），篩選 mCherry 陽性最高 5% 的細胞，並以 GFP 幾何平均值／mCherry 幾何平均值作為輸出指標，再把 19 個計算預測因子與之做相關分析。感測器的分配函數摺疊自由能達到 Spearman rho = 0.62-0.63，而 GC 含量只有 -0.29、最長同聚物為 -0.31——因此 RADAR-Scout 內部的排序濾器用的是摺疊能量，而不是序列組成。他們對失敗的部分也很誠實：用同一組特徵做線性、Ridge 與 Elastic Net 回歸只達到 Q2 = 0.20，而這正是把他們從統計擬合推向機制式 ODE 的原因。各器官前 300 個基因的跨器官分析發現，1,136 個不同基因中有 857 個只出現在單一器官，兩兩 Jaccard 相似度僅 0.050-0.145，因此他們否定了「存在一組通用纖維化生物標記」的想法。異構物篩選使用 GTEx 的 Oxford Nanopore 長讀資料（約 150,000 個轉錄本、92 個樣本、15 種組織），確認觸發序列真的存在於該細胞類型所表現的異構物中。","software_zh":"RADAR-Scout 已上線於 https://radar-scout.vercel.app/ ，儀表板在 https://radar-scout-dashboard.vercel.app/ 。它解決了一個真實的工程問題：Gao 實驗室已發表的 RADAR 候選表格約有 700 萬列，無法全部放進記憶體，因此 build_database.py 以每 100,000 列為一塊，把 human_RADAR_sensor_candidates.csv.gz 匯入 SQLite 資料庫並在 gene 欄位建索引，應用程式則以唯讀方式查詢、每個 API 分頁回傳 50 個候選。個人化微針貼片的電腦視覺管線使用 U-Net++ 搭配 ResNet34 編碼器（來自 segmentation_models.pytorch）分割蟹足腫傷口照片，再驅動 Autodesk Fusion 360 API 輸出可 3D 列印的 CAD/STL 檔。另外，SynBase（https://synbase.web.app/home.html ）是一個已釋出、免費、需註冊帳號的線上學習平台。部件方面：26 個模組化 RADAR 部件，包括橫跨五個轉錄本的 15 個功能性感測器、能一次測試某基因整組感測器的新型複合合成觸發序列、一個雙輸入 AND 閘，以及以 T7 體外轉錄、加帽並加多腺苷酸尾的 mRNA 版本。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Two deliberately linked programmes. SiBRP (Stanford iGEM Bioengineering Research Program) is a free, fully online three-week bioengineering bootcamp for high school students and incoming freshmen, with nine synchronous two-hour sessions plus three supplemental ones, progressing from molecular biology fundamentals through biodesign, genetic circuit design, plasmid design and experimental workflow to entrepreneurship and ethics. Students work in small groups to produce a full research proposal with literature review and experimental design, submitted as a draft, returned with TA feedback, then revised against a published rubric. It drew nearly 5,000 applications from all 50 US states and over 100 countries (up from 321 in its first year), with two-thirds of applicants female and over 60% from low-income and first-generation backgrounds; 230 participated. Nine guest speakers included iGEM co-founder Drew Endy. Because mentored capacity could not meet demand, the team converted the whole curriculum into SynBase (https://synbase.web.app/home.html) - 'Khan Academy, but for synthetic biology' - nine self-paced modules with accounts that save progress, knowledge checks, interactive activities and discussion boards, no application and no deadline, free worldwide. As of 17 October 2026 it had 750+ registered learners and 650+ free-response discussion contributions, with dry lab modules in development, and the team explicitly invites other iGEM teams to use or adapt it for onboarding their own members.","ihp":"The team was trained in Stanford's Biodesign process by Dr Ross Venook, who told them that biodesign means shadowing clinicians rather than searching online, and they built the whole project around that. Ideation ran as a weekly discipline: every member interviewed one person a week - over twenty conversations with professors, researchers and people in their lives - and a team member's experience with ReSurge, an NGO training reconstructive surgeons abroad, surfaced the statistic that 30% of global disease burden is surgical and reframed abnormal scarring as an access problem. Professor Fan Yang told them burns and keloids are separate research areas and doing both would muddle the work, so they picked one. At the Stanford BIOME Shark Tank they pitched to eight judges (faculty, investors, biotech entrepreneurs) who returned written scorecards; the published response table shows each criticism and what they did, including a judge's suggestion to build an AI-CAD platform for microneedles, which became the U-Net++ segmentation-to-Fusion-360 pipeline. When they looked for keloid patient advocacy groups there were almost none, and the one foundation that replied told them to talk to clinicians instead - the team says plainly that physicians cannot stand in for patients' lived experience and documents this as a second-best route. They then contacted 28 Stanford dermatologists and plastic surgeons and interviewed seven, with a standard instrument of Likert-scale ranking statements plus specialty-specific open questions. Three concerns recurred - recurrence within two years, pain and inconvenience of repeated injections, and difficulty getting drug into dense scar tissue - and each changed the design: Dr Teng's point that late-stage keloids are far harder to treat moved the target from prevention to established keloids; Dr Li's recommendation of collagen-scaffold fibroblast and hydrogel mechanotransduction assays changed the validation plan; physicians' complaint about repeated injections, plus Dr Li's endorsement of a patch, drove the wound-shaped microneedle array, held at 900 um because needles over 1000 um are documented to cause bleeding and pain. Dr Miranda consulted her own network on whether viral-derived parts are inflammatory, and the team decided against combining saRADAR with RNA export machinery as a result. With no animal model for keloids (they occur only in humans), they met Genoskin about their ex vivo human skin models and identified that as the next safety step.","realWorld":"The team was explicit at the Shark Tank that a target product profile was secondary to characterising a modular sensor platform other teams and scientists can reuse, and the contribution page is written as a handoff: swap the sensor region for a new transcript, add a second input as an AND gate, deliver as DNA or RNA, attach your own payload. The clinical path is staged and named - validate the Gao lab sensors and their own in HEK293, validate the AND gate, move to keloid and normal human fibroblast lines, add payload, then terminal assay in Genoskin's ex vivo human skin model for immunotoxicity, phenotypic and transcriptomic readouts - and Genoskin representatives engaged and advised on how to run it. The Cas12a2 payload work and the in vitro transcribed mRNA format are both framed as moving toward the form a real therapy would take rather than a reporter demo. SynBase is maintained beyond the competition as a continuing programme rather than a competition artefact.","partners":["ReSurge International","Genoskin","Stanford Biodesign","Stanford Hospital Department of Dermatology","Stanford Department of Plastic and Reconstructive Surgery","Stanford BIOME (Biological Interdisciplinary Open Maker Environment)","Bay Area Bioengineering Symposium","Stanford Arc Institute","Gao Lab (RADAR technology)","Covert Lab","CELLxGENE / Chan Zuckerberg Initiative","GTEx Consortium"],"publicEngagement_zh":"兩個刻意相連的計畫。SiBRP（Stanford iGEM Bioengineering Research Program）是為高中生與即將入學大一新生開設的免費、全線上三週生物工程密集課程，含九堂兩小時同步課程加三堂補充課，從分子生物學基礎一路推進到 biodesign、基因迴路設計、質體設計與實驗流程，再到創業與倫理。學生分小組完成一份完整的研究提案，含文獻回顧與實驗設計，先交草稿、由助教回饋，再依公開的評分量表修改。它吸引了來自美國全部 50 州與 100 多個國家、將近 5,000 份申請（第一年僅 321 份），其中三分之二為女性、超過 60% 來自低收入與家中第一代大學生背景；最終 230 人參與。九位客座講者包括 iGEM 共同創辦人 Drew Endy。由於有導師帶領的容量跟不上需求，團隊把整套課程轉化為 SynBase（https://synbase.web.app/home.html ）——「合成生物學版的可汗學院」——九個可自訂進度的模組，帳號會保存學習進度，含知識檢核、互動活動與討論區，無須申請、沒有截止日期，全球免費。至 2026 年 10 月 17 日已有 750 位以上註冊學習者與 650 則以上的開放式討論貢獻，乾實驗室模組仍在開發中；團隊也明確邀請其他 iGEM 隊伍使用或改編它來訓練自己的新成員。","ihp_zh":"團隊接受 Dr Ross Venook 的 Stanford Biodesign 流程訓練，他告訴他們 biodesign 的意思是跟著臨床醫師實地觀察，而不是上網搜尋，而整個專案就是圍繞這點建起來的。發想階段被當成每週的紀律執行：每位成員每週訪談一個人——與教授、研究者及自己生活圈中的人累積二十多場對話——而一位成員在 ReSurge（一個在海外培訓重建外科醫師的 NGO）的經驗，帶出「全球疾病負擔有 30% 屬於外科」這個數據，把異常疤痕重新定義為一個醫療取得的問題。楊帆教授告訴他們燒傷與蟹足腫是分開的研究領域，兩者都做只會把工作弄混，於是他們選了一個。在 Stanford BIOME Shark Tank，他們向八位評審（教授、投資人、生技創業者）提案，並收到書面評分表；公開的回應表列出每一項批評以及他們的作為，其中一位評審建議為微針打造 AI-CAD 平台，後來就成了 U-Net++ 分割接 Fusion 360 的管線。當他們去找蟹足腫的病友倡議團體時幾乎找不到，而唯一回覆的基金會建議他們去找臨床醫師談——團隊直言醫師無法代表病患的親身經驗，並把這記錄為一條次佳路徑。接著他們聯絡了 28 位 Stanford 的皮膚科與整形外科醫師，訪談了七位，使用的標準工具是李克特量表排序陳述加上各專科特有的開放式問題。有三項顧慮反覆出現——兩年內復發、反覆注射的疼痛與不便，以及藥物難以進入緻密的疤痕組織——每一項都改變了設計：Dr Teng 指出晚期蟹足腫治療困難得多，使標的從預防轉向已形成的蟹足腫；Dr Li 建議的膠原支架纖維母細胞與水膠力學轉導分析改變了驗證計畫；醫師們抱怨反覆注射，加上 Dr Li 支持貼片形式，促成了依傷口形狀製作的微針陣列，針長定在 900 um，因為文獻記載超過 1000 um 的針會造成流血與疼痛。Dr Miranda 向自己的人際網絡詢問病毒來源的部件是否會引起發炎，團隊因此決定不把 saRADAR 與 RNA 輸出機制結合。由於蟹足腫沒有動物模型（只發生在人類身上），他們與 Genoskin 討論其離體人類皮膚模型，並把它定為下一個安全性驗證步驟。","realWorld_zh":"團隊在 Shark Tank 上就明確表示，目標產品輪廓的重要性次於「鑑定出一個其他隊伍與科學家能重複使用的模組化感測器平台」，而貢獻頁面是以交棒的方式寫成的：把感測區換成新的轉錄本、加上第二個輸入做成 AND 閘、以 DNA 或 RNA 遞送、接上你自己的酬載。臨床路徑分階段並逐一指名——先在 HEK293 中驗證 Gao 實驗室的感測器與自己的感測器、驗證 AND 閘、移到蟹足腫與正常人類纖維母細胞株、加上酬載，最後在 Genoskin 的離體人類皮膚模型中做終點分析，涵蓋免疫毒性、表現型與轉錄體讀值——而 Genoskin 的代表確實參與並就如何執行提供建議。Cas12a2 酬載工作與體外轉錄 mRNA 形式，都被定位為朝真實療法該有的型態推進，而不是報告子的示範。SynBase 在競賽之後仍持續維運，被當作一個延續的計畫而非競賽產物。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6278/wiki/m2-fig4-trigger-selection.webp","caption":"Trigger selection in RADAR-Scout: 600 filtered genes ranked across five keloid cohorts on the left (POSTN first at DSS 1.288), with every candidate sensor for the selected gene plotted on the right, so target and sensor are chosen in one view.","credit":"Team Stanford University, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"RADAR-Scout 中的觸發標的選擇：左側把 600 個經篩選的基因在五個蟹足腫世代資料上排序（POSTN 以 DSS 1.288 居首），右側繪出所選基因的每一個候選感測器，讓標的與感測器在同一個檢視中選定。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6278/wiki/m2-fig10-rho-ranked.webp","caption":"All 19 computational predictors ranked by Spearman rho against sensor output: the two folding-energy terms lead at 0.62-0.63 while GC content, the field's informal selection rule, reaches only -0.29.","credit":"Team Stanford University, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"全部 19 個計算預測因子依與感測器輸出的 Spearman rho 排序：兩個摺疊能量項以 0.62-0.63 領先，而該領域的非正式選擇準則 GC 含量只有 -0.29。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6278/wiki/m3-cv1-patch.webp","caption":"A microneedle array patch generated from a photograph of a keloid scar: U-Net++ with a ResNet34 encoder segments the wound, and the Autodesk Fusion 360 API turns the mask into a 3D-printable CAD file.","credit":"Team Stanford University, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"由一張蟹足腫疤痕照片生成的微針陣列貼片：U-Net++ 搭配 ResNet34 編碼器分割傷口，Autodesk Fusion 360 API 再把遮罩轉成可 3D 列印的 CAD 檔。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6278/wiki/m2-fig20-nine-state.webp","caption":"The nine-state hybridization and editing scheme for the AND-gate RADAR sensor; only the doubly-edited state is translated into GFP, and the enumerated transitions are how the system was verified to be complete.","credit":"Team Stanford University, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"AND 閘 RADAR 感測器的九狀態雜合與編輯方案；只有雙重編輯狀態會被轉譯成 GFP，而把所有轉換逐一列舉出來，正是驗證該系統完整性的方法。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6278/wiki/sibrp-call.webp","caption":"The final session of SiBRP 2026, the team's free three-week online bioengineering bootcamp, with students joining from 24 US states and 40 countries.","credit":"Team Stanford University, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"SiBRP 2026 的最後一堂課——團隊免費的三週線上生物工程密集課程，學生來自美國 24 州與 40 個國家。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Stanford's SiBRP-to-SynBase pivot is the directly copyable move: they ran a small mentored cohort, discovered demand they could not staff (5,000 applications for 230 places), and then converted the exact same curriculum into a free self-paced online course with progress tracking and discussion boards - so the teaching asset outlives the cohort. A high-school-plus centre in Taiwan can do the same with its own course material, and should also adopt their dry-lab habit of testing the field's received wisdom (lowest GC content) against its own measured data and replacing it with a better predictor.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/stanford-university/","https://2026.igem.wiki/stanford-university/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/stanford-university/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/stanford-university/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/stanford-university/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/stanford-university/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/stanford-university/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/stanford-university/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/stanford-university/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/stanford-university/safety","https://radar-scout.vercel.app/","https://radar-scout-dashboard.vercel.app/","https://synbase.web.app/home.html"],"projectTitle_zh":"KelePatch","tagline_zh":"一種以邏輯閘控制、具細胞狀態專一性的蟹足腫 RNA 療法，透過依傷口形狀製作的微針貼片遞送。","summary_zh":"KelePatch 建立了一個基於 ADAR 的 RADAR RNA 感測器，只在蟹足腫的肌纖維母細胞內開啟，因此治療酬載只在病變細胞中製造，而不在健康皮膚中。團隊針對五個纖維化轉錄本（ADAM12、POSTN、ASPN、COL11A1、SPP1）設計了一套 26 個部件的模組化感測器集合，在 HEK293 細胞中驗證，再把表現最好的兩個組成雙輸入 AND 閘以提升選擇性，並在健康皮膚纖維母細胞與源自蟹足腫的纖維母細胞中測試；他們也把一個感測器與 Cas12a2 配對，證明輸出不限於螢光報告子。濕實驗室之外，他們做了 RADAR-Scout——一個已發布的網頁平台，輸入細胞類型與基因，就回傳一份考慮 RNA 結構、經排序的 RADAR 感測器候選清單，外加一套關於其行為的機制模擬。本專案獲得總冠軍，因為每一層都彼此相連：960,518 個單細胞的轉錄體資料挑出觸發標的、ViennaRNA 的摺疊能量為感測器排序、ODE 模型解釋了他們在實驗台上看到的延遲，而一套 U-Net++ 電腦視覺管線則把一張疤痕照片變成可 3D 列印的貼片。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"Stanford 從 SiBRP 轉向 SynBase 的這一步最可直接照抄：他們先辦了一個有導師帶領的小型班，發現需求遠超過自己能配置的人力（5,000 份申請搶 230 個名額），接著把完全相同的課程轉成免費、可自訂進度的線上課程，附進度追蹤與討論區——於是教學資產的壽命超過了那一屆學員。台灣的高中以上研究單位可以用自己的課程教材做同一件事，同時也該採用他們在乾實驗室的習慣：拿領域裡的既有共識（挑 GC 含量最低）去對照自己實測的資料檢驗，再用更好的預測因子取代它。","awards_zh":["總冠軍（大學組）","Top 10（大學組）","最佳模型 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）","最佳治療專案 — 得主"],"rank":230},"6279":{"team":"UBC-Vancouver","id":"6279","section":"Undergrad","country":"Canada","village":"Diagnostics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ubc-vancouver/","projectTitle":"FAST: a point-of-care antibiotic susceptibility test","tagline":"Three devices, a 200-promoter screen and a measurement page that opens by admitting the readout is the whole diagnostic.","summary":"UBC-Vancouver built FAST, a point-of-care antibiotic susceptibility test in which a patient sample and a candidate antibiotic are combined on a microfluidic chip, and whatever antibiotic survives that step reaches stress-responsive E. coli biosensors downstream: a susceptible sample leaves the antibiotic active, the stress promoter fires and sfGFP is expressed, while a resistant sample degrades the antibiotic and the signal stays near baseline. Because the fluorescence is the diagnosis rather than a supporting observation, the team treated measurement as the project's foundation, establishing baselines, finding the usable concentration window, measuring the response and anchoring everything to controls. Three devices remove the infrastructure a point-of-care test cannot assume: a PDMS microfluidic chip at one to five dollars, a $204.48 fluorescence detector, and a $106.68 bioreactor to produce the biosensor cultures.","awards":["Best Hardware — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Diagnostics Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"The measurement page is written in the order the work had to be done, establishing a baseline, determining the usable range, measuring the response, then controls and calibration, then scaling, with a limitations section at the end. Human Practices is counted as integrated only where the project would have been different without it, so every conversation is paired with what it changed. Each bioreactor iteration was assessed against a fixed question set covering ease of use, comparability to benchtop standards, modularity and monitoring, with outcomes recorded as what worked and what did not.","dataviz":"Growth curves with simultaneous OD600 and fluorescence for biosensor strains against wild-type EPI300; dose-response panels expressed as fold change against an untreated control on the same plate; a library-wide scatter in which most of the 200-plus promoter constructs cluster near a growth ratio and induction ratio of one and genuine hits appear as outliers from roughly 3-fold to 12-fold; LTSpice simulation node tables comparing expected against simulated voltages for two supply-rail configurations; sensor-reading-against-time traces under constant illumination for the optical density sensor; CAD models published as .glb files for every chip design iteration alongside engineering drawings.","datascience":"The baseline work is the part most teams skip. Before measuring any response the team generated growth curves for the CpxP and RecA biosensor strains alongside wild-type EPI300 with no antibiotic present, recording OD600 and fluorescence at 485/510 nm at every timepoint, and found two things that change how all later numbers must be read: the biosensor strains reach maximum cell densities about 35% lower than wild type, indicating metabolic burden from the reporter plasmids and meaning fluorescence cannot be compared across strains without normalising to cell density; and the CpxP strain shows roughly 18 to 20-fold higher basal sfGFP than wild type or RecA after 25 hours at 37 C, which ceases at 22 C. They state the consequence directly, that a team adopting CpxP without knowing this would mistake baseline for signal. OD600 calibration curves were produced from these runs so fluorescence can be normalised rather than reported raw. The first dose-response attempt, 13 two-fold concentrations sampled at 10-minute intervals over 40 to 60 minutes, produced no dose dependence, and the team read that as a failure of the measurement window rather than of the biosensors, publishing it because a team seeing a flat one-hour curve should not conclude their reporter does not work. Correcting it required knowing where the strains stay alive, so MIC titrations for gentamicin, tobramycin and amoxicillin with ranges seeded from published values gave provisional MIC ranges of 4 to 8 ug/mL, defining the subinhibitory window inside which every later measurement was placed. The repeated eight-hour dose response then found CpxP peaking between four and eight hours, reaching 2-fold at four hours and 3-fold at eight at 8 ug/mL amoxicillin, and RecA responding to amoxicillin but not to either aminoglycoside, a negative the team reports explicitly so that others do not reuse the SOS response as an aminoglycoside readout. Controls are anchored rather than assumed: wild-type EPI300 as the chassis negative control, untreated cultures on the same plate as the denominator for every fold change, and blank media wells subtracted from all fluorescence. The plasmid retention assay is itself a control on the measurement conditions, run because chloramphenicol confounds the stress response they are measuring; plasmids were lost within one hour without selection, so selection was retained and the confound documented rather than quietly accepted. Scaling to more than 200 promoter-GFP constructs with UBC's Biofactorial automation facility used apparent MICs cross-checked against EUCAST, subinhibitory concentrations at roughly 0.25 to 0.5 times apparent MIC, 30 384-well plates with OD600 and GFP sampled every 30 minutes over eight hours, plus a no-antibiotic control plate and a media-only blank, with each promoter's response calculated as GFP normalised to OD600 and then to its own control so that constructs with different growth characteristics remain comparable. The detector carries its own calibration routine: a baseline is taken by subtracting an LED-off reading from an LED-on reading, signal and reference voltage are read together and subtracted during collection so supply-rail drift is removed rather than recorded as signal, and gain is set from low upward until the brightest expected sample lands near the top of the 0.883 V usable range. The resolution is derived and published so others can repeat the calculation for their own configuration: the Arduino's 1.1 V internal reference gives an ADC step of 1.074 mV per count, and with a 10 MOhm transimpedance resistor at a gain of 101 the smallest detectable current is about 1 pA. Limitations are stated as limitations, that the MIC values are provisional because they came from endpoint OD600 in a two-fold series rather than standardised broth microdilution against a reference strain, so they locate a working range rather than establish a clinical breakpoint.","software":"PRISM (Promoter Response Index and Selection Map), a relational SQLite evidence database that integrates RNA-seq differential expression results, regulatory interactions, promoter and transcription-unit annotations and sequence information to rank antibiotic-responsive promoters for screening, published on GitLab with a separate figures repository. The team is explicit that their contribution is the integration, interpretation and review workflow rather than the expression model or the source measurements, and that PRISM makes those relationships inspectable and produces a reproducible selection proposal; identifier mappings retain the source row, reference release and mapping basis so that one symbol mapping to multiple loci is represented rather than silently collapsed. Supporting modelling covers a degradation model, a promoter library analysis and a patient-sample design of experiments. A protocol database covers LB medium preparation, growth curves, the plasmid retention assay, MIC titration, the biosensor dose-response assay, cloning, the antibiotic degradation assay, PDMS casting, bioreactor culture and assembly, flow testing, and calibration SOPs for the SEN0169 pH probe and TSL2591 optical density sensor, each written to be followed by someone who was not present.","stack":["Arduino with 1.1 V internal reference ADC","AD8606 op-amp transimpedance front end","488 nm LED, 500 nm long-pass filter, photodiode on a shared vertical axis","KiCad and Altium Designer, JLCPCB manufacture","LTSpice","SolidWorks flow simulation","PDMS cast from FDM-printed PLA molds","TSL2591 optical density sensor and SEN0169 pH probe","SQLite (PRISM)","RNA-seq differential expression","384-well automated screening (Biofactorial)"],"techniques":["Baseline characterisation before response measurement","OD600 calibration curves and per-construct normalisation","MIC titration to define a subinhibitory measurement window","Fold change against an untreated control on the same plate","Blank media subtraction","Plasmid retention assay as a control on assay conditions","Publishing negative and absent responses","LED-off baseline subtraction and reference-voltage subtraction","Published ADC step and minimum detectable current","Gain set from low upward to avoid saturation","Validation against a flask control in triplicate across three experiments","Hydraulic resistance modelling checked against flow simulation"],"frameworks_zh":"量測頁面是按照工作必須進行的順序寫的：建立基線、確定可用範圍、量測反應，接著是對照與校正，然後是放大規模，最後以限制一節收尾。人類實踐只有在「少了它專案就會不一樣」的地方才算整合，因此每場對話都配上它改變了什麼。生物反應器的每一次迭代都用同一組固定問題評估，涵蓋易用性、與桌上型標準設備的可比性、模組化與監測能力，結果則記成哪些可行、哪些不可行。","dataviz_zh":"生物感測器菌株與野生型 EPI300 對照的生長曲線，同時記錄 OD600 與螢光；劑量反應圖以同一塊盤上未處理對照的倍數變化表示；全文庫散佈圖中，200 多個啟動子構築體大多聚集在生長比與誘導比均接近 1 的位置，真正的命中則以約 3 倍到 12 倍的離群點出現；LTSpice 模擬的節點表比較兩種電源軌配置下的預期電壓與模擬電壓；光密度感測器在固定照明下的讀值對時間軌跡；每一代晶片設計的 CAD 模型都以 .glb 檔公開，並附工程圖。","datascience_zh":"基線工作正是多數團隊會跳過的部分。在量測任何反應之前，團隊先在無抗生素的條件下，為 CpxP 與 RecA 兩個生物感測器菌株以及野生型 EPI300 做生長曲線，每個時間點都記錄 OD600 與 485/510 nm 的螢光，並發現兩件會改變後續所有數字讀法的事：生物感測器菌株的最大菌體密度比野生型低約 35%，顯示報導質體造成代謝負擔，也意味著不先以菌體密度標準化，螢光就不能跨菌株比較；以及 CpxP 菌株在 37 C 培養 25 小時後，基礎 sfGFP 表現比野生型或 RecA 高約 18 至 20 倍，而這個現象在 22 C 下消失。他們直接把後果寫出來：任何在不知情的情況下採用 CpxP 的團隊，都會把基線誤當成訊號。OD600 校正曲線就由這些實驗產生，使螢光可以經標準化後再報告，而不是直接報原始值。第一次劑量反應嘗試用 13 個二倍序列濃度、每 10 分鐘取樣一次、共 40 至 60 分鐘，結果完全看不到劑量依賴性；團隊把這讀成量測時間窗的失敗，而不是生物感測器的失敗，並把它公開出來，因為看到一小時平坦曲線的團隊，不該就此斷定自己的報導系統沒用。要修正它必須先知道菌株能活在哪個範圍，於是他們以文獻值作為起始範圍，對 gentamicin、tobramycin 與 amoxicillin 做 MIC 滴定，得到 4 至 8 ug/mL 的暫定 MIC 區間，界定出次抑制濃度窗，後續每一次量測都落在這個窗內。重做的八小時劑量反應顯示 CpxP 在第四到第八小時之間達到高峰，在 8 ug/mL amoxicillin 下第四小時達 2 倍、第八小時達 3 倍；而 RecA 對 amoxicillin 有反應，對兩種胺基醣苷類都沒有——這個陰性結果被團隊明確報出，以免他人把 SOS 反應再拿去當胺基醣苷類的讀值。對照是定錨而非假設出來的：以野生型 EPI300 作為底盤陰性對照，以同一塊盤上未處理的菌液作為所有倍數變化的分母，並從所有螢光值中扣掉只有培養基的空白孔。質體保留分析本身就是對量測條件的一道對照，之所以要做，是因為 chloramphenicol 會干擾他們所量測的壓力反應；結果顯示沒有選擇壓力時質體在一小時內就流失，因此選擇壓力被保留下來，而這個干擾因素被記錄下來，而不是默默接受。放大到 200 多個啟動子-GFP 構築體時，他們使用 UBC 的 Biofactorial 自動化設施：表觀 MIC 與 EUCAST 交叉核對，次抑制濃度設為表觀 MIC 的約 0.25 至 0.5 倍，用 30 塊 384 孔盤、每 30 分鐘取樣一次 OD600 與 GFP、共八小時，另加一塊無抗生素對照盤與只有培養基的空白；每個啟動子的反應都先以 OD600 標準化 GFP，再對自己的對照標準化，使生長特性不同的構築體仍可相互比較。偵測器自帶校正流程：以 LED 開的讀值減去 LED 關的讀值取得基線；訊號與參考電壓在收集過程中一起讀取並相減，使電源軌漂移被扣除，而不是被記成訊號；增益則由低往上調，直到預期最亮的樣本落在 0.883 V 可用範圍的上緣附近。解析度是推導出來並公開的，好讓他人能依自己的配置重算一遍：Arduino 的 1.1 V 內部參考電壓對應每個計數 1.074 mV 的 ADC 階距，而在 10 MOhm 跨阻電阻、增益 101 的條件下，最小可偵測電流約為 1 pA。限制就以限制的方式寫出來：MIC 數值只是暫定值，因為它們來自二倍序列稀釋的終點 OD600，而不是對參考菌株進行標準化的肉湯微量稀釋法，因此它們只是定出一個可操作範圍，並未建立臨床判定閾值。","software_zh":"PRISM（Promoter Response Index and Selection Map）是一個以 SQLite 建的關聯式證據資料庫，整合 RNA-seq 差異表現結果、調控交互作用、啟動子與轉錄單元註解以及序列資訊，為篩選排序出對抗生素有反應的啟動子；已發布在 GitLab，並另有一個放圖的儲存庫。團隊明確表示他們的貢獻在於整合、解讀與審查的工作流程，而不是表現模型或原始量測；PRISM 的作用是讓這些關聯可供檢視，並產出可重現的篩選提案。識別碼對應會保留來源資料列、參考版本與對應依據，因此一個符號對應到多個基因座的情況會被呈現出來，而不是無聲地被合併掉。輔助性的建模包括一個降解模型、啟動子文庫分析，以及病人樣本的實驗設計。一套實驗流程資料庫涵蓋 LB 培養基製備、生長曲線、質體保留分析、MIC 滴定、生物感測器劑量反應分析、選殖、抗生素降解分析、PDMS 灌模、生物反應器培養與組裝、流動測試，以及 SEN0169 pH 探針與 TSL2591 光密度感測器的校正 SOP；每一份都寫成讓當時不在現場的人也能照著做。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A wet-lab training video series of one to five minute clips covering pipetting, heat-shock transformation, LB media and plates, colony picking, autoclaving and waste disposal, and aseptic technique, made so a multidisciplinary team could learn asynchronously and review later. Beyond the team, the Human Practices group designed synthetic biology resources and workshops for primary and secondary students, for marginalised adults, and ran the Youreka Vancouver Symposium pairing high school students with research, plus a Geering Up microfluidics activity rebuilt after its first version leaked.","ihp":"Nine clinicians, researchers and patient partners were chosen for what each could say that the literature could not: researchers on what a test must detect, infectious disease physicians and a bedside nurse on what happens to patients once resistance is found, patient partners on living with it, and a patient engagement specialist on how a student team without ethics approval can involve patients at all. On the hardware side, Amin Abdolkhani talked the team out of abandoning PLA molds for resin printing, which would have been more expensive, more wasteful and dependent on another lab's printer, advising one more attempt against revised requirements; it worked. Bram Banik, a PCB designer at D-Wave, explained that adapting published circuits is standard practice rather than deriving from first principles, then ran a KiCad tutorial. Dr Celestine Hong hosted an industrial bioreactor tour that showed how sterility is maintained through screws and O-rings, positive internal pressure, sterile filtration and clamp-and-syringe sampling, recommended feedback control loops, suggested simplifying to a microcontroller, sensor and single control element on the available budget, and warned that the common optical-density-to-cell-count conversion is poorly supported below an OD of 1, recommending a dry cell weight calibration curve instead.","realWorld":"The need is costed: conventional susceptibility testing needs a microbiology laboratory and days of turnaround, fluorescence readers suitable for this output run from about $630 to over $42,000, and none of the commercial readers accept a custom chip format, so a rapid test that still needs a plate reader and a central lab is not a point-of-care test. The team scoped the hardware around removing those dependencies rather than around building the most capable instrument. Market work sizes FAST against the global clinical diagnostics industry using a TAM-PAM-SAM-SOM framework and sets out competitors and the regulatory rules that would govern the product, alongside needs-finding, business development, strategic planning and long-term growth pages. Reproduction materials are complete: each device page carries a bill of materials with current prices, the chip page provides CAD models for every iteration as .glb files plus engineering drawings for the final straight, gradient-generating and snaking designs, and the detector page provides both PCB designs, a 3D model and a user manual.","partners":["Biofactorial, UBC High-Throughput Biology and Automation Facility","Amin Abdolkhani (UBC SBME, CMED lab)","Bram Banik (UBC Engineering Physics / D-Wave)","Dr Celestine Hong (UBC Chemical and Biological Engineering)","Geering Up","Youreka Vancouver"],"publicEngagement_zh":"一套濕實驗訓練影片系列，每段 1 至 5 分鐘，涵蓋移液、熱休克轉形、LB 培養基與平板、挑菌落、高壓滅菌與廢棄物處理，以及無菌操作技術，目的是讓一支跨領域團隊能非同步學習、事後也能複習。團隊之外，人類實踐小組為中小學生以及處於邊緣處境的成人設計合成生物學教材與工作坊，並舉辦 Youreka Vancouver Symposium，把高中生與研究配對；另有一項 Geering Up 的微流體活動，在第一版漏液之後重做。","ihp_zh":"九位臨床醫師、研究者與病人夥伴的選擇，依據的是文獻說不出、但他們說得出的內容：研究者談一項檢測必須偵測到什麼；感染科醫師與一位臨床護理師談一旦查出抗藥性，病人會經歷什麼；病人夥伴談帶著抗藥性感染生活是什麼樣子；病人參與專家則談一支沒有倫理審查許可的學生團隊，究竟還能如何讓病人參與。硬體方面，Amin Abdolkhani 勸退了團隊「放棄 PLA 模具改用樹脂列印」的想法——那會更貴、更浪費，而且得依賴別人實驗室的印表機——他建議按修訂後的需求再試一次；結果成功了。D-Wave 的 PCB 設計師 Bram Banik 說明改用已發表的電路是業界標準做法，不必從第一原理推導，接著帶了一場 KiCad 教學。Dr Celestine Hong 帶他們參觀工業用生物反應器，說明無菌是如何靠螺栓與 O 形環、內部正壓、無菌過濾以及夾管加針筒取樣來維持；她建議加入回饋控制迴圈，也建議在現有預算下簡化為一顆微控制器、一個感測器與單一控制元件，並警告常見的光密度換算細胞數在 OD 低於 1 時證據薄弱，建議改用乾菌重校正曲線。","realWorld_zh":"需求有算出成本：傳統感受性試驗需要微生物實驗室，而且要等好幾天；適合這種輸出的螢光判讀儀從約 630 美元到超過 42,000 美元，而且沒有一台商用判讀儀接受自訂晶片格式——因此一項仍需要盤式判讀儀與中央實驗室的快速檢測，並不是定點照護檢測。團隊設定硬體範圍時，是以移除這些依賴為目標，而不是以做出效能最強的儀器為目標。市場分析以 TAM-PAM-SAM-SOM 框架把 FAST 放在全球臨床診斷產業中估算規模，並列出競爭者與將規範此產品的法規，另有需求探索、商業開發、策略規劃與長期成長等頁面。重現所需的材料齊備：每個裝置頁面都附上標有現價的物料清單；晶片頁面提供每一代的 CAD 模型（.glb 檔），以及最終直線型、梯度生成型與蛇形設計的工程圖；偵測器頁面則提供兩份 PCB 設計、一個 3D 模型與一份使用手冊。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6279/wiki/assets/87edc504fab45511ac34a0233e32a223.avif","caption":"The overall setup of the fluorescence detection system. Aligning a 488 nm LED, the sample, a 500 nm long-pass filter and a photodiode on a single vertical axis removed one of the two optical filters conventional detectors need, cutting optical material cost by at least half.","credit":"Team UBC-Vancouver, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"螢光偵測系統的整體配置。把 488 nm LED、樣本、500 nm 長波通濾光片與光二極體排在同一條垂直軸上，省掉了傳統偵測器所需兩片光學濾光片中的一片，使光學材料成本至少減半。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6279/wiki/assets/1049987edaae516c9d470c1dcf17c072.avif","caption":"The 30 mm by 90 mm main detection PCB, with the LED, the microfluidic chip well and the photodiode vertically aligned along the board. The complete device costs $204.48 to build.","credit":"Team UBC-Vancouver, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"30 mm x 90 mm 的主偵測 PCB，LED、微流體晶片孔位與光二極體沿板面垂直對齊。整台裝置的製作成本為 204.48 美元。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6279/wiki/assets/797aed1798be54a683e510a5b995770a.avif","caption":"The physical PDMS microfluidic chip beside its SolidWorks model. Cast from FDM-printed PLA molds over seven design cycles, it costs roughly one to five dollars per chip and needs neither a cleanroom nor a resin printer.","credit":"Team UBC-Vancouver, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"PDMS 微流體晶片實體與其 SolidWorks 模型並列。它以 FDM 列印的 PLA 模具灌模而成，歷經七輪設計，每片成本約 1 至 5 美元，既不需要無塵室也不需要樹脂印表機。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6279/wiki/assets/cb607262e5ed54178078cdf0291acf72.avif","caption":"TSL2591 light sensor readings against time under constant illumination, part of the bioreactor's optical density calibration. The bioreactor costs $106.68, monitors temperature, pH and optical density, and was validated against flask culture in triplicate across three experiments.","credit":"Team UBC-Vancouver, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"TSL2591 光感測器在固定照明下的讀值對時間，屬於生物反應器光密度校正的一部分。這座生物反應器成本 106.68 美元，可監測溫度、pH 與光密度，並在三次實驗中各以三重複對照搖瓶培養完成驗證。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Characterise the uninduced baseline before you measure any response: discovering that one reporter strain carries 18 to 20-fold higher basal expression and 35% lower maximum density than wild type is the difference between a calibrated signal and mistaking a constitutive background for a result, and it is cheap to find and free to publish.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/ubc-vancouver/project/best-measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/ubc-vancouver/project/best-hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/ubc-vancouver/hardware/fluorescence-detector","https://2026.igem.wiki/ubc-vancouver/hardware/bioreactor","https://2026.igem.wiki/ubc-vancouver/hardware/microfluidic-chip","https://2026.igem.wiki/ubc-vancouver/modelling/prism","https://2026.igem.wiki/ubc-vancouver/project/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/ubc-vancouver/administration/market-research-","https://2026.igem.wiki/ubc-vancouver/human-practices/education"],"projectTitle_zh":"FAST：一套定點照護的抗生素感受性試驗","tagline_zh":"三件自製裝置、一次 200 個啟動子的篩選，以及一個開頭就承認讀值本身就是整個診斷的量測頁面。","summary_zh":"UBC-Vancouver 做出 FAST，一套定點照護的抗生素感受性試驗：病人樣本與候選抗生素在微流體晶片上混合，凡是在這一步仍存活的抗生素會流到下游、遇上具壓力反應的 E. coli 生物感測器——若樣本為感受性菌，抗生素仍具活性，壓力啟動子啟動並表現 sfGFP；若樣本具抗藥性，抗生素被分解，訊號就停在接近基線的位置。由於螢光就是診斷本身，而不是輔助觀察，團隊把量測當成整個專案的基礎：建立基線、找出可用的濃度區間、量測反應，並把一切錨定在對照組上。三件裝置移除了定點照護檢測不能假設存在的基礎設施：一枚成本 1 至 5 美元的 PDMS 微流體晶片、一台 204.48 美元的螢光偵測器，以及一座 106.68 美元、用來生產生物感測器菌液的生物反應器。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"量測任何反應之前，先把未誘導的基線做特性分析：發現某個報導菌株的基礎表現量比野生型高 18 至 20 倍、最大菌體密度低 35%，這就是「校正過的訊號」與「把組成型背景誤認為結果」之間的差別——而且查出來便宜，公開出來更是免費。","awards_zh":["最佳硬體 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳診斷專案 — 得主"],"rank":33},"6280":{"team":"LYON","id":"6280","section":"Undergrad","country":"France","village":"Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/","projectTitle":"BioThetis","projectTitle_zh":"BioThetis","tagline":"De novo protein binders anchored on cheap cellulose that capture trifluoroacetic acid from industrial water and release it with heat — no living organism in the filter.","tagline_zh":"以 de novo 設計、固定在便宜纖維素上的蛋白質結合體，從工業廢水中捕捉三氟乙酸，再用加熱把它放出來——濾材裡沒有任何活體生物。","summary":"BioThetis goes after trifluoroacetic acid, the smallest and most stubborn PFAS: an NGO found it in 34 of 36 tap water samples across eleven European countries in 2024, activated carbon barely retains short chains, ion-exchange resins are not approved for French drinking water, and reverse osmosis only concentrates TFA five to ten times at enormous energy cost — the elected official in charge of water at the Metropole de Lyon told the team a single installation would run to roughly one billion euros. Their alternative is a protein binder fused to the cellulose-binding module CBM3a, which sticks to ordinary microcrystalline cellulose with no chemical coupling, captures TFA, and gives it back when the column is heated to 65 C so the material is reusable. Because TFA weighs only 114 Da and no natural binder was on offer, they designed binders from scratch with BoltzGen — 10,000 candidates, 6,823 through the filters, top 5 kept, three taken to the bench in two anchor orientations each — and demonstrated dose-dependent TFA binding by nanoDSF that does not respond to difluoroacetic or acetic acid, so the recognition is TFA-specific. They also solved the fluoroacetate dehalogenase DAR3835 to 1.10 A, the highest resolution reported for that enzyme, and said plainly that no density on the processed datasets is attributable to TFA. It won Best Bioremediation and Best Presentation on an unusually honest project: 15 new Registry parts, 25 printable protocols, all code and all dead ends released CC BY 4.0, and a human practices record that names exactly which conversation changed which page.","summary_zh":"BioThetis 針對的是三氟乙酸，PFAS 家族中最小也最難處理的一員：一個 NGO 在 2024 年於十一個歐洲國家的 36 份自來水樣本中，有 34 份驗出它；活性碳幾乎留不住短鏈；離子交換樹脂在法國未獲准用於飲用水；而逆滲透只能把 TFA 濃縮五到十倍，代價是巨大的能耗——大里昂都會區（Metropole de Lyon）主管水務的民選官員告訴團隊，單一座設施的造價約為十億歐元。他們的替代方案是把蛋白質結合體與纖維素結合模組 CBM3a 融合，不需任何化學偶合就能黏在普通微晶纖維素上，捕捉 TFA，並在管柱加熱到 65 C 時把它還回來，使材料可重複使用。因為 TFA 只有 114 Da，而且沒有現成的天然結合蛋白可用，他們用 BoltzGen 從零設計——10,000 個候選、6,823 個通過篩選、保留前 5 名、其中三個各以兩種錨定方向進入實驗桌——並以 nanoDSF 證明劑量依賴的 TFA 結合，而且對二氟乙酸或乙酸沒有反應，所以辨識具 TFA 專一性。他們也把氟乙酸脫鹵酶 DAR3835 解到 1.10 A，是該酵素已報告的最高解析度，並明白表示處理後的資料集中沒有任何電子密度可歸因於 TFA。這個專案以罕見的誠實拿下 Best Bioremediation 與 Best Presentation：15 個新的 Registry 元件、25 份可列印的實驗協議、全部程式碼與全部走不通的路都以 CC BY 4.0 釋出，以及一份會指名「哪一場對話改了哪一頁」的人類實踐紀錄。","awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Education — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Two strands, both documented with their failures intact. Binder design used BoltzGen 0.3.2 (Stark et al. 2025) on the Neurosnap platform with protein length constrained to 80-120 residues: 10,000 candidates generated, 6,823 passing BoltzGen's geometric and energetic filters, then re-filtered with the documented parameters (alpha 0.2, RMSD threshold 3.0 A) to keep the top 5 — across that shortlist median RMSD 0.982 A, median pTM 0.859, median ipTM 0.859, which the team notes shows consistent confidence rather than one lucky outlier. Three binders (Galatea, Ianassa, Melite) went forward in two anchor orientations each. Separately, a rational-design pipeline for DAR3835 variants combined structure prediction (Boltz-2 and AlphaFold3 via Neurosnap), sequence redesign with LigandMPNN, and binding-energy scoring with AutoDock Vina, run first on the related dehalogenase RPA1163 and then on DAR3835. Its result was negative and reported as such: no automatically redesigned mutant beat its wild-type benchmark on either scaffold, backbone confidence stayed high so the losses were interface rather than folding effects, and with the ligand pose at pLDDT 46-48 on the fluorines a Vina difference of 0.4 kcal/mol sits below the method's noise and cannot rank designs. The nine variants were therefore picked on explicit structural reasoning and rotamer feasibility, with docking used only as a consistency check, and one design was dropped at review after a rotamer check. The second strand is a packed-bed breakthrough column model in MATLAB: advection, axial dispersion and binder capture along the bed, Danckwerts inlet condition at C0, zero outlet gradient, bed starting empty, solved by finite differences with the stiff solver ode15s, reporting the breakthrough curve, BV10 and BV50, empty-bed contact time, bed Peclet number, Damkohler number and total TFA captured. All AI-designed proteins were screened through ToxinPred2 and BLAST against known toxins before anything was ordered.","frameworks_zh":"兩條線，而且兩條都把失敗原封不動記錄下來。結合體設計用的是 Neurosnap 平台上的 BoltzGen 0.3.2（Stark 等人，2025），蛋白質長度限制在 80-120 個殘基：產生 10,000 個候選，6,823 個通過 BoltzGen 的幾何與能量篩選，再以記錄下來的參數（alpha 0.2、RMSD 門檻 3.0 A）重新篩選，保留前 5 名——這份短名單的中位數 RMSD 為 0.982 A、中位數 pTM 0.859、中位數 ipTM 0.859，團隊指出這代表信心度一致，而不是碰巧出現一個幸運的離群值。三個結合體（Galatea、Ianassa、Melite）各以兩種錨定方向往前推進。另一條是 DAR3835 變異體的理性設計流程，結合結構預測（透過 Neurosnap 使用 Boltz-2 與 AlphaFold3）、以 LigandMPNN 做序列重新設計，以及用 AutoDock Vina 做結合能評分，先跑在相近的脫鹵酶 RPA1163 上，再跑 DAR3835。結果是負面的，而且照實報告：在兩個骨架上，沒有任何自動重新設計的突變體勝過其野生型基準；主鏈信心度維持在高位，因此損失來自介面而非折疊效應；而在配體位置的氟原子處 pLDDT 只有 46-48 的情況下，Vina 相差 0.4 kcal/mol 已低於方法本身的雜訊，無法為設計排序。於是那九個變異體是依明確的結構推理與旋轉異構物可行性挑出來的，對接只當一致性檢查用，而其中一個設計在旋轉異構物檢查後於審查階段被刪掉。第二條線是在 MATLAB 中建的填充床穿透曲線管柱模型：沿床的對流傳輸、軸向分散與結合體捕捉，入口採 C0 的 Danckwerts 條件、出口梯度為零、床體起始為空，以有限差分搭配剛性求解器 ode15s 求解，並報告穿透曲線、BV10 與 BV50、空床接觸時間、床體 Peclet 數、Damkohler 數與捕捉到的 TFA 總量。所有 AI 設計的蛋白質在下訂之前都先經過 ToxinPred2 與對已知毒素的 BLAST 篩查。","dataviz":"The dry lab page is built to be read and reused rather than admired. The column model is introduced by a single annotated schematic that shows water entering at concentration C0 and flow rate Q, the two state variables C(z,t) dissolved and q(z,t) captured, a front moving down the bed, the three things that happen to TFA (carried by flow, spread by mixing, captured by binder), and the breakthrough curve as the output — so the whole model is legible before any equation. BoltzGen's 10,000 designs are shown as three scatter plots against design length (predicted error, pTM, ipTM) with grey for all designs, red for top quality after filtering and blue for quality-and-diversity picks, which makes the funnel from 10,000 to 5 visible instead of asserted. Retained designs are presented as superpositions of four AlphaFold3 predictions each. Every figure's generating script is published alongside it. The wiki itself carries a light/dark theme the visitor chooses, and the human practices section is organised as a stakeholder ledger where each entry is tagged Opened, Changed or Confirmed, with the date, the topic, and the specific wiki pages that entry altered.","dataviz_zh":"乾實驗頁是為了被讀、被重複使用而建的，不是為了被欣賞。管柱模型由一張加註的示意圖引入，圖上畫出以濃度 C0、流率 Q 進入的水、兩個狀態變數 C(z,t)（溶解態）與 q(z,t)（已捕捉）、沿床往下移動的前緣、TFA 會遇到的三件事（被流動帶走、被混合擴散、被結合體捕捉），以及作為輸出的穿透曲線——整個模型在任何方程式出現之前就讀得懂。BoltzGen 的 10,000 個設計以三張對設計長度作圖的散佈圖呈現（預測誤差、pTM、ipTM），灰色是全部設計、紅色是篩選後的頂級品質、藍色是兼顧品質與多樣性的選擇，使從 10,000 收斂到 5 的漏斗看得見，而不是被宣稱。保留的設計則各以四個 AlphaFold3 預測結構疊合呈現。每張圖的產生腳本都和圖一起公開。wiki 本身提供由訪客選擇的亮色/暗色主題，而人類實踐那一節編成一份利害關係人帳本，每一筆都標上 Opened、Changed 或 Confirmed，附日期、主題，以及那一筆所改動的具體 wiki 頁面。","datascience":"The honest handling of uncertainty is the real data science contribution. The team established an analytical limit case, a mass balance check and an independent re-implementation of the column model before trusting it, and published the parameter file with units and sources — flagging openly that some support and column parameters remain placeholders because they did not finish the model as intended. The conclusion they draw from it is genuinely useful and counterintuitive: affinity and capacity, not column geometry, decide how long a filter lasts. On the protein side they converted thermal shift assays into quantitative affinities (Ianassa N-term apparent Kd 25.0 +/- 4.9 mM, C-term 24.9 +/- 4.0 mM against TFA, versus 105.01 for wild-type DAR3835) and quantified the cellulose anchor by depletion assay (Bmax 1.18 +/- 0.11 nmol/mg, Kd 0.66 +/- 0.33 uM on microcrystalline cellulose). Engineering was run through explicit decision gates with pass criteria written in advance — TFA binding required a Tm shift of at least 0.5 C at 50 mM, reproducible and dose-dependent (met); thermal reversibility required at least 80% of the unfolding transition recovered on a second ramp (not met, for either DAR3835 or the de novo binders, and recorded as a failure with a proposed fix). They also list four checks required before the next synthesis round: redo the ligand pose by docking (AutoDock Vina or GNINA) on PDB 8SDC followed by 100 ns of molecular dynamics with recomputed RESP charges for TFA to test whether the Protenix pose reproduces; a rotamer scan on every bulky substitution; nanoDSF Tm plus post-cycle refolding yield for every variant; and acetate and propionate negative controls so affinity is attributed to the CF3 group rather than a generic carboxylate interaction.","datascience_zh":"真正的資料科學貢獻是對不確定性的誠實處理。團隊在信任管柱模型之前，先建立了一個解析極限案例、一次質量平衡檢查，以及一份獨立的重新實作，並把參數檔連同單位與來源公開——同時公開標示部分載體與管柱參數仍是佔位值，因為他們沒能如原計畫把模型做完。他們從中得出的結論既有用又反直覺：決定一個濾材能撐多久的是親和力與容量，不是管柱幾何。蛋白質那側，他們把熱位移分析換算成定量親和力（Ianassa 的 N 端對 TFA 的表觀 Kd 為 25.0 +/- 4.9 mM、C 端為 24.9 +/- 4.0 mM，野生型 DAR3835 則是 105.01），並以耗竭分析量化纖維素錨定（在微晶纖維素上 Bmax 1.18 +/- 0.11 nmol/mg、Kd 0.66 +/- 0.33 uM）。工程推進則走明確的決策關卡，通過標準事先寫好——TFA 結合要求在 50 mM 下 Tm 位移至少 0.5 C，且需可重現並呈劑量依賴（達成）；熱可逆性要求第二次升溫時回復至少 80% 的解折疊轉變（未達成，DAR3835 與 de novo 結合體都沒過，並記為失敗並附上建議的修正方式）。他們也列出下一輪合成前必須先做的四項檢查：在 PDB 8SDC 上以對接（AutoDock Vina 或 GNINA）重做配體位置，接著以重新計算 TFA 的 RESP 電荷跑 100 ns 分子動力學，檢驗 Protenix 的位置是否可重現；對每一個大體積取代做旋轉異構物掃描；每個變異體都要做 nanoDSF 的 Tm 加上循環後的再折疊產率；以及加入乙酸鹽與丙酸的陰性對照，以確認親和力該歸給 CF3 基團，而不是一般性的羧酸根交互作用。","software":"Everything is released under CC BY 4.0 on the team GitLab. The column model (MATLAB column_model.m, the parameter sweep scripts, a parameter file with units and sources, and the script behind each figure) is at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/lyon/-/tree/main/model/biothetis-column-model with an explicit invitation to plug in your own binder. BL21 is a browser video game that fits in a single 1.3 MB HTML file, runs entirely offline with no third-party assets, stores levels as data so the science is swappable (change the chassis and the target), takes about 15 minutes, works in French and English, and ships with 33 automated tests. The education kit adds three printable board games including an escape game with facilitator guides in English and French, colour-blind-safe design pairing every colour with a symbol, an experiments booklet, a handbook for school staff, and a before-and-after mind map to measure what pupils learned. They also published 15 new Registry parts (six binder constructs — Galatea, Ianassa and Melite each in two orientations — and nine DAR3835 variants, annotated region by region with one feature per mutated codon, numbered as PDB 8SDC plus 14 so mutations map straight onto the published structure), 25 bench protocols and three reference tables in one printable layout, and the survey questionnaire with anonymised aggregated results.","software_zh":"所有東西都以 CC BY 4.0 釋出在團隊的 GitLab 上。管柱模型（MATLAB 的 column_model.m、參數掃描腳本、附單位與來源的參數檔，以及每張圖背後的腳本）放在 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/lyon/-/tree/main/model/biothetis-column-model，並明確邀請他人把自己的結合體接進去。BL21 是一款瀏覽器電玩，整個塞在單一個 1.3 MB 的 HTML 檔裡，完全離線運作、不用任何第三方素材，關卡以資料形式儲存，所以科學內容可替換（換底盤、換標的），玩完約 15 分鐘，支援法語與英語，並附 33 個自動化測試。教育套件另外加上三款可列印的桌遊（含一款密室逃脫遊戲，附英法雙語帶領者指南）、每個顏色都配一個符號的色盲友善設計、一本實驗手冊、一本給學校教職員的手冊，以及一份前後對照的心智圖以量測學生學到什麼。他們也公開 15 個新的 Registry 元件（六個結合體構築體——Galatea、Ianassa、Melite 各兩種方向——與九個 DAR3835 變異體，逐區段註解、每個被突變的密碼子各給一個 feature，編號採 PDB 8SDC 加 14，使突變可直接對應到已發表的結構）、25 份實驗桌協議與三張參考表（排成同一份可列印版面），以及問卷本身與去識別化的彙總結果。","stack":["BoltzGen 0.3.2","Boltz-2","AlphaFold3","Neurosnap platform","LigandMPNN","AutoDock Vina (GNINA planned)","ToxinPred2 and BLAST toxin screening","MATLAB with ode15s stiff solver","X-ray crystallography (DAR3835 at 1.10 A, PDB 8SDC reference)","nanoDSF thermal shift","GitLab (iGEM instance)","Molecular dynamics with RESP charge recomputation (planned)"],"techniques":["De novo binder generation and multi-stage filtering (10,000 to 6,823 to 5)","Cofolding-based ligand pose prediction treated explicitly as a hypothesis","Rotamer feasibility screening of substitutions","Docking-based binding energy scoring with a stated noise floor","Packed-bed breakthrough modelling (advection-dispersion-capture PDE)","Danckwerts boundary conditions and finite-difference discretisation","Dimensionless analysis: Peclet, Damkohler, EBCT, BV10/BV50","Analytical-limit, mass-balance and independent-reimplementation validation","nanoDSF dose-response Kd determination with specificity comparators","Cellulose depletion binding assay (Bmax, Kd)","Pre-registered engineering decision gates with pass/fail criteria","Techno-economic cost-per-cubic-metre modelling"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"LYON built formats deliberately matched to audience rather than one activity repeated: children 6-14, high school students, adults, families, school staff, students, researchers and professionals, and anyone online from age 12. The flagship is four three-hour workshops run between 8 October and 19 November 2026 with a full ULIS class of 18 pupils in a primary school in Givors, south of Lyon, an area particularly affected by PFAS — ULIS being the unit that includes pupils with disabilities inside a mainstream school. Each session follows one line of reasoning: map environmental pollution with hands-on experiments, question filtration with a filter the pupils build themselves, define synthetic biology simply with a short video, and close with a board game. Pupils run the experiments themselves; the school aides who support them take part; the team adapts to children who need breaks and follows their rhythm rather than imposing a programme, and collects teacher and aide feedback after every session. They measured learning with a before-and-after mind map and published the experiments booklet, protocols and a school-staff handbook as a reusable kit, with partnerships continuing past the Jamboree and the guide left behind where the workshops happened. The materials are designed for reuse: three printable board games in French and English with facilitator guides, colour paired with symbols for colour blindness, and BL21, a single-file offline browser game with swappable science and 33 automated tests. A dialogue-free short film made with oKlama about the psychological impact of PFAS contamination carries no language barrier. They took shorter stand versions to Meet & Fabrik (winning two second prizes), visited three lycees, worked with biology, agriculture, dietetics, and history-and-geography teachers so PFAS gets studied from several angles, and organised an inter-school conference on 19 November where students present their own posters. A public survey drew 376 responses by 7 October, published anonymised with a frank list of what they would change. Community work included organising the French Mini Jamboree, a joint Jamboree talk with Berlin and Wageningen on PFAS, sending their game to iGEM Patras's community game library, joining Bochum's trading card project with 29 other teams, and a peer-reviewed article in Vector Volume 5 guided by Maastricht.","publicEngagement_zh":"LYON 刻意依對象設計形式，而不是把同一個活動重複辦：6-14 歲兒童、高中生、成人、家庭、學校教職員、大學生、研究者與專業人士，以及任何 12 歲以上的網路受眾。旗艦活動是 2026 年 10 月 8 日至 11 月 19 日之間辦的四場三小時工作坊，對象是里昂南方 Givors 一所國小裡一整班 18 位 ULIS 學生——該地區受 PFAS 影響特別嚴重，而 ULIS 是把身心障礙學生納進一般學校的融合教育班。每一場都沿一條推理線走：用實作實驗把環境污染畫出來、用學生自己做的濾材去質問過濾、用一支短片簡單定義合成生物學，最後以桌遊收尾。實驗由學生自己動手；支援他們的學校助理也一同參與；團隊會為需要休息的孩子調整，跟著他們的節奏走，而不是硬推一套課程，並在每一場之後收集教師與助理的回饋。他們以前後對照的心智圖量測學習成效，並把實驗手冊、協議與學校教職員手冊做成可重複使用的套件公開，合作關係在 Jamboree 之後仍持續，指南也留在工作坊舉辦的地方。這些素材本來就是為重複使用而設計的：三款法英雙語可列印桌遊附帶領者指南、顏色都配上符號以照顧色盲者，以及 BL21——一個單檔、離線、科學內容可替換、附 33 個自動化測試的瀏覽器遊戲。另有一支與 oKlama 合作、關於 PFAS 污染心理衝擊的無對白短片，沒有語言隔閡。他們把較短的攤位版本帶到 Meet & Fabrik（拿下兩個二獎）、造訪三所高中，並與生物、農業、營養學以及歷史地理科教師合作，讓 PFAS 能從多個角度被研究，還在 11 月 19 日辦了一場校際研討會，由學生發表自己的海報。一份公眾問卷到 10 月 7 日累積 376 份回覆，以去識別化方式公開，並坦白列出他們會改哪些地方。社群工作包括籌辦法國 Mini Jamboree、與 Berlin 和 Wageningen 在 Jamboree 合辦 PFAS 的聯合演講、把他們的遊戲送進 iGEM Patras 的社群遊戲庫、與另外 29 支團隊一起參與 Bochum 的交換卡牌專案，以及在 Maastricht 指導下於 Vector 第 5 卷發表一篇經同儕審查的文章。","ihp":"The human practices record is structured as a ledger where every stakeholder entry is tagged Opened, Changed or Confirmed, dated, assigned a topic, and linked to the exact wiki pages it altered — which makes the influence auditable rather than claimed. The largest change: public concern about releasing engineered organisms moved them to a system containing no living cells at all, only purified protein on cellulose. Residents at an Institut Ecocitoyen PERFAO workshop set the target — their first request was depolluting drinking water because their catchment is over-contaminated and the installed activated carbon does not work on TFA — and testimony from PFAS Contre Terre, the plaintiffs of the 'proces des 250' against Arkema and Daikin, and team members' own relatives confirmed that TFA specifically, and the polluter-pays principle, is what local people want addressed. Veolia's technical director for France and two engineers across July and September calls reshaped the commercial design: they confirmed activated carbon barely works on short chains, that ion-exchange resins lack French health-authority approval for drinking water, that reverse osmosis concentrates TFA only five to ten times while being energy and water intensive and leaving an unmanageable concentrate, that resins and carbon are usually single-use so a regenerable system is commercially interesting, and that factory outflows typically carry 1-10 ug/L; they validated heat elution and CBM3a anchoring and suggested using it on reverse osmosis concentrate. Hector Osuna at Applexion pushed scale-up and multi-column systems, which became the carousel design. A nature protection association's plant visit taught them which treatment plants could realistically adopt it — large and relatively recent ones — and that economics, regulation and political decisions, not just feasibility, govern deployment. Florence Besoin of a residents' association in Saint-Genis-Laval, who approached them after seeing a flyer, set their public tone: residents are genuinely anxious and need to see people taking the problem seriously without being promised an unrealistic fix, so the team adopted 'honest and encouraging, never triumphant' and states on every page what the approach cannot do yet. A utopia-or-dystopia workshop at the French Mini Jamboree surfaced the failure mode of selling to households — clean water for those who can pay, risk left with the most exposed — confirmed by the survey where 96.3% of respondents wanted PFAS producers and users to pay, so customers are companies and operators only, never households. They also voted at the outset not to contact PFAS emitters, fearing reprisal and being used for greenwashing, and say so openly. After an intellectual property warning from Claude Mabillat they took IP training and then chose to release everything under an open licence anyway.","ihp_zh":"人類實踐紀錄編成一份帳本，每一筆利害關係人紀錄都標上 Opened、Changed 或 Confirmed，附日期、指定主題，並連到它實際改動的 wiki 頁面——這讓影響力可稽核，而不是只被宣稱。最大的改變是：公眾對釋放工程改造生物的擔憂，把他們推向一個完全不含活細胞的系統，只有固定在纖維素上的純化蛋白。Institut Ecocitoyen PERFAO 工作坊的居民定下了標的——他們的第一個請求就是把飲用水的污染去掉，因為他們的取水區污染過重，而已裝設的活性碳對 TFA 無效；而來自 PFAS Contre Terre（對 Arkema 與 Daikin 提起的「proces des 250」原告群）以及團隊成員自己親屬的證詞，確認在地居民真正希望處理的，正是 TFA，以及污染者付費原則。Veolia 的法國技術總監與兩位工程師在 7 月與 9 月的通話，重塑了商業設計：他們確認活性碳對短鏈幾乎無效、離子交換樹脂在法國未取得衛生主管機關的飲用水核准、逆滲透只能把 TFA 濃縮五到十倍而且耗能耗水、還留下無法處理的濃縮液、樹脂與活性碳通常是單次使用因此可再生的系統在商業上有吸引力，以及工廠排水通常帶有 1-10 ug/L；他們也驗證了熱洗脫與 CBM3a 錨定，並建議把它用在逆滲透濃縮液上。Applexion 的 Hector Osuna 推動放大與多管柱系統，於是有了轉盤式設計。一個自然保護協會帶他們參觀處理廠，教會他們哪些處理廠現實上採用得起——規模大而且相對新的那些——也教會他們佈署受經濟、法規與政治決策支配，不只是可行性。Saint-Genis-Laval 一個居民協會的 Florence Besoin（看到傳單後主動找上他們）定下了他們對外說話的調性：居民確實焦慮，需要看到有人認真對待這個問題，但不能被承諾一個不現實的解方；於是團隊採取「誠實而鼓舞人心，絕不自我吹捧」，並在每一頁上寫明這個方法目前還做不到什麼。法國 Mini Jamboree 的一場「烏托邦或反烏托邦」工作坊，點出了賣給家戶的失效模式——乾淨的水給付得起的人，風險留給暴露最深的人——而問卷中有 96.3% 的受訪者希望 PFAS 的生產者與使用者付錢，印證了這一點，所以客戶只會是公司與營運單位，絕不是家戶。他們也在一開始就投票決定不聯繫 PFAS 排放者，因為擔心遭報復、也擔心被用來漂綠，而且把這件事公開說出來。在 Claude Mabillat 提出智慧財產權的警告之後，他們去上了智財訓練，然後仍然選擇把所有東西以開放授權釋出。","realWorld":"The product is specified as a treatment skid in a container: two cellulose columns carrying the binder, one capturing while the other is heated to 65 C to release TFA into a small volume that goes to destruction, capacity added by extending the carousel, sold, rented or charged per cubic metre treated with binder cartridges as consumables. First roadmap targets are pharmaceutical peptide synthesis, fluorinated chemistry and agrochemistry — industrial emitters and treatment operators, explicitly never households. The economics are worked and bounded: destroying the concentrate adds about 0.80 EUR per cubic metre at a placeholder 300 EUR per cubic metre of concentrate, cost barely moves between 1 and 10 ug/L, and since the support holds at most about 0.13 mg TFA per gram of cellulose the filter stays cheaper than destroying the whole stream up to roughly 40 mg/L at pilot pricing and a few hundred mg/L at industrial pricing, so the dilute regime is where it works — consistent with 2022 state measurements around the Pierre-Benite platform finding long-chain PFAS in industrial outlets from ug/L to low mg/L. Incumbents are costed side by side (activated carbon 29-33 kWh per kg to manufacture plus re-calcination above 850 C; ion-exchange resin 18-24 kWh per kg to make and 4.4 kWh per kg to regenerate at USD 18-33 per kg of medium), and one billion euros is used as the order of magnitude for the reference reverse-osmosis solution at drinking-water scale. The team's stated ethical position is that remediation complements regulation and never replaces it, repeated on every page and in every talk, with restriction supported first. They are open to founding a start-up as the 2025 Lyon team did, but on an open-licence basis, and a film screening with debate is planned for January.","realWorld_zh":"產品規格是一個裝在貨櫃裡的整裝式處理模組：兩座帶結合體的纖維素管柱，一座在捕捉時另一座加熱到 65 C，把 TFA 釋放到一小體積液體中送去銷毀；要加容量就延長轉盤，而商業模式可為販售、租賃，或按處理每立方公尺計價，結合體卡匣則作為耗材。路線圖的第一批標的是製藥用胜肽合成、含氟化學與農用化學——也就是工業排放者與處理營運商，並明確寫出絕不包含家戶。經濟面算過也劃了邊界：以每立方公尺濃縮液 300 EUR 的佔位價計，銷毀濃縮液約增加每立方公尺 0.80 EUR；成本在 1 到 10 ug/L 之間幾乎不變；而由於載體每克纖維素最多只能吸附約 0.13 mg TFA，以試量產價計到約 40 mg/L、以工業價計到幾百 mg/L 之前，這個濾材都比直接銷毀整股水流便宜——換句話說，稀薄的那一端才是它成立的區域，這和 2022 年政府在 Pierre-Benite 廠區周邊的量測一致：工業排水口的長鏈 PFAS 從 ug/L 到低個位數 mg/L。現有技術也並排估價（活性碳製造需 29-33 kWh/kg，再加上 850 C 以上的再煅燒；離子交換樹脂製造需 18-24 kWh/kg、再生需 4.4 kWh/kg，介質每公斤 USD 18-33），而十億歐元則被用作飲用水規模下逆滲透參考方案的數量級。團隊寫明的倫理立場是：整治是法規的補充，絕不是取代，這句話在每一頁與每一場演講中重複，而且他們先支持限制使用。他們不排除像 2025 年里昂團隊那樣創辦新創公司，但要建立在開放授權的基礎上；另外一月還規劃了一場放映加座談。","partners":["Veolia (technical director for France plus two engineers)","Hector Osuna, R&D manager, Applexion","Metropole de Lyon (Anne Grosperrin, elected official for water)","Lyon-Feyssine water treatment plant staff","Institut Ecocitoyen pour la Connaissance des Pollutions","PFAS Contre Terre citizen collective (Lucas Miguel)","Florence Besoin, residents' ecological association, Saint-Genis-Laval","Plaintiffs of the 'proces des 250' against Arkema and Daikin","Marie-Charlotte Garin (member of parliament) and Stephane Horel (journalist)","Claude Mabillat (intellectual property)","ULIS class, primary school in Givors, with teachers and AESH school aides","oKlama (short film)","iGEM Berlin and iGEM Wageningen (joint PFAS talk)","iGEM Patras (community game library), iGEM Bochum (trading cards), iGEM Maastricht (Vector article)","iGEM Lyon 2025 (inherited plasmids)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6280/wiki/drylab/column-schematic.avif","caption":"The packed-bed filter model in one picture: water carrying TFA at concentration C0 and flow rate Q enters a cellulose column carrying the binder, with curves for C(z,t) dissolved and q(z,t) captured showing the front moving down the bed, and the breakthrough curve as the output.","caption_zh":"一張圖講完填充床濾材模型：帶著濃度 C0 的 TFA、以流率 Q 進入的水流入一座帶結合體的纖維素管柱，溶解態 C(z,t) 與已捕捉 q(z,t) 的曲線顯示前緣沿床往下移動，而輸出就是穿透曲線。","credit":"Team LYON, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6280/wiki/drylab/image-1.avif","caption":"Design pTM against design length for every one of the 10,000 BoltzGen candidates — grey for all designs, red for top quality after filtering, blue for the quality-and-diversity picks — making the funnel down to five retained binders visible rather than asserted.","caption_zh":"10,000 個 BoltzGen 候選設計的 pTM 對設計長度作圖——灰色是全部設計、紅色是篩選後的頂級品質、藍色是兼顧品質與多樣性的選擇——讓收斂到五個保留結合體的漏斗看得見，而不是被宣稱。","credit":"Team LYON, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6280/wiki/drylab/ian-overlay.avif","caption":"Superposition of the retained Ianassa designs, four AlphaFold3 predictions per design — the lead binder that went to the bench and showed TFA-specific, dose-dependent binding by nanoDSF.","caption_zh":"保留下來的 Ianassa 設計疊合圖，每個設計四個 AlphaFold3 預測結構——這就是進了實驗桌、並以 nanoDSF 顯示出 TFA 專一且劑量依賴結合的領先結合體。","credit":"Team LYON, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6280/wiki/education/image-2026-10-19-203152498.avif","caption":"Pupils running the experiments themselves during one of four three-hour workshops with a ULIS inclusion class of 18 in Givors, an area south of Lyon particularly affected by PFAS contamination.","caption_zh":"四場三小時工作坊之一，在里昂南方受 PFAS 污染影響特別嚴重的 Givors，18 位學生的 ULIS 融合教育班學生自己動手做實驗。","credit":"Team LYON, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Steal LYON's human practices ledger: every stakeholder entry tagged Opened, Changed or Confirmed, with a date, a topic and a link to the specific project pages it altered — it turns 'we talked to people' into an auditable record and forces the team to admit when a conversation changed nothing. The second transferable habit is publishing failure as a deliverable: LYON state that their docking scores could not rank designs because the ligand pose confidence made a 0.4 kcal/mol difference meaningless, that thermal reversibility was never demonstrated, and that some column parameters are still placeholders — and release the code anyway so the next team starts further along. A high-school centre can adopt both tomorrow at zero cost, and both are exactly what judges and reviewers reward.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把 LYON 的人類實踐帳本偷走：每一筆利害關係人紀錄都標上 Opened、Changed 或 Confirmed，附日期、主題，以及連到它實際改動的專案頁面——這把「我們和人談過」變成可稽核的紀錄，也迫使團隊承認某場對話其實什麼都沒改。第二個可移植的習慣是把失敗當成交付成果公開：LYON 寫明他們的對接分數無法為設計排序，因為配體位置的信心度讓 0.4 kcal/mol 的差異失去意義；寫明熱可逆性從未被證明；寫明部分管柱參數仍是佔位值——然後照樣把程式碼釋出，讓下一支團隊從更前面起跑。一個高中中心明天就能零成本採用這兩件事，而這兩件事也正是評審與審稿人會給分的地方。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/","https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/design","https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/sustainability","https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/safety-and-security","https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/collaborations","https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/communication","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/lyon/-/tree/main/model/biothetis-column-model"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 得主（大學組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 得主"],"rank":129},"6283":{"team":"GYHS","id":"6283","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/gyhs/","projectTitle":"ReefBond: A Mussel-Inspired Bioadhesive for Coral Reef Restoration","projectTitle_zh":"ReefBond：一款用於珊瑚礁復育的仿貽貝生物黏著劑","tagline":"A mussel-inspired protein material, designed to help coral fragments hold on while they establish a new home.","tagline_zh":"一種受貽貝啟發的蛋白質材料，設計目的是讓珊瑚斷枝在建立新家的期間能夠附著得住。","summary":"GYHS (Guangdong Guangya High School, Guangzhou) built ReefBond, a recombinant fusion protein that joins a mussel foot protein adhesion module (Mfp3-v12 / Mfp3-v15) to an acidic mineralization module (a CARP3-derived peptide, (Asp)8, (DE)6 or (DDE)4) so that surface adhesion and interfacial mineral deposition act at the same coral-substrate interface. Eight fusion designs were expressed in E. coli BL21(DE3) from pET21a; the team reports qualitative surface-retention staining, in vitro CaCO3 deposition with SEM imaging, and a purpose-built two-version underwater test tank with a motor-guided force gauge, five-level wave generator and a six-channel monitoring interface. The project is unusually honest: nearly every claim is paired with what has not yet been measured, and no live-coral test has been done. Human Practices is the spine of the project rather than a decoration - expert and practitioner advice visibly reorders the experimental programme.","summary_zh":"GYHS（廣東廣雅中學，廣州）打造了 ReefBond，一種重組融合蛋白，把貽貝足蛋白的黏附模組（Mfp3-v12 / Mfp3-v15）與一個酸性礦化模組（源自 CARP3 的胜肽、(Asp)8、(DE)6 或 (DDE)4）接在一起，使表面黏附與界面礦物沉積作用於同一個珊瑚與基質的界面上。八種融合設計以 pET21a 在 E. coli BL21(DE3) 中表現；團隊回報了定性的表面滯留染色、搭配 SEM 影像的體外 CaCO3 沉積，以及一座自行打造、做了兩個版本的水下測試水槽，具備馬達導引的測力計、五段式造波器與六通道監測介面。這個專案誠實得不尋常：幾乎每一項主張都同時列出還沒量到什麼，而且完全沒有做過活體珊瑚測試。人類實踐是整個專案的骨幹而不是裝飾，專家與實務工作者的建議明顯重排了實驗計畫的順序。","awards":["Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"No computational modelling framework. The Model and Software template pages are essentially unfilled iGEM boilerplate; the dry-lab contribution is the instrumentation and data-recording software for the hardware platform, plus a literature-based mechanistic review (Venn 2011, Mass 2013, Cornwall 2021, Lange 2024, Gavriel 2018, Laipnik 2020) used in place of simulation.","frameworks_zh":"沒有運算建模框架。Model 與 Software 兩個頁面基本上仍是未填寫的 iGEM 範本樣板；乾實驗的貢獻是硬體平台的儀器與資料記錄軟體，再加上一份基於文獻的機制回顧（Venn 2011、Mass 2013、Cornwall 2021、Lange 2024、Gavriel 2018、Laipnik 2020），用以替代模擬。","dataviz":"ReefBond monitor renders live time-series charts for six channels (electrical conductivity, water temperature, total dissolved solids, salinity, pH and a raw light-sensor ADC value), a recent-image gallery and time-lapse playback; records are written about once per second and plots refresh about every two seconds.","dataviz_zh":"ReefBond monitor 會即時繪製六個通道的時間序列圖（導電度、水溫、總溶解固體、鹽度、pH，以及光感測器的原始 ADC 值），另有近期影像圖庫與縮時播放；紀錄大約每秒寫入一次，圖表大約每兩秒更新一次。","datascience":"Record discipline rather than analysis: readings and the manually selected wave level are written to CSV with timestamps, a channel is left blank after more than 6 s without a reading while a measured zero is kept as zero, and the team insists raw ADC and ppm values are not relabelled as lux/PAR or PSU without calibration. Planned work is to key sensor CSVs, photographs and mechanical test sheets to shared experiment and sample identifiers.","datascience_zh":"這裡的重點是記錄紀律而不是分析：讀值與手動選定的造波段位會連同時間戳寫入 CSV，某個通道若超過 6 秒沒有讀值即留空，而真正量到的零值則保留為零；團隊並堅持未經校正的原始 ADC 與 ppm 值不得被改標成 lux/PAR 或 PSU。計畫中的工作是把感測器 CSV、照片與機械測試表單以共用的實驗與樣本識別碼串接起來。","software":"ReefBond monitor - a browser-based acquisition and recording interface for the underwater test platform (device status, six environmental channels, scheduled photography at 5-86,400 s intervals, time-lapse, CSV export). Published at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/gyhs/reefbondmonitor .","software_zh":"ReefBond monitor，一個供水下測試平台使用、在瀏覽器中執行的擷取與記錄介面（裝置狀態、六個環境通道、間隔 5 至 86,400 秒的定時拍照、縮時影片、CSV 匯出）。發布於 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/gyhs/reefbondmonitor 。","stack":["Arduino Uno","four-in-one digital probe over USB-RS485","analogue pH module (A1) and light sensor (A0)","stepper and DC motor drivers","USB camera","turbidity meter","CSV logging","web/touch monitoring interface","PETG 3D printing"],"techniques":["instrument calibration planning (two-point pH conversion, comparison against reference instruments)","SEM morphology of recovered deposits","Coomassie Brilliant Blue surface-retention staining and NBT reactivity staining","digital force-gauge pull testing with guide-rail loading","in vitro CaCO3 deposition (10 mM CaCl2, 25 mM MgCl2, 10 mM NaHCO3, 25 C, 7 d)"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A school club exhibition with a Chinese-language 'SAVE CORAL REEF' poster, a knowledge quiz with small prizes and whiteboard questions introduced coral biology, reef ecology, threats and existing restoration methods before explaining ReefBond; students and teachers read the displays and talked with the team. Social media extended this, with post-level viewing records of 1,489 views for the iGEM introduction and 679 for the coral-themed post. The strongest element is a published set of six quiz questions and answers written specifically to kill misconceptions the team had encountered - corals are animals, bleaching is not death, an acidic module is a design hypothesis and not proof of increased coral calcification, engineered bacteria stay in the lab. The team states plainly that it has evidence of participation (photos, view counts) but not of learning, and sets out the paired anonymous pre/post records it will collect next.","publicEngagement_zh":"一場校內社團展覽，搭配中文的「SAVE CORAL REEF」海報，以及附小獎品的知識問答與白板提問，在介紹 ReefBond 之前先帶入珊瑚生物學、礁區生態、威脅與既有的復育方法；學生與老師閱讀展板並與團隊交談。社群媒體延伸了這項工作，並有逐篇的觀看紀錄，iGEM 介紹文為 1,489 次觀看，珊瑚主題文為 679 次。最強的部分是一組公開的六題問答，專為擊破團隊實際遇過的迷思而寫，包括珊瑚是動物、白化不等於死亡、酸性模組只是一個設計假說而不是珊瑚鈣化增加的證據、工程菌只留在實驗室內。團隊明白表示自己有參與的證據（照片、觀看次數），但沒有學習成效的證據，並列出下一步要蒐集的匿名配對前後測紀錄。","ihp":"The causal chain is explicit and runs through five strands. A field visit to the Guangdong Marine Science Education Base with Professor Xie (Shenzhen Research Institute, Guangdong Ocean University) and the coral husbandry and restoration staff produced the first redirection: Xie explained that the facility's existing modified mortar already wins on cost and underwater handling but needs surface cleaning, and recommended testing underwater setting time, substrate differences, resistance to water movement and temperature stability - so the team replaced 'bond strength' with a seven-part requirement set (working and setting time, substrate compatibility, disturbance resistance, stable positioning, durability, cost, effects on coral and water quality) and adopted a staged validation pathway starting in ornamental reef aquaria rather than the sea. Yusong Shi, a Westlake University doctoral student and stony-coral hobbyist, turned handling into structure: his insistence on minimising handling disturbance produced the V2 fixed base, screw-in detachable holders and recessed model interfaces, and his suggestion of an ointment-style tube became the roughly 0.5 g single-use small-dose packaging concept. The sharpest change came from four experts converging against the team's own favourite module - Xie doubted their equipment could measure coral calcification rates, Shi recommended simpler mineralization work, Professor Baowei Chen (School of Marine Sciences, Sun Yat-sen University) told them not to interpret external deposition as stimulation of coral metabolism, and Professor Wang (South China University of Technology) prioritised adhesion because mineralization tests are more demanding; instead of dropping or defending the module, the team rewrote its research question to 'does a candidate mineralization module change in vitro deposition, and can that change measurably affect attachment performance?', reinterpreted mineralization as material-interface deposition and kept only comparative screening of the four acidic peptide classes. Professor Wang's point that microbes will use the protein and raise local oxygen demand added aeration, dissolved-oxygen and coral-microbiome questions to the assessment plan, while Professor Xu (College of Environmental and Resource Sciences, Zhejiang University) converted 'did mineral form?' into a method - indirect turbidity and TDS monitoring followed by SEM of endpoint samples - which is why TDS recording and a turbidity meter were added to V2. A peer, Student Chen of Guangdong Guangya High School with internship experience at a South China Sea coral facility, asked how long ReefBond would hold and what failure would mean, which pushed the team from a single tensile number to attachment service life, reapplication after failure and pollution burden. Professor Chen's separation of composition, dose, release, bioavailability and the distinction between functional aging and biodegradation became a six-dimension safety endpoint framework (composition and residues; exposure; degradation; water quality and microbes; deposit contact; organism selection), and the team then read Chinese Biosecurity Law Articles 35-38 and environmental-code Articles 95 and 737-738 against their own plan. They state clearly that no regulatory consultation has yet happened and no live coral has been tested - the honesty is itself part of the method.","ihp_zh":"因果鏈清楚可見，並沿五條線索展開。一次與謝教授（廣東海洋大學深圳研究院）以及珊瑚養護與復育人員同行的廣東海洋科學教育基地實地參訪，帶來了第一次方向修正：謝教授說明該場域現用的改質砂漿在成本與水下操作性上已經勝出，但需要清理表面，並建議測試水下凝結時間、不同基質的差異、抗水流擾動能力與溫度穩定性；於是團隊把「黏結強度」換成一組七項要求（可操作時間與凝結時間、基質相容性、抗擾動性、定位穩定性、耐久性、成本，以及對珊瑚與水質的影響），並採用一條分階段的驗證路徑，從觀賞性珊瑚缸開始而不是直接下海。西湖大學博士生、同時是石珊瑚愛好者的 Yusong Shi 把操作性轉成了結構：他堅持要把操作擾動降到最低，催生出 V2 的固定底座、可旋入拆卸的夾持件與內凹式的模型接合介面，而他提出的藥膏式軟管建議，則變成約 0.5 g 的單次使用小劑量包裝構想。最關鍵的改變來自四位專家一致對著團隊自己最喜歡的那個模組開火：謝教授懷疑他們的設備量不出珊瑚的鈣化速率，Shi 建議把礦化工作做得更簡單，陳寶威教授（中山大學海洋科學學院）告訴他們不要把外部沉積解讀為對珊瑚代謝的刺激，而王教授（華南理工大學）則認為應優先做黏附，因為礦化測試的要求更高；團隊沒有砍掉這個模組，也沒有為它辯護，而是把研究問題改寫為「某個候選礦化模組是否會改變體外沉積，而這個改變是否能在附著表現上造成可量測的差異？」，把礦化重新解釋為材料界面上的沉積，並只保留對四類酸性胜肽的比較性篩選。王教授指出微生物會利用這個蛋白質並提高局部需氧量，這使曝氣、溶氧與珊瑚微生物相的問題被加入評估計畫；而徐教授（浙江大學環境與資源學院）把「到底有沒有形成礦物？」轉換成一套方法，也就是先間接監測濁度與 TDS、再對終點樣本做 SEM，這正是 V2 加入 TDS 記錄與濁度計的原因。一位同儕，廣東廣雅中學的陳同學，曾在南海一處珊瑚場域實習，他問 ReefBond 能撐多久、失效會造成什麼後果，這把團隊從單一的拉伸數值推向附著使用壽命、失效後重新施用與污染負荷。陳教授把成分、劑量、釋放、生物可利用性區分開來，並區分功能性老化與生物降解，這些成為一個六構面的安全性終點框架（成分與殘留；暴露；降解；水質與微生物；沉積物接觸；生物選擇），團隊接著也對照自己的計畫研讀了中國《生物安全法》第 35 至 38 條以及環境法規第 95 條與第 737 至 738 條。他們明白表示目前尚未進行任何法規諮詢，也還沒測試過活體珊瑚，而這份誠實本身就是方法的一部分。","realWorld":"Need is framed with cited numbers rather than slogans: reefs are about 0.2% of the seafloor but support at least 25% of marine species, NOAA recorded bleaching-level heat stress over roughly 84.4% of global reef area in 2023-2025, and a review of historical restoration cases found 60-70% survival for common genera but a median restored area of only 100 m2 monitored for 12 months - which is why the team targets the early post-transplant attachment window rather than restoration as a whole. Four SDGs are claimed with named sub-targets and justification: 14.2 (attachment material for ecosystem restoration), 14.a (the open hardware, operating instructions and published software as marine research-capacity and knowledge transfer), 12.4 and 12.5 (composition, release, degradation and a proposed metric of material consumed per acceptable attachment over a defined period, including reapplication after failure), 9.5 and 9.4 (traceable development and testing capacity), and 11.4 (conservation practice and engagement); SDG 13 is explicitly held as indirect rather than counted. Deployment follows an evidence-gated pathway - laboratory production and functional testing, then functional and safety assessment in aquaria or nurseries, then carefully planned marine trials - with Xie's warning that cost could block large-scale restoration kept on the page. The regulatory path is named but unstarted: teachers and the partner institution will compile composition, residue, dose, release and site information for internal review before consulting local environmental, natural resources and fisheries authorities and the site manager about approvals, filings, organism sources, site use and monitoring. Cost is treated as full accounting - preparation and application losses, replacement, tool reuse, equipment cost, training and maintenance - and after the Jamboree the plan is calibration and repeatability testing of the platform, matched-control comparisons of fusion proteins against the adhesive component and commercial materials, staged safety assessment, aquarium user trials of dispensing and positioning, and returning the data to Professor Xie, Shi and Student Chen to ask whether their concerns were actually answered, recording the reasons for each decision including when results show no improvement.","realWorld_zh":"需求是以引用的數字而非口號架起來的：珊瑚礁約佔海床的 0.2%，卻支撐至少 25% 的海洋物種；NOAA 記錄到 2023 至 2025 年間全球約 84.4% 的珊瑚礁面積承受達白化程度的熱壓力；而一份回顧歷史復育案例的研究發現，常見屬別的存活率為 60 至 70%，但復育面積中位數僅 100 m2、監測期僅 12 個月。這正是團隊把目標放在移植後早期的附著關鍵期，而不是整個復育工作的原因。他們主張對應四項 SDG，並列出具名子目標與理由：14.2（用於生態系復育的附著材料）、14.a（開源硬體、操作說明與公開軟體作為海洋研究能力與知識移轉）、12.4 與 12.5（成分、釋放、降解，以及一項提議的指標，即在一段界定期間內達成每一次可接受附著所消耗的材料量，並含失效後重新施用）、9.5 與 9.4（可追溯的開發與測試能力），以及 11.4（保育實務與公眾參與）；SDG 13 則明確被列為間接而不予計入。部署遵循一條以證據為關卡的路徑，先是實驗室製備與功能測試，再是在水族缸或苗圃中的功能與安全評估，最後才是經仔細規劃的海域試驗，而謝教授關於成本可能阻礙大規模復育的提醒也留在頁面上。法規路徑有被指名但尚未啟動：老師與合作機構將彙整成分、殘留、劑量、釋放與場址資訊供內部審查，之後再就許可、備查、生物來源、場址使用與監測事宜，諮詢當地的環保、自然資源與漁業主管機關以及場址管理者。成本以完整會計的方式處理，包含配製與施用損耗、重新施作、工具重複使用、設備成本、訓練與維護；Jamboree 之後的計畫則是平台的校正與重複性測試、融合蛋白對黏附元件與商用材料的配對對照比較、分階段的安全評估、在水族缸中由使用者實測擠出與定位，以及把資料帶回給謝教授、Shi 與陳同學，問他們當初的疑慮是否真的得到回答，並記錄每一個決定的理由，包括結果顯示沒有改善的那些情形。","partners":["Guangdong Marine Science Education Base (coral husbandry and restoration team)","Professor Xie, Shenzhen Research Institute of Guangdong Ocean University","Yusong Shi, School of Medicine, Westlake University (reef aquarium user)","Professor Baowei Chen, School of Marine Sciences, Sun Yat-sen University","Professor Wang, South China University of Technology (coral-associated microbiology)","Professor Xu, College of Environmental and Resource Sciences, Zhejiang University","Mr Xu, engineering and maker educator (hardware mentor)","Student Chen, Guangdong Guangya High School / South China Sea Institute of Oceanology intern (restoration workshop)","Worldshaper Academy (instructors)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6283/wiki/public/hp/figure-01-hp-overview.webp","caption":"Overview of Human Practices inputs, decisions and project responses: the five strands linking stakeholder advice to design, experiment, safety and follow-up.","caption_zh":"人類實踐的輸入、決策與專案回應總覽：把利害關係人建議連結到設計、實驗、安全與後續工作的五條線索。","credit":"Team GYHS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6283/wiki/public/hp/figure-03-facility-visit.webp","caption":"Field visit and discussion with Professor Xie at the Guangdong Marine Science Education Base, including coral husbandry aquaria and mounting bases.","caption_zh":"在廣東海洋科學教育基地與謝教授的實地參訪與討論，包含珊瑚養護水族缸與固定底座。","credit":"Team GYHS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6283/wiki/public/hp/figure-04-attachment-workflow.webp","caption":"The current coral attachment workflow - nursery growth, attachment with bases, grids, screws or putty, then continued checks - compiled from discussions at the restoration facility.","caption_zh":"目前的珊瑚附著作業流程，即苗圃育成、以底座、網格、螺絲或黏土進行附著，再持續檢查，整理自在該復育場域的討論。","credit":"Team GYHS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6283/wiki/public/hp/figure-05-validation-pathway.webp","caption":"The staged pathway for evaluating a coral attachment material, in which progression depends on evidence from the preceding stage.","caption_zh":"評估珊瑚附著材料的分階段路徑，其中能否往下一階段推進取決於前一階段產生的證據。","credit":"Team GYHS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Adopt GYHS's habit of letting stakeholders attack the module you are most attached to and then rewriting the research question instead of the conclusion: four experts doubted their mineralization story, so the team reinterpreted it as interfacial deposition and kept only a controlled comparative screen. Pair it with their discipline of printing, beside every result, the measurement that would be needed to make the claim and has not yet been made.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"學 GYHS 的習慣：讓利害關係人去攻擊你最捨不得的那個模組，然後改寫研究問題，而不是改寫結論。四位專家都質疑他們的礦化論述，於是團隊把它重新解釋為界面沉積，只保留一項受控的比較性篩選。再搭配他們的另一項紀律：在每一項結果旁邊，都寫出要讓那個主張成立所需、但目前還沒做的量測。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/gyhs/","https://2026.igem.wiki/gyhs/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/gyhs/sustainability","https://2026.igem.wiki/gyhs/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/gyhs/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/gyhs/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/gyhs/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/gyhs/safety-and-security","https://2026.igem.wiki/gyhs/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/gyhs/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/gyhs/assets/index-5Lo3wIOn.js","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/gyhs/reefbondmonitor"],"awards_zh":["最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6284":{"team":"HUST-China","id":"6284","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hust-china/","projectTitle":"IRIS","projectTitle_zh":"IRIS","tagline":"Turning discarded cotton textiles into bacterial-cellulose nanocrystal films that reproduce the iridescence of kingfisher feathers, so the Dian Cui craft needs no birds","tagline_zh":"把廢棄棉織品轉化為細菌纖維素奈米晶體薄膜，重現翠鳥羽毛的虹彩，讓點翠工藝不再需要鳥","summary":"HUST-China built IRIS to resolve an ethical problem inside a Chinese intangible cultural heritage: Dian Cui, the court craft of inlaying kingfisher feathers into metal jewellery. Rather than finding another animal substitute, they went after the physics - keratin-and-air microstructures producing angle-dependent structural colour, with melanin absorbing stray light to raise saturation - and reproduced it by growing bacterial cellulose from discarded cotton textiles, converting it to cellulose nanocrystals and self-assembling those into an ordered photonic structure, layered with pigment-based functional layers. Their design philosophy, formed in dialogue with artisans and conservationists, is 'retain the aesthetic core while abandoning the outdated carrier'. They won the peer-voted iGEMers Prize, and the reasons are legible on the wiki: they hosted a regional forum for other teams modelled on the Jamboree itself, and co-produced open science-communication materials with multiple other teams rather than only publishing their own.","summary_zh":"HUST-China 做 IRIS，是為了解決一項中國非物質文化遺產內部的倫理問題：點翠——把翠鳥羽毛鑲嵌進金屬首飾的宮廷工藝。他們沒有去找另一種動物替代品，而是直接追究背後的物理：角蛋白與空氣交錯的微結構產生隨角度變化的結構色，黑色素則吸收雜散光以提高飽和度。他們改以廢棄棉織品培養細菌纖維素，再轉化為纖維素奈米晶體，讓其自組裝成有序的光子結構，並疊上以色素為基礎的功能層，重現了這個效果。與工藝師和保育人士對話後形成的設計理念是「保留美學核心，捨棄過時的載體」。他們獲得由各隊互相投票選出的 iGEMers Prize，原因在 wiki 上看得很清楚：他們仿照 Jamboree 本身的形式為其他隊伍辦了一場區域論壇，也與多支隊伍共同製作開放的科學傳播材料，而不只是發表自己的東西。","awards":["iGEMers Prize — Winner (Undergrad & Overgrad)","Best Fashion & Cosmetics Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A published 'Who / Why / What / How' stakeholder engagement matrix, offered explicitly as a reusable blueprint for ethical technology research, plus a value-system analysis with value-oriented task execution. Education is organised as a three-dimensional positioning matrix of audience age against outreach domain, so every activity occupies a named cell (for example 'community teenagers x synthetic biology x Dian Cui culture x ecological conservation') and gaps in coverage are visible. SDGs 4, 11 (target 11.4), 12, 15 and 17 (targets 17.16, 17.17) are mapped individually with the specific partner that delivers each.","frameworks_zh":"團隊發布了一套「Who／Why／What／How」利害關係人互動矩陣，並明確定位為可供倫理性技術研究重複使用的藍圖，另有一套價值體系分析與以價值為導向的任務執行方法。教育工作則編排成一張三維定位矩陣，以受眾年齡對推廣領域交叉，每項活動都落在一個具名的格子裡（例如「社區青少年 x 合成生物學 x 點翠文化 x 生態保育」），覆蓋不足的空缺也因此一目了然。SDG 4、11（指標 11.4）、12、15 與 17（指標 17.16、17.17）逐項對應，並指明由哪個夥伴負責落實。","dataviz":"A three-dimensional positioning map of educational practices (audience age x outreach domains); survey-result charts of public preferences for Dian Cui inheritance and conservation approaches; molecular dynamics trajectory analyses with reported standard deviations.","dataviz_zh":"一張教育實踐的三維定位圖（受眾年齡 x 推廣領域）；關於民眾對點翠傳承與保育方式偏好的調查結果圖表；以及附標準差的分子動力學軌跡分析。","datascience":"Public surveys run as design instruments with reported n and percentages: 257+ then more than 400 valid responses (409 valid samples cited for the product-form survey), showing 63% had heard of Dian Cui but only 4% claimed in-depth understanding, 54.1% preferred recreating Dian Cui with substitute materials, 74.08% supported using synthetic biology to reproduce the structural colour, and 61.5% of science information reaching respondents came through short-video channels. The key analytic conclusion reshaped the whole programme: 'the inheritance dilemma stems from a lack of science communication, not public indifference', which produced tiered rather than uniform outreach.","datascience_zh":"民眾問卷被當成設計工具使用，並載明樣本數與百分比：先是 257 份以上、後來超過 400 份有效回覆（產品形式問卷引用 409 份有效樣本），顯示 63% 的人聽過點翠，但只有 4% 自認深入了解；54.1% 偏好以替代材料重現點翠；74.08% 支持用合成生物學重現這種結構色；而填答者接收到的科學資訊有 61.5% 來自短影音管道。最關鍵的分析結論重塑了整個計畫：「傳承困境源自科學傳播不足，而非民眾漠不關心」，因而產生分層而非一體適用的推廣設計。","software":"Molecular dynamics work on an engineered disulfide tether: the S38C/T101C pair was simulated across oxidised and reduced states sharing coordinates and differing only by the SSBOND entry, with pdb2gmx closing the specbond from a 4.0 A Cbeta-Cbeta start to S-S 2.027 A (100% of frames inside 0.18-0.22 nm); reduction released the C-terminal region (CTR-to-core centre-of-mass distance 1.39 +/- 0.05 to 2.41 +/- 0.70 nm, CTR RMSF up ~1.9x). In a six-chain 100 ns per state run the tether settled at 2.96 +/- 0.04 A, 45% beyond its unstrained length, with no frame inside the relaxed 1.95-2.15 A window, so the team explicitly reclassified it as an extended covalent tether rather than a textbook disulfide and modelled it as a deliberately softened harmonic SG-SG bond - a careful negative-result reinterpretation.","software_zh":"針對一個人工設計的雙硫鍵繫鏈所做的分子動力學工作：S38C/T101C 這組突變在氧化與還原兩種狀態下模擬，兩者共用同一組座標，唯一差別是 SSBOND 這一行；pdb2gmx 把 specbond 從起始的 4.0 A Cbeta-Cbeta 距離收攏到 S-S 2.027 A（100% 的影格落在 0.18-0.22 nm 之內）；還原則釋放了 C 端區域（CTR 與核心的質心距離由 1.39 +/- 0.05 nm 增至 2.41 +/- 0.70 nm，CTR 的 RMSF 上升約 1.9 倍）。在六條鏈、每種狀態各 100 ns 的模擬中，繫鏈最終穩定在 2.96 +/- 0.04 A，比其無應變長度多出 45%，而且沒有任何一個影格落在鬆弛的 1.95-2.15 A 區間內，因此團隊明確把它重新歸類為一條被拉伸的共價繫鏈，而不是教科書上的雙硫鍵，並刻意以軟化的諧振 SG-SG 鍵來建模——這是對負面結果一次謹慎的重新解讀。","stack":["GROMACS / pdb2gmx molecular dynamics","ExPASy ProtParam","survey analysis","low-cost custom environmental-control hardware for film casting"],"techniques":["bacterial cellulose production from waste cotton textiles","BC-to-CNC conversion","cellulose nanocrystal self-assembly into ordered photonic films","structural-colour pitch and gradient tuning","protein tag modification for detection","engineered disulfide tether design","abandoned reflectin heterologous expression route"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"HUST-China's education programme is built as a matrix, not a list: a three-dimensional map of audience age against outreach domain, with each activity placed in a named cell so coverage and gaps are both visible. The analytical basis was their own survey work - more than 400 valid responses showing 63% had heard of Dian Cui but only 4% understood it in any depth - which produced the diagnosis that drove everything else: the heritage inheritance crisis is a science-communication failure, not public apathy, so outreach must be tiered rather than uniform. The youngest cell is remote-area online teaching: joining the HUST Graduate Teaching-Support Group in Long'an, Guangxi, they delivered online science classes to local primary-school students, using sharks as the narrative thread to explain a species' importance to marine ecosystem stability and how synthetic biology can produce substitute materials ('Microbial Superheroes: Protecting Sharks'). The most grassroots cell is the Huanyu Cup street outreach, 'Huanyu Together - Reviving the Ancient Craft - Guarding Kingfisher Vitality', run in three staged phases: a community street booth explaining Dian Cui heritage in age-appropriate language with physical replica samples and correcting misconceptions through quizzes and on-site Q&A; close-range handling of craft replicas followed by guided hands-on Dian Cui-style handcraft so children experienced 'listening, seeing and making'; and distribution of science handbooks and souvenirs to consolidate learning. This reached over a hundred community children free of charge and, in the team's own framing, broke the 'waiting for audiences' limitation of traditional lecturing and proved lightweight grassroots outreach is feasible. The 'Colorful Vacation' summer childcare class at the Zisong Yijing Huating neighbourhood in Wuhan deliberately opened three topics in one classroom - synthetic biology, Dian Cui culture and ecological conservation - using science-aesthetic integration and accessible metaphors, with feedback collected during the handcraft session feeding back into the design of activities for younger groups. For secondary students choosing their majors, team members ran an alma mater revisit programme over the winter vacation, delivering lectures at five schools: the First Affiliated High School of Central China Normal University, Zhengding High School in Hebei, Foshan No. 1 High School, Yali High School and Yongji County Experimental High School, covering synthetic biology basics, kingfisher conservation and competition-experience sharing as career guidance. On campus they ran outreach classes and science booths with IRIS culturally inspired creative products. Ecological education left the classroom entirely through joint birdwatching with the HUST Bird Association, explaining kingfisher habitat and wetland ecology in the field, alongside an agreement with the Wuhan Birdwatching Association (President Ming Liang) on data linkage and university-society outreach. Internationally, three rounds of overseas interviews plus cultural exchange in Singapore, the United Kingdom and France carried Chinese aesthetics and kingfisher conservation abroad, with an explicit stance against 'piling up fragmented Chinese symbols or catering to stereotyped Western imaginings of the East', and the narrative strategy drawn from those interviews was 'emotional connection first, transparent technology second'. The work most likely to explain the peer-voted iGEMers Prize is what they did for other teams. On 12 July 2026 HUST-China independently hosted the First Central-China iGEM Forum (CCiF) at the Qiming College Maker Space, deliberately replicating the structure of the international Jamboree - opening speeches, thematic keynotes, a LiveStage presentation block, judge comment sessions and poster-booth free communication - with 15 online and offline teams, invited iGEM senior consultants, former gold medallists and industry guests; 14 teams presented in sequence and received targeted commentary on experimental design, human practices arrangement and logical completeness, then moved to poster booths for peer feedback, and every attendee left with a certificate and themed souvenirs. They also attended Grand APiC, the first Asia-Pacific Synthetic Biology Youth Conference (16-19 August at Southern University of Science and Technology and the University of Hong Kong), joined NAU-CHINA's nationwide ICII (Into China, Into iGEM 2026) community initiative and explicitly borrowed ICII's community-construction logic when designing their own CCiF, and won a Gold Prize at SynBio Challenges 2026 - exchanging with more than ten teams including Jilin University, Wuhan University, Nanjing University and the University of Hong Kong. Three concrete co-productions followed. With Beijing University of Chemical Technology they co-created the science picture book 'Wukong Asks the Way: A Pilgrimage Through Biological Science', and separately contributed specialised content to BUCT's air-to-protein popular-science publication addressing public misconceptions about electro-biocatalytic protein production, jointly refining the argument that proteins made from CO2 and N2 are biologically derived rather than hazardous industrial chemicals and that purification and toxicological evaluation are mandatory before deployment; the text was reviewed by both teams and published on BUCT's wiki as a shared output. With JLU-FBH they joined 'Together with iGEM: Across Villages, From Myths to Facts', a community-driven myth-busting handbook where JLU-FBH acted as chief editor coordinating submissions from over 17 global iGEM teams; HUST-China independently wrote a complete entry debunking the pseudoscience claim that blackened silver ornaments can detect heavy-metal poisons, which after mutual review and format alignment was integrated into the collective handbook and released publicly as a shared anti-misinformation resource for student synthetic biology groups worldwide. Finally, and unusually, the team benchmarked itself against past Best Education winners and published six named next-iteration commitments, each crediting the team it learned from: establish pre/post classroom tests following GreatBay-SCIE's accuracy-based pre/post design; standardise and open-source the Huanyu Cup and childcare-class courses into reusable course packages following RWTH Aachen's open course model; build an online matrix of short videos, graphics and online classrooms to match the 61.5% short-video share found in their survey; turn picture books, handbooks and posters into continuously updated open resources; explore parent and family participation models following GreatBay-SCIE's parent workshops; and keep recording 'whom we asked, what we learned, and what we changed accordingly', writing education as a traceable decision log rather than a list of activities.","publicEngagement_zh":"HUST-China 的教育計畫是以矩陣而非清單搭起來的：一張受眾年齡對推廣領域的三維地圖，每項活動都放進一個具名的格子，因此覆蓋到哪裡、哪裡還缺，都看得見。分析基礎是他們自己的問卷——超過 400 份有效回覆顯示 63% 聽過點翠，但只有 4% 有任何深度的了解——由此得出帶動其餘一切的診斷：非遺傳承的危機是科學傳播的失敗，不是民眾冷漠，所以推廣必須分層，不能一體適用。年齡最小的那一格是偏鄉線上教學：他們加入華中科技大學在廣西隆安的研究生支教團，為當地小學生上線上科學課，以鯊魚作為敘事主線，說明一個物種對海洋生態系穩定的重要性，以及合成生物學如何做出替代材料（「微生物超級英雄：保護鯊魚」）。最貼近基層的一格是「環宇杯」街頭推廣活動「環宇同行——重現古藝——守護翠鳥生機」，分三個階段進行：先在社區街頭設攤，用符合年齡的語言解釋點翠這項工藝，備有實體複製樣品，並透過問答與現場提問糾正錯誤認知；接著讓孩子近距離把玩工藝複製品，再帶他們動手做點翠風格的手工藝，完整經歷「聽、看、做」；最後發放科普手冊與紀念品以鞏固學習。這場活動免費觸及一百多位社區兒童，用團隊自己的說法，它打破了傳統講座「等觀眾上門」的限制，證明輕量級的基層推廣是可行的。在武漢紫松逸景華庭社區辦的「繽紛假期」暑期托管課，刻意在同一間教室裡同時打開三個主題——合成生物學、點翠文化與生態保育——以科學與美學結合的方式和易懂的比喻講述，手作環節蒐集到的回饋則回頭用於設計給更低年齡層的活動。針對正在選填科系的中學生，隊員利用寒假回母校宣講，在五所學校開講：華中師範大學第一附屬中學、河北正定中學、佛山市第一中學、雅禮中學與永吉縣實驗高中，內容涵蓋合成生物學基礎、翠鳥保育與競賽經驗分享，作為生涯輔導。在校內，他們開設推廣課程並設置科普攤位，搭配 IRIS 的文創產品。生態教育則完全走出教室：他們與校內觀鳥協會合辦賞鳥活動，在野外解說翠鳥棲地與濕地生態，並與武漢觀鳥協會（會長 Ming Liang）達成資料串連與校會合作推廣的協議。在國際面，三輪海外訪談加上在新加坡、英國與法國的文化交流，把中式美學與翠鳥保育帶到國外；他們也明確表態反對「堆砌零碎的中國符號，或迎合西方對東方的刻板想像」，而從這些訪談整理出的敘事策略是「先建立情感連結，再談透明的技術」。最能解釋他們為何能拿下各隊互投的 iGEMers Prize 的，是他們替其他隊伍做的事。2026 年 7 月 12 日，HUST-China 獨力在啟明學院創客空間舉辦第一屆華中 iGEM 論壇（CCiF），刻意複製國際 Jamboree 的架構——開幕致詞、主題演講、LiveStage 報告時段、評審評論環節與海報攤位自由交流——共有 15 支線上與線下隊伍參與，並邀請 iGEM 資深顧問、歷屆金獎隊伍成員與產業界來賓；14 支隊伍依序報告，針對實驗設計、人類實踐安排與邏輯完整性收到具體評論，之後移往海報攤位接受同儕回饋，所有參加者都領到證書與主題紀念品。他們也參加了第一屆亞太合成生物學青年大會 Grand APiC（8 月 16-19 日，在南方科技大學與香港大學舉行），加入 NAU-CHINA 發起的全國性社群計畫 ICII（Into China, Into iGEM 2026），並明白表示自己設計 CCiF 時借用了 ICII 的社群建構邏輯；他們還在 SynBio Challenges 2026 拿到金獎——過程中與吉林大學、武漢大學、南京大學與香港大學等十多支隊伍交流。接著是三項具體的共同產出。他們與北京化工大學共同創作科普繪本《悟空問路：生物科學取經記》，另外也為 BUCT 關於「空氣變蛋白」的科普出版物提供專業內容，處理民眾對電化學生物催化產製蛋白的誤解，並共同把論點打磨清楚：以 CO2 與 N2 製成的蛋白質來源是生物性的，而非危險的工業化學品，但在實際應用前必須完成純化與毒理評估；該文經兩隊互審後，刊在 BUCT 的 wiki 上作為共享產出。他們也與 JLU-FBH 一同參與「Together with iGEM: Across Villages, From Myths to Facts」——一本由社群驅動的破除迷思手冊，由 JLU-FBH 擔任主編，統整全球 17 支以上 iGEM 隊伍的投稿；HUST-China 獨立撰寫了一則完整條目，駁斥「銀飾變黑可以驗出重金屬毒物」這個偽科學說法，經互審與格式統一後併入這本集體手冊，並公開發布，成為全球學生合成生物學社群共用的反錯誤資訊資源。最後，也相當少見：團隊拿自己去對標歷屆 Best Education 得主，公布六項具名的下一輪改進承諾，每一項都註明是向哪支隊伍學來的：參考 GreatBay-SCIE 以正確率為基礎的前後測設計，建立課堂前後測；參考 RWTH Aachen 的開放課程模式，把環宇杯與托管班的課程標準化、開源成可重複使用的課程包；建立短影音、圖文與線上課堂的線上矩陣，以對應問卷中 61.5% 的短影音佔比；把繪本、手冊與海報轉為持續更新的開放資源；參考 GreatBay-SCIE 的家長工作坊，探索家長與家庭參與的模式；並持續記錄「我們問了誰、學到什麼、又因此改了什麼」，把教育寫成一份可追溯的決策紀錄，而不是一張活動清單。","ihp":"Human Practices is described as the strategic engine and compass rather than a parallel track, and the evidence supports it. Early dialogue with Dian Cui artisans, cultural scholars and conservationists produced the zero-animal-harm ecological baseline and the design philosophy of retaining the aesthetic core while abandoning the outdated carrier. Expert consultation on the in vitro film-formation difficulty of reflectin triggered a decisive wet-lab pivot: the reflectin module was abandoned entirely for the fashion-waste-to-CNC route. Further expert feedback produced protein tag modifications for easier detection and optimisation of the BC-to-CNC conversion. Market research and public surveys redefined the product from a museum replica into mid-priced Bio-Fashion daily-wear jewellery, which in turn drove the team to design custom cost-conscious hardware for better environmental control during film casting. Stakeholder findings were specific: Teacher Liu Yang at Beijing 798's Slow Time Handicraft Workshop showed that peacock-feather imitations are too green and bright and crack and peel; the manager of the Guangzhou Yuequ Intangible Cultural Heritage Inheritance Institute explained that natural peacock feathers carry high loss and raw-material cost, that Dian Cui has high social-media popularity but far fewer offline experience visits than mother-of-pearl, that goose feathers and blue pattern paper cannot replicate the iridescence, and that a real Dian Cui sealing layer destroys the iridescence - a pain point that became the team's core engineering goal of reconciling film durability with structural-colour retention. Systematic museum benchmarking at the Palace Museum, Hong Kong Palace Museum, Zhenbao (Treasure) Museum and Hubei Provincial Museum set the optical performance target and informed film pitch and colour-gradient tuning; at the Hubei Provincial Museum the absence of genuine Dian Cui and the crudeness of the gift-shop imitations pushed them away from motif reproduction toward material reproduction. Government engagement produced a written reply from the Wuhan Bureau of Landscape Architecture and Forestry confirming Wuhan has no traditional Dian Cui manufacturers and no records of illegal hunting or trade, which deliberately shifted the team's narrative from 'solving current poaching' to 'preventing potential poaching risks' via positive biodiversity publicity; a dedicated symposium with the Wuhan Ecology and Environment Bureau on 10 September 2025 brought in solid-waste, ecological-protection and environmental-industry experts and standardised lab waste management and compliant waste-cellulose sourcing.","ihp_zh":"人類實踐被定位為整個專案的策略引擎與指南針，而不是一條平行的支線，而證據也支持這個說法。早期與點翠工藝師、文化學者與保育人士的對話，確立了零動物傷害的生態底線，以及「保留美學核心、捨棄過時載體」的設計理念。關於 reflectin 在體外難以成膜的專家諮詢，促成濕實驗的決定性轉向：reflectin 模組被完全放棄，改走「時尚廢棄物轉 CNC」的路線。後續的專家意見帶來蛋白質標籤的修改以方便偵測，也促成 BC 轉 CNC 流程的最佳化。市場調查與民眾問卷把產品從博物館複製品重新定義為中價位、可日常佩戴的 Bio-Fashion 首飾，這又促使團隊自行設計低成本硬體，以在薄膜製備時更好地控制環境條件。利害關係人的回饋很具體：北京 798 慢時光手作工坊的 Liu Yang 老師指出，孔雀羽毛做的仿品偏綠偏亮，而且會開裂、剝落；廣州 Yuequ 非物質文化遺產傳承院的負責人說明，天然孔雀羽毛的損耗與原料成本都高，點翠在社群媒體上熱度很高、但實際到店體驗的人數遠低於螺鈿，鵝毛與藍色花紋紙都無法重現那種虹彩，而真正的點翠封層會破壞虹彩——這個痛點後來成為團隊的核心工程目標：讓薄膜的耐久性與結構色的保留能夠兼得。他們也系統性地到故宮博物院、香港故宮文化博物館、珍寶館與湖北省博物館做實物對標，據此訂出光學表現目標，並調整薄膜的螺距與色彩漸層；在湖北省博物館，館內沒有真品點翠、紀念品店的仿品又相當粗糙，使他們從「重現紋樣」轉向「重現材料」。與政府部門的往來則取得武漢市園林和林業局的書面回覆，確認武漢沒有傳統點翠製造業者，也沒有非法獵捕或交易的紀錄，這讓團隊刻意把敘事從「解決當前的盜獵問題」轉為「透過正面的生物多樣性宣導，預防潛在的盜獵風險」；2025 年 9 月 10 日與武漢市生態環境局合辦的專題座談，請來固體廢棄物、生態保護與環保產業的專家，促成實驗室廢棄物管理的標準化，以及合規的廢棄纖維素來源管道。","realWorld":"Four reusable outputs are named explicitly: the value-system analysis and value-oriented task execution framework; the documented Who/Why/What/How stakeholder engagement matrix as a blueprint for ethical technology research; open-source educational resources co-created with other teams; and low-cost hardware promoted so other teams and industry can fabricate structural-colour films more consistently on a limited budget. Market positioning was derived from field evidence: Wuhan SKP luxury retail (Louis Vuitton, Rolex) as the high end, the Tanhualin district in Wuhan and Chongqing cultural-creative markets as the affordable end, where the team found Dian Cui and imitation products essentially absent and most blue ornaments made from pigment, mother-of-pearl or spun thread - establishing the mid-tier sustainable jewellery gap IRIS targets.","realWorld_zh":"團隊明確列出四項可重複使用的產出：價值體系分析與以價值為導向的任務執行框架；已文件化的 Who/Why/What/How 利害關係人互動矩陣，作為倫理性技術研究的藍圖；與其他隊伍共同創作的開源教育資源；以及對外推廣的低成本硬體，讓其他隊伍與產業能在有限預算下更穩定地製作結構色薄膜。市場定位則是從田野證據推導出來的：高端對標武漢 SKP 的精品零售（Louis Vuitton、Rolex），平價端則看武漢曇華林一帶與重慶的文創市集，而團隊發現點翠與其仿品在那裡基本上不存在，多數藍色飾品是以色素、螺鈿或繞線製成——由此確立 IRIS 要切入的中價位永續首飾缺口。","partners":["Palace Museum (Beijing)","Hong Kong Palace Museum","Zhenbao (Treasure) Museum","Hubei Provincial Museum","Beijing 798 Slow Time Handicraft Workshop (Teacher Liu Yang)","Guangzhou Yuequ Intangible Cultural Heritage Inheritance Institute","Tashan Academy - Book Neighbor Haven","Wuhan Bureau of Landscape Architecture and Forestry","Wuhan Ecology and Environment Bureau","Wuhan Birdwatching Association (President Ming Liang)","HUST Bird Association","HUST Graduate Teaching-Support Group, Long'an, Guangxi","Zisong Yijing Huating community childcare class, Wuhan","First Affiliated High School of Central China Normal University; Zhengding High School, Hebei; Foshan No. 1 High School; Yali High School; Yongji County Experimental High School","Prof. Cai Xinyuan, School of Design, HUST","Wuhan SKP","iGEM teams: BUCT (picture book and air-to-protein publication), JLU-FBH (myth-busting handbook with 17+ teams), NAU-CHINA (ICII), Jilin University, Wuhan University, Nanjing University, University of Hong Kong","Grand APiC (SUSTech and HKU)","SynBio Challenges 2026"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6284/wiki/image/wiki/education-wiki/education1-1.avif","caption":"The three-dimensional positioning map of educational practices: audience age against outreach domain, so every activity occupies a named cell","caption_zh":"教育實踐的三維定位圖：受眾年齡對推廣領域，每項活動都落在一個具名的格子裡","credit":"Team HUST-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6284/wiki/image/wiki/education-wiki/education4.avif","caption":"The Huanyu Cup street outreach booth, 'Huanyu Together - Reviving the Ancient Craft - Guarding Kingfisher Vitality'","caption_zh":"「環宇杯」街頭推廣攤位：「環宇同行——重現古藝——守護翠鳥生機」","credit":"Team HUST-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6284/wiki/image/wiki/education-wiki/education5.avif","caption":"Community booth: immersive intangible cultural heritage experience for children, reaching over a hundred free of charge","caption_zh":"社區攤位：為兒童設計的沉浸式非物質文化遺產體驗，免費觸及一百多人","credit":"Team HUST-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6284/wiki/image/wiki/education-wiki/education3.avif","caption":"Online class for primary-school students in Long'an, Guangxi: 'Microbial Superheroes: Protecting Sharks'","caption_zh":"為廣西隆安小學生開設的線上課程：「微生物超級英雄：保護鯊魚」","credit":"Team HUST-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6284/wiki/image/wiki/education-wiki/education10.avif","caption":"The myth-busting handbook co-developed with JLU-FBH and over 17 global iGEM teams, 'Together with iGEM: Across Villages, From Myths to Facts'","caption_zh":"與 JLU-FBH 及全球 17 支以上 iGEM 隊伍共同開發的破除迷思手冊「Together with iGEM: Across Villages, From Myths to Facts」","credit":"Team HUST-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6284/wiki/image/wiki/education-wiki/education11.avif","caption":"'Wukong Asks the Way: A Pilgrimage Through Biological Science', the science picture book co-created with the BUCT team","caption_zh":"《悟空問路：生物科學取經記》，與 BUCT 隊伍共同創作的科普繪本","credit":"Team HUST-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6284/wiki/image/wiki/education-wiki/education9.avif","caption":"An on-site Dian Cui-style handcraft workshop, the 'making' stage of the three-stage booth design","caption_zh":"現場的點翠風格手作工坊，也就是三階段攤位設計中的「做」","credit":"Team HUST-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Earn peer goodwill by building infrastructure for other teams, not just audiences: HUST hosted a regional forum that replicated the Jamboree's own format (keynotes, LiveStage talks, judge commentary, poster walk) for 15 teams, then wrote entries into two other teams' open publications - and publicly benchmarked its own education against past Best Education winners with six named, credited improvements for next year.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"想贏得同儕的好感，就去為其他隊伍建基礎設施，而不只是對著觀眾做推廣：HUST 為 15 支隊伍辦了一場區域論壇，完整複製 Jamboree 自己的形式（主題演講、LiveStage 報告、評審評論、海報巡展），接著替另外兩支隊伍的開放出版物撰寫條目——而且還公開拿自己的教育工作去對標歷屆 Best Education 得主，列出六項具名、並註明向誰學習的明年改進事項。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/hust-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hust-china/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/hust-china/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/hust-china/collaboration","https://2026.igem.wiki/hust-china/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/hust-china/sustainable"],"awards_zh":["iGEMers 票選獎 — 得主（大學暨研究生組）","最佳時尚與美妝專案 — 入圍"],"rank":33},"6289":{"team":"ETH-Zurich","id":"6289","section":"Overgrad","country":"Switzerland","village":"Foundational Advance","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/eth-zurich/","projectTitle":"preCISe","projectTitle_zh":"preCISe","tagline":"A modular tool for precise intracellular delivery using contractile injection systems","tagline_zh":"一套以收縮式注射系統實現精準胞內遞送的模組化工具","summary":"About 79% of the human proteome is intracellular and largely undruggable, and no approved protein therapeutic delivers an exchangeable protein cargo into the cytosol. preCISe engineers Photorhabdus virulence cassettes (PVCs), bacterial extracellular contractile injection systems that act as molecular syringes, into a retargetable delivery platform: a SpyTag/SpyCatcher-attached binder arm swaps the target without re-engineering the cage, demonstrated against CD20 on engineered mammalian cells with a piggyBac Cre-loxP reporter line (preCISion) that turns on GFP only when Cre reaches the cytosol. To raise specificity they added dual targeting, splitting the cargo across two PVCs against two receptors. It won Best Software and Best Foundational Advance because the platform ships as reusable infrastructure: 29 tested protocols, a part collection for evaluating intracellular delivery, and two open-source tools, deCISion and OpenSplitProtein.","summary_zh":"人類蛋白質體約有 79% 位於細胞內、且大多無法成藥，而目前沒有任何已核准的蛋白質藥物能把可替換的蛋白質酬載送進細胞質。preCISe 把 Photorhabdus virulence cassette（PVC）——一種細菌的胞外收縮式注射系統、功能上就像分子注射器——改造成一個可更換標的的遞送平台：一個以 SpyTag/SpyCatcher 接上的結合子臂可以替換標的，而不必重新改造整個外殼；他們以工程化哺乳類細胞上的 CD20 示範，並建立了一株以 piggyBac Cre-loxP 為基礎的報告細胞株（preCISion），只有在 Cre 真的抵達細胞質時才會打開 GFP。為提升專一性，他們加入了雙標的設計，把酬載拆分到兩個針對不同受體的 PVC 上。此專題拿下最佳軟體與最佳基礎進展獎，因為這個平台是以可重複使用的基礎設施形式交付：29 份經測試的實驗規程、一組用於評估胞內遞送的元件集合，以及兩套開源工具 deCISion 與 OpenSplitProtein。","awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Part Collection — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Software — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Foundational Advance Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Both tools are deliberately model-free, which is the team's central dry-lab argument. OpenSplitProtein ranks every peptide bond in a .pdb or .cif structure on two separate questions rather than one blended score: split tolerance (packing density weighted by inverse squared distance, distance from the buried core, solvent exposure summed over the flanking pair) and fragment reassembly (cross-cut contacts within 8 A, size-normalised interface, interface-to-cohesion ratio). No network was trained and no coefficient was fitted into the ranking; the only constants are the direction of each measurement, two size exponents from the domain-parsing literature and the 8 A contact cutoff. Crucially they defined a structure-free baseline (the length of the shorter fragment, plus relative position i/n) and showed that cross-cut contacts flip sign once it is held fixed, from +0.174 to -0.108, meaning the naive positive correlation was an artefact of chain geometry. Validation used Tsuboyama et al. (2023) cDNA display proteolysis insertion-stability labels at 13,622 backbone positions across 293 domains in 129 sequence families for split tolerance, and 223 split-intein sites from the Int-In dataset (126 with graded efficiency) for reassembly, with feature selection frozen before the test sites were seen and no sequence family shared at 40% identity nor fold at TM-score 0.3. deCISion is a database-integration pipeline rather than a predictor, chaining the Cell Surface Protein Atlas, Human Protein Atlas, SAbDab, Cellosaurus, UniProt, RCSB PDB, NCBI, the iGEM Registry and the Kazusa codon table.","frameworks_zh":"兩套工具都刻意不依賴模型，這是團隊乾實驗的核心論點。OpenSplitProtein 會為一個 .pdb 或 .cif 結構中的每一個胜肽鍵評分，但分成兩個獨立的問題、而不是混成單一分數：切點容忍度（以距離平方倒數加權的堆積密度、與埋藏核心的距離、兩側殘基對的溶劑暴露總和）與片段重組能力（8 Å 內的跨切點接觸數、依大小標準化的介面、介面與內聚的比值）。排序中沒有訓練任何網路、也沒有擬合任何係數；唯一的常數是每項量測的方向、兩個取自區域切分文獻的大小指數，以及 8 Å 的接觸截斷值。關鍵在於他們定義了一條不依賴結構的基準線（較短片段的長度，加上相對位置 i/n），並顯示一旦固定這條基準線，跨切點接觸數的相關性就會翻轉符號，從 +0.174 變成 -0.108，意即原本那個看似正向的相關其實是鏈幾何造成的假象。驗證方面，切點容忍度使用 Tsuboyama 等人（2023）的 cDNA display 蛋白酶解插入穩定性標註，涵蓋 129 個序列家族、293 個結構域中的 13,622 個骨幹位點；重組能力則使用 Int-In 資料集中的 223 個分裂內含肽位點（其中 126 個有分級效率數據）；特徵選擇在看到測試位點之前即已凍結，兩組之間在 40% 相同度下不共用序列家族、在 TM-score 0.3 下不共用折疊。deCISion 則是一條資料庫整合流程、而不是預測器，串接 Cell Surface Protein Atlas、Human Protein Atlas、SAbDab、Cellosaurus、UniProt、RCSB PDB、NCBI、iGEM Registry 與 Kazusa 密碼子使用表。","dataviz":"The benchmark is reported as a percentile table against three comparators of different kinds, and the team says so explicitly: SplitSeek-Pro (a true competitor), the 2019 iGEM Protein-split Model, and ThermoMPNN-I (not split software at all, but the only released model predicting the insertion label directly, included as the hardest baseline). On 21 published split sites across superfolder GFP, Cre recombinase, horseradish peroxidase, firefly luciferase, Cas9 and NanoLuc, OpenSplitProtein puts the working site at a median 21st percentile with 13 of 21 in the top quarter, against a random expectation of 50; a 22nd site (Cas9 713/714) is excluded and the reason given. Both tools run in the browser (OpenSplitProtein needs only the HTML file opened; structures never leave the user's machine) with a 3D viewer showing the cut and both halves, and the wiki itself is a searchable static site with term callouts, a 'cut anatomy' diagram and an interactive outreach map rendered with d3-geo and topojson over OpenStreetMap and Natural Earth data. Published figures carry explicit tables for how to read a correlation column.","dataviz_zh":"基準測試以百分位表格對照三個性質各異的比較對象呈現，團隊也明確說明理由：SplitSeek-Pro（真正的競爭對手）、2019 年 iGEM 的 Protein-split Model，以及 ThermoMPNN-I（它根本不是切點軟體，但是唯一已釋出、能直接預測該插入穩定性標註的模型，作為最嚴苛的基準納入）。在 superfolder GFP、Cre recombinase、辣根過氧化酶、螢火蟲螢光素酶、Cas9 與 NanoLuc 上共 21 個已發表的切點中，OpenSplitProtein 把可用切點排在中位數第 21 百分位，21 個中有 13 個落在前四分之一，而隨機期望值為 50；另有第 22 個位點（Cas9 713/714）被排除，理由也有說明。兩套工具都能在瀏覽器中執行（OpenSplitProtein 只需開啟 HTML 檔，結構資料從不離開使用者電腦），並附 3D 檢視器顯示切點與兩個半邊；wiki 本身是一個可搜尋的靜態網站，有術語提示框、一張「切點解剖」示意圖，以及一張以 d3-geo 與 topojson 疊在 OpenStreetMap 與 Natural Earth 資料上繪製的互動科普地圖。發表的圖表都附上明確的表格，說明相關性那一欄該怎麼讀。","datascience":"The project's data-science contribution is the separation of proxy label from real task. Insertion stability measures the cost of perturbing an intact chain, never the cost of releasing two fragments, and the wiki states that difference rather than eliding it; the split-intein set is then used as the only label that directly tests reassembly. Scores are converted to within-structure ranks (0-1, displayed 0-100) so results are comparable across proteins of different size, and selection and testing datasets are separated with structural alignment checks. deCISion turns a public mass-spectrometry atlas into an actionable ranking: it reports each surface receptor's measurement strength on the chosen cell type and how many of the 47 CSPA cell types it was detected on as a specificity proxy, counter-checks normal tissue, cell-type, blood and tumour expression from the Human Protein Atlas, and lists only nanobodies and scFvs from solved structures with measured Kd where one exists (and states that only 1,019 of 14,860 SAbDab binders, 6.9%, have one). Limitations are enumerated rather than hidden: 47 cell types only, selectivity across cultured lines is not tissue specificity, and 'not detected' is not absence because Cell Surface Capture only sees N-glycosylated protein.","datascience_zh":"此專題在資料科學上的貢獻，是把替代標註與真正的任務區分開來。插入穩定性量的是擾動一條完整鏈的代價，從來不是釋放兩個片段的代價，wiki 把這個差別明說出來、而不是含混帶過；分裂內含肽資料集隨後被當成唯一能直接檢驗重組能力的標註使用。分數會換算成同一結構內的排名（0-1，顯示為 0-100），使不同大小的蛋白質之間可以比較，而選擇集與測試集之間也以結構比對檢查加以隔離。deCISion 把一個公開的質譜圖譜轉成可行動的排序：它回報每個表面受體在所選細胞型別上的量測強度，以及它在 47 種 CSPA 細胞型別中被檢出過幾種（作為專一性的替代指標），再以 Human Protein Atlas 交叉檢核正常組織、細胞型別、血液與腫瘤的表現量，並只列出有解出結構的奈米抗體與 scFv、在有數據時附上實測 Kd（並說明 SAbDab 的 14,860 個結合子中只有 1,019 個、即 6.9% 有 Kd 數據）。限制是列舉出來、而不是藏起來：只有 47 種細胞型別、培養細胞株之間的選擇性不等於組織專一性，而「未檢出」不等於不存在，因為 Cell Surface Capture 只看得到帶 N-糖基化的蛋白質。","software":"Two released tools. OpenSplitProtein (gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/eth-zurich/opensplitprotein) ranks split sites from a structure file, installation-free in the browser. deCISion (gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/eth-zurich/decision) turns a cell type into a PVC construct in five steps: pick one of 47 CSPA human cell types by name, disease or tissue; choose a receptor; choose a nanobody or scFv binder (whole antibodies are rejected as too large for a PVC); accept the published XTEN linker or paste your own (pointing users to iGEM Calgary 2023's LINKED database); assemble binder-linker-SpyCatcher and export protein and DNA sequences as FASTA plus GenBank and SBOL3, with the three plasmids to order (cage, cargo, binder arm) listed. It ships MIT-licensed with a web interface, a JSON API and a CLI, 28 automated tests on every push through GitLab CI, a Docker build, a 2.5-minute demo video, and documentation of the architecture, the data build, what did not work and what the software cannot tell you. The team also published 29 tested eCIS protocols and a piggyBac/SpyTag part collection.","software_zh":"釋出了兩套工具。OpenSplitProtein（gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/eth-zurich/opensplitprotein）從一個結構檔為切點排序，在瀏覽器中免安裝執行。deCISion（gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/eth-zurich/decision）以五個步驟把一個細胞型別轉成一個 PVC 構築：依名稱、疾病或組織從 47 種 CSPA 人類細胞型別中挑一種；選一個受體；選一個奈米抗體或 scFv 結合子（完整抗體會被拒絕，因為對 PVC 來說太大）；接受已發表的 XTEN 連接子或貼上自己的（並指引使用者參考 iGEM Calgary 2023 的 LINKED 資料庫）；最後組裝成結合子-連接子-SpyCatcher，把蛋白質與 DNA 序列匯出成 FASTA，另附 GenBank 與 SBOL3，並列出要訂購的三個質體（外殼、酬載、結合子臂）。它以 MIT 授權釋出，提供網頁介面、JSON API 與 CLI，透過 GitLab CI 在每次推送時執行 28 項自動化測試，另有 Docker 建置、一支 2.5 分鐘的示範影片，以及架構、資料建置、哪些做法行不通，與這套軟體無法告訴你什麼等文件。團隊也發表了 29 份經測試的 eCIS 實驗規程，以及一組 piggyBac/SpyTag 元件集合。","stack":["GitLab CI","Python 3.11","bun","Docker","MIT licence","JSON API + CLI + web UI","FASTA / GenBank / SBOL3 export","Cell Surface Protein Atlas (CSPA)","Human Protein Atlas","SAbDab","Cellosaurus","UniProt / RCSB PDB / NCBI","Kazusa codon usage database","iGEM Registry (BBa_K1159201 SpyTag)","d3-geo / topojson","BioRender"],"techniques":["geometric structure scoring (packing density, SASA, cross-cut contacts)","within-structure rank normalisation","confounder adjustment against a structure-free baseline","benchmark against published split sites and a stability-prediction baseline","family- and fold-level data leakage control (40% identity, TM-score 0.3)","surfaceomics-driven target selection and counter-selection","SpyTag/SpyCatcher modular retargeting","split-protein and split-intein design","piggyBac transposon reporter line construction","SWOT stakeholder analysis"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education was structured on three pillars (outreach, media, events) with a defined target audience per group and a before-and-after survey used as the measurement instrument, not just feedback. They visited four Swiss high schools (Kantonsschule Uster, Seetal, the cantonal high school for adults, Hohe Promenade) reaching over 130 students in formats from 45 to 90 minutes, and ran a hands-on week at the Wyss Zurich mint & pepper BioSTARS summer camp with 20 students from across Switzerland who performed their own PCR and gel electrophoresis, co-hosted with iGEM Zurich; over 150 students in total. They published two scientific-journal articles including one in BIOspektrum, ran a YouTube channel, co-hosted the Swiss iGEM Meetup for five teams, and presented at the Student Biolab welcome event, with about 16,900 social views. All templates and teaching material are published for reuse.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育工作建立在三根支柱上（科普、媒體、活動），每個群體都有明確界定的對象，並以前後問卷作為量測工具、而不只是收集感想。他們走訪了四所瑞士高中（Kantonsschule Uster、Seetal、成人州立高中、Hohe Promenade），以 45 到 90 分鐘不等的形式觸及超過 130 位學生；並與 iGEM Zurich 合辦，在 Wyss Zurich 的 mint & pepper BioSTARS 夏令營帶了一週的動手做課程，20 位來自瑞士各地的學生親手跑了 PCR 與膠體電泳；合計超過 150 位學生。他們發表了兩篇科學期刊文章（其中一篇在 BIOspektrum）、經營一個 YouTube 頻道、與人合辦了有五隊參加的瑞士 iGEM 聚會，並在 Student Biolab 的迎新活動上發表，社群媒體觀看數約 16,900 次。所有模板與教學材料都已公開供再利用。","ihp":"24 interviews across six stakeholder groups, each analysed with a SWOT grid, and the changes are concrete. The project began as an eCIS biopesticide against Drosophila suzukii in Swiss crops; conversations with Drosophila experts and BFH European Meet-Up judges (Dr. Nicole Gensch, Amelia Wei) established that this was not viable and the team pivoted to human intracellular delivery while keeping eCIS. Scientific experts in the Pilhofer and Food Microbiology labs drove the choice of CD20 as the proof-of-concept target and the design of the reporter systems. The dual-targeting split-cargo concept was invented in direct response to expert questions about off-target risk, and OpenSplitProtein exists only because that concept needed a cut site: the wiki states the idea came from those conversations, recorded under Human Practices. Dr. Max Brackmann (NBC arms control laboratory, Spiez) assessed the work case-by-case against CDC and Robert Koch Institute checklists and concluded neither the PVC work nor deCISion required additional biosafety layers; the idea of building deCISion on the CSPA came from Prof. Bernd Wollscheid, after the team found the existing SISYPHUS interface unusable for their actual question. Investors and companies (Athebio, Procavea, Nanosyrinx) pushed specificity, off-target data, IP and scalability, and advised focusing a platform on one lead application.","ihp_zh":"24 場訪談橫跨六個利害關係人群體，每一場都以 SWOT 表格分析，而改動都很具體。這個專題最初是要做一款針對瑞士作物上 Drosophila suzukii 的 eCIS 生物農藥；與果蠅專家及 BFH 歐洲聚會評審（Dr. Nicole Gensch、Amelia Wei）的交流確立了這條路不可行，團隊於是轉向人類胞內遞送，但保留了 eCIS。Pilhofer 與食品微生物學實驗室的科學專家促成了以 CD20 作為概念驗證標的的選擇，以及報告系統的設計。雙標的拆分酬載的構想，是直接回應專家對脫靶風險的質問而生，而 OpenSplitProtein 之所以存在，純粹是因為那個構想需要一個切點：wiki 明確說明這個想法來自那些對話，並記錄在人類實踐之下。Dr. Max Brackmann（Spiez 的 NBC 軍備管制實驗室）逐案以美國 CDC 與 Robert Koch 研究所的檢核表評估這些工作，結論是 PVC 工作與 deCISion 都不需要額外的生物安全層級；而把 deCISion 建在 CSPA 之上的想法來自 Prof. Bernd Wollscheid，當時團隊發現既有的 SISYPHUS 介面無法用來回答他們真正的問題。投資人與公司（Athebio、Procavea、Nanosyrinx）則推動他們重視專一性、脫靶數據、智慧財產與可規模化，並建議把一個平台聚焦在單一個先導應用上。","realWorld":"The team is explicit that this is a foundational advance handed to others rather than a product: the stated purpose is to let future iGEM teams and researchers engineer eCIS more easily, backed by 29 protocols with recommended controls for teams with no prior wet-lab experience, a part collection, and two MIT-licensed tools. Their own validation honesty is part of the case: they state that the best validation of deCISion would be wet-lab targeting of new cell types from its outputs, that they had neither the time nor the scale, and that confidence therefore rests on the validated public databases underneath. The outlook names the sequence required before any clinical path: uniform and consistent PVC expression, verification of predicted binders, validation of split cargo, an industrially scalable PVC production workflow, then in-vivo mouse work on immune response, degradation, accumulation and efficacy. Clinicians (University Hospital Zurich, Hirslanden) were approached partly to establish contacts should the project continue past the competition.","realWorld_zh":"團隊明確表示這是一項交給他人使用的基礎進展、而不是一項產品：其聲明的目的是讓未來的 iGEM 隊伍與研究者更容易改造 eCIS，支撐這點的是 29 份附建議對照組的實驗規程（供完全沒有濕實驗經驗的隊伍使用）、一組元件集合，以及兩套 MIT 授權的工具。他們對自身驗證的誠實也是論證的一部分：他們直說 deCISion 最好的驗證方式，是依其輸出在濕實驗中針對新的細胞型別做標的實驗，但他們既沒有時間也沒有規模，因此信心只能建立在底層那些已驗證的公開資料庫之上。展望中點名了任何臨床路徑之前必須完成的順序：PVC 表現的一致與穩定、對預測結合子的驗證、對拆分酬載的驗證、一條可工業規模化的 PVC 生產流程，然後才是小鼠體內的免疫反應、降解、累積與療效研究。他們接觸臨床醫師（蘇黎世大學醫院、Hirslanden），部分目的是為專題在競賽結束後若要延續先建立人脈。","partners":["Pilhofer Lab, ETH Zurich (Adam Pinsler, David Schaumann, Dr. Charles Ericson)","Prof. Bernd Wollscheid, ETH Zurich (CSPA)","Dr. Enea Maffei, Food Microbiology, ETH Zurich","Prof. Martin Loessner, ETH Zurich","Prof. Nadia Mazouz, ETH Zurich (ethics)","Dr. Max Brackmann, NBC arms control laboratory Spiez","Dr. James Lapworth, Nanosyrinx","Dr. Tom Edwardson, Procavea Biotech","Dr. Richard Woods and Dr. Johannes Urban, Athebio","Lukas Frischknecht, University Hospital Zurich","Jan Duscha, Hirslanden medical group","Wyss Zurich mint & pepper BioSTARS summer camp","iGEM Zurich (UZH)","BFH European Meet-Up","Student Biolab Zurich","ScopeM, ETH Zurich"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6289/wiki/images/software/opensplitprotein/web1-03-ranked-v3.webp","caption":"OpenSplitProtein's browser interface showing every cut site in an uploaded structure ranked separately for split tolerance and fragment reassembly, instead of a single blended score.","caption_zh":"OpenSplitProtein 的瀏覽器介面，把上傳結構中的每一個切點分別就切點容忍度與片段重組能力排序，而非給出單一混合分數。","credit":"Team ETH-Zurich, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6289/wiki/images/software/decision/howto4-2-receptor.webp","caption":"deCISion's receptor step: surface receptors measured on the chosen CSPA cell type, with measurement strength, how many of the 47 cell types each was detected on as a specificity proxy, and the number of PVC-compatible binders available.","caption_zh":"deCISion 的受體步驟：列出在所選 CSPA 細胞型別上測得的表面受體，附上量測強度、各受體在 47 種細胞型別中被檢出過幾種（作為專一性的替代指標），以及可用的 PVC 相容結合子數量。","credit":"Team ETH-Zurich, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6289/wiki/images/results/retargeting-v3.webp","caption":"Retargeting result: PVCs carrying an anti-CD20 binder arm attached through SpyTag/SpyCatcher act specifically on CD20-expressing preCISion cells.","caption_zh":"更換標的的結果：帶有經 SpyTag/SpyCatcher 接上的抗 CD20 結合子臂的 PVC，專一地作用於表現 CD20 的 preCISion 細胞。","credit":"Team ETH-Zurich, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6289/wiki/images/education/summer-camp-gel.webp","caption":"Students running their own gel electrophoresis at the Wyss Zurich mint & pepper BioSTARS summer camp, where 20 high-school students from across Switzerland worked through a realistic research scenario.","caption_zh":"學生在 Wyss Zurich 的 mint & pepper BioSTARS 夏令營親手跑膠體電泳；20 位來自瑞士各地的高中生在營中走過一個貼近真實的研究情境。","credit":"Team ETH-Zurich, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"The transferable move is cheap-but-honest computation: ETH beat heavier published tools by scoring six geometric quantities, refusing to fit a model, and then spending their effort on validation design instead (a structure-free confounder baseline, frozen feature selection, no shared sequence family or fold between selection and test sets). A school research centre can reproduce that whole method on a laptop, and should copy the companion habit of publishing a 'what the software cannot tell you' section alongside the results.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"可移植的做法是「便宜但誠實」的運算：ETH 只用六個幾何量來評分、拒絕擬合任何模型，就勝過了已發表的更重量級工具，然後把力氣花在驗證設計上（一條不依賴結構的干擾因子基準線、在看到測試資料前就凍結特徵選擇、選擇集與測試集之間不共用序列家族也不共用折疊）。一所學校的研究中心用一台筆電就能重現這整套方法，也該借鏡他們的配套習慣：在結果旁邊附上一節「這套軟體無法告訴你什麼」。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/eth-zurich/","https://2026.igem.wiki/eth-zurich/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/eth-zurich/software/","https://2026.igem.wiki/eth-zurich/software/decision/","https://2026.igem.wiki/eth-zurich/results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/eth-zurich/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/eth-zurich/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/eth-zurich/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/eth-zurich/contribution/"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳元件集 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳軟體 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳基礎推進專案 — 得主"],"rank":136},"6292":{"team":"Stockholm","id":"6292","section":"Overgrad","country":"Sweden","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/stockholm/","projectTitle":"TIDE","projectTitle_zh":"TIDE","tagline":"A yeast that senses bisphenol A and degrades it from the same sensing event, rebuilt as a contained reactor after three experts said open release would never fly","tagline_zh":"一株能偵測雙酚 A、並由同一個偵測事件啟動分解的酵母；在三位專家都說開放釋放絕無可能之後，重新設計成封閉式反應器","summary":"Stockholm (KTH) built TIDE, a three-plasmid Saccharomyces cerevisiae system: a detection module encoding a synthetic LexA-mER-alpha transcription factor, a degradation module encoding laccase, and a GFP reporter, so that detecting BPA also triggers its breakdown. They assembled by Gibson, verified by sequencing, read GFP by microscopy and 96-well plate, measured laccase by a modified ABTS assay at 420 nm and BPA removal by LC-MS, and built a modular dry-lab pipeline (structure prediction with pLDDT/PAE early screening, then batch docking of a bisphenol analogue panel). They won the Safety and Security Award in the Overgrad section, and the reason is visible in the work: a three-expert advisory board, a formal STPA hazard analysis, a published wastewater-containment guidebook for future teams, and a documented decision to abandon their own central deployment assumption.","summary_zh":"Stockholm（KTH）做出 TIDE，一套三質體的 Saccharomyces cerevisiae 系統：偵測模組編碼一個合成的 LexA-mER-alpha 轉錄因子，分解模組編碼漆酶，再加一個 GFP 報告基因，使得偵測到 BPA 的同時也觸發它的分解。他們以 Gibson 組裝、以定序確認，用顯微鏡與 96 孔盤讀取 GFP，以改良的 ABTS 分析在 420 nm 測漆酶活性，並以 LC-MS 測 BPA 去除率，另外建了一條模組化的乾實驗流程（先做結構預測並以 pLDDT/PAE 早期篩選，再對一組雙酚類似物進行批次對接）。他們拿下 Overgrad 組的安全與保安獎，而原因在作品中看得見：一個三位專家組成的諮詢委員會、一份正式的 STPA 危害分析、一本公開給未來隊伍使用的廢水圍阻指南，以及一份明確放棄自己核心部署假設的紀錄。","awards":["Safety and Security Award — Winner (Overgrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Systems-Theoretic Process Analysis (STPA), the aerospace hazard-analysis method from Nancy Leveson's MIT group, applied to a biological system: a control structure of regulators, development team, operator, engineered yeast and independent BPA measurement, yielding eight losses, system-level hazards with safety constraints, twenty-six unsafe control actions with controller constraints, and causal scenarios with candidate mitigations. They credit iGEM UCalgary 2024's ErythrO as the precedent for adapting STPA biologically. Alongside it: a structured expert advisory board, KTH's KLARA chemical risk-management documentation, and a self-built laboratory safety form.","frameworks_zh":"系統理論製程分析（STPA），這套源自 Nancy Leveson 在 MIT 團隊的航太危害分析方法，被套用到一個生物系統上：控制結構包含法規機關、開發團隊、操作者、工程化酵母與獨立的 BPA 量測，產出八項損失、附安全約束的系統層級危害、二十六項附控制者約束的不安全控制行動，以及附候選緩解措施的因果情境。他們也致謝 iGEM UCalgary 2024 的 ErythrO 是把 STPA 轉用於生物領域的先例。除此之外還有：一個結構化的專家諮詢委員會、KTH 的 KLARA 化學風險管理文件，以及一份自建的實驗室安全表單。","dataviz":"An STPA control-structure diagram distinguishing control actions (solid) from feedback (dashed) with the BPA-clearing path highlighted, plasmid maps, a dry-lab pipeline schematic, sequencing alignment profiles, GFP microscopy panels, LC-MS figures, docking score and contact-map tables, and market-growth forecasts for BPA versus its alternatives with shaded inter-source variation and an explicit note that the data were compiled and visualised with AI assistance and the sources manually verified.","dataviz_zh":"一張 STPA 控制結構圖，以實線區分控制行動、虛線區分回饋，並標示強調 BPA 清除路徑；另有質體圖譜、乾實驗流程示意圖、定序比對剖面、GFP 顯微鏡圖組、LC-MS 圖、對接分數與接觸圖表格，以及 BPA 與其替代品的市場成長預測（以陰影標示不同來源間的差異），並明確註記這些資料是在 AI 輔助下彙整與視覺化、來源則經人工核實。","datascience":"A modular structure-prediction and docking pipeline with an early screening stage that filters candidates on configurable pLDDT and PAE cutoffs before the expensive full run, plus shared-memory and worker-RAM optimisation, and a batch mode that docks every ligand in the bisphenol analogue panel against each receptor candidate automatically. Validation: docking estradiol into 1ERE reproduces the crystal pose to within about 0.6 Angstrom. The code is deliberately split into modelling, docking and redesign modules rather than one end-to-end script, so other teams can reuse parts.","datascience_zh":"一條模組化的結構預測與對接流程，設有早期篩選階段，在進入昂貴的完整運算之前先依可設定的 pLDDT 與 PAE 門檻過濾候選，另有共享記憶體與工作者 RAM 的最佳化，以及一個批次模式，可自動把雙酚類似物組中的每個配體對每個受體候選進行對接。驗證方式：把雌二醇對接到 1ERE，可重現晶體中的結合姿態至約 0.6 Å 以內。程式碼刻意拆成建模、對接與再設計三個模組，而不是一支端到端的腳本，讓其他隊伍能分開重複使用。","software":"A reusable sequence-to-binding-score pipeline (structure prediction, docking, redesign) released as separate modules with configurable confidence-score screening.","software_zh":"一條可重複使用、從序列到結合分數的流程（結構預測、對接、再設計），以各自獨立的模組釋出，並可設定信心分數的篩選門檻。","stack":["AlphaFold-style structure prediction with pLDDT/PAE confidence filtering","molecular docking","S. cerevisiae three-plasmid system","Gibson Assembly","LC-MS","ABTS laccase assay","fluorescence microscopy","KLARA risk-management system"],"techniques":["LexA-mER-alpha synthetic transcription factor sensing","laccase-mediated BPA degradation","multi-plasmid yeast transformation","LC-MS discrimination of degradation from uptake and adsorption","auxotrophic selection","STPA hazard modelling"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"They ran a Model United Nations conference simulating the UN Environment Assembly on 'Strengthening Global Monitoring and Regulatory Frameworks for Bisphenol A and Other Endocrine Disrupting Chemicals', and published the planning documents as a reusable toolkit so other iGEM teams can run one, explicitly designed to be approachable for beginners. A second online MUN for current and former iGEM members, on equitable access to biotechnological innovation, is being organised. They also built two SDG outreach games for different age groups, contributed a BPA literature review to the MSP Vector journal run by the Maastricht iGEM team and took part in its peer review, and appeared at the KTH Climate Action Centre, ForskarFredag, a school visit, a student magazine and conferences in Copenhagen, Munster and Oslo.","publicEngagement_zh":"他們辦了一場模擬聯合國會議，模擬聯合國環境大會討論「強化雙酚 A 與其他內分泌干擾物的全球監測與管制架構」，並把籌辦文件公開成一份可重複使用的工具包，讓其他 iGEM 隊伍也能辦，且明確設計成新手也能上手。第二場線上模擬聯合國正在籌辦，對象是現任與前任 iGEM 成員，議題是生物技術創新的公平取得。他們也針對不同年齡層做了兩款 SDG 外展遊戲，為馬斯垂克 iGEM 隊經營的 MSP Vector 期刊投稿一篇 BPA 文獻回顧並參與其同儕審查，另外出現在 KTH 氣候行動中心、ForskarFredag、一次校園參訪、一份學生雜誌，以及哥本哈根、明斯特與奧斯陸的會議。","ihp":"Over twenty named stakeholders including Naturvardsverket (the Swedish EPA) and Stockholm Vatten och Avfall, with a regulatory comparison that is genuinely specific: Sweden's SFS 2012:991 restricting BPA-releasing coatings in food packaging ahead of the EU-wide ban, against the FDA's continuing position that BPA is safe at authorised levels. The decisive engagement, though, is the safety advisory board, where each of three KTH experts is documented with the questions asked, the answer given and the change made. Gunaratna Kuttuva Rajarao told them wastewater plants are not closed systems, that plants will not accept GMOs, that the safety of the organism cannot be guaranteed and that a kill switch alone would probably not be enough. Zeynep Cetecioglu Gurol explained the plant layout and identified the membrane-bioreactor stage as the only place a retained organism could sit, named Bromma as a plant planning to adopt membrane bioreactors, flagged that real operating temperatures of 20-25 degrees C differ from lab conditions, and recommended non-targeted metabolite analysis because transformation products may be more harmful than BPA itself. Gustav Sjoberg said physical containment in a closed reactor is sufficient (no open drains, double barriers, sealed reactors, fail-closed computer-controlled valves, autoclaved waste), that secreting laccase from yeast is hard and a high-secreting filamentous fungus would be the real production host, that holding yield over many generations is the real risk and should be addressed by genome integration near an essential gene, and bluntly that activated carbon followed by incineration is very cheap and hard to compete with.","ihp_zh":"二十多位具名的利害關係人，包括 Naturvardsverket（瑞典環保署）與 Stockholm Vatten och Avfall，而法規比較確實具體：瑞典的 SFS 2012:991 早於歐盟全面禁令就限制食品包裝中會釋出 BPA 的塗層，對照美國 FDA 仍維持 BPA 在核准劑量下安全的立場。不過真正決定性的互動是安全諮詢委員會，三位 KTH 專家每一位都記錄了問了什麼、回答什麼、改了什麼。Gunaratna Kuttuva Rajarao 告訴他們污水處理廠不是封閉系統、廠方不會接受基改生物、該生物的安全性無法保證，而且單靠一個自殺開關很可能不夠。Zeynep Cetecioglu Gurol 說明了處理廠的配置，指出薄膜生物反應器段是唯一能容納被滯留生物的位置，點名 Bromma 是一座計畫採用薄膜生物反應器的廠，並提醒實際運轉溫度 20-25 °C 與實驗室條件不同，另建議做非標的代謝物分析，因為轉化產物可能比 BPA 本身更有害。Gustav Sjoberg 則表示在封閉反應器中的實體圍阻已經足夠（無開放排水口、雙重屏障、密封反應器、失效即關閉的電腦控制閥、廢棄物高壓滅菌），並指出從酵母分泌漆酶很困難，真正的生產宿主會是一株高分泌量的絲狀真菌；他認為真正的風險是在多代之後維持產量，應以靠近必需基因的基因組整合來處理；他也直言活性碳加焚化非常便宜，很難競爭。","realWorld":"This is the rare case where the safety work demolished the business case and the team published the demolition. Rajarao's feedback produced what they themselves call the project's largest change: they abandoned the assumption that TIDE would ever be released into municipal wastewater. The system is now proposed as a contained biological reactor with physical containment as the primary safeguard and genetic measures only as an additional layer; the application moved from large municipal volumes to a defined, more concentrated industrial stream (food packaging and manufacturing effluent, which Rajarao noted has more BPA and fewer competing contaminants); and they rebuilt the economic case around that smaller stream, stating enzyme demand at low concentration as a limitation rather than hiding it. They also stopped treating a drop in BPA as proof of safe effluent, because degradation products and enzyme demand are unanswered. Sjoberg's point that activated carbon plus incineration is cheap and hard to beat is accepted rather than argued away: their case now rests on degradation being more energy-efficient than boiling off water and burning, on picking the right stream, and on a credible operating model, with membrane cost and continuous dosing listed as limitations. The regulatory read is honest too: EU GMO regulation is not expected to open up, the EU wastewater directive currently requires only monitoring of micropollutants and pharmaceutical capture is expected to use activated carbon, and deployment is declared conditional on safety and regulatory assessment with the sequence set by Cetecioglu Gurol (prove laboratory function, then pilot, then full risk assessment, environmental and techno-economic work). Be clear about what this means: there is no business model here in the commercial sense, no company, no investor, no patent, no customer and no pricing, and the proposed implementation organism may not even be yeast, since they now describe S. cerevisiae as a proof-of-concept host and point at a high-secreting filamentous fungus for production. The results are equally unvarnished: sequence verification problems, an incorrect primer and an overly long PCR target muddied verification rounds, the positive control (tamoxifen) never arrived, and they state that sequence verification should precede functional testing and each assay needs a positive control. What they built instead of a venture is reusable safety infrastructure: a downloadable Guidebook to Wastewater Treatment Systems comparing nine systems (activated sludge, UASB, biofilm reactors, membrane bioreactors, nature-based lagoons and combinations) and setting out the containment, horizontal-gene-transfer and regulatory questions each one raises for a GMO project, closing with a checklist for future teams; the full STPA as a PDF; a modular dry-lab pipeline; and the MUN toolkit. Notably, the guidebook exists because they noticed, during an unmoderated caucus at their own MUN, that delegates had little understanding of how wastewater treatment plants work yet enthusiastically wrote remediation into the resolution anyway, and inferred the same gap would exist among iGEM teams. Continuation is framed as a research path rather than a company: transfer the circuit to a production organism, integrate essential genes into the plasmids under native promoters, build a CRISPR knockout strain for dependence, and characterise degradation products before any safety claim.","realWorld_zh":"這是少見的案例：安全工作把商業論述整個拆掉，而該隊把拆掉的過程也一併公開。Rajarao 的意見促成他們自稱的全專案最大改變：他們放棄了 TIDE 會被釋放到市政污水中的假設。系統現在被提議為一座封閉式生物反應器，以實體圍阻為主要防護，遺傳手段只作為額外一層；應用場景也從市政的大量水體移到一條定義明確、濃度更高的工業水流（食品包裝與製造業廢水，Rajarao 指出這類水流 BPA 含量更高、競爭污染物更少）；他們並依這條較小的水流重建經濟論述，同時把低濃度下的酵素需求量列為限制而非隱藏。他們也不再把 BPA 下降當成出水安全的證明，因為分解產物與酵素需求量都還沒有答案。Sjoberg 關於活性碳加焚化既便宜又難以擊敗的論點，他們是接受而非辯解掉：現在的論述建立在分解比把水煮乾再燒掉更節能、選對水流，以及一個可信的營運模式上，並把薄膜成本與連續投藥列為限制。法規判讀也很誠實：預期歐盟的基改法規不會鬆綁、歐盟廢水指令目前只要求監測微量污染物、藥物捕捉預期將使用活性碳；部署則宣告以安全與法規評估為前提，順序依 Cetecioglu Gurol 的建議（先證明實驗室功能、再做試驗規模、再做完整風險評估與環境及技術經濟分析）。要說清楚這代表什麼：這裡並沒有商業意義上的商業模式，沒有公司、沒有投資人、沒有專利、沒有客戶、也沒有定價，而且擬議的實作生物甚至可能不是酵母，因為他們現在把 S. cerevisiae 描述為概念驗證宿主，並指向一株高分泌量的絲狀真菌作為生產宿主。結果同樣毫不修飾：定序確認出了問題，一支錯誤的引子與一段過長的 PCR 標的讓幾輪確認變得混亂，正對照（tamoxifen）始終沒有送達；他們並指出定序確認應該先於功能測試，而每一項分析都需要正對照。他們沒有做出一間公司，而是做出了可重複使用的安全基礎建設：一本可下載的《廢水處理系統指南》，比較九種系統（活性污泥、UASB、生物膜反應器、薄膜生物反應器、自然式氧化塘，以及各種組合），並逐一列出每種系統對基改專案所帶來的圍阻、水平基因轉移與法規問題，最後附上一份給未來隊伍的檢核表；完整 STPA 的 PDF；一條模組化的乾實驗流程；以及模擬聯合國工具包。值得一提的是，這本指南之所以存在，是因為他們在自己辦的模擬聯合國的自由磋商中注意到，代表們對污水處理廠如何運作所知甚少，卻仍然熱切地把復育寫進決議文裡，於是推論 iGEM 隊伍之間也存在同樣的落差。後續工作被框定為研究路徑而非公司：把迴路轉移到生產用生物、把必需基因以原生啟動子整合進質體、建立一株 CRISPR 剔除菌株以製造依賴性，並在提出任何安全宣稱之前先把分解產物特性化。","partners":["KTH Royal Institute of Technology, Dept. of Industrial Biotechnology (Johan Rockberg, PI)","Gunaratna Kuttuva Rajarao, KTH (wastewater treatment and bioremediation; safety advisory board and general safety training)","Zeynep Cetecioglu Gurol, KTH (wastewater bioremediation, SYMBIOREM Horizon Europe project; safety advisory board)","Gustav Sjoberg, KTH (metabolic engineering and GMOs in bioreactors; safety advisory board)","Naturvardsverket (Swedish Environmental Protection Agency)","Stockholm Vatten och Avfall (and Bromma wastewater treatment plant as a possible future test site)","KTH Climate Action Centre","MSP Vector journal, Maastricht University iGEM team (literature review and peer review)","iGEM UCalgary 2024 (STPA precedent)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6292/wiki/safety-and-security/figure1-stpa-control-structure.avif","caption":"STPA control structure for TIDE, mapping regulators, developers, operator, the engineered yeast and independent BPA measurement, with control actions as solid lines and feedback as dashed","caption_zh":"TIDE 的 STPA 控制結構，盤點法規機關、開發者、操作者、工程化酵母與獨立的 BPA 量測，控制行動以實線、回饋以虛線表示","credit":"Team Stockholm, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6292/wiki/safety-and-security/guna-meeting.avif","caption":"Safety and security advisory board interview with Gunaratna Kuttuva Rajarao, whose feedback ended the plan to release TIDE into municipal wastewater","caption_zh":"與 Gunaratna Kuttuva Rajarao 的安全與保安諮詢委員會訪談，她的意見終結了把 TIDE 釋放到市政污水中的計畫","credit":"Team Stockholm, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6292/wiki/safety-and-security/zeynep-meeting.avif","caption":"Advisory board interview with Zeynep Cetecioglu Gurol, who identified the membrane-bioreactor stage as the only containment point in a conventional treatment plant","caption_zh":"與 Zeynep Cetecioglu Gurol 的諮詢委員會訪談，她指出薄膜生物反應器段是傳統處理廠中唯一的圍阻點","credit":"Team Stockholm, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6292/wiki/community-impact/mun.avif","caption":"The team's Model United Nations simulation of the UN Environment Assembly on regulating bisphenol A and other endocrine disruptors, released with a reusable organiser toolkit","caption_zh":"該隊模擬聯合國環境大會、討論雙酚 A 與其他內分泌干擾物管制的模擬聯合國活動，並附一份可重複使用的籌辦工具包釋出","credit":"Team Stockholm, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Convene a small safety and security advisory board of domain practitioners (not just academics in your own field) early enough that their answers can still change the project, and publish each interview as questions asked, answer given and change made, including the change that kills your headline application. Then run a formal STPA on the deployed system, since modelling controllers, feedback loops and unsafe control actions surfaces failure modes that a biosafety checklist never reaches, and release the analysis as a document other teams can copy.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"及早召集一個小型的安全與保安諮詢委員會，成員要是該領域的實務工作者（而不只是你自己領域的學者），早到他們的回答還能改變專案；並且把每一場訪談都公開為：問了什麼問題、得到什麼回答、做了什麼改變——包括那個把你招牌應用殺掉的改變。接著對部署後的系統做一次正式的 STPA，因為把控制者、回饋迴圈與不安全控制行動都模型化，會浮現生物安全檢核表永遠觸及不到的失效模式，並把分析結果以其他隊伍可直接照用的文件形式釋出。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/stockholm/","https://2026.igem.wiki/stockholm/safety-and-security","https://2026.igem.wiki/stockholm/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/stockholm/assets/index-D8fvRSn0.js","https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6292/wiki/safety-and-security/stpa-tide.pdf","https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6292/wiki/safety-and-security/safety-security-guidebook-igem.pdf"],"awards_zh":["安全與保安獎 — 得主（研究生組）"],"rank":26},"6294":{"team":"SDU-Denmark","id":"6294","section":"Overgrad","country":"Denmark","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/sdu-denmark/","projectTitle":"Shewanode","projectTitle_zh":"Shewanode","tagline":"A microbial fuel cell built from scratch, and a measurement workflow for the outer membrane vesicles that carry its electrons.","tagline_zh":"一座從零打造的微生物燃料電池，以及一套量測承載其電子的外膜囊泡的工作流程。","summary":"SDU-Denmark engineered Shewanella oneidensis MR-1 to improve extracellular electron transfer and built the hardware to measure it: first a two-chamber microbial fuel cell as proof of concept, then a single-chamber design with an air-breathing cathode and carbon felt electrode that became the team's primary electrochemical measurement system. The measurement work centres on the outer membrane vesicles that carry the MtrCAB cytochrome complex, asking how to isolate them reproducibly and how to quantify their size, morphology, charge and concentration. Each question is answered with complementary methods, each with stated calibration, controls, replicates and limitations. Along the way the team documented a working anolyte recipe, which the literature generally leaves as 'Shewanella basal medium', and released it for other teams.","summary_zh":"SDU-Denmark 改造 Shewanella oneidensis MR-1 以提升胞外電子傳遞，並自行做出量測它的硬體：先是一座雙室微生物燃料電池作為概念驗證，之後是採用空氣呼吸陰極與碳氈電極的單室設計，後者成為團隊主要的電化學量測系統。量測工作的核心是承載 MtrCAB 細胞色素複合體的外膜囊泡，要問的是如何可重現地分離它們，以及如何量化它們的大小、形態、電荷與濃度。每個問題都以互補的方法回答，每一種方法都寫明校正、對照、重複次數與限制。過程中團隊也把一份可行的陽極液配方記錄下來，文獻通常只寫成 Shewanella basal medium，而他們把配方公開給其他團隊使用。","awards":["Best Alternative Platform — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Measurement — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"The measurement page is structured by goal rather than by technique: each goal states the question, the method, the calibration, the controls and replicates, the results, a discussion and an explicit limitations section. Complementary quantitative and qualitative methods are paired deliberately (preparative size exclusion chromatography with quantitative BCA; qualitative helium ion and scanning electron microscopy with quantitative DLS and zeta potential), and the team states where a method cannot support a claim.","frameworks_zh":"量測頁面是依目標而不是依技術來組織：每個目標都寫出問題、方法、校正、對照與重複、結果、討論，以及一段明確的限制。量化與定性方法刻意成對搭配（製備型粒徑排除層析搭配定量的 BCA；定性的氦離子顯微術與掃描式電子顯微術搭配定量的 DLS 與界面電位），而且團隊會寫明哪一種方法不足以支撐某個主張。","dataviz":"BCA calibration curve of blank-corrected absorbance against BSA concentration; per-fraction protein concentration plots with lysed and unlysed series and a zoomed inset; DLS size-distribution-by-intensity panels with correlation functions for each biological replicate; full Zetasizer statistics tables reporting mean, standard deviation, relative standard deviation, minimum and maximum, and including the instrument's own intercept and fit error; current-versus-time traces from the single-chamber MFC and the H-cell; heme concentration bar plots showing both means and individual replicate points.","dataviz_zh":"BCA 的校正曲線，以扣除空白後的吸光度對 BSA 濃度作圖；各分管的蛋白濃度圖，同時呈現裂解與未裂解兩組並附放大插圖；DLS 的強度粒徑分布圖，每個生物重複都附相關函數；完整的 Zetasizer 統計表，回報平均值、標準差、相對標準差、最小值與最大值，並包含儀器自身的截距與擬合誤差；單室微生物燃料電池與 H 型電池的電流對時間曲線；血基質濃度長條圖，同時顯示平均值與各重複的個別資料點。","datascience":"Vesicle isolation is verified rather than assumed. A BCA assay against a BSA dilution series at 562 nm gives the standard curve, and each size-exclusion fraction is then measured twice, once untreated and once lysed with Triton X-100 for 10 minutes on ice, with an isolation-buffer-plus-Triton control confirming the detergent itself does not shift absorbance. The lysed fractions read 100 to 200 ug/mL against lower unlysed values, which is the argument that intact vesicles are present and only open on lysis; fractions above 2 mg/mL are explicitly flagged as exceeding the assay's upper linear range and excluded from interpretation. Morphology is imaged by helium ion microscopy and SEM and quantified in Fiji (wildtype n = 29 particles, mean Feret diameter 288.3 +/- 97.9 nm, circularity 0.837; mutant n = 18, 300.6 +/- 69.6 nm, circularity 0.767), and the team then states that without a buffer-only blank slide taken through the same fixation and drying the structures cannot be definitively identified as vesicles, and that some sharp-edged objects may be crystallised solvent. Size, concentration and charge come from a Malvern Zetasizer Advance Ultra Red Label with every instrument setting published (material refractive index 1.45, absorption 0.001, 25 C, dispersant RI 1.33, viscosity 0.887, dielectric constant 78.5), three biological replicates from different colonies, and technical replicates where the instrument allowed. Main-peak diameters cluster at 130 to 171 nm with z-averages of 87 to 147 nm, polydispersity indices up to 0.39 are read as genuine heterogeneity, and the team reasons through the candidate causes (subpopulations, artefacts, residual protein) using the BCA separation as evidence against one of them. Zeta potential is reported as wildtype -5.532 +/- 0.5955 mV versus MtrCAB-overexpressing mutant -4.671 +/- 0.3632 mV, the direction predicted by the hypothesis but a smaller change than expected, which the team attributes to PBS ions partially neutralising surface charge and proposes repeating in lower-ionic-strength solvents. The reported limitations are unusually candid: BSA is acknowledged as an imperfect standard for a mixed vesicle proteome; DLS is noted as sensitive to dust and aggregates, blind to morphology, and dependent on analysis models the team could not inspect because only data reports were produced; and technical replicates missing from some samples are identified as a possible artificial source of the observed subpopulations. Electrochemistry is logged as a voltage drop across a 100 ohm resistor on a PicoLog 1216, with the first current rise after about two days reported as indicative only because the experiment ran without biological replicates. The heme assay uses a standard curve to convert absorbance to micromolar concentration, with two biological replicates whose individual points are plotted alongside the means and the explicit statement that no standardised protocol exists for this application so the method would need further validation.","datascience_zh":"囊泡的分離是經過驗證的，不是假設成立的。以 BSA 稀釋系列在 562 nm 下的 BCA 分析建立標準曲線，接著每一個粒徑排除分管都量兩次，一次未處理、一次以 Triton X-100 在冰上裂解 10 分鐘，並以分離緩衝液加 Triton 的對照確認清潔劑本身不會改變吸光度。裂解後的分管讀到 100 至 200 ug/mL，未裂解的數值較低，這就是囊泡確實完整存在、只有在裂解時才打開的論據；高於 2 mg/mL 的分管則被明確標示超出分析的線性上限，並排除在解讀之外。形態以氦離子顯微術與 SEM 成像，並在 Fiji 中量化（野生型 n = 29 個顆粒，平均 Feret 直徑 288.3 ± 97.9 nm、圓形度 0.837；突變株 n = 18，300.6 ± 69.6 nm、圓形度 0.767）；團隊接著說明，若沒有一張只含緩衝液、經過同樣固定與乾燥流程的空白載片，這些結構就無法被確認為囊泡，而有些邊緣銳利的物體可能只是結晶的溶劑。大小、濃度與電荷由 Malvern Zetasizer Advance Ultra Red Label 量得，所有儀器設定都公開（材料折射率 1.45、吸收 0.001、25 C、分散介質折射率 1.33、黏度 0.887、介電常數 78.5），採用來自不同菌落的三個生物重複，並在儀器允許的情況下做技術重複。主峰直徑集中在 130 至 171 nm，z 平均值為 87 至 147 nm，最高達 0.39 的多分散指數被解讀為真實的異質性，團隊也逐一討論可能原因（次族群、假影、殘留蛋白），並用 BCA 的分離結果作為排除其中一項的證據。界面電位回報為野生型 -5.532 ± 0.5955 mV，過表現 MtrCAB 的突變株為 -4.671 ± 0.3632 mV，方向與假說預測一致，但變化幅度小於預期；團隊把原因歸於 PBS 中的離子部分中和了表面電荷，並提議改用離子強度較低的溶劑重做。他們列出的限制異常坦白：承認以 BSA 作為混合囊泡蛋白體的標準並不理想；指出 DLS 對灰塵與聚集體敏感、看不出形態，而且依賴他們無法檢視的分析模型，因為儀器只產出資料報告；還指出部分樣本缺少技術重複，可能是觀察到次族群的人為來源。電化學資料以 PicoLog 1216 記錄 100 歐姆電阻上的電壓降；約兩天後出現的第一次電流上升只被當作指示性結果，因為該實驗沒有生物重複。血基質分析以標準曲線把吸光度換算成微莫耳濃度，使用兩個生物重複，個別資料點與平均值一併作圖，並明確說明這個應用上並沒有標準化的實驗流程，因此方法仍需進一步驗證。","software":"An Arduino-based voltage logger was built for the two-chamber MFC as a low-cost alternative to dedicated logging equipment; the single-chamber system was logged on a PicoLog 1216. A hardware parts list is published for download, together with the anolyte recipe and standard operating procedures for each measurement method.","software_zh":"他們為雙室微生物燃料電池自製了一個以 Arduino 為基礎的電壓記錄器，作為專用記錄設備的低成本替代方案；單室系統則以 PicoLog 1216 記錄。硬體零件清單已公開供下載，另附陽極液配方與每一種量測方法的標準作業程序。","stack":["Malvern Zetasizer Advance Ultra Red Label (DLS and zeta potential)","Helium ion microscopy","Scanning electron microscopy","Fiji / ImageJ particle analysis","Pierce-style BCA assay","IZON qEVoriginal 35 nm size exclusion columns","PicoLog 1216 data logger","Arduino voltage logger","Carbon felt / carbon weave electrodes","BioRender"],"techniques":["BSA standard curve with blank correction","Lysed versus unlysed paired fraction measurement","Detergent-only control","Explicit upper-linear-range exclusion","Three biological replicates from independent colonies","Published instrument settings for reproducibility","Polydispersity index as a heterogeneity readout","Zeta potential with conductivity reported alongside","Feret diameter and circularity from image analysis","Per-goal limitations sections","Voltage across a known resistor for current measurement"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"","ihp":"Human Practices is the largest single page on the wiki and is credited with changing the project's direction. Stakeholder discussion moved the target away from large-scale energy production toward reliability of low-power generation, which reframed the application space around environmental monitoring sensors, decentralised low-power supply, wastewater treatment with simultaneous energy recovery, and biosensor-style monitoring of marine, agricultural and remote infrastructure.","ihp_zh":"人類實踐是整個 wiki 上篇幅最大的單一頁面，也被認為改變了專案的方向。與利害關係人的討論把目標從大規模發電轉向低功率發電的可靠性，進而把應用範圍重新框定在環境監測感測器、分散式低功率供電、同時回收能源的污水處理，以及用於海洋、農業與偏遠基礎設施的生物感測式監測。","realWorld":"The application page sets out five pathways with explicit preconditions rather than claims: low-power generation for sensors triggered by a pollutant; decentralised continuous supply, conditional on storage; a battery alternative justified by the environmental cost of lithium, cobalt and nickel extraction; wastewater treatment, which would require redesigning the cell so water can flow through; and monitoring circuits where an interruption produces a signal. The team states that stability, output and maintenance all need assessment before any of these is feasible, and that the right application depends on matching the cell's capability to a specific device's energy requirement.","realWorld_zh":"應用頁面列出五條路徑，而且寫的是明確的前提條件，不是宣稱：由污染物觸發的感測器低功率供電；分散式的連續供電，前提是要有儲能；以鋰、鈷與鎳開採的環境代價為理由的電池替代方案；污水處理，這需要重新設計電池讓水能流過；以及中斷即產生訊號的監測迴路。團隊也說明在這些方案任何一項可行之前，穩定性、輸出與維護都需要評估，而正確的應用取決於把電池的能力對上某個特定裝置的能耗需求。","partners":["IZON Science (qEV columns)","University of Southern Denmark microscopy facilities","Novo Nordisk Fonden","BioRender","MathWorks"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6294/wiki/wetlab/calibration-curve-bca.avif","caption":"Calibration curve for the bicinchoninic acid assay: blank-corrected absorbance at 562 nm against a dilution series of bovine serum albumin, used to convert fraction absorbances into protein concentration.","caption_zh":"二喹啉甲酸（BCA）分析的校正曲線：扣除空白後在 562 nm 的吸光度對牛血清白蛋白稀釋系列作圖，用來把各分管的吸光度換算成蛋白濃度。","credit":"Team SDU-Denmark, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6294/wiki/subpages/hardware/tc-mfc-prototype.avif","caption":"The two-chamber microbial fuel cell prototype assembled in the laboratory from two 50 mL falcon tubes, an inverted U-tube salt bridge and a hand-matted carbon weave electrode. It served as proof of concept before the team moved to a single-chamber air-breathing design.","caption_zh":"在實驗室中組裝的雙室微生物燃料電池原型，由兩支 50 mL falcon 管、一個倒 U 型鹽橋與一片手工壓製的碳編織電極做成。在團隊轉向單室空氣呼吸設計之前，它擔任概念驗證。","credit":"Team SDU-Denmark, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6294/wiki/wetlab/him.avif","caption":"Helium ion microscopy of isolated vesicles from Shewanella oneidensis MR-1 wildtype and the MtrCAB-overexpressing mutant. Fiji analysis gave mean Feret diameters of 288 and 301 nm; the team notes that without a buffer-only blank slide taken through the same drying procedure these structures cannot be definitively called vesicles.","caption_zh":"Shewanella oneidensis MR-1 野生型與過表現 MtrCAB 突變株所分離出囊泡的氦離子顯微影像。Fiji 分析給出平均 Feret 直徑 288 與 301 nm；團隊指出，若沒有一張只含緩衝液、經過同樣乾燥流程的空白載片，這些結構還不能確定稱為囊泡。","credit":"Team SDU-Denmark, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6294/wiki/wetlab/wetlab-results-figure7-current-scmfc.svg","caption":"Current from the single-chamber microbial fuel cell, recorded as the voltage drop across a 100 ohm resistor on a PicoLog 1216. The team reports the two-day rise as indicative only, because the experiment ran without biological replicates.","caption_zh":"單室微生物燃料電池的電流，以 PicoLog 1216 記錄 100 歐姆電阻上的電壓降而得。團隊說明兩天後的上升只是指示性結果，因為該實驗沒有生物重複。","credit":"Team SDU-Denmark, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Publish the instrument settings, not just the result: the refractive index, absorption, viscosity and dielectric constant used for a DLS run, the resistor value behind a current measurement, and the statistics the instrument reports about its own fit quality. A number without its acquisition settings cannot be reproduced or contested.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"要公開的是儀器設定，不只是結果：DLS 執行時所用的折射率、吸收、黏度與介電常數，電流量測背後的電阻值，以及儀器自己回報的擬合品質統計量。一個沒有附上取得條件的數字，既無法被重現，也無法被質疑。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/sdu-denmark/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/sdu-denmark/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/sdu-denmark/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/sdu-denmark/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/sdu-denmark/application","https://2026.igem.wiki/sdu-denmark/alternative-platform"],"awards_zh":["最佳替代平台 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳量測 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"rank":14},"6295":{"team":"Princeton","id":"6295","section":"Undergrad","country":"United States","village":"Foundational Advance","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/","projectTitle":"SymPleco: Making Precision Sequestration Sym-ple","tagline":"One M13 phage chassis, any cargo — bulk-capacity adsorption with antibody-grade specificity and light-triggered release.","summary":"SymPleco attacks a trade-off that runs through all remediation chemistry: activated carbon captures a lot but cannot tell similar molecules apart, while monoclonal antibodies bind precisely but need harsh pH or chaotropic salts to release and cannot be recovered or scaled. Princeton's answer is a filamentous M13 bacteriophage used as a programmable adsorbent: sortase A-mediated ligation staples engineered fusion proteins onto the N-terminus of every pVIII copy (making 'furry' phage that bypass classical display size limits), with pIII carrying a Cg-Defensin anchor for PLA filter attachment, a VHH7 nanobody for macrophage clearance, and an AsLOV2 optomonobody that holds cargo in the dark and lets go under 450 nm light. Because swapping the target means swapping only the displayed binder, the team paired it with SymPlify, a de novo binder design pipeline, so a new target does not wait on a new antibody. It won on foundational-advance logic: a genuinely modular chassis demonstrated across three deliberately unrelated applications (melanoma exosome sequestration, Parkinson's alpha-synuclein interception, microcystin/BPA water remediation), backed by an unusually self-critical ODE model and an IRB-approved patient engagement programme.","awards":["2nd Runner-up (Undergrad)","Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Part Collection — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Measurement — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Foundational Advance Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Two distinct computational efforts. SymPlify is a de novo protein binder design pipeline that routes a target by type: a protein chain goes to BindCraft (AlphaFold2-multimer hallucination with gradient descent on logits through softmax, SolubleMPNN sequence design, AF2-monomer re-prediction as a deliberately harsh filter, then PyRosetta physical metrics for binding energy and surface hydrophobicity), while a small-molecule or macrocycle chain goes to RFdiffusion3 all-atom diffusion plus LigandMPNN (eight sequences per backbone) and an independent complex-prediction model. PeSTo supplies hotspot residue scoring, RDKit renders structures and finds pharmacophores, and freesasa computes hydrophobic patch fraction. Separately, the measurement work is backed by a mechanistic ODE model of the recursive Phage Jumpstart Assay (jumpstart.py, jumpstart_mechanistic.py, passage.py, phase2.py, recursion.py) tracking naive, infected and free-particle pools with superinfection exclusion (sigma = 0.05), saturating infection, carrying capacity, and a hybrid-coat infectivity a_h derived from real pIII gene dosage (a_h ~0.729 at m13ko7_copies=20); the 1:11 passage step samples each particle pool by Poisson rather than plain division so a lineage can genuinely go extinct.","dataviz":"SymPlify's web interface is the visualisation centrepiece: an RDKit 3D viewer colours the target by PeSTo binding probability, lists top hotspot residues with confidence scores, lets the user delete low-scoring ones with an x to tighten the patch, and recomputes the difficulty breakdown (spread, hydrophobic surface fraction, globularity) live as the selection changes — plus a warning when residues sit more than 30 A apart, because one binder cannot reach them all. A run-status page shows pipeline stage, target type, elapsed time, auto-resubmits, design count and job ID, and a final ranking screen lets the user click through designs and download .pdb files with or without GS linkers. The model page is unusually transparent as data presentation: it prints the full command reference, labels every parameter as measured, derived or assumed, and ranks assumptions by their sensitivity on the round-2 plate ratio.","datascience":"The Jumpstart assay turned a single colony-ratio readout into a trajectory: because each recursion is both a manipulation and a measurement, repeated rounds on a population being driven toward one genotype reveal behaviour a single ratio cannot. Statistics are handled carefully — intervals bootstrap over wells, leave-one-well-out checks are reported, panels yielding 0-2 Amp colonies out of 165-272 are reported as upper bounds rather than measurements, and a chi-square test (197 on 5 df) establishes that the six Run B constructs are not interchangeable while the team explicitly declines to lean on the ordering because the bottom four are indistinguishable from zero. They also report that three magnitude-based titer estimators disagreed by up to 20,000-fold on the same panel, which is why they built a ratio readout instead. Most notably the model documents its own error history: an initial m13ko7_copies=200 was simply the wrong figure (wild-type M13 rolling-circle copy number rather than M13KO7's actual p15A-driven one), corrected to 10 and then 20 as evidence improved, with the admission that the corrected model is more parameter-sensitive, not less.","software":"SymPlify, an integrated de novo binder design pipeline with a web interface, hotspot prediction, cluster job submission with auto-resubmission, and post-design filtering and ranking; released for the wider synthetic biology community and wet-lab tested on the team's own targets. Team repository: https://github.com/dianalluu/puigem2026, with an AlphaFold deployment for the Princeton Della cluster at https://github.com/09aaronl/alphafold_princeton-della. The ODE model ships as a Python package with 52 automated checks in test_model.py (~80 s full run, ~8 s in fast mode) covering mass-balance and neutrality invariants, the hybrid-coat gene-dosage derivation, the Poisson passage statistics and pinned regression values. Hardware: a 3D-printed PLA gyroid biofilter cartridge whose two winning PITCCH designs are published as downloadable source STEP assemblies.","stack":["BindCraft","AlphaFold2-multimer","AlphaFold2 monomer","RFdiffusion3 (RosettaCommons foundry)","LigandMPNN","SolubleMPNN / ProteinMPNN","PeSTo","PyRosetta","RDKit","freesasa","ChimeraX","Python (NumPy/SciPy ODE integration)","Benchling","SLURM GPU cluster (Princeton Della)"],"techniques":["De novo binder design by AF2 hallucination with gradient descent on logits","All-atom diffusion backbone generation around a fixed ligand","Inverse folding / sequence design","Hotspot (epitope) prediction and patch-tightness scoring","Target difficulty scoring (0-100, Easy to Very Hard) from flexibility, globularity, hotspot patch, size, epitope chemistry","Small-molecule scoring by logP 30%, size 20%, rigidity 20%, TPSA 20%, aromaticity 10%","ODE compartment modelling of phage-host population dynamics","Poisson resampling of passage dilutions to allow true extinction","One-at-a-time parameter sensitivity ranking","Bootstrap confidence intervals over wells and leave-one-well-out robustness","Chi-square test of construct interchangeability","Regression-pinned unit testing of a scientific model"],"frameworks_zh":"兩項性質不同的計算工作。SymPlify 是一條 de novo 蛋白質結合子設計管線，依標的類型分流：蛋白質鏈走 BindCraft（以 AlphaFold2-multimer 做幻構，對經 softmax 的 logits 做梯度下降，再以 SolubleMPNN 設計序列，並刻意用 AF2-monomer 重新預測作為嚴苛濾器，最後以 PyRosetta 計算結合能與表面疏水性等物理指標），而小分子或大環分子鏈則走 RFdiffusion3 全原子擴散加上 LigandMPNN（每個骨架八條序列）與一個獨立的複合物預測模型。PeSTo 提供熱點殘基評分，RDKit 負責結構繪製與藥效團尋找，freesasa 計算疏水區塊比例。另一方面，量測工作背後有一個遞迴式 Phage Jumpstart Assay 的機制性 ODE 模型（jumpstart.py、jumpstart_mechanistic.py、passage.py、phase2.py、recursion.py），追蹤未感染、已感染與游離顆粒三個族群，納入超感染排除（sigma = 0.05）、飽和式感染、環境承載量，以及由真實 pIII 基因劑量導出的混合外殼感染力 a_h（在 m13ko7_copies=20 時 a_h 約 0.729）；1:11 的傳代步驟以 Poisson 抽樣各顆粒族群而非單純除法，因此一個譜系真的可能絕滅。","dataviz_zh":"SymPlify 的網頁介面是視覺化的重心：一個 RDKit 3D 檢視器依 PeSTo 結合機率為標的著色，列出信賴分數最高的熱點殘基，使用者可用 x 刪掉低分的殘基以收緊區塊，而難度分解（分散程度、疏水表面比例、球狀度）會隨選擇即時重算——當殘基彼此相距超過 30 A 時還會出現警告，因為單一結合子無法同時觸及它們。執行狀態頁顯示管線階段、標的類型、已耗時間、自動重送次數、設計數量與工作 ID，最後的排序畫面讓使用者逐一點開設計、下載含或不含 GS 連接子的 .pdb 檔。模型頁面在資料呈現上也異常透明：它印出完整的指令參考，把每個參數標示為實測、導出或假設，並依其對第二輪盤面比值的敏感度為假設排序。","datascience_zh":"Jumpstart 分析把單一的菌落比例讀值變成一條軌跡：因為每一次遞迴同時是一次操作與一次量測，在一個被推往單一基因型的族群上反覆進行，就能揭露單一比值看不出的行為。統計處理謹慎——信賴區間以孔位為單位做 bootstrap、報告逐孔留一檢驗，而在 165-272 個菌落中只長出 0-2 個 Amp 菌落的面板被報告為上界而非量測值；一項卡方檢定（5 自由度下為 197）確立 Run B 的六個構築並非可互換，但團隊明確不願依賴其排序，因為最後四個與零無法區分。他們也報告三種基於絕對量級的效價估計法在同一面板上彼此相差高達 20,000 倍，而這正是他們改用比例讀值的原因。最值得一提的是，模型記錄了自己的錯誤史：最初採用的 m13ko7_copies=200 根本是個錯誤數字（那是野生型 M13 滾環複製的複本數，而非 M13KO7 實際由 p15A 驅動的複本數），隨證據改善先修正為 10、再修正為 20，並承認修正後的模型對參數更敏感，而不是更不敏感。","software_zh":"SymPlify 是一條整合式 de novo 結合子設計管線，附網頁介面、熱點預測、具自動重送的叢集工作提交，以及設計後的篩選與排序；已向更廣泛的合成生物學社群釋出，並在團隊自己的標的上做過濕實驗驗證。團隊程式庫：https://github.com/dianalluu/puigem2026 ，另有針對 Princeton Della 叢集的 AlphaFold 部署於 https://github.com/09aaronl/alphafold_princeton-della 。ODE 模型以 Python 套件形式發布，test_model.py 中有 52 項自動化檢查（完整執行約 80 秒、快速模式約 8 秒），涵蓋質量平衡與中性不變量、混合外殼的基因劑量推導、Poisson 傳代統計，以及釘住的回歸數值。硬體方面：一個 3D 列印的 PLA 螺旋二十四面體（gyroid）生物濾材匣，其兩個 PITCCH 獲獎設計以可下載的 STEP 組件原始檔公開。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"PITCCH, the Princeton iGEM Team CAD Competition for Hardware, is the standout: entrants were given a real open engineering problem from the project — design a 3D-printable gyroid biofilter, 20 mm diameter by 25 mm height, maximising contact surface area — along with the team's actual print parameters. It ran free, fully asynchronous and online in a junior division (grades 5-12) and an open division (18+), explicitly permitted responsible AI use, and drew 42 registered submissions from the United States, United Kingdom and Mexico, of which 26 passed dimensional and printability screening before being sliced and computationally ranked by total surface area. Announcement emails went to thousands more via high school superintendents, undergraduate engineering directors and makerspaces, each carrying a project description and iGEM links. The team frames it as citizen science and backed that framing with credit: two winning designs appear on the wiki with the designers named on the attribution form, and the registration terms stated plainly that the team reserves the right to draw inspiration from submissions with attribution. They also postered at symposiums and presented at bioethics exchanges, and at the US-China iGEM Human Practices Summit showed their halted immunology work as a case study in how to pivot.","ihp":"This is the strongest documented chain of design changes of any team here, and several of them cut capability rather than adding it. Dr Bowen Jing's technical advice seeded SymPlify and his steric clash filter was adopted, but the team then cut AlphaFold3 from the pipeline entirely because Dr Martin Pacesa argued it often mispredicts binding sites; Pacesa also supplied PeSTo as the hotspot engine and, after the team ran competing designs to compare, AF2 monomer was implemented on his side of the argument. Dr Reynold Panettieri talked them out of sequestering IL-6 — their original software benchmark target — by pointing out IL-6's dual-sided effects on blood cell production and T-cell regulation, redirecting them toward a niche where cheaper-than-mAb production is the real advantage and toward naming one indication and working from there, which is exactly how the final applications are framed. Dr Douglas Galasko's distinction between biomarkers and toxins moved them off amyloid-beta for Alzheimer's and into the Parkinson's and rabies work. Two multiple myeloma patients, interviewed under Princeton IRB Protocol #20003, independently said the word 'virus' for a bacteriophage was a problem — one noting roughly 80% of myeloma patients are treated in community settings and take their doctor's word — which changed how the team describes the project in all outreach. A former FDA biologics deputy director, Dr Celia Witten, pointed them to CBER's phage therapy work; EPA Office of Pesticide Programs and OPPT staff sent them to the statutes; and marine microbiologist Dr Stephen Giovannoni plus phage ecologist Prof Forest Rohwer turned the Cg-Defensin antimicrobial worry into a specific planned avidity-comparison assay. Dr John Wnek, who conserves Diamondback terrapins, chose their environmental targets: microcystins and BPA, because nearby New Jersey plants discharge effluent half a mile offshore with no process for xenobiotics.","realWorld":"The regulatory path is mapped rather than asserted: phage therapy under FDA CBER for the clinical arms, and statute-level grounding for the environmental arm after meetings with EPA Office of Pesticide Programs and Office of Pollution Prevention and Toxics, with the team careful to state that nothing should be read as EPA guidance. Containment is designed for deployment — the phage stays inside a closed water treatment facility bound to a biodegradable PLA filter so it is retrievable and localised, with macrophage clearance via VHH7 as the biosafety route for therapeutic use. The commercial argument is reconfiguration cost: because capture specificity lives in one genetic part on pVIII, changing target means changing that part and not the media, housing, attachment chemistry or capital cycle, which is the case made against granular activated carbon for PFAS where GAC retains poorly over realistic service lifetimes. Work is mapped to SDG 3.4, 6.3 and 9. Continuation is concrete: further IRB submissions to interview melanoma patients and Parkinson's patients and caregivers, the Rohwer avidity assay, qPCR of M13KO7 copy number to settle the model's most sensitive parameter, and phage hydrogels as an alternative anchor that would remove the Cg-Defensin concern altogether.","partners":["Dr Martin Pacesa (BindCraft author)","Dr Bowen Jing (computational biology)","Dr Reynold Panettieri, Rutgers Translational Medicine and Science","Dr Jared Radbel, Robert Wood Johnson Medical School","Dr Douglas Galasko (neurology)","Dr Celia Witten, former deputy director, FDA biologics center","US EPA Office of Pesticide Programs and Office of Pollution Prevention and Toxics","Dr John Wnek (environmental conservation, Diamondback terrapin)","Dr Stephen Giovannoni (marine microbiology)","Prof Forest Rohwer (marine phage ecology)","Prof Ned Wingreen and Lawrence Abad (phage biology)","Prof Jared Toettcher (faculty PI, IRB Protocol #20003)","Princeton Institutional Biosafety Committee","Multiple myeloma patient advocacy organisations","US-China iGEM Human Practices Summit","IDT, GenScript, ODI (sponsors)"],"publicEngagement_zh":"PITCCH（Princeton iGEM Team CAD Competition for Hardware）是最突出的一項：參賽者拿到的是專案中一個真實且未解的工程問題——設計一個可 3D 列印的 gyroid 生物濾材，直徑 20 mm、高 25 mm，使接觸表面積最大化——還附上團隊實際使用的列印參數。競賽免費、全程非同步線上進行，分為青少年組（5-12 年級）與公開組（18 歲以上），明確允許負責任地使用 AI，共收到來自美國、英國與墨西哥的 42 份註冊投稿，其中 26 份通過尺寸與可列印性審查，再經切層並以總表面積做計算排序。公告電子郵件另外透過高中學區督學、大學部工程學程主任與創客空間寄給數千人，每一封都附上專案說明與 iGEM 連結。團隊把它定位為公民科學，並以實際的署名支持這個定位：兩個獲獎設計出現在 wiki 上、設計者姓名列在貢獻表上，而報名條款也明白寫出團隊保留在署名前提下從投稿中取得靈感的權利。他們也在研討會張貼海報、在生物倫理交流場合報告，並在美中 iGEM 人類實踐高峰會上，把自己中止的免疫學工作當成「如何轉向」的案例研究展示。","ihp_zh":"這是本批隊伍中記錄最完整的一串設計變更，而其中有好幾項是砍掉能力、而不是增加能力。Dr Bowen Jing 的技術建議催生了 SymPlify，他的立體衝突濾器也被採納；但團隊隨後把 AlphaFold3 整個從管線中移除，因為 Dr Martin Pacesa 主張它經常錯誤預測結合位點。Pacesa 也提供 PeSTo 作為熱點引擎，而在團隊實際跑了相互競爭的設計做比較之後，AF2 monomer 依他那一方的論點被實作進來。Dr Reynold Panettieri 勸退了他們捕捉 IL-6 的想法——那原本是軟體的基準標的——他指出 IL-6 對血球生成與 T 細胞調節具有雙面作用，並把他們導向「比單株抗體更便宜的生產才是真正優勢」的利基，以及「先指名一個適應症、再由此展開」的做法，而最終的應用正是以此方式定位的。Dr Douglas Galasko 對生物標記與毒素的區分，使他們離開阿茲海默症的 amyloid-beta，轉向帕金森氏症與狂犬病相關的工作。兩位多發性骨髓瘤病患在 Princeton IRB 第 #20003 號計畫下接受訪談，各自獨立指出用「病毒」這個詞指稱噬菌體會造成問題——其中一位提到約 80% 的骨髓瘤病患是在社區醫療場域接受治療、並且聽從醫師的說法——這改變了團隊在所有外推場合描述專案的方式。前 FDA 生物製劑副主任 Dr Celia Witten 把他們指向 CBER 的噬菌體療法工作；美國環保署農藥計畫辦公室與 OPPT 的人員則讓他們回去讀法規條文；而海洋微生物學家 Dr Stephen Giovannoni 與噬菌體生態學家 Prof Forest Rohwer 則把對 Cg-Defensin 抗菌性的憂慮，轉成一項具體規劃的親和力比較實驗。保育鑽紋龜的 Dr John Wnek 選定了他們的環境標的：微囊藻毒素與 BPA，因為附近的新澤西廠區把廢水排到半英里外的海中，而且沒有任何處理外源化學物質的程序。","realWorld_zh":"法規路徑是被實際盤點出來的，而不是口頭宣稱：臨床方向依 FDA CBER 的噬菌體療法規範，環境方向則在與美國環保署農藥計畫辦公室及污染預防與毒性物質辦公室會談後回到法規條文層級，而團隊也謹慎聲明這一切都不應被解讀為環保署的指引。圍堵是為實際部署而設計——噬菌體留在封閉的水處理設施內、結合在可生物降解的 PLA 濾材上，因此可回收且限定於局部；治療用途則以 VHH7 媒介的巨噬細胞清除作為生物安全途徑。商業論點在於重新配置的成本：由於捕捉專一性存在於 pVIII 上的單一個基因部件，更換標的只需更換該部件，而不必更換介質、殼體、附著化學或資本週期——這正是他們對照用於 PFAS 的粒狀活性碳（GAC）所提出的論據，因為 GAC 在現實的使用壽命下滯留效果不佳。工作對應到 SDG 3.4、6.3 與 9。後續延伸很具體：再送 IRB 申請以訪談黑色素瘤病患、帕金森氏症病患與照顧者；執行 Rohwer 建議的親和力實驗；以 qPCR 量測 M13KO7 的複本數以確定模型最敏感的那個參數；以及把噬菌體水膠作為替代錨定方式，這樣就能完全消除對 Cg-Defensin 的顧慮。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6295/wiki/figures/symplify-hotspots-protein.avif","caption":"SymPlify's hotspot selection screen: the protein target rendered in 3D and coloured by PeSTo binding probability, with top hotspot residues listed by confidence so low-scoring ones can be removed to leave the focused patch of three to five that BindCraft works best with.","credit":"Team Princeton, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"SymPlify 的熱點選擇畫面：蛋白質標的以 3D 呈現並依 PeSTo 結合機率著色，結合信賴度最高的熱點殘基列於旁側，使用者可移除低分殘基，留下 BindCraft 表現最好的三到五個殘基構成的聚焦區塊。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6295/wiki/figures/symplify-filtered-designs.avif","caption":"SymPlify's ranking and filtering view, where accepted binder designs are sorted by AlphaFold confidence metrics and PyRosetta physical scores and can be downloaded as .pdb files with or without GS linkers.","credit":"Team Princeton, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"SymPlify 的排序與篩選檢視，通過的結合子設計依 AlphaFold 信賴指標與 PyRosetta 物理分數排序，並可下載為含或不含 GS 連接子的 .pdb 檔。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6295/wiki/figures/hardware-pitcch-surface-area.avif","caption":"Ranked printable surface area for the 26 PITCCH entries that passed dimensional and printability screening, plotted against reference geometries — public CAD submissions evaluated computationally and used to pick the biofilter geometry.","credit":"Team Princeton, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"26 件通過尺寸與可列印性審查的 PITCCH 投稿，其可列印表面積排序並與參考幾何對照——這些公開的 CAD 投稿經計算評估，並用來挑選生物濾材的幾何形狀。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6295/wiki/figures/saf-macrophage-uptake-gfp.avif","caption":"Overlaid phase-contrast and green-fluorescence micrograph of cultured macrophages after incubation with GFP-expressing phage, showing uptake by the VHH7 clearance arm. Scale bar 150 micrometres.","credit":"Team Princeton, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"培養的巨噬細胞與表現 GFP 的噬菌體共培養後，相位差與綠色螢光的疊合顯微影像，顯示 VHH7 清除臂所促成的吞噬。比例尺 150 微米。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy PITCCH: hand the public a genuine, unsolved sub-problem from your own project with real constraints and real print parameters, judge entries computationally on a single objective metric, then credit the winners by name and actually build their design in. It converts outreach into contributed engineering at almost no cost, and it works for high-school students because spatial creativity, not synthetic biology training, is what the task rewards. Pair it with Princeton's habit of writing down which model parameters are measured, derived or merely assumed — and publishing the history of their own corrected mistakes — which is the cheapest credibility a student dry lab can buy.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/design-rationale","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/application","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/sustainability","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/safety-and-security","https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/judging"],"projectTitle_zh":"SymPleco：讓精準捕捉變簡單（Making Precision Sequestration Sym-ple）","tagline_zh":"一個 M13 噬菌體載體、任意貨物——兼具大容量吸附、抗體級專一性與光觸發釋放。","summary_zh":"SymPleco 針對貫穿所有污染整治化學的一個取捨下手：活性碳吸附量大，卻無法分辨結構相近的分子；單株抗體結合精準，但需要劇烈的 pH 或離液鹽才能釋放，而且無法回收、也難以放大。Princeton 的答案是把絲狀 M13 噬菌體當成可程式化的吸附劑：以 sortase A 媒介的接合把工程化融合蛋白釘在每一份 pVIII 的 N 端（做出「毛茸茸」的噬菌體，繞過傳統展示技術的尺寸限制），而 pIII 則帶著用於附著 PLA 濾材的 Cg-Defensin 錨定子、供巨噬細胞清除的 VHH7 奈米抗體，以及一個 AsLOV2 光控單體抗體——在暗處抓住貨物，在 450 nm 光照下放手。由於更換標的只需要更換所展示的結合蛋白，團隊另外搭配了 SymPlify，一條 de novo 結合蛋白設計管線，讓新標的不必等待新抗體。它靠基礎進展的邏輯獲獎：一個真正模組化的載體，在三個刻意互不相關的應用上得到驗證（黑色素瘤外泌體捕捉、帕金森氏症 alpha-synuclein 攔截、微囊藻毒素／BPA 水體整治），背後還有一個異常自我批判的 ODE 模型，以及一個經 IRB 核准的病患參與計畫。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"學 PITCCH：把你自己專案中一個真實、未解的子問題，連同真實的限制條件與真實的列印參數交給公眾，以單一客觀指標用計算方式評審，然後具名表彰獲獎者，並真的把他們的設計做進去。這幾乎不花成本就把外推轉成了實際貢獻的工程成果，而且對高中生有效，因為這項任務獎勵的是空間創造力，而不是合成生物學訓練。再搭配 Princeton 的習慣：寫清楚哪些模型參數是實測、哪些是導出、哪些只是假設——並且公開自己修正錯誤的歷程——這是學生乾實驗室能買到最便宜的可信度。","awards_zh":["季軍（大學組）","Top 10（大學組）","最佳元件集 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳量測 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳基礎推進專案 — 得主"],"rank":205},"6296":{"team":"KIT","id":"6296","section":"Overgrad","country":"Germany","village":"Foundational Advance","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/kit/","projectTitle":"ENCORE - Engineered Nanocompartments for Capture, Optimization and Reactor Engineering","projectTitle_zh":"ENCORE - Engineered Nanocompartments for Capture, Optimization and Reactor Engineering","tagline":"A standardized modular Golden Gate toolkit that expresses self-assembling encapsulin nanocompartments with custom cargo in yeast","tagline_zh":"一套標準化的模組式 Golden Gate 工具組，可在酵母中表現會自組裝的 encapsulin 奈米區室並搭載自選載物","summary":"KIT, the first iGEM team at Karlsruhe Institute of Technology, built ENCORE: a standardised modular cloning system (the toolKIT) that co-expresses a self-assembling encapsulin protein nanocompartment and its cargo in Saccharomyces cerevisiae, chosen because encapsulins assemble from a single repeating subunit and so need far fewer transcriptional units than bacterial microcompartments or virus-like particles. They won the 2026 Inclusivity Award for work that turned inward rather than outward: instead of role-model campaigns, they asked how tasks are actually distributed inside scientific teams and what role gender plays, surveyed 71 people, ran proper statistics, and published the negative result honestly. The resulting deliverables - a facilitated workshop with moderation guide and printable worksheet, and TeamKIT, a team-and-meeting-culture guide - are the reusable artefacts.","summary_zh":"KIT 是 Karlsruhe Institute of Technology 的第一支 iGEM 團隊，他們做出 ENCORE：一套標準化的模組式選殖系統（toolKIT），可在 Saccharomyces cerevisiae 中共同表現一個會自組裝的 encapsulin 蛋白質奈米區室與其載物；選 encapsulin 的理由是它由單一重複次單元組裝而成，因此所需的轉錄單元遠少於細菌微區室或類病毒顆粒。他們拿下 2026 年的 Inclusivity Award，靠的是把目光往內而不是往外：他們沒有做典範人物宣傳，而是去問科學團隊內部的任務實際上是怎麼分配的、性別在其中扮演什麼角色，調查了 71 人、做了正規統計，然後誠實地把負面結果公開。由此產出的交付成果——一套附帶帶領指南與可列印學習單的工作坊，以及團隊與會議文化指南 TeamKIT——才是可重複使用的成品。","awards":["Inclusivity Award — Winner (Overgrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Survey research methodology applied with unusual rigour for an iGEM team: seven self-derived teamwork task categories (Coordination, Social, Operational, Scientific Conception, Creative Design, External Communication, Leadership/Mentoring) each with a written definition; separation of actual task distribution from perceived distribution; a 12-item five-point Likert instrument grouped into three constructs (Perception, Autonomy, Allocation) of four items each with one reverse-scored item; debriefing placed deliberately at the end of the instrument so as not to prime respondents, following social-science practice; expert instrument review; piloting; and an ethics-committee determination.","frameworks_zh":"問卷研究方法學，以 iGEM 團隊而言做得罕見嚴謹：七個自行推導的團隊合作任務類別（協調、社交、執行、科學構想、創意設計、對外溝通、領導/帶人），每一類都有書面定義；把實際任務分配與主觀感受的分配分開；一份 12 題的五點李克特量表工具，分成三個構念（感受、自主性、分配）各四題，其中一題反向計分；依社會科學慣例，把說明與揭露（debriefing）刻意放在工具最後，以免引導受訪者；工具經專家審閱；做過前測；並取得倫理委員會的認定。","dataviz":"A heptagon dot-poster used as the physical pre-survey instrument at Campus Day, later rebuilt as an interactive clickable heptagon on the wiki; grouped mean-frequency bar charts of task distribution by gender for the full dataset and the iGEM subgroup; box plots of Likert sum scores for Perception, Autonomy and Allocation; diverging stacked bar charts of each Likert item by gender with sub-10% segments suppressed; an interactive TeamKIT map where a visitor picks their chapter and situation and is pointed to a model and an exercise; and a self-check tool so a reader can see which roles they take in their own team. Figures were generated with AI assistance (Claude) and labelled as such.","dataviz_zh":"一張七邊形的貼點海報，在 Campus Day 上作為實體的前導調查工具，後來在 wiki 上重建為可點擊的互動七邊形；依性別分組的任務分配平均頻率長條圖，分別呈現完整資料集與 iGEM 子群；感受、自主性與分配三個李克特加總分數的盒形圖；每一題依性別繪製的雙向堆疊長條圖，並隱去不足 10% 的區段；一張互動式 TeamKIT 地圖，訪客選擇自己的章節與情境後會被指向一個模型與一項練習；以及一個自我檢核工具，讓讀者看出自己在團隊中扮演哪些角色。圖表是在 AI（Claude）協助下產生的，並已如此標示。","datascience":"Pre-survey n = 58 (30 female, 28 male) at KIT Campus Day; main survey n = 71 (45 female, 24 male, 2 non-binary, the latter excluded from gender comparison for sample size and stated as a limitation), of whom 59 were iGEM members, 8 from research groups and 4 from university groups, predominantly undergraduate (41) and graduate (18) students. Because the data were not normally distributed the team used two-sample Mann-Whitney U tests rather than Welch t-tests, at alpha = 0.05. Result: for every task area the null hypothesis held, except Scientific Conception in the full dataset (p = 0.039), where men reported taking it on more often; that difference vanished in the iGEM-only subgroup. All three Likert constructs showed no significant gender difference (p = 0.271, 0.750, 0.113) and scale reliability was good to excellent (Cronbach's alpha 0.822, 0.991, 0.930). The single most striking descriptive finding: for 'I receive adequate recognition for my contributions to the team', no male participant disagreed while 9 of 45 women did. Limitations are set out at length - voluntary-participation selection bias, no cultural-background data collected, comparability of iGEM teams with research groups uncertain, no participant reported being in a predominantly male team despite ~70% of KIT students being male, and the team states plainly it has no formal social-science training.","datascience_zh":"前導調查在 KIT Campus Day 收得 n = 58（30 位女性、28 位男性）；主調查 n = 71（45 位女性、24 位男性、2 位非二元性別；後者因樣本量而被排除在性別比較之外，並已列為限制），其中 59 位是 iGEM 成員、8 位來自研究團隊、4 位來自大學社團，多為大學部（41）與研究所（18）學生。因為資料並非常態分佈，團隊採用兩樣本 Mann-Whitney U 檢定而非 Welch t 檢定，alpha = 0.05。結果：所有任務領域的虛無假設都成立，唯一例外是完整資料集中的「科學構想」（p = 0.039），男性自述較常承擔；而這個差異在只看 iGEM 的子群中就消失了。三個李克特構念都沒有顯著的性別差異（p = 0.271、0.750、0.113），而量表信度從良好到優異（Cronbach's alpha 分別為 0.822、0.991、0.930）。最引人注意的單一描述性發現是：對於「我對團隊的貢獻獲得了足夠的肯定」這一題，沒有任何男性受訪者表示不同意，而 45 位女性中有 9 位不同意。限制也寫得很長：自願參與造成的選樣偏誤、沒有收集文化背景資料、iGEM 團隊與研究團隊的可比性不確定、儘管 KIT 約 70% 的學生是男性卻沒有任何受訪者表示自己身處以男性為主的團隊，而且團隊也直說自己沒有受過正式的社會科學訓練。","software":"Two integrated tools. The Open NC Database curates nanocompartment properties scattered across the primary literature - internal volume, pore diameter and charge, reported stability, associated targeting peptide - into a searchable, filterable form, with a data model that distinguishes the biological candidate from the experimentally reported assembly and its supporting evidence and explicitly marks unreported values as unreported; candidates are keyed by UniProt accession and structures by PDB identifier, a sequence enters the catalog only after a documented translation check, and the database accepts contributions by pull request. The ENCORE-Builder turns a database selection into a complete Golden Gate / MoClo design: it assigns fusion sites across three cloning levels, places start and stop codons, codon-optimises for S. cerevisiae, designs primers and oligonucleotide pairs, avoids sites forbidden by RFC 10 and RFC 1000, and emits annotated GenBank and SBOL 3 files plus order lists, with the toolKIT's combinatorial rules enforced so invalid designs cannot be produced. It was validated against a real cloning: the Builder's Level 2 design for the Quasibacillus thermotolerans shell with LGB4 matches the construct the team cloned in the lab.","software_zh":"兩套整合在一起的工具。Open NC Database 把散落在原始文獻中的奈米區室性質整理成可搜尋、可篩選的形式——內部體積、孔徑與電性、已報告的穩定性、相關的標靶胜肽——其資料模型會區分「生物學上的候選者」與「實驗上已報告的組裝體」及其支持證據，並明確標示哪些數值未被報告；候選者以 UniProt 編號為鍵、結構以 PDB 識別碼為鍵，序列必須通過有紀錄的轉譯檢查才會進入目錄，而資料庫以 pull request 接受外部貢獻。ENCORE-Builder 則把資料庫中的選擇轉成一份完整的 Golden Gate / MoClo 設計：它跨三個選殖層級指派融合位點、放上起始與終止密碼子、為 S. cerevisiae 做密碼子最佳化、設計引子與寡核苷酸對、避開 RFC 10 與 RFC 1000 禁用的位點，並輸出帶註解的 GenBank 與 SBOL 3 檔案以及訂購清單，同時強制套用 toolKIT 的組合規則，使無效的設計根本產不出來。它也對照真實選殖做過驗證：Builder 為 Quasibacillus thermotolerans 外殼搭配 LGB4 所產生的 Level 2 設計，與團隊在實驗室實際選殖出的構築體一致。","stack":["Golden Gate / MoClo assembly","SBOL 3 and annotated GenBank output","UniProt and PDB identifiers as data keys","git / GitLab pull-request contribution model","Mann-Whitney U test","Cronbach's alpha","OpenDyslexic (SIL Open Font License 1.1)","Scientific Colour Maps v8.0.1 (Crameri)","Blender (encapsulin rendering)","Miro"],"techniques":["encapsulin shell self-assembly in S. cerevisiae","targeting-peptide cargo fusion","T=1/T=3/T=4 shell selection (24, 32, 42 nm)","VCPO reactor","oxygen-free space engineering","mRNA capture","building a lab from scratch"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"KIT won Inclusivity by doing what almost no previous iGEM gender-equity project had done: looking inward. The team read the iGEM Diversity & Inclusion Committee blog post 'Bursting demographic bubbles', surveyed prior iGEM work (Paris Bettencourt 2013, JIASHU-Shanghai 2024, Stony Brook 2022, Patras-Med 2024, Guelph 2024) and identified that almost all of it faces outward through role models, outreach to girls or awareness campaigns, with only Guelph coming close to an internal view by surveying its own composition. KIT's research question went further: not who is on the team, but how work is distributed - who ends up in the lab, who presents, who takes the organisational and invisible tasks, and, memorably, who empties the dishwasher in the institute kitchen. They derived seven task categories from reflecting on their own team, tested them as a physical heptagon dot-poster at KIT Campus Day (n = 58, colour-coded dots by gender), then designed a full instrument separating actual task distribution from perception, had it reviewed by Dr Melanie-Marita Leidecker-Sandmann of KIT's Department of Science Communication (who had them shorten items, add demographics, remove two questions that revealed the hypothesis, and add a proper debriefing), piloted it with Engineers Without Borders at KIT, obtained an ethics-committee determination, and distributed it through Instagram, the official iGEM Slack and a QR-code flyer at the Barcelona Meetup, plus KIT mailing lists. 71 responses came back. The honest headline is that their hypothesis was not supported - women did not take disproportionately more secretarial or communication work - but two findings held: most participants of either gender agreed organisational work receives less recognition than research work, and 9 of 45 women versus 0 of 24 men felt their contributions were not adequately recognised. They published the full statistics, the Cronbach's alphas, the raw data, both survey versions and the ethics statement, and wrote a long, specific limitations section. The transfer step is what makes this copyable. After discussing results with Ines Koehler, Head of KIT's Department for Equal Opportunities and Diversity Management, who invoked iGEM's 'give back to the community' principle, the team built two artefacts. The Gender Roles & Task Distribution Workshop is designed for newly formed teams at the start of collaboration, when patterns are easiest to shift: each person maps how their time splits across the seven task areas and rates satisfaction with each, then in paired conversations talks to someone who regularly carries a task area they themselves would feel least confident taking on, making invisible effort tangible; it ends with concrete next steps including a weekly challenge where members swap tasks and a check-in a few weeks later. The full moderation guide with a printable worksheet is downloadable, needs no prior gender-research knowledge, and adapts to 1.5-2.5 hour sessions. It was revised after written feedback from Ines Koehler and from Anietta Weckauff and Marina Jaehnert Giannitrapani, co-founders of the Women in STEM Initiative at the University of Stuttgart - changes included replacing 'blind spot' with 'perception gap' because unnoticed tasks are not wilfully ignored, changing 'a task I would never do' to 'a task area you feel least confident taking on' so the choice does not read as a judgment of the task's worth, adding a satisfaction rating, explicit ground rules, an opt-out in the warm-up, a note on intersectional factors and a recommendation for mixed-gender co-moderation. The team states plainly that neither version has been piloted yet and asks teams who run it to report back. TeamKIT is a downloadable guide to team and meeting culture built because, as the first KIT team with no predecessor, they had to work out task distribution, meetings and conflict from nothing - and found first-year teams at Aarhus and Berlin had the same problem; it moves from individual strengths and interests through interpersonal communication to the whole team, ending with meeting and conflict methods, with inclusion threaded through rather than placed in its own chapter, and it was reviewed by Freja from iGEM Aarhus. Public outreach for a Foundational Advance project was equally deliberate, since nanocompartments are invisible and hard to picture. Three members joined KIT's first science slam camp, eight workshop days on storytelling, stage presence, visualisation and PR, and performed to around 100 people at a Karlsruhe science communication event with a metaphor they arrived at only after scrapping draft after draft: the yeast cell is a ball pit and the nanocompartment a wonder machine that fetches a toy you are too big to reach, gives a child a protected space to make chewing gum without harming anything around it, and takes snapshots of children quarrelling among the balls (mRNA capture). CoLab was an art exhibition built on an open call that asked artists a question rather than commissioning illustrations: what becomes of a promoter, what could competent cells be, what does autoclaving mean, and what do you see in four unlabelled scientific figures from the team's own lab work; eleven works by nine artists (one dating from 1980) were shown over two weekends in October at the pavilions in the Fasanengarten in Karlsruhe with team members present throughout, and visitors asked questions that never come up in the lab - what exactly are you changing in those cells, what happens to them afterward, who decides what is allowed. 'The Yeast We Can Do' is a fully open board game for 3-6 players aged 12+, about 45 minutes, no prior knowledge needed, with 19 missions across six application areas from breaking down forever chemicals to capturing CO2 and growing nanocrystals, where all players compete for the same 20 amino acids on the same 37 fields of nutrient medium; rules, board image, mission cards, event cards, score pad and quick reference are downloadable PDFs and the yeast-cell and budding-yeast playing pieces are STL files for any FDM printer, all on GitLab. The team's stated design goal is that a complete newcomer leaves knowing a protein is a chain of twenty kinds of beads, some hard to come by, while an iGEMer might spot the catalytic triad in the plastic-degrading enzyme. They also ran two pub quizzes at the student-run venue Z10 (27 April and again on 15 October during first-year orientation week), staffed a Campus Day stand with a science quiz, a pipette-tip-box filling race and pipetting lessons, published ENCORE in BIOspektrum 04/26 (a leading German molecular life sciences journal, Springer Nature) and in the KIT student magazine clicKIT, built a social media identity from zero deliberately as team-building infrastructure for their successors, and hosted the first iGEM Baden-Wuerttemberg Meetup at KIT on 13 June with GU Frankfurt, Bonn, Saarland, Aachen, Berlin, Heidelberg and Stuttgart, opening with a poster-design session by Sylvia Erhardt of the Center for Synthetic Genomics and continuing with a peer-consultation workshop where teams brought their most pressing internal problems and bottlenecks for structured peer feedback, including team-dynamics questions that rarely surface in formal settings. The wiki itself is an accessibility deliverable, built following UniMuenster 2023's 'Inclusive Wiki Design' guide: large clear sans-serif type, a high-contrast palette of six colours in three shades each chosen for colour-vision deficiency, one-click OpenDyslexic font toggle, one-click dark mode, descriptive alt text on every figure for screen readers, a glossary of scientific terms and abbreviations, a site-wide search function, and shape-coded navigation (encapsulin-shaped octagons for research, circles for Human Practices) so section is distinguishable without relying on colour. Commitments extend past the competition: gender-specific task distribution may feature in next year's KIT Diversity Day, and an article about the project will appear in the KIT Diversity Magazine.","publicEngagement_zh":"KIT 拿下 Inclusivity，是因為做了幾乎沒有任何先前 iGEM 性別平權專案做過的事：往內看。團隊讀了 iGEM Diversity & Inclusion Committee 的部落格文章「Bursting demographic bubbles」，盤點了過往的 iGEM 作品（Paris Bettencourt 2013、JIASHU-Shanghai 2024、Stony Brook 2022、Patras-Med 2024、Guelph 2024），並指出這些幾乎全都是向外的——透過典範人物、對女孩的推廣或意識宣導——只有 Guelph 因為調查了自己團隊的組成而接近內部視角。KIT 的研究問題走得更遠：不是誰在團隊裡，而是工作怎麼分配——誰最後進了實驗室、誰上台報告、誰承擔組織性與看不見的任務，以及最令人印象深刻的一個：誰去清系所廚房的洗碗機。他們從反思自己的團隊推導出七個任務類別，先在 KIT Campus Day 以實體七邊形貼點海報測試（n = 58，貼點依性別以顏色區分），接著設計出一份把實際任務分配與主觀感受分開的完整工具，請 KIT 科學傳播系的 Dr Melanie-Marita Leidecker-Sandmann 審閱（她要他們把題目縮短、加入人口變項、刪掉兩題會洩漏假設的題目，並補上正式的說明與揭露），再與 KIT 的 Engineers Without Borders 做前測，取得倫理委員會的認定，然後透過 Instagram、官方 iGEM Slack、Barcelona Meetup 上的 QR code 傳單以及 KIT 的郵件群組發放。共收回 71 份回覆。誠實的結論是他們的假設並未獲得支持——女性並沒有不成比例地承擔更多文書或溝通工作——但有兩項發現成立：不論性別，多數受訪者都同意組織性工作獲得的肯定少於研究工作；而覺得自己貢獻未獲足夠肯定的，女性是 45 人中的 9 位，男性是 24 人中的 0 位。他們公開了完整統計、各項 Cronbach's alpha、原始資料、兩個版本的問卷與倫理聲明，並寫了一節長而具體的限制說明。真正讓這件事可被照抄的是轉化那一步。在與 KIT 平等機會與多元管理部門主管 Ines Koehler 討論結果之後（她引用了 iGEM 的「回饋社群」原則），團隊做出兩件成品。Gender Roles & Task Distribution Workshop 是為剛成立的團隊、在合作一開始、也就是模式最容易改變的時候設計的：每個人先畫出自己的時間如何分配在七個任務領域、並為每一項的滿意度評分，接著在兩人對話中，去找一位經常承擔「自己最沒信心承擔的那個任務領域」的人談，讓看不見的付出變得具體；最後以具體的下一步收尾，包括一週的任務互換挑戰，以及幾週後的回訪確認。完整的帶領指南連同可列印學習單都能下載，不需要事先具備性別研究知識，並可調整為 1.5 到 2.5 小時的場次。它在收到 Ines Koehler 以及 University of Stuttgart「Women in STEM Initiative」共同創辦人 Anietta Weckauff 與 Marina Jaehnert Giannitrapani 的書面回饋後修訂過——改動包括把「盲點」改成「感受落差」，因為沒被注意到的任務並不是被刻意忽視；把「我絕不會做的任務」改成「你最沒信心承擔的任務領域」，使這個選擇不會讀成對該任務價值的評斷；加入滿意度評分、明確的基本規則、暖身階段的退出選項、一段關於交織性因素的說明，以及建議採男女共同帶領。團隊也直說兩個版本都還沒試辦過，並請辦過的團隊回報。TeamKIT 是一本可下載的團隊與會議文化指南，做它的原因是：作為 KIT 第一支、前面沒有任何前輩的團隊，他們必須從零摸索任務分配、會議與衝突——而他們發現 Aarhus 與 Berlin 的第一年團隊也有同樣的問題；內容從個人的強項與興趣，走到人際溝通，再到整個團隊，最後以會議與衝突處理方法收尾，而包容性是貫穿全書而非單獨設一章，並由 iGEM Aarhus 的 Freja 審閱。對一個 Foundational Advance 專案來說，公眾推廣同樣是刻意設計的，因為奈米區室看不見、也難以想像。三位成員參加了 KIT 第一屆 science slam 營，八天的工作坊涵蓋敘事、台風、視覺化與公關，並在 Karlsruhe 一場科學傳播活動上對約 100 人演出，用的比喻是他們一稿一稿丟掉之後才找到的：酵母細胞是一座球池，而奈米區室是一台神奇機器，會去幫你拿你身體太大拿不到的玩具、給小孩一個受保護的空間做口香糖而不會傷到周遭的任何東西，還會把在球堆裡吵架的小孩拍下來（mRNA 捕捉）。CoLab 是一場建立在公開徵件上的藝術展，而徵件問藝術家問題、而不是委託他們畫插圖：啟動子會變成什麼、勝任細胞（competent cells）可能是什麼、高壓滅菌意味著什麼，以及你在團隊自己實驗室工作中的四張未加標註的科學圖表中看到什麼；九位藝術家的十一件作品（其中一件完成於 1980 年）在 10 月的兩個週末於 Karlsruhe 的 Fasanengarten 展亭展出，團隊成員全程在場，而訪客問出了實驗室裡永遠不會出現的問題——你們到底在那些細胞裡改了什麼、它們之後會怎麼樣、誰決定什麼是被允許的。「The Yeast We Can Do」是一款完全開放授權的桌遊，3-6 人、12 歲以上、約 45 分鐘、不需先備知識，共 19 個任務橫跨六個應用領域，從分解永久化學物質到捕捉 CO2 與養出奈米晶體，所有玩家在同樣 37 格的培養基上競爭同樣的 20 種胺基酸；規則、棋盤圖、任務卡、事件卡、計分紙與快速參考表都是可下載的 PDF，而酵母細胞與出芽酵母的棋子則是任何 FDM 印表機都能印的 STL 檔，全部放在 GitLab 上。團隊寫明的設計目標是：一個完全的新手玩完之後會知道蛋白質是一條由二十種珠子串起來的鏈、其中某些珠子很難取得；而一位 iGEMer 則可能在那個分解塑膠的酵素裡看出催化三元組。他們也在學生自營場地 Z10 辦了兩場酒吧問答（4 月 27 日，以及 10 月 15 日新生週期間再辦一場）、在 Campus Day 設攤辦科學問答、比賽裝滿一盒吸管尖與教人操作微量吸管，把 ENCORE 發表在 BIOspektrum 04/26（德國重要的分子生命科學期刊，Springer Nature）與 KIT 的學生雜誌 clicKIT，刻意從零建立社群媒體形象作為留給後繼者的團隊基礎建設，並在 6 月 13 日於 KIT 主辦了第一屆 iGEM Baden-Wuerttemberg Meetup，與 GU Frankfurt、Bonn、Saarland、Aachen、Berlin、Heidelberg 與 Stuttgart 共同參與，開場是 Center for Synthetic Genomics 的 Sylvia Erhardt 帶的海報設計工作坊，接著是一場同儕諮詢工作坊，各團隊帶著自己最急迫的內部問題與瓶頸來取得結構化的同儕回饋，包括在正式場合很少被攤開來談的團隊動力問題。wiki 本身也是一項無障礙交付成果，依 UniMuenster 2023 的「Inclusive Wiki Design」指南建成：大而清楚的無襯線字體、六種顏色各三個色階、針對色覺辨識障礙挑選的高對比配色、一鍵切換 OpenDyslexic 字體、一鍵切換暗色模式、每張圖都有供螢幕閱讀器使用的描述性替代文字、科學名詞與縮寫的詞彙表、全站搜尋功能，以及以形狀編碼的導覽（研究用 encapsulin 形狀的八邊形、人類實踐用圓形），讓區塊不必依賴顏色就能分辨。承諾也延續到競賽之後：性別化的任務分配可能出現在明年的 KIT Diversity Day，而一篇關於這個專案的文章將刊在 KIT Diversity Magazine。","ihp":"Integrated Human Practices is tightly coupled to the inclusivity work - the interview with Ines Koehler of KIT's Equal Opportunities and Diversity Management department is documented on the iHP page and is what converted the survey from a finding into two deliverables. The survey's own development through expert feedback, piloting and revision is itself documented as an engineering cycle ('Survey on Task Distribution') on the Engineering page, applying DBTL to a social-science instrument. The team explicitly anchored the work to UN Sustainable Development Goal 5 (gender equality) and to the local fact that roughly 70% of KIT students in engineering and technical programmes are male, while in Europe only one in five ICT and engineering specialists is female.","ihp_zh":"整合式人類實踐與包容性工作緊密扣合——與 KIT 平等機會與多元管理部門的 Ines Koehler 的訪談記錄在 iHP 頁上，而那正是把一項調查發現轉成兩件交付成果的關鍵。問卷本身透過專家回饋、前測與修訂而成形的過程，也在 Engineering 頁上記錄為一個工程循環（「Survey on Task Distribution」），把 DBTL 套用在一份社會科學工具上。團隊也明確把這項工作扣回聯合國永續發展目標 5（性別平等），以及一項在地事實：KIT 工程與技術學程的學生約 70% 為男性，而在歐洲，ICT 與工程專業人員中只有五分之一是女性。","realWorld":"Everything is downloadable and reusable: the workshop moderation guide and printable worksheet, the TeamKIT guide, the full board game (rules, board, cards, score pad, quick reference, STL print files) on GitLab, both survey versions, the raw data and the ethics statement, the Open NC Database (open to pull requests) and the ENCORE-Builder (new parts, adapters and backbones added as data files so other teams can extend it). The team's framing of why this matters for successors is worth copying: 'fair task distribution should not depend on whether a team happens to have someone who already cares about the topic', and the most useful thing a first team can leave behind is not a project but a starting point.","realWorld_zh":"所有東西都可下載、可重複使用：工作坊帶領指南與可列印學習單、TeamKIT 指南、放在 GitLab 上的完整桌遊（規則、棋盤、卡牌、計分紙、快速參考表、STL 列印檔）、兩個版本的問卷、原始資料與倫理聲明、Open NC Database（開放 pull request）以及 ENCORE-Builder（新元件、轉接件與骨架都以資料檔形式加入，方便其他團隊擴充）。團隊說明這件事為何對後繼者重要的那句話值得照抄：「公平的任務分配，不該取決於一個團隊剛好有沒有一個本來就在意這個議題的人」——而一支第一年的團隊能留下最有用的東西，不是一個專案，而是一個起點。","partners":["Ines Koehler, Head of Department for Equal Opportunities and Diversity Management, KIT","Dr Melanie-Marita Leidecker-Sandmann, Department of Science Communication, Institute for Technology Futures, KIT","Women in STEM Initiative, University of Stuttgart (Anietta Weckauff, Marina Jaehnert Giannitrapani)","Engineers Without Borders KIT (survey pilot)","KIT Ethics Committee","nine artists in the CoLab exhibition (Friederike Wallmen, Fabien Stark, Linus Hense, Silas Goettle, Marina Schreidl, Andreas Krueger, Lenara Bortscheller, Guenter Wallmen)","Z10 student-run venue, Karlsruhe","BIOspektrum (Springer Nature)","clicKIT magazine","Sylvia Erhardt, Center for Synthetic Genomics","iGEM Aarhus (TeamKIT review), iGEM Berlin","BaWue Meetup teams: GU Frankfurt, Bonn, Saarland, Aachen, Berlin, Heidelberg, Stuttgart","BFH European Meetup (Bielefeld, Frankfurt, Hamburg)","Mini Jamboree Eindhoven","KIT Diversity Magazine / Diversity Day"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6296/wiki/human-practices-resp/who-does-what-in-a-team/campus-day-presurvey-heptagon.avif","caption":"The heptagon pre-survey: visitors placed a gender-coded dot on the task category they most often take on in teamwork (n = 58)","caption_zh":"七邊形前導調查：訪客在自己在團隊合作中最常承擔的任務類別上貼一個依性別標色的點（n = 58）","credit":"Team KIT, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6296/wiki/human-practices-resp/who-does-what-in-a-team/task-frequency-all-20data.avif","caption":"Mean frequency of task distribution by gender across seven task areas, Mann-Whitney U tested (n = 69)","caption_zh":"七個任務領域依性別的任務分配平均頻率，以 Mann-Whitney U 檢定（n = 69）","credit":"Team KIT, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6296/wiki/human-practices-resp/building-a-team-from-scrach/teamkit.avif","caption":"TeamKIT, the downloadable guide to team and meeting culture written for first-year iGEM teams","caption_zh":"TeamKIT，為第一年的 iGEM 團隊所寫、可下載的團隊與會議文化指南","credit":"Team KIT, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6296/wiki/human-practices-resp/public-outreach/the-yeast-we-can-do/game-board.avif","caption":"'The Yeast We Can Do': the open-licensed board game board, 19 missions over 37 fields of nutrient medium, with 3D-printable yeast pieces","caption_zh":"「The Yeast We Can Do」：開放授權桌遊的棋盤，37 格培養基上共 19 個任務，附可 3D 列印的酵母棋子","credit":"Team KIT, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6296/wiki/human-practices-resp/public-outreach/art-exhibition/pavillon-fasanengarten.avif","caption":"CoLab, the art exhibition at the Fasanengarten pavilions in Karlsruhe, built from an open call asking artists what lab words mean to them","caption_zh":"CoLab，在 Karlsruhe Fasanengarten 展亭舉辦的藝術展，由一場公開徵件發起，問藝術家那些實驗室詞彙對他們而言意味著什麼","credit":"Team KIT, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6296/wiki/human-practices-resp/public-outreach/science-20slam-2.avif","caption":"The Science Slam performance to around 100 people, explaining the yeast cell as a ball pit and the nanocompartment as a wonder machine","caption_zh":"對約 100 人演出的 Science Slam，把酵母細胞解釋成一座球池、把奈米區室解釋成一台神奇機器","credit":"Team KIT, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6296/wiki/human-practices-resp/public-outreach/meetups/events/baw-meetup-everyone.avif","caption":"The first iGEM Baden-Wuerttemberg Meetup, hosted at KIT with eight German teams and a peer-consultation workshop","caption_zh":"第一屆 iGEM Baden-Wuerttemberg Meetup，由 KIT 主辦，八支德國團隊參與，並含一場同儕諮詢工作坊","credit":"Team KIT, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Point inclusivity work at your own house before the public: survey how tasks are actually distributed inside your own teams with a properly reviewed instrument, publish the result even when it contradicts your hypothesis, and convert it into a ready-to-run workshop plus a team-culture guide that a brand-new cohort can use in week one, so fair task distribution does not depend on one person happening to care.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"在面向大眾之前，先把包容性的工作對準自己家裡：用一份經過正式審閱的工具，調查你自己團隊裡的任務實際上怎麼分配，即使結果和你的假設相反也照樣公開，再把它轉成一套隨開即用的工作坊加一份團隊文化指南，讓全新一屆的成員在第一週就能用——這樣公平的任務分配就不必靠剛好有某個人在意。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/kit/","https://2026.igem.wiki/kit/inclusivity","https://2026.igem.wiki/kit/public-outreach","https://2026.igem.wiki/kit/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/kit/integrated-human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/kit/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/kit/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/kit/building-a-lab"],"awards_zh":["包容性獎 — 得主（研究生組）"],"rank":26},"6297":{"team":"McMaster-Canada","id":"6297","section":"Undergrad","country":"Canada","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/mcmaster-canada/","projectTitle":"Chariot: A Platform Technology for OMV-based Therapeutics","projectTitle_zh":"Chariot：一個以 OMV 為基礎的療法平台技術","tagline":"Inducible loading of bacterial outer membrane vesicles, plus the standardised generation, isolation and characterisation protocols the field does not have.","tagline_zh":"細菌外膜囊泡的可誘導裝載，加上這個領域目前所缺的標準化生成、分離與表徵流程。","summary":"McMaster built Chariot, a platform that loads cargo into bacterial outer membrane vesicles (OMVs) using the VNp tagging system, so that accumulation of a VNp-fused protein forces membrane curvature and vesiculation under an inducible promoter. Having identified that OMV work is held back less by biology than by the absence of standard methods, the team made measurement the project: they characterised VNp-driven OMV generation, benchmarked four isolation methods against a shared filtrate reference, and wrote everything into an openly published Protocol Handbook. Alongside this sits Apollo and Artemis, an in-silico platform combining GFlowNet-based active learning for peptide design with molecular dynamics for VNp-cargo compatibility. The project was shaped by 40 stakeholder interviews run through a purpose-built OMVS framework.","summary_zh":"McMaster 打造了 Chariot，一個以 VNp 標籤系統把載運物裝進細菌外膜囊泡（OMV）的平台：在可誘導啟動子之下，VNp 融合蛋白的累積會強迫膜彎曲並形成囊泡。團隊認定 OMV 研究受限的原因，與其說是生物學，不如說是缺乏標準方法，於是把量測本身當成專案主體：他們表徵了 VNp 驅動的 OMV 生成、以共用的濾液作為參考基準對四種分離方法做對標，並把一切寫進一本公開發行的實驗流程手冊。與此並列的是 Apollo 與 Artemis，一個電腦模擬平台，把基於 GFlowNet 的主動學習用於胜肽設計，並以分子動力學模擬評估 VNp 與載運物的相容性。整個專案由 40 場利害關係人訪談所形塑，訪談則透過一套專為此目的建立的 OMVS 框架進行。","awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (Undergrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A declared 'dual measurement' policy: every conclusion must be supported by at least two independent measurement techniques, and every comparison must run against a control. Integrated Human Practices uses a bespoke OMVS framework (Observe, Modify, Vision, Synthesis) built on the UKRI AREA principles, with each letter mapped to a specific iGEM Human Practices judging question. Machine learning is framed as an explicit design-test-learn loop in which measurements become training data.","frameworks_zh":"團隊明訂了一項「雙重量測」政策：每一個結論都必須由至少兩種獨立的量測技術支持，而每一項比較都必須對照一個對照組。整合式人類實踐使用一套自訂的 OMVS 框架（Observe、Modify、Vision、Synthesis），建立在 UKRI 的 AREA 原則之上，而每一個字母都對應到一個特定的 iGEM 人類實踐評審問題。機器學習則被明確框定為一個設計-測試-學習迴圈，其中量測結果成為訓練資料。","dataviz":"Interactive wiki charts with toggles for 'individual measurements', 'mean +/- SD', 'logarithmic scale' and 'show data', so a reader can switch between the summary and the underlying points; an interactive stakeholder network of 40 stakeholders across 37 nodes, colour-coded by category, where clicking a node jumps to its position on an engagement timeline; a conceptual platform-workflow animation for the Apollo/Artemis pipeline.","dataviz_zh":"wiki 上的互動圖表附有「individual measurements」、「mean +/- SD」、「logarithmic scale」與「show data」等切換項，讓讀者可以在摘要與底層資料點之間切換；一張互動式利害關係人網路圖呈現 40 位利害關係人分布於 37 個節點，依類別以顏色區分，點選某個節點即跳到它在互動時間軸上的位置；另有一段 Apollo/Artemis 流程的概念性平台工作流程動畫。","datascience":"The measurement work is built around the idea that a single endpoint cannot be trusted. OMV preparations are characterised by dynamic light scattering (Z-average diameter and polydispersity index on a Zetasizer Nano ZS) and by nanoparticle tracking analysis (particle concentration), with the team noting explicitly that DLS readings and NTA runs are independent and not paired by row, and flagging a date discrepancy between the workbook label and the raw file timestamps rather than quietly fixing it. Total protein is quantified with a Pierce BCA assay against a BSA standard curve (R2 = 0.97), with blank-subtracted technical triplicates and the individual absorbance readings published; the resulting 709.2 ug/mL is reported alongside the caveat that BCA measures total protein and cannot distinguish lumenal cargo from membrane-associated or co-isolated protein. Comparisons between isolation methods are tested statistically rather than by eye: one-way ANOVA on log10-transformed values with Tukey post-hoc at alpha 0.05 for size and polydispersity across ultracentrifugation, centrifugal concentration, the Norgen kit, a novel 'Push-Pull' adaptation and 0.22 um filtration, all referenced to a single shared 0.45 um PES filtrate so no method gets a head start; lysis conditions are tested by one-way ANOVA with Dunnett's test against untreated OMVs; and the 4-hour versus 18-hour vesiculation comparison uses Welch's t-test on log10 values (p = 0.0005). SDS-PAGE is quantified by ImageJ densitometry, giving 41% recovery of total extracellular mNeonGreen through OMV isolation. Crucially the team kept and measured every fraction each method produced, including supernatants, flow-throughs and intermediate washes they were meant to discard, so losses can be attributed to a step. Limitations are stated as findings: the proteinase K protection assay that would distinguish genuine vesicle lysis from detergent micelle formation was not completed, so DLS size shifts remain the only lysis evidence; the 0.45 um filtrate was never run on NTA; and BCA reports preparation-level protein, not cargo. On the modelling side, Apollo is a generative flow network trained with trajectory balance and coupled to Bayesian optimisation: an ensemble of five independently initialised MLP regressors on padded one-hot peptide sequences acts as a proxy for a fixed D2-AlBERT oracle, with a UCB acquisition score converted into the GFN reward, and the released CLAMP/DBAASP dataset deduplicated and split by target identifier. The team is careful about what this does not establish, writing that negative labels do not represent experimentally demonstrated inactivity, that grouping by target does not separate closely related sequences, and that a falling training loss does not verify exact reward-proportional sampling.","datascience_zh":"整個量測工作建立在一個想法之上：單一終點指標不可信。OMV 製備物以動態光散射（在 Zetasizer Nano ZS 上測 Z 平均粒徑與多分散指數）以及奈米顆粒追蹤分析（顆粒濃度）兩種方式表徵，團隊並明確指出 DLS 讀值與 NTA 執行結果彼此獨立、並非逐列配對，也標示出工作簿標籤與原始檔案時間戳之間的日期不一致，而不是悄悄改掉它。總蛋白量以 Pierce BCA 分析對照 BSA 標準曲線定量（R2 = 0.97），採扣除空白的三個技術重複，並公開了個別吸光讀值；所得的 709.2 ug/mL 與一項保留條件一併回報，即 BCA 量的是總蛋白，無法區分囊泡內腔的載運物、與膜結合的蛋白質，或一同被分離出來的蛋白質。分離方法之間的比較是用統計檢定，而不是用肉眼判斷：對 log10 轉換後的數值做單因子變異數分析，並以 alpha 0.05 的 Tukey 事後檢定比較超高速離心、離心濃縮、Norgen 套組、一種新的「Push-Pull」改良法與 0.22 um 過濾在粒徑與多分散性上的差異，而全部都以同一份共用的 0.45 um PES 濾液為基準，使任何方法都無法占先；裂解條件以單因子變異數分析搭配 Dunnett 檢定對照未處理的 OMV；而 4 小時與 18 小時囊泡化的比較則對 log10 數值使用 Welch t 檢定（p = 0.0005）。SDS-PAGE 以 ImageJ 密度定量，得到胞外 mNeonGreen 總量在 OMV 分離過程中的回收率為 41%。關鍵是團隊保留並量測了每種方法產生的每一個分部，包括照理說該丟掉的上清液、流穿液與中間洗滌液，因此流失量可以歸屬到具體的步驟。限制則被當成發現來陳述：原本能區分真正囊泡裂解與清潔劑微胞形成的 proteinase K 保護分析並未完成，因此 DLS 的粒徑位移仍是裂解的唯一證據；0.45 um 濾液從未上 NTA 測量；而 BCA 回報的是製備物層級的蛋白質，不是載運物。建模一側，Apollo 是一個以軌跡平衡訓練、並與貝氏最佳化耦合的生成流網路：五個獨立初始化的 MLP 迴歸器集成，在經補齊的 one-hot 胜肽序列上運作，作為一個固定的 D2-AlBERT 神諭的代理模型，再把 UCB 擷取分數轉換成 GFN 的獎勵，而釋出的 CLAMP/DBAASP 資料集則經去重並依標的識別碼切分。團隊對這套做法「沒有證明什麼」相當謹慎，寫明負標籤並不代表已由實驗證明無活性、依標的分組並不能把高度相近的序列分開，以及訓練損失下降並不足以驗證取樣真的與獎勵成比例。","software":"Apollo (GFlowNet + Bayesian optimisation peptide design, built on the published GFlowNet biological-sequence-design framework and the CLAMP/DBAASP dataset) and Artemis (molecular dynamics comparison of VNp-cargo pairings). A Protocol Handbook covering molecular cloning through OMV generation, isolation, lysis and analysis is published for reuse. Wiki source at gitlab.igem.org/2026/mcmaster-canada; site content licensed CC BY 4.0.","software_zh":"Apollo（GFlowNet 加貝氏最佳化的胜肽設計，建立在已發表的 GFlowNet 生物序列設計框架與 CLAMP/DBAASP 資料集之上）與 Artemis（以分子動力學模擬比較 VNp 與各種載運物的配對）。一本涵蓋分子選殖到 OMV 生成、分離、裂解與分析的實驗流程手冊也已公開供重複使用。Wiki 原始碼位於 gitlab.igem.org/2026/mcmaster-canada；網站內容以 CC BY 4.0 授權。","stack":["Malvern Zetasizer Nano ZS (DLS, zeta)","Nanoparticle tracking analysis (NTA)","Pierce BCA protein assay","SDS-PAGE with ImageJ densitometry","Norgen Bacterial EV Isolation Kit","Ultracentrifugation","50 kDa centrifugal concentrators","GFlowNets (trajectory balance)","Bayesian optimisation / GP-UCB","MLP ensembles","Molecular dynamics"],"techniques":["Dual orthogonal measurement per conclusion","Shared reference control across methods","One-way ANOVA on log10 values with Tukey post-hoc","Dunnett's test against untreated control","Welch's t-test on log10 values","BSA standard curve with R2","Technical triplicates with blank subtraction","Measuring discarded fractions to locate losses","Explicit statement of unmeasured confounds","Active learning / design-test-learn loop"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education outputs include a SynBio Handbook and a zine series, classroom and community sessions with named educators, and outreach materials documented on the education page.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育產出包括一本 SynBio Handbook 與一套小誌（zine）系列、與具名教育工作者合作的課堂與社區課程，以及記錄在教育頁面上的推廣素材。","ihp":"Forty stakeholders were consulted across five groups (patients, healthcare providers, regulatory experts, industry experts and biosafety experts), with sub-expertise in clinical infection, biofilms and pathogen biology, OMV and EV engineering, and drug delivery and nanomedicine. Each conversation is written up through the OMVS framework and tied to a project change; the stakeholder map records three kinds of link (referrals, sequences where a question raised in one meeting was answered in a later one, and convergences where two stakeholders who had never met reached the same conclusion), so a reader can trace a design decision back to the conversation that caused it. The first major pivot came from Dr Coombes, who raised uncontrolled inflammation and septic-like responses as unavoidable risks of systemic bacterial-derived therapeutics and cautioned that peanut-allergy mechanisms are not well enough understood for rational design; the team dropped its oncology and allergy concepts and moved to localised gut-associated systems, judging every subsequent concept on biological feasibility and patient safety before therapeutic potential.","ihp_zh":"團隊諮詢了 40 位利害關係人，分屬五個群體（病患、醫療提供者、法規專家、業界專家與生物安全專家），其專長再細分為臨床感染、生物膜與病原生物學、OMV 與 EV 工程，以及藥物遞送與奈米醫學。每一場對話都透過 OMVS 框架寫成紀錄並綁定到一項專案變更；利害關係人圖譜記錄三種連結（轉介；某次會議提出的問題在後續會議中得到解答的序列；以及兩位從未見過面的利害關係人得出相同結論的匯聚），因此讀者可以把一個設計決定追溯回促成它的那場對話。第一次重大轉向來自 Dr Coombes，他指出不受控的發炎與類敗血症反應是全身性投予細菌來源療法無法避免的風險，並提醒花生過敏的機制還沒被理解到足以支撐理性設計；團隊因此放棄了腫瘤與過敏方向的構想，轉向局部作用的腸道相關系統，並從此在評估每一個後續構想時，都先看生物學可行性與病患安全，再看治療潛力。","realWorld":"The entrepreneurship case positions Chariot as a modular OMV loading platform for biotechnology and pharmaceutical partners developing protein-based therapeutics, with antimicrobial resistance as the first application because OMVs fuse with bacterial and mammalian membranes and can deliver non-membrane-disrupting antimicrobial peptides past the permeability barrier. The stated value proposition is improved cargo loading plus more consistent and scalable production. The team also frames its protocol standardisation as the deliverable most likely to outlive the competition, benchmarking itself against earlier OMV teams (Freiburg 2024, NYU Abu Dhabi 2025).","realWorld_zh":"創業論述把 Chariot 定位為一個模組化的 OMV 裝載平台，服務正在開發蛋白質類療法的生技與製藥合作夥伴，第一個應用則是抗藥性，因為 OMV 能與細菌和哺乳類細胞膜融合，可以把不破壞膜的抗菌胜肽送過通透性屏障。團隊所述的價值主張是更好的載運物裝載效率，加上更一致且可放大的生產。他們也把自己的流程標準化定位為最可能在賽事結束後仍然留存的交付成果，並以過去的 OMV 團隊（Freiburg 2024、NYU Abu Dhabi 2025）作為自我對標的基準。","partners":["Farncombe Family Digestive Health Research Institute","Didar Lab, McMaster University","Dr Brian Coombes (McMaster)","Dr Michael Surette (McMaster)","Dr Elena Verdu (Farncombe Institute)","Dr Robert Hancock","Dr Greg Hussack","iGEM Freiburg 2024","iGEM NYU Abu Dhabi 2025"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6297/wiki/measurement/measure-sds-page.avif","caption":"12% SDS-PAGE of E. coli BL21(DE3) pET26b(+) 6xHis-mNeonGreen-VNp6 induction and OMV isolation products. ImageJ densitometry on this gel gave 41% recovery of total extracellular mNeonGreen through the isolation.","caption_zh":"E. coli BL21(DE3) pET26b(+) 6xHis-mNeonGreen-VNp6 誘導與 OMV 分離產物的 12% SDS-PAGE。對這張膠做 ImageJ 密度定量，得到胞外 mNeonGreen 總量在分離過程中的回收率為 41%。","credit":"Team McMaster-Canada, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6297/wiki/measurement/omv-filtrate-plate.avif","caption":"The 0.45 um PES-filtered vesicle preparation plated on LB agar. No growth confirms the absence of whole-cell contamination in the shared filtrate that every isolation method was benchmarked against.","caption_zh":"經 0.45 um PES 過濾的囊泡製備物塗在 LB 瓊脂平板上。沒有生長，確認了所有分離方法共同對標的這份濾液中不含完整細胞的污染。","credit":"Team McMaster-Canada, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6297/wiki/measurement/fluorescence-post-isolation.avif","caption":"mNeonGreen-VNp OMVs after Norgen kit isolation on a bench-safe blue light box: a 4-hour vesiculation period on the left, 18 hours on the right. The visible difference was then quantified by NTA, where the 18-hour preparation yielded significantly more vesicles (Welch's t-test on log10 values, p = 0.0005).","caption_zh":"經 Norgen 套組分離後的 mNeonGreen-VNp OMV，置於實驗桌上安全的藍光燈箱上：左為 4 小時囊泡化，右為 18 小時。這個肉眼可見的差異接著以 NTA 定量，18 小時的製備物產出顯著更多的囊泡（對 log10 數值做 Welch t 檢定，p = 0.0005）。","credit":"Team McMaster-Canada, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Keep and measure the fractions you were told to throw away. Benchmarking every isolation or purification method against one shared starting material, then analysing the supernatants, flow-throughs and washes as well as the eluates, turns a yield number into a map of where material is lost and at which step.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把人家叫你丟掉的那些分部留下來並且量它們。把每一種分離或純化方法都對照同一份起始材料做對標，然後除了沖提液之外，也把上清液、流穿液與洗滌液一併分析，就能把一個產率數字變成一張「材料在哪裡、在哪一步流失」的地圖。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/mcmaster-canada/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/mcmaster-canada/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/mcmaster-canada/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/mcmaster-canada/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/mcmaster-canada/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/mcmaster-canada/hardware"],"awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（大學組）"],"rank":7},"6300":{"team":"NU Boston","id":"6300","section":"Undergrad","country":"United States","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nu-boston/","projectTitle":"Soil Shield, with the FLARE soil simulation chamber","projectTitle_zh":"Soil Shield，搭配 FLARE 土壤模擬艙","tagline":"A $300 fluorescence macroscope and controlled soil chamber that tests whether a strain still works under post-wildfire stress, instead of assuming it will.","tagline_zh":"一台 $300 的螢光巨觀成像儀與受控土壤艙，用來檢驗菌株在野火後的逆境下是否仍然有效，而不是逕自假設它會有效。","summary":"NU Boston engineered Pseudomonas putida to survive post-wildfire soil conditions while degrading polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons, using the ectABC/D hydroxyectoine pathway for desiccation tolerance and a salicylate-dependent ccdA/ccdB toxin-antitoxin kill switch for biocontainment. Their hardware answer to the obvious objection, that a strain which works on a bench says little about a burnt hillside, is FLARE: a light-tight soil chamber that recreates oxidative stress and desiccation and images salicylate fluorescence in situ. It replaces lasers and arc lamps with 295 nm UVB COB LEDs and a 410 nm bandpass filter, bringing a fluorescence imaging rig that commercially costs thousands to tens of thousands of dollars down to roughly $300 to $500 in parts, with the full bill of materials published line by line.","summary_zh":"NU Boston 改造 Pseudomonas putida，使其能在野火後的土壤條件下存活並同時降解多環芳香烴，以 ectABC/D 的 hydroxyectoine 途徑取得耐乾燥性，並用依賴水楊酸鹽的 ccdA/ccdB 毒素-抗毒素自殺開關做生物圍阻。面對最明顯的質疑，也就是一株在實驗桌上有效的菌株對一片燒過的山坡幾乎說明不了什麼，他們的硬體答案是 FLARE：一個不透光的土壤艙，能重現氧化壓力與乾燥逆境，並就地拍攝水楊酸鹽的螢光。它以 295 nm 的 UVB COB LED 與 410 nm 帶通濾光片取代雷射與弧光燈，把商用價格數千至數萬美元的螢光成像設備壓到約 300 至 500 美元的零件成本，而完整的 BOM 逐項公開。","awards":["Best Hardware — Nominee (Undergrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A separate Design-Build-Test-Learn cycle is run for each major subsystem (enclosure, kill switch, UV/camera module, hydrogen peroxide delivery), and the team adds a fifth stage of their own, 'How We Moved Forward', which records explicitly what each cycle's learning changed in the next design. Requirements are elicited from the wet lab as the primary stakeholder and then renegotiated: a formal requirements meeting established what stressors were needed and what could be dropped, and a follow-up meeting after first use produced a feedback-to-design-change table.","frameworks_zh":"每個主要子系統（外殼、自殺開關、UV／相機模組、過氧化氫輸送）都各跑一個獨立的 Design-Build-Test-Learn 循環，團隊還自行加上第五個階段「How We Moved Forward」，明確記錄每一輪學到的東西改變了下一版設計的什麼。需求是以濕實驗組作為主要利害關係人來蒐集，之後再重新協商：一次正式的需求會議確立了需要哪些逆境因子、哪些可以捨棄，首次使用後的追蹤會議則產出一張回饋對應設計變更的對照表。","dataviz":"A calibration curve relating sodium salicylate concentration to mean blue fluorescence signal; a current-versus-voltage characterisation plot for both UV LEDs with the minimum rated voltage and maximum rated current marked as reference lines; flow-rate-against-duty-cycle curves for both pumps with trendlines and R2 values; before-and-after dose image panels for small and large salicylate doses; excitation and emission spectra for sodium salicylate with the chosen LED and filter wavelengths marked; CAD drawings with dimensions and tolerances for the quartz shield, bandpass filter and lens tube.","dataviz_zh":"一條把水楊酸鈉濃度對應到平均藍色螢光訊號的校正曲線；兩顆 UV LED 的電流對電壓特性圖，並以參考線標出最低額定電壓與最大額定電流；兩顆泵的流量對工作週期曲線，附趨勢線與 R2 值；小劑量與大劑量水楊酸鹽的投藥前後影像對照；水楊酸鈉的激發與放射光譜，並標出所選的 LED 與濾光片波長；石英護片、帶通濾光片與鏡筒的 CAD 圖，附尺寸與公差。","datascience":"The instrument is characterised component by component before it is trusted as a whole. Both UV LEDs were swept on a programmable DC supply from 1 V to the manufacturer's 6.2 V maximum, with current recorded and illumination checked at each step for 5 seconds, the same exposure used in the final capture cycle; both drew no current below 5 V, and the team stopped at 5.9 V rather than risk the 700 mA ceiling, with LED 1 reaching it at 5.9 V and LED 2 at 5.7 V, documenting that two nominally identical parts differ. Optics are chosen from the fluorophore's spectra rather than by convention: sodium salicylate excites with a peak at 299 nm and a 10% minimum normalised intensity range of 262 to 325 nm, and emits from 359 to 509 nm peaking at 412 nm, so the team specified 295 +/- 5 nm COB LEDs and a 410 nm bandpass filter, and explains why a bandpass rather than the longpass filter used in the DIY designs they built on. Camera height was set empirically, adjusted while live-viewing then measured with calipers at 79 mm to give full coverage of the dish. The first user test produced the most useful measurement finding: at 5 mM salicylate about a third of the dish image reached the maximum pixel value of 255, so differences in brightness above that limit could not be recorded, an explicit saturation limit on the dynamic range. The same test showed that the dish had to be held in a fixed position so control and experimental images could be compared and background properly subtracted, and that perlite in the soil interfered with imaging and had to be removed. Quantification is by pixel-wise comparison of each post-dose image against its own pre-dose control rather than by visual inspection, validated by showing that fluorescence intensity and coverage scale with dose. The final run produced the calibration curve the team will use for all future tests, Signal = 0.0495 x C + 31.44 with R2 = 0.9871. The fluidics were calibrated as carefully: cycle 1 could only switch a pump on and off, which the team identified as controlling duration but not volume, so cycle 2 added PWM duty cycle as a control variable and measured delivered volume into a graduated cylinder over 60 seconds per setting. Both curves came out nonlinear with a dead zone below 20% and little gain above 60%, the two pumps differed by a factor of about 1.5 at full duty despite pumping the same liquid, and the team concluded that each pump needs its own calibration table and, crucially, that doses should be interpolated from the measured values rather than read off the fitted trendline, which misses points at 30 to 40%. On the biology side, an intended OD600 plate-reader assay for the kill switch was invalidated once the team found that ccdB induces filamentation, which changes light scattering so that filamentous and normal populations cannot be compared by turbidity; flow cytometry live/dead staining then showed viability mirroring the uninduced control, and only a CFU assay with cells induced in mid-log phase at OD600 0.4 to 0.6 gave a statistically significant difference, with the forward-scatter increase across arabinose concentrations retrospectively confirming the filamentation. The team publishes that whole chain of invalidated assays rather than only the one that worked.","datascience_zh":"這台儀器在被當作整體來信任之前，先逐個元件做了特性分析。兩顆 UV LED 都以可程式直流電源從 1 V 掃到製造商標示的 6.2 V 上限，每一步都記錄電流並檢查照度 5 秒，與最終拍攝週期所用的曝光時間相同；兩顆在 5 V 以下都不導通電流，而團隊在 5.9 V 就停手，不願冒險觸及 700 mA 的上限，其中 LED 1 在 5.9 V 達到該上限、LED 2 在 5.7 V 達到，記錄下兩個名義上相同的零件其實有差異。光學元件是依螢光團的光譜而非慣例來選：水楊酸鈉的激發峰在 299 nm，正規化強度 10% 的最小範圍為 262 至 325 nm，放射則從 359 到 509 nm、峰值在 412 nm，因此團隊指定 295 +/- 5 nm 的 COB LED 與 410 nm 帶通濾光片，並說明為何採用帶通，而不是他們所參考的 DIY 設計中使用的長波通濾光片。相機高度以實作方式設定：邊看即時影像邊調整，再用游標卡尺量得 79 mm，剛好完整涵蓋培養皿。第一次使用者測試帶來最有用的量測發現：在 5 mM 水楊酸鹽下，培養皿影像約有三分之一達到像素最大值 255，因此超過該上限的亮度差異無法被記錄，這是對動態範圍一項明確的飽和限制。同一次測試也顯示培養皿必須固定在同一位置，對照影像與實驗影像才能比較、背景才能正確扣除，而土壤中的珍珠石會干擾成像、必須移除。定量是以逐像素比較每張投藥後影像與其自身投藥前對照，而非目視判讀，並以螢光強度與覆蓋面積隨劑量上升來驗證。最後一次執行產出團隊未來所有測試都會採用的校正曲線：Signal = 0.0495 x C + 31.44，R2 = 0.9871。流體部分校正得同樣仔細：第 1 輪只能把泵開和關，團隊認出這只控制了時間而非體積，於是第 2 輪把 PWM 工作週期加入作為控制變數，並在每個設定下用量筒量測 60 秒內的輸送體積。兩條曲線都呈非線性，20% 以下是死區、60% 以上增益很小；兩顆泵在滿工作週期下相差約 1.5 倍，儘管抽送的是同一種液體；團隊因此結論是每顆泵都需要自己的校正表，而最關鍵的是劑量應由實測值內插，而不是從擬合的趨勢線讀取，因為該趨勢線在 30 至 40% 處偏離了資料點。在生物這一側，原本為自殺開關設計的 OD600 微量盤判讀檢測，在團隊發現 ccdB 會誘導絲狀化之後即失效，因為絲狀化改變了光散射，使絲狀族群與正常族群無法以濁度比較；接著以流式細胞術的活／死染色顯示存活率與未誘導對照相當；最後只有在對數生長中期（OD600 0.4 至 0.6）誘導的 CFU 檢測才給出統計上顯著的差異，而隨阿拉伯糖濃度上升的前向散射增加則事後印證了絲狀化。團隊把這一整串失效的檢測全都公布，而不是只公布那個行得通的。","software":"A published FLARE manual (PDF, 2.4 MB) accompanies the hardware. Firmware runs on a Raspberry Pi 5 with a Raspberry Pi Camera Module 3 for imaging, and an Arduino driving MOSFET-switched 12 V peristaltic pumps via PWM; the LED program is written to turn the UV lights on for only 5 seconds per capture, 4 seconds for the camera to adjust plus 1 second for the shot, at intervals of 5 minutes or more, which is also the argument that UV exposure is too low to degrade the printed components. The kill-switch interlock was redesigned so that the Raspberry Pi reads the magnetic reed switch state on a GPIO pin and cuts power itself, rather than the switch physically breaking a circuit it was not rated for.","software_zh":"硬體附有一份公開的 FLARE 操作手冊（PDF，2.4 MB）。韌體跑在 Raspberry Pi 5 上，影像由 Raspberry Pi Camera Module 3 擷取，另有一片 Arduino 以 PWM 透過 MOSFET 切換 12 V 蠕動泵；LED 程式寫成每次拍攝只把 UV 燈開 5 秒（4 秒給相機調整、1 秒拍攝），間隔 5 分鐘以上，這同時也是 UV 曝露量太低、不足以劣化列印件這項論點的依據。自殺開關的連動機制被重新設計，改由 Raspberry Pi 在 GPIO 腳位讀取磁簧開關狀態並自行切斷電源，而不是讓開關去物理性地切斷一個超出其額定的電路。","stack":["Raspberry Pi 5 and Camera Module 3 (1080p, 11.9 MP)","Arduino with MOSFET-switched 12 V peristaltic pumps (PWM)","295 nm UVB COB LEDs, 60 degree viewing angle","Edmund Optics 410 nm bandpass filter and 20 mm SM1 lens tube","Quartz glass shields rated to 1148 C","Magnetic reed switch lid interlock","Onshape CAD","FDM 3D printing and laser-cut acrylic","Flow cytometry and CFU assays"],"techniques":["Per-component characterisation before system validation","LED current-voltage sweep at the operational exposure time","Optics selected from measured excitation and emission spectra","Explicit pixel-saturation limit on dynamic range","Fixed sample positioning for background subtraction","Pixel-wise comparison against a matched pre-dose control","Calibration curve with R2 for concentration readout","Pump duty-cycle calibration by delivered volume","Interpolation from measured points rather than the fitted line","Published bill of materials with unit costs","Documented invalidated assays and why they failed"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A two-year partnership with CitySprouts, which runs schoolyard gardens with Boston public schools focused on sustainability, community and equitable access for students in underfunded areas. The team took on two new gardens at Nathan Hale and Higginson Lewis Elementary in Roxbury and tended them weekly through the summer, watering, weeding and harvesting. The work fed back into the project: handling many soil types showed how much texture and environment change with weather, and watching an extreme Boston heatwave desiccate the gardens reinforced the case for the soil chamber as a testing ground. The team also ran a microfluidic chip design activity at a Geering Up workshop and rebuilt it with paper towels and paint for the next session after the paper version leaked.","publicEngagement_zh":"與 CitySprouts 維持兩年的夥伴關係；該組織與波士頓公立學校合作經營校園菜園，聚焦永續、社群，以及讓資源不足地區的學生也能公平參與。團隊接下 Roxbury 的 Nathan Hale 與 Higginson Lewis Elementary 兩座新菜園，整個夏天每週照料，包括澆水、除草與採收。這些工作也回饋到專案本身：接觸多種土壤類型讓他們看到質地與環境隨天候變化的幅度有多大，而目睹波士頓一次極端熱浪把菜園曬乾，更強化了把土壤艙作為測試場的理由。團隊也在 Geering Up 工作坊帶了一場微流體晶片設計活動，並在紙製版本漏液之後，用紙巾與顏料為下一場重做了一版。","ihp":"Expert consultation shaped the optics and the fluidics. Dr Kai Zhang, a postdoctoral research associate in physics at Northeastern, resolved the team's confusion between excitation and emission wavelengths and established that they needed both an LED in the fluorophore's excitation range and a filter isolating its emission. Professor Timothy Lannin warned that condensation on the quartz LED shields and the camera filter could degrade measurements over time and suggested adding a cold spot to collect it. The wet lab acted as the device's primary user throughout, and their feedback produced six concrete design changes including plastic rather than glass petri dishes, a lid handle, longer ribbon cables so modules can be removed while still connected, a friendlier interface, a kill switch against UV exposure, and ethanol-resistant materials for the final chamber.","ihp_zh":"專家諮詢形塑了光學與流體設計。Northeastern 物理系的博士後研究員 Dr Kai Zhang 釐清了團隊對激發波長與放射波長的混淆，並確立他們同時需要一顆落在螢光團激發範圍的 LED，以及一片能隔出其放射的濾光片。Professor Timothy Lannin 警告石英 LED 護片與相機濾光片上的凝結水氣會隨時間劣化量測結果，並建議加一個冷點來收集它。濕實驗組全程扮演這台裝置的主要使用者，他們的回饋產出六項具體設計變更：改用塑膠而非玻璃培養皿、加上蓋把手、更長的排線使模組在仍連接的狀態下也能取下、更友善的介面、一個防止 UV 曝露的切斷開關，以及最終艙體採用耐乙醇的材料。","realWorld":"The team states the broader case directly: fluorescence imaging is one of biology's most important tools and its price keeps it out of reach of smaller colleges, K-12 classrooms and community science programmes, with commercial systems running from a few thousand dollars into six figures. FLARE is costed at as low as $300 against $10,000, and the low cost is argued to enable running several units side by side to collect imaging data from many samples at once, which is impractical with one shared microscope. Beyond the wildfire application the team lists protein expression analysis, live/dead assays and expression-level detection as reusable uses. Chemical safety drove a scoping decision as well: the team avoided bringing naphthalene into an undergraduate teaching lab because of its carcinogenicity and shifted to salicylate and the nahG gene, keeping a genuinely relevant part of the degradation pathway while removing the exposure risk.","realWorld_zh":"團隊直接把更大的論點說出來：螢光成像是生物學最重要的工具之一，但它的價格讓規模較小的學院、K-12 教室與社區科學計畫都用不起，商用系統從數千美元一路到六位數。FLARE 的成本低至 $300，相對於 $10,000，而低成本的論點是可以同時並排運行數台，一次從許多樣品收集影像資料，這在只有一台共用顯微鏡時並不可行。除了野火應用之外，團隊還列出蛋白質表現分析、活／死檢測與表現量偵測作為可重用的用途。化學安全也驅動了一項範圍決策：團隊避免把萘帶進大學部教學實驗室，因為它具致癌性，因而改用水楊酸鹽與 nahG 基因，既保留降解途徑中真正相關的一段，又排除暴露風險。","partners":["CitySprouts (Boston)","Nathan Hale Elementary and Higginson Lewis Elementary, Roxbury","Geering Up","Dr Kai Zhang (Northeastern University, Physics)","Professor Timothy Lannin (Northeastern University)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6300/wiki/hardware/hardware.avif","caption":"FLARE, the team's controlled soil chamber and fluorescence macroscope. The laser-cut opaque black acrylic enclosure keeps ambient light out so the UV/camera module can image salicylate fluorescence directly in soil.","caption_zh":"FLARE，團隊的受控土壤艙與螢光巨觀成像儀。雷射切割的不透光黑色壓克力外殼阻絕環境光，讓 UV／相機模組能直接在土壤中拍攝水楊酸鹽螢光。","credit":"Team NU Boston, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6300/wiki/hardware/figures/flare-calibration-curve.avif","caption":"Calibration curve relating sodium salicylate concentration to mean blue fluorescence signal, Signal = 0.0495 x C + 31.44 with R2 = 0.9871, produced on the completed system and adopted for all future tests.","caption_zh":"把水楊酸鈉濃度對應到平均藍色螢光訊號的校正曲線，Signal = 0.0495 x C + 31.44，R2 = 0.9871，在完工的系統上產出，並被採用於後續所有測試。","credit":"Team NU Boston, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6300/wiki/hardware/figures/flare-salicylate-5mm.avif","caption":"5 mM sodium salicylate imaged in the first wet-lab user test. About a third of the dish reached the camera's maximum pixel value of 255, so brightness differences above that limit could not be recorded, an explicit saturation ceiling on the instrument's dynamic range.","caption_zh":"第一次濕實驗使用者測試中拍攝的 5 mM 水楊酸鈉。培養皿約有三分之一達到相機的像素最大值 255，因此超過該上限的亮度差異無法被記錄，這是儀器動態範圍上一道明確的飽和上限。","credit":"Team NU Boston, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6300/wiki/hardware/figures/flare-final-test.avif","caption":"The final test run on the completed FLARE system, after the wet lab's feedback produced plastic dishes, a lid handle, longer ribbon cables, a reworked interface, a UV kill switch and ethanol-resistant materials.","caption_zh":"在完工的 FLARE 系統上進行的最後一次測試；在此之前，濕實驗組的回饋已促成塑膠培養皿、上蓋把手、更長的排線、重做的介面、一個 UV 切斷開關與耐乙醇材料。","credit":"Team NU Boston, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Calibrate the actuator as carefully as the detector, and then do not use the fitted line: the team measured delivered volume against pump duty cycle, found both curves nonlinear with a dead zone and a plateau, and ruled that doses must be interpolated from the measured points because the trendline missed the data where it mattered.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把致動器校正得和偵測器一樣仔細，然後不要用擬合出來的那條線：團隊量測了輸送體積對泵工作週期的關係，發現兩條曲線都是非線性的，既有死區也有平台區，因此裁定劑量必須由實測點內插求得，因為趨勢線在最關鍵的地方偏離了資料。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/nu-boston/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/nu-boston/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/nu-boston/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/nu-boston/outreach","https://2026.igem.wiki/nu-boston/results"],"awards_zh":["最佳硬體 — 入圍（大學組）"],"rank":7},"6301":{"team":"UCNZ","id":"6301","section":"Undergrad","country":"New Zealand","village":"Biomanufacturing","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/","projectTitle":"NanoBrew","projectTitle_zh":"NanoBrew","tagline":"Enzymatic production of nanocellulose from brewers' spent grain - turning 39 million tonnes a year of brewing waste into a high-value biomaterial.","tagline_zh":"以酵素從啤酒糟生產奈米纖維素——把每年 3,900 萬公噸的釀酒廢棄物變成高值生物材料。","summary":"NanoBrew takes brewers' spent grain (BSG), which makes up about 85% of beer brewing waste by weight and is mostly landfilled or sold as cheap animal feed, and extracts nanocellulose from it enzymatically instead of with hot acid and energy-intensive mechanical grinding. The team expressed a Bacillus subtilis xylanase (XynA) to strip hemicellulose and open up the cellulose, plus an ancestrally reconstructed Cel5A endoglucanase fused to a carbohydrate binding module to cut cellulose down to nanofibrils, and tested six construct variants with and without the YebF secretion tag in E. coli. It was Top 10 and nominated for Presentation, Entrepreneurship and Biomanufacturing because the project is framed end to end as a New Zealand circular-economy story - built on a real brewery partnership, grounded in the Maori value of kaitiakitanga, with a full pilot-plant cost analysis and letters of support - and because the team is candid that it never managed to characterise its product. No previous iGEM team had extracted nanocellulose from lignocellulosic plant material rather than growing it bacterially.","summary_zh":"NanoBrew 以啤酒糟（BSG）為原料——它以重量計約占啤酒釀造廢棄物的 85%，目前大多進入掩埋場或低價賣作動物飼料——改用酵素、而不是熱酸與高耗能的機械研磨來萃取奈米纖維素。團隊表現了一個 Bacillus subtilis 的木聚醣酶（XynA）以剝除半纖維素、把纖維素暴露出來，並表現一個經祖先序列重建的 Cel5A 內切葡聚醣酶、融合一個碳水化合物結合模組，把纖維素切到奈米纖絲尺度；他們在 E. coli 中測試了六種構築版本，分別帶與不帶 YebF 分泌標籤。此專題進入前十並獲簡報、創業與生物製造三項提名，因為整個專題從頭到尾被框成一個紐西蘭循環經濟的故事——建立在一段真實的釀酒廠合作關係上、紮根於毛利人的 kaitiakitanga（守護）價值，並附有完整的試量產廠成本分析與支持函——也因為團隊坦白承認自己始終沒能完成產品的特性分析。此前沒有任何 iGEM 隊伍從木質纖維素植物材料中萃取奈米纖維素，過去都是用細菌培養出來的。","awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Biomanufacturing Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Modest but purposeful, and honestly scoped. Before ordering genes, all six constructs were folded with AlphaFold 3 and the predicted structures aligned in PyMOL against the unfused enzymes to check the YebF tag, linkers and CBM had not disturbed the catalytic core - RMSD came out at 0.101 and 0.117 Angstrom for XynA and YebF-XynA, and 0.183, 0.155, 0.173 Angstrom for the endoglucanase variants, all well under 2 Angstrom, with pTM reported per model and the flexible linker correctly flagged as an unstructured region. Enzyme assays were run as time-series DNS and fitted to Michaelis-Menten-like behaviour on both the control substrate (birchwood xylan) and on BSG, with enzyme inactivation used to freeze each timepoint. For the system-level question they built a causal loop diagram with 12 nodes linking the environmental, economic and social effects of an upscaled process, signed each causal link positive or negative, and decomposed the graph into balancing and reinforcing loops - while explicitly refusing to quantify link strength. The microfluidic viscometer was designed entirely in simulation (Capillarix, an unreleased capillary-microfluidics simulator supplied by its creator) with a simulated error table, and the absorbance sensor uses a machine learning calibration running on the device itself.","frameworks_zh":"規模不大但目的明確，而且範圍劃分誠實。在訂購基因之前，六個構築全部用 AlphaFold 3 折疊，並在 PyMOL 中把預測結構與未融合的酵素對位，檢查 YebF 標籤、連接子與 CBM 沒有擾動催化核心——XynA 與 YebF-XynA 的 RMSD 分別為 0.101 與 0.117 埃，內切葡聚醣酶的各版本為 0.183、0.155、0.173 埃，全都遠低於 2 埃，每個模型都報告 pTM 值，柔性連接子也正確標記為無序區域。酵素活性試驗以 DNS 法做時間序列，並在對照受質（樺木木聚醣）與 BSG 上都擬合近似 Michaelis-Menten 的行為，各時間點以酵素失活方式凍結。在系統層級的問題上，他們畫了一張含 12 個節點的因果迴圈圖，串起流程放大後的環境、經濟與社會效應，為每條因果連結標上正負號，並把圖分解成平衡迴圈與增強迴圈——同時明確表示拒絕量化連結強度。微流體黏度計完全在模擬中設計完成（Capillarix，一套由其作者提供、尚未釋出的毛細管微流體模擬器），並附一份模擬誤差表；吸光度感測器則採用一套在裝置上自行運行的機器學習校正。","dataviz":"The two devices are the visualization story: the project needed a way to read nanocellulose concentration from microlitre samples, and the engineering subteam built it. The differential microfluidic viscometer compares a sample against a reference fluid in a sealed channel to cancel out the variable hydrophilicity of PMMA, computing relative viscosity as the ratio of average length-times-velocity products over the first second of flow, then calibrating to the expected sample range so unknowns are read by linear interpolation. The optical sensor strobes red, green and blue LEDs sequentially and feeds the three absorbance values to a machine learning model on an onboard ESP32, which infers concentration - and is deliberately built so a biotechnologist can recalibrate it for whatever property they want to infer. The wiki itself keeps each page to a clear sectioned structure with a sidebar contents list, and the stakeholder work is presented as an influence-interest grid rather than a list.","dataviz_zh":"兩個裝置本身就是視覺化的重點：這個專題需要一個能從微升級樣品讀出奈米纖維素濃度的方法，而工程分組把它做出來了。差動式微流體黏度計在密封流道中把樣品與參考流體相比，以抵銷 PMMA 親水性不穩定的影響，並以流動第一秒內「長度乘速度」乘積平均值的比值計算相對黏度，再對預期的樣品範圍校正，使未知樣品可用線性內插讀出。光學感測器依序閃爍紅、綠、藍 LED，把三個吸光度值餵給板載 ESP32 上的機器學習模型推論濃度——而且刻意設計成讓生物技術人員能重新校正，用來推論自己想要的任何性質。wiki 本身把每一頁維持在分節清楚的結構，並在側欄附目錄，利害關係人的工作也以影響力—關注度矩陣呈現、而不是列成清單。","datascience":"The dry lab's strongest quality is calibrated honesty rather than volume of computation. The team states plainly at the top of the entrepreneurship page that its market research targeted cellulose nanofibrils because that was the anticipated product from the literature, but that it was unable to characterise what it actually made; the FTIR comparison against a pure nanocellulose reference sample came back inconclusive, and they published that, named ATR-FTIR as the next attempt, and said they were waiting on expert advice as of the wiki freeze. For the absorbance sensor they ran out of nanocellulose and substituted guar gum, justifying it as shear-thinning with a similar concentration-opacity relationship, and tabulating the results as such. The viscometer error table notes that surface roughness is not modelled. They also report that only one student in their school talks had heard of iGEM, and that a 2019 survey of 9,000 New Zealanders found 30% opposed selling GM food at all - using measured baselines rather than assertions about public attitudes.","datascience_zh":"乾實驗最強的品質不在運算量，而在校準過的誠實。團隊在創業頁面最上方直白說明，他們的市場研究是以纖維素奈米纖絲為標的，因為文獻預期的產物是它，但他們無法完成對實際做出來的東西的特性分析；與純奈米纖維素參考樣品的 FTIR 比對結果不明確，他們照實公開，點名 ATR-FTIR 是下一次的嘗試，並說明在 wiki 凍結時他們仍在等專家意見。吸光度感測器部分，他們的奈米纖維素用完了，改以關華豆膠替代，並以其同為剪切稀化、且濃度與不透明度關係相似為理由加以說明，表格也如實標示。黏度計的誤差表則註明表面粗糙度未納入模型。他們也報告在校內演講中只有一位學生聽過 iGEM，以及一份 2019 年對 9,000 位紐西蘭人的調查發現 30% 完全反對販售基改食品——用實測的基線、而不是對公眾態度的斷言。","software":"No standalone software release. The hardware is the deliverable: two sensors for reading nanocellulose concentration in microlitre volumes, one a differential capillary-microfluidics viscometer validated in simulation, the other a built RGB-strobing absorbance/turbidity sensor with on-ESP32 machine learning calibration, both developed through two documented iterations of the engineering design cycle and integrated into University of Canterbury engineering students' coursework with some of those students joining as external collaborators. Parts are the other contribution: six constructs registered, with EG-CBM (BBa_26TOG7XZ) highlighted as expressing and purifying extremely well with good activity on complex substrates, plus Pichia/yeast-targeted versions using an OST1 signal sequence and T2A self-cleaving peptide bicistronic designs (BBa_266IKFQ3, BBa_26OB3D76), and a characterisation of the YebF secretion tag (BBa_K1610300, from TAS_Taipei 2015) intended to let future teams choose a secretion system on evidence.","software_zh":"沒有獨立的軟體發布。硬體才是交付成果：兩個用於在微升體積下讀取奈米纖維素濃度的感測器，一個是在模擬中驗證的差動毛細管微流體黏度計，另一個是已製作完成、以紅綠藍閃爍取光的吸光度／濁度感測器，並在 ESP32 上做機器學習校正；兩者都經過兩輪有完整紀錄的工程設計循環，並被整合進坎特伯里大學工程系學生的課程作業，其中部分學生還以外部協作者身分加入團隊。元件是另一項貢獻：註冊了六個構築，其中 EG-CBM（BBa_26TOG7XZ）被特別標示為表現與純化都極佳、且對複雜受質有良好活性，另有針對 Pichia／酵母的版本，採用 OST1 訊號序列與 T2A 自切胜肽的雙順反子設計（BBa_266IKFQ3、BBa_26OB3D76），以及對 YebF 分泌標籤（BBa_K1610300，來自 TAS_Taipei 2015）的特性分析，目的是讓未來的隊伍能依證據選擇分泌系統。","stack":["AlphaFold 3","PyMOL","SnapGene 8.2.3","Capillarix (capillary microfluidics simulation)","ESP32","Google Patents / BLAST (freedom-to-operate searching)","FTIR spectroscopy","SEM","solid-state NMR (via Bioeconomy Science Institute)"],"techniques":["Structure prediction and RMSD alignment for fusion-construct validation","pTM / confidence-based interpretation of predicted models","Time-series DNS enzyme assay with Michaelis-Menten fitting","Causal loop diagramming with balancing and reinforcing loop decomposition","Differential capillary viscometry","Multi-wavelength absorbance with on-device ML calibration","Sedimentation assay for aspect ratio","FTIR purity assessment","Two-cycle engineering design iteration","PEST and SWOT analysis","Pilot-plant cost forecasting","Influence-interest stakeholder mapping"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Outreach was built around a deliberate hypothesis: in New Zealand, synthetic biology means genetic modification and genetic modification means risk, so the team tested whether a local story changes how people engage. They gave three secondary-school talks (one at Burnside High School, two at Christchurch Girls' High School, both schools some members had attended) covering synthetic biology, iGEM, what a science degree looks like and how NanoBrew works, and structured them for dialogue - long question time, small-group breakout discussion, a quiz where answers were argued through rather than marked, contact details left for follow-ups, and teacher feedback collected. Their findings are reported as findings: students already knew breweries and brewery waste so the local hook carried the science; small groups worked far better than whole-cohort presentation; most questions were about science careers and preparing for university, where undergraduates were better placed to answer than any teacher; and only one student had ever heard of iGEM. For the wider public they worked with the university communications team on a press release framed as a local problem with a local solution, which reached The Press, NZ Herald, Radio New Zealand, NewstalkZB, The Breeze, The Platform and deliberately rural and regional outlets including the Ashburton Courier and Selwyn Times, with a team member and the PI giving radio interviews that explained containment in plain language; the Instagram account passed 23,000 views. They also presented at the Biomolecular Interaction Centre Winter Symposium. The published lessons for future teams are practical: get your institution's comms team involved early, and contact schools months ahead because they plan a year out.","publicEngagement_zh":"科普工作圍繞一個刻意設定的假說展開：在紐西蘭，合成生物學等同於基因改造，而基因改造等同於風險，因此團隊檢驗了一個在地故事能否改變人們參與的方式。他們辦了三場中學演講（一場在 Burnside High School、兩場在 Christchurch Girls' High School，兩校都有成員就讀過），內容涵蓋合成生物學、iGEM、讀科學學位是什麼樣子，以及 NanoBrew 如何運作，並且是為對話而設計的——很長的問答時間、小組分組討論、一場答案要被辯論而不是被打分數的測驗、留下聯絡方式供後續提問，並收集教師意見。他們把發現當成發現來報告：學生本來就認識釀酒廠與釀酒廢棄物，所以在地切入點把科學帶動了起來；小組的效果遠好於對全體學生做簡報；大多數問題關於科學職涯與升大學的準備，而在這方面大學部學生比任何老師都更能回答；而且只有一位學生曾聽過 iGEM。對更廣的公眾，他們與校方傳播團隊合作發出一份以「在地問題、在地解法」為框架的新聞稿，觸及 The Press、NZ Herald、Radio New Zealand、NewstalkZB、The Breeze、The Platform，並刻意涵蓋鄉村與區域媒體，包括 Ashburton Courier 與 Selwyn Times；一位隊員與計畫主持人接受廣播訪問，用淺白語言說明生物圍堵；Instagram 帳號觀看數超過 23,000。他們也在生物分子交互作用中心的冬季研討會上發表。公開給未來隊伍的經驗很實際：及早讓學校的傳播團隊介入，並提早數個月聯絡學校，因為學校的規劃是以年為單位。","ihp":"Human practices is organised around kaitiakitanga, the Maori concept of guardianship, with Bree Bell (Kaiarahi for UC Science) consulted early on how the project interfaces with iwi and hapu, and further consultation explicitly deferred to the scale-up stage rather than claimed as done. Stakeholders are mapped on an influence-interest grid and the design changes are specific. The team was split between on-site plants at each brewery and one centralised facility; Professor Jack Heinemann and Dr Brigitta Kurenbach, both involved in international synthetic biology regulation, argued that a distributed model multiplies accidental-exposure risk and regulatory burden because each site needs separate approval, so the team went centralised. The same pair identified the circular-economy rebound effect - if BSG becomes valuable, beer gets cheaper to make, production rises and total waste could increase - and told them 'sustainable' depends on timeframe and is often marketing; the team consequently narrowed its claim to reducing environmental impact relative to alternative BSG disposal, up to a stated horizon, and no further. Materially Kiwi (a startup making leather from kiwifruit waste) independently warned that customers buy on performance, consistency and price, not sustainability, and that a free feedstock does not mean a cheap product once collection, processing, testing and equipment are counted - which moved yield confirmation and full process costing to the top of the priority list. Dr Stefan Hill and Dr Mathias Sorieul at the Bioeconomy Science Institute warned that BSG-derived nanocellulose may be indistinguishable from wood-derived, so the low-cost waste feedstock, not the material, is the selling point; they also reframed BSG's high hemicellulose as a possible advantage, citing an Australian spinifex grass result where hemicellulose remnants improved material properties, and prescribed the three characterisation methods (SEM for fibril width, sedimentation for aspect ratio, FTIR for purity) the team then attempted. Dr Andrew Prest at Foodstuffs Own Brands listed what a packaging buyer needs and confirmed food-contact use would need substantial safety assessment, which is why the team targets non-food packaging first. Lincoln Agritech's suggestion of rheology as a measurement route is what started the viscometer, and Professor Volker Nock was met at the BIC symposium after researchers there raised the energy cost of freeze-thaw cycles at scale.","ihp_zh":"人類實踐以毛利人的守護概念 kaitiakitanga 為核心組織，並在早期就諮詢了 Bree Bell（坎特伯里大學理學院的 Kaiarahi），討論專題如何與 iwi（部族）與 hapū（氏族）接合，而更進一步的諮詢則明確留待放大階段、沒有宣稱已經完成。利害關係人以影響力—關注度矩陣繪製，設計上的改動也很具體。團隊原本在「每家釀酒廠設在地廠」與「集中一座設施」之間猶豫；Professor Jack Heinemann 與 Dr Brigitta Kurenbach（兩人都參與國際合成生物學法規工作）主張分散式模式會放大意外暴露的風險與法規負擔，因為每個場址都需要各自核准，於是團隊改走集中式。這兩位也指出了循環經濟的反彈效應——如果 BSG 變得有價值，釀啤酒的成本就降低、產量就上升，總廢棄量反而可能增加——並告訴他們「永續」取決於時間尺度、而且往往只是行銷語言；團隊因此把主張收斂為「相對於其他 BSG 處理方式可降低環境衝擊」，並明訂時間範圍，不再多說。Materially Kiwi（一家以奇異果廢料製作皮革的新創）則獨立提醒他們，客戶買的是性能、一致性與價格，不是永續性，而且一旦把收集、處理、檢測與設備都算進去，免費的原料並不等於便宜的產品——這把產率確認與完整流程成本推上了優先清單的最前面。生物經濟科學研究所的 Dr Stefan Hill 與 Dr Mathias Sorieul 警告，來自 BSG 的奈米纖維素可能與木材來源的無法區分，因此賣點是低成本的廢料原料、不是材料本身；他們也把 BSG 半纖維素含量高一事重新框成可能的優勢，引用一項澳洲 spinifex 草的結果，其中殘留的半纖維素改善了材料性質，並指定了三種特性分析方法（以 SEM 量纖絲寬度、以沉降法量長寬比、以 FTIR 驗純度），團隊隨後也照著嘗試。Foodstuffs Own Brands 的 Dr Andrew Prest 列出包材採購方的需求，並確認接觸食品的用途需要相當完整的安全性評估，這就是團隊先鎖定非食品包材的原因。Lincoln Agritech 建議以流變學作為量測途徑，正是黏度計的起點；而在生物分子交互作用中心研討會上，有研究者提出大規模冷凍—解凍循環的能耗問題之後，他們才見到 Professor Volker Nock。","realWorld":"The commercial case is unusually complete for an undergraduate team and backed by two letters of support (Cassels Brewing Co. and Lincoln University). Local grounding: in Christchurch alone BSG accounts for an estimated 680-1,000 tonnes to landfill a year, costing breweries up to NZ$220,000 in disposal fees, and nationally roughly 13,700 tonnes to landfill producing 14,000 tonnes CO2-equivalent, which the promotional video renders as 3,300 petrol cars running for a year. Market: nanocellulose at US$947 million in 2026 growing at 23.74% CAGR to a projected US$6.4 billion by 2035, with the team noting that estimates vary between reports and stating which figure it uses throughout. Price reality from stakeholders sets the strategy: at around $100/kg nanocellulose suits high-value medical uses while broad uptake needs roughly $10/kg, so packaging is the entry market. The page carries a development roadmap, a commercial-scale cost forecast, a downloadable preliminary CNF cost analysis for a pilot-scale plant, financial analysis and timeline, a business exit strategy, minimum viable product definition, PEST, SWOT, risk and competitor analyses (including Nano-Sea/AgriSea making kelp-derived nanocellulose locally, which does not target packaging), and a pitch deck. On IP, the UC Technology Transfer Office told them a first filing runs NZ$10-15K and is only worth it if results look promising, that only novel elements need protecting, that much of their approach is already published so finding the novel element may be hard, and that they should BLAST their enzyme sequences against patented sequences to check freedom to operate - and that they should document negative results because that is how an invention's origin is evidenced. The team notes everything submitted to iGEM enters the public domain, so any filing had to precede the wiki. Continuation is real: the media coverage plus the results won University of Canterbury funding for a summer research project carrying the work on under Dr Kelsi Hall, one of only 18 scholarships awarded across all faculties in 2026. The team also commits to licensing the process to other agricultural and food-processing waste streams once protected, with documentation, stakeholder map and methods open now.","realWorld_zh":"這份商業論證對一支大學部隊伍而言完整度異常地高，並有兩封支持函支撐（Cassels Brewing Co. 與 Lincoln University）。在地立論：僅在基督城，BSG 估計每年就有 680 至 1,000 公噸進入掩埋場，使釀酒廠付出高達 22 萬紐幣的處理費；全國約 13,700 公噸進掩埋場、產生 14,000 公噸二氧化碳當量，宣傳影片把它換算成 3,300 輛汽油車跑一年。市場：奈米纖維素在 2026 年規模為 9.47 億美元，以 23.74% 的年複合成長率推估到 2035 年達 64 億美元，團隊並註明各份報告的估計值不一致，也說明自己全篇採用的是哪一個數字。利害關係人提供的價格現實決定了策略：在每公斤約 100 美元時奈米纖維素適合高值醫療用途，但要廣泛採用需要約每公斤 10 美元，因此包材是進入市場的切入點。該頁面附有開發路線圖、商業規模成本預測、一份可下載的試量產廠 CNF 初步成本分析、財務分析與時程、商業退場策略、最小可行產品定義、PEST、SWOT、風險與競品分析（包括在當地以海帶製作奈米纖維素、但不以包材為標的的 Nano-Sea/AgriSea），以及一份募資簡報。在智慧財產方面，坎特伯里大學技術移轉辦公室告訴他們首次申請要花 1 萬至 1.5 萬紐幣，只有在結果看來有潛力時才值得；只有新穎的部分需要保護；他們的做法有很大一部分已被發表，因此要找出新穎處可能很難；他們應該把自己的酵素序列對專利序列做 BLAST，以確認可實施性——而且應該記錄負面結果，因為那正是證明一項發明來源的方式。團隊也指出，凡提交給 iGEM 的內容都進入公共領域，因此任何申請都必須在 wiki 之前完成。延續是真的：媒體報導加上研究成果，為他們贏得坎特伯里大學的暑期研究計畫經費，由 Dr Kelsi Hall 指導把工作接續下去，而 2026 年全校各學院合計只核發 18 份這類獎助。團隊也承諾，在取得保護之後會把這套流程授權給其他農業與食品加工的廢料流，而文件、利害關係人地圖與方法現在就已公開。","partners":["Cassels Brewing Co.","Lincoln University","Lincoln Agritech","Bioeconomy Science Institute (BSI)","Foodstuffs Own Brands","Materially Kiwi","Kai Commitment","Biomolecular Interaction Centre (BIC), University of Canterbury","UC Technology Transfer Office","Momentum (UC entrepreneurship programme)","University of Canterbury Communications and Events","Burnside High School","Christchurch Girls' High School","University of Canterbury School of Biological Sciences","University of Canterbury engineering students (external collaborators)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6301/wiki/hp/fig-2.avif","caption":"The causal loop diagram: 12 nodes linking the environmental, economic and social effects of an upscaled NanoBrew process, with each link signed positive or negative and the graph decomposed into balancing and reinforcing loops - including the circular-economy rebound effect raised by regulatory stakeholders.","caption_zh":"因果迴圈圖：12 個節點串起 NanoBrew 流程放大後的環境、經濟與社會效應，每條連結都標上正負號，整張圖並分解成平衡迴圈與增強迴圈——其中包括法規方面的利害關係人所提出的循環經濟反彈效應。","credit":"Team UCNZ, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6301/wiki/hp/fig-1.avif","caption":"The stakeholder influence-interest grid used to decide who to consult and in what order, spanning the brewery partner, regulators, characterisation experts, potential customers and Maori advisors.","caption_zh":"用來決定要諮詢誰、以什麼順序諮詢的利害關係人影響力—關注度矩陣，涵蓋釀酒廠夥伴、法規機關、特性分析專家、潛在客戶與毛利顧問。","credit":"Team UCNZ, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6301/wiki/hardware/figure-1-1.avif","caption":"The final design for the differential microfluidic viscometer, simulated in Capillarix, which infers nanocellulose concentration by comparing relative viscosity of a microlitre sample against a reference fluid.","caption_zh":"差動式微流體黏度計的最終設計，在 Capillarix 中模擬；它以微升級樣品與參考流體的相對黏度比較來推論奈米纖維素濃度。","credit":"Team UCNZ, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6301/wiki/results/results-fig02.avif","caption":"A time-series DNS assay showing XynA xylanase activity rising on both the control substrate (birchwood xylan) and on brewers' spent grain, in Michaelis-Menten-like fashion.","caption_zh":"DNS 法的時間序列試驗，顯示 XynA 木聚醣酶在對照受質（樺木木聚醣）與啤酒糟上的活性都呈上升，且呈近似 Michaelis-Menten 的形態。","credit":"Team UCNZ, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6301/wiki/education/school.avif","caption":"A NanoBrew talk at a Christchurch secondary school, run with long question time and small-group breakouts after the team found whole-cohort presentation far less effective.","caption_zh":"在基督城一所中學的 NanoBrew 演講；團隊發現對全體學生做簡報效果差得多之後，改以很長的問答時間與小組分組進行。","credit":"Team UCNZ, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"UCNZ shows how to publish an unfinished result well: they never characterised their nanocellulose, said so at the top of the page that depended on it, named the failed method (FTIR, inconclusive against a reference sample), the planned replacement (ATR-FTIR) and the substitute material they used when samples ran out - and still won Top 10. The second transferable move is the local hook: anchor the project in an industry students already recognise, then get the institution's communications office involved early enough that national and regional media carry the story, which is what converted their outreach into continuation funding.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"UCNZ 示範了如何把一個未完成的結果好好發表：他們始終沒有完成奈米纖維素的特性分析，就把這點寫在最依賴它的那一頁最上方，點名失敗的方法（FTIR，與參考樣品比對後結果不明確）、計畫中的替代方法（ATR-FTIR），以及樣品用完時所用的替代材料——然後還是進了前十。第二項可移植的做法是在地切入點：把專題錨定在學生本來就認得的產業上，再及早讓校方的傳播室介入，讓全國與區域媒體把故事帶出去——這正是把他們的科普轉化為後續經費的關鍵。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/experiments","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/education-and-outreach","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/safety-and-security","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/notebook"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳創業 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物製造專案 — 入圍"],"rank":91},"6306":{"team":"NYCU-Taiwan","id":"6306","section":"Undergrad","country":"Taiwan","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nycu-taiwan/","projectTitle":"BITE — Biosensing for Instant Target Pathogen Evaluation","tagline":"A two-chamber swab that turns Cas12a collateral cleavage into a blue colour you can read with your eyes","summary":"NYCU-Taiwan built BITE, a hand-operated two-chamber cartridge for foodborne Salmonella detection: chamber one releases magnetic beads carrying DNA capture probes plus lysis buffer, heat lysis frees bacterial DNA, a magnet concentrates the bead-bound target, then chamber two delivers Cas12a with crRNA and a hairpin reporter whose G-rich segment, once cleaved, folds into a potassium-stabilised G-quadruplex that binds hemin to form a DNAzyme and oxidises TMB from colourless to blue. The point of the design is that the final step needs no instrument. They won Best Project Promotion Video in the Undergrad/Overgrad section, and the same communication discipline runs through the wiki, which is built as a scroll-driven narrative rather than a document.","awards":["Best Project Promotion Video — Winner (Undergrad & Overgrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A narrative structure applied consistently: everyday stakes, then the quantified global burden with its source named, then what existing methods do well, then the specific real-world constraints that make them impractical, then a refusal of the implied trade-off, then the solution and only then the mechanism. Each mechanistic step is introduced by the question it answers (Cas12a can cut DNA, but how do we turn an invisible molecular reaction into something we can see?), so the chemistry arrives as an answer rather than as content.","dataviz":"Roughly 67 separately numbered illustration layers on the landing page alone, assembled into a scroll-driven walkthrough: an exploded device diagram with each component labelled (two chambers, Y-connector, sampling swab, collection tube), a magnetic-bead sequence split into meet-the-beads, capture and magnetic separation, an RNP assembly and trans-cleavage sequence, and a hairpin-to-G4-to-DNAzyme-to-blue-TMB chain. Numbers are set as display type (866 million ill, 1.52 million deaths) with the WHO foodborne-hazards estimate cited beneath them.","datascience":"Education impact is measured rather than asserted: paired pre- and post-surveys at the 16 May outreach session moved the share of 102 high-school candidates rating their understanding of synthetic biology at 4 to 5 from 13.3 percent to 80.0 percent. The April workshop, lacking reflection surveys, was instead scored against observational rubrics and task-completion rates (96 percent produced clean four-tier density gradients, 92 percent kept sterile boundaries in the laminar hood, 88 percent of culture tubes stayed contamination-free at 14 days, 85 percent distinguished nicked, supercoiled and linear plasmid bands, 95 percent built a correct genetic circuit first time). Instagram is reported with the diagnostic metric rather than the vanity one: 41,851 views across 6 July to 6 October, views up 209.6 percent on the previous period, and 57.9 percent of views from non-followers.","software":"BITE & SEEK, a bilingual public food-safety website launched 10 August 2026, with a card-based kitchen-decision quiz that reshuffles each round so replaying tests understanding rather than recall, a Facts page keyed to the 7-60 degrees C temperature danger zone per Taiwan FDA guidance and the WHO Five Keys, a History page tracing five outbreaks that changed food-safety law, and a live visitor map with per-country quiz averages.","stack":["LbCas12a","crRNA","G-quadruplex/hemin DNAzyme","TMB colorimetry","streptavidin-biotin magnetic beads","HRP/TMB control readout","fluorescence time-course assays"],"techniques":["magnetic-bead target enrichment with capture probes","heat lysis","Cas12a trans-cleavage of a hairpin reporter","potassium-dependent G4 folding","colorimetric readout development and background characterisation"],"frameworks_zh":"一套一貫套用的敘事結構：先講日常的切身利害，再給出具名出處的全球疾病負擔數字，接著是現有方法做得好的地方，然後是讓它們在現實中不切實際的具體限制，接著拒絕那個隱含的取捨，才給出解方，最後才講機制。每個機制步驟都由它所回答的問題引入（Cas12a 能切 DNA，但我們要怎麼把看不見的分子反應變成看得見的東西？），因此化學是作為答案出現，而不是作為內容堆上來。","dataviz_zh":"光是首頁就有約 67 層分別編號的插圖，組合成一段捲動式導覽：一張爆炸圖標出裝置的每個元件（兩個腔室、Y 型接頭、採樣棒、收集管），磁珠的流程拆成認識磁珠、捕捉與磁性分離三段，一段 RNP 組裝與反式切割的序列，以及髮夾到 G-四聯體到 DNAzyme 到藍色 TMB 的連鎖。數字以大字標題呈現（8.66 億人患病、152 萬人死亡），底下引用 WHO 的食源性危害估計。","datascience_zh":"教育成效是量出來的，不是宣稱出來的：5 月 16 日那場推廣活動以配對的前後測問卷，讓 102 位高中考生中把自己對合成生物學理解程度評為 4 到 5 分的比例，從 13.3% 上升到 80.0%。4 月那場工作坊沒有做反思問卷，改以觀察評分表與任務完成率評量（96% 做出乾淨的四層密度梯度，92% 在無菌操作台內維持無菌邊界，88% 的培養管在第 14 天仍無污染，85% 能分辨缺口型、超螺旋與線型質體條帶，95% 第一次就組出正確的基因迴路）。Instagram 的數據報告用的是有診斷價值的指標，而不是好看的虛榮指標：7 月 6 日至 10 月 6 日共 41,851 次觀看，比前一期成長 209.6%，其中 57.9% 的觀看來自非追蹤者。","software_zh":"BITE & SEEK 是一個雙語的食品安全公眾網站，2026 年 8 月 10 日上線：有一套卡片式的廚房決策測驗，每一輪都會重新洗牌，因此重玩測的是理解而不是記憶；一個 Facts 頁面對應台灣食藥署指引所定的 7 至 60 度 C 危險溫度帶與 WHO 食品安全五大要點；一個 History 頁面追溯五起改變食品安全法規的事件；還有一張即時訪客地圖，顯示各國的測驗平均分數。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Three channels with distinct jobs rather than three copies of the same message. BITE & SEEK carries the knowledge in replayable interactive form (133 visits from 5 countries by 18 October, which they report honestly as modest). A four-station hands-on workshop on 18 April took 25 students through micropipetting, sundew tissue culture, gel electrophoresis and BioBrick LEGO modelling, with the full station protocols published so another team can run it. A 16 May session reached 102 high-school candidates during departmental interviews, deliberately timed when the audience was already thinking about studying biotechnology. Instagram splits formats by function: posts for team and event information, Reels for lab life and concepts, Stories for real-time interaction, and the best-performing content was the team introduction post (4,169 views) and a lab Reel (3,039 views), which also drove the most new followers. Their own conclusion from that is the useful one: real people in authentic settings outperform polished explanation, and content anchored to daily life travels furthest.","ihp":"Two company visits on 5 September, both of which changed something concrete. Dr. Lance Chang, founder and executive director of Trade Wind Biotech, proposed a microfluidic format to cut reagent consumption (the G4 readout being their main reagent cost), asked whether Cas12a cleavage could be coupled directly to the G4 reaction without a transfer step and whether reagents could be pre-dried in the device, and gave them the single most important communication instruction in the whole report: do not open with the molecular mechanism of Cas12a collateral cleavage, open with the visible signal and then explain how target recognition produces it. He also insisted that a clear explanation rests on actually understanding the science, which sent them to the literature on why G4 prefers potassium over sodium (ion coordination plus the greater energetic cost of dehydrating sodium). At AccuSens Biomed, Dr. Chen told them to pick one specific potential advantage and define the evidence needed to support it rather than trying to beat PCR on every axis. Acting on that, they read competitors' technical documentation properly and found that Hygiena's BAX System Real-Time Salmonella assay already uses lyophilised single-tube reagents, holds AOAC OMA and AFNOR certification and offers quantification through SalQuant, meaning several features they had believed distinctive were already on the market. They published that finding. Dr. Chen also gave bench-level troubleshooting (1-5 ng purified plasmid, medium-sized colonies, three- or four-zone streaking with a 20 microlitre tip instead of a metal loop, a descending IPTG series, pre-induction growth to OD600 around 0.5 and never above 0.6) and set field-deployment targets they explicitly label as targets, not features: room-temperature lyophilised reagent beads, a reader that runs off an ordinary power bank, and software that works on a local offline network and syncs to cloud when connectivity returns.","realWorld":"There is no commercialisation claim here, and the restraint is the point. Every page separates demonstrated results from development directions in so many words: the microfluidic format, reagent pre-mixing and storage stability 'remain future development directions' whose feasibility 'has not yet been established'; the current results 'do not establish shorter sample enrichment, room-temperature reagent stability, or field-ready operation'; background colour development is named as a remaining limitation of their own colorimetric readout. They also state the general lesson, which is the one most iGEM teams miss: successful component tests provide a foundation but do not establish the performance of the complete system. The competitive honesty is equally unusual, since discovering that a commercial assay already has your differentiators and then publishing that discovery is the opposite of what a pitch rewards. What is worth copying, though, is the communication craft. Four things make it work. First, the arc puts stakes before mechanism, so the audience knows why they should care before any molecular biology arrives. Second, it states the constraints that disqualify existing methods in plain operational terms (a test may need lab equipment, a result may take time, testing may need trained personnel) rather than claiming existing methods are bad, which keeps the claim defensible. Third, it refuses a false choice out loud ('but why should we have to choose?') and that refusal becomes the product definition, with the five requirements (fast, sensitive and specific, simple, accessible, portable) spelling out the acronym the device is named after. Fourth, each mechanistic step is framed as the answer to a question the previous step raised, and the chain terminates in something sensory, a blue colour, which is also the actual engineering contribution. The invitation to act is a single pun, 'take a BITE before every bite'. Supporting all of this is real production investment: dozens of bespoke illustration layers, three custom web fonts including a hand-lettered one, bilingual content, and a scroll-driven build rather than a page of text and figures. Continuation is framed as community infrastructure rather than a company: a team leaderboard opening the BITE & SEEK quiz to every iGEM team at the Grand Jamboree with prizes for the top ten, progressive challenges, shareable result cards, full English coverage, and in-person workshops linking the website to hands-on demonstrations.","partners":["Trade Wind Biotech Co., Ltd. (Dr. Lance Chang, Founder and Executive Director; device format, reagent integration and communication strategy)","AccuSens Biomed Co., Ltd. (Dr. Chen; competitive positioning, field-deployment requirements, offered materials for reagent pre-mixing tests)","National Yang Ming Chiao Tung University, Department of Biological Science and Technology","IDT and CEB (listed sponsors)"],"publicEngagement_zh":"三個管道各有不同任務，而不是同一則訊息的三份複本。BITE & SEEK 以可重玩的互動形式承載知識（到 10 月 18 日為止有來自 5 個國家的 133 次造訪，他們誠實地說這個數字不大）。4 月 18 日的四站式動手工作坊帶 25 名學生做微量吸管操作、毛氈苔組織培養、膠體電泳與以樂高建構 BioBrick 模型，各站的完整操作流程都已公開，別的團隊可以照辦。5 月 16 日的場次在系所面試期間觸及 102 位高中考生，刻意安排在受眾本來就在思考要不要唸生物科技的時候。Instagram 則按功能分配格式：貼文放團隊與活動資訊，Reels 放實驗室生活與概念，Stories 做即時互動；表現最好的內容是團隊介紹貼文（4,169 次觀看）與一支實驗室 Reel（3,039 次觀看），後者也帶來最多新追蹤者。他們由此得出的結論很有用：真實場景裡的真實人物勝過打磨過的解說，而扣住日常生活的內容傳得最遠。","ihp_zh":"9 月 5 日的兩場企業拜訪，兩場都改變了具體的東西。Trade Wind Biotech 的創辦人兼執行董事 Dr. Lance Chang 建議改採微流體形式以降低試劑消耗（G4 讀值正是他們主要的試劑成本），並問他們 Cas12a 的切割能不能不經轉移步驟就直接與 G4 反應耦合、試劑能不能預先乾燥在裝置裡；他也給了全篇報告中最重要的一句溝通指示：不要用 Cas12a 附帶切割的分子機制開場，要從看得見的訊號開始，然後再解釋目標辨識是如何產生它的。他並且強調，講得清楚的前提是真的懂這門科學，這促使他們去查文獻，弄懂為什麼 G4 偏好鉀離子而非鈉離子（離子配位，加上鈉離子去水合所需的能量代價更高）。在 AccuSens Biomed，Dr. Chen 要他們挑出一個具體的潛在優勢，並定義出支持它所需要的證據，而不是想在每個面向上都打贏 PCR。照著做之後，他們認真讀了競爭者的技術文件，發現 Hygiena 的 BAX System Real-Time Salmonella 檢測早已採用冷凍乾燥的單管試劑，取得 AOAC OMA 與 AFNOR 認證，並透過 SalQuant 提供定量功能——也就是說，他們原以為獨到的好幾項特點，市面上早就有了。他們把這個發現公開寫出來。Dr. Chen 也給了實驗檯層級的除錯建議（純化質體 1-5 ng、挑中等大小的菌落、用 20 微升吸管尖而非金屬接種環做三區或四區畫線、IPTG 濃度採遞減序列、誘導前培養到 OD600 約 0.5 且絕不超過 0.6），並設下現地部署的目標——他們也明確標示那是目標而非既有功能：可室溫保存的冷凍乾燥試劑珠、能以一般行動電源供電的判讀器，以及可在本地離線網路運作、待連線恢復後再同步上雲的軟體。","realWorld_zh":"這裡沒有任何商業化的主張，而這份克制正是重點。每一頁都用明白的文字把已驗證的結果與未來發展方向分開：微流體形式、試劑預混與儲存穩定性「仍屬未來發展方向」，其可行性「尚未確立」；目前的結果「並未證實更短的樣本濃縮時間、室溫試劑穩定性或可現地操作」；背景呈色也被具名為他們自己比色讀值仍存在的限制。他們也寫出那個一般性的教訓，而這正是多數 iGEM 團隊漏掉的：元件測試成功只是奠定基礎，並不能確立整個系統的效能。在競爭分析上的誠實同樣罕見：發現某個商用檢測早已具備你的差異化特點，然後把這個發現公開，這與一場推銷所獎勵的行為正好相反。不過真正值得學的是他們的溝通手藝。有四件事讓它成立。第一，敘事弧把切身利害放在機制之前，因此在任何分子生物學登場之前，觀眾已經知道自己為什麼該在意。第二，它用平實的操作語言說明既有方法為何不適用（檢測可能需要實驗室設備、結果可能要等、操作可能需要受訓人員），而不是宣稱既有方法不好，這讓主張站得住腳。第三，它大聲拒絕一個假的二選一（「但我們憑什麼非得選？」），而這個拒絕就成了產品定義：五項要求（快速、靈敏且專一、簡單、可取得、可攜）正好拼出裝置名稱的縮寫。第四，每個機制步驟都被寫成前一步所提出問題的答案，而整條鏈收束在一件感官可感的事物上——藍色——那同時也是真正的工程貢獻。行動呼籲是一句雙關：take a BITE before every bite。支撐這一切的是實際的製作投入：數十層客製插圖、三款自訂網頁字型（其中一款是手寫字）、雙語內容，以及捲動驅動的網站架構，而不是一頁文字加圖。後續規劃被定位為社群基礎設施而非公司：在 Grand Jamboree 把 BITE & SEEK 測驗開放給每一支 iGEM 隊伍並設團隊排行榜、前十名有獎、逐級加難的挑戰、可分享的成績卡、完整英文版，以及把網站與動手示範串起來的實體工作坊。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6306/wiki/01-home/279-home-walk-dev-base.webp","caption":"One layer of the exploded BITE device walkthrough, built from dozens of separately drawn illustration components so the cartridge can be assembled step by step as the reader scrolls","credit":"Team NYCU-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"BITE 裝置爆炸圖導覽中的一層，由數十個分別繪製的插圖元件組成，讀者一邊捲動，匣式裝置就一步一步組起來"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6306/wiki/01-home/138-home-hero-people-back.webp","caption":"Opening illustration of the landing-page narrative, which starts at a shared meal rather than at a molecule","credit":"Team NYCU-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"首頁敘事的開場插圖，起點是一頓共享的餐食，而不是一個分子"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6306/wiki/17-hp-integrated-hp/253-ihp-tradewind-1.webp","caption":"Visit to Trade Wind Biotech, where Dr. Lance Chang told the team to lead with the visible signal rather than with Cas12a collateral cleavage","credit":"Team NYCU-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"拜訪 Trade Wind Biotech，Dr. Lance Chang 在此告訴團隊要從看得見的訊號開場，而不是從 Cas12a 的附帶切割開場"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6306/wiki/18-hp-education/30-hp-edu-expo-2.avif","caption":"Four-station hands-on workshop, with full station protocols published so other teams can reproduce it","credit":"Team NYCU-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"四站式動手工作坊，各站完整操作流程皆已公開，其他團隊可以重現"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Adopt their narrative order for every public-facing explanation: stakes with a sourced number, what current methods do well, the operational constraints that disqualify them, an explicit refusal of the trade-off, then the solution, then the mechanism told as a chain of answers ending in something a person can see. And take Trade Wind's instruction literally: open with the visible result, not the enzyme, and only explain the molecular step once the audience wants to know how the result happened.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/nycu-taiwan/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nycu-taiwan/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nycu-taiwan/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nycu-taiwan/project","https://www.youtube.com/@NYCU_Taiwan_2026"],"projectTitle_zh":"BITE——即時目標病原評估的生物感測（Biosensing for Instant Target Pathogen Evaluation）","tagline_zh":"一支雙腔室採樣棒，把 Cas12a 的附帶切割變成肉眼就讀得出來的藍色","summary_zh":"NYCU-Taiwan 做出 BITE，一個手動操作的雙腔室匣式裝置，用於檢測食品中的沙門氏菌：第一腔室釋出帶有 DNA 捕捉探針的磁珠與裂解緩衝液，加熱裂解釋出細菌 DNA，再以磁鐵把結合在磁珠上的目標濃縮；接著第二腔室送出帶 crRNA 的 Cas12a 與一個髮夾報導子，其富含 G 的片段一旦被切斷，就會折疊成由鉀離子穩定的 G-四聯體，結合 hemin 形成 DNAzyme，把 TMB 由無色氧化成藍色。這個設計的重點在於最後一步不需要任何儀器。他們獲得大學部／研究生組的 Best Project Promotion Video 獎，而同一份溝通紀律貫穿整個 wiki——它是以捲動驅動的敘事方式建成，而不是一份文件。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"任何對外說明都值得照搬他們的敘事順序：先用有出處的數字講清利害關係，再講現有方法做得好的地方，接著是讓它們在實務上行不通的操作限制，然後明白地拒絕那個取捨，才講解方，最後把機制講成一連串問答，收尾在一件人眼看得見的事情上。還有，把 Trade Wind 的指示照字面執行：開場講看得見的結果，不要講酵素；只有在觀眾想知道這個結果是怎麼來的時候，才解釋分子層次的步驟。","awards_zh":["最佳專案宣傳影片 — 得主（大學暨研究生組）"],"rank":26},"6308":{"team":"Tsinghua-T","id":"6308","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"Fashion & Cosmetics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/tsinghua-t/","projectTitle":"GALATEA","projectTitle_zh":"GALATEA","tagline":"Yeast-based glabridin production inside engineered liquid-liquid phase-separated condensates, with success criteria written by industry","tagline_zh":"在人工設計的液-液相分離凝聚體中以酵母生產光甘草定，而成功的標準是由產業界寫下的","summary":"Glabridin is 0.08-0.35% of licorice root dry weight and all three Glycyrrhiza species are on China's National Key Protected Wild Plants Catalogue, so one gram of the skincare active corresponds to roughly 286-1,250 g of dried root; GALATEA replaces that extraction route with Saccharomyces cerevisiae. The team built tunable protein condensates - an FTH1-24 ferritin iron core as nucleation seed, intrinsically disordered regions, and an SH3/PDZ scaffold at 3:1 recruiting the OC and DMT enzymes - instead of relying on random co-localisation. Their integrated human practices is organised as a four-act loop (Define, Optimize, Calibrate, Echo) in which each act must produce a change, and the loop closes by returning the engineering improvements to the same 96 street respondents for re-validation. Advice from Tsinghua chemical engineering professors reordered the biosynthetic pathway itself, and seven company visits rewrote the project's definition of success.","summary_zh":"光甘草定只佔甘草根乾重的 0.08-0.35%，而三種甘草屬植物全都列入中國《國家重點保護野生植物名錄》，因此 1 公克這種護膚活性成分約相當於 286-1,250 公克乾燥根；GALATEA 以 Saccharomyces cerevisiae 取代這條萃取路線。團隊建了可調的蛋白質凝聚體——以 FTH1-24 鐵蛋白的鐵核作為成核種子、內在無序區段，以及以 3:1 比例招募 OC 與 DMT 兩個酵素的 SH3/PDZ 骨架——而不是依賴隨機的共定位。他們的整合式人類實踐編成一個四幕的迴圈（Define、Optimize、Calibrate、Echo），每一幕都必須產出一項改變，而整個迴圈以「把工程上的改良帶回給同一批 96 位街訪受訪者重新驗證」來閉合。清華大學化工系教授的建議改變了生合成途徑本身的順序，而七次企業參訪則重寫了這個專案對成功的定義。","awards":["Best New Composite Part — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Fashion & Cosmetics Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A six-module dry-lab pipeline run over four engineering rounds: M0 evidence collection, M1 sequence-level screening, M2 structural and assembly screening, M3 enzyme recruitment and partitioning, M4 pathway kinetics, M5 experimental comparison. Every module states explicitly what a negative screen does NOT establish (for example, 'M1 flags sequence and topology risks for structural follow-up; a negative screen does not establish enzyme activity or scaffold assembly'). Outputs were deliberately changed from a single yield prediction to 'recommended conditions + sensitivity ranking + uncertainty interval + failure criteria'.","frameworks_zh":"一條六模組的乾實驗流程，跑了四輪工程循環：M0 證據蒐集、M1 序列層級篩選、M2 結構與組裝篩選、M3 酵素招募與分配、M4 途徑動力學、M5 實驗比對。每個模組都明確寫出「篩選結果為負」並不能證明什麼（例如「M1 標示出序列與拓樸上的風險以供結構面後續追查；篩選為負並不能證明酵素活性或骨架組裝」）。輸出格式也刻意從單一的產量預測改成「建議條件 + 敏感度排序 + 不確定區間 + 失敗判準」。","dataviz":"A before/after paired bar chart of the same 96 street respondents' judgments; a stakeholder-by-theme emphasis matrix (eight engagement records x five themes, graded not highlighted / mentioned / discussed in depth); an interview coding grid (seven participants x five themes); consumer-needs and technical-concerns word clouds; a three-stage deployment-path diagram; and a two-column 'Measured Results / Next-Step Validations' format applied to every presentation slide.","dataviz_zh":"同一批 96 位街訪受訪者判斷的前後配對長條圖；一張利害關係人對主題的著重程度矩陣（八筆互動紀錄 x 五個主題，分級為未提及／有提到／深入討論）；一張訪談編碼表（七位受訪者 x 五個主題）；消費者需求與技術顧慮的文字雲；三階段部署路徑圖；以及套用在每一張報告投影片上的「已量測結果／下一步驗證」雙欄格式。","datascience":"A 1,397-DOI literature analysis, a 16-compound computational safety screen against a fixed skincare reference panel, and a three-tier evidence table (Production, Skin Health, Safety) in which each entry records the experimental system, concentration range, source and evidence grade. Sequence screening uses IUPred2A disorder, SignalP, DeepTMHMM, PSIPRED, net charge per residue and mean hydropathy; all external data on the wiki carry source and experimental-condition labels, with literature values visually separated from the team's own measurements.","datascience_zh":"一份涵蓋 1,397 個 DOI 的文獻分析、一份針對固定護膚對照組的 16 種化合物運算安全性篩選，以及一張三層證據表（生產、皮膚健康、安全性），每一筆都記錄實驗系統、濃度範圍、來源與證據等級。序列篩選使用 IUPred2A 的無序預測、SignalP、DeepTMHMM、PSIPRED、每殘基淨電荷與平均親疏水性；wiki 上所有外部資料都標註來源與實驗條件，文獻數值也在視覺上與團隊自己的量測結果分開。","software":"GALATEA-Caelum, an integrated platform combining a literature-retrieval algorithm with an Agent harness that turns a researcher's prompt plus registered tools into a reviewable dry-lab plan grounded in the project's own wet-lab data. The retrieval algorithm queries OpenAlex, Crossref and Europe PMC, then ranks with BM25 (k1=1.5, b=0.75) plus BAAI/bge-m3 semantic embeddings, fuses with Reciprocal Rank Fusion, deduplicates by Jaccard, diversifies with MMR, rereads the full text of top records to extract numerical parameters, and runs AI-assisted quality evaluation. Built to be reused by future iGEM teams.","software_zh":"GALATEA-Caelum 是一個整合平台，把文獻檢索演算法與一套 Agent 框架結合，使研究者的提示加上已註冊的工具，能產出一份可供審閱、且立基於團隊自身濕實驗資料的乾實驗計畫。檢索演算法會查詢 OpenAlex、Crossref 與 Europe PMC，再以 BM25（k1=1.5、b=0.75）加上 BAAI/bge-m3 的語意嵌入排序，用 Reciprocal Rank Fusion 融合、以 Jaccard 去重、用 MMR 增加多樣性，接著重讀排名最高文獻的全文以擷取數值參數，並執行 AI 輔助的品質評估。設計上就是要讓未來的 iGEM 隊伍重複使用。","stack":["GALATEA-Caelum","BM25 + BAAI/bge-m3 embeddings","Reciprocal Rank Fusion / MMR","OpenAlex, Crossref, Europe PMC APIs","IUPred2A","SignalP","DeepTMHMM","PSIPRED","confocal fluorescence microscopy"],"techniques":["FTH1-based Corelets condensate modelling","modular SH3/PDZ recruitment modelling","partition-coefficient and leakage modelling","pathway kinetic modelling","LLPS scaffold design with linker length and flexibility gradients","retrieval-augmented parameter extraction","sensitivity ranking and uncertainty interval reporting"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Public engagement is built as a measurement instrument rather than a broadcast. Two rounds of street interviews (118 then 96 participants) bracket the engineering work: round one asked 'what do you need', round two revisited the same sites, gave respondents a short questionnaire, showed them the improved plain-language cards and the engineering evidence, then asked the same questions again - acceptance of biosynthetic ingredients rose 54.2% to 78.1%, the belief that a titre number alone is enough to judge success fell 71.9% to 22.9%, and willingness to pay 10% more for traceable production rose 26% to 51%. A 286-response campus questionnaire (18 items, two open-ended) plus 7 young-consumer interviews and 137 Q&A exchanges run with NUS supplied the baseline. Also four on-campus seminars (210 attendees), an offline outreach session at Beijing 101 High School, 23 articles on the WeChat account 'Tanwei iGEMer', two contributed pages in a science-outreach artbook with Rice iGEM, and the organisation of Tsinghua University's first Synthetic Biology Innovation Contest (62 teams from 21 universities).","publicEngagement_zh":"公眾參與被設計成一種量測工具，而不是單向廣播。兩輪街訪（先 118 位、後 96 位）把工程工作夾在中間：第一輪問「你需要什麼」，第二輪回到同樣的地點，請受訪者填一份簡短問卷，再給他們看改良後的白話說明卡與工程證據，然後重問同樣的問題——對生物合成成分的接受度從 54.2% 升到 78.1%，認為「單看效價數字就足以判斷成功」的比例從 71.9% 降到 22.9%，願意為可追溯的生產方式多付 10% 價格的比例從 26% 升到 51%。另有一份 286 份回覆的校園問卷（18 題，兩題開放式）、7 場年輕消費者訪談，以及與 NUS 合作進行的 137 次問答交流，共同建立了基線。此外還有四場校內講座（210 人參加）、在北京一零一中學的實體推廣活動、微信公眾號「Tanwei iGEMer」上的 23 篇文章、與 Rice iGEM 合作的科普畫冊中兩頁投稿內容，以及主辦清華大學第一屆合成生物學創新賽（21 所大學、62 支隊伍）。","ihp":"GALATEA states its IHP function in one sentence - 'at each decision point it brings external stakeholders into the process and converts their judgment into concrete changes' - and then shows the conversions. The deepest chain runs through Professor Zheng Liu and Professor Chong Zhang of Tsinghua's Department of Chemical Engineering, who were shown the team's initial plan of directly fusing enzymes and relying on random co-localisation. They made three objections: random co-localisation cannot stop intermediates diffusing away before reaching the next enzyme; the DMT enzyme has high substrate promiscuity and poor selectivity, with a reported extracellular fraction of the intermediate demethylvestitol of 88.4 +/- 4.2%; and OC is hydrophobic, so it can be recruited into relatively hydrophobic droplets, and since OC is the rate-limiting step the OC:DMT ratio is the lever. The team changed four things: they replaced direct fusion with a tunable FTH1-24 ferritin-seeded scaffold plus IDR condensate and SH3/PDZ recruitment at 3:1 that keeps local OC concentration above DMT; they moved the DMT demethylation step to the very end of the biosynthetic pathway so promiscuity cannot contaminate intermediate steps; they expanded readouts from 'final yield only' to product identity, purity, intra- and extracellular intermediates, by-products, batch-to-batch stability and functional relevance; and they embedded red and green fluorescent markers in the scaffold so droplet formation and enzyme co-localisation are observed under the microscope rather than inferred. That is a stakeholder conversation changing the reaction order of a metabolic pathway. The seven company visits, sampled deliberately across supply-chain roles (Blue-Peptides and INNOBIO upstream in Dalian; WuXi Biologics and Zerun Biotech as CDMO in Shanghai; CHANDO Beauty Science City and Guyu Beauty as end brands in Guangzhou; IMEIK against medical-device standards in Beijing), were run with the same four questions each time, and each produced a specific change: Blue-Peptides' line that 'an unrepeatable yield figure equals zero in industry' added a batch-to-batch variation column to the experimental records; WuXi Biologics' thresholds of purity >= 95% and +/- 5% batch variation went into the wet-lab detection items; CHANDO's raw-material gate (efficacy, safety, cost and supply stability all must pass) and Guyu's four-document procurement logic split efficacy evidence into in vitro cellular and formulation tiers so in vitro results are never presented as efficacy claims; IMEIK's insistence that a complete data package matters more than any single impressive metric produced a data-package checklist consolidating all seven companies' requirements with a tick-box for whether the team currently holds each item. Together these rewrote the judgment chain from 'LLPS works -> leakage falls -> yield rises -> success' to that chain plus product identity and quality evidence plus functional relevance to specific skin problems. NUS professors' critique that partition coefficient, leakage rate, linker flexibility and effective enzyme concentration were implicit and invisible drove the model-output change and the three-tier evidence table. Peer iGEM teams each closed a specific gap: Nanjing Normal University on genomic integration versus plasmid expression to reduce batch variation; Nankai University on platform scope and the scale-up bottleneck, which the team admits they could not answer at the time and then added to the public project description; Beijing Institute of Technology on provenance, pointing out that an unlabelled 88.4% leakage figure would read as the team's own measurement - which is why every external number on the wiki now carries a source label. Conference feedback was treated the same way: NCIM made them split every slide into 'Measured Results' and 'Next-Step Validations'; CCiC's objection that a single leakage percentage without a stated loading ratio is meaningless added the three comparison groups (free enzyme, random co-localisation, LLPS scaffold) and the 1:1 / 1:2 / 2:1 recruitment gradient to the formal protocol; APiC moved the fluorescence co-localisation data out of the appendix and into results; and a question at the Peking-Rice Summit about skin-tone controversy produced the impact-boundary assessment. They also adopted Beijing Institute of Technology's HP process discipline - preparation, execution, review, with a named note-taker per phase - so every visit produced minutes in a fixed format.","ihp_zh":"GALATEA 用一句話交代 IHP 的功能——「在每個決策點把外部利害關係人帶進流程，並把他們的判斷轉換成具體的改變」——接著就把這些轉換一一攤開。最深入的一條鏈來自清華大學化工系的 Zheng Liu 教授與 Chong Zhang 教授，團隊向他們展示了最初的方案：直接把酵素融合在一起，靠隨機共定位運作。他們提出三點反對：隨機共定位無法阻止中間產物在抵達下一個酵素前就擴散掉；DMT 這個酵素的底物雜泛性高、選擇性差，文獻報導中間產物 demethylvestitol 的胞外比例高達 88.4 +/- 4.2%；而 OC 是疏水性的，可以被招募進相對疏水的液滴中，又因為 OC 是速率限制步驟，OC:DMT 的比例才是真正的槓桿。團隊改了四件事：以可調的 FTH1-24 鐵蛋白成核骨架加上 IDR 凝聚體、並以 3:1 的 SH3/PDZ 招募比例取代直接融合，使局部 OC 濃度維持在 DMT 之上；把 DMT 的去甲基化步驟移到生合成途徑的最末端，讓雜泛性不會污染中間步驟；把讀值從「只看最終產量」擴充為產物鑑定、純度、胞內與胞外中間產物、副產物、批次間穩定性與功能相關性；並在骨架中嵌入紅、綠螢光標記，使液滴形成與酵素共定位是在顯微鏡下看到的，而不是推論出來的。這是一次利害關係人對談，直接改變了一條代謝途徑的反應順序。七次企業參訪刻意取樣供應鏈上不同角色（大連的上游 Blue-Peptides 與 INNOBIO；上海作為 CDMO 的 WuXi Biologics 與 Zerun Biotech；廣州作為終端品牌的 CHANDO 美妝科技城與 Guyu Beauty；北京以醫療器材標準為對照的 IMEIK），每一次都問同樣的四個問題，而每一次都產生具體的改變：Blue-Peptides 那句「一個無法重現的產量數字，在產業界等於零」，讓實驗紀錄多了一欄批次間變異；WuXi Biologics 的門檻——純度 >= 95%、批次變異 +/- 5%——被寫進濕實驗的檢測項目；CHANDO 的原料關卡（功效、安全、成本與供應穩定度必須全部過關）與 Guyu 的四份文件採購邏輯，使功效證據被拆成細胞層級的體外與配方兩層，因此體外結果絕不會被當成功效宣稱來呈現；IMEIK 強調一份完整的資料包比任何單一亮眼指標都重要，於是產生了一張資料包檢核表，彙整七家公司的要求，並為每一項加上「團隊目前是否已具備」的勾選欄。這些加總起來，把判斷鏈從「LLPS 有效 → 外漏下降 → 產量上升 → 成功」改寫成：原本那條鏈，再加上產物鑑定與品質證據，再加上與特定皮膚問題的功能相關性。NUS 幾位教授批評分配係數、外漏率、連接子柔性與有效酵素濃度都是隱含而看不見的，這促成了模型輸出格式的改變與那張三層證據表。同儕 iGEM 隊伍各自補上一個具體缺口：南京師範大學談的是基因組整合相對於質體表現，以降低批次變異；南開大學問的是平台的適用範圍與放大的瓶頸，團隊承認當場答不出來，後來把它補進公開的專案說明；北京理工大學則談出處，指出一個沒有標註的 88.4% 外漏數字會被讀成團隊自己的量測結果——這也是為什麼現在 wiki 上每個外部數字都附有來源標註。會議回饋也以同樣方式處理：NCIM 讓他們把每張投影片都拆成「已量測結果」與「下一步驗證」；CCiC 指出，一個沒有說明負載比例的外漏百分比毫無意義，因此正式操作流程中加入三組對照（游離酵素、隨機共定位、LLPS 骨架）與 1:1／1:2／2:1 的招募比例梯度；APiC 讓螢光共定位資料從附錄移進結果；而在 Peking-Rice 高峰會上一個關於膚色爭議的提問，促成了影響界線評估。他們也採用了北京理工大學的 HP 流程紀律——準備、執行、覆盤，每個階段都指定紀錄人——因此每一次參訪都產出固定格式的會議紀錄。","realWorld":"The need is quantified at the resource level: 0.08-0.35% glabridin content in licorice root, all three Glycyrrhiza species protected under Chinese law, 286-1,250 g of dried Uzbek root and stolon per gram of product assuming complete recovery, and documented habitat degradation from overharvesting. Only three SDGs are claimed - 3 Good Health and Well-being, 9 Industry Innovation and Infrastructure, 12 Responsible Consumption and Production - and each is tied to a specific question (what makes the ingredient useful, how it should be produced, how materials are used responsibly). Crucially, the sustainability page contains a table mapping each HP concern to its source participant or specialist, to the assessment dimension it created, to what was actually included in the analysis, and to the SDG connection, so the SDG link is derived from stakeholder evidence rather than asserted. The regulatory path is checked item by item against Chinese cosmetic law: spot-fading and whitening claims require human efficacy evaluation trials, naming follows the Cosmetic Classification Rules and Catalogue, biotechnological raw materials fall under YY/T 10001-2026, and new ingredients require registration and filing - from which the team concludes that efficacy claims are their most constrained category because their evidence stops at the in vitro and yeast level, far below what the claim would require. A negative-impacts table lists who is affected, under what conditions, the residual uncertainty and the team's own boundary for three topics including colorism, committing to never rank skin tones by lightness and to use specific skin-problem wording instead. Deployment is staged with a cost target: 1-2 years to prove platform portability to other high-value molecules, 2-3 years to pilot-scale fermentation with dry-lab models recalibrated against the industrial parameters collected on the visits, aiming to bring cost from about RMB 100,000 per kilogram at lab scale to below RMB 30,000, then 3-5 years into cosmetics, traditional Chinese medicine and nutraceuticals via licensing and joint development. Most tellingly, the one thing public communication could not fix is reported unfixed: 56.3% still regarded price as a major barrier after seeing the cards, so the team wrote price back into the Part 3 cost targets 'unchanged' and added 'efficacy claims running ahead of evidence' to its red lines for future communication.","realWorld_zh":"需求是在資源層面量化的：甘草根中光甘草定含量 0.08-0.35%、三種甘草屬植物全受中國法律保護、假設完全回收的情況下每公克產品需要 286-1,250 公克烏茲別克產的乾燥根與匍匐莖，以及文獻記載因過度採收造成的棲地退化。他們只主張三項 SDG——3 良好健康與福祉、9 產業創新與基礎設施、12 責任消費與生產——而且每一項都綁定一個具體問題（是什麼讓這個成分有用、它該怎麼生產、原料如何被負責任地使用）。關鍵的是，永續頁面有一張表，把每一項 HP 關切事項對應到提出它的參與者或專家、它催生的評估面向、實際納入分析的內容，以及與哪一項 SDG 連結，因此 SDG 的關聯是從利害關係人證據推導出來的，而不是逕自宣稱。法規路徑逐項對照中國化妝品法規檢查：淡斑與美白宣稱需要人體功效評價試驗、命名須依《化妝品分類規則和分類目錄》、生物技術原料適用 YY/T 10001-2026，而新原料需註冊備案——團隊由此得出結論：功效宣稱是他們最受限制的一類，因為他們的證據只停在體外與酵母層級，遠低於該宣稱所需的水準。一張負面影響表列出三個主題（其中包括膚色歧視）各自的受影響對象、發生條件、殘餘不確定性與團隊自訂的界線，並承諾絕不以膚色由淺到深排序，改用針對特定皮膚問題的措辭。部署分階段進行並訂有成本目標：1-2 年內證明平台可移轉到其他高價值分子；2-3 年內做到中試規模發酵，並用參訪時蒐集到的產業參數重新校正乾實驗模型，目標是把成本從實驗室規模每公斤約 10 萬人民幣降到 3 萬以下；再以 3-5 年透過授權與共同開發進入化妝品、中藥與保健食品領域。最能說明問題的是：公眾溝通唯一沒能解決的那件事，他們就照實寫成沒有解決——看過說明卡之後仍有 56.3% 把價格視為主要障礙，因此團隊把價格「原封不動」寫回第三部分的成本目標，並把「功效宣稱跑在證據之前」列入未來溝通的紅線。","partners":["Department of Chemical Engineering, Tsinghua University (Prof. Zheng Liu, Prof. Chong Zhang)","National University of Singapore (professors and iGEM team)","Blue-Peptides (Dalian)","INNOBIO (Dalian)","WuXi Biologics (Shanghai)","Zerun Biotech (Shanghai)","CHANDO Beauty Science City (Shanghai)","Guyu Beauty (Guangzhou)","IMEIK (Beijing)","NNU-Nanjing-China iGEM","Nankai University iGEM","Beijing Institute of Technology iGEM","Rice University iGEM","Peking University iGEM","Beijing 101 High School"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6308/wiki/assests/human-practice/hp-figure-10-01.avif","caption":"Expert interviews with the Department of Chemical Engineering, Tsinghua University - the conversation that moved the promiscuous DMT demethylation step to the end of the pathway","caption_zh":"與清華大學化工系的專家訪談——正是這場對話，把雜泛性高的 DMT 去甲基化步驟移到途徑最末端","credit":"Team Tsinghua-T, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6308/wiki/assests/human-practice/hp-figure-19-01.avif","caption":"Dalian company visits to Blue-Peptides and INNOBIO, where 'an unrepeatable yield figure equals zero in industry' added a batch-to-batch variation column to the lab records","caption_zh":"大連參訪 Blue-Peptides 與 INNOBIO，「一個無法重現的產量數字，在產業界等於零」讓實驗紀錄多了一欄批次間變異","credit":"Team Tsinghua-T, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6308/wiki/assests/human-practice/hp-figure-20-01.avif","caption":"Shanghai visits to Zerun Biotech, WuXi Biologics and CHANDO Beauty Science City, which supplied the purity >=95% and +/-5% batch-variation thresholds","caption_zh":"上海參訪 Zerun Biotech、WuXi Biologics 與 CHANDO 美妝科技城，提供了純度 >=95% 與批次變異 +/-5% 的門檻","credit":"Team Tsinghua-T, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6308/wiki/assests/human-practice/hp-figure-22-01.avif","caption":"IMEIK in Beijing, where medical-device-grade raw material review produced the team's data-package checklist","caption_zh":"北京的 IMEIK，以醫療器材等級的原料審查產出了團隊的資料包檢核表","credit":"Team Tsinghua-T, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Close the loop by measuring it: take the engineering changes stakeholder feedback produced back to the same respondents, ask the same questions before and after, and publish the one metric that did not move - then convert industry's hard thresholds into the project's own definition of a successful design, so a higher titre alone can no longer count as success.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"要閉環，就把它量出來：把利害關係人回饋所促成的工程改變帶回給同一批受訪者，前後問同樣的問題，並公開那個沒有改變的指標——接著把產業界的硬門檻轉換成專案自己對「成功設計」的定義，讓「效價更高」這件事再也不能單獨算作成功。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/tsinghua-t/","https://2026.igem.wiki/tsinghua-t/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/tsinghua-t/hp-part-1/","https://2026.igem.wiki/tsinghua-t/hp-part-2/","https://2026.igem.wiki/tsinghua-t/hp-part-3/","https://2026.igem.wiki/tsinghua-t/hp-part-4/","https://2026.igem.wiki/tsinghua-t/sustainability/","https://2026.igem.wiki/tsinghua-t/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/tsinghua-t/software/"],"awards_zh":["最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 得主（大學組）","最佳時尚與美妝專案 — 入圍"],"rank":40},"6329":{"team":"Baltimore","id":"6329","section":"High School","country":"United States","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/baltimore/","projectTitle":"KeraTINT","projectTitle_zh":"KeraTINT","tagline":"A chromoprotein-keratin-binding-peptide fusion that colours hair and repairs it in the same step","tagline_zh":"一個色蛋白與角蛋白結合肽的融合蛋白，在同一個步驟中既染色又修護頭髮","summary":"Baltimore Biocrew, based at the Baltimore Underground Science Space community lab, engineered fusion proteins joining chromoproteins (aeblue, UM) to keratin-binding peptides so that a semi-permanent dye deposits colour while reinforcing the hair shaft. The entrepreneurship work was run through iGEM's Venture Creation Labs curriculum, the same incubator route their 2023 project RhizeUp took, and it produced an OKR table with numeric key results, a scored risk register, a US-specific patent strategy and a competitor map. Market evidence rests on two IRB-approved consumer surveys (56 then 54 responses, translated into Chinese and Filipino) plus named interviews with a cosmetics founder, two L'Oreal North America hair-colour-lab staff, a cosmetology student and the Boeke Lab at NYU Langone. They were nominated for Best Entrepreneurship in the High School section.","summary_zh":"Baltimore Biocrew 以 Baltimore Underground Science Space 社群實驗室為基地，工程改造出把色蛋白（aeblue、UM）與角蛋白結合肽接起來的融合蛋白，讓半永久染髮劑在沉積顏色的同時強化髮幹。創業工作透過 iGEM 的 Venture Creation Labs 課程進行，和他們 2023 年的專案 RhizeUp 走的是同一條育成路徑，產出一張附具體數值關鍵結果的 OKR 表、一份有評分的風險登錄表、一套針對美國的專利策略，以及一張競爭者地圖。市場證據建立在兩份經 IRB 核准的消費者調查（先 56 份、後 54 份回覆，並翻譯成中文與菲律賓語）之上，另有具名訪談對象：一位化妝品公司創辦人、兩位 L'Oreal 北美染髮實驗室人員、一位美容科學生，以及 NYU Langone 的 Boeke Lab。他們入圍高中組最佳創業獎。","awards":["Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"iGEM Venture Creation Labs curriculum as the scaffold, Golden Circle, Unique Value Proposition, Lean Business Model Canvas, SWOT, a seven-phase Objectives and Key Results table with business-day estimates and fixed-cost lines, a risk register with a published 1-5 impact x 1-5 likelihood scoring rubric and named owners, direct and indirect and future competitor tiers, and the iGEM judging ballot answered question by question.","frameworks_zh":"以 iGEM Venture Creation Labs 課程為骨架，搭配黃金圈、獨特價值主張、精實商業模式畫布、SWOT、一張七階段的目標與關鍵結果（OKR）表（附工作日估算與固定成本行）、一份風險登錄表（附公開的 1-5 衝擊 x 1-5 可能性評分準則與具名負責人）、直接／間接／未來競爭者的分層，以及逐題回答的 iGEM 評審評分表。","dataviz":"Interactive click-through SWOT, a nine-slide pitch deck embedded as a carousel, a lean canvas, a long-term impact-assessment graphic, a 2027-2029 timeline, and a horizontally scrollable OKR and risk table. Survey results are reported as percentages and cross-tabulated by language group and age.","dataviz_zh":"可點擊切換的互動式 SWOT、以輪播形式嵌入的九頁簡報、一張精實畫布、一張長期影響評估圖、一條 2027-2029 時間軸，以及一張可水平捲動的 OKR 與風險表。調查結果以百分比呈現，並依語言群體與年齡交叉分析。","datascience":"Two-round survey analysis with a genuine iteration: a bimodal distribution on grey-coverage priority in Survey 1 (a quarter rating it 1, nearly half rating it 10) was hypothesised to be two age cohorts, and Survey 2 confirmed it by adding age, hair type and prior chemical-treatment questions. Reported figures include 64.3 percent rating less hair damage a 10/10 priority, 89 percent rating it 8 or above, 50 percent using at-home boxed kits and only 25.9 percent relying solely on salons.","datascience_zh":"兩輪調查分析，並有一次真正的迭代：第 1 份調查中關於白髮覆蓋優先度的雙峰分布（四分之一給 1 分，近半數給 10 分）被假設為兩個年齡族群所致，第 2 份調查加入年齡、髮質與過去化學處理經驗的題目後確認了這一點。報告數字包括：64.3% 把「減少頭髮損傷」列為 10/10 的優先度，89% 給 8 分以上，50% 使用家用盒裝染髮組，只有 25.9% 完全依賴沙龍。","software":"","stack":["Google Forms","chromoprotein-keratin-binding peptide fusion constructs"],"techniques":["fusion protein design","colour retention and wash-cycle testing (planned)","cytotoxicity assay development (started, not completed)","pH and thermal stability assessment (literature-based)"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Surveys were deliberately multilingual, translated into Chinese and Filipino to reach their own communities, and the results split cleanly by language and age in ways that changed the product thesis: younger English-speaking respondents wanted fashion blues, pinks and purples, which happens to be what their chromoproteins produce, while older Chinese and Filipino respondents wanted grey coverage and natural shades. They also found that the phrase 'genetically engineered' on a label worried more respondents than it attracted, with several linking it to harmful chemicals or illness, and responded by planning a consumer FAQ booklet distributed through partner salons instead of a call centre. They presented at the July 2026 Mid-Atlantic Meetup alongside eight other regional teams.","publicEngagement_zh":"調查刻意採多語進行，翻譯成中文與菲律賓語以觸及他們自己的社群，而結果依語言與年齡分得很乾淨，並改變了產品論述：較年輕的英語受訪者想要時尚的藍色、粉紅與紫色，而那恰好是他們的色蛋白能做出的顏色；較年長的中文與菲律賓語受訪者則想要白髮覆蓋與自然色調。他們也發現標籤上「基因工程」這個詞讓受訪者擔心的多於被吸引的，有幾位把它連結到有害化學物質或疾病，於是改為規劃一本透過合作沙龍發放的消費者 FAQ 小冊，而不是設客服中心。他們在 2026 年 7 月的 Mid-Atlantic Meetup 與其他八支區域隊伍一同發表。","ihp":"A Closed-Loop Framework structured each stakeholder conversation into relevance, insight, integration and future question. IRB approval from the BUGSS Board of Directors was obtained before surveying, which is unusual rigour at high-school level. Specific conversations changed specific decisions: Savannah Shumaker (chemist, co-founder and CEO of Eight Count Cosmetics) pushed branding toward audience values and simplified their science communication, and suggested contacting cosmetology schools, which led to Rachel Lu; Lindsay Menzer and Yun Yong Jang (L'Oreal Hair North America, Head of Hair Color Lab) flagged patenting during early testing, which launched the US patent-strategy investigation; the Boeke Lab at NYU Langone recommended storage conditions for chromoproteins, prompting a preservation study; and a question from another team at the Mid-Atlantic Meetup about pH and temperature sensitivity, which they had deprioritised, is what sent them to the Boeke Lab in the first place.","ihp_zh":"一套閉環架構把每場利害關係人對話整理成相關性、洞見、整合與未來問題四項。調查之前已取得 BUGSS 董事會的 IRB 核准，這在高中層級是不尋常的嚴謹。具體的對話改變了具體的決定：Savannah Shumaker（化學家，Eight Count Cosmetics 共同創辦人兼執行長）把品牌推向受眾價值，並簡化了他們的科學溝通，還建議聯繫美容學校，這促成了與 Rachel Lu 的接觸；Lindsay Menzer 與 Yun Yong Jang（L'Oreal Hair North America，染髮實驗室主管）提醒要在早期測試階段就處理專利，這啟動了美國專利策略的研究；NYU Langone 的 Boeke Lab 建議了色蛋白的保存條件，促成一項保存研究；而在 Mid-Atlantic Meetup 上另一支隊伍關於 pH 與溫度敏感性的提問（這是他們原本降低優先度的項目），正是把他們帶往 Boeke Lab 的起因。","realWorld":"This is a credible early-stage venture plan with the finance section still hollow. What is genuinely strong is the execution scaffolding. The OKR table is the best artefact: it sets falsifiable targets with costs and durations attached, including catalogue 15 salons statewide, a minimum of 10 qualitative interviews, at least 5 Letters of Intent, 10 investor pitches, 10,000 dollars from stakeholder investment plus research grants, cell viability above 70 percent in cytotoxicity assays, dye longevity of 40 wash cycles, protein stability at 50 degrees C, 1,000 sales per month and two new production labs in other mid-Atlantic states. Named funding targets are real and local (Wexford SciTech Venture Fund, TEDCO grants, Connect Labs at 4MLK as prospective lab space, youth competitions such as Blue Ocean, Paradigm and Slingshot). Crucially, every one of these is still an aspiration: the Letters of Intent are a key result, not a signed document; the grant is applied for, not won; there is no registered entity, though forming an LLC is floated inside the liability risk row. The regulatory path is the most concretely researched part of the whole analysis and is credible: they identify that the FDA Office of Cosmetics and Colors certifies coal-tar and synthetic colour additives but that a chromoprotein appears to fall into neither bucket, name 21 CFR parts 73 and 74 subpart C, name the Color Certifications Inquiry Branch as the body to ask, and note that certified and uncertified colours carry legally distinct names. The IP strategy is equally specific and actually actionable: a provisional patent on the aeblue-keratin fusion first, converted to a non-provisional within twelve months, with USPTO micro-entity status claimed for an 80 percent fee reduction, and they check their own eligibility against the 262,380 dollar gross-income threshold. Market sizing, by contrast, is the weakest link, resting on Grand View Research hair-colour market reports rather than any bottom-up estimate, with no price point, no cost of goods and no unit economics anywhere. Continuation is plausible rather than secured: they state plainly that as a high-school iGEM team they can never test on human hair, so KeraTINT must pursue third-party testing or operate independently of iGEM after the competition, and they sequence cytotoxicity, pH and thermal assays as the first post-Jamboree work. The precedent helps their case, since the same team's 2023 RhizeUp project went through the same incubator.","realWorld_zh":"這是一份可信的早期創業計畫，只是財務一節仍然空洞。真正強的是執行的骨架。OKR 表是最好的產出：它設下可被否證的目標，並附上成本與時程，包括盤點全州 15 間沙龍、至少 10 場質性訪談、至少 5 封意向書、10 場投資人簡報、來自利害關係人投資加研究補助的 10,000 美元、細胞毒性試驗中細胞存活率高於 70%、染色可維持 40 次洗髮週期、蛋白質在 50 °C 下穩定、每月 1,000 筆銷售，以及在中大西洋其他州設立兩座新生產實驗室。具名的募資標的真實且在地（Wexford SciTech Venture Fund、TEDCO 補助、把 4MLK 的 Connect Labs 列為可能的實驗室空間、Blue Ocean、Paradigm 與 Slingshot 等青年競賽）。關鍵在於：這些目前全都還只是期望——意向書是關鍵結果，不是已簽署的文件；補助是已申請，不是已獲得；也還沒有登記任何法人實體，雖然在責任風險那一列裡提到了成立 LLC 的可能。法規路徑是整份分析中研究得最具體、也最可信的部分：他們指出 FDA 的 Office of Cosmetics and Colors 認證煤焦油與合成色素添加物，但色蛋白看來兩類都不屬於；他們指名 21 CFR 第 73 與第 74 部 subpart C，指名 Color Certifications Inquiry Branch 是該詢問的單位，並注意到已認證與未認證色素在法律上有不同的名稱。智財策略同樣具體且實際可行：先對 aeblue-角蛋白融合蛋白提出臨時專利申請，在十二個月內轉為正式申請，並主張 USPTO 微型實體身分以取得 80% 的費用減免，他們還對照 262,380 美元的總收入門檻檢查自己的資格。相對地，市場規模估算是最弱的一環，只靠 Grand View Research 的染髮市場報告，而不是任何自下而上的推估，整份文件沒有價格點、沒有銷貨成本、也沒有任何單位經濟分析。延續性屬於有可能而非已確保：他們直白地說，作為高中 iGEM 隊伍，他們永遠不能在真人頭髮上測試，因此 KeraTINT 必須尋求第三方測試，或在競賽結束後脫離 iGEM 獨立運作；他們也把細胞毒性、pH 與熱穩定性試驗排為 Jamboree 之後的第一批工作。先例對他們有利，因為同一支隊伍 2023 年的 RhizeUp 專案走過同一條育成路徑。","partners":["iGEM Venture Creation Labs / Venture Foundry (incubator curriculum)","Baltimore Underground Science Space (BUGSS) community lab and its Board of Directors (IRB approval)","Savannah Shumaker, chemist and co-founder/CEO, Eight Count Cosmetics","Lindsay Menzer and Yun Yong Jang, L'Oreal Hair North America, Head of Hair Color Lab","Rachel Lu, cosmetology student and freelance makeup artist","Dr. Jef Boeke and Aleksandra Wudzinska, Boeke Lab, NYU Langone Health","Mid-Atlantic Meetup regional iGEM teams"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6329/wiki/entrepreneurship/lbmc.avif","caption":"KeraTINT lean business model canvas identifying local salons and cosmetic companies as first customers","caption_zh":"KeraTINT 的精實商業模式畫布，把在地沙龍與化妝品公司列為首批客戶","credit":"Team Baltimore, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6329/wiki/entrepreneurship/timeline.avif","caption":"Commercialisation timeline from 2027 stakeholder re-engagement to a 2029 salon product roll-out","caption_zh":"商業化時間軸，從 2027 年重新接觸利害關係人到 2029 年沙龍產品上市","credit":"Team Baltimore, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6329/wiki/entrepreneurship/pitch-deck/2.avif","caption":"Slide from the nine-slide KeraTINT pitch deck covering market sizing and distribution channels","caption_zh":"KeraTINT 九頁簡報中的一頁，涵蓋市場規模與通路","credit":"Team Baltimore, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6329/wiki/entrepreneurship/impact-assessment.avif","caption":"Long-term positive and negative impact assessment for consumers and the wider hair-care market","caption_zh":"針對消費者與整個護髮市場的長期正面與負面影響評估","credit":"Team Baltimore, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Steal the OKR table: every commercialisation objective gets a numeric key result, a business-day estimate and a fixed-cost line, including scientific gates such as cell viability above 70 percent and dye longevity of 40 wash cycles, so a business plan becomes a checklist a successor team can inherit. Also copy getting institutional IRB approval before running consumer surveys, which both protects participants and makes the resulting data citable.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"值得照抄那張 OKR 表：每一項商業化目標都配上一個數值關鍵結果、一個工作日估算與一行固定成本，連科學關卡也一樣——例如細胞存活率高於 70%、染色可維持 40 次洗髮週期——於是商業計畫變成一份後繼隊伍可以接手的檢核表。另外也值得照抄的是在進行消費者調查前先取得機構 IRB 核准，這既保護受試者，也讓所得資料可被引用。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/baltimore/","https://2026.igem.wiki/baltimore/entrepreneurship/","https://2026.igem.wiki/baltimore/human-practices/"],"awards_zh":["最佳創業 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6330":{"team":"HBUT-China","id":"6330","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hbut-china/","projectTitle":"IGNITE — oHSV2-Neo-IL-2","projectTitle_zh":"IGNITE — oHSV2-Neo-IL-2","tagline":"An AI-redesigned IL-2 that activates CD8 T cells without expanding Tregs, delivered from an oncolytic HSV-2 into microsatellite-stable cold tumours","tagline_zh":"一種經 AI 重新設計的 IL-2，能活化 CD8 T 細胞而不擴增 Treg，並以溶瘤型 HSV-2 遞送至微衛星穩定的冷腫瘤","summary":"HBUT-China targeted microsatellite-stable colorectal cancer, the roughly 80-85 percent of advanced cases that behave as immunologically cold tumours, by arming an attenuated oncolytic herpes simplex virus type 2 with an engineered interleukin-2. Their Best New Basic Part, Neo-IL-2, is an AI-guided interface redesign that weakens binding to IL-2R-alpha (CD25) while keeping signalling through the IL-2R-beta/gamma-c complex, so it activates CD8 T cells and NK cells without driving the regulatory T-cell expansion and dose-limiting toxicity that have crippled wild-type IL-2. The cassette was recombined into an HG52 backbone already deleted for ICP34.5 (neurovirulence) and ICP47 (TAP inhibition, so MHC class I presentation is restored), replacing a CMV-GFP cassette at the gamma-34.5 locus. They won Best New Basic Part in the Undergrad section and Best Oncology Project.","summary_zh":"HBUT-China 針對微衛星穩定（MSS）型結腸直腸癌，也就是在晚期病例中約占 80-85%、表現為免疫冷腫瘤的那一群，做法是為一株減毒的溶瘤型第 2 型單純疱疹病毒裝上經改造的介白素-2。他們獲得 Best New Basic Part 的 Neo-IL-2 是一項以 AI 引導的界面重新設計，削弱與 IL-2R-alpha（CD25）的結合，同時保留透過 IL-2R-beta/gamma-c 複合體的訊號傳遞，因此能活化 CD8 T 細胞與 NK 細胞，而不會引發重創野生型 IL-2 的調節型 T 細胞擴增與劑量限制毒性。該表現匣以同源重組置入已刪除 ICP34.5（神經毒力）與 ICP47（TAP 抑制，因此 MHC class I 呈現得以恢復）的 HG52 骨架，取代 gamma-34.5 位點上原有的 CMV-GFP 匣。他們在 Undergrad 組獲得 Best New Basic Part 與 Best Oncology Project。","awards":["Best New Basic Part — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Oncology Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Two named, reusable frameworks offered as contributions: SHIELD, a six-module full-chain safety paradigm covering safety-by-design, wet-lab operational governance, hardware infrastructure assurance, emergency response, training and education, and public outreach; and HOPES, a closed-loop human-centred methodology for integrated human practices. Plus a documented chassis-comparison exercise weighing HSV-1 against HSV-2 across oncolytic capacity, payload size and other dimensions before committing.","frameworks_zh":"兩個具名且可重用的框架被當作貢獻提出：SHIELD，一個六模組的全鏈安全範式，涵蓋設計階段安全、濕實驗操作治理、硬體基礎設施保證、緊急應變、訓練與教育，以及公眾推廣；還有 HOPES，一套以人為中心的閉環方法論，用於整合式人類實踐。此外還有一份有記錄的載體比較作業，在定案之前就溶瘤能力、負載容量等多個面向權衡 HSV-1 與 HSV-2。","dataviz":"Construction schematics showing the HG52 (ICP34.5-/ICP47-) backbone with TRL/IRL/IRS/TRS repeats and the homologous-recombination replacement of CMV-GFP with CMV-Neo-IL-2-BGH-polyA, three-round plaque-purification panels in bright-field, green and merged channels, flow-cytometry Treg percentage comparisons, qPCR and RTCA traces, tumour growth curves and survival plots, and a watercolour shield diagram linking the six SHIELD dimensions.","dataviz_zh":"建構示意圖呈現帶有 TRL/IRL/IRS/TRS 重複序列的 HG52（ICP34.5-/ICP47-）骨架，以及以同源重組把 CMV-GFP 置換為 CMV-Neo-IL-2-BGH-polyA 的過程；三輪病毒斑純化的明視野、綠色與疊合通道圖組；流式細胞術的 Treg 百分比比較；qPCR 與 RTCA 曲線；腫瘤生長曲線與存活曲線；以及一張把 SHIELD 六個面向串連起來的水彩盾牌圖。","datascience":"AI-assisted protein interface design followed by multi-tool computational triage: molecular docking, affinity prediction, stability and manufacturability analysis, with PRODIGY used to forecast receptor-binding profiles at 37 degrees C and confirm reduced CD25 affinity alongside retained CD122/CD132 association. The design hypothesis is then tested rather than assumed, with SPR used for direct receptor-binding verification.","datascience_zh":"以 AI 輔助的蛋白質界面設計，接著進行多工具的計算分流：分子嵌合、親和力預測、穩定性與可製造性分析，並以 PRODIGY 預測 37 度 C 下的受體結合輪廓，確認對 CD25 的親和力下降、同時保留與 CD122/CD132 的結合。設計假設隨後是被檢驗而非被假定成立，他們以 SPR 直接驗證受體結合。","software":"","stack":["AI-assisted protein design","PRODIGY affinity prediction","molecular docking","HSV-2 HG52 (ICP34.5-/ICP47-) backbone","pHG52d34.5-CMV-GFP shuttle vector","ICP4 complementing cells","calcium phosphate co-transfection","SPR","RTCA real-time cytotoxicity","flow cytometry","ELISA","qPCR"],"techniques":["rational receptor-bias engineering of a cytokine","homologous recombination into a viral genome at a defined locus","three-round plaque purification","Treg selective-activation assay","T-cell activation assay","high-passage stability testing of a transgene in a recombinant virus","in vivo tumour volume and survival monitoring in tumour-bearing mice"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Tiered outreach designed per audience rather than one talk repeated: young children (storybooks, five published as PDFs), special-needs children and groups with intellectual disabilities, university students, and elderly communities, including a graded calisthenics set with a basic and an advanced version so seniors of different fitness levels can use it. Formats span hands-on experiments, physical teaching aids and salons.","publicEngagement_zh":"分層的推廣活動是依對象分別設計，而不是同一場演講重複講：幼童（繪本，其中五本以 PDF 發表）、特殊需求兒童與智能障礙群體、大學生，以及高齡社區，後者包括一套分級的徒手健身操，有基礎版與進階版，讓體能不同的長者都能使用。形式涵蓋動手實驗、實體教具與沙龍。","ihp":"Patient, clinician and expert interview transcripts were analysed alongside a public questionnaire on understanding of cold versus hot tumours and a review of previous iGEM human-practices cases, organised through their HOPES closed-loop framework. Safety input came from named virologists, including Qiu Yang, a researcher at the Wuhan Institute of Virology, Chinese Academy of Sciences, who works on viral vector safety evaluation and animal model assessment, with multiple rounds of interviews on virology and animal experimentation feeding the risk-assessment design.","ihp_zh":"病患、臨床醫師與專家的訪談逐字稿，與一份關於民眾對冷腫瘤與熱腫瘤理解程度的公眾問卷，以及對過往 iGEM 人類實踐案例的回顧一併分析，並以他們的 HOPES 閉環框架加以組織。安全方面的意見來自具名的病毒學家，包括中國科學院武漢病毒研究所研究員 Qiu Yang，其研究領域為病毒載體安全評估與動物模式評估；關於病毒學與動物實驗的多輪訪談，則餵進了風險評估的設計。","realWorld":"There is no venture here and the team does not pretend otherwise, so the instructive material is the part and the safety practice. On reusability, Neo-IL-2 is one of the better-engineered iGEM parts because the characterisation is layered rather than single-assay: SDS-PAGE for expression, qPCR and ELISA for transcript and protein, SPR for direct receptor binding, a Treg selective-activation assay and a T-cell activation assay for the functional claim that actually matters, RTCA for real-time cytotoxicity, and crucially a stability test of Neo-IL-2 expression after high-passage propagation of the recombinant virus, which is the test that tells a downstream user whether the part survives in a working vector. They also state the reuse envelope explicitly and in vector-agnostic terms: the coding sequence is intended for any context needing selective CD8 T-cell and NK activation without Treg expansion, and they name oncolytic viruses, mRNA-LNP and chassis strains as delivery platforms it can move into. Eight new parts were built (six basic, two composite), two existing parts reused, and functional annotations and characterisation descriptions on the Registry entries were deliberately expanded, with a named Part Leader owning the documentation. That combination, a design rationale, a computational prediction, an orthogonal physical measurement of the predicted property, a functional assay of the intended benefit, and a passage-stability result, is what makes a part genuinely inheritable rather than merely registered. On safety, the standout is institutional rather than technical: HBUT initiated and led a five-school joint biosafety manual for anti-tumour synthetic-biology projects with four other university iGEM teams (ZJU-China, BNU-China, JLU-FBH and ZJUT-China), covering oncolytic-virus modification operating standards, GMO leakage hazards and waste-disposal guidance, published as a downloadable PDF and explicitly designed with internally unified but differentiable risk-assessment protocols, since the five teams use different carriers. Their reasoning for doing it is the honest one: an individual iGEM team is limited in research vision, experimental conditions and risk-assessment competence, so cross-team safety communication is how those limits get overcome. Safety is also built into the construct rather than bolted on, with ICP34.5 deleted to cut neurovirulence and improve tumour selectivity and ICP47 deleted to restore antigen presentation, and they state plainly that genetic attenuation cannot eliminate risk entirely because viruses are inherently infectious. Wet-lab practice is documented at BSL-2 with risk assessment, PPE, waste handling and training, photographed down to biosafety-cabinet operation, eyewash stations and fridge labelling. The blunt limitations are theirs: the project is explicitly still in progress, systematic toxicity assessment requires expansion to multiple animal models, and the AI protein-screening system needs further experimental iteration.","realWorld_zh":"這裡沒有創業案，團隊也不假裝有，因此真正有教益的是零件本身與安全實務。在可重用性上，Neo-IL-2 是工程上較為紮實的 iGEM 零件之一，因為它的特性分析是分層的，而不是只做一種檢測：以 SDS-PAGE 檢查表現、以 qPCR 與 ELISA 檢查轉錄本與蛋白、以 SPR 直接檢驗受體結合、以 Treg 選擇性活化檢測與 T 細胞活化檢測支撐那項真正要緊的功能主張、以 RTCA 做即時細胞毒性，而最關鍵的是對重組病毒高次傳代後 Neo-IL-2 表現的穩定性測試，這正是能告訴下游使用者這個零件在實際使用的載體中能否存活的那項測試。他們也以不綁定特定載體的方式明確說出重用範圍：這段編碼序列適用於任何需要選擇性活化 CD8 T 細胞與 NK 細胞、又不擴增 Treg 的情境，並點名溶瘤病毒、mRNA-LNP 與底盤菌株作為它可以移入的遞送平台。團隊共建立八個新零件（六個基本、兩個複合），重用兩個既有零件，並刻意擴充 Registry 條目上的功能註釋與特性分析描述，還指派一位具名的 Part Leader 負責文件。設計理由、計算預測、對所預測性質的獨立物理量測、對預期益處的功能檢測，再加上傳代穩定性結果，這樣的組合才讓一個零件真正可被繼承，而不只是被註冊。在安全方面，最突出的是制度性而非技術性的做法：HBUT 發起並主導一本針對抗腫瘤合成生物學專案的五校聯合生物安全手冊，合作對象是另外四支大學 iGEM 隊伍（ZJU-China、BNU-China、JLU-FBH 與 ZJUT-China），內容涵蓋溶瘤病毒改造的操作標準、GMO 外洩危害與廢棄物處置指引，以可下載的 PDF 發表，並刻意設計成內部統一但可分化的風險評估流程，因為五支團隊使用的載體各不相同。他們這麼做的理由很誠實：單一 iGEM 團隊在研究視野、實驗條件與風險評估能力上都有限，因此跨隊的安全溝通正是突破這些限制的方式。安全也是內建在構築體裡而不是事後加上：刪除 ICP34.5 以降低神經毒力並提升腫瘤選擇性，刪除 ICP47 以恢復抗原呈現；他們並直言基因減毒無法完全消除風險，因為病毒本質上具感染性。濕實驗實務以 BSL-2 等級記錄，包含風險評估、個人防護裝備、廢棄物處理與訓練，連生物安全櫃操作、洗眼設備與冰箱標示都有照片。那些直白的限制也是他們自己說的：專案明確仍在進行中，系統性的毒性評估需要擴展到多種動物模式，而 AI 蛋白質篩選系統還需要進一步的實驗迭代。","partners":["Qiu Yang, Wuhan Institute of Virology, Chinese Academy of Sciences (viral vector safety evaluation and animal models)","ZJU-China, BNU-China, JLU-FBH and ZJUT-China iGEM teams (five-school joint biosafety manual for anti-tumour synthetic biology)","Clinicians and patients interviewed on MSS colorectal cancer treatment options"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6330/wiki/safety/wiki/safety/review-20261019/d-shield-framework.webp","caption":"The SHIELD safety framework, consolidating safety-by-design, wet-lab governance, hardware infrastructure, emergency response, training and outreach into one reusable full-chain paradigm","caption_zh":"SHIELD 安全框架，把設計階段安全、濕實驗治理、硬體基礎設施、緊急應變、訓練與推廣整合成一個可重用的全鏈範式","credit":"Team HBUT-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6330/wiki/description/description-figure-6-hd.avif","caption":"Construction of oHSV2-Neo-IL-2: homologous recombination replaces the CMV-GFP cassette at the gamma-34.5 locus of the ICP34.5-/ICP47- HG52 backbone with CMV-Neo-IL-2 and a BGH poly(A) signal","caption_zh":"oHSV2-Neo-IL-2 的建構：以同源重組把 ICP34.5-/ICP47- HG52 骨架 gamma-34.5 位點上的 CMV-GFP 匣，置換為 CMV-Neo-IL-2 與 BGH poly(A) 訊號","credit":"Team HBUT-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6330/wiki/safety/icp47-antigen-presentation-20261021.avif","caption":"Rationale for the ICP47 deletion: relieving TAP inhibition restores MHC class I antigen presentation, a safety and efficacy choice made at the design stage","caption_zh":"刪除 ICP47 的理由：解除 TAP 抑制可恢復 MHC class I 抗原呈現，這是在設計階段就做出的安全與療效選擇","credit":"Team HBUT-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6330/wiki/safety/wiki/safety/review-20261019/i-bsc-front.webp","caption":"Documented BSL-2 practice for oncolytic HSV-2 work, photographed as part of the SHIELD infrastructure-assurance module","caption_zh":"針對溶瘤 HSV-2 工作所記錄的 BSL-2 實務，作為 SHIELD 基礎設施保證模組的一部分拍照留存","credit":"Team HBUT-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"For any part GEMS wants other groups to reuse, publish the five-layer evidence stack HBUT used for Neo-IL-2: design rationale, computational prediction of the specific property changed, an orthogonal physical measurement of that property (SPR, not just docking), a functional assay of the intended benefit and of the harm avoided, and a stability result after many passages in the working vector. Separately, copy the five-school joint biosafety manual: co-author a shared risk-assessment document with other groups working on the same hazard class, since one lab's risk-assessment competence is narrower than five labs'.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"任何 GEMS 希望其他團隊重用的零件，都該公布 HBUT 為 Neo-IL-2 建立的五層證據堆疊：設計理由、對所改變之特定性質的計算預測、對該性質的獨立物理量測（要有 SPR，不只是分子嵌合）、針對預期益處與所避免危害的功能檢測，以及在實際使用的載體中經多次傳代後的穩定性結果。另外也該照抄那本五校聯合生物安全手冊：與處理同一危害等級的其他團隊共同撰寫一份風險評估文件，因為單一實驗室的風險評估能力，比五個實驗室加起來要窄得多。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/hbut-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hbut-china/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/hbut-china/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/hbut-china/safety","https://2026.igem.wiki/hbut-china/assets/index-B5AKokKr.js","https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6330/wiki/education/pdf/education-biosafety-manual-v1.pdf"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 得主（大學組）","最佳腫瘤專案 — 得主"],"rank":52},"6337":{"team":"NJU-China","id":"6337","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nju-china/","projectTitle":"Starase Atlas — Atlas-BRIDGE, Atlas-COMPASS and Atlas-EDGE for enzyme discovery","projectTitle_zh":"Starase Atlas — 用於酵素探索的 Atlas-BRIDGE、Atlas-COMPASS 與 Atlas-EDGE","tagline":"Given a target reaction and limited experimental resources, which enzyme candidates should a researcher test first?","tagline_zh":"在目標反應已定、實驗資源有限的情況下，研究者該優先測試哪些酵素候選？","summary":"NJU-China built a three-part platform around one decision: which enzyme to test next. Atlas-BRIDGE (Broad Retrieval with Inference-Driven Gated Experts) is a dual-tower contrastive retrieval model that will rank any protein it can encode, then lets specialist 'expert' models and two kinds of memory nudge that ranking only where their evidence genuinely applies; Atlas-COMPASS is a natural-language agent front end that resolves entities before it computes anything; Atlas-EDGE is a MySQL/graph knowledge base of compound nodes and enzyme edges built from UniProt, Rhea and ChEBI. The model's recommendation was then taken to the bench: M5AW86 was predicted and confirmed to convert FPP to beta-farnesene by GC-MS, TLC and 1H NMR against empty-vector controls. It won Best Software & AI Project and was nominated for Best Model.","summary_zh":"NJU-China 圍繞一個決策做出三件一組的平台：下一個該測哪個酵素。Atlas-BRIDGE（Broad Retrieval with Inference-Driven Gated Experts）是一個雙塔對比式檢索模型，能對任何可被編碼的蛋白質排序，再讓專門的專家模型與兩種記憶機制，只在其證據真正適用的地方微調這個排序；Atlas-COMPASS 是自然語言代理前端，在開始計算之前先把實體解析清楚；Atlas-EDGE 則是以 MySQL 與圖結構建立的知識庫，節點是化合物、邊是酵素，資料來自 UniProt、Rhea 與 ChEBI。模型的推薦後來真的拿到實驗台上驗證：M5AW86 被預測、並經 GC-MS、TLC 與 1H NMR 與空載體對照比較後確認可把 FPP 轉成 beta-farnesene。這個專案拿下 Best Software & AI Project，並入圍 Best Model。","awards":["Best Model — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Software & AI Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Atlas-BRIDGE is a machine-learning information-retrieval model, not a kinetic one, and its central design idea is worth copying regardless of domain: separate *eligibility to be ranked* from *availability of evidence*. The base model ('Broad') is a two-tower encoder — one tower for protein sequence, one for reaction transformation — trained with a multi-positive contrastive objective that respects the many-to-many nature of enzyme data, L_MP = lambda*L_R2E + (1-lambda)*L_E2R, where each directional loss sums over the full set of known positives rather than treating a single pair as the truth. Because an unrecorded enzyme-reaction pair is not a true negative, they apply positive-unlabeled (PU) learning plus sequence-cluster masking to decide which pairs are even admitted for contrast, and because experimental screening only tests the top of a list they add an explicit head-ranking hinge, L_head = softplus(n_K - p* + m), pushing the best positive above the K-th admissible negative, with hard negatives mined from the candidates the current model confuses most. The final score is additive and auditable: S = S_Broad + alpha_LT*Delta_LT + alpha_epi*Delta_epi + sum_k g_k*Delta_k. The Gated Experts are plug-in models carrying functional, structural/mechanistic or family/domain evidence; each must publish candidate-wise scores *and an availability mask*, has its applicability gate, normalisation and maximum correction magnitude locked on separate validation data before any external test, and reverts exactly to the prior ranking wherever its evidence is missing — so absent data is never silently read as a low score. Long-term memory replays the training-cutoff catalytic graph at inference, projecting 16 annotated protein neighbours and 8 annotated reaction neighbours back into the Broad space with query-conditioned permission weights fitted on 5,216 annotated development associations, and it only re-sorts the top 1,000 Broad candidates. Episodic memory handles positives that appear *after* the training cutoff (new curation, new assays, a collaborator's private hit) without retraining anything: each support is encoded in the frozen Broad space and combined by parameter-free attention, a_i = softmax(zscore(q^T s_i)), m_epi = sum a_i s_i, with authority scaled by support count, internal coherence and conflict with the baseline; positives already in the training graph are stripped out first to prevent double-counting with long-term memory. Atlas-COMPASS wraps this in a DeepSeek-API-driven agent that first resolves every reaction, protein and compound in a plain-language question to a Rhea / UniProt / ChEBI record and shows a confirmation card the user must approve before anything is computed, then plans the retrieval, and can additionally run thermodynamic Max-min Driving Force analysis and E. coli iML1515 genome-scale flux checks on candidate pathways when asked.","frameworks_zh":"Atlas-BRIDGE 是一個機器學習的資訊檢索模型，不是動力學模型，而它的核心設計概念值得任何領域借用：把*是否有資格被排序*與*是否有證據可用*分開處理。基礎模型（Broad）是一個雙塔編碼器，一塔處理蛋白質序列、一塔處理反應轉換，以多正例對比目標訓練，尊重酵素資料本身多對多的性質：L_MP = lambda*L_R2E + (1-lambda)*L_E2R，其中每個方向的損失都是對全部已知正例求和，而不是把單一配對當成唯一的正解。由於沒有被記錄的酵素與反應配對並不等於真正的負例，他們採用正例未標記（PU）學習搭配序列叢集遮罩，決定哪些配對才可以被納入對比；又因為實驗篩選只會測清單最前面的部分，他們加上一個明確的前段排序鉸鏈損失 L_head = softplus(n_K - p* + m)，把最佳正例推到第 K 個可納入負例之上，並從現行模型最容易混淆的候選中挖掘困難負例。最終分數是可相加、可稽核的：S = S_Broad + alpha_LT*Delta_LT + alpha_epi*Delta_epi + sum_k g_k*Delta_k。Gated Experts 是可插拔的模型，各自攜帶功能性、結構／機制或家族／結構域的證據；每一個都必須同時公布逐候選的分數*與一個可用性遮罩*，其適用性閘門、正規化方式與最大修正幅度，都在任何外部測試之前先以獨立的驗證資料鎖定；一旦缺少證據，它就精確地回到原本的排序，因此缺資料永遠不會被默默當成低分。長期記憶在推論時重播訓練截止時的催化圖，把 16 個已標註的蛋白質鄰居與 8 個已標註的反應鄰居投影回 Broad 空間，權重是以 5,216 筆已標註的開發集關聯擬合、依查詢條件而定的許可權重，而且它只對 Broad 的前 1,000 個候選重新排序。情節記憶則處理在訓練截止*之後*才出現的正例（新的人工校正、新的實驗分析、合作者未公開的命中），完全不需要重新訓練：每一筆支持資料都在凍結的 Broad 空間中編碼，再以無參數的注意力合併，a_i = softmax(zscore(q^T s_i))，m_epi = sum a_i s_i，其權威程度依支持筆數、內部一致性與與基線的衝突程度調整；已經在訓練圖中的正例會先被剔除，避免與長期記憶重複計算。Atlas-COMPASS 把這一切包進一個由 DeepSeek API 驅動的代理：它先把自然語言問題中的每一個反應、蛋白質與化合物解析到 Rhea／UniProt／ChEBI 的對應紀錄，並顯示一張必須由使用者確認的卡片，確認後才開始計算；接著規劃檢索流程，若使用者要求，還能對候選路徑執行熱力學的 Max-min Driving Force 分析，以及 E. coli iML1515 基因組尺度通量檢查。","dataviz":"The visual argument is carried by the evaluation figures rather than by decoration. Benchmark comparisons are plotted as grouped MRR / Hit@10 / Hit@20 bars against EnzymeCAGE on two external test sets, with the harder Orphan-335 set shown alongside Enzyme-405 so the reader sees where the gain is largest. The four-configuration study is drawn as a controlled 2x2 (reference, coverage-only, ranker-only, complete system) in both retrieval directions, so the figure itself separates 'we found more candidates' from 'we ranked them better'. Ablation panels remove one evidence block at a time in both directions. Seed-count sensitivity is shown both as performance-versus-number-of-positive-seeds line plots under two evaluation protocols (random-positive and the much stricter protein-cluster-cold) and as grouped Hit@3/10/20 bars for one, two and three seeds. The model page also renders the architecture itself — dual-tower geometry, anchored reranking that visibly protects the base order, and query-level gating of each expert — as labelled schematics, and the five development cycles are laid out as a descending staircase so the reader walks the DBTL history. Atlas-EDGE's own interface is the other half of the dataviz: a hand-built SVG graph in which compounds are nodes and enzymes are directional edges, with composite edges that collapse multiple enzymes between two compounds and expand on click, click-through compound and enzyme info cards, zoom, drag, filtering, path highlighting and URL-synced view state.","dataviz_zh":"視覺上的論證靠的是評估圖表，而不是裝飾。基準比較以分組長條圖呈現 MRR／Hit@10／Hit@20 與 EnzymeCAGE 在兩個外部測試集上的對比，並把較難的 Orphan-335 與 Enzyme-405 並列，讓讀者看出增益最大的地方在哪裡。四種設定的研究以受控的 2x2 形式繪出（基準、只加覆蓋、只加排序器、完整系統），並在兩個檢索方向上都呈現，因此這張圖本身就把「我們找到更多候選」與「我們排得更好」分開。消融實驗圖則在兩個方向上逐一移除一塊證據。種子數量的敏感度同時以折線圖（在兩種評估協定下的表現對正例種子數：隨機正例，以及嚴格許多的蛋白質叢集冷啟動）與一、二、三個種子的 Hit@3/10/20 分組長條圖呈現。模型頁面也把架構本身畫成標註清楚的示意圖：雙塔幾何、看得見如何保護基礎排序的錨定重排，以及每個專家在查詢層級的閘控；五個開發循環則排成一道往下的階梯，讓讀者一路走過 DBTL 的歷程。Atlas-EDGE 自己的介面是資料視覺化的另一半：一張手工打造的 SVG 圖，化合物是節點、酵素是有方向的邊，兩個化合物之間的多個酵素會收合成一條複合邊、點擊即展開，另有可點入的化合物與酵素資訊卡、縮放、拖曳、篩選、路徑高亮，以及與 URL 同步的檢視狀態。","datascience":"Evaluation is the strongest part of this project and is unusually self-sceptical. External benchmarking used the EnzymeCAGE authors' own test sets under their protocol: 21,505 training-unseen positive relationships ranked over the full encodable universe of 185,918 protein candidates (11,081 reaction candidates in the reverse direction). Reported gains: Enzyme-405 MRR +16.0% and Hit@10 +4.55pp; Orphan-335 MRR +44.0%, Hit@10 +17.32pp, Hit@20 +18.51pp. Four ablation studies follow, including a difficulty-balanced re-aggregation that freezes every prediction, candidate set and rank and changes *only* the averaging — giving equal weight to seen, protein-cold, reaction-cold and double-cold exposure classes and then to the graph-degree strata within each — explicitly to stop frequent, highly connected, easy relations dominating a micro-average. Domain experts were tested only on queries where they are applicable, with deterministic family held-out splits for P450 and phosphatase and a frozen semantic applicability gate selecting 18 of 1,042 strict double-cold queries for terpene synthases; gains were P450 MRR 0.0394 to 0.0503, phosphatase 0.3012 to 0.3077, TPS 0.1225 to 0.3114 with Hit@10 11.11% to 33.33%, candidate sets and core scores held fixed. Wet-lab closure: M5AW86 was recommended for FPP to beta-farnesene and confirmed by a converging evidence chain (differential GC-MS peak at ~5.5 min with base peak m/z 69, fragments at 41/81/93/107/121/135 and a low-abundance molecular ion at m/z 204; TLC spots absent from empty-vector controls; 1H NMR olefinic signals at delta 6.3-6.4 and 5.0-5.3 ppm matched to a literature reference). They also publish a disconfirmation: for D9XD61 the model predicted (+)-T-muurolol but the isolated product was identified as 7-epi-alpha-eudesmol, and they say so. Preliminary GC-MS hit rate was 7 of 14 recommended candidates (50%). The interface discipline matches: the 0-100 displayed model score is explicitly documented as 'not a catalytic success rate', not activity or yield, not comparable across retrieval routes, and a high rank means 'deserves priority verification, not that it has been biologically proven'; 'unknown' in a compatibility cell means missing records, not incompatibility.","datascience_zh":"評估是這個專案最強的部分，而且罕見地對自己抱持懷疑。外部基準測試使用 EnzymeCAGE 原作者的測試集並遵循其協定：21,505 筆訓練時未見過的正向關係，在 185,918 個可編碼蛋白質候選的完整範圍中排序（反方向則是 11,081 個反應候選）。回報的增益：Enzyme-405 的 MRR +16.0%、Hit@10 +4.55 個百分點；Orphan-335 的 MRR +44.0%、Hit@10 +17.32 個百分點、Hit@20 +18.51 個百分點。接著是四項消融研究，其中包括一種依難度平衡的重新彙總：凍結所有預測、候選集與排名，*只*改變平均方式，讓已見過、蛋白質冷啟動、反應冷啟動與雙重冷啟動四種曝露類別等權重，再在每一類內部對圖連結度分層等權重，目的明確是避免頻繁出現、連結度高、較容易的關係主宰微平均。領域專家模型只在它們適用的查詢上測試：P450 與磷酸酶採用確定性的家族保留切分，萜類合成酶則由一個凍結的語意適用性閘門，從 1,042 筆嚴格雙重冷啟動查詢中選出 18 筆；增益為 P450 的 MRR 從 0.0394 到 0.0503、磷酸酶從 0.3012 到 0.3077、TPS 從 0.1225 到 0.3114（Hit@10 從 11.11% 到 33.33%），候選集與核心分數都固定不變。濕實驗把迴圈閉合：M5AW86 被推薦用於 FPP 轉 beta-farnesene，並由一連串互相收斂的證據確認（GC-MS 在約 5.5 分鐘出現差異峰，基峰 m/z 69，碎片在 41/81/93/107/121/135，並有低豐度的分子離子 m/z 204；TLC 上出現空載體對照所沒有的斑點；1H NMR 在 delta 6.3-6.4 與 5.0-5.3 ppm 的烯類訊號與文獻參考值相符）。他們也公布了一個不符預期的結果：D9XD61 這一筆，模型預測產物是 (+)-T-muurolol，但實際分離出的產物被鑑定為 7-epi-alpha-eudesmol，而他們照實寫出來。初步的 GC-MS 命中率是 14 個推薦候選中有 7 個（50%）。介面上的紀律也相符：顯示的 0-100 模型分數在文件中明確寫明不是催化成功率，不是活性、也不是產率，而且不同檢索路徑之間不可比較；排名高只代表值得優先驗證，而不是已經在生物學上被證實；相容性欄位中的 unknown 代表缺少紀錄，而不是不相容。","software":"Both instruments are Apache 2.0 open source in the official iGEM GitLab repository, deployable with git clone plus bash scripts/bootstrap.sh, setup_release.sh --download and --check, then manage.sh configure-key / start / status. Linux with Python 3.12 is the validated environment, ~5 GiB for model assets, WSL2 for Windows, macOS explicitly flagged as not validated — and crucially no GPU is required, since validation and inference run on CPU. The DeepSeek API key is stored in a git-ignored runtime directory and the docs tell deployers to put the service behind HTTPS with access control, rate limiting, log monitoring and API quotas, and to explain how external model services handle data. Atlas-EDGE is a full production stack: React + TypeScript + Vite front end (hand-drawn SVG graph, History API URL sync, localStorage session persistence, AbortController to cancel stale searches), FastAPI + Uvicorn + Pydantic + async SQLAlchemy/aiomysql backend on a /api/v1 prefix, MySQL 8.0.46, a four-round UniProt REST crawl plus Rhea SPARQL and ChEBI flat files, pandas/RDKit ETL into entity and association tables with a unified sha1-keyed search index, local NCBI BLAST+ (blastp/makeblastdb, run in a thread with a mutex guarding database construction and an sha1 cache key), Ketcher for draw-a-molecule structure search, and DeepSolNet run locally with original weights to generate per-protein solubility scores used as a search filter.","software_zh":"兩套工具都以 Apache 2.0 開源放在官方 iGEM GitLab 程式庫中，部署方式是 git clone 之後執行 bash scripts/bootstrap.sh、setup_release.sh --download 與 --check，再執行 manage.sh configure-key / start / status。已驗證的環境是 Linux 搭配 Python 3.12，模型檔案約需 5 GiB，Windows 使用 WSL2，macOS 則明確標示未經驗證；關鍵在於不需要 GPU，驗證與推論都在 CPU 上執行。DeepSeek 的 API 金鑰存放在被 git 忽略的執行期目錄中，文件也要求部署者把服務放在 HTTPS 之後，並搭配存取控制、流量限制、日誌監控與 API 用量上限，並向使用者說明外部模型服務如何處理資料。Atlas-EDGE 是一套完整的生產級技術堆疊：前端為 React + TypeScript + Vite（手繪 SVG 圖、以 History API 同步 URL、以 localStorage 保存工作階段、用 AbortController 取消過期的搜尋），後端為 FastAPI + Uvicorn + Pydantic 加上非同步 SQLAlchemy／aiomysql，掛在 /api/v1 前綴下，資料庫為 MySQL 8.0.46；資料來源包括四輪 UniProt REST 爬取，加上 Rhea SPARQL 與 ChEBI 平面檔；以 pandas 與 RDKit 做 ETL，匯入實體表與關聯表，並建立以 sha1 為鍵的統一搜尋索引；本地執行 NCBI BLAST+（blastp／makeblastdb，在獨立執行緒中運行，以互斥鎖保護資料庫建置，並以 sha1 作為快取鍵）；以 Ketcher 提供畫分子結構的搜尋方式；並以原始權重在本地執行 DeepSolNet，產生每個蛋白質的溶解度分數作為搜尋篩選條件。","stack":["Python 3.11 / 3.12","PyTorch (dual-tower encoders)","FastAPI","Uvicorn","Pydantic","SQLAlchemy asyncio + aiomysql","MySQL 8.0.46","React + TypeScript + Vite","pandas","RDKit","NCBI BLAST+","Ketcher","DeepSolNet","DeepSeek API","UniProt REST","Rhea SPARQL","ChEBI flat files","Pfam","cobrapy / iML1515 genome-scale model","scikit-learn / random forest / gradient boosting (experts)"],"techniques":["dual-tower contrastive retrieval","multi-positive InfoNCE-style loss","positive-unlabeled learning","sequence-cluster negative masking","hard-negative mining","listwise head-ranking hinge loss","mixture-of-experts gating with availability masks","retrieval-augmented long-term graph memory","parameter-free attention episodic memory (few-shot, training-free update)","protein language model embeddings","differential reaction fingerprints (DRFP)","learning-to-rank (LambdaMART lineage)","ablation studies","cold-start / double-cold stratified evaluation","difficulty-balanced metric re-aggregation","MRR and Hit@K ranking metrics","graph database modelling","pathway search over a directed multigraph","Max-min Driving Force thermodynamic analysis","genome-scale flux balance analysis (iML1515)","natural-language agent with entity grounding"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Nine primary-school lessons from March to July 2026 (five plant lessons, four summer science lessons), each treated as its own Design-Build-Test-Learn unit: Design fixed audience and objectives, Build made slides and materials, Test watched what pupils actually explained and where they needed help, Learn turned the observed problems into changes to the next lesson. From that they distilled SPARK as a reusable design and review lens — See, Probe, Ask, Record and Respond, Keep improving — and then applied it back onto their secondary-school intro and lab teaching and their public science conversations at Starlight Market. The handover is concrete: slides, activity materials, a lesson design checklist, guidelines for experimental and simulation activities, a feedback and evaluation form, and 'SPARK-Edu Skill', an AI-assisted guide that encodes their principles, workflow and examples so a future education team can adapt rather than restart.","publicEngagement_zh":"2026 年 3 月到 7 月間進行九堂小學課程（五堂植物課、四堂暑期科學課），每一堂都當成獨立的 Design-Build-Test-Learn 單元：Design 定下受眾與目標、Build 製作投影片與教材、Test 觀察學生實際能說出什麼、哪裡需要協助，Learn 則把觀察到的問題變成下一堂課的修改。他們從中提煉出 SPARK 作為可重複使用的設計與檢討透鏡（See、Probe、Ask、Record and Respond、Keep improving），再把它套回自己的高中入門課與實驗教學，以及在 Starlight Market 的公眾科學對話。交接也很具體：投影片、活動教材、一份課程設計檢核表、實驗與模擬活動的指引、回饋與評估表單，以及 SPARK-Edu Skill，一份把他們的原則、流程與範例編碼進去的 AI 輔助指南，讓未來的教育組可以直接沿用，而不必從零開始。","ihp":"Human Practices is presented as evidence that changed the build, with a counted audit trail: 24 evidence records, 6 stakeholder lenses, 4 design shifts, 3 intended influence pathways, across academic (8), iGEM and user (4), industry (5), technology transfer (3), safety (2) and education contacts. The four shifts are stated as before/after pairs: from a black-box compatibility score to explicit experimental prioritisation; from searching known pairs to open exploration with uncertainty; from ranked names only to explainable recommendations; from a post-hoc warning to responsibility by design. The origin is traceable: in November 2025 Jing Shi pointed out that a promising enzyme record may behave differently in a new host, Fei Zhou described the preparatory work caused by scattered information, and Long Wang warned that sequence similarity is not function — which is why the platform separates recorded associations (the factual layer) from model candidates (the prediction layer) in every view. The team also took on the dual-use question directly: if an AI tool makes finding functional enzymes easier, which questions should it decline to answer lightly, how should high-risk queries be handled, and what may private data be used for.","ihp_zh":"人類實踐被呈現為真正改變了成品的證據，並附上可計數的稽核軌跡：24 筆證據紀錄、6 個利害關係人視角、4 項設計轉向、3 條預期的影響路徑，接觸對象包括學界（8）、iGEM 與使用者（4）、產業界（5）、技術移轉（3）、安全（2）與教育。四項轉向以前後對照的方式寫出：從黑盒子式的相容性分數，到明確的實驗優先排序；從搜尋已知配對，到帶著不確定性的開放探索；從只給排序後的名單，到可解釋的推薦；從事後警示，到從設計階段就納入責任。來源也可追溯：2025 年 11 月，Jing Shi 指出一筆看來很有潛力的酵素紀錄，在新宿主中的表現可能完全不同；Fei Zhou 描述資訊零散所造成的前置工作；Long Wang 則警告序列相似不等於功能相同，這正是平台在每一個檢視畫面中都把已記錄的關聯（事實層）與模型候選（預測層）分開的原因。團隊也直接面對兩用性問題：如果一個 AI 工具讓尋找有功能的酵素變得更容易，它應該拒絕輕易回答哪些問題、高風險查詢該如何處理，以及私有資料可以被用在什麼地方。","realWorld":"The entrepreneurship case is for a screening *service* rather than another database: computational screening carried through to wet-lab validation so the customer receives a confirmed candidate, with the pipeline and its documentation left behind as a reusable toolkit and the methods and data kept public. Numbers are stated with their baselines: enzyme-to-reaction accuracy 15.32% (up from 8.47% in the team's own historical runs), a 1.92x top-20 hit rate against CLIPZyme (15.97% vs 8.33%) over 166,202 benchmark candidates, a 50% preliminary GC-MS hit rate (7 of 14), an estimated core enterprise TAM of RMB 14.42M annually in the baseline forecast, and a proposed tiered price range of RMB 4.3k to 319.5k per year from Academic to Enterprise Advanced. They are candid that the current demo only accepts target reactions and candidate proteins and returns rankings, with traceability, version management and full decision support still to come. The stated audiences are research labs (inspectable enzyme discovery), the iGEM community (reflective HP practice) and the bio-manufacturing ecosystem (governed, compatible pilots).","realWorld_zh":"創業論證的對象是一項篩選*服務*，而不是又一個資料庫：把計算篩選一路做到濕實驗驗證，讓客戶拿到的是已經確認的候選，流程與其文件則留下來成為可重複使用的工具組，方法與資料也保持公開。數字都附上基線：酵素對反應的準確率 15.32%（團隊自己過去的執行結果為 8.47%）；在 166,202 個基準候選上，前 20 名命中率是 CLIPZyme 的 1.92 倍（15.97% 對 8.33%）；初步 GC-MS 命中率 50%（14 個中 7 個）；基線預測下，企業核心市場的年 TAM 估計為人民幣 1,442 萬元；並提出從 Academic 到 Enterprise Advanced 的分級價格區間，每年人民幣 4.3 千元到 31.95 萬元。他們也坦白目前的示範版只接受目標反應與候選蛋白質、回傳排序，可追溯性、版本管理與完整的決策支援都還沒做到。他們宣稱的受眾是研究實驗室（可檢視的酵素探索）、iGEM 社群（具反思性的人類實踐做法），以及生物製造生態系（受治理且可相容的試行計畫）。","partners":["Nanjing University School of Life Sciences","Nanjing University School of Intelligence Science and Technology","Nanjing University School of Chemistry and Chemical Engineering","Nanjing University School of Software","Vazyme","WuXi","BioSphere"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6337/wiki/model/model.avif","caption":"Atlas-BRIDGE architecture: a shared dual-tower retrieval geometry that will score any encodable protein or reaction, with query-level gated experts and dual (long-term graph plus episodic) memory applying additive corrections only inside their valid scope.","caption_zh":"Atlas-BRIDGE 架構：一個共用的雙塔檢索幾何，可以為任何可編碼的蛋白質或反應打分，並以查詢層級閘控的專家模型與雙重記憶（長期圖記憶加情節記憶），在各自有效的範圍內做加法式修正。","credit":"Team NJU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6337/wiki/model/7.avif","caption":"The Broad Retrieval dual-tower architecture for bidirectional enzyme-reaction ranking: one tower encodes protein sequence, the other the reaction transformation, trained with a multi-positive contrastive loss plus a head-ranking constraint so the top of the list — the part experiments actually test — is sharpened.","caption_zh":"用於酵素與反應雙向排序的 Broad Retrieval 雙塔架構：一塔編碼蛋白質序列、另一塔編碼反應轉換，以多正例對比損失搭配前段排序約束訓練，使清單最前面、也就是實驗真正會測的那一段變得更銳利。","credit":"Team NJU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6337/wiki/model/seed-performance-lines-v2.avif","caption":"Performance as a function of the number of positive seeds, plotted under two evaluation protocols — random-positive and the much stricter protein-cluster-cold — so the reader can see how much of the apparent gain survives when close homologs of the known positives are withheld.","caption_zh":"表現隨正例種子數變化的曲線，並在兩種評估協定下繪出：隨機正例，以及嚴格許多的蛋白質叢集冷啟動，讓讀者看出當已知正例的近緣同源序列被扣住時，表面上的增益還剩下多少。","credit":"Team NJU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6337/wiki/model/9.avif","caption":"Query-level gating of the functional, structural/mechanistic, family/domain and memory experts. Each expert must emit an availability mask as well as scores, and reverts exactly to the prior ranking wherever its evidence is missing, so absent data is never read as a low score.","caption_zh":"功能性、結構／機制、家族／結構域與記憶等專家在查詢層級的閘控。每個專家除了分數之外都必須輸出一個可用性遮罩，一旦缺少證據就精確回到原本的排序，因此缺資料永遠不會被讀成低分。","credit":"Team NJU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Make every model output carry an availability mask, so 'we have no evidence about this candidate' and 'this candidate scores badly' are never the same number — and separate the factual layer (what a database records) from the prediction layer (what your model guesses) in every table and figure you publish. Then re-aggregate your headline metric with equal weight across difficulty strata to check your result is not just the easy cases.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"讓每一個模型輸出都帶上可用性遮罩，這樣「我們對這個候選沒有任何證據」與「這個候選分數很差」就永遠不會是同一個數字；並且在你公布的每一張表與每一張圖中，都把事實層（資料庫記錄了什麼）與預測層（模型猜了什麼）分開。接著把你的頭條指標依難度分層等權重重新彙總一次，檢查你的結果不只是那些容易的案例。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/nju-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nju-china/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nju-china/software/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nju-china/compass/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nju-china/edge/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nju-china/proof/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nju-china/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nju-china/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nju-china/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nju-china/entrepreneurship/"],"awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳軟體與 AI專案 — 得主"],"rank":33},"6338":{"team":"ASIJ-Tokyo","id":"6338","section":"High School","country":"Japan","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/asij-tokyo/","projectTitle":"Project 茶(Sa)kure-it-all","tagline":"Yeast cocultures that produce four plant specialized metabolites from sakura and tea - sakuranetin, quercetin, EGCG and L-theanine - without the plant","summary":"ASIJ-Tokyo engineered Saccharomyces cerevisiae to make four plant specialized metabolites tied to Japanese culture: sakuranetin, quercetin, EGCG and L-theanine. Rather than one overloaded strain, they split pathways across cocultured strains at optimised ratios (7:3 for sakuranetin and quercetin, 5:3:2 for the three-strain EGCG system), with every enzyme cassette behind a GAL promoter and a constitutive pTEF1 fluorescent reporter so strain ratios can be verified before induction. Their education portfolio is unusually broad for a high-school team and explicitly gap-driven: each activity was created to fill a named gap they had identified. They contributed 34 new parts, a no-HPLC semi-quantitative screening workflow and a low-cost DIY bioreactor with full build instructions, all aimed at other resource-limited high-school teams.","awards":["Best Part Collection — Nominee (High School)","Best Education — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Space / Foundational Advance / Software & AI / Biomanufacturing)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Stakeholder analysis structured into three domains (agricultural supply, health and consumer needs, production and commercial viability); Duke iGEM's Risk and Research Ethics Assessment tool used as an external bioethics compliance check.","dataviz":"Stakeholder map figure grouping identified issues and stakeholders into the three domains; coculture architecture diagrams.","datascience":"A semi-quantitative screening workflow designed specifically for teams without HPLC access, published as a contribution. In-silico modelling of a proposed active-transport system was explored with guidance from a Johns Hopkins biomedical engineering student, then explicitly abandoned because without HPLC the team could not measure intra- versus extracellular compound concentrations to validate it - a documented negative result.","software":"Village 茶(Sa)kura: a free Animal Crossing-style educational game built in Unity and coded in C# over two years with the Japanese technology entertainment company ABAL Inc. Players receive villager requests (for example 'bring me anti-inflammatory sakura cream'), scavenge ingredients in the Sakura Forest, read recipes at crafting stations, synthesise items in in-game labs and return them, with up to 10 encoded pathways; published free on itch.io with a game manual. Also a memory card game, a 'What is?' YouTube explainer series, and The Catalyst: Science & Curiosity, a student science news/publication website.","stack":["Unity Engine","C#","itch.io distribution","YouTube","web publishing platform (The Catalyst)","HPLC (via International Christian University)"],"techniques":["yeast coculture at optimised strain ratios","dual-plasmid selection (pRS316/URA3 + pRS315/LEU2 on SC -Ura -Leu dropout)","GAL-inducible enzyme cassettes","pTEF1 constitutive fluorescent reporter for ratio verification","modular pathway splitting across strains","DIY low-cost bioreactor build","CRISPR-Cas9 teaching lab","agarose gel electrophoresis","strawberry and banana DNA extraction"],"frameworks_zh":"利害關係人分析分為三個領域（農業供應、健康與消費者需求、生產與商業可行性）；並使用 Duke iGEM 的風險與研究倫理評估工具作為外部的生物倫理合規檢核。","dataviz_zh":"一張利害關係人地圖，把指認出的問題與利害關係人歸入三個領域；另有共培養架構示意圖。","datascience_zh":"一套專為沒有 HPLC 的隊伍設計的半定量篩選流程，已作為貢獻發布。他們也在一位約翰霍普金斯大學生醫工程學生的指導下探索了一個主動運輸系統提案的電腦模擬，隨後明確放棄，因為沒有 HPLC 就無法量測細胞內與細胞外的化合物濃度來驗證它——這是一項有記錄的負面結果。","software_zh":"Village 茶(Sa)kura：一款免費的《動物森友會》風格教育遊戲，以 Unity 建置、用 C# 撰寫，與日本科技娛樂公司 ABAL Inc. 合作開發兩年。玩家接受村民的請求（例如「幫我帶抗發炎的櫻花乳霜來」），在櫻花森林採集材料、在製作站閱讀配方、在遊戲內的實驗室合成物品再交回去，最多可編入 10 條代謝路徑；在 itch.io 上免費發布並附遊戲手冊。另有一款記憶卡牌遊戲、一個「What is?」YouTube 解說系列，以及 The Catalyst: Science & Curiosity——一個學生科學新聞與投稿網站。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"ASIJ-Tokyo opened its education work with a diagnostic question - who is not yet part of the synthetic biology conversation - and then built one artefact per identified gap, which makes the portfolio unusually legible. Gap: low public awareness of sakura's health properties, addressed by an Earth Day booth (22 April 2025 and 2026) where elementary, middle and high school students painted flower pots and took home sakura seeds while being briefed on anti-inflammatory and antioxidant properties, reaching 70+ participants each year, plus a Sakura & Matcha Goodies recipe book whose recipes each carry a 'the science behind' blurb. Gap: almost no synthetic biology video content pitched at high school level, addressed by a 'What is?' YouTube series running since 2023 covering bioethics, cellular transport, yeast in synthetic biology, metabolic engineering, genetic switches, cocultures, biosensors and cellular fluorescence, deliberately sequenced so concepts build on each other. Gap: little attention to memory degradation in Japan's ageing population, addressed by a memory card game run at a senior home on 13 October 2026, using six cards depicting cluttered domestic interiors with recall questions (colour of the couch, number of pencils) across repeated rounds individually and in groups of 2-3; the team was scrupulous about its limits, stating plainly that this was a small pilot and not a clinical study, and left the game with the facility and its nurses as a low-pressure cognitive exercise. Gap: no easy way for teachers outside iGEM or biology to run these activities, addressed by a free downloadable workbook of seven tested lesson plans covering DNA, natural pigment, cell modelling, chromatography, biomaterials and polymer creation, refined so that the labs connect into a holistic overview, plus The Catalyst: Science & Curiosity, a newspaper-style website that also acts as a publication platform where any secondary school student can publish science writing from 300-word pieces to 20-page experimental reports. The flagship format is Village 茶(Sa)kura, an Animal Crossing-style Unity/C# game co-developed over two years with ABAL Inc., a Japanese technology entertainment company, iterated against industry-expert feedback and published free on itch.io with a manual. Direct teaching reached a wide spread of ages: a four-year-running CRISPR-Cas9 and gel electrophoresis lab for 8th graders built into their sickle cell anaemia unit (13-14 May 2025 and 12-13 May 2026, including why researchers target the BCL11A enhancer rather than the mutation itself); DNA extraction workshops for over 30 students at Tokyo Bay International School and Montessori School Tokyo in Azabu (31 March and 22 July 2026); the same experiment with bananas for 80+ children aged 5-10 daily at the school's Summer Day Camp, deliberately reaching local and non-international-school children; a 60+ child booth with leaf-rubbing and plant-engineering discussion at Aoyama Gakuin's Global Day (21 October 2025), tied to the UN SDGs and to English-language learning; a Winterfest campus-wide CSI escape-room-style DNA mystery (4 December 2025) with three stations - DNA matching to eliminate suspects, leaf-morphology comparison to locate the crime scene, and gel electrophoresis to identify the culprit; a Community Health Fair obstacle-course race (11 April 2025) where participants acted as skin cells carrying sakuranetin past crawl-space 'constricted blood vessels' and hurdle 'blockages' on a two-minute timer; and Back to School Night in 2025 and 2026, the 2026 edition adding a hands-on flower pipetting activity and recipe-book matcha cookies for 100+ parents, students and teachers. Evidence of iteration is explicit and honest: PCR was cut from the 8th grade lab because crucial steps ran out of time, lesson plans were reworked so activities connect, pipetting was added to Back to School Night, and the team states openly that it did not systematically record feedback this year and therefore added a feedback page to the workbook so teachers who use it can report back. Collaboration was a deliberate education strategy in its own right: activities were created or joined with eight teams across eight countries (Duke, Maastricht, Manipal, Concordia, Ruhr University Bochum, St Stephen's College Hong Kong, Patras, KCIS Xiugang) plus the iGEM Community Blackboard - contributing a scent to Manipal's Scents of the World, an abstract to Maastricht's peer-reviewed MSP Vector journal, a Pokemon-style card to RUBochum's Trading Card Project, a Japanese translation of HKSSC's food-waste comic, and both of their games to Patras's downloadable game gallery.","ihp":"Four stakeholder engagements reshaped the project, each with a recorded design consequence. Tea producer Masahiro Okutomi of Sayama-cha Okutomien (10 April 2026) explained that overseas matcha orders have risen sharply while new tea plants take at least five years to mature and processing equipment three years to arrive, and that L-theanine is what gives matcha much of its quality - so extracting it from leaves for supplements would leave farmers with a degraded product. This directly strengthened the decision to produce L-theanine in yeast rather than extract it, and reframed the team's positioning from replacement to 'an extra source that works beside farms'. He also noted Japanese companies market catechins like EGCG while consumers do not know what L-theanine does, which changed the team's communication plan to explain each compound separately starting with L-theanine. Yukari Kawahito of Sakura Science Beauty (May 2026) introduced transdermal patches as a delivery format the team had not considered and opened a second business route of selling compounds to companies with existing formulation capability. Vikki Adams (Johns Hopkins) advised on an in-silico active-transport model that was ultimately dropped for lack of HPLC validation. A visit to the six-generation family-run Maruichi Mizuno Tea Farm in Shizuoka (16 June 2026) showed how the farm covers plants with sheets, harvests three times a year, processes its own hojicha and sencha and is now seeking matcha manufacturers to benefit from the boom - confirming producers already market L-theanine and EGCG benefits while demand for fermentation-derived ingredients remains untested. The visit was filmed as a vlog.","realWorld":"The project's framing is a supply constraint, not a novelty: sakura-flavoured products appear across Japanese supermarkets every spring and vanish by May because the raw material does, sakuranetin being bound to one of the shortest harvest windows in agriculture, while tea faces the opposite problem of a demand boom farms cannot meet. Contributions were deliberately designed for resource-limited high-school teams: a reusable coculture architecture where a future team can keep Strain N unchanged and only build its own downstream strain, 34 new Registry parts, a semi-quantitative screening workflow usable without HPLC, and a low-cost DIY bioreactor with full build instructions. The team hosted six students from St Mary's International School to build a biosensor, gained HPLC access through a bioanalytical chemistry professor at International Christian University, and will give an opening keynote alongside university professors at ASIJ's first semi-annual science fair on 14 November 2026 to roughly 100 students and teachers.","partners":["ABAL Inc. (Japanese technology entertainment company, two-year Unity game co-development)","Tokyo Bay International School","Montessori School Tokyo, Azabu","Aoyama Gakuin (Global Day)","International Christian University (bioanalytical chemistry professor, HPLC access)","St Mary's International School","Recolle Team Hayate (STEM Racing student team)","Sayama-cha Okutomien (tea producer Masahiro Okutomi)","Sakura Science Beauty (Yukari Kawahito)","Maruichi Mizuno Tea Farm, Shizuoka","Johns Hopkins University (Vikki Adams)","itch.io (game distribution)","Japan iGEM meet-up at Hiroo Gakuen (UTokyo, TUS, Waseda, Keio, Oakridge, HG)","iGEM teams: Duke, Maastricht, Manipal, Concordia, RUBochum, HKSSC, Patras, KCIS Xiugang"],"publicEngagement_zh":"ASIJ-Tokyo 的教育工作是從一個診斷性問題開始的——誰還沒被納入合成生物學的對話——然後針對每一個指認出的缺口各做一件作品，使整個組合格外容易讀懂。缺口：公眾對櫻花保健特性的認識不足，以地球日攤位回應（2025 與 2026 年 4 月 22 日），小學、國中與高中學生在攤位彩繪花盆、帶櫻花種子回家，同時聽取抗發炎與抗氧化特性的說明，每年觸及 70 人以上；另有一本《Sakura & Matcha Goodies》食譜，每道食譜都附一段「背後的科學」。缺口：幾乎沒有以高中程度為對象的合成生物學影片內容，以自 2023 年持續製作的「What is?」YouTube 系列回應，主題涵蓋生物倫理、細胞運輸、酵母在合成生物學中的角色、代謝工程、基因開關、共培養、生物感測器與細胞螢光，並刻意排序讓概念層層累積。缺口：對日本高齡人口記憶退化的關注不足，以 2026 年 10 月 13 日在一間老人之家進行的記憶卡牌遊戲回應，使用六張描繪雜亂居家室內的卡片，搭配回想問題（沙發的顏色、鉛筆的數量），分個人與 2-3 人小組進行多輪；團隊對自身限制相當嚴謹，直言這只是一次小規模試辦、不是臨床研究，並把遊戲留給該機構與護理人員作為低壓力的認知練習。缺口：iGEM 或生物領域之外的老師沒有簡便方式執行這些活動，以一本可免費下載的手冊回應，內含七個經測試的教案，涵蓋 DNA、天然色素、細胞建模、色層分析、生物材料與高分子製作，並經修改讓各實驗能串連成一個整體概觀；另有 The Catalyst: Science & Curiosity，一個報紙風格的網站，同時作為投稿平台，任何中學生都能發表從 300 字短文到 20 頁實驗報告的科學寫作。旗艦作品是 Village 茶(Sa)kura，一款《動物森友會》風格的 Unity/C# 遊戲，與日本科技娛樂公司 ABAL Inc. 共同開發兩年，依產業專家回饋反覆修改，並在 itch.io 上附手冊免費發布。直接教學觸及的年齡層分布很廣：為八年級生開設、已連續四年的 CRISPR-Cas9 與膠體電泳實驗課，嵌入他們的鎌形血球貧血單元（2025 年 5 月 13-14 日與 2026 年 5 月 12-13 日，內容包括為何研究者針對 BCL11A 增強子而非突變本身）；在 Tokyo Bay International School 與麻布的 Montessori School Tokyo 為 30 多位學生舉辦 DNA 萃取工作坊（2026 年 3 月 31 日與 7 月 22 日）；在校內夏日營隊每天為 80 位以上 5 至 10 歲孩童用香蕉做同一個實驗，刻意觸及本地與非國際學校的孩子；在青山學院的 Global Day（2025 年 10 月 21 日）設攤，為 60 多位孩童進行葉片拓印與植物工程討論，並連結聯合國 SDG 與英語學習；Winterfest 的全校 CSI 式密室逃脫 DNA 謎案（2025 年 12 月 4 日），設三個關卡——以 DNA 比對排除嫌犯、以葉形比較鎖定犯罪現場、以膠體電泳指認兇手；社區健康博覽會的障礙賽（2025 年 4 月 11 日），參與者扮演攜帶 sakuranetin 的皮膚細胞，在兩分鐘計時內穿過代表「狹窄血管」的爬行空間與代表「阻塞」的跨欄；以及 2025 與 2026 年的返校之夜，2026 年版新增動手的花朵微量吸管活動與食譜書中的抹茶餅乾，服務 100 位以上家長、學生與教師。迭代的證據明確而誠實：因為關鍵步驟時間不夠，八年級實驗課砍掉了 PCR；教案被重寫以讓各活動相互串連；返校之夜加入了微量吸管操作；團隊也公開承認今年沒有系統性地記錄回饋，因此在手冊中加入一個回饋頁面，讓使用它的教師能回報意見。合作本身就是一項刻意的教育策略：他們與八個國家的八支隊伍共同創建或參與活動（Duke、Maastricht、Manipal、Concordia、Ruhr University Bochum、香港 St Stephen's College、Patras、康橋秀岡 KCIS），再加上 iGEM Community Blackboard——他們為 Manipal 的 Scents of the World 貢獻一種香氣、為 Maastricht 的同儕審查期刊 MSP Vector 投稿一篇摘要、為 RUBochum 的交換卡牌計畫做了一張寶可夢風格卡片、把 HKSSC 的食物浪費漫畫翻成日文，並把自己的兩款遊戲都放進 Patras 的可下載遊戲展示區。","ihp_zh":"四次利害關係人互動重塑了這個專案，每一次都留下具體的設計後果。狹山茶奧富園的茶農奧富雅浩（2026 年 4 月 10 日）說明海外抹茶訂單急遽增加，但新茶樹至少需要五年才成熟、加工設備也要等三年才到貨，而 L-theanine 正是抹茶品質的主要來源之一——因此若為了做保健食品而從茶葉中萃取它，留給農民的只會是品質下降的產品。這直接強化了「在酵母中生產 L-theanine 而非萃取」的決定，也把團隊的定位從取代改寫為「在農場旁邊運作的額外來源」。他還指出日本企業行銷的是 EGCG 之類的兒茶素，而消費者並不知道 L-theanine 有什麼作用，這使團隊改變傳播計畫，改為逐一說明每種化合物、並從 L-theanine 開始。Sakura Science Beauty 的川人由加里（2026 年 5 月）引入了團隊原本沒想到的遞送形式——經皮貼片，並開啟了第二條商業路線：把化合物賣給已有配方能力的公司。約翰霍普金斯大學的 Vikki Adams 就一個電腦模擬的主動運輸模型提供建議，該模型最終因缺乏 HPLC 驗證而被放棄。造訪靜岡縣經營六代的丸一水野茶園（2026 年 6 月 16 日）則讓他們看到農場如何以覆蓋布遮蔽茶樹、一年採收三次、自行加工焙茶與煎茶，而現在正尋找抹茶製造商以搭上這波熱潮——證實生產者已在行銷 L-theanine 與 EGCG 的益處，而市場對發酵來源原料的需求仍未經檢驗。這次造訪被拍成 vlog。","realWorld_zh":"專案的立論是供給限制，而不是新奇感：櫻花口味的產品每年春天出現在日本各大超市，到五月就消失，因為原料本身就消失了——sakuranetin 綁定在農業中最短的採收窗口之一；而茶則面對相反的問題：需求暴增而農場跟不上。貢獻刻意為資源有限的高中隊伍設計：一個可重複使用的共培養架構，讓未來的隊伍能保持 N 菌株不變、只建自己的下游菌株；34 個新的 Registry 部件；一套不需 HPLC 也能使用的半定量篩選流程；以及一台附完整製作說明的低成本自製生物反應器。團隊接待了六位來自 St Mary's International School 的學生一起製作生物感測器，並透過國際基督教大學一位生物分析化學教授取得 HPLC 使用機會；他們也將在 2026 年 11 月 14 日 ASIJ 首屆半年度科學展上，與大學教授並列發表開場主題演講，對象約 100 位學生與教師。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6338/wiki/education/crafting-screenshot.avif","caption":"A crafting station in Village 茶(Sa)kura, the free Unity/C# synthetic biology game built with ABAL Inc. and published on itch.io","credit":"Team ASIJ-Tokyo, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"Village 茶(Sa)kura 中的製作站——這款免費的 Unity/C# 合成生物學遊戲與 ABAL Inc. 共同開發，並在 itch.io 上發布"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6338/wiki/education/seniorhouse.avif","caption":"Running the six-card memory game with residents at a senior home, 13 October 2026","credit":"Team ASIJ-Tokyo, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"2026 年 10 月 13 日，與老人之家的住民一起進行六張卡片的記憶遊戲"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6338/wiki/education/winterfest-igem.avif","caption":"The campus-wide CSI-themed DNA mystery stations at Winterfest, 4 December 2025","credit":"Team ASIJ-Tokyo, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"2025 年 12 月 4 日 Winterfest 的全校 CSI 主題 DNA 謎案關卡"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6338/wiki/education/igem-backtoschool-2-1.avif","caption":"Back to School Night 2026: hands-on flower pipetting activity for 100+ parents, students and teachers","credit":"Team ASIJ-Tokyo, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"2026 年返校之夜：為 100 位以上家長、學生與教師舉辦的動手花朵微量吸管活動"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6338/wiki/education/booth2.avif","caption":"The Earth Day booth, where 70+ students painted sakura flower pots and took home seeds","credit":"Team ASIJ-Tokyo, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"地球日攤位，70 位以上學生在此彩繪櫻花花盆並帶種子回家"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6338/wiki/education/youtube-ss.avif","caption":"The 'What is?' YouTube explainer series, built to fill the gap in synthetic biology video pitched at high school level","credit":"Team ASIJ-Tokyo, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"「What is?」YouTube 解說系列，專為填補以高中程度為對象的合成生物學影片缺口而製作"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Start from a written list of named gaps (which audience, which missing resource) and build exactly one artefact per gap, then package the reusable ones - a seven-lesson tested workbook with a built-in feedback page, a free game, a sequenced video series - so teachers outside synthetic biology can run them without you.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/asij-tokyo/","https://2026.igem.wiki/asij-tokyo/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/asij-tokyo/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/asij-tokyo/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/asij-tokyo/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/asij-tokyo/entrepreneurship"],"projectTitle_zh":"Project 茶(Sa)kure-it-all","tagline_zh":"以酵母共培養生產四種來自櫻花與茶的植物特化代謝物——sakuranetin、quercetin、EGCG 與 L-theanine——而不需要植物本身","summary_zh":"ASIJ-Tokyo 改造 Saccharomyces cerevisiae 來製造四種與日本文化相連的植物特化代謝物：sakuranetin、quercetin、EGCG 與 L-theanine。他們沒有把全部路徑硬塞進單一菌株，而是把路徑拆分到以最佳比例共培養的多個菌株（sakuranetin 與 quercetin 為 7:3，三菌株的 EGCG 系統為 5:3:2），每個酵素卡匣都置於 GAL 啟動子之下，並加上組成型 pTEF1 螢光報告子，使菌株比例能在誘導前先行確認。他們的教育作品組合對高中隊伍而言格外廣泛，而且明確由缺口驅動：每一項活動都是為填補他們指認出的某個特定缺口而設計。團隊貢獻了 34 個新部件、一套無須 HPLC 的半定量篩選流程，以及一台附完整製作說明的低成本自製生物反應器，全都瞄準其他資源有限的高中隊伍。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"從一份寫下來的缺口清單出發（哪個受眾、缺哪項資源），針對每個缺口只做一件作品，然後把可重複使用的那些包裝好——一本含內建回饋頁的七課測試過教案手冊、一款免費遊戲、一個循序編排的影片系列——讓合成生物學圈外的教師不必靠你也能自己執行。","awards_zh":["最佳元件集 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（太空 / 基礎推進 / 軟體與 AI / 生物製造）"],"rank":21},"6339":{"team":"Muenster-University","id":"6339","section":"Overgrad","country":"Germany","village":"Agriculture","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/muenster-university/","projectTitle":"P.A.C. Immunity","projectTitle_zh":"P.A.C. Immunity","tagline":"A modular platform that retrofits native plant immune sensors so a crop detects a pathogen's own protease directly and triggers an instant immune response.","tagline_zh":"一個模組化平台，改裝植物本身的免疫感測器，讓作物直接偵測病原自己的蛋白酶，並立即啟動免疫反應。","summary":"P.A.C. Immunity rewires plant immunity instead of breeding for it. A plant NLR immune receptor is held inactive by a synthetic blocker peptide containing a protease cleavage site; when a pathogen secretes its effector protease into the host cell - a step many viruses, bacteria, fungi and nematodes cannot skip - the protease cleaves the blocker, the NLR fires, and the plant mounts a hypersensitive response. Because only the cleavage site changes between pathogens, swapping one short sequence retargets the whole system, which is the modularity argument: classical resistance breeding takes years and pathogens overcome new resistances quickly. The bottleneck they hit is that almost no pathogen protease has a known cleavage motif, so the dry lab built ProTEUS (Protease Target Elucidation Using Structural Modeling), a de-novo-binder-style pipeline chaining AlphaFold3, RFdiffusion3 and LigandMPNN with a mechanistically grounded geometric scoring function to generate candidate cleavage peptides for proteases with no characterised substrates at all.","summary_zh":"P.A.C. Immunity 是把植物免疫重新接線，而不是靠育種慢慢選。一個植物 NLR 免疫受體被一段含有蛋白酶切位的合成阻斷胜肽鎖在失活狀態；當病原把它的效應蛋白酶分泌進宿主細胞——這是許多病毒、細菌、真菌與線蟲都省不掉的一步——該蛋白酶就會切開阻斷胜肽，NLR 隨之啟動，植物便發動過敏性反應。由於不同病原之間唯一要改的只有切位，換掉一段短序列就能把整套系統重新指向新標的，這正是模組化的論點：傳統抗病育種要花好幾年，而病原很快就能突破新的抗性。他們撞上的瓶頸是：幾乎沒有任何病原蛋白酶有已知的切割基序，於是乾實驗做出 ProTEUS（Protease Target Elucidation Using Structural Modeling），一條 de novo 結合蛋白式的流程，把 AlphaFold3、RFdiffusion3 與 LigandMPNN 串起來，再配上一套以機制為根據的幾何評分函數，為完全沒有已知受質的蛋白酶產生候選切割胜肽。","awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best New Composite Part — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Agriculture Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"ProTEUS repurposes the de novo mini-binder design stack for an unsolved problem - predicting cleavage sites for proteases whose substrates are unknown - which existing tools (PROSPER, PROSPERous, Procleave, iProt-Sub) cannot do, since they only predict where a given substrate is cut by a protease with 30 or more already-described sites. The pipeline, named as machines on the wiki: AlphaFold3 predicts the target protease structure (AF3 machine I), since no crystal structure existed for any of RipT, RipE1, RipBN or HopN1; the structure is inspected in ChimeraX and aligned by Matchmaker against papain (PDB 9PAP) and other characterised proteases to derive catalytic triads and specificity residues, whose solvent-exposed atoms become hotspot constraints (scanner); RFdiffusion3 generates 5,000 binder backbones per target (1,000 batches of 5) with atom-level rather than residue-level hotspot conditioning and 'is_non_loopy' set to false so no helical bias blocks accessible peptides, with gamma_0 raised from 0.2 to 0.6 to reduce duplicate sequences (RFD3 machine); a Python filter rejects backbones closer than 1.7 A to the protease or farther than 8.0 A from the catalytic centre, with target-specific pass rates of 94.2% for HopN1, 51.1% for RipE1, 48.1% for RipT and 12.3% for RipBN, which they attribute to differences in pocket depth and hotspot geometry (cannon I); LigandMPNN (checkpoint ligandmpnn_v_32_010_25, seed 111, sampling temperature raised to 0.3 from 0.1 for short-sequence diversity) designs 6-10 sequences per backbone with sidechain conformations (MPNN machine); AlphaFold3 re-folds each unique designed sequence in complex with the target protease (AF3 machine II); and a Python scoring script extracts binding geometry and ranks with selected weights (cannon 2), handing the top 100 per protease to wet-lab screening (portal). Everything ran on the PALMA II HPC cluster at Munster - RFdiffusion3 on an RTX 4090 (24 GB) node at about 14 h per protease, LigandMPNN on 8 CPU cores at about 10 h, AlphaFold3 on an A100 (40 GB). Confidence handling is deliberate: they analysed pLDDT and minimum binder-target PAE rather than pTM/ipTM, which have been reported as weaker predictors for protein-peptide interactions, found mean binder pLDDT of 39.73-49.00 across the four targets, and chose explicitly not to filter hard on confidence (a pLDDT > 80 cut would keep only a handful; a pLDDT > 50 intermediate filter changed nothing in the final 100 after structural assessment), reasoning that badly predicted designs would fail the geometric assessment anyway.","frameworks_zh":"ProTEUS 把 de novo 微型結合蛋白的設計工具鏈挪用到一個未解的問題上——預測受質未知的蛋白酶的切位——這是現有工具（PROSPER、PROSPERous、Procleave、iProt-Sub）做不到的，因為它們只能預測某個給定受質會在哪裡被一個「已有 30 個以上已描述切位」的蛋白酶切開。整條流程在 wiki 上以機械零件命名：AlphaFold3 預測標靶蛋白酶結構（AF3 machine I），因為 RipT、RipE1、RipBN 或 HopN1 都沒有任何晶體結構；結構在 ChimeraX 中檢視，並以 Matchmaker 對齊 papain（PDB 9PAP）與其他已特性化的蛋白酶，以推導催化三元組與專一性殘基，其溶劑可及的原子即成為熱點限制（scanner）；RFdiffusion3 為每個標靶產生 5,000 條結合蛋白骨架（1,000 批次、每批 5 條），採原子層級而非殘基層級的熱點條件化，並把 'is_non_loopy' 設為 false，避免螺旋偏好擋掉可用的胜肽，同時把 gamma_0 從 0.2 提高到 0.6 以減少重複序列（RFD3 machine）；一個 Python 過濾器剔除距蛋白酶近於 1.7 A、或距催化中心遠於 8.0 A 的骨架，各標靶的通過率分別為 HopN1 94.2%、RipE1 51.1%、RipT 48.1%、RipBN 12.3%，團隊歸因於口袋深度與熱點幾何的差異（cannon I）；LigandMPNN（checkpoint ligandmpnn_v_32_010_25、seed 111、取樣溫度自 0.1 提高到 0.3 以增加短序列的多樣性）為每條骨架設計 6-10 條序列並附側鏈構形（MPNN machine）；AlphaFold3 再把每條獨特的設計序列與標靶蛋白酶一起重新折疊成複合體（AF3 machine II）；最後一支 Python 評分腳本取出結合幾何、以選定權重排序（cannon 2），把每個蛋白酶的前 100 名交給濕實驗篩選（portal）。全部跑在 Munster 的 PALMA II 高效能運算叢集上——RFdiffusion3 在一個 RTX 4090（24 GB）節點上，每個蛋白酶約 14 小時；LigandMPNN 在 8 個 CPU 核心上約 10 小時；AlphaFold3 在 A100（40 GB）上。信心度的處理也是刻意的：他們分析 pLDDT 與結合蛋白—標靶間的最小 PAE，而不是 pTM/ipTM，因為後者在蛋白質—胜肽交互作用上被報告為較弱的預測指標；四個標靶的結合蛋白平均 pLDDT 為 39.73-49.00，而他們明確選擇不對信心度做嚴格過濾（pLDDT > 80 的切線只會留下寥寥幾個；而在結構評估之後，pLDDT > 50 的中間過濾對最終 100 名毫無影響），理由是預測得差的設計反正也過不了幾何評估。","dataviz":"The wiki is a single-page React application built as an explorable argument rather than a document. It opens with Gary, a farmer whose story carries the problem (30% of global yield losses to plant pathogens, pesticide treadmill, resistances overcome quickly) before any molecular biology appears, and that narrative thread was a direct result of human practices advice. The dry lab page presents the ProTEUS pipeline as a machine metaphor - scanner, RFD3 machine, cannon, MPNN machine, portal - with an animated workflow, and each of the four candidate proteases gets a card showing its AlphaFold3 prediction with per-residue pLDDT for each catalytic triad member and for the whole and core enzyme, plus the hotspot atoms chosen for diffusion. Quantitative figures include a pLDDT-versus-PAE hexbin density plot with the official AlphaFold confidence bands marked, before-and-after pLDDT bars showing what trimming disordered N-terminal secretion signals does to each protease's confidence (raising RipBN above 70), and side-by-side renders of a rejected design versus a kept one. An interactive 3Dmol viewer serves structures (including an AlphaFold3 resistosome model), Rive animations drive the cloning and engineering-cycle explanations, and inline tooltips expand every acronym. Education results are themselves visualised as radial comparison charts of pre- versus post-event survey answers.","dataviz_zh":"這個 wiki 是一個單頁 React 應用程式，被建成一條可探索的論證，而不是一份文件。開場是農夫 Gary，他的故事承載了問題（全球作物產量損失約 30% 來自植物病原、「農藥跑步機」式的惡性循環、抗性很快被突破），而這一切出現在任何分子生物學之前；這條敘事線正是人類實踐建議的直接結果。乾實驗頁把 ProTEUS 流程以機械比喻呈現——scanner、RFD3 machine、cannon、MPNN machine、portal——並配上動畫化的工作流程，而四個候選蛋白酶各有一張卡片，顯示它的 AlphaFold3 預測結構，以及每個催化三元組成員、整體酵素與核心區的逐殘基 pLDDT，加上用於擴散模型的熱點原子。量化圖表包括一張標出官方 AlphaFold 信心區帶的 pLDDT 對 PAE 六角分箱密度圖、一組前後對照的 pLDDT 長條圖（顯示修掉無序的 N 端分泌訊號對各蛋白酶信心度的影響，使 RipBN 升到 70 以上），以及一組被剔除設計與被保留設計的並排渲染圖。一個互動式 3Dmol 檢視器提供結構（包括一個 AlphaFold3 的 resistosome（抗病小體）模型），Rive 動畫驅動選殖與工程循環的說明，而行內提示會展開每一個縮寫。教育成果本身也被視覺化成活動前後問卷答案的放射狀比較圖。","datascience":"Their most transferable piece of work is converting enzymology into a scorable geometry, because no training data existed. Since their four targets have no known cleavage motifs, they could not fit a model; instead they derived scoring parameters from the catalytic mechanism of protein-nucleophile proteases - the nucleophile sulfur or oxygen within attack distance of the base nitrogen, the nucleophile-to-carbonyl-carbon distance, the hydrogen-bond distance from the oxyanion hole amide NH to the scissile carbonyl oxygen, the nucleophile's reactive rotamer (gauche- versus trans, which determines whether the oxyanion hole is formed by the nucleophilic residue's own amide NH or the one C-terminal to it), the near-universal angle between the nucleophile atoms and the base, and the nucleophilic attack angle, with the explicit correction that cysteine proteases take a different ideal attack angle than serine proteases because sulfur hybridises more weakly than oxygen. These were combined into a weighted score over AlphaFold3 complex geometry. They also engineered the cost down: profiling showed the jackhmmer MSA search accounted for over 86% of AlphaFold3 runtime, and because every binder in an iteration is co-folded with the same protease they cached the protease MSA and skipped MSA generation for the artificial peptides entirely (homologs of a designed peptide being meaningless), cutting time per prediction from about 13 minutes to 30 seconds and making a 5,000-30,000 prediction campaign feasible where the naive estimate was 45 to 270 days. Validation was retrospective: run on NIa-Pro, a protease with a known motif, the pipeline recovered the correct residues (E/P6, V/P4, Q/P1) among its top 100 candidates, and for the four uncharacterised proteases it pinpointed potentially important residues, with preliminary wet-lab signal for HopN1, RipBN and RipT that the team states needs a refined screening assay to confirm.","datascience_zh":"他們最可移植的一項工作，是把酵素學轉成可評分的幾何，因為根本沒有訓練資料。既然四個標靶都沒有已知切割基序，他們沒辦法擬合模型；於是他們從「以蛋白質親核基進行催化」的蛋白酶的催化機制推導出評分參數——親核基的硫或氧必須落在距鹼基氮原子的攻擊距離內、親核基到羰基碳的距離、氧陰離子洞的醯胺 NH 到待切斷羰基氧的氫鍵距離、親核基的反應性旋轉異構物（gauche- 對 trans，它決定氧陰離子洞是由親核殘基自己的醯胺 NH 構成，還是由其 C 端那一個構成）、親核原子與鹼基之間那個近乎通用的角度，以及親核攻擊角度；並明確做出校正：半胱胺酸蛋白酶的理想攻擊角度與絲胺酸蛋白酶不同，因為硫的混成比氧弱。這些被合成一個對 AlphaFold3 複合體幾何計算的加權分數。他們也把成本壓了下來：效能剖析顯示 jackhmmer 的 MSA 搜尋佔了 AlphaFold3 執行時間的 86% 以上，而由於一次迭代中的每個結合蛋白都與同一個蛋白酶共同折疊，他們把蛋白酶的 MSA 快取起來，並對人工設計的胜肽完全跳過 MSA 產生（一條設計胜肽的同源序列本來就沒有意義），使每次預測從約 13 分鐘降到 30 秒，讓 5,000-30,000 次預測的大規模運算變得可行——而天真估計原本要 45 到 270 天。驗證是回溯式的：把流程跑在已知基序的蛋白酶 NIa-Pro 上，它在前 100 名候選中找回了正確的殘基（E/P6、V/P4、Q/P1）；而對四個未特性化的蛋白酶，它指出了可能重要的殘基，HopN1、RipBN 與 RipT 已有初步的濕實驗訊號，而團隊明說這需要更精細的篩選分析才能確認。","software":"ProTEUS is the team's software contribution, documented step by step on the model page with every tool version, checkpoint, seed, non-default parameter and HPC node specification stated - enough for another group to rebuild it - but no public repository link is given on the wiki. Their released artefact is instead the part collection on the iGEM Registry, which is where the Best New Composite Part came from: a modular toolkit for plant-immunity engineering comprising pathogen effector protease expression constructs (NIa-Pro from Potato Potyvirus Y with an N-terminal myc tag, plus AvrPphB, HopN1, RipT, RipE1 and RipBN from Pseudomonas syringae and Ralstonia with C-terminal myc tags), a blocker peptide that prevents NLR activity when fused to the N-terminus (experimentally demonstrated on autoactive AtNRG1.1 [D485V], BBa_26V5N8GY), graded series of protease cleavage sites for NIa-Pro, AvrRpt2 and AvrPphB with short, medium and asymmetric GS-linkers plus non-cleavable mutant negative controls, a FRET pair (mTurquoise / cpVenus173) for Nicotiana benthamiana, and synthetic BsaI, BsaI-with-internal-NdeI and PaqCI dropout segments designed so an insert can be swapped into a composite part by Golden Gate assembly - built specifically for pooled library cloning, which is what makes the collection modular 'for anyone to advance with standard cloning practices'.","software_zh":"ProTEUS 就是團隊的軟體貢獻，在模型頁上逐步記錄，每個工具版本、checkpoint、seed、非預設參數與 HPC 節點規格都寫出來——足以讓另一個團隊重建它——但 wiki 上沒有給公開版本庫的連結。他們真正釋出的成品是 iGEM Registry 上的元件集，也正是 Best New Composite Part 的來源：一套植物免疫工程的模組化工具組，包含病原效應蛋白酶的表現構築體（來自 Potato Potyvirus Y 並帶 N 端 myc 標籤的 NIa-Pro，以及來自 Pseudomonas syringae 與 Ralstonia、帶 C 端 myc 標籤的 AvrPphB、HopN1、RipT、RipE1 與 RipBN）、一段融合在 N 端即可阻斷 NLR 活性的阻斷胜肽（已在自體活化的 AtNRG1.1 [D485V] 上實驗證明，BBa_26V5N8GY）、針對 NIa-Pro、AvrRpt2 與 AvrPphB 的一系列分級蛋白酶切位（含短、中與非對稱 GS 連接子，以及不可被切割的突變陰性對照）、一組給 Nicotiana benthamiana 用的 FRET 配對（mTurquoise / cpVenus173），以及合成的 BsaI、含內部 NdeI 的 BsaI 與 PaqCI 置換區段，使插入片段可透過 Golden Gate 組裝換進一個複合元件中——這些是專為混合庫選殖設計的，也正是這個元件集之所以能「讓任何人用標準選殖方法繼續推進」的模組化基礎。","stack":["AlphaFold3","RFdiffusion3","LigandMPNN / ProteinMPNN","ChimeraX (Matchmaker)","Python (filtering + geometric scoring)","jackhmmer (MSA, cached)","PALMA II HPC (NVIDIA RTX 4090, A100)","3Dmol.js","React + Vite (wiki)","Rive (animations)","iGEM Registry","Golden Gate / MoClo","Gibson assembly","Western blot and GFP degradation-tag reporter screening","Nicotiana benthamiana transient expression"],"techniques":["de novo binder design repurposed for protease substrate discovery","atom-level hotspot conditioning in structure diffusion","structural alignment to characterised homologs to locate catalytic triads without crystal structures","steric and distance filtering of backbone-only diffusion output","mechanism-derived geometric scoring in place of a trained model","reactive rotamer analysis to identify the active oxyanion hole","pLDDT and minimum binder-target PAE instead of pTM/ipTM for peptide complexes","disordered-terminus trimming before confidence assessment","MSA caching and MSA-free folding of synthetic peptides for throughput","retrospective validation on a protease with a known motif","screen-many-good-predictions rather than pick-the-best","GFP-cleavage-site-degradation-tag high-throughput plate screening","FRET-based cleavage readout in planta","Design-Build-Test-Learn cycles documented per module"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"The broadest and most systematically evaluated education programme of the five teams, and almost every activity was measured with pre- and post-activity questionnaires decided on in advance. Formats: a stand on the MS Wissenschaft science exhibition ship (a German federal research ministry project visiting 33 cities across Germany, Poland and Austria) during its Munster stop, drawing on roughly 5,000 weekend visitors, where people isolated DNA from bananas with household chemicals, built DNA double strands from 60+ gummy-bear model kits (deoxyribose, phosphate and four coloured bases) and translated their own codon to an amino acid on a take-home worksheet with a QR code back to the project; a workshop series at the LWL Museum of Natural History over the summer holidays bridging microscopic to macroscopic DNA, with agar-plate cultures cleared in writing with museum management and lab management, ending with participants designing their own Petri dishes, and follow-up feedback collected from parents rather than only participants; a protease workshop series for 8th and 9th grade school classes using digestive enzymes - ginger-juice proteases curdling milk at different temperatures, fruit juices degrading gelatine - iterated after anonymous participant feedback that the first round's instructions were 'a little hard to understand'; a bio pub quiz with the question rounds embedded in a narrative frame; 'Design Your Crop', a 3-6 player card game in which players become plant breeders guarding a hidden genome, built as a scalable substitute for events that only reach as many people as the team's time allows; a children's book featuring a farmer and a planned primary-school reading-plus-worksheet collaboration; a bioethics lecture analysing P.A.C. Immunity as a case study under the new EU NGT Directive; 'A Mosaic of Opinions', a dialogue event designed against the finding that consumer fear of gene editing in the food chain comes from campaigns plus shallow understanding; and a Fishbowl discussion in Nottuln co-organised with the Westphalia-Lippe Agricultural Association (WLV), with roughly two rounds pairing critical and supportive voices - fruit grower and pomology expert Hans-Joachim Bannier and Bioland farmers against Prof. Jochen Schmid (IMMB Munster) and the team - attended by regional farmers, Bioland farmers, association representatives, science students and the general public. They also hosted their own three-day conference, Junior Jam Munster, at the Munster castle, with expert talks, interactive workshops, poster sessions, a panel discussion and a session on iGEM judging criteria, and reported the meta-lesson from participant feedback that interactive workshops retain more than frontal ones and that Zoom talks land far weaker than in-person. The most durable piece is curricular: they developed a lesson concept on proteases for 8th and 9th grade biology, refined with teachers at a partner school and compliant with North Rhine-Westphalia's rules on genetic engineering experiments in schools; recognising that thermocyclers, electrophoresis chambers and photometers are not available in every school, they designed a lending experiment-kit concept, and they are working to shape teacher training through a university module in which master's students build and trial a lesson plan with invited school classes - aimed partly at the fifth Abitur examination subject with experimental assessment arriving in 2027-28.","publicEngagement_zh":"這是五支團隊中範圍最廣、也最系統性被評估的教育計畫，而且幾乎每項活動都用事先決定好的前後問卷量測過。形式包括：在科學展示船 MS Wissenschaft（德國聯邦研究部的計畫，巡迴德國、波蘭與奧地利共 33 個城市）停靠 Munster 期間設攤，觸及週末約 5,000 位訪客，民眾在那裡用家用化學品從香蕉中萃取 DNA、用 60 多組小熊軟糖模型套件（去氧核糖、磷酸與四種顏色的鹼基）搭出 DNA 雙股，並在一張可帶回家、附有連回專案 QR code 的學習單上把自己的密碼子轉譯成胺基酸；暑假期間在 LWL 自然史博物館的工作坊系列，把微觀的 DNA 接到巨觀的 DNA，其中培養皿瓊脂培養已與館方與實驗室管理方以書面方式取得同意，最後讓參與者自己設計培養皿，並向家長而不只是參與者收集後續回饋；一套給 8 與 9 年級班級的蛋白酶工作坊系列，用的是消化酵素——薑汁中的蛋白酶在不同溫度下使牛奶凝結、果汁分解明膠——並在匿名回饋指出第一輪的操作說明「有點難懂」之後做了迭代；一場把題目輪次嵌進敘事框架的生物酒吧問答；「Design Your Crop」，一款 3-6 人的卡牌遊戲，玩家扮演守護一份隱藏基因體的育種者，設計初衷是作為可規模化的替代方案，因為實體活動能觸及的人數受限於團隊的時間；一本以農夫為主角的童書，以及一項規劃中的國小朗讀加學習單合作；一場生物倫理講座，把 P.A.C. Immunity 當作歐盟新 NGT 指令下的案例研究來分析；「A Mosaic of Opinions」，一場對話活動，針對的是「消費者對食物鏈中基因編輯的恐懼來自宣傳運動加上理解不深」這項發現；以及在 Nottuln 與 Westphalia-Lippe 農業協會（WLV）共同舉辦的 Fishbowl 式討論，大致分兩輪，讓批判與支持的聲音兩兩對陣——果樹栽培與果樹學專家 Hans-Joachim Bannier 與 Bioland 農民，對上 Prof. Jochen Schmid（IMMB Munster）與團隊——與會者包括地方農民、Bioland 農民、協會代表、理工科學生與一般大眾。他們也自己在 Munster 城堡辦了一場為期三天的研討會 Junior Jam Munster，有專家演講、互動工作坊、海報發表、一場座談與一場談 iGEM 評審標準的場次，並從參與者回饋中報告了一項後設心得：互動式工作坊的留存率高於單向講授，而 Zoom 演講的效果遠弱於實體。最耐久的一塊在課程端：他們為 8 與 9 年級生物課開發了一套關於蛋白酶的課程概念，與夥伴學校的教師一起打磨，並符合北萊因-西發利亞邦關於校園基因工程實驗的規定；由於認知到並非每所學校都有熱循環儀、電泳槽與光度計，他們設計了一套可出借的實驗教具組概念；他們也正透過一門大學課程模組推動影響師資培育——碩士生在該模組中設計並試教一份教案，對象是受邀的學校班級——部分瞄準的是 2027-28 年將上路、含實驗評量的 Abitur 第五考科。","ihp":"They state their principle as treating criticism as an ally and letting unanswered questions dictate which experts to approach next, and the chain is traceable. Prof. Dr. Dirk Prufer (Institute of Plant Biology and Biotechnology, Munster) validated the concept but said a project is only as strong as its ability to be explained, which is why the work up to that point - almost entirely experimental - was rebuilt around a narrative thread, and why they distilled their science communication learning into a reusable form. Public-trust interviews produced the framing that their biggest challenge is outside the lab, since without public trust there is no foundation for engineered crops in Europe. The bottleneck conversation is the most consequential: with no reliable way to identify protease cleavage motifs, they interviewed Prof. Dr. Kummel's working group and Lasse Middendorf, Michel Westermann and Michel Stevens, who told them that AlphaFold predicting a peptide in a pocket is not evidence it will be cleaved, advised a screen-many-good-predictions approach over seeking a single best prediction, recommended validating the pipeline on a protease with a known motif, and warned that AlphaFold would struggle with short peptides - all four of which became design decisions in ProTEUS, including the separate geometric scoring layer and the NIa-Pro retrospective validation. They advised against an alternative N-terminal-binding-domain NLR engineering route on feasibility grounds, which the team dropped. Verification strategy changed too: they settled on Western blotting with the cleavage site placed between two differently sized tagged proteins, and on co-infiltrating the NLR construct with the protease construct to guarantee both are expressed, judging the live-pathogen route better suited to stably transformed plants later. Industry contacts advised focusing on crops with higher production margins and identifying which chemical pesticides are likely to be restricted so the technology can be positioned as a replacement. An early farmer-focused interview changed the education strategy outright: they contacted the WLV agricultural association to reach farmers directly, and used the resulting discussion to extract farmers' specific requirements for genetic engineering, quoting farmers' own statements back as design references.","ihp_zh":"他們寫明的原則是把批評當盟友，並讓未解的問題決定下一個該找誰；而這條鏈是可追溯的。Prof. Dr. Dirk Prufer（Munster 植物生物學與生物技術研究所）認可這個構想，但說一個專案的強度只等於它被說清楚的能力，這正是為什麼到那時為止幾乎純實驗的工作被重新圍繞一條敘事線重建，也是為什麼他們把自己的科學傳播心得整理成可重複使用的形式。關於公眾信任的訪談則產生了這個定調：他們最大的挑戰在實驗室之外，因為沒有公眾信任，工程改造作物在歐洲就沒有立足的基礎。而影響最大的是那場關於瓶頸的對話：在沒有可靠方法辨識蛋白酶切割基序的情況下，他們訪談了 Prof. Dr. Kummel 的研究團隊以及 Lasse Middendorf、Michel Westermann 與 Michel Stevens，對方告訴他們：AlphaFold 預測出一段胜肽落在口袋裡，並不等於它會被切開；建議採「篩很多個好預測」而不是追求單一最佳預測；建議先在一個已知基序的蛋白酶上驗證整條流程；並警告 AlphaFold 處理短胜肽會很吃力——這四點全都變成 ProTEUS 中的設計決策，包括另設一層幾何評分，以及 NIa-Pro 的回溯驗證。他們也以可行性為由，建議放棄另一條以 N 端結合結構域改造 NLR 的路線，團隊照辦。驗證策略也因此改變：他們決定採 Western blot，把切位放在兩個大小不同的標籤蛋白之間；並把 NLR 構築體與蛋白酶構築體共同滲潤表現，以確保兩者都有表現，並判斷活體病原的路線比較適合之後的穩定轉殖植株。業界聯絡人則建議聚焦在生產毛利較高的作物，並找出哪些化學農藥可能被限用，好把這項技術定位為替代方案。一場早期以農民為對象的訪談直接改變了教育策略：他們聯繫 WLV 農業協會以直接接觸農民，並用由此產生的討論，萃取出農民對基因工程的具體要求，再把農民自己的說法當作設計依據引述回來。","realWorld":"There is no entrepreneurship page; the real-world case is made through regulation, agronomic positioning and safety. The project is timed against the EU's new genomic techniques regulation: they tracked the European Parliament debate through the season, committed in advance to analysing the outcome's effect on their project, and published a bioethics case study assessing P.A.C. Immunity under the new NGT Directive alongside a risk analysis, noting that it remains to be seen how the rules play out in practice. Their market framing is agronomic rather than financial - pathogens cause roughly 30% of global yield losses, pesticide dependence carries economic and ecological costs, classical resistance breeding is slow and resistances are overcome quickly, so the selling point is a platform that updates by swapping one short cleavage sequence - and industry advice pushed them toward higher-margin crops and toward positioning against pesticides facing restriction. Safety is addressed as a staged transition: current work is under laboratory containment, and they state explicitly that moving toward pathogen-resistant crops in the field introduces a fundamentally different risk picture. The honest limitation is published as its own section: not all crop pathogens secrete proteases into host cells, so the platform is not universal, and ProTEUS is positioned as what would let P.A.C. Immunity expand from a few pathogens toward broad-spectrum use. The modular part collection on the Registry, plus the documented ProTEUS methodology, are the handover to whoever continues it.","realWorld_zh":"這個專案沒有創業頁；現實世界的論證是靠法規、農藝定位與安全來建立的。專案的時程刻意對準歐盟的新基因組技術法規：他們整季追蹤歐洲議會的辯論、事先承諾會分析結果對自己專案的影響，並發表一份生物倫理案例研究，在新的 NGT 指令下評估 P.A.C. Immunity 並附上風險分析，同時註明規則在實務上會怎麼運作還有待觀察。他們的市場論述是農藝的而非財務的——病原造成全球約 30% 的產量損失、對農藥的依賴帶來經濟與生態成本、傳統抗病育種緩慢而抗性很快被突破，所以賣點是一個只要換掉一段短切位序列就能更新的平台——而業界建議把他們推向毛利較高的作物，以及定位在面臨限用的農藥之上。安全則以分階段過渡來處理：目前的工作都在實驗室圍堵條件下進行，而他們明確寫出：走向田間的抗病作物會帶來根本不同的風險樣貌。誠實的限制自成一節公開：不是所有作物病原都會把蛋白酶分泌到宿主細胞裡，所以這個平台並非萬用；而 ProTEUS 被定位為能讓 P.A.C. Immunity 從少數病原擴展到廣效應用的關鍵。Registry 上的模組化元件集，加上有完整紀錄的 ProTEUS 方法學，就是他們交給後繼者的東西。","partners":["Prof. Dr. Dirk Prufer, Institute of Plant Biology and Biotechnology, University of Munster","Prof. Dr. Kummel and working group, University of Munster (structural modelling)","Lasse Middendorf, Michel Westermann and Michel Stevens (modelling advisors)","Prof. Dr.-Ing. Jochen Schmid, Institute for Molecular Microbiology and Biotechnology (IMMB), University of Munster","Westphalia-Lippe Agricultural Association (WLV) - Stefan Wolfert, Michael Uckelmann, Tim Richter","Hans-Joachim Bannier (pomology expert, critical perspective)","Jorg Schulze Buschhoff (farmer)","Dr. Holger Ophoff (official oversight perspective)","LWL Museum of Natural History, Munster","MS Wissenschaft / German Federal Ministry of Research, Technology and Space","PALMA II HPC, University of Munster","Partner school and Biology Education Department, University of Munster","Junior Jam Munster participant teams; iGEM Dusseldorf Meetup; BFH"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6339/wiki/dry-lab/figures/fig3.avif","caption":"AlphaFold3 confidence for the four candidate effector proteases before and after excluding disordered N-terminal regions, averaged over 10 samples, with the share of each protein trimmed shown above each bar.","caption_zh":"四個候選效應蛋白酶在排除無序 N 端區域前後的 AlphaFold3 信心度，取 10 個樣本平均，每根長條上方標出該蛋白被修掉的比例。","credit":"Team Muenster-University, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6339/wiki/dry-lab/figures/fig4.avif","caption":"The HopN1 protease with the hotspot atoms used to steer RFdiffusion3, shown as ribbon and surface, next to a rejected design filtered out by the Python geometry check and one kept for sequence design.","caption_zh":"HopN1 蛋白酶與用來引導 RFdiffusion3 的熱點原子，以帶狀與表面兩種方式呈現，旁邊是一個被 Python 幾何檢查剔除的設計，以及一個被保留下來進入序列設計的設計。","credit":"Team Muenster-University, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6339/wiki/education/cardgame/dsc9496-gro.avif","caption":"'Design Your Crop', the 3-6 player card game in which players become plant breeders guarding a hidden genome, built so the team's engagement could scale past events limited by their own time.","caption_zh":"「Design Your Crop」，3-6 人的卡牌遊戲，玩家扮演守護一份隱藏基因體的育種者；做這款遊戲是為了讓團隊的互動推廣能突破受自身時間限制的活動規模。","credit":"Team Muenster-University, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6339/wiki/education/fish-bowl-discussion/dsc05178.avif","caption":"The Fishbowl discussion in Nottuln, co-organised with the Westphalia-Lippe Agricultural Association, bringing regional farmers, Bioland farmers, association representatives and researchers into the same conversation about green genetic engineering.","caption_zh":"在 Nottuln 與 Westphalia-Lippe 農業協會共同舉辦的 Fishbowl 式討論，把地方農民、Bioland 農民、協會代表與研究者拉進同一場關於綠色基因工程的對話。","credit":"Team Muenster-University, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Two things are directly portable. First, when no training data exists, derive a scoring function from the mechanism instead of waiting for a dataset: Munster turned textbook protease enzymology - nucleophile-to-base distance, oxyanion hole hydrogen bonds, reactive rotamer, nucleophilic attack angle, with the serine-versus-cysteine correction - into a weighted score over predicted structures, and validated it by recovering a known motif. Second, copy their education evaluation habit: decide before each event how you will check whether the learning objective was met, run a short pre- and post-questionnaire, and publish the result including what failed - and copy the curricular endgame, where a workshop becomes a lesson plan for local schools plus a lending kit for schools without thermocyclers, which is how one season's outreach keeps running after the team disbands.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"有兩件事可以直接搬走。第一，當沒有訓練資料時，就從機制推導出評分函數，不要等資料集：Munster 把教科書上的蛋白酶酵素學——親核基到鹼基的距離、氧陰離子洞的氫鍵、反應性旋轉異構物、親核攻擊角度，加上絲胺酸與半胱胺酸的差異校正——變成對預測結構計算的加權分數，再用一個已知基序把它驗證回來。第二，照抄他們的教育評估習慣：在每場活動之前就決定要怎麼檢驗學習目標達成了沒有，做一份簡短的前後問卷，並把結果包含失敗的部分一起公開——也照抄他們在課程端的收尾，把一場工作坊變成給當地學校的教案，再加上一套給沒有熱循環儀的學校的出借教具組，這就是一季的推廣在團隊解散之後還能繼續運作的方式。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/muenster-university/","https://2026.igem.wiki/muenster-university/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/muenster-university/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/muenster-university/results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/muenster-university/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/muenster-university/experiments/","https://2026.igem.wiki/muenster-university/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/muenster-university/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/muenster-university/contribution/","https://2026.igem.wiki/muenster-university/safety-and-security/"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳新複合元件 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳農業專案 — 入圍"],"rank":117},"6341":{"team":"KAUST-KSA","id":"6341","section":"Overgrad","country":"Saudi Arabia","village":"Space","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/kaust-ksa/","projectTitle":"SHIHAB","projectTitle_zh":"SHIHAB","tagline":"SHIHAB (shooting star): resilient microbial chassis and a suitcase bioreactor for on-demand therapeutic protein manufacturing in space","tagline_zh":"SHIHAB（流星）：耐受性強的微生物底盤，加上一台行李箱式生物反應器，用於在太空中按需製造治療性蛋白質","summary":"Stocking an inventory of medicines for long-duration missions costs payload mass, so SHIHAB makes the medicine instead: a small library of lyophilised engineered microbes ('pills'), each producing a different nanobody, plus a compact automated bioreactor and purification train that an untrained astronaut can run. The wet lab integrated Dsup, the tardigrade damage-suppressor protein, genomically into three chassis (Bacillus subtilis, Saccharomyces cerevisiae, Pichia pastoris) and quantified radiation resistance against UV-C and X-ray doses with four complementary readouts, then expressed and purified a payload protein by HisTrap. The dry lab answered which host, what feedstock and when to induce using genome-scale metabolic models plus an ODE layer, and COMSOL CFD decided the rotor geometry for mixing under Mars, Moon and transit gravity. It won Best Hardware and Best Space Project; the whole platform was taken out of the lab and run on desert dunes to prove the 'anywhere' claim.","summary_zh":"為長期任務備齊一整櫃藥品要付出酬載質量的代價，因此 SHIHAB 選擇現場製藥：一小套凍乾的工程微生物（「藥丸」），每一顆生產一種不同的奈米抗體，再加上一台小型自動化生物反應器與純化串列，讓未受訓練的太空人也能操作。濕實驗把水熊蟲的損傷抑制蛋白 Dsup 以基因組整合方式導入三種底盤（Bacillus subtilis、Saccharomyces cerevisiae、Pichia pastoris），並以四種互補的判讀方式量化其對 UV-C 與 X 光劑量的抗性，接著表現並以 HisTrap 純化了一個酬載蛋白質。乾實驗以基因組尺度代謝模型加上一層 ODE，回答了該用哪個宿主、用什麼進料與何時誘導，而 COMSOL 的流體力學模擬則決定了在火星、月球與航行期重力下用於混合的轉子幾何。本案拿下 Best Hardware 與 Best Space Project；為了證明「在任何地方都能用」的說法，整套平台被搬出實驗室、在沙漠沙丘上實際運行。","awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Measurement — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Hardware — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Space Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Flux balance analysis on three published genome-scale reconstructions (Yeast9 for S. cerevisiae, iBsu1147 for B. subtilis, iMS837 for Synechococcus elongatus PCC 7942, itself built on iJB792), plus a dynamic ODE layer integrated with scipy.integrate.solve_ivp (RK45) because FBA assumes steady state and cannot answer a timing question. Shared constraints are stated: glucose exchange 5, glycerol 0, oxygen 10 (aerobic) or 0 (anaerobic) mmol/gDW/h, nitrate capped at 10 for anaerobic Bacillus, habitat-analogue light at 145 mmol photons/gDW/h for the cyanobacterium, maximum nanobody flux computed with no growth requirement. The team repaired iBsu1147 by adding two reactions (NadB L-aspartate oxidase for de novo NAD+ synthesis and PyrD/PyrK dihydroorotate dehydrogenase for orotate), each justified with in-vitro literature evidence, because the published model failed without oxygen. Results: under oxygen restriction B. subtilis out-produces yeast roughly 3.4-fold on nanobody flux provided nitrate is supplied, and loses 46% of growth capacity against yeast's 82%; an engineered cyanobacterial supplier raises anaerobic yeast growth 13-fold (0.014 to 0.18 /h) once its sucrose export (0.81 mmol/gDW/h, tripled by capping the supplier's own growth) and oxygen (up to 4.2 mmol/gDW/h) are passed in as uptake bounds; the supplier is nitrogen-limited rather than carbon- or light-limited, and candidate gene knockouts do nothing. The ODE layer returns a closed-form optimal induction window of 6.5 to 7 h. Hardware modelling is COMSOL Multiphysics CFD comparing three rotor geometries for bubble fate, air distribution and vortex depth at 50-400 rpm across Earth, Mars, Moon and transit gravity.","frameworks_zh":"在三個已發表的基因組尺度重建模型上執行通量平衡分析（S. cerevisiae 用 Yeast9、B. subtilis 用 iBsu1147、Synechococcus elongatus PCC 7942 用 iMS837，後者本身建立在 iJB792 之上），再加上一層以 scipy.integrate.solve_ivp（RK45）積分的動態 ODE，因為 FBA 假設穩態，無法回答「何時」這類問題。共通的限制條件都有載明：葡萄糖交換通量 5、甘油 0、氧氣 10（好氧）或 0（厭氧）mmol/gDW/h，厭氧 Bacillus 的硝酸鹽上限為 10，藍綠菌的類棲地光照為 145 mmol photons/gDW/h，而最大奈米抗體通量則在不要求生長的條件下計算。團隊修補了 iBsu1147，補上兩個反應（供 NAD+ 從頭合成的 NadB L-天門冬胺酸氧化酶，以及生成乳清酸的 PyrD/PyrK 二氫乳清酸脫氫酶），每一個都以體外文獻證據佐證，因為已發表的模型在缺氧條件下無法求解。結果如下：在氧氣受限時，只要供應硝酸鹽，B. subtilis 的奈米抗體通量約為酵母的 3.4 倍，且其生長能力只損失 46%，而酵母損失 82%；一個經改造的藍綠菌供養者可讓厭氧酵母的生長提升 13 倍（由 0.014 升至 0.18 /h），前提是把它的蔗糖輸出（0.81 mmol/gDW/h，透過限制供養者自身的生長而提高為三倍）與氧氣（最高 4.2 mmol/gDW/h）當作攝取上限傳入；該供養者受限的是氮而不是碳或光，而候選的基因剔除則毫無作用。ODE 層給出一個封閉形式解的最佳誘導時間窗，為 6.5 至 7 小時。硬體建模則以 COMSOL Multiphysics 的流體力學模擬，在 50 至 400 rpm、涵蓋地球、火星、月球與航行期重力的條件下，比較三種轉子幾何的氣泡去向、空氣分布與漩渦深度。","dataviz":"The dry-lab page is an interactive model map: a scheme of the three chassis plus the cyanobacterial supplier where every label is a clickable result, and a 'TRY ME' prompt tells the reader to select a label to open that finding and jump to the section that develops it. Each result is also stated as a one-line claim before any plot ('Induction window: 6.5 to 7 h', 'Knockouts do nothing', 'Capping growth triples sucrose export'), with headline deltas as large-type stat tiles (3.4x, -46% vs -82%, 13x, 2 reactions). Table 1 is the most unusual piece of visualisation discipline on any of these wikis: for every link between models it states what is actually passed between them and labels the link Modeled, Identified or Assumed, so the reader can see exactly where the chain is evidence and where it is an assumption. The hardware page carries an animated 3D walkthrough of the purification sequence in its carry case, labelled 'illustrative flow, not measured data', and a live simulation of the bioreactor's touchscreen dashboard where the reader can drag the motor-speed dial and change temperature and pH setpoints. CFD results are shown as four-gravity comparison panels. All stat tiles and dashboards are reader-operable rather than screenshots.","dataviz_zh":"乾實驗頁面是一張互動式的模型地圖：一張涵蓋三種底盤加藍綠菌供養者的示意圖，其中每個標籤都是可點選的結果，而一句「TRY ME」提示讀者點選標籤即可展開該項發現並跳到闡述它的章節。每一項結果在任何圖表之前都先以一行主張陳述（「誘導時間窗：6.5 至 7 小時」、「基因剔除毫無作用」、「限制生長使蔗糖輸出變成三倍」），關鍵的變化量則以大字級統計方塊呈現（3.4 倍、-46% 對 -82%、13 倍、2 個反應）。表 1 是這批 wiki 中最不尋常的一項視覺化紀律：對每一個模型之間的連結，它都載明兩者之間實際傳遞的是什麼，並把該連結標示為已建模、已查定或假設，讓讀者精確看出這條鏈在哪裡是證據、在哪裡只是假設。硬體頁面附有一段攜行箱內純化流程的 3D 動畫導覽，並標註「僅為示意流程，非量測資料」，另有一個生物反應器觸控螢幕儀表板的即時模擬，讀者可以拖曳馬達轉速旋鈕並更改溫度與 pH 設定值。流體力學模擬結果以四種重力的對照面板呈現。所有統計方塊與儀表板都是讀者可操作的，而不是截圖。","datascience":"Measurement was designed as a framework rather than a set of assays: wild-type and Dsup-expressing B. subtilis, S. cerevisiae and P. pastoris were exposed to UV-C (0-30 mJ/cm2, and 0-300 J/m2 series) or X-rays (mock to 2000 Gy in 200 Gy steps) and read out four complementary ways (serial-dilution spot assay, OD600 time course, resazurin dye-reduction and FUN-1 staining), so a resistance claim has to survive four independent readouts rather than one. Three Dsup integration strains per host were compared against wild type and a nanobody control. On the engineering side the team derived a calibration mapping the analog voltage of a DFRobot SEN0189 turbidity sensor to NTU and then a linear OD600 = a(NTU) + b fit against reference spectrophotometer readings, following Fan et al. (2016) on Bacillus coagulans, which is what makes automatic IPTG induction at OD600 0.5 possible with no human in the loop. The modelling output is explicitly handed to the bench: a 'For the Wet Lab' box tells the experimenters where to start the co-culture and what growth cap to impose on the cyanobacteria.","datascience_zh":"量測是被設計成一套框架，而不是一組檢定：野生型與表現 Dsup 的 B. subtilis、S. cerevisiae 與 P. pastoris 分別暴露於 UV-C（0 至 30 mJ/cm2，以及 0 至 300 J/m2 兩個系列）或 X 光（由假照射到 2000 Gy，以 200 Gy 為間隔），並以四種互補方式判讀（序列稀釋點滴試驗、OD600 時間歷程、resazurin 染料還原法與 FUN-1 染色），因此一項抗性主張必須通過四種獨立判讀而不是只有一種。每個宿主各有三株 Dsup 整合菌株，與野生型以及一個奈米抗體對照相比較。工程面上，團隊推導出一條校正曲線，把 DFRobot SEN0189 濁度感測器的類比電壓對應到 NTU，再依參考分光光度計的讀值擬合出線性關係 OD600 = a(NTU) + b，做法沿用 Fan et al.（2016）在 Bacillus coagulans 上的方法，而這正是能在 OD600 達 0.5 時自動進行 IPTG 誘導、完全無需人為介入的關鍵。建模的輸出也明確交到實驗台上：一個「給濕實驗」方塊告訴實驗人員共培養該從哪裡起步，以及該對藍綠菌施加什麼樣的生長上限。","software":"No standalone released application, but the code is published: ODE models and GEM notebooks are linked from the model page, and the whole wiki plus hardware design lives at gitlab.igem.org/2026/kaust-ksa under CC BY 4.0. The hardware itself is the deliverable and is documented for reproduction: an Arduino Mega control stack with a touchscreen dashboard in a compact enclosure, closed-loop temperature (DS18B20 probe to heating elements), pH (DANOPLUS KIB-87 probe with signal-conditioning board to acid/base dispensing) and OD (turbidity sensor to IPTG induction), hollow structural supports routing all wiring, a filtration unit with user-selectable stages of decreasing pore size in gasketed modules (Kapton, paper, Acrodisc), syringe-pump buffer handling and affinity chromatography, all released with a Hardware User Manual, a Radiation Resistance Testing Handbook and a Protein Expression and AKTA Purification Handbook.","software_zh":"沒有獨立釋出的應用程式，但程式碼有公開：ODE 模型與 GEM 計算筆記本都由模型頁面連出，整個 wiki 連同硬體設計則放在 gitlab.igem.org/2026/kaust-ksa，採 CC BY 4.0 授權。硬體本身就是交付成果，並有完整的複製文件：一套 Arduino Mega 控制系統搭配置於小型機殼中的觸控螢幕儀表板、閉迴路的溫度控制（DS18B20 探針驅動加熱元件）、pH 控制（DANOPLUS KIB-87 探針搭配訊號調理板，驅動酸鹼加注）與 OD 控制（濁度感測器觸發 IPTG 誘導），中空的結構支柱負責走線，過濾單元採使用者可選擇、孔徑遞減的多段式帶墊圈模組（Kapton、濾紙、Acrodisc），另有注射泵式的緩衝液處理與親和層析；全部連同一本硬體使用手冊、一本抗輻射測試手冊與一本蛋白質表現與 AKTA 純化手冊一併釋出。","stack":["COBRA-style FBA on Yeast9, iBsu1147, iMS837 (iJB792 lineage)","scipy.integrate.solve_ivp (RK45)","Python / Jupyter notebooks","COMSOL Multiphysics (CFD)","Arduino Mega","DS18B20 temperature probe","DANOPLUS KIB-87 pH probe","DFRobot SEN0189 turbidity sensor","3D printing / CAD","Xstrahl X-ray irradiator","AKTA / HisTrap affinity chromatography","GitLab","React (wiki)"],"techniques":["genome-scale metabolic modelling and model curation (gap repair with literature-backed reactions)","anaerobic and oxygen-sweep constraint analysis","co-culture modelling by passing computed fluxes as uptake bounds","sequential nutrient co-limitation cascade","growth versus product-secretion trade-off (Pareto) analysis","in-silico knockout screening","ODE dynamic induction-timing optimisation with closed-form optimum","computational fluid dynamics across multiple gravity regimes","sensor calibration to OD600 for closed-loop autoinduction","four-readout radiation resistance characterisation","genomic integration of Dsup","Comet assay for DNA damage"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Engagement was built around a stated regional gap: synthetic biology is largely absent from secondary curricula in Saudi Arabia and the wider MENA region, and almost no learning resources exist in Arabic. The flagship is the Tawasol Initiative, a network uniting MENA iGEM teams through film, podcasts and social media specifically to reach Arabic speakers, run alongside a Tawasol Hackathon; it extended to a joint programme with NYU Abu Dhabi iGEM (28-30 August) and reached as far as Peru and Kazakhstan. Programmes are differentiated by audience: the Thuwal Science Pioneers Program brought middle and high school students onto the KAUST campus for a lecture with a before-and-after knowledge check, a 'design your own microbe to help astronauts' activity, tours of the Nanofabrication and Robotics core labs, and lunch with the team; a trip to Zahrat Al Sahra International School 80 km south reached 58 middle schoolers; a KAUST Summer Mentorship Program is paired with Oboor (Arabic for 'transition'), a university-adaptation programme for Saudi students built with a counselling-psychology researcher at Umm Al-Qura University; a farmer-facing course trains youth volunteers who then teach rural farmers; and family-facing 'Copy-Paste Plants' booths and science movie nights ran for the wider community, with just over two thirds of the film audience staying for the discussion. One standout artefact is a bilingual illustrated dialogue between two young Peruvian students working through whether a CRISPR edit of a plant's own gene is a Living Modified Organism under Peru's Law 31.111 moratorium or exempt under Ministerial Resolution D000068-2026-MINAM-DM of April 2026, a genuinely difficult regulatory distinction turned into a readable comic.","publicEngagement_zh":"推廣工作建立在一個明確指出的區域落差上：合成生物學在沙烏地阿拉伯以及更廣的 MENA 地區的中學課綱中幾乎不存在，而阿拉伯語的學習資源也幾乎沒有。旗艦計畫是 Tawasol Initiative，一個以影片、播客與社群媒體串連 MENA 各 iGEM 團隊、專門面向阿拉伯語使用者的網路，並同時舉辦 Tawasol Hackathon；它後來延伸成與 NYU Abu Dhabi iGEM 的聯合計畫（8 月 28 至 30 日），影響範圍遠達秘魯與哈薩克。各項方案依受眾區分：Thuwal Science Pioneers Program 把國中與高中生帶進 KAUST 校園，進行一場附前後測知識檢核的講座、一個「設計你自己的微生物來幫助太空人」活動、參訪奈米製造與機器人核心實驗室，並與團隊共進午餐；一趟前往 80 公里外南方 Zahrat Al Sahra International School 的行程觸及 58 位國中生；KAUST Summer Mentorship Program 則與 Oboor（阿拉伯語的「過渡」）搭配，那是一個為沙烏地學生設計、與 Umm Al-Qura University 一位諮商心理學研究者共同建立的大學適應方案；另有一門面向農民的課程，訓練青年志工再由他們去教導偏鄉農民；而面向家庭的「Copy-Paste Plants」攤位與科學電影之夜則服務更廣大的社群，電影觀眾中有略超過三分之二留下來參加討論。其中一項突出的產出，是一篇雙語圖文對話，由兩位秘魯年輕學生逐步推敲一個問題：以 CRISPR 編輯植物自身的基因，究竟算是秘魯第 31.111 號法律禁令下的活體改造生物，還是依 2026 年 4 月的部長決議 D000068-2026-MINAM-DM 獲得豁免，一個確實困難的法規區分被轉化成一則讀得下去的漫畫。","ihp":"Over 30 activities and 15 named conversations, and the wiki is explicit that seven parts of SHIHAB changed, with an interactive map letting the reader pick either a person or a component. The team built their own ORBIT framework (Observe, Reach, Build, Iterate, Translate) and four values (autonomy, adaptability, responsibility, accessibility). Documented changes: Dr. Christopher E. Mason's feedback made Dsup one of the protective genes in the chassis-engineering strategy and added the Comet assay to the experimental workflow; Konstantinos Vergos and Dr. Akshay Chandrashekhar converged on microgravity as a mandatory part of validation, which is why the COMSOL simulations exist (as a precursor to parabolic flight); Sarah Al Harbi's point about crew supervision load produced the dry-lab monitoring dashboard and shaped the hardware; KAUST Health, Safety and Environment directly wrote the structure of the Safety Handbook (hazard identification, risk assessment, containment failure, accidental exposure, environmental release, emergency response) and shaped the Hardware manual; a regulatory expert pushed them to prioritise therapeutics by the conditions astronauts actually face on specific missions rather than by ease of production, which is how Spaceflight-Associated Neuro-ocular Syndrome and carcinogenesis entered the payload list; and conversations with humanitarian responders Rachel Kessler and Jonathan Grant replaced a generic 'disaster zone' use case with a stated principle, design for a specific context, not an abstract disaster zone. The project also started on oxygen production and moved to therapeutics after team and PI discussion, with the earlier adviser's emphasis on automation, monitoring, product quality and space-relevant validation carried over. Astronaut Rayyanah Barnawi and Starr Corbin informed the astronaut-facing requirements; the Tawasol Hackathon surfaced three governance priorities (remote quality assurance, operational accountability, healthcare integration).","ihp_zh":"超過 30 項活動與 15 場具名對話，而 wiki 明白指出 SHIHAB 有七個部分因此改變，並以一張互動地圖讓讀者從「人」或「元件」任一側切入查看。團隊自建了 ORBIT 框架（Observe、Reach、Build、Iterate、Translate）與四項價值（自主性、適應性、責任、可及性）。有紀錄的改變包括：Dr. Christopher E. Mason 的回饋使 Dsup 成為底盤改造策略中的保護基因之一，並把彗星試驗（Comet assay）加進實驗流程；Konstantinos Vergos 與 Dr. Akshay Chandrashekhar 不約而同認為微重力是驗證中必要的一環，這正是那些 COMSOL 模擬存在的原因（作為拋物線飛行的前置工作）；Sarah Al Harbi 關於組員監看負擔的意見，催生了乾實驗的監測儀表板並形塑了硬體；KAUST 的健康、安全與環境部門直接寫定了安全手冊的結構（危害辨識、風險評估、圍阻失效、意外暴露、環境釋出、緊急應變），也形塑了硬體手冊；一位法規專家促使他們依太空人在特定任務中實際面對的病症、而不是依生產難易度來排定治療標的的優先順序，太空飛行相關神經眼症候群與致癌風險因此進入酬載清單；而與人道救援工作者 Rachel Kessler 和 Jonathan Grant 的對話，則讓原本籠統的「災區」使用情境被一條明確原則取代，也就是為特定情境設計，而不是為一個抽象的災區設計。這個專案最初做的是氧氣生產，在團隊與 PI 討論後才轉向治療用途，而先前顧問對自動化、監測、產品品質與太空相關驗證的強調則延續了下來。太空人 Rayyanah Barnawi 與 Starr Corbin 提供了面向太空人的需求意見；Tawasol Hackathon 則浮現出三項治理優先事項（遠端品質保證、操作問責、醫療體系整合）。","realWorld":"Two application contexts are carried in parallel and the second was added because of stakeholder input: space missions, and remote or disaster-affected settings with disrupted medicine supply chains, each treated as a specific deployment context rather than one generic 'remote healthcare' market. The continuation plan is staged as a roadmap, beginning with demonstrating small-scale biomanufacturing in Low Earth Orbit and evaluating production under microgravity and space radiation, with a long-term pathway developed out of conversations with Savi Glowe and industry contacts (Deep Space Biology, BIOASTRA). Practical adoptability is the strongest part of the case: the only manual step is loading the pill, the platform is designed for low power and low payload mass, and it is documented well enough for a non-specialist to run from the Hardware User Manual, which the team tested by setting the bioreactor and fluid-dispensing system up on a folding table in the desert dunes, far from any bench.","realWorld_zh":"兩個應用情境被並行推進，而第二個正是因為利害關係人意見才加入的：太空任務，以及藥品供應鏈中斷的偏遠或受災地區，兩者都被當成具體的部署情境處理，而不是合併成一個籠統的「偏遠醫療」市場。後續計畫以路線圖分階段編排，先在近地軌道示範小規模生物製造，並評估微重力與太空輻射下的生產表現，長期路徑則由與 Savi Glowe 及業界聯繫人（Deep Space Biology、BIOASTRA）的對話發展而成。這份論證最強的部分是實際的可採用性：唯一的人工步驟是放入藥丸，平台設計上耗電低、酬載質量小，而且文件完善到讓非專業人士也能照著硬體使用手冊操作；團隊為此做了實測，把生物反應器與流體加注系統架在沙漠沙丘的一張折疊桌上，遠離任何實驗台。","partners":["Rayyanah Barnawi (Saudi astronaut)","Starr Corbin","Dr. Christopher E. Mason, Weill Cornell Medicine","Prof. Alexandre Rosado, KAUST","Dr. Luis Zea","Konstantinos Vergos and Dr. Akshay Chandrashekhar","Kimberly Washington, Deep Space Biology","BIOASTRA","Savi Glowe","KAUST Health, Safety and Environment","Rachel Kessler and Jonathan Grant (humanitarian response)","NYU Abu Dhabi iGEM","Tawasol Initiative (MENA iGEM network)","Zahrat Al Sahra International School, Jeddah","Thuwal community schools","Renad Almalki, Umm Al-Qura University (Oboor programme)","StruBE Lab, KAUST"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6341/wiki/content/hardware/cfd-prototype-3.webp","caption":"COMSOL Multiphysics CFD of the third rotor concept (three rows of small tilted blades) at 200 rpm, comparing bubble fate under Earth, Mars, Moon and transit gravity: the simulation that selected the final rotor geometry.","caption_zh":"第三種轉子構想（三排小型傾斜葉片）在 200 rpm 下的 COMSOL Multiphysics 流體力學模擬，比較地球、火星、月球與航行期重力下的氣泡去向：這就是選定最終轉子幾何的那次模擬。","credit":"Team KAUST-KSA, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6341/wiki/content/hardware/final-bioreactor.avif","caption":"The built SHIHAB bioreactor: glass vessel with 3D-printed lid and rotor between two hollow supports carrying all wiring, heating band around the vessel, and the Arduino-driven touchscreen dashboard in the base.","caption_zh":"實際做出來的 SHIHAB 生物反應器：玻璃反應槽搭配 3D 列印的上蓋與轉子，置於兩根負責走線的中空支柱之間，槽身外圍包覆加熱帶，底座則是由 Arduino 驅動的觸控螢幕儀表板。","credit":"Team KAUST-KSA, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6341/wiki/content/hardware/desert-pic-1.avif","caption":"SHIHAB tested on desert dunes with a folding table and a laptop, putting the 'operable anywhere' claim to a field test rather than asserting it.","caption_zh":"SHIHAB 在沙漠沙丘上以一張折疊桌與一台筆電進行測試，把「在任何地方都能操作」這個說法拿去做實地檢驗，而不是光靠嘴上宣稱。","credit":"Team KAUST-KSA, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6341/wiki/content/public-engagement/copy-paste-plants-activity.avif","caption":"The Copy-Paste Plants activity at a family-facing community booth, part of an engagement programme built around the near-absence of synthetic biology from MENA school curricula and of Arabic-language resources.","caption_zh":"面向家庭的社區攤位上的 Copy-Paste Plants 活動，屬於一套針對「合成生物學在 MENA 學校課綱中幾乎不存在、阿拉伯語資源也幾乎沒有」而設計的推廣方案。","credit":"Team KAUST-KSA, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Steal Table 1: for every link between two models, write down what is actually passed and label it Modeled, Identified or Assumed. It costs one table and it immunises a student modelling chain against the usual criticism that the pieces were never really connected. Pair that with KAUST's four-readout rule (no resistance or phenotype claim unless it survives several independent assays) and the habit of ending each model section with a 'For the Wet Lab' instruction, so the dry lab visibly changes what gets done at the bench.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把表 1 學起來：對每一個模型與模型之間的連結，寫下實際被傳遞的究竟是什麼，並標示為已建模、已查定或假設。它只花一張表的成本，卻能讓學生團隊的建模鏈免受那個最常見的批評，也就是這些片段其實從未真正接起來。再搭配 KAUST 的四判讀規則（除非通過數項獨立檢定，否則不得宣稱任何抗性或表型），以及在每個模型章節結尾放一則「給濕實驗」指示的習慣，讓乾實驗明顯改變了實驗台上實際會做的事。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/kaust-ksa/","https://2026.igem.wiki/kaust-ksa/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/kaust-ksa/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/kaust-ksa/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/kaust-ksa/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/kaust-ksa/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/kaust-ksa/science-communication","https://2026.igem.wiki/kaust-ksa/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/kaust-ksa/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/kaust-ksa/safety-and-security"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳量測 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳硬體 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳太空專案 — 得主"],"rank":143},"6345":{"team":"BGI-College","id":"6345","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/bgi-college/","projectTitle":"BioH2","tagline":"A wild Clostridium isolated from a Guangdong wetland, made genetically tractable, then redesigned into a closed-loop biorefinery once the arithmetic killed hydrogen-only","summary":"BGI-College took Clostridium beijerinckii S63, a strain newly isolated from sediment at Yundonghai Wetland Park in Foshan, Guangdong (a site of interest because of unusually high natural soil hydrogen in the Sanshui Basin), and turned a non-model anaerobe into a working chassis. They sequenced it to a single circular 5,870,246 bp chromosome, measured 40.20 plus or minus 3.45 percent hydrogen in its gas output, built a metabolic flux model that identified PFOR and HydA overexpression plus thl deletion as targets, and established an electroporation transformation system through three documented DBTL cycles, two of which failed outright. Their economic check then did something unusual: it proved their own original premise impossible, since breaking even on glucose alone would need 6.70 mol H2 per mol glucose against a hard biochemical ceiling of 4.0, which forced a redesign around byproduct valorisation. They won Best Alternative Platform in the High School section and were nominated for Best New Basic Part and Best Presentation.","awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (High School)","Best Alternative Platform — Winner (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Explicit DBTL cycles used as the organising structure for platform development, each written as Design, Build and Test, then Learn, with the failed cycles kept in place. A metabolic flux framework integrating pathway stoichiometry, carbon allocation and electron transfer, released with a visual interface so non-modellers can use it. Hydrogen pathways benchmarked in a four-way comparison table (grey, blue, green, bio-green) on carbon footprint, levelised cost, supply-chain risk and commercial status.","dataviz":"Baseline versus engineered model runs shown side by side so the predicted yield change is legible, the full electroporation workflow drawn as a process diagram with voltages and buffers labelled, a parameter-sweep figure for the optimisation attempts, and, notably, photographs of the empty selective plates from the failed transformations alongside the successful ones. Field photographs of the wetland sampling site locate the strain in a real place.","datascience":"The modelling is used as a decision tool, not decoration: it put theoretical yield at 2.46 mol H2/mol glucose for wild type rising to 3.60 under an idealised engineered scenario, and the HPLC product profile (acetate and butyrate dominant, little lactate) is what selected thl as the deletion target rather than a generic guess. The economic model is the standout piece of quantitative reasoning: industrial glucose at about 3,000 RMB per tonne against hydrogen at 40 RMB per kg requires 6.70 mol H2 per mol glucose to cover feedstock alone, which exceeds the 4.0 mol theoretical maximum of dark fermentation, so a hydrogen-only business is arithmetically impossible. Genome work includes ANI above 98 percent against C. beijerinckii DSM 791 (GCF_018223745.1), phylogenetic placement, whole-genome alignment and VFDB virulence screening, published as a separate PDF.","software":"A visual interface over the metabolic flux model, built explicitly to lower the barrier for researchers who do not routinely do computational modelling.","stack":["Clostridium beijerinckii S63 (non-model anaerobe)","Bacillus subtilis 941","E. coli DH5-alpha","pNICKclos2.0 CRISPR editing vector","electroporation in an anaerobic chamber","whole-genome sequencing and annotation","ANI and phylogenetic analysis","VFDB","HPLC","gas chromatography"],"techniques":["electrocompetent cell preparation under strict anaerobiosis","electroporation at 1.8 kV in a 2 mm cuvette with erythromycin selection","CRISPR knockout design in Clostridium","native promoter plus CDS plus terminator part cloning from a wild isolate","dark fermentation with HPLC organic-acid tracking","secondary cultivation of B. subtilis on spent fermentation broth"],"frameworks_zh":"明確的 DBTL 循環被當作平台開發的組織結構，每一輪都寫成 Design、Build、Test 再加 Learn，失敗的循環也原樣保留。一個代謝通量框架整合途徑化學計量、碳流分配與電子傳遞，並附上視覺化介面發布，讓不做建模的人也能使用。氫氣製程則以四路比較表（灰氫、藍氫、綠氫、生物綠氫）在碳足跡、均化成本、供應鏈風險與商業化狀態上做基準比較。","dataviz_zh":"基準與工程化後的模型執行結果並排呈現，使預測產率的變化一眼可讀；完整的電穿孔流程畫成製程圖，電壓與緩衝液都標示清楚；最佳化嘗試有一張參數掃描圖；特別值得注意的是，失敗轉形所留下的空白選擇盤照片，與成功的照片並列。濕地採樣現場的照片把這株菌定位在一個真實的地方。","datascience_zh":"建模是當決策工具用的，不是裝飾：模型算出野生型的理論產率為 2.46 mol H2/mol glucose，在理想化的工程情境下升到 3.60；而 HPLC 的產物圖譜（以乙酸與丁酸為主，乳酸很少）正是選定 thl 作為剔除目標的依據，而不是隨便猜的。經濟模型是整份量化推理中最突出的一塊：工業級葡萄糖約每公噸 3,000 人民幣，氫氣每公斤 40 人民幣，光要打平原料成本就需要每莫耳葡萄糖產出 6.70 莫耳 H2，已超過暗發酵 4.0 莫耳的理論上限，因此只賣氫氣的生意在算術上不可能成立。基因組工作包括與 C. beijerinckii DSM 791（GCF_018223745.1）比對的 ANI 高於 98%、親緣關係定位、全基因組比對，以及 VFDB 毒力因子篩查，並另以 PDF 發表。","software_zh":"代謝通量模型之上加了一層視覺化介面，明確是為了降低不常做計算建模的研究者的門檻。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"","ihp":"Human practices was run as a test of the project's core assumption rather than as outreach. They consulted academic researchers and industrial practitioners including engineers at China General Nuclear Power (CGN), and report the difference in how the two groups framed the problem: academics asked whether the pathway was technically feasible and rigorous, industry asked what it would cost and whether it would scale. Industry input on hydrogen's transport and storage barriers, combined with their own break-even arithmetic, is what turned a hydrogen-only project into a closed-loop biorefinery. A second consultation was decisive technically: after two failed DBTL cycles, Dr. Youduo Wu of Dalian University of Technology told them to reconsider anaerobic handling across the whole workflow rather than keep tuning electroporation parameters, which led them to move the electroporator inside the anaerobic chamber and finally obtain transformants.","realWorld":"Three things here are worth copying, and the honesty running through all of them is the reason the platform is credible. First, the economics. Their break-even calculation is the single most useful piece of commercialisation reasoning in this cohort precisely because it falsifies their own premise: at roughly 3,000 RMB per tonne of industrial glucose and 40 RMB per kg of hydrogen, covering only the sugar feed needs 6.70 mol H2 per mol glucose, while dark fermentation cannot exceed 4.0 mol, so no amount of strain improvement makes a hydrogen-only product profitable. They state that plainly and redesign rather than hedge. The replacement model is coherent: HPLC confirmed the broth still holds organic acids after hydrogen evolution stops, so instead of paying for chemical waste disposal they use the spent broth as a free substrate to grow commercial Bacillus subtilis and sell it as a liquid biofertiliser, a secondary revenue stream that offsets the feedstock cost and sidesteps hydrogen storage and transport entirely. Note what is and is not claimed: they say the biofertiliser revenue 'substantially offsets' feedstock cost when scaled against raw material inputs, but publish no kit price, no biofertiliser price, no yield per litre of broth and no full P&L, so the loop is a validated concept with the unit economics still missing. There is no company, no patent and no investor. Second, the platform. What makes S63 genuinely reusable by other groups is that they published the route in, not just the destination: the full electroporation workflow with buffers, voltage and cuvette gap specified, the parameter sweep they tried (OD600 0.2 to 1.0, 600 to 1800 V, 100 to 400 microlitres, 1 and 2 mm cuvettes at fixed 200 ohms and 25 microfarads), photographs of the blank plates from both failed cycles, and the one change that actually worked. They also record a failure that did not resolve, stating that the Thl-targeting editing plasmid could not be assembled even though all four fragments amplified and sequenced correctly. Fifteen basic parts were cloned from S63 as native promoter plus CDS plus terminator triples across three HydA and two PFOR genes, which is the right format for a non-model host where heterologous regulatory elements may not work. The genome is published as a separate annotated report. And they label the limits precisely: the transformation system is 'an early-stage platform, rather than a fully optimised or universally reliable protocol', the model 'is not a validated predictor of experimentally achieved hydrogen production', and the oxygen hypothesis 'needs further controlled experiments' to confirm its specific contribution. Third, the safety reasoning, which is more sophisticated than most undergraduate work. The chassis was changed from C. butyricum to C. beijerinckii during an early safety review to avoid strain-dependent pathogenicity risk; they explicitly refuse to let a species-level BSL-1 classification (ATCC 35702) transfer to their own isolate, and instead confirm identity by ANI and phylogeny and screen against VFDB, while recording the correct caveat that a database match does not by itself show a functional virulence factor and that several hits were partial or low-coverage. They are candid that as high-school students they depend on instructors for safety decisions and authorised tasks, do not adjust gas-supply settings or gas-line connections themselves, and they report that three students failed the safety assessment on first attempt and had to re-sit before the team reached a 100 percent pass rate. Continuation is framed as community reuse: the model, the parts, the transformation protocol and the troubleshooting record are offered so that future dark-fermentation teams 'reuse our rationales, protocols, and lessons rather than repeat them'.","partners":["BGI Research (Dr. Yingshan Li, secondary PI; isolated and sequenced S63, ran the genome and virulence analyses and taught the team to interpret them)","Dr. Youduo Wu, Dalian University of Technology (diagnosed oxygen exposure as the transformation bottleneck)","China General Nuclear Power (CGN) engineers (cost and scale-up framing that drove the redesign)","Yundonghai Wetland Park, Foshan, Guangdong (environmental source of strain S63)"],"ihp_zh":"人類實踐是當作對專案核心假設的檢驗來做的，而不是當成對外推廣。他們諮詢了學術研究者與產業實務人士，包括中國廣核集團（CGN）的工程師，並報告兩群人框定問題的方式有何不同：學者問這條途徑在技術上是否可行、是否嚴謹；業界問它要花多少錢、能不能放大。產業方面關於氫氣運輸與儲存障礙的意見，加上他們自己的損益兩平算術，正是把一個只做氫氣的專案轉成閉環生物精煉廠的原因。第二場諮詢在技術上具決定性：在兩個 DBTL 循環失敗之後，大連理工大學的 Dr. Youduo Wu 要他們重新檢視整條流程的厭氧操作，而不是繼續調電穿孔參數；他們因此把電穿孔儀搬進厭氧操作箱內，終於得到轉形株。","realWorld_zh":"這裡有三件事值得學，而貫穿三者的誠實，正是這個平台可信的原因。第一是經濟性。他們的損益兩平計算是本屆最有用的一段商業化推理，正因為它推翻了自己的前提：工業級葡萄糖約每公噸 3,000 人民幣、氫氣每公斤 40 人民幣，光要打平糖源成本就需要每莫耳葡萄糖 6.70 莫耳 H2，而暗發酵無法超過 4.0 莫耳，因此不論菌株改良到什麼程度，只賣氫氣的產品都無法獲利。他們把這點直說，然後重新設計，而不是打迷糊仗。替代的商業模式是自洽的：HPLC 證實氫氣停止產生後，培養液中仍留有有機酸，於是他們不去付化學廢棄物處理費，而是把發酵後的培養液當成免費基質來培養商用 Bacillus subtilis，再以液態生物肥料出售；這條次級收入既抵掉原料成本，也完全避開氫氣的儲存與運輸問題。要注意他們主張了什麼、沒主張什麼：他們說生物肥料的收入在對比原料投入放大後能「大幅抵銷」原料成本，但沒有公布套組價格、生物肥料價格、每公升培養液的產量，也沒有完整損益表，因此這個閉環是一個已驗證的概念，但單位經濟仍然缺席。沒有公司、沒有專利、也沒有投資人。第二是平台。讓 S63 真的能被其他團隊重複使用的原因，是他們發表了進入的路徑而不只是終點：完整的電穿孔流程，緩衝液、電壓與電穿孔槽間距都寫明；他們試過的參數掃描（OD600 0.2 至 1.0、600 至 1800 V、100 至 400 微升、1 mm 與 2 mm 電穿孔槽，電阻固定 200 歐姆、電容 25 微法拉）；兩次失敗循環的空白培養盤照片；以及真正奏效的那一個改動。他們也記下一個始終沒解決的失敗：針對 Thl 的編輯質體始終組不起來，儘管四個片段都成功增幅且定序正確。他們從 S63 選殖出 15 個基本零件，形式是原生啟動子加 CDS 加終止子的三件組，涵蓋三個 HydA 與兩個 PFOR 基因；對一個異源調控元件可能無法運作的非模式宿主而言，這正是對的格式。基因組另以一份帶註解的報告發表。限制也標示得很精準：轉形系統是「早期階段的平台，而不是已完全最佳化或普遍可靠的流程」；模型「並不是實驗所達成氫氣產量的已驗證預測工具」；而關於氧氣的假說「還需要進一步的對照實驗」才能確認其具體貢獻。第三是生物安全的推理，比多數大學部的工作更細緻。底盤在早期安全審查中從 C. butyricum 改為 C. beijerinckii，以避免因菌株而異的致病性風險；他們明確拒絕把物種層級的 BSL-1 分類（ATCC 35702）直接套到自己的分離株上，而是以 ANI 與親緣關係確認身分，並對 VFDB 做篩查，同時記下正確的保留意見：資料庫比對到並不等於存在具功能的毒力因子，而且其中幾個命中只是部分比對或覆蓋率偏低。他們也坦白身為高中生，安全決策與可執行的任務都倚賴指導老師，氣體供應設定與氣路接頭不由自己調整；並且報告有三位學生第一次安全評量未通過、必須重考，團隊才達到 100% 通過率。後續則定位為社群再利用：模型、零件、轉形流程與除錯紀錄都提供出來，好讓未來做暗發酵的團隊「重複使用我們的推理、流程與教訓，而不是重複經歷一遍」。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6345/wiki/assets/alternative-platform/fig3.avif","caption":"The electroporation transformation workflow established for Clostridium beijerinckii S63, published with buffers, voltage and cuvette gap specified so another group can reproduce it","credit":"Team BGI-College, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"為 Clostridium beijerinckii S63 建立的電穿孔轉形流程，發表時寫明緩衝液、電壓與電穿孔槽間距，讓其他團隊能夠重現"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6345/wiki/assets/alternative-platform/fig4.avif","caption":"Published evidence of failure: blank erythromycin selective plates from the first transformation attempt, kept on the wiki alongside the eventual success","credit":"Team BGI-College, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"公開發表的失敗證據：第一次轉形嘗試所得的空白紅黴素選擇盤，與最終成功的結果一併留在 wiki 上"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6345/wiki/assets/alternative-platform/fig5.avif","caption":"The electroporation parameter sweep across cell density, voltage, competent-cell volume and cuvette gap that still did not yield transformants, before the anaerobic-chamber redesign","credit":"Team BGI-College, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"在改成厭氧操作箱內作業之前，橫跨細胞密度、電壓、勝任細胞體積與電穿孔槽間距的電穿孔參數掃描，仍然沒有得到轉形株"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6345/wiki/assets/contribution/fig2.avif","caption":"Model-guided engineering run showing the theoretical hydrogen yield change from PFOR and HydA overexpression with thl deletion, shown against the wild-type baseline","credit":"Team BGI-College, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"模型導引的工程化執行結果，顯示 PFOR 與 HydA 過量表現加上 thl 剔除所帶來的理論氫氣產率變化，並與野生型基準對照"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Run the break-even arithmetic against the biochemical ceiling before committing a year of lab work: BGI-College showed a hydrogen-only product needs 6.70 mol H2 per mol glucose while dark fermentation caps at 4.0, which killed their premise early and forced a byproduct-valorisation design that actually closes. And when publishing a platform for a non-model chassis, publish the failed cycles too — the parameter sweep that did nothing, the photographs of blank plates, the plasmid that would never assemble — because the route in is what another lab needs, not the destination.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/bgi-college/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bgi-college/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bgi-college/alternative-platform/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bgi-college/contribution/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bgi-college/safety-and-security/","https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6345/wiki/assets/alternative-platform/genome-analysis-of-s63.pdf"],"projectTitle_zh":"BioH2","tagline_zh":"一株從廣東濕地分離出的野生 Clostridium，被改造成可做基因操作的宿主；當算術否決了只賣氫氣這條路之後，整個專案又被重新設計成閉環生物精煉廠","summary_zh":"BGI-College 取用 Clostridium beijerinckii S63——一株新分離自廣東佛山雲東海濕地公園底泥的菌株（該地之所以受注意，是因為三水盆地的天然土壤氫含量異常高）——把一株非模式厭氧菌變成能用的底盤。他們把它定序到單一環狀染色體 5,870,246 bp，量得氣體產物中氫氣含量為 40.20 加減 3.45%，建立代謝通量模型並據以指出 PFOR 與 HydA 過量表現加上 thl 剔除為工程目標，並經由三個有完整記錄的 DBTL 循環（其中兩個徹底失敗）建立電穿孔轉形系統。他們的經濟性檢核接著做了一件不尋常的事：它證明了自己最初的前提不可能成立——若只靠葡萄糖要達到損益兩平，每莫耳葡萄糖需產生 6.70 莫耳 H2，而生化上的硬上限是 4.0，這迫使他們圍繞副產物加值利用重新設計。他們獲得高中組的 Best Alternative Platform，並入圍 Best New Basic Part 與 Best Presentation。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"在投入一年的實驗工作之前，先把損益兩平的算術拿去對照生化上限：BGI-College 證明只賣氫氣的產品需要每莫耳葡萄糖 6.70 莫耳 H2，而暗發酵的上限是 4.0，這及早否決了他們的前提，逼出一個真的能收攏的副產物加值設計。而當你要為非模式底盤發表一個平台時，也請把失敗的循環一起發表——那個毫無效果的參數掃描、空白培養盤的照片、那個始終組不起來的質體——因為別的實驗室需要的是進得去的路，而不是終點。","awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳替代平台 — 得主（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":40},"6350":{"team":"Marburg","id":"6350","section":"Overgrad","country":"Germany","village":"Alternative Platform","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/marburg/","projectTitle":"CLiPPR - Chloroplast Library for inducible PPRs","projectTitle_zh":"CLiPPR——可誘導 PPR 的葉綠體元件庫（Chloroplast Library for inducible PPRs）","tagline":"Making the chloroplast switchable: inducible designer PPR proteins paired with synthetic 5'UTRs","tagline_zh":"讓葉綠體變成可開關的：把可誘導的訂製 PPR 蛋白與合成 5'UTR 配對使用","summary":"Chloroplasts are arguably the cheapest protein factories available (around 90% of global primary production, up to 70% of a plant cell's protein as transgenic product, linear rather than capital-intensive scaling), but they lack the one tool microbial hosts have: inducibility, so growth and production compete permanently and a toxic product means no plant at all. CLiPPR outsources that inducibility to the nucleus: nuclear-encoded, inducibly expressed synthetic pentatricopeptide repeat proteins are imported into the plastid, where they bind matched synthetic 5'UTRs placed upstream of a chloroplast gene and switch translation up or down by three mechanisms (blocking the start codon, protecting an unstable 5'UTR from exonucleases, or resolving a hairpin over the ribosome binding site). The team designed 30 fully synthetic 5'UTRs de novo, produced, purified and tested 19 new-to-nature PPR proteins, reported the highest transgene expression yet recorded in a chloroplast in vitro, and validated across three systems of rising complexity: chloroplast cell-free extract, Chlamydomonas reinhardtii, and Nicotiana benthamiana. It won Best Alternative Platform and was nominated for Part Collection, Education, Presentation, Wiki and Foundational Advance.","summary_zh":"葉綠體可說是現有最便宜的蛋白質工廠（占全球初級生產約 90%，轉殖產物可達植物細胞蛋白質的 70%，放大是線性而非資本密集），但它缺少微生物宿主早就有的那一項工具：可誘導性，因此生長與生產永遠在互相競爭，而一個有毒的產物就等於根本長不出植物。CLiPPR 把這份可誘導性外包給細胞核：由細胞核編碼、可誘導表現的合成五肽重複（PPR）蛋白被運入色素體，在那裡結合置於葉綠體基因上游的配對合成 5'UTR，並以三種機制把轉譯調高或調低（遮蔽起始密碼子、保護不穩定的 5'UTR 不被外切酶分解，或解開蓋在核糖體結合位上的髮夾結構）。團隊從頭設計了 30 條完全合成的 5'UTR，生產、純化並測試了 19 個自然界中不存在的 PPR 蛋白，報告出葉綠體體外至今最高的轉殖基因表現量，並在三個複雜度遞增的系統中驗證：葉綠體無細胞萃取液、Chlamydomonas reinhardtii 與 Nicotiana benthamiana。它拿下最佳替代平台獎，並獲元件集合、教育、簡報、wiki 與基礎進展等提名。","awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Part Collection — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Alternative Platform — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Education — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Foundational Advance Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"The computational work is sequence and assembly engineering rather than structure prediction, and it is tightly coupled to a hard constraint: PPRs are long tandem repeats, and the high GC content of the C. reinhardtii nuclear genome makes conventional gene synthesis of those repetitive stretches expensive or impossible, which is what forced an organism-specific toolbox instead of ordering full coding sequences. Adapting the published GRASP Golden Gate toolbox (Dennis et al. 2025, consensus S-type repeats with a programmable PPR code, 42 level-1 modules assembling 9-, 14- and 19-nt binders) from E. coli to Chlamydomonas meant codon-optimising every module, which shifts the Golden Gate fusion sites and therefore changes assembly fidelity and module boundaries, a set of interdependent decisions the team first worked through by hand. They placed the new fusion sites inside the ARELF motif (the most variable codons in the repeat, giving the largest overhang pool), pulled C. reinhardtii codon usage from the Kazusa table, excluded every codon below 50% relative abundance among the most abundantly expressed proteins, searched the remaining ARELF translations for overhang sets, and scored candidates with the NEB ligase fidelity calculator against a target above 75%, first running the original GRASP level 0 and level 1 overhangs through the same calculator to get a baseline on the same scale rather than comparing a prediction against a published measurement. B- and D-modules were intronized per Baier et al., offered with and without the LHCBM1i2 intron. Binding was validated biophysically by fluorescence polarisation to extract dissociation constants, with one optimised PPR reaching a Kd among the best in the literature.","frameworks_zh":"運算工作做的是序列與組裝工程、而非結構預測，而且與一項硬性限制緊緊相扣：PPR 是長串的串聯重複序列，而 C. reinhardtii 核基因組的高 GC 含量使這些重複片段的常規基因合成變得昂貴或根本不可行，這才迫使他們做出一套針對該物種的工具箱、而不是直接訂購完整的編碼序列。要把已發表的 GRASP Golden Gate 工具箱（Dennis 等人 2025 年，採用共有序列的 S 型重複、具可程式化的 PPR 密碼，共 42 個第一層模組，可組裝 9、14 與 19 nt 的結合子）從 E. coli 移到 Chlamydomonas，就必須對每個模組做密碼子最佳化，而這會移動 Golden Gate 的融合位點、因而改變組裝保真度與模組邊界——這一組互相牽動的決策，團隊最初是用手工一步步推出來的。他們把新的融合位點放在 ARELF 基序內（該重複中變異最大的密碼子，可提供最大的黏端選擇池），從 Kazusa 表取得 C. reinhardtii 的密碼子使用頻率，排除在表現量最高的蛋白質中相對豐度低於 50% 的所有密碼子，再在剩下的 ARELF 轉譯可能性中搜尋黏端組合，並以 NEB 連接酶保真度計算器對超過 75% 的目標值評分；他們還先把原始 GRASP 的第 0 層與第 1 層黏端也跑過同一個計算器，以在同一個尺度上取得基準線，而不是拿一個預測值去比對一份已發表的實測值。B 與 D 模組依 Baier 等人的做法加入內含子，並提供含與不含 LHCBM1i2 內含子的兩種版本。結合能力以螢光偏極法做生物物理驗證、求出解離常數，其中一個最佳化後的 PPR 的 Kd 達到文獻中數一數二的水準。","dataviz":"The wiki is unusually honest and unusually readable. Every page carries a per-page inventory in the subtitle ('7 sections / 17 pictures / 10 references'), a key-achievements list before any narrative, and a scroll progress indicator themed as a PPR walking along its binding sites ('PPR Bound Site 1 / 8'), with a Reinhardt mascot reacting to the content. Negative results are given the same prominence as positive ones: the XRN-1 titration and pair screening are reported as showing the nuclease is barely active under the chosen conditions, with the reason stated (room temperature and a buffer chosen to keep the chloroplast extract working rather than to keep the nuclease happy), followed by the redesigned assay that removed the extract and the translation step entirely; the semi-automated purification is reported as robust and reproducible but too low-yielding, with a recommendation about which other teams it would still suit. The Chlamydomonas screen reports that only a handful of mNeonGreen-positive transformants were usable because of their transplastomic background. The software is published as form-driven Colab notebooks with a 'click to explore our tools' interface, and the codon-usage comparison is given as a full 64-codon table with per-codon percentage-point differences between C. reinhardtii and E. coli rather than a summary statistic.","dataviz_zh":"這份 wiki 既異常誠實、也異常好讀。每一頁的副標題都附上該頁的清單（「7 個段落／17 張圖／10 篇參考文獻」）、在任何敘述之前先列出關鍵成果，並有一條以 PPR 沿著其結合位點行走為主題的捲動進度指示（「PPR Bound Site 1 / 8」），還有一個 Reinhardt 吉祥物會依內容做出反應。負面結果與正面結果被給予同等的篇幅位置：XRN-1 的滴定與配對篩選被報告為顯示該核酸酶在所選條件下幾乎沒有活性，並說明原因（室溫，以及為了讓葉綠體萃取液保持運作、而不是為了讓核酸酶舒服所選的緩衝液），接著是重新設計的試驗，把萃取液與轉譯步驟完全移除；半自動化純化則被報告為穩健且可重現，但產率太低，並附上建議說明它對哪些其他隊伍仍然適用。Chlamydomonas 的篩選則報告，因為轉殖色素體的背景，只有少數幾株 mNeonGreen 陽性的轉殖株可用。軟體以表單驅動的 Colab 筆記本形式發布，搭配一個「點這裡探索我們的工具」介面，而密碼子使用頻率的比較則以完整的 64 密碼子表呈現，逐一列出 C. reinhardtii 與 E. coli 之間的百分點差異，而不是給一個總結統計量。","datascience":"The characterisation campaign is a throughput argument. Building and testing a library of this size by hand was not feasible, so three automation technologies were made integral to the experimental design rather than bolted on. An Echo 525 acoustic liquid handler, programmed with the PyEcho script, assembled all large assays (the largest replacing 868 final pipetting steps per replicate) and, by dispensing 25 nl droplets, allowed reaction volumes to be cut to a quarter of the 10 ul manual minimum, which both saved purified PPR protein and removed the pipetting inaccuracy inherent in sub-0.5 ul manual additions; planning the plate layout in software also made reagent demand calculable in advance (including when to buy expensive XRN-1), made pipetting-scheme errors catchable before they happened, and cut run-to-run variance because a 384-well plate is assembled in under five minutes rather than over an hour of reagents sitting out of the freezer. The BMG Clariostar autoinjector dispensed furimazine for the NanoLuc reporter at an identical incubation time every run, measurably lowering standard deviation against manual addition. A 96-well semi-automated protein purification workflow adapted from the Baker Lab protocol combined IMAC and automated size-exclusion chromatography so purification and characterisation happened in one run.","datascience_zh":"整個特性分析工作是一項關於通量的論證。要用手工建出並測試這個規模的元件庫並不可行，因此三項自動化技術被納入實驗設計的核心、而不是事後加掛。一台以 PyEcho 腳本控制的 Echo 525 聲波液體處理器組裝了所有大型試驗（其中最大的一項，每個重複取代了 868 個最終吸量步驟），而且因為它分配的是 25 nl 液滴，反應體積得以縮到人工 10 ul 下限的四分之一，這既省下純化好的 PPR 蛋白，也排除了人工加入 0.5 ul 以下體積時固有的吸量誤差；用軟體規劃盤面配置也讓試劑需求可以事先算出（包括何時該採購昂貴的 XRN-1）、讓吸量方案的錯誤在發生前就能被抓到，並降低批次間變異，因為一塊 384 孔盤可以在五分鐘內組裝完成，而不是讓試劑在冷凍庫外放一個多小時。BMG Clariostar 的自動注射器在每次執行時都以完全相同的孵育時間注入 furimazine 給 NanoLuc 報告系統，相較人工加入可量測地降低了標準差。另有一套改寫自 Baker Lab 規程的 96 孔半自動蛋白質純化流程，把 IMAC 與自動化粒徑篩析層析結合起來，使純化與特性分析在同一次執行中完成。","software":"PPR-opt, released as two form-driven Google Colab notebooks that run entirely remotely with no local install: PPR-opt Designer builds a PPR for a single target RNA sequence in a chosen host organism, and PPR-opt Inventory generates a whole GRASP-style toolbox able to clone every possible PPR for that organism. It automates the process the team first did manually: codon-optimising each PPR module for the target organism and redistributing the Golden Gate module boundaries accordingly. The team states plainly that all outputs are software predictions not yet experimentally validated, and that so far one PPR from the resulting Chlamy-GRASP toolbox has been successfully transformed into the C. reinhardtii nucleus. Alongside it they published the first PPR parts collection in the iGEM Registry: matched sets of synthetic 5'UTRs and their corresponding PPR proteins with sequence information, functional descriptions and characterisation data, plus the Chlamy-GRASP level 0 and level 1 modules; the wiki repository is gitlab.igem.org/2026/marburg.","software_zh":"PPR-opt 以兩個表單驅動的 Google Colab 筆記本釋出，完全在遠端執行、不需本機安裝：PPR-opt Designer 為指定宿主生物中的單一標的 RNA 序列建構一個 PPR，而 PPR-opt Inventory 則生成一整套 GRASP 式的工具箱，足以選殖該物種所有可能的 PPR。它把團隊最初手工完成的工作自動化：為標的生物對每個 PPR 模組做密碼子最佳化，並相應重新分配 Golden Gate 的模組邊界。團隊直白說明所有輸出都是軟體預測、尚未經實驗驗證，且目前為止由所得 Chlamy-GRASP 工具箱產出的 PPR 中，有一個已成功轉殖進 C. reinhardtii 的細胞核。除此之外，他們在 iGEM Registry 發表了第一個 PPR 元件集合：成對的合成 5'UTR 與其對應的 PPR 蛋白，附序列資訊、功能說明與特性分析資料，另有 Chlamy-GRASP 的第 0 層與第 1 層模組；wiki 程式庫在 gitlab.igem.org/2026/marburg。","stack":["Google Colab (form-driven notebooks)","GRASP Golden Gate PPR toolbox (Dennis et al. 2025)","Kazusa codon usage database","NEB ligase fidelity calculator","PyEcho (HN-lab)","Beckman Coulter Labcyte Echo 525 acoustic liquid handler","BMG Clariostar plate reader with autoinjector","automated size-exclusion chromatography / IMAC in 96-well format","NanoLuc / firefly luciferase / mNeonGreen reporters","fluorescence polarisation assay","iGEM Registry"],"techniques":["codon optimisation with fusion-site redistribution","Golden Gate overhang selection and fidelity prediction against a same-scale baseline","intronization for expression in C. reinhardtii","de novo synthetic 5'UTR design (30 UTRs)","three orthogonal PPR regulation mechanisms (blocking, exonuclease protection, hairpin resolution)","chloroplast cell-free extract screening","dissociation-constant determination by fluorescence polarisation","acoustic nanolitre liquid handling for 384-well assay assembly","automated substrate injection for reproducible luminescence","semi-automated parallel protein expression and purification","nuclear inducible/repressible promoter construction (estradiol, IPTG, rapamycin, MetE, THI4)"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Marburg's education work is explicitly meta: they did not just build activities, they studied how to build them, after their first Girls' Day event prompted the question of what happens once an event is over. They reviewed the literature, consulted 15 experts across education, science communication and evaluation research, and found that existing iGEM documentation covers how outreach was organised but almost never how to ground it in theory or evaluate it beyond whether participants enjoyed it. Four outputs followed. A curriculum-aligned Teaching Toolbox ('Die CLiPPR Toolbox'), co-designed with education experts and aligned to the four German KMK national competency domains, tested with seven teachers at three schools and revised on their feedback. Plasmid Panic, an escape game playable by anyone over 12 with no scientific background, distributed through schools and with iGEM Patras in English and German. A SciComm and Evaluation Guide written specifically for future iGEM teams, covering how to set goals, pick evaluation methods and feed findings back. And a documented Evidence and Feedback process, published so others can see not only what was made but why, what changed and what was learned. Three expert quotations frame the whole approach: 'Reach is not impact, and satisfaction is not learning' (Dorothee Menhart), and 'Why are we communicating, and why should people care?' (Dr. Sascha Vogel).","publicEngagement_zh":"Marburg 的教育工作明確是後設層次的：他們不只是做活動，而是研究如何做活動——起因是他們第一場 Girls' Day 活動讓他們開始問，活動結束之後會留下什麼。他們回顧文獻、諮詢了教育、科學傳播與評量研究領域共 15 位專家，發現既有的 iGEM 文件大多記錄科普活動是怎麼辦的，卻幾乎從不說明如何奠基於理論、或如何做出「參與者是否玩得開心」以外的評量。由此產出四項成果。一套對齊課綱的教學工具箱（「Die CLiPPR Toolbox」），與教育專家共同設計、對齊德國 KMK 的四大國家能力領域，在三所學校與七位教師試用後依其回饋修訂。Plasmid Panic，一款 12 歲以上、無須科學背景即可玩的密室逃脫遊戲，透過學校發送，並與 iGEM Patras 合作推出英語與德語版。一份專為未來 iGEM 隊伍撰寫的《SciComm and Evaluation Guide》，涵蓋如何設定目標、挑選評量方法與把發現回饋到設計中。以及一套有完整紀錄的證據與回饋流程，公開發布，讓他人不只看到做了什麼，也看到為什麼做、改了什麼、學到什麼。三句專家引言框住了整套做法：「觸及數不是影響力，滿意度不是學習」（Dorothee Menhart），以及「我們為什麼要傳播，而人們又為什麼該在意？」（Dr. Sascha Vogel）。","ihp":"45 stakeholders, organised by the six application domains the technology touches (scientific impact, agriculture, space, molecular farming, environment and sustainability, law and regulations) rather than by job title, and the design changes are specific and attributed. Dr. Silvia Ramundo rejected the team's original plan to base the 'resolving' 5'UTR on Prikyl et al., where the hairpin the PPR resolves also contains the ribosome binding site, and recommended a design in which the PPR site and the RBS are locally disconnected so the PPR cannot interfere with ribosome binding; the team adapted to the Rojas et al. 2019 binding mechanism as a result. Prof. Ralph Bock (Max Planck Institute of Molecular Plant Physiology, a pioneer of chloroplast transformation) strongly advised dropping variable RBS testing and sticking to his validated Shine-Dalgarno sequence for predictable chloroplast translation, which they did. Prof. Alison Smith's input led them to combine two well-established repressible parts, the MetE and THI4 promoters, in one construct specifically to minimise leakiness, after Dr. Reimo Zoschke identified leakiness as the real unsolved problem ('what remains problematic are tight systems'). Tania Ryzhkova and another adviser steered characterisation away from an EMSA toward a fluorescence polarisation assay and then advised on RNase-free practice, labelled-RNA design, protein concentration ranges and controls, and on the analysis. An interview with an explosives-degradation expert made them realise phytoremediation bottlenecks come from pollutant kinetics and bioavailability rather than chloroplast gene timing, so they dropped that application. Prof. Yuri Gleba supplied the economic case (recombinant protein from plants at around 100 USD per kilogram; plants scale linearly while fermentation requires buying the next-size bioreactor), and Elena Lesch and Farley Kwok advised on testing in the 2021 Marburg chloroplast cell-free extracts rather than only E. coli, warning that such extracts are far less common than standard E. coli systems. On the education side, Prof. Malte Schwinger (educational psychology, Marburg) told them to use validated Likert-scale instruments instead of writing their own, and one evaluation expert advised against factual recall as the primary measure for the Teaching Toolbox.","ihp_zh":"45 位利害關係人，依這項技術所觸及的六個應用領域（科學影響、農業、太空、分子農業、環境與永續、法律與法規）分類、而不是依職稱，而設計上的改動都具體且有具名出處。Dr. Silvia Ramundo 否決了團隊原本要以 Prikyl 等人的研究為基礎來設計「解開型」5'UTR 的計畫，因為在那套設計裡 PPR 要解開的髮夾本身就包含核糖體結合位；她建議改用 PPR 位點與 RBS 在局部上彼此分離的設計，使 PPR 不會干擾核糖體結合；團隊因此改採 Rojas 等人 2019 年的結合機制。Prof. Ralph Bock（馬克斯普朗克分子植物生理學研究所，葉綠體轉殖的先驅）強烈建議放棄測試不同的 RBS，直接採用他已驗證的 Shine-Dalgarno 序列以取得可預期的葉綠體轉譯，團隊照辦。Prof. Alison Smith 的意見使他們把兩個成熟的可抑制元件 MetE 與 THI4 啟動子結合在同一個構築中，專門用來把洩漏降到最低；在此之前 Dr. Reimo Zoschke 已指出洩漏才是真正未解的問題（「仍然棘手的是夠緊的系統」）。Tania Ryzhkova 與另一位顧問把特性分析從 EMSA 導向螢光偏極試驗，並進一步在無 RNase 操作、標記 RNA 的設計、蛋白質濃度範圍與對照組，以及分析方法上提供建議。一場與爆裂物降解專家的訪談讓他們意識到植物復育的瓶頸來自污染物的動力學與生物可利用性、而不是葉綠體基因的時序，於是他們放棄了該應用。Prof. Yuri Gleba 提供了經濟面的論證（植物生產的重組蛋白每公斤約 100 美元；植物是線性放大，而發酵則必須買下一個尺寸的生物反應器），Elena Lesch 與 Farley Kwok 則建議在 2021 年 Marburg 的葉綠體無細胞萃取液中測試、而不只在 E. coli，並提醒這類萃取液遠不如標準 E. coli 系統普遍。在教育方面，Prof. Malte Schwinger（馬爾堡，教育心理學）要他們使用已驗證的李克特量表工具、而不是自己寫一套，而一位評量專家則建議不要把事實回憶當成教學工具箱的主要評量指標。","realWorld":"The team frames CLiPPR as enabling infrastructure for molecular farming rather than a product, and is candid that it is one of several missing pieces: chloroplast transformation is still not established in many plant species, selecting successful transformants is often as hard as making them, and the absence of post-translational processing limits which proteins can be made there. Fourteen molecular-farming stakeholders were interviewed on what integration would actually look like, covering compound classes, the advantages of stable transformants, inducer choice, production setup and regulation; Jess Bunchek and Dr. Don Stewart established that higher-plant molecular farming would realistically run in contained greenhouses rather than open fields. Containment is also a design argument, since in most higher plants the chloroplast is maternally inherited, so transgenes are not spread by pollen. Light-based induction via optogenetics was investigated with Lars Broker (PULSE system) because it costs nothing, leaves no residue, and is already applied by drone in modern agriculture, and is held as the most attractive long-term inducer from a safety standpoint. The five remaining application domains (agriculture, space, sustainability, law and regulation, scientific impact) each have their own analysis page, and the parts collection is the handover mechanism: documented, Registry-deposited, and intended for other teams doing organelle engineering and RNA-level regulation in plants.","realWorld_zh":"團隊把 CLiPPR 定位為分子農業的使能基礎設施、而不是一項產品，並坦白說明它只是數片缺失拼圖中的一片：葉綠體轉殖在許多植物物種上仍未建立，篩選成功的轉殖株往往和做出它們一樣困難，而缺乏轉譯後修飾也限制了哪些蛋白質能在那裡生產。他們訪談了 14 位分子農業的利害關係人，談整合實際上會是什麼樣子，涵蓋化合物類別、穩定轉殖株的優勢、誘導物的選擇、生產配置與法規；Jess Bunchek 與 Dr. Don Stewart 確立了高等植物的分子農業現實上會在封閉溫室、而不是露天田間進行。圍堵同時也是一項設計論點，因為在大多數高等植物中葉綠體是母系遺傳，轉殖基因不會透過花粉擴散。他們與 Lars Broker（PULSE 系統）一起研究了以光遺傳學為基礎的光誘導，因為它零成本、不留殘留，而且在現代農業中已可用無人機施作，並被視為從安全角度看最具吸引力的長期誘導方式。其餘五個應用領域（農業、太空、永續、法律與法規、科學影響）各有自己的分析頁面，而元件集合則是交接機制：有完整文件、存入 Registry，並預期供其他做胞器工程與植物 RNA 層級調控的隊伍使用。","partners":["Prof. Dr. Yuri Gleba (plant molecular farming)","Dr. Reimo Zoschke (chloroplast gene expression)","Prof. Dr. Ralph Bock, Max Planck Institute of Molecular Plant Physiology","Dr. Silvia Ramundo","Prof. Alison Smith","Prof. Dr. Ian Small / GRASP toolbox authors","Tania Ryzhkova, Philipps-Universitat Marburg","Elena Lesch and Farley Kwok","Lars Broker (PULSE optogenetics)","Jess Bunchek and Dr. Don Stewart (molecular farming in higher plants)","Prof. Dr. Malte Schwinger, Educational Psychology, Philipps-Universitat Marburg","Nina Miller (science communicator)","Monica Dechene, Munich Science Communication Lab","Dr. Sascha Vogel","Dorothee Menhart","Seven teachers across three schools (Teaching Toolbox co-design)","iGEM Patras (escape game distribution)","iGEM Marburg 2021 (chloroplast cell-free extract)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6350/wiki/src/contents/project/alternative-platform/ccfs-utr-screening-1280.avif","caption":"Screening the library of synthetic 5'UTR and designer PPR pairs in chloroplast cell-free extract, the lowest-complexity of the three test systems; one of these 30 de novo UTRs gave the highest transgene expression yet reported in a chloroplast in vitro.","caption_zh":"在葉綠體無細胞萃取液中篩選合成 5'UTR 與訂製 PPR 的配對元件庫，這是三個測試系統中複雜度最低的一個；這 30 條從頭設計的 UTR 中有一條，給出了葉綠體體外至今報告過的最高轉殖基因表現量。","credit":"Team Marburg, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6350/wiki/src/contents/project/alternative-platform/chlamy-ppr107-microscopy-1280.avif","caption":"Microscopy of PPR107 in Chlamydomonas reinhardtii, confirming that a nuclear-encoded designer PPR is imported into the chloroplast, the step the whole 'outsource inducibility to the nucleus' design depends on.","caption_zh":"PPR107 在 Chlamydomonas reinhardtii 中的顯微影像，確認由細胞核編碼的訂製 PPR 確實被運入葉綠體——整套「把可誘導性外包給細胞核」的設計就靠這一步。","credit":"Team Marburg, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6350/wiki/src/contents/lab/ppropt/automation/sapp-plates-1024-1280.avif","caption":"Stacked plates for semi-automated protein purification in 96-well format: a fritted Ni-NTA plate, a filter plate and a flat-bottom plate assembled for centrifugation, adapted from the Baker Lab protocol for scaled characterisation of designed proteins.","caption_zh":"用於 96 孔格式半自動蛋白質純化的疊盤：一塊含燒結濾板的 Ni-NTA 盤、一塊過濾盤與一塊平底盤疊起來以供離心，改寫自 Baker Lab 用於放大設計蛋白質特性分析的規程。","credit":"Team Marburg, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6350/wiki/src/contents/education/escape-game/escape-game-cover-1280.avif","caption":"Plasmid Panic, the team's escape game, redesigned after school visits showed students were far more curious about what daily lab life looks like than about the science content; released in English and German with multiple difficulty levels.","caption_zh":"團隊的密室逃脫遊戲 Plasmid Panic；在校園參訪顯示學生對實驗室的日常長什麼樣子遠比對科學內容更好奇之後，遊戲被重新設計，並推出英語與德語版、含多種難度。","credit":"Team Marburg, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Marburg's most transferable asset is the SciComm and Evaluation Guide mindset: decide the intended outcome first, use validated Likert instruments rather than home-made ones, and never accept attendance or enjoyment as evidence of learning ('reach is not impact, and satisfaction is not learning'). On the dry-lab side, copy their automation-as-design-decision argument: an acoustic liquid handler plus a planned plate layout does not just save pipetting, it shrinks reaction volumes fourfold, makes reagent budgets predictable in advance, and cuts variance, which is exactly what lets a small team characterise a real library instead of three constructs.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"Marburg 最可移植的資產是那套《SciComm and Evaluation Guide》的心態：先決定想要達成的結果，使用已驗證的李克特量表工具、而不是自己隨手編的，而且絕不把出席人數或參與者玩得開心當成學習的證據（「觸及數不是影響力，滿意度不是學習」）。在乾實驗這一端，值得借鏡他們把自動化當成設計決策的論點：一台聲波液體處理器加上事先規劃好的盤面配置，不只是省下吸量的工夫，它把反應體積縮到四分之一、讓試劑預算可以事先算得出來，還降低了變異——而這正是讓一支小團隊能真正完成一個元件庫的特性分析、而不是只做三個構築的關鍵。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/marburg/","https://2026.igem.wiki/marburg/project/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/marburg/alternative-platform","https://2026.igem.wiki/marburg/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/marburg/lab/automation","https://2026.igem.wiki/marburg/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/marburg/human-practices/molecular-farming","https://2026.igem.wiki/marburg/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/marburg/education/escape-game","https://2026.igem.wiki/marburg/project/parts-collection","https://2026.igem.wiki/marburg/contribution"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳元件集 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳替代平台 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳基礎推進專案 — 入圍"],"rank":131},"6356":{"team":"TU Darmstadt","id":"6356","section":"Overgrad","country":"Germany","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-darmstadt/","projectTitle":"UNRAVEL: Unlocking New Resources And Value from End-of-Life textiles","projectTitle_zh":"UNRAVEL：從報廢紡織品中釋放新資源與價值","tagline":"Enzymes and thermophilic hosts for mixed textile waste, plus a 134 euro anaerobic chamber, a 115 euro oxygen monitor and a 68 euro shaker, all documented including the failures.","tagline_zh":"針對混合紡織廢棄物的酵素與嗜熱宿主，外加一個 134 歐元的厭氧操作箱、一個 115 歐元的氧氣監測器與一台 68 歐元的振盪器，全部都有文件記錄，包括失敗的部分。","summary":"TU Darmstadt attacked mixed textile waste, of which roughly 92 million tonnes are generated globally each year and less than 1% is recycled back into fibres, by working with two thermophilic organisms: Acetivibrio thermocellus, a strict anaerobe with a cellulosome that degrades cotton at 60 C, and Geobacillus thermocatenulatus, whose carboxylesterase the team characterised and registered as GeoEsterase. Because those organisms need equipment the team did not have, they built it: a movable DIY anaerobic chamber for under 150 euros, a portable ESP32 oxygen monitor when resazurin proved too slow and cumbersome to verify the atmosphere, and two generations of orbital shaker to fit inside an existing 60 C incubator. What makes the work a measurement case study is the discipline of separating what was demonstrated from what was not, in both the enzymology and the hardware.","summary_zh":"TU Darmstadt 處理的是混合紡織廢棄物——全球每年產生約 9,200 萬公噸，重新回到纖維的比例不到 1%——他們用了兩種嗜熱微生物：Acetivibrio thermocellus，一種嚴格厭氧菌，具有可在 60°C 降解棉的纖維小體；以及 Geobacillus thermocatenulatus，團隊對其羧酸酯酶做了特性分析，並以 GeoEsterase 之名註冊。因為這些菌需要團隊原本沒有的設備，他們就自己做：一個造價不到 150 歐元、可移動的 DIY 厭氧操作箱；在發現 resazurin 判讀太慢又麻煩、無法確認箱內氣氛時，做了一台可攜式 ESP32 氧氣監測器；還有兩代軌道式振盪器，以便塞進現有的 60°C 培養箱。真正讓這份工作成為量測案例研究的，是他們在酵素學與硬體兩方面，都嚴守「已證明」與「未證明」的分野。","awards":["Best New Basic Part — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Hardware — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Every hardware page is structured as motivation and design requirements, design decisions, bill of materials and costs, construction instructions, materials-processing lessons, testing, evaluation, limitations and conclusion, with a recurring distinction between what was built, what was tested and what has not yet been demonstrated quantitatively. The same discipline runs through the results page, where computational predictions are labelled as predictions and never presented as measured enzyme performance. The team frames its contribution to iGEM as the designs, methods and troubleshooting lessons for working with non-model organisms, so that later teams do not start from scratch.","frameworks_zh":"每一個硬體頁面都按同一結構寫：動機與設計需求、設計決策、物料清單與成本、製作說明、材料加工的經驗教訓、測試、評估、限制與結論，並反覆區分「做出來的」、「測過的」與「還沒有被定量證明的」。同樣的紀律貫穿結果頁面：運算預測一律標示為預測，絕不被當成已量測的酵素表現呈現。團隊把自己對 iGEM 的貢獻定位為「與非模式生物工作所需的設計、方法與疑難排解經驗」，讓後來的隊伍不必從零開始。","dataviz":"Interactive parameter plots for kinetic constants with buttons to switch between kcat, KM and kcat/KM across temperature, and between temperatures on the initial-rate plots, with axes held constant so panels can be compared directly; dashed lines for fitted Michaelis-Menten curves and dotted lines explicitly marking measurements for which no fit could be established, so an unfittable dataset is visible rather than absent; absorbance-against-time traces with the blank subtracted and each trace shown relative to its first read; ATR-IR spectra overlaid against simulated reference spectra; collapsible result sections with open-all and close-all controls; an interactive 3D protein model on the landing page.","dataviz_zh":"動力學常數的互動式參數圖，可用按鈕在 kcat、KM 與 kcat/KM 之間切換並對照溫度，初速圖也可在不同溫度間切換，座標軸固定不變，因此各圖可以直接比較；擬合的 Michaelis-Menten 曲線用虛線、無法擬合的量測則以點線明確標出，讓擬合不出來的資料集看得見而不是直接消失；吸光度對時間的曲線都已扣除空白值，並以各自的第一次讀值為基準呈現；ATR-IR 光譜與模擬參考光譜疊圖；結果區段可收合，並附全部展開／全部收合的控制；首頁還有一個互動式 3D 蛋白質模型。","datascience":"Enzyme activity is measured against p-nitrophenyl hexanoate as a soluble stand-in for one of the two ester bonds in PET, with the released 4-nitrophenol quantified by absorbance at 396 nm using a stated extinction coefficient of 18,100 M-1 cm-1 under their conditions, so the readout is anchored to a physical constant rather than left in absorbance units. Conditions are fully specified: 0.5 uM enzyme (0.25 uM for the deep-eutectic-solvent comparison) against 0.5, 1, 2 and 4 mM substrate in 5 C steps around 37 C, every value the mean of a triplicate. The initial rate is defined operationally as the highest rate of product formation between two consecutive reads, identified automatically by their evaluation sheet rather than chosen by eye, and Vmax and KM are then fitted by minimising the sum of squared differences in Excel Solver, with kcat following from Vmax and enzyme concentration. Measurements for which no fit could be established are excluded from the table and the figure and said to be excluded, and one suspect value is flagged twice, at 47 C the Thermo MHETase trace shows a single jump in absorbance shortly after the start, so the team warns that the derived initial rate and the fit containing it should be treated with caution. Every plate's evaluation sheet is published as a PDF with the date, the enzymes, the temperature and the notes, including one where well D12 was excluded for air bubbles, so the chain from raw plate to reported constant is auditable. Thermal stability is measured by thermal shift assay with both enzymes on the same plate under identical conditions (2 uM protein, 5x SYPRO Orange, 1x LEW buffer with 10% glycerol, n = 3), and the negative result is reported with its statistics rather than buried: GeoEsterase 74.54 +/- 0.03 C and Thermo GeoEsterase 74.63 +/- 0.13 C by Boltzmann fit with R2 at least 0.998, a difference of +0.09 C with a 95% confidence interval of -0.21 to +0.40 C and a Welch t-test p of 0.34, from which the team concludes not merely that no improvement was seen but that the interval excludes any stabilisation larger than about 0.4 C. Material identity is verified before use rather than assumed, with ATR-IR on a PerkinElmer FT-IR with MIR TGS detector confirming the nylon is Nylon 6 and the polyester is PET against simulated references, and solvent extraction with methanol and acetone followed by repeat spectra used to test for additives and dyes. Particle sizing produced an honest dead end: cryomilling was optimised by ball diameter (25 mm adopted after 5, 7 and 12 mm failed), recovery across 24 runs ran from 79 to 100% with two same-day replicates at 100 and 79%, which the team reads as powder retained in the jar and funnel rather than as a result, saying explicitly it is not a degradation readout; DLS on a Malvern Zetasizer Nano with the serial number and software version recorded showed none of the samples monodisperse with much of the material above the 10 um measuring range, sonication changed nothing, and the team concluded cryomilling cannot produce the monodisperse dispersions repeatable kinetics need and abandoned the approach in favour of weighed fabric pieces. Microscopy covered the coarse end that DLS cannot reach, 3.1 to 40 um for polyester and 3 to 50 um for nylon, with the caveat that only two samples with few particles were imaged so no distribution can be fitted, plus an incidental warning that polyester autofluoresces without any dye because of optical brighteners, UV stabilisers and degradation products. Computational work is held to the same standard: 51 substitutions across five proteins are reported with the explicit statement that a DeepSTABp-predicted +9.27 C melting-temperature change and a +167% TemStaPro score gain answer different questions and must not be treated as equivalent, that 73% versus 97% binding-pocket residue overlap indicates similar identified residues but does not prove correct substrate positioning or catalytic activity, that a substitution 6.55 angstroms from the catalytic serine is active-site-adjacent and not a mutation of a catalytic residue, and that a 28.2 percentage-point increase in near-serine contact fraction across 100 ns trajectories is geometry, not a measured reaction rate, with the roughly 3.3-fold ester-to-amide contact ratio labelled a simulation-derived geometric comparison and not a change in catalytic specificity.","datascience_zh":"酵素活性以 p-nitrophenyl hexanoate 為受質量測，作為 PET 中兩種酯鍵之一的可溶性替代物，釋出的 4-nitrophenol 以 396 nm 吸光度定量，並載明在其條件下的吸光係數為 18,100 M-1 cm-1，使讀值錨定在一個物理常數上，而不是停留在吸光度單位。條件完整交代：0.5 uM 酵素（深層低共熔溶劑比較組為 0.25 uM）對 0.5、1、2 與 4 mM 受質，以 37°C 為中心每 5°C 一階，每個數值都是三重複的平均。初速以操作型定義界定：相鄰兩次讀值之間產物生成速率的最大值，由他們的評估表自動找出，而不是靠目測挑選；Vmax 與 KM 則以 Excel Solver 最小化平方差之和來擬合，kcat 再由 Vmax 與酵素濃度推得。無法擬合的量測從表格與圖中排除，並明說已排除；一個可疑數值還被標記了兩次——在 47°C 時 Thermo MHETase 的曲線在開始後不久出現一次吸光度跳升，因此團隊提醒由此推得的初速以及包含它的擬合都應謹慎看待。每一塊盤的評估表都以 PDF 公開，附上日期、使用的酵素、溫度與備註，其中一份還記載 D12 孔因氣泡而排除，因此從原始盤面到所報告常數的整條鏈都可稽核。熱穩定性以熱位移分析量測，兩個酵素放在同一塊盤、條件完全相同（2 uM 蛋白質、5x SYPRO Orange、含 10% 甘油的 1x LEW 緩衝液，n = 3），而負面結果連同統計數字一併報告，沒有被埋起來：以 Boltzmann 擬合（R2 至少 0.998）得到 GeoEsterase 74.54 +/- 0.03°C、Thermo GeoEsterase 74.63 +/- 0.13°C，差值為 +0.09°C，95% 信賴區間為 -0.21 至 +0.40°C，Welch t 檢定的 p 值為 0.34；團隊由此得出的結論不只是「沒看到改善」，而是這個區間排除了任何大於約 0.4°C 的穩定化效果。材料身分在使用前先驗證，而不是假定：以 PerkinElmer FT-IR（搭配 MIR TGS 偵測器）做 ATR-IR，對照模擬參考光譜確認尼龍是 Nylon 6、聚酯是 PET；並以甲醇與丙酮做溶劑萃取後重測光譜，以檢驗是否含添加劑與染料。粒徑分析走進一條被老實承認的死路：低溫研磨先依球徑最佳化（5、7 與 12 mm 都失敗後改用 25 mm），24 次研磨的回收率落在 79 到 100%，其中同一天的兩個重複分別是 100% 與 79%，團隊把它解讀為粉末殘留在罐子與漏斗裡，而不是一個結果，並明說這不是降解的讀值；在 Malvern Zetasizer Nano 上做的 DLS（機器序號與軟體版本都有記錄）顯示沒有任何樣品是單一分散的，而且很大一部分材料超出 10 um 的量測範圍，超音波處理也沒有改變什麼；團隊因此判定低溫研磨無法產出可重現動力學所需的單一分散懸浮液，放棄這條路，改用秤重的布片。顯微鏡補上了 DLS 到不了的粗粒端：聚酯 3.1 到 40 um、尼龍 3 到 50 um，但附註只拍了兩個顆粒很少的樣品，因此無法擬合粒徑分布；另有一個順帶的提醒：聚酯在沒有任何染劑的情況下也會自體螢光，原因是螢光增白劑、紫外線穩定劑與降解產物。運算工作也守同樣的標準：五個蛋白質上共 51 個胺基酸置換，報告中明確寫出——DeepSTABp 預測的 +9.27°C 熔點變化與 TemStaPro 分數提升 +167% 回答的是不同的問題，不可當作等價；結合口袋殘基重疊度 73% 對 97% 只表示所辨識出的殘基相似，並不能證明受質定位正確或具有催化活性；距催化絲胺酸 6.55 埃的置換屬於活性位點鄰近，而不是催化殘基本身的突變；而 100 ns 軌跡中「鄰近絲胺酸接觸比例」上升 28.2 個百分點是幾何，不是量測到的反應速率；酯鍵與醯胺鍵接觸比約 3.3 倍，也標示為模擬推得的幾何比較，而非催化專一性的改變。","software":"Hardware is released as build documentation rather than code: a full assembly procedure for the anaerobic chamber with bills of materials and per-item recorded costs, a step-by-step oxygen-monitor build with the complete I2C scanner sketch and both the simple and advanced Arduino display programs printed in full on the wiki, a wiring table mapping every OLED and sensor pin to its ESP32 pin, and an orbital shaker build with its own BOM, tool list and assembly steps. Nine 3D models and a seventeen-image gallery accompany the shaker, with bearing specifications listed. Plate-reader evaluation sheets are published per plate as PDFs, including the current version of the sheet with a worked example of the layout and calculation steps.","software_zh":"硬體是以建造文件而非程式碼的形式釋出：厭氧操作箱的完整組裝流程，附物料清單與逐項記錄的成本；氧氣監測器的逐步製作說明，I2C 掃描程式與簡易版、進階版兩套 Arduino 顯示程式都完整印在 wiki 上；一張接線表把每個 OLED 與感測器腳位對應到 ESP32 的腳位；以及軌道式振盪器的製作說明，附自己的 BOM、工具清單與組裝步驟。振盪器另附九個 3D 模型與一組十七張圖的圖庫，並列出軸承規格。盤讀儀的評估表則逐盤以 PDF 公開，包括該表的當前版本與一份含版面與計算步驟的範例。","stack":["ESP32 NodeMCU with DFRobot SEN0465 factory-calibrated electrochemical oxygen sensor","0.91 inch 128x32 I2C OLED, Arduino IDE 2.3.10, DFRobot_MultiGasSensor and Adafruit GFX/SSD1306 libraries","12 V DC gear motor with PWM control and MOSFET switching","PerkinElmer FT-IR with ATR accessory and MIR TGS detector","Malvern Zetasizer Nano (DLS)","Light and confocal microscopy","Thermal shift assay with SYPRO Orange","AKTA and gravity His-tag affinity chromatography","Excel Solver (GRG Nonlinear) for Michaelis-Menten fitting","DeepSTABp, TemStaPro, ProteinMPNN","100 ns explicit-solvent molecular dynamics with MM-GBSA and MM-PBSA","3D printing and cryomilling"],"techniques":["Absorbance converted with a stated extinction coefficient","Operationally defined initial rate, selected automatically","Michaelis-Menten fitting by least squares with published evaluation sheets","Unfittable datasets shown as dotted lines rather than omitted","Suspect traces flagged and carried through to the limitations","Paired same-plate comparison for thermal shift","Negative result reported with a confidence interval that bounds the effect","Material identity confirmed by ATR-IR against reference spectra","Solvent extraction to test for additives before interpreting spectra","Recovery reported as process loss rather than as a result","Abandoning a method when its dispersions cannot support repeatable kinetics","In-tube thermometry and leak testing for DIY equipment","Separating prediction from measurement throughout"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A sustainability page sets out the environmental case alongside the science, and the project's framing is that recycling is only part of the answer, with buying less and wearing clothes for longer mattering just as much.","publicEngagement_zh":"一個永續頁面把環境面的論述與科學並列，而專案的定調是：回收只是答案的一部分，少買、把衣服穿久一點同樣重要。","ihp":"Human Practices treats textile waste as a humanitarian problem first: rich countries export their waste and the communities that handle it are never the ones who benefited from producing it. The team quantifies the flow, with EU exports of used textiles more than doubling since 2005 to over 1.4 million tonnes in 2025, Germany exporting approximately 462,500 tonnes in 2022 and second only to the USA, an estimated 30 to 40% of German exports ending in landfills in receiving countries, and Chile receiving about 131,000 tonnes in 2022. They also note that only about 15% of the EU's 6.94 million tonnes of textile waste was collected separately, with 85% going into mixed household waste where it can no longer be recycled, and they sought out textile companies and the local collectors, sorters and thrift stores who keep materials in circulation. Their stated position is that responsible science means asking who the work should be for, not only whether it can work.","ihp_zh":"人類實踐首先把紡織廢棄物當成人道問題來處理：富國把廢棄物出口出去，而處理這些廢棄物的社群，從來不是當初因生產而受益的那些人。團隊把這條流向量化：歐盟的二手紡織品出口自 2005 年以來成長超過一倍，2025 年超過 140 萬公噸；德國在 2022 年出口約 462,500 公噸，僅次於美國；德國出口量估計有 30 至 40% 最後進入接收國的掩埋場；智利在 2022 年接收約 131,000 公噸。他們也指出，歐盟 694 萬公噸的紡織廢棄物中只有約 15% 被分類收集，85% 進入混合家戶垃圾，從此再也無法回收；團隊因此主動去找紡織公司，以及讓材料持續流通的在地回收業者、分類業者與二手商店。他們明言的立場是：負責任的科學意味著要問「這份工作該為誰而做」，而不只是問它能不能成功。","realWorld":"An entrepreneurship page addresses whether biological textile recycling makes economic sense, from cultivation and enzyme production costs to the practical obstacles of bringing the approach out of the laboratory, on the argument that scientific ideas often fail to leave the lab for economic rather than technical reasons. The hardware is the most directly reusable output: the anaerobic chamber is costed at 134.30 euros in materials against roughly 3,000 euros for a cheap professional chamber, a 95% reduction and the cheapest DIY solution the team could find, with the oxygen monitor at 114.60 euros per unit (the sensor being about 83% of that) and the orbital shaker at 68.08 euros. The build guides are written for reproduction, including which parts must be matched to each other, and the team says what it would record differently next time, specifically hole centres, hole diameters, edge distances and fastener lengths, to reduce another team's trial and error.","realWorld_zh":"一個創業頁面處理「生物法紡織品回收在經濟上是否說得通」這個問題，從菌體培養與酵素生產成本，一路談到把這套方法帶出實驗室的實際障礙，論點是科學構想往往不是因為技術、而是因為經濟原因才走不出實驗室。硬體是最能直接重複使用的產出：厭氧操作箱的材料成本為 134.30 歐元，對比一台便宜的專業操作箱約 3,000 歐元，降低 95%，也是團隊所能找到最便宜的 DIY 方案；氧氣監測器每台 114.60 歐元（感測器佔其中約 83%）；軌道式振盪器 68.08 歐元。製作指南是為了讓人重現而寫的，包括哪些零件必須彼此配對；團隊也說明下次會改成記錄哪些資訊——具體來說是孔心位置、孔徑、邊距與扣件長度——以減少其他隊伍的試誤。","partners":["Prof. Warzecha (TU Darmstadt)","Futury Startup Summer School","Textile companies and local collectors, sorters and thrift stores (Human Practices)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6356/wiki/hardware/ac5.avif","caption":"The DIY anaerobic chamber: a transparent 55 L plastic storage container fitted with 125 mm glove ports, brass ball valves for gas inlet and outlet, an EPDM-sealed lid clamped with C-clamps along aluminium U-profile, and a two-container transfer lock, for 134.30 euros in materials against roughly 3,000 euros for a cheap commercial chamber.","caption_zh":"DIY 厭氧操作箱：一個透明的 55 L 塑膠收納箱，裝上 125 mm 手套口、作為氣體進出口的黃銅球閥，箱蓋以 EPDM 密封並沿鋁製 U 型軌以 C 型夾夾緊，另有雙箱體的轉移氣閘，材料成本 134.30 歐元，相較一台便宜的商用操作箱約需 3,000 歐元。","credit":"Team TU Darmstadt, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6356/wiki/hardware/oxygen-sensor.avif","caption":"The portable oxygen monitor inside the chamber, reading 0.5% on its OLED. Built from an ESP32, a factory-calibrated DFRobot SEN0465 electrochemical sensor and a 0.91 inch display in a repurposed plastic box for about 115 euros, it was made because resazurin proved too slow to tell the team whether the chamber had actually reached an anaerobic atmosphere.","caption_zh":"箱內的可攜式氧氣監測器，OLED 上顯示 0.5%。它由 ESP32、原廠已校正的 DFRobot SEN0465 電化學感測器與一片 0.91 吋顯示器組成，裝在一個再利用的塑膠盒裡，造價約 115 歐元；之所以要做它，是因為 resazurin 判讀太慢，無法告訴團隊操作箱是否真的達到厭氧狀態。","credit":"Team TU Darmstadt, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6356/wiki/hardware/shaker/further-pictures/shaker-in-chamber-2.avif","caption":"The orbital shaker, built from perforated plate and angle, a 12 V gear motor with PWM control and furniture casters as eccentrics, for 68.08 euros in materials so it fits inside an existing 60 C incubator for thermophilic cultures.","caption_zh":"軌道式振盪器，以沖孔板與角鐵、一具帶 PWM 控制的 12 V 齒輪馬達，加上家具滑輪作為偏心件製成，材料成本 68.08 歐元，因此能塞進現有的 60°C 培養箱裡培養嗜熱菌。","credit":"Team TU Darmstadt, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6356/wiki/chem-results/petandreference.avif","caption":"ATR-IR spectrum of the team's polyester sample overlaid on a simulated PET reference, recorded on a PerkinElmer FT-IR with MIR TGS detector. Material identity was confirmed before any degradation experiment, rather than assumed from the label.","caption_zh":"團隊聚酯樣品的 ATR-IR 光譜，疊在模擬的 PET 參考光譜上，以 PerkinElmer FT-IR 搭配 MIR TGS 偵測器量測。材料身分在任何降解實驗之前就先確認，而不是照標籤假定。","credit":"Team TU Darmstadt, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Report a null result with the interval that bounds it: measuring both enzyme variants on the same plate under identical conditions let the team say not just that the engineered variant was no more stable, but that the data exclude any stabilisation larger than about 0.4 C, which is a usable constraint rather than an absence of evidence.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"報告虛無結果時，要附上框住它的區間：把兩個酵素變異體放在同一塊盤、以完全相同的條件量測，團隊因此不只能說工程化變異體並沒有更穩定，還能說資料排除了任何大於約 0.4°C 的穩定化效果——這是一個可用的約束條件，而不是「沒有證據」。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-darmstadt/","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-darmstadt/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-darmstadt/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-darmstadt/human-practices"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳硬體 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"rank":40},"6366":{"team":"Peking","id":"6366","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/peking/","projectTitle":"TermiTox — engineered yeast baits for species-specific termite colony control","projectTitle_zh":"TermiTox——以工程酵母餌劑進行物種專一的白蟻巢群防治","tagline":"Two engineered yeast strains, modelled from molecular dynamics to whole-colony collapse, to protect wooden heritage buildings without broad-spectrum pesticide.","tagline_zh":"兩株工程酵母，從分子動力學一路模擬到整個巢群崩解，在不使用廣效殺蟲劑的前提下保護木造古蹟建築。","summary":"Peking built a genuinely three-scale model of a termite bait. Strain A delivers a pH-gated listeriolysin O mutant that lyses the hindgut protozoa a termite depends on for cellulose digestion; Strain B releases hairpin RNA under hindgut hypoxia to silence RsEG (a termite cellulase) and Hexamerin-1 (a caste-development regulator). The Molecular Model used all-atom MD to verify the H311A-LLO safety premise, the Individual Model is a cohort-ODE system calibrated by MAP fitting against quantitative data extracted from 43 papers, and the Colony Model is a spatially explicit agent-based stochastic simulation of trophallaxis through a two-layer nest network with caste structure. The colony model produced a non-obvious and testable deployment schedule that the team then designed hardware for, plus a dose and collapse-time estimate anchored to published hexaflumuron field trials.","summary_zh":"Peking 為白蟻餌劑真正建了一個三尺度的模型。A 菌株投遞一個受 pH 調控的李斯特菌溶素 O（LLO）突變體，裂解白蟻賴以消化纖維素的後腸原生動物；B 菌株則在後腸低氧條件下釋放髮夾 RNA，靜默 RsEG（一種白蟻纖維素酶）與 Hexamerin-1（階級發育的調控因子）。分子模型以全原子 MD 驗證 H311A-LLO 的安全前提，個體模型是一套世代結構的 ODE 系統，以最大後驗（MAP）擬合對從 43 篇論文中擷取的定量資料進行校準，巢群模型則是一個空間明確的主體基隨機模擬，模擬交哺行為在具階級結構的兩層巢網路中的傳播。巢群模型產出一個並不直觀、但可被檢驗的投放時程，該隊接著為此設計硬體，並給出以已發表 hexaflumuron 田間試驗為錨的劑量與崩解時間估計。","awards":["Best Model — Nominee (Undergrad)","Safety and Security Award — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Conservation Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Three models at three scales, each answering a different design question, and the output of each feeds the next. (1) MOLECULAR — all-atom molecular dynamics in GROMACS-style protocol on LLO (PDB 4CDB, residues 39-526) to test whether the H311A mutant is really pH-gated. PROPKA3 predicted pKa for all 141 titratable residues, identifying E247 and H311 as the residues whose protonation flips between pH 5.5 and 7.4; ten systems were built (four solution, two membrane, four crystal-contact dimers from ChimeraX packing) in CHARMM36-jul2022 with TIP3P water, 310 K V-rescale thermostat, 1 atm C-rescale barostat with semi-isotropic coupling for the membranes, 2 fs timestep, 1.2 nm non-bonded cutoff, LINCS on H-bonds, through minimisation, NVT, NPT and production. The result is quantitative: under acidic conditions the H311A acidic triad (D208/E247/D320) tightens to a D208-D320 distance of 3.94 Angstrom, while at neutral pH the distances open to 6.05-6.20 Angstrom and the salt bridges collapse, and in the membrane systems the protein sits 29 Angstrom from the phosphorus plane at pH 5.5 but drifts to 58 Angstrom at pH 7.4 by t = 20.5 ns. H311A is 17-18 Angstrom from the triad and never touches it, so the mechanism claimed is allosteric. (2) INDIVIDUAL — a cohort-structured ODE model. Because repeated bait feeding and in-gut yeast division create cells of different ages, yeast is divided into cohorts, each with its own hindgut-age clock; founder cells arrive with preloaded payload Q_0 while hindgut-born cells start empty and must build payload. All A and B cohorts share one logistic hindgut carrying capacity, b_s = r_s - [r_s]_+ Y_total/K_Y. A DAN1-calibrated hypoxia clock a_D(a) = l_D + (phi_H - l_D) G_2(a; tau_D) gates payload expression and Strain B's release module. Strain A uptake uses a delayed waiting function and saturates as protozoa are depleted, with a per-yeast kill probability p = 1 - exp(-Psi_A q), and because protozoan enzymes outlive the protozoa, digestive capacity follows through a first-order lag dE_P/dt = (ln2/T_EP)(F_P - E_P). Strain B's hairpin RNA feeds a hindgut pool with first-order decay, and the gut-pool-to-knockdown step is a convolution with an empirical time kernel fitted from oral RNAi studies, X_j(t) = A_j * integral u_j(s) K_j(t-s) ds with M_j = exp(-X_j); mRNA then drives protein pools through further lags, and total digestive function is a weighted sum D_E = w_R + w_P E_P + w_C C_H. (3) COLONY — a spatially explicit, stochastic agent-based model. The nest is a two-layer network: a macro graph linking the royal chamber, six wood modules and one or two bait modules by tunnels, with each module containing a micro branching tunnel network generated by a stochastic excavation process adapted from Lee and Lee's agent-based termite tunnelling model and converted to a continuous centreline graph. Colony members are coarse-grained weighted agents (2,000 worker agents at 250 workers each, 300 larval agents at 125 each, one explicit king and 50 explicit queens) with resolution convergence checked at 1,000/150, 2,000/300 and 4,000/600. Workers run a three-state FORAGE/RETURN/DISTRIBUTE behavioural loop; when two meet, trophallaxis fires with probability P_ij = p_max * normalised_local_density * |F_i - F_j| and half the food-load difference transfers, with a one-relay-only rule for food en route to the royal chamber. Each termite tracks food load, transferable A and B payload and accumulated damage, with worker damage Delta_D = alpha_A Q_A + alpha_B Q_B + gamma_AB * 2 Q_A Q_B/(Q_A + Q_B + eps) — a harmonic-mean synergy term that only fires when both payloads are active in the same insect, with coefficients ordered alpha_A > alpha_B > gamma_AB from the individual model. Strain A damage is assigned only to workers on the biological ground that queens and larvae lack the worker hindgut protist system. The model deliberately rejects a conventional SIR epidemic formulation because nest space and caste direction are what make trophallactic spread non-uniform.","frameworks_zh":"三個尺度的三個模型，各回答一個不同的設計問題，而且前一個的輸出餵給下一個。(1) 分子尺度——以 GROMACS 形式的流程對 LLO（PDB 4CDB，第 39-526 號殘基）做全原子分子動力學，檢驗 H311A 突變體是否真的受 pH 調控。PROPKA3 預測全部 141 個可滴定殘基的 pKa，指認出 E247 與 H311 是質子化狀態會在 pH 5.5 與 7.4 之間翻轉的殘基；共建立十個系統（四個溶液、兩個膜、四個由 ChimeraX 堆積得到的晶體接觸二聚體），採 CHARMM36-jul2022 搭配 TIP3P 水，310 K V-rescale 恆溫器，1 atm C-rescale 恆壓器（膜系統採半等向耦合），2 fs 時間步，1.2 nm 非鍵結截斷，以 LINCS 約束含氫鍵長，依序經過最小化、NVT、NPT 與正式模擬。結果是定量的：在酸性條件下，H311A 的酸性三元體（D208/E247/D320）收緊，D208 與 D320 距離為 3.94 Å，而在中性 pH 下距離擴大到 6.05-6.20 Å、鹽橋網路崩解；在膜系統中，蛋白質在 pH 5.5 時位於距磷原子平面 29 Å 處，但在 pH 7.4 下到 t = 20.5 ns 時已漂移到 58 Å。H311A 距三元體 17-18 Å，從未與之接觸，因此所主張的機制屬於異位效應。(2) 個體尺度——一個具世代結構的 ODE 模型。由於反覆取食餌劑與酵母在腸道內增殖會產生年齡不同的細胞，酵母被分成世代，各自有自己的後腸年齡時鐘；創始細胞帶著預先裝載的酬載 Q_0 進入，而在後腸中出生的細胞則從空的開始，必須自行累積酬載。所有 A 與 B 世代共用一個邏吉斯型的後腸環境負載量，b_s = r_s - [r_s]_+ Y_total/K_Y。一個由 DAN1 校準的低氧時鐘 a_D(a) = l_D + (phi_H - l_D) G_2(a; tau_D) 控制酬載表現與 B 菌株的釋放模組。A 菌株的攝取採用延遲等待函數，並隨原生動物被耗盡而飽和，每個酵母的致死機率為 p = 1 - exp(-Psi_A q)；又因原生動物的酵素比原生動物本身存活更久，消化能力以一階延遲跟隨 dE_P/dt = (ln2/T_EP)(F_P - E_P)。B 菌株的髮夾 RNA 餵入一個具一階衰減的後腸池，而從腸道池到基因靜默這一步則是與一個由口服 RNAi 研究擬合出的經驗時間核函數做卷積，X_j(t) = A_j * integral u_j(s) K_j(t-s) ds，其中 M_j = exp(-X_j)；mRNA 再透過更多延遲驅動蛋白質池，而整體消化功能為加權和 D_E = w_R + w_P E_P + w_C C_H。(3) 巢群尺度——一個空間明確的隨機主體基模型。巢被建成兩層網路：巨觀圖以隧道連接王室、六個木材模組與一到兩個餌劑模組，而每個模組內部又含一個微觀分支隧道網路，由一個隨機挖掘過程生成（改寫自 Lee 與 Lee 的白蟻挖掘主體基模型），再轉換為連續的中心線圖。巢群成員是粗粒化的加權主體（2,000 個工蟻主體，每個代表 250 隻工蟻；300 個幼蟲主體，每個代表 125 隻；一隻明確表示的蟻王與 50 隻明確表示的蟻后），並在 1,000/150、2,000/300 與 4,000/600 三種解析度下檢查收斂。工蟻執行 FORAGE/RETURN/DISTRIBUTE 三狀態行為迴圈；當兩隻相遇時，交哺以機率 P_ij = p_max * normalised_local_density * |F_i - F_j| 發生，並轉移食物負載差的一半，而運往王室的食物設有只能中繼一次的規則。每隻白蟻都追蹤食物負載、可轉移的 A 與 B 酬載，以及累積傷害，工蟻的傷害為 Delta_D = alpha_A Q_A + alpha_B Q_B + gamma_AB * 2 Q_A Q_B/(Q_A + Q_B + eps)——這是一個調和平均形式的協同項，只有在同一隻昆蟲體內兩種酬載都活躍時才會作用，係數依個體模型排序為 alpha_A > alpha_B > gamma_AB。A 菌株的傷害只指派給工蟻，生物學依據是蟻后與幼蟲沒有工蟻那套後腸原生生物系統。該模型刻意拒用常見的 SIR 傳染病表述，因為正是巢的空間結構與階級方向性，使交哺傳播並不均勻。","dataviz":"The headline is interactivity that is genuinely explanatory rather than ornamental: an embedded individual-model explorer where the reader sets total dose and treatment duration, presses Update model, and then drags a timeline through 42 days watching a labelled flow diagram (INPUT, YEAST, PAYLOAD, ACTION, TARGETS, HOST) light up — clicking any element in the diagram highlights that quantity's trajectory. The colony model ships six embedded simulation videos selectable by schedule (nest construction, worker movement, A-only, B-only, A+B mixed, best schedule) with a draggable progress bar and playback speed, and one video follows a single tracked worker's food load, A payload, B payload and damage in an inset as it feeds, transfers and dies. Both explorers degrade gracefully, with the page explicitly stating that the static figures below show the same modelled outcomes when JavaScript is off. The spatial figures are the best static work: Figures 8 and 9 are matrices with treatment days 10-120 as columns and worker cohorts grouped by home module as rows, showing ever-exposed fraction, payload burden in a no-damage tracer run, and functional-worker fraction — making the distance-to-bait gradient and the spatial refuges immediately visible, then showing them disappear when a second bait station is added. Stochastic outputs are reported as three-seed medians with Q25-Q75 shading, and every caption lists the parameter values used (s = 1.40, home/adjacent/global target probabilities 0.65/0.20/0.15, global bait weights 4/2/1).","dataviz_zh":"最醒目的是真正具解釋力、而非裝飾性的互動：頁面嵌入一個個體模型探索器，讀者可設定總劑量與處理持續時間，按下 Update model，再拖曳時間軸走過 42 天，看著一張標註好的流程圖（INPUT、YEAST、PAYLOAD、ACTION、TARGETS、HOST）逐一亮起——點選圖中任一元素，就會把該量的軌跡標示出來。巢群模型附六支可依時程選擇的嵌入模擬影片（築巢、工蟻移動、僅 A、僅 B、A+B 混合、最佳時程），可拖曳進度條並調整播放速度，其中一支影片以子畫面追蹤單一工蟻的食物負載、A 酬載、B 酬載與傷害，一路看它取食、轉移、死亡。兩個探索器都有優雅的降級處理，頁面也明確說明在關閉 JavaScript 時下方的靜態圖呈現的是同一組模型結果。空間圖是靜態呈現中最好的部分：圖 8 與圖 9 是矩陣，橫軸為處理第 10 至 120 天，縱軸為依所屬模組分組的工蟻世代，顯示曾暴露比例、在不計傷害的示蹤模擬中的酬載負擔，以及仍具功能的工蟻比例——讓距餌劑遠近的梯度與空間避難所立刻可見，接著再展示加入第二個餌站後這些避難所如何消失。隨機模擬的輸出以三組種子的中位數報告，並以 Q25-Q75 區間著色，每張圖說也列出所用的參數值（s = 1.40，本模組／鄰近／全域目標機率 0.65/0.20/0.15，全域餌劑權重 4/2/1）。","datascience":"This is a parameter-provenance project. The team collected quantitative experiments from 43 papers covering yeast persistence, trophallaxis, hindgut oxygen, LLO, protozoa, oral RNAi, cellulase activity and yeast release systems, recording species, delivery route, exposure schedule, observation times, units and readout for each — and then published an EVIDENCE MAP table that states, row by row, what each dataset can estimate, what remains unresolved, and an identifiability status of Composite, Partly identifiable, Structural constraints only, Scenario only, Structure identifiable but rates unresolved, or Not identifiable. For example, LLO entering protozoan food vacuoles is marked 'Not identifiable', and A+B synergy is marked 'Not identifiable' with the honest note that no LLO-plus-RNAi study exists, so independent, additive, limiting-factor and multiplicative scenarios are all carried instead of one being asserted. The model structure was then deliberately built as the SMALLEST structure the data can constrain: when several microscopic steps were only ever observed through one final readout, they were kept together as one effective process rather than split into unidentifiable rates. Parameters were calibrated by maximum a posteriori fitting, theta_hat = argmin[-sum_e log p(y_e | H_e(x_e(theta))) - log p(theta)], jointly across studies rather than one parameter set per paper, following the biological chain (yeast dynamics, then protozoa-to-digestion, then hex RNAi, then cellu RNAi, then terminal dose-response), with directly reported quantities fixed first, multiple starting points per block, and each study keeping its own dose schedule and control. Validation is reproduction before prediction: seven published experiments were reproduced by the model before it was used to predict TermiTox. Real time was anchored by simulating a reference compound through the same two models — hexaflumuron, chosen because both individual and colony data exist — giving a model-time ratio of 137/120 = 1.14 that converts Im and Han's 56-day arena collapse into ~65 days for TermiTox at ~10^4 termites and Tsunoda's 9-month field result into ~10.3 months, with the dose converted to a bait loading of 2.03e9 cells per g dry bait, or ~5.1% w/w at 4e10 cells per g lyophilised preparation.","datascience_zh":"這是一個關於參數來源的專案。該隊從 43 篇論文中蒐集定量實驗，涵蓋酵母存續、交哺、後腸氧氣、LLO、原生動物、口服 RNAi、纖維素酶活性與酵母釋放系統，逐筆記錄物種、投遞途徑、暴露時程、觀測時間點、單位與讀值——然後公開一張「證據地圖」表格，逐列說明每份資料集能估計什麼、哪些仍未解決，以及可辨識性狀態：複合、部分可辨識、僅有結構約束、僅能以情境處理、結構可辨識但速率未定，或不可辨識。例如 LLO 進入原生動物食物泡這一步被標為「不可辨識」，而 A+B 的協同作用也被標為「不可辨識」，並誠實註明目前不存在同時使用 LLO 與 RNAi 的研究，因此並列獨立、相加、限制因子與相乘四種情境，而不是斷言其中一種。模型結構於是刻意建成資料所能約束的最小結構：當好幾個微觀步驟只能透過同一個最終讀值被觀察時，就把它們合併為一個有效過程，而不是拆成無法辨識的速率。參數以最大後驗擬合校準，theta_hat = argmin[-sum_e log p(y_e | H_e(x_e(theta))) - log p(theta)]，並跨研究聯合擬合，而不是每篇論文一組參數，順序依生物鏈進行（酵母動態、原生動物到消化、hex RNAi、cellu RNAi，最後是終端劑量反應），先固定有直接報告的量，每個區塊採多個起始點，而每篇研究保留自己的劑量時程與對照。驗證採先重現再預測：模型在被用來預測 TermiTox 之前，先重現了七項已發表的實驗。真實時間則以一個參考化合物走過同兩個模型來錨定——選用 hexaflumuron，因為它同時有個體與巢群層級的資料——得到模型時間比 137/120 = 1.14，把 Im 與 Han 在競技場中 56 天的崩解換算為 TermiTox 在約 10^4 隻白蟻下的約 65 天，並把 Tsunoda 的 9 個月田間結果換算為約 10.3 個月，劑量則換算為每公克乾餌 2.03e9 個細胞的裝載量，若冷凍乾燥製劑為每公克 4e10 個細胞，則約為 5.1% w/w。","software":"RNAiWeave, a local web application that turns one target gene sequence into ranked, traceable hairpin RNAi candidates. It does sliding-window fragment filtering (default arm 300-400 nt, GC 30-60%, 21-nt siRNA window, all adjustable) screening out homopolymers, low complexity and tandem repeats with siRNA features computed once and reused via prefix sums; an activity estimate from four features reported in the published dsRIP study (terminal thermodynamic asymmetry, antisense self-folding, antisense GC and others); off-target screening against a local FASTA or RefSeq RNA scope that retains matching positions and records; and full-precursor folding in ViennaRNA. The structure score H is an explicit weighted formula over seven quantities (inter-arm stem coverage R at weight 0.50, linker-pairing burden J, MFE-per-nucleotide suitability E benchmarked to a project reference of 0.80 kcal/mol/nt, equilibrium probability of the MFE structure P, 21-nt unpaired-window accessibility U, overall paired fraction F, and a penalty for unexpected pairs X), so a reader can see exactly why one candidate outranked another. Environmental persistence is modelled separately as first-order decay with DT50 and DT90, with a Q10 temperature correction and literature reference scenarios (15-28 h for DvSnf7 RNA in agricultural soils, 56-72 h for non-bioactive dsRNA in water-sediment microcosms). Exports are FASTA, CSV, versioned JSON, dot-bracket and SVG. The team is scrupulous about limits: without off-target screening the output is labelled a preview ranking with sequence safety 'not assessed', and they state plainly that they have not compared knockdown efficacy or runtime against dsRIP. Model code is public at gitlab.igem.org/2026/peking/-/tree/main/Model_code.","software_zh":"RNAiWeave，一個在本機執行的網頁應用程式，把單一標的基因序列轉成有排序、可追溯的髮夾 RNAi 候選。它以滑動視窗做片段篩選（預設臂長 300-400 nt、GC 30-60%、21-nt siRNA 視窗，皆可調整），排除同聚物、低複雜度與串聯重複，siRNA 特徵只計算一次並透過前綴和重複使用；活性估計取自已發表 dsRIP 研究所報告的四項特徵（末端熱力學不對稱性、反義股自身折疊、反義股 GC 含量等）；脫靶篩選針對本地 FASTA 或 RefSeq RNA 範圍進行，並保留比對位置與紀錄；完整前驅物折疊則以 ViennaRNA 計算。結構分數 H 是一個明確的加權公式，涵蓋七個量（臂間莖區覆蓋率 R 權重 0.50、連接子配對負擔 J、以專案參考值 0.80 kcal/mol/nt 為基準的每核苷酸 MFE 適配度 E、MFE 結構的平衡機率 P、21-nt 未配對視窗的可及性 U、整體配對比例 F，以及非預期配對的懲罰項 X），因此讀者能清楚看出某個候選為何排在另一個之前。環境持久性則另以一階衰減建模，給出 DT50 與 DT90，附 Q10 溫度校正與文獻參考情境（農業土壤中 DvSnf7 RNA 為 15-28 小時，水—底泥微宇宙中無生物活性的 dsRNA 為 56-72 小時）。匯出格式為 FASTA、CSV、帶版本的 JSON、dot-bracket 與 SVG。該隊對限制相當嚴謹：若未執行脫靶篩選，輸出會被標示為預覽排序，序列安全性為「未評估」，他們也直白表示並未與 dsRIP 比較靜默效果或執行時間。模型程式碼公開於 gitlab.igem.org/2026/peking/-/tree/main/Model_code。","stack":["Python","GROMACS (CHARMM36-jul2022, TIP3P)","PROPKA3","ChimeraX","ViennaRNA / RNAplot","NumPy / SciPy ODE solvers","custom agent-based simulator","local web app (RNAiWeave)","NCBI RefSeq / local BLAST-style off-target search"],"techniques":["all-atom molecular dynamics","pKa prediction and constant-protonation-state MD","membrane-bilayer simulation with semi-isotropic pressure coupling","protein-protein dimer MD for oligomerisation tendency","salt-bridge and distance trajectory analysis","cohort-structured ODE modelling","logistic growth with shared carrying capacity","delay / convolution kernel modelling of oral RNAi","first-order lag chains (mRNA to protein to function)","maximum a posteriori parameter estimation with literature priors","structural identifiability assessment","minimal-model construction from evidence","literature benchmark reproduction (7 experiments)","spatially explicit agent-based simulation","stochastic tunnel-network generation","coarse-grained weighted agents with resolution convergence check","contact-process trophallaxis modelling","multi-seed stochastic replication with quantile bands","cross-scale parameter handoff (individual to colony)","reference-compound anchoring of model time to real time","RNA secondary-structure thermodynamics","multi-criteria weighted scoring","first-order environmental fate modelling with Q10 correction"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education was pitched per audience: a 'Code of Life' session at Huangchenggen Primary School on 13 April 2026 explaining DNA, genes and proteins with locally resonant analogies (the double helix as a twisted Chinese fried dough twist) followed by hands-on strawberry DNA extraction with Grade 6 pupils using dish soap, salt and ethanol; lab visits connecting textbook content to a working research environment; interactive games on termites, evolution and biodiversity; a May Day fun fair co-hosted with PKUHSC; and a Biodiversity Fair booth, reaching primary and middle school students, university students, families and the general public.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育依受眾分別設計：2026 年 4 月 13 日在皇城根小學辦了一場「生命密碼」課程，用當地有共鳴的比喻講解 DNA、基因與蛋白質（把雙螺旋比作扭起來的麻花），接著與六年級學生以洗碗精、食鹽與酒精動手做草莓 DNA 萃取；另有實驗室參訪，把教科書內容連到真實的研究環境；關於白蟻、演化與生物多樣性的互動遊戲；與 PKUHSC 合辦的五一遊園會；以及一個生物多樣性市集攤位，觸及小學與中學生、大學生、家庭與一般大眾。","ihp":"The origin story is unusually concrete and honest: a team member looked up at a century-old campus building and saw termite tunnels inside a wooden beam no maintenance record had noted, and the team then realised every member came from a termite-affected region (Beijing, Sichuan, Fujian, Shanghai, Chongqing, Suzhou). Before any protocol was drafted they ran a questionnaire across ages, backgrounds and regions in China and overseas, collecting 539 valid responses; respondents rated heritage-building termite risk at 7.99 out of 8 and named three priorities — early-warning monitoring, low environmental impact, and target specificity — which the team acknowledge essentially outline the final project. Fifteen students ran a closed-loop review every Saturday evening from April to October 2026, feeding ~17 deep consultations with entomologists, heritage conservators, frontline control officers, RNAi industry people, PIs and past iGEMers and judges. They record what they killed as well as what they built: broad-spectrum pesticides were ruled out as leaving residues unacceptable for sites like the Forbidden City, and crude biocontrol strains were ruled out as too blunt for ancient wooden halls, each discarded idea costing weeks. Community work included six gatherings (NCIM meetup, Synbiopunk-CCiC Dalian, the 1st Grand APiC where TermiTox won Best Project, Synbio Challenge Shenzhen, the Peking-Rice International HP Summit they co-organised with 50+ universities, and the SZU green-bio roundtable).","ihp_zh":"起源故事具體而誠實到不尋常：一位隊員抬頭看著校內一棟百年建築，在一根木梁裡看到從未被任何維護紀錄提及的白蟻隧道，隨後全隊才意識到每位成員都來自受白蟻影響的地區（北京、四川、福建、上海、重慶、蘇州）。在草擬任何實驗流程之前，他們先在中國與海外跨年齡、背景與地區發出問卷，收到 539 份有效回覆；受訪者把古蹟建築的白蟻風險評為 8 分中的 7.99 分，並指出三項優先事項——早期預警監測、低環境衝擊、標的專一性——該隊承認這三項基本上就已經勾出了最終的專案。十五位學生從 2026 年 4 月到 10 月，每週六晚上進行一次閉環檢討，餵入約 17 場與昆蟲學家、古蹟修復專家、前線防治人員、RNAi 產業人士、PI 以及歷屆 iGEMer 與評審的深度諮詢。他們也記錄自己砍掉了什麼，而不只是做了什麼：廣效殺蟲劑因殘留在故宮這類場址不可接受而被排除，粗放的生物防治菌株則因對古代木構殿堂而言過於粗糙而被排除，每個被丟棄的想法都花掉數週。社群工作包含六場聚會（NCIM meetup、大連 Synbiopunk-CCiC、首屆 Grand APiC——TermiTox 在該場獲最佳專案、深圳 Synbio Challenge、他們與 50 多所大學共同籌辦的 Peking-Rice 國際 HP 高峰會，以及深圳大學的綠色生物圓桌會議）。","realWorld":"The application is cultural-heritage conservation — the Forbidden City, old temples and traditional courtyard houses — where residue-free, species-specific control matters more than speed. The modelling fed directly into deliverables: the colony model's counter-intuitive finding that Strain B must be *kept* in the bait when Strain A is added (because withdrawing B lets surviving larvae become replacement queens and the colony recovers) is implementable only with a refillable bait station, which the team designed as hardware; and the finding that multiple bait stations break the distance gradient and remove spatial refuges became a stated deployment principle for placing several recoverable stations around a protected structure. The quantitative deliverable is a usable specification: ~5% w/w dry yeast loading, ~65 days to collapse for a constrained colony of order 10^4 termites, ~10-10.5 months for a field colony of several hundred thousand.","realWorld_zh":"應用場域是文化遺產保存——故宮、古廟與傳統四合院——在這些地方，無殘留與物種專一性比速度更重要。建模直接餵進交付成果：巢群模型一個反直覺的發現是，當加入 A 菌株時，B 菌株必須*保留*在餌劑中（因為撤掉 B 會讓存活的幼蟲發育成替補蟻后，巢群得以恢復），而這只有在可補充的餌站上才實作得出來，該隊也因此把它設計成硬體；另一個發現是多個餌站可以打破距離梯度、消除空間避難所，這成為一條明確的投放原則：在受保護結構周圍放置數個可回收的餌站。定量的交付成果是一份可用的規格：乾酵母裝載量約 5% w/w，對一個量級為 10^4 隻白蟻的受限巢群約 65 天崩解，對一個數十萬隻的田間巢群約 10 至 10.5 個月。","partners":["Peking University","PKUHSC (Peking University Health Science Center)","Huangchenggen Primary School","Rice University (co-organised International HP Summit)","Shenzhen University (SZU green-bio roundtable)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6366/wiki/model/quick-view/termitox-model-whole-picture-v5.webp","caption":"The whole picture of the TermiTox multiscale model: molecular dynamics of the pH-gated LLO mutant, a cohort-ODE individual model of yeast persistence through payload release to functional decline, and a spatially explicit agent-based colony model of trophallactic spread, with each scale's output feeding the next.","caption_zh":"TermiTox 多尺度模型的全貌：受 pH 調控的 LLO 突變體的分子動力學、從酵母存續經酬載釋放到功能衰退的世代結構 ODE 個體模型，以及交哺傳播的空間明確主體基巢群模型，每個尺度的輸出都餵給下一個尺度。","credit":"Team Peking, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6366/wiki/model/colony-scale/figure-08-spatial-progression-one-bait.avif","caption":"Figure 8: spatial progression with one bait station. Columns are treatment days 10-120, rows are worker cohorts grouped by home module, and the three stacked panels show ever-exposed fraction, payload burden in a no-damage tracer run, and functional-worker fraction. Distant modules are exposed later and stay functional longer, acting as spatial refuges — a result that only appears because the nest geometry is modelled explicitly instead of as an SIR epidemic.","caption_zh":"圖 8：單一餌站下的空間進程。橫軸為處理第 10 至 120 天，縱軸為依所屬模組分組的工蟻世代，三個堆疊面板分別顯示曾暴露比例、在不計傷害的示蹤模擬中的酬載負擔，以及仍具功能的工蟻比例。較遠的模組較晚暴露、也維持功能更久，形成空間避難所——這個結果之所以會出現，正是因為巢的幾何被明確建模，而不是被當成 SIR 傳染病處理。","credit":"Team Peking, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6366/wiki/project/dry-design/model-validation-seven-literature-benchmarks-v2.avif","caption":"Seven published experiments reproduced by the individual-level model before it was used to predict anything about the team's own system — on yeast persistence, protozoa-dependent digestion and oral RNAi.","caption_zh":"個體層級模型在被用來預測該隊自己系統的任何事情之前，先重現的七項已發表實驗——涵蓋酵母存續、依賴原生動物的消化，以及口服 RNAi。","credit":"Team Peking, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6366/wiki/model/molecular-scale/figure-03-acidic-triad-closeup.avif","caption":"The acidic triad (D208/E247/D320) of H311A-LLO under acidic (left) and neutral (right) conditions. The salt-bridge network holds at pH 5.5 and separates at pH 7.4, supporting the safety premise that the pore-forming toxin is active only inside acidic protozoan food vacuoles — an allosteric effect, since the mutation site sits 17-18 Angstrom away and never contacts the triad.","caption_zh":"H311A-LLO 的酸性三元體（D208/E247/D320）在酸性（左）與中性（右）條件下的狀態。鹽橋網路在 pH 5.5 時維持、在 pH 7.4 時分離，支持了這個安全前提：這個造孔毒素只在酸性的原生動物食物泡內具活性——而且是異位效應，因為突變位點距離三元體 17-18 Å，從未與之接觸。","credit":"Team Peking, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Before writing a single equation, build an evidence map: a table listing every process you want to model, the published experiment that constrains it, what that experiment can and cannot separate, and a verdict of identifiable / composite / not identifiable — then build only the smallest model those data support, and carry multiple scenarios where the verdict is 'not identifiable' instead of asserting one. Then anchor model time to reality by simulating a well-documented reference compound through the same pipeline.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"在寫下任何方程式之前，先做一張證據地圖：列出你想建模的每一個過程、約束它的那篇已發表實驗、該實驗能區分與不能區分什麼，以及一個判定——可辨識／複合／不可辨識；然後只建這些資料所能支撐的最小模型，而在判定為「不可辨識」的地方，就並列多個情境，而不是斷言其中一個。接著把模型時間錨定到現實：讓一個文獻紀錄充分的參考化合物走過同一條流程。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/peking/","https://2026.igem.wiki/peking/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/peking/software/","https://2026.igem.wiki/peking/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/peking/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/peking/results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/peking/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/peking/education/"],"awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（大學組）","安全與保安獎 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳保育專案 — 入圍"],"rank":21},"6379":{"team":"NCKU-Tainan","id":"6379","section":"Undergrad","country":"Taiwan","village":"Infectious Diseases","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ncku-tainan/","projectTitle":"Capture: detecting and inhibiting Pseudomonas aeruginosa quorum-sensing signals","projectTitle_zh":"Capture：偵測並抑制 Pseudomonas aeruginosa 的群體感應訊號","tagline":"A US$54 to US$161 single-cuvette fluorescence reader, and a browser app that turns its counts into an AHL concentration with a 95% confidence interval.","tagline_zh":"一台造價 54 至 161 美元的單樣品槽螢光判讀儀，以及一個瀏覽器應用程式，可把它的計數值換算成帶 95% 信賴區間的 AHL 濃度。","summary":"NCKU-Tainan targeted the acyl-homoserine lactone signals that Pseudomonas aeruginosa uses to coordinate toxin release and biofilm formation in healthcare-associated infections, with two systems reading the same molecule: one that detects the signal and reports the infection, and one that inhibits it with published single-stranded DNA aptamers acting as molecular sponges. To read their GFP reporter without booking a shared plate reader in another building they built CAPTURE-Screen, a single-cuvette fluorescence reader in two versions, 3D-printed and laser-cut, costing 21 to 65 times less than an open-source plate reader. LasReader, a browser application, completes the chain by fitting a weighted four-parameter logistic calibration, deriving limits of detection from the blanks and returning each sample's concentration with an approximate confidence interval.","summary_zh":"NCKU-Tainan 針對 Pseudomonas aeruginosa 在醫療照護相關感染中用來協調毒素釋放與生物膜形成的醯基高絲胺酸內酯訊號，做了兩套讀取同一個分子的系統：一套偵測訊號並通報感染，另一套則以已發表的單股 DNA 適體作為分子海綿來抑制它。為了讀取自己的 GFP 報告訊號又不必到另一棟樓預約共用的微量盤判讀儀，他們做了 CAPTURE-Screen，一台單樣品槽螢光判讀儀，有 3D 列印與雷射切割兩個版本，成本比開源微量盤判讀儀低 21 至 65 倍。瀏覽器應用程式 LasReader 補完了整條鏈：擬合加權的四參數邏輯斯校正曲線，由空白樣本推導偵測極限，並回傳每個樣品的濃度與近似信賴區間。","awards":["Best Hardware — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Infectious Diseases Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"The hardware page opens by deriving its requirements from the assay rather than from an instrument wish list: 200 uL of sfGFP culture per reaction, read every hour for six hours at 37 C, benchmarked against the plate-reader standard of 485/510 nm, and cheap enough to rebuild. The modelling is split into three parts that each serve a different part of the team (an inhibition model for the wet lab, an imaging model for the software, a fluorescence model for the hardware). Software, hardware and model are written as one workflow, with LasReader checking the reader, showing which tube to read next, and keeping every saved curve with its limit of detection and usable range.","frameworks_zh":"硬體頁面一開頭就從檢測需求而非儀器願望清單推導規格：每次反應 200 uL 的 sfGFP 培養液、在 37 C 下每小時讀一次共六小時、以微量盤判讀儀的 485/510 nm 標準作為對標，而且便宜到可以重做一台。建模被拆成三個部分，各自服務團隊的不同組別（給濕實驗的抑制模型、給軟體的成像模型、給硬體的螢光模型）。軟體、硬體與模型寫成同一條工作流程：LasReader 會檢查判讀儀狀態、顯示下一支該讀哪一管，並把每一條存下的曲線連同其偵測極限與可用範圍一併保留。","dataviz":"Plan-view and cut-away optical diagrams drawn to scale with a stated pixel-to-millimetre ratio; an interactive exploded view of the instrument; counts-versus-condition plots that always show the emission channel beside the scatter channel; a calibration page in the app that renders the fitted curve as a PNG alongside the CSV export; a step bar at the top of every CAPTURE-Screen page showing the reader status, the number of calibration runs, how many produced a usable curve, and whether Measure is ready.","dataviz_zh":"依比例繪製並標明像素對毫米比例的俯視圖與剖面光學圖；可互動的儀器爆炸圖；計數值對條件的圖表，而且總是把放射通道與散射通道並列呈現；應用程式中的校正頁面會把擬合曲線輸出為 PNG，同時提供 CSV 匯出；每一個 CAPTURE-Screen 頁面頂端都有一條步驟列，顯示判讀儀狀態、校正執行次數、其中有幾次產生可用曲線，以及 Measure 是否就緒。","datascience":"The instrument is honest about what its numbers are. Readings are raw sensor counts from an AS7341 ten-channel spectral sensor, with F4 (515 nm) as the emission channel and F3 (480 nm) reported beside it as the scatter channel, because the team found that dense suspensions give a few counts of F4 with no reporter present once F3 passes about 46 and none below about 33, so a few counts alone are not evidence of GFP. Excitation and emission are separated by angle (detection at 90 degrees) and by colour (the sensor's own bands), with no emission filter, and a light trap whose end wall slopes at about 41 degrees turns transmitted blue up into the roof rather than back at the sample. Every measurement cycle begins and ends with a dark read, and under the shield every channel must read exactly zero or the cycle is void. Repeatability is quantified at the level that actually varies: five re-insertions of one tube gave 0.76% standard deviation at about 50 counts. Validation is comparative rather than self-referential, with one batch of sfGFP culture at five dilutions plus medium and a non-fluorescent culture read on the team's reader and on a SpectraMax M3 on the same day, ranking the tubes the same way, with the green reading rising from 2.44 to 86.44 counts and about 104 counts per unit OD600 across the three denser tubes. The team states plainly that counts from the two readers are not interchangeable, and reports the failures: the laser-cut build could not distinguish the AHL sensor strain from cells without sfGFP, and the 3D-printed build read zero on its emission channel for that strain. LasReader carries the statistics. It requires at least four concentrations and two blanks as the minimum for a four-parameter curve and a limit of detection, and fits a weighted four-parameter logistic in which EC50 is fitted as its logarithm to keep it positive and the Hill slope is bounded between 0.05 and 20, with blanks entering at zero concentration so they fix the baseline directly. Weighting is used because replicates scatter more at high signal than at low, and the uncertainty of the fitted curve is propagated through the Jacobian of the model derivatives with a diagonal weight matrix, which is what produces the approximate 95% confidence interval on every reported concentration. Detection limits follow the blank-based convention, LOD as the inverse curve evaluated at the blank mean plus three blank standard deviations and LOQ at ten, with documented fallbacks when every blank reads identically, and the usable range starting at whichever is higher, the LOD or the lowest standard, so that a sample can clear the LOD and still be reported as below the usable range. Exports are auditable: one CSV with every reading, every exclusion and its reason, and every result, plus the curve as a PNG, with a curve's own exclusions kept with the curve in its JSON backup. The mechanistic modelling matches this care, with two parameters fitted to swarming data and uncertainty assessed by 400 joint draws combining plate-level bootstrap resampling with uncertain model inputs and refitting each time (296 successful), reporting 5th to 95th percentile ranges, PRCC sensitivity indices, and the explicit statement that these are effective values and not confidence intervals for measured biochemical constants.","datascience_zh":"這台儀器對自己的數字很誠實。讀值是來自 AS7341 十通道光譜感測器的原始計數，以 F4（515 nm）作為放射通道，並把 F3（480 nm）作為散射通道並列報告，因為團隊發現在沒有報告蛋白時，濃密的菌懸液一旦 F3 超過約 46 就會給出幾個計數的 F4，而低於約 33 則完全沒有，所以單憑幾個計數並不能作為 GFP 的證據。激發與放射以角度（在 90 度偵測）與顏色（感測器自身的頻段）分開，沒有放射濾光片；一個末端牆面傾斜約 41 度的光陷阱會把穿透的藍光往上導向頂部，而不是反射回樣品。每一個量測週期的開始與結束都做一次暗讀值，在遮罩之下每一個通道都必須讀到恰好為零，否則該週期作廢。重複性是在真正會變動的層次上被量化：同一管重新插入五次，在約 50 個計數處得到 0.76% 的標準差。驗證採比較式而非自我參照：同一批 sfGFP 培養液的五個稀釋度，加上培養基與一組不發螢光的培養液，在同一天分別以團隊的判讀儀與一台 SpectraMax M3 量測，兩者對各管的排序一致，綠色讀值從 2.44 上升到 86.44 個計數，在較濃的三管中約為每單位 OD600 104 個計數。團隊直白表示兩台判讀儀的計數並不可互換，也報告了失敗：雷射切割版本無法區分 AHL 感測菌株與不含 sfGFP 的細胞，而 3D 列印版本對該菌株的放射通道讀到零。統計則由 LasReader 承擔。它要求至少四個濃度與兩個空白樣本，作為四參數曲線與偵測極限的最低條件，並擬合加權的四參數邏輯斯模型，其中 EC50 以對數形式擬合以保持為正值，Hill 斜率被限制在 0.05 與 20 之間，而空白樣本以濃度為零進入擬合，因此直接固定了基線。採用加權是因為重複樣本在高訊號處的分散程度大於低訊號處；擬合曲線的不確定性則透過模型導數的 Jacobian 矩陣搭配對角權重矩陣傳遞，這正是每一個報告濃度上那個近似 95% 信賴區間的來源。偵測極限遵循以空白為基礎的慣例：LOD 為反函數曲線在空白平均值加三倍空白標準差處的取值，LOQ 則取十倍，並對所有空白讀值完全相同的情況記錄了備援做法；可用範圍則從 LOD 與最低標準品之中較高者開始，因此一個樣品可能通過 LOD，卻仍被報告為低於可用範圍。匯出內容可供稽核：一份 CSV 包含每一筆讀值、每一次排除及其理由，以及每一項結果，另加曲線的 PNG，而某條曲線自身的排除紀錄會與該曲線一起保存在它的 JSON 備份中。機制性建模也維持同樣的謹慎：兩個參數以群游資料擬合，不確定性以 400 次聯合抽樣評估，做法是把盤層級的 bootstrap 重抽與不確定的模型輸入結合，每次都重新擬合（其中 296 次成功），並報告第 5 到第 95 百分位區間、PRCC 敏感度指標，同時明確聲明這些是有效值，而不是所測生化常數的信賴區間。","software":"LasReader, a browser application with nothing to install, released under the MIT License with source on iGEM GitLab, carrying a research-use-only disclaimer that it reports concentrations inferred from a calibration curve and is not intended for diagnostic use. It works either with CAPTURE-Screen, where the instrument becomes part of the workflow, or with data from any plate reader through the same steps, and the analysis never uses the target's name so it transfers to other biosensors whose rising response suits a 4PL fit. The hardware is released as 53 STL files covering 66 pieces across both versions, with firmware that controls LED timing and integration, plus the laser-cut design, wiring and schematic.","software_zh":"LasReader 是一個不需安裝任何東西的瀏覽器應用程式，以 MIT License 釋出，原始碼放在 iGEM GitLab，並帶有僅供研究使用的免責聲明，說明它所報告的濃度是由校正曲線推得，不供診斷用途。它既可與 CAPTURE-Screen 搭配，使儀器成為工作流程的一部分，也能以相同步驟處理任何微量盤判讀儀的資料；而分析過程從未用到標的物的名稱，因此可以移轉到其他反應隨濃度上升、適合 4PL 擬合的生物感測器上。硬體以 53 個 STL 檔釋出，涵蓋兩個版本共 66 個零件，並附上控制 LED 時序與積分時間的韌體，以及雷射切割設計圖、配線與電路圖。","stack":["AS7341 ten-channel spectral sensor (SEN0365 board)","Cree 470 nm excitation LED","UVette 200 uL cuvettes","3D printing (FDM) and laser cutting","SpectraMax M3 as reference instrument","Four-parameter logistic regression (weighted)","Bootstrap resampling and PRCC sensitivity analysis","Browser-based analysis app (MIT licence)"],"techniques":["Dark read at the start and end of every cycle, voided if non-zero","Scatter channel reported alongside the emission channel","Re-insertion repeatability as a stated percentage","Side-by-side benchmarking against a commercial plate reader","Weighted 4PL calibration with bounded Hill slope","Confidence intervals propagated through the fit Jacobian","Blank-derived LOD and LOQ with documented fallbacks","Usable range set by the higher of LOD and lowest standard","Auditable CSV export of every exclusion and its reason","Bootstrap plus input-uncertainty joint refitting","PRCC parameter sensitivity"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education work includes a board game and an online game alongside a documented education programme, a promotion page and a survey.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育工作包括一款桌遊與一款線上遊戲，另有一份有記錄的教育計畫、一個推廣頁面與一份問卷調查。","ihp":"A meet-with-experts programme fed the project's scope and its claims. Prof. Nan-Si Li's framing, that at this stage the project detects signals and does not diagnose infections, is quoted directly in the software's own disclaimer, so the limit on the claim is visible inside the tool rather than only on the wiki.","ihp_zh":"一個與專家會面的計畫餵養了專案的範圍與其主張。Prof. Nan-Si Li 的定調，也就是現階段這個專案偵測的是訊號、並不診斷感染，被直接引述在軟體自己的免責聲明裡，因此主張的界線就顯示在工具內部，而不只是寫在 wiki 上。","realWorld":"The problem is framed around healthcare-associated infections, where P. aeruginosa resists many antibiotics, releases tissue-damaging toxins and forms biofilms that antibiotics struggle to cross, all behaviours that depend on cells coordinating through chemical signals. The instrument's justification is operational: a shared plate reader is booked, scheduled and in one building, while either build can sit next to the incubator. Cost is given against a named alternative, at most US$161 for the 3D-printed build and US$54 for the laser-cut one versus under US$3,500 for a published open-source plate reader, with the point that anyone with the source files can rebuild it. The reader is positioned for the commonest reading in synthetic biology, green fluorescence from a GFP reporter in a liquid sample, and for cell-free portable sensors that hold no cells at all.","realWorld_zh":"問題框定在醫療照護相關感染上：P. aeruginosa 對許多抗生素具抗性，會釋出破壞組織的毒素，並形成抗生素難以穿透的生物膜，而這些行為全都依賴細胞透過化學訊號彼此協調。儀器的理由是操作層面的：共用的微量盤判讀儀要預約、要排程，而且在另一棟樓裡，而這兩個版本都可以就放在培養箱旁邊。成本是對著一個具名的替代方案給出的：3D 列印版本最多 161 美元、雷射切割版本 54 美元，相對於一台已發表的開源微量盤判讀儀不到 3,500 美元；重點在於任何人只要有原始檔案就能重做一台。這台判讀儀的定位是合成生物學中最常見的讀值，也就是液體樣品中 GFP 報告蛋白的綠色螢光，以及完全不含細胞的無細胞可攜式感測器。","partners":["Prof. Nan-Si Li","National Cheng Kung University"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6379/wiki/hardware/hardware.avif","caption":"CAPTURE-Screen, the team's single-cuvette fluorescence reader for GFP reporter cultures, built so it can sit next to the incubator instead of competing for a shared plate reader in another building.","caption_zh":"CAPTURE-Screen，團隊為 GFP 報告菌培養液打造的單樣品槽螢光判讀儀，設計上可以就放在培養箱旁邊，不必去搶另一棟樓裡的共用微量盤判讀儀。","credit":"Team NCKU-Tainan, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6379/wiki/hardware/printed-run-1-cuvette-in.avif","caption":"A 200 uL UVette loaded into the 3D-printed build. Excitation enters from the side and the AS7341 detector reads at 90 degrees, with no emission filter; the colour separation is the sensor's own.","caption_zh":"一支 200 uL 的 UVette 裝入 3D 列印版本。激發光從側面進入，AS7341 偵測器在 90 度讀取，沒有放射濾光片；顏色的分離來自感測器本身。","credit":"Team NCKU-Tainan, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6379/wiki/haddwarelacerreader/haddwarelacerreader/front.avif","caption":"The laser-cut version of the reader in its own enclosure, costed at US$54 against under US$3,500 for the open-source plate reader the team benchmarked against.","caption_zh":"雷射切割版本的判讀儀與其外殼，成本計為 54 美元，對比團隊所對標的開源微量盤判讀儀不到 3,500 美元。","credit":"Team NCKU-Tainan, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6379/wiki/software/curve.avif","caption":"LasReader's calibration view. A weighted four-parameter logistic curve is fitted with the blanks fixing the baseline, limits of detection and quantification are derived from the blanks, and each sample inside the usable range is returned with an approximate 95% confidence interval.","caption_zh":"LasReader 的校正畫面。加權四參數邏輯斯曲線以空白樣本固定基線進行擬合，偵測極限與定量極限由空白樣本推導，而落在可用範圍內的每個樣品都會附上近似 95% 信賴區間回傳。","credit":"Team NCKU-Tainan, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Ship the analysis with the instrument: a calibration that fits a weighted 4PL, derives its detection limit from the blanks, propagates a confidence interval onto every reported concentration, and exports every excluded reading with its reason turns a cheap reader's raw counts into a number someone else can audit.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把分析與儀器一起出貨：一套會擬合加權 4PL、由空白樣本推導偵測極限、把信賴區間傳遞到每一個報告濃度上，並把每一筆被排除的讀值連同排除理由一起匯出的分析流程，能把一台便宜判讀儀的原始計數值，變成別人可以稽核的數字。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/ncku-tainan/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/ncku-tainan/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/ncku-tainan/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/ncku-tainan/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/ncku-tainan/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/ncku-tainan/human-practices"],"awards_zh":["最佳硬體 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳傳染病專案 — 得主"],"rank":33},"6381":{"team":"UCL","id":"6381","section":"Undergrad","country":"United Kingdom","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/","projectTitle":"SHELLter — capturing cisplatin from patient urine with a chelator made from shellfish waste","projectTitle_zh":"SHELLter — 以甲殼廢料製成的螯合劑，從病人尿液中捕捉順鉑","tagline":"A point-of-care cartridge that chelates platinum chemotherapy drugs out of patient urine, with the chelator made enzymatically from crab shell.","tagline_zh":"一個在照護現場使用的濾匣，把鉑類化療藥物從病人尿液中螯合出來，而螯合劑本身是以酵素從蟹殼製造的。","summary":"About half of each cisplatin dose leaves the patient in urine within days, and UK hospital effluent is not treated for cytotoxics at all. SHELLter intercepts it at the point of care with a monoacetylchitosan chelating ligand produced from shellfish-processing waste by an engineered SmChiA-VcCDA fusion enzyme. The dry lab is presented as four Python files on an interactive laptop — kinetic_model.py, docking_simulation.py, life_cycle_assessment.py and techno_economic_analysis.py — and all four feed each other: the kinetic model sets reaction conditions and predicts how downstream purification affects product yield, that yield drives the techno-economic cost per gram, and the same mass balance underpins the openLCA life cycle assessment. The docking study is a rigorously controlled computational experiment with negative controls, a pre-specified acceptance rule, multiple-comparison correction and a stated power analysis.","summary_zh":"每一劑順鉑約有一半會在數天內隨尿液離開病人體內，而英國醫院的廢水完全沒有針對細胞毒性藥物做處理。SHELLter 在照護現場就把它攔下來，使用的是以單乙醯幾丁聚醣為基礎的螯合配體，由改造過的 SmChiA-VcCDA 融合酵素以甲殼加工廢料製成。乾實驗室被呈現為一台互動式筆電上的四個 Python 檔案——kinetic_model.py、docking_simulation.py、life_cycle_assessment.py 與 techno_economic_analysis.py——而且四者互相餵養：動力學模型決定反應條件，並預測下游純化如何影響產物產率；該產率驅動技術經濟分析的每公克成本；同一份質量平衡也支撐起 openLCA 的生命週期評估。對接研究則是一個控制嚴謹的計算實驗，具備負對照、事先訂好的接受準則、多重比較校正，以及明確的檢定力分析。","awards":["Best Model — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Four models, deliberately coupled. (1) KINETIC MODEL — a mechanistic ODE system rather than an empirical fit, chosen precisely because the fusion enzyme is novel and PpChi is barely characterised, so no dataset exists to fit against. It is built from inhibited Michaelis-Menten forms: competitive inhibition for product rebinding, and noncompetitive inhibition for process impurities where, lacking any single inhibition constant for a mixture, they substitute chitin's measured protein-holding capacity (Cm = 0.032573 g/g) times substrate concentration as the rate-limiting term, giving dP/dt = kcat*ET*S / [Km(1 + I/Ki + D/(Cm*S)) + S(1 + D/(Cm*S))]. SmChiA's non-Michaelian processive mechanism on insoluble chitin is handled by converting polymer mass to N-acetylglucosamine residues (R0 = S0/203 g/mol), and PpChi's substrate is converted to GlcN-GlcN-GlcNAc motifs with the motif yield derived from degree of acetylation, Y = DA(1-DA)^2, and an average residue weight W = DA*203 + (1-DA)*161. Environmental dependence is interpolated with double-sigmoid rate modifiers for pH (F) and temperature (G) multiplying kcat, with all nine fitted sigmoid constants tabulated per enzyme, and thermal enzyme decay modelled with Bigelow's law. Twelve assumptions are tabulated with their impact AND their limitation, and the most influential are tested in a dedicated Choice Sensitivity section. (2) DOCKING SIMULATION — a ten-stage pipeline built as a controlled experiment, which is what makes it exceptional. Four fusion constructs (varying only the two things literature could not settle: domain order and His-tag terminus; all 1015 residues, GGGGSGGGGS inter-domain linker, GGGGS tag linker, native signal peptides retained) were each predicted five times by AlphaFold 3 with different seeds, giving twenty structures. Two design rules govern everything: every measurement is a difference taken WITHIN a single predicted structure, never between structures, because across seeds the CDA domain moved 25.6 +/- 11.0 Angstrom relative to ChiA so a between-structure comparison would measure AlphaFold rather than the protein; and every effect is measured against an apo' control in which the stochastic relaxation is re-run with nothing changed but the random seed, giving a genuine noise floor. Active-site residues were MEASURED rather than quoted: heavy atoms within 4.5 Angstrom of a bound chito-oligosaccharide across multiple crystal structures (1EHN, 1NH6 for SmChiA; 4NZ1, 4NZ3, 4OUI for VcCDA, 98.7-99.8% identity), with a residue required to appear in at least two independent structures, a 6.0 Angstrom criterion defining the mobile cleft, ligands under ten heavy atoms ignored to exclude buffer and cryoprotectant, and SIX NEGATIVE-CONTROL structures expected to return nothing, which returned zero contacts. Relaxation is Rosetta FastRelax under ref2015 via PyRosetta, five rounds, with a movemap freeing only the ~400 residues within 10 Angstrom of either cleft, computed once per replicate from the apo structure and reused unchanged across all four conditions so that apo and holo are compared over an identical mobile set. Substrates (tetraacetylchitotetraose, 57 heavy atoms, for the chitinase groove; diacetylchitobiose, 29 heavy atoms, for the deacetylase pocket) were built from PubChem with RDKit, parameterised with Meeko, and verified atom by atom. Docking is AutoDock Vina at exhaustiveness 32 with three independent seeds per receptor-substrate pair, 148 searches total, into a box centred on the contacting residues padded 6 Angstrom and clamped 18-32 Angstrom with a guard flagging any box centre more than 5 Angstrom from the cleft centroid. (3) LIFE CYCLE ASSESSMENT — a cradle-to-use LCA of four process steps (chitin extraction from shellfish waste, fusion production in E. coli, ligand production, device use), built in two independent halves that must agree: a component mass balance tracking every stream in every unit operation, and an openLCA model reproducing that arithmetic separately. Functional unit is one treatment course: one patient, five cycles, five cartridges per cycle, 60 kg of urine carrying 0.336 g of drug, with the baseline being the status quo of untreated discharge. (4) TECHNO-ECONOMIC MODEL — built on the same central mass balance, with a localised impurity-prediction part that feeds back into project design and a full cost-of-goods and discounted-cash-flow analysis.","frameworks_zh":"四個模型，刻意互相耦合。（1）動力學模型：一組機制性的 ODE 系統，而不是經驗式擬合；之所以這樣選，正是因為這個融合酵素是全新的，而 PpChi 幾乎沒有被表徵過，根本沒有資料集可以拿來擬合。模型以帶抑制的 Michaelis-Menten 形式建立：產物再結合採競爭性抑制，製程雜質採非競爭性抑制；由於混合物沒有單一的抑制常數可用，他們改以幾丁質實測的蛋白吸附容量（Cm = 0.032573 g/g）乘上基質濃度作為限速項，得到 dP/dt = kcat*ET*S / [Km(1 + I/Ki + D/(Cm*S)) + S(1 + D/(Cm*S))]。SmChiA 在不溶性幾丁質上非 Michaelis 式的連續作用機制，以把高分子質量換算成 N-乙醯葡萄糖胺殘基（R0 = S0/203 g/mol）來處理；PpChi 的基質則換算成 GlcN-GlcN-GlcNAc 模式單元，其產率由乙醯化度推得，Y = DA(1-DA)^2，平均殘基分子量 W = DA*203 + (1-DA)*161。環境依賴性以 pH（F）與溫度（G）的雙 S 形速率修正因子內插，兩者乘上 kcat，每一種酵素所擬合的九個 S 形常數都列表呈現；酵素的熱衰減則以 Bigelow 定律建模。十二項假設都列表呈現，同時寫出它的影響與它的限制，而影響最大的幾項則在專門的選擇敏感度章節中加以檢驗。（2）對接模擬：一條十階段的流程，被當成一個受控實驗來設計，這正是它出色的原因。四種融合構築（只變動文獻無法定案的兩件事：結構域順序與 His-tag 放在哪一端；全長皆為 1015 個殘基，結構域間連接子為 GGGGSGGGGS，標籤連接子為 GGGGS，並保留原生訊號胜肽）各以不同隨機種子用 AlphaFold 3 預測五次，共得到二十個結構。有兩條設計規則貫穿全局：每一項量測都是在同一個預測結構內部取差值，絕不跨結構比較，因為在不同種子之間，CDA 結構域相對於 ChiA 移動了 25.6 ± 11.0 埃，跨結構比較量到的會是 AlphaFold 而不是蛋白質本身；而每一項效應都要對照一組 apo' 對照，也就是只改隨機種子、其他完全不變地重跑一次隨機鬆弛，藉此得到真正的雜訊底線。活性位殘基是量出來的，不是引用來的：在多個晶體結構中（SmChiA 用 1EHN、1NH6；VcCDA 用 4NZ1、4NZ3、4OUI，相似度 98.7-99.8%）取距離已結合幾丁寡醣 4.5 埃以內的重原子，並要求一個殘基至少出現在兩個獨立結構中；以 6.0 埃的標準界定可動的裂隙；忽略重原子少於十個的配體，以排除緩衝液與冷凍保護劑；另外設置六個預期應該什麼都不回傳的負對照結構，結果確實回傳零接觸。鬆弛使用透過 PyRosetta 執行、以 ref2015 評分函數的 Rosetta FastRelax，跑五輪，movemap 只釋放兩個裂隙任一側 10 埃以內的約 400 個殘基；這個 movemap 針對每個重複由 apo 結構計算一次，並在全部四種條件下原封不動重複使用，讓 apo 與 holo 在完全相同的可動殘基集合上比較。基質（幾丁質酶溝槽用四乙醯幾丁四醣，57 個重原子；去乙醯酶口袋用二乙醯幾丁二醣，29 個重原子）以 RDKit 從 PubChem 建構、用 Meeko 參數化，並逐一原子核對。對接使用 AutoDock Vina，exhaustiveness 設 32，每一組受體與基質配對跑三個獨立種子，總共 148 次搜尋；搜尋盒以接觸殘基為中心、外擴 6 埃，並限制在 18-32 埃之間，另設一道檢核，只要盒子中心離裂隙質心超過 5 埃就會被標示出來。（3）生命週期評估：一份從搖籃到使用階段的 LCA，涵蓋四個製程步驟（從甲殼廢料萃取幾丁質、在 E. coli 中生產融合酵素、生產配體、裝置使用），並以兩個必須互相吻合的獨立半邊建立：一份逐一追蹤每個單元操作中每一股物流的成分質量平衡，以及一個獨立重現同一套算術的 openLCA 模型。功能單位是一個療程：一位病人、五個週期、每週期五個濾匣、60 kg 尿液中帶有 0.336 g 藥物，基線則是現狀，也就是未經處理直接排放。（4）技術經濟模型：建立在同一份核心質量平衡上，另有一個局部的雜質預測部分會回饋到專案設計，並包含完整的製造成本與折現現金流分析。","dataviz":"The model landing page is an interactive laptop whose screen lists the four models as Python filenames, which the reader clicks to open — a small piece of framing that tells the reader immediately that the dry lab is four programs, not one vague 'model'. The kinetic results are presented as parameter sweeps with the optimum marked by a dot on each curve: time to 50% and 90% substrate conversion against temperature for each enzyme separately (PpChi 45 C, SmChiA 43 C, VcCDA 39 C) and a two-dimensional temperature-by-pH heatmap for the fusion (optimum 43 C, pH 6.1) drawn in the Okabe-Ito colour-blind-safe palette with darker colours for faster conversion — the team say so in the caption. Figure 20 is the decisive one: an enzyme molar-ratio sweep from 0.1 to 40 at constant total enzyme mass, showing a 15:1 SmChiA:VcCDA optimum roughly twice as fast as the 1:1 ratio a fusion is structurally locked into. The docking pipeline is drawn as a ten-stage flow diagram where each box names the stage, what it does and the software used, with stage 0 (measuring active sites from crystal structures) and stage 3 (building substrates from PubChem) shown as completing before the work they feed. Structures are shown in an embedded 3Dmol.js v2.5.5 viewer with a toggle between colour-by-part and colour-by-pLDDT confidence, and every AlphaFold figure caption carries the warning 'NOT experimentally determined or validated'. The LCA opens with a calibrated comparison instead of an abstract number: one SHELLter course emits 19.76 kg CO2eq, about 36 caffe lattes, 2.1 CT scans or one chemotherapy cycle — immediately followed by a note that these equivalence figures come from papers using different impact methods and databases and are 'given only for contextual perspective'.","dataviz_zh":"模型首頁是一台互動式筆電，螢幕上以 Python 檔名列出四個模型，讀者點擊即可開啟；這個小小的呈現方式立刻告訴讀者，乾實驗室是四個程式，而不是一個含糊的「模型」。動力學結果以參數掃描呈現，每條曲線上都用一個點標出最佳值：各酵素分別的基質轉換達 50% 與 90% 所需時間對溫度作圖（PpChi 45 C、SmChiA 43 C、VcCDA 39 C），以及融合酵素的溫度對 pH 二維熱圖（最佳點 43 C、pH 6.1），採用對色盲友善的 Okabe-Ito 色盤，顏色越深代表轉換越快；團隊在圖說中也說明了這一點。圖 20 是最關鍵的一張：在總酵素質量固定的條件下，把酵素莫耳比從 0.1 掃到 40，顯示 SmChiA 比 VcCDA 為 15:1 時最佳，速度約為融合蛋白在結構上被鎖定的 1:1 比例的兩倍。對接流程畫成一張十階段流程圖，每個方塊都寫出階段名稱、做什麼以及使用的軟體，並把階段 0（從晶體結構量測活性位）與階段 3（從 PubChem 建構基質）畫成在它們所餵養的工作之前就已完成。結構以內嵌的 3Dmol.js v2.5.5 檢視器呈現，可切換依部位上色或依 pLDDT 信賴度上色，而每一張 AlphaFold 圖的圖說都附上警語：並非由實驗測定或驗證。LCA 一開始不是給一個抽象數字，而是給一個有校準的比較：一個 SHELLter 療程排放 19.76 kg CO2eq，大約等於 36 杯拿鐵、2.1 次電腦斷層掃描，或一個化療週期；緊接著就註明這些等價數字來自使用不同衝擊評估方法與資料庫的論文，只是為了提供脈絡上的參照。","datascience":"The statistical design of the docking study is the standout. The initial pose-convergence test (maximum pairwise RMSD across seeds) was found to conflate two different failure modes — seeds genuinely scattering versus a majority agreeing with one outlier — and was replaced mid-run with a rule written down BEFORE the run finished and then applied uniformly: a pose is accepted only if a strict majority of seeds agree within 2.0 Angstrom, the best-scoring pose falls inside that majority, at least 60% of its heavy atoms lie within 5 Angstrom of the cleft, and it clears every face of the search box by at least 1 Angstrom; every non-unanimous replicate got two further seeds. Results are reported with explicit counts and the honest verdict for each of five pre-set questions: both sites still bind (35 of 40 dockings accepted); each site responds structurally to its OWN substrate and not the other (25 of 32 paired comparisons, p = 0.0021, with Holm-Bonferroni correction cited); both sites can be occupied simultaneously (16 of 20 replicates); occupying one site produces no detectable effect at the other by three independent measurements, with the effect size BOUNDED below the apo' noise floor and the Rosetta additivity residual below ~4 REU; and domain order is reported as 'Not resolved at this sample size' with the explicit gloss that this means insufficient power, not absence of an effect. They then do the power analysis properly: at 9-12 replicates per group the null can only be rejected on unanimity, at 16 one may disagree, at 20 three may, so twenty per group is where the design starts to be able to detect what it currently cannot — with the per-step compute cost given (7.4 min per ligand docking, 16-24 min per relaxation on four cores) so the extension is actionable. Ten numbered assumptions are tabulated with impact and limitation, including that the VcCDA catalytic Zn2+ is simply absent from predicted structures (which they offer as the likely cause of DACB poses sitting partly off the pocket), that Vina affinities 'should be read as a ranking aid, not as delta-G', and that the docking score's 8 Angstrom interatomic cutoff could not register a direct 34-47 Angstrom cross-site interaction even if one existed — which is precisely why they also ran the cutoff-free Rosetta additivity test. The models genuinely changed decisions: the kinetic model's 15:1 ratio finding and the fusion-vs-dual-enzyme-vs-PpChi comparison table (time to 90% conversion: fusion 2.05 h, dual single-pot 1.17 h, dual multi-pot 1.84 h, PpChi 12.68 h) reframed the construct choice; the impurity model showed that going from 6 to 8 downstream unit operations nearly doubled product at 10 hours (11.44 to 22.40 mM), and feeding that into the TEA gave a cost per gram of chitobiose for each of five flowsheets (78.66, 84.57, 59.98, 172.62, 180.01 GBP/g), selecting PEG precipitation over chromatography on the reasoning that the fusion is not a biopharmaceutical so its purity target exists only to improve function. The DCF analysis, solved with GoalSeek to NPV = 0 at a 12% discount rate, gives a 17-year payback and a unit price of GBP 146.45, contextualised as ~1.9% of the GBP 7,670 NHS cost of treating one patient with systemic anti-cancer therapy.","datascience_zh":"對接研究的統計設計是最突出的一點。最初的姿態收斂檢驗（跨種子的最大兩兩 RMSD）被發現會把兩種不同的失敗模式混為一談：種子真的四散，與多數一致但有一個離群值；於是在執行過程中換成另一條規則，而這條規則是在整批執行結束之前就先寫下來、之後一律適用：一個姿態只有在超過半數的種子彼此落在 2.0 埃以內、得分最佳的姿態也落在這個多數之中、其重原子至少 60% 位於裂隙 5 埃以內、而且與搜尋盒的每一個面都至少保留 1 埃距離時，才會被接受；凡是沒有全體一致的重複，都再加跑兩個種子。結果都附上明確的計數，並對五個事先設定的問題各自給出誠實的判斷：兩個活性位仍然會結合（40 次對接中接受 35 次）；每個活性位只對自己的基質產生結構反應，而不是對另一個（32 組配對比較中有 25 組，p = 0.0021，並引用 Holm-Bonferroni 校正）；兩個活性位可以同時被佔據（20 個重複中有 16 個）；佔據其中一個活性位，以三種獨立量測都偵測不到對另一個的影響，效應量被界定在 apo' 雜訊底線之下，Rosetta 的加成性殘差也低於約 4 REU；至於結構域順序，則回報為在這個樣本數下無法定論，並明確說明這代表檢定力不足，而不是沒有效應。接著他們把檢定力分析做得很紮實：每組 9-12 個重複時，只有全體一致才能拒絕虛無假設；16 個時可以容許一個不一致；20 個時可以容許三個，所以每組二十個才是這個設計開始能偵測到目前偵測不到的東西的地方；他們也給出每一步的運算成本（每次配體對接 7.4 分鐘，四核心上每次鬆弛 16-24 分鐘），讓後續的延伸真的可以執行。十項編號的假設都列表附上影響與限制，包括：預測結構中根本沒有 VcCDA 的催化 Zn2+（他們認為這很可能就是 DACB 姿態部分落在口袋外的原因）；Vina 的親和力數值應該被當成排序的輔助，而不是 delta-G；以及對接評分的 8 埃原子間截斷距離，即使真有一個橫跨 34-47 埃的跨活性位交互作用也偵測不到——這正是他們另外做了不設截斷距離的 Rosetta 加成性檢驗的原因。這些模型真的改變了決策：動力學模型 15:1 的比例結論，以及融合酵素對雙酵素對 PpChi 的比較表（達 90% 轉換所需時間：融合 2.05 小時、雙酵素單鍋 1.17 小時、雙酵素多鍋 1.84 小時、PpChi 12.68 小時），重新框定了構築的選擇；雜質模型顯示下游單元操作從 6 個增加到 8 個，可讓 10 小時的產物量幾乎倍增（11.44 到 22.40 mM），把這個結果餵進技術經濟分析後，得出五種流程方案各自的每公克幾丁二醣成本（78.66、84.57、59.98、172.62、180.01 英鎊／公克），並選擇 PEG 沉澱而非層析，理由是這個融合酵素不是生物藥品，純度目標的存在只是為了改善功能。折現現金流分析以 GoalSeek 在 12% 折現率下求解到 NPV = 0，得到 17 年回收期與每單位 146.45 英鎊的價格，並放在脈絡中說明：這大約是 NHS 為一位病人施行全身性抗癌治療 7,670 英鎊成本的 1.9%。","software":"The kinetic model is released on the team's software GitLab at gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/ucl/model. The docking pipeline is parameterised and scripted end to end, which is what makes the stated extension (add seeds, re-run the same scripts) credible. Structures are presented in-browser with 3Dmol.js v2.5.5 (BSD-3-Clause) with a pLDDT colouring toggle. The LCA is built in openLCA alongside an independent spreadsheet mass balance as a cross-check.","software_zh":"動力學模型釋出在團隊的軟體 GitLab：gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/ucl/model。對接流程從頭到尾都參數化並寫成腳本，這也是他們所提延伸做法（加種子、重跑同一批腳本）之所以可信的原因。結構以 3Dmol.js v2.5.5（BSD-3-Clause）在瀏覽器中呈現，並可切換 pLDDT 上色。LCA 以 openLCA 建立，並以一份獨立的試算表質量平衡作為交叉檢查。","stack":["Python","SciPy ODE integration","AlphaFold 3 (AlphaFold Server)","PyRosetta / Rosetta FastRelax (ref2015)","AutoDock Vina","Meeko","RDKit","3Dmol.js v2.5.5","openLCA","Excel / GoalSeek (discounted cash flow)","PubChem","Protein Data Bank","Benchling"],"techniques":["mechanistic ODE enzyme kinetics","competitive and noncompetitive inhibited Michaelis-Menten kinetics","processive-enzyme substrate conversion (polymer to residue/motif)","double-sigmoid environmental rate modifiers for pH and temperature","Bigelow thermal inactivation","multi-dimensional parameter sweeps for process optimisation","enzyme ratio optimisation / rate-limiting step identification","mass-balance error checking as a solver test","structure prediction with multi-seed replication","within-structure paired comparison design","stochastic-relaxation noise-floor control (apo')","active-site definition measured from crystal structures with negative controls","localised movemap relaxation","molecular docking (AutoDock Vina) with multi-seed convergence acceptance rules","induced-fit measurement","dual-occupancy / additivity testing","Holm-Bonferroni multiple-comparison correction","statistical power analysis and sample-size planning","effect-size bounding when a null is not rejected","life cycle assessment (cradle-to-use, openLCA)","component mass balance with independent reproduction","techno-economic analysis","cost-of-goods and flowsheet comparison","discounted cash flow, NPV and IRR analysis"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"An education programme with its own substantial page, built around two recurring illustrated characters (Cisplatin and Shelly) who appear throughout the wiki, including in the loading animation — a consistent visual voice that makes a technical oncology-waste project approachable. The team's public-facing identity extends to Instagram and a LinkedIn company page for SHELLter.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育工作有自己一個篇幅不小的頁面，建立在兩個反覆出現的插畫角色上（Cisplatin 與 Shelly），它們出現在整個 wiki 中，連載入動畫也有；這種一致的視覺語調，讓一個技術性的腫瘤科廢棄物專案變得親切。團隊對外的身分也延伸到 Instagram，以及 SHELLter 的 LinkedIn 公司頁面。","ihp":"The strongest part of the project's non-technical work, and genuinely regulatory rather than decorative. Conversations with NHS England's healthcare and sustainability teams uncovered a specific, exploitable regulatory gap: Water UK forbids direct discharge of cytotoxic and cytostatic medications to foul sewers under any circumstances, including rinsing their containers, but patient bodily discharges containing 'metabolised medications' are permitted — while the actual degree of metabolism varies from 10-97%, giving patient discharge rates of roughly 3-90%, so metabolic-rate statistics can be selected to bypass waste-management rules. Dr Anne Woolridge explained that England's focus is on protecting personnel from cytotoxic exposure rather than downstream treatment, visible in the Pan London Cytotoxic Policy; the team then cite evidence that even tertiary membrane-bioreactor treatment removes only up to 51% of hydrophilic cisplatin, and that 22% of platinum compounds were detected in the outflows of a major UK hospital (Derriford, Plymouth) after conventional treatment. Anne O'Connor and Dr Kumud Kantilal established why point-of-care capture is the right intervention: outpatient chemotherapy is becoming the norm, but patient bodily fluids remain hazardous for up to seven days after discharge, so a large fraction of excreted cytotoxic residue can never reach any hospital treatment system. Joe Burton and Dr Sharon Pfleger surfaced a gap in NHS clinical-waste sustainability priorities. Stakeholders including Dr Jay Burt, Professor Louis Grandjean, Dr Anne Woolridge, Professor Laurence Lovat, Dr Sophie Fridman and Alex Senechal independently asked for the economic case, which is explicitly why the techno-economic model exists and why it is structured to produce a cost per unit of environmental benefit.","ihp_zh":"這是整個專案非技術工作中最強的部分，而且是真的在處理法規，不是裝飾。與 NHS England 的醫療與永續團隊對話，讓他們發現一個具體而可切入的法規缺口：Water UK 在任何情況下都禁止把細胞毒性與細胞抑制類藥物直接排入污水下水道，連沖洗容器也不行，但含有已代謝藥物的病人排泄物卻是允許的；而實際的代謝程度在 10-97% 之間變動，病人排出的比例因此大約在 3-90%，意思是只要挑選合適的代謝率統計數字，就能繞過廢棄物管理規定。Dr Anne Woolridge 說明英格蘭的重點放在保護人員不受細胞毒性藥物暴露，而不是下游處理，這在 Pan London Cytotoxic Policy 中看得很清楚；團隊接著引用證據指出，即使是三級的膜生物反應器處理，對親水性順鉑的去除率也只到 51%，而英國一家大型醫院（Plymouth 的 Derriford）在常規處理後的排放水中仍檢出 22% 的鉑化合物。Anne O'Connor 與 Dr Kumud Kantilal 則確立了為什麼照護現場捕捉才是正確的介入點：門診化療正在成為常態，但病人的體液在離院後最長七天內仍具危害性，因此有很大一部分排出的細胞毒性殘留根本不可能進入任何醫院的處理系統。Joe Burton 與 Dr Sharon Pfleger 指出 NHS 臨床廢棄物永續優先順序中的一個缺口。包括 Dr Jay Burt、Professor Louis Grandjean、Dr Anne Woolridge、Professor Laurence Lovat、Dr Sophie Fridman 與 Alex Senechal 在內的利害關係人都各自要求看經濟論證，這正是技術經濟模型存在的原因，也是它被設計成要產出每單位環境效益的成本的原因。","realWorld":"The commercial and environmental case is quantified rather than asserted. The LCA's functional unit is a real clinical course (one patient, five cycles, fifteen cartridges, 60 kg of urine carrying 0.336 g of drug) measured against the actual status quo of untreated discharge, and the headline is framed as a trade: 19.76 kg CO2eq to prevent an emission that currently happens unchecked, roughly a fifth added to the ~100 kg CO2eq of the five-cycle treatment it cleans up. The objective is stated as ecotoxicity avoided per unit of climate and energy burden, with unit operations ranked by their contribution to each impact category. The techno-economic model selects the full nine-step downstream train (centrifugation, resuspension, homogenisation, flocculation, centrifugation, depth filtration, PEG precipitation, tangential flow filtration, resolubilisation) on cost-per-gram grounds, and gives a sellable unit price of GBP 146.45 at NPV = 0 with a 17-year payback, deliberately benchmarked against NHS treatment cost. The feedstock is shellfish-processing waste, which makes the chelator itself a valorised waste stream.","realWorld_zh":"商業與環境論證是算出來的，不是喊出來的。LCA 的功能單位是一個真實的臨床療程（一位病人、五個週期、十五個濾匣、60 kg 尿液中帶有 0.336 g 藥物），對照的是未經處理直接排放的實際現狀，而結論被框定成一筆交換：付出 19.76 kg CO2eq，去阻止一筆目前完全沒有被攔截的排放，相當於在這個五週期療程本身約 100 kg CO2eq 之上再加約五分之一。他們把目標表述為每單位氣候與能源負擔所避免的生態毒性，並依各單元操作對每一個衝擊類別的貢獻度排序。技術經濟模型以每公克成本為依據，選定完整的九步下游流程（離心、再懸浮、均質、絮凝、離心、深層過濾、PEG 沉澱、切向流過濾、再溶解），並得出在 NPV = 0 時可販售的單位價格 146.45 英鎊、回收期 17 年，而且刻意與 NHS 的治療成本對比。原料是甲殼加工廢料，這讓螯合劑本身也成為一條被加值利用的廢棄物流。","partners":["University College London","UCL Department of Biochemical Engineering","UCL Faculty of Engineering Sciences","VaxHub","Resilience","Ribbon","NHS England healthcare and sustainability teams"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6381/wiki/dockingpipeline.avif","caption":"The ten-stage docking pipeline, with each box naming the stage, what it does and the software used. Stage 0 defines the active sites by measuring them from substrate-bound crystal structures independently of any model built later, and stage 3 builds and verifies the substrates from PubChem — both complete before the work they feed into begins.","caption_zh":"十階段的對接流程，每個方塊都寫出階段名稱、做什麼以及使用的軟體。階段 0 以量測的方式從結合基質的晶體結構界定活性位，獨立於之後建立的任何模型；階段 3 則從 PubChem 建構並核對基質；兩者都在它們所餵養的工作開始之前就已完成。","credit":"Team UCL, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6381/wiki/figure-20-km.avif","caption":"Figure 20: the enzyme-ratio parameter sweep that settled a construct decision. Holding total enzyme mass constant at 0.111 g/L, the SmChiA:VcCDA ratio was swept from 0.1 to 40; the 90%-conversion optimum sits at 15:1, roughly twice as fast as the 1:1 ratio a fusion protein is structurally locked into, identifying SmChiA as the rate-limiting step.","caption_zh":"圖 20：決定了構築選擇的酵素比例參數掃描。在總酵素質量固定為 0.111 g/L 的條件下，SmChiA 比 VcCDA 的比例從 0.1 掃到 40；達 90% 轉換的最佳點落在 15:1，約為融合蛋白在結構上被鎖定的 1:1 比例的兩倍快，也指出 SmChiA 才是限速步驟。","credit":"Team UCL, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6381/wiki/figure-18-km.avif","caption":"Figure 18: time to 50% and 90% substrate conversion for the fusion enzyme across temperature and pH, drawn in the Okabe-Ito colour-blind-safe palette with darker colours for faster conversion and a dot marking the optimum (43 C, pH 6.1). The surface shows the fusion optimum is weighted far more toward SmChiA than VcCDA.","caption_zh":"圖 18：融合酵素在不同溫度與 pH 下，基質轉換達 50% 與 90% 所需的時間，採用對色盲友善的 Okabe-Ito 色盤，顏色越深代表轉換越快，並以一個點標出最佳條件（43 C、pH 6.1）。這個曲面顯示融合酵素的最佳條件明顯更偏向 SmChiA，而不是 VcCDA。","credit":"Team UCL, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6381/wiki/fusion.avif","caption":"AlphaFold 3 model of the ChiA-CDA-His fusion, coloured by prediction confidence: two compact well-predicted domains with an extended low-confidence loop arcing above them. The team use this honestly — because the CDA domain moved 25.6 +/- 11.0 Angstrom relative to ChiA across five seeds, every measurement in the study is a difference taken within a single structure rather than between them.","caption_zh":"ChiA-CDA-His 融合蛋白的 AlphaFold 3 模型，依預測信賴度上色：兩個結構緊密、預測良好的結構域，上方則有一段延展的低信賴度環。團隊對它的使用很誠實——由於 CDA 結構域在五個種子之間相對於 ChiA 移動了 25.6 ± 11.0 埃，整個研究中每一項量測都是在單一結構內部取差值，而不是在結構之間比較。","credit":"Team UCL, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Run a computational study as a real experiment: define your measurement target by measuring it (active-site residues from crystal structures, with negative controls that must return nothing) rather than quoting a number, include a do-nothing control that captures the method's own noise (re-run the stochastic relaxation with only the seed changed), write the acceptance rule down before you finish the run, and when a comparison fails to reach significance say 'not resolved at this sample size' and state how many replicates would be needed.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把計算研究當成真正的實驗來做：用量測來定義你的量測標的（從晶體結構量出活性位殘基，並設置應該什麼都不回傳的負對照），而不是引用一個數字；放進一個什麼都不改的對照，用來捕捉方法本身的雜訊（只改隨機種子、重跑一次隨機鬆弛）；在整批執行結束之前就先把接受準則寫下來；而當一項比較沒有達到顯著時，就說在這個樣本數下無法定論，並說明還需要多少重複。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/kinetic-model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/kinetic-model-structure/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/kinetic-model-results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/docking-simulation/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/life-cycle-assessment/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/techno-economic-analysis/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/techno-economic-analysis-results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/education/"],"awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 入圍"],"rank":28},"6389":{"team":"UFABC-Brazil","id":"6389","section":"Overgrad","country":"Brazil","village":"Diagnostics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/","projectTitle":"Patchlepsy","tagline":"A paper-read toehold biosensor that gives people with epilepsy the one thing they do not have: warning time.","summary":"Patchlepsy is a toehold-switch biosensor designed to detect three tRNA-derived fragments (5'GlyGCC, 5'AlaTGC, 5'GluCTC) whose plasma levels rise before seizures in temporal lobe epilepsy, as reported by Hogg et al. (2019). Each switch releases a different chromoprotein reporter (mRFP1, AmilCP, fwYellow), read by a low-cost ESP32 plus AS7341 multispectral device and logged in a mobile app. To the team's knowledge these are the first toehold switches targeting tRFs rather than microRNAs. The cell-free assays never activated in either a CFPS extract kit or PURExpress, and the team publishes that failure with its two mechanistic hypotheses; the whole-cell system did work, with the GlyGCC/mRFP1 switch reaching a fold change of up to 23 in the presence of its trigger. The whole wiki is bilingual English and Portuguese.","awards":["Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Diagnostics Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Design followed the Green et al. (2014) toehold architecture with the recognition domains rewritten as the complement of each target tRF, and domains c and d constrained by explicit sequence patterns (c defined first as N4VVVVVVVGAGGAGAWWWWN2AUG, then revised to N4VVVVVVVAGAGGAGAWWWWN2AUG with an added adenine to widen the RBS, with A4/C4/G4/U4/K6/M6/R6/S6/W6/Y6 runs and stop codons forbidden in domain d). Candidates were generated by an in-house script, 30 in the first round and 80 per target in the second, and ranked in NUPACK on equilibrium probability, predicted folding, free energy of toehold alone versus toehold-target complex, and probability of strand displacement. Structures were built in RNAComposer, docked in HADDOCK3, and the complexes simulated in GROMACS 2024 (steepest-descent minimisation, 100 ps NVT, 1 ns NPT, AMBER99SB-ILDN force field, explicit TIP3P water in a periodic dodecahedral box, 0.15 M Na+/Cl-, Particle Mesh Ewald, 1.0 nm cutoffs), reporting RMSD, radius of gyration, hydrogen-bond counts and per-nucleotide RMSF. Three switches are deposited in the Registry.","dataviz":"DataSUS and IBGE epidemiology is visualised as time series of hospitalisations and costs (2020-2026), choropleth maps of Brazil by state and of the seven ABC Paulista municipalities normalised per 10,000 inhabitants using IBGE SIDRA Tabela 6579, stacked contributions of epilepsy to all nervous-system disease hospitalisations and costs, Likert distributions for the 44-respondent survey, a before-and-after SWOT matrix pair, and a two-axis stakeholder interest-versus-influence matrix built from scores each interviewee gave on a 0-10 scale.","datascience":"Two reproducible pipelines, both published on GitLab. The tRF quantification pipeline reanalyses the Hogg et al. (2019) small RNA-seq dataset across two collection sites: fastp preprocessing (minimum Phred 20, 15-50 nt), Bowtie2 alignment to a tRNA reference in --very-sensitive-local mode reporting up to 10 alignments per read because of tRNA similarity, and Samtools handling, quantifying at both isoacceptor and individual-fragment level as a built-in consistency check. The cross-reactivity pipeline runs BLASTn of query sequences against a genome panel and classifies alignments by similarity tier; run with three complete tRNA sequences against 150 E. coli genome assemblies it produced 12,480 unique alignments, predominantly moderate similarity, before anything was tested in the chassis.","software":"A Python acquisition and processing application drives the ESP32 and AS7341 across ten spectral channels, with background correction added after the first run saturated channels F2, F4, F5, F6, F7 and Clear at 65,535, and with raw readings preserved separately from background-corrected values for traceability plus an export function. A mobile prototype built in MIT App Inventor records readings, keeps a diary and raises an alert when a previously registered value recurs; the team states clearly that automatic sensor integration and spectral-marker interpretation were not completed.","stack":["NUPACK","RNAComposer","HADDOCK3","GROMACS 2024","AMBER99SB-ILDN / TIP3P","fastp","Bowtie2","Samtools","BLASTn","Python","Arduino / ESP32","AS7341 multispectral sensor","MIT App Inventor","React","GSAP","GitLab"],"techniques":["toehold switch thermodynamic design","RNA-RNA molecular docking","all-atom molecular dynamics (RMSD, Rg, H-bonds, RMSF)","small RNA-seq tRF quantification at isoacceptor and fragment level","BLASTn cross-reactivity screening against a 150-genome panel","3D-printed low-cost spectrophotometry","cell-free (CFPS and PURExpress) and whole-cell reporter assays","DataSUS/IBGE epidemiological analysis","survey-validated SWOT"],"frameworks_zh":"設計依循 Green 等人（2014）的 toehold 架構，但把辨識區改寫為各標的 tRF 的互補序列，並以明確的序列模式約束 c 與 d 兩個區域（c 最初定義為 N4VVVVVVVGAGGAGAWWWWN2AUG，後修訂為 N4VVVVVVVAGAGGAGAWWWWN2AUG，多加一個腺嘌呤以拓寬 RBS；d 區則禁止 A4/C4/G4/U4/K6/M6/R6/S6/W6/Y6 連續段與終止密碼子）。候選序列由自製腳本產生，第一輪 30 個、第二輪每個標的 80 個，再於 NUPACK 中依平衡機率、預測摺疊、toehold 單獨與 toehold—標的複合物的自由能，以及股置換機率排序。結構以 RNAComposer 建立、以 HADDOCK3 嵌合，複合物則在 GROMACS 2024 中模擬（最陡下降能量最小化、100 ps NVT、1 ns NPT，AMBER99SB-ILDN 力場，週期性十二面體盒中的顯式 TIP3P 水，0.15 M Na+/Cl-，Particle Mesh Ewald，1.0 nm 截斷），並報告 RMSD、迴轉半徑、氫鍵數與逐核苷酸 RMSF。三個開關已存入 Registry。","dataviz_zh":"DataSUS 與 IBGE 的流行病學資料以多種形式視覺化：住院數與費用的時間序列（2020-2026）、依州別呈現巴西全境的分級統計地圖，以及以 IBGE SIDRA Tabela 6579 每萬人正規化的 ABC Paulista 七個行政區地圖；另有癲癇在全部神經系統疾病住院數與費用中所佔比例的堆疊圖、44 位回覆者問卷的李克特分布、前後對照的兩張 SWOT 矩陣，以及一張雙軸的利害關係人「興趣對影響力」矩陣，分數由每位受訪者自行以 0-10 評定。","datascience_zh":"兩條可重現的管線，皆公開於 GitLab。tRF 定量管線重新分析 Hogg 等人（2019）的小 RNA-seq 資料集、涵蓋兩個採樣地點：以 fastp 前處理（最低 Phred 20、15-50 nt），以 Bowtie2 在 --very-sensitive-local 模式下對 tRNA 參考序列比對，並因 tRNA 彼此相似而每條 read 回報最多 10 個比對位置，再以 Samtools 處理，同時在 isoacceptor 與單一片段兩個層級定量作為內建的一致性檢核。交叉反應管線則以 BLASTn 把查詢序列比對一組基因組，並依相似度分級歸類；以三條完整 tRNA 序列對 150 個 E. coli 基因組組裝執行，產生 12,480 個獨特比對結果、以中度相似為主，而這一切都在載體中進行任何測試之前完成。","software_zh":"一個 Python 擷取與處理應用程式驅動 ESP32 與 AS7341、橫跨十個光譜通道；在第一次執行時 F2、F4、F5、F6、F7 與 Clear 通道在 65,535 處飽和後，加入了背景校正，並把原始讀值與背景校正後的數值分開保存以利追溯，另附匯出功能。一個以 MIT App Inventor 建置的手機原型可記錄讀值、維護日誌，並在先前登錄過的數值再次出現時發出警示；團隊明確說明自動感測器整合與光譜標記解讀並未完成。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Engagement was built around stigma rather than around the technology. The team joined the Marco Roxo awareness walk organised by the Brazilian Epilepsy Association (ABE) in Sao Paulo in March 2026, produced an original documentary, 'Epilepsy: What You Don't See', featuring people living with epilepsy and their relatives, and on 29 September 2026 screened it with ABE followed by a roundtable with a pediatric neurologist (Dr. Daniela Bezerra), a person living with epilepsy (Gustavo Theodoro) and the mother of a child with a rare neurological condition associated with epilepsy (Angelica Akemi). Educational work was gamified: escape rooms in public state schools across the ABC region during Brain Awareness Week (10-14 March 2025, with Pense Brain and faculty, for 9th grade to 3rd year of high school, using puzzles, quizzes and 3D skull and brain models), and a synthetic-biology escape room at UFABC for Biotechnologist Day with LiNA Biotecnologia UFABC in which teams assembled complementary DNA sequences and constructed plasmids. Explanatory flyers were written separately for young people and for older adults, on the reasoning that informational needs differ by group, and they teach bystanders how to assist during a seizure safely. An Introduction to Synthetic Biology mini-course, a poster and talks at the II Brazilian Synthetic Biology Congress, Bio's Start and Semana de Biotecnologia round it out. The team also published a funding guide, 'Overcoming Financial Barriers in Brazil: A Guide to Public and Private Funding', documenting how a parliamentary amendment actually works and how to approach companies in a structured way, because Brazilian teams cannot cover iGEM registration or Jamboree travel from conventional research grants.","ihp":"The IHP is organised as a four-step causal chain and is genuinely integrated rather than consultative. Step one asked whether the problem is real, using DataSUS (SIH/SUS) with IBGE population denominators: epilepsy hospitalisations in Brazil rose from 49,204 in 2020 to 73,222 in 2025 (+48.8%) while their cost to SUS rose from R$ 43,692,171 to R$ 92,460,210 (+111.6%), so cost per admission grew faster than admissions; epilepsy accounts for 28-30% of all nervous-system disease hospitalisations nationally and 40-50% in the team's own ABC Paulista region. Critically, the team reads its own maps against itself, noting that Sao Caetano do Sul, long the highest-HDI municipality in Brazil, also records the most hospitalisations, which more plausibly reflects access to the health system than disease frequency, so 'the real burden is likely greater than what DataSUS is able to capture', and citing IEPS data that average travel time to an ICU bed is 3.3 hours in the Legal Amazon against 0.3 hours elsewhere. Step two put the team's own internal SWOT to the people who would use the device: a survey of 44 people with epilepsy, reached through ABE and approved by a Brazilian Research Ethics Committee, with each SWOT point converted into a Likert question and a rule for confirmation or refutation declared before the results were seen. Two assumptions were refuted and the matrix was redrawn: the expected concern about personal health data moved from weaknesses to strengths, and distrust of a seizure-predicting technology moved from threats to opportunities. Step three was eleven ethics-approved stakeholder interviews across research, clinical practice, industry and public policy, each closing with 0-10 scores for interest and influence that built a stakeholder matrix; the team's own conclusion from it is that the people with most influence over whether Patchlepsy reaches patients are not the technology developers but clinicians, industry and public policy. Step four is where the design actually moved, and the strongest chain is convergent rather than single-source: five stakeholders independently pushed away from a pipetted cell-free reaction, for five different reasons, with Prof. Cintia Marques Coelho (UnB Synthetic Biology Lab) saying the cell-free system is expensive, needs refrigeration, pipetting and controls and would make the device inaccessible, Fabricio Pamplona proposing a strip format and portability from the start, Karen Uchiyama recommending filter paper specifically because it makes the device safer and easier to document for ANVISA, Amanda Mendes do Carmo (clinical research pharmacist, market access) asking for something easy to maintain and carry, and Prof. Danielle Biscaro Pedrolli insisting the test must not depend on the qualification of whoever uses it. The hardware was rebuilt around a filter-paper strip inserted through a slot between the LED and the sensor, with the cell-free reaction embedded in the paper as the declared next step, citing Karlikow et al. (2022), who validated paper-based cell-free toehold assays on patient samples in Recife at US$ 5.48 per test against US$ 11 for RT-qPCR in a freeze-dried, refrigeration-free format. A second chain changed the DNA itself: Danielle flagged that the antibiotic resistance gene in the plasmids rules out home use and complicates disposal, Karen reinforced that ANVISA would require a documented use-and-disposal workflow, and because the team had kept BioBrick prefix and suffix on its toehold plasmids from the start it could produce the constructs as linear DNA with no resistance marker (untested at the deadline, and the team says so). A third chain made leakage the central technical question after Prof. Elibio Rech, Danielle and Luiz Caires independently warned about leakage and physiological tRF concentrations, which is why the team characterised leakage experimentally in its own constructs instead of relying on predictions. Two stakeholder inputs were integrated as honest downgrades rather than features: Prof. Alexandre Kihara made the team distinguish predicting an imminent seizure from monitoring seizure susceptibility, after which they describe their result as a proof of concept of tRF-responsive sensing and not prediction, and Elibio pointed out their tRF evidence comes from one population with gender differences, so they state plainly that they do not yet know for whom these biomarkers work. Dr. Cezzar Santos de Souza, a psychiatrist at CAPS Nucleo de Atencao Casa Aberta in the public system, showed them that for patients with intellectual disabilities who cannot recognise or communicate an aura, an alert is only useful if it reaches somebody else, which, with 93.2% of survey respondents saying early detection would help caregivers, became a committed design change: the alert goes to a registered support network. And because 40.9% said such a technology could itself cause anxiety, they decided the alert must communicate increased risk within a time window plus what to do about it, never a seizure as a certainty, with the user choosing how and whether they are warned.","realWorld":"The real-world framing is unusually concrete on health-system economics and unusually thin on sustainability. Need is grounded in SUS data rather than global prevalence quotes, down to local news reporting that someone is hospitalised for epilepsy every eight hours in the Greater ABC region, and the mechanism of benefit is stated modestly: knowing in advance would not prevent a seizure but could let someone reach a safe place and avoid the admission that drives the cost. The regulatory path was identified only because a stakeholder raised it, and the team says so: after Karen Uchiyama's point about documentation, they established that Patchlepsy would be regulated in Brazil as an in vitro diagnostic under ANVISA RDC 830/2023 and that ANVISA, FDA and EMA harmonise requirements through IMDRF, concluding that the usage and disposal workflow has to be designed together with the device rather than documented afterwards. Any future work with human participants or clinical samples would need CEP/CONEP ethical review; the project itself used synthetic tRF mimics and no patient material. The deployment plan is SUS-oriented: Amanda do Carmo's route is market entry followed by incorporation into public provision, with price justified against the cost of high-cost antiseizure medication, and the team's own cost strategy is to develop an in-house cell-free system because commercial kits are a large part of what makes such a test expensive. There is no business model, no unit economics and no market sizing. There is also no SDG claim anywhere on the wiki, not even a logo wall, which for a diagnostics project with this much public-health data behind it is a missed open goal rather than hand-waving. What is published instead, and what will outlast the Jamboree, is reusable: three Registry parts, two pipelines, the low-cost spectral reader and its software, a fully documented cell-free negative result with its two hypotheses and the troubleshooting route they would take next (linear PCR expression templates instead of circular plasmids), the survey-validated SWOT method, and the Brazilian funding guide. Next technical steps are the cell-free reaction embedded in paper, an intermediate integrase-controlled amplification module proposed after Luiz Caires raised sensitivity, and replacing resistance markers with a plasmid-dependency or auxotrophic selection system following Danielle's suggestion.","partners":["Brazilian Epilepsy Association (ABE) - survey reach and documentary support","Dr. Daniela Fontes Bezerra (pediatric neurologist) - documentary, survey design, clinical perspective","Dr. Cezzar Santos de Souza, CAPS Nucleo de Atencao Casa Aberta (SUS community mental health centre)","Dr. Ana Maria Amorim (pediatric neurology)","Dr. Guilherme Marques (municipal cannabis-derived treatment project)","Prof. Danielle Biscaro Pedrolli, Unesp Araraquara and PI of iGEM Unesp Brazil","Prof. Cintia Marques Coelho, UnB Synthetic Biology Lab","Prof. Elibio Rech (toehold switches and biosensors)","Prof. Alexandre Hiroaki Kihara, ARI-UFABC (neuroscience)","Amanda Mendes do Carmo (clinical research pharmacy, market access, ICESP/ICON)","Karen Uchiyama (pharmaceutical market intelligence)","Luiz Caires, Vyro Biotechnologies; Fabricio Pamplona, Mind the Graph","Pense Brain and LiNA Biotecnologia UFABC","FAPESP, CNPEM, INCT-EngBio, Inova UFABC, FUNDEP (UFMG), MathWorks, Twist Bioscience, IDT, GenScript, Ansa Biotechnologies"],"publicEngagement_zh":"參與活動是圍繞污名、而非圍繞技術建構起來的。團隊參加了巴西癲癇協會（ABE）2026 年 3 月在聖保羅舉辦的 Marco Roxo 宣導健走，製作了一部原創紀錄片《Epilepsy: What You Don't See》（癲癇：你看不見的事），由癲癇患者與其家屬出鏡，並在 2026 年 9 月 29 日與 ABE 一同放映，接著舉行圓桌論壇，與談者包括一位小兒神經科醫師（Dr. Daniela Bezerra）、一位癲癇患者（Gustavo Theodoro），以及一位孩子患有與癲癇相關罕見神經疾病的母親（Angelica Akemi）。教育工作則遊戲化：在腦科學週（2025 年 3 月 10-14 日）與 Pense Brain 及教師合作，在 ABC 地區各公立州立學校辦密室逃脫，對象是九年級到高三學生，使用謎題、問答與 3D 頭骨與腦部模型；另在 UFABC 的生技人日與 LiNA Biotecnologia UFABC 合辦一場合成生物學密室逃脫，參賽隊伍要組出互補的 DNA 序列並建構質體。說明傳單針對年輕人與高齡者分別撰寫，理由是不同群體的資訊需求不同，內容也教旁人如何在癲癇發作時安全協助。另有一門合成生物學入門短期課程，以及在第二屆巴西合成生物學大會、Bio's Start 與生物技術週的海報與演講。團隊還出版了一份募資指南《Overcoming Financial Barriers in Brazil: A Guide to Public and Private Funding》，記錄國會修正案補助實際上如何運作，以及如何有條理地接洽企業——因為巴西隊伍無法用一般研究補助支付 iGEM 註冊費或 Jamboree 的旅費。","ihp_zh":"整份 IHP 以一條四步因果鏈組織，而且是真正的整合、不只是諮詢。第一步問這個問題是否真實存在，使用 DataSUS（SIH/SUS）搭配 IBGE 人口分母：巴西的癲癇住院數從 2020 年的 49,204 例上升到 2025 年的 73,222 例（+48.8%），而其對 SUS 的費用則從 R$ 43,692,171 增至 R$ 92,460,210（+111.6%），因此每次住院的成本比住院數增加得更快；癲癇在全國占所有神經系統疾病住院數的 28-30%，在團隊自己的 ABC Paulista 地區則占 40-50%。關鍵的是，團隊會拿自己的地圖反過來檢驗自己：他們指出長年為巴西人類發展指數最高的 Sao Caetano do Sul 同時也是住院數最多的行政區，而這更可能反映的是就醫可及性而非疾病頻率，因此「真實負擔很可能大於 DataSUS 所能捕捉到的」；他們並引用 IEPS 的資料，指出法定亞馬遜地區前往 ICU 床位的平均交通時間為 3.3 小時，其他地區則為 0.3 小時。第二步把團隊內部的 SWOT 拿去問真正會使用這個裝置的人：透過 ABE 接觸、並經巴西研究倫理委員會核准，對 44 位癲癇患者做問卷，把每一條 SWOT 要點轉成一道李克特題目，並在看到結果之前就先宣告確認或推翻的判準。結果有兩項假設被推翻、矩陣被重畫：原先預期對個人健康資料的擔憂從「弱點」移到了「優勢」，而對「能預測發作的技術」的不信任則從「威脅」移到了「機會」。第三步是十一場經倫理核准的利害關係人訪談，橫跨研究、臨床實務、產業與公共政策，每場結束時請對方就興趣與影響力各打 0-10 分，據以建立利害關係人矩陣；團隊自己從中得出的結論是：對 Patchlepsy 能否觸及病患最有影響力的人不是技術開發者，而是臨床醫師、產業與公共政策。第四步才是設計真正移動的地方，而其中最有力的一條鏈是多方匯聚而非單一來源：有五位利害關係人出於五種不同理由，各自獨立地把他們推離「以微量吸管操作的無細胞反應」——Prof. Cintia Marques Coelho（UnB 合成生物學實驗室）說無細胞系統昂貴、需要冷藏、需要吸管操作與對照，會讓裝置變得難以取得；Fabricio Pamplona 從一開始就建議採用試紙形式與可攜性；Karen Uchiyama 特別建議使用濾紙，因為這能讓裝置更安全、也更容易為 ANVISA 留下文件；Amanda Mendes do Carmo（臨床研究藥師、市場准入）要求一個容易維護與攜帶的東西；而 Prof. Danielle Biscaro Pedrolli 堅持檢驗不能取決於使用者的資格。硬體因此圍繞一條插入 LED 與感測器之間溝槽的濾紙試紙重建，並把無細胞反應嵌入紙中列為明確宣告的下一步，依據是 Karlikow 等人（2022）——他們在 Recife 以病患樣本驗證了紙基無細胞 toehold 分析，每次檢驗 5.48 美元、相對 RT-qPCR 的 11 美元，且採冷凍乾燥、無須冷藏的形式。第二條鏈改變了 DNA 本身：Danielle 指出質體中的抗生素抗性基因排除了居家使用、也使廢棄處理複雜化；Karen 則補強說 ANVISA 會要求有文件記載的使用與棄置流程；而由於團隊從一開始就在 toehold 質體上保留了 BioBrick 前綴與後綴，他們能把構築做成不帶抗性標記的線性 DNA（在截稿時尚未測試，團隊也如實說明）。第三條鏈把滲漏變成核心技術問題：Prof. Elibio Rech、Danielle 與 Luiz Caires 各自獨立警告滲漏與生理狀態下的 tRF 濃度問題，因此團隊在自己的構築中以實驗鑑定滲漏，而不是依賴預測。另有兩項利害關係人意見是以誠實的降級、而非新增功能的方式被整合進來：Prof. Alexandre Kihara 讓團隊區分「預測即將發生的發作」與「監測發作易感性」，此後他們把自己的成果描述為 tRF 反應式感測的概念驗證，而非預測；Elibio 則指出他們的 tRF 證據來自單一族群、且存在性別差異，於是他們直言目前還不知道這些生物標記對誰適用。公立系統中 CAPS Nucleo de Atencao Casa Aberta 的精神科醫師 Dr. Cezzar Santos de Souza 讓他們看到：對於無法辨識或表達前驅症狀（aura）的智能障礙病患而言，警示只有在能傳達給其他人時才有用；加上 93.2% 的問卷回覆者表示早期偵測對照顧者有幫助，這成了一項確定的設計變更：警示會發送給一個已登錄的支持網絡。而因為有 40.9% 的人表示這樣的技術本身可能造成焦慮，他們決定警示必須傳達的是「某個時間窗內風險升高」以及「該怎麼做」，絕不把發作說成確定會發生，並由使用者自行選擇是否、以及如何接收警示。","realWorld_zh":"真實世界的立論在醫療體系經濟面異常具體，在永續性方面則異常單薄。需求扎根於 SUS 的資料，而不是引用全球盛行率，細到引述地方新聞報導「大 ABC 地區每八小時就有一人因癲癇住院」；獲益機制的陳述也很克制：事先知道並不能阻止發作，但可以讓人移動到安全的地方，並避免那筆推高成本的住院。法規路徑是因為一位利害關係人提起才被盤點出來的，而團隊也如實說明：在 Karen Uchiyama 指出文件要求之後，他們確認 Patchlepsy 在巴西會依 ANVISA RDC 830/2023 作為體外診斷產品受規範，而 ANVISA、FDA 與 EMA 透過 IMDRF 協調要求，並由此得出結論：使用與棄置流程必須與裝置一起設計，而不是事後補文件。任何未來涉及人體受試者或臨床樣本的工作都需要 CEP/CONEP 的倫理審查；專案本身使用合成的 tRF 模擬物，未使用任何病患檢體。部署計畫以 SUS 為導向：Amanda do Carmo 建議的路徑是先進入市場、再納入公共供給，價格則以高價抗癲癇藥物的成本作為對照來論證；而團隊自己的成本策略是自行開發無細胞系統，因為商用套組正是讓這類檢驗昂貴的主要原因之一。沒有商業模式、沒有單位經濟、也沒有市場規模估算。wiki 上任何地方也都沒有 SDG 的主張，連一面標誌牆都沒有——對一個背後有這麼多公共衛生資料的診斷專案來說，這是一個白白錯過的空門，而不是含糊其詞。真正被公開、而且會比 Jamboree 活得更久的，是那些可重複使用的東西：三個 Registry 部件、兩條管線、低成本光譜判讀器及其軟體、一份完整記錄的無細胞負面結果連同兩個假說與他們接下來會採取的排錯路線（以線性 PCR 表現模板取代環狀質體）、經問卷驗證的 SWOT 方法，以及那份巴西募資指南。下一步的技術工作是把無細胞反應嵌入紙中、在 Luiz Caires 提出靈敏度問題後提案的中介整合酶控制放大模組，以及依 Danielle 建議以質體依賴性或營養缺陷型篩選系統取代抗性標記。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6389/wiki/human-practices/integrated/fluxograma-hp-english.avif","caption":"The four-step integrated human practices workflow: DataSUS epidemiology, SWOT validation with people with epilepsy, stakeholder interviews, and project refinement.","credit":"Team UFABC-Brazil, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"四步整合式人類實踐流程：DataSUS 流行病學、與癲癇患者一起驗證 SWOT、利害關係人訪談，以及專案修正。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6389/wiki/human-practices/integrated/new-fig-18-ing.avif","caption":"The four changes already made to Patchlepsy, each traced back to the survey, the SWOT validation or a named stakeholder interview.","credit":"Team UFABC-Brazil, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"Patchlepsy 已完成的四項變更，每一項都可追溯回問卷、SWOT 驗證或某場指名的利害關係人訪談。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6389/wiki/human-practices/integrated/the-stakeholder-influence-mattrix-fig17.avif","caption":"Stakeholder interest-versus-influence matrix, scored 0-10 by the interviewees themselves, which showed the team that clinicians, industry and policy hold more implementation power than technology developers.","credit":"Team UFABC-Brazil, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"利害關係人的興趣對影響力矩陣，分數由受訪者自己以 0-10 評定；它讓團隊看到臨床醫師、產業與政策握有比技術開發者更大的落地權力。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6389/wiki/human-practices/public-outreach/documentario-toodos.avif","caption":"Premiere of the team's documentary 'Epilepsy: What You Don't See' with the Brazilian Epilepsy Association, followed by a roundtable with a neurologist, a person living with epilepsy and a parent.","credit":"Team UFABC-Brazil, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"團隊紀錄片《Epilepsy: What You Don't See》與巴西癲癇協會合辦的首映，隨後與一位神經科醫師、一位癲癇患者及一位家長舉行圓桌論壇。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy the survey-validated SWOT: write your internal SWOT first, convert every point into a question your actual users can answer, declare the confirmation or refutation rule before you see the data, then redraw the matrix. UFABC had two assumptions refuted this way, which is exactly the kind of error a team never finds by assessing itself.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/assets/index-CX6oK0XP.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/wet-lab-results","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/dry-lab-results","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/public-outreach","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/safety-and-security","https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/attributions"],"projectTitle_zh":"Patchlepsy","tagline_zh":"一款以紙張判讀的 toehold 生物感測器，提供癲癇患者最缺乏的一件東西：預警時間。","summary_zh":"Patchlepsy 是一個 toehold switch 生物感測器，設計用來偵測三種 tRNA 衍生片段（5'GlyGCC、5'AlaTGC、5'GluCTC）——根據 Hogg 等人（2019）的報告，這些片段在顳葉癲癇患者發作前的血漿濃度會上升。每個開關各釋出一種不同的色素蛋白報告子（mRFP1、AmilCP、fwYellow），再由一台低成本的 ESP32 加 AS7341 多光譜裝置判讀，並記錄在手機應用程式中。就團隊所知，這是第一批以 tRF（而非 microRNA）為標的的 toehold switch。無細胞分析在 CFPS 萃取套組與 PURExpress 中都未曾活化，團隊把這項失敗連同兩個機制假說一併公開；全細胞系統則確實可行，GlyGCC/mRFP1 開關在其觸發物存在時達到最高 23 倍的倍數變化。整個 wiki 以英文與葡萄牙文雙語呈現。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"學這套經問卷驗證的 SWOT：先寫出你內部的 SWOT，把每一條轉成你真正的使用者能回答的問題，在看到資料之前先宣告確認或推翻的判準，然後重畫矩陣。UFABC 就這樣推翻了兩項假設——而這正是一支隊伍靠自我評估永遠找不出的那種錯誤。","awards_zh":["最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳診斷專案 — 入圍"],"rank":14},"6391":{"team":"Oxford","id":"6391","section":"Undergrad","country":"United Kingdom","village":"Agriculture","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/oxford/","projectTitle":"NECTAR","projectTitle_zh":"NECTAR","tagline":"An end-to-end platform for designing, validating, producing and deploying RNAi interventions, stress-tested on Varroa destructor","tagline_zh":"一個從設計、驗證、生產到佈署 RNAi 干預措施的端到端平台，並以 Varroa destructor 作為壓力測試對象","summary":"NECTAR is a programmable RNAi pipeline: FORAGER (computational dsRNA design with off-target screening against the Apis mellifera transcriptome), microbial production in yeast, and delivery to hives in a pollen patty. Varroa destructor, the single biggest threat to honeybees, is the first real-world case study. The team built HIVE, an explicit four-step human-practices decision procedure (Hear, Investigate, Verdict, Evaluate) run over six open project questions with 28+ named stakeholders including US EPA/FDA/USDA staff, the Chair of the UK Advisory Committee on Releases to the Environment, and the Secretariat of the Convention on Biological Diversity. Stakeholder evidence changed the chassis (living engineered Snodgrassella alvi to heat-inactivated yeast), the delivery format, the off-target screening stage, the survey instrument and the definition of success.","summary_zh":"NECTAR 是一條可程式化的 RNAi 流程：FORAGER（以計算方法設計 dsRNA，並對 Apis mellifera 轉錄體做脫靶篩查）、在酵母中以微生物方式生產，以及用花粉餅把成品送進蜂箱。蜂蟹蟎 Varroa destructor 是蜜蜂最大的單一威脅，也是第一個真實世界的案例研究。團隊建立了 HIVE，一套明確的四步人類實踐決策程序（Hear、Investigate、Verdict、Evaluate），套用在六個開放的專案問題上，涵蓋 28 位以上具名利害關係人，包括美國 EPA/FDA/USDA 的人員、英國環境釋出諮詢委員會（ACRE）主席，以及生物多樣性公約秘書處。利害關係人提供的證據改變了底盤（從活體工程改造的 Snodgrassella alvi 改為熱去活化的酵母）、遞送形式、脫靶篩查階段、問卷工具，以及對「成功」的定義。","awards":["Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Agriculture Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"FORAGER, a three-stage standardised dsRNA design pipeline: target gene identification (most abundant transcripts of well-connected genes, weighted by known Varroa RNAi data), within-gene region selection (endogenous Varroa siRNA sequence features, guide competence, RNAplfold target accessibility, combined as three equally weighted complementary evidence layers rather than one fused score), and off-target analysis. Also a BEEHAVE-based colony population model and a bespoke partial-equilibrium economic model.","frameworks_zh":"FORAGER 是一條三階段的標準化 dsRNA 設計流程：標的基因辨識（挑選連結度高的基因中表現量最高的轉錄本，並以已知的 Varroa RNAi 資料加權）、基因內區段選擇（Varroa 內源 siRNA 的序列特徵、引導股適任性、RNAplfold 的標的可及性，三者作為權重相同的互補證據層，而不是融合成單一分數）以及脫靶分析。另有一個以 BEEHAVE 為基礎的蜂群族群模型，以及一個自行建立的部分均衡經濟模型。","dataviz":"Hand-drawn mechanism illustrations throughout (FORAGER stages, the five-step path of a dose through the hive, the SDG goal map), a geocoded stakeholder map with latitude/longitude per interviewee, and per-cycle engineering tables; the wiki is a custom React/Astro-style build with light and dark themes.","dataviz_zh":"全站都用手繪的機制插圖（FORAGER 各階段、一劑藥在蜂箱中經過的五步路徑、SDG 目標地圖），一張為每位受訪者標上經緯度的地理編碼利害關係人地圖，以及逐循環的工程表格；wiki 本身是自建的 React/Astro 風格網站，並提供亮色與暗色主題。","datascience":"Construction of a clean Varroa destructor small-RNA dataset from public sequencing, basic population feature analysis of that sRNA pool, sequence feature analysis, whole-region homology and local exact-match screening against the honeybee transcriptome (16-nt strict mapping plus relaxed whole-region similarity), BLAST-based non-target screening, and a documented limitations table stating that the three evidence layers are equally weighted only because no Varroa RNAi efficacy data existed to fit weights.","datascience_zh":"他們從公開定序資料建出一份乾淨的 Varroa destructor 小 RNA 資料集，對該 sRNA 池做基本的族群特徵分析與序列特徵分析，再對蜜蜂轉錄體做全區段同源性與局部完全比對的篩查（16 nt 的嚴格比對，加上寬鬆的全區段相似度），並以 BLAST 做非標的篩查；另附一張有紀錄的限制表，寫明三個證據層權重相同的唯一理由是：沒有任何 Varroa RNAi 的效力資料可用來擬合權重。","software":"FORAGER is released with one file per stage and a documented frontmatter/body contract so other teams can re-run it; the HIVE method and its full interview question bank are released under CC BY 4.0. Hive insert and PCR-tube feeding adaptor are downloadable 3D-printable hardware.","software_zh":"FORAGER 釋出時每個階段各一個檔案，並附有紀錄的 frontmatter/本文格式約定，方便其他團隊重跑；HIVE 方法與完整的訪談題庫則以 CC BY 4.0 釋出。蜂箱插件與 PCR 管餵食轉接件是可下載的 3D 列印硬體。","stack":["ViennaRNA / RNAplfold","BLAST","Bowtie","BEEHAVE (NetLogo)","Boltz structure prediction","molecular docking","R","Python","React / Astro wiki build"],"techniques":["functional network connectivity analysis (STRING-type)","mRNA abundance weighting","small-RNA population profiling","RNA secondary structure and accessibility prediction","MS2 hairpin array folding optimisation (6% to 67% complete-array folding)","partial-equilibrium economic modelling with supply/demand elasticities","sensitivity analysis"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Buzz In, a three-episode stakeholder podcast built deliberately to put stakeholders who disagreed with each other into contact rather than collecting views in isolation: episode 1 paired Varroa-resistance academic Prof. Stephen Martin with commercial beekeeper Paul Horton on whether to treat at all; episode 2 brought together the CEO of the Australian Honey Bee Industry Council, Amateur Beekeepers Australia and Hive & Wellness; episode 3 set the project against social, environmental and economic lenses with a social scientist, a bee researcher and an agricultural economist. GMO 101, a joint Zoom workshop with NYU Abu Dhabi iGEM on 8 October 2026, measured participation through Nearpod (24 participants, 83% took part). A beekeeper survey received a favourable opinion from a subcommittee of the Oxford Central University Research Ethics Committee (ref MS IDREC 3973787), with public task as the lawful basis and informed consent before questions; 100+ respondents, 63% reported struggling with Varroa at mean severity 5.74/10 and 70% said they would be open to a GMO-based treatment. School sessions at St Clare's summer course were run as a two-way choice exercise (present two delivery routes with honest trade-offs, ask which students would accept, measure the acceptance shift before and after) rather than a lecture. Plus street interviews, a bee campaign, Instagram and TikTok.","publicEngagement_zh":"Buzz In 是一檔三集的利害關係人 podcast，刻意設計成把彼此意見不同的人放在一起，而不是各自收集看法：第 1 集讓研究 Varroa 抗性的學者 Prof. Stephen Martin 與商業養蜂人 Paul Horton 對談「到底該不該治療」；第 2 集把 Australian Honey Bee Industry Council 的執行長、Amateur Beekeepers Australia 與 Hive & Wellness 放在一起；第 3 集則以一位社會科學家、一位蜜蜂研究者與一位農業經濟學家，從社會、環境與經濟三個視角檢視這個專案。GMO 101 是 2026 年 10 月 8 日與 NYU Abu Dhabi iGEM 合辦的 Zoom 工作坊，參與度以 Nearpod 量測（24 位參與者，83% 有互動）。一份養蜂人問卷取得 Oxford Central University Research Ethics Committee 子委員會的正面意見（編號 MS IDREC 3973787），以公共任務為合法處理依據，並在提問前取得知情同意；回覆超過 100 份，其中 63% 表示為 Varroa 所苦、嚴重程度平均 5.74/10，而 70% 表示願意接受以 GMO 為基礎的治療方式。在 St Clare's 暑期課程的學校場次不是講授，而是辦成一次雙向選擇練習（呈現兩條遞送路線並誠實說明各自取捨，問學生會接受哪一條，並量測前後的接受度變化）。另外還有街訪、一場蜜蜂宣傳活動，以及 Instagram 與 TikTok。","ihp":"Oxford's IHP is the strongest kind: a documented decision procedure with a mandatory 'How we implemented the advice to change NECTAR' field on every one of 28+ interview write-ups, and a rule that 'We considered their feedback is not an implementation'. The largest single change is the chassis. Danny Le Feuvre (CEO, Australian Honey Bee Industry Council) and Mike Allerton (VP and Biosecurity Officer, Amateur Beekeepers Australia) both preferred a persistent living engineered Snodgrassella alvi gut symbiont because it minimises beekeeper labour; the team did not simply follow them but took the question to regulators, and Laura Bowden (GM manager, Science and Advice for Scottish Agriculture), Elizabeth Frost (NSW Department of Primary Industries), Tom Hartley (Senior Certification Officer, Soil Association Certification) and the Scottish Government Honey Bee Health Team pushed the opposite way, so the team switched to heat-inactivated, dried engineered yeast and stated plainly what that cost: the persistence that made S. alvi attractive, meaning repeat dosing and more beekeeper labour, against the preference of beekeepers they had interviewed. Austein McLoughlin of the Convention on Biological Diversity Secretariat then confirmed the inactivated product is not a living modified organism under the Cartagena Protocol, but also refused to let the team stop at SDG alignment, pushing them to ask whether NECTAR produces 'measurable improvement' - which is why the sustainability analysis widened to the whole NECTAR lifecycle and built baseline comparisons into the modelling. A joint meeting with Mike Mendelsohn and Alan Reynolds (US EPA), Adam Moyer and Laura Epstein (FDA) and Alan Pearson (USDA) then 'prevented us from treating our shift to heat-inactivated yeast as a universal regulatory shortcut', forcing jurisdiction-by-jurisdiction regulatory mapping instead of one global classification. The deepest economic chain runs through Prof. Wally Thurman (Agricultural and Resource Economics, NC State, interviewed 29 July 2026) and Prof. Brittney Goodrich (Agricultural and Consumer Economics, Illinois, 7 August 2026): Thurman set five methodological commitments (start from an average commercial operation not an industry aggregate; use existing treatments as the counterfactual; assess costs and revenues not survival rates; use simple partial equilibrium; restrict to paid pollination markets), and Goodrich's operation-level cost structure redefined the cost of Varroa to include labour, colony replacement and lost honey and pollination revenue rather than just the price of acaricide. The team then ran the chain backwards - what a beekeeper can afford, to allowable cost per dose, to allowable manufacturing cost, to required mass of intact dsRNA per gram of dry yeast - converting 'high expression' into a pass/fail wet-lab specification of 0.005 mg dsRNA per g yeast for US viability and 0.05 mg/g for both markets, against a fermentation cost of about 2.33 USD per gram. They also deliberately recruited dissent: the Oxfordshire Natural Beekeeping Group (about 20 chemical-free hobbyists) and treatment-free beekeeper Mark Sandham argued that treating removes the selection pressure that would produce tolerant bees, an argument against the entire premise; rather than abandoning the project the team narrowed its target user to commercial operations and wrote that OxNatBees changed 'not the molecular mechanism of NECTAR, but the problem we believed NECTAR should - and should not - try to solve'. Smaller but equally traceable: Lord John Krebs (first FSA Chairman) and Prof. Jim Dunwell (Chair, ACRE) made environmental fate and off-target effects explicit engineering requirements, moving non-target organisms into the FORAGER off-target screening stage and adding in vivo dsRNA-persistence experiments; Prof. Paul Lam (environmental chemistry, Hong Kong Metropolitan University) drove the adoption of BLAST off-target screening and reframed public engagement as risk management rather than promotion; Dr Michael Morrison (HeLEX, Oxford Law) rewrote the survey instrument so it asked separately about pollen patties, constitutively active engineered bacteria and inducible engineered bacteria rather than about 'GMOs' in general; Dr Théotime Colin's point about secondary pests prompted dsRNA constructs for wax moth and small hive beetle; Prof. Giles Budge's reassurance kept the adult-bee oral delivery route alive and produced the 300/500/700 bp length comparison; and Melanie Teece (Head of Technical, Hilltop Honey) and Wade Ford (Hive & Wellness) turned honey purity into a reason for additional in vivo work. The published HIVE guide names its own failure modes (interviewing agreeable people, treating 'the public' as one stakeholder, letting the Verdict drift into a summary, consulting regulators too late to change anything) and requires every Verdict to state what was decided, what was rejected and what that cost.","ihp_zh":"Oxford 的 IHP 屬於最強的那一類：一套有紀錄的決策程序，28 份以上的訪談紀錄每一份都有一個必填欄位「我們如何落實這條建議以改變 NECTAR」，並訂下一條規則——「『我們考慮過他們的回饋』不算落實」。最大的單一改變是底盤。Danny Le Feuvre（Australian Honey Bee Industry Council 執行長）與 Mike Allerton（Amateur Beekeepers Australia 副會長兼生物安全官）都偏好持續存在的活體工程改造 Snodgrassella alvi 腸道共生菌，因為那能把養蜂人的勞力降到最低；團隊並沒有直接照辦，而是把這個問題帶去問法規端，而 Laura Bowden（Science and Advice for Scottish Agriculture 的 GM 經理）、Elizabeth Frost（NSW Department of Primary Industries）、Tom Hartley（Soil Association Certification 資深認證官）與蘇格蘭政府蜜蜂健康小組都往相反方向推，於是團隊改用熱去活化、乾燥的工程改造酵母，並把代價寫得很白：S. alvi 之所以吸引人的那個「持續性」沒了，意味著要重複投藥、養蜂人要花更多勞力，而這違背了他們訪談過的養蜂人的偏好。接著生物多樣性公約秘書處的 Austein McLoughlin 確認：去活化的產品在卡塔赫納生物安全議定書下不屬於活體改造生物；但他也不讓團隊停在「與 SDG 對齊」這一步，而是推他們去問 NECTAR 是否產生「可量測的改善」——這正是永續性分析後來擴大到整個 NECTAR 生命週期、並把基準線比較納進模型的原因。隨後與 Mike Mendelsohn 和 Alan Reynolds（美國 EPA）、Adam Moyer 和 Laura Epstein（FDA）以及 Alan Pearson（USDA）的聯合會議，「阻止了我們把改用熱去活化酵母當成一條通用的法規捷徑」，迫使他們逐一管轄區做法規盤點，而不是套一個全球分類。最深的一條經濟鏈，走過 Prof. Wally Thurman（NC State 農業與資源經濟學，2026 年 7 月 29 日訪談）與 Prof. Brittney Goodrich（Illinois 農業與消費者經濟學，2026 年 8 月 7 日）：Thurman 定下五項方法學承諾（從一個平均規模的商業養蜂場出發，而不是產業總量；以現有療法作為反事實對照；評估成本與收入，而不是存活率；用簡單的部分均衡；只限於有付費的授粉市場），而 Goodrich 以場級成本結構重新定義了 Varroa 的成本，把勞力、蜂群替換，以及損失的蜂蜜與授粉收入都算進去，而不只是殺蟎劑的價錢。團隊接著把這條鏈反向跑：從養蜂人付得起多少，推到每劑可容許的成本、再推到可容許的製造成本，最後推到每克乾酵母中必須含有多少完整 dsRNA 的質量——把「高表現量」換算成一條通過/不通過的濕實驗規格：美國市場可行需每克酵母 0.005 mg dsRNA，兩個市場都要可行則需 0.05 mg/g，而發酵成本約為每克 2.33 USD。他們也刻意去找反對意見：Oxfordshire Natural Beekeeping Group（約 20 位不用藥的業餘養蜂人）與不治療派養蜂人 Mark Sandham 主張，治療會移除那個本來會篩選出耐受性蜜蜂的選擇壓力——這是對整個前提的反對。團隊沒有因此放棄專案，而是把目標使用者收窄到商業養蜂場，並寫下 OxNatBees 改變的「不是 NECTAR 的分子機制，而是我們認為 NECTAR 應該——以及不應該——嘗試解決的問題」。較小但同樣可追溯的改變：Lord John Krebs（首任 FSA 主席）與 Prof. Jim Dunwell（ACRE 主席）把環境宿命與脫靶效應變成明確的工程需求，使非標的生物被納入 FORAGER 的脫靶篩查階段，並加入體內 dsRNA 持續性實驗；Prof. Paul Lam（香港都會大學環境化學）推動採用 BLAST 脫靶篩查，並把公眾參與重新定義為風險管理而不是宣傳；Dr Michael Morrison（Oxford 法學院 HeLEX）改寫了問卷工具，使它分別詢問花粉餅、組成型表現的工程改造細菌與誘導型工程改造細菌，而不是籠統地問「GMO」；Dr Théotime Colin 關於次級害蟲的提醒，促成了針對蠟蛾與小蜂巢甲蟲的 dsRNA 構築體；Prof. Giles Budge 的保證讓成蜂口服遞送路線得以保留，並產生了 300/500/700 bp 的長度比較；而 Melanie Teece（Hilltop Honey 技術總監）與 Wade Ford（Hive & Wellness）則把蜂蜜純度變成了追加體內實驗的理由。公開的 HIVE 指南自己點名了各種失效模式（只訪談會同意你的人、把「大眾」當成單一利害關係人、讓 Verdict 退化成摘要、太晚才諮詢法規機關以致什麼都改不了），並要求每一次 Verdict 都必須寫出決定了什麼、否決了什麼，以及那個代價是什麼。","realWorld":"The need is framed with numbers rather than adjectives: Varroa is an invasive alien species across most of its range and the most serious pest of the western honeybee; Australia's failed eradication attempt cost A$101 million and destroyed about 30,000 hives, and surveyed US commercial operations lost around 62% of colonies in 2024-25, estimated at over $600 million. SDGs are chosen, not collected: 15 (Life on Land) and 2 (Zero Hunger) are the primary goals with 17 and 4 as enabling goals, each mapped to named sub-targets (15.8 on invasive alien species is the headline, plus 15.1, 15.5, 15.9), and the analysis extends into the Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework targets 7, 10, 11 and 17 at the CBD Secretariat's suggestion. The team then writes a dedicated negative-impacts section on goal conflicts - accessibility across economic status, pollution, ecological threat, and whether healthier managed colonies put pressure on wild pollinators (goal 15 against goal 2) - and admits an unresolved contradiction: stakeholders insisted cost was decisive while 48% of their own survey respondents ranked cost least important, with the honest line 'We have not resolved this'. Deployment rides on existing practice (dsRNA-bearing heat-killed yeast in a conventional pollen patty laid over the frames, plus a 3D-printable hive insert), the regulatory path is mapped per jurisdiction after the EPA/FDA/USDA conversation, and the cost model gives both a per-colony net private benefit and the titre threshold manufacturing must hit. They are unusually candid about what is not demonstrated: no dsRNA titre was measured against the model thresholds, the yeast could not be cloned and the E. coli route gave no detectable dsRNA, so 'this is a case for the approach, not a demonstration of the product'. Handover material - FORAGER, the HIVE cycle and question bank, the bee research guide, protocols and hardware files - is released CC BY 4.0 for future teams.","realWorld_zh":"需求是用數字而不是形容詞寫出來的：Varroa 在其大部分分布範圍內都是入侵外來種，也是西方蜜蜂最嚴重的害蟲；澳洲失敗的撲滅行動花了 A$1.01 億並銷毀約 30,000 個蜂箱，而受調查的美國商業養蜂場在 2024-25 年損失約 62% 的蜂群，估計損失超過 6 億美元。SDG 是選出來的，不是蒐集來的：15（陸域生命）與 2（消除飢餓）是主要目標，17 與 4 為支持性目標，每一項都對應到具名的子目標（關於入侵外來種的 15.8 是重點，另有 15.1、15.5、15.9），而在 CBD 秘書處的建議下，分析還延伸到昆明-蒙特婁全球生物多樣性框架的目標 7、10、11 與 17。團隊接著專設一節寫負面影響與目標衝突——不同經濟條件下的可取得性、污染、生態威脅，以及更健康的人工管理蜂群是否會對野生授粉者造成壓力（目標 15 對上目標 2）——並承認一個未解的矛盾：利害關係人堅稱成本是決定性因素，但他們自己問卷中有 48% 的受訪者把成本排在最不重要，而他們誠實地寫下「我們還沒解決這個矛盾」。佈署搭在既有慣行做法上（把帶 dsRNA 的熱殺死酵母放進一塊傳統花粉餅、鋪在巢框上方，另有一個可 3D 列印的蜂箱插件），法規路徑在 EPA/FDA/USDA 那場對話之後逐管轄區盤點，而成本模型同時給出每個蜂群的淨私人效益，以及製造端必須達到的效價門檻。他們對「尚未證明的事」也異常坦白：沒有量測到任何 dsRNA 效價來對照模型門檻、酵母無法選殖成功、而 E. coli 路線完全測不到 dsRNA，所以「這是在為這個方法做論證，不是對產品的展示」。交接材料——FORAGER、HIVE 循環與題庫、蜜蜂研究指南、各項協議與硬體檔案——都以 CC BY 4.0 釋出給未來的團隊。","partners":["Amateur Beekeepers Australia","Australian Honey Bee Industry Council","Hive & Wellness Australia","NSW Department of Primary Industries","Science and Advice for Scottish Agriculture (SASA)","Scottish Government Honey Bee Health Team","Advisory Committee on Releases to the Environment (ACRE)","Soil Association Certification","Secretariat of the Convention on Biological Diversity","US EPA, FDA and USDA","Hilltop Honey","Sustainable Conservation / Almond Board of California","Oxfordshire Natural Beekeeping Group","NYU Abu Dhabi iGEM","University of Oxford Department of Biology (Prof. Geraldine Wright)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6391/wiki/assets/drawings/sdg-description.avif","caption":"NECTAR at the centre of four chosen SDGs - 15 Life on Land and 2 Zero Hunger as primary goals, 17 Partnerships and 4 Quality Education as enabling goals - each with its own justification rather than a logo wall","caption_zh":"NECTAR 置於四個被選定的 SDG 中央——15 陸域生命與 2 消除飢餓為主要目標，17 夥伴關係與 4 優質教育為支持性目標——每一項都附自己的理由，而不是一面標誌牆","credit":"Team Oxford, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6391/wiki/assets/education/gmo-webinar-zoom.avif","caption":"GMO 101, the joint Zoom workshop with NYU Abu Dhabi iGEM on 8 October 2026, with participation measured through Nearpod","caption_zh":"GMO 101，2026 年 10 月 8 日與 NYU Abu Dhabi iGEM 合辦的 Zoom 工作坊，參與度以 Nearpod 量測","credit":"Team Oxford, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6391/wiki/assets/bee-research-guide/walking-to-the-hives.avif","caption":"The team walking to the hives - fifteen members with zero beekeeping experience at the start of the project","caption_zh":"團隊走向蜂箱——十五位成員在專案開始時全都沒有養蜂經驗","credit":"Team Oxford, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6391/wiki/assets/education/street-interview.avif","caption":"Street interviews on public attitudes to GMOs in bee treatment, run as risk management rather than promotion after advice from Prof. Paul Lam","caption_zh":"關於民眾對蜜蜂治療中使用 GMO 態度的街訪；在 Prof. Paul Lam 的建議後，這被當成風險管理而非宣傳來進行","credit":"Team Oxford, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Make the write-up template itself enforce integration: every stakeholder record must carry a 'what this changed' field, and every verdict must name what was decided, what was rejected and what that cost - then run the affordability chain backwards from what the user can pay to a numerical pass/fail specification for the bench.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"讓撰寫的範本本身強制整合：每一筆利害關係人紀錄都必須帶一個「這改變了什麼」欄位，而每一次 Verdict 都必須寫出決定了什麼、否決了什麼，以及那個代價是什麼——然後把可負擔性這條鏈反向跑一次，從使用者付得起多少，一路推回到給實驗桌的一條有數字的通過/不通過規格。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/oxford/","https://2026.igem.wiki/oxford/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/oxford/sustainability","https://2026.igem.wiki/oxford/economic-modelling","https://2026.igem.wiki/oxford/case-studies","https://2026.igem.wiki/oxford/beekeeper-survey","https://2026.igem.wiki/oxford/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/oxford/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/oxford/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/oxford/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/oxford/project-description"],"awards_zh":["最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳農業專案 — 得主"],"rank":47},"6395":{"team":"NUS-Singapore","id":"6395","section":"Undergrad","country":"Singapore","village":"Biomanufacturing","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/","projectTitle":"ORCHID","projectTitle_zh":"ORCHID","tagline":"Multiplexed fluorescent stress biosensors in yeast plus a machine-learning layer that turns intracellular stress into the next experiment to run.","tagline_zh":"在酵母中建立多工螢光壓力生物感測器，再加上一層機器學習，把細胞內的壓力狀態轉換成下一個該做的實驗。","summary":"Industrial bioreactors hold hundreds of thousands of litres and a single bad batch is expensive, yet conventional monitoring tracks only physical and chemical parameters such as pH and dissolved oxygen — nothing about what is happening inside the cell. Omics and LC-MS can see inside, but they are offline, destructive and slow enough that results arrive after the batch has finished, so they cannot act on anything. ORCHID puts biosensors for endoplasmic reticulum, oxidative and ATP stress into Saccharomyces cerevisiae as fluorescent reporters readable straight from a plate reader, solves the resulting spectral overlap with a linear unmixing model, and feeds the separated stress signals into SABLe, a neural-network framework that predicts growth, product and stress from process conditions and then proposes which culture to run next. It won nominations across parts, presentation, wiki and integrated human practices because the loop actually closed: SABLe's exploration rule proposed 27 C, the team grew that plate, and the measured product signal reached 491 mApple RFU/OD600 against 204 and 179 at the 24 and 30 C conditions it was trained on.","summary_zh":"工業級生物反應器動輒數十萬公升，一批壞掉就所費不菲，然而常規監測只追蹤 pH 與溶氧這類物理化學參數，對細胞內部正在發生什麼完全無法掌握。體學分析與 LC-MS 看得到內部，但它們是離線、破壞性的，而且慢到結果在批次結束後才拿到，因此無法據以採取任何行動。ORCHID 把偵測內質網壓力、氧化壓力與 ATP 壓力的生物感測器以螢光報導子的形式放進 Saccharomyces cerevisiae，可直接用盤式讀取儀讀取，再以一個線性解混模型處理隨之而來的光譜重疊，並把分離出來的壓力訊號餵給 SABLe，一個由製程條件預測生長、產物與壓力、並進而提議下一盤該培養什麼條件的類神經網路框架。本案在零件、簡報、wiki 與整合式人類實踐多項入圍，因為這個迴圈真的閉合了：SABLe 的探索規則提議 27 C，團隊真的培養了那一盤，而量到的產物訊號達到 491 mApple RFU/OD600，相對於訓練資料中 24 C 與 30 C 條件下的 204 與 179。","awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Part Collection — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Biomanufacturing Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Three layers, built in sequence. First, a linear unmixing model adapted from multispectral fluorescence imaging to plate-reader wells: each sample's readings are modelled as a mixture matrix with one column per reporter and one row per channel, with diagonal entries carrying a reporter's own signal and off-diagonal entries the crosstalk, inverted to recover each reporter's share. It was validated on mixtures of single-reporter strains including untransformed BY4741 for autofluorescence and water-only wells for background, six replicates per condition. Second, a mechanistic baseline: Hill dose-response curves fitted at each temperature for DTT against the stress reporter and galactose against the product reporter, plus simple ODE time-course equations. The ODEs tracked growth well (R-squared about 0.91-0.93) but fitted stress (0.33-0.47) and product (0.41-0.42) poorly, and the team uses that failure as the explicit justification for moving to machine learning rather than assuming ML was needed. Third, SABLe: a multilayer perceptron trained on 700 culture-time records from 40 unique condition combinations (two temperatures at 24 and 30 C, five DTT concentrations 0-1 mM, four galactose concentrations 0-0.2%, three independent plate cultures each, measured at 0, 3, 5, 7, 9 and 24-26 hours), predicting OD600, mApple/OD600 and mCitrine/OD600 without ever receiving their measured values as inputs. On top of the trained network they run gradient ascent (network frozen, 64 starting conditions, 500 steps each, 32,000 evaluations without growing a culture), a ten-member bootstrap ensemble for disagreement-based uncertainty, and UMAP projection of the 64-dimensional latent response to 20,000 queried conditions to inspect what the network learned.","frameworks_zh":"三層架構，依序建起。第一層是一個線性解混模型，由多光譜螢光影像的做法改寫套用到盤式讀取儀的反應孔上：每個樣本的讀值都被建模為一個混合矩陣，每個報導子一欄、每個偵測通道一列，對角元素承載該報導子自身的訊號、非對角元素則是串訊，再透過求逆還原出每個報導子的占比。它以單一報導子菌株的混合物驗證，包含以未轉形的 BY4741 作為自體螢光對照、以純水孔作為背景，每個條件六個重複。第二層是機制基準線：在每個溫度下分別擬合 DTT 對壓力報導子、半乳糖對產物報導子的 Hill 劑量反應曲線，再加上簡單的 ODE 時間歷程方程式。這些 ODE 把生長追蹤得不錯（R 平方約 0.91 至 0.93），但對壓力（0.33 至 0.47）與產物（0.41 至 0.42）的擬合很差，而團隊正是以這個失敗作為轉向機器學習的明確理由，而不是先假設非用機器學習不可。第三層是 SABLe：一個多層感知器，以 40 種獨特條件組合下的 700 筆培養時間點紀錄訓練（兩個溫度 24 與 30 C、五種 DTT 濃度 0 至 1 mM、四種半乳糖濃度 0 至 0.2%，每種條件三盤獨立培養，於 0、3、5、7、9 與 24 至 26 小時量測），預測 OD600、mApple/OD600 與 mCitrine/OD600，而這些量測值從未作為輸入餵給它。在訓練好的網路之上，他們執行梯度上升（網路凍結、64 個起始條件、各 500 步，共 32,000 次評估而不必培養任何一盤細胞）、一個十成員的 bootstrap 集成以取得基於不一致的不確定性，以及對 20,000 個查詢條件的 64 維潛在響應做 UMAP 投影，以檢視網路到底學到了什麼。","dataviz":"The wiki is a Three.js scrollytelling experience that walks a reader from the $2-4 trillion bioeconomy projection down to a single yeast cell, with hoverable bioreactors explaining Titer, Rate and Yield before the project is even introduced — the argument is built visually before any data appears. The dry lab page is laid out as a numbered slide sequence (raw extremes, normalisation, normalised trajectories, stress dose fit, product dose fit, time model fit, fivefold split, held-out scores, held-out trajectories, gradient search, ensemble uncertainty, exploration score, optimisation versus exploration, latent UMAP, measured DTT response, UMAP robustness), so the reasoning chain is the navigation. Two choices stand out. The exploit-versus-explore panel shows side by side that maximising predicted signal just returns to a corner already measured, while the exploration rule spreads eight proposed tests across under-sampled combinations — making the value of the method visible rather than argued. And the UMAP is drawn sixteen different ways with the caption telling the reader to compare colour gradients rather than outlines, with an explicit note that the map axes have no biological units, which is an honest treatment of a technique usually presented as if its shape meant something.","dataviz_zh":"這個 wiki 是一段 Three.js 捲動敘事，帶著讀者從 2 至 4 兆美元的生物經濟規模預測，一路下降到單一個酵母細胞，途中可滑過的生物反應器會解釋效價、速率與產率，而這一切都發生在專案本身被介紹之前，也就是論證先以視覺建立，資料才出現。乾實驗頁面編排成一連串有編號的投影片（原始極端值、歸一化、歸一化後的軌跡、壓力劑量擬合、產物劑量擬合、時間模型擬合、五折切分、保留測試分數、保留測試軌跡、梯度搜尋、集成不確定性、探索分數、最佳化對探索、潛在空間 UMAP、實測 DTT 反應、UMAP 穩健性），因此推理鏈本身就是導覽結構。其中兩個選擇特別突出。利用對探索的面板並排顯示：單純最大化預測訊號只會回到一個已經量過的角落，而探索規則則把八個提議的測試散布到取樣不足的組合上，讓這套方法的價值變成看得見的，而不是用說的。另外，UMAP 以十六種不同方式繪製，而圖說告訴讀者要比較的是顏色梯度而不是輪廓，並明確註明圖的座標軸沒有生物學單位，這對一項常被呈現得好像其形狀自有意義的技術而言，是相當誠實的處理。","datascience":"The statistical discipline here is well above the usual standard. Cross-validation groups all biological replicates and time points from a single cultivation condition into one split, because splitting correlated measurements across train and test would inflate performance — so the reported scores (R-squared 0.955 for OD600, 0.891 for mApple/OD600, 0.842 for mCitrine/OD600) measure generalisation to genuinely unseen condition combinations. Channel selection asked how few reads are needed and found one well-chosen channel per reporter matches a full spectral scan (three channels as good as six for three reporters, four as good as eight for four), turning an hour-long scan into minutes so a bioreactor can be sampled routinely. A simulation study set the design rule for adding reporters: for each separation angle from 2 to 90 degrees they generated 3,000 random two-reporter mixtures with 5% noise and found median error stays within 5 percentage points once reporters are at least 28 degrees apart — which is why mCitrine and eGFP at 20 degrees are ruled out. Errors are diagnosed rather than reported: the consistent 3-point overestimate of mTurquoise2 and underestimate of mApple in three-reporter mixtures is attributed to sample preparation rather than the algorithm because noise alone would scatter in both directions, and the larger four-reporter errors are traced to the whole plate being 6-17 times dimmer, leaving mApple and mTurquoise2 only about 160 and 690 RFU above water. Then the model generated a biological hypothesis: UMAP showed conditions with more DTT clustering where both stress and product are predicted high (79% of high-predicted-product conditions were also high DTT, 81% high predicted stress, against 25% expected by chance), the team went back to the measured cultures and confirmed it (Spearman rho, p < 0.001), checked that mCitrine bleed into the mApple channel could explain at most 8% of the rise, and named the next mechanistic question. They also caught their own education-survey analogue of this problem in the model: the 27 C validation plate was read at 24 hours while earlier plates were read at about 25, and they say so.","datascience_zh":"這裡的統計紀律明顯高於一般水準。交叉驗證把來自同一培養條件的所有生物重複與時間點全部歸進同一折，因為把彼此相關的量測分散到訓練與測試集會虛增表現，因此回報的分數（OD600 的 R 平方 0.955、mApple/OD600 的 0.891、mCitrine/OD600 的 0.842）量到的是對真正沒見過的條件組合的泛化能力。通道選擇要回答的是最少需要讀幾個通道，結果發現每個報導子只要一個選得好的通道，就能比得上完整光譜掃描（三個報導子用三通道與六通道一樣好，四個報導子用四通道與八通道一樣好），把一小時的掃描縮短到幾分鐘，使生物反應器可以常規取樣。一項模擬研究則訂出了增加報導子的設計準則：對 2 至 90 度的每一個分離角度，他們生成 3,000 組帶 5% 雜訊的隨機雙報導子混合物，發現只要報導子相距至少 28 度，誤差中位數就能維持在 5 個百分點以內，而這正是相距 20 度的 mCitrine 與 eGFP 被排除的原因。誤差是被診斷而不是只被回報：三報導子混合物中 mTurquoise2 一致高估約 3 個百分點、mApple 一致低估，被歸因於樣本製備而不是演算法，因為單純的雜訊會往兩個方向散開；而四報導子時較大的誤差則追溯到整盤亮度低了 6 至 17 倍，使 mApple 與 mTurquoise2 分別只比純水高出約 160 與 690 RFU。接著模型產生了一個生物學假說：UMAP 顯示 DTT 較高的條件會聚集在壓力與產物都被預測為高的區域（預測產物高的條件中有 79% 同時是高 DTT、81% 是高預測壓力，而隨機期望值為 25%），團隊回頭檢視實測的培養結果並予以確認（Spearman rho，p < 0.001），也核算過 mCitrine 溢漏到 mApple 通道最多只能解釋其中 8% 的上升，並點出下一個機制層面的問題。他們也在模型中抓到自己在教育問卷裡同類型的問題：27 C 的驗證盤是在 24 小時讀取，而先前的盤是在約 25 小時讀取，而他們把這件事說了出來。","software":"SABLe and the linear unmixing algorithm are released on the iGEM GitLab at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/nus-singapore/model, framed explicitly as a reusable framework rather than a one-project script — future teams can use the unmixing to quantify several fluorescent proteins at once and track multiple cellular processes from a single strain design. The part collection is the other deliverable: 17 modular basic parts (stress-sensing elements including altered and native Yap1 response elements, UPRE1 and UPRE2 Hac1 binding sites, biosensor tuning elements, promoters of differing strengths, terminators, and fluorescent reporters including a genetically encoded green ATP sensor) plus 12 composite parts for the ER, oxidative and ATP stress biosensors, designed for plug-and-play assembly. They also characterised leakiness-reduction design principles as a reusable pattern: Sko1 repression upstream of the TATA box, a cP_CYC1 core promoter to lower basal expression, an ODC degradation tag for continuous turnover of background protein, and an RPP2Bt terminator. Two education artefacts are software: a browser game in which players build genetic circuits in virtual yeast populations, with every number and equation documented by source category (published, game-balance tuned by scripted playtesting, or stated rule) and an honest statement that no value was fitted to a real culture so the game shows the shape of the biology rather than predictions; and SynVision, an app whose camera scanner links everyday objects to synthetic biology concepts and then runs DBTL-guided questioning.","software_zh":"SABLe 與線性解混演算法釋出於 iGEM GitLab（https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/nus-singapore/model），並明確定位為一個可重複使用的框架而非單一專案的腳本：未來的團隊可以用這套解混法同時定量數種螢光蛋白，並從單一菌株設計中追蹤多個細胞程序。零件集是另一項交付成果：17 個模組化基礎零件（壓力感測元件，包含經改造與原生的 Yap1 反應元件、UPRE1 與 UPRE2 的 Hac1 結合位、生物感測器調校元件、強度各異的啟動子、終止子，以及含一個基因編碼綠色 ATP 感測器的螢光報導子），加上 12 個用於內質網、氧化與 ATP 壓力生物感測器的複合零件，全部為隨插即用式組裝而設計。他們也把降低滲漏表現的設計原則整理成一個可重複使用的模式：TATA 盒上游的 Sko1 抑制、以 cP_CYC1 核心啟動子降低基礎表現量、以 ODC 降解標籤讓背景蛋白質持續被代謝掉，以及一個 RPP2Bt 終止子。兩項教育產出也是軟體：一款瀏覽器遊戲，玩家在虛擬酵母族群中建構基因迴路，其中每一個數值與方程式都依來源類別標註（已發表、以腳本化試玩調整遊戲平衡，或明訂規則），並誠實聲明沒有任何數值是擬合到真實培養資料上的，因此遊戲呈現的是生物學的形狀而不是預測；以及 SynVision，一款以相機掃描把日常物件連結到合成生物學概念、再進行 DBTL 導引式提問的應用程式。","stack":["Python with a multilayer perceptron (ReLU)","Deep ensembles for predictive uncertainty","UMAP dimensionality reduction","Gradient ascent over a frozen network","Linear unmixing / matrix inversion on plate-reader channels","Hill dose-response curve fitting","ODE time-course models","Spearman correlation with Holm correction","Saliency-map style latent inspection","Three.js scrollytelling wiki","Microsoft Forms with anonymous participant linking codes","GitLab (iGEM instance)"],"techniques":["Multiplexed fluorescent biosensing with spectral deconvolution","Reference-spectra calibration including autofluorescence and background wells","Condition-grouped cross-validation to prevent leakage from correlated replicates","Channel-subset selection to minimise readout time","Simulation-based design thresholds (28-degree separation rule)","Bootstrap ensemble disagreement as an uncertainty proxy","Exploit-versus-explore acquisition scoring (normalised disagreement plus distance to nearest tested condition)","Latent-space projection to generate testable biological hypotheses","Robustness checks across 16 hyperparameter settings","Model-proposed condition validated at the bench","Systematic error diagnosis distinguishing preparation artefacts from algorithm error"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"NUS treated their educational game as a research object, which is rare at any level. It was designed against Self-Determination Theory with autonomy, competence and relatedness mapped to specific mechanics (free choice of parts, a shared leaderboard, facilitated peer discussion), and every simulation value published with its provenance. Evaluation used paired pre- and post-surveys via Microsoft Forms where participants generated the same anonymous linking code on both forms from details only they would know, so before-and-after answers could be matched without collecting names or emails. They deployed across six settings — Project STEMpact Workshop 3 with secondary school students, NCEB Engineering Biology Week FUTURES Day with polytechnic students, two undergraduate modules (SP2718C and BN4501), NUS Telegram channels and a Raffles Girls' School email blast — getting 58 pre-surveys and 27 post-surveys between 5 September and 18 October 2026, of which 24 paired. The analysis is where it becomes exemplary: four Intrinsic Motivation Inventory subscales were shortened and reworded, then checked for internal consistency with Cronbach's alpha in their own data, which exposed that Perceived Choice at alpha 0.23 was not a single construct (its two items measured having choices and feeling obliged to play) so they reported them separately instead of averaging. Three items were negatively worded and reverse-scored to catch acquiescent responders. Attrition bias was tested — only 41% of pre-survey takers paired — and no item differed (all p > .18). Self-ratings on all three understanding statements rose 1.3-1.8 points (d = 0.76-0.95) and intent to pursue synthetic biology from 4.0 to 4.9 (d = 0.64), all surviving Holm correction. But they also scored free-text definitions as an independent check: promoters rose from 64% to 91% correct, sensors from 23% to 45%, genes stayed at 55%, and the overall written score moved only 1.4 to 1.9 out of 3 (p = .06). Crucially, self-ratings matched written answers before playing (rho = .65) and did not afterwards (rho = -.04) — participants felt they understood more than they could explain — so the team explicitly treats the self-reported gains as an upper bound. Their own headline finding is that participants valued the game more than they enjoyed it: the highest-rated statement in the survey was that the game is useful for understanding synthetic biology (5.5) and the lowest was about enjoying it while playing (4.3).","publicEngagement_zh":"NUS 把自己的教育遊戲當成研究對象來處理，這在任何層級都很罕見。遊戲依自我決定論設計，把自主性、能力感與關聯感對應到具體機制（自由挑選零件、共用排行榜、經引導的同儕討論），而每一個模擬數值都連同其出處一併公開。評估採用透過 Microsoft Forms 進行的前後測配對問卷，參與者在兩份表單上以只有自己知道的資訊生成相同的匿名連結碼，因此前後作答能夠配對，卻不必蒐集姓名或電子郵件。他們在六個場域施行，包括與中學生進行的 Project STEMpact Workshop 3、與技職學院學生進行的 NCEB Engineering Biology Week FUTURES Day、兩門大學課程（SP2718C 與 BN4501）、NUS 的 Telegram 頻道，以及一次 Raffles Girls' School 的電子郵件群發；在 2026 年 9 月 5 日至 10 月 18 日之間收到 58 份前測與 27 份後測，其中 24 份成功配對。真正堪為典範的是分析本身：四個內在動機量表（IMI）分量表經縮短與改寫後，他們以自己的資料計算 Cronbach's alpha 檢查內部一致性，結果暴露出「知覺選擇感」的 alpha 只有 0.23，並不是單一構念（其兩題分別量到「有選擇」與「覺得被迫玩」），因此他們分開回報而不是取平均。另有三題以負向措辭並反向計分，用以抓出有默認作答傾向的受訪者。流失偏誤也經過檢定，前測受訪者中只有 41% 成功配對，而沒有任何一題出現差異（全部 p > .18）。三項理解程度的自評都上升 1.3 至 1.8 分（d = 0.76 至 0.95），而投入合成生物學的意願由 4.0 升至 4.9（d = 0.64），全部通過 Holm 校正。但他們也對開放式定義作答評分作為獨立檢核：啟動子由 64% 正確升至 91%、感測器由 23% 升至 45%、基因維持在 55%，而整體書面分數在 3 分制下僅由 1.4 移動到 1.9（p = .06）。關鍵在於，自評在玩之前與書面作答一致（rho = .65），玩過之後則不再一致（rho = -.04），也就是參與者自覺理解的比他們能解釋的更多，因此團隊明確把自陳的進步視為上限。他們自己的頭條發現是，參與者對這款遊戲的評價高於他們玩得開心的程度：問卷中評分最高的敘述是「這款遊戲對理解合成生物學有幫助」（5.5），最低的則是關於玩的時候是否享受（4.3）。","ihp":"The project's scope was set and then substantially narrowed by stakeholders. An application scientist at TJX Bioengineering established that a single failed batch causes substantial financial loss and shifted the team's attention from the product to the production process and the changing conditions cells experience; Anomaly Bio, a precision fermentation startup, established that conventional monitoring tracks physical and chemical parameters while the cell's inner workings are overlooked because they are hard to measure and hard to interpret. The largest single change came from Dr Bruce Li, Alan Yang and Prof Yong-Su Jin raising scale-up challenges, deployment barriers and startup resource constraints: in response the team moved ORCHID's primary intended application from continuous industrial monitoring to early-stage R&D, naming strain-engineering and process-development teams at startups as the primary users and dropping production-scale deployment as an immediate objective. Several design elements are individually attributable — Dr Jee Loon Foo's guidance set the initial oxidative and ER stress targets, Sheena Chan's feedback added the ATP depletion sensor, and Dr Bruce Li's concerns about whether the biosensors themselves perturb the cell led them to build parental-versus-biosensor-strain comparisons into the experimental design. Sook Wei explained how genome-scale metabolic models represent competition between growth and product formation but warned that conventional metabolic models may not match real cellular behaviour because of unaccounted byproducts, competing pathways and biological constraints, stressing that experimental data is what closes that gap and pointing toward combining genome-scale modelling with machine learning — advice visible in the final architecture, where a mechanistic ODE baseline is fitted first, shown to fail on stress and product, and only then replaced by a learned model. Later feedback also asked them to extend the model to weigh productivity, yield and cost together rather than optimising a single predicted output, which is recorded as future work rather than claimed as done.","ihp_zh":"專案的範圍是由利害關係人定下來、並且被他們大幅收窄的。TJX Bioengineering 的一位應用科學家確立了「一批失敗就造成重大財務損失」這件事，使團隊的注意力由產物轉向生產製程以及細胞所經歷的變動條件；精準發酵新創 Anomaly Bio 則確立了常規監測只追蹤物理與化學參數，而細胞內部運作之所以被忽略，是因為既難量測也難解讀。最大的單一改變來自 Dr Bruce Li、Alan Yang 與 Prof Yong-Su Jin 提出的放大量產挑戰、部署障礙與新創資源限制：團隊因此把 ORCHID 的主要預期應用從連續性的工業監測改為早期研發階段，指名新創公司的菌株工程與製程開發團隊為主要使用者，並放棄把量產規模部署當成立即目標。有幾項設計元素可以逐一歸因：Dr Jee Loon Foo 的指引定下了最初的氧化壓力與內質網壓力標的；Sheena Chan 的回饋加入了 ATP 耗竭感測器；而 Dr Bruce Li 關於「生物感測器本身是否會干擾細胞」的疑慮，使他們把親代菌株與生物感測器菌株的比較納入實驗設計。Sook Wei 說明了基因組尺度代謝模型如何表徵生長與產物形成之間的競爭，但也提醒傳統代謝模型可能與真實的細胞行為不符，原因是未納入計算的副產物、競爭途徑與生物學上的限制，並強調實驗資料才是填補那個落差的東西，同時指出把基因組尺度建模與機器學習結合的方向；這項建議在最終架構中看得見，也就是先擬合一條機制性的 ODE 基準線、指出它在壓力與產物上失效，然後才以學習而來的模型取代它。後續的回饋也要求他們把模型擴充成同時權衡生產力、產率與成本，而不是只最佳化單一預測輸出，而這一點被記錄為未來工作，沒有被當成已完成來宣稱。","realWorld":"The deployment story is deliberately modest after the industry reality check. ORCHID is positioned as an early-stage R&D platform for strain engineering and process development teams at startups, not as production-scale instrumentation, because the team accepted that industrial implementation carries technical and financial constraints they cannot yet meet. The workflow they specify is concrete: build or adopt modular biosensors for the analytes of interest in whatever chassis is being engineered, culture under varied process conditions, train the model on how conditions map to stress responses, use it to interpolate and recommend conditions, then run the organism under those conditions — with the intracellular data also making unintended effects on the host easier to spot. The framing they use for the value proposition is a grey box rather than a black box: in-line pH and dissolved oxygen sensors show how organism and environment affect each other, but when production is inefficient researchers still cannot tell which pathway is the constraint, and high-dimensional intracellular stress data gives a window into that. Because the biosensors are modular, they argue the collection builds toward a shared library: metabolic engineering teams can track the burden a heterologous pathway places on the cell, and environmental synthetic biology teams can assess strain robustness in harsh conditions. Troubleshooting is published as a first-class deliverable, with issues and fixes in segmented boxes down the results page specifically so later teams hit them less hard.","realWorld_zh":"經過業界的現實檢驗之後，部署的敘事刻意保持謙抑。ORCHID 被定位為供新創公司菌株工程與製程開發團隊使用的早期研發平台，而不是量產規模的儀器，因為團隊接受了工業落實帶有他們目前還做不到的技術與財務限制。他們所指定的工作流程相當具體：在正在改造的任何底盤中，針對關注的分析標的建立或採用模組化生物感測器，在不同製程條件下培養，用這些資料訓練模型學會條件如何對應到壓力反應，再用它內插並推薦條件，然後在那些條件下實際培養該生物；而細胞內的資料也讓宿主身上非預期的影響更容易被發現。他們用來談價值主張的框架是「灰箱」而不是「黑箱」：線上的 pH 與溶氧感測器能顯示生物與環境如何互相影響，但當生產效率不佳時，研究人員仍然無法判斷到底是哪一條途徑成為瓶頸，而高維度的細胞內壓力資料正好提供了那扇窗。由於這些生物感測器是模組化的，他們主張整個零件集會累積成一座共享資料庫：代謝工程團隊可以追蹤一條異源途徑對細胞造成多少負擔，而環境合成生物學團隊則可以評估菌株在嚴苛條件下的穩健性。疑難排解被當成第一級的交付成果公開，問題與解法以分段方塊的形式沿著結果頁面排列，明確就是為了讓後續團隊少踩一些坑。","partners":["TJX Bioengineering (application scientist, cell culture bioprocess)","Anomaly Bio (precision fermentation startup)","Dr Bruce Li","Alan Yang","Prof Yong-Su Jin","Dr Jee Loon Foo","Sheena Chan","Prof Matthew Chang","Prof Dong-Yup Lee","Prof Tom Ellis","Sook Wei (genome-scale metabolic modelling)","Lucas Gelain","Goh Lay Koon","Chionh Yok Hian","Project STEMpact","NCEB Engineering Biology Week (FUTURES Day)","Raffles Girls' School"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6395/wiki/pages/model/ml-stuff/sable-slide-12-exploration-score.avif","caption":"SABLe's acquisition rule made visible: model disagreement across the ten bootstrap networks and distance from already-tested conditions highlight different gaps, and their combined exploration score first selected 27 C, 1 mM DTT and 0.15% galactose as the next culture to grow.","caption_zh":"SABLe 的擷取規則被攤開來看：十個 bootstrap 網路之間的模型不一致，以及與已測試條件的距離，各自標示出不同的空缺，而兩者合成的探索分數最先選出了 27 C、1 mM DTT 與 0.15% 半乳糖，作為下一盤要培養的條件。","credit":"Team NUS-Singapore, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6395/wiki/pages/model/ml-stuff/figure-18-27c-product-comparison.avif","caption":"The closed loop: measured mApple per OD600 at 0.2% galactose across DTT doses for 24, 27 and 30 C. The model-proposed 27 C plate reached 491 RFU/OD600 at 0.5 mM DTT, against 204 and 179 for the matched 24 and 30 C cultures the model was trained on.","caption_zh":"閉合的迴圈：在 0.2% 半乳糖下，24、27 與 30 C 三個溫度隨 DTT 劑量變化的實測 mApple per OD600。由模型提議的 27 C 盤在 0.5 mM DTT 時達到 491 RFU/OD600，而模型訓練所用的對應 24 C 與 30 C 培養分別為 204 與 179。","credit":"Team NUS-Singapore, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6395/wiki/pages/model/ml-stuff/sable-slide-14-latent-umap.avif","caption":"UMAP projection of the network's 64-dimensional internal response to 20,000 untested process conditions, the same points coloured by DTT dose, predicted stress and predicted product — the view that generated the testable hypothesis that higher DTT accompanies both more stress and more product.","caption_zh":"網路對 20,000 個未測試製程條件的 64 維內部響應的 UMAP 投影，同一組點分別以 DTT 劑量、預測壓力與預測產物著色，正是這個視圖催生出「DTT 越高會同時伴隨更多壓力與更多產物」這個可檢驗的假說。","credit":"Team NUS-Singapore, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6395/wiki/pages/outreach-and-education/game/game-fig2-written-definitions.avif","caption":"Share of 22 paired participants giving a correct written definition before and after playing the circuit-building game — the independent check that showed smaller gains than self-ratings and led the team to treat the self-reported improvement as an upper bound.","caption_zh":"22 位配對參與者在玩過建構迴路遊戲前後，給出正確書面定義的比例，這是那項獨立檢核，它顯示的進步幅度小於自評，也促使團隊把自陳的進步視為上限。","credit":"Team NUS-Singapore, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Two things are directly copyable and neither needs a bioreactor. First, NUS's active-learning loop: fit a simple mechanistic model, show where it fails, train a small neural net on your own plate data, then use ensemble disagreement plus distance from tested conditions to pick the next experiment — and actually run it, so the write-up ends with a measured confirmation rather than a prediction. Second, and more unusual, evaluate your outreach the way you evaluate an assay: paired pre/post surveys with anonymous linking codes, reverse-scored items to catch acquiescence, Cronbach's alpha on any scale you shorten, attrition checks, and a free-text knowledge score as an independent check on self-reports. NUS found their participants felt they had learned more than they could explain, and said so — that kind of honesty about one's own teaching is both rare and cheap to adopt.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"有兩件事可以直接照抄，而且都不需要生物反應器。第一是 NUS 的主動學習迴圈：先擬合一個簡單的機制模型，指出它在哪裡失效，再用自己盤上的資料訓練一個小型類神經網路，然後以集成模型之間的不一致加上與已測試條件的距離來挑下一個實驗，而且真的去把它做出來，讓整份報告以一次實測確認收尾，而不是以一個預測收尾。第二件更少見：請用評估一項檢定的方式來評估你的科普推廣，也就是以匿名連結碼配對的前後測問卷、用反向計分題抓出默認作答傾向、對任何被你縮短的量表計算 Cronbach's alpha、做流失偏誤檢查，並以開放式作答的知識評分作為自評結果的獨立檢核。NUS 發現他們的參與者自覺學到的比實際能解釋的更多，而且他們把這件事說了出來。這種對自身教學成效的誠實既罕見，採用的成本也極低。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/experiments","https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/implementation","https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/safety-and-security","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/nus-singapore/model"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","最佳元件集 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物製造專案 — 入圍"],"rank":105},"6399":{"team":"Kyoto","id":"6399","section":"Undergrad","country":"Japan","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/kyoto/","projectTitle":"OiLipase — a protein timer that stops rice-bran lipase without destroying rice-bran protein","projectTitle_zh":"OiLipase——一個蛋白質定時器，讓米糠脂解酶停工、卻不摧毀米糠蛋白","tagline":"Degrade the enzyme that spoils rice bran oil, then build a molecular timer that degrades the protease once the job is done.","tagline_zh":"先分解讓米糠油敗壞的那個酵素，再做一個分子定時器，在任務完成後把蛋白酶自己也分解掉。","summary":"Rice bran goes rancid because endogenous lipase attacks the oil after milling. Kyoto tethered trypsin to an interface-seeking carrier so it preferentially cleaves lipase at the oil-water interface, then faced the real problem: once the lipase is gone, unselective trypsin starts eating the valuable albumin and globulin. Their answer is a protein timer — a split HRV 3C protease whose N-terminal half is sequestered by an excess decoy that is also a 3C substrate, producing an autocatalytic, tunable lag before 3C fires and destroys the trypsin. Three models carry the project: an ODE timer model with full sensitivity analysis, an induction-diffusion model that derives an interior optimum for leucine-zipper dissociation rate, and a protease-resistance design model that failed its own experiment and was then rebuilt into CleaveRank, released under GPL-3.0.","summary_zh":"米糠會變質，是因為碾米之後內源的脂解酶開始攻擊油脂。Kyoto 把胰蛋白酶（trypsin）繫在一個會自行尋找界面的載體上，使它優先在油水界面切斷脂解酶，接著就面對了真正的問題：脂解酶一旦被清除，沒有選擇性的胰蛋白酶就會開始吃掉珍貴的白蛋白與球蛋白。他們的解法是一個蛋白質定時器——一個分裂式 HRV 3C 蛋白酶，其 N 端半邊被過量的誘餌隔離住，而該誘餌本身也是 3C 的受質，從而在 3C 啟動並摧毀胰蛋白酶之前，產生一段自催化、可調校的延遲。三個模型撐起整個專題：一個附完整敏感度分析的 ODE 定時器模型、一個推導出白胺酸拉鍊解離速率存在內部最佳值的誘導—擴散模型，以及一個蛋白酶抗性設計模型——後者在自家實驗中被推翻，之後被重建成 CleaveRank，以 GPL-3.0 釋出。","awards":["Best Part Collection — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Model — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Food & Nutrition Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Three distinct models, and the first thing to notice is that each one is a piece of mechanistic reasoning rather than a simulation run for its own sake. (1) TIMER MODEL — a competing-substrate ODE system for a split-protease delay circuit. Species: A (N-terminal split HRV 3C + zipper AN3.5), B (C-terminal + BN3, Kd 279 nM), B' (decoy: zipper BN3.5 with Kd 5.15 nM plus a 3C cleavage site), AB (active 3C), AB' (inactive), and Tr (engineered trypsin). Because 3C sees Tr, B' and AB' as competing substrates, all three rates share a Michaelis denominator den = KM + [Tr] + rel*([B'] + [AB']), with rel being the designable relative cleavability of decoy versus trypsin. Zipper association is treated as at equilibrium, justified because heterodimeric leucine zippers associate in seconds while the lag spans minutes to hours — a reduction that drops k_on from the equations and takes the integration from four variables to two, with A recovered by solving a conservation law; the team notes no measured k_on exists for their zippers and that the equilibrium approximation was checked only against a kinetic version of their own model. Integration is SciPy solve_ivp with LSODA. The conceptual heart of the model is the derivation of WHY the lag scales with decoy amount: a first-order decoy-consumption reaction has a time constant independent of initial concentration, so adding more decoy buys no time; two independent routes to zeroth-order kinetics are identified — Route 1 enzyme saturation (rel*[B']_0 >> KM) and Route 2 sequestration ([B']_0/Kd_Bp >> [B]_0/Kd_B AND [B']_0 >> [A]_0, making [AB] proportional to 1/[B'] so [B'] cancels out of k[AB][B']) — and the team computes their own degree of saturation as 0.38, concluding Route 1 contributes only modestly and the lag is bought almost entirely by sequestration, with the two routes together pushing the order toward -1 and the delay toward quadratic in decoy. They then derive the general result that an n-th order consumption gives depletion time proportional to amount^(1-n), and show the measured local exponent runs 1.75 to 2.82, with the operative 'amount' being u = [B']_0 - [A]_0, the decoy not spent sequestering A. (2) INDUCTION-DIFFUSION MODEL — a transport-and-kinetics model of a two-component induced system (a trypsinogen-zipper-carrier 'Z form' at 0.99 uM and an enterokinase-zipper-carrier 'E form' at 0.01 uM, plus a 1.0 uM free zipper-trypsinogen pool), where the carrier is an inactivated trypsin-resistant lipase that self-targets the oil-water interface. The mean reaction time is assembled from an induction rate k_ind = p_B/tau_search (bulk diffusion to the interface times adsorption probability), a reloading rate k_re = k_on * C_free_TG, the zipper off-rate and the interfacial reaction rate, giving tau_total = 1/k_ind + k_off/(k_ind k_re) + 1/k_off + 1/k_r. The insight that generalises: when the tethered enzyme cannot reach its target (K_act near 0), dissociation becomes an OBLIGATORY step on the reaction path, but dissociation that is too fast wastes transport — so there is an interior optimum in k_off, which means a catalogued leucine-zipper collection spanning a range of dissociation rates has real design value, and a covalent SpyTag/SpyCatcher linkage cannot work at all. They then tested the generalisation against six literature and past-iGEM systems (liposomal release, inhaled formulations, antibody-drug conjugates, Linkoping 2019, Imperial 2010, an intra-articular PLGA depot) and found only one case met both conditions — publishing the degenerate cases as figures. Reported gains: ~18.5x selectivity and 1.6x time-to-completion versus free trypsin, with 91% of water-soluble protein preserved against 0%. (3) PROTEASE RESISTANCE / CleaveRank — see datascience and software.","frameworks_zh":"三個各自獨立的模型，而首先該注意的是，每一個都是一段機制性的推理、而不是為了跑模擬而跑的模擬。(1) 定時器模型——一套用於分裂式蛋白酶延遲迴路的競爭受質 ODE 系統。物種包括：A（N 端分裂式 HRV 3C + 拉鍊 AN3.5）、B（C 端 + BN3，Kd 279 nM）、B'（誘餌：拉鍊 BN3.5，Kd 5.15 nM，並帶一個 3C 切位）、AB（有活性的 3C）、AB'（無活性）與 Tr（經改造的胰蛋白酶）。由於 3C 會把 Tr、B' 與 AB' 都當成互相競爭的受質，這三個速率共用同一個 Michaelis 分母 den = KM + [Tr] + rel*([B'] + [AB'])，其中 rel 是誘餌相對於胰蛋白酶的可切割度，屬於可設計的參數。拉鍊的結合被視為處於平衡狀態，理由是異二聚白胺酸拉鍊在數秒內即完成結合，而延遲長達數分鐘到數小時——這項簡化把 k_on 從方程式中移除，並把積分從四個變數降為兩個，A 則透過守恆律求解回推；團隊指出他們所用的拉鍊並沒有實測的 k_on，而這個平衡近似只對照過他們自己模型的動力學版本檢驗。積分以 SciPy 的 solve_ivp 搭配 LSODA 完成。這個模型在概念上的核心，是推導出延遲「為什麼」會隨誘餌量而增長：一個一階的誘餌消耗反應，其時間常數與起始濃度無關，所以加更多誘餌根本買不到時間；他們指認出兩條獨立通往零階動力學的路徑——路徑一是酵素飽和（rel*[B']_0 >> KM），路徑二是隔離作用（[B']_0/Kd_Bp >> [B]_0/Kd_B 且 [B']_0 >> [A]_0，使 [AB] 與 1/[B'] 成正比，於是 [B'] 在 k[AB][B'] 中相消）——而團隊算出自己的飽和程度為 0.38，結論是路徑一的貢獻只是中等，延遲幾乎完全由隔離作用買來，而兩條路徑合起來把反應階數推向 -1、把延遲推向與誘餌量成平方關係。接著他們推導出一般性結果：n 階的消耗會使耗盡時間與量的 (1-n) 次方成正比，並顯示實測的局部指數落在 1.75 到 2.82 之間，而其中起作用的「量」是 u = [B']_0 - [A]_0，也就是沒有被用去隔離 A 的那部分誘餌。(2) 誘導—擴散模型——一個雙組分誘導系統的傳輸與動力學模型（0.99 uM 的胰蛋白酶原—拉鍊—載體「Z 型」與 0.01 uM 的腸激酶—拉鍊—載體「E 型」，再加上 1.0 uM 的游離拉鍊—胰蛋白酶原池），其中載體是一個已去活性、且耐胰蛋白酶的脂解酶，會自行靶向油水界面。平均反應時間由幾部分組合而成：誘導速率 k_ind = p_B/tau_search（本體擴散到界面的時間乘上吸附機率）、重新載入速率 k_re = k_on * C_free_TG、拉鍊的解離速率，以及界面上的反應速率，合起來得到 tau_total = 1/k_ind + k_off/(k_ind k_re) + 1/k_off + 1/k_r。可一般化的洞見是：當繫住的酵素無法觸及其標的（K_act 接近 0）時，解離就成為反應路徑上「必經」的一步，但解離太快又會白費傳輸的工夫——因此 k_off 存在一個內部最佳值，這意味著一組涵蓋不同解離速率的白胺酸拉鍊收藏具有真實的設計價值，而 SpyTag/SpyCatcher 這種共價連結則完全行不通。他們接著以六個文獻與歷屆 iGEM 系統檢驗這項一般化（脂質體釋放、吸入劑型、抗體藥物複合體、Linkoping 2019、Imperial 2010，以及一種關節腔內的 PLGA 緩釋儲庫），發現只有一個案例同時滿足兩項條件——並把那些退化的案例也畫成圖發表。報告的效益為：相對於游離胰蛋白酶，選擇性約 18.5 倍、完成時間 1.6 倍，並保留 91% 的水溶性蛋白，而游離胰蛋白酶為 0%。(3) 蛋白酶抗性／CleaveRank——見資料科學與軟體兩節。","dataviz":"The timer model's figures are a model of how to present a sensitivity analysis. Figure 3 shows the lag directly (no decoy: Tr below 90% in under a minute; with 3.0 uM decoy: a 27-minute lag) alongside the active-3C trace held near zero through the lag then rising sharply, so the reader sees the autocatalysis rather than being told about it. Figure 4 plots the decoy sweep on log-log axes and reports the LOCAL EXPONENT of the tangent (1.75 to 2.82) rather than claiming a single power law. Figure 5 sweeps the four waveform-shaping parameters in a top row of lag and rise time and a bottom row of sharpness (defined as lag divided by rise time), and the caption explains why kcat gets no panel — it only rescales the time axis and leaves sharpness exactly unchanged. A parameter table gives every sweep range with its resulting lag, rise and sharpness span, so a reader can see that Kd_Bp moves the lag from 8.3 min to 4.5 days and sharpness from 0.59 to 310. The induction-diffusion generalisation is visualised as six SVG figures of the objective function for six different reference systems, with captions that state the failure mode ('there is nothing to optimise', 'without the stage of induction the objective function degenerates', 'Pi_rel is not a design variable') — negative results drawn as carefully as positive ones. CleaveRank's output is organised into four quadrants on three axes (cleavability, impact, risk to activity) so design targets are chosen by rank within a quadrant.","dataviz_zh":"定時器模型的圖，是如何呈現敏感度分析的典範。圖 3 直接把延遲畫出來（無誘餌時：胰蛋白酶在一分鐘內就掉到 90% 以下；加 3.0 uM 誘餌時：出現 27 分鐘的延遲），旁邊並列有活性 3C 的曲線，在整段延遲期間貼近零、之後急遽上升，於是讀者是「看見」自催化，而不是被告知有自催化。圖 4 把誘餌掃描畫在雙對數軸上，並報告切線的「局部指數」（1.75 到 2.82），而不是宣稱存在單一的冪次律。圖 5 掃過四個塑形波形的參數，上排是延遲與上升時間、下排是銳度（定義為延遲除以上升時間），圖說並解釋為什麼 kcat 沒有自己的面板——它只是把時間軸重新縮放，銳度完全不變。一張參數表給出每個掃描範圍及其所得的延遲、上升與銳度跨度，讓讀者看得出 Kd_Bp 會把延遲從 8.3 分鐘推到 4.5 天、把銳度從 0.59 推到 310。誘導—擴散的一般化則以六張 SVG 圖呈現六個不同參照系統的目標函數，圖說直接寫出失效模式（「沒有東西可以最佳化」、「少了誘導這個階段，目標函數就退化了」、「Pi_rel 不是一個設計變數」）——負面結果和正面結果畫得一樣仔細。CleaveRank 的輸出則依三個軸（可切割度、影響度、對活性的風險）整理成四個象限，使設計標的是在某個象限內依排名挑選。","datascience":"The protease-resistance work is the single most honest piece of dry-lab self-criticism in this cohort. The team wrote a 317-line script to design trypsin-resistant 3C protease variants: compute secondary structure and SASA, enumerate loops flanked by stable elements, evaluate with a 'slack' geometry term (slack = 3.3*(loop residues - 7) + 11.3 - anchor distance, from the 7-residue P4-P3' extension spanning 11.3 Angstrom that a protease requires), exclude everything within 14 Angstrom of the catalytic triad, and tier exposed Lys/Arg. Five variants were built. THE EXPERIMENT DENIED BOTH PREMISES: wild-type 3C was already trypsin-resistant across the whole tested range (5 uM substrate, 5-500 nM trypsin, 5-120 min, no cleavage detected), and four of five variants failed to fold. The team then re-ran the original script and diagnosed six specific defects in public. (i) Secondary structure was assigned in-house via a local Kabsch-Sander implementation instead of DSSP; against mkdssp 4.2.2 agreement was 0.761 with entirely one-sided error — 43 beta-strand residues called loop, 44 of 94 'loop' residues actually beta strand, 15 of 20 enumerated loops containing strand, and the largest-slack 'loop' 61-72 actually two beta strands joined by a turn. (ii) The replacement residue was never really chosen: after the exclusion rules the pool was six residues, within which Lys-to-Gln and Arg-to-Gln are uniquely maximal under BLOSUM62, so 'Gln everywhere' was a deterministic artefact — and the exclusions were hard-coded for chymotrypsin and elastase, proteases absent from the experiment. (iii) A crystal structure's B-factor column was read as pLDDT; given the X-ray structure 6KYZ of the same protein the script silently returns zero tier-A positions. (iv) Ranking used descending exposure alone, and later validation showed a structure-only predictor reaches AUC 0.4466 — indistinguishable from chance — so the original code ranked on the one axis that does not work while computing and discarding the axis (specificity) that does. (v) Thirteen thresholds were hand-set, and K175 entered the design by clearing a 14.0 Angstrom cut-off with 0.12 Angstrom to spare. (vi) Substitution sites were scored independently although they are not. Every defect was fixed: DSSP output only; a continuous specificity score built from 22,992 MEROPS records; risk = cleavability x impact; input structure provenance and MD5 recorded with a warning on replacement; an interaction layer for combined substitutions; and 1180 regression-test checks freezing every numeric value, with measurements that would move a threshold PRE-REGISTERED before they are run. Re-ranking the same ten positions under the fixed implementation spreads them 22-fold and puts mut1's K82 and R84 first and third — mut1 being the only variant that folded. Validation went from 4 systems to 48 systems and 9 proteases, giving a mean AUC of 0.7186 over the 47 systems with positive sites, 95% CI [0.642, 0.791] — with the explicit caveat that per-system performance spans [0.38, 1.00] so the interval must not be applied to a single target. Benchmarks: against ExPASy PeptideCutter rules (which by construction cannot rank within their own set, AUC 0.5) CleaveRank reaches 0.7225; against the trained sequence model ProsperousPlus over 45 systems, 0.9305 vs 0.8957 over all residues and 0.7787 vs 0.6873 within the candidate set, with sensitivity 45/45 vs 36/45, paired difference +0.0914 [+0.0043, +0.1855], winning in 25 of 45 — and they then decompose that advantage and report that it CANNOT be attributed: sequence-only features tie the comparator (+0.0036), and neither the structural factors nor the impact weight reaches significance alone, so 'part of the advantage rests on an uncalibrated weight'. They also rule out contamination by stratifying into systems that may and may not have been in ProsperousPlus's training data, showing the gap widens in the unseen stratum. Finally, they tested whether a structure predictor could do the job instead: AlphaFold3 given human trypsin plus LIP2 plus Ca2+, five samples from one seed, with the trypsin-BPTI inhibitor complex as positive control. BPTI gave ipTM 0.95, minimum inter-chain PAE 0.78 Angstrom, P1 Lys15 carbonyl at 2.6 Angstrom from the catalytic Ser, 14/14 shared interface residues; LIP2 gave ipTM 0.14-0.15, PAE 15.3-15.8 Angstrom, nearest carbonyl 5.4-7.0 Angstrom and not at any cleavage site, 0 of 85 shared interface residues, and 23.8-29.3 Angstrom chain displacement — while both monomers were reproduced at 0.16-0.52 Angstrom RMSD. Their conclusion is a genuinely sharp piece of reasoning about method limits: structure prediction returns stable complexes, the PDB is full of protease-inhibitor complexes and almost empty of Michaelis complexes with folded globular substrates because those dissociate on cleavage, and susceptibility to cleavage is not a property of a stable complex — 'this asymmetry is the mechanism of the result, and it will not be removed by scale'.","datascience_zh":"蛋白酶抗性這部分，是本屆乾實驗中最誠實的一次自我批判。團隊寫了一支 317 行的腳本來設計耐胰蛋白酶的 3C 蛋白酶變異體：計算二級結構與 SASA、列舉兩端被穩定結構夾住的環、以一個「slack」幾何項評估（slack = 3.3*(環內殘基數 - 7) + 11.3 - 錨點距離，依據的是蛋白酶所需的 7 殘基 P4-P3' 延伸段橫跨 11.3 埃）、排除催化三聯體 14 埃以內的一切，並為暴露的 Lys/Arg 分級。他們做了五個變異體。實驗推翻了兩個前提：野生型 3C 在整個測試範圍內本來就耐胰蛋白酶（受質 5 uM、胰蛋白酶 5-500 nM、5-120 分鐘，未檢出任何切割），而五個變異體中有四個無法折疊。團隊於是重跑原始腳本，並公開診斷出六項具體缺陷。(i) 二級結構是用本地自行實作的 Kabsch-Sander 法指定、而非用 DSSP；與 mkdssp 4.2.2 相比一致度為 0.761，而且誤差完全是單向的——43 個 beta 股殘基被判為環，94 個被判為「環」的殘基中有 44 個其實是 beta 股，列舉出的 20 個環中有 15 個含有股，而 slack 最大的那個「環」61-72 其實是兩段 beta 股由一個轉角相連。(ii) 取代後的殘基其實從未真正被選擇過：在套完排除規則後候選池只剩六個殘基，而在這六個之中，依 BLOSUM62，Lys 換成 Gln 與 Arg 換成 Gln 都是唯一的最大值，因此「全部換成 Gln」是個必然的人為結果——而那些排除規則還是為胰凝乳蛋白酶與彈性蛋白酶寫死的，而這兩種蛋白酶根本沒出現在實驗裡。(iii) 一個晶體結構的 B-factor 欄被當成 pLDDT 讀取；若給它同一蛋白質的 X 光結構 6KYZ，腳本會無聲地回傳零個 A 級位點。(iv) 排序只用暴露度由高到低，而後來的驗證顯示，只用結構的預測器只達到 AUC 0.4466——與隨機無從區分——所以原本的程式是用那個行不通的軸來排序，同時把真正有用的那個軸（專一性）算出來又丟掉。(v) 有十三個門檻是手動設定的，而 K175 之所以進入設計，是因為它以 0.12 埃之差通過了 14.0 埃的截斷值。(vi) 各取代位點被當成彼此獨立來評分，但實際上並非如此。每一項缺陷都被修正了：只採用 DSSP 的輸出；以 22,992 筆 MEROPS 紀錄建出一個連續的專一性分數；風險 = 可切割度 x 影響度；記錄輸入結構的來源與 MD5，並在被替換時發出警示；加入一層處理合併取代的交互作用；以及凍結每一個數值的 1180 項迴歸測試檢查，而任何會移動門檻的量測都在執行前先「事先登錄」。在修正後的實作下對同樣的十個位點重新排序，結果的分散度擴大到 22 倍，並把 mut1 的 K82 與 R84 排到第一與第三——而 mut1 正是唯一折疊成功的變異體。驗證從 4 個系統擴大到 48 個系統與 9 種蛋白酶，在 47 個有正向位點的系統上得到平均 AUC 0.7186，95% 信賴區間 [0.642, 0.791]——並明確提出保留：單一系統的表現跨度為 [0.38, 1.00]，因此這個區間不可套用到單一標的。基準比較方面：對照 ExPASy PeptideCutter 的規則（這套規則在結構上就無法在自己的集合內排序，AUC 0.5），CleaveRank 達到 0.7225；對照已訓練的序列模型 ProsperousPlus，在 45 個系統上，就全部殘基而言為 0.9305 比 0.8957，在候選集內則為 0.7787 比 0.6873，靈敏度 45/45 比 36/45，配對差異 +0.0914 [+0.0043, +0.1855]，在 45 個系統中勝出 25 個——接著他們把這個優勢拆解開來，並報告它「無法歸因」：只用序列的特徵與對照模型打成平手（+0.0036），而結構因子與影響度權重單獨來看都未達顯著，因此「這項優勢有一部分建立在一個未經校準的權重上」。他們也排除了資料污染的可能，方法是把系統分層為可能、與不可能出現在 ProsperousPlus 訓練資料中的兩群，結果顯示在未見過的那一層差距還拉得更大。最後，他們檢驗了結構預測器是否能取代這項工作：給 AlphaFold3 人類胰蛋白酶加上 LIP2 與 Ca2+，從一個隨機種子取五個樣本，並以胰蛋白酶—BPTI 抑制劑複合物作為正對照。BPTI 得到 ipTM 0.95、最小鏈間 PAE 0.78 埃、P1 位 Lys15 的羰基距催化 Ser 僅 2.6 埃、14/14 個共享的介面殘基；LIP2 則得到 ipTM 0.14-0.15、PAE 15.3-15.8 埃，最近的羰基距離 5.4-7.0 埃且不位於任何切位上，85 個介面殘基中共享 0 個，鏈位移 23.8-29.3 埃——然而兩個單體本身都以 0.16-0.52 埃的 RMSD 被重現出來。他們的結論是一段關於方法極限的真正鋭利的推理：結構預測回傳的是「穩定」的複合物，而 PDB 裡滿是蛋白酶—抑制劑複合物、卻幾乎沒有以折疊好的球狀蛋白為受質的 Michaelis 複合物，因為後者在切割時就解離了；而「容易被切割」並不是一個穩定複合物的性質——「這種不對稱性就是這個結果的成因，而它不會因為把規模做大而消失」。","software":"CleaveRank, a command-line tool released under GPL-3.0-or-later. It takes a target's sequence and structure, the residues whose cleavage abolishes function, and the cleavage rules and complex structure of the protease you want resistance against; it ranks the sites that will actually be cleaved, proposes concrete mutations (substitution, loop shortening, proline introduction, disulfide or salt-bridge insertion), evaluates each one's effect on activity and the interactions between them, then builds and relaxes the chosen structure in PyRosetta and verifies it on three axes. The development discipline is the lesson: 1180 frozen regression checks where the current output is the expected value so any code change that moves a number fails at the point it moved, expected values updated only for an intended change with the change recorded first, documented 'conditions under which the tool may and may not be used' fixed as explicit statements, and threshold-moving measurements pre-registered. The timer model's rate-equation derivation and lag derivation are published as separate companion PDF notes.","software_zh":"CleaveRank 是一套命令列工具，以 GPL-3.0 或更新版本釋出。它接受標的的序列與結構、哪些殘基一旦被切斷就會喪失功能，以及你想要對抗的那種蛋白酶的切割規則與複合物結構；它會為真正會被切割的位點排序、提出具體的突變方案（取代、縮短環、引入脯胺酸、插入雙硫鍵或鹽橋），評估每一項對活性的影響以及彼此之間的交互作用，然後在 PyRosetta 中建構並鬆弛所選結構，並就三個軸加以驗證。真正的教訓在於它的開發紀律：1180 項凍結的迴歸檢查，以目前的輸出作為期望值，因此任何讓某個數字移動的程式修改，都會在它移動的那一點就報錯；期望值只有在刻意修改時才更新，而該修改必須先被記錄下來；「本工具在哪些條件下可以用、哪些條件下不可以用」被寫成明確的陳述固定下來；而會移動門檻的量測都要事先登錄。定時器模型的速率方程式推導與延遲推導，另以兩份配套的 PDF 筆記發表。","stack":["Python","SciPy solve_ivp (LSODA)","PyRosetta","mkdssp 4.2.2 (DSSP)","MEROPS database (22,992 records)","AlphaFold3 (tested as a comparator and rejected)","ExPASy PeptideCutter (benchmark)","ProsperousPlus (benchmark)","BLOSUM62","regression-test harness (1180 checks)"],"techniques":["competing-substrate Michaelis-Menten ODE system","quasi-equilibrium reduction of binding steps","conservation-law solving for free species","reaction-order analysis (zeroth-order routes to a tunable delay)","autocatalytic positive-feedback circuit design","analytical approximation and derivation of a lag expression","one-at-a-time parameter sweeps with lag / rise / sharpness metrics","local-exponent (log-log tangent) analysis instead of assumed power laws","diffusion-limited transport modelling (Damkohler number)","mean-first-passage-time reasoning","interior-optimum optimisation of a kinetic design variable","cross-system generalisation testing against literature and past iGEM projects","structural bioinformatics (DSSP, SASA, loop geometry)","continuous specificity scoring from a curated proteomics database","ranking-metric validation (AUC) with paired bootstrap confidence intervals","training-contamination stratification","ablation decomposition of a benchmark advantage","negative control design (BPTI) for a structure-prediction test","regression-test value freezing and pre-registration"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A dialogue-first mission — 'to communicate the fun of synthetic biology to a wide range of age groups through dialogue and hands-on experiences' — delivered at Kyoto University's November Festival, TEDxKyotoUniversity 2026 and CHILDREN'S PARK UNIVERSITY. Activities were hands-on with real research equipment: a broccoli DNA extraction booth with the buffer recipe published (38 g salt and 50 mL neutral detergent in 1 L tap water) so anyone can reproduce it, plus colour-change demonstrations. The stated method was to adjust the content and depth of explanation to each visitor's interest and level rather than deliver a fixed script.","publicEngagement_zh":"一項以對話為先的任務——「透過對話與動手體驗，把合成生物學的樂趣傳達給各個年齡層」——在京都大學的十一月祭、TEDxKyotoUniversity 2026 與 CHILDREN'S PARK UNIVERSITY 上實踐。活動都是用真正的研究器材動手做：一個青花菜 DNA 萃取攤位，並公開緩衝液配方（1 公升自來水加 38 g 食鹽與 50 mL 中性清潔劑），任何人都能重現，另有顏色變化的示範。他們聲明的做法是依每位參觀者的興趣與程度調整解說的內容與深度，而不是照著固定腳本講。","ihp":"Kyoto draw a line most teams blur: 'not all HP constitute Integrated Human Practices'. They ran 19 interactions (interviews, site visits, email exchanges), state that 16 of them led to a design decision, and keep two separate pages — an HP page documenting everything and an IHP page tracing only the interactions that changed the design, decision by decision. They are also candid that they abandoned their chosen food-related project theme more than once after researcher conversations exposed real-world implementation problems, before arriving at rice bran. Stakeholder interviews with industrial processors and smaller milling businesses established that rice bran is not simply waste — it already flows to oil extraction, feed, fertiliser and household uses — which reframed the project question as whether better preservation and quality assessment can make higher-value uses feasible inside existing collection routines, and surfaced the key commercial constraint that bran-specific capital investment is hard to justify when the material has low sale value.","ihp_zh":"Kyoto 劃出了一條多數隊伍含混帶過的界線：「並非所有 HP 都構成整合式人類實踐」。他們進行了 19 次互動（訪談、實地參訪、電子郵件往來），聲明其中 16 次導致了一項設計決策，並維持兩個分開的頁面——一個 HP 頁面記錄全部內容，一個 IHP 頁面只逐項追溯那些真正改變了設計的互動。他們也坦白表示，在研究者的對話揭露了現實落地問題之後，他們不只一次放棄了原先選定的食品相關主題，最後才走到米糠。與工業加工業者及較小型碾米業者的訪談確立了米糠並不只是廢棄物——它早已流向榨油、飼料、肥料與家庭用途——這把專題的問題重新框成：更好的保存與品質評估能否讓更高值的用途在既有的收集作業中變得可行；訪談也浮現出關鍵的商業限制：當材料本身售價很低時，很難正當化專為米糠投入的資本支出。","realWorld":"Rice bran is roughly 10% of brown rice by weight in Japan and contains about 20% oil plus dietary fibre, functional lipids and proteins, vitamins and minerals, but endogenous lipase starts hydrolysing triacylglycerides to free fatty acids as soon as milling disrupts the grain. Existing stabilisation is thermal (extrusion and heating), which costs energy and capital and affects bran components. The venture, OiLipase, has two parts: KANNAME, the enzymatic stabilisation system that localises protease activity at the oil-water interface to knock down lipase at ambient temperature, and NIINAME, a quality-assessment component. The team state plainly what remains undemonstrated in their own system: selective degradation of Lipase-II, preservation of other valuable proteins, and controlled termination of proteolysis. The computed dose is 115 mg/L, and the timer gives 91% preservation of water-soluble protein against 0% for free trypsin.","realWorld_zh":"在日本，米糠約占糙米重量的 10%，含約 20% 的油脂，另有膳食纖維、功能性脂質與蛋白質、維生素與礦物質，但只要碾製破壞了穀粒，內源的脂解酶就會開始把三酸甘油酯水解成游離脂肪酸。既有的穩定化方法是熱處理（擠壓與加熱），既耗能又耗資本支出，且會影響米糠成分。這個創業計畫 OiLipase 分成兩部分：KANNAME 是酵素穩定化系統，把蛋白酶活性限定在油水界面，以在常溫下把脂解酶打下來；NIINAME 則是品質評估的部分。團隊直白說明自家系統中仍未證實的事項：對 Lipase-II 的選擇性分解、其他有價值蛋白質的保留，以及蛋白酶解的受控終止。計算得出的劑量為 115 mg/L，而定時器使水溶性蛋白保留 91%，游離胰蛋白酶則為 0%。","partners":["Kyoto University","COSMO BIO","MIYAKO CAPITAL","Twist Bioscience","IDT","IDEA BANK"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6399/wiki/dry/fig3-timer-core.avif","caption":"Figure 3: the timer working. Without decoy, trypsin falls below 90% in under a minute; with 3.0 uM decoy a 27-minute lag appears. The lower panel shows active 3C held near zero through the whole lag then rising sharply as the decoy runs out — the autocatalysis made visible rather than asserted.","caption_zh":"圖 3：定時器運作的樣子。沒有誘餌時，胰蛋白酶在一分鐘內就掉到 90% 以下；加入 3.0 uM 誘餌後出現 27 分鐘的延遲。下方面板顯示有活性的 3C 在整段延遲期間都貼近零、待誘餌耗盡後才急遽上升——把自催化呈現出來，而不是用斷言帶過。","credit":"Team Kyoto, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6399/wiki/dry/fig4-sens-decoy-1.avif","caption":"Figure 4: the decoy sweep on log-log axes. Rather than claiming a single power law, the team report the local exponent of the tangent moving from 1.75 to 2.82, consistent with their derivation that an n-th order decoy consumption gives depletion time proportional to amount^(1-n) and that two independent routes to zeroth-order kinetics push the system toward quadratic.","caption_zh":"圖 4：誘餌掃描畫在雙對數軸上。團隊沒有宣稱存在單一冪次律，而是報告切線的局部指數從 1.75 移動到 2.82，這與他們的推導一致：n 階的誘餌消耗會使耗盡時間與量的 (1-n) 次方成正比，而兩條獨立通往零階動力學的路徑會把系統推向平方關係。","credit":"Team Kyoto, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6399/wiki/dry/fig5-sens-shape-2.avif","caption":"Figure 5: sweeps of the parameters that shape the waveform, with lag and rise time on the top row and sharpness (lag divided by rise time) below. kcat gets no panel because it only rescales the time axis and leaves sharpness exactly unchanged — the caption says so, which is how a sensitivity analysis should read.","caption_zh":"圖 5：掃過那些塑形波形的參數，上排是延遲與上升時間，下方是銳度（延遲除以上升時間）。kcat 沒有自己的面板，因為它只是把時間軸重新縮放、銳度完全不變——圖說把這點寫出來，而這正是一份敏感度分析該有的讀法。","credit":"Team Kyoto, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6399/wiki/dry/fig05-linkoping.svg","caption":"One of six figures testing whether the induction-diffusion generalisation applies to other systems. This one, for Linkoping 2019's reservoir-type design, is captioned 'there is nothing to optimise' — a negative result drawn with the same care as a positive one, which is how the team established that only one of six reference systems met both conditions for an interior optimum in dissociation rate.","caption_zh":"六張檢驗誘導—擴散一般化是否適用於其他系統的圖之一。這一張針對 Linkoping 2019 的儲庫型設計，圖說寫的是「沒有東西可以最佳化」——一個與正面結果畫得同樣仔細的負面結果，而這正是團隊得以確立六個參照系統中只有一個同時滿足解離速率存在內部最佳值兩項條件的方式。","credit":"Team Kyoto, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"When an experiment contradicts your model, treat the model's source code as the next object of study: Kyoto re-ran their own script, enumerated six specific defects (DSSP done in-house, B-factor read as pLDDT, ranking on the one axis that measured at chance AUC, thresholds cleared by 0.12 Angstrom), published every one, and then froze 1180 regression checks so no number can move unnoticed. Pre-registering any measurement that would move a threshold is a practice a school lab can adopt immediately and it is worth more than a bigger model.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"當實驗與你的模型相矛盾時，就把模型的原始碼當成下一個研究對象：Kyoto 重跑了自己的腳本，列舉出六項具體缺陷（DSSP 是自己實作的、把 B-factor 當成 pLDDT 讀、用那個實測 AUC 等同隨機的軸來排序、門檻只以 0.12 埃之差通過），把每一項都公開，然後凍結 1180 項迴歸檢查，讓任何數字都不可能無聲地變動。把任何會移動門檻的量測事先登錄，是一所學校實驗室馬上就能採用的做法，而且比做一個更大的模型更有價值。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/kyoto/","https://2026.igem.wiki/kyoto/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/kyoto/software/","https://2026.igem.wiki/kyoto/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/kyoto/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/kyoto/results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/kyoto/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/kyoto/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/kyoto/entrepreneurship/"],"awards_zh":["最佳元件集 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳模型 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳食品與營養專案 — 入圍"],"rank":21},"6401":{"team":"HKU-HongKong","id":"6401","section":"","country":"Hong Kong","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/","projectTitle":"Omni-Patch","projectTitle_zh":"Omni-Patch","tagline":"A cell-free single-layer sodium alginate dressing carrying a de novo TLR4/MD-2 antagonist peptide and FGF2 for hard-to-heal wounds","tagline_zh":"一款無細胞的單層海藻酸鈉敷料，載有 de novo 設計的 TLR4/MD-2 拮抗肽與 FGF2，用於難癒合傷口","summary":"Omni-Patch is a cell-free sodium alginate wound dressing loaded with aTi-14, a de novo designed peptide intended to block LPS binding to the MD-2/TLR4 complex, plus FGF2 as a repair-supporting growth factor. The team's first concept used a living chassis secreting a literature peptide (TAP2) under nitric-oxide control via NorR; recombinant TAP2 could not be recovered and the macrophage assay showed no reduction in inflammatory markers, so they pivoted to de novo design and a cell-free carrier. A nitric-oxide diffusion model then showed NO penetration depth was far shorter than the hydrogel thickness needed for exudate handling, which killed the NO-sensing component and reframed the device as open-loop. The wiki is unusually candid: aTi-14 left-shifted FITC-LPS binding at 25 uM in a one-concentration THP-1 M0 screen while five sibling variants did not, but matched qPCR showed no transcript drop, the Griess nitrite run was discarded for bacterial contamination, and no IC50 is claimed.","summary_zh":"Omni-Patch 是一款無細胞的海藻酸鈉傷口敷料，載有 aTi-14——一個 de novo 設計的肽，目的是阻斷 LPS 與 MD-2/TLR4 複合體的結合——再加上 FGF2 作為支持修復的生長因子。該隊最初的構想是用活體載體，在 NorR 的一氧化氮調控下分泌一個文獻中的肽（TAP2）；但重組 TAP2 無法回收，巨噬細胞試驗也顯示發炎指標沒有下降，於是他們轉向 de novo 設計與無細胞載體。接著一個一氧化氮擴散模型顯示 NO 的穿透深度遠小於處理滲液所需的水膠厚度，這直接殺掉了 NO 感測元件，並把裝置重新定位為開迴路。這個 wiki 坦率得不尋常：在單一濃度的 THP-1 M0 篩選中，aTi-14 在 25 uM 下使 FITC-LPS 的結合左移，而五個同批變體則沒有，但配對的 qPCR 並未顯示轉錄本下降，Griess 亞硝酸鹽那一輪因細菌污染而作廢，他們也沒有宣稱任何 IC50。","awards":["Best New Composite Part — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Therapeutics Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Four chained mechanistic modules plus a design-space inversion. Module 1 models payload release from the alginate matrix and transport from gel surface into wound tissue, recalibrated against the measured FGF2-G3 BCA release fraction after the wet lab released less than predicted. Module 2 models competition between aTi-14 and LPS for the MD-2 pocket, using the measured relative reduction in LPS binding at 25 uM as a dissociation-constant proxy to output receptor-occupancy fraction. Module 3 propagates occupancy to downstream NF-kB signalling output (nuclear p65, NO, accumulated nitrite). Module 4 is a Fisher-KPP reaction-diffusion wound-closure model in which the FGF2-G3 arm drives fibroblast proliferation and inflammation suppresses growth through the aTi-14 arm, with a front-speed criterion drawing the heal/no-heal boundary and predicted closure time as the patient-facing output. A separate NO-sensing model (NorR regulator circuit, penetration-depth heatmap, NO-vs-NorR threshold) was built before the planned experiment and its negative result removed the sensing component from the wet-lab design.","frameworks_zh":"四個串接的機制模組，再加上一次設計空間反演。模組 1 模擬酬載從海藻酸鈉基質釋放、並從膠體表面輸送進入傷口組織，在濕實驗釋放量低於預測之後，依實測的 FGF2-G3 BCA 釋放比例重新校準。模組 2 模擬 aTi-14 與 LPS 競爭 MD-2 口袋，以 25 uM 下實測的 LPS 結合相對下降量作為解離常數的替代指標，輸出受體佔據率。模組 3 把佔據率傳遞到下游 NF-kB 訊號輸出（核內 p65、NO、累積的亞硝酸鹽）。模組 4 是一個 Fisher-KPP 反應—擴散的傷口閉合模型，其中 FGF2-G3 這條臂驅動纖維母細胞增生，而發炎則透過 aTi-14 這條臂抑制生長，並以波前速度判準畫出癒合／不癒合的界線，以預測的閉合時間作為面向病人的輸出。另有一個獨立的 NO 感測模型（NorR 調控迴路、穿透深度熱圖、NO 對 NorR 的閾值），在原定實驗之前就先建好，而它的負面結果把感測元件從濕實驗設計中移除。","dataviz":"Figure set is systematically numbered per module (m1-m4, ds-, sa-, no-, ps- prefixes) and served through a custom DryLabFigure/FigureLightbox React component with figure number, caption and note. Includes solver-convergence plots, release curves overlaid on BCA data, kymographs of aTi-14 and FGF2 concentration through gel depth and time, MD-2 occupancy curves, endotoxin-load shift plots, p65-vs-occupancy curves, closure-time curves, a front-speed verification plot, a Sobol dose-vs-closure sensitivity figure, an NO penetration-depth heatmap, and a design map from the inverse run.","dataviz_zh":"圖組依模組系統性編號（m1-m4，並以 ds-、sa-、no-、ps- 為前綴），透過自製的 DryLabFigure/FigureLightbox React 元件呈現，附圖號、圖說與註記。內容包括求解器收斂圖、疊在 BCA 資料上的釋放曲線、aTi-14 與 FGF2 濃度隨膠體深度與時間變化的 kymograph（時空圖）、MD-2 佔據率曲線、內毒素負荷位移圖、p65 對佔據率的曲線、閉合時間曲線、波前速度驗證圖、一張 Sobol 劑量對閉合時間的敏感度圖、一張 NO 穿透深度熱圖，以及反演運算得出的設計圖。","datascience":"Global sensitivity analysis (Sobol) across the chained modules, confirming the dominant uncertainties (endotoxin load, receptor affinity, mobile fraction) propagate into the design criteria without amplification, so conclusions are robust to constants that could not be directly validated. Solver-convergence verification for each module before use. After verification the whole chain was run in reverse as a design-space inversion, deriving the loading and thickness criteria the patch must satisfy to reach a target closure time, with a time-above-target/dosing-interval figure and a design map. A bespoke 'mathematical filter' scores candidates on three sub-modules (binding suitability, structural burden, proteolytic stability); applied retrospectively it flagged structural liabilities in the failed TAP2 peptide that the earlier affinity-only score had missed, and cleared aTi-14.","datascience_zh":"跨串接模組的全域敏感度分析（Sobol），確認主導的不確定來源（內毒素負荷、受體親和力、可移動比例）會傳遞到設計判準但不被放大，因此結論對無法直接驗證的常數具有穩健性。每個模組在使用前都做了求解器收斂驗證。驗證完成後，整條鏈被反向執行為一次設計空間反演，推導出貼片為達到目標閉合時間所必須滿足的載藥量與厚度判準，並附一張「高於目標的時間／給藥間隔」圖與一張設計圖。另有一個自訂的「數學濾網」，以三個子模組為候選評分（結合適配性、結構負擔、蛋白酶解穩定性）；回溯套用時，它在失敗的 TAP2 肽上標出了先前只看親和力的評分所漏掉的結構弱點，而 aTi-14 則通過。","software":"RFD3-binder-studio: a locally deployable, open-source ten-stage de novo binder design and triage pipeline behind one command line, published at github.com/igemhku/rfd3-binder-studio and gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/hku-hongkong/rfd3-binder-studio. Stage 1 generates binder backbones against the MD-2 target structure and its hotspot residues with RFdiffusion3; stage 2 writes sequences with LigandMPNN/ProteinMPNN across a temperature/noise grid; stage 3 re-folds and validates with RoseTTAFold3 against pLDDT, PAE and backbone RMSD gates; stage 4 co-folds target and binder de novo with Boltz-2 for ipTM, interface pLDDT, PAE and affinity; stage 5 reads interface biophysics with PRODIGY (binding free energy, hydrogen bonds, salt bridges, buried surface area); stage 6 screens immunogenicity with MHCflurry, MHCnuggets and IEDB; stage 7 scans off-targets by MMseqs2 homology search of the target then co-folds candidates against anti-target receptor PDBs with the same Boltz-2 engine for like-for-like comparison; stage 8 applies hard pass/fail gates then a block-weighted composite rank; stage 9 runs in silico directed evolution whose children re-enter at stage 4 so every generation is re-folded, re-scored and re-gated on identical terms, with full lineage in a database; stage 10 writes ranked_candidates.csv and report.md. All parameters live in editable YAML. Ships a --dry-run mode with fabricated metrics that validates the full pipeline on any laptop, a doctor command that reports what the current machine can run, --resume, and an init-example campaign. Stages 1-4 and 7 need CUDA GPU; 5, 6, 8, 9 run on CPU. The team explicitly states the scoring weights are reasoned priors, not measured calibration, so output is a triage order and not an affinity.","software_zh":"RFD3-binder-studio：一條可在本機部署、開源、以單一指令列驅動的十階段 de novo 結合蛋白設計與分流流程，發佈於 github.com/igemhku/rfd3-binder-studio 與 gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/hku-hongkong/rfd3-binder-studio。階段 1 以 RFdiffusion3 針對 MD-2 標靶結構及其熱點殘基生成結合蛋白骨架；階段 2 以 LigandMPNN/ProteinMPNN 在溫度／雜訊網格上寫出序列；階段 3 以 RoseTTAFold3 重新折疊，並以 pLDDT、PAE 與骨架 RMSD 關卡驗證；階段 4 以 Boltz-2 對標靶與結合蛋白做 de novo 共折疊，取得 ipTM、介面 pLDDT、PAE 與親和力；階段 5 以 PRODIGY 判讀介面生物物理性質（結合自由能、氫鍵、鹽橋、埋藏表面積）；階段 6 以 MHCflurry、MHCnuggets 與 IEDB 篩選免疫原性；階段 7 先以 MMseqs2 對標靶做同源性搜尋掃描脫靶，再用同一套 Boltz-2 引擎把候選與反標靶受體的 PDB 共折疊，以確保同等條件比較；階段 8 先套用硬性的通過／不通過關卡，再做區塊加權的綜合排名；階段 9 執行 in silico 定向演化，其子代回到階段 4 重新進入，因此每一代都在完全相同的條件下重新折疊、重新評分、重新過關，完整譜系存於資料庫；階段 10 輸出 ranked_candidates.csv 與 report.md。所有參數都放在可編輯的 YAML 中。它附一個 --dry-run 模式，以虛構的指標在任何筆電上驗證整條流程，另有一個 doctor 指令回報當前機器能跑哪些階段、一個 --resume，以及一個 init-example 範例戰役。階段 1-4 與 7 需要 CUDA GPU；階段 5、6、8、9 可在 CPU 上執行。該隊明確說明評分權重是有理據的先驗，不是經量測校準的結果，所以輸出是分流順序，不是親和力。","stack":["RFdiffusion3 (RFD3)","ProteinMPNN / LigandMPNN","RoseTTAFold3 (RF3)","Boltz-2","PRODIGY","MHCflurry 2.0","MHCnuggets","IEDB","MMseqs2","YAML-driven config","Python CLI","GitLab / GitHub"],"techniques":["De novo binder backbone generation against hotspot residues","Independent refold validation (pLDDT / PAE / RMSD gating)","De novo co-folding for ipTM and interface confidence","Binding free energy estimation","MHC class I/II immunogenicity screening","Homology-based off-target panel construction and like-for-like co-folding","Hard gating then block-weighted composite ranking","In silico directed evolution with revalidation re-entry","Reaction-diffusion (Fisher-KPP) front-speed modelling","Receptor competitive-binding / occupancy modelling","Release and tissue-transport kinetics with wet-lab recalibration","Sobol global sensitivity analysis","Inverse design / design-space inversion","Solver convergence verification"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A structured SynBio Workshop Series rather than one-off events, each with matched pre/post Likert surveys and reported means. 'Running with DNA' at South Tuen Mun Government Secondary School (28 September 2026) gave 13 Form 4-5 students a full agarose gel electrophoresis and DNA fingerprinting run in their own school lab, co-led by STMGSS alumni on the iGEM team; the pre-survey established the access gap (13/13 reported few opportunities to run gels, 10/13 for micropipettes) and the post-survey returned an aggregated mean of 4.46/5.00 across 16 items with 92.3% reporting better understanding of synthetic biology. A separate lower-secondary workshop (18 S1-S2 respondents) scored 4.67/5.00 on micropipetting and 4.39/5.00 on hands-on learning being more effective than lectures. A case-based DBTL Healthcare Challenge for secondary biology students built around a fictional 62-year-old diabetic patient moved understanding of engineered bacteria from 3.06 to 4.13/5.00 and of the DBTL cycle from 3.44 to 4.19 across 16 matched responses. The HKU-iBRIDGE SynBio Bootcamp (3-4 October 2026, HKU Medical Campus) brought 40+ S3-S5 students from across Hong Kong through two dry-lab sessions. The team leader also appeared as an expert guest on Episode 121 of the Disconnected podcast, distributed on web, Spotify, Apple Podcasts, Amazon Music and YouTube, discussing AlphaFold, generative diffusion models, human-in-the-loop governance and the stigma researchers face. An Omni-Patch Arcade of four browser games with a built-in feedback portal and dual difficulty tiers extends engagement past the physical workshops.","publicEngagement_zh":"一個結構化的 SynBio 工作坊系列，而不是一次性活動，每一場都配有前後測的李克特量表問卷並報告平均值。2026 年 9 月 28 日在屯門南官立中學辦的「Running with DNA」，讓 13 位中四至中五學生在自己學校的實驗室完整做一次洋菜膠電泳與 DNA 指紋分析，並由 iGEM 隊中該校校友共同帶領；前測確立了機會落差（13 位全部表示很少有機會跑膠，13 位中有 10 位很少有機會用微量吸管），後測在 16 個題項上取得 4.46/5.00 的總平均，92.3% 表示對合成生物學的理解提升。另一場針對初中的工作坊（18 位中一至中二受訪者）在微量吸管操作上得 4.67/5.00，在「動手學習比講授更有效」上得 4.39/5.00。一個以案例為基礎、圍繞一位虛構 62 歲糖尿病病人設計的 DBTL 醫療挑戰，讓 16 份配對回覆中對工程化細菌的理解從 3.06 升到 4.13/5.00、對 DBTL 循環的理解從 3.44 升到 4.19。HKU-iBRIDGE SynBio Bootcamp（2026 年 10 月 3-4 日，香港大學醫學院校區）帶領來自全香港 40 多位中三至中五學生完成兩場乾實驗課程。隊長也以專家嘉賓身分出現在 Disconnected podcast 第 121 集，發布於網頁、Spotify、Apple Podcasts、Amazon Music 與 YouTube，討論 AlphaFold、生成式擴散模型、人在迴路的治理，以及研究者所面對的汙名。另有一個 Omni-Patch Arcade，收錄四款瀏覽器遊戲，內建回饋入口與雙難度分級，把互動延伸到實體工作坊之外。","ihp":"Five stakeholder tiers defined up front with a stated reason for approaching each: lived experience (patients, home caregivers, bedside nurses), clinical and technical specialists, health-system and regulatory actors, public and educational actors, then a final synthesis tier that is explicitly not new conversations but a thematic analysis across all of them, mapping agreement, disagreement and tension. Each interview is written to a fixed four-part template (background and why approached, problems and gaps identified, takeaways and advice, closed-loop action plan). The closed loops are concrete and often restrictive rather than flattering. Prof. Chen (Institute of Antibiotics, Huashan Hospital, Fudan University) established that bacterial colonisation is not infection and that LPS or inflammatory signal alone cannot justify antibiotics, which rewrote both the scientific hypothesis (partial modulation of excessive bacteria-associated inflammation, with host-defence and bacterial-clearance evidence required alongside cytokine readouts) and the education materials (emphasise regular foot observation and prompt professional assessment, never self-diagnosis). A burn-surgery director at Beijing Jishuitan Hospital established that diabetic foot ulcer healing is multifactorial and forced the team to test one peptide and one defined mechanism before proposing combinations, and to drop the M1/M2 framing and NO trigger pending evidence. A plastic surgery consultant pointed out hydrogels absorb exudate poorly relative to foam and negative-pressure wound therapy and that high exudate flow could wash out a topically released peptide, suggesting integration with NPWT or application to sterile surgical dressings instead.","ihp_zh":"一開始就定義五層利害關係人，並說明為何接觸每一層：親身經驗者（病人、居家照顧者、床邊護理人員）、臨床與技術專家、衛生體系與法規行動者、公眾與教育行動者，最後是一層綜整層——這一層明確不是新的訪談，而是跨所有訪談的主題分析，盤點共識、分歧與張力。每場訪談都依固定的四段模板撰寫（背景與接觸原因、指出的問題與落差、心得與建議、閉環行動計畫）。這些閉環很具體，而且多半是限制性的而非讚美式的。陳教授（復旦大學華山醫院抗生素研究所）確立了細菌移生不等於感染，而單憑 LPS 或發炎訊號不足以正當化使用抗生素，這同時改寫了科學假說（改為部分調節過度的細菌相關發炎，且除細胞激素讀值外還需宿主防禦與細菌清除的證據）與教育素材（強調定期檢查足部並及早接受專業評估，絕不自我診斷）。北京積水潭醫院一位燒傷科主任確立糖尿病足潰瘍的癒合是多因素的，並要求該隊在提出組合療法之前先測試單一一個肽與單一一個明確機制，也要求在取得證據之前先放下 M1/M2 架構與 NO 觸發機制。一位整形外科顧問醫師指出，相對於泡棉與負壓傷口治療（NPWT），水膠吸收滲液的能力不佳，而高滲液流量可能把局部釋放的肽沖走，並建議改為與 NPWT 整合，或改用於無菌手術敷料。","realWorld":"The project is consistently positioned as a preclinical adjunct to standard care, not a replacement for debridement, offloading, infection treatment, vascular assessment or clinical judgement, and the wiki repeats that boundary on description, measurement and IHP pages. Health-system and regulatory stakeholders (clinicians managing wound-care workflows, MedTech entrepreneurs, trade and regulatory specialists familiar with Hong Kong and Greater Bay Area pathways) shaped the value proposition, target indication and translation route. The epidemiological framing is specific to Hong Kong, built on Census and Statistics Department population projections to 2046 for residents aged 65+, and cites pooled chronic-wound prevalence and diabetic foot ulcer lifetime risk from systematic reviews rather than asserted numbers. Both educational games are open-source single-file HTML that run offline in any browser, work on mobile, are fully bilingual English/Chinese, need no account or install, and carry a public live visit counter so uptake is externally verifiable.","realWorld_zh":"該專案一貫定位為標準照護之外的臨床前輔助，而不是取代清創、減壓、感染治療、血管評估或臨床判斷，而 wiki 在專案說明、量測與 IHP 各頁都重複這道界線。衛生體系與法規端的利害關係人（管理傷口照護流程的臨床醫師、醫療科技創業者、熟悉香港與大灣區路徑的貿易與法規專家）形塑了價值主張、目標適應症與落地路徑。流行病學的框定專屬香港，建立在政府統計處對 65 歲以上居民至 2046 年的人口推估之上，並引用系統性回顧中彙整的慢性傷口盛行率與糖尿病足潰瘍終身風險，而不是自行斷言數字。兩款教育遊戲都是開源的單一檔案 HTML，可在任何瀏覽器離線執行，支援手機，完整中英雙語，不需帳號或安裝，並附一個公開的即時造訪計數器，使使用情況可被外部驗證。","partners":["South Tuen Mun Government Secondary School (STMGSS)","Pui Ching Middle School","HKU-iBRIDGE","Asia-Pacific iGEM Conference (APIC)","Institute of Antibiotics, Huashan Hospital, Fudan University","Beijing Jishuitan Hospital / Capital Medical University Burn and Wound Repair","Disconnected podcast"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6401/wiki/modeling/updated/m4-fig2-closure-curves-and-time.avif","caption":"Module 4 Fisher-KPP wound-closure model: predicted closure curves and closure time, the patient-facing output of the chained model stack.","caption_zh":"模組 4 的 Fisher-KPP 傷口閉合模型：預測的閉合曲線與閉合時間，這是整條串接模型堆疊面向病人的輸出。","credit":"Team HKU-HongKong, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6401/wiki/modeling/updated/no-fig4-penetration-depth-heatmap.avif","caption":"Nitric-oxide penetration-depth heatmap. Simulated NO depth fell short of the hydrogel thickness needed for exudate handling, so the NO-sensing module was cut from the wet-lab design before the experiment was run.","caption_zh":"一氧化氮穿透深度熱圖。模擬的 NO 深度不足以達到處理滲液所需的水膠厚度，因此 NO 感測模組在實驗進行之前就被從濕實驗設計中刪掉。","credit":"Team HKU-HongKong, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6401/wiki/modeling/updated/ds-fig3-design-map.avif","caption":"Design map from the inverse run: with all modules verified, the chain was reversed to derive the loading and thickness criteria the patch must satisfy to reach a target closure time.","caption_zh":"反演運算得出的設計圖：在所有模組都驗證完成後，整條鏈被反向執行，推導出貼片為達到目標閉合時間所必須滿足的載藥量與厚度判準。","credit":"Team HKU-HongKong, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6401/wiki/education/edu-bootcamp-graph-knowledge-pre-post.avif","caption":"Pre/post knowledge gain across ten technical topics at the HKU-iBRIDGE SynBio Bootcamp, where baseline scores were weakest exactly in computational tools and mathematical modelling (both 1.52/5).","caption_zh":"HKU-iBRIDGE SynBio Bootcamp 中十個技術主題的前後測知識增益，而基線分數最低的恰恰是計算工具與數學建模（皆為 1.52/5）。","credit":"Team HKU-HongKong, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Build the dry lab's own workflow into a teachable artefact: HKU turned their real de novo campaign into two free single-file browser games that make students apply the team's actual gates (pLDDT >= 70, ipTM >= 0.80, MMseqs2 off-target screens, MHCflurry immunogenicity) to the team's actual ten candidates, and deliberately let students run the wrong decay model first so the correct rule is discovered as a fix rather than announced as a formula. Pair this with their discipline of publishing the modelling result that killed a design feature (the NO penetration-depth run) as a headline finding, which is the cheapest way for students with no GPU budget to show real engineering judgement.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把乾實驗自己的工作流程做成可教學的產出：HKU 把他們真實的 de novo 設計戰役變成兩款免費、單一檔案的瀏覽器遊戲，讓學生把該隊真實的關卡（pLDDT >= 70、ipTM >= 0.80、MMseqs2 脫靶篩選、MHCflurry 免疫原性）套用在該隊真實的十個候選上，並刻意讓學生先跑錯的衰減模型，於是正確的規則是以「修正」的方式被發現，而不是以公式的方式被宣告。再搭配他們另一項紀律：把殺掉某個設計特徵的建模結果（NO 穿透深度那一輪）當成重點發現公開——對沒有 GPU 預算的學生來說，這是展現真正工程判斷最便宜的方式。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/software/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/measurement/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/contribution/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/parts/","https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/safety-and-security/","https://github.com/igemhku/rfd3-binder-studio"],"awards_zh":["最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳治療專案 — 入圍"],"rank":21},"6405":{"team":"CalPolySLO","id":"6405","section":"Undergrad","country":"United States","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/calpolyslo/","projectTitle":"Accessible Science: Expanding the Synthetic Cell Toolkit for All","projectTitle_zh":"可及的科學：為所有人擴展合成細胞工具組","tagline":"A cheap polyphosphate-powered energy module, a reproducible synthetic-cell fabrication device, and the calibrated ATP assay that makes both measurable.","tagline_zh":"一個便宜的多磷酸鹽供能模組、一台能可重現製作合成細胞的裝置，以及讓兩者都能被量測的經校正 ATP 分析法。","summary":"Cal Poly SLO built a cell-free and synthetic-cell platform aimed at putting synthetic cells into undergraduate hands. The science problem is that PURE-type cell-free reactions run out of energy and that commercial creatine-phosphate regeneration is one of the most expensive parts of the kit, so the team screened a library of polyphosphate kinase 2 (PPK2) enzymes, filtered from roughly 18,000 sequences down to 16 phylogenetically diverse candidates, that regenerate ATP from cheap inorganic polyphosphate. To compare those enzymes they had to build the measurement first: a scalable, interference-corrected luciferase ATP assay with matched standard curves, published protocols, OpenTrons scripts and Excel templates. They also designed a 3D-printed emulsification 'washboard' and a tip-wipe recovery step to make hand-made vesicles reproducible, and wrote the whole thing into CHEM 471, a new undergraduate synthetic-cell lab course.","summary_zh":"Cal Poly SLO 做了一套無細胞與合成細胞平台，目標是把合成細胞交到大學生手上。科學問題在於 PURE 類型的無細胞反應會耗盡能量，而商用的磷酸肌酸再生系統又是整組套件中最貴的部分之一，因此團隊篩選了一組多磷酸鹽激酶 2（PPK2）酵素庫，從大約 18,000 條序列過濾到 16 個在親緣關係上具多樣性的候選，這些酵素能以便宜的無機多磷酸鹽再生 ATP。為了比較這些酵素，他們得先把量測方法做出來：一套可擴充、已校正干擾的螢光素酶 ATP 分析法，具備條件相符的標準曲線、公開的實驗流程、OpenTrons 腳本與 Excel 範本。他們也設計了一個 3D 列印的乳化「洗衣板」以及一道擦拭吸頭的回收步驟，讓手工製作的囊泡變得可重現，並把整套內容寫進 CHEM 471，一門全新的大學部合成細胞實驗課。","awards":["Best Alternative Platform — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Measurement — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Education — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Foundational Advance Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Design-Build-Test-Learn applied separately to the assay, to the 3D-printed emulsification device (v0 to v8) and to the course materials; an explicit 'problem -> approach -> solution -> outcome' framing on every major page; measurement treated as a prerequisite for enzyme screening rather than a reporting step; Human Practices feedback logged as 'feedback -> action' pairs that changed protocols.","frameworks_zh":"Design-Build-Test-Learn 分別套用在分析方法、3D 列印乳化裝置（v0 到 v8）與課程教材上；每個主要頁面都有明確的問題、方法、解法、結果四段架構；量測被視為酵素篩選的前提條件，而不是最後的呈報步驟；人類實踐的回饋則以回饋對行動的配對記錄，而這些行動確實改動了實驗流程。","dataviz":"Interactive charts embedded in the wiki (per-condition time courses, Michaelis-Menten fits, reproducibility datasets) with selectable conditions; side-by-side uncorrected vs corrected Michaelis-Menten fits; log-scaled ATP standard curves; per-cell log10 GFP scatter plots across 24 timepoints with per-timepoint median lines and a dashed per-plate subpopulation threshold; a two-clock explainer diagram teaching readers how to read the quench-validation figures; SolidWorks drawings of every finalized 3D-printed part.","dataviz_zh":"wiki 中嵌入互動圖表（各條件的時間曲線、Michaelis-Menten 擬合、重現性資料集）並可自行選擇條件；未校正與已校正的 Michaelis-Menten 擬合並排對照；對數座標的 ATP 標準曲線；跨 24 個時間點的單細胞 log10 GFP 散布圖，附每個時間點的中位數線與每片盤各自的次族群虛線門檻；一張「兩個時鐘」的解說圖，教讀者如何讀終止反應驗證的圖表；以及每一個定稿 3D 列印零件的 SolidWorks 圖。","datascience":"The core contribution is an ATP assay that was validated before it was trusted. Three quench methods were compared head to head (cold dilution, 95 C heat stop, EDTA chelation) by sampling a DrPPK2 reaction at fixed reaction times and then varying the hold time before adding CellTiter-Glo; a flat line means the reaction stopped, a rising line means it did not. EDTA was chosen because it scales to 16 enzymes in pre-poured plates, and the concentration was then tuned from 10 mM to 5 mM when enzyme load dropped from 50 to 7.5 ng/uL. The team then defined the assay's reliable ATP range by testing whether they could extend Promega's 10 nM to 1 uM window in either direction, found they could not (0.061 nM ATP still read above 10,000 RLU; the 100 uM standard deviated from linearity), and committed to reading only inside that range and never extrapolating, discarding data that fell outside. Because EDTA, AMP and ADP all suppress luciferase, every sample is compared against ATP standards prepared at the same pre-reagent EDTA concentration and the same substrate concentration, and the ratio of slopes gives per-condition correction factors (tabulated for all eight AMP and ADP levels at both 1:25 and 1:50 dilutions, e.g. AMP CF 0.0822 at 2 mM and 0.6113 at 0.0156 mM) that are hard-coded into the published Excel templates. Correcting recovers the kinetic trend that inhibition had destroyed: the same DrPPK2 AMP dataset moves from Km 0.020 mM / Vmax 5.66 uM/min uncorrected to Km 0.139 mM / Vmax 23.2 uM/min corrected, and the 2 mM AMP point is openly excluded from the fit because the correction does not fully recover it. Benchmark kinetics are reported with R2 (DrPPK2 ADP Km 0.985 mM, Vmax 11.7 uM/min, R2 0.9894; ManPPK2 ADP Km 2.67 mM, Vmax 42.6 uM/min, R2 0.9993; FtPPK2 ADP Km 3.16 mM, Vmax 80.05 uM/min, R2 0.9963). Reproducibility was tested as an experiment in its own right: three team members ran the same full-range assay on the same enzyme aliquot on the same day, giving Km 0.0775 +/- 0.0145 mM and Vmax 8.62 +/- 1.39 uM/min, and the team states plainly that these do not match the earlier full-range values and lists the candidate causes (different purification batch, new polyP lot, new AMP lot) as unresolved. Microscopy is handled by a named pipeline, CellScope, which runs Cellpose segmentation at 1.332 um/pixel after 4x downsampling, exports one row per object per timepoint to parquet (over a million objects on one plate), applies a QC gate on diameter 5 to 60 um, circularity 0.80 to 1.25 and no saturated pixels, reports each well as fold over its own background, and runs a two-mode (delta-BIC) test for subpopulations; a dedicated figure documents a case where the segmentation silently failed on a visibly good well, which the team published rather than hid. Every bulk plate carries a 0.125 uM fluorescein well as a dye reference, and the wiki maintains an explicit glossary distinguishing RFU (plate reader) from AU (microscope) as non-comparable units.","datascience_zh":"核心貢獻是一套先驗證、才信任的 ATP 分析法。三種終止反應的方法被正面比較（低溫稀釋、95 C 加熱終止、EDTA 螯合）：在固定反應時間取 DrPPK2 反應的樣本，再改變加入 CellTiter-Glo 之前的靜置時間；曲線平坦代表反應真的停了，上升則代表沒停。最後選擇 EDTA，因為它可以在預先分盤的情況下擴充到 16 種酵素；當酵素用量從 50 ng/uL 降到 7.5 ng/uL 時，濃度也從 10 mM 調到 5 mM。接著團隊界定這套分析法可靠的 ATP 範圍：測試能否把 Promega 給的 10 nM 到 1 uM 視窗往任一方向延伸，結果發現不行（0.061 nM 的 ATP 讀值仍高於 10,000 RLU；100 uM 的標準品則偏離線性），於是決定只讀這個範圍內的值、絕不外推，落在範圍外的資料一律丟棄。由於 EDTA、AMP 與 ADP 都會抑制螢光素酶，每個樣本都要對照在相同的試劑前 EDTA 濃度與相同基質濃度下配製的 ATP 標準品，兩者斜率的比值就給出各條件的校正因子（1:25 與 1:50 兩種稀釋倍率下、八個 AMP 與 ADP 濃度全都列表，例如 AMP 在 2 mM 時校正因子為 0.0822、在 0.0156 mM 時為 0.6113），這些因子直接寫進公開的 Excel 範本裡。校正之後，被抑制效應破壞掉的動力學趨勢又回來了：同一份 DrPPK2 的 AMP 資料，未校正時為 Km 0.020 mM、Vmax 5.66 uM/min，校正後變成 Km 0.139 mM、Vmax 23.2 uM/min；而 2 mM AMP 這一點則公開排除在擬合之外，因為校正並沒有完全把它救回來。基準動力學參數都附上 R2（DrPPK2 對 ADP 的 Km 0.985 mM、Vmax 11.7 uM/min、R2 0.9894；ManPPK2 對 ADP 的 Km 2.67 mM、Vmax 42.6 uM/min、R2 0.9993；FtPPK2 對 ADP 的 Km 3.16 mM、Vmax 80.05 uM/min、R2 0.9963）。重現性本身被當成一個獨立的實驗來測：三位隊員在同一天、用同一管酵素分裝，跑同一套全範圍分析，得到 Km 0.0775 ± 0.0145 mM 與 Vmax 8.62 ± 1.39 uM/min；團隊直言這些數值與先前的全範圍結果並不一致，並列出可能原因（不同批次的純化、新批號的 polyP、新批號的 AMP），標註為尚未釐清。顯微影像交由一條有名字的流程 CellScope 處理：先做 4 倍降採樣，再以 1.332 um/pixel 執行 Cellpose 分割，把每個物件在每個時間點各自輸出一列到 parquet（單一盤超過一百萬個物件），套用品管門檻（直徑 5 到 60 um、圓形度 0.80 到 1.25、不得有飽和像素），每個孔都以相對於自身背景的倍數回報，並以雙峰（delta-BIC）檢定判斷是否存在次族群；另有一張專門的圖記錄了一個案例：在一個肉眼看起來很好的孔上，分割默默失敗了，而團隊選擇公開而不是藏起來。每一片批量盤都放一個 0.125 uM 螢光素孔作為染劑參照，wiki 也維護一份明確的術語表，把 RFU（盤式讀取儀）與 AU（顯微鏡）區分為不可互相比較的單位。","software":"OpenTrons OT-2 Python protocols for dilution-plate creation and dilution execution (full-range and confirmatory, four enzymes), published as .py downloads; Excel analysis templates for the full-range AMP, full-range ADP and confirmatory assays with correction factors built in; a master-mix calculator, titration design workbooks, plate-map template and osmolarity worksheet; the CellScope image-analysis pipeline (Cellpose segmentation, OzaLabCP/Imageanalysis) with a published vesicle_pipeline.txt; STL files for the washboard insert and rubber-band sled; raw time-course data and raw image data/masks released. All downloads are collected on https://2026.igem.wiki/calpolyslo/downloads and the lab manuals are released under CC BY 4.0.","software_zh":"OpenTrons OT-2 的 Python 流程，用於建立稀釋盤與執行稀釋（全範圍與確認性版本，四種酵素），以 .py 檔案公開下載；全範圍 AMP、全範圍 ADP 與確認性分析的 Excel 分析範本，校正因子已內建；母液計算器、滴定設計工作表、盤面配置範本與滲透壓工作表；CellScope 影像分析流程（Cellpose 分割、OzaLabCP／Imageanalysis）並附公開的 vesicle_pipeline.txt；洗衣板插件與橡皮筋滑座的 STL 檔；原始時間序列資料與原始影像資料及遮罩也一併釋出。所有下載都集中在 https://2026.igem.wiki/calpolyslo/downloads，實驗手冊則以 CC BY 4.0 授權釋出。","stack":["Promega CellTiter-Glo 2.0 luciferase ATP assay","Promega GloMax luminometer","BioTek Cytation5 plate reader","Cephla Squid automated fluorescence microscope","OpenTrons OT-2 liquid handler","Cellpose / CellScope segmentation pipeline","Python","Parquet","Excel analysis templates","SolidWorks","FDM 3D printing"],"techniques":["Matched-condition standard curves","Interference correction factors","Quench-method validation","Defined linear measurement range (no extrapolation)","Michaelis-Menten fitting with R2","Inter-operator reproducibility testing","Fluorescein dye reference wells","Image segmentation with explicit QC gates","Bimodality testing (delta BIC)","Osmolarity control","DBTL hardware iteration"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"The team designed CHEM 471: Engineering Synthetic Cells, described as the first known undergraduate synthetic-cell course in the US, wrote and tested ten open-licence (CC BY 4.0) lab manuals plus an instructor packet with prep lists, reagent costs, timing and common failure points, taught it to ten students in spring 2026, and surveyed them before and after. Confidence rose in 9 of 12 skills; the three that did not became design inputs. Students rated fluorescence microscopy lower at the end than at the start, so the microscope protocols were rewritten and re-tested by the team's least experienced members; manual cytosol-recipe maths was replaced by auto-scaling Excel calculators; NanoOrange/A280 protein quantification was replaced with a Bradford assay plus BSA standard curve; and the Promega AMP/ADP protocol was replaced with the team's own real-time assay. A student's suggestion became the tip-wipe oil-removal method that was then tested against the standard method.","publicEngagement_zh":"團隊設計了 CHEM 471：Engineering Synthetic Cells，據稱是美國第一門大學部的合成細胞課程；他們撰寫並實測了十份開放授權（CC BY 4.0）的實驗手冊，另加一份教師包，內含準備清單、試劑成本、時間安排與常見失敗點，2026 年春季開給十位學生，並在課前課後各做一次問卷。12 項技能中有 9 項信心上升；沒有上升的三項則成為設計輸入。學生在課程結束時對螢光顯微術的評分比開始時更低，因此顯微鏡的實驗流程被重寫，並由隊上經驗最少的成員重新測試；手算細胞質配方的部分換成會自動換算的 Excel 計算器；NanoOrange 與 A280 的蛋白定量換成 Bradford 分析加 BSA 標準曲線；Promega 的 AMP 與 ADP 流程則換成團隊自己的即時分析法。一位學生的建議變成後來的擦拭吸頭除油法，之後還拿去與標準方法對照測試。","ihp":"Consultations with ethicists, legal and biosecurity scholars and industry scientists were run as feedback-to-action pairs. Dr Hank Greely advised publishing safety and containment thinking before starting work, so the team published aims, protocols, lab manuals and safety forms. Dr Ryan Jenkins recommended survivability testing as risk-assessment evidence, so the team tested whether synthetic cells survive outside the tube across pH, salinity and real environmental water samples (Los Osos Creek wetland, Avila Beach ocean water, campus pond, tap and deionised water) and found the cells lyse outside pH 7 +/- 1, at seawater salinity and in every environmental sample; he also prompted a lab-notebook safety checklist. Dr Keith Robison raised dual-use scenarios, which produced a benefits-vs-misuse framework. Dr Tae Seok Moon raised public perception, which produced IRB-approved surveys (Cal Poly IRB #2026-194 and #2026-195) of 10 CSHL Summer Synthetic Biology participants and 30 Cal Poly FSURP students on comfort, trust and regulation. Dr Zachary Sun's view that education may be the realistic near-term application reshaped the project's scope toward enzyme characterisation and teaching.","ihp_zh":"與倫理學者、法律與生物安全研究者以及產業科學家的諮詢，都以回饋對行動的配對方式進行。Dr Hank Greely 建議在開始實驗之前就先公開安全與圍堵的思考，於是團隊公開了研究目標、實驗流程、實驗手冊與安全表單。Dr Ryan Jenkins 建議把存活性測試當成風險評估的證據，於是團隊測試合成細胞在試管之外能否存活，涵蓋不同 pH、鹽度與真實環境水樣（Los Osos Creek 濕地、Avila Beach 海水、校園池水、自來水與去離子水），結果發現細胞在 pH 7 ± 1 之外、在海水鹽度下、以及在每一個環境水樣中都會破裂；他也促成了一份實驗紀錄簿的安全檢核表。Dr Keith Robison 提出兩用性情境，產出一套效益對誤用的評估框架。Dr Tae Seok Moon 提出公眾觀感問題，產出經 IRB 核准的問卷（Cal Poly IRB #2026-194 與 #2026-195），對 10 位 CSHL Summer Synthetic Biology 參與者與 30 位 Cal Poly FSURP 學生調查其接受度、信任感與對監管的看法。Dr Zachary Sun 認為教育可能才是近期內現實可行的應用，這個看法把專案的範圍重新導向酵素表徵與教學。","realWorld":"The framing throughout is cost of access rather than novelty: PPK2 plus polyphosphate is pursued because it lowers the price floor of cell-free protein synthesis, and the 3D-printed washboard replaces a hand-raking step that varies between operators. The course is explicitly packaged as a template other undergraduate institutions can adopt, with reagent costs and set-up in an instructor packet, and the full protocol set released so other programmes can either reproduce the six enzyme-characterisation experiments or swap in their own enzymes. Six characterised PPK2 enzymes and sixteen candidate-panel enzymes are deposited as registry parts with their datasets linked.","realWorld_zh":"整份論述的切入點是取得成本，而不是新穎性：之所以追求 PPK2 加多磷酸鹽，是因為它能降低無細胞蛋白質合成的價格下限；而 3D 列印的洗衣板則取代了一個因操作者而異的手工刮動步驟。課程也被明確包裝成其他大學部單位可以直接採用的樣板，試劑成本與建置方式都寫在教師包裡，整套實驗流程也公開釋出，讓其他學程可以重現那六個酵素表徵實驗，或換成自己的酵素。六個已表徵的 PPK2 酵素與十六個候選組酵素都存入 Registry 成為零件，並連結其資料集。","partners":["Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory Summer Synthetic Biology Program","Cal Poly Frost Summer Undergraduate Research Program (FSURP)","b.next (Nucleus cytosol kit)","Promega","Dr Hank Greely (Stanford)","Dr Ryan Jenkins","Dr Keith Robison","Dr Tae Seok Moon","Dr Zachary Sun"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6405/wiki/measurement/meas-opentrons-deck.avif","caption":"The Opentrons OT-2 deck loaded with tip racks and plates; the robot was revived after five years to prepare the EDTA stop plates and the fixed 1:25 and 1:50 dilution plates for the ATP assay.","caption_zh":"裝好吸頭架與盤子的 Opentrons OT-2 平台；這台機器在閒置五年後被重新啟用，用來準備 ATP 分析所需的 EDTA 終止盤，以及固定的 1:25 與 1:50 稀釋盤。","credit":"Team CalPolySLO, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6405/wiki/measurement/meas-glomax-reader.avif","caption":"The Promega GloMax plate reader used to convert quenched, diluted PPK2 reactions into luminescence, which is then converted to ATP concentration against EDTA- and substrate-matched standard curves.","caption_zh":"Promega GloMax 盤式讀取儀，用來把已終止並稀釋的 PPK2 反應轉換成發光訊號，再對照 EDTA 與基質條件相符的標準曲線換算成 ATP 濃度。","credit":"Team CalPolySLO, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6405/wiki/measurement/meas-celltiter-glo.avif","caption":"CellTiter-Glo 2.0, the luciferase chemistry the assay is built on. Because the reagent carries an undisclosed amount of magnesium, the safe upper EDTA limit could not be calculated and had to be measured.","caption_zh":"CellTiter-Glo 2.0，這套分析法所依據的螢光素酶化學。由於試劑中的鎂含量並未公開，EDTA 的安全上限無法計算，只能實際量出來。","credit":"Team CalPolySLO, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6405/wiki/emulsion-device/emu-final.avif","caption":"The finalized 3D-printed emulsification device: a semicircle chassis with a ridged washboard insert and a 30-degree rubber-band sled, which shears cytosol into lipid-in-oil for four tubes at once in place of hand-raking a single tube along an empty rack.","caption_zh":"定稿的 3D 列印乳化裝置：半圓形機身搭配帶稜紋的洗衣板插件與 30 度的橡皮筋滑座，一次可把四管的細胞質剪切成油中脂質乳液，取代原本把單一管子沿著空試管架手工刮動的做法。","credit":"Team CalPolySLO, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Before comparing anything, prove the measurement: validate the quench, establish the instrument's honest linear range and refuse to extrapolate outside it, then build a separate standard curve for every interfering condition and hard-code the resulting correction factors into the analysis template you ship. Then test reproducibility by handing the written protocol to people who have never run it, and publish the disagreement when their numbers differ from yours.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"在比較任何東西之前，先證明你的量測站得住腳：驗證反應終止方法、確立儀器誠實的線性範圍並拒絕外推，再為每一種會造成干擾的條件各建一條標準曲線，並把算出的校正因子直接寫進你要發布的分析範本裡。接著把寫好的實驗流程交給從沒做過的人來測重現性，而當他們的數字和你的不一樣時，就把這個不一致公開出來。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/calpolyslo/","https://2026.igem.wiki/calpolyslo/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/calpolyslo/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/calpolyslo/alternative-platform","https://2026.igem.wiki/calpolyslo/emulsion-device","https://2026.igem.wiki/calpolyslo/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/calpolyslo/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/calpolyslo/downloads"],"awards_zh":["最佳替代平台 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳量測 — 得主（大學組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳基礎推進專案 — 入圍"],"rank":47},"6409":{"team":"RDFZ-China","id":"6409","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/rdfz-china/","projectTitle":"GlacierGuard","tagline":"Protect the ice. Leave less behind.","summary":"RDFZ-China engineered E. coli to produce bacterial cellulose (BC) and built GlacierGuard, a biodegradable BC composite membrane intended to slow localized glacier surface ablation. Three genetic systems support it: heterologous bcsABCD plus a pgm/galU UDP-glucose precursor boost for BC yield, a urease (ureABC) biomineralization module that precipitates white CaCO3 inside the BC fibre network to raise albedo, and a CspA cold-shock-protein module to lower the fermentation temperature needed on the Qinghai-Tibet Plateau. BC production reached 230.6 +/- 15.3 mg/L in C41(DE3), roughly 65.9x the empty-vector control, and covered ice retained 3.2 percentage points more mass than geotextile-covered ice in a refrigerator day-night simulation. The team deliberately deployed only commercially sourced (non-engineered) BC membranes during its Tibet field trial and removed all material before leaving.","awards":["Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"ESM-C protein language model scoring combined with a MuZero reinforcement-learning agent and Monte Carlo Tree Search over AlphaFold-predicted structure; Rosetta used for structural-energy scoring. Candidates ranked by AI Score = 0.5 x ESM-C percentile + 0.5 x Rosetta percentile.","dataviz":"Figure-based reporting of screening hit rates and benchmark score distributions, BC yield comparisons, ice-mass-retention curves, infrared transmission by membrane layer count, and a power/interest stakeholder map. The wiki also carries an interactive 3D 'Glacier Atlas' globe with five Chinese glacier records (Dagu, Azha, Urumqi No. 1, Baishui River No. 1, Mingyong).","datascience":"Benchmarked MuZero/MCTS against genetic algorithms, Beam Search and Random Search, and against SaProt, ESM-C and ESM-1v foundation models, using 50 candidate sequences per method and a hit rate defined as the fraction falling in the top 10% of the benchmark score distribution. MuZero/MCTS reached 24% hit rate vs GA 10%, Beam Search 8%, Random Search 0%; 40% vs 0% for all three foundation models. 1,855 unique BcsD variants were generated after 10,000 model updates; top candidate W19R + G113E (AI score 0.8445).","software":"No standalone released software tool; the dry lab is an in-house screening pipeline. The wiki itself is a hand-built server-rendered site with an interactive glacier atlas. Note: the /model path on this wiki serves leftover template content from an unrelated project and is not the team's dry lab.","stack":["ESM-C","ESM-1v","SaProt","AlphaFold","Rosetta","MuZero","Monte Carlo Tree Search"],"techniques":["protein language model variant scoring","reinforcement-learning sequence search","structural energy calculation","method benchmarking against GA/Beam/Random search","life-cycle and cost reasoning drawn from published BC LCA and techno-economic studies"],"frameworks_zh":"以 ESM-C 蛋白質語言模型評分，結合一個 MuZero 強化學習代理人與蒙地卡羅樹搜尋，在 AlphaFold 預測的結構上進行搜尋；Rosetta 則用於結構能量評分。候選以 AI Score = 0.5 x ESM-C 百分位 + 0.5 x Rosetta 百分位 排序。","dataviz_zh":"以圖表呈現篩選命中率與基準分數分布、BC 產量比較、冰質量保留曲線、不同膜層數的紅外穿透率，以及一張權力／興趣的利害關係人地圖。wiki 另有一個互動式 3D「冰川地圖」地球儀，收錄五條中國冰川的記錄（達古、阿札、烏魯木齊 1 號、白水河 1 號、明永）。","datascience_zh":"他們把 MuZero/MCTS 與基因演算法、Beam Search 與隨機搜尋做基準比較，也與 SaProt、ESM-C 與 ESM-1v 等基礎模型比較，每種方法各取 50 條候選序列，命中率定義為落在基準分數分布前 10% 的比例。MuZero/MCTS 達到 24% 命中率，而 GA 為 10%、Beam Search 為 8%、隨機搜尋為 0%；對三個基礎模型則是 40% 對 0%。在 10,000 次模型更新後產生 1,855 個獨特的 BcsD 變異體；最佳候選為 W19R + G113E（AI 分數 0.8445）。","software_zh":"沒有獨立釋出的軟體工具；乾實驗室是一條自製的篩選管線。wiki 本身是手工打造、伺服器端渲染的網站，附一個互動式冰川地圖。附註：此 wiki 的 /model 路徑提供的是某個無關專案遺留的範本內容，並非團隊的乾實驗室。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A 440-response public survey (online forms, social media, QR codes on posters) found 93.6% thought glacier protection 'very necessary' but 92.0% knew little or nothing about glacier blankets, and 70.5% named 'biodegradable and free from harmful substances or microplastic release' as a top material requirement. The team turned respondents' nicknames and messages into a physical team flag and carried it to the glacier. Other engagement: a visit to the China Quaternary Glacial Vestige Exhibition Hall in Beijing (interview with a staff member surnamed Ma); Xiaohongshu/RedNote science communication that deliberately shifted the message from 'how do we protect a glacier' to 'why protect glaciers and what can individuals do'; a campus exhibition of BC samples and expedition photographs; glacier-themed penguin badges; project slogans printed on racing apparel and a racing helmet sticker; and an online fundraiser for Tibet disaster relief after the August 2026 Gyirong Port debris-flow disaster. In Tibet the team ran outreach for about 150 students across three classes at Bomi County Middle School, built around local glaciers and ecosystems, with a Tibetan-language title and a strawberry DNA extraction experiment; feedback cards came back in both Chinese and Tibetan.","ihp":"This is one of the strongest high-school IHP chains of the year: 27 interviews, site visits and engagement activities organised under an explicit Why-How-What-Adaptation (WHWA) loop in which each entry states the change made. Dr. Donghui Shangguan (cryosphere scientist, glacier change) said in substance 'rather than trying to protect every glacier, we should first determine which glaciers should be prioritised,' and pointed out that glacier surfaces host microorganisms and pioneer plants; the team therefore abandoned 'cover as much glacier area as possible' and repositioned GlacierGuard as targeted protection of high-value, human-accessible sites (parks, research stations, culturally or scientifically significant glaciers), and rewrote its customer definition from bulk consumers to institutions with monitoring and impact-assessment capacity. Jiaojiao Hu of Polar Future warned that glacier winds lift and tear thin membranes and that the team's planned metal anchoring nails would add thermal conductivity and foreign material; she suggested using stones already present on site, and the team both adopted stone/biodegradable anchoring and converted her concern into measurable tests - 11.7 N peak force to failure under freezing conditions and a twisted BC rope carrying 9.5 kg. Professor Haibo Zhang told them a working genetic module does not guarantee an efficient host, so instead of keeping their assumed chassis they built bcsABCD in both BL21(DE3) and C41(DE3), measured yields, and switched to C41(DE3). Polar scientist Limin Xia said unmodified BC alone would probably not reach the needed optical performance and recommended biomineralisation whitening plus attention to infrared wavelengths - this is the direct origin of the ureABC/CaCO3 System 2, and of the added water-absorption (842.0% mass gain) and layered infrared transmission tests (1200 W/m2 bare, falling to 605/370/340 W/m2 for one/two/three layers). Associate Professor Xuan Yu of Xihua University was consulted about using highland barley (qingke) liquor residues as a cheap local carbon source (an idea seeded by iGEM team BUCT-China); she judged the residue route technically difficult and instead recommended the cold-shock protein CspA to cut fermentation heating, which became System 3, while the barley residue was honestly demoted to 'future investigation, yield unmeasured.' Arctic researcher Dr. Ma Liheng pushed them on a hypothetical polar bear ingesting the membrane, which triggered a comparative soil-burial test (BC fully degraded in 7 days, geotextile unchanged) and an explicit admission that wildlife-ingestion safety is unresolved. Professor Jian Zhang (Tsinghua) attacked the evidence base - summer-only observations cannot represent annual glacier trends, biodegradation in soil does not predict biodegradation at glacier temperatures, retention and refreezing on sloping ice is unproven, and someone must pay for production, transport, installation and maintenance - and the team responded by date-stamping its late-August observation window, flagging those uncertainties as open, and adding campus exhibition and Glacier Casualty List-style storytelling to its plan. Negative results are reported with equal weight: essential-oil hydrophobic coating failed the contact-angle test and was dropped, mechanical reinforcement was dropped because the unmodified membrane already passed the tests and extra layers would hurt biodegradability and cost, and a judge's suggestion (Ho Chun Loong, Shenzhen SynBio Challenge) to add ice-nucleating proteins was researched and then explicitly rejected because INPs address nucleation rather than meltwater runoff or radiation absorption. The stakeholder map is two-dimensional (power x interest) and, unusually, names non-human stakeholders - glacier ecosystems, glacier microbial communities, alpine ecosystems and downstream aquatic ecosystems - as parties whose needs must enter design decisions.","realWorld":"Implementation is specified down to a four-step field procedure (site preparation to remove sharp gravel, membrane placement with overlapping sheets and minimal trapped air, biodegradable edge anchoring, final inspection), with membranes dried, cut, folded or rolled for compact transport and hand-carried in batches to glaciers vehicles cannot reach, installed in a cold window before the melt season. Named customers are glacier conservation organisations, national park and nature reserve authorities, high-altitude local governments and restoration/adaptation programmes, with glacier tourism sites and high-altitude ski resorts as early pilot hosts. The regulatory path is real rather than gestural: the team read the Ecological and Environmental Code of the People's Republic of China and the Regulations of the Tibet Autonomous Region on Glacier Protection, emailed iGEM Headquarters and submitted an Environmental Risk Assessment before fieldwork, used only commercial non-engineered BC on the ice, and removed every membrane before leaving. SDG claims are tied to named sub-targets with the team's own evidence: 13.1/13.2/13.3 (melt-reduction test, policy reference materials, climate education), 12.2/12.4/12.5/12.8 (BC life-cycle, cited cradle-to-gate LCA by Forte et al. 2021, residue reuse), 9.5 (industrial fermentation feasibility, citing Dourado et al. 2016), 6.1/6.4/6.6 and 15.1/15.4, plus a candid spillover analysis flagging SDG 7 energy demand from scale-up, SDG 8 high-altitude worker safety, and an SDG 10 equity risk that high deployment cost would concentrate protection in well-funded locations. On cost the team refuses to overclaim: it states that agricultural by-products do not automatically make BC cheaper, that the alternative-carbon-source process is unvalidated and its yield unmeasured, and that a full-life-cycle cost model covering production, maintenance, replacement, waste treatment and recovery - expressed as cost per unit area and per unit of ice melt avoided - must precede any scale-up. Next steps are paired control/treatment plots on real glaciers with continuous monitoring through research stations such as the Aza Glacier Citizen Science Monitoring Site (now part of Polar Future's long-term observation network), plus a standing offer from Professor Xian-En Zhang (Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology) to host further experiments.","partners":["Polar Research Institute of China (virtual tour led by Dr. Wang Luo)","China's Zhongshan Station, Antarctica (station leader Cui Xiangbin)","Dr. Ma Liheng, Arctic field researcher","Dr. Donghui Shangguan, glacier/cryosphere scientist","Jiaojiao Hu, Polar Future","Limin Xia, polar expedition scientist","Professor Haibo Zhang","Professor Weilin Xu","Professor Jian Zhang, Tsinghua University","Associate Professor Xuan Yu, Xihua University","Professor Xian-En Zhang, Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology","Lanzhou University Chayu Monsoon Corridor Multisphere Research Station, Tibet","Southeast Tibet Observation and Research Station for the Alpine Environment, Chinese Academy of Sciences","Aza Glacier Citizen Science Monitoring Site","Daosheng Bio fermentation facility","China Quaternary Glacial Vestige Exhibition Hall, Beijing","Bomi County Middle School, Tibet","iGEM team BUCT-China","Ho Chun Loong, Shenzhen SynBio Challenge judge"],"publicEngagement_zh":"一份 440 份回覆的公眾問卷（線上表單、社群媒體、海報上的 QR code）發現，93.6% 認為保護冰川「非常必要」，但 92.0% 對冰川覆蓋被幾乎一無所知，而 70.5% 把「可生物降解、不含有害物質或釋出微塑膠」列為材料的首要要求。團隊把回覆者的暱稱與留言做成一面實體隊旗，帶上冰川。其他參與活動包括：造訪北京的中國第四紀冰川遺跡陳列館（訪談一位馬姓工作人員）；在小紅書上做科學傳播，並刻意把訊息從「我們要怎麼保護一條冰川」轉向「為什麼要保護冰川，以及個人能做什麼」；在校內展出 BC 樣品與考察照片；製作冰川主題的企鵝徽章；把專案標語印在賽車服上並做成賽車頭盔貼紙；以及在 2026 年 8 月吉隆口岸泥流災害後為西藏賑災舉辦線上募款。在西藏，團隊為波密縣中學三個班約 150 位學生進行外推活動，內容圍繞當地冰川與生態系統，標題使用藏文，並做了草莓 DNA 萃取實驗；回饋卡上以中文與藏文兩種文字寫回。","ihp_zh":"這是今年高中組最強的 IHP 鏈之一：27 場訪談、實地走訪與參與活動，統整在一個明確的 Why-How-What-Adaptation（WHWA）迴圈之下，每一筆都寫出所做的改變。上官冬輝博士（冰凍圈科學家，研究冰川變化）的意見實質上是「與其試圖保護每一條冰川，應該先判定哪些冰川該被優先保護」，並指出冰川表面本身就有微生物與先鋒植物；團隊因此放棄「盡可能覆蓋更大冰川面積」，把 GlacierGuard 重新定位為針對高價值、人員可達場址（公園、研究站、具文化或科學意義的冰川）的標的式保護，並把客戶定義從大量採購者改寫為具備監測與影響評估能力的機構。極地未來的胡嬌嬌警告冰川風會把薄膜掀起並撕裂，而團隊原本規劃的金屬固定釘會增加熱傳導並引入外來物質；她建議就地取用現場已有的石塊，團隊既採納了石塊／可生物降解的固定方式，也把她的顧慮轉成可量測的測試——在冰凍條件下破壞時的尖峰力為 11.7 N，而一條扭製的 BC 繩可承載 9.5 kg。張海波教授告訴他們，一個能運作的基因模組並不保證宿主效率也高，因此他們沒有沿用原本假定的載體，而是在 BL21(DE3) 與 C41(DE3) 中都建構 bcsABCD、量測產量，最後改用 C41(DE3)。極地科學家夏立民表示，單靠未修飾的 BC 大概達不到所需的光學性能，並建議加上生物礦化增白，同時注意紅外波段——這正是 ureABC/CaCO3 系統 2 的直接來源，也是新增吸水測試（質量增加 842.0%）與分層紅外穿透測試（裸冰 1200 W/m2，一／二／三層分別降至 605/370/340 W/m2）的來源。西華大學余璇副教授則被諮詢是否能用青稞酒糟作為廉價的當地碳源（這個想法由 iGEM 隊伍 BUCT-China 啟發）；她判斷酒糟路線技術上困難，改而建議使用冷震蛋白 CspA 以減少發酵加熱，這成了系統 3，而青稞酒糟則被誠實地降級為「未來研究、產量未量測」。北極研究者馬立恆博士追問一個假設情境：若北極熊吃下這層膜會怎樣？這促成了一項對照式土壤埋藏試驗（BC 在 7 天內完全降解，土工織物毫無變化），以及一句明確的承認：野生動物誤食的安全性尚未解決。清華大學張見教授則直攻證據基礎——只有夏季的觀測無法代表冰川的全年趨勢、在土壤中的生物降解無法預測在冰川溫度下的降解、在傾斜冰面上的滯留與再凍結未經證實，而且總得有人支付生產、運輸、安裝與維護的費用——團隊的回應是為八月下旬的觀測窗標上日期、把這些不確定性標示為未解，並在計畫中加入校內展覽與「冰川死亡名單」式的敘事。負面結果也以同等篇幅報告：精油疏水塗層在接觸角測試中失敗而被放棄；機械補強被放棄，因為未修飾的膜已通過測試，而額外層數會損及生物降解性與成本；而一位評審（深圳 SynBio Challenge 的 Ho Chun Loong）建議加入冰核蛋白的提案，在研究後被明確否決，因為冰核蛋白處理的是結晶核形成，而不是融水逕流或輻射吸收。利害關係人地圖是二維的（權力 x 興趣），而且很不尋常地納入非人類的利害關係人——冰川生態系統、冰川微生物群落、高山生態系統與下游水域生態系統——把它們列為其需求必須進入設計決策的當事方。","realWorld_zh":"落地細節具體到一套四步現場程序（場址整理以清除尖銳碎石、以重疊方式鋪設膜並盡量減少夾住的空氣、以可生物降解方式固定邊緣、最後檢查），膜經乾燥、裁切、折疊或捲起以便精簡運輸，分批以人力背運到車輛無法抵達的冰川，並在融雪季前的低溫窗口安裝。指名的客戶是冰川保育組織、國家公園與自然保護區主管機關、高海拔地方政府，以及復育／調適計畫，另以冰川觀光景點與高海拔滑雪場作為早期試行場址。法規路徑是真的走過而非做樣子：團隊研讀了《中華人民共和國生態環境法典》與《西藏自治區冰川保護條例》，在實地工作前致信 iGEM 總部並提交環境風險評估，在冰上只使用商購的非工程化 BC，並在離開前把每一片膜都移除。SDG 主張都扣在指名的子目標上並附團隊自己的證據：13.1/13.2/13.3（減融測試、政策參考資料、氣候教育）、12.2/12.4/12.5/12.8（BC 生命週期，引用 Forte 等人 2021 的搖籃到廠門 LCA、酒糟再利用）、9.5（工業發酵可行性，引用 Dourado 等人 2016）、6.1/6.4/6.6 與 15.1/15.4，另加一份坦率的外溢效應分析，點出放大規模會帶來 SDG 7 的能源需求、SDG 8 的高海拔工作者安全，以及 SDG 10 的公平風險——高昂的部署成本會讓保護集中在資金充裕的地點。在成本上，團隊拒絕誇大：他們明白表示農業副產物並不會自動讓 BC 變便宜、替代碳源的製程尚未驗證且產量未量測，而且在任何規模放大之前，必須先有一個涵蓋生產、維護、更換、廢棄處理與回收的全生命週期成本模型，並以每單位面積成本與每單位避免冰融量的成本表示。下一步是在真實冰川上設置成對的對照／處理樣區，透過研究站進行連續監測，例如阿札冰川公民科學監測點（現已納入極地未來的長期觀測網絡），另有深圳理工大學張先恩教授主動提供場地以承接後續實驗。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6409/wiki/human-practices/img16.avif","caption":"GlacierGuard stakeholder map plotted on power and interest axes, including non-human stakeholders such as glacier microbial communities and downstream aquatic ecosystems.","credit":"Team RDFZ-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"GlacierGuard 的利害關係人地圖，繪於權力與興趣兩軸上，並納入冰川微生物群落與下游水域生態系統等非人類利害關係人。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6409/wiki/human-practices/img18.avif","caption":"The team interviewing glacier scientist Dr. Donghui Shangguan, whose advice to prioritise specific glaciers rather than cover area redefined the project's target users.","credit":"Team RDFZ-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"團隊訪談冰川科學家上官冬輝博士，他關於「應優先選定特定冰川而非追求覆蓋面積」的建議，重新界定了專案的目標使用者。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6409/wiki/human-practices/img55.avif","caption":"Temporary on-site placement of a commercially sourced (non-engineered) bacterial cellulose membrane on the Aza Glacier surface during the Tibet field investigation; all material was removed before leaving.","credit":"Team RDFZ-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"西藏實地考察期間，在阿札冰川表面暫時鋪設一片商購（非工程化）的細菌纖維素膜；所有材料在離開前都已移除。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6409/wiki/human-practices/img26.avif","caption":"Nature education session at Bomi County Middle School in Tibet, linking glaciers to forests, wetlands and grasslands for roughly 150 local students.","credit":"Team RDFZ-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"在西藏波密縣中學的自然教育課程，為約 150 位當地學生把冰川與森林、濕地與草原連結起來。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Adopt RDFZ-China's Why-How-What-Adaptation template, where every stakeholder entry must end in a named design change or an explicitly rejected option, and copy their habit of converting a stakeholder's worry into a measurable bench test (wind-tearing concern becomes an 11.7 N tensile figure; reflectivity advice becomes an infrared transmission curve).","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/rdfz-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/rdfz-china/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/rdfz-china/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/rdfz-china/sustainability","https://2026.igem.wiki/rdfz-china/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/rdfz-china/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/rdfz-china/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/rdfz-china/safety-and-security","https://2026.igem.wiki/rdfz-china/team","https://2026.igem.wiki/rdfz-china/education"],"projectTitle_zh":"GlacierGuard","tagline_zh":"守護冰川，少留痕跡。","summary_zh":"RDFZ-China 改造 E. coli 生產細菌纖維素（BC），並做出 GlacierGuard——一種可生物降解的 BC 複合膜，用來減緩局部冰川表面消融。三套基因系統支撐它：異源的 bcsABCD 加上 pgm/galU 的 UDP-葡萄糖前驅物增補以提升 BC 產量；一個尿素酶（ureABC）生物礦化模組，在 BC 纖維網絡內析出白色 CaCO3 以提高反照率；以及一個 CspA 冷震蛋白模組，用來降低在青藏高原發酵所需的溫度。BC 產量在 C41(DE3) 中達到 230.6 +/- 15.3 mg/L，約為空載體對照的 65.9 倍；在冰箱日夜循環模擬中，覆蓋膜的冰比覆蓋土工織物的冰多保留 3.2 個百分點的質量。團隊在西藏實地考察時刻意只部署商購（非工程化）的 BC 膜，並在離開前把所有材料全部移除。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"採用 RDFZ-China 的 Why-How-What-Adaptation 範本——每一筆利害關係人記錄都必須以一項指名的設計變更、或一個被明確否決的選項作結；同時學他們把利害關係人的擔憂轉成可量測實驗的習慣（對風力撕裂的顧慮變成 11.7 N 的抗拉數值；關於反射率的建議變成一條紅外穿透曲線）。","awards_zh":["最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6422":{"team":"UiOslo-Norway","id":"6422","section":"Overgrad","country":"Norway","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/uioslo-norway/","projectTitle":"HePatch","tagline":"A thermostable hepatitis B surface antigen for a dissolvable microneedle patch - and a hard look at whether that is actually the right problem","summary":"HePatch engineers the hepatitis B surface antigen (HBsAg) for thermostability so it could be delivered in a dissolvable microneedle patch without a cold chain, benchmarked against the WHO controlled temperature chain condition of 28 days at 37 C. The dry lab scored 2,260 ESM2/Rosetta substitutions on a 238-residue E. coli construct, retained 989 after a ddG filter, and ranked candidates for the bench. What distinguishes the team is that it put the project in front of ethicists, legal scholars, Norway's national research ethics committees, a medical officer in Kenya's highest-prevalence county and a youth-led organisation in Nairobi's informal settlements - and then published the places where those people broke the project's own premise. Each stakeholder round is closed with a 'What changed?' box naming the previous assumption, the new approach and the updated framing.","awards":["Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A two-phase candidate-prioritisation pipeline for HBsAg substitutions. Phase 1 scores substitutions on sequence, structure and developability features; Phase 2 prepares checked ProteinMPNN and molecular-dynamics packages. Ethical reflection is structured on Kenneth Pimple's three questions for responsible conduct of research - is it true, is it fair, is it wise - with most of the human-practices work deliberately placed under 'is it wise'.","dataviz":"Original GIS cartography made by the team rather than borrowed from publications: population density, mean annual temperature, road network and hospital locations for Turkana and Nairobi counties, rendered in QGIS at WGS 84 (EPSG:4326), with every data source, resolution and limitation stated in the caption. Plus per-variant structural figures (WT, S54T, T56A, T113S) and the recurring 'What changed?' three-column comparison boxes.","datascience":"2,260 ESM2/Rosetta-scored substitutions filtered to 989 by ddG; an earlier construct-v2 exploration ran AlphaFold2 and ProteinMPNN on six candidates, kept as a separately labelled history rather than merged. Provenance discipline is unusually strict: the pipeline records every input, output and source checksum, and the team states that the selected run reuses preserved ESM2 and Rosetta outputs whose original software versions and seeds were not recorded. Geospatial analysis used WorldPop 2020 constrained counts at 100 m, WorldClim 2.1 BIO1 at 30 arc-seconds, GADM 4.1 boundaries and OpenStreetMap amenity and road tags.","software":"A reproducible released pipeline containing the reusable code, tests and a synthetic example, with a separate archive preserving the selected run and its full provenance history. The model page carries a blanket disclaimer that none of the in silico output establishes expression yield, solubility, antigenicity, disulfide bonding, particle assembly or biological function.","stack":["ESM2","Rosetta (ddG)","ProteinMPNN","AlphaFold2","molecular dynamics","QGIS","WorldPop","WorldClim","GADM","OpenStreetMap"],"techniques":["in silico saturation substitution scoring","ddG stability filtering","developability feature scoring","inverse folding","geospatial triangulation of stakeholder testimony","checksum-based provenance recording"],"frameworks_zh":"一套兩階段的 HBsAg 取代候選排序管線。第一階段依序列、結構與可開發性特徵為各取代評分；第二階段備好經檢查的 ProteinMPNN 與分子動力學套件。倫理反思則架在 Kenneth Pimple 關於研究行為責任的三個問題上——是否為真、是否公平、是否明智——而大部分的人類實踐工作被刻意放在「是否明智」之下。","dataviz_zh":"團隊自製的 GIS 製圖，而不是從文獻借來的：Turkana 與 Nairobi 兩郡的人口密度、年均溫、道路網與醫院位置，以 QGIS 在 WGS 84（EPSG:4326）下繪製，每一項資料來源、解析度與限制都寫在圖說裡。另有各變異體的結構圖（WT、S54T、T56A、T113S），以及反覆出現的「What changed?」三欄比較方框。","datascience_zh":"2,260 個經 ESM2/Rosetta 評分的取代，以 ddG 篩到 989 個；較早的 construct-v2 探索曾對六個候選跑過 AlphaFold2 與 ProteinMPNN，被另行標示為歷史紀錄而非合併進來。來源履歷的紀律嚴格得少見：管線會記錄每一項輸入、輸出與來源檢查碼，而團隊也聲明本次所選的執行沿用保留下來的 ESM2 與 Rosetta 輸出，而那些輸出原本的軟體版本與隨機種子並未被記錄。地理空間分析使用 100 m 的 WorldPop 2020 constrained 人口計數、30 弧秒的 WorldClim 2.1 BIO1、GADM 4.1 行政邊界，以及 OpenStreetMap 的設施與道路標籤。","software_zh":"發布了一條可重現的管線，內含可重複使用的程式碼、測試與一個合成資料範例，並另有一份封存保留所選執行及其完整來源履歷。模型頁面掛上一段總括免責聲明：所有電腦模擬（in silico）輸出都不足以確立表現量、可溶性、抗原性、雙硫鍵形成、顆粒組裝或生物功能。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education ran from kindergarten upward - children building model viruses and extracting DNA, sessions at Forskningstorget (the Norwegian public research fair), and presentations to biology students - with photo documentation of each. A separate Dialogues page records the conversations held with ethics and legal experts. The notable choice is a principle adopted from a stakeholder and applied to their own outreach: June Alfreds of Youth and Urbanism told them that raising awareness of a vaccine a family then cannot obtain does not build trust, it destroys it, and the team now treats that as a firm constraint on their own public communication.","ihp":"UiOslo's IHP is the clearest example in this set of engagement that attacks the project rather than endorsing it, and every round ends in a published 'What changed?' box. Professor Kristin Bergtora Sandvik (Criminology and Sociology of Law, University of Oslo, fifteen years on the legal and ethical side of global health including vaccines and cold chains) pointed out that in Norway a vaccination appointment is also when a nurse weighs the child, checks for malnutrition, asks after the mother and notices when a family stops coming - so the team had been thinking about removing the syringe and the fridge without noticing they were also removing the healthcare visit. Professor Kristine Baeroe (Institute of Health and Society) refused to let reduced healthcare involvement count as an automatic benefit, and said of the recipients that children are 'the vulnerable among the vulnerable'. The design consequence is explicit: they moved away from designing for full self-administration towards a trained person being present, began investigating community health workers as administrators, and now describe HePatch as replacing a healthcare visit rather than an injection. Baeroe also told them that studying one country in depth beats a general claim about low-resource settings, which is why the project now writes about Kenya and specifically Turkana County; and she made the communication risk concrete by asking them to imagine a patch arriving in a community with no prior context for it, described as a cure, noting that mistrust in that situation is not irrational and that an intervention can be read as something done to a child rather than for them. Then the team did the thing most teams skip: they designed the Kenyan conversations as a falsification test, stating in advance that the alternative they were genuinely prepared to find - that cold-chain dependence was not a leading barrier in either setting - 'would have undercut the premise of the project as a whole'. Dr Vincent Ebenyo, medical officer at Lodwar County Referral Hospital in Turkana (16.8% hepatitis B prevalence in KENPHIA 2018, the highest county figure in Kenya), partly did undercut it: asked for the single biggest driver of low birth-dose coverage he named unsterilised shared cutting instruments used in ceremonies such as scarification and late health-seeking behaviour first, not the cold chain, which taught the team that transmission prevention and vaccine access are two different problems and a delivery-technology fix only addresses the second. He did confirm the core rationale with a precedent - his hospital had already switched from oxytocin to heat-stable carbetocin because local power instability made cold storage unreliable - but located the cold-chain failure specifically at sub-county and outreach facilities rather than the referral hospital, and noted mothers travelling up to 100 km who arrive a week or a month after birth, far outside the WHO 24-hour window. On self-administration he drew a comparison the team had not considered, that insulin-dependent patients are trusted to self-inject after training, while insisting that training must cover recognising side effects and knowing when to seek care, not just application; and he named the Pharmacy and Poisons Board as the body that would need to run sample trials, which is why the team now treats engagement with Kenyan regulators as part of the project path rather than an afterthought. Edwin Odhiambo, June Alfreds and nurse Steve Donell of Youth and Urbanism in Nairobi's informal settlements went further: Odhiambo said flatly that if HePatch can still only be administered inside a hospital, a mother gains nothing from the fact that it no longer needs a fridge, because she makes the same trip to the same limited set of facilities - a distribution and licensing problem, not a temperature one. Alfreds added barriers the team had not identified at all: teenage mothers unaware of the 24-hour window and stigmatised by providers, Social Health Authority registration requirements that undocumented mothers cannot meet, financial dependency and intimate partner violence determining whether a mother can attend at all, and a day queueing at a hospital being a day of lost income. Donell showed that stigma is locally specific rather than generic - in Nairobi hepatitis B is wrongly linked to sexual behaviour and drug use and mentally associated with HIV, whereas in Turkana the same disease is more often mistranslated as an alcohol-related liver condition - and recommended routing messaging through trusted community health volunteers and faith leaders rather than through specialists or the project itself. The result is a conditional value proposition rather than one universal pitch: transport and storage resilience in remote off-grid Turkana, and expanded distribution to non-hospital providers in Nairobi only if paired with a licensing pathway. The team also publishes two arguments against itself - that solving the cold chain for one vaccine could remove a reason to fund and maintain the shared cold-chain infrastructure every other vaccine depends on, and that since the WHO already permits some vaccines outside 2-8 C under controlled temperature chain rules, protein stability may not be the real bottleneck at all - and names its remaining gap honestly, that the Network for Adolescent and Youth of Africa could not attend, so the adolescent perspective 'remains a genuine gap in what we can currently report'.","realWorld":"The need is framed at the level of a specific failure point rather than a continent: hepatitis B birth dose must be given within 24 hours, the conventional vaccine is an aqueous aluminium-adjuvant suspension that loses potency irreversibly if frozen as well as if overheated, and the cold chain in Turkana holds at the county referral hospital but not at the generator-dependent sub-county and outreach facilities below it, across a county of about 68,700 square kilometres served by eight hospital-level facilities spaced one to two hundred kilometres apart, with mean annual temperatures above 30 C across most of the inhabited lowlands. SDGs are used as tests, not labels: SDG 3 as primary with named targets 3.3, 3.8 and 3.b and a quantitative benchmark (28 days at 37 C, the WHO controlled temperature chain condition), SDG 9 and SDG 10 as supporting, and an explicit statement that these are intended contributions and not measured outcomes. They decline to claim a fourth, environmental SDG at all, writing that removing refrigeration and sharps could cut some material and energy demand but the polymer patch, sterile packaging and manufacturing have impacts, so a life-cycle assessment would be needed before any environmental claim - a refusal that is rarer and more credible than a claim. A trade-offs table pairs each possible benefit with its risk and with what would have to be measured to settle it (for example, delivery closer to home against work shifting to already stretched community health workers, measured by training time, workload, follow-up and user preference). The regulatory path runs through Kenya's own Pharmacy and Poisons Board rather than an external or parallel route. On equity they commit that a patch must not become a cheaper, less supported option offered only where health systems have fewer resources, and that any future use needs the same safety, dose and protection evidence as other vaccine formats - operationalised as comparing HePatch against the vaccination a child would otherwise receive rather than against no vaccination, because 'measuring our option against nothing makes it look better than it is'. What they claim now is bounded: antigen candidates designed and tested, no complete thermostable vaccine patch, no demonstrated lower emissions, lower cost or improved coverage.","partners":["Department of Criminology and Sociology of Law, University of Oslo (Prof. Kristin Bergtora Sandvik)","Institute of Health and Society, University of Oslo (Prof. Kristine Baeroe)","NEM - Norwegian National Research Ethics Committee for Medicine and Health","NENT - Norwegian National Research Ethics Committee for Science and Technology","Lodwar County Referral Hospital, Turkana County, Kenya (Dr Vincent Ebenyo)","Youth and Urbanism, Nairobi","Network for Adolescent and Youth of Africa (NAYA, invited, unable to attend)","Forskningstorget public research fair"],"publicEngagement_zh":"教育工作從幼兒園一路往上——小朋友做病毒模型、萃取 DNA，在 Forskningstorget（挪威的公眾科研展）設場次，並向生物系學生報告——每一項都有照片記錄。另有一個 Dialogues 頁面記下與倫理及法律專家的對話。值得一提的選擇是他們採納了某位利害關係人的原則，並套用到自己的推廣上：Youth and Urbanism 的 June Alfreds 告訴他們，宣傳一支家庭之後拿不到的疫苗並不會建立信任，而是會摧毀信任；團隊現在把這句話當成自己對外溝通的硬性限制。","ihp_zh":"UiOslo 的 IHP 是本組中最清楚的例子：互動是用來攻擊專案，而不是替它背書，而每一輪都以一個公開的「What changed?」方框收尾。Professor Kristin Bergtora Sandvik（University of Oslo 犯罪學與法律社會學，在全球衛生的法律與倫理面已有十五年經驗，包含疫苗與冷鏈）指出，在挪威，一次預防接種同時也是護理師為孩子量體重、檢查營養不良、關心母親狀況、並察覺某個家庭不再出現的時刻——因此團隊一直想著拿掉針筒與冰箱，卻沒注意到自己也一併拿掉了那次就醫。Professor Kristine Baeroe（Institute of Health and Society）拒絕讓減少醫療體系介入自動算成好處，並就接種對象說，兒童是「脆弱者中的脆弱者」。設計上的後果是明確的：他們從完全自行施用的設計方向退開，改為要求有受過訓練的人在場，並開始研究由社區衛生工作者施用的可能，現在也把 HePatch 描述為取代一次就醫，而不是取代一次注射。Baeroe 也告訴他們，把一個國家研究透徹勝過對低資源環境下一個籠統主張，這就是專案現在改寫肯亞、特別是 Turkana 郡的原因；她並把溝通風險講得很具體：要他們想像一張貼片突然出現在一個對它毫無背景認識的社區，又被形容成解藥，並指出在那種情境下的不信任並不是非理性的，而一項介入也可能被理解成對孩子做了什麼，而不是為孩子做了什麼。接著團隊做了多數隊伍會跳過的事：他們把在肯亞的對話設計成一次否證檢驗，並事先聲明自己真的準備好可能得到的另一種答案——在兩個場域中冷鏈依賴都不是主要障礙——而那「將會削弱整個專案的前提」。Turkana 的 Lodwar County Referral Hospital 醫官 Dr Vincent Ebenyo（KENPHIA 2018 顯示該郡 B 型肝炎盛行率 16.8%，是肯亞各郡最高）確實部分削弱了它：被問到出生劑接種率低的最大單一因素時，他首先點出的是劃紋等儀式中共用、未滅菌的切割器具，以及就醫過晚，而不是冷鏈；這讓團隊明白，傳染的預防與疫苗的可及性是兩個不同的問題，而遞送技術的解方只處理後者。他的確以一個先例確認了核心論據——他所在的醫院已因當地電力不穩、冷藏不可靠，而從催產素改用耐熱型 carbetocin——但他把冷鏈的失效點具體定位在分郡與外展據點，而不是這家轉診醫院；他也提到有母親要走上 100 公里，產後一週或一個月才抵達，遠超出 WHO 的 24 小時時間窗。關於自行施用，他提出一個團隊沒想到的類比：依賴胰島素的病人在受訓後就被信任可以自行注射；但他也堅持訓練內容必須包含辨認副作用與知道何時該就醫，不能只教怎麼貼上去。他還指出 Pharmacy and Poisons Board 才是需要執行樣品試驗的單位，這也是團隊現在把與肯亞監管機關的互動當成專案路徑的一部分、而不是事後補上的原因。在 Nairobi 非正式聚落工作的 Youth and Urbanism 成員 Edwin Odhiambo、June Alfreds 與護理師 Steve Donell 走得更遠：Odhiambo 直言，如果 HePatch 仍然只能在醫院內施用，那不再需要冰箱這件事對一位母親而言毫無意義，因為她還是得跑同一趟路、到同一批有限的據點——這是分配與許可的問題，不是溫度的問題。Alfreds 又補上團隊完全沒有辨識到的障礙：青少女母親不知道有 24 小時時間窗，且在醫療人員面前受到汙名；Social Health Authority 的註冊要求是無身分證件的母親無法滿足的；經濟依賴與親密伴侶暴力決定了一位母親究竟能不能前往；而在醫院排隊一天，就是少掉一天的收入。Donell 則顯示汙名是因地而異、不是通用的——在 Nairobi，B 型肝炎被錯誤地連到性行為與藥物使用，並在認知上與 HIV 掛在一起；而在 Turkana，同一個疾病更常被誤譯成與飲酒有關的肝病——他建議訊息應透過受信任的社區衛生志工與宗教領袖傳遞，而不是透過專家或專案本身。結果是一套有條件的價值主張，而不是一套通用說詞：在偏遠、無電網的 Turkana，賣點是運輸與儲存的韌性；在 Nairobi，則是把配送擴大到非醫院的提供者——但前提是必須搭配一條許可路徑。團隊還公開兩項對自己不利的論點——為一支疫苗解決冷鏈問題，可能反而抽掉了資助與維護那套所有其他疫苗都依賴的共用冷鏈基礎設施的理由；以及既然 WHO 在控溫鏈規則下已允許部分疫苗在 2-8 C 之外運送，蛋白質穩定性或許根本不是真正的瓶頸——並誠實指出自己剩下的缺口：Network for Adolescent and Youth of Africa 無法出席，因此青少年的觀點「在我們目前能報告的內容中仍是一個真正的缺口」。","realWorld_zh":"需求是框在一個具體的失效點上，而不是框在一整個洲：B 型肝炎的出生劑必須在 24 小時內接種；常規疫苗是鋁鹽佐劑的水性懸浮液，無論結凍或過熱都會不可逆地失去效價；而 Turkana 的冷鏈在郡級轉診醫院撐得住，在其下依賴發電機的分郡與外展據點則撐不住——這個郡約 68,700 平方公里，只有八處醫院層級的設施，彼此相距一兩百公里，而有人居住的低地大部分年均溫高於 30 C。SDG 是當檢驗用的，不是當標籤：以 SDG 3 為主，具名指出 3.3、3.8 與 3.b 三個標的，並有一個量化基準（37 C 下 28 天，即 WHO 控溫鏈條件）；SDG 9 與 SDG 10 為輔；並明確聲明這些是意圖貢獻，而不是已量測的成果。他們完全不去主張第四個與環境相關的 SDG，並寫明去掉冷藏與尖銳廢棄物固然可能減少部分材料與能源需求，但高分子貼片、無菌包裝與製造本身都有衝擊，因此在提出任何環境主張之前需要先做生命週期評估——這樣的拒絕比一個主張更罕見、也更可信。一張取捨對照表把每一項可能的好處與它的風險、以及要判定它需要量測什麼配成一組（例如：讓接種更貼近家門，對上把工作推給本已吃緊的社區衛生工作者，衡量指標為訓練時數、工作負荷、追蹤情形與使用者偏好）。法規路徑走的是肯亞自己的 Pharmacy and Poisons Board，而不是某條外部或平行的途徑。在公平性上，他們承諾貼片不可以變成一個比較便宜、支援比較少，而且只提供給衛生體系資源較匱乏之處的選項，而未來任何使用都必須具備與其他疫苗形式相同的安全性、劑量與保護力證據——落實的做法是把 HePatch 拿去和孩子原本會接種的疫苗比較，而不是和不接種比較，因為「拿我們的選項去和什麼都沒有比，會讓它看起來比實際更好」。他們現在的主張有明確邊界：抗原候選已設計並測試；沒有完整的耐熱疫苗貼片；也沒有證明排放更低、成本更低或接種覆蓋率提升。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6422/wiki/human-practices/kenya-1.avif","caption":"Conversations with practitioners in Kenya, designed as a falsification test of the project's own premise that cold-chain dependence is the main barrier to hepatitis B vaccination","credit":"Team UiOslo-Norway, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"與肯亞實務工作者的對話，被設計成對專案自身前提（冷鏈依賴是 B 型肝炎接種的主要障礙）的一次否證檢驗"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6422/wiki/human-practices/kenya-2.avif","caption":"The Turkana and Nairobi conversations were held separately because the team expected - and found - that the two settings would answer the cold-chain question differently","credit":"Team UiOslo-Norway, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"Turkana 與 Nairobi 的對話分開進行，因為團隊預期——也確實發現——兩個場域對冷鏈這個問題會給出不同的答案"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6422/wiki/human-practices/kenya-3.avif","caption":"Engagement with Youth and Urbanism, the Nairobi youth-led organisation whose licensing and stigma critique turned HePatch's benefit into a conditional, setting-specific claim","credit":"Team UiOslo-Norway, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"與 Youth and Urbanism 的互動；這個 Nairobi 青年主導組織對許可與汙名的批評，把 HePatch 的效益改寫成一項有條件、因場域而異的主張"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6422/wiki/education/gruppebildemheplatket.avif","caption":"The team with the HePatch model during public education work, which ran from kindergarten sessions to the Forskningstorget research fair","credit":"Team UiOslo-Norway, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"團隊在公眾教育活動中與 HePatch 模型合影；這些活動從幼兒園場次一路做到 Forskningstorget 科研展"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Design the stakeholder conversation as a falsification test, stating in advance which answer would undercut the project, then publish it when it partly does - and close every round with a three-column box naming the previous assumption, the new approach and the updated framing, so integration is auditable rather than asserted.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/uioslo-norway/","https://2026.igem.wiki/uioslo-norway/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/uioslo-norway/dialogues","https://2026.igem.wiki/uioslo-norway/sustainability","https://2026.igem.wiki/uioslo-norway/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/uioslo-norway/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/uioslo-norway/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/uioslo-norway/education"],"projectTitle_zh":"HePatch","tagline_zh":"一種為可溶解微針貼片設計的耐熱 B 型肝炎表面抗原——以及對這到底是不是對的問題的一次嚴厲檢視","summary_zh":"HePatch 把 B 型肝炎表面抗原（HBsAg）改造成具熱穩定性，使其能以可溶解微針貼片在沒有冷鏈的情況下遞送，並以 WHO 控溫鏈條件（37 C 下 28 天）作為基準。乾實驗為一個 238 個殘基的 E. coli 構築體評分了 2,260 個 ESM2/Rosetta 取代，經 ddG 篩選後保留 989 個，並為實驗檯排出候選順序。真正讓這支團隊與眾不同的是，他們把專案拿到倫理學者、法律學者、挪威國家研究倫理委員會、肯亞盛行率最高郡的一位醫官，以及 Nairobi 非正式聚落中一個青年主導組織面前——然後把這些人戳破專案自身前提的地方公開出來。每一輪利害關係人互動都以一個「What changed?」方框收尾，寫明原先的假設、新的做法與更新後的框定。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"把利害關係人對話設計成一次否證檢驗：事先說明哪一種答案會削弱自己的專案，然後在它真的部分被削弱時照樣公開——並在每一輪結束時以一個三欄方框寫明原先的假設、新的做法與更新後的框定，讓整合是可稽核的，而不是嘴上說的。","awards_zh":["最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"rank":21},"6426":{"team":"CAU-China","id":"6426","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"Food & Nutrition","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/cau-china/","projectTitle":"Fungal Sentinel, with the OptiX phone spectrometer","projectTitle_zh":"Fungal Sentinel，搭配 OptiX 手機光譜儀","tagline":"A $12 to $30 phone-based spectrometer and the two-client software stack that turns one RAW photograph into a concentration with an uncertainty attached.","tagline_zh":"一台 12 到 30 美元的手機光譜儀，加上一組雙端軟體堆疊，把一張 RAW 照片變成一個附帶不確定度的濃度值。","summary":"CAU-China built Fungal Sentinel, engineered yeast that senses mould volatiles such as 1-octen-3-ol through a GPCR and reports them as fluorescence, and then built the instrument to read it where the mould actually is. OptiX is a pocket spectrometer that uses the phone's own camera as the detector: a threaded interchangeable excitation source, a sample chamber with light-trap fins, a collection module, a frosted-glass slit, a transmission grating, and two USB-C reference lamps that calibrate wavelength and spectral response per device. The software is two programs implementing one written specification, a Python reference implementation and an Android deployment client, held together by a parity test suite that enforces numerical agreement between them. The result is quantitative fluorescence with a limit of detection of 0.81 nM purified EGFP on an early build with no emission filter.","summary_zh":"CAU-China 做了 Fungal Sentinel——一種工程酵母，透過 GPCR 感測 1-octen-3-ol 等黴菌揮發物，並以螢光回報——接著又做了儀器，好在黴菌真正出現的地方讀取訊號。OptiX 是一台口袋型光譜儀，直接用手機自己的相機當偵測器：可螺紋互換的激發光源、帶有擋光鰭片的樣品室、收集模組、毛玻璃狹縫、穿透式繞射光柵，以及兩個 USB-C 參考燈，用來逐機校正波長與光譜響應。軟體是依同一份書面規格寫出的兩個程式：一個 Python 參考實作與一個 Android 部署端，由一組對等性測試套件把兩者的數值結果綁在一起。成果是可定量的螢光量測：在尚未加裝發射濾片的早期版本上，純化 EGFP 的偵測極限為 0.81 nM。","awards":["Best Hardware — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Food & Nutrition Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Five explicit hardware DBTL cycles, each stated as a bottleneck that the previous cycle exposed: separate wavelengths, reject excitation, calibrate wavelengths, block ambient light, collect fluorescence. The software is organised as one shared specification implemented twice, with a parity suite that holds the Python and Android implementations to identical expectations on the algorithms they share, so that a field result and a desk result are the same number rather than two approximations of it. Every validation result is accompanied by its limitations.","frameworks_zh":"五個明確的硬體 DBTL 循環，每一輪都以前一輪暴露出的瓶頸來陳述：分離波長、排除激發光、校正波長、阻絕環境光、收集螢光。軟體則組織成「一份共用規格、實作兩次」，並以對等性測試套件要求 Python 與 Android 兩個實作在共用演算法上給出完全一致的預期結果，使現場量到的數字與桌上算出的數字是同一個數，而不是它的兩個近似值。每一項驗證結果都附上自己的限制。","dataviz":"An interactive light-path simulation in which the reader drags a spectrum to trace a chosen wavelength through the instrument; an exploded CAD view with numbered, selectable components; row-wise intensity profiles of the three Bayer channels inside the automatically detected spectral band with dynamic peak windows shaded and fitted centroids marked, plotted against a converted wavelength axis; held-out-point calibration residual plots; per-channel absolute response curves inside a dual mask with the response-proportional fusion weights shown as a partition of unity and the channel crossover wavelengths labelled; standard curves with insets marking the limit of detection as a dashed line and the limit of quantification as dotted.","dataviz_zh":"一個互動式光路模擬，讀者可以拖動光譜，追蹤某個選定波長在儀器中的行進路徑；一張爆炸圖式的 CAD 視圖，元件都有編號可點選；自動偵測出的光譜帶內三個 Bayer 通道的逐列強度分布圖，動態峰值視窗以陰影標示、擬合出的質心也標出，橫軸已換算為波長；保留點校正殘差圖；雙重遮罩內各通道的絕對響應曲線，與響應成正比的融合權重以「和為一」的分割方式呈現，並標註通道交越波長；標準曲線附有放大圖，以虛線標示偵測極限、點線標示定量極限。","datascience":"This is an unusually complete instrument-to-number pipeline. Raw pixel values are first made physical: exposure time is read from TIFF/EXIF tag 33434 and the sensor black level from DNG tag 50714, and the frame is normalised to (raw minus black level) over exposure time, so what leaves the first stage is proportional to a photon flux rate rather than to brightness. Wavelength calibration is two-point by design and validated on a held-out channel: blue and red LED peaks fit a linear pixel-to-wavelength model, the green peak at a nominal 522.5 nm is deliberately excluded from the fit and used only to turn a pixel residual into a wavelength error (reported as +15.3 px, i.e. +5.57 nm), with quality grades of PASS at 2.5 nm or better, WARNING to 10 nm and FAILED beyond, and a FAILED calibration blocking downstream steps unless explicitly overridden. Peaks are located inside valley-bounded windows and refined by a log-parabola vertex fit accepted only if the curvature is negative and the vertex falls inside the window, with a half-height edge midpoint as fallback, windows containing multiple local maxima tagged suspect, and the legacy intensity-weighted centroid still reported as a diagnostic so a reviewer can see how much the estimator choice mattered. Spectral response is measured per channel against a NICHIA white LED whose spectral power distribution the manufacturer publishes, inside a dual mask restricting the estimate to wavelengths both inside the usable 430 to 660 nm band and lit strongly enough, and the team deliberately does not smooth the response curves (smoothing fabricates detail the sensor never measured, exactly where the response is least trustworthy) and does not normalise them to each other (that would destroy the relative magnitudes that say which channel to trust where). Order of operations is enforced rather than suggested: blank subtraction is additive and clipped at zero before averaging so a noisy blank cannot produce a negative spectrum, then response division is applied only where the response exceeds 20% of its maximum and reported as zero elsewhere, because dividing before subtracting would multiply the background up as well. Spikes are removed by a local median-absolute-deviation test with a 2% amplitude floor so the filter does not fire on flat regions. Quantification uses spectral unmixing rather than band integration: the sample spectrum is fitted pointwise over an emission window as a linear combination of the measured reference emission shape (taken as the highest standard minus its own blank, on this instrument, not an idealised literature spectrum), the measured blank carrying scatter and Raman structure, and a constant offset, solved by ordinary least squares, with the metric being the fitted coefficient times the area under the reference emission. Because scatter and offset are fitted out before integration, the background no longer sets the detection floor, and with scattered excitation about 100 times stronger than EGFP emission at the lowest levels the unmixing gives a limit of detection ten times lower than blank subtraction alone (0.81 nM versus 7.8 nM). Three safeguards are built around it: automatic and auditable reference selection with a diagnostic naming every candidate's in-window area, a window that starts just beyond the measured scatter peak rather than a fixed symmetric band, and a t-test on the calibration slope (t below 3 is reported as not significant with the LoD and LoQ flagged unreliable rather than printed). Detection limits follow the IUPAC convention from the residual standard deviation of the fitted curve, LoD = 3.3 s_yx / slope and LoQ = 10 s_yx / slope, with weighted regression supported for the heteroscedastic, approximately Poisson character of fluorescence data, and the reported LoD taken from the lowest exposure block whose slope is significant with that provenance printed beside it. Saved calibration curves are re-fitted on import and rejected if the stored slope or intercept do not reproduce, so a hand-edited preset cannot silently change a result. Validation covers accuracy and dynamic range (0.81 nM LoD, linear 6.6 to 1684 nM, recovery 80 to 120%), EGFP in living yeast, mCherry in E. coli, OD600 against a bench spectrophotometer (R2 0.994, slope 1.02), absorbance spectra matched against a Nanodrop, and stability over 27 minutes at 0.30% coefficient of variation with all 14 stability criteria passed. Limitations are published alongside: the lowest standard was still detected so the LoD is extrapolated, and long 16-second exposures read lower than short ones for reasons not yet resolved.","datascience_zh":"這是一條罕見地完整的「從儀器到數字」處理流程。原始像素值先被還原成物理量：曝光時間從 TIFF/EXIF 標籤 33434 讀取、感測器黑階從 DNG 標籤 50714 讀取，整張影格再正規化為（原始值減黑階）除以曝光時間，因此第一階段的輸出與光子通量速率成正比，而不是與亮度成正比。波長校正刻意採兩點法，並以一個保留在外的通道驗證：藍光與紅光 LED 的峰值用來擬合像素到波長的線性模型，標稱 522.5 nm 的綠光峰值刻意不納入擬合，只用來把像素殘差換算成波長誤差（報告值為 +15.3 px，即 +5.57 nm）；品質等級為 2.5 nm 以內 PASS、10 nm 以內 WARNING、更差則 FAILED，而 FAILED 的校正會阻擋後續步驟，除非明確覆寫。峰值在以谷為邊界的視窗內定位，再以對數拋物線的頂點擬合細修，而且只有在曲率為負、頂點又落在視窗內時才被接受，否則退回以半高邊緣中點取值；視窗內若有多個局部極大值則標記為可疑；舊版的強度加權質心仍作為診斷資訊一併報告，讓審閱者看得出估計方法的選擇影響有多大。光譜響應逐通道量測，對照一顆 NICHIA 白光 LED（原廠公布其光譜功率分布），並以雙重遮罩把估計限制在同時落在可用的 430 至 660 nm 波段、且照度足夠的波長範圍內；團隊刻意不對響應曲線做平滑（平滑會在響應最不可信的地方，憑空製造出感測器從未量到的細節），也刻意不把各通道彼此正規化（那會破壞「在哪個波段該信哪個通道」所依賴的相對量值）。運算順序是強制的，不是建議：空白值的扣除以加法進行，並在平均前截斷於零，使雜訊大的空白不會產生負的光譜；接著只在響應超過其最大值 20% 的波長範圍內除以響應，其餘回報為零——因為先除再減會把背景一起放大。突刺以局部的中位數絕對偏差檢定去除，並設 2% 的振幅下限，使濾波器不會在平坦區段誤觸發。定量採用光譜解混，而非波段積分：樣品光譜在發射視窗內逐點擬合，視為三者的線性組合——實測的參考發射形狀（取最高濃度標準品減去其自身空白，而且是在這台儀器上量的，不是理想化的文獻光譜）、帶有散射與拉曼結構的實測空白，以及一個常數偏移——以普通最小平方法求解，而指標則是擬合係數乘以參考發射曲線下的面積。由於散射與偏移在積分之前就被擬合掉，背景不再決定偵測下限；在最低濃度時散射的激發光約比 EGFP 發射強 100 倍，而解混得到的偵測極限比單純扣空白低了十倍（0.81 nM 對 7.8 nM）。外圍還有三道防護：參考光譜的選取是自動且可稽核的，診斷資訊會列出每個候選在視窗內的面積；發射視窗的起點設在實測散射峰之後，而不是用一個固定的對稱波段；以及對校正曲線斜率做 t 檢定（t 小於 3 即報告為不顯著，LoD 與 LoQ 會被標記為不可靠，而不是逕自印出）。偵測極限依 IUPAC 慣例，由擬合曲線的殘差標準差計算：LoD = 3.3 s_yx / 斜率、LoQ = 10 s_yx / 斜率；並支援加權迴歸，以處理螢光資料變異數不齊、近似泊松分布的特性；所報告的 LoD 取自斜率具顯著性的最低曝光區塊，並在旁邊註明其出處。已儲存的校正曲線在匯入時會重新擬合，若儲存的斜率或截距無法重現就直接拒收，因此手動改過的預設檔無法悄悄改變結果。驗證涵蓋準確度與動態範圍（LoD 0.81 nM、線性範圍 6.6 至 1684 nM、回收率 80 至 120%）、活酵母中的 EGFP、E. coli 中的 mCherry、與桌上型分光光度計對照的 OD600（R2 0.994、斜率 1.02）、與 Nanodrop 對照的吸收光譜，以及 27 分鐘內的穩定性（變異係數 0.30%，14 項穩定性判準全部通過）。限制也一併公開：最低濃度的標準品仍然被測到，所以 LoD 是外推得出的；而 16 秒的長曝光讀值會低於短曝光，原因尚未釐清。","software":"FSSA (Fungal Sentinel Spectral Analyzer), a Python desktop reference implementation requiring Python 3.10 or later with numpy, scipy, matplotlib and tifffile, with pytest for the test suite and no network access at any stage; MycoSpec, the Kotlin Android client built on Camera2 RAW that reimplements the validated pipeline natively so a RAW-capable phone performs the whole analysis on device; and a CSV Data Cleaner that prepares lamp spectral power distributions from plot-digitised datasheet points, clipping negatives, dropping duplicate wavelengths and resampling onto a 1 nm grid using shape-preserving PCHIP interpolation specifically because a natural cubic spline would overshoot and invent emission structure that is not in the datasheet. Both programs are released under the Apache License 2.0, on GitHub (github.com/LittleSky-CN/Fungal-Sentinel-Spectral-Analyzer and github.com/LittleSky-CN/Mycospec) and mirrored on iGEM GitLab (gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/cau-china/). The instrument itself is modelled and rendered from a Fusion 360 assembly, and the team cites the open-source smartphone spectrophotometer literature it builds on.","software_zh":"FSSA（Fungal Sentinel Spectral Analyzer）是 Python 桌面參考實作，需要 Python 3.10 或更新版本，搭配 numpy、scipy、matplotlib 與 tifffile，測試套件使用 pytest，而且全程不需網路連線；MycoSpec 是以 Kotlin 寫的 Android 端，建立在 Camera2 RAW 之上，把已驗證的流程原生重寫一次，因此支援 RAW 的手機就能在裝置上完成整套分析；另有一支 CSV Data Cleaner，用來把從原廠規格書圖表數位化取得的點整理成燈具的光譜功率分布，會截掉負值、刪除重複波長，並以保形的 PCHIP 內插重新取樣到 1 nm 的網格——之所以指定 PCHIP，是因為自然三次樣條會過衝，憑空造出規格書中沒有的發射結構。兩個程式都以 Apache License 2.0 釋出，放在 GitHub（github.com/LittleSky-CN/Fungal-Sentinel-Spectral-Analyzer 與 github.com/LittleSky-CN/Mycospec），並在 iGEM GitLab（gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/cau-china/）上有鏡像。儀器本身以 Fusion 360 組件建模與算圖，團隊也引用了他們所依據的開源手機分光光度計文獻。","stack":["Phone CMOS sensor with RAW (DNG) capture","600 to 1200 line/mm transmission grating","NICHIA NFSW757DT reference white LED with published SPD","USB-C powered positioning and calibration lamp PCBs","Fusion 360","3D printing","Python (numpy, scipy, matplotlib, tifffile, pytest)","Kotlin / Android Camera2 RAW","PCHIP (Fritsch-Carlson) interpolation","Apache License 2.0"],"techniques":["Exposure and black-level normalisation to photon flux rate","Two-point wavelength calibration validated on a held-out channel","Log-parabola vertex peak fitting with fallback and suspect flagging","Per-device, per-channel absolute spectral response calibration","Dual masking to avoid estimating response from noise","Enforced subtract-then-divide order with a guarded division","MAD-based local spike removal with an amplitude floor","Spectral unmixing against a measured reference emission shape","IUPAC LoD and LoQ from residual standard deviation","Weighted regression for heteroscedastic fluorescence data","Slope significance testing before reporting a detection limit","Exposure-block LoD selection with printed provenance","Calibration preset re-validation on load","Cross-implementation parity testing"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"An age-inclusive education programme spanning a science summer camp, one-day lectures, science-themed orienteering and community talks, reaching preschool and primary children through to university students and older adults, with biosensor concepts tied to everyday mould-prevention practice and courseware tailored per age group. Every activity and its stakeholder feedback was documented and used to revise the next session.","publicEngagement_zh":"一套跨年齡的教育計畫，包含科學夏令營、單日講座、科學主題定向越野與社區講座，受眾從學前與國小兒童一路到大學生與年長者，把生物感測器的概念與日常防黴做法扣在一起，教材也依年齡層分別調整。每一項活動與其利害關係人回饋都有記錄，並用來修訂下一場。","ihp":"Integrated Human Practices is organised through an F-Ring model with four stakeholder groups (Fungal, Feasibility, Field, Future) and a Focus-Finding-Feedback conversation structure, with each conversation routed back into the DBTL cycle. The project's origin is a reported need rather than an assumed one: students in Science and Technology Backyards in Malawi and Zambia described smallholder farmers in remote and resource-limited communities relying on visual inspection because laboratory testing is too costly, large, maintenance-heavy and technically demanding, and missing early-stage or hidden fungal contamination.","ihp_zh":"整合式人類實踐以一個 F-Ring 模型組織，含四個利害關係人群組（Fungal、Feasibility、Field、Future）與 Focus-Finding-Feedback 的對談結構，每一次對談都導回 DBTL 循環。專案的起點是被實際回報的需求，而不是假想出來的：在馬拉威與尚比亞「科技小院」的學生描述，偏遠且資源有限社區的小農只能靠目視檢查，因為實驗室檢測太貴、設備太大、維護負擔重又有技術門檻，結果錯過早期或隱藏的真菌污染。","realWorld":"The entrepreneurship work treats the device as a product and tests that hypothesis against real users, opening with questions the lab cannot answer: who would own the device, a farmer, a cooperative, a warehouse or an extension station; who keeps it working after the pilot ends and who replaces a broken light source three hundred kilometres from the nearest city; how much a household living on stored grain would pay; and what happens if a farmer receives a warning they cannot act on. The technical case is framed around coverage as much as cost, since fungal contamination in stored maize is unevenly distributed by location, depth and batch, so a method that can only analyse a few transported samples cannot represent the warehouse. The hardware is explicitly dual-purpose, usable as a general pocket spectrophotometer, fluorometer or spectrometer by other teams simply by changing the light source.","realWorld_zh":"創業部分把這台裝置當成產品，並拿真實使用者檢驗這個假設，開場就是實驗室回答不了的問題：這台裝置該由誰擁有——農民、合作社、倉庫，還是農業推廣站；試辦結束後由誰維護，在距離最近城市三百公里的地方，光源壞了由誰換；一個靠存糧生活的家庭願意付多少錢；以及如果農民收到一個他無力處理的警示，會發生什麼事。技術面的論述同樣看重覆蓋率而不只是成本，因為儲存玉米的真菌污染在位置、深度與批次之間分布不均，所以只能分析少數運送出去的樣本的方法，無法代表整座倉庫。硬體明確設計為雙用途：其他隊伍只要換掉光源，就能把它當成一般的口袋型分光光度計、螢光計或光譜儀使用。","partners":["Science and Technology Backyards (Malawi and Zambia)","China Agricultural University"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6426/wiki/optix-wiki-package/images/design/hero-cad-render.avif","caption":"OptiX, the phone-based spectrometer, rendered from the team's Fusion 360 assembly. Materials cost $12 to $30 per unit excluding the optional filter, because the most expensive component, the detector, is the camera the user already owns.","caption_zh":"OptiX 手機光譜儀，由團隊的 Fusion 360 組件算圖產生。不含選購濾片時每台材料成本 12 到 30 美元，因為最貴的元件——偵測器——就是使用者本來就有的相機。","credit":"Team CAU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6426/wiki/optix-wiki-package/images/design/exploded-view-cad.avif","caption":"Exploded view of the instrument: interchangeable excitation source, light shields, sample chamber with light-trap fins, collection module, frosted-glass slit, diffraction grating and phone-holder assembly. Excitation enters the cuvette from the side and fluorescence is collected at 90 degrees.","caption_zh":"儀器的爆炸圖：可互換的激發光源、遮光罩、帶擋光鰭片的樣品室、收集模組、毛玻璃狹縫、繞射光柵與手機固定座。激發光從側面進入樣品槽，螢光則在 90 度方向收集。","credit":"Team CAU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6426/wiki/optix-wiki-package/images/design/software-wavelength-calibration.avif","caption":"Two-point wavelength calibration validated on a held-out channel. Only the blue and red LED peaks enter the linear pixel-to-wavelength fit; the green peak is predicted from its nominal 522.5 nm and its residual becomes the accuracy the per-device calibration preset must hold.","caption_zh":"以保留在外的通道驗證的兩點波長校正。只有藍光與紅光 LED 的峰值進入像素到波長的線性擬合；綠光峰值則由其標稱的 522.5 nm 預測，而其殘差就成為逐機校正預設檔必須達到的準確度。","credit":"Team CAU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6426/wiki/optix-wiki-package/images/validation/accuracy-standard-curve.avif","caption":"EGFP standard curve with the lowest exposure block inset, marking the limit of detection as a dashed line and the limit of quantification as dotted. Both follow the IUPAC convention from the residual standard deviation of the fit, giving 0.81 nM on an early build with no emission filter.","caption_zh":"EGFP 標準曲線，附最低曝光區塊的放大圖，以虛線標示偵測極限、點線標示定量極限。兩者都依 IUPAC 慣例由擬合的殘差標準差計算，在尚未加裝發射濾片的早期版本上得到 0.81 nM。","credit":"Team CAU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Write the analysis as a specification first, then implement it twice and hold the two implementations to a parity test suite; and inside that specification, validate the calibration on a point you deliberately held out of the fit, fit the background out of the signal rather than subtracting a band, and refuse to print a detection limit when the calibration slope is not statistically significant.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"先把分析方法寫成規格，再實作兩次，並用一組對等性測試套件把兩個實作綁在一起；而在那份規格裡，用一個刻意從擬合中保留在外的點來驗證校正、把背景從訊號中擬合掉而不是直接扣掉一整段波段，並且在校正曲線斜率不具統計顯著性時，拒絕印出偵測極限。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/cau-china/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/cau-china/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/cau-china/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/cau-china/integrated-human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/cau-china/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/cau-china/education"],"awards_zh":["最佳硬體 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳食品與營養專案 — 得主"],"rank":40},"6439":{"team":"NFLSHS-CHINA","id":"6439","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nflshs-china/","projectTitle":"CroTeen","projectTitle_zh":"CroTeen","tagline":"Microbial crocetin: a controllable cell-factory supplement to saffron farming, taken all the way to B2B ingredient specs","tagline_zh":"微生物產番紅花酸：一座可控的細胞工廠，作為番紅花農業的補充，而且一路做到 B2B 原料規格","summary":"NFLSHS-China built a fully heterologous crocetin pathway in E. coli (idi, CrtE, CrtB, CrtI, CrtY, CrtZ upstream to zeaxanthin; CsCCD2 plus Neurospora crassa NcALD downstream to free crocetin), then re-engineered it after wet-lab failure from a two-plasmid system into a single-plasmid, two-T7-cassette construct (pET-Ds-Cro) for strain stability under scale-up. They used AlphaFold3, PrankWeb and CB-Dock2 to guide semi-rational mutagenesis of the rate-limiting CsCCD2 enzyme, with the N366G mutant giving a 1.13-fold yield increase confirmed by HPLC. The commercial side is unusually disciplined for a high-school team: a named B2B beachhead, a filed and accepted patent application on the CsCCD2 mutant, two physical MVPs with full formula tables, and an explicit separation of what is designed from what is still unvalidated. They won Best Entrepreneurship and Best Presentation in the High School section.","summary_zh":"NFLSHS-China 在 E. coli 中建出一條完全異源的番紅花酸（crocetin）途徑（上游 idi、CrtE、CrtB、CrtI、CrtY、CrtZ 做到玉米黃素；下游 CsCCD2 加上 Neurospora crassa 的 NcALD 做到游離番紅花酸），在濕實驗失敗後又把它從雙質體系統重新設計成單一質體、兩個 T7 卡匣的構築體（pET-Ds-Cro），以確保放大時的菌株穩定性。他們用 AlphaFold3、PrankWeb 與 CB-Dock2 指導限速酵素 CsCCD2 的半理性突變，其中 N366G 突變體使產量提升 1.13 倍，並經 HPLC 確認。商業那一側對高中團隊來說紀律罕見：一個具名的 B2B 灘頭堡市場、一件已提出並受理的 CsCCD2 突變體專利申請、兩個實體 MVP 與完整的配方表，以及明確區分「已設計完成」與「仍未驗證」。他們拿下高中組的 Best Entrepreneurship 與 Best Presentation。","awards":["Best Presentation — Winner (High School)","Best Entrepreneurship — Winner (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Lean Canvas (problem, solution, UVP, key metrics, customer segments, channels, unfair advantage, cost structure, revenue streams), TAM-SAM-SOM with an explicit refusal to take a percentage of the macro market, SWOT, a risk-assessment matrix, a stage-gated Gantt chart from 2026 to 2032, three named exit options, and Techno-Economic Analysis plus Life Cycle Assessment named as future obligations.","frameworks_zh":"精實畫布（問題、解方、UVP、關鍵指標、客群、通路、不公平優勢、成本結構、營收來源）、TAM-SAM-SOM（並明確拒絕直接從宏觀市場取一個百分比）、SWOT、一張風險評估矩陣、一張從 2026 到 2032 年的階段關卡式甘特圖、三個具名的退場選項，以及把技術經濟分析（TEA）與生命週期評估（LCA）列為未來的義務。","dataviz":"Nineteen numbered entrepreneurship figures: pathway maps for the two-plasmid and single-plasmid constructs, the biomanufacturing-to-application three-stage chain, a capability-gap table, a partnership-network map with a disclaimer about which relationships are confirmed, a risk matrix, a SWOT quadrant and an SDG panel. HPLC chromatograms carry the quantitative claims.","dataviz_zh":"19 張編號的創業圖表：雙質體與單一質體構築體的途徑圖、從生物製造到應用的三段鏈、一張能力缺口表、一張附有「哪些關係已確認」聲明的合作網路圖、一張風險矩陣、一個 SWOT 四象限，以及一張 SDG 面板。量化主張則由 HPLC 層析圖承載。","datascience":"HPLC quantification of crocetin as the core analytical readout; mutant screening comparing predicted variants against measured titre (N366G at 1.13x). No fermentation kinetics model or cost model with numbers.","datascience_zh":"核心的分析讀值是以 HPLC 定量番紅花酸；突變體篩選則把預測出的變異體與實測產量相比（N366G 為 1.13 倍）。沒有發酵動力學模型，也沒有帶數字的成本模型。","software":"","stack":["AlphaFold3","PrankWeb","CB-Dock2","HPLC","pET-Duet-1 backbone","E. coli BL21(DE3)","E. coli DH5-alpha"],"techniques":["heterologous carotenoid pathway assembly","single-plasmid multi-cassette expression with RBS re-tuning","semi-rational enzyme engineering from binding-pocket prediction","site-directed mutagenesis","vacuum freeze-drying and bead-beating extraction","soft-capsule and essence-oil formulation"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"An online survey plus street interviews run 12-17 March 2026 across mixed demographics found over 60 percent of respondents had never heard of crocetin and routinely confused it with crocin, and that over 40 percent would pay only 5-10 RMB per day for a mood-soothing product. That cognitive gap triggered a dedicated education page and a Xiaohongshu (Rednote) account translating biosynthesis into public infographics. They also presented at the 10th iSCRM and the 1st Grand APiC conference, and built peer resources after hearing that team members elsewhere felt unsure their assigned role mattered.","publicEngagement_zh":"2026 年 3 月 12 至 17 日進行的線上問卷加街訪，涵蓋不同人口背景，發現超過 60% 的受訪者從沒聽過番紅花酸，而且常把它和番紅花苷（crocin）搞混；另有超過 40% 表示，一款舒緩情緒的產品他們每天只願意付 5-10 RMB。這個認知落差促成了一個專門的教育頁面，以及一個把生合成轉譯成公眾資訊圖表的小紅書（Rednote）帳號。他們也在第 10 屆 iSCRM 與第 1 屆 Grand APiC 會議上發表，並在聽說其他團隊的成員覺得自己被分配到的角色不重要之後，做了給同儕的資源。","ihp":"Five explicitly staged iHP phases, each written as motivation, action and integration, with dates and named interlocutors. Phase I traced the supply chain to source: an online interview with Iranian saffron grower Ali Norouzi (17 March) produced concrete constraints (15-20 day harvest window, 1-2 g dried saffron per person per day, water shortage, currency volatility), and visits to Daofengtang Rende TCM Clinic and chain pharmacies produced a real price point of 60-90 RMB per gram and the observation that pharmacies barely stock it. Phase II is the strongest: after near-zero crocetin yield on 12 May, Dr Huang Danqiong diagnosed metabolic burden and plasmid instability and told them to collapse to a single plasmid, which they did; Prof Huang Guanqin then reviewed the single-plasmid circuit against scale-up cost on 20 June; Fapon's technical director on 22 July pushed them off blind screening onto AI-guided rational design. Phase III used Associate Professor Li Chenyang twice to kill an unstable aqueous formulation on physicochemical grounds and pick the oil and capsule routes, and a perfumer, Ms Weng, taught the actual blending process. Phase IV took the business plan to Attorney Zhang on 17 September for NMPA/FDA classification, licensing and labelling risk, which changed their claims language across the wiki and social media. This is iHP that visibly rewrote both the construct and the marketing copy.","ihp_zh":"五個明確分期的 iHP 階段，每一期都寫成動機、行動與整合三段，並附日期與具名對談者。第一期把供應鏈追到源頭：與伊朗番紅花種植者 Ali Norouzi 的線上訪談（3 月 17 日）帶回具體限制（15-20 天的採收時間窗、每人每天 1-2 g 乾番紅花、缺水、幣值波動），而走訪 Daofengtang Rende TCM Clinic 與連鎖藥局則得到每克 60-90 RMB 的真實價格點，以及一個觀察：藥局幾乎不備貨。第二期最強：在 5 月 12 日番紅花酸產量幾近於零之後，Dr Huang Danqiong 診斷出代謝負擔與質體不穩定，並要他們收斂成單一質體，他們照做；接著 Prof Huang Guanqin 在 6 月 20 日針對放大成本審視了單一質體迴路；而 Fapon 的技術總監在 7 月 22 日把他們從盲篩推向 AI 指導的理性設計。第三期兩度請教 Li Chenyang 副教授，依物理化學理由否決了一個不穩定的水性配方，並選定油劑與膠囊兩條路線；另有一位調香師 Weng 女士親自教了實際的調配流程。第四期在 9 月 17 日把營運計畫帶去找 Zhang 律師，處理 NMPA/FDA 分類、許可與標示風險，而這改變了他們在整個 wiki 與社群媒體上的訴求用語。這是一份看得見地同時改寫了構築體與行銷文案的 iHP。","realWorld":"This is a real venture attempt, not a canvas exercise. The business model is specifically B2B-first: the beachhead is small-to-medium functional skincare brands and boutique cosmetic R&D labs, chosen because they have shorter decision cycles than multinationals, and the first deliverable is explicitly not a consumer product but standardised samples plus HPLC chromatograms to support a customer's own formulation prototyping. Market evidence is real but qualitative: interviews across the full chain (Iranian grower, TCM clinic and pharmacies, boutique formulators, Fapon, an iGEM-mentor founder, a lawyer), a public survey with reported percentages and a willingness-to-pay band, and a visit to Shenzhen University's fermentation facility. They refuse to multiply the roughly USD 2.0 billion TAM by a made-up share and instead say SOM must be computed from reachable R&D nodes times sample volume per test, which is the correct instinct even though they then do not finish the arithmetic. Hard assets exist: a patent application, Carotenoid Cleavage Dioxygenase 2 Mutant, Preparation Method and Application, filed and accepted, and two physical MVPs with published formula tables down to percentages (essence oil at 0.03 percent crocetin, 0.5 percent vitamin E in cold-pressed olive oil; capsule at 70 percent crocetin-olive oil, 15 percent L-theanine, 13 percent soy lecithin, 2 percent vitamin E). The regulatory path is credible and specific, naming NMPA and FDA classification, production and distribution licensing, and the prohibition on medical claims, with a consequence they actually implemented, standardising functional claims site-wide. The continuation plan is a stage-gated Gantt from 2026 lab validation through 2027 customer testing, 2028 CDMO pilot and 2029 B2B commercialisation to 2030-2032 international registration, where each gate has named prerequisite resources and a numeric-in-principle pass condition, plus three exit routes (trade sale to BASF, Givaudan or DSM-Firmenich; technology licensing with royalties; VC/PE buyout). What is genuinely missing is the money: there are no unit economics, no cost of goods, no price per gram, no funding raised, no registered entity and no incubator place, and the partnership map carries its own honest disclaimer that everything except university support and paid service relationships is a prospective contact rather than a formal agreement. They also list, in their own words, the data still absent before industrialisation, including yield, purity, recovery, batch consistency and pilot-scale mutant validation. Even the downside is faced squarely, including the possibility that fermentation's carbon footprint exceeds agriculture's and that cheap biomanufacturing could destroy saffron growers' livelihoods, for which they propose market segmentation that leaves the high-end plant premium alone.","realWorld_zh":"這是一次真正的創業嘗試，不是畫布作業。商業模式明確以 B2B 為先：灘頭堡是中小型功能性保養品牌與精品化妝品研發實驗室，選它們的理由是決策週期比跨國企業短；而第一項交付成果明確不是消費品，而是標準化樣品加上 HPLC 層析圖，用來支持客戶自己做配方原型。市場證據是真實但偏質性的：橫跨整條鏈的訪談（伊朗種植者、中醫診所與藥局、精品配方商、Fapon、一位擔任 iGEM 導師的創辦人、一位律師）、一份有回報百分比與願付價格區間的公眾問卷，以及一次深圳大學發酵設施的參訪。他們拒絕把約 20 億美元的 TAM 乘上一個憑空想像的佔比，而是說 SOM 必須由「可觸及的研發節點數」乘上「每次測試的樣品量」算出來——這個直覺是對的，儘管他們後來並沒有把算式做完。硬資產確實存在：一件已提出並受理的專利申請「類胡蘿蔔素裂解雙加氧酶 2 突變體、製備方法與應用」，以及兩個實體 MVP，配方表公開到百分比（精華油為 0.03% 番紅花酸、0.5% 維生素 E，基底為冷壓橄欖油；膠囊為 70% 番紅花酸橄欖油、15% L-茶胺酸、13% 大豆卵磷脂、2% 維生素 E）。法規路徑可信且具體，點名 NMPA 與 FDA 的分類、生產與配銷許可，以及禁止醫療宣稱，而且他們真的落實了一項後果：把全站的功能性訴求用語統一標準化。後續計畫是一張階段關卡式甘特圖，從 2026 年的實驗驗證，經 2027 年的客戶測試、2028 年的 CDMO 試量產、2029 年的 B2B 商業化，到 2030-2032 年的國際註冊，每一道關卡都有具名的前置資源與原則上可量化的通過條件，另有三條退場路線（出售給 BASF、Givaudan 或 DSM-Firmenich；技術授權收權利金；VC/PE 買下）。真正缺的是錢：沒有單位經濟、沒有銷貨成本、沒有每克售價、沒有募到資金、沒有登記的法人實體、也沒有進駐育成中心；而合作關係地圖自己也誠實聲明，除了大學的支持與付費的服務關係之外，其餘都只是潛在接觸，而非正式協議。他們也用自己的話列出工業化之前仍缺的資料，包括產量、純度、回收率、批次一致性，以及試量產規模的突變體驗證。連不利的一面也正面處理，包括發酵的碳足跡可能超過農業的可能性，以及便宜的生物製造可能摧毀番紅花種植者的生計——對此他們提出市場分區，把高端的植物來源溢價市場留著不動。","partners":["Fapon (biotech company; technical director and business development; AI platform exposure and commercialisation advice)","Shenzhen University (Prof. Wang Chaogang, Prof. Huang Guanqin, Prof. Chen Weizhao; fermentation facility access)","Dr. Huang Danqiong (fermentation expert; diagnosed the two-plasmid failure)","Associate Professor Li Chenyang (formulation and safety screening)","Ali Norouzi (Iranian saffron grower and supplier)","Daofengtang Rende TCM Clinic and local chain pharmacies","Li Shiyuan (founder, Shanghai Transformant Information Technology Co.; iGEM mentor; technical evaluation)","Attorney Zhang (regulatory and IP legal review)","Ms. Weng (perfumer; essential-oil production process)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6439/wiki/entrepreneurship8.avif","caption":"Patent application for the CsCCD2 mutant, filed and accepted, shown on the entrepreneurship page as the project's first hard IP asset","caption_zh":"CsCCD2 突變體的專利申請，已提出並受理，放在創業頁上作為這個專案第一項實質的智財資產","credit":"Team NFLSHS-CHINA, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6439/wiki/entrepreneurship10.avif","caption":"Stage-gated development plan from 2026 laboratory validation through 2029 B2B commercialisation to 2030-2032 international expansion","caption_zh":"階段關卡式開發計畫，從 2026 年實驗室驗證，經 2029 年 B2B 商業化，到 2030-2032 年的國際擴張","credit":"Team NFLSHS-CHINA, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6439/wiki/entrepreneurship9.avif","caption":"Business exit strategy: trade sale to an ingredient major, technology licensing with royalties, or VC/PE buyout","caption_zh":"商業退場策略：出售給大型原料公司、技術授權收權利金，或由 VC/PE 買下","credit":"Team NFLSHS-CHINA, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6439/wiki/entrepreneurship17v2.avif","caption":"SWOT analysis supporting the B2B-first ingredient strategy","caption_zh":"支持 B2B 優先原料策略的 SWOT 分析","credit":"Team NFLSHS-CHINA, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy their honesty architecture: a 'Current Validation Status' block that splits completed designs from data still required, and a partnership map annotated to say which relationships are confirmed and which are merely prospective contacts. Pair it with their stage-gate habit, where each phase of the roadmap names its prerequisite resources and the single pass condition that unlocks the next phase, so a project cannot drift forward on enthusiasm.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"照抄他們的誠實架構：一個「目前驗證狀態」區塊，把已完成的設計與仍需補的資料分開；以及一張合作關係地圖，標註哪些關係已確認、哪些只是潛在接觸。再搭配他們的階段關卡習慣——路線圖的每個階段都寫明所需的前置資源，以及解鎖下一階段的那一個通過條件——這樣專案就無法僅憑熱情往前漂。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/nflshs-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nflshs-china/entrepreneurship/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nflshs-china/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nflshs-china/product/"],"awards_zh":["最佳簡報 — 得主（高中組）","最佳創業 — 得主（高中組）"],"rank":52},"6450":{"team":"IISER-Kolkata","id":"6450","section":"","country":"India","village":"Conservation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/","projectTitle":"FINS","projectTitle_zh":"FINS","tagline":"An estrogen-responsive E. coli biosensor coupled to secreted bacterial laccase, immobilised in PVA-alginate beads as a contained tank inside an existing wastewater treatment train","tagline_zh":"一種對雌激素有反應的 E. coli 生物感測器，與分泌型細菌漆酶串接，固定在 PVA-海藻酸鹽珠體中，作為既有污水處理流程內的一座封閉式槽體","summary":"FINS detects and degrades estrogenic endocrine disruptors (estrone E1, 17beta-estradiol E2, 17alpha-ethinylestradiol EE2) in wastewater. Module 1 uses EdcR, a TetR-family estrogen-dependent repressor from Caenibius tardaugens, expressed constitutively from BBa_J23105 to hold the Pb promoter shut; estrogen de-represses Pb, a T7 RNA polymerase stage amplifies the partial de-repression, and the output is either mScarlet3 (detection build) or secreted 6xHis-tagged BPul laccase from Bacillus pumilus, which oligomerises estrogens by oxidative coupling in the bulk phase. Module 2 is a holin-endolysin kill switch whose trigger was rebuilt from UV/LexA-SOS to RclR with the rclA promoter after wastewater practitioners pointed out Indian plants disinfect with sodium hypochlorite, not UV, on cost grounds. The project is sited as a discrete tank after secondary treatment and before chlorination, so the plant's own disinfection stage doubles as containment. The dry lab is the standout: 13 coupled ODEs, exact Gillespie and Linear Noise Approximation cross-checks, Fisher information and a Cramer-Rao limit of detection, a lattice-Boltzmann packed-bed solve, and a bespoke C++ elastic network solver released as open software.","summary_zh":"FINS 偵測並降解廢水中的雌激素類內分泌干擾物（雌酮 E1、17beta-雌二醇 E2、17alpha-炔雌醇 EE2）。模組 1 使用 EdcR，一個來自 Caenibius tardaugens 的 TetR 家族雌激素依賴型抑制蛋白，由 BBa_J23105 組成型表現，使 Pb 啟動子保持關閉；雌激素會解除對 Pb 的抑制，再由一段 T7 RNA 聚合酶放大這部分去抑制，輸出則是 mScarlet3（偵測版本）或分泌型、帶 6xHis 標籤的 Bacillus pumilus BPul 漆酶，後者在液相中以氧化偶合把雌激素寡聚化。模組 2 是一個 holin-endolysin 自殺開關；在污水處理從業者指出印度的處理廠出於成本考量是以次氯酸鈉而非 UV 消毒之後，其觸發機制從 UV/LexA-SOS 改建為搭配 rclA 啟動子的 RclR。整套系統被設置為二級處理之後、加氯之前的一座獨立槽體，因此處理廠自身的消毒步驟同時兼作生物圍阻。乾實驗是最突出的部分：13 條耦合 ODE、精確 Gillespie 與線性雜訊近似的交互驗證、Fisher 資訊量與 Cramer-Rao 偵測極限、一次格子 Boltzmann 填充床求解，以及一套自行開發、以開源軟體釋出的 C++ 彈性網路求解器。","awards":["Best Presentation — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Conservation Project — Nominee"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A ten-page modelling stack, each page ending in numbers and an explicit uncertainty page that re-derives the uncertainty of the other nine using school-level arithmetic. Deterministic core: 27 mass-action reactions reduced to 13 ODEs under three stated assumptions (well-mixed 1 fL cell so Omega = 0.602192 molecules per nM; mRNA at quasi-steady state since delta_m = 0.231 >> delta_p = 0.0261; one dilution rate for all proteins). Hill repression at the operator fitted directly by least squares in SciPy against digitised fluorescence from Ibero et al. Figure 12, giving K_eff and n = 1.49; the team flags that the repression coefficient was tuned to reproduce the measured leak and is therefore 'an input wearing a prediction's clothes', while every other number is a prediction. A pure elongation calculation from actual construct lengths, with transcription and translation overlapping in E. coli, gives 1.158 min to synthesise and 38.158 min to first photon. Transport: a diffusion-based molecular communication model (built on Adam Noel's framework but for a sustained source rather than a pulse) carrying estrogen from the well through medium, across membrane, to the repressor, justified by measured octanol-water partition coefficients satisfying Overton's rule, with a three-layer cell and conservative-solver mass-balance closure to machine precision. Reactor: a lattice-Boltzmann solve (D3Q19, TRT) of the packed bead bed reproducing porosity to 0.04% and Kozeny-Carman permeability to 0.998x, validated against Zick and Homsy within 2.4%, feeding a geometric depth-removal argument. Structural: AlphaFold 2 (32 models across three runs) on wild-type EdcR, docking of E1 and EE2 to BPul laccase and to the EdcR dimer, plus two independent 100 ns GROMACS MD runs (amber99sb-ildn, TIP3P, GAFF2/AM1-BCC ligand, ~80,300 atoms, 4 fs with hydrogen mass repartitioning).","frameworks_zh":"一套十頁的建模堆疊，每一頁都以數字收尾，另有一頁明確的不確定性分析，用中學程度的算術重新推導其餘九頁的不確定性。決定論核心：27 條質量作用反應在三項明示假設下化簡為 13 條 ODE（均勻混合的 1 fL 細胞，因此 Omega = 0.602192 分子每 nM；mRNA 處於準穩態，因為 delta_m = 0.231 >> delta_p = 0.0261；所有蛋白質採用同一個稀釋率）。操作子處的 Hill 抑制以 SciPy 的最小平方法，直接對 Ibero 等人 Figure 12 中數位化擷取的螢光資料擬合，得到 K_eff 與 n = 1.49；團隊並標示抑制係數是為了重現實測的滲漏而調校出來的，因此是一個穿著預測外衣的輸入值，而其餘每一個數字都是預測。一項純粹的延伸速率計算，依實際構築體長度並考慮 E. coli 中轉錄與轉譯重疊，得到合成需 1.158 分鐘、到第一個光子需 38.158 分鐘。傳輸：一個以擴散為基礎的分子通訊模型（建立在 Adam Noel 的框架上，但針對持續性來源而非脈衝），把雌激素從水體經介質、穿過細胞膜一路帶到抑制蛋白，依據是實測的辛醇-水分配係數符合 Overton 規則，並採用三層細胞模型與守恆型求解器，使質量平衡閉合到機器精度。反應器：一次格子 Boltzmann 求解（D3Q19、TRT）模擬填充珠床，孔隙率重現誤差 0.04%、Kozeny-Carman 滲透率重現至 0.998 倍，並與 Zick 及 Homsy 的結果相符至 2.4% 以內，再餵入一個幾何式的深度去除率論證。結構：對野生型 EdcR 做 AlphaFold 2（三次執行共 32 個模型）、把 E1 與 EE2 分子嵌合到 BPul 漆酶與 EdcR 二聚體上，另有兩次獨立的 100 ns GROMACS 分子動力學模擬（amber99sb-ildn、TIP3P、GAFF2/AM1-BCC 配體、約 80,300 個原子、採氫質量重分配的 4 fs 步長）。","dataviz":"Figures carry their own epistemic status. Dose-response panels overlay the digitised source bars, the Hill fit as a dashed line and the integrated ODE steady state as a solid line, with the unrepressed control marked. Gillespie histograms are drawn under LNA curves for each of the three core species across the estrone sweep. The stochastic dose-response plots single Gillespie cells as dots, their mean with 1 SD bars as circles, and the ODE steady state as a line, on both linear and log axes. Fisher information is plotted per cell against estrone for four constitutive promoter strengths. A dedicated dry-vs-wet figure and a knob-ranges figure put model predictions against what the bench actually produced. An interactive browser Normal Mode Explorer renders modes as per-residue displacement arrows coloured blue to red on the structure, overlays CCP4/MRC density as contour mesh or solid isosurface, and reports cross-correlation before and after flexible fitting.","dataviz_zh":"圖表各自帶著自己的知識論地位。劑量反應圖組疊上數位化擷取的原始長條、以虛線呈現的 Hill 擬合，以及以實線呈現的 ODE 穩態值，並標出未受抑制的對照。Gillespie 直方圖畫在 LNA 曲線之下，涵蓋雌酮掃描中三個核心物種各自的情形。隨機版的劑量反應圖以點表示單一 Gillespie 細胞、以帶 1 個標準差誤差棒的圓圈表示其平均值、以線表示 ODE 穩態，並同時以線性與對數座標呈現。Fisher 資訊量則以每個細胞為單位對雌酮作圖，涵蓋四種組成型啟動子強度。另有一張專門的乾實驗對濕實驗圖與一張參數可調範圍圖，把模型預測與實驗桌上實際做出的結果擺在一起。可互動的瀏覽器版 Normal Mode Explorer 會把模態以每個殘基的位移箭頭、由藍到紅上色疊在結構上，可把 CCP4/MRC 密度以等值線網格或實體等值面疊加，並報告柔性擬合前後的交叉相關係數。","datascience":"The information-theoretic treatment is the strongest in this cohort. One LNA solve per estrone level gives mean and variance of each species; derivatives are taken by central differences with h = 0.01*theta (closed form 6.2560 vs finite difference 6.2559 for the reporter at 322.5 ng/mL). ODE, LNA and exact Gillespie (1,500 cells per level) agree to within 0.17% and 0.49% on means, with the largest gap (T7 at 409 ng/mL, +1.8%) attributed to gate curvature the LNA omits. From Fisher information they derive a Cramer-Rao bound and a limit of detection of 54.5 ng/mL at N = 10^3 cells, and show analytically that only K_E1, the noise CV/gain of the molecule read, and N enter the LOD formula (matching the full LNA to 0.5%). A systematic knob sweep raising each parameter up to x1000 with the full 9-species LNA shows amplification scales signal and noise together so SNR is unchanged: three orders of amplification move the LOD by 1.9 ng/mL while three orders of k3 move it by 53. They explicitly retire the Fano factor as a figure of merit here ('a low value means a brighter circuit, not a quieter one'), identify a tighter estrone-binding protein as the only real lever, note LOD scales as N^(-1/4), and then conclude against themselves: surface water and effluent hold under 0.01 ng/mL, over three orders of magnitude below their LOD. Elasticity analysis identifies the Hill coefficient as the largest elasticity (-0.613 on the width of the working window, an order of magnitude above the next constant) and the quantity the wet lab most clearly contradicts. The working window where fluorescence actually encodes concentration is bounded at 147 to 988 ng/mL, a 6.70x span, taken as 10% and 90% of the climb from G_off to G_on. Reactor sizing is translated into plant terms: 95 m2 cross-section for one 57 MLD sewage plant, 889 m2 for all of Kolkata's 534 MLD, and a 3400x bead penalty for treating a 17 m3/day factory stream downstream at the city plant instead of at source.","datascience_zh":"資訊論的處理是這一批團隊中最強的。每個雌酮濃度各做一次 LNA 求解，得到各物種的平均值與變異數；導數以中央差分取得，h = 0.01*theta（在 322.5 ng/mL 處，報告蛋白的閉合解為 6.2560、有限差分為 6.2559）。ODE、LNA 與精確 Gillespie（每個濃度 1,500 個細胞）在平均值上相符至 0.17% 與 0.49% 以內，最大落差（409 ng/mL 處的 T7，+1.8%）被歸因於 LNA 未納入的閘門曲率。他們由 Fisher 資訊量推導出 Cramer-Rao 下界，並在 N = 10^3 個細胞下得到 54.5 ng/mL 的偵測極限，再以解析方式證明只有 K_E1、分子讀取的雜訊變異係數對增益之比，以及 N 會進入 LOD 公式（與完整 LNA 相符至 0.5%）。一次系統性的參數掃描把每個參數分別提高至 1000 倍，並以完整的 9 物種 LNA 計算，顯示放大會讓訊號與雜訊同步放大，因此訊雜比不變：三個數量級的放大只讓 LOD 移動 1.9 ng/mL，而三個數量級的 k3 卻能移動 53。他們明確在此處廢除 Fano 因子作為評價指標（「數值低代表迴路更亮，而不是更安靜」），指出唯一真正的槓桿是找到一個對雌酮結合更緊的蛋白，注意到 LOD 隨 N^(-1/4) 縮放，然後做出不利於自己的結論：地表水與放流水的濃度低於 0.01 ng/mL，比他們的 LOD 低超過三個數量級。彈性分析指出 Hill 係數具有最大的彈性（對工作窗寬度為 -0.613，比次高的常數高出一個數量級），而這正是濕實驗最明確牴觸的量。螢光真正能編碼濃度的工作窗落在 147 至 988 ng/mL，跨距 6.70 倍，取法是從 G_off 爬升到 G_on 的 10% 與 90%。反應器尺寸被換算成處理廠的語言：一座 57 MLD 污水廠需要 95 m2 的截面積，整個加爾各答的 534 MLD 則需要 889 m2，而把一股 17 m3/day 的工廠廢水放到下游的市級處理廠處理而非在源頭處理，珠體用量會付出 3400 倍的代價。","software":"Quiver, at gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/iiser-kolkata/quiver: a compiled elastic network model solver (enm-solve, ANM and GNM) with a dependency-free browser viewer, the Normal Mode Explorer, and a 27-page PDF handbook. It takes PDB/mmCIF, optionally an AlphaFold predicted aligned error matrix, or a multi-model conformational ensemble or MD trajectory; it outputs mode files and per-residue fluctuation profiles in native formats for VMD, ProDy, PyMOL, ChimeraX, NumPy and MATLAB. The viewer does normal-mode display, cryo-EM density display, normal-mode flexible fitting of a structure into a map, and an AlphaFold-informed dynamics and essential-dynamics workspace. Validation is the remarkable part. (1) A 206-structure crystallographic B-factor benchmark, median Pearson r = 0.633, reported on a single-chain protocol with the 75 multi-chain files flagged as making that a lower bound, and the selection queries, rejected entries with reasons and download commands committed to the repo. (2) Independent cross-check: five structures re-run end to end through ProDy's own parser, Kirchhoff matrix and fluctuations, agreeing to within 0.01 (1UBQ 0.806 vs 0.804, 2LZM 0.578 vs 0.576, 7RSA 0.628 vs 0.628, 1GPB 0.400 vs 0.399, 1HRC 0.192 vs 0.19). (3) MD validation against the two 100 ns trajectories, with the XTC decoder itself verified frame-0 atom-by-atom against the deposited start.pdb before any analysis, because a subtly wrong decoder produces plausible numbers. Amplitude correlation 0.824-0.840 against simulated RMSF over 388 residues, apo and holo agreeing to within 0.016. Cutoff robustness: ANM varies by at most 0.05 between 10 and 18 A and peaks at the 15 A default taken from literature and not fitted, while GNM's 10 A default is shown to be suboptimal here by about 0.06. Directional validation by RMSIP against essential dynamics: 0.715 at k = 10 against a random expectation of 0.092 confirmed over 200 random orthonormal subspace pairs, specific to the input structure (each network matches its own trajectory at 0.715 and the other at 0.51-0.55) and, strikingly, the two MD trajectories agree with each other at only 0.598, so the elastic model predicts each trajectory better than the other trajectory does. Three of 1,164 coordinates carry half the motion. Rigid-body sanity: exactly six zero modes at 20,000 residues with overlap 1.000000 against the analytic basis. 33 tests, a pinned Docker image, Linux/macOS Intel and Apple Silicon/Windows via WSL2, an explicitly stated domain of applicability (compact globular protein-only structures), and a stated requirement that release builds disable fused multiply-add contraction or the sparse-vs-dense Hessian consistency check fails on arm64.","software_zh":"Quiver，位於 gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/iiser-kolkata/quiver：一個編譯型的彈性網路模型求解器（enm-solve，含 ANM 與 GNM），搭配一個零相依的瀏覽器檢視器 Normal Mode Explorer，以及一本 27 頁的 PDF 手冊。它可接受 PDB/mmCIF，選擇性地接受 AlphaFold 的預測對齊誤差矩陣，或是多模型構型系集與分子動力學軌跡；輸出則是模態檔與每個殘基的擾動分布，格式可直接供 VMD、ProDy、PyMOL、ChimeraX、NumPy 與 MATLAB 使用。檢視器能做正規模態顯示、冷凍電顯密度顯示、把結構以正規模態柔性擬合進密度圖，並提供一個由 AlphaFold 資訊輔助的動力學與本質動力學工作區。真正了不起的是驗證。（1）一項涵蓋 206 個結構的晶體 B 因子基準測試，Pearson r 中位數為 0.633，以單鏈流程報告，並標示其中 75 個多鏈檔案使這個數字只是下界；篩選查詢語句、被排除的條目與排除理由，以及下載指令都提交到 repository 中。（2）獨立交叉驗證：五個結構完整重跑一次，改用 ProDy 自己的解析器、Kirchhoff 矩陣與擾動計算，結果相符至 0.01 以內（1UBQ 0.806 對 0.804，2LZM 0.578 對 0.576，7RSA 0.628 對 0.628，1GPB 0.400 對 0.399，1HRC 0.192 對 0.19）。（3）對兩條 100 ns 軌跡的分子動力學驗證，而且在做任何分析之前，先把 XTC 解碼器本身以第 0 幀逐原子對照已存放的 start.pdb 驗證過，因為一個只錯得很細微的解碼器會產生看起來合理的數字。在 388 個殘基上，振幅與模擬 RMSF 的相關係數為 0.824-0.840，apo 與 holo 兩種形式相符至 0.016 以內。截斷半徑的穩健性：ANM 在 10 至 18 A 之間變動至多 0.05，並在取自文獻、未經擬合的 15 A 預設值處達到峰值；GNM 的 10 A 預設值則被證明在此並非最佳，差距約 0.06。方向性驗證以 RMSIP 對本質動力學進行：在 k = 10 時為 0.715，相對於隨機期望值 0.092，後者以 200 對隨機正交子空間確認；這個結果對輸入結構具專一性（每個網路對上自己的軌跡為 0.715，對上另一條則為 0.51-0.55）；更引人注目的是，兩條分子動力學軌跡彼此之間只相符至 0.598，因此彈性模型對每條軌跡的預測比另一條軌跡還準。1,164 個座標中有 3 個承載了一半的運動。剛體檢核：在 20,000 個殘基下恰好得到六個零模態，與解析基底的重疊度為 1.000000。另有 33 項測試、一個版本鎖定的 Docker 映像、支援 Linux/macOS 的 Intel 與 Apple Silicon 以及透過 WSL2 的 Windows、一段明確寫出的適用範圍（僅限緊緻的球狀純蛋白質結構），以及一項明述要求：正式版建置必須關閉融合乘加的運算合併，否則在 arm64 上稀疏與稠密 Hessian 矩陣的一致性檢查會失敗。","stack":["C++ (enm-solve) with LAPACK/BLAS","SciPy / NumPy","GROMACS","mdtraj","ProDy","AlphaFold 2","Docker","React / three.js wiki","VMD / PyMOL / ChimeraX output formats","GitLab"],"techniques":["Deterministic ODE circuit modelling with stated reduction assumptions","Hill-function parameter fitting by least squares on digitised literature data","Exact Gillespie stochastic simulation","Linear Noise Approximation","Fisher information and Cramer-Rao bound","Analytic limit-of-detection derivation and knob sweeps","Elasticity / local sensitivity analysis","Diffusion-based molecular communication modelling","Lattice-Boltzmann (D3Q19 TRT) porous-media flow","Kozeny-Carman permeability validation","Anisotropic and Gaussian network models","Essential dynamics / PCA of MD trajectories","RMSIP subspace overlap with randomised null","Normal-mode flexible fitting into cryo-EM density","Molecular docking","Reactor sizing and process-train siting calculations"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Between June and September 2026 the team ran a structured science-education programme reaching about 1,000 students aged 8 to 18 across four schools and their own institute, pitched separately for each age band from class 3 to class 12 and deliberately extended to students who are rarely asked. Teaching was mostly in Bengali, keeping the English terms and building explanations around them, because synthetic biology's vocabulary (plasmid, promoter, transcription, chassis) has no settled Bengali equivalents. Rani Rashmoni School (24 June, class 3-4): living versus non-living through a card game, then cells, DNA and a live DNA extraction. Satish Chandra Memorial School (8 July, class 11-12): genetic engineering, CRISPR and synthetic biology as a discipline; the team found this audience knew more of the content than expected and less of the practice than assumed, so the useful addition was not information but the fact that a person sits down and designs recombinant DNA. Bharat Sevashram Sangha (8 July, class 10), a residential school for Scheduled Tribe students: the prepared class 10 session had to be rebuilt from the base vocabulary mid-session, and the team names the lesson plainly, that prior exposure and not age sets the starting point, and that they had not noticed the age assumption because it had held everywhere else. Institute Open Day (10 July) ran FINS itself as the exhibit, including the parts that did not work, delivered forty to fifty times in short bursts to mixed class 9-12 groups; it was covered by DD Bangla, the state public broadcaster, carrying the project to a general Bengali-speaking audience. A week-long institute summer camp for about 70 students from North-Eastern India, organised with Kendriya Vidyalaya, included lab tours, the modelling side of the project and an original synthetic-biology crime-scene investigation. A long-term partnership with Ek Pehal runs Saturday on-campus sessions and Sunday neighbourhood visits for children from settlements around IISER Kolkata, for which the team wrote 41 free teaching files in English, Hindi and Bengali for classes 8-12 plus 36 literacy/numeracy/science files for younger children. A free webinar on Master's and PhD study abroad drew 151 registrants with Dr Deepak Kumar Malik (President, DAAD IndiAlumni) and the Emerging Scholars Council. Education props were built from cardboard, paper and reused items, which the team notes as an unplanned consequence worth keeping: materials that cost nothing to make are materials a school with no science budget can remake exactly.","publicEngagement_zh":"2026 年 6 月至 9 月間，團隊執行了一項有結構的科學教育計畫，在四所學校與自己的研究院觸及約 1,000 名 8 至 18 歲學生，從三年級到十二年級各年齡層分別設計內容，並刻意延伸到那些很少被問到的學生。授課多以孟加拉語進行，保留英文術語並圍繞它們建立說明，因為合成生物學的詞彙（plasmid、promoter、transcription、chassis）在孟加拉語中尚無定譯。Rani Rashmoni School（6 月 24 日，三至四年級）：先用卡牌遊戲區分生物與非生物，再談細胞、DNA，並現場做 DNA 萃取。Satish Chandra Memorial School（7 月 8 日，十一至十二年級）：基因工程、CRISPR 與作為一門學科的合成生物學；團隊發現這群聽眾對內容的了解比預期多，對實作的了解卻比想像少，因此真正有用的補充不是資訊，而是有人會坐下來設計重組 DNA 這件事。Bharat Sevashram Sangha（7 月 8 日，十年級）是一所供 Scheduled Tribe 學生就讀的住宿學校：原本準備好的十年級課程必須在課堂進行中從基礎詞彙重新搭建，團隊也直白寫下這個教訓：決定起點的是先前接觸過什麼，而不是年齡；而他們之所以沒注意到自己對年齡的假設，是因為在其他地方這個假設都成立。研究院開放日（7 月 10 日）直接把 FINS 本身當展品，包括那些沒成功的部分，以短場次的方式對九至十二年級的混合群體講了四十到五十次；這場活動獲州立公共廣播機構 DD Bangla 報導，把專案帶到一般的孟加拉語閱聽眾面前。一場為期一週、與 Kendriya Vidyalaya 合辦、約 70 名來自印度東北部學生參加的院內夏令營，包含實驗室導覽、專案的建模面向，以及一場原創的合成生物學犯罪現場調查。與 Ek Pehal 的長期合作則有週六的校內課程與週日的社區走訪，對象是 IISER Kolkata 周邊聚落的孩子；團隊為此撰寫了 41 份針對八至十二年級的免費教材（英文、印地語與孟加拉語），另有 36 份給更小孩子的識字、算術與科學教材。一場關於出國攻讀碩博士的免費線上講座吸引 151 人報名，講者包括 Dr Deepak Kumar Malik（DAAD IndiAlumni 會長）與 Emerging Scholars Council。教具全以紙板、紙張與回收物製作，團隊指出這是一項非預期但值得保留的結果：製作成本為零的材料，正是一所沒有科學預算的學校能原樣重做的材料。","ihp":"Around thirty engagements written to an explicit template that starts with 'Need: the assumption we were carrying and the gap we hoped to fill'. The project originates outside the lab, on the deck of the Fishery Survey of India vessel M.F.V. Matsya Darshini off Visakhapatnam, where the team lead logged a haul of twenty-six fish before the team existed; months later they returned to the same coast to test the observation. The page's integrity is its best feature: three engagements are documented as having declined to give the finding the team went in for. Mr Mohadep Dutta, who has fished the Ganga since he was seven, could not comment on a shift in sex ratio because it is not visible to him, and the team records that as evidence the effect is invisible without instrumentation rather than resolving the disagreement in their favour. The closed loops are structural. Wastewater practitioner S.K. Ghosh (Director, Effluents and Water Treatments Engineer) established that Indian plants disinfect with sodium hypochlorite rather than UV on cost grounds, which forced the kill-switch trigger to be rebuilt around RclR, an AraC-family activator responding specifically to hypochlorous acid and one of only three HOCl-sensing regulators known in E. coli K-12, chosen partly because it activates rather than de-represses so the lysis cassette is off by default; the original UV/LexA-SOS switch was retained and published as a part for the global market rather than discarded. A SAV Water WWTP engagement supplied the operating envelope (aerobic, 8-16 hours aeration). An oceanographer corrected their dispersal modelling, which had assumed static water and annual averages, and established that any dispersal work must rest on seasonal INCOIS current and sea surface temperature data for the Bay of Bengal. A fish ecologist supplied three zebrafish endpoints (egg-laying, mating patterns, growth) and a two-layer safety framework that now structures the toxicity plan, plus the caution that wild-caught fish do not reproduce reliably in confinement, which is why the team nowhere extrapolates from model organisms to wild populations. An account of broken enforcement changed who the Human Practices work addresses, so community and regulatory engagement now run as two parallel levers of equal weight rather than outreach built around regulation. A hospital-effluent intervention branch was closed rather than kept as an alternative. Literature was treated as the first stakeholder, and stakeholders handed over documents (Central Pollution Control Board sector-specific effluent discharge standards, the Department of Fisheries Handbook on Fisheries Statistics) that are cited as such. Prior iGEM teams were studied as precedent: JU Krakow 2024 for an environmental biosensor in a regulatory context where the compound was not monitored, and Sao Carlos 2019 for documenting a regulatory framework that did not fit the work rather than forcing the work into it.","ihp_zh":"約三十場交流活動都依一套明確的模板撰寫，開頭是「需求：我們當時抱持的假設，以及我們希望填補的落差」。專案的起點不在實驗室，而是在 Visakhapatnam 外海、印度漁業調查署船隻 M.F.V. Matsya Darshini 的甲板上；當時團隊還不存在，隊長就記下了一網二十六條魚的漁獲，數個月後他們回到同一片海岸去檢驗這項觀察。這個頁面最好的地方是它的誠實：有三場交流被記錄為並未給出團隊原本想要的發現。自七歲起就在恆河捕魚的 Mr Mohadep Dutta 無法就性別比的變化發表意見，因為那對他而言是看不見的；團隊把這一點記錄為「沒有儀器就看不到這個效應」的證據，而不是把分歧解釋成對自己有利。閉環則是結構性的。污水處理從業者 S.K. Ghosh（Effluents and Water Treatments Engineer 總監）確立印度的處理廠出於成本考量是以次氯酸鈉而非 UV 消毒，這迫使自殺開關的觸發機制改以 RclR 重建；RclR 是 AraC 家族的活化子，專一回應次氯酸，也是 E. coli K-12 中目前已知僅有的三個 HOCl 感測調控因子之一，選它的部分理由是它採活化而非去抑制，因此裂解表現匣預設為關閉；原本的 UV/LexA-SOS 開關則被保留，並作為零件發表供全球使用，而不是直接丟棄。一場與 SAV Water 污水處理廠的交流提供了操作條件範圍（好氧、曝氣 8 至 16 小時）。一位海洋學家糾正了他們原先假設靜止水體與年平均值的擴散建模，並確立任何擴散工作都必須建立在 INCOIS 關於孟加拉灣的季節性洋流與海表溫度資料上。一位魚類生態學家提供了三項斑馬魚終點指標（產卵、交配模式、生長）與一套兩層的安全框架，如今成為毒性計畫的骨架；他並提醒野外捕獲的魚在圈養下無法穩定繁殖，這正是團隊在任何地方都不從模式生物外推到野生族群的原因。一段關於執法失靈的陳述改變了人類實踐工作所訴求的對象，因此社區參與與法規參與現在是兩條權重相等的平行槓桿，而不是圍繞法規安排的推廣。一條針對醫院廢水的介入支線被關閉，而不是留作備案。文獻被當成第一位利害關係人，而利害關係人交付的文件（中央污染控制委員會的分業別放流水標準、漁業部的 Handbook on Fisheries Statistics）也以此身分被引用。過往 iGEM 團隊被當作前例研究：JU Krakow 2024 作為在該化合物未被監測的法規情境下做環境生物感測器的案例，Sao Carlos 2019 則示範了如何記錄一套並不貼合自身工作的法規架構，而不是硬把工作塞進去。","realWorld":"Deployment is specified down to plant siting and footprint: a sealed tank with cells in a PVA-alginate matrix placed after secondary treatment and before chlorination, so the influent is already low in solids and organics and the plant's own chlorination stage serves as containment. The matrix composition window is argued from transport, not convenience, with alginate alone rejected because ionic Ca2+ crosslinks are reversible and destabilised by phosphate and citrate, and the blend bounded below roughly 1.5% alginate (skin forms too slowly to prevent agglomeration during extrusion) and above roughly 12% PVA (network tightens enough to impede transport). Chassis choice is reasoned against Pseudomonas putida KT2440, the standard bioremediation chassis. Sensitivity is framed as the principal engineering constraint from the outset, citing published EdcR EC50 of 3.32 uM for E1 and 1.38 uM for E2 against typical environmental loads, and the team builds the circuit on a low-copy p15A origin in pTU2-A to trade absolute expression for reduced metabolic burden. The target was set by Indian conditions, where estrone dominates the pollutant profile and is reported at ug/L in Indian WWTP influent, and the economic case is made against granular activated carbon, ozonation and advanced oxidation, which work but are largely absent from Indian plants on capital cost, energy demand and retrofit grounds. They cite EU Directive 2024/3019 on quaternary treatment for micropollutants at plants above 150,000 p.e., phased to 2045, as the regulatory precedent, and are explicit that FINS targets a compound no Indian monitoring framework measures. The claim at the end is deliberately narrow, and the modelling's own verdict, that the LOD sits over three orders of magnitude above environmental concentrations, is published rather than buried. Deliverables left behind include a Biosafety and Bioethics Handbook as a standalone educational product covering pre-synthesis part screening, contained-versus-released design decisions and stakeholder integration, and the genetic engineering and CRISPR slide deck released for other teams.","realWorld_zh":"部署方式細到處理廠的位置與佔地：一座密閉槽體，細胞固定在 PVA-海藻酸鹽基質中，設在二級處理之後、加氯之前，因此進流水的固體與有機物已經偏低，而處理廠自身的加氯步驟即可作為生物圍阻。基質組成的範圍是以傳輸特性而非方便性來論證：單用海藻酸鹽被否決，因為離子性 Ca2+ 交聯可逆，且會被磷酸鹽與檸檬酸鹽破壞穩定；混合比例的下界約為 1.5% 海藻酸鹽（低於此，表層形成太慢，無法在擠出過程中防止結塊），上界約為 12% PVA（高於此，網絡緊密到會阻礙傳輸）。宿主選擇是對著生物修復的標準底盤 Pseudomonas putida KT2440 來論證的。靈敏度從一開始就被定位為主要的工程限制，團隊引用已發表的 EdcR EC50（對 E1 為 3.32 uM、對 E2 為 1.38 uM）對比典型的環境負荷，並把迴路建在 pTU2-A 中的低拷貝數 p15A 複製起點上，以絕對表現量換取較低的代謝負擔。標的物由印度的條件決定：雌酮主導當地的污染物組成，且在印度污水處理廠進流水中被報告為 ug/L 等級；經濟論證則是對照粒狀活性碳、臭氧處理與高級氧化，這些方法有效，但因建置成本、能耗與改裝困難，在印度的處理廠中幾乎不存在。他們引用歐盟 Directive 2024/3019 關於 150,000 人口當量以上處理廠須對微量污染物採行四級處理、分階段實施至 2045 年的規定作為法規先例，並明說 FINS 針對的是一個印度監測架構完全不量測的化合物。最後的主張刻意收得很窄，而建模自身的判決，也就是 LOD 比環境濃度高出三個數量級以上，是被公布而不是被埋起來。留下的交付成果包括一本獨立的教育產品《Biosafety and Bioethics Handbook》，涵蓋合成前的零件篩查、封閉式與釋放式設計的取捨，以及利害關係人整合；另有一份供其他團隊使用、已釋出的基因工程與 CRISPR 簡報。","partners":["Fishery Survey of India (FSI), Visakhapatnam","CIFRI Barrackpore (Dr S.K. Nag, Dr Kavita Kumari)","CIFNET","SAV Water / municipal WWTP engineers","Central Pollution Control Board contacts","Ek Pehal (student-led education initiative)","Kendriya Vidyalaya","Rani Rashmoni School","Satish Chandra Memorial School","Bharat Sevashram Sangha Residential School for ST students","DD Bangla (state public broadcaster)","DAAD IndiAlumni / Emerging Scholars Council","iGEM VIT Vellore","iGEM IISER Thiruvananthapuram","iGEM IISER Berhampur","iGEM IIT Kharagpur","IISER Kolkata Institutional Biosafety Committee"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6450/wiki/software/software/quiver-mode-arrows.webp","caption":"The Normal Mode Explorer, Quiver's browser interface: a structure drawn as a ribbon coloured blue to red by displacement with per-residue mode arrows overlaid.","caption_zh":"Normal Mode Explorer，Quiver 的瀏覽器介面：結構以帶狀呈現，依位移由藍到紅上色，並疊上每個殘基的模態箭頭。","credit":"Team IISER-Kolkata, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6450/wiki/software/software/quiver-fit-result.webp","caption":"Normal-mode flexible fitting of a structure into a cryo-EM density map, reporting cross-correlation before and after fitting, model displacement and largest bond strain.","caption_zh":"以正規模態把結構柔性擬合進冷凍電顯密度圖，並報告擬合前後的交叉相關係數、模型位移量與最大鍵結應變。","credit":"Team IISER-Kolkata, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6450/wiki/model/noise-fisher-information.webp","caption":"Fisher information of mScarlet3 per cell against estrone for four constitutive promoter strengths; the design curve peaks at 322.5 ng/mL, below the EC50 of 409 ng/mL.","caption_zh":"mScarlet3 每個細胞的 Fisher 資訊量對雌酮作圖，涵蓋四種組成型啟動子強度；設計所用的曲線在 322.5 ng/mL 處達到峰值，低於 409 ng/mL 的 EC50。","credit":"Team IISER-Kolkata, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6450/wiki/model/dry-vs-wet.webp","caption":"Model prediction set against the bench result, one of several figures where the team publishes where the dry lab and wet lab disagree.","caption_zh":"模型預測與實驗桌結果的對照，這是團隊公布乾實驗與濕實驗分歧之處的數張圖之一。","credit":"Team IISER-Kolkata, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Teach students to compute the detection limit their design can actually reach, then publish it even when it damns the project: IISER-Kolkata derived an LOD of 54.5 ng/mL from Fisher information and a Cramer-Rao bound, showed by sweeping every gain parameter x1000 that amplification moves signal and noise together, and then stated plainly that environmental levels sit three orders of magnitude lower. For a centre with school-age students, their second transferable practice costs nothing: build every teaching prop from cardboard, paper and reused items, because a resource that costs nothing to make is one a school with no budget can rebuild exactly as you ran it.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"教學生算出自己的設計實際能達到的偵測極限，然後即使這個數字會判自己的專案死刑也照樣公布：IISER-Kolkata 由 Fisher 資訊量與 Cramer-Rao 下界推導出 54.5 ng/mL 的 LOD，再以把每個增益參數都放大 1000 倍的掃描顯示放大會讓訊號與雜訊一起上升，然後直白說出環境中的濃度比這低三個數量級。對一個有中小學生參與的單位來說，他們第二項可移轉的做法不花一毛錢：所有教具都以紙板、紙張與回收物製作，因為製作成本為零的教材，正是一所沒有預算的學校能照你的做法原樣重做的教材。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/","https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/design/","https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/software/","https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/public-outreach-and-collaboration/","https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/inclusivity/","https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/safety-and-security/","https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/parts/","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/iiser-kolkata/quiver"],"awards_zh":["最佳簡報 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）","最佳保育專案 — 入圍"],"rank":21},"6456":{"team":"Jilin-China","id":"6456","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/jilin-china/","projectTitle":"A DNA-based recorder of transient fermentation stress in Pichia pastoris","projectTitle_zh":"一個以 DNA 記錄 Pichia pastoris 發酵過程中瞬時壓力的記錄器","tagline":"Turn fleeting glucose and oxygen limitation during a fermentation run into permanent, readable marks in DNA.","tagline_zh":"把一次發酵運行中轉瞬即逝的葡萄糖與氧限制，變成 DNA 上永久且可讀取的印記。","summary":"Jilin-China built a two-channel genetic event recorder: pGTH1 drives Cre (recording glucose limitation) acting on a lox71/lox66 pair, and PsADH2 drives FLP (recording oxygen limitation) acting on an FRT-LE/FRT-RE pair, each inversion flipping a fluorescent reporter read after the run. Five separate models answer five design questions that experiments could not settle: which synonymous FLP sequence to synthesise, how bulk glucose maps to a promoter input, whether an alginate capsule isolates its cells from the broth, what DNA states the construct can occupy, and which published promoter evidence actually applies. The most striking feature is epistemic discipline: nearly every claim is accompanied by a statement of what the calculation does NOT establish, and when the glucose model's predicted low-glucose crossing time (7.56 h) disagreed with the measured 0.11 g/L at 8 h, the team reported the disagreement and downgraded the 0.05 g/L figure to a scenario threshold rather than a promoter activation threshold.","summary_zh":"Jilin-China 打造了一個雙通道的基因事件記錄器：pGTH1 驅動 Cre（記錄葡萄糖限制）作用於一組 lox71/lox66，而 PsADH2 驅動 FLP（記錄氧限制）作用於一組 FRT-LE/FRT-RE，每一次反轉都會翻轉一個螢光報導子，待運行結束後再讀取。五個各自獨立的模型回答了五個實驗無法定奪的設計問題：該合成哪一條同義密碼子的 FLP 序列、整體葡萄糖濃度如何對應到啟動子的輸入、海藻酸鹽膠囊是否真的把囊內細胞與培養液隔開、這個構築體可以存在於哪些 DNA 狀態，以及已發表的啟動子證據中哪些才真正適用。最醒目的特徵是認識論上的紀律：幾乎每一項主張都附帶一句說明，講清楚該計算並未證明什麼；而當葡萄糖模型預測的低葡萄糖跨越時間（7.56 小時）與第 8 小時實測的 0.11 g/L 不符時，團隊回報了這個不一致，並把 0.05 g/L 這個數字降級為情境閾值，而不是啟動子的活化閾值。","awards":["Best Model — Nominee (Undergrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Five models, each tied to a design action. (1) RecombiOpt — synonymous CDS design. It works in the real construct context (the 6,628 nt pET28a-FLP plasmid with a BL21(DE3) host profile), correctly identifies that translation starts at position 107 while FLP starts at 221 because of a 114 nt / 38 aa fusion tag, and computes accessibility as an opening free energy Delta_G_open = -RT ln P_unpaired for the contiguous 48 nt window [-24, +24) around the ACTUAL translation start using local RNA folding in ViennaRNA at 30 C with W = L = 210 nt. A greedy coordinate-descent local search over the first 10/15/30 FLP codons (max three rounds, methionine preserved) produced 'target5prime-30', which changed only 15 nt across 14 codons and cut opening energy from 10.6473 to 7.9007 kcal/mol while leaving CAI essentially flat (0.5184 to 0.5246), versus a constrained-maxCAI design that changed 352 nt to reach CAI 0.9948 but only reached 8.3520 kcal/mol. A complementary RNAstructure 6.6 analysis at 30 C compared MFE and mean single-base unpaired probability across the first 30, 90, 150 nt and full 1,272 nt CDS windows. (2) Glucose model — a coupled ODE of enzymatic glucose release, cellular uptake and OD growth. Sterile release was calibrated FIRST and separately in water and in YP medium (no parameter transfer between them) as a sum of first-order releasable pools dD_i/dt = -k_i D_i with r_h(t) = sum k_i D_i, giving the closed form G(t) = G_0 + sum A_i(1 - exp(-k_i t)); a one-pool model was retained unless adding a second pool cut fitting RMSE by more than 40%. Uptake and growth were then fitted jointly with shared parameters across conditions, with time and condition holdouts. (3) Capsule2Memory — a spherically symmetric reaction-diffusion PDE for an immobilisation bead, dG/dt = (D_eff/r^2) d/dr(r^2 dG/dr) - X q_max G/(K_m + G) with Monod uptake, solved under three distinct boundary regimes (prescribed surface concentration; a Robin condition D_eff dG/dr|_R = k_L[G_b - G(R,t)] for finite interfacial transfer; and a finite-bath case with instantaneous partitioning c_g(R,t) = K C_b(t) that solves bath and interior together including the sampling withdrawals). Four model variants are compared — M0 (follows input directly), M1 (diffusion only), M2 (diffusion plus uptake), M2-lumped (one uniform internal state with k_eff = 15 D_eff/R^2, where the factor 15 is derived from the steady-state mean deficit of a sphere with constant volumetric uptake) — and the page explicitly derives the exact volume-averaged balance and states why the lumped closure is an approximation, since Monod uptake is nonlinear so <G/(K_m+G)>_V is not G_bar/(K_m+G_bar). Numerics are a spherical-shell finite-volume discretisation with implicit BDF integration, solved separately across input discontinuities. (4) Recombistate — a discrete state machine over DNA sequences. The 16,098 bp final plasmid is annotated down to coordinates (lox71 at 4,767-4,800, lox66 at 6,050-6,083, FRT-LE at 6,272-6,305, FRT-RE at 7,784-7,817, with the reverse-strand FRT-RE reported in both genomic-forward and feature-oriented conventions), and the state graph is enumerated on an earlier 3,367 bp reporter fragment under specified Cre/lox and FLP/FRT rules, max two recombination steps, yielding four distinct DNA sequences, four transitions and five event histories. The key result is a negative one about observability: the two orderings of events A and B converge on the SAME final sequence, so the final DNA does not retain event order. (5) FermentPromoterBank — a promoter evidence registry (9 core constructs, 8 watchlist candidates, 252 discovery entries, 12 design entries) that keeps sequence boundaries, host and culture conditions in one record, explicitly described as not an activity predictor.","frameworks_zh":"五個模型，每一個都綁定一項設計動作。(1) RecombiOpt，同義密碼子 CDS 設計。它在真實的構築體情境中運作（6,628 nt 的 pET28a-FLP 質體，搭配 BL21(DE3) 的宿主組態），正確辨識出轉譯起始於第 107 位而 FLP 本身起始於第 221 位，原因是有一段 114 nt / 38 個胺基酸的融合標籤；它以開啟自由能 Delta_G_open = -RT ln P_unpaired 計算可及性，取真正轉譯起點周圍連續 48 nt 的窗格 [-24, +24)，並在 30 C、W = L = 210 nt 的設定下以 ViennaRNA 做局部 RNA 折疊。對 FLP 前 10/15/30 個密碼子執行貪婪座標下降的局部搜尋（最多三輪，保留甲硫胺酸），產生了「target5prime-30」，它只改動了 14 個密碼子中的 15 個 nt，就把開啟能量由 10.6473 降到 7.9007 kcal/mol，而 CAI 幾乎沒變（0.5184 至 0.5246）；相較之下，一個受限的最大 CAI 設計改動了 352 nt 才達到 CAI 0.9948，但開啟能量只降到 8.3520 kcal/mol。另有一項互補的 RNAstructure 6.6 分析在 30 C 下，比較了 CDS 前 30、90、150 nt 以及完整 1,272 nt 各窗格的 MFE 與單鹼基未配對機率平均值。(2) 葡萄糖模型，一組把酶促葡萄糖釋放、細胞攝取與 OD 生長耦合起來的 ODE。無菌條件下的釋放先被單獨校正，且在水中與在 YP 培養基中各自校正（兩者之間不做參數轉移），形式為一階可釋放池之和 dD_i/dt = -k_i D_i，其中 r_h(t) = sum k_i D_i，得到封閉形式解 G(t) = G_0 + sum A_i(1 - exp(-k_i t))；除非加入第二個池能使擬合 RMSE 下降超過 40%，否則保留單池模型。攝取與生長接著以跨條件共用參數的方式聯合擬合，並做時間與條件的保留驗證。(3) Capsule2Memory，一個描述固定化珠體的球對稱反應-擴散 PDE，dG/dt = (D_eff/r^2) d/dr(r^2 dG/dr) - X q_max G/(K_m + G)，採 Monod 型攝取，並在三種不同的邊界條件型態下求解（指定表面濃度；對應有限界面傳輸的 Robin 條件 D_eff dG/dr|_R = k_L[G_b - G(R,t)]；以及具瞬時分配 c_g(R,t) = K C_b(t) 的有限浴槽情形，該情形連同取樣抽出一併求解浴槽與珠體內部）。文中比較了四個模型變體，即 M0（直接跟隨輸入）、M1（僅擴散）、M2（擴散加攝取）、M2-lumped（單一均勻的內部狀態，k_eff = 15 D_eff/R^2，其中係數 15 由定值體積攝取下球體的穩態平均缺額導出）；該頁並明確推導出精確的體積平均平衡式，並說明為何集總閉合只是一個近似，因為 Monod 型攝取是非線性的，所以 <G/(K_m+G)>_V 並不等於 G_bar/(K_m+G_bar)。數值方法為球殼有限體積離散化搭配隱式 BDF 積分，並在輸入的不連續點處分段求解。(4) Recombistate，一個建立在 DNA 序列之上的離散狀態機。最終 16,098 bp 的質體被註解到座標層級（lox71 位於 4,767-4,800、lox66 位於 6,050-6,083、FRT-LE 位於 6,272-6,305、FRT-RE 位於 7,784-7,817，其中位於反股的 FRT-RE 同時以基因組正向與特徵導向兩種慣例標示），而狀態圖則是在一段較早的 3,367 bp 報導子片段上，依指定的 Cre/lox 與 FLP/FRT 規則、最多兩次重組步驟的條件下列舉，得到四條不同的 DNA 序列、四個轉移與五種事件歷史。關鍵結果是一個關於可觀測性的負面結論：事件 A 與 B 的兩種先後順序最終收斂到同一條序列，因此最終的 DNA 並不保留事件的發生順序。(5) FermentPromoterBank，一個啟動子證據登錄庫（9 個核心構築體、8 個觀察名單候選、252 筆發現條目、12 筆設計條目），把序列邊界、宿主與培養條件保存在同一筆紀錄中，並明確說明它不是活性預測工具。","dataviz":"Twenty-two numbered figures, and the captions are the most instructive part of them. Each caption states the axis meaning, the exact computational settings used, and what the figure may not be read as: 'connecting lines guide the eye and do not represent a time course'; 'the panels use different metrics and horizontal scales'; 'Error bars and asterisks are reproduced from the original figure. Replicate counts, the error measure and the statistical comparisons are unspecified, so we do not infer P values or statistical significance from these marks'; 'the graph is a structural calculation under the registered FRT rule; it is not a measurement of four fluorescence channels'. Figure 3 plots mean paired gains with 95% intervals from 5,000 group-bootstrap resamples, and the caption notes the intervals come from saved out-of-fold predictions and do not include full-retraining uncertainty. Figure 1 is a model-dependency diagram that distinguishes solid arrows (within-module workflows and documented design selections) from dashed arrows (conceptual interfaces that are NOT a validated coupled prediction) — a distinction almost no iGEM team draws. Figure 4 shows the three-way trade-off (CAI, opening energy, nucleotide edits) as separate aligned panels rather than a composite score. Figure 20 is a conditional DNA-state graph that visually separates sequence states from event histories, making the two converging paths to S_CF legible.","dataviz_zh":"二十二張編號圖表，而其中最有教育意義的部分是圖說。每一則圖說都寫明座標軸的意義、所使用的確切運算設定，以及這張圖不能被怎麼解讀：「連線僅為引導視線之用，並不代表時間歷程」；「各面板使用不同的指標與橫軸尺度」；「誤差線與星號係自原始圖表轉載。重複數、誤差指標與統計比較方式皆未載明，因此我們不從這些標記推論 P 值或統計顯著性」；「此圖是在已登錄的 FRT 規則下所做的結構性計算，並不是對四個螢光通道的量測」。圖 3 繪製平均配對增益並附以 5,000 次分組 bootstrap 重抽所得的 95% 區間，圖說並註明這些區間來自已儲存的折外預測，不包含完整重新訓練的不確定性。圖 1 是一張模型依賴關係圖，區分實線箭頭（模組內的工作流程與有文件記載的設計選擇）與虛線箭頭（概念性介面，並不是一項已驗證的耦合預測），而這個區分幾乎沒有任何 iGEM 團隊會畫。圖 4 把三方權衡（CAI、開啟能量、核苷酸改動數）呈現為三個對齊的獨立面板，而不是一個綜合分數。圖 20 是一張條件式 DNA 狀態圖，在視覺上把序列狀態與事件歷史分開，使兩條通往 S_CF 的收斂路徑清楚可讀。","datascience":"The machine-learning work is a model of restraint. They tested whether RNA structure features add information to expression proxy models by holding the ExtraTrees algorithm, base features and data splits fixed and only adding opening energy and local MFE, across three tasks (Boel expression levels, TIsigner detectable-expression labels, Nieuwkoop mRFP synonymous variants) with grouped five-fold validation and five random seeds — grouping by protein family for the first two and by experimental plate for the third, specifically to stop related samples appearing in both train and test. Gains were small but consistent: Boel QWK 0.1391 to 0.1677 (+0.0286 [0.0229, 0.0344]), TIsigner AP 0.8851 to 0.8997 (+0.0146), Nieuwkoop Spearman 0.7622 to 0.7906 (+0.0283), all five seeds positive — and they then note that even with RNA features the Boel QWK of ~0.168 means expression-level agreement 'remained limited', and that Boel and TIsigner share 2,363 protein-family components so positive results in both are not two independent replications. Crucially, they then DECLINED to use those models to rank their FLP candidates: an out-of-distribution protocol (MMseqs2 10-6d92c family search with predefined thresholds fident >= 0.30 and bidirectional coverage qcov, tcov >= 0.80, plus explicit feature distance, prediction disagreement and construct context) classified all 12 candidate-task combinations as OOD, so candidate selection was made on hard constraints (protein and vector invariance) plus a qualitative trade-off, with the team stating 'we did not add numerical weights after the fact' and that target5prime-30 'is not the unique optimum across every metric and window' since a five-window sensitivity analysis changed the ranking. Model selection followed predefined performance-and-complexity rules that retained simple linear models for two tasks and rejected frozen CodonBERT representations for lack of consistent gain. Wet-lab closure: FLP-Var (target5prime-30) gave a stronger anti-His Western signal than FLP-WT after 0.5 mM IPTG for 6 h and a higher OD600-normalised RFP recombination-reporter curve — reported as qualitative support only, with the team noting the two assays use different regulatory constructs, that OD600 normalisation does not equalise FLP amounts, and that no RNA-decay assay was run so the proposed hydrolysis-resistance mechanism remains a hypothesis. The glucose dataset is 138 concentration and OD600 records; six '<0.02 g/L' readings were retained as upper bounds rather than coerced to 0.02.","datascience_zh":"機器學習這部分是克制的典範。他們檢驗 RNA 結構特徵是否能為表現量代理模型帶來額外資訊，做法是固定 ExtraTrees 演算法、基礎特徵與資料切分方式，只額外加入開啟能量與局部 MFE，橫跨三項任務（Boel 的表現量等級、TIsigner 的可偵測表現標籤、Nieuwkoop 的 mRFP 同義變體），採分組五折驗證與五個隨機種子，前兩項依蛋白質家族分組、第三項依實驗盤分組，明確就是為了避免相近樣本同時出現在訓練集與測試集。增益幅度小但一致：Boel 的 QWK 由 0.1391 升至 0.1677（+0.0286 [0.0229, 0.0344]）、TIsigner 的 AP 由 0.8851 升至 0.8997（+0.0146）、Nieuwkoop 的 Spearman 由 0.7622 升至 0.7906（+0.0283），五個種子全為正；而他們接著指出，即使加入 RNA 特徵，Boel 約 0.168 的 QWK 仍意味著表現量層級的一致性「仍然有限」，並指出 Boel 與 TIsigner 共用 2,363 個蛋白質家族成分，因此兩者都出現正向結果並不算兩次獨立的重複驗證。關鍵在於，他們接著拒絕用這些模型來為自己的 FLP 候選排序：一套分布外檢測流程（MMseqs2 10-6d92c 家族搜尋，門檻事先定為 fident >= 0.30 且雙向覆蓋率 qcov、tcov >= 0.80，再加上明確的特徵距離、預測不一致與構築體情境）把全部 12 個候選與任務的組合都判為 OOD，因此候選的選擇改以硬性約束（蛋白質序列與載體不變）加上定性的權衡來決定，團隊並聲明「我們沒有事後補上數值權重」，也說明 target5prime-30「並不是在每一個指標與每一個窗格下都是唯一的最優解」，因為一項橫跨五個窗格的敏感度分析會改變排序。模型選擇遵循事先訂定的效能與複雜度規則，結果有兩項任務保留了簡單的線性模型，而凍結的 CodonBERT 表徵則因缺乏一致增益而被否決。濕實驗的收尾：在 0.5 mM IPTG 誘導 6 小時後，FLP-Var（target5prime-30）的 anti-His 西方墨點訊號比 FLP-WT 更強，以 OD600 歸一化的 RFP 重組報導子曲線也更高；但這些只被回報為定性支持，團隊並指出兩項檢定使用不同的調控構築體、以 OD600 歸一化並不能讓 FLP 的量相等，而且沒有做 RNA 降解檢定，因此所提出的抗水解機制仍只是一個假說。葡萄糖資料集為 138 筆濃度與 OD600 紀錄；其中六筆「<0.02 g/L」的讀值被保留為上限值，而不是被強制改成 0.02。","software":"RecombiOpt is a released tool (v0.3.0 noted) with host profiles for E. coli BL21(DE3) and P. pastoris GS115, a conditional synonymous generator, a separate 'engineering repair' step that searches for synonymous fixes to declared rule violations and then re-runs all checks, protein and vector invariant verification, and retained tool versions and complete parameters alongside every analysis. The team is explicit that a current optimize run cannot reproduce the entire historical study, and that repair 'addresses whether a sequence meets engineering requirements; it does not predict expression'. The validation table lists, per module, exactly which checks were completed and what evidence supports them — analytical and numerical checks plus replay of a public transport subcase for Capsule2Memory, comparison against an independent solver for the bacterial parameter example, mass-balance and numerical-refinement checks for the tracer experiment, grouped internal validation and OOD checks for RecombiOpt, sterile-source calibration plus joint fitting plus time and condition holdouts for the glucose model, and DNA/junction/convergence checks for Recombistate.","software_zh":"RecombiOpt 是一個已釋出的工具（版本標為 v0.3.0），具備 E. coli BL21(DE3) 與 P. pastoris GS115 的宿主組態、一個條件式同義序列產生器、一個獨立的「工程修補」步驟（針對已宣告的違規項搜尋同義密碼子層級的修正方案，修正後再重跑全部檢查）、蛋白質與載體不變性的驗證，以及在每一次分析旁保留所用的工具版本與完整參數。團隊明白表示，現在跑一次 optimize 並不能重現整個歷史研究，而修補功能「處理的是序列是否符合工程要求，它不預測表現量」。驗證表逐模組列出究竟完成了哪些檢查、以及有什麼證據支持：Capsule2Memory 有解析與數值檢查，外加重跑一個公開的傳輸子案例；細菌參數範例則與一個獨立求解器比對；示蹤實驗有質量平衡與數值精化檢查；RecombiOpt 有分組的內部驗證與 OOD 檢查；葡萄糖模型有無菌來源校正加聯合擬合，以及時間與條件的保留驗證；而 Recombistate 則有 DNA、接合處與收斂性檢查。","stack":["Python","SciPy (implicit BDF integration)","ViennaRNA (local folding)","RNAstructure 6.6","MMseqs2 10-6d92c","scikit-learn (ExtraTrees, linear models)","CodonBERT (evaluated and rejected)","custom finite-volume PDE solver","custom DNA state-machine enumerator (RecombiOpt / Recombistate)"],"techniques":["synonymous codon design with greedy coordinate descent","RNA local folding accessibility / opening free energy","RNA secondary-structure MFE and base-pair probability analysis","codon adaptation index with project-specific host reference","supervised regression and classification with grouped cross-validation","group bootstrap confidence intervals (5,000 resamples)","out-of-distribution applicability protocol with prespecified thresholds","predefined model-selection rules favouring simplicity","coupled ODE fitting with shared parameters across conditions","parsimony criterion for adding model components (40% RMSE rule)","time and condition holdout validation","spherically symmetric reaction-diffusion PDE with Monod kinetics","Dirichlet, Robin and finite-bath boundary conditions compared","volume averaging and lumped-parameter model reduction with derived closure","finite-volume spatial discretisation","mass-balance and independent-solver numerical verification","discrete DNA state-machine enumeration","event-history vs state-observability analysis","structured evidence registry"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A sustained programme rather than one-off events, organised under the 'Continue' step of their 5C Guidelines: the 5th Annual Community Day, the Apricot Blossom Festival, high-school and middle-school outreach, a Popular Science Series Course, a Summer Science Exploration Camp, senior-community outreach and a Sci-Tech Festival, reaching audiences across generations and educational backgrounds through lectures, hands-on activity and conversation. A promotion brochure is published as a downloadable PDF.","publicEngagement_zh":"這是一個持續性的方案而非一次性活動，編排在他們 5C Guidelines 的「Continue」這一步之下：第 5 屆年度社區日、杏花節、面向高中與國中的推廣、一門科普系列課程、一個暑期科學探索營、面向長者社區的推廣，以及一場科技節，透過講座、動手活動與對話觸及跨世代、跨教育背景的受眾。另有一份宣傳手冊以可下載的 PDF 公開。","ihp":"The team built a named framework from the sociology-of-technology literature: a Social Shaping Loop of Encounter, Reflect, Respond, Rewrite, grounded in Argyris's distinction between single-loop learning (improving the existing method) and double-loop learning (questioning the assumptions behind it), layered on their own 5C Guidelines (Collect, Comprehend, Compromise, Continue) carried over from 2025, and framed by MacKenzie and Wajcman's The Social Shaping of Technology. They then applied the distinction honestly: single-loop work was adjusting recombinant expression conditions, codon optimisation, leakage-test conditions and hydrogel diffusion; the double loop was realising that a strong fluorescence signal does not establish industrial usefulness, and that the real questions are whether a recorded state accurately represents a relevant environmental event, whether the information stays interpretable after the event has passed, and whether the system works under representative fermentation conditions. Industrial engagement at BYHEALTH and vaccine and pharmaceutical production facilities surfaced stability, process compatibility, data interpretation and operational safety as criteria. Scientific exchange at the iGEM Northeast China Exchange and university visits fed directly into a modelling result: the Recombistate finding that different event sequences converge on the same final DNA state changed the design goal, pushing them toward a modular sensing-memory-readout toolkit while stating plainly that the toolkit is a direction rather than a validated set.","ihp_zh":"團隊從科技社會學的文獻中建立了一套具名框架：一個由 Encounter、Reflect、Respond、Rewrite 構成的社會形塑迴圈，立基於 Argyris 對單迴圈學習（改善既有方法）與雙迴圈學習（質疑方法背後的假設）的區分，疊加在他們自 2025 年延續下來的 5C Guidelines（Collect、Comprehend、Compromise、Continue）之上，並以 MacKenzie 與 Wajcman 的 The Social Shaping of Technology 作為理論框架。接著他們誠實地運用了這個區分：屬於單迴圈的工作是調整重組表現條件、密碼子最佳化、滲漏測試條件與水凝膠擴散；而雙迴圈則是意識到「強螢光訊號並不代表具有工業用途」，而真正的問題是：一個被記錄下來的狀態是否確實代表一個相關的環境事件、該資訊在事件過去之後是否仍然可解讀，以及這套系統在具代表性的發酵條件下是否行得通。在 BYHEALTH 以及疫苗與藥品生產廠區的業界交流，浮現出穩定性、製程相容性、資料解讀與操作安全這幾項判準。在 iGEM 東北中國交流會與各校參訪的學術交流，則直接餵養了一項建模結果：Recombistate 發現不同的事件順序會收斂到同一個最終 DNA 狀態，這改變了設計目標，推著他們走向一套模組化的感測-記憶-判讀工具組，同時明白表示這套工具組目前只是一個方向，而不是一組已驗證的成品。","realWorld":"The application target is industrial fermentation monitoring: a recorder that preserves information about transient stress events (glucose limitation, oxygen limitation) that a bulk probe reading cannot capture, read out after the run. Alginate-style encapsulation is part of the deployment concept, which is exactly why Capsule2Memory exists — the model shows that splitting one large bead into several of equal total biomass shortens the diffusion distance, but that insufficient interfacial exchange can still produce substantial error during a long low-glucose event, so size, cell loading and exchange capacity must be screened together rather than separately. The team repeatedly marks the boundary of the claim, noting that glucose trajectory, promoter response and DNA writing have not yet been measured in the same experiment.","realWorld_zh":"應用標的是工業發酵的監測：一個記錄器，用來保存整體探針讀值無法捕捉的瞬時壓力事件（葡萄糖限制、氧限制）的資訊，待運行結束後再讀出。海藻酸鹽類的包覆是部署構想的一部分，而這正是 Capsule2Memory 存在的理由：模型顯示把一顆大珠體拆成數顆、維持總生物量相同，可以縮短擴散距離，但界面交換不足時，在一段長時間的低葡萄糖事件中仍可能造成相當大的誤差，因此尺寸、細胞載量與交換容量必須一起篩選，而不是分開處理。團隊反覆標出主張的邊界，指出葡萄糖濃度軌跡、啟動子反應與 DNA 寫入三者尚未在同一個實驗中被量測過。","partners":["Jilin University","BYHEALTH","iGEM Northeast China Exchange (NECE)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6456/wiki/day-lab/model/model-1.avif","caption":"Figure 1: connections among the five models, with solid arrows for within-module workflows and documented design selections and dashed arrows for conceptual interfaces that are explicitly NOT a validated coupled prediction — a distinction that lets a reader see exactly where the chain of evidence is real and where it is aspiration.","caption_zh":"圖 1：五個模型之間的連結，實線箭頭代表模組內的工作流程與有文件記載的設計選擇，虛線箭頭代表概念性介面，並明確不是一項已驗證的耦合預測，而這個區分讓讀者能精確看出證據鏈在哪裡是真的、在哪裡只是期望。","credit":"Team Jilin-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6456/wiki/day-lab/model/model-4.avif","caption":"Figure 4: the three-way trade-off between codon adaptation index, predicted RNA opening energy of the 48 nt translation-initiation region, and number of nucleotide edits, shown as three aligned panels. The locally optimised candidate changed 15 nt and reached the lowest opening energy (7.90 kcal/mol); the full-length maxCAI design changed 352 nt to reach CAI 0.9948 but only 8.35 kcal/mol.","caption_zh":"圖 4：密碼子適應指數、48 nt 轉譯起始區的預測 RNA 開啟能量，以及核苷酸改動數之間的三方權衡，以三個對齊的面板呈現。局部最佳化的候選只改動 15 nt 就達到最低的開啟能量（7.90 kcal/mol）；全長的最大 CAI 設計改動了 352 nt 才達到 CAI 0.9948，但開啟能量只到 8.35 kcal/mol。","credit":"Team Jilin-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6456/wiki/day-lab/model/model-12.avif","caption":"Figure 12: dynamic responses to low-glucose events under equal-resource encapsulation designs, from the spherically symmetric reaction-diffusion model with Monod uptake. Splitting one bead into several of the same total biomass shortens the diffusion path, but finite interfacial exchange can still mistime a long low-glucose event.","caption_zh":"圖 12：在資源相同的各種包覆設計下對低葡萄糖事件的動態反應，取自採 Monod 型攝取的球對稱反應-擴散模型。把一顆珠體拆成數顆、總生物量維持相同，可以縮短擴散路徑，但有限的界面交換仍可能讓一段長時間的低葡萄糖事件被記錄在錯誤的時間點上。","credit":"Team Jilin-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6456/wiki/day-lab/model/model-20.avif","caption":"Figure 20: the conditional DNA-state graph for the reporter fragment, which separates sequence states (S0, SC, SF, SCF) from event histories. The two paths into SCF are different orders of the same two events reaching an identical final sequence, so the recorder cannot report event order — a negative result that changed the design goal.","caption_zh":"圖 20：報導子片段的條件式 DNA 狀態圖，把序列狀態（S0、SC、SF、SCF）與事件歷史分開。通往 SCF 的兩條路徑是同樣兩個事件的不同先後順序，卻抵達完全相同的最終序列，因此這個記錄器無法回報事件順序，而這個負面結果改變了設計目標。","credit":"Team Jilin-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Write every figure caption and every model claim with an explicit scope limit attached — what this calculation does not establish, which constructs and conditions it covers, which arrows in your diagram are validated and which are aspirational — and when a prediction disagrees with a measurement, publish the disagreement and demote the prediction rather than quietly dropping it. Jilin also shows the right way to use an off-the-shelf ML model: run a prespecified out-of-distribution check first, and if your target fails it, do not use the score.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"在每一張圖說與每一項模型主張上，都明確附上適用範圍限制，說明這項計算並未證明什麼、它涵蓋哪些構築體與條件、你的圖中哪些箭頭是已驗證的、哪些只是期望；而當預測與量測不符時，請把這個不一致公開並把預測降級，而不是悄悄把它拿掉。Jilin 也示範了使用現成機器學習模型的正確方式：先執行一項事先指定的分布外（OOD）檢查，如果你的標的沒通過，那就不要用那個分數。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/jilin-china/","https://2026.igem.wiki/jilin-china/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/jilin-china/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/jilin-china/human-practices/"],"awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（大學組）"],"rank":7},"6462":{"team":"Eton-College-UK","id":"6462","section":"High School","country":"United Kingdom","village":"Infectious Diseases, Therapeutics, Diagnostics & Oncology","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/","projectTitle":"ProteaSign","projectTitle_zh":"ProteaSign","tagline":"A point-of-care electrochemical sensor that quantifies individual protease activities in chronic wound exudate in about ten minutes.","tagline_zh":"一款照護現場的電化學感測器，約十分鐘內定量慢性傷口滲出液中各個蛋白酶的活性。","summary":"ProteaSign is a disposable-cartridge electrochemical diagnostic that separately measures MMP-9 (which degrades the extracellular matrix) and human neutrophil elastase (which degrades the growth factors needed for repair) in chronic wound fluid, turning wound assessment from a visual judgement into a measurement. The sensing interface is a gold electrode carrying methylene-blue-labelled, protease-cleavable peptides whose cleavage is read by square-wave voltammetry, with an independently anchored ferrocene reporter providing internal ratiometric normalisation and a matched non-cleavable peptide control on a second working electrode. The peptide sequences were not guessed: the team built a seven-protease machine-learning substrate predictor trained on 10,472 curated cleavage windows, and validated the predictions with two reprogrammable recombinant sfGFP protease biosensors. It won on the rare combination of genuinely publication-grade dry lab (cluster-aware cross-validation, Laplace-transform kinetics derivations, a physics-based SWV forward model), working hardware, and a human practices programme with over twenty named clinical and industrial stakeholders that visibly moved the design.","summary_zh":"ProteaSign 是一款採用一次性匣體的電化學診斷裝置，能分別量測慢性傷口液中的 MMP-9（分解細胞外基質）與人類嗜中性球彈性蛋白酶（分解修復所需的生長因子），把傷口評估從目視判斷變成量測。感測介面是一個金電極，表面帶有以亞甲藍標記、可被蛋白酶切斷的胜肽，其切斷情形以方波伏安法讀取；另有一個獨立固定的二茂鐵報告分子提供內部比率式標準化，並在第二個工作電極上設置配對的不可切斷胜肽對照。胜肽序列不是猜的：團隊建了一個涵蓋七種蛋白酶的機器學習受質預測器，以 10,472 個經整理的切割視窗訓練，並以兩套可重新編程的重組 sfGFP 蛋白酶生物感測器驗證預測結果。它之所以勝出，靠的是一個罕見的組合：真正達到可發表水準的乾實驗（具群集意識的交叉驗證、以拉普拉斯變換推導的動力學、基於物理的 SWV 正向模型）、能運作的硬體，以及一套有二十多位具名臨床與產業利害關係人、且明顯改變了設計的人類實踐計畫。","awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best Education — Nominee (High School)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Infectious Diseases / Therapeutics / Diagnostics / Oncology)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Three distinct modelling efforts, all unusually deep for high school. (1) A protease substrate predictor: for each of seven proteases (MMP-2, MMP-8, MMP-9, MMP-14, neutrophil elastase, LasB, and a pooled digestive serine protease group) they trained two additive scorers on 8-residue cleavage windows — an L2-regularised logistic regression on VHSE physicochemical descriptors (8 descriptors per residue, so 64 standardised features) and a BLOSUM62-smoothed position-specific scoring matrix — using 10,472 confirmed windows from MEROPS, Eckhard et al. 2016 proteomic MMP profiling, and a re-extracted LasB elastin-digestion table from Yang et al. 2015. Negatives were constructed 3:1 (half other proteases' real windows, half random Swiss-Prot 8-mers at natural amino-acid frequencies). (2) A surface-bound enzyme kinetics model: they derived both the steady-state solution and the exact biexponential solution for Michaelis-Menten kinetics on a surface-attached substrate using Laplace transforms and partial-fraction decomposition, then proved analytically and numerically that the steady-state approximation is only valid as their single parameter lambda approaches 1. (3) A square-wave voltammetry forward model (swv_forward_model.py) that computes net SWV current from probe-level physics — about 3.1e10 probes at 7.4 nm spacing, with a 1.4 nm methylene-blue lateral excursion used to justify treating probes as non-interacting.","frameworks_zh":"三項各自獨立的建模工作，對高中生來說都深得異常。(1) 蛋白酶受質預測器：針對七種蛋白酶（MMP-2、MMP-8、MMP-9、MMP-14、嗜中性球彈性蛋白酶、LasB，以及一個合併的消化性絲胺酸蛋白酶組），他們在 8 殘基的切割視窗上訓練了兩個加成式評分器——一個是以 VHSE 物理化學描述子（每個殘基 8 個描述子，因此共 64 個標準化特徵）為輸入的 L2 正規化邏輯斯迴歸，另一個是經 BLOSUM62 平滑的位置專一性評分矩陣——使用來自 MEROPS、Eckhard 等人 2016 年 MMP 蛋白質體剖析，以及從 Yang 等人 2015 年重新擷取的 LasB 彈性蛋白分解表，共 10,472 個已確認的視窗。負樣本以 3:1 建構（一半取自其他蛋白酶的真實視窗，一半是依天然胺基酸頻率隨機產生的 Swiss-Prot 8-mer）。(2) 表面結合酵素的動力學模型：他們以拉普拉斯變換與部分分式分解，同時推導出表面固定受質上 Michaelis-Menten 動力學的穩態解與精確的雙指數解，再以解析與數值兩種方式證明，穩態近似只有在他們定義的單一參數 lambda 趨近 1 時才成立。(3) 一個方波伏安法的正向模型（swv_forward_model.py），從探針層級的物理計算 SWV 淨電流——約 3.1e10 個探針、間距 7.4 nm，並以亞甲藍 1.4 nm 的側向擺動幅度來論證可以把探針視為彼此不交互作用。","dataviz":"The substrate predictor page ends in a live in-browser scorer ('Try It — Score a Peptide'): you type a peptide, mark the scissile bond, and every protease in the panel scores it as you type, with warm/cool per-position attribution bars that sum exactly to the logit and the PSSM score, and grey bars for unknown (gapped) positions. The sensor probe itself is shown scored at every bond by the MMP-9 and elastase models, with the P4-to-P4' window shaded and the actual cut marked. The SWV page carries an interactive forward-model plot where moving across reads every predicted current curve at one potential. Results are presented as out-of-fold ROC curves, precision-recall curves against a 0.25 prior, and held-out percentile distributions against a uniform null, plus paired difference plots with 95% cluster-bootstrap intervals where a filled marker means the interval excludes zero. Equations are rendered in KaTeX and the human practices page uses globe.gl.","dataviz_zh":"受質預測器那一頁以一個可在瀏覽器即時執行的評分器收尾（「Try It — Score a Peptide」）：你輸入一條胜肽、標出要切斷的鍵，面板中每一種蛋白酶都會隨著你打字即時評分，並以暖色／冷色的逐位點貢獻長條呈現，其總和恰好等於邏輯斯迴歸的 logit 與 PSSM 分數，未知（有缺口）的位置則以灰色長條表示。感測探針本身也被呈現為由 MMP-9 與彈性蛋白酶模型對每一個鍵評分的結果，P4 到 P4' 的視窗加上底色，實際切點也標示出來。SWV 那一頁有一張互動的正向模型圖，橫向移動即可在同一電位下讀出每一條預測電流曲線。結果以折外（out-of-fold）ROC 曲線、對照 0.25 先驗的精確率—召回率曲線，以及保留樣本相對於均勻虛無分布的百分位分布呈現，另有配對差異圖搭配 95% 群集拔靴區間，其中實心標記代表區間不含零。方程式以 KaTeX 呈現，人類實踐頁面則使用 globe.gl。","datascience":"The evaluation methodology is the real achievement and is more careful than most undergraduate iGEM dry lab. They recognised that near-duplicate cleavage windows cause data leakage under ordinary K-fold CV, so they defined Hamming-distance clusters (any pair with d_H <= 2, taken as connected components, found in near-linear time via a 3+3+2-block pigeonhole trick with union-find) and used stratified group 5-fold splitting whole clusters, with a nested 3-fold inner CV to pick the regularisation strength C per protease, and the null percentile distribution and PSSM rebuilt per outer fold to avoid leaking into the background. They separated two questions — Detection (held-out positives vs random background) and Discrimination (held-out positives vs another protease's confirmed sites), noting the latter is what actually matters for a multiplexed sensor. They derived and Monte-Carlo-verified an analytic ceiling on measured AUROC under false negatives (measured AUROC <= 1 - pi/2 for a fraction pi of mislabelled negatives), ran three controls (label shuffle collapsing AUROC to 0.49-0.53; composition-only ablation showing e.g. 0.664 vs 0.874 for MMP-2 but 0.886 vs 0.877 for LasB because 76% of its positives come from elastin; and random vs cluster-aware folds, where LasB drops 0.886 to 0.879 once leakage is removed). Scores from the two models are converted to percentiles against 100,000 random Swiss-Prot background windows so they are comparable across proteases, combined by harmonic mean (high only when both are high), and reported as a 'specificity margin' = target consensus percentile minus the strongest competitor's. They also published an explicit list of eight assumptions and limitations, including that additivity costs at most 0.007 AUROC against gradient-boosted trees, that VHSE PCA captures only 64-79% of the full positional signal, and that the harmonic-mean consensus was reasoned rather than validated.","datascience_zh":"評估方法論才是真正的成就，而且比大多數大學部 iGEM 的乾實驗更謹慎。他們認知到近乎重複的切割視窗會在一般 K 折交叉驗證下造成資料洩漏，於是定義了漢明距離群集（任何一對 d_H <= 2 的序列視為相連，取其連通分量，並以 3+3+2 分塊的鴿籠原理技巧加上併查集在近線性時間內求出），再以分層群組 5 折切分、把整個群集一起分配，另以內層巢狀 3 折交叉驗證為每種蛋白酶挑選正規化強度 C，而虛無百分位分布與 PSSM 都在每一個外層折內重建，以避免洩漏進背景分布。他們把兩個問題分開——偵測（保留的正樣本對隨機背景）與辨別（保留的正樣本對另一種蛋白酶已確認的切位），並指出後者才是多工感測器真正在意的。他們推導並以蒙地卡羅驗證了在存在偽陰性時實測 AUROC 的解析上限（若有比例 pi 的負樣本被誤標，則實測 AUROC <= 1 - pi/2），並跑了三項對照（標籤打亂使 AUROC 塌到 0.49-0.53；只用組成的消融實驗顯示，例如 MMP-2 為 0.664 對 0.874，但 LasB 為 0.886 對 0.877，因為它有 76% 的正樣本來自彈性蛋白；以及隨機折對具群集意識的折，其中 LasB 在洩漏被移除後從 0.886 降到 0.879）。兩個模型的分數都換算成相對於 100,000 個隨機 Swiss-Prot 背景視窗的百分位，使不同蛋白酶之間可以比較，再以調和平均合併（只有兩者都高時才會高），並以「專一性邊際」= 標的共識百分位減去最強競爭者的百分位來報告。他們也公開列出八項明確的假設與限制，包括：相對於梯度提升樹，加成性最多只損失 0.007 的 AUROC；VHSE 的主成分分析只擷取了完整位置訊號的 64-79%；以及調和平均的共識做法是推理得出、而非驗證過的。","software":"The substrate predictor is released as a protease-agnostic Python package (modules spred.data, spred.model, spred.pssm, spred.train, spred.validation, spred.evaluation, spred.panel) that another team retrains on its own protease panel's known substrates on a basic laptop in a few hours; the team explicitly frames it as a reusable contribution. Hardware: a handheld reader built around the Analog Devices AD5940 electrochemical analogue front end with an nRF52840 microcontroller and a TI TMUX1104 4:1 precision multiplexer, sequentially interrogating four working electrodes against a shared reference and counter electrode, with full KiCad schematics (5 sheets) and an exported bill of materials released as PDF. The hardware builds on the open-source Biocoin wearable multiplexed biosensing platform (github.com/ProfDrewHall/Biocoin; Hack & Hall, npj Biosensing 2026). They also contribute two reprogrammable recombinant protease biosensors with swappable substrate 'cassettes': pES-01 (FLAG-sfGFP / peptide / C-terminal His6, read by Ni-NTA depletion, ELISA, Western blot or SDS-PAGE) and pDUAL (split-sfGFP with GFP11 embedded in an eglin c surface loop, giving a fluorescence readout). Code and wiki at https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/eton-college-uk.","software_zh":"受質預測器以一個與蛋白酶無關的 Python 套件釋出（模組有 spred.data、spred.model、spred.pssm、spred.train、spred.validation、spred.evaluation、spred.panel），其他隊伍可以用自己蛋白酶面板的已知受質，在一台普通筆電上花幾小時重新訓練；團隊明確把它定位為可重複使用的貢獻。硬體方面：一台手持讀取器，核心是 Analog Devices 的 AD5940 電化學類比前端，搭配 nRF52840 微控制器與 TI TMUX1104 的 4:1 精密多工器，依序對四個工作電極相對於共用的參考與對電極進行詢測，並釋出完整的 KiCad 電路圖（5 張圖頁）與匯出的材料清單（BOM）PDF。硬體建立在開源的 Biocoin 穿戴式多工生物感測平台之上（github.com/ProfDrewHall/Biocoin；Hack 與 Hall，npj Biosensing 2026）。他們也貢獻了兩套可重新編程、受質「卡匣」可替換的重組蛋白酶生物感測器：pES-01（FLAG-sfGFP／胜肽／C 端 His6，可用 Ni-NTA 耗竭、ELISA、西方墨點法或 SDS-PAGE 讀取）與 pDUAL（分裂式 sfGFP，把 GFP11 嵌在 eglin c 的表面環中，提供螢光讀數）。程式碼與 wiki 在 https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/eton-college-uk 。","stack":["Python","scikit-learn","NumPy","SciPy","logistic regression (L2)","position-specific scoring matrix (PSSM)","BLOSUM62","VHSE amino-acid descriptors","gradient-boosted trees (ablation)","MEROPS database","NCBI/UniProt","Swiss-Prot background frequencies","React + Vite wiki SPA","KaTeX","globe.gl","KiCad","AD5940 AFE","nRF52840","TMUX1104 multiplexer","GitLab (iGEM)"],"techniques":["cluster-aware stratified group K-fold cross-validation","Hamming-distance clustering with union-find + pigeonhole blocking","nested inner cross-validation for hyperparameter selection","cluster bootstrap confidence intervals (500 resamples)","AUROC and precision-recall evaluation","label-shuffle, composition-only and fold-construction controls","analytic false-negative bound on AUROC with Monte Carlo verification","percentile normalisation against a 100,000-window null","harmonic-mean consensus scoring and specificity margin","gapped-window masking (neutral logistic features, background-weighted PSSM expectation)","Laplace transform solution of surface enzyme kinetics","partial fraction decomposition","square-wave voltammetry forward modelling","ratiometric (MB/Fc) internal normalisation","self-assembled monolayer electrode functionalisation"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A genuinely reusable education portfolio rather than a set of one-off visits. 'What If?' is a team-written and illustrated comic modelled on Marvel's What If...? series, built directly from the four ideas children drew at the Eton Porny workshop (colour-changing plants, bacteria making medicines, programmable cells, healing wounds); over 350 printed copies were distributed in two months and it was translated into two further languages. A 58-page Activities Handbook of printable exercises at graded difficulty, with instructions and answer keys written in conversation with a secondary school teacher, was inspired by Leiden iGEM 2025's approach to reusable materials. 'Bio-Detectives' is a museum-sabotage mystery workshop for Year 8 in which teams work five stations — reconstructing DNA sequences, exploring protein production, critiquing flawed experiments, comparing lab labels, and modelling genetic control through AND/OR/NOR gates — and must explain their reasoning to unlock each piece of evidence, ending in a fixed-budget redesign task; student and facilitator packs plus the presentation are released so it can be rerun. Year 11 volunteers facilitated and reported their own gains ('I'm not a science student but still really enjoyed it because of the mystery format'). They report honestly that the content was too hard for pupils who had not yet met DNA and recommend targeting Year 10/11 instead. Other sessions: a hands-on goat-DNA genetic modification build for 34 Year 5 pupils at St George's Windsor (physically assembling glowing / curly-hair / spider-silk gene templates from spare nucleotides), an edible animal-cell modelling workshop with a published allergen risk assessment, protease kits for a carers' workshop, street interviews (8 of N respondents had no personal experience of chronic wounds), and biosafety videos.","publicEngagement_zh":"一套真正可重複使用的教育作品集，而不是幾場一次性的參訪。《What If?》是團隊自行撰寫與繪製的漫畫，形式模仿 Marvel 的《What If...?》系列，內容直接取自孩子們在 Eton Porny 工作坊畫出的四個想法（會變色的植物、會製藥的細菌、可程式化的細胞、癒合傷口）；兩個月內發出 350 多本印刷本，並譯成另外兩種語言。一本 58 頁的《活動手冊》收錄可列印、分難度等級的練習，說明與答案是與一位中學教師對談後寫成的，靈感來自 Leiden iGEM 2025 製作可重複使用材料的做法。「Bio-Detectives」是一場為八年級設計的博物館破壞案推理工作坊，各組要走過五個站——重建 DNA 序列、探索蛋白質生產、批判有缺陷的實驗、比較實驗室標籤，以及用 AND/OR/NOR 邏輯閘模擬基因調控——而且必須說明自己的推理才能解鎖每一項證據，最後以一項固定預算的重新設計任務收尾；學生包、帶領者包與投影片都已釋出，使這場工作坊可以再辦。十一年級的志工擔任帶領者，並回報自己也有收穫（「我不是念科學的，但因為是推理解謎的形式，我還是玩得很開心」）。他們誠實報告，內容對還沒學過 DNA 的學生來說太難，並建議改以十／十一年級為對象。其他場次包括：為溫莎聖喬治學校 34 位五年級學生設計的動手做山羊 DNA 基因改造活動（用備用的核苷酸實體拼出會發光／捲毛／蛛絲等基因模板）、一場可食用動物細胞模型工作坊並公開其過敏原風險評估、為照顧者工作坊準備的蛋白酶套件、街頭訪問（N 位受訪者中有 8 位對慢性傷口沒有親身經驗），以及生物安全影片。","ihp":"Over twenty named stakeholders across wound care, electrochemistry, health economics, regulation and patient advocacy, with a 'pinpoint / event / action' structure that states what changed. Concrete examples: Dr Anatoliy Markiv (King's College London) moved them off pET-24a(+) to pSB1C3 as a reusable starting plasmid, reviewed their primers and proposed a better substrate-swapping method, and pointed them to the split-GFP protease-sensing paper that became their second design cycle; he also required construct sequences for biosafety assessment before permitting experiments. Dr Ben Bullen (podiatry) cemented the reusable-reader / disposable-cartridge split and the ~20 microlitre sample volume, and set a 15-minute workflow target against the team's estimated 30 minutes — which the team records as an unmet goal requiring shorter incubation. Ms Kathleen Leak (tissue viability) and Trish Idensohn drove the requirement for fast readouts and simple operating procedures, which produced the cartridge's standardised metering, dilution and incubation steps before SWV acquisition. Dr Honda Hsu (plastic surgeon, Taiwan) confirmed the device fits a real clinical workflow and his account of delegated wound care created an explicit usability requirement that routine dressing-change staff, not just specialists, must be able to run it. Dr Kevin Lye (Accorto Regulatory Solutions) and Dr Douglas Queen (health economics of wound care) covered the regulatory and reimbursement path; Dr Martin Peacock (Zimmer and Peacock) and Professor Kevin Lam (synthetic electrochemistry, Greenwich) and Dr Ana Maria Totea advised on electrodes and liquid handling; Professor Keith Harding (Cardiff), Professor Steven Jeffery (Pioneer Wound Clinics), Professor Dato Harikrishna Nair, Professor Paul Davis (co-founder of Mologic) and Professor Eleanor Stride (Oxford biomedical engineering) reviewed the clinical and device case. Patient and charity voices included 'Bob', a person living with a chronic wound, Breakthrough T1D and Diabetes Scotland. Feedback also reinforced measuring cleavage rate with calibration across known enzyme concentrations. The anonymised 'David' narrative on the description page is explicitly constructed from real accounts heard through these conversations.","ihp_zh":"二十多位具名利害關係人，橫跨傷口照護、電化學、健康經濟、法規與病友倡議，並以「指出問題／事件／採取行動」的結構說明改了什麼。具體例子：Dr Anatoliy Markiv（倫敦國王學院）讓他們從 pET-24a(+) 改用 pSB1C3 作為可重複使用的起始質體、審閱了他們的引子並提出更好的受質替換方法，也把他們指向那篇分裂式 GFP 蛋白酶偵測的論文，後來成為他們的第二輪設計循環；他同時要求在允許實驗之前先提供構築序列以供生物安全評估。Dr Ben Bullen（足部醫學）確立了「可重複使用讀取器 + 一次性匣體」的拆分與約 20 微升的檢體體積，並對照團隊估計的 30 分鐘訂下 15 分鐘的流程目標——團隊把這記錄為一項尚未達成的目標，需要縮短孵育時間。Ms Kathleen Leak（組織存活）與 Trish Idensohn 推動了快速讀數與簡單操作程序的要求，這產出了匣體在 SWV 取樣前標準化的計量、稀釋與孵育步驟。Dr Honda Hsu（台灣，整形外科醫師）確認這個裝置符合真實的臨床流程，而他描述傷口照護如何被授權給他人執行，則催生出一項明確的可用性要求：不只是專科人員，連日常換藥的人員也必須能操作它。Dr Kevin Lye（Accorto Regulatory Solutions）與 Dr Douglas Queen（傷口照護健康經濟）涵蓋了法規與給付路徑；Dr Martin Peacock（Zimmer and Peacock）、Professor Kevin Lam（格林威治，合成電化學）與 Dr Ana Maria Totea 就電極與液體處理提供建議；Professor Keith Harding（卡地夫）、Professor Steven Jeffery（Pioneer Wound Clinics）、Professor Dato Harikrishna Nair、Professor Paul Davis（Mologic 共同創辦人）與 Professor Eleanor Stride（牛津生醫工程）審閱了臨床與裝置面的論證。病友與公益團體的聲音包括一位與慢性傷口共處的當事人「Bob」、Breakthrough T1D 與 Diabetes Scotland。回饋也強化了「以已知酵素濃度做校正、量測切割速率」這項做法。描述頁上那段匿名的「David」敘事，明確說明是從這些對話中聽到的真實經歷建構而成。","realWorld":"The implementation page is a structured device risk assessment rather than a business pitch: it enumerates infection transfer through reusable components, pain or damage to fragile healing tissue, allergic reaction to wound-contacting materials, unnecessary anxiety or treatment escalation from false positives, and exposure of identifiable patient data, each with a named mitigation (prefer single-use patient-contacting components, biocompatibility assessment of all wound-contacting materials, clinically justified interpretation criteria with evaluated specificity and false-positive rates, calibration and quality-control procedures with error alerts and clear invalid-test instructions, minimised personal data collection with access restriction and retention policies). The intended route to market is a reusable reader plus disposable cartridge for community wound care — GPs, wound-care nurses, podiatrists and carers — positioned to guide selection of the existing protease-modulating dressings (e.g. UrgoStart) and to track proteolytic activity over time alongside wound size. Costing came from the KiCad bill of materials plus estimated enclosure and reagent costs. The team is candid that clinical validation, bacterial confounding of the chosen peptides, and testing on real clinical samples all remain outstanding. A Smith + Nephew work experience business insight day and an Imperial iGEM mini-jamboree (24 August, UK and European teams) fed the commercial framing.","realWorld_zh":"落地頁面是一份有結構的裝置風險評估、而不是商業提案：它列舉了透過可重複使用元件傳播感染、對脆弱癒合組織造成疼痛或傷害、對接觸傷口材料的過敏反應、偽陽性引發不必要的焦慮或治療升級，以及可識別病人資料的外洩，每一項都附具名的緩解措施（優先採用一次性的接觸病人元件、對所有接觸傷口的材料做生物相容性評估、以經評估的專一性與偽陽性率制定臨床上站得住腳的判讀準則、校正與品管程序並搭配錯誤警示與明確的無效檢測指示、將個人資料收集降到最低並設定存取限制與保存政策）。預期的上市路徑是一台可重複使用的讀取器加一次性匣體，用於社區傷口照護——家醫、傷口照護護理師、足部醫師與照顧者——定位是協助選擇既有的蛋白酶調節敷料（例如 UrgoStart），並與傷口大小並行追蹤蛋白酶解活性隨時間的變化。成本估算來自 KiCad 的材料清單加上外殼與試劑的估計成本。團隊坦白表示臨床驗證、所選胜肽受細菌干擾的問題，以及在真實臨床檢體上的測試都仍未完成。Smith + Nephew 的工作體驗商業洞察日與帝國理工 iGEM 的小型 jamboree（8 月 24 日，英國與歐洲隊伍）則餵養了商業面的框架。","partners":["Dr Anatoliy Markiv (King's College London)","Dr Ciaran Devoy (author of the synthetic protein protease sensor platform)","Dr Brian Callahan (split-GFP protease sensing)","Dr Ben Bullen (podiatry and wound care)","Ms Kathleen Leak (tissue viability specialist)","Trish Idensohn","Dr Honda Hsu (plastic surgeon, Taiwan)","Professor Keith Harding (Wound Healing Research Unit, Cardiff University)","Professor Steven Jeffery (Pioneer Wound Clinics)","Professor Dato Harikrishna Nair","Professor Eleanor Stride (University of Oxford)","Professor Robert Marks (biosensors and biotechnology)","Professor Kevin Lam (University of Greenwich)","Professor Paul Davis (co-founder of Mologic)","Dr Martin Peacock (Zimmer and Peacock)","Dr Ana Maria Totea","Dr Kevin Lye (Accorto Regulatory Solutions)","Dr Douglas Queen (health economics of wound care)","Breakthrough T1D","Diabetes Scotland","Smith + Nephew (business insight day)","Imperial College London iGEM (mini-jamboree)","Professor Drew Hall / Biocoin open-source platform"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6462/wiki/f09.avif","caption":"Out-of-fold performance of the consensus score for all seven proteases: ROC curves with per-protease detection AUROC, precision-recall curves against a 0.25 prior, and the distribution of held-out positives' consensus percentiles against the uniform null.","caption_zh":"七種蛋白酶共識分數的折外表現：附每種蛋白酶偵測 AUROC 的 ROC 曲線、對照 0.25 先驗的精確率—召回率曲線，以及保留正樣本的共識百分位相對於均勻虛無分布的分布。","credit":"Team Eton-College-UK, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6462/wiki/probe-cleavage-mmp9.webp","caption":"The sensing probe before and after MMP-9 cleavage: methylene blue on peptide SGKIPRTLTA joined by a PEG6 spacer to the gold electrode among ferrocene-hexanethiol, cut between T7 and L8, releasing the MB-ATL fragment.","caption_zh":"感測探針在 MMP-9 切斷前後的樣子：亞甲藍接在胜肽 SGKIPRTLTA 上，以 PEG6 間隔基連到金電極、位於二茂鐵—己硫醇之間，在 T7 與 L8 之間被切斷，釋出 MB-ATL 片段。","credit":"Team Eton-College-UK, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6462/wiki/wiring-diagram.webp","caption":"Wiring diagram of the ProteaSign reader, built around the AD5940 electrochemical analogue front end and an nRF52840 microcontroller multiplexing four working electrodes.","caption_zh":"ProteaSign 讀取器的接線圖，核心是 AD5940 電化學類比前端與一個 nRF52840 微控制器，以多工方式輪詢四個工作電極。","credit":"Team Eton-College-UK, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6462/wiki/bio-detectives.webp","caption":"Year 8 pupils at Holyport working through the Bio-Detectives museum-sabotage clues with a team member; student and facilitator packs were released so the workshop can be rerun.","caption_zh":"Holyport 的八年級學生與一位隊員一起解開 Bio-Detectives 博物館破壞案的線索；學生包與帶領者包都已釋出，使這場工作坊可以再辦。","credit":"Team Eton-College-UK, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy their evaluation discipline, not just their model: before reporting any ML metric, cluster near-duplicate sequences by Hamming distance and split whole clusters across folds, then run a label-shuffle control and an ablation that strips the information you claim to be using — three cheap steps that turn a high-school classifier from a number into evidence. Their second transferable move is shipping the model as a live in-browser scorer with per-position attribution bars, so a judge or clinician can interrogate the prediction instead of taking the AUROC on trust.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"值得借鏡的是他們的評估紀律、而不只是他們的模型：在報告任何機器學習指標之前，先以漢明距離把近乎重複的序列分群，並把整個群集一起分到同一折，再跑一次標籤打亂對照，以及一次剝除你聲稱正在使用的資訊的消融實驗——這三個便宜的步驟，就能把一個高中生的分類器從一個數字變成證據。他們第二項可移植的做法是把模型做成可在瀏覽器即時執行的評分器，並附逐位點的貢獻長條，讓評審或臨床醫師能質問這個預測、而不必單憑信任接受那個 AUROC。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/","https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/assets/DescriptionPage-CRFAzJI5.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/assets/SubstratePredictorPage-CyEQQMJS.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/assets/SurfaceEnzymeKineticsPage-B3hFHqb0.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/assets/SWVPage-Dx0cJgd7.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/assets/HardwarePage-DvJAf84t.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/assets/HumanPracticesPage-Dqe8y5eH.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/assets/EducationPage-DjCpVrhR.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/assets/ImplementationPage-kdhRbM8d.js","https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/assets/ContributionPage-brszWapD.js","https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/eton-college-uk"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（傳染病 / 治療 / 診斷 / 腫瘤）"],"rank":91},"6463":{"team":"Yucai-SZ","id":"6463","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/yucai-sz/","projectTitle":"SpotAway: a dry-activatable emergency stain patch","tagline":"De novo designed pigment binders and a lipase fusion, measured with explicit methodological boundaries on every assay.","summary":"Yucai-SZ designed SpotAway, a concept for a portable dry patch that treats fresh oil stains where they happen. The functional layer pairs a cellulose-binding-module fusion carrying a de novo designed capsanthin binder, for capturing the hydrophobic pigment in chili oil, with a triolein-binding-domain lipase fusion that anchors near oil droplets and hydrolyses triglycerides, all held in a trehalose-mannitol-protected xerogel that is rehydrated with one or two drops of water. The dry lab extended the standard Foundry de novo design pipeline by layering a docking-based binding-ability pre-test onto structural screening, after wet-lab results showed that structural metrics alone could not rank candidates. What distinguishes the measurement work is that every assay is published with a section defining what it cannot show.","awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Four measurement modules (M1 to M4), each written as introduction, experimental setup and validation, results and discussion, methodological boundaries, and applications. The boundaries section is not an afterthought: it states the wavelength, concentration range, temperature and pH over which each conclusion holds and names the techniques that would be required to go further. Four wet-lab Design-Build-Test-Learn cycles are layered onto a two-round computational screening loop in which wet-lab disagreement with the dry-lab ranking is the trigger for changing the pipeline.","dataviz":"UV background scans from 240 to 320 nm in 5 nm steps for seven separate control groups, with the absorbance maximum arrowed on each; delta-OD bar charts with mean +/- SD, individual significance annotations and n stated; two paired standard curves for the lead binder, one for protein quantification and one for the binding response; time-course photographs of pigment adsorption alongside the quantitative data; lycopene stability curves comparing light-exposed and light-protected groups over 270 minutes with the sample photographs beside them; an oleic acid calibration curve.","datascience":"The measurement wavelength is derived rather than assumed. Seven control groups covering buffer, pure solvent, the biphasic solvent background, pigment absorption and intrinsic protein absorption were scanned from 240 to 320 nm in 5 nm increments, which showed the binder's 280 nm peak shifting about 5 nm shorter in the petroleum-ether biphasic system, fixing 275 nm as the quantification wavelength, with the explicit rule that 275 nm must not be adopted without rescanning if the pigment, solvent ratio or biphasic conditions change. Protein specificity of the response is then tested with a negative protein control, egg white, which also absorbs near 280 nm but does not reproduce a comparable delta-OD on adding capsanthin, and independent-samples t-tests distinguish genuine responses (Binder-1 and Binder-3 increased, p < 0.01; Binder-2 decreased, p < 0.001) from non-responses (Binder-4 and egg white, not significant). Two standard curves are built for the lead candidate rather than one, a binder concentration curve at 275 nm over 0 to 1.5 mg/mL (y = 0.388x + 0.03, R2 = 0.990) to account for protein background and a delta-OD against concentration curve (y = 0.108x - 0.006, R2 = 0.993) measured against a blank at matched binder concentration after a 30-minute light-protected reaction, with the stated limit that the fits are valid only over 0 to 1.5 mg/mL and must not be extrapolated, and that the method cannot yield a dissociation constant, which would require ligand titration across orders of magnitude and separation of free from bound states by SPR, ITC, MST or fluorescence quenching. The most instructive module is M3, where transferring the UV strategy to lycopene produced unstable results and the team stopped to measure the measurement system itself: a lycopene standard curve in petroleum ether (y = 0.1109x - 0.00223, R2 = 0.994) plus light-exposed and light-protected time series read at 0, 30, 60, 120, 180, 240 and 270 minutes showed the OD474.5 signal drifting with an apparent half-life of about 2.5 hours under illumination, which meant an observed OD change could not be attributed to binder activity. The team terminated the lycopene route on that basis and states the conclusion precisely, that the current lycopene assay system lacks sufficient stability for binder assessment, not that lycopene cannot be used at all, and notes that they did not identify the degradation products or separate photodegradation from thermal degradation. Lipase activity is quantified by copper-soap colorimetry at 710 nm against an oleic acid standard curve (y = 0.0123x + 0.0452, R2 = 0.999), with free lipase at 4.19 U/mL and the Lipase-Binder fusion at 3.68 U/mL at matched 1 mg/mL protein (87.8% retention), and the team is careful that the 143% apparent retention per catalytic centre is a theoretical molar correction based on an unverified 1.63x molecular-weight ratio calculated from amino acid composition, not an independent measurement of enhancement. The unit is defined (1 U equals 1 umol fatty acid released per minute at 37 C and pH 7.0) and the assay conditions are justified against the intended use, olive oil as a stand-in for the long-chain triglycerides in cooking-oil stains, 37 C as warm-water washing and pH 7.0 as neutral washing, while stating that performance at 20 C or pH 9 to 10 is not established.","software":"The computational pipeline is built on RFdiffusion3 for backbone generation, LigandMPNN for sequence design, RoseTTAFold3 for pTM and ipTM structure evaluation with RMSD as a designability filter, and AutoDock Vina docking added in round two as a binding-ability pre-screen after the wet lab showed that four candidates with near-identical structural metrics behaved very differently in adsorption. Redesigning 200 sequences on the Binder-1 backbone and docking-screening them produced Binder-5 with the strongest predicted binding energy (-10.9 kcal/mol), which improved about 40% over its parent in the wet lab without overtaking the round-one best candidate, a result the team reports as showing docking can rescue weak candidates rather than as a validation of docking.","stack":["UV-Vis spectrophotometry (240 to 320 nm scans, 275 nm and 474.5 nm quantification)","Copper-soap colorimetry at 710 nm","RFdiffusion3","LigandMPNN","RoseTTAFold3","AutoDock Vina","PubChem ligand preparation","Independent-samples t-tests"],"techniques":["Wavelength selection by multi-control background scanning","Negative protein control to establish specificity","Paired standard curves (protein background and response)","Declared linear range with no extrapolation","Analyte stability testing before attributing signal change","Light-exposed versus light-protected controls with a time series","Apparent half-life as a measurement-window criterion","Enzyme activity in defined units against a calibration curve","Assay conditions matched to intended use conditions","Explicit methodological boundaries section per assay","Dry-lab ranking tested against wet-lab outcome"],"frameworks_zh":"四個量測模組（M1 至 M4），每一個都寫成導言、實驗設置與驗證、結果與討論、方法學邊界，以及應用。方法學邊界那一節不是事後補的裝飾：它寫明每個結論成立的波長、濃度範圍、溫度與 pH，並點名若要再往前走需要哪些技術。四輪濕實驗的 Design-Build-Test-Learn 循環疊在一個兩輪的計算篩選迴圈上，而濕實驗結果與乾實驗排序不一致，就是改動管線的觸發條件。","dataviz_zh":"七組獨立對照的 UV 背景掃描，從 240 到 320 nm 每 5 nm 一步，每一組都以箭頭標出吸收最大值；delta-OD 柱狀圖附平均值 +/- 標準差、逐項顯著性標註與 n 值；主要結合蛋白有兩條配對的標準曲線，一條用於蛋白定量、一條用於結合反應；色素吸附的時序照片與定量數據並列；茄紅素穩定性曲線比較曝光組與避光組在 270 分鐘內的變化，旁邊附上樣品照片；以及一條油酸校正曲線。","datascience_zh":"量測波長是推導出來的，而不是直接假設的。涵蓋緩衝液、純溶劑、雙相溶劑背景、色素吸收與蛋白本身吸收的七組對照，從 240 掃到 320 nm、每 5 nm 一步，結果顯示結合蛋白的 280 nm 峰在石油醚雙相系統中往短波方向位移約 5 nm，因此把 275 nm 定為定量波長；並明訂一條規則：若色素、溶劑比例或雙相條件改變，未重新掃描前不得逕自採用 275 nm。反應的蛋白專一性則以蛋白陰性對照（蛋清）檢驗——它同樣在 280 nm 附近有吸收，但加入辣椒紅素後並不會產生可比的 delta-OD；獨立樣本 t 檢定把真正的反應（Binder-1 與 Binder-3 上升，p < 0.01；Binder-2 下降，p < 0.001）與無反應（Binder-4 與蛋清，未達顯著）區分開來。主要候選分子建了兩條標準曲線而不是一條：一條是 275 nm 下 0 至 1.5 mg/mL 的結合蛋白濃度曲線（y = 0.388x + 0.03，R2 = 0.990），用來扣除蛋白背景；另一條是 delta-OD 對濃度的曲線（y = 0.108x - 0.006，R2 = 0.993），在避光反應 30 分鐘後，對照相同結合蛋白濃度的空白量測。限制也寫明了：擬合只在 0 至 1.5 mg/mL 區間內成立，不得外推；而且這個方法得不到解離常數——那需要跨數個數量級的配體滴定，並以 SPR、ITC、MST 或螢光淬熄把游離態與結合態分開。最有啟發性的模組是 M3：把這套 UV 策略移到茄紅素上時結果不穩定，團隊於是停下來量測量測系統本身——石油醚中的茄紅素標準曲線（y = 0.1109x - 0.00223，R2 = 0.994），加上在 0、30、60、120、180、240 與 270 分鐘讀取的曝光組與避光組時間序列，顯示 OD474.5 的訊號會漂移，照光下的表觀半衰期約 2.5 小時；這意味著觀察到的 OD 變化無法歸因於結合蛋白的作用。團隊據此終止茄紅素這條路線，並把結論寫得很精準：是目前的茄紅素分析系統穩定性不足、不適合用於評估結合蛋白，而不是茄紅素完全不能用；他們也註明自己沒有鑑定降解產物，也沒有把光降解與熱降解分開。脂解酶活性以 710 nm 的銅皂比色法對油酸標準曲線（y = 0.0123x + 0.0452，R2 = 0.999）定量：在蛋白濃度同為 1 mg/mL 的條件下，游離脂解酶為 4.19 U/mL，Lipase-Binder 融合蛋白為 3.68 U/mL（保留 87.8%）。團隊很謹慎地指出，每個催化中心表觀保留 143% 這個數字，是基於由胺基酸組成推算、未經驗證的 1.63 倍分子量比所做的理論莫耳修正，而不是對活性提升的獨立量測。單位也有定義（1 U 等於在 37 C、pH 7.0 下每分鐘釋出 1 umol 脂肪酸），而分析條件也對照預定用途逐一說明理由：以橄欖油代表食用油污中的長鏈三酸甘油酯、37 C 代表溫水洗滌、pH 7.0 代表中性洗滌；同時聲明在 20 C 或 pH 9 至 10 下的表現尚未確立。","software_zh":"計算管線以 RFdiffusion3 產生骨架、LigandMPNN 設計序列、RoseTTAFold3 以 pTM 與 ipTM 評估結構並以 RMSD 作為可設計性篩選；第二輪則加入 AutoDock Vina 對接作為結合能力預篩，因為濕實驗顯示四個結構指標幾乎相同的候選，在吸附行為上差異很大。他們在 Binder-1 的骨架上重新設計 200 條序列並做對接篩選，得到預測結合能最強的 Binder-5（-10.9 kcal/mol），在濕實驗中比其母體改善約 40%，但仍未超越第一輪的最佳候選；團隊把這個結果報告成對接能救回弱候選，而不是當成對接方法本身的驗證。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"The team runs an education programme and publishes a cookbook alongside the project, with collaborations and a sustainable-development-goals page documenting wider activity.","ihp":"The project began from a questionnaire with 719 valid responses plus interviews with hotpot enthusiasts, used to test whether the team's own experience of oil stains reflected a broader need before committing to the problem.","realWorld":"An entrepreneurship page accompanies the project. The team is careful to describe the patch as a concept whose integration remains to be experimentally validated, and frames the measurement conditions, 37 C and pH 7.0 with olive oil as substrate, as deliberately matching the product's intended use so that the reported activity reflects performance in context rather than serving only as a proof of principle.","partners":[],"publicEngagement_zh":"團隊經營一套教育計畫，並隨專案出版一本食譜，另有合作與永續發展目標頁面記錄更廣泛的活動。","ihp_zh":"專案起點是一份有 719 份有效回覆的問卷，加上對火鍋愛好者的訪談，用來在投入這個問題之前，檢驗團隊自己對油污的經驗是否反映了更普遍的需求。","realWorld_zh":"專案另附一個創業頁面。團隊謹慎地把貼片描述為一個概念，其整合仍待實驗驗證；並說明量測條件（37 C、pH 7.0，以橄欖油為基質）是刻意對應產品的預定用途，使所報告的活性反映的是在使用情境下的表現，而不只是作為原理驗證。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6463/wiki/wetlab-oct15/figure-17a5a3588f362703.avif","caption":"Standard curves for the lead binder at 275 nm: a protein quantification curve in petroleum ether (R2 = 0.990) used to account for protein background, and the delta-OD against concentration curve for Binder-2 in the capsanthin system (R2 = 0.993), both declared valid only over 0 to 1.5 mg/mL.","credit":"Team Yucai-SZ, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"主要結合蛋白在 275 nm 的標準曲線：石油醚中的蛋白定量曲線（R2 = 0.990），用於扣除蛋白背景；以及辣椒紅素系統中 Binder-2 的 delta-OD 對濃度曲線（R2 = 0.993）；兩者都聲明僅在 0 至 1.5 mg/mL 區間內有效。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6463/wiki/wetlab-oct15/original-image22.avif","caption":"Oleic acid calibration curve (y = 0.0123x + 0.0452, R2 = 0.999) used to convert the 710 nm copper-soap absorbance change into lipase activity in U/mL, with one unit defined as 1 umol fatty acid released per minute at 37 C and pH 7.0.","credit":"Team Yucai-SZ, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"油酸校正曲線（y = 0.0123x + 0.0452，R2 = 0.999），用於把 710 nm 銅皂吸光值的變化換算成以 U/mL 表示的脂解酶活性；一個單位定義為在 37 C、pH 7.0 下每分鐘釋出 1 umol 脂肪酸。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6463/wiki/wetlab-oct15/figure-15556142df20e307.avif","caption":"Assay stability testing with lycopene: the standard curve in petroleum ether (R2 = 0.994), photographs of light-exposed and light-protected samples, and the time-dependent OD curves showing an apparent half-life of about 2.5 hours under illumination, which led the team to terminate the lycopene route.","credit":"Team Yucai-SZ, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"以茄紅素進行的分析穩定性測試：石油醚中的標準曲線（R2 = 0.994）、曝光與避光樣品的照片，以及隨時間變化的 OD 曲線——照光下表觀半衰期約 2.5 小時，這使團隊決定終止茄紅素路線。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6463/wiki/wetlab-oct15/engineering-oct18-image6.avif","caption":"Change in absorbance at 275 nm for each candidate binder and for the egg white negative protein control after incubation with capsanthin, shown as mean +/- SD (n = 3) with independent-samples t-tests, which separates a protein-specific spectral response from a response any protein would give.","credit":"Team Yucai-SZ, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"各候選結合蛋白以及蛋清陰性對照與辣椒紅素共同培養後，在 275 nm 的吸光值變化，以平均值 +/- 標準差（n = 3）呈現並做獨立樣本 t 檢定，用以把蛋白專一的光譜反應與任何蛋白都會給出的反應分開。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Before attributing a signal change to your molecule, measure whether the analyte itself is stable under the measurement conditions: light-exposed versus light-protected time series and an apparent half-life define the window in which a reading means anything, and are cheap enough to run before every new target.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/yucai-sz/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/yucai-sz/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/yucai-sz/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/yucai-sz/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/yucai-sz/engineering"],"projectTitle_zh":"SpotAway：一款乾式可活化的緊急除污貼片","tagline_zh":"從頭設計的色素結合蛋白與一個脂解酶融合蛋白，而且每一項分析都附上明確的方法學邊界。","summary_zh":"Yucai-SZ 設計了 SpotAway，一個可攜乾式貼片的概念，用來就地處理剛沾上的油污。功能層由兩部分配對：一個帶有從頭設計辣椒紅素結合蛋白的纖維素結合模組融合蛋白，負責捕捉辣油中的疏水性色素；以及一個帶三油酸甘油酯結合域的脂解酶融合蛋白，會錨定在油滴附近並水解三酸甘油酯；兩者都包在以海藻糖與甘露醇保護的乾凝膠中，滴一兩滴水即可再水合。乾實驗則在標準的 Foundry de novo 設計管線上多加一層——在結構篩選之外再疊上以對接為基礎的結合能力預測試——因為濕實驗結果顯示單憑結構指標無法為候選排序。這份量測工作真正與眾不同之處在於：每一項分析都附上一節，明確定義它不能證明什麼。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"在把訊號變化歸因於自己的分子之前，先量測待測物本身在量測條件下是否穩定：曝光組與避光組的時間序列，加上一個表觀半衰期，就能界定讀值有意義的時間窗，而且便宜到每換一個新目標都值得先跑一次。","awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6475":{"team":"BGCFullerton","id":"6475","section":"High School","country":"United States","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/bgcfullerton/","projectTitle":"MycoVela — helping mycorrhizal fungi establish with plants in lunar regolith simulant","projectTitle_zh":"MycoVela——協助菌根真菌在月壤模擬物中與植物建立共生","tagline":"Protect arbuscular mycorrhizal fungi from the oxidative chemistry of lunar regolith so they can form symbiosis with crops off Earth.","tagline_zh":"保護叢枝菌根真菌不受月壤氧化化學的傷害，使其能在地球之外與作物形成共生。","summary":"Lunar regolith generates hydroxyl radicals and stunts plant growth, and arbuscular mycorrhizal fungi (AMF) are the obvious partner to help plants reach nutrients in it — if the spores survive long enough to germinate. MycoVela tests whether pyomelanin, catalase, trehalose and calcium alginate can protect AMF during establishment in regolith simulant. The dry lab is a five-part collection built by a Boys and Girls Club team drawing students from ten schools, and its statistical standard is genuinely graduate-level: a 34-parameter Monte Carlo oxidative-stress simulation, a Fisher-information identifiability and Sobol sensitivity analysis that found exact degeneracies and an unobservable parameter and so changed the model's own equations, a hierarchical Bayesian dose-response model with partial pooling across three laboratories and 400 simulation-based calibration runs, a reproducible image-analysis tool (MycoLens) whose failure cases are published alongside its successes, and a structural screen of KatE catalase surface variants.","summary_zh":"月壤會產生氫氧自由基並抑制植物生長，而叢枝菌根真菌（AMF）是幫助植物在其中取得養分最顯然的夥伴——前提是孢子能活得夠久、撐到發芽。MycoVela 要測試的是：pyomelanin、catalase、trehalose 與海藻酸鈣能否在 AMF 於月壤模擬物中建立初期提供保護。乾實驗是一支 Boys and Girls Club 隊伍（成員來自十所學校）做出的五件套，而其統計水準確實達到研究所層級：一個 34 參數的蒙地卡羅氧化逆境模擬、一套費雪訊息可辨識性分析與 Sobol 敏感度分析（找出了精確退化與一個不可觀測的參數，因而改寫了模型自己的方程式）、一個跨三間實驗室做部分匯聚的階層貝氏劑量反應模型並執行 400 次模擬式校正、一個可重現的影像分析工具（MycoLens，失敗案例與成功案例一併公開），以及一組 KatE 觸酶表面變異體的結構篩選。","awards":["Best Model — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Five distinct computational pieces, each answering a different question, and the chain between them is the real achievement. MODEL-03, the Oxidative Stress and AMF Protection Model, is a Monte Carlo simulation over 34 biological parameters covering side-reaction kinetics, reactive-oxygen-species regeneration and antioxidant effects, predicting AMF germination (24 h) and hyphal development (240 h) under a declared lunar stress scenario phi. Treatments are compared under the SAME sampled conditions, which is what makes the probabilistic comparison meaningful, and the model is built around real mechanism: vitamin C is a strong scavenger of hydroxyl radical and superoxide but reacts slowly with peroxide and reduces Fe(III) to Fe(II), feeding the Fenton reaction, so the model weighs protection against that side reaction; pyomelanin by contrast coats the regolith and reduces stress at source but binds iron. The headline output is a trade-off rather than a winner: pyomelanin protects germination more strongly than vitamin C in 61-76% of parameter draws under every variation of the ranges, but reduces hyphal growth at high doses in 17-50% of draws. MODEL-04, the Measurement Design Model, is the standout. It takes MODEL-03's own equations and asks which parameters the planned measurements can actually distinguish: it computes the sensitivity matrix S, forms the Fisher information matrix F = S^T S, and counts how many parameter combinations a measurement panel determines to within +/-10% (eigenvalues of F above 1/0.1^2) and +/-30%; it separately finds the largest identifiable subset by greedy search under a collinearity index threshold gamma <= 15, and reports both because the greedy subset need not grow when measurements are added while the Fisher count must. Candidate exact degeneracies are not merely asserted but VERIFIED numerically by moving the model 10% along each direction and measuring the change in every observation — exact if under 0.001 standard deviations, against a benchmark that a genuine 10% change in one parameter moves observations by about one SD. Three exact degeneracies were confirmed with their mechanism named (k_fen and f_pH appear only as a product in the Fenton term; p_max and pi_pH only as a product in the germination map; growth sees only Fe_tot/K_N while Fenton chemistry sees only Fe_tot*k_fen). Run on MODEL-03's ORIGINAL parameterisation it also flagged R_0 and phi_sim as exactly confounded, which, with the analytical result that k_dmg, D_50 and D_g50 act only through their ratios, is why the team fixed the damage scale and demoted phi_sim to a declared scenario — a model changed by its own identifiability analysis. Total-order Sobol indices from 512 base samples complement the local analysis, with damage analysed on a log scale because on the original scale 1% of samples carried 89% of the variance. Final verdict: of 34 parameters, 13 identifiable alone, 8 only with a correlated partner, 6 structurally confounded, 6 weakly sensitive, and one (rho_root) unobservable. MODEL-05, the Bayesian Dose-Response Model, fits protection and toxicity curves with a hierarchical model that lets the three collaborating laboratories (UCI, Chapman, Sino American Cancer Foundation) have different protection EC50 values via partial pooling, ec50_s = ec50_pop * exp(ec50_site_sd * z_s) with z_s ~ N(0,1), estimating the between-site standard deviation from the data rather than fixing it. An ordered transform constrains the protection curve to be non-decreasing, and the team state plainly that this is a LIMITATION they cannot fix within the model: if colonization rose and then fell at high dose the model could not represent it, and the separate plant-toxicity likelihood would not repair the missing decline — and they note MODEL-03 predicts exactly that shape on mechanistic grounds, so the two models are in productive tension. MycoLens measures fungal geometry from microscopy images by building a pixel graph and skeletonising it to extract hyphal length and junction nodes. The KatE screen is a structural-bioinformatics design: starting from E. coli KatE/HPII (UniProt P21179, 753 residues; PDB 28WU four-subunit structure, chosen over KatG/HPI and B. subtilis KatA), it excludes positions 1-509 as a conservative rule, then requires every candidate site to pass, in all four subunits, relative solvent accessibility >= 0.35 (Biopython Shrake-Rupley, 1.4 Angstrom probe, 300 sphere points per atom, Tien maximum-accessibility values), <= 5 Angstrom^2 accessibility lost on tetramer assembly, >= 25 Angstrom from heme, >= 10 Angstrom from another chain, >= 20 Angstrom from protected sites and >= 4 Angstrom between basic side-chain nitrogens and acidic oxygens; six variants were modelled in PyMOL 3.2.0a with low-strain rotamers and cross-checked against a five-homolog panel (P30266, P42234, P50979, P95539, Q9X576), selecting K624E primary and K621E backup, with the double substitution deliberately deferred 'to keep the first comparison interpretable'. MycoFerre, the radiation-transport side of the hardware, uses NIST attenuation and stopping-power tables with referenced material properties.","frameworks_zh":"五件各自獨立的運算工作，各回答一個不同的問題，而它們之間的串接才是真正的成就。MODEL-03（氧化逆境與 AMF 保護模型）是一個橫跨 34 個生物參數的蒙地卡羅模擬，涵蓋副反應動力學、活性氧物種的再生與抗氧化作用，並在一個明確宣告的月面逆境情境 phi 之下預測 AMF 的發芽（24 小時）與菌絲發育（240 小時）。各處理是在同一組抽樣條件下比較——這正是讓機率性比較具有意義的關鍵；而模型是圍繞真實機制建的：維生素 C 是氫氧自由基與超氧陰離子的強力清除者，但與過氧化氫反應緩慢，又會把 Fe(III) 還原成 Fe(II)、助長 Fenton 反應，因此模型會把保護效果與這個副反應放在一起權衡；pyomelanin 則相反，它覆蓋在月壤表面、從源頭降低逆境，但會結合鐵。主要結論是一個取捨，而不是一個贏家：在各種參數範圍變化下，pyomelanin 在 61-76% 的參數抽樣中對發芽的保護都強於維生素 C，但在高劑量時有 17-50% 的抽樣會抑制菌絲生長。MODEL-04（量測設計模型）是最突出的一件。它拿 MODEL-03 自己的方程式，問的是：規劃中的量測實際上能分辨哪些參數？它計算敏感度矩陣 S、形成費雪訊息矩陣 F = S^T S，再數出一組量測面板能把多少個參數組合確定到 +/-10% 以內（F 的特徵值大於 1/0.1^2）與 +/-30% 以內；另外也以貪婪搜尋在共線性指標 gamma <= 15 的門檻下找出最大的可辨識子集，並同時報告兩者——因為增加量測時貪婪子集不一定會變大，費雪計數卻一定會。候選的精確退化不是光說說，而是以數值驗證：沿每個方向把模型移動 10%，再量測每一個觀測量的變化——若變化小於 0.001 個標準差即判定為精確退化，對照的基準是：單一參數真正變動 10% 時，觀測量大約會移動一個標準差。三個精確退化獲得確認，並指明其成因（k_fen 與 f_pH 在 Fenton 項中只以乘積出現；p_max 與 pi_pH 在發芽映射中也只以乘積出現；生長只看得到 Fe_tot/K_N，而 Fenton 化學只看得到 Fe_tot*k_fen）。在 MODEL-03 最初的參數化上執行時，它還標出 R_0 與 phi_sim 完全互相混淆；這一點加上解析結果顯示 k_dmg、D_50 與 D_g50 只透過比值發揮作用，正是團隊把損傷尺度固定下來、並把 phi_sim 降級為一個宣告式情境的原因——一個被自己的可辨識性分析改掉的模型。以 512 個基底樣本算出的總階 Sobol 指數補足了局部分析，其中損傷改以對數尺度分析，因為在原尺度下 1% 的樣本就承擔了 89% 的變異。最終判定：34 個參數中，13 個可單獨辨識、8 個只能與一個相關參數成對辨識、6 個在結構上互相混淆、6 個敏感度微弱，還有一個（rho_root）不可觀測。MODEL-05（貝氏劑量反應模型）以階層模型擬合保護與毒性曲線，透過部分匯聚讓三間合作實驗室（UCI、Chapman、Sino American Cancer Foundation）各有不同的保護 EC50 值，形式為 ec50_s = ec50_pop * exp(ec50_site_sd * z_s)，其中 z_s ~ N(0,1)，而站點間的標準差是由資料估計，不是事先固定。一個排序轉換把保護曲線限制為非遞減，而團隊直言這是他們在模型內無法解決的限制：如果侵染率先上升、在高劑量又下降，模型無法表現出來，而另外那個植物毒性的似然函數也補不回這段缺失的下降——他們並指出，MODEL-03 從機制上預測的正是這種形狀，因此兩個模型處於一種有建設性的張力之中。MycoLens 從顯微影像量測真菌的幾何形態：建立像素圖後做骨架化，以擷取菌絲長度與交會節點。KatE 的篩選是一項結構生物資訊設計：以 E. coli 的 KatE/HPII 為起點（UniProt P21179，753 個殘基；採用 PDB 28WU 的四次單元結構，並捨棄 KatG/HPI 與 B. subtilis KatA），先以保守原則排除第 1-509 位，接著要求每個候選位點在四個次單元中都必須通過：相對溶劑可及性 >= 0.35（Biopython 的 Shrake-Rupley 演算法，1.4 埃探針、每原子 300 個球面取樣點、採用 Tien 的最大可及性數值）、四聚體組裝時可及性損失 <= 5 平方埃、距 heme >= 25 埃、距另一條鏈 >= 10 埃、距受保護位點 >= 20 埃，以及鹼性側鏈氮與酸性氧之間 >= 4 埃；六個變異體在 PyMOL 3.2.0a 中以低應變旋轉異構物建模，並與一組五個同源蛋白的對照（P30266、P42234、P50979、P95539、Q9X576）交叉檢查，最後選定 K624E 為主、K621E 為備案，而雙重置換則刻意延後，「以保持第一次比較的可解釋性」。硬體中負責輻射傳輸的 MycoFerre，使用 NIST 的衰減與阻擋本領資料表，材料性質均附引用來源。","dataviz":"Figures are built to answer design questions, not to look impressive. Figure 4.2 is a measurement-by-parameter sensitivity heatmap where darker means the measurement responds more strongly and is therefore more useful for estimating that parameter — and the caption reads the pattern for you (germination responds to stress and damage parameters, hyphal length to growth parameters, peroxide and superoxide to pigment chemistry, surface coverage weakly to everything). Figure 4.3 shows the identifiability of all 34 parameters grouped by class with a sensitivity floor drawn as a dashed line. Figure 4.4 is the one that changed the experiment: cumulative measurement panels ordered by assumed effort, showing germination alone determines only two parameter combinations to +/-30%, adding the hyphal time course raises it to five, adding peroxide to ten (the largest single gain), superoxide and residual pigment add one each, and surface coverage adds nothing. Figure 4.5 ranks measurements by information added AND by information lost if dropped, which is a different and more useful question. Figure 5.1 plots protection and toxicity curves on one dose axis with 94% credible bands and shades the safe window where both criteria hold (at least 0.10 gain in colonization over control and under 0.10 additional plant damage). Figure 5.6 draws the shape the model CANNOT fit next to the shape it can. Figure 5.9 compares each laboratory fitted independently against the pooled fit and reports that all three shifts are under 0.5 mg/plant and well inside their credible intervals, so with this much data the pooling choice barely matters. Table 5.3 is a prior-by-prior evidence table. The MycoLens image pilot is a published failure report: original, mask and skeleton-plus-junction overlays side by side, with draft reference traces in magenta against MycoLens skeletons in cyan, and the numbers that disagree stated outright (skeleton 3,195 um versus draft trace 500 um on one frame; 1,139 versus 437 on another; 12 um of skeleton produced from background debris in a region with no visible hyphae).","dataviz_zh":"圖表是為了回答設計上的問題而做，不是為了好看。圖 4.2 是一張「量測對參數」的敏感度熱圖，顏色越深代表該量測反應越強、因此對估計該參數越有用——圖說還直接幫讀者把規律讀出來（發芽率反應的是逆境與損傷參數、菌絲長度反應生長參數、過氧化氫與超氧陰離子反應色素化學，而表面覆蓋率對什麼都只有微弱反應）。圖 4.3 以類別分組呈現全部 34 個參數的可辨識性，並以虛線畫出敏感度下限。圖 4.4 是真正改變了實驗的那一張：依假設的工作量排序、逐步累加的量測面板顯示，只量發芽率只能把兩個參數組合確定到 +/-30%，加入菌絲的時間序列提升到五個，再加過氧化氫提升到十個（單項增益最大），超氧陰離子與殘餘色素各加一個，而表面覆蓋率毫無貢獻。圖 4.5 同時依「加入後增加的資訊量」與「捨棄後損失的資訊量」為量測項目排序，而後者是一個不同、也更有用的問題。圖 5.1 把保護與毒性曲線畫在同一條劑量軸上，附 94% 可信區間帶，並把兩個條件同時成立的安全區間以陰影標出（相對對照組侵染率提升至少 0.10，且額外植物損傷低於 0.10）。圖 5.6 把模型擬合不出來的那種曲線形狀，畫在它能擬合的形狀旁邊。圖 5.9 把每間實驗室各自獨立擬合的結果與匯聚後的擬合相比，報告三者的偏移都小於 0.5 mg/株，且都遠在各自的可信區間之內，因此在目前這個資料量下，是否匯聚幾乎不影響結果。表 5.3 是一張逐一列出每個先驗及其證據的表格。MycoLens 的影像先導測試是一份公開的失敗報告：原始影像、遮罩與「骨架加交會節點」疊圖並排呈現，初步的參考描繪以洋紅色、MycoLens 的骨架以青色對照，而不一致的數字也直接寫出來（某一影格骨架長 3,195 um，初步描繪只有 500 um；另一影格是 1,139 對 437；在一處看不到菌絲的區域，背景雜物還產生了 12 um 的骨架）。","datascience":"The epistemic discipline here exceeds most undergraduate entries. MODEL-03 was deliberately NOT calibrated to the team's own laboratory data, and they say why and what that costs: absolute predictions depend on literature-estimated ranges, so 'the rankings describe the chosen equations and ranges' and 'their stability across the tested variations does not establish the ranking in AMF experiments'. Pyomelanin doses are labelled explicitly as model-equivalent scenario coordinates with no molecular-mass or repeat-unit basis, so the apparent sixtyfold potency gap against vitamin C 'cannot be converted into experimental doses or compared as a measured potency difference' — a unit-honesty most teams skip. The calibration procedure itself was checked against synthetic germination counts with known truth. MODEL-05's validation is textbook Bayesian workflow: parameter recovery on simulated colonization and plant-damage counts, 400 simulation-based calibration runs, 14 prior-sensitivity fits and nine pooling comparisons, with a DELIBERATELY BROKEN equation used to demonstrate why parameter recovery is needed in addition to convergence checks — because a wrong model can still converge. MCMC is four chains, 1500 tuning steps and 1500 draws each at target acceptance 0.9, with a hard gate of R-hat below 1.01, bulk and tail effective sample size above 400, and zero divergences, judged on the worst diagnostic across all eight parameters, followed by the line that matters: 'Passing is a prerequisite for interpretation; it does not show that the biological model is correct.' Table 5.3 grades every prior by its evidence: two rest on a genuine quantitative literature base (Hill slopes from Prinz and Schonichen 2008 and Prinz 2010, chosen over a HalfNormal because that peaks at zero and would make 'no dose-response at all' the most likely shape), two on one-sided bounds from studies that never measured the needed quantity, one qualitative only, and four on reasoning and bounds alone — and they point out that the two parameters which most strongly determine the final recommendation, EC50 and tox_EC50, are among the least well evidenced. They further identify a unit-conversion blocker: every published figure is in mg/L while their dose axis is mg/plant, the conversion needs an applied volume that is not recorded, so both priors currently fall back to scaling from the configured maximum dose — and 'the model reports which basis is in force on every run rather than concealing the fallback'. The ec50_site_sd prior is deliberately wide because with only three sites the between-site SD is weakly identified and 'a tighter prior would manufacture false confidence in site similarity'. MycoLens was verified against eleven hand-defined skeletons at three calibrations and on degraded synthetic images, then run on three public fungal-colony crops WITHOUT retuning — and the results are reported as failures where they failed: default dark Otsu masks followed background texture, particle edges and phase halos; the frozen S1 preset (bright adaptive threshold, 51 px window, offset 15, minimum component 30 px) left disconnected fragments and missed faint strands; settings were tuned on one movie (S1) with S2 and S3 held out and all frames from a movie kept together to avoid leakage; input JPEGs were checked against Zenodo MD5 checksums; and the honest conclusion is that 'these comparisons do not establish biological measurement accuracy' because the missing reference is human agreement, for which they built a blank two-reviewer tracing workspace that presents the same nine regions with no model overlays or AI traces so independent polylines can be compared spatially as well as by total length. They also note that a similar total length can hide completely different traced structures. An independent check against published growth data (Serghi et al. 2021, 219 spores across nine strains, CC BY 4.0) is flagged as extending beyond MODEL-03's configured 240-hour horizon.","datascience_zh":"這裡的知識論紀律超過大多數大學部的作品。MODEL-03 刻意沒有用團隊自己的實驗資料校正，而他們也說明了原因與代價：絕對預測值取決於文獻估計的參數範圍，因此「這些排序描述的是所選的方程式與範圍」，而且「它們在各種測試變化下的穩定性，並不能確立在 AMF 實驗中的排序」。pyomelanin 的劑量被明確標示為模型等效的情境座標，沒有分子量或重複單元的依據，因此它與維生素 C 之間看似六十倍的效力差距「不能換算成實驗劑量，也不能當成量測到的效力差異來比較」——這種對單位的誠實，大多數隊伍都跳過了。校正程序本身也拿已知真值的合成發芽計數檢驗過。MODEL-05 的驗證就是教科書式的貝氏工作流程：在模擬的侵染與植物損傷計數上做參數回復、400 次模擬式校正、14 組先驗敏感度擬合與九組匯聚比較，並刻意放進一個寫壞的方程式，用來說明為什麼除了收斂檢查之外還需要參數回復——因為錯的模型照樣可以收斂。MCMC 跑四條鏈，各 1500 步調校與 1500 次抽樣，目標接受率 0.9，並設下硬性關卡：R-hat 低於 1.01、主體與尾部有效樣本數都高於 400、發散次數為零，而且是以全部八個參數中最差的診斷值來判定；接著是最關鍵的一句：「通過只是可以開始解讀的前提，並不表示這個生物模型是對的。」表 5.3 為每個先驗依其證據評等：兩個有真正的定量文獻基礎（Hill 斜率取自 Prinz 與 Schonichen 2008 及 Prinz 2010，之所以不用 HalfNormal，是因為它的峰值在零，會讓「完全沒有劑量反應」成為最可能的形狀）、兩個只有來自從未量測所需量的研究所給的單側界限、一個僅有定性依據，還有四個只靠推理與界限——而他們也指出，最強烈決定最終建議的那兩個參數 EC50 與 tox_EC50，恰恰屬於證據最薄弱的一群。他們還指出一個單位換算上的卡點：所有已發表的數值都是 mg/L，而他們的劑量軸是 mg/株，換算需要一個沒有被記錄下來的施用體積，因此這兩個先驗目前都退回以設定的最大劑量做比例縮放——而且「模型在每次執行時都會報告當下採用哪一種依據，不會把這個退路藏起來」。ec50_site_sd 的先驗刻意設得很寬，因為只有三個站點時站點間標準差的可辨識性很弱，而「更窄的先驗會製造出對站點相似性的虛假信心」。MycoLens 以十一份人工定義的骨架在三種校正下驗證，也在劣化的合成影像上測試，接著在三張公開的真菌菌落裁切影像上執行，而且完全沒有重新調參——失敗的地方就照實報告為失敗：預設的暗場 Otsu 遮罩會跟著背景紋理、顆粒邊緣與相位光暈走；凍結的 S1 預設組（亮場自適應閾值、51 px 視窗、偏移 15、最小連通元件 30 px）留下斷開的碎片，也漏掉較淡的菌絲；參數是在一段影片（S1）上調的，S2 與 S3 保留在外，同一段影片的所有影格都綁在一起處理以避免資料洩漏；輸入的 JPEG 檔都對照 Zenodo 的 MD5 檢核碼確認過；而誠實的結論是「這些比較並不能確立生物量測的準確度」，因為缺的那個參照是人與人之間的一致性——為此他們做了一個空白的雙審閱者描繪工作區，呈現同樣的九個區域、不帶任何模型疊圖或 AI 描繪，使獨立畫出的折線除了總長度之外，還能在空間上互相比較。他們也指出，總長度相近可能掩蓋了完全不同的描繪結構。另有一項對照已發表生長資料的獨立檢驗（Serghi 等人 2021，九個菌株共 219 顆孢子，CC BY 4.0），並標明它已超出 MODEL-03 所設定的 240 小時範圍。","software":"Everything is built for reuse by other teams. Each model keeps treatment inputs, shared parameter ranges and run settings in separate files with source notes for every value, and the exact run configuration is published: 0.05 h default step, 3,000 germination draws, 800 hyphal-length draws, seed 20260809. MycoLens saves the input hash, settings and calibration with every measurement, pins its source version and exact dependencies, gives the commands to reproduce each validation figure, and carries a recorded test suite of 99 tests; the pilot analysis names its exact build (MycoLens 2.0, commit 1e030449). The team state the reuse limitation that matters most: the Bayesian model's protection curve cannot describe a decline at high dose, and MycoLens's default segmentation performs poorly on images with different characteristics, so a team using it on new specimens would need to check the masks and validate against reference annotations. Model documentation is also published as a PDF. Two games, Lunar Traitor and MycoVela: Lunar Lab, plus a transport simulator and 3D designs, carry the science into lessons. A U-Net segmentation pipeline exists but is explicitly untrained pending annotated AMF images.","software_zh":"每一樣東西都是為了讓其他隊伍重複使用而做的。各個模型把處理輸入、共用參數範圍與執行設定分放在不同檔案，每個數值都有來源註記，而確切的執行設定也公開：預設步長 0.05 小時、發芽抽樣 3,000 次、菌絲長度抽樣 800 次、隨機種子 20260809。MycoLens 在每一次量測時都會存下輸入檔的雜湊值、設定與校正資訊，鎖定原始碼版本與確切的相依套件，提供重現每一張驗證圖的指令，並附一套已記錄的 99 項測試；先導分析也標明確切的建置版本（MycoLens 2.0，commit 1e030449）。團隊也把最關鍵的重用限制寫清楚：貝氏模型的保護曲線無法描述高劑量下的下降，而 MycoLens 的預設影像切割在特性不同的影像上表現很差，因此若要用在新的樣本上，必須檢查遮罩並對照參考標註加以驗證。模型文件另以 PDF 形式發布。兩款遊戲 Lunar Traitor 與 MycoVela: Lunar Lab，加上一個運輸模擬器與 3D 設計，把這些科學帶進課堂。另有一條 U-Net 影像切割流程，但明確標示在取得已標註的 AMF 影像之前尚未訓練。","stack":["Python","NumPy / SciPy","Monte Carlo sampling (Latin hypercube)","Sobol sensitivity analysis","Fisher information / sensitivity matrix analysis","Bayesian MCMC with R-hat and ESS diagnostics","simulation-based calibration","Biopython (Shrake-Rupley SASA)","PyMOL 3.2.0a","scikit-image style pixel-graph skeletonisation (MycoLens)","U-Net (pipeline present, untrained)","NIST attenuation and stopping-power tables","pytest (99-test suite)"],"techniques":["multi-parameter mechanistic ODE/kinetic simulation","Monte Carlo uncertainty propagation with shared sampled conditions across treatments","probability-of-superiority treatment comparison","structural identifiability analysis","Fisher information matrix eigenvalue counting","collinearity-index greedy subset search","numerical verification of exact parameter degeneracies","total-order Sobol global sensitivity analysis","optimal experimental design / measurement panel ranking by information gain","power analysis for replicate and dish number","hierarchical Bayesian inference with partial pooling and shrinkage","ordered-constraint transforms for monotonic curves","prior elicitation with explicit evidence grading","prior-sensitivity analysis","simulation-based calibration","parameter recovery on synthetic data","deliberately broken-model control","MCMC convergence diagnostics (R-hat, bulk and tail ESS, divergences)","image segmentation and skeletonisation for morphometry","held-out tuning with group-aware splits","checksum verification of input data","published failure-case reporting","inter-rater reliability study design","structural bioinformatics surface-site screening (SASA, distance constraints)","homolog panel comparison for residue tolerance","rotamer modelling and steric contact screening","radiation transport calculation"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"An outstanding programme for a club-based team. Genesis brought students from ten schools together through the Boys and Girls Club of Fullerton, and over 80% of the schools in their ten-lesson programme were Title I schools, with free after-school and home participation. Across seven school and club locations children used micropipettes, tested protective structures and designed organisms with safety switches; the seven planned lessons became nine. Outcomes are measured and reported with numbers: 83% of Speaker Series respondents reported learning about synthetic biology and 95% wanted to return; across two high-school lessons 82.5% reported greater interest in synthetic biology and 77.3% said they would seek further research opportunities; at Discovery Cube the proportion rating their space-agriculture knowledge highly rose from 26.7% to 86.7%; at Rocket Fever 95.5% reported learning more about space agriculture. Activities include a Moon Farm Challenge, a Save the Moon Plant model and hands-on roots-and-AMF models, plus two original games. Individual learners are spotlighted by name and story rather than counted (Ryan sharing his designs at Speaker Series, Cora teaching her parents at Discovery Cube, Anya explaining fungal networks over Zoom).","publicEngagement_zh":"對一支以社團為基礎的隊伍而言，這是一個傑出的計畫。Genesis 透過 Boys and Girls Club of Fullerton 把十所學校的學生聚在一起，而他們十堂課的計畫中超過 80% 的學校屬於 Title I 學校，課後與在家參與都免費。在七個學校與社團場地，孩子們使用微量吸管、測試保護性結構，並設計帶有安全開關的生物；原本規劃的七堂課最後變成九堂。成效有量測也有數字：Speaker Series 的回覆者中有 83% 表示學到了合成生物學、95% 想再來；兩堂高中課程中有 82.5% 表示對合成生物學更有興趣、77.3% 表示會去尋找進一步的研究機會；在 Discovery Cube，自評太空農業知識良好的比例從 26.7% 升到 86.7%；在 Rocket Fever 有 95.5% 表示對太空農業了解更多。活動包括 Moon Farm Challenge、Save the Moon Plant 模型與根系及 AMF 的動手模型，另有兩款原創遊戲。個別學習者是以名字與故事被突顯出來，而不是被算成人數（Ryan 在 Speaker Series 分享他的設計、Cora 在 Discovery Cube 教她的父母、Anya 透過 Zoom 解釋真菌網路）。","ihp":"Structured as four repeating steps — Aspiration, Action, Analysis, Adaptation — with each cycle starting from a question, recording the feedback received, and explaining what was done with it, then linking that decision to the specific experimental plan, model, design or activity it changed. The team are explicit that some conversations made them let an idea go, and they name which: Robertas Ursache's feedback led them away from CIF peptides, Julie Brisset changed how they planned their regolith mixtures, and Ian Sanders pushed them to look more closely at moisture and spore germination. A stakeholder assessment table matches each question to relevant expertise across six perspectives — plant and space biology (Marzan, Ursache, Blancaflor, Sanders, Levy, Berliner), regolith and lunar systems (Horanyi, Amoros Trepat, Brisset, Yong), safety and future use (Kutz, Demick, Fulmer, Exponent), educators and families, design and reuse, and prospective users — and, unusually, it also tracks which perspectives their records do NOT yet cover. Dr Florian Schunck advised on using leave-one-out validation and WAIC to compare alternative model structures, and Dr Marco Bisoffi of Chapman served as scientific advisor; the honesty extends to the business side, where they write that 'confirmed adoption and purchasing decisions remain to be demonstrated'.","ihp_zh":"架構是四個反覆的步驟——Aspiration、Action、Analysis、Adaptation——每一輪都從一個問題出發，記錄收到的回饋，說明他們怎麼處理，再把那個決定連回它所改變的具體實驗計畫、模型、設計或活動。團隊明確表示，有些對談讓他們放掉了某個想法，並且指名是哪些：Robertas Ursache 的意見讓他們離開 CIF 胜肽這條路、Julie Brisset 改變了他們規劃月壤混合物的方式，而 Ian Sanders 則推動他們更仔細地看水分與孢子發芽。一張利害關係人評估表把每個問題對應到六個面向中的相關專長——植物與太空生物學（Marzan、Ursache、Blancaflor、Sanders、Levy、Berliner）、月壤與月面系統（Horanyi、Amoros Trepat、Brisset、Yong）、安全與未來用途（Kutz、Demick、Fulmer、Exponent）、教育者與家庭、設計與重用，以及潛在使用者——而且少見地，它同時也追蹤哪些面向是他們的紀錄還沒有涵蓋的。Florian Schunck 博士建議使用留一驗證與 WAIC 來比較不同的模型結構，Chapman 的 Marco Bisoffi 博士則擔任科學顧問；這份誠實也延伸到商業面，他們寫道「確定的採用與採購決策仍有待證明」。","realWorld":"The scientific case is built on cited evidence rather than enthusiasm: Hendrix et al. (2024) found experimentally reduced lunar simulants generated roughly 5 to 100 times more hydroxyl radicals in deionized water than non-reduced simulants, linked to metallic iron from reduction; Paul et al. (2022) grew Arabidopsis in Apollo 11, 12 and 17 regolith and found about 71% of differentially expressed genes associated with salt, metal or ROS stress, with the most mature sample (Apollo 11) producing the slowest growth; Atkin et al. (2026) showed an AMF inoculum let chickpeas set seed in up to 75% LHS-1 simulant but not in 100%, where plants were colonised and survived two weeks longer yet died without flowering. The commercial plan is deliberately terrestrial first and candid about what it needs: it targets nursery and transplant growers, and the team state they 'will need to find a crop and stress condition where adding the carrier improves on existing inoculants', that potential use in degraded soil would require separate work, and that they would simplify the formulation if fewer components work just as well. Cost per treatment is published.","realWorld_zh":"科學論述建立在有引用的證據上，而不是熱情：Hendrix 等人（2024）發現經實驗還原處理的月壤模擬物在去離子水中產生的氫氧自由基，約為未還原模擬物的 5 到 100 倍，並與還原產生的金屬鐵有關；Paul 等人（2022）在 Apollo 11、12 與 17 的月壤中種植阿拉伯芥，發現約 71% 的差異表現基因與鹽、金屬或 ROS 逆境有關，而成熟度最高的樣本（Apollo 11）造成的生長最慢；Atkin 等人（2026）顯示一種 AMF 接種劑能讓鷹嘴豆在最高 75% LHS-1 模擬物中結實，但在 100% 時不行——在 100% 的條件下植株有被定殖、也多活了兩週，卻未開花即死亡。商業計畫刻意先走地球市場，並坦白說明還缺什麼：目標客群是育苗與移植栽培業者，而團隊明言他們「必須先找到一種作物與逆境條件，讓加入這個載體真的勝過現有的接種劑」，在退化土壤上的潛在用途需要另外一套工作，而且如果更少的成分就能達到同樣效果，他們會把配方簡化。每次處理的成本也已公開。","partners":["Boys & Girls Club of Fullerton","University of California, Irvine","Chapman University","Sino American Cancer Foundation","Fleet Science Center","Discovery Cube","Inside the Outdoors","America on Tech","Apple Pi","CDE Foundation","LA STEM Collective","Max Apogee","Exponent","Azusa Pacific University"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6475/wiki/models/models/source-p35-1.avif","caption":"Figure 4.2: sensitivity of each planned measurement to each of the 34 model parameters. Darker cells mean the measurement responds more strongly and is therefore more useful for estimating that parameter — germination tracks the stress and damage parameters, hyphal length the growth parameters, peroxide and superoxide the pigment chemistry, and surface coverage almost nothing.","caption_zh":"圖 4.2：每一項規劃中的量測對 34 個模型參數的敏感度。顏色越深代表該量測反應越強、因此對估計該參數越有用——發芽率追蹤的是逆境與損傷參數、菌絲長度追蹤生長參數、過氧化氫與超氧陰離子追蹤色素化學，而表面覆蓋率幾乎什麼都追蹤不到。","credit":"Team BGCFullerton, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6475/wiki/models/models/source-p40-1.avif","caption":"Figure 5.1: protection and toxicity curves on the same dose axis with 94% credible bands from the hierarchical Bayesian model. A dose enters the safe window only where both criteria hold — at least a 0.10 gain in colonization over control and under 0.10 additional plant damage — so the recommendation is a window, not a number.","caption_zh":"圖 5.1：保護與毒性曲線畫在同一條劑量軸上，附階層貝氏模型給出的 94% 可信區間帶。只有在兩個條件同時成立時，某個劑量才落入安全區間——相對對照組侵染率提升至少 0.10，且額外植物損傷低於 0.10——因此建議的是一個區間，不是一個數字。","credit":"Team BGCFullerton, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6475/wiki/models/models/table-5-3-model-priors.avif","caption":"Table 5.3: every prior in the Bayesian model with the evidence behind it, graded. Only two rest on a quantitative literature base; two rest on one-sided bounds from studies that never measured the quantity needed, one is qualitative, and four rest on reasoning alone — including the two parameters that most strongly determine the final dose recommendation.","caption_zh":"表 5.3：貝氏模型中的每一個先驗，連同背後的證據並加以評等。只有兩個有定量文獻基礎；兩個僅憑從未量測所需量的研究所給的單側界限；一個只有定性依據；還有四個純憑推理——其中就包括最強烈決定最終劑量建議的那兩個參數。","credit":"Team BGCFullerton, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6475/wiki/models/mycolens-figure-11-1.avif","caption":"Figure 11.1: MycoLens output on a public fungal-colony image — original, mask, and overlay with the extracted skeleton in red and junction nodes in yellow. The team ran the tool on public images without retuning and published where it failed, noting the colony is not AMF and that these comparisons do not establish biological measurement accuracy.","caption_zh":"圖 11.1：MycoLens 在一張公開真菌菌落影像上的輸出——原始影像、遮罩，以及把擷取出的骨架以紅色、交會節點以黃色疊上的結果。團隊在未重新調參的情況下把工具跑在公開影像上，並公開它失敗的地方，同時註明該菌落不是 AMF，而這些比較並不能確立生物量測的準確度。","credit":"Team BGCFullerton, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Before you fit anything, run an identifiability analysis on your own model: build the sensitivity matrix, form the Fisher information matrix, count how many parameter combinations each candidate measurement panel can actually pin down, and verify suspected degeneracies numerically by perturbing along them. BGCFullerton used exactly this to discover that germination alone constrained two parameter combinations while adding peroxide raised it to ten — changing both their equations and the wet lab's data request — and they pair it with a prior-by-prior evidence table that grades how much each number is really known. Both are achievable by high-school students and are worth more than a larger simulation.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"在擬合任何東西之前，先對自己的模型做一次可辨識性分析：建出敏感度矩陣、形成費雪訊息矩陣，算出每一組候選量測面板實際上能釘住幾個參數組合，再沿著疑似退化的方向擾動，以數值方式驗證它們。BGCFullerton 正是這樣發現：只量發芽率只能約束兩個參數組合，加上過氧化氫的量測就提升到十個——這同時改變了他們的方程式與對濕實驗的資料需求；他們還搭配一張逐一評等的先驗證據表，標明每個數字到底有多少根據。這兩件事高中生做得到，而且比跑一個更大的模擬更有價值。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/bgcfullerton/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bgcfullerton/model/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bgcfullerton/software/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bgcfullerton/description/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bgcfullerton/engineering/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bgcfullerton/results/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bgcfullerton/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bgcfullerton/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bgcfullerton/entrepreneurship/","https://2026.igem.wiki/bgcfullerton/hardware/"],"awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6478":{"team":"Athens","id":"6478","section":"Overgrad","country":"Greece","village":"Conservation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/athens/","projectTitle":"ApiconIASIS","projectTitle_zh":"ApiconIASIS","tagline":"Healing honeybees, sustaining pollinators: a precision phage-derived enzyme therapy for European Foulbrood","tagline_zh":"治癒蜜蜂、維繫授粉者：一種源自噬菌體的精準酵素療法，用於歐洲幼蟲病","summary":"ApiconIASIS targets European Foulbrood (EFB), a statutory honeybee brood disease caused by Melissococcus plutonius for which the only legal response in most of Europe is burning the colony. The team mined 165 M. plutonius genomes for dormant prophages, ranked hundreds of candidate lysins and selected two enzymes (an endolysin and a GH25 muramidase), each built with and without a fused antimicrobial peptide, expressed and purified in E. coli. They showed roughly 40% loss of OD600 against M. plutonius (LMG 20360) with 50 ug/mL purified endolysin while producing no effect distinguishable from the untreated control against the bee-gut commensals Lactobacillus apis and Bombilactobacillus mellis, both Lactobacillales like the pathogen. It won because the whole chain is closed: a protein (not a replicating phage) delivered in brood food, three linked dry-lab models (protein optimisation, larval-gut pharmacokinetics, bioprocess scale-up), and an entrepreneurship case built on the cost of hive burning.","summary_zh":"ApiconIASIS 針對歐洲幼蟲病（EFB），這是一種由 Melissococcus plutonius 造成的法定通報蜂子疾病，而在歐洲大部分地區，唯一合法的處置就是把整個蜂群燒掉。該隊從 165 個 M. plutonius 基因組中挖掘休眠的原噬菌體，對數百個候選溶解酶排序，選出兩個酵素（一個內溶素與一個 GH25 胞壁質酶），每個都做了接上與不接抗菌肽的版本，並在 E. coli 中表現與純化。他們顯示 50 ug/mL 的純化內溶素對 M. plutonius（LMG 20360）可造成約 40% 的 OD600 下降，而對蜂腸共生菌 Lactobacillus apis 與 Bombilactobacillus mellis（兩者與病原同屬 Lactobacillales）則沒有可與未處理對照區分的效果。它之所以出色，是因為整條鏈是閉合的：投遞的是一個蛋白質（不是會複製的噬菌體），透過蜂子食物給予；三個互相銜接的乾實驗模型（蛋白質最佳化、幼蟲腸道藥物動力學、生物製程放大）；以及一份以燒毀蜂箱的成本為基礎建立的創業論述。","awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Model — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Education — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Conservation Project — Winner"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Three distinct model layers. (1) A semi-rational protein engineering cascade for the poorly soluble GH25 muramidase (Protein-Sol 0.411, below the 0.45 aggregation threshold, with inclusion bodies confirmed in the wet lab): a 40-residue 'freeze list' built from three independent evidence sources (structural role, ESM-2 650M evolutionary constraint, literature), validated by all-atom molecular dynamics (RMSF < 2 A), then ThermoMPNN point-mutation ddG scanning, an ESM-2 log-likelihood filter at -2.0 to drop family-implausible substitutions, NSGA-II multi-objective search via pymoo over the 17 surviving mutations, and ColabFold refolding as a final structural gate catching epistasis; AlphaFold pLDDT > 70 was a stated input requirement. (2) A deterministic single-compartment ODE pharmacokinetic model of the honeybee larval midgut treating the lumen as a sealed, expanding compartment and the pathogen as absolute cell number N, with an Emax saturating kill law fitted to in-vitro lysis data (phi_max ~ 0.006125 /min, KE ~ 0.633 ug/mL, R2 = 0.935). (3) A bioprocess flowsheet model of a medium-scale E. coli plant with a three-stage seed train (baffled shake flask, seed bioreactor, production fermenter under high-cell-density culture), solving for biomass and product mass per batch.","frameworks_zh":"三個不同層次的模型。(1) 針對溶解度不佳的 GH25 胞壁質酶（Protein-Sol 0.411，低於 0.45 的聚集門檻，且濕實驗中確認形成包涵體）建立的半理性蛋白質工程串級流程：先以三個獨立證據來源（結構角色、ESM-2 650M 的演化約束、文獻）建出一份 40 個殘基的「凍結清單」，並以全原子分子動力學驗證（RMSF < 2 A），接著以 ThermoMPNN 做點突變 ddG 掃描，以 ESM-2 對數似然在 -2.0 處設濾網剔除在家族中不合理的取代，再以 pymoo 的 NSGA-II 對存活下來的 17 個突變做多目標搜尋，最後以 ColabFold 重新折疊作為結構關卡，捕捉上位效應；AlphaFold pLDDT > 70 是明定的輸入要求。(2) 一個確定性的單室 ODE 藥物動力學模型，描述蜜蜂幼蟲中腸，把腸腔當成一個密封且體積膨脹的隔室，病原則以絕對細胞數 N 表示，並以 Emax 飽和型殺滅定律擬合體外裂解資料（phi_max 約 0.006125 /min，KE 約 0.633 ug/mL，R2 = 0.935）。(3) 一個中等規模 E. coli 廠的生物製程流程圖模型，含三階段種子培養序列（帶擋板搖瓶、種子生物反應器、以高細胞密度培養運轉的生產發酵槽），求解每批次的生物量與產物質量。","dataviz":"The wiki stages results as a narrative rather than a figure dump: the landing page counts down the disease (90% brood mortality, 36% of surveyed colonies carrying the bacterium with 72% of those looking healthy) before showing the funnel 165 genomes to hundreds of candidates to two enzymes to one lead, then flask to bioreactor to hive to landscape. The model section front-loads a one-sentence summary of each pipeline and marks P1-P4 as falsifiable predictions, with P4 flagged as the main untested exposure because binding selectivity was never an optimisation objective. The optimisation page carries a Venn diagram of the three freeze-list evidence sources, RMSF and DCCM plots from the MD run, an ESM-2 log-likelihood filter plot and the NSGA-II Pareto front.","dataviz_zh":"這個 wiki 把結果編排成敘事而非圖片堆疊：首頁先以數字倒數這個疾病（蜂子死亡率 90%、受調查蜂群有 36% 帶有該細菌，而其中 72% 看起來健康），再呈現漏斗——165 個基因組到數百個候選、到兩個酵素、到一個領先候選——接著是從搖瓶到生物反應器、到蜂箱、到整片地景。模型章節把每條流程的一句話摘要放在最前面，並把 P1-P4 標記為可被否證的預測，其中 P4 被標示為主要尚未驗證的風險，因為結合選擇性從未被列為最佳化目標。最佳化頁面則有一張三個凍結清單證據來源的文氏圖、MD 模擬得出的 RMSF 與 DCCM 圖、一張 ESM-2 對數似然濾網圖，以及 NSGA-II 的 Pareto 前緣。","datascience":"Biological measurements were converted into decision rules rather than descriptive statistics. A pH-plate experiment was decomposed into two separable effects: kill rate is essentially flat across the lumen band (pH 5.5-7.5) while stability is strongly pH-dependent (t_half ~140-280 h at pH 5.5-6.7, ~7 h at pH 4, ~12 h at pH 7.5), which showed the enzyme is about 30x more stable in the lumen than assumed and dropped the required food concentration about 31-fold, making dilution rather than degradation the dominant loss term. Because nurse bees feed roughly 4,300 times a day, delivery was modelled as a continuous infusion at quasi-steady state. Full sterilisation within 48 h holds only up to about 455 cells (a saturation, not a dose, limit; a 300-cell inoculum already needs 26.2 ug/mL against a larva-safe cap of 23 ug/mL), so the team switched to a 'recovery' criterion that raised the handleable inoculum by four to five orders of magnitude to about 10^7 cells. The model's stated output is a starting dose plus an exposure profile (peak concentration, AUC, dosing duration, clearance time) handed to the wet lab and to a companion toxicity model.","datascience_zh":"生物量測被轉換成決策規則，而不是描述性統計。一次 pH 盤實驗被拆解成兩個可分離的效應：殺滅速率在腸腔的 pH 區間（5.5-7.5）內基本持平，而穩定性則強烈依賴 pH（pH 5.5-6.7 時半衰期約 140-280 小時、pH 4 時約 7 小時、pH 7.5 時約 12 小時），這顯示該酵素在腸腔中的穩定性約為原先假設的 30 倍，使所需的食物中濃度降低約 31 倍，於是主導的損失項變成稀釋而不是降解。由於育幼蜂一天餵食約 4,300 次，投遞被建模為準穩態下的連續輸注。48 小時內完全滅菌只在大約 455 個細胞以下成立（這是飽和限制而非劑量限制；300 個細胞的接種量就已需要 26.2 ug/mL，而對幼蟲安全的上限是 23 ug/mL），因此該隊改採「恢復」判準，把可處理的接種量提高四到五個數量級，達到約 10^7 個細胞。模型明示的輸出是一個起始劑量加上一份暴露曲線（峰值濃度、AUC、給藥持續時間、清除時間），交給濕實驗以及一個配套的毒性模型。","software":"ApiconIASIS: Bee Wanderer, a browser-based educational game built for the EU-CONEXUS Hackathon in plain JavaScript, HTML5 Canvas, CSS3 and Three.js with no game engine: a custom 2D platformer engine (requestAnimationFrame loop, AABB collision, sinusoidal moving platforms, parallax) in level-engine.js with per-level config files, plus an interactive WebGL globe using Three.js OrbitControls and raycasting for level selection across Athens, the Himalayas, Tanzania, Uganda and New Zealand. Collectibles map to biotech stages (DNA Pollen, Enzyme Drops, Purification Beads); progression persists in localStorage with no backend, and a Weather Station pulls live data from Open-Meteo and wttr.in. All dry-lab scripts are released at https://github.com/igemathens2026/iGEM-Athens-2026---Software-; the wiki repository is gitlab.igem.org/2026/athens.","software_zh":"ApiconIASIS: Bee Wanderer，一款為 EU-CONEXUS Hackathon 製作的瀏覽器教育遊戲，以純 JavaScript、HTML5 Canvas、CSS3 與 Three.js 寫成，沒有使用遊戲引擎：level-engine.js 中是自製的 2D 平台跳躍引擎（requestAnimationFrame 迴圈、AABB 碰撞偵測、正弦移動平台、視差捲動），搭配每個關卡各自的設定檔，另有一個互動式 WebGL 地球儀，以 Three.js 的 OrbitControls 與射線投射選取關卡，地點涵蓋雅典、喜馬拉雅、坦尚尼亞、烏干達與紐西蘭。可收集道具對應到生技流程階段（DNA 花粉、酵素液滴、純化微珠）；進度以 localStorage 保存，不需後端，另有一個氣象站功能從 Open-Meteo 與 wttr.in 取得即時資料。所有乾實驗腳本釋出於 https://github.com/igemathens2026/iGEM-Athens-2026---Software-；wiki 的程式庫為 gitlab.igem.org/2026/athens。","stack":["ESM-2 650M","ThermoMPNN","pymoo (NSGA-II)","ColabFold","AlphaFold","Protein-Sol","all-atom molecular dynamics (RMSF, DCCM)","Python","JavaScript / HTML5 Canvas","Three.js / WebGL","Open-Meteo API","wttr.in API","GitHub","GitLab"],"techniques":["multi-objective Pareto optimisation (NSGA-II)","protein language model constraint profiling","hard-constraint freeze lists from multi-source evidence","ddG stability scanning","structural validation gate (refolding)","single-compartment ODE pharmacokinetics","Emax saturating kill-law fitting","prophage mining across 165 genomes","bioprocess flowsheet simulation","seed-train scale-up modelling"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education was run as a programme rather than a set of visits, across age groups and education levels, and deliberately bilingual (every pamphlet and deck in English and Greek). At NTUA Open Days (17 March 2026) they reached over 100 STEM-track candidates at an engineering school where students have largely dropped biology, pairing an interactive presentation on industrial biotechnology and its ethical framework with a tour of the Laboratory of Biotechnology and Industrial Biocatalysis; the team recorded that the students were most engaged by ethics, and built that framing into every later event. The portfolio also includes a multi-day summer programme at Villa Aimilia (design-a-microbe, strawberry DNA extraction, bees-leaves-cells), Second Chance Schools in Peristeri and Piraeus for adult learners, the 4th Panhellenic Synthetic Biology Riddle Competition, ChemExpo, the Pasteur institute and iGEM Fest. The Bee Wanderer game extends the same material into a free browser format.","publicEngagement_zh":"教育是以計畫的方式推動，而不是一組零散的參訪，跨越年齡層與教育階段，並刻意採雙語（每一份手冊與簡報都有英文與希臘文）。在 NTUA 開放日（2026 年 3 月 17 日），他們在一所學生大多已放棄生物學的工學院觸及 100 多位 STEM 組考生，把一場關於工業生物技術及其倫理框架的互動簡報，搭配生物技術與工業生物催化實驗室的導覽；該隊記錄下學生最投入的部分是倫理，並把這個切入點寫進之後每一場活動。活動組合還包括 Villa Aimilia 的多日夏季營（設計一隻微生物、草莓 DNA 萃取、蜜蜂—葉片—細胞）、佩里斯特里與比雷埃夫斯的第二次機會學校（成人學習者）、第 4 屆全希臘合成生物學謎題競賽、ChemExpo、巴斯德研究所與 iGEM Fest。Bee Wanderer 這款遊戲則把同一批素材延伸成免費的瀏覽器形式。","ihp":"The human practices page is written as a ledger of what the project gave up. Two requirements came from beekeeping, not from the team, and now define success: the protein must reach the brood, and it must survive the larval gut. Delivery was moved from spray to feed because adjuvant surfactants are documented to harm bees and because the person holding the sprayer inhales it; protective equipment therefore appears in the protocols, not in the product. They chose a purified non-replicating enzyme over a live phage knowing it is weaker and more expensive, because a protein cannot spread, establish or transfer genes. They counter-screened against Lactobacillus apis and Bombilactobacillus mellis, the closest relatives of the pathogen in the hive, instead of easier distant organisms, and they used a reduced-virulence M. plutonius lineage although a virulent strain was available, accepting a weaker efficacy claim. Advisor Anastasis Galanis and beekeeper Peter Kasztelewicz (whose own hive footage is on the wiki) shaped these choices while they were being made; Peter's gentler methods, requeening and partial clean-out, are what motivated the feed route.","ihp_zh":"human practices 頁面寫成一本「放棄了什麼」的帳簿。兩項需求來自養蜂實務而非團隊本身，而它們現在定義了何謂成功：這個蛋白質必須抵達蜂子，而且必須在幼蟲腸道中存活。投遞方式從噴灑改為餵食，原因是佐劑界面活性劑已有文獻紀錄會傷害蜜蜂，而且拿著噴槍的人會吸入它；因此防護裝備出現在實驗流程中，而不是出現在產品裡。他們明知純化的非複製型酵素比活噬菌體效力更弱、成本更高，仍然選了它，因為蛋白質不會擴散、不會建立族群、也不會轉移基因。他們以蜂箱中與病原最親近的 Lactobacillus apis 與 Bombilactobacillus mellis 做反向篩選，而不是挑比較容易過關的遠緣菌種；而且即使有高毒力株可用，他們仍使用一株低毒力的 M. plutonius 株系，因而接受一個較弱的效力主張。顧問 Anastasis Galanis 與養蜂人 Peter Kasztelewicz（wiki 上有他自己蜂箱的影片）在這些選擇形成的過程中就參與其中；Peter 較溫和的做法——更換蜂王與部分清巢——正是餵食路線的動機來源。","realWorld":"ApiconIASIS is positioned as the first target-specific sustainable EFB treatment, with the value proposition pinned to a quantified loss: quarantine and hive burning halt honey production for about eight weeks on top of the destroyed colony. Unlike antibiotics (not authorised in the EU, and resistance-breeding where used) or fungal extracts, the enzyme is argued to leave the bee microbiome intact and to leave no residue in honey, preserving market value. The business plan carries a pitch deck and an investor one-pager; the entrepreneurial analysis includes a customer map built from interviews with commercial beekeeping companies and individual beekeepers, and the scale-up model gives the costing basis (105 L final working volume, 51.62 g/L maximum biomass, 2.55 g product per batch) with the explicit target of pricing below the financial loss of hive burning so that no beekeeper is excluded.","realWorld_zh":"ApiconIASIS 定位為第一個具標的專一性且永續的 EFB 處理方式，其價值主張釘在一個量化的損失上：隔離與燒毀蜂箱除了毀掉整個蜂群之外，還讓蜂蜜生產停擺約八週。相較於抗生素（在歐盟未獲授權，而且在使用的地方會培養出抗藥性）或真菌萃取物，他們論證這個酵素不會破壞蜜蜂的微生物相，也不會在蜂蜜中留下殘留，因而保住市場價值。商業計畫附一份簡報與一份投資人單頁說明；創業分析包含一張由與商業養蜂公司及個體養蜂人訪談建立的客戶地圖；而放大模型提供了成本計算的基礎（最終工作體積 105 L、最大生物量 51.62 g/L、每批次產物 2.55 g），並明確以定價低於燒毀蜂箱的財務損失為目標，使任何養蜂人都不會被排除在外。","partners":["Peter Kasztelewicz ('Beeman'), beekeeper, UK","Anastasis Galanis (team advisor)","National Technical University of Athens, School of Chemical Engineering (Prof. E. Topakas)","Laboratory of Biotechnology and Industrial Biocatalysis, NTUA","EU-CONEXUS Hackathon","TechnosetBee","Greek beekeeping associations","Villa Aimilia summer programme","Second Chance Schools, Peristeri and Piraeus","Hellenic Pasteur Institute","Twist Bioscience","SnapGene"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6478/wiki/optimization/fig7-pareto.avif","caption":"Pareto front from the NSGA-II search over the 17 mutable positions, trading predicted solubility against thermostability (ddG) for the GH25 muramidase; variants A, B and C were selected along this front.","caption_zh":"NSGA-II 在 17 個可突變位置上搜尋所得的 Pareto 前緣，為 GH25 胞壁質酶權衡預測溶解度與熱穩定性（ddG）；變體 A、B、C 即沿此前緣選出。","credit":"Team Athens, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6478/wiki/optimization/venn-freeze.avif","caption":"Venn diagram of the three independent evidence sources (structural role, ESM-2 evolutionary constraint, literature) used to build the 40-residue freeze list; a position was frozen only if at least two sources agreed.","caption_zh":"用來建立 40 個殘基凍結清單的三個獨立證據來源（結構角色、ESM-2 演化約束、文獻）的文氏圖；只有至少兩個來源一致時，該位置才會被凍結。","credit":"Team Athens, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6478/wiki/optimization/fig6a-rmsf.avif","caption":"Root-mean-square fluctuation from the all-atom MD run, confirming that the frozen residues are genuinely rigid (RMSF below 2 A) and turning the freeze list from a heuristic into a tested claim.","caption_zh":"全原子 MD 模擬得出的均方根波動，確認被凍結的殘基確實僵硬（RMSF 低於 2 A），把凍結清單從一條經驗法則變成一項經檢驗的主張。","credit":"Team Athens, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6478/wiki/education/day2-strawberry-dna-villa-aimilia.avif","caption":"Strawberry DNA extraction with children at the Villa Aimilia summer programme, day two of a hands-on sequence that began with design-a-microbe and ended with bees, leaves and cells.","caption_zh":"在 Villa Aimilia 夏季營與孩子一起做草莓 DNA 萃取，這是動手系列的第二天，該系列從「設計一隻微生物」開始，以蜜蜂、葉片與細胞收尾。","credit":"Team Athens, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy the freeze-list discipline: before optimising anything, lock the residues (or variables) that at least two independent lines of evidence call functional, then prove the lock with a simulation, and only then search aggressively over what is left; it converts a student ML pipeline into a defensible claim. Equally transferable is Athens' habit of writing down what each stakeholder conversation cost them (spray to feed, phage to enzyme, virulent to weak strain), which is far more persuasive to judges than a list of meetings.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"值得照抄「凍結清單」這套紀律：在最佳化任何東西之前，先把至少有兩條獨立證據指向具功能的殘基（或變數）鎖住，再以模擬證明這個鎖是對的，然後才對剩下的部分積極搜尋；這能把一條學生等級的機器學習流程變成一個站得住腳的主張。同樣可轉移的是 Athens 的另一個習慣：把每一場利害關係人對話讓他們付出的代價寫下來（從噴灑改為餵食、從噬菌體改為酵素、從高毒力株改為弱毒株），這對評審而言，比一串會議清單有說服力得多。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/athens/","https://2026.igem.wiki/athens/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/athens/model/in-silico-optimization","https://2026.igem.wiki/athens/model/pharmacokinetics-model","https://2026.igem.wiki/athens/model/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/athens/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/athens/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/athens/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/athens/entrepreneurship/business-plan"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳模型 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳創業 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳保育專案 — 得主"],"rank":136},"6479":{"team":"PSI Korea","id":"6479","section":"High School","country":"South Korea","village":"Biomanufacturing / materials and measurement (Best Village Project nominee; the village is not named on the wiki)","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/","projectTitle":"Bio Color ID - design and validation of a product authentication system using synthetic biology","projectTitle_zh":"Bio Color ID：以合成生物學打造產品真偽辨識系統的設計與驗證","tagline":"An authentication tag whose identity is the material itself, read as 60 optical features","tagline_zh":"一種以材料本身作為身分的真偽辨識標籤，讀取為 60 項光學特徵","summary":"Bio Color ID is a counterfeit-detection tag made by casting biologically produced indigoid pigments into bacterial PHB, so that the authentication feature is the material's own optical response rather than a printed code that can be copied or transferred. Two pathways were engineered into E. coli - phaCAB for PHB from acetyl-CoA, and a tryptophan-derived halogenated-indigoid route - with the team solving substrate competition between the halogenase and TnaA by deleting chromosomal tnaA by lambda-Red, moving the host to BL21-AI to stop T7 leakage, screening seven TnaA variants for intermediate rather than maximal activity, and screening six halogenases before settling on SttH. Tags are then read by a team-built reader: a camera plus five LEDs over four coloured backgrounds, giving 60 RGB features per tag. The team shows that three independently fabricated tags agree to Pearson r >= 0.9977 (MAE 3.58 DN) while visually indistinguishable tags and watercolour paper imitations separate clearly.","summary_zh":"Bio Color ID 是一種防偽辨識標籤，做法是把生物生產的靛類色素澆鑄進細菌產製的 PHB 中，使辨識特徵成為材料自身的光學反應，而不是一組可被複製或轉貼的印刷碼。團隊在 E. coli 中建構兩條途徑，一條是由 acetyl-CoA 生產 PHB 的 phaCAB，另一條是源自色胺酸的鹵化靛類路線；他們以 lambda-Red 刪除染色體上的 tnaA 來解決鹵化酶與 TnaA 之間的底物競爭，把宿主換成 BL21-AI 以阻止 T7 滲漏，篩選七個 TnaA 變體以取得中等而非最大的活性，並在篩選六個鹵化酶後定案採用 SttH。標籤再由團隊自製的判讀裝置讀取：一台相機加五顆 LED，搭配四種彩色背景，每個標籤可得 60 項 RGB 特徵。團隊顯示三個各自獨立製作的標籤相符至 Pearson r >= 0.9977（MAE 3.58 DN），而肉眼難以區分的標籤與水彩紙仿品則能被清楚分開。","awards":["Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Space / Foundational Advance / Software & AI / Biomanufacturing)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Measurement science and statistical modelling rather than mechanistic simulation, and done to a standard most undergraduate teams do not reach. The matching model (BioColor Verify) explicitly decomposes variance into capture variance (repeated photographs of one tag) and specimen variance (independently manufactured tags of the same recipe), standardises each of the 60 features by its own standard deviation, pools variance across colour IDs with the assumption stated and flagged, and weights specimen means equally so a heavily photographed tag cannot dominate the reference centre. Matching combines three metrics (standardised distance, maximum single-feature deviation, outlier count) rather than one distance, because a single large deviation gets diluted in a 60-dimensional norm. Thresholds are set by whole-specimen holdout - all captures of one tag are removed, the model is rebuilt, and the excluded tag is scored - with the team noting that holding out single captures would leak. Rejection of unregistered tags is framed as open-set recognition. Design review is anchored to the Eurachem method-validation guide.","frameworks_zh":"他們做的是量測科學與統計建模，而非機制性模擬，而且水準是多數大學部團隊也達不到的。比對模型（BioColor Verify）明確把變異數分解為拍攝變異（對同一標籤重複拍照）與樣本變異（同一配方下各自獨立製造的標籤），把 60 項特徵各自以其自身的標準差標準化，在各顏色 ID 之間合併變異數並明白寫出並標示該項假設，並把各樣本的平均值等權處理，使一個被大量拍攝的標籤無法主導參考中心。比對是結合三項指標（標準化距離、單一特徵的最大偏差、離群值個數）而非只用一個距離，因為單一處的大偏差會在 60 維範數中被稀釋。閾值以整個樣本保留法設定：移除某個標籤的所有拍攝影像、重建模型，再對被排除的標籤評分；團隊指出若只保留單張拍攝影像，資訊就會洩漏。對未註冊標籤的拒絕被框定為開放集辨識。設計審查則錨定在 Eurachem 的方法驗證指引上。","dataviz":"60-feature profile plots with a fixed, documented ordering (background -> LED -> channel) so any mismatching feature is traceable back to one illumination, one background region and one channel; overlaid profiles for independently fabricated tags with min-max shading; side-by-side profiles of tags versus paper imitations in three colours; sensitivity-score charts per lighting/background configuration; cumulative pixel-selection curves across tolerance; absorption spectra for pigment identification. Every figure caption states what the result does not establish.","dataviz_zh":"60 項特徵的輪廓圖採固定且有記錄的排序（背景 -> LED -> 通道），因此任何不相符的特徵都能回溯到某一種照明、某一塊背景區域與某一個通道；各自獨立製作的標籤輪廓疊圖，並附最小-最大範圍陰影；標籤與紙仿品在三種顏色下的並列輪廓圖；各照明／背景組態的靈敏度分數圖；不同容差下的累積像素選取曲線；用於色素鑑定的吸收光譜。每一張圖說都寫明該結果不能證明什麼。","datascience":"MAE, RMSE and Pearson r reported together with the explicit warning that high correlation does not imply agreement in absolute value; 51 of 60 features within 10 DN across three tags; variance-ratio feature screening that subtracts repeat-capture variance from between-specimen variance and floors negatives at zero (49 of 60 features positive, 11 zeroed); a specimen-variability sensitivity score of 34.6 across all features, with the team pointing out that a higher score is not automatically good because the signal being measured is manufacturing noise. Algorithm performance is evaluated on synthetic data generated from measured variation (480 records = 4 IDs x 4 specimens x 5 captures x 6 random datasets), and the report states repeatedly that these are synthetic results and do not establish authentication performance on physical tags. Instrument-level caveats are unusually sharp: JPEG gamma and colour correction mean RGB is not proportional to light intensity, RGB565 bit-shift maxima are 248/252/248 so a value of 248 does not prove saturation, and records before 28 September 2026 have illumination labels offset by one acquisition step.","datascience_zh":"MAE、RMSE 與 Pearson r 一併報告，並明確警告高相關並不代表絕對值一致；三個標籤之間，60 項特徵中有 51 項落在 10 DN 以內；特徵篩選採變異數比，從樣本間變異中扣除重複拍攝變異，並把負值截為零（60 項特徵中 49 項為正、11 項被歸零）；全部特徵的樣本變異度靈敏度分數為 34.6，而團隊指出分數較高並不自動代表好，因為被量測的訊號本身就是製造過程的雜訊。演算法效能是在由實測變異生成的合成資料上評估（480 筆記錄 = 4 個 ID x 4 個樣本 x 5 次拍攝 x 6 組隨機資料集），報告中反覆聲明這些是合成結果，並不能證明在實體標籤上的辨識效能。儀器層級的保留條件異常尖銳：JPEG 的 gamma 與色彩校正意味著 RGB 並不與光強度成正比；RGB565 的位元位移最大值為 248/252/248，因此 248 這個值並不證明已經飽和；而 2026 年 9 月 28 日之前的記錄，其照明標籤與實際擷取步驟相差一步。","software":"Three programs sharing one database: an exploratory pixel/region analyser written in Python with Streamlit (region statistics including mean, SD, quartiles, coefficient of variation and saturation fraction, with a warning below 20 selected pixels, and pixel selection by maximum channel difference, RGB Euclidean distance or channel ratio), a data-acquisition tool, and the BioColor Verify matching application. Database connection handling was tested against four mock servers, row-level security policies block direct client access to classification tables, and the admin key is kept in server environment variables. The team states candidly that integration testing against the live server was blocked by network restrictions, that the analyser still needs a local Python process and ships as an archive, and that at the record cutoff the public repository and release commit were not finalised although lockfiles, schema scripts and an example environment config were prepared.","software_zh":"三個共用同一個資料庫的程式：一個以 Python 搭配 Streamlit 寫成的探索式像素／區域分析器（區域統計量包含平均值、標準差、四分位數、變異係數與飽和比例，選取像素少於 20 個時會警告，像素選取方式可依最大通道差、RGB 歐氏距離或通道比值），一個資料擷取工具，以及 BioColor Verify 比對應用程式。資料庫連線處理已針對四個模擬伺服器測試，列層級安全性政策阻擋用戶端直接存取分類資料表，管理金鑰則保存在伺服器的環境變數中。團隊坦白表示，對線上伺服器的整合測試因網路限制而被阻擋；分析器仍需要一個本機 Python 行程，並以壓縮檔形式發布；而在資料截止時，公開的 repository 與發布 commit 尚未定案，不過 lockfile、schema 腳本與一份環境設定範例都已準備好。","stack":["Python","Streamlit (exploratory pixel/region analyser)","scikit-learn","ESP32-S3 with ESP-IDF LEDC for LED control","GC0308 camera module (RGB565 -> JPEG quality 80)","CAD and 3D printing for the reader shell and tag jig","server database with row-level security","UV-Vis absorption spectroscopy, FTIR, Nile red staining"],"techniques":["60-feature optical fingerprinting (5 LEDs x 4 backgrounds x RGB)","two-level variance decomposition (capture vs specimen)","whole-specimen holdout validation and threshold setting","multi-metric matching (standardised distance + max deviation + outlier count)","open-set recognition framing with explicit Mismatch reasons","MAE / RMSE / Pearson r reported jointly with interpretation caveats","variance-ratio feature selection with noise floor","synthetic-data algorithm testing with perturbation types and fixed random seeds","gray-card normalisation with its approximation limits stated","fixed-ROI coordinates stored as image fractions for resolution independence","independent third-party hardware rebuild as a reproducibility test"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Maker Faire Seoul 2026, where roughly 100 visitors over two days engaged with the exhibit, and the team recorded the questions rather than the headcount: imitation resistance, whether a dedicated reader is really needed, identification performance, LED selection, how it compares with QR codes and holograms, and variation between smartphones. Each question was converted into a named development priority (evaluation with independent samples, light-source characterisation, calibration with reference samples, simplified reading procedure, total cost assessment). The team also learned anti-counterfeiting design from the Bank of Korea Money Museum and discussed consumer verification behaviour with industry at Seoul Beauty Week (DDP) and the KINTEX K-Beauty Expo.","publicEngagement_zh":"2026 年的 Maker Faire Seoul，兩天約有 100 名訪客參與展示，而團隊記錄的是問題而不是人數：防仿能力、是否真的需要專用判讀裝置、辨識效能、LED 的選擇、與 QR code 及全像防偽標相比如何，以及不同智慧型手機之間的差異。每個問題都被轉換成一項具名的開發優先事項（以獨立樣本進行評估、光源特性分析、以參考樣品校正、簡化判讀流程、總成本評估）。團隊也到韓國銀行貨幣博物館學習防偽設計，並在首爾美妝週（DDP）與 KINTEX 的 K-Beauty Expo 與業界討論消費者的驗證行為。","ihp":"Expert consultation that visibly changed the measurement protocol. Professor Youngkyung Park first assessed whether LED-plus-RGB-camera measurement was feasible at all; the team then measured samples and returned for a second consultation, which produced the requirement to separate material contributions from instrument contributions. Professor Sungsoo Kang covered measurement consistency and operating procedures. Professor Brian T. Cunningham advised by email to use LEDs with known output spectra and pointed them toward work combining reference samples with computational analysis - the team responded by disabling auto-exposure and auto-white-balance, fixing per-illumination exposure and recording imaging conditions. Dr Jina Son challenged the environmental rationale directly, noting that using PHB in a small marker does not by itself justify the material, which pushed the team into scoping application range, production consistency and extraction time. Industry feedback on adoption cost and verification procedure is what defined the B2B model.","ihp_zh":"專家諮詢明顯改變了量測流程。Professor Youngkyung Park 先評估以 LED 加 RGB 相機量測這件事究竟可不可行；團隊隨後實際量測樣品並回去做第二次諮詢，由此產生了必須把材料的貢獻與儀器的貢獻分離的要求。Professor Sungsoo Kang 則談量測一致性與操作流程。Professor Brian T. Cunningham 以電子郵件建議使用輸出光譜已知的 LED，並指引他們參考結合參考樣品與計算分析的研究；團隊的回應是關閉自動曝光與自動白平衡、為每種照明固定曝光值，並記錄成像條件。Dr Jina Son 直接質疑環境面的立論，指出在一個小小的標記上使用 PHB 本身並不足以正當化這種材料的選擇，這把團隊推向界定應用範圍、生產一致性與萃取時間。業界關於採用成本與驗證流程的回饋，則是 B2B 模式成形的原因。","realWorld":"An agreement with cosmetics company IEUM&Co. to supply real products so the team can test attachment position, packaging curvature, damage, removal and transfer, and readout ease, with the team stating that they will judge the collaboration by recording product provision, attachment trials, field readout and actual adoption. Collaboration with K-beauty brand Atelier Glow on product application. Arts collaborator CRETION made the watercolour paper imitations that serve as the negative controls. The most striking real-world validation is on hardware: four mechanical engineering students from Hanyang University rebuilt the reader from the released documentation alone, buying parts from the same vendors and printing the released files with the same slicer settings. The team is careful about what it has not shown: a profile match does not establish tag uniqueness or distribution history, and acceptance of genuine physical tags and rejection of unregistered ones has not yet been measured.","realWorld_zh":"團隊與化妝品公司 IEUM&Co. 達成協議，由對方提供真實產品，讓他們測試貼附位置、包裝曲度、損傷、移除與轉貼，以及判讀的便利性；團隊並表示他們會以產品提供、貼附試驗、現場判讀與實際採用的紀錄來評斷這項合作。另與 K-beauty 品牌 Atelier Glow 合作進行產品應用。藝術合作方 CRETION 製作了作為陰性對照的水彩紙仿品。最醒目的真實世界驗證在硬體上：漢陽大學四位機械工程系學生僅憑已釋出的文件就重做出判讀裝置，向同樣的供應商採購零件，並以相同的切層軟體設定列印已釋出的檔案。團隊對自己尚未證明的事相當謹慎：輪廓相符並不能證明標籤的唯一性或流通履歷，而對真品實體標籤的接受率與對未註冊標籤的拒絕率，目前尚未量測。","partners":["IEUM&Co. (cosmetics company, product supply agreement)","Atelier Glow (K-beauty brand)","CRETION (arts collaborator, imitation samples)","Professor Youngkyung Park (optical measurement)","Professor Sungsoo Kang (measurement consistency)","Professor Brian T. Cunningham (advised by email on LED spectra and reference samples)","Dr Jina Son (PHB and environmental rationale)","Hanyang University Department of Mechanical Engineering students (independent reader rebuild)","Bank of Korea Money Museum","Maker Faire Seoul 2026, Seoul Beauty Week (DDP), KINTEX K-Beauty Expo"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6479/wiki/description/figure-11-reader-assembly.webp","caption":"Assembly of the Bio Color ID Reader: a fixed camera, a hemispherical shell carrying five LEDs (405, 525, 625, 660 nm plus broadband white) and a tag holder over four coloured background panels.","caption_zh":"Bio Color ID Reader 的組裝：固定式相機、一個載有五顆 LED（405、525、625、660 nm 加寬頻白光）的半球形外殼，以及位於四片彩色背景板上方的標籤座。","credit":"Team PSI Korea, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6479/wiki/description/figure-12-optical-conditions.webp","caption":"Tags on four coloured backgrounds imaged under five LED illumination conditions - the acquisition scheme that produces 60 RGB features per tag.","caption_zh":"標籤置於四種彩色背景、在五種 LED 照明條件下成像，這套擷取方案為每個標籤產生 60 項 RGB 特徵。","credit":"Team PSI Korea, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6479/wiki/description/figure-16-independent-tags.webp","caption":"Profiles of the 60 optical features for three tags independently fabricated under identical conditions, which agreed at Pearson r >= 0.9977 with a summary MAE of 3.58 DN.","caption_zh":"三個在相同條件下各自獨立製作的標籤，其 60 項光學特徵的輪廓；它們相符至 Pearson r >= 0.9977，摘要 MAE 為 3.58 DN。","credit":"Team PSI Korea, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6479/wiki/description/figure-20-paper-imitation-light-purple.webp","caption":"Bio Color ID tags compared with watercolour-painted paper imitations across the 60 features: visually similar samples separate clearly under specific illumination-channel combinations.","caption_zh":"Bio Color ID 標籤與水彩塗繪紙仿品在 60 項特徵上的比較：肉眼相似的樣品在特定的照明與通道組合下能清楚分開。","credit":"Team PSI Korea, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"This is the single best model in this cohort for what a high-school dry lab should look like, and almost all of it is reachable in one season: the maths is variance decomposition, holdout validation and three summary statistics, the tooling is Python plus Streamlit plus a 20-dollar ESP32 and a camera module, and the compute requirement is zero. The limiting factor is not tooling or compute but intellectual discipline and the mentorship that instils it - the habit of writing what a result does not establish next to every result, of holding out whole specimens rather than single images, and of reporting that integration tests were blocked instead of quietly omitting them.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"在這一批團隊中，這是高中乾實驗該長成什麼樣子的最佳範本，而且其中幾乎每一項都能在一季之內做到：數學部分是變異數分解、保留樣本驗證與三個摘要統計量；工具是 Python 加 Streamlit，再加一片 20 美元的 ESP32 與一個相機模組；運算需求為零。限制因素不是工具或算力，而是思考上的紀律，以及能培養這種紀律的指導，也就是在每一項結果旁邊寫下這項結果不能證明什麼的習慣、保留整個樣本而非單張影像的做法，以及把整合測試被阻擋這件事如實報告，而不是悄悄略過。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/","https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/sustainability","https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/project/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/project/parts","https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/wet-lab/experiments","https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/safety-and-security"],"awards_zh":["最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（太空 / 基礎推進 / 軟體與 AI / 生物製造）"],"rank":21},"6485":{"team":"WUXI-DSAS","id":"6485","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/","projectTitle":"ReNovo","projectTitle_zh":"ReNovo","tagline":"A hidden signal in a drop.","tagline_zh":"一滴尿裡藏著的訊號。","summary":"ReNovo is a whole-cell E. coli biosensor for urinary gentisic acid (2,5-dihydroxybenzoic acid), built as a non-invasive early-screening route for renal cell carcinoma (RCC), which is 80-85% of primary kidney malignancies and asymptomatic exactly when it is curable. The team adapted the maleylpyruvate-responsive GtdR/PgtdA system of Cupriavidus necator, deliberately omitting the gtdT transporter from the published circuit to obtain a monotonic, quantifiable dose-response, and used mCherry to dodge urine's green autofluorescence. Because urinary analyte concentration tracks hydration, a parallel colorimetric creatinine assay is run on the same chip and the result is reported as a gentisic acid-to-creatinine ratio in a three-tier risk band. The second-generation sensor PG2 gave a linear response over 0-12 uM (y = 1.094x + 16.8, R2 = 0.9764) with no significant artificial-urine matrix effect and no cross-reactivity to 2-, 3-, 4-HBA or salicyluric acid.","summary_zh":"ReNovo 是一個偵測尿中龍膽酸（2,5-二羥基苯甲酸）的全細胞 E. coli 生物感測器，被設計成腎細胞癌（RCC）非侵入式早期篩檢的途徑；RCC 佔原發性腎臟惡性腫瘤的 80-85%，而且偏偏在還可治癒的階段毫無症狀。團隊改用 Cupriavidus necator 中對順丁烯二醯丙酮酸有反應的 GtdR/PgtdA 系統，並刻意把已發表迴路中的 gtdT 運輸蛋白去掉，以取得單調且可量化的劑量反應關係，同時用 mCherry 避開尿液本身的綠色自體螢光。由於尿中分析物濃度會隨補水狀況變動，同一片晶片上還並行一個比色法肌酸酐分析，結果以龍膽酸對肌酸酐的比值、分三級風險區間回報。第二代感測器 PG2 在 0-12 uM 區間呈線性反應（y = 1.094x + 16.8，R2 = 0.9764），在人工尿液基質中沒有顯著的基質效應，對 2-、3-、4-HBA 或水楊尿酸也沒有交叉反應。","awards":["Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"Business and policy analysis frameworks applied explicitly: PEST analysis of China and global markets, Porter's five forces, SWOT, a marketing-mix positioning exercise, a five-phase evidence-gated development roadmap to 2035 with documented decision gates, and a dated risk register. A concentric three-layer SDG impact model (Inner Core / Proximal Field / Outer Ripple) organises the sustainability analysis by causal distance rather than importance.","frameworks_zh":"明確套用商業與政策分析框架：對中國與全球市場做 PEST 分析、Porter 五力分析、SWOT、行銷組合定位練習、一份延伸到 2035 年、以證據為關卡的五階段開發路線圖並記錄各決策關卡，以及一份註明日期的風險登錄表。另有一個同心三層的 SDG 影響模型（Inner Core／Proximal Field／Outer Ripple），依因果距離而不是重要性來組織永續性分析。","dataviz":"Unusually strong, data-first wiki: an interactive GLOBOCAN 2024 choropleth of age-standardised kidney-cancer incidence across 186 countries and territories with the underlying CSV published for download, keyboard-navigable; per-question survey charts that print exact n, option counts and percentages as accessible text; a concentric SDG framework figure and a cross-goal synergy/trade-off figure; an experiment-report calendar.","dataviz_zh":"這是一個資料優先、罕見地紮實的 wiki：一張互動式的 GLOBOCAN 2024 分層著色地圖，呈現 186 個國家與地區的年齡標準化腎癌發生率，底層 CSV 公開供下載，並可用鍵盤操作；逐題呈現的問卷圖表，以無障礙文字印出確切的 n 值、各選項計數與百分比；一張同心的 SDG 框架圖與一張跨目標綜效與取捨圖；以及一份實驗報告日曆。","datascience":"Survey instrument run in two waves (n = 131 general awareness; n = 70 product-preference, including a ranked-preference question scored out of 5) with results reported per option and used to justify named design choices. Wet-lab statistics are reported properly: linear regressions with R2 (PG2 0.9764; creatinine Jaffe calibration R2 = 0.98; enzymatic cascade calibration R2 = 0.9614; undiluted induction R2 = 0.9294), two-way ANOVA for matrix effect (concentration p < 0.0001, matrix p = 0.6), one-way ANOVA for reciprocal interference (p = 0.9837), exponential and log-linear fits of positive-cell fraction (R2 = 0.9954 and 0.9723).","datascience_zh":"問卷工具分兩波施測（一般認知 n = 131；產品偏好 n = 70，其中含一題以 5 分計的排序偏好題），結果逐選項回報，並用來支撐他們指名的設計選擇。濕實驗統計也做得規矩：線性迴歸都附 R2（PG2 為 0.9764；肌酸酐 Jaffe 法校正 R2 = 0.98；酵素級聯校正 R2 = 0.9614；未稀釋誘導 R2 = 0.9294）、基質效應用雙因子變異數分析（濃度 p < 0.0001、基質 p = 0.6）、相互干擾用單因子變異數分析（p = 0.9837）、陽性細胞比例則以指數與對數線性擬合（R2 分別為 0.9954 與 0.9723）。","software":"No standalone software deliverable. The /software page states plainly that it covers only wiki tools (interactive kidney-cancer map, scientific illustrations, experiment-report calendar) with the implementation in the wiki repository. The /model page is equally candid: it is marked RECORDS PENDING and states that a team model with documented assumptions, parameters, code and validation has not been published, pointing readers to Results instead. A phone mini-program that computes the gentisic-acid-to-creatinine ratio, asks a pre-test aspirin question and prints a tiered report is described as a proposal, not a built artefact.","software_zh":"沒有獨立的軟體產出。/software 頁面直接寫明它只涵蓋 wiki 上的工具（互動式腎癌地圖、科學插圖、實驗報告日曆），實作則放在 wiki 的程式庫中。/model 頁面同樣坦白：它標記為 RECORDS PENDING，並說明團隊並未發表具備完整假設、參數、程式碼與驗證的模型，請讀者改看 Results。一個可計算龍膽酸對肌酸酐比值、在檢測前詢問是否服用阿斯匹靈並印出分級報告的手機小程式，則被描述為一個提案，而不是已經做出來的東西。","stack":["interactive web map (GLOBOCAN 2024 / IARC data)","CAD hardware drawings","proposed WeChat-style mini-program","wiki repository on GitLab"],"techniques":["microfluidic chip and optical-reader design with spatial and temporal baseline subtraction against a sealed fluorescent standard","four-enzyme creatinine cascade design with documented interferents (endogenous creatine, hemoglobin)","survey design and reporting","regression and ANOVA analysis","PEST / Porter / SWOT market analysis","risk register with gated review points"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Two public surveys underpin the engagement work rather than decorating it: n = 131 on awareness (71.76% had only heard the name of kidney cancer, 35.11% had never considered that early RCC is asymptomatic, 57.25% each named hospital queues and fear of invasive procedures as screening barriers) and n = 70 on product expectations (safe handling ranked top at 4.39/5; 61.43% wanted digital confirmation of a colour readout rather than reading it themselves; 61.43% felt only 'somewhat reassured' about engineered bacteria and wanted more safety information; 44.29% wanted a built-in inactivation step before disposal; 58.57% would share anonymised data only with identity confidentiality; 68.57% preferred short science videos and 67.14% detailed articles with charts). Outreach was then built to that evidence: dual-track materials (comics, posters, brochures in English and Chinese, videos for younger audiences; rigorous seminars for senior students and faculty), age-tiered workshops from kindergarten to Grade 11 (LEGO cell models for Grades 1-3, strawberry DNA extraction for Grades 6-8, gel electrophoresis loading and interpretation for IB Grade 11), a presentation for parents and faculty, and WeChat / RedNote / Instagram channels. On Ms. Fiona You's challenge to 'go beyond iGEM', the team committed to a permanent campus Synthetic Biology Club and structured knowledge transfer so the next cohort builds on rather than restarts the work.","publicEngagement_zh":"兩份公眾問卷是參與工作的基礎，而不是裝飾：認知調查 n = 131（71.76% 只聽過腎癌這個名字，35.11% 從未想過早期 RCC 是沒有症狀的，各有 57.25% 把醫院排隊與害怕侵入性檢查列為篩檢障礙），產品期待調查 n = 70（安全操作的重要性排名最高，4.39/5；61.43% 希望有數位判讀來確認顏色結果，而不是自己讀；61.43% 對工程菌只覺得有點放心，希望看到更多安全資訊；44.29% 希望丟棄前內建一道去活化步驟；58.57% 只在身分保密的前提下願意分享去識別化資料；68.57% 偏好短科普影片、67.14% 偏好附圖表的詳細文章）。推廣活動就是照這些證據設計的：雙軌素材（漫畫、海報、中英文手冊、給年齡較小觀眾的影片；給高年級學生與教職員的嚴謹研討會）、從幼兒園到 11 年級的分齡工作坊（1-3 年級用樂高做細胞模型、6-8 年級做草莓 DNA 萃取、IB 11 年級做凝膠電泳的上樣與判讀）、一場給家長與教職員的簡報，以及 WeChat、小紅書與 Instagram 頻道。面對 Ms. Fiona You 要他們走出 iGEM 之外的挑戰，團隊承諾成立一個常設的校園合成生物學社團，並建立知識傳承的機制，讓下一屆是在既有成果上繼續，而不是重新開始。","ihp":"Nineteen named stakeholders across clinical medicine, diagnostics, regulation, bioethics and education, each mapped to the specific project section their input changed - and the changes are real, not cosmetic. The single strongest chain is the circuit redesign: the first-generation gtdR-gtdA-gtdT-mCherry sensor gave a non-monotonic response that peaked around 2 uM and then fell, making quantification impossible. Professor Hangxiang Wang suggested testing lower concentration gradients to check for promoter saturation; the team did, and the non-linearity persisted. Dr. Jing Shi then diagnosed the mechanism from the sequence architecture - the large expressed proteins and heavy transporter expression imposed metabolic strain - and Dr. Tengfei Hu proposed replacing active symport with passive diffusion by excising gtdT to stop intracellular 3-maleylpyruvate over-accumulation. Dr. Christina Feng reinforced it from a different angle: heavy metabolic load creates selection pressure for spontaneous loss-of-function mutations and plasmid clearance, which would make a deployed biosensor unreliable. The team deleted gtdT, and the second-generation PG2 construct restored linearity to R2 = 0.9764. Second chain, normalisation: Dr. Zhou (diagnostics researcher) warned that a single urinary metabolite moves with hydration, diet, medication and age so an elevated reading cannot be distinguished from a concentrated sample, and Dr. Gu (urology director) specifically recommended creatinine correction and first-morning-urine collection, while Dr. Xuan supplied the physiology - before a tumour invades the collecting system, biomarker secretion is very low. The team added a parallel creatinine assay as an internal reference and changed its reported output from raw fluorescence to a gentisic acid-to-creatinine ratio; it then changed chemistry between contexts for a stated reason, keeping the Jaffe picric-acid method for 96-well lab characterisation but switching the device to a four-enzyme cascade because Jaffe responds to non-creatinine urinary compounds and needs strongly alkaline conditions unsuited to dried reagents. Third chain, specificity: Dr. Wu (clinical laboratory physician, Wuxi No. 2 People's Hospital) said routine urine tests cannot separate nephritis or UTI from RCC, and Dr. Zhong warned that herbal medicines and diet confound urinary organic acids; the team ran an artificial-urine matrix panel (Na2HPO4, NaCl, KCl, creatinine, albumin, urea) and a look-alike panel (2-, 3-, 4-hydroxybenzoic acid, salicyluric acid, salicylic acid as the main aspirin metabolite), finding no matrix effect and no cross-reactivity, and added a pre-test aspirin question to the proposed app. Fourth chain, hardware and logistics: Dr. Wu demanded elimination of manual pipetting in favour of a single-use enclosed cassette plus automated reader; Dr. Vargas pointed them to Cologuard's non-contact sample handling as a benchmark; Dr. Christina Feng said in Chinese that she would 'recommend that you consider freeze-drying', naming -40 to -60 C cold chain as a commercial killer, and Dr. Zhong noted community clinics lack refrigeration - so lyophilised cells dried into the chip became the design target. Fifth chain, ethics and framing: Mr. Matthew Peatman argued a false positive is ethically acceptable because it only triggers non-invasive imaging whereas a false negative is disastrous, which set sensitivity as the priority over specificity; he also warned of 'psychosomatic health dysmorphia' from unregulated self-testing, and Dr. Martin Goffriller argued results must stay in the user's own hands, which produced local-only processing, opt-in anonymised data sharing and a three-tier Low/Borderline/Elevated report with an explicit disclaimer instead of a raw number. Dr. Wang Keming's insistence that the device be positioned strictly as a preliminary screening aid rather than a diagnosis is carried through the whole wiki. The notable discipline here is how consistently the team labels unvalidated claims: the 80 C / 20-minute thermal inactivation hold, hydrophobic vent containment, post-lyophilisation viability, and the three-tier cutoffs are each written as 'requires validation' or 'has not yet been demonstrated'.","ihp_zh":"十九位具名的利害關係人，橫跨臨床醫學、診斷、法規、生物倫理與教育，每一位都被對應到他們的意見所改動的特定專案章節，而這些改動是真的，不是表面功夫。最有力的一條鏈是迴路重新設計：第一代的 gtdR-gtdA-gtdT-mCherry 感測器反應不是單調的，在約 2 uM 達到高峰之後就下降，使定量變得不可能。Professor Hangxiang Wang 建議測試更低的濃度梯度，檢查是否為啟動子飽和；團隊照做了，非線性仍然存在。接著 Dr. Jing Shi 從序列架構診斷出機制：表現的蛋白質體積大、運輸蛋白表現量又高，造成代謝負擔；Dr. Tengfei Hu 則提議把主動共運輸換成被動擴散，也就是切掉 gtdT，以免細胞內 3-順丁烯二醯丙酮酸過度累積。Dr. Christina Feng 從另一個角度加強這個判斷：沉重的代謝負荷會形成選汰壓力，使自發性功能喪失突變與質體被清除，讓實際部署的生物感測器變得不可靠。團隊刪掉 gtdT，第二代的 PG2 構築把線性恢復到 R2 = 0.9764。第二條鏈是正規化：Dr. Zhou（診斷研究者）警告單一尿中代謝物會隨補水狀況、飲食、用藥與年齡變動，因此讀值偏高和樣本太濃根本分不出來；Dr. Gu（泌尿科主任）具體建議做肌酸酐校正並採集晨尿；Dr. Xuan 則提供生理學基礎：在腫瘤侵入集尿系統之前，生物標記的分泌量非常低。團隊因此加上一個並行的肌酸酐分析作為內部參照，並把回報的輸出從原始螢光值改成龍膽酸對肌酸酐的比值；他們也因為明確的理由，在不同場景改用不同化學方法：96 孔盤的實驗室表徵仍用 Jaffe 苦味酸法，裝置上則改為四酵素級聯，因為 Jaffe 法會對尿中非肌酸酐的化合物起反應，而且需要強鹼條件，不適合乾式試劑。第三條鏈是專一性：Dr. Wu（無錫市第二人民醫院臨床檢驗醫師）指出常規尿液檢查無法把腎炎或泌尿道感染與 RCC 分開；Dr. Zhong 則警告中草藥與飲食會干擾尿中有機酸；團隊因此跑了一組人工尿液基質測試（Na2HPO4、NaCl、KCl、肌酸酐、白蛋白、尿素）與一組結構相似物測試（2-、3-、4-羥基苯甲酸、水楊尿酸，以及阿斯匹靈的主要代謝物水楊酸），結果沒有基質效應、也沒有交叉反應，並在提案中的應用程式裡加入檢測前的阿斯匹靈用藥詢問。第四條鏈是硬體與物流：Dr. Wu 要求取消手動移液，改用一次性的密閉匣加自動判讀儀；Dr. Vargas 指出 Cologuard 的非接觸式樣本處理可作為標竿；Dr. Christina Feng 以中文表示她會建議他們考慮冷凍乾燥，並指出 -40 到 -60 C 的冷鏈在商業上是致命傷；Dr. Zhong 也指出社區診所沒有冷藏設備，於是把凍乾菌體直接乾燥在晶片上成為設計目標。第五條鏈是倫理與表述：Mr. Matthew Peatman 主張偽陽性在倫理上可以接受，因為它只會引導到非侵入性的影像檢查，而偽陰性才是災難，這也確立了靈敏度優先於專一性；他同時警告不受規範的自我檢測可能造成身心性的健康體像障礙；Dr. Martin Goffriller 則主張結果必須留在使用者自己手上，這帶來只在本機處理、選擇加入才分享去識別化資料，以及改用 Low／Borderline／Elevated 三級報告加上明確免責聲明，而不是給一個原始數值。Dr. Wang Keming 堅持這個裝置必須嚴格定位為初步篩檢的輔助工具、而不是診斷，這一點貫徹在整個 wiki 中。特別值得一提的紀律，是團隊標註未驗證主張時有多麼一致：80 C／20 分鐘的熱去活化持溫、疏水排氣孔的圍堵效果、凍乾後的存活率，以及三級分界值，每一項都寫明尚需驗證或尚未被證實。","realWorld":"The real-world framing is quantified and sourced: 442,570 new kidney-cancer cases and 144,871 deaths worldwide in 2024 (GLOBOCAN), China carrying roughly 18% of cases (80,211) and the highest national mortality (25,029) while sitting below the world age-standardised rate, so the burden is population scale rather than per-capita risk; 93.6% five-year relative survival for localised disease against 20.3% once metastatic; around 60% of cases found incidentally. The SDG case is built on named sub-targets with the team's own evidence rather than a logo wall: SDG 3 (3.4, 3.8, 3.d), 4 (4.4, 4.7, 4.a), 9 (9.1, 9.5, 9.b), 12 (12.4, 12.5, 12.8), 8 (8.2, 8.3, 8.5), 10 (10.2, 10.3, 10.4) and 17 (17.6, 17.16, 17.17), arranged in a concentric model and accompanied by a cross-goal synergy and trade-off analysis. The team also does something most teams skip: it checks its claim against an external commitment, noting that the UICC World Cancer Declaration 2025-2035 target of diagnosing 60% of cancers early is framed around cancers with existing evidence-based screening (breast, cervical, colorectal) and that RCC's absence from that list is precisely the gap. Regulation is specific: the National Medical Products Administration catalogues instruments and in-vitro diagnostic reagents separately and assesses them independently, so the reader and the biologically active chip follow two tracks of different length and the chip governs the launch date; the EU IVDR is cited as a separate conformity regime; China's Cancer Prevention and Control Action Plan 2023-2030 is noted as favouring early detection but not listing kidney cancer. On cost the team refuses a headline number, stating instead that cost per result is dominated by how often the reusable reader is amortised and that it avoids setting a selling price at this stage, while positioning unit cost low enough to be absorbed into a subsidised programme or public insurance, and identifying that payer, decider and beneficiary are three different parties. After the Jamboree: a five-phase evidence-gated roadmap to 2035 with a documented decision gate between phases and a dated risk register (clinical validity 2028, specificity confounded by salicylate or diet 2028, unresolved creatinine-versus-specific-gravity normalisation 2028, production QC variability 2031, regulatory classification or evidence gap 2033), plus the campus Synthetic Biology Club and the Jiangnan University School of Life Sciences link as the institutional carriers.","realWorld_zh":"現實世界的鋪陳都有數字也有來源：2024 年全球新增腎癌 442,570 例、死亡 144,871 例（GLOBOCAN），中國約佔其中 18%（80,211 例）並有最高的全國死亡數（25,029 例），但年齡標準化率仍低於世界平均，因此這個負擔是人口規模造成的，而不是個人風險特別高；局部性疾病的五年相對存活率為 93.6%，一旦轉移則降到 20.3%；約 60% 的病例是偶然發現的。SDG 論述建立在指名的子目標與團隊自己的證據上，而不是貼一排標誌：SDG 3（3.4、3.8、3.d）、4（4.4、4.7、4.a）、9（9.1、9.5、9.b）、12（12.4、12.5、12.8）、8（8.2、8.3、8.5）、10（10.2、10.3、10.4）與 17（17.6、17.16、17.17），以同心模型排列，並附一份跨目標的綜效與取捨分析。團隊還做了多數隊伍會跳過的事：把自己的主張對照外部承諾檢核，指出 UICC World Cancer Declaration 2025-2035 關於 60% 癌症早期確診的目標，是圍繞已有實證篩檢方式的癌症（乳癌、子宮頸癌、大腸癌）設定的，而 RCC 不在那份名單上，正好就是那個缺口。法規部分寫得很具體：中國國家藥品監督管理局把儀器與體外診斷試劑分開列管、各自獨立審查，因此判讀儀與具生物活性的晶片走的是兩條長短不同的路，而上市時程由晶片決定；歐盟 IVDR 則被引述為另一套符合性規範；中國的癌症防治行動計畫 2023-2030 被指出雖然支持早期發現，但並未把腎癌列入。成本方面，團隊拒絕給一個標題數字，而是說明每次檢測的成本主要取決於可重複使用的判讀儀被攤提多少次，並表示現階段不訂售價，只把單位成本定位在低到可以被補助方案或公共保險吸收的水準，同時指出付費者、決策者與受益者是三個不同的角色。Jamboree 之後：一份延伸到 2035 年、以證據為關卡的五階段路線圖，各階段之間都有記錄下來的決策關卡，另有一份註明日期的風險登錄表（臨床效度 2028、專一性受水楊酸或飲食干擾 2028、肌酸酐與比重正規化之爭未解 2028、生產品質管制變異 2031、法規分類或證據缺口 2033），以及校園合成生物學社團與江南大學生命科學學院的連結作為制度上的承接者。","partners":["Dr. Haiwen Zheng, community hospital physician","Dr. Wang Keming, Head of Oncology, Second Affiliated Hospital of Nanjing Medical University","Dr. Xuan, Urology Department Director, Wuxi People's Hospital","Dr. Gu, Urology Department Director, Clinical Urological Center","Dr. Zhou, diagnostics researcher, Jiangnan University","Dr. Wu, clinical laboratory physician, Wuxi No. 2 People's Hospital","Dr. Zhong, integrative oncology and early diagnosis expert","Dr. Hangxiang Wang, First Affiliated Hospital of Zhejiang University","Dr. Jing Shi, synthetic biology specialist","Dr. Tengfei Hu, synthetic biology specialist","Dr. Christina Feng, academic principal and biochemist","Dr. Vargas, diagnostic testing and regulatory expert","Mr. Matthew Peatman, Head of Upper Secondary Humanities","Dr. Martin Goffriller, humanities specialist","Ms. Fiona You, Executive Principal","Ms. Lulu Zhu, Director of School Pastoral","Ms. Shuyi Xu, biology educator","Fan Jia, public representative","Ms. Gu, public representative","Jiangnan University School of Life Sciences"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6485/wiki/sustainability-figure-01-concentric-impact-framework.avif","caption":"ReNovo's concentric SDG framework: SDG 3 at the clinical core, SDGs 4/9/12 at the user interface, and SDGs 8/10/17 in the outer ripple, with layer position set by causal distance rather than importance.","caption_zh":"ReNovo 的同心 SDG 框架：SDG 3 位於臨床核心，SDG 4／9／12 位於使用者介面層，SDG 8／10／17 位於外圈漣漪，各層位置依因果距離而非重要性決定。","credit":"Team WUXI-DSAS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6485/wiki/sustainability-figure-02-cross-goal-synergies-and-trade-offs.avif","caption":"Cross-goal synergy and trade-off analysis across the seven claimed Sustainable Development Goals.","caption_zh":"針對所主張的七項永續發展目標所做的跨目標綜效與取捨分析。","credit":"Team WUXI-DSAS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6485/wiki/human-practices-specificity-panel.avif","caption":"The specificity panel built in response to clinicians Dr. Wu and Dr. Zhong: urine matrix components (Na2HPO4, NaCl, KCl, creatinine, albumin, urea) and structurally related phenolics (2-, 3-, 4-HBA, salicyluric acid) tested against gentisic acid.","caption_zh":"為回應臨床醫師 Dr. Wu 與 Dr. Zhong 而建立的專一性測試組：尿液基質成分（Na2HPO4、NaCl、KCl、肌酸酐、白蛋白、尿素）與結構相關的酚類（2-、3-、4-HBA、水楊尿酸）分別與龍膽酸對照測試。","credit":"Team WUXI-DSAS, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6485/wiki/human-practices-reader-concept.avif","caption":"Proposed reusable optical reader, shown closed and open, 90 x 110 x 100 mm, designed after survey respondents asked for digital confirmation rather than reading a colour change themselves.","caption_zh":"提案中可重複使用的光學判讀儀，圖中呈現閉合與開啟兩種狀態，尺寸 90 x 110 x 100 mm；會這樣設計是因為問卷受訪者希望有數位判讀來確認，而不是自己讀顏色變化。","credit":"Team WUXI-DSAS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy WUXI-DSAS's stakeholder map that indexes each of nineteen interviewees to the numbered project section their advice changed, so a reader can audit the causal claim; and copy their discipline of writing 'requires validation' next to every unproven design feature (thermal inactivation hold, lyophilisation viability, risk cutoffs) instead of letting a proposal read as a result.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"照抄 WUXI-DSAS 的利害關係人地圖：把十九位受訪者每一位都索引到他們的建議所改動的那個編號專案章節，讓讀者可以稽核這個因果主張；也照抄他們在每一項未經證實的設計特徵旁邊寫上尚需驗證的紀律（熱去活化持溫、凍乾後存活率、風險分界值），而不是讓一個提案讀起來像是已完成的結果。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/","https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/sustainability","https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/entrepreneurship","https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/results","https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/engineering","https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/safety-and-security","https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/team"],"awards_zh":["最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6497":{"team":"Worldshaper-Shanghai","id":"6497","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/worldshaper-shanghai/","projectTitle":"SweetCycle","tagline":"Don't sell the molecule, sell the step that makes it cheap to separate: engineered glycosyltransferases licensed into existing Reb A refineries","summary":"Worldshaper-Shanghai engineered the two glycosyltransferases that perform the final steps to Rebaudioside M (SrUGT76G1 and SrUGT91D2), screened eight designed variants in a contained Stevia hairy-root chassis with qPCR and HPLC read-out, and found that T284I raised Reb M to 21.96 micrograms per gram fresh weight against 15.44 for wild type while the SrUGT91D2 variants did nothing. The commercial insight is genuinely original: Reb M is expensive not because the pathway is hard but because it sits at about 2 percent of a pool of near-identical glycosides, so the only lever that matters is raising that fraction (eta), and the party who benefits is whoever owns the separation column. They therefore sell a licensed process asset to Reb A refiners rather than a product, backed by a published, recomputable techno-economic model that ranks three production routes and finds their own current enzyme performance gives a negative NPV in every scenario. They were nominated for Best Entrepreneurship in the High School section.","awards":["Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A purpose-built Reb M Commercialisation Decision Model (25-year NPV at a 12 percent discount rate across mild, neutral and fast price-convergence scenarios) plus PESTEL, Porter's Five Forces scored force by force, SWOT with deliberately unbalanced counts because the null results are listed as weaknesses, 4P, Business Model Canvas rewritten for licensing, bottom-up TAM/SAM/SOM, a four-phase milestone table with quantitative gates and pre-committed fallback decisions, and a risk register where every row has a triggering measurement and the decision that follows.","dataviz":"Eighteen figures carrying analysis rather than decoration: an evidence chain where node area is influence on the plan and colour is source type, a log-scale cost-per-sweetness positioning map, an S3 cost build-up split into bought-in versus engineerable lines, a Sherwood-type separation-cost curve, a compliance-status matrix with ok / work-in-progress / not-assessed, a 25-year NPV chart, an economic-window heatmap, a product-architecture diagram and a stakeholder map that deliberately includes the parties their success would harm.","datascience":"The standout dry-lab contribution. They normalise every price to RMB per kilogram of sucrose sweetness equivalent (RMB/SSE) because a 300x and a 250x sweetener cannot be compared per kilogram, which immediately shows that their real competitor is sucralose at 0.33 RMB/SSE, not sucrose at 5.40. The separation-cost model is calibrated as C_sep = 40/eta on top of a shared RMB 198.9/kg, giving a twenty-fold fall from about RMB 2,000/kg at eta = 2 percent to about RMB 100/kg at 40 percent. Decision thresholds are stated as checkable numbers: alpha greater than or equal to 0.9 or TON greater than or equal to 108 for the enzyme route to beat the fermentation proxy, eta greater than or equal to 9, 16.8 and 26.5 percent for three different comparisons. The model is published as runnable code with a parameter spreadsheet.","software":"model_core.py producing model_results.json and then the figures, published so a counterparty can re-run the analysis, with a supplementary Excel of parameters and scenarios.","stack":["Python (model_core.py)","JSON results pipeline","Excel parameter and scenario workbook","HPLC","qPCR","Stevia hairy-root culture via Rhizobium rhizogenes","Questionnaire Star"],"techniques":["glycosyltransferase variant design (T284I, T284S)","RFC-compliant part registration","contained hairy-root functional screening in 8-10 weeks","steviol glycoside quantification by HPLC","techno-economic route modelling with NPV and sensitivity","Sherwood separation-cost calibration"],"frameworks_zh":"一個專門打造的 Reb M 商業化決策模型（25 年期 NPV，折現率 12%，涵蓋溫和、中性與快速價格收斂三種情境），加上 PESTEL、逐項評分的波特五力、SWOT（各欄數目刻意不對稱，因為負面結果被列為弱點）、4P、為授權模式改寫的商業模式畫布、由下而上的 TAM/SAM/SOM、一張附量化門檻與預先承諾退路決策的四階段里程碑表，以及一份風險登錄表——每一列都有觸發的量測指標與隨之而來的決策。","dataviz_zh":"十八張承載分析而非裝飾的圖：一張證據鏈圖，節點面積代表對計畫的影響力、顏色代表來源類型；一張對數尺度的「每單位甜度成本」定位圖；一張 S3 成本堆疊圖，拆成外購項與可工程化項；一條 Sherwood 式分離成本曲線；一張合規狀態矩陣，分為可行／進行中／未評估；一張 25 年 NPV 圖；一張經濟窗口熱圖；一張產品架構圖；以及一張刻意納入「他們成功會傷害到的當事方」的利害關係人地圖。","datascience_zh":"這是乾實驗室最突出的貢獻。他們把所有價格都正規化為每公斤蔗糖甜度當量的人民幣價（RMB/SSE），因為 300 倍甜與 250 倍甜的甜味劑無法按公斤比較；這立刻顯示他們真正的競爭者是 0.33 RMB/SSE 的三氯蔗糖，而不是 5.40 的蔗糖。分離成本模型校準為在共同的 198.9 元/公斤之上加上 C_sep = 40/eta，於是從 eta = 2% 時的約 2,000 元/公斤，下降到 40% 時的約 100 元/公斤，相差二十倍。決策門檻都寫成可查核的數字：酵素路線要勝過發酵代理方案，需 alpha 大於或等於 0.9、或 TON 大於或等於 108；而三組不同比較則分別要求 eta 大於或等於 9%、16.8% 與 26.5%。模型以可執行的程式碼公開，並附參數試算表。","software_zh":"model_core.py 產出 model_results.json 再生成各張圖，並公開發布，讓交易對手能自行重跑整份分析；另附一份參數與情境的 Excel 補充檔。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"A 503-respondent consumer survey (Questionnaire Star, 2026) reported with the uncomfortable parts intact: natural/healthy/safe drives 61.95 percent of motivation but taste only 12.06 percent and price 4.16 percent, while 57.38 percent would preferentially buy if taste approached sucrose at a reasonable price, and 35.34 percent had never heard of stevia or monk-fruit sweeteners at all. They pair this with a brand-marketing observation that 80-90 percent of consumers cannot distinguish sweetener types, and draw the warning rather than the flattering conclusion: a natural label does not sell itself. Consumer content on Xiaohongshu and Douyin is scoped explicitly to label literacy and evidence-based sugar reduction, with a stated compliance boundary of no health claims and no in-house taste panels.","ihp":"Thirteen stakeholder interviews plus the survey, tabulated with who said what and, in a separate column, exactly what it changed. Three decisions are traceable to specific conversations rather than to any market report. AGV (Ai-Chi-Wei) brand R&D gave the priority order cost before supply stability before natural origin, which moved the success metric to cost per unit sweetness and narrowed the first market to premium beverage; AGV marketing added where not to compete, naming mass-market fruit tea as unwinnable and partial replacement as the realistic ask. Tiancao Technology, a functional food ingredient supplier, killed the plant-is-cheaper claim outright and pushed them from building capacity toward licensing. A fermentation engineer reordered the roadmap by stating that fermentation or in vitro catalysis is the pragmatic route for 5-10 years, that a new plant variety takes 7-12 years to commercialise, and that LCAs typically favour fermentation over leaf extraction by roughly 92 percent less cropland and 90 percent less water, which caused them to delete every claim that sunlight makes plants greener. Mr Lu, a grower and extension author, supplied the three clauses growers actually respond to (yield not reduced, purchase premium, guaranteed contract) and the line that without a demonstration field there is no trust, which became a hard Phase 3 gate. The China Food and Beverage Association established that different production processes are legally different raw materials even for an identical molecule, turning process disclosure into a named workstream. Most tellingly, three separate interviews told them whole-plant residue valorisation is a brand story rather than a purchase criterion, and they removed it from the base business case rather than argue with the data.","realWorld":"The most intellectually honest commercialisation analysis in this cohort, high school or otherwise, and the honesty is structural rather than decorative. The business model is a licence, not a product: a characterised SrUGT76G1 variant plus immobilisation and UDP-glucose-recycling parameters delivered as a technology transfer file, priced at a running royalty of 15 percent of the licensee's incremental gross margin (range 10-25 percent) with signing and milestone fees sized only to recover transfer cost, plus a per-hectare trait royalty of 10-15 percent later and a hairy-root pre-screening service throughout. Every price is anchored to a number the counterparty can verify in their own plant, which they state as the point: nobody is asked to believe a claim, only to run a calculation. Unit economics are fully built: target process cost RMB 438/kg at alpha 0.90 and TON 30, licensee incremental margin RMB 362/kg at a Reb M price of RMB 800/kg, royalty about RMB 54/kg, a five-year indicative P&L with every input as a substitutable row, cumulative break-even in commercial year 2 to 3, and a next-twelve-months funding ask of RMB 150,000-200,000 (USD 21,000-29,000) itemised down to calibration standards and two counterparty visits, with the explicit comment that they would rather present a small itemised ask than a round number. Market evidence is primary: 13 interviews and a 503-person survey, with secondary market data (Mordor, Grand View) used only where it is the right layer and with the two series explicitly declared non-comparable. The TAM is left unquantified and flagged as data gap G1 rather than fabricated. The regulatory path is specific and already open for the lead route: China's National Health Commission announcements 2024 No. 2 and 2025 No. 1 approved steviol glycosides by enzymatic conversion and by fermentation as food additives, which is precisely why the enzyme route leads and the engineered trait follows, with the non-GM conventional-crossing route (published at 56.8-61.6 percent Reb M) kept as a pre-planned fallback that avoids the GM layer. Now the blunt assessment. There is no company, no signed licence, no letter of intent, and one engaged counterparty rather than a customer; they say so in their own weaknesses. Their SrUGT91D2 variants produced a null result across five samples and they publish it, arguing correctly that doing so is what makes the SrUGT76G1 result credible. Their own Reb M quantification is labelled directional only: single batch, no biological replicate, all peak areas below the lowest calibration standard, so absolute values are extrapolated, and the fix (0.5, 1 and 2 microgram standards) is listed as outstanding work. Every performance number in the business case is still a literature value, which they say outright. And the model's most important finding is one that undermines their own pitch: at today's enzyme performance the NPV is negative in every scenario, and the economic window for the in vitro route is 0.7-4.6 years, shorter than the payback period, so the advantage is a window rather than a moat. The continuation plan is correspondingly disciplined: a four-artefact customer-validation gate for the next twelve months (a named refinery completing non-food performance testing, a brand defining partial-replacement acceptance criteria, a toll manufacturer quoting the kilogram-scale process, a regulatory and freedom-to-operate screen), with the statement that until those exist the NPV and P&L remain scenario analyses rather than sales forecasts. They even list the parties their success would disadvantage, including Reb A-only refiners holding the wrong asset and smallholders likely to be reached last, and the public-health trade-off that cheaper sucrose-like sweetness is only a gain if it displaces sugar rather than water.","partners":["Tiancao Technology (functional food ingredient supplier; first named economic buyer, engaged)","AGV / Ai-Chi-Wei, China Taiwan (brand R&D and marketing; specification pull)","China Food & Beverage Association (regulatory and standard-setting convening)","Mr Lu, stevia grower and extension author (trait adoption and demonstration plots)","Shanghai Chenshan Botanical Garden (plant and scientific infrastructure)","A fermentation engineer and a plant synthetic biologist (route and containment advice)","Toll manufacturer or enzyme house (to be contracted in Phase 2)"],"publicEngagement_zh":"一份 503 份回覆的消費者問卷（問卷星，2026），報告時連難堪的部分都原樣保留：天然／健康／安全驅動了 61.95% 的購買動機，而口味只有 12.06%、價格只有 4.16%；同時 57.38% 表示若口味接近蔗糖且價格合理就會優先購買，而有 35.34% 根本沒聽過甜菊或羅漢果甜味劑。他們把這份結果與一項品牌行銷觀察並列——80-90% 的消費者分辨不出甜味劑種類——並且得出警示而非討喜的結論：「天然」這個標籤不會自己把產品賣掉。在小紅書與抖音上的消費者內容，範圍明確限定在標示識讀與以證據為基礎的減糖，並宣告合規邊界：不做健康聲稱、不自辦內部品評。","ihp_zh":"十三場利害關係人訪談加上問卷，列表記錄誰說了什麼，並另闢一欄寫明它究竟改變了什麼。有三個決定可追溯到特定對話，而不是任何市場報告。AGV（愛之味）品牌研發給出的優先順序是成本先於供應穩定性、再先於天然來源，這使成功指標改為每單位甜度成本，並把第一個市場收窄到高階飲料；AGV 的行銷端則補上「不該在哪裡競爭」，指名大眾市場果茶是打不贏的，而部分取代才是現實的訴求。功能性食品原料供應商天草科技則直接否決了「植物來源更便宜」的說法，把他們從自建產能推向授權模式。一位發酵工程師重排了路線圖，他指出未來 5-10 年發酵或體外催化才是務實的路線、一個新植物品種要 7-12 年才能商業化，而 LCA 通常顯示發酵相較於葉片萃取可少用約 92% 的農地與 90% 的水——這使他們刪掉了所有「陽光讓植物更環保」的說法。種植戶兼推廣文章作者盧先生提供了種植者真正會回應的三項條件（產量不減、收購溢價、保證契約），以及一句「沒有示範田就沒有信任」，後者成為第三階段的硬性門檻。中國食品飲料協會則確立了一件事：即使是同一個分子，不同生產製程在法規上就是不同的原料，這使製程揭露成為一條指名的工作線。最能說明問題的是，有三場各自獨立的訪談都告訴他們，全株殘渣加值利用只是品牌故事、而不是採購準則，而他們就把它從基礎商業論證中移除，沒有去跟資料爭辯。","realWorld_zh":"這是本批隊伍中——不論高中組或其他組別——智識上最誠實的一份商業化分析，而這份誠實是結構性的，不是裝飾性的。商業模式是授權，不是產品：一個已鑑定的 SrUGT76G1 變異體，加上固定化與 UDP-葡萄糖回收的參數，以技術移轉文件的形式交付，定價為被授權方增量毛利的 15% running royalty（區間 10-25%），簽約金與里程碑金的額度只以回收移轉成本為限；後續再加上每公頃 10-15% 的性狀權利金，以及全程提供的毛狀根預篩服務。每一個價格都錨定在交易對手能在自己廠內驗證的數字上，而他們明說這正是重點：沒有人被要求相信任何主張，只被要求跑一次計算。單位經濟完整建構：在 alpha 0.90、TON 30 下，目標製程成本為 438 元/公斤；在 Reb M 價格為 800 元/公斤時，被授權方的增量毛利為 362 元/公斤，權利金約 54 元/公斤；並附一份五年指示性損益表，每一項投入都是可替換的一列，累積損益兩平落在商業化第 2 至 3 年；未來十二個月的募資需求為 15 萬至 20 萬人民幣（2.1 萬至 2.9 萬美元），細列到校正標準品與兩次交易對手拜訪，並明白表示他們寧可提出一個細列的小額需求，也不要一個整數。市場證據以一手為主：13 場訪談與 503 人問卷，二手市場資料（Mordor、Grand View）只用在適當的層級上，並明確宣告兩組數列不可相互比較。TAM 則留白、標示為資料缺口 G1，而不是憑空捏造。法規路徑具體，而且對領先路線已經打開：中國國家衛生健康委員會 2024 年第 2 號與 2025 年第 1 號公告，已核准以酵素轉化與以發酵法製得的甜菊醇糖苷作為食品添加物——這正是酵素路線領先、而工程化性狀跟在後面的原因；而非基改的常規雜交路線（已發表的 Reb M 比例為 56.8-61.6%）則作為預先規劃的退路保留，可避開基改這一層。接著是直白的評估。沒有公司、沒有已簽署的授權、沒有意向書，只有一個已接觸的交易對手而非客戶；他們自己把這些寫在弱點裡。他們的 SrUGT91D2 變異體在五個樣本上都得到空結果，而他們照實公開，並正確地主張：正因為這麼做，SrUGT76G1 的結果才可信。他們自己的 Reb M 定量被標示為僅供方向參考：單一批次、沒有生物重複、所有峰面積都低於最低校正標準品，因此絕對值是外推而來，而修補方法（0.5、1 與 2 微克標準品）被列為待辦工作。商業論證中的每一個效能數字目前仍是文獻值，這點他們也直說。而模型最重要的發現，正是一個戳破自己提案的發現：以今天的酵素效能，每一種情境下的 NPV 都是負的，而體外路線的經濟窗口只有 0.7 至 4.6 年，比回收期更短——所以他們擁有的是一個窗口，而不是一道護城河。後續計畫也相應地嚴謹：未來十二個月設下一道由四項成果構成的客戶驗證門檻（一家指名的精煉廠完成非食品用途的效能測試、一個品牌定義部分取代的接受標準、一家代工廠對公斤級製程報價、一份法規與自由實施（FTO）審查），並聲明在這些成果出現之前，NPV 與損益表仍是情境分析，而不是銷售預測。他們甚至列出自己成功會讓哪些當事方不利，包括手上持有錯誤資產的純 Reb A 精煉商，以及很可能最後才被觸及的小農，還有一個公共衛生上的取捨：更便宜的、近似蔗糖的甜味只有在取代糖、而不是取代水的時候才算是收益。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6497/wiki/worldshaper-shanghai/entrepreneurship/image3.webp","caption":"Positioning map of cost per sucrose-sweetness equivalent on a log scale, showing sucralose at 0.33 RMB/SSE as the ceiling over the whole natural-sweetener category","credit":"Team Worldshaper-Shanghai, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"以對數尺度呈現的每單位蔗糖甜度當量成本定位圖，顯示 0.33 RMB/SSE 的三氯蔗糖構成整個天然甜味劑類別的天花板"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6497/wiki/worldshaper-shanghai/entrepreneurship/image15.webp","caption":"Twenty-five-year NPV by route and scenario at a 12 percent discount rate; only the combined enzyme-then-trait strategy stays positive across all three price-convergence paths","credit":"Team Worldshaper-Shanghai, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"折現率 12% 下，各路線與各情境的 25 年期 NPV；只有「先酵素、後性狀」的組合策略在三條價格收斂路徑上都維持正值"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6497/wiki/worldshaper-shanghai/entrepreneurship/image16.webp","caption":"Economic-window heatmap: the year the enzyme licence stops making money under each price path, giving the 0.7 to 4.6 year window on today's enzyme performance","credit":"Team Worldshaper-Shanghai, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"經濟窗口熱圖：在每一條價格路徑下，酵素授權不再賺錢的年份，由此得出以今日酵素效能計算的 0.7 至 4.6 年窗口"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6497/wiki/worldshaper-shanghai/entrepreneurship/image1.webp","caption":"Evidence chain in which node area is the influence a source had on the plan and colour is the source type, built from 13 interviews and a 503-person survey","credit":"Team Worldshaper-Shanghai, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"證據鏈圖，節點面積代表該來源對計畫的影響力、顏色代表來源類型，由 13 場訪談與 503 人問卷建成"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Build one recomputable decision model per project, published as code plus parameters, whose job is to tell you which route your asset belongs in and what performance threshold makes it worth pursuing, then write every milestone as a quantitative gate with a pre-committed continue, modify or stop decision. The practice that makes it work is publishing the result that hurts: their model says today's enzyme gives a negative NPV, and saying so is what makes every other number believable.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/worldshaper-shanghai/","https://2026.igem.wiki/worldshaper-shanghai/entrepreneurship/","https://2026.igem.wiki/worldshaper-shanghai/assets/entrepreneurship-DyASDvRD.js"],"projectTitle_zh":"SweetCycle","tagline_zh":"不賣分子，賣讓分離變便宜的那一步：把工程化的糖基轉移酶授權給既有的 Reb A 精煉廠","summary_zh":"Worldshaper-Shanghai 改造了負責 Rebaudioside M 最後幾步反應的兩個糖基轉移酶（SrUGT76G1 與 SrUGT91D2），在受圍堵的甜菊毛狀根載體中篩選八個設計變異體，以 qPCR 與 HPLC 讀值判定，結果發現 T284I 把 Reb M 提升到每公克鮮重 21.96 微克，而野生型為 15.44；SrUGT91D2 的變異體則毫無作用。商業洞見確實原創：Reb M 之所以昂貴，不是因為路徑困難，而是因為它只占一池幾乎無法區分的糖苷中的約 2%，因此唯一真正有用的槓桿是提高這個比例（eta），而受益者是擁有分離管柱的那一方。於是他們把授權式的製程資產賣給 Reb A 精煉商，而不是賣產品，並以一份公開、可重新計算的技術經濟模型為支撐——該模型對三條生產路線排序，並發現以他們目前的酵素效能，在每一種情境下的 NPV 都是負的。他們獲得高中組 Best Entrepreneurship 提名。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"為每個專案建立一個可重新計算的決策模型，以程式碼加參數的形式公開，它的任務是告訴你自己的資產該走哪一條路線，以及什麼效能門檻才值得追下去；然後把每一個里程碑都寫成量化門檻，附上預先承諾的繼續、修改或停止決策。讓這套做法真正奏效的關鍵，是把傷害自己的結果也公開：他們的模型說今天的酵素給出負的 NPV，而正因為他們這麼說，其他每一個數字才變得可信。","awards_zh":["最佳創業 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6511":{"team":"Labi-Taiwan","id":"6511","section":"High School","country":"Taiwan","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/labi-taiwan/","projectTitle":"BlueCatcher: a cell-free electrochemical biosensor for MDD-associated circulating microRNAs","tagline":"A multistep biosensor validated stage by stage, from three-way-junction target recognition to a calibrated square-wave voltammetry readout.","summary":"Labi-Taiwan built BlueCatcher, a portable cell-free electrochemical biosensor for circulating microRNAs associated with major depressive disorder, intended as objective biological evidence alongside clinical assessment rather than as a diagnosis. The signal chain is deliberately long: a three-way junction recognises the target miRNA and releases a trigger strand, the trigger activates a toehold switch that expresses a nuclease, the nuclease cleaves a methylene-blue-labelled DNA reporter, and the released reporter is captured on a gold-modified screen-printed carbon electrode and quantified by square-wave voltammetry. Because a final signal alone cannot show that every step behaved, the team built a stepwise measurement framework in which each stage is independently validated before integration, with the degree of calibration deliberately matched to each measurement's role. The project also carries a machine-learning design suite and a strong education programme grounded in its own 432-respondent survey; it won the iGEMers Prize in the High School section.","awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (High School)","iGEMers Prize — Winner (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A stepwise measurement framework that follows the sensor from target recognition to electrochemical readout, with a published table listing for each method its purpose and its reusable output. Each measurement is classified by the question it can answer: structural validation, relative comparison under matched conditions, or absolute quantification. Three modular measurement workflows are released separately from the project so that another team can adopt one without adopting BlueCatcher. The software follows a Design-Predict-Test loop in which predictions are returned to the wet lab and the results are used to judge where the model performed well.","dataviz":"A heatmap of background-adjusted fluorescence response across all 25 three-way-junction probe combinations, measured every five minutes for 30 minutes; time-course FRET curves with mean +/- SD (n = 3); dose-response and specificity bar panels with individual data points overlaid and significance annotated; overlaid baseline-corrected SWV voltammograms across the reporter concentration series with an inset log-linear calibration; batch-to-batch SWV bar charts with individual measurements shown; an interactive experimental-design flow diagram mapping every assay onto the stage of the sensor it validates.","datascience":"The calibration philosophy is stated explicitly and is the most transferable thing here: different measurements are calibrated to different degrees according to what they are for. FRET measurements, used only for comparison under matched conditions, are reported as a background-adjusted response (delta F equals fluorescence with target minus fluorescence without target) and are explicitly said to be in arbitrary units, intended for within-experiment comparison and not for absolute cross-instrument quantification. Toehold-switch fluorescence is interpreted against a three-way control framework of sensor-only, trigger-only and sensor-plus-trigger, with fold change calculated as (sensor+trigger minus trigger-only) over (sensor-only minus trigger-only) so that background and OFF-state leakage are separated from activation; this is what revealed a 43.4-fold response in BL21(DE3) against 3.6-fold in pLysS and justified the strain choice. Native PAGE is used only as qualitative structural validation, and the team states that the paired plus- and minus-target lanes are different experimental conditions and not independent replicates, with quantitative reproducibility deferred to the replicated FRET measurements. Only the final electrochemical step is developed as an absolute quantitative endpoint: SWV on functionalised Au@SPCEs across 0 to 500 nM methylene-blue reporter gives a nonlinear full-range response but an approximately linear relationship against log concentration, Ip = 2.313 log10(C) - 2.028 with R2 = 0.9457, and the limit of detection is derived properly from the blanks as I_LOD = I_blank + 3 sigma_blank then inverted through the calibration to give 7.53 nM, with the 0 nM condition serving both as the blank for the threshold and as the negative control. Reproducibility is measured at the level that actually varies, the electrode: three independently fabricated batches of Au@SPCE were measured against the same 200 nM reporter, showed no statistically significant difference, and gave a combined coefficient of variation of 10.66%. Upstream quality control is explicit and non-binary: UV absorbance (A230, A260, A280) is used as a checkpoint rather than a pass/fail gate, with the full table of ratios published including a sample flagged for an anomalous A230 of 1.097 and a 260/230 of 0.048, and samples carried forward to Sanger sequencing as the higher-resolution arbiter in a declared chain of plasmid extraction, purity check, restriction digest, sequence confirmation, then functional measurement. Electrode fabrication itself is characterised stepwise by cyclic voltammetry, chronoamperometry and electrochemical impedance spectroscopy across bare SPCE, Au@SPCE, probe-modified, MCH-blocked and reporter-hybridised states, with EIS used as interface characterisation rather than as the quantitative readout. Statistics are named: two-way ANOVA with Tukey multiple-comparisons for the cell-free screening, with significance levels reported alongside n = 3 and individual points. The team also states what has not been done, that the toehold-switch-to-AciI construct is not yet built so the system is not integrated, and refuses to claim that BlueCatcher is faster, more sensitive or more accessible than qRT-PCR until it is, marking every projected time in its comparison table with an asterisk.","software":"The BlueCatcher Software Suite, with independent design modules for three-way-junction probes (trained Random Forest) and toehold switches (trained XGBoost), available through a browser interface and as a local install. A user supplies a target or trigger sequence, the suite generates candidate designs, computes sequence, structural, thermodynamic and interaction features using NUPACK and custom scripts, applies the trained model, and returns ranked candidates with prediction confidence plus the complete sequence components needed to order and test them, exportable as CSV. Documented limits of applicability are published: 18 to 25 nucleotide targets for the TWJ module and up to 30 nucleotide triggers for the toehold module, stated as the sequence spaces represented in training rather than as biological limits, together with a discussion of dataset coverage, how prediction confidence should be interpreted, and the NUPACK dependency that constrains distribution. Supporting material includes complete Sanger sequencing datasets as PDFs and three standalone protocol documents (nucleic-acid characterisation, toehold-switch cloning and expression, electrochemical signal generation).","stack":["Square-wave voltammetry on gold-modified screen-printed carbon electrodes","Cyclic voltammetry, chronoamperometry, open circuit potential, EIS","FRET fluorescence (FAM/BHQ1)","Native and SDS-PAGE with in-gel fluorescence","Cell-free expression systems","Sanger sequencing","NUPACK","Random Forest and XGBoost","ESP32-WROOM-32 portable reader with WiFi/Bluetooth","Polyimide flexible heater"],"techniques":["Calibration depth matched to measurement purpose","Background-adjusted response (delta F) for relative screening","Sensor-only / trigger-only / sensor+trigger control framework","Log-linear SWV calibration with R2","Blank-derived LOD (mean + 3 sigma, inverted through the curve)","Batch-to-batch reproducibility with coefficient of variation","Standardised baseline correction","Two-way ANOVA with Tukey post-hoc","Orthogonal protein-level validation of a fluorescence readout","Quality-control chain with a higher-resolution arbiter","Machine-learning pre-screening with declared domain limits"],"frameworks_zh":"一套逐步量測框架，跟著感測器從標的辨識一路走到電化學讀值，並公開一張表列出每個方法的目的與可重複使用的產出。每一項量測都依它能回答什麼問題來分類：結構驗證、在相同條件下的相對比較，或絕對定量。三套模組化的量測工作流程與專案分開發布，讓別的團隊可以只採用其中一套，而不必連 BlueCatcher 一起採用。軟體則遵循 Design-Predict-Test 迴圈，預測結果回送到濕實驗，再以實驗結果判斷模型在哪些地方表現良好。","dataviz_zh":"一張熱圖呈現全部 25 種三向接合探針組合扣除背景後的螢光反應，每 5 分鐘量測一次、共 30 分鐘；FRET 時間曲線附平均值 +/- 標準差（n = 3）；劑量反應與專一性柱狀圖疊上個別數據點並標註顯著性；報導子濃度序列的基線校正後 SWV 伏安圖疊合呈現，並以內嵌小圖放對數線性校正曲線；批次間 SWV 柱狀圖並顯示個別量測值；還有一張互動式實驗設計流程圖，把每一項分析對應到它所驗證的感測器階段。","datascience_zh":"校正哲學被明確寫出來，也是這裡最值得搬走的東西：不同量測依其用途，校正到不同的程度。FRET 量測只用於相同條件下的比較，因此以扣除背景後的反應呈現（delta F 等於有標的時的螢光減去無標的時的螢光），並明確聲明其單位為任意單位，僅供同一實驗內比較，不適用於跨儀器的絕對定量。toehold switch 的螢光則在三路對照框架下解讀——只有感測器、只有觸發股、感測器加觸發股——倍數變化以（感測器+觸發股 減 只有觸發股）除以（只有感測器 減 只有觸發股）計算，藉此把背景與 OFF 狀態的滲漏和真正的活化分開；正是這個算法顯示 BL21(DE3) 的反應為 43.4 倍、pLysS 僅 3.6 倍，從而為菌株選擇提供依據。Native PAGE 只當作定性的結構驗證使用，團隊並聲明有標的與無標的這組配對膠道是兩種不同的實驗條件，不是獨立重複；定量的再現性則交由有重複的 FRET 量測來承擔。只有最後的電化學步驟被發展成絕對定量的終點：在功能化 Au@SPCE 上，對 0 至 500 nM 的亞甲藍報導子做 SWV，全程反應並非線性，但對濃度取對數後近似線性，Ip = 2.313 log10(C) - 2.028，R2 = 0.9457；偵測極限則以正確的方式從空白推出——I_LOD = I_blank + 3 sigma_blank，再經校正曲線反推得到 7.53 nM；而 0 nM 條件同時擔任門檻值所用的空白與陰性對照。再現性是在真正會變動的層級量測的，也就是電極：三批獨立製作的 Au@SPCE 對同一個 200 nM 報導子量測，彼此沒有統計上的顯著差異，合併變異係數為 10.66%。上游的品質管制明確而且不是二分的：UV 吸光值（A230、A260、A280）被當作檢核點而不是通過／不通過的關卡，比值的完整表格也公開，其中包含一個被標記為異常的樣本（A230 為 1.097、260/230 為 0.048）；樣本接著送 Sanger 定序作為更高解析度的判準，整條鏈明示為質體萃取、純度檢查、限制酶切、序列確認，然後才是功能量測。電極製作本身也以循環伏安法、計時電流法與電化學阻抗頻譜逐步做特性分析，涵蓋裸 SPCE、Au@SPCE、探針修飾、MCH 封閉與報導子雜交等狀態；EIS 在此是用來做界面特性分析，而不是作為定量讀值。統計方法有具名：無細胞篩選採二因子變異數分析搭配 Tukey 多重比較，顯著水準與 n = 3 及個別數據點一併呈現。團隊也寫出還沒做到的部分：從 toehold switch 接到 AciI 的構築體尚未建成，因此系統並未整合；在那之前，他們拒絕宣稱 BlueCatcher 比 qRT-PCR 更快、更靈敏或更容易取得，並在比較表中每一個推估時間旁都加上星號。","software_zh":"BlueCatcher Software Suite 含兩個獨立的設計模組：三向接合探針（以隨機森林訓練）與 toehold switch（以 XGBoost 訓練），可透過瀏覽器介面使用，也可在本機安裝。使用者輸入一段標的或觸發序列，工具組會產生候選設計，利用 NUPACK 與自撰程式計算序列、結構、熱力學與交互作用特徵，套用訓練好的模型，最後回傳排序後的候選、預測信心度，以及訂購與測試所需的完整序列組件，並可匯出為 CSV。適用範圍也有文件化公開：TWJ 模組適用 18 至 25 個核苷酸的標的，toehold 模組最多 30 個核苷酸的觸發序列，並說明這些是訓練資料所涵蓋的序列空間，而不是生物學上的極限；另附資料集涵蓋度的討論、預測信心度應如何解讀，以及限制散布方式的 NUPACK 依賴問題。輔助材料包括以 PDF 形式提供的完整 Sanger 定序資料，以及三份可獨立使用的操作流程文件（核酸特性分析、toehold switch 的選殖與表現、電化學訊號產生）。"},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Education began with research rather than assumption. An anonymous online survey, preceded by an informed-consent statement and screened for careless or too-fast responses (12 excluded, 432 retained), used translated versions of three validated instruments: the six-item Depression Literacy and eight-item Misconceptions subscales of the DepSter scale and the nine-item perceived-stigma subscale of the Depression Stigma Scale, with internal consistency reported for this sample (alpha 0.66, 0.84 and 0.72). Literacy was high (mean 25.1 of 30) and misconceptions were broadly rejected (15.7 of 40), while perceived public stigma sat in the moderate-to-high range (29.3 of 45), with the highest-scoring items describing expected social exclusion. The team's conclusion, that the gap in Taiwan is stigma rather than knowledge, redirected the education programme; a saturated path model was estimated to test how education and personal contact relate to literacy, misconceptions and the perceived limits of counselling-only assessment. The programme that followed used different approaches for different audiences: a flipped classroom, a summer laboratory camp whose toehold-switch protocol is published as a reusable four-day workflow, family information sessions, a podcast, TGEM community-building among Taiwanese teams, and social media.","ihp":"Stakeholder work spans healthcare professionals, researchers, regulatory specialists, potential users and investment professionals, and fed an entrepreneurship roadmap covering regulatory planning and market analysis. The project's framing, that BlueCatcher complements rather than replaces clinical evaluation, comes from this engagement, as does the explicit statement that the device detects signals and does not diagnose.","realWorld":"The clinical gap is stated concretely: MDD assessment depends on interviews, symptom reporting and professional judgement, and patients face irregular follow-up because of stigma or access, no quantitative way to assess recovery or relapse, and trial-and-error treatment selection. The long-term aim is a portable format operating closer to the point of care in settings without centralised laboratory infrastructure, avoiding the reverse transcription and PCR amplification that qRT-PCR requires. The hardware is specified down to the reader's internals: an insertable electron reader module carrying the electrode pad and a cellulose overflow pad, a battery, a polyimide flexible heater, a lever that mechanically breaks a separation membrane in a two-chamber microtube to release the second reagent, and an ESP32 module that processes the signal and transmits results by WiFi and Bluetooth to a companion application that reports Low, Moderate or High biomarker variation with timestamped metadata rather than a binary diagnosis.","partners":["TGEM (Taiwanese iGEM community)","Previous Taipei-KCISLK teams (V1 2023, V2 2024, V3 2025)"],"publicEngagement_zh":"教育工作是從研究開始，而不是從假設開始。一份匿名線上問卷，事前附知情同意聲明，並剔除作答草率或過快的回覆（排除 12 份、保留 432 份），採用三個已驗證量表的中譯版本：DepSter 量表中六題的憂鬱症識能分量表與八題的迷思分量表，以及 Depression Stigma Scale 中九題的知覺汙名分量表；並報告此樣本的內部一致性（alpha 分別為 0.66、0.84 與 0.72）。識能偏高（平均 25.1 分，滿分 30），迷思大致被否定（15.7 分，滿分 40），而知覺到的公眾汙名則落在中高區間（29.3 分，滿分 45），其中分數最高的題目都在描述預期會遭到的社會排斥。團隊的結論是台灣的缺口在汙名而不在知識，這也讓整個教育計畫轉向；他們並估計了一個飽和路徑模型，檢驗教育程度與個人接觸經驗如何與識能、迷思，以及對僅憑諮商評估之局限的知覺相關聯。後續的計畫對不同受眾採取不同做法：翻轉教室、一場暑期實驗營（其 toehold switch 操作流程以可重複使用的四天工作流程公開）、家長說明會、一檔播客、在台灣各隊之間推動 TGEM 社群，以及社群媒體。","ihp_zh":"利害關係人工作橫跨醫療專業人員、研究者、法規專家、潛在使用者與投資專業人士，並餵進一份涵蓋法規規劃與市場分析的創業路線圖。專案的定位——BlueCatcher 是補充而非取代臨床評估——即出自這些互動，而「這台裝置偵測訊號、不做診斷」這句明確聲明也是。","realWorld_zh":"臨床缺口寫得很具體：重度憂鬱症的評估依賴會談、症狀自述與專業判斷；而病人則面臨因汙名或就醫可及性而不規則的回診、沒有量化方式評估康復或復發，以及用試誤方式選擇治療。長期目標是做成可攜形式，在沒有集中式實驗室基礎設施的場域更靠近照護現場運作，並避開 qRT-PCR 所需的反轉錄與 PCR 增幅。硬體連判讀器內部都有規格：一個可插入的電子判讀模組，上面載有電極墊與纖維素溢流墊；一顆電池；一片聚醯亞胺軟性加熱片；一支以機械方式壓破雙腔微量管內分隔膜、以釋出第二種試劑的撥桿；以及一顆 ESP32 模組負責處理訊號，並以 WiFi 與藍牙把結果傳到配套應用程式——該程式回報的是低、中、高三級的生物標記變異程度，並附帶時間戳記的後設資料，而不是二分的診斷結果。"},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6511/wiki/wet-lab/measurement/v2/figure-23.avif","caption":"Square-wave voltammetry quantification of the methylene-blue reporter on functionalised Au@SPCEs across 0 to 500 nM. The inset shows the approximately linear relationship between peak current and log concentration (R2 = 0.9457), from which a blank-derived limit of detection of 7.53 nM is calculated.","credit":"Team Labi-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"在功能化 Au@SPCE 上以方波伏安法對 0 至 500 nM 亞甲藍報導子進行定量。內嵌小圖顯示峰電流與濃度對數之間的近似線性關係（R2 = 0.9457），並據此算出由空白推得的偵測極限 7.53 nM。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6511/wiki/wet-lab/measurement/v2/figure-24.avif","caption":"Batch-to-batch reproducibility of the SWV readout: three independently fabricated batches of functionalised Au@SPCE measured against the same 200 nM reporter, showing no significant difference and an overall coefficient of variation of 10.66%.","credit":"Team Labi-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"SWV 讀值的批次間再現性：三批獨立製作的功能化 Au@SPCE 對同一個 200 nM 報導子量測，彼此無顯著差異，整體變異係數為 10.66%。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6511/wiki/measurement/flow/full.avif","caption":"The experimental design of the project, mapping every assay onto the stage of the sensing pathway it validates, from three-way-junction target recognition through toehold-switch signal generation to electrode fabrication and the electrochemical readout.","credit":"Team Labi-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"專案的實驗設計，把每一項分析對應到它所驗證的感測路徑階段，從三向接合的標的辨識、toehold switch 的訊號產生，到電極製作與電化學讀值。"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6511/wiki/dry-lab/hardware/figure-3.avif","caption":"Exploded view of the portable electrochemical reader's internal components: the insertable electron reader module with the electrode pad and cellulose overflow pad, a battery, a polyimide flexible heater, a lever that breaks the microtube's separation membrane, and an ESP32-WROOM-32 module on the main PCB.","credit":"Team Labi-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"可攜式電化學判讀器內部元件的爆炸圖：可插入的電子判讀模組（含電極墊與纖維素溢流墊）、電池、聚醯亞胺軟性加熱片、壓破微量管分隔膜的撥桿，以及主 PCB 上的 ESP32-WROOM-32 模組。"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Match the amount of calibration to the job each measurement does: screening comparisons can stay in background-subtracted arbitrary units if you say so, but the one measurement you report as a concentration needs a real calibration curve, a blank-derived limit of detection, standardised baseline correction and a between-batch coefficient of variation. Treating every signal as equally quantitative is where overclaiming starts.","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/labi-taiwan/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/labi-taiwan/software","https://2026.igem.wiki/labi-taiwan/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/labi-taiwan/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/labi-taiwan/education"],"projectTitle_zh":"BlueCatcher：針對重度憂鬱症相關循環 microRNA 的無細胞電化學生物感測器","tagline_zh":"一個多步驟的生物感測器，逐站驗證：從三向接合的標的辨識，一路到經過校正的方波伏安讀值。","summary_zh":"Labi-Taiwan 做出 BlueCatcher，一台可攜式、無細胞的電化學生物感測器，用於偵測與重度憂鬱症相關的循環 microRNA；其定位是在臨床評估之外提供客觀的生物證據，而不是作為診斷。訊號鏈刻意拉得很長：三向接合辨識標的 miRNA 並釋出觸發股，觸發股啟動一個 toehold switch 表現核酸酶，核酸酶切開標記亞甲藍的 DNA 報導子，釋出的報導子再被捕捉到鍍金網印碳電極上，以方波伏安法定量。由於單看最終訊號無法證明每一個步驟都如預期運作，團隊建立了一套逐步量測框架，讓每一站在整合之前都先獨立驗證，而校正的深度也刻意對應每一項量測各自的角色。專案另有一套機器學習設計工具組，以及一個以自家 432 份有效問卷為基礎的紮實教育計畫；他們獲得高中組的 iGEMers Prize。","gemsTakeaway_zh":"讓校正的程度對應每一項量測所承擔的工作：用於篩選比較的數據可以停留在扣除背景後的任意單位——只要你說清楚；但唯一要以濃度形式報告的那項量測，就需要真正的校正曲線、由空白推得的偵測極限、標準化的基線校正，以及批次間變異係數。把每個訊號都當成同等定量，正是過度宣稱的起點。","awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（高中組）","iGEMers 票選獎 — 得主（高中組）"],"rank":33},"6520":{"team":"Al-Nahrain-IRAQ","id":"6520","section":"Undergrad","country":"Iraq","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/al-nahrain-iraq/","projectTitle":"SYNOVA","projectTitle_zh":"SYNOVA","tagline":"The first Iraqi iGEM team: a software platform and home-built bioreactor for turning date-palm waste into bioethanol, built under hard local constraints","tagline_zh":"伊拉克第一支 iGEM 團隊：一個軟體平台與一台自製生物反應器，在嚴苛的在地限制下把椰棗廢料變成生物乙醇","summary":"Al-Nahrain-IRAQ is the first Iraqi team ever to compete in iGEM, from Al-Nahrain University, with a team drawn from Biotechnology, AI & Robotics Engineering, Civil Engineering and Business Economics. SYNOVA tackles yeast fermentation of date-palm waste into bioethanol, with a software platform of four apps whose governing rule is that a prediction must never be presented as a measurement, so predicted, published-measured and your-own-lab-measured results are kept separate and never combined into one number. The project is defined as much by what Iraq lacks: no local S. cerevisiae collection to borrow, no liquid ethanol sensor purchasable anywhere in Iraq or neighbouring countries at a reasonable price or wait, no local gene bank because of national restrictions, and RT-qPCR primers that took months and arrived only on 19 October. They built the sensor themselves, isolated four candidate wild yeasts from local sourdough, pomegranate vinegar, date vinegar and an overripe date from Najaf, and set an explicit goal of leaving behind protocols, tools and trained people that the next Iraqi team can start from.","summary_zh":"Al-Nahrain-IRAQ 來自 Al-Nahrain University，是史上第一支參加 iGEM 的伊拉克團隊，成員來自生物技術、AI 與機器人工程、土木工程與商業經濟。SYNOVA 處理的是用酵母把椰棗廢料發酵成生物乙醇，軟體平台由四個應用程式組成，其統御規則是：預測永遠不能被當成量測呈現，因此預測值、已發表的量測值與你自己實驗室的量測值被分開保存，絕不合併成同一個數字。這個專案同樣被「伊拉克缺什麼」所定義：沒有可借用的本地 S. cerevisiae 菌種庫、在伊拉克或鄰國都買不到價格與等待時間合理的液相乙醇感測器、因國家限制而沒有本地基因庫，以及等了好幾個月、直到 10 月 19 日才到貨的 RT-qPCR 引子。他們自己做了感測器，從在地酸麵團、石榴醋、椰棗醋與一顆來自 Najaf 的過熟椰棗中分離出四株候選野生酵母，並明確立下目標：留下協議、工具與受過訓練的人，讓下一支伊拉克團隊可以從那裡起跑。","awards":["iGEM Spirit Award — Winner (Undergrad & Overgrad)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"A hard evidence-provenance rule enforced in code and in every claim: two engines kept separate, with Engine 2 handling measured evidence and Engine 1 handling predicted evidence, and every result labelled predicted, measured (published) or measured (your lab). Pre-registered checks: the team fixed pass criteria before testing and published the failures rather than tuning parameters to pass, writing that 'a model tuned to pass would say less about how it behaves on real batches'. Human Practices used a four-column what-we-heard / who-said-it / what-we-changed / where-it-landed table.","frameworks_zh":"一條在程式碼與每一項主張中都被強制執行的證據來源規則：兩個引擎分開，Engine 2 處理量測的證據、Engine 1 處理預測的證據，而每個結果都標示為預測、量測（已發表）或量測（你的實驗室）。預先登錄的檢核：團隊在測試之前就固定通過標準，並把失敗公開，而不是去調參數讓它過關，他們寫道「一個被調到剛好通過的模型，對它在真實批次上的行為反而說得更少」。人類實踐則採一張四欄表格：我們聽到什麼／誰說的／我們改了什麼／落在哪裡。","dataviz":"Hand-built accessible SVG figures with full text descriptions in <desc> elements, including a three-band dot figure showing the funnel from every testable strain, gene and condition down to the five experiments worth running first at the bench, a two-engine diagram with a dark band separating prediction from measurement, a 74-square grid of environmental samples with four marked as candidate isolates, a four-row prototype-evolution figure, and a load-cell density-sensor explainer.","dataviz_zh":"手工製作、具無障礙設計的 SVG 圖，每張都在 <desc> 元素中附完整文字描述，包括一張三帶點狀圖，顯示從「所有可測試的菌株、基因與條件」收斂到「最值得先在實驗桌上跑的五個實驗」的漏斗；一張兩引擎示意圖，以一條深色帶把預測與量測隔開；一張 74 格的環境樣本網格，其中四格標為候選分離菌；一張四列的原型演進圖；以及一張荷重元密度感測器的說明圖。","datascience":"Engine 2 is a differential-expression pipeline: RNA-seq results analysed with DESeq2 (PyDESeq2), filtered at padj < 0.05 and at least two-fold change, gene IDs resolved through the R64 reference genome, narrowed across five layers to an 18-gene hand-checked catalogue each with a published effect, covering ethanol, heat, sugar transport and osmotic stress. Its validation check: 83 genes were significant in both of two experiments where about 42 were expected by chance, and MED15 came out at log2 fold change -6.58. Engine 1 is a batch kinetics model plus optimizer whose check failed and was published as failed: it predicted 2.4 g/L ethanol at 13.25 hours where 7.6 g/L was measured, and its grid sweep did not recover the published optimum from Ahmad et al. (2021). The team states that four of Engine 1's parameter values have no published source, that parameters were read from papers with AI assistance and have not yet been re-checked by a team member, that values from Ghose and Tyagi (1979) could not be re-checked at all for lack of full-text access, and that the statistical design of the differential-expression analysis has not been reviewed in depth so its tables should be treated as unreviewed.","datascience_zh":"Engine 2 是一條差異表現流程：RNA-seq 結果以 DESeq2（PyDESeq2）分析，以 padj < 0.05 且至少兩倍變化過濾，基因 ID 透過 R64 參考基因體解析，再跨五層收斂成一份 18 個基因的人工核對目錄，每個都附一項已發表的效應，涵蓋乙醇、熱、糖運輸與滲透壓逆境。它的驗證檢核是：在兩個實驗中都顯著的有 83 個基因，而純屬偶然的預期值約為 42 個，其中 MED15 的 log2 fold change 為 -6.58。Engine 1 是一個批次動力學模型加最佳化器，它的檢核沒過，而且就以「沒過」公開：它預測在 13.25 小時時為 2.4 g/L 乙醇，而實測是 7.6 g/L，而它的網格掃描也沒能還原 Ahmad 等人（2021）發表的最佳條件。團隊寫明 Engine 1 有四個參數值沒有已發表的來源、參數是在 AI 協助下從論文讀出來的而且還沒有任何團隊成員重新核對過、來自 Ghose 與 Tyagi（1979）的數值因為拿不到全文而完全無法重新核對，以及差異表現分析的統計設計尚未被深入審閱，因此其表格應視為未經審閱。","software":"SYNOVA: four apps behind one landing page. Engine 1 (kinetic model of one batch fermentation plus condition optimizer, which refuses results breaking mass-balance rules), the micro-max method (re-implementation of a published growth-rate method, which matched the published method within a pre-set tolerance and passed a held-out strain), Lab Data (tools where any lab enters its own growth curves, RT-qPCR Ct values, primer and isolate sequences and fermentation runs), and Engine 2 (the differential-expression pipeline). Code on GitLab, data on Zenodo (10.5281/zenodo.23533297), with a docs/DATA.md listing file sizes and checksums and an honest note that two data files are not yet in the public record and must be requested from a team member. A guided demo was added after stakeholder feedback that the platform had to be usable even by experts. The dry lab also built interactive educational games based on SYNOVA for children. Bioinformatics workflows were built in Galaxy with Trimmomatic, HISAT2 and SAMtools.","software_zh":"SYNOVA：一個到達頁後面有四個應用程式。Engine 1（單一批次發酵的動力學模型加條件最佳化器，會拒絕違反質量平衡規則的結果）、micro-max 方法（對一個已發表生長速率方法的重新實作，在預設容差內與原方法相符，並通過一株保留菌株的檢驗）、Lab Data（任何實驗室都可以輸入自己的生長曲線、RT-qPCR 的 Ct 值、引子與分離菌序列以及發酵批次的工具）以及 Engine 2（差異表現流程）。程式碼在 GitLab，資料在 Zenodo（10.5281/zenodo.23533297），並有一份 docs/DATA.md 列出檔案大小與校驗碼，以及一則誠實的註記：有兩個資料檔尚未進入公開紀錄，必須向團隊成員索取。在利害關係人回饋指出平台必須連專家都用得順之後，他們加上了引導式示範。乾實驗組也以 SYNOVA 為基礎做了給兒童的互動教育遊戲。生物資訊流程則建在 Galaxy 上，使用 Trimmomatic、HISAT2 與 SAMtools。","stack":["Galaxy","Trimmomatic","HISAT2","SAMtools","DESeq2 / PyDESeq2","Google Colab","NCBI BioProject / BLAST","GitLab","Zenodo","Arduino","MQ3 vapour sensor","load-cell density sensor (own design)","SD-card data logging"],"techniques":["wild yeast isolation from local environmental samples (74 samples, 4 candidates)","ethanol tolerance screening on PDA with 7.6%, 8% and 10% ethanol","PCR with S. cerevisiae-specific MEX67 primers","ITS region amplification and sequencing (pending)","agarose gel electrophoresis","YPS30 anaerobic fermentation","crystal violet staining and 100x oil immersion morphology","four-generation home-built bioreactor with foam seal, SD logging, own liquid density sensor and coil condenser"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"The Spirit story is structural, not sentimental: the first Iraqi team in iGEM built a public-engagement programme that ran from primary-school children up to a deputy minister, and documented every rung. School workshops: Ajyal Al-Amal School on 15 July 2026 for 25 children and Sarh Baghdad School on 20 July 2026 for 30 children, 45 minutes each, explicitly designed so children could participate 'regardless of their previous knowledge'. Each session centred on hands-on banana DNA extraction so that a scientific concept became something children could observe directly rather than hear about, supported by interactive games the dry lab built from SYNOVA itself, themed colouring sheets, lab-coat-shaped candies and a question-and-answer competition. Both schools asked the team to return, and the principal of Sarh Baghdad School awarded the team certificates of appreciation. For older audiences they ran two 'AI in Biotechnology' workshops: an online session on 30 July 2026 with the KAUST iGEM team's Synthetic Biology Mentorship Program (13 students, 45 minutes, where Al-Nahrain was hosted as a special guest) and a two-hour session on 30 August 2026 at the American Space inside the American University in Baghdad for 90 participants drawn from students, educators and the wider community. They then convened a public event at Al-Farabi University with two moderated discussion panels, hosted by their supervisor Dr Zaid Nsaif Abbas: 'The AI Revolution: From Data to New Horizons of Innovation' with the AI Research Center at Al-Farabi University, the CEO of First Finance and the Dean of the College of Excellence at the University of Baghdad; and 'From Presence to Impact: Iraq's Voice on the Global Stage', moderated by Dr Muntadher Qasim with an assistant professor from Al-Farabi, a representative of the Office of the Deputy Minister for Scientific Research Affairs and the CEO of Al-Jisr Marketing Company - a panel built squarely around the question of Iraqi participation in global competitions like iGEM, which is the Spirit theme made into a programme. Institutional engagement climbed deliberately: the President of Al-Nahrain University on 28 April 2026, where the team pitched three project ideas to assembled professors and, on the feedback, abandoned all three and started again before arriving at SYNOVA; and Dr Hayder Abdul Zahid, Deputy Minister of Higher Education and Scientific Research, together with the syndicate presidents of human medicine and dentistry, on 6 September 2026, to spread the idea of iGEM in Iraq. They also exhibited at ITEX, the Iraqi International Telecommunication and Information Technology Exhibition, talking to technology companies and meeting the President of Al-Imam Al-Sadiq University. Internationally they were visibly a team being helped and then helping back - mentorship from other teams before they started, guest slot in KAUST's mentorship programme, project exchanges with KFUPM and McGill, the KAUST TAWASOL Showcase, and MIT-MAHE's Scents of the World activity where they chose a scent to represent Iraq. Their own stated lesson is unusually clear-eyed: there is no single way to teach science, a hands-on experiment suits a child while open discussion suits university students, 'our responsibility as educators is not just to explain information, but to make it understandable and leave room for curiosity and questions', and they documented their activities and methods specifically so other iGEM teams and educators can adapt them. Accessibility is built into the wiki as a reading-settings panel offering looser spacing (more space between letters, words, lines and paragraphs), narrower lines, a plain background with no grain or glyph field, motion reduction layered on top of the system setting, and high contrast, with settings kept on-device and ignored by printing; every SVG figure carries a written description.","publicEngagement_zh":"這裡的 Spirit 故事是結構性的，不是煽情的：伊拉克第一支 iGEM 團隊做出了一套從國小兒童一路延伸到一位副部長的公眾參與計畫，而且每一級都有紀錄。學校工作坊：2026 年 7 月 15 日在 Ajyal Al-Amal School 為 25 位兒童、7 月 20 日在 Sarh Baghdad School 為 30 位兒童，各 45 分鐘，並明確設計成讓兒童「不論先前知識如何」都能參與。每一場都以親手做香蕉 DNA 萃取為核心，讓一個科學概念變成孩子可以直接觀察的東西，而不是只能聽人講；搭配乾實驗組以 SYNOVA 本身做出的互動遊戲、主題著色紙、實驗衣形狀的糖果，以及一場問答競賽。兩所學校都邀請團隊再來，而 Sarh Baghdad School 的校長還頒給團隊感謝狀。對年紀較大的對象，他們辦了兩場「AI in Biotechnology」工作坊：2026 年 7 月 30 日與 KAUST iGEM 團隊的 Synthetic Biology Mentorship Program 合辦的線上場次（13 位學生、45 分鐘，Al-Nahrain 以特別嘉賓身分受邀），以及 2026 年 8 月 30 日在巴格達美國大學內 American Space 舉行的兩小時場次，共 90 位參與者，來自學生、教育工作者與更廣的社群。接著他們在 Al-Farabi University 辦了一場公開活動，含兩場有主持的座談，由他們的指導老師 Dr Zaid Nsaif Abbas 主持：「The AI Revolution: From Data to New Horizons of Innovation」，與 Al-Farabi University 的 AI 研究中心、First Finance 執行長與巴格達大學卓越學院院長同台；以及「From Presence to Impact: Iraq's Voice on the Global Stage」，由 Dr Muntadher Qasim 主持，與談者包括一位 Al-Farabi 的助理教授、科學研究事務副部長辦公室的代表，以及 Al-Jisr Marketing Company 的執行長——這場座談整個圍繞著「伊拉克如何參與 iGEM 這類國際競賽」這個問題，正是把 Spirit 的主題做成了一套節目。機構層面的往來也刻意一級一級往上：2026 年 4 月 28 日見 Al-Nahrain University 校長，團隊在一群教授面前提了三個專案構想，依回饋把三個全部放棄、重新開始，才走到 SYNOVA；2026 年 9 月 6 日則見高等教育與科學研究部副部長 Dr Hayder Abdul Zahid，以及人類醫學與牙醫公會的理事長們，為的是把 iGEM 的概念在伊拉克推開。他們也在 ITEX（伊拉克國際電信與資訊技術展）設展，與科技公司交談，並會見 Al-Imam Al-Sadiq University 校長。在國際上，他們明顯是一支先被幫助、再回頭幫助別人的團隊——開始之前先接受其他團隊的指導、在 KAUST 的導師計畫中獲得客座時段、與 KFUPM 和 McGill 做專案交流、參加 KAUST TAWASOL Showcase，以及 MIT-MAHE 的 Scents of the World 活動，他們在其中選了一種氣味代表伊拉克。他們自己寫下的心得異常清醒：教科學沒有唯一的方法，動手實驗適合孩子、開放討論適合大學生，「我們作為教育者的責任不只是解釋資訊，而是讓它可被理解，並留下好奇與提問的空間」，而他們把活動與方法記錄下來，正是為了讓其他 iGEM 團隊與教育者可以改編使用。無障礙也做進 wiki：一個閱讀設定面板提供較寬鬆的間距（字母、字詞、行與段落之間都加大）、較窄的行寬、沒有紋理或字符底紋的純背景、疊加在系統設定之上的動態效果減量，以及高對比；設定只存在裝置端，列印時會被忽略；而每張 SVG 圖都附文字描述。","ihp":"Human Practices was run as an input to design with the change recorded each time. Raghad Al-Shabandar, president of the National AI Center, pointed out that without clear or abundant labelled public data an AI model was the wrong tool and computational and statistical methods would pay off - so the team switched to equation-based models and statistics. Hussain Ali Mohammed, an AI instructor and data scientist, told them their ethanol-yield accuracy was unreliable and pointed them to ODE-based papers, which shaped Engine 1. Abdulrahman Faisal, CEO of Nabu Academy, warned the platform would not be adopted unless it informed labs or industry from their own data - which produced the Lab Data page where any lab enters its own growth curves, Ct values, sequences and fermentation runs. Ahmed Al-Katib, an economic expert and entrepreneurship trainer, said the platform must be as user-friendly as possible even for experts, so they added a guided demo. Muslim Sagban Altamimi, then Head of the Agricultural Engineers Syndicate in Diyala, discussed agricultural production, domestic consumption and spoilage and suggested extending beyond dates to figs and grapes, which went into future work. Dr Mohammed of Al-Khutwat Al-Sareea Company gave them access to his agricultural land to collect raw materials. Deans of Business Economics and Engineering at Al-Nahrain shaped the economic and feasibility thinking, and Manar Al-Obaidi (CEO of First Finance, known from Iraq's Shark Tank) became the team's sponsor after several meetings. The team also completed the two-day iGEM Entrepreneurship Boot Camp and a one-week British Council entrepreneurship programme. Their closing note on all this is refreshingly disciplined: 'We do not consider encouragement alone proof that our scientific design has changed.' They also name the dilemmas they faced - whether to train an AI model or build from published equations, and what to do when a model failed pre-fixed checks - and record choosing the equations and keeping the failures visible.","ihp_zh":"人類實踐是當成設計的輸入來跑的，而且每一次都把改變記下來。國家 AI 中心主任 Raghad Al-Shabandar 指出，在沒有清楚或充足的公開標註資料的情況下，AI 模型是錯誤的工具，而計算與統計方法才會有回報——於是團隊改用方程式型模型與統計。AI 講師兼資料科學家 Hussain Ali Mohammed 告訴他們乙醇產量的準確度不可靠，並指引他們去看以 ODE 為基礎的論文，這形塑了 Engine 1。Nabu Academy 執行長 Abdulrahman Faisal 警告，除非平台能用實驗室或產業自己的資料提供資訊，否則不會被採用——這催生了 Lab Data 頁面，任何實驗室都能在那裡輸入自己的生長曲線、Ct 值、序列與發酵批次。經濟專家與創業培訓師 Ahmed Al-Katib 說平台必須盡可能好用，連專家也一樣，所以他們加上了引導式示範。時任 Diyala 農業工程師公會主席的 Muslim Sagban Altamimi 與他們討論農業產量、國內消費與腐損，並建議從椰棗擴展到無花果與葡萄，這被列入未來工作。Al-Khutwat Al-Sareea Company 的 Dr Mohammed 讓他們進入自己的農地採集原料。Al-Nahrain 商業經濟與工程學院的院長們形塑了經濟與可行性的思考，而 Manar Al-Obaidi（First Finance 執行長，以伊拉克版 Shark Tank 為人所知）在數次會面後成為團隊的贊助者。團隊也完成了為期兩天的 iGEM Entrepreneurship Boot Camp 與一週的 British Council 創業計畫。他們對這一切的收尾寫得令人耳目一新地有紀律：「我們不把單純的鼓勵當成我們的科學設計已經改變的證據。」他們也點出自己面對過的兩難——是要訓練一個 AI 模型，還是從已發表的方程式建起；以及當一個模型沒通過事先固定的檢核時該怎麼辦——並記下他們選了方程式，也讓失敗保持可見。","realWorld":"The explicit deliverable is infrastructure for the teams that follow: a page titled 'Building the ground for future Iraqi iGEM teams' lists what can be reused - the S. cerevisiae isolate data on Zenodo (10.5281/zenodo.23533297), SYNOVA's four apps on GitLab, the bioreactor design together with its failure notes, and 22 qPCR primers documented as iGEM Registry parts with their specificity warnings - plus hard-won practical advice (mind the season; start where fermentation is already happening; make your own reference; don't start with ethanol; use enough inoculum for tolerance screening; our media recipes; plan for delays). Because Iraq has no local gene bank, SYNOVA ships a small reference set of yeast genes labs can use to check primers and isolates. The environmental case is date-palm waste valorisation into bioethanol as a substitute for gasoline; the social case is public exposure to bioinformatics, a field the team notes most people locally do not know exists. Content is licensed CC BY 4.0, and AI assistance is disclosed on a Responsible AI section of the Attributions page, including that the PyDESeq2 and SNP-matching Colab code were AI-assisted and that which assistant was used was not recorded.","realWorld_zh":"明確的交付成果是為後續團隊準備的基礎建設：一個名為「Building the ground for future Iraqi iGEM teams」的頁面列出哪些東西可以重用——Zenodo 上的 S. cerevisiae 分離菌資料（10.5281/zenodo.23533297）、GitLab 上 SYNOVA 的四個應用程式、附失敗紀錄的生物反應器設計，以及記錄成 iGEM Registry 元件並附專一性警語的 22 組 qPCR 引子——再加上得來不易的實務建議（注意季節；從已經在發酵的地方開始；自己建參考資料；不要一開始就做乙醇；耐受性篩選要用足夠的接種量；我們的培養基配方；要預留延遲的時間）。因為伊拉克沒有本地基因庫，SYNOVA 還附上一小組酵母基因的參考序列，供實驗室用來核對引子與分離菌。環境面的論證是把椰棗廢料加值成生物乙醇以替代汽油；社會面的論證則是讓大眾接觸生物資訊——團隊指出在當地大多數人根本不知道有這個領域存在。內容以 CC BY 4.0 授權，而 AI 的協助在 Attributions 頁的 Responsible AI 一節中揭露，包括 PyDESeq2 與 SNP 比對的 Colab 程式碼是在 AI 協助下完成，以及當時用的是哪個助理並沒有被記錄下來。","partners":["Al-Nahrain University (President Prof. Dr. Ali Abdulaziz Al-Shawi; Deans of Business Economics and Engineering)","Ministry of Higher Education and Scientific Research (Deputy Minister Dr. Hayder Abdul Zahid; Office of the Deputy Minister for Scientific Research Affairs)","Ajyal Al-Amal School","Sarh Baghdad School","American Space, American University in Baghdad","Al-Farabi University (AI Research Center; Dr. Zaid Nsaif Abbas; Dr. Ahmed Falah)","University of Baghdad, College of Excellence","ITEX - Iraqi International Telecommunication and Information Technology Exhibition","Al-Imam Al-Sadiq University","National AI Center of Iraq (Raghad Al-Shabandar)","Nabu Academy (Abdulrahman Faisal)","Agricultural Engineers Syndicate, Diyala (Muslim Sagban Altamimi)","Al-Khutwat Al-Sareea Company (Dr. Mohammed, land access)","First Finance (Manar Al-Obaidi, sponsor)","British Council","iGEM teams: KAUST (Synthetic Biology Mentorship Program, TAWASOL Showcase), KFUPM, McGill, MIT-MAHE (Scents of the World)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6520/wiki/hp-education/banana-dna-interactive-learning-01.avif","caption":"Banana DNA extraction with schoolchildren at Ajyal Al-Amal and Sarh Baghdad schools","caption_zh":"在 Ajyal Al-Amal 與 Sarh Baghdad 兩所學校與小學生一起做香蕉 DNA 萃取","credit":"Team Al-Nahrain-IRAQ, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6520/wiki/hp-education/banana-dna-interactive-learning-04.avif","caption":"Lab-coat-shaped candies made for the school workshops","caption_zh":"為學校工作坊特製的實驗衣形狀糖果","credit":"Team Al-Nahrain-IRAQ, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6520/wiki/hp-education/banana-dna-interactive-learning-05.avif","caption":"Children working through the team's themed colouring sheets","caption_zh":"孩子們完成團隊設計的主題著色紙","credit":"Team Al-Nahrain-IRAQ, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6520/wiki/hp-education/inclusivity-creating-opportunities-01.avif","caption":"A school workshop session: children and team members working together","caption_zh":"一場學校工作坊：孩子與團隊成員一起動手","credit":"Team Al-Nahrain-IRAQ, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6520/wiki/hp-education/bringing-together-academic-institutional-international-01.avif","caption":"Bringing academic, institutional and international partners together around SYNOVA","caption_zh":"把學術、機構與國際夥伴聚攏到 SYNOVA 周圍","credit":"Team Al-Nahrain-IRAQ, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6520/wiki/hp-education/connecting-synova-local-resources-01.avif","caption":"Connecting SYNOVA to local agricultural resources: date-palm waste as feedstock","caption_zh":"把 SYNOVA 接上在地農業資源：以椰棗廢料為原料","credit":"Team Al-Nahrain-IRAQ, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Build the engagement ladder deliberately and publish your failures: Al-Nahrain went schoolchildren to university students to industry to a deputy minister in one season, each conversation logged as what-we-heard / what-we-changed, and left behind a reuse page (isolates on Zenodo, code on GitLab, Registry primers, bioreactor design with its failure notes, and seven blunt pieces of practical advice) so the next team in their country starts further along than they did.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"刻意把參與的階梯一級一級搭起來，並把失敗公開：Al-Nahrain 在一季之內從小學生、大學生、產業一路走到一位副部長，每一場對話都記成「我們聽到什麼／我們改了什麼」，並留下一個可重用頁面（Zenodo 上的分離菌株、GitLab 上的程式碼、Registry 上的引子、附失敗紀錄的生物反應器設計，以及七條直白的實務建議），讓他們國家的下一支團隊比他們當初起跑得更前面。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/al-nahrain-iraq/","https://2026.igem.wiki/al-nahrain-iraq/education","https://2026.igem.wiki/al-nahrain-iraq/human-practices","https://2026.igem.wiki/al-nahrain-iraq/engagement","https://2026.igem.wiki/al-nahrain-iraq/contribution","https://2026.igem.wiki/al-nahrain-iraq/model","https://2026.igem.wiki/al-nahrain-iraq/hardware","https://2026.igem.wiki/al-nahrain-iraq/bioinformatics"],"awards_zh":["iGEM 精神獎 — 得主（大學暨研究生組）"],"rank":26},"6523":{"team":"NIS Almaty-Medeu","id":"6523","section":"High School","country":"Kazakhstan","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nis-almaty-medeu/","projectTitle":"MiRVOX (Pulmora and OncoNose)","projectTitle_zh":"MiRVOX（Pulmora 與 OncoNose）","tagline":"Two approaches to accessible lung cancer screening: programmable RNA detection of blood microRNAs, and exploratory breath volatile organic compound patterns","tagline_zh":"兩條通往可負擔肺癌篩檢的路徑：對血液 microRNA 的可程式化 RNA 偵測，以及呼氣揮發性有機化合物模式的探索性研究","summary":"NIS Almaty-Medeu built MiRVOX, two parallel platforms for accessible lung cancer research: Pulmora, a synthetic biology platform for programmable detection of circulating microRNAs in blood, and OncoNose, an exploratory engineering project on volatile organic compound patterns in exhaled breath. The team states plainly on its landing page that neither platform is a clinically validated diagnostic test. The project is framed by hard numbers - 2.5 million lung cancer diagnoses and 1.8 million deaths worldwide in 2022, 12.4% of new cancers and 18.7% of cancer deaths, and 4,429 estimated new cases in Kazakhstan where it is the second most diagnosed cancer and the most common cancer in men. Their education and inclusivity work is extraordinarily large for a high-school team and is written with unusual methodological honesty, including a published disagreement between two of their own documents' participant counts.","summary_zh":"NIS Almaty-Medeu 打造了 MiRVOX，兩個並行的平台，目標是讓肺癌研究更易於觸及：Pulmora 是一個合成生物學平台，用於可程式化地偵測血液中的循環 microRNA；OncoNose 則是一個探索性的工程專案，研究呼出氣體中揮發性有機化合物的模式。團隊在首頁就明白表示，這兩個平台都不是經臨床驗證的診斷檢測。整個專案以具體數字定調：2022 年全球有 250 萬人被診斷為肺癌、180 萬人死亡，佔新增癌症的 12.4% 與癌症死亡的 18.7%；而在哈薩克估計有 4,429 例新病例，肺癌在當地是第二常被診斷的癌症，也是男性最常見的癌症。他們的教育與包容性工作對一支高中團隊而言規模大得驚人，而且在方法學上誠實得不尋常，甚至公開了自家兩份文件之間參與人數不一致的問題。","awards":["Inclusivity Award — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"An explicit four-step human practices loop (Ask, Understand, Change, Check back) with the questions for each stakeholder group published before the conversations happened, deliberately 'to keep us honest about what we learned afterwards'. Inclusivity was structured as three questions: what prevents participation, whose input should guide our response, and what can we change so people have a meaningful opportunity to contribute - with a barrier-to-response table published for each strand. A five-stage workshop framework (Introduction, Demonstration, short explanation, Practical work, Presenting the result) with three prepared difficulty levels per activity.","frameworks_zh":"一個明確的四步人類實踐迴圈（Ask、Understand、Change、Check back），而且每一個利害關係人群體的問題都在對話發生之前就先公開，刻意是「為了讓我們對事後聲稱學到什麼這件事保持誠實」。包容性工作則以三個問題架構起來：是什麼阻礙了參與、誰的意見應該指引我們的回應，以及我們能改變什麼，才能讓這些人有真正有意義的參與機會，而每一條工作線都公開了一份障礙對應措施表。另有一個五階段的工作坊架構（引入、示範、簡短講解、實作、成果發表），每項活動都預先準備三種難度層級。","dataviz":"Barrier-and-response tables mapping each identified barrier to the specific adaptation it produced; a day-by-day accelerator schedule table with focus, activities and output per day; a feedback table mapping each piece of feedback to the implication it had for programme delivery; partnership tables distinguishing institutions from contributions. The wiki also uses explicitly labelled 'Limitation' callout boxes throughout.","dataviz_zh":"障礙與回應對照表，把每一項被指認出來的障礙對應到它實際促成的具體調整；一份逐日的加速器議程表，列出每天的重點、活動與產出；一份回饋對照表，把每一則回饋對應到它對方案執行的意涵；以及夥伴關係表格，把機構與其貢獻分開呈現。這個 wiki 也全篇使用明確標示為「Limitation」的提示方塊。","datascience":"Reach figures are reported with deliberate methodological care: the team distinguishes the 70-school partnership network from the 23 schools visited in person, flags that summer attendance figures may include returning children, and separately records mentor-network size versus completed mentoring outcomes. Most strikingly, they publish a 'Limitation: two different participant counts' box stating that their Inclusivity document reports 120 participants in the biocomputing course while the Education document reports 64, that they have not established which is correct, and that neither figure should be quoted until confirmed. They also state that their evidence shows participation and application but that longer-term changes in understanding would require more consistent follow-up.","datascience_zh":"觸及人數的回報帶著刻意的方法學謹慎：團隊區分 70 校的夥伴網路與實際親自造訪的 23 所學校、標示暑期出席人數可能包含重複參加的兒童，並把業師網路規模與已完成的業師輔導成果分開記錄。最醒目的是，他們公開了一個「Limitation：兩個不同的參與人數」方塊，說明他們的包容性文件記載生物運算課程有 120 位參與者，而教育文件記載的是 64 位，而他們尚未確認哪一個才正確，因此在確認之前這兩個數字都不應被引用。他們也表明自己的證據顯示的是參與與應用，而要證實理解程度在較長期的變化，則需要更一致的後續追蹤。","software":"Code Against Cancer, a three-module no-equipment computational biology course: 'Find the Bug in DNA' (compare sequences in Google Sheets, identify differences, then encounter sequence search via BLAST), '3D Molecular Tetris' (explore protein structures in Mol* Viewer and relate molecular shape to interaction) and 'Pipeline of Life' (order the stages of a simplified biological analysis workflow on a collaborative Miro board). Lab Ladder, a 54-page illustrated code-free handbook, walks beginners through six tool 'rungs' with screenshots and worked accessions: NCBI (NM_000207), UniProt (P42212), Benchling (BBa_J23100), BLAST, Geneious Prime and AlphaFold (Q9NZQ7). A Kazakh-language facilitator platform, Tagylym, hosts the methodology.","software_zh":"Code Against Cancer，一門不需任何設備、分三個模組的計算生物學課程：「Find the Bug in DNA」（在 Google Sheets 中比對序列、找出差異，再進一步接觸以 BLAST 做序列搜尋）、「3D Molecular Tetris」（在 Mol* Viewer 中探索蛋白質結構，並把分子形狀與交互作用連結起來），以及「Pipeline of Life」（在協作的 Miro 白板上，把一套簡化的生物分析工作流程依序排好）。Lab Ladder 是一本 54 頁的圖解、免寫程式手冊，帶初學者走過六個工具「階」，附截圖與實作用的登錄號：NCBI（NM_000207）、UniProt（P42212）、Benchling（BBa_J23100）、BLAST、Geneious Prime 與 AlphaFold（Q9NZQ7）。另有一個哈薩克語的帶領者平台 Tagylym 存放整套方法。","stack":["BLAST","NCBI","UniProt","Benchling","Geneious Prime","AlphaFold","Mol* Viewer","Google Sheets","Miro","LEGO robotics programming","Google Meet","Kahoot"],"techniques":["microRNA biomarker detection","cell-free reactions intended for use outside a laboratory","primer design","volatile organic compound pattern analysis from exhaled breath","simple optical reader concept for low-cost local manufacture"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"Three large programmes, each documented barrier-first. First Qadam, run jointly with Panheya Robotics (Panheya supplied LEGO sets and robotics mentors, the iGEM team supplied biological content and volunteers), brings practical STEAM, engineering and biotechnology education to children aged 6-17 facing barriers of location, money, institutional setting, health or unadapted teaching formats. Six school visits in January 2026 reached 226 children; the team then contacted over 100 school directors and built a 70-school collaborating network (the Keleshek network), visiting 23 schools in person near Almaty, Taldykorgan and Taraz between February and May with online sessions and lesson recordings for the rest. Their key finding is quotable: access to equipment did not automatically mean access to meaningful participation, because teachers and children often needed help to start using resources they already had. So they trained teachers alongside students and supplied reusable instructions - and by September teachers and older students in nine partner schools were delivering activities themselves, with five school teams entering a dedicated competition league in June after the team helped create an entry route for Keleshek schools. Daniyar, a research project mentor at Al-Farabi School No. 31, reported running his own activity using the materials from their joint workshop. With Integrity Unite, a volunteer organisation supporting students from unstable financial backgrounds, a first online robotics session for 40 children showed the format was too theory-heavy and depended on kit the children did not own; the team responded by building the no-equipment, mentor-supported Code Against Cancer biocomputing course, run over one week in March after two weeks of recruitment, which produced roughly 34 completed mini-projects with 21 in revision and 26 at the idea stage. With 'House of Mercy: Autism Can Be Overcome', a first April session for 15 children revealed that shared LEGO sets meant nothing stayed with the children; the team then partnered with Sheber Bala to add supervised woodworking so each child made an individual wooden honey spoon plus a drawing on ecological and biological themes to take home, used calm communication and named badges, and allowed flexibility in pace, repetition, breaks and individual assistance across roughly eight summer visits of 10-20 children each. Crucially they write that they adapted to the particular group 'rather than treating a diagnostic label as a complete description of a learner' and explicitly refuse to generalise from one group of autistic children to all. An April workshop for 20 children in residential care combined supported LEGO work with age-banded books on innovation and biotechnology. A paediatric oncology visit for 15 children in Bishkek exposed a continuity barrier - the volunteers and the LEGO left with them - so after consulting KAUST iGEM representatives and a Central Asian iGEM ambassador the team built 12 individual hospital kits containing warm socks, stickers, a book, science colouring activities and crosswords, a change prompted by medical oncologist Baurzhan Ospanovich and summarised as a shift in planning question from 'what can we deliver during a visit?' to 'what opportunities will remain afterwards?'. Delivery was in Russian and Kazakh with visual demonstration alongside verbal instruction, three difficulty levels, two-to-four-hour sessions with flexible pacing, groups capped at five where intensive support was needed and 15 otherwise, with three to five volunteers per group, and multiple contribution routes within a session (assembling, programming, drawing, choosing materials, explaining a result, presenting). Second programme: Girls Go First, which targets the gap between interest in STEM and access to mentorship, networks, resources and leadership roles. A January online workshop with Technovation Girls put six female speakers in front of more than 130 girls across CIS countries; a spring global forum with Yurt Space (a girls-led aerospace engineering community) and Technovation Girls drew participants from more than three countries; a National Forum and StartUp Contest in January-February required every project to be girl-led with girls at least a third of each team, drew about 700 applications from around 386 teams, brought roughly 300 participants from 70 teams to finals in Almaty and Astana, and distributed a KZT 1,000,000 prize pool (backed by Women in Tech, InvestlyHub and StemTrades) as seed funding to seven girl-led teams; an April-June Business Case Championship with Astana Hub and its 11 regional subhubs involved 137 teams and 441 girls across 11 regions of Kazakhstan, each girl-led, with the challenge being to examine existing STEM systems and propose ways to make them more inclusive - and the ideas from that championship fed back into First Qadam's own inclusion policy. An ongoing global mentorship programme with the National Student Research Institute links 65 mentors to more than 45 mentees across over 15 countries, 31 of the mentors being FIRST Robotics and iGEM alumni. The team documents one concrete continuation chain honestly and modestly: Aidana, a Grade 11 participant, met judge Alexander Tyutin (Google Developer Groups) at one of their events, he became mentor for her EcoHub project, and her team went on to win an award at Technovation Girls - with the team noting that the award was Aidana's team's achievement and their own contribution was the opportunity through which the mentoring began. They also publish a limitation box stating that mentor-network size and completed mentoring outcomes are counted separately and that further follow-up is needed. Third: two flagship events. 'Can We Outsmart Cancer?', a free online forum on 8-9 August 2026 on Google Meet with five invited speakers (from UC Berkeley, IIT Patna, Oxford and KAUST) plus two student organisers, three tracks (fundamental research; applications, startups and commercialisation; synthetic biology and student participation through iGEM), a 'Truth or Myth?' Kahoot quiz on cancer misconceptions, and Q&A after each talk; 54 participants on day one and 41 on day two (95 participations) from ten countries - Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, the United States, Romania, Tanzania, Indonesia, India, Pakistan, Saudi Arabia and the United Kingdom - with an EdTech partner, 1609+, giving three free subscriptions and a 10% discount to everyone else. The team published both their own organising lessons (cold LinkedIn outreach works when personal and specific; one Instagram post is not enough so registration plus a WhatsApp group plus reminders are needed; attendance dropped on day two so send inter-day reminders; split content into beginner and advanced next time) and the speakers' critical feedback (schedule delays, technical difficulties, a suggestion to prepare backup questions). Then the Bio-Innovator Accelerator, a ten-day hybrid programme from 10-21 August 2026 for 55 participants in teams of three or four - 23 in person at American Corner Almaty and 32 online from Almaty, Astana and regional centres - built because promising laboratory developments in Central Asia rarely reach commercialisation. Week one covered problem validation, customer discovery, TAM/SAM/SOM market sizing, no-code MVP prototyping and unit economics; week two covered biosafety by design, regulatory pathways, intellectual property and freedom-to-operate searching in Google Patents, scientific storytelling, pitch decks and a live Demo Day before an independent jury. Eleven named guest lecturers ran the modules, including founders of ArtSkin, Grader.ai, LUMO/AsarQ and SoundVision, NU iGEM members on Human Practices and dry-lab prototyping, and the KAUST iGEM lead on project design and storytelling with optional 30-minute per-team mentoring. Demo Day projects included FermentAI, a computational platform predicting fermentation outcomes and simulating strains and reactor conditions, and MycoBlock, insulation and building panels grown from Ganoderma lucidum mycelium on local oak sawdust waste as an alternative to imported petroleum insulation. Finally, four open-access magazines published digitally in Kazakh, Russian and English, each deliberately serving one reader intent: Synapse (two issues, 15 and 20 pages - what synthetic biology is, iGEM's history from a 2003 MIT course, Kazakhstan's iGEM history from the first Nazarbayev University team in 2013, a five-step roadmap for joining a lab, questions to ask a lab before joining, six career paths, and national grants such as Zhas Galym and Bolashak); Beyond the Diagnosis (24 pages - cancer causes and types, modern treatments, eight myths versus facts, a patient story and clinician insight, microRNA biomarkers); Lab Ladder (54 pages - the illustrated code-free tool handbook); and iGEM Atlas (20 pages - the Oncology Village, award-winning 2024 projects, commercial transitions such as PvP Biologics to Takeda, startup guides). All four are archived in a public folder and offered explicitly as an adaptable blueprint future Central Asian teams may freely adopt, translate and build on, with Lab Ladder positioned as a new-member onboarding manual.","publicEngagement_zh":"三個大型方案，每一個都以「先談障礙」的方式記錄。第一個是 First Qadam，與 Panheya Robotics 合辦（Panheya 提供 LEGO 套件與機器人業師，iGEM 團隊提供生物學內容與志工），把實作型的 STEAM、工程與生物技術教育帶給 6 至 17 歲、面臨地理位置、金錢、機構環境、健康或未經調整的教學形式等障礙的兒童。2026 年 1 月的六場校園參訪觸及 226 位兒童；團隊接著聯繫了 100 多位校長，建立起一個 70 校的合作網路（Keleshek 網路），並在 2 月至 5 月間親自造訪了 Almaty、Taldykorgan 與 Taraz 附近的 23 所學校，其餘則以線上課程與課程錄影支援。他們的關鍵發現值得一再引用：擁有設備並不自動等於擁有有意義的參與機會，因為老師與孩子往往需要有人協助，才能開始使用他們手上早就有的資源。於是他們把老師與學生一起訓練，並提供可重複使用的說明文件；到了九月，九所夥伴學校的老師與較年長的學生已經能自行帶領這些活動，而在團隊協助為 Keleshek 學校建立參賽途徑之後，六月有五支校隊進入了一個專門的競賽聯盟。Al-Farabi School No. 31 的研究專案業師 Daniyar 回報，他已用他們共同辦理的工作坊素材，自行辦了一場活動。與支持經濟狀況不穩定學生的志工組織 Integrity Unite 合作時，第一場面向 40 位兒童的線上機器人課程顯示這個形式偏重理論，而且依賴孩子並不擁有的套件；團隊因此建立了不需設備、由業師陪伴的 Code Against Cancer 生物運算課程，在兩週招募後於三月進行一週，產出約 34 個已完成的小型專案，另有 21 個在修改中、26 個停在構想階段。與「House of Mercy: Autism Can Be Overcome」合作時，四月的第一場面向 15 位兒童的活動揭露出共用 LEGO 套件意味著孩子手上什麼都留不下；團隊於是與 Sheber Bala 合作，加入在督導下進行的木工，讓每個孩子都做出一支屬於自己的木製蜂蜜匙，再加上一幅生態與生物主題的畫作可以帶回家；他們採用平緩的溝通方式與寫上名字的名牌，並在大約八次每場 10 至 20 人的暑期探訪中，允許步調、重複、休息與個別協助上的彈性。關鍵在於他們寫下自己是針對這一個特定群體做調整，「而不是把一個診斷標籤當成對一位學習者的完整描述」，並明確拒絕由一群自閉症兒童推論到所有自閉症兒童。四月另有一場面向 20 位安置機構兒童的工作坊，把有人陪伴的 LEGO 操作與依年齡分級的創新與生物技術書籍結合起來。在 Bishkek 面向 15 位兒童的小兒腫瘤科探訪則暴露出一個延續性障礙，也就是志工與 LEGO 都隨著他們離開了；因此在諮詢 KAUST iGEM 的代表與一位中亞 iGEM 大使之後，團隊製作了 12 份個人用的醫院套件，內含保暖襪、貼紙、一本書、科學著色活動與填字遊戲，而這項改變是由腫瘤內科醫師 Baurzhan Ospanovich 所促成，並被總結為規劃問題的轉換，從「我們在一次探訪中能交付什麼？」變成「探訪結束之後還會留下哪些機會？」。活動以俄語與哈薩克語進行，口頭說明之外並搭配視覺示範，提供三種難度層級，每場兩到四小時且步調彈性，需要密集協助時每組上限五人、其餘情況上限 15 人，每組配三到五位志工，並在同一場活動中提供多種參與途徑（組裝、寫程式、繪圖、挑選材料、解說結果、上台發表）。第二個方案是 Girls Go First，針對的是「對 STEM 有興趣」與「能取得業師、人脈、資源與領導職位」之間的落差。一月與 Technovation Girls 合辦的線上工作坊，讓六位女性講者面向 CIS 各國超過 130 位女孩；春季與 Yurt Space（一個由女孩主導的航太工程社群）及 Technovation Girls 合辦的全球論壇，吸引了來自三個以上國家的參與者；一月至二月的全國論壇與新創競賽要求每個專案都必須由女生主導、且每隊至少三分之一為女生，共收到約 386 支隊伍的約 700 份申請，最後約 300 位來自 70 支隊伍的參與者進入 Almaty 與 Astana 的決賽，並把 100 萬 KZT 的獎金池（由 Women in Tech、InvestlyHub 與 StemTrades 支持）作為種子資金分配給七支由女生主導的隊伍；四月至六月與 Astana Hub 及其 11 個區域分部合辦的商業案例錦標賽，則有來自哈薩克 11 個地區的 137 支隊伍、441 位女生參與，每隊都由女生主導，題目是檢視現有的 STEM 體系並提出讓它更具包容性的方法，而這場錦標賽產出的想法又回饋到 First Qadam 自己的包容政策之中。一個與 National Student Research Institute 合辦、持續進行中的全球業師方案，把 65 位業師與超過 15 個國家、45 位以上的受輔導者連結起來，其中 31 位業師是 FIRST Robotics 與 iGEM 的校友。團隊誠實且不誇大地記錄了一條具體的延續鏈：11 年級參與者 Aidana 在他們某場活動中認識了評審 Alexander Tyutin（Google Developer Groups），他後來成為她 EcoHub 專案的業師，而她的隊伍最終在 Technovation Girls 獲獎；團隊並註明該獎項是 Aidana 隊伍的成就，他們自己的貢獻只是提供了那個讓輔導關係得以開始的機會。他們也公開了一個限制方塊，說明業師網路規模與已完成的輔導成果是分開計算的，而且需要進一步追蹤。第三個部分是兩場旗艦活動。「Can We Outsmart Cancer?」是 2026 年 8 月 8 至 9 日在 Google Meet 上舉行的免費線上論壇，有五位受邀講者（來自 UC Berkeley、IIT Patna、Oxford 與 KAUST）加上兩位學生籌辦者、三條分軌（基礎研究；應用、新創與商業化；合成生物學與透過 iGEM 參與），一場針對癌症迷思的「Truth or Myth?」Kahoot 問答，以及每場演講後的問答；第一天有 54 人、第二天有 41 人參與（合計 95 人次），來自十個國家，即哈薩克、吉爾吉斯、美國、羅馬尼亞、坦尚尼亞、印尼、印度、巴基斯坦、沙烏地阿拉伯與英國，並有一個 EdTech 夥伴 1609+ 提供三份免費訂閱以及給其餘所有人的 10% 折扣。團隊同時公開了自己的籌辦心得（冷接觸式的 LinkedIn 邀約在夠個人化且夠具體時是有效的；只發一則 Instagram 貼文不夠，必須有報名加 WhatsApp 群組再加提醒；第二天出席率下降，所以要在兩日之間發提醒；下次要把內容拆成初階與進階），以及講者們的批評性回饋（議程延遲、技術問題，以及建議事先準備備用問題）。接著是 Bio-Innovator Accelerator，2026 年 8 月 10 至 21 日為期十天的混合形式方案，55 位參與者分成三到四人一組，其中 23 人在 American Corner Almaty 實體參與，32 人從 Almaty、Astana 與各區域中心線上參與；開辦這個方案的原因是中亞有前景的實驗室成果很少走到商業化。第一週涵蓋問題驗證、客戶探索、TAM/SAM/SOM 市場規模估算、免寫程式的 MVP 原型製作與單位經濟；第二週涵蓋設計階段即納入生物安全、法規路徑、智慧財產與在 Google Patents 做自由實施檢索、科學敘事、提案簡報，以及在獨立評審團面前的現場 Demo Day。十一位具名的客座講師負責各模組，包括 ArtSkin、Grader.ai、LUMO/AsarQ 與 SoundVision 的創辦人、負責人類實踐與乾實驗原型的 NU iGEM 成員，以及負責專案設計與敘事的 KAUST iGEM 負責人，後者並提供每隊 30 分鐘的選擇性輔導。Demo Day 的專案包括 FermentAI，一個預測發酵結果並模擬菌株與反應器條件的運算平台；以及 MycoBlock，以 Ganoderma lucidum 菌絲體在當地橡木木屑廢料上長成的隔熱與建築板材，用以替代進口的石油基隔熱材。最後是四份開放取用的刊物，以哈薩克語、俄語與英語數位發行，每一份都刻意服務一種讀者意圖：Synapse（兩期，15 頁與 20 頁，介紹合成生物學是什麼、iGEM 自 2003 年 MIT 一門課起的歷史、哈薩克自 2013 年第一支 Nazarbayev University 隊伍以來的 iGEM 歷史、加入實驗室的五步路線圖、加入之前該問實驗室哪些問題、六條職涯路徑，以及 Zhas Galym 與 Bolashak 等國家級補助）；Beyond the Diagnosis（24 頁，癌症成因與類型、現代治療方式、八組迷思與事實對照、一則病患故事與臨床醫師見解、microRNA 生物標記）；Lab Ladder（54 頁的圖解免寫程式工具手冊）；以及 iGEM Atlas（20 頁，介紹 Oncology Village、2024 年的獲獎專案、PvP Biologics 併入 Takeda 這類商業化轉型，以及新創指南）。四份刊物全部存放在一個公開資料夾中，並明確作為一份可調整套用的藍圖，供未來的中亞團隊自由採用、翻譯與延伸，其中 Lab Ladder 被定位為新成員的上手手冊。","ihp":"The human practices page is built around a published commitment: list the groups whose answers would change the project and publish the questions for each before the conversations, so the team cannot retrofit what it learned. Five stakeholder groups are specified with their questions - clinicians (where in the pathway a triage test could help, what accuracy would earn their trust, what a false alarm costs), patients and the public (whether breathing into a device is acceptable and where, how an elevated-risk result should be explained, what should happen next and how fast), public health and policy (how lung cancer screening is organised in Kazakhstan today, what evidence a pilot would require, which regions have least CT access), bioethics and biosafety (what is required before collecting human breath samples, how to handle results the project is not qualified to interpret, what biosafety rules apply to cell-free reactions used outside a lab) and engineers and manufacturers (what a simple optical reader would cost to build locally, how cell-free reagents could ship without a cold chain). The team's framing sentence is that a screening test is a health-system decision, not a device decision, and that affordability, portability and follow-up capacity shape the design as much as the biology.","ihp_zh":"人類實踐頁面是圍繞一項公開承諾建起來的：先列出哪些群體的回答會改變這個專案，並在對話之前就公開對每一群體要問的問題，使團隊無法事後把學到的東西回頭套上去。文中具體指定了五個利害關係人群體及其問題，包括臨床醫師（在整個診療路徑的哪一段，一個分流檢測會有幫助；什麼樣的準確度才能贏得他們的信任；一次假警報的代價是什麼）、病患與一般公眾（對著一個裝置吹氣是否可接受、在什麼場所可接受；風險升高的結果該如何解釋；接下來該怎麼辦、要多快）、公共衛生與政策（哈薩克目前的肺癌篩檢如何組織；一項試辦計畫需要什麼樣的證據；哪些地區最缺 CT）、生物倫理與生物安全（採集人體呼氣樣本之前必須具備什麼；對於本專案沒有資格解讀的結果該如何處理；在實驗室外使用無細胞反應時適用哪些生物安全規範），以及工程師與製造商（一台簡易光學讀取器在本地自製要多少成本；無細胞試劑如何在沒有冷鏈的情況下運送）。團隊用來定調的那句話是：篩檢檢測是一個衛生體系的決定，而不是一個裝置的決定；而可負擔性、可攜性與後續追蹤能力對設計的影響，與生物學本身一樣大。","realWorld":"Consent and privacy practice is unusually explicit for a high-school team: activities were pre-coordinated with receiving organisations through correspondence, calls and preliminary visits; parents or legal representatives gave permission, with photography consented separately so children whose parents declined were not photographed; participants could decline an activity, a photograph or a question; access to original photographs and video was restricted to designated representatives of the visiting team and the receiving organisation and publication followed agreement with the organisation; and the team states that their photographs therefore do not represent every participant or activity. Prize-pool money in Girls Go First went through official consent-related documentation. Open resources: four trilingual magazines in a public folder, lesson recordings, age-banded books, science colouring activities and crosswords, guides and workshop methodology, with the full methodology available through partnership at a published contact address. External recognition includes a letter dated 22 April 2026 from the Ministry of Health of the Kyrgyz Republic thanking the team for supporting people with oncological conditions. Partnership documentation covers hospital work across multiple countries and is presented with an explicit distinction between resources already delivered and offers of future collaboration.","realWorld_zh":"就一支高中團隊而言，同意與隱私的做法明確得不尋常：所有活動都事先透過書信、電話與前置探訪與接待機構協調；由家長或法定代理人給予許可，拍照另外單獨徵求同意，因此家長不同意的孩子不會被拍攝；參與者可以拒絕某項活動、某張照片或某個問題；原始照片與影片的取用權僅限於參訪團隊與接待機構的指定代表，而發布則須先取得該機構同意；團隊並表明，因此他們的照片並不代表所有參與者或所有活動。Girls Go First 的獎金也經過正式的同意相關文件程序。開放資源包括：公開資料夾中的四份三語刊物、課程錄影、依年齡分級的書籍、科學著色活動與填字遊戲、各式指南與工作坊方法，而完整方法則可透過夥伴關係在一個公開的聯絡地址取得。外部肯定包括吉爾吉斯共和國衛生部於 2026 年 4 月 22 日發出的一封信函，感謝團隊對腫瘤疾病患者的支持。夥伴關係文件涵蓋跨多國的醫院工作，並明確區分已經交付的資源與未來合作的意向。","partners":["Panheya Robotics (LEGO sets, robotics mentors)","Integrity Unite (students from unstable financial backgrounds)","House of Mercy: Autism Can Be Overcome","Sheber Bala (woodworking expertise)","Keleshek school network (70 collaborating schools; 23 visited)","Al-Farabi School No. 31","National Centre for Motherhood and Childhood, Bishkek","Asan ophthalmology department, Dushanbe","MIOT International, Chennai","BLK-Max","Marengo Asia Hospitals","Artemis Hospital (Gurugram)","Fortis Healthcare / National Research Center for Maternal and Child Health, Astana (UMC branch)","Ministry of Health of the Kyrgyz Republic (letter of thanks)","KAUST iGEM and a Central Asian iGEM ambassador (hospital kit design)","Technovation Girls","Yurt Space","Astana Hub and its 11 regional subhubs","Women in Tech Kazakhstan, InvestlyHub, StemTrades (prize pool)","National Student Research Institute (mentor network)","American Corner Almaty (accelerator venue)","1609+ EdTech platform","Nazarbayev University iGEM","Startup Lab 119, iHub, Accelerate Prosperity and High Technology Park (Kyrgyzstan)"]},"images":[],"gemsTakeaway":"Copy two habits: publish your stakeholder questions before the interviews so you cannot retrofit your conclusions, and shift the planning question from 'what can we deliver during a visit?' to 'what will remain afterwards?' - which is what turned a hospital workshop into 12 take-home kits and turned 23 school visits into nine schools now running the activities themselves.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"照抄兩個習慣：在訪談之前就先公開你的利害關係人問題，這樣你就無法事後把結論回頭套上去；以及把規劃時要問的問題，從「我們在一次探訪中能交付什麼？」換成「探訪結束之後還會留下什麼？」而正是這個轉換，把一場醫院工作坊變成了 12 份可帶回家的套件，也把 23 場校園參訪變成現在有九所學校自己在辦這些活動。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/nis-almaty-medeu/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nis-almaty-medeu/education/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nis-almaty-medeu/inclusivity/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nis-almaty-medeu/human-practices/","https://2026.igem.wiki/nis-almaty-medeu/model/"],"awards_zh":["包容性獎 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7},"6529":{"team":"CHINAGuangdongShimen","id":"6529","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/chinaguangdongshimen/","projectTitle":"Re-CDI Alert: an engineered EcN platform for monitoring and treating recurrent Clostridioides difficile infection","projectTitle_zh":"Re-CDI Alert：用於監測與治療復發性 Clostridioides difficile 感染的工程化 EcN 平台","tagline":"A p-cresol-sensing probiotic biosensor, characterised with a measurement protocol written so that other teams can repeat it.","tagline_zh":"一個偵測 p-cresol 的益生菌生物感測器，其特性分析搭配一份寫成可供其他隊伍重複執行的量測規程。","summary":"Shimen built an Escherichia coli Nissle 1917 (EcN) biosensor that detects p-cresol, the metabolite Clostridioides difficile produces to suppress competing gut microbes and secure its own niche, and couples detection to a therapeutic output targeting the TcdB toxin. Because recurrence after CDI treatment is diagnosed only once symptoms return, the aim is to shift from symptom-triggered diagnosis toward proactive risk sensing during the post-treatment window. The dry-lab contribution is the measurement protocol itself: a documented, reusable workflow for characterising a small-molecule biosensor, covering plate layout, normalisation, chassis comparison, tolerance limits, dose response and specificity against structural analogues.","summary_zh":"Shimen 建了一個 Escherichia coli Nissle 1917（EcN）生物感測器，偵測 p-cresol——那是 Clostridioides difficile 用來壓制競爭的腸道微生物、為自己保住生態棲位的代謝物——並把偵測結果耦合到針對 TcdB 毒素的治療性輸出。由於 CDI 治療後的復發要等症狀再出現才會被診斷出來，他們的目標是從症狀觸發的診斷，轉向在治療後窗口期主動感測風險。乾實驗的貢獻就是那份量測規程本身：一套有完整文件、可重複使用的小分子生物感測器特性分析流程，涵蓋盤面配置、標準化、底盤比較、耐受上限、劑量反應，以及對結構類似物的專一性。","awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (High School)"],"dry":{"frameworks":"The measurement page is written as a contribution: seven numbered measurement strategies are stated up front, then each is given its own design, methods, results and discussion, with the standardisation framed explicitly as something future iGEM teams can reuse. Measurements are ordered so that each answers a prerequisite for the next, establishing the reporter, then the chassis, then the tolerance window, then the dose response, then specificity.","frameworks_zh":"量測頁面是當成一項貢獻來寫的：開頭先列出七項編號的量測策略，接著每一項各有自己的設計、方法、結果與討論，而標準化則明確定位為未來 iGEM 隊伍可以重複使用的東西。各項量測的順序安排成每一項都回答下一項的前提條件：先確立報告基因，再是底盤，再是耐受窗口，再是劑量反應，最後是專一性。","dataviz":"Nine numbered measurement figures covering the chassis comparison, the tolerance assay, the concentration-response series and the specificity panel, each expandable on the wiki alongside the protocol that produced it.","dataviz_zh":"九張編號的量測圖，涵蓋底盤比較、耐受試驗、濃度反應系列與專一性面板，每一張都可在 wiki 上展開，並與產生該圖的規程並列。","datascience":"Three parts of this stand out for a high-school team. First, plate layout is treated as a source of error: three empty wells are left between each set of three replicate wells, because repeated experiments showed that when adjacent wells differed substantially in p-cresol concentration, the high-concentration wells affected the readings from the low-concentration wells. That is an optical and chemical cross-talk control most teams never run. Second, normalisation is written out as a formula rather than implied, with normalised fluorescence calculated as (sample fluorescence minus fluorescence background) divided by (sample OD600 minus medium OD600 blank), and the team specifies what each blank must be: the fluorescence background from a GFP-negative culture matched to the experimental conditions, and the OD600 blank from cell-free medium. The stated reason is that total fluorescence depends on cell abundance, so raw fluorescence cannot be compared across conditions and only a per-biomass value answers the question. Third, the viable measurement window is established before the dose response is interpreted: a tolerance assay incubating EcN at 0 to 20 mM p-cresol with OD600 read every two hours over 24 hours found no appreciable inhibition at 0.1 to 1 mM, inhibition emerging at 2 mM, strong inhibition at 5 to 10 mM and near-total inhibition at 20 mM, which produced the rule that induction experiments must stay at or below 1 mM so that growth inhibition cannot be mistaken for a sensor response. Only then is the full dose response run, across fifteen concentrations from 0 to 5 mM, locating a discernible rise at roughly 500 nM to 1 uM and a working range of 1 uM to 1 mM. Chassis comparison is measured rather than argued: BL21 and modified EcN (cryptic plasmids pMUT1 and pMUT2 removed and the flagellar regulators flhDC deleted to free cellular resources) are run side by side, and the team reports that OD600 stayed between about 0.77 and 0.89 in both strains with no decrease as concentration rose, which is what licenses the claim that the fluorescence rise is not a cell-number artefact. Specificity is tested against the structural analogues that would actually confound a gut measurement, with o-cresol, m-cresol and phenol all at the same 10 uM concentration, and all reading close to the uninduced control while only p-cresol rose. All fluorescence is read on a BioTek plate reader at 485 nm excitation and 528 nm emission in triplicate, with a no-p-cresol negative control throughout. The team notes a p-cresol stock preparation protocol down to the weighed mass and 0.22 um filtration, with light-protected aliquots stored at -20 C.","datascience_zh":"對一支高中隊伍來說，這裡有三點特別突出。第一，盤面配置被當成誤差來源處理：每一組三個重複孔之間都留三個空孔，因為反覆實驗顯示，當相鄰孔的 p-cresol 濃度差異很大時，高濃度孔會影響低濃度孔的讀數。這是一項光學與化學串擾的對照，多數隊伍根本不會做。第二，標準化被寫成明確的公式、而不是暗示：標準化螢光值 =（樣品螢光值減去螢光背景）除以（樣品 OD600 減去培養基 OD600 空白值），而團隊也指明每個空白值該是什麼：螢光背景取自與實驗條件相同、但不帶 GFP 的培養液，OD600 空白值則取自無細胞的培養基。所述理由是總螢光值取決於細胞數量，因此原始螢光值無法跨條件比較，只有以單位生物量為基準的數值才回答得了問題。第三，可用的量測窗口在解讀劑量反應之前就先確立：一項耐受試驗把 EcN 培養在 0 至 20 mM 的 p-cresol 中，24 小時內每兩小時讀一次 OD600，發現在 0.1 至 1 mM 沒有明顯抑制、2 mM 時開始出現抑制、5 至 10 mM 時抑制強烈、20 mM 時幾乎完全抑制；由此訂出一條規則：誘導實驗必須維持在 1 mM 以下，使生長抑制不會被誤認為感測器的反應。只有在此之後才跑完整的劑量反應，橫跨 0 至 5 mM 共十五個濃度，定位出大約在 500 nM 至 1 uM 之間開始出現可辨識的上升，工作範圍為 1 uM 至 1 mM。底盤比較是量出來、不是講出來的：BL21 與改造過的 EcN（移除隱性質體 pMUT1 與 pMUT2，並剔除鞭毛調控基因 flhDC 以釋出細胞資源）並行測試，團隊報告兩個菌株的 OD600 都維持在約 0.77 至 0.89 之間、且未隨濃度上升而下降，正是這點才使「螢光上升不是細胞數量造成的假象」這個主張站得住腳。專一性則針對真正會干擾腸道量測的結構類似物測試，o-cresol、m-cresol 與 phenol 全部用同樣的 10 uM 濃度，結果都接近未誘導的對照，只有 p-cresol 上升。所有螢光都在 BioTek 盤式讀取儀上以激發 485 nm、發射 528 nm 讀取，三重複，並全程設置不加 p-cresol 的負對照。團隊並記下 p-cresol 母液的配製規程，細到秤取的質量與 0.22 um 過濾，分裝後避光保存於 -20 C。","software":"","stack":["BioTek microplate reader (485/528 nm)","OD600 growth monitoring in a plate reader","E. coli Nissle 1917 chassis (pMUT1/pMUT2-cured, flhDC-deleted)","GFP reporter","PcrSR-Pcmh two-component p-cresol sensing system"],"techniques":["Spaced replicate wells to prevent inter-well interference","OD600 normalisation with specified fluorescence and medium blanks","Tolerance assay to define the non-inhibitory working range","Fifteen-point concentration-response series","Specificity testing against structural analogues at matched concentration","Chassis comparison under identical conditions","Technical triplicates with a no-inducer negative control","Protocol documentation written for reuse"]},"good":{"publicEngagement":"An education page and an inclusivity page accompany the project.","publicEngagement_zh":"專題附有一個教育頁面與一個包容性頁面。","ihp":"Human Practices is reported in four stages with four named changes of direction. Conversations with a Chinese clinician reframed the opening question from whether CDI exists in China to whether patients are being identified in time, because the physician attributed low reported incidence partly to insufficient testing and clinical awareness rather than low disease occurrence. Interviews with two physicians abroad narrowed the target population from the general public to people with a confirmed CDI history who remain at high risk of recurrence. Interviews at Guangdong Hospital of Integrated Chinese and Western Medicine highlighted that antibiotic treatment itself further disturbs the gut microbiota, which moved the project from a standalone detection concept to coupling monitoring with targeted intervention. Advice from a microbiology researcher, Dr Peng, replaced a planned multivalent antibody with a single E3 monovalent nanobody against TcdB to improve experimental feasibility and reduce cost, and also informed the EcN chassis optimisation that improved protein expression.","ihp_zh":"人類實踐以四個階段報告，並有四項具名的方向改動。與一位中國臨床醫師的對話把開場問題重新框定：從「CDI 在中國是否存在」改成「病人是否被及時辨識出來」，因為該醫師認為通報發生率偏低，有一部分是檢驗量與臨床警覺不足所致、而不是疾病真的少見。與兩位國外醫師的訪談把目標族群從一般大眾收斂為有確診 CDI 病史、且仍處於高復發風險的人。在廣東省中西醫結合醫院的訪談指出抗生素治療本身會進一步擾亂腸道菌相，這使專題從單純的偵測構想，轉為把監測與標的性介入耦合起來。一位微生物學研究者彭博士的建議，則把原本計畫的多價抗體換成針對 TcdB 的單一 E3 單價奈米抗體，以提高實驗可行性並降低成本；他的意見也促成了 EcN 底盤的最佳化，進而改善蛋白質表現。","realWorld":"The intended use is a monitoring platform for the post-treatment recurrence window in patients with a confirmed CDI history, chosen because recurrence occurs in 20 to 30% of patients after an initial episode and up to 60% after a second, and because diagnosis of recurrence usually waits for overt symptoms such as diarrhoea. Chassis selection is justified against three stated criteria: adaptation to the human intestinal environment, availability of established genetic tools, and biosafety with a history of clinical use. The project also states a biosafety framework as one of its outputs.","realWorld_zh":"預期用途是為有確診 CDI 病史的病人，在治療後的復發窗口期提供一個監測平台；之所以如此設定，是因為初次發作後有 20 至 30% 的病人復發，第二次之後更高達 60%，而復發的診斷通常要等到腹瀉等明顯症狀出現。底盤的選擇依三項明示標準論證：對人體腸道環境的適應性、是否有成熟的遺傳工具可用，以及生物安全性與臨床使用歷史。該專題也把一套生物安全框架列為其產出之一。","partners":["Guangdong Hospital of Integrated Chinese and Western Medicine","Dr Peng (microbiology researcher)","Dr Miti (clinician, childhood diarrhoea research)"]},"images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6529/wiki/public/measurement/measurement-figure-01.webp","caption":"Measurement figure from the Re-CDI Alert characterisation workflow, which reads GFP fluorescence at 485 nm excitation and 528 nm emission alongside OD600 so that every value can be normalised per unit biomass.","caption_zh":"Re-CDI Alert 特性分析流程中的量測圖；該流程在激發 485 nm、發射 528 nm 下讀取 GFP 螢光，並同時讀取 OD600，使每個數值都能依單位生物量標準化。","credit":"Team CHINAGuangdongShimen, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6529/wiki/public/measurement/measurement-figure-05.webp","caption":"Measurement figure from the chassis and dose-response work comparing BL21 with the modified EcN strain across a p-cresol gradient, with OD600 recorded alongside fluorescence to show that the rise is not driven by changes in cell number.","caption_zh":"底盤與劑量反應工作的量測圖，在一系列 p-cresol 濃度梯度下比較 BL21 與改造後的 EcN 菌株，並與螢光值一併記錄 OD600，以顯示訊號上升並非由細胞數量變化所驅動。","credit":"Team CHINAGuangdongShimen, iGEM 2026 wiki"},{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6529/wiki/public/measurement/measurement-figure-07.webp","caption":"Measurement figure from the tolerance and specificity work. The tolerance assay fixed 1 mM as the upper usable p-cresol concentration, and the specificity panel compared p-cresol with o-cresol, m-cresol and phenol at a matched 10 uM.","caption_zh":"耐受與專一性工作的量測圖。耐受試驗把 1 mM 定為 p-cresol 可用濃度的上限，而專一性面板則在相同的 10 uM 濃度下比較 p-cresol 與 o-cresol、m-cresol 及 phenol。","credit":"Team CHINAGuangdongShimen, iGEM 2026 wiki"}],"gemsTakeaway":"Run a tolerance curve before the dose-response curve. Establishing the concentration at which the chassis itself starts to suffer defines the window in which a reporter signal can honestly be attributed to sensing rather than to dying cells, and it costs one 24-hour plate.","gemsTakeaway_zh":"在做劑量反應曲線之前，先做耐受曲線。確立底盤本身開始受損的濃度，就界定出一個區間，在其中報告基因的訊號才能誠實地歸因於感測、而不是歸因於正在死去的細胞——而這只要花一塊培養盤、24 小時。","sources":["https://2026.igem.wiki/chinaguangdongshimen/measurement","https://2026.igem.wiki/chinaguangdongshimen/description","https://2026.igem.wiki/chinaguangdongshimen/human-practices"],"awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（高中組）"],"rank":7}};
